INSERT INTO `hosts` VALUES (49682,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49682','Ali And David','Portland, OR','We enjoy cooking, singing, hiking, bicycles, tabby cats, libraries and parlor guitars. We love meeting travelers and hearing their stories; can\'t wait to hear yours.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/49682/profile_pic/1404668771/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(162158,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/162158','Paul','Portland, OR','I look forward to helping people discover the best of the great northwest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/162158/profile_pic/1386533007/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(300391,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/300391','Matt','United States','I travel all over the world staying in Airbnbs for a month or more at a time. I love meeting new people and experiencing new cultures. I will take great care of your place. I hope you take great care of mine! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eb170cd3-9708-4fd7-b81c-4d5904cb0efd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(329777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/329777','Will','Portland, OR','I have a love for Portland OR and all things that make it special. If I\'m hosting you, I hope you will too. I’m also a former concierge for a hotel here in Portland and current urban planner. If you\'re interested, I enjoy giving suggestions and recommendations on shopping, dining and activities in and out of the city. I recharge with travel, food, books and people. \n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1ccbf4ee-0bc3-44f2-8e59-a1a0e219faf8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(345461,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/345461','Diane','Portland, OR','We live in Portland, Oregon-- we enjoy classical and jazz music, the museums, the theater, hiking and the fabulous restaurants. I am a retired pharmacist and my wife is a health care writer with her own web based journal. We have traveled all over the world in the 25 years of our marriage with our favorite countries being Peru, Iran, India and Myanmar and we use Airbnb hosts whenever we can. Last spring we went to 5 Persian Gulf countries and were warmly received and had a great time. Then in the fall we visited Eastern Europe -- Russia, Lithuania, Latvia and Estonia. We love to share our travel experiences with our guests and invite them to join us on our deck for a glass of wine or beer.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/345461/profile_pic/1341551636/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(501715,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/501715','Teresa','Portland, OR','I started renting furnished rooms in my house in NE Portland, before there was Airbnb! \nI became a mom in 2016 at age 42 and moved in with Daddy about 15 minutes away. We built a large addition on to the airbnb house, which now has multiple bedrooms in a shared guest house/hostel. There is now also a top floor luxury apt added to the house.\nWe also now help my mother-in-law rent her furnished apt in American Fork Utah!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-501715/original/e8b2289b-02d2-4217-94d1-3c89d9cb7052.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(523311,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/523311','Mark','Phoenix, AZ',' I was born in Guayaquil, Ecuador to a Spanish father and a Washington(Vancouver) born and raised mother, I grew up in Hayward, California. \r\nI moved to Arizona in 1994 for a woman, and because I was obsessed with Indians. Life in Phoenix has been good for us in some ways. I own and operate 3 businesses in Phoenix, AZ and I have a wife and 3 kids.\r\n\r\nI love coffee, wine, beer, food, free markets, my family, friends and anyone who is funny.\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e0dfe44c-1186-470d-9139-c9cab773bd5c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(589016,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/589016','Steven','Portland, OR','I\'m a married father of two teen-aged girls, I work in transportation electrification, I’m a youth soccer coach, an outdoor enthusiast and an avid reader.  I have lived primarily in the Portland area since I was 8 years old, but I have also lived in and/or traveled in North America, Europe and Asia.  My favorite pastimes involve my family and good Italian food, a drizzly fall day playing soccer at the local park, or a second cup of coffee and a good novel.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aca3ea1e-2e6b-42c6-8a85-0fd1cd6b1f89.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(659137,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/659137','Anjali','Portland, OR','What a great time I have hosting people from all over the world. It\'s like traveling while staying at home! \n\n This location in Mississippi District is ground-zero for fun. I love helping people make the most of their stay, however they like!   Having lived here quite awhile, I\'m a font of info on a wide array of interests. \n\nSome fun loving guests wrote \"Paradise!\n in chalk in front of the house, like a little road map pointing  to my house How fun is that! \n\nNano-bio: I am an artist, performer, RN-PhD, investor, entrepreneur, published author, host.  mother, and GRAND mother.   I love life and  creative expression!\n\nCo-vid Style:  We operate under the strictest of  Oregon covid guidelines for everybody\'s safety.  Your safety, comfort, and enjoyment is  our  top priority. \n\nPlease let us know if you have any questions. \n\nWarm regards, \nAnjali LeBoeuf PhD RN\n\n\n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-659137/original/146953d7-107a-4675-acf1-92d7c6053153.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(683139,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/683139','Amy','Portland, OR',' a very easy going person that loves to laugh, cook, listening to music, outdoor activities and gardening. I\'m one of those gym rats !  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m 5\'2 Filipino Hawaiian, my passions are music like jazz, blues,raggae and the 80\'s. I work out 3 times a week and go hiking on weekends and go snowboarding during winter of which Im still learning..My other passions are cooking and gardenning. I got lots of friends and I\'m easy to get along with..Athletic..\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-683139/original/db6b03b5-25fa-41ab-8975-667f05d2a4f8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52505,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52505','Judy','Portland, OR','I\'m Judy. I\'m a retired recycling specialist and ACLU lobbyist. I love to do art, travel, cook, sing and to have guests. I\'m quiet, adventurous and independent. I spend my time making music, art, walking around new places, quilting, reading, camping, bicycling, cooking and eating great food. I enjoy meeting new people and doing new things. I\'m in a happy relationship. I speak Spanish and can get by in French.\r\nPortland is a wonderful city and I enjoy helping people get to know it. But -- no smoking inside, no drugs, no partying.\r\nIf you are requesting a stay, please tell me a little about yourself.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6935579-9560-4004-ab57-d793abca95b1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(975606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/975606','Leo','Portland, OR','Howdy Do! \r\nBig Fan of people here, glad to meet and have at least brief interactions and cerebral interludes with the whole sh\'bang and gamut of characters this planet provides.  Travel feeds me well.  Another way to get that vitamin supplement from life in the times between travelings is to be part of another\'s adventure in some small way.  Hence, my own fondness for travel and the moments of feeling at home in the most remote stretches of the world is what brings me to AirBnB.  \r\n\r\nI have warm, inviting space to spare, as well as energy and ideas about this pretty city that I dug so much I had to buy a little plot in it for myself and to SHARE with YOU!  Portland is beautiful.  I hope to make your travel far more enjoyable with a relaxing home base to replenish in between forays into the wild fray!\r\nMy darling, trusty, sweetheart William is my able co-host and a sweet addition to the casa\'s general goodness!\r\nHe is a fine horticulturalist and hobbyist filmmaker..\r\nAlso as of 2015 we have a son who is an awesome component of the tapestry around here. Our resting space is separate from the rest of the house for the most part, but we do share common space daily as well.\r\nI do a little work from the home a couple days a week, but it ought never interfere with your autonomous fun having whilst here.  Let me know if I can help you with anything.\r\n\r\nPersonally~\r\n I\'m an easy-moving, joyful, well-adjusted, silly critter, musician, painter, cook, writerly sort, interested in health and wholeness, Chinese herbal medicine (the eternal study continues!) and Acupuncture. I\'m a traveler, an explorer, innate documentarian and story gatherer.  I\'m handy, oft DIY-style, prefer  repurposing and re-using things and building materials in my projects.  \r\n I appreciate, to the point of deep reverence, the natural world\'s offerings and feel compelled to protect it with conscious consumption and recycling etc. I love clever design, architecture and texture in living/ working/ growing spaces as well.  Fond of dirt, making food and flora in it.  \r\nPlenty to do in the loosely sketched canvas that a piece of land provides. If it suits your fancy, feel free to join me gardening during your stay. It\'s always fun to putter about in the yard with folks!\r\n\r\nSee you soon, with any luck!\r\n-Leo\r\n\r\nPS~ Incase you\'ve wondered: I think I\'ve got a good lead on what the meaning of life is. \r\nWanna hear it?\r\nTo Give Exchange and Explore Loving Energy as Earnestly, Thoroughly and Frequently as Possible is Why We are Here.\r\nFeels about right to me, so I figure we may as well move about the cabin in kindness, gathering recipes, hugs, soul food, stories and songs along the way! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/31d62cd2-a2e3-49dc-8503-bdda5fe3dd1b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6313800,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6313800','Margot','Portland, OR','Must have coffee…these days I’m chasing both my toddler son and the sun…native to Portland, Oregon.  In 2023 I sold my event business of 10 + years (@opal28) but continue to host, own and manage the upstairs apartments as popular Airbnb\'s - vintage accommodations.  I’m manifesting my next concept, hopefully somewhere sunny and near the ocean. My husband is my travel buddy, working remotely as a luminaire in his trade.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7956d07b-833a-4c59-8f60-8db0ef7ff3ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1153902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1153902','Taizz','Portland, OR','I started an eco-guesthouse 13 yrs ago for travelers who come to Portland for blues, brews, bicycling, rain gardens, dogs, coffee roasting, and wellness.  Please tell me a little about yourself, and the nature of your visit so I will know if I’m a good host for you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/efa63b55-f04e-47c0-8a66-bb6b8d2cbe97.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(960864,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/960864','Naomi','Los Cerritos, Mexico','Portland, OR resident since 2008. Have lived all around the country and abroad.  Love having the spirit of travel in and around my home!\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/02f71203-730c-4ec5-af76-a5fd7cb8d20c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(828435,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/828435','Furnished In Portland','Portland, OR','We love to welcome people to PDX!\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/828435/profile_pic/1427837691/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1206902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1206902','LeBrie','Portland, OR','I am an artist who can often be found gardening, riding my bike or playing backgammon, when not working in the studio. My boyfriend and I love to travel, and we rent our house out when we are away (profile photo taken in the world\'s largest ferris wheel in Tokyo, while airbnb guests stayed in our house). \r\n\r\nOur experience with airbnb has always been positive, as hosts and guests. We love sharing our home and making connections with like-minded folks around the world.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1206902/profile_pic/1395158290/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38860,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38860','Renata','Portland, OR','I am a creative fun people person.  I have a home here in beautiful Portland Oregon and also a condo in West Hollywood CA where I lived for many years.\r\n\r\nI\'ve spent a lot of time gardening, growing flowers and truly cultivating a beautiful outdoor environment on my property. Each year brings new challenges and opportunities for me to learn more as I continue to plant new things. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/38860/profile_pic/1259120532/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1810476,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1810476','Susan','Portland, OR','Originally from So. Calif. I have been in Portland for about 45 years. I am retired and don\'t know how I managed to find time to work! I like re-modeling (less as my body gets older!) and gardening. I spend a lot of time involved with musical activities playing cello - orchestras and chamber music, and both singing and choral directing. I also very much like meeting new people and people from different places, and love to travel myself.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1810476/profile_pic/1331707507/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1213257,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1213257','Dayna','Portland, OR','Dayna is a native of Staten Island, New York. She received a Bachelor\'s degree in Fine Art from the Maryland Institute of Art and studied painting at the Glasgow School of Art. In 1996 moved to Portland, Or, and has lived there since. She has designed, built, and operates multiple restaurant and hospitality projects located in Portland. She has recently branched out to acquire an 1890\'s adobe dwelling in the historic Barrio Viejo district in downtown Tucson, AZ. The Folkore Adobe Hotel is part of her collection of curated environments available soon to enjoy on Airbnb.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/906c7c84-4c4e-4dd2-afa6-6adde9a4da60.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51531579,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51531579','Lucca','Portland, OR','My husband and I like to travel together, we are from Portland, Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7807dba-8e0c-421f-9bbf-c6c2a2050f23.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(532509,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/532509','Maria','Portland, OR','What\'s on your bucket list? Reaching the summit of Mt Kilimanjaro and stepping foot in all 7 continents filled my bucket.\r\n\r\nAs avid travelers, we have made the study of people, food, and cultures the thesis of our wanderlust. From cycling to surfing and from yoga to meditation, our interests are as diverse as there are cultures.\r\n\r\nWe believe a successful lifestyle is about balancing work, play, and rest. This means work that is intellectually stimulating, creative, and meaningful and down time is more than sleep.\r\n\r\nWe love meeting new people and introducing visitors to Portland and especially Multnomah Village. We\'ll be glad to share our favorite hike, restaurant, and shops with you. \r\n\r\nBy working downtown Maria stays on top of the food cart and restaurant scene. To counter this appetite for good food she commutes by bike each day over Terwilliger Blvd. Portland is bike friendly (mostly).\r\n\r\nKenyon is in charge of the garden and as a flower farmer he knows horticulture. His garden was featured by Janet Eastman of the Oregonian. Search the web for \"Sleeping in Portland - Master bedroom conversion in Multnomah Village\".\r\n\r\n\"Be who you are and say what you feel because those who mind don\'t matter and those who matter don\'t mind.\" -- Dr. Seuss\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/532509/profile_pic/1398632393/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2034859,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2034859','Ruby','Portland, OR','I am a massage therapist, artist, a mother, a gardner...i love to cook and take long walks with my dog in the forest...i love Portland and all it offers! I love to cook and try new places as this city is full of amazing cuisine. \n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3613f83d-17ee-4403-9c4e-4e75271b2fb1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1099616,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1099616','Abraham','Portland, OR','I\'m a small business owner and native Oregonian, having lived in Portland for 23 years now.  A few of my favorite things: music, cooking, motorcycling, world travel.  I\'ve explored high and low over my years here, and I\'m happy to share my insight on all that Portland has to offer.  I\'m a clean, respectful, easy-going person, and I\'m hoping you are as well. Please let me know if you have any questions.  Thank you for considering my listing.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4c4da9e7-56bb-496e-8c87-ad116099a69b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2226037,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2226037','Bruce','Portland, OR','Greetings! \r\n\r\nI am excited to share my beautiful home, some local favorite restaurants and neighborhood highlights with travelers and guests to my home here in Portland Oregon! \r\n\r\nFor 25 years I worked as Creative Director in Media/Broadcasting. I\'ve always had a passion for the arts, design, photography and take pride in the remodeling of my 1915 Craftsman home. Traveling, tiling, landscaping, wine and cooking are my other passions. \r\n\r\nPortlandia put us on the map. An amazing amount of culture abound here. I love to travel and the best experience is feeling comfortable and welcome wherever you end up. Having lived abroad in New Zealand, Australia, Bali, Mexico, Hawaii and France I\'ve gained a fondness for guest houses, seeking out creative stays all along the adventure. \r\n\r\nDream  +  Believe  +  Create  + Inspire\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eddcc6a0-2824-44e8-be47-0e7e77abbdd3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2236909,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2236909','Shane','Portland, OR','I love living in Portland. I get to ride my bike around town most days or work on house or yard projects. I usually do a range of sports during the week depending on the time of year--including basketball, soccer, ultimate frisbee, running and cycling. \nHowever, my biggest sports passions are kitesurfing, rock climbing, and slacklining. I\'ve been climbing for over 20 years and have put up many new climbing routes around Portland over the years. Depending on the time of year, I will have a slackline set up in the backyard. If you\'ve never tried it, it\'s unlike any other balance sport...basically a single line trampoline that feels impossible at first, but is actually quite manageable after a bit of practice.\nI like gardening and have spent the last 10 years or so transplanting and cultivating trees, shrubs and sedums at the house. There are all sorts of perennial edibles here--cherry, plum, persimmon, fig, blueberry, huckleberry, strawberry, pear, grape, asparagus, kiwi and raspberry. Feel free to sample anything that\'s in season!\nI lived in Bolivia for a couple of years while I was in the Peace Corps and have traveled to about 50 countries since then. I like being an adventure traveler and enjoy hosting other travelers and visitors as well. \nI bought this house back in 2006 and it was practically unlivable. Then once I decided to replace all the plumbing, it was unlivable for about 3 months. doh! But that was years ago. These days, I continue to work on smallish projects around the house, whether it\'s transplanting my bamboo, adding a new gravel path, refinishing the 100yr old fir floors, planning a new garden bed, or building a covered bike storage area out of recycled materials.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2236909/original/a5d48d16-0409-46f5-a9f1-d3f6254d4041.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1387456,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1387456','Dana','Portland, OR','We are a family run vacation rental. Dana is a licensed massage therapist and Eric is a professional actor/writer. Our daughters can often be found chasing dragons in the back yard.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/db654632-aa11-4f09-b182-37c60285e31b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19234,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19234','Scott','Portland, OR','That\'s my partner and myself and our two kids. The youngest one is living on his own in Portland and the oldest is living in San Diego. We have lived in New York City then San Francisco and finally Portland, OR and love the city and love our neighborhood. We are both very active (running, hiking, etc). If you are visiting Portland for the first time, try to fit in a visit to the Gorge. It\'s beautiful and only 30-40 minutes away.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3675af15-9eed-471c-a2c6-41aab91e08de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2555917,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2555917','Thomas','Portland, OR','I\'m from Portland, Oregon and have two little kids who are my companions in adventure.  I love all of the aspects of hosting at my houses and am constantly trying to improve the experience for my guests. I\'m usually immediately available by phone and strive to make sure everyone is satisfied.  Each of the houses is constantly being updated and improved. This is new to me but note that when you review me that 4 stars means I suck and 5 stars means that everything was as expected.  I have a lot of reviews where people leave glowing comments but only 4 stars.  I\'m trying to be a super host and I need to average 4.8 stars to get there.  These house aren\'t the Four Seasons but they are really nice:)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2555917/profile_pic/1338928095/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1601890,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1601890','Janie And Ginnie','Portland, OR','My partner Ginnie and I have lived in Portland for over 20 years and love all that Portland and the Northwest has to offer.  We both love the outdoors - whether it\'s skiing, surfing, sailing, hiking, biking or gardening, you can usually find us outside with our border collie, Mae Belle.  \r\n\r\nWe are so fortunate to have such rich bounty in this part of the country- the most amazing local produce, award winning wines, the freshest seafood, it\'s a foodie\'s paradise!   We would love to share our favorite spots, both in Portland and on the Oregon Coast.\r\n\r\nWhen we are not adventuring around the Northwest, we love to travel to experience other cultures and beautiful parts of the world. \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/b6a80c08-7c4b-4574-bb3d-2706281b58d9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40759,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40759','Robert James','Portland, OR','We live in a historic home in Laurelhurst, in Portland.  Sue is a retired principal and Bob retired from the big aerospace company in Seattle (Boeing).  Sue has a passion for decorating and gardening (is very creative and good at both), Bob is into art and also enjoys and appreciates creating and living in a tasteful environment.  We both enjoy entertaining, hosting frequent social gatherings in our home  in our English garden or just  having  friends over for a \"glass\" of wine.  We also have a house on the Oregon Coast that we love and enjoy sharing with family and friends and that is also available for short term rental.  We stay constantly busy with our \"projects\" spending time with the grandchildren,  try to fit some time in for a little golf and getting away for a few days from time to time. \r\n\r\nAs hosts and your staying in our Portland apartment, we would be happy to invite our guests for a tour of our historic home, sit with us and enjoy a glass of wine in front of the inglenook fireplace or on the patio in the garden.  If our guests prefer to left alone we are sensitive to that as well.  Our goal is to provide a welcoming, comfortable, and tasteful environment for our guests, and possibly develop new friendships.\r\n\r\nIf you are staying in our beach house,  you will have total privacy.  We will not be there to greet you.  We provide you with a code to the lock box and you are have the home to yourself.  If you need something you can call us and we will do what we need to address your needs.\r\n\r\nAs guests we appreciate friendly hosts, but we do appreciate a host  sensitivity to our privacy. We also appreciate hosts that provide recommendations and insight into places to visit and things to do.\r\n\r\nAs to a life motto we both think that,  Live, Love, Laugh and Learn is how we approach life.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/40759/profile_pic/1391490917/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(307635,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/307635','Andrew','Portland, OR','Informaticist and into surf, hike, snorkeling.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-307635/original/c25dafe2-d66e-4767-8be1-0b60f277b226.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2696498,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2696498','Meredith','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2696498/original/a0b43c22-ca7d-468e-b6d0-82f4383eb2bb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2690880,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2690880','Randy','Portland, OR','Hello, hosts and travelers. My wife and I have lived and worked in our beloved Portland for more than 20 years. We’ve been hosting on the Airbnb platform since 2012. Recently, we created a modern guest suite onsite so visitors could have full privacy. Our entire house is also available as a separate listing. We enjoy making people feel welcome, at peace and comfortable. Come stay with us!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c14f93d-382f-41c8-b69f-d9418fbbce24.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1115782,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1115782','Elliott','Portland, OR','Hi, I am Elliott.  I am a Latin American history professor at Lewis & Clark College in Portland.  My research is on late nineteenth century borderlands history, and more recently about Chinese migration in the Americas.   My partner, Reiko, is also a history professor at Lewis & Clark.  She studies the built environment and the US South in the 19th century.  We both love to bike in the city, and eat great food in the neighborhood.  We have an 18-year old daughter who likes making movies and will be going to Sarah Lawrence College next year.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bdd0411e-f433-4a39-990a-45603ced0bdf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2854451,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2854451','Julie','Panama City, Panama','I love to fly, in dreams and real life.  My favorite objects are clouds. I\'m from Portland, Oregon, currently living in Panama. I support equal rights, LGBTQ & BLM. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/798007ff-49a2-4010-a98b-975d08d389e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2881063,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2881063','Kevin','Portland, OR','I am a young professional that manages a branch for a local credit union. I was originally born in England and have since claimed Oregon as my home. I graduated from the University of Oregon in 2002 and moved to Portland to pursue my career in finance while enjoying living in the beautiful Pacific Northwest.\r\n\r\nBeing born abroad to an Irish father and an English mother, I have always enjoyed traveling the world, meeting new people, and seeking new experiences. My most recent excision was to Belize. I also love sports - especially football and soccer, live music, and the outdoors. I\'ve come to know all the corners of the wonderful city of Portland and can help guide any traveler to great nightlife, hikes, live music, or whatever your likings may be.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/88cbde5a-d8a9-4941-a931-aa73fb41a236.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2974150,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2974150','Shannon','Portland, OR','I am an outgoing woman interested in new experiences and living life to the fullest. I am passionate about art, design, food, travel and deep, lasting friendships. I have a love for animals and have a Weimaraner that is my heart. I enjoy gardening, welding and international/art & documentary films. I have traveled to many places including Ireland, Scotland, England, France, The Netherlands, Germany, Prague, throughout the US and have the bug again to travel more in the near future like Asia and New Zealand. I look forward to meeting new people on this journey….',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a817b8a9-cde2-412b-a1b6-6bc7c80a1ca0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1493662,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1493662','Jeffrey','Portland, OR','Jeff and Katie have lived in Portland for approximately twenty years, transplanted from Alaska/Kansas and Chicago, respectively. Jeff works in Natural Resources, Katie as a Speech Pathologist, and Nina (12), Leo (8), and Iver (4) as bringers of joy to the world. Our priority at home is to maximize outdoor living, so we are out in the yard and garden a lot.  Our priority as hosts is to respect your space and privacy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1493662/original/dd38cea3-64bb-4653-b711-3e076ec1d642.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(869146,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/869146','Gina And Andy','Portland, OR','We love Portland and our Sellwood neighborhood.  We met at a party in 1993, started dating in 2000 and married in 2004. Gina moved into the house after the wedding and has endured many construction projects!\n\nWe joined Airbnb in 2012 and wondered \"Why would people want to stay here?\" We\'ve rented to parents helping their kids move from college, grandparents visiting grandkids, foodies, ferry boat captains and others... It\'s been a lot of fun and really gratifying when people ask if they can move in permanently!\n\nOur work weeks are spent in high tech and non-profits. We are the parents of a Schipperke, a Yorkipoo and a feisty black cat. The dogs are very friendly and enjoy meeting our visitors. The cat... not so much.\n\nOur favorite travel destination is Hawaii and anywhere our family lives. Season ticket holders to Portland Timbers and Portland Thorns soccer teams! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/869146/profile_pic/1370824230/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1731137,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1731137','Stephanie','Portland, OR','Great space! I am reliable and trustworthy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1731137/profile_pic/1328896199/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3425231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3425231','Kit','Portland, OR','   The house is a 1912 Bungalow,  clean and peaceful, and you will get the best of Portland here.  Walking distance to restaurants, shops, movies, Powells (on Hawthorne.) The neighborhood is super safe, and quiet. The house is quiet, but comfortable, as well.   I\'ve had a variety of different roomates over the years, but currently I just want to enjoy guests like yourself. .  The room is on the main floor, near a bathroom.  I need to emphasize that this is a shared bathroom with another guest.  I live upstairs and have my own bathroom.  I come down to use the kitchen,  and take my little dog outside. My dog is a Cocker, very friendly.  I work 2-3 eves a week (RN). My job is nearby.  I\'m pretty easy going, and  I don\'t set out a breakfast, as New Seasons and Fred Meyer are a block away, but I share my Olive oil.  You can smoke on the front porch if you like.   I\'m glad to go have a beer with you , or a cup of Joe if you like!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3425231/original/9cc33f05-53b0-41c6-8ef0-3a5b96b795c3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3569549,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3569549','Ash','Geelong West, Australia','I am a Company Director of Popcultcha which sells pop culture merchandise from the biggest video games, movies, TV shows, music and everything in between to geeks and misfits residing on Earth.\r\n\r“Dorky Cringe Dad” to Gus and Anouk.\r\n\r\nWe live in Geelong, Victoria, Australia and in Alberta Arts District, Portland, Oregon, USA.\r\n\r\nMusic lover, Festival goer, Movie lover, beer/wine, meat and seafood connoisseur.\r\n\r\nHave travelled a fair bit - done nearly all of Europe and North America. Some more remote places I have been to - Cuba, Iceland, Slovenia, Bosnia are all places that spring to mind. Always looking to explore new places and cultures.\r\n\r\nLove an adventure, meeting people and getting out amongst it!\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1d708387-6602-41d0-aace-458c7234b925.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3190134,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3190134','Jenna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/afb1fc9b-ca31-48bf-aecd-1adbc3454b64.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2605790,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2605790','Amanda & Sebastien','Golden, CO','Sebastien and Amanda are temporarily renting out their beloved home in Portland while they travel between Colorado, France, and elsewhere. Amanda’s mother Karin is the acting property manager for their home. Karin will provide the keys and is your local contact. She is happy to answer any questions you may have (before 8 pm please!) and give recommendations, orientation, etc. Additionally, Amanda and Sebastien will be available by email, and we provide an ample collection of maps and information on things to do and see in Portland and greater Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2605790/profile_pic/1347853365/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1186353,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1186353','Fredrick','Palm Springs, CA','Thanks for checking out my vacation rental properties. I would be pleased to answer any questions. Just let me know.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1186353/profile_pic/1316545654/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2646777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2646777','Kyle','Portland, OR','I love to travel and have used AirBnB when traveling in Europe. It was great to meet new people. \r\n\r\nI work in sustainability for the CIty of Portland. Most my free time is spent hiking, traveling, gardening and training.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2646777/profile_pic/1351566867/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3622006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3622006','Lee Ann','Portland, OR','From Portland, Oregon (originally NY/Philadelphia) - love to travel around the around the world, and am raising my kids to be respectful global citizens. \r\n\r\nAs a host, it’s important for you to know that ALL are welcome; no discrimination or disrespect to minorities, LGBTQ, disabled, immigrants. I love to host and help guests get the most out of their visit to my beautiful city!\n\nAs a guest, I strive for five star ratings and I  always leave the rental cleaner than I found it. You can expect an extremely clean checkout with no issues at all. When I do bring our dogs, you will never have known they were there (other than me telling you!), because they are well-behaved and I clean thoroughly after them. \n\nThanks for considering me as a host and/or guest!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/11eaa699-75c2-4722-92d2-328cc353c50b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1150082,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1150082','Michelle','Portland, OR','We are a husband and wife who love to travel and love designing houses. The vacation rental industry is the perfect intersection of our passions. We adore Portland and think its one of the best cities in the USA. We are excited to share all of this goodness with you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1150082/profile_pic/1320282855/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4123246,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4123246','Leopoldo','Portland, OR','I live part of the year in Portland, Oregon, with my son, and the rest in San Isidro, Argentina with my wife Marcela and her two children. I love to take hikes in the woods and look for mushrooms when I am in Oregon. In Argentina a favorite pastime with my wife is to head to the islands at the mouth of the Paraná river for kayaking.  We are flexible, easy going and enjoy a wide diversity of experiences. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/82c5f1e6-e182-4bff-a5e5-a2c2ed36aaf4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4134978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4134978','Huma','San Francisco, CA','Born and raised in Los Gatos, CA. I love good food, great company and exploring new cities. I spent 10 years living in England, Washington, and Oregon and returned to CA a few years ago to attend law school. I met my soon to be hubby shortly after and looks like I’m back in the bay to stay! :)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6e1e05c5-affa-44ae-9fbc-a95d57521834.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4161754,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4161754','Rhonda','Portland, OR','Rhonda\'s a residential designer, originally from Iowa. Doug, a New Yorker (who left his accent there),  is a freelance writer, actor and also a Portland Walking Tour guide!\n\nAfter 30 years marinading in the best of Portland, we\'re bonafide card carrying ambassadors. Give us your interests, give us your lists and we\'ll help curate suggestions (some off the path less traveled).  Recommendations for restaurants, tours, comedy, music, theater, bars, hiking, travel jaunts (east/gorge or west/beach)? We\'re on it! \n\nWe love having the world come to our front door! That one cute red door is shared by us and guests alike. You can join us on the deck (hundreds of stories shared there) or come and go (we respect your privacy)...your call.\n\nTO CLARIFY OUR SPACE (since Airbnb doesn\'t have a category for ours; that\'s how special we are:)\n-  MAIN FLOOR: Shared - front door, living room, kitchen, deck - you walk through those spaces to your space...\n-  LOWER FLOOR (daylight basement): Your private space - sitting area, sleeping area, bathroom, closet\n-  SECOND FLOOR:  2nd story: Our private space',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4161754/profile_pic/1374685220/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4203145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4203145','Rupert Kinnard','Portland, OR','We, Rupert Kinnard and Scott Stapley, have been the proud owners of The Kinley Manor Coach House since it\'s construction and official opening in June of 2006. Scott has a background as a mental health therapist and I, Rupert, am a writer/illustrator/cartoonist/graphic designer. I am also a Motown fanatic. I grew up in Chicago, IL and Scott hails from Redding, CA. \r\n\r\nDuring our years as guesthouse owners, Scott and I have enjoyed welcoming people from as close as down the street to people from as far away as Saudi Arabia and Australia. When asked is our place is a Bed & Breakfast Inn, we are fond of responding, \"We provide you a bed but if you would like to offer us breakfast, we would consider it.\"\r\n\r\nWe are both avid film lovers, frequent live theater, truly enjoy living in Portland and are very active in our community. We absolutely honor all of our guests...especially all of our return visitors.\r\n\r\nIf we had a motto I would say that it would be: \"We don\'t look at life as having ups and downs. We see it as a series of adventures and challenges.\"\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4203145/profile_pic/1353462854/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4382924,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4382924','Reggie','Portland, OR','Married with loving family',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4382924/original/eb675e61-faa0-43c2-94ab-eb906211fe9c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4440080,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4440080','Lori','Portland, OR','I\'m thrilled to share this amazing house I purchased back in the summer of 2012. It\'s a truly fabulous home, and I\'m excited to open it up to new friends through Airbnb. \n\nHosting has always been a natural inclination of mine, as I\'ve had the pleasure of welcoming many friends and family over the years. Now, I\'m eager to meet people from across the river, across the country, and even beyond!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4440080/profile_pic/1381544825/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3528646,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3528646','Aysha','Portland, OR','I first came to Portland thinking I would only stay for a few months.  29 years later  I am still here and I still love it.  It\'s a great city that I have no doubt you will also fall in love with.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f244fad1-2c9f-4327-9a66-9605022a6049.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4955336,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4955336','BettyLou','Portland, OR','My favorite things in Portland:\r\nNorthwest Film Center and Portland International Film Festival,\r\nThe Portland Bar Method,\r\nWeekly soup delivery to my door by Soupcycle,\r\nFarmer\'s Markets,\r\nMt. Hood views,\r\nWalking and Hiking,\r\nCrispy Dragon Potatoes (no cheese and no sour cream) at Isabels,\r\nPearl Bakery,\r\nAndina Restaurant,\r\nDaily Cafe\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4955336/profile_pic/1359944987/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1916182,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1916182','Alexis','Portland, OR','I\'m originally from San Francisco, but now living in Portland, Oregon. I\'m a writer and a teacher, and my husband is a writer and an editor. I love reading, watching films, going to museums, eating good food, drinking wine and of course traveling!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1916182/profile_pic/1363706635/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1515905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1515905','Rick','Portland, OR','Rick & Kristin- we\'re from Portland, Oregon. Both into the local theater & ecstatic dance scene. Kristin is a success coach for college students and Rick is a kids entertainer. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/198fa396-2241-4a63-8d2e-ef97ac5e7c0c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5097860,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5097860','Max','Portland, OR','Just an easy-going international traveler who loves meeting new people, trying new things and visiting new places.  \r\n\r\nStarted hosting on Airbnb a few years ago and have absolutely loved the experience.  Always looking forward to sharing all that the Pacific NW has to offer and getting to be a part of the Airbnb community. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1c6f7ce2-54a6-472c-9812-45ffdfaf8d18.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5161731,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5161731','Debra & Ludger','Portland, OR','We love the urban life, and we adore the Northwest\'s natural beauty. We love to hike, kayak, get to the coast and garden.\r\n\r\nLudger\'s an engineer, computer consultant and craftsman who makes old houses work better (and can fix just about anything!), and Deborah\'s a writer, poet and taught college English for a long time. We both work from home but love travel. We met on the way to Khajuraho, India (where you\'ll find the largest group of Medieval Hindu and Jain temples--famous for their erotic sculptures!) The bus broke down, and there we  sat--two travelers dazed as the locals and their chickens and bags of rice departed.\r\n\r\nWe enjoy sharing our northeast Portland home, and respect your privacy. With a private entrance to come and go as you please, you can simply enjoy your time alone, or join us on the front porch. We are happy to tell you about our favorite haunts and hikes, answer any questions, or leave you to your romantic getaway. When our garden thrives, we\'ll share some produce.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5161731/profile_pic/1392569378/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5216499,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5216499','Allison','Portland, OR','Single professional woman who enjoys working on the house, getting outdoors often, and the great food and wine that Portland has to offer.  I am active and exercise daily including jogging and dragon boat racing.  I am pretty quiet during the week and am in and out on the weekends.  I read a lot as well as enjoy movies and an occasional TV series on Netflix. In the fall I\'m pretty addicted to college football. I am fluent in Spanish.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5216499/profile_pic/1365535473/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1507209,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1507209','Penelope And Nathan','Portland, OR','I am a professional organizer and co-active coach.   Our current home and abode has been featured in the home decor blog Apartment Therapy.  I love creating a magical and enchanted space for others to enjoy and refuel in..   \r\n\r  I love leaving a list of our favorite spots here in Portland and enjoy being a host so you can enjoy visiting this sweet town as much as I do living here. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47eff909-952b-4da9-86ff-cc0dbe72f135.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5455260,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5455260','Susan','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Susan.  I\'ve lived in the Ladds Addition neighborhood of Portland since 1992, originally hailing from L.A. and living for a few years each in NYC, Maui and the a ski resort in the eastern Sierra Mountains.  I have 2 vacation guest houses in Portland.  Hospitality is in my DNA, having previously managed vacation rentals in Nicaragua and on Maui. I\'m a passionate ceramist artist, backpacker, fly fisher, cyclist and gardener, growing perennials and organic vegetables.  I love to eat and seek out new fine dining opportunities as well as unique food trucks and I\'m happy to share them with you. During your stay, I can lay low, offering privacy or be a resource for your intro to Portland\'s many interesting offerings. For inspiration, these evocative words speak volumes to me. \" Let yourself be silently drawn by the strange pull of what you really love. It will not lead you astray\"......Rumi',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/94f35340-91ec-44bf-b149-47a037cea570.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3041678,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3041678','Cora','Villareal, Costa Rica','Mother of two littles and hosting on Airbnb for travelers near and far for over 10 years. I\'ve lived as a local in all the cities that I host in so  I\'m ready for questions and here to help make your visit a fun and easy one!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3041678/original/3ce87a56-7564-4836-ae7a-963b4662d2ab.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4430753,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4430753','Catie','Portland, OR','From Ohio (don\'t judge), love Ohio - but love the Pacific Northwest more.  Jobs brought my husband, Caleb, and me to Portland in 2011 - now we couldn\'t imagine leaving.  \r\nFor fun we hang with our pup, hike/bike all around PDX, eat (and eat and eat), and travel as much as possible.\r\nWe aim to be super considerate and delightful guests when we rent and to provide a clean, rad home when we host. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4430753/original/981fcd7d-a181-4681-8540-9e00c84c2713.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3978304,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3978304','Anthony','Portland, OR','I have Canadian roots, traveled Europe, lived in the Czech Republic and went to college a couple hours South of Portland.  Most of my life, however, has been lived here in this humble zip code in SE Portland.  Not just a townie that is stuck where he grew up, but rather I really like it here and I like to tell people about Portland and hope that I represent our city well.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3978304/profile_pic/1384494300/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1284016,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1284016','Susan','Portland, OR','We are a married couple who lives in Portland and in Europe.  My husband is a professional cycling coach and entrepreneur and I am a yoga therapist who loves salsa dancing and hiking.  We like to travel together and cycle every place that we visit.  :)\n\nOne of the things we enjoy doing is going to a local coffee shop for a morning latte.  There are so many outstanding coffee roasters in Portland!  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1284016/profile_pic/1363836753/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5707629,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5707629','Arlene & Jeff','Portland, OR','Graduate of Portland State University in Graphic Design, 2 sons Wade and Wyatt, and recently married to Jeff Nokes, carpenter. Together we are entrepreneurs  in Vozee leather and Dye, and our Airbnb.  I have lived in Portland, Oregon since 1973, and lived in Baltimore, Maryland for 10 years.  I love the Blues, and NFL football. That would be the Baltimore \"Ravens\".  My house is an expression of my personality.  Whimsical, kozy, colorful, friendly, some of that friendly is on all fours. Chimmy kitty and Jack the Schnauzer. When you come to our home you are part of our family with the utmost respect to your privacy.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5707629/original/d19f3039-9339-4cef-a072-ef4fad5eb12b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5970172,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5970172','Dj','Portland, OR','I love helping others and sharing my home on airbnb.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5970172/profile_pic/1366256199/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(496929,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/496929','Sam','Portland, OR','I run a travel business that customizes programs around the world. I love getting to know our guests and the people I stay with when they have time. \n\nOn another note, I was the first Airbnb host in my neighborhood in Portland, and I used to be the Community Manager for Airbnb in Portland back when the company was around 100 people.\n\nIf our schedules overlap, I offer walking tours of the neighborhood, kayak tours of the river, and play/ teach a little Ping Pong. \n\nMy wife speaks Vietnamese if that helps you in any way.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f1990bb-27bb-4187-b386-bef801fe19df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6060622,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6060622','Norah','Portland, OR','I am Norah. I like to exercise, listen to music and have a good time.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/61801487-06a3-49e7-9713-816ee75e90c8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6000443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6000443','Cara','Portland, OR','Professional couple who enjoy urban life with 2 simple cats. New York is too fast, Seattle too crowded, Portland is just right. Hosting out-of-town friends (and now strangers) is pure pleasure in this great town!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6000443/profile_pic/1415159382/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2749411,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2749411','Mariah','Portland, OR','We are a long term couple who have made Portland our home for over 20 years. The beauty of this place continues to knock our socks off! Getting out to hike, bike or kayak is a natural draw for us. Picnicking on the Wahclella Falls trail or kayaking on Lost Lake with Mt. Hood shining in the distance are favorite places.  When we get home we can walk to a nearby Thai bistro, Monsoon and pick up some Pumpkin Curry.  And there\'s also pizza and beer at the Kennedy School movie house. We love to walk out the door and wander down historic Mississippi Avenue for breakfast -- crepes at FlapJak or creme brulee oatmeal at Gravy.  Maybe we\'ll catch one of the seasonal events there like the Mardi Gras parade, Mississippi Street Fair or the Naked Bike Ride. \r\nBut we also love hanging with friends or watching one of our favorite Netflix shows like \'Miss Fisher\'s Mystery Theatre\'. I\'m currently semi-retired and Marilyn is fully retired as of October 2016. We have plenty of time to welcome folks to our charming cottage and be available as needed. Chances are we can answer your questions or point you in the right direction.\r\nOur motto is JAFA, Baby! (when you meet us, ask us what it means!)\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/56e44c39-65b3-474a-87a6-39e34e140023.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1996078,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1996078','Sally K','Portland, OR','Hospitality comes naturally to us. We\'ve come to learn that our most enjoyable guests enjoy taking care of themselves--and cleaning up after themselves. We love the simplicity, comfort and beauty of our home place, and we welcome you to find magic in the ordinary.  The guest rooms are on a separate floor from our living spaces, with 3 entrances to the garden. The garden is large & lush, with meandering paths and private places to be alone or together.  It\'s quiet here; the air is fragrant and full, with bird songs, creek sound, and honey bees. He is a farmer and I\'m a psychotherapist. I see possibility and he likes hard work. We\'ve been a good team; having found this crooked old house on a trash dump creek 20 years ago; we\'ve cared for and cultivated what has become a very special place. We thrive on good conversation, food, music, books, art, wine, dance, & laughter. We also like our privacy, and the structure of the house provides plenty of room to choose that. You can choose solitude or conviviality here as you like. It\'s a beautiful place to gather with a small group of friends if they like to talk softly or go away by 10 pm. Sound carries through the floors, so there\'s headphones to wear if you want to blast the stereo or watch a movie late. The TV has cable and surround sound. There\'s some real food in the kitchen, fresh sheets on the beds, good towels, toiletries, espresso & tea.  Namaste.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d3594e9c-b9ed-4110-a03f-a1279ee650ad.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6526820,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6526820','Ivy','Portland, OR','I\'m a settled-down traveler who found a gem of hidden land on the edge of the city--land that wants to be shared. I raise my family, tend the land and work in the community. Artist, herbalist, permaculturist, teacher and writer.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6526820/profile_pic/1370068939/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5927807,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5927807','Margo','Portland, OR','Carpenter, Artist, Traveler, Free Spirit.  From the Boston area.  Currently living in Portland, OR.  I love the Cape so much!\r\n\r\nI built this, my dream home, on the last sliver of my grandfathers property.  I grew up going to the cape every summer.  This is truly a magical and peaceful place and I hope you enjoy it as much as I do.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5927807/profile_pic/1365997800/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6510017,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6510017','Irene & Steve','Portland, OR','Steve and I both work in the hospitality industry. We love film, travel, food and wine... but our current obsession is our son, Luke. We love our little condo on the water... it\'s simple, but quaint. It provides us with a great getaway home from time to time to enjoy PDX\'s great food scene or a good music gig. We are happy to share it and hope you enjoy it as much as we do.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6510017/profile_pic/1395087400/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6621964,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6621964','Amy','Portland, OR','Hi, I  live in Oregon most of the time, but I grew up in Florida and I have a vacation rental there, in the town where my son lives. Check all our listings. \nWe love to provide a great experience for our guests! Having traveled the world and stayed in all sorts of places from hotels, vacation rentals, tents, thatched huts and resorts, I know I\'d be happy to land in one of my rental houses. My goal is to make you feel at home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6011374e-75a6-4c24-8c0a-8b200fdbd138.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6774413,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6774413','Duane','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Duane. I\'m a footwear designer and musician who loves to see new places. I spent 10 years in Portland so I\'m pretty familiar with the city and the NW in general. Aside from designing shoes for some of the NBA\'s biggest stars, I\'ve learned to snowboard here, discovered great food, and met some amazing people. I launched a tiny music career in this city so I can recommend some great venues as well. As a host, I welcome responsible travelers who appreciate well kept surroundings. As a guest, I treat your place as my own. Mi casa su casa. Su casa mi casa.\r\nduanealawrence  d o t c o m\r\nchampagneduane  d o t c o m\r\nhttps://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1242928\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6774413/profile_pic/1436903896/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6416589,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6416589','Adam And Arthur','Portland, OR','Adam Sanford and Arthur Wald are the owners and creators of THE STAY PALM SPRINGS and THE STAY PORTLAND. Having hosted over 8,000 guests, we’re excited to welcome you to our unique and captivating properties. We’re creatives at heart, with a knack for designing innovative and playful spaces you won\'t want to leave.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6416589/profile_pic/1425402189/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(234549,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/234549','Kerry','Portland, OR','World traveler, former journalist and guidebook writer with longtime experience living abroad (Nepal, China, France, Peru . . . ) -- I welcome fellow travelers to this lovely corner of the U.S.! My own travel style is a mix of research and serendipity. Happy to share favorite restaurants and things to do in Portland, where I\'ve lived since 1998, and have been hosting AirBnB guests since 2010. You\'ll be able to come and go as you please, and you\'ll have lots of privacy in the house. If I happen to be out of town, my very capable house manager will be taking care of you. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af1d7e4f-f7f3-4f3d-99cc-0436fa7190ee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5037209,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5037209','Pamela','Portland, OR','My husband and I have lived in this beautiful four square house for 14 years.  Scott is a native Oregonian, I was born just outside of Boston. I spent the first half of my life on the East Coast, with a little time spent in LA.\r\nFive things I can\'t live without: Mount Hood Vanilla tea,  my awesome camera, my wonderful children, my generous husband, and tuna salad with tarragon. \r\nI have a home office, so I am often available for suggestions and directions.  \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f57c99f-a988-4b9d-860a-4cc6a640c5f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7055900,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7055900','Saadi','Portland, OR','For us it\'s a tale of two cities! We spend our time between Portland, OR and Phoenix, AZ because we enjoy so much of what each offers. The seasons allow us to Hike, Bike & take advantage of the outdoors year round.\r\nWe would love to share this with you as well as provide you with the comfort of a place you can call home. We are true believers of a Sharing Economy!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c087617-a2d1-4f8d-9545-b5ec312656ff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6153335,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6153335','Sonia','Portland, OR','Hi, I’m Sonia. I’ve been an Airbnb host since 2013, and enjoy hosting. I like to create beautiful spaces for people to enjoy. My surroundings are very important to me. And having as small a footprint on this earth as possible is also important. So- My spaces are built with beauty and sustainability in mind. I use mostly reclaimed materials whenever possible, and each one of my Airbnb’s have beautiful lush gardens surrounding them filled with mostly reclaimed plants.\nMy three Airbnb’s are designed for different needs, but all with the purpose of creating a relaxing environment away from home. \nAll have full time tenants somewhere on the grounds, but the only shared spaces are the gardens themselves. \nThe Green Fairy: \nIs a Victorian duplex in the heart of the vibrant Mississippi/Williams neighborhood.\nPerfect for a family, or anyone traveling for work that wants a big beautiful space in the center of a super vibrant neighborhood. Tons of restaurants, yoga, brewpubs, coffee shops, stores etc. all a walk out your door.\n\nhttps://www.airbnb.com/h/thegreenfairy\n\nThe Treehouse: \nIs a separate modern daylight apartment in a 1970’s home (ours) in the west hills that backs up to Forest Park and all the hiking trails, yet it’s only 4 mind above the city.\nPerfect for work travel, and those that like hiking, trail running, and nature :)\n\nhttps://www.airbnb.com/h/thetreehousemodernorganicapartment\n\nThe Nest:\nIs a cheery simple tiny home behind my 1911 Craftsman in the vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood. Perfect for those who don’t need a lot of space, but want something cheerful and bright, in the heart of absolutely everything in a super vibrant neighborhood. Literally walk or bike everywhere :)\n\n https://www.airbnb.com/h/thenest-tinyhomeandgarden-thealbertaartsdistrict\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6153335/profile_pic/1408396735/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1616228,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1616228','Sally','Portland, OR','I manage a Yoga studio, teach Yoga and Meditation and practice Craniosacral Therapy... I have 2 adult daughters.  I love to cook, eat, travel and throw ceramics. My husband is a wonderful local architect who designed and built many of the modern details on our historic home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1616228/profile_pic/1372700193/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3859198,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3859198','Justin','Portland, OR','From Portland, Oregon\r\n\r\nI like the outdoors, active sports and nice beverage from time to time ;-).\r\n\r\nWhat else do you need to know?  Ask away!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3859198/profile_pic/1350165045/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(942377,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/942377','Emily','Portland, OR','Fitness professional and business owner who travels for work and play!   I have been in Portland for over 20 years and LOVE this place.  Would be happy to help point you in the right direction to make your stay here awesome ;).  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3559cb0b-7624-4c0e-9f4d-618c88fb1f82.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6960996,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6960996','David','Portland, OR','I am a teacher and corporate trainer.   With my free time, I like gardening, playing guitar, doing projects around the house and traveling.  We like music and in better weather, we invite people over and jam in the backyard. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6960996/original/1b030148-52d4-4cde-9eaa-33816abcd6a5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7647618,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7647618','Rose','Portland, OR','Originally from NYC, Rose has been in Portland for 25+ years. She works in property management and performs in comedy, Shakespeare and aerial arts. She enjoys sharing her knowledge of Portland with visiting guests.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/116c0e63-7264-4195-80a4-b64ac544e049.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7656277,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7656277','Joanne','Portland, OR','Greetings from the Rose City! I\'m a well-established and experienced airbnb host who thoroughly enjoys sharing my charming abode and making new connections with folks from all over the country and the world.  I maintain a very active lifestyle, enjoying year-round cycling, urban and mountain hikes and a regular yoga practice.  When home, I typically I spend time in my master bedroom suite and afford my guests a lot of privacy, but I\'m very adaptable to providing as much or as little contact as my guests might desire.  My goal as a  host is to provide a comfortable, welcoming place for travelers who are just passing through Portland, those who like to stay and explore the city and nearby areas, and for visiting family members of other Portland residents.  I believe my reviews attest to a very positive experience, so I hope that you are only a stranger to me until we have the chance to meet!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/28a0e967-c975-460d-b04b-49df0b203dff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7727691,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7727691','Kara','Portland, OR','I\'ve traveled and lived abroad, across Latin America and Europe... from camping to couchsurfing to hosteling to staying in nice hotels :) I love the shock of new cultures and am a language geek! I work as an American Sign Language/English/Spanish interpreter, and I speak basic Italian and French as well :)\r\n\r\nI love coffee, the green of the Pacific Northwest, backpacking, grilling out with family and friends, MexiTrain and Chickenfoot, dancing, and my garden.\r\n\r\nAs a host, I\'m sociable and will make you feel entirely comfortable while you\'re here. If you\'d like company, you got it! But my default is to leave you in peace, and allow you to enjoy the space on your own. As a guest, I\'m easy to please and tend to make coffee in the morning, leave, and come back to sleep at night! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e531092a-8f88-41ba-8386-58afe6de3bae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8138263,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8138263','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/297cc659-0f6f-4964-981d-a56cacb87954.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8207605,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8207605','Sharon','Portland, OR','.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9dc0b480-f298-4587-9491-6aabaf66c6fc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2722503,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2722503','Casey','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m casey. I co-host my loft with my friend Heidi. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2722503/profile_pic/1376789554/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2655510,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2655510','Steven','Portland, OR','Originally from the East Coast, we have been in Oregon for over 45 years, Portland for over 20 of those. We\'ve enjoyed Portland\'s cultural and culinary attractions, as well as hiking in the Northwest, especially with our dog, and traveling. Steve is happy to serve as host, including assisting or guiding you during your stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f6568b9f-9a6a-4265-b9ab-57d119ee59b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8441694,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8441694','Christina','Portland, OR','Caring and active young woman who loves Portland and the Pacific Northwest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f9b75e06-4e77-4902-8f28-9f2a5f3a634c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1178070,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1178070','Candace','White Salmon, WA','I am a Designer who enjoys designing for small spaces and traveling the World staying in Airbnb homes.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1178070/profile_pic/1392139737/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8703941,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8703941','Tracy','Portland, OR','I am a true Oregonian and love all Portland has to offer.  People instantly fall for our quirky, art-loving, coffee sipping, get outdoors and play city.  Personally,  I love yoga, running, travel, and meditation. I found Airbnb on a visit to see my son who attends college near Boston.  I enjoyed the experience so much, I decided to become a host.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8703941/profile_pic/1378653393/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1178421,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1178421','Stephanie','Portland, OR','I love where we live! Our neighborhood has so many of the things that make life beautiful. Great food, amazing bookstores, funky theatres, live music, an awesome selection of beer and wine, and to top it off - beautiful nature at Mt Tabor park. To me, family and friends are what make life worth living. We are so fortunate to live in a community that believes in working together and supporting each other. We look forward to sharing what we think is the best neighborhood in Portland with you.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1178421/profile_pic/1316729214/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8017624,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8017624','Martha','Portland, OR','Welcome! \n\nI\'m a self-employed professional that enjoys outdoor adventures in this Pacific Northwest wonderland. I list my home on AirBnb so others can enjoy this great launching spot for the Stumptown experience.\n\nWhen I\'m not traveling, I\'m often in the backyard studio and happy to help with anything you may need.\n\nEnjoy your time here!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8017624/profile_pic/1376889590/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4426731,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4426731','Martha','Portland, OR','I am a creative type and have loved calling Portland my home for over 20 years. I have 2 kids, one in college and in one graduating high school this year We keep busy enjoying all that Portland has to offer, from open air concerts, art festivals and street fairs, to simple walks around the beautiful tree-lined neighborhood with our little dog, Benjamin.\r\n\r\nWe love to kick about, take hikes, go bike riding, and play tennis. I have a small business in the creative industry and work for a major footwear company, KEEN, as director of talent acquisition. We are very in to having travelers stay in our new lovely guest houses, whether from nearby towns, across the country, or from another continent. We love traveling too! Every day should be an adventure and a day to learn from the people we encounter and make a new friend! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6bfdaf4f-5bda-4264-8864-faa81a012ec9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4243978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4243978','Anne','Portland, OR','Kind, outgoing, friendly, helpful, artistic, outdoorsy, active, gardeners and lovers of life! We have a big circle of friends and love music, dance, are interested in social and political issues and love to travel and enjoy meeting people from all over the world.\r\nOur home includes a wonderful, boisterous 7 year old girl in the main house and we are kid and family (and everyone else) friendly in our airbnb. Welcome! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/add121b0-69ce-48b2-a398-e1d3eb9e8d25.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84148,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84148','Mo','Portland, OR','I grew up in Pittsburgh, PA. After moving all over in my college years, I spent some time in New York and moved to Portland, OR in 2012.  I\'m an adventurous home chef, avid skier, nature lover and world traveler. I have roots in this area and love everything about the PNW - the mountains, the ocean and all the amazing places in-between. I love the bounty that every season brings us, my amazing friends and community, and yes, even the weather! As an airbnb host, I\'m honored to share the places that mean so much to me and my family with you. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5680669d-ae16-48b0-a80c-c539b3ba9e31.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8036326,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8036326','Martin','Portland, OR','I\'m a long-time Portland resident who\'s worked as a forest ecologist, a writer, and a stay-at-home dad.  I\'m an aficionado of what might be called \"practical architecture\" or \"low design\" -- stuff that really works, as opposed to just looking good.  Of course it\'s nice if it looks good too. :)\r\n\r\nAs a host, my goal is to make you comfortable then kinda get out of the way.  However, I do live right next door, so if you want, I\'m easily available to chat about stuff to do in Portland, the architecture of houses tiny and large, places to eat, hikes to take, etc. \r\n\r\nHope to see you soon!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8036326/profile_pic/1379894704/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9110094,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9110094','Douglas','Portland, OR','Hi, my name is Douglas!  Former attorney and history teacher who now founded and runs Portland Underground Grad School (pugspdx).  I\'ve lived in a lot of places: Toronto, California, all over the East Coast, London, and there\'s no place I love more than Portland. I ride bikes, play soccer, and go on hikes.  At home, I read the New Yorker and the NY Times, along with diversions into science, geography, Eastern poetry, and financial market theory.  \r\n\r\nFavorite restaurants: I have a lot.  I\'m a foodie in a foodie town.  \r\n\r\nI grew up in a restaurant family, so hospitality is in my blood.  I really like connecting people with place, so introducing guests to Portland, giving them a real sense of the city, is one of my favorite things to do.  \r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/19a7b05b-d021-498f-aa61-3e2f29105ce3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(102666,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/102666','Rosy','Portland, OR','Portland has been my home for many years. When not working I enjoy dancing, food, travel, and meeting new people. If you have the time I enjoy trading stories. If your curious ask me about things to see or places to visit.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3599bf0d-7d07-4ca4-9af5-ec1e9d35466f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4912906,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4912906','Jennifer','Portland, OR','Mother of three amazing young adults, yoga student & teacher. I love living in Portland but my truly happy place is on a warm, sandy beach. I love to travel and see the world but I feel fortunate to have raised my family in such a beautiful place as the Pacific Northwest.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4912906/original/cacf6c8c-ea30-4976-a0a8-c3928f145b38.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2592211,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2592211','Joelle And James','Portland, OR','We love our home, neighborhood, and city and enjoy sharing all three with travelers from near and far. James, originally from New York City, is a composer and music director and is well connected to the music and art community in Portland. Joelle, originally from Los Angeles, is a  kindergarten teacher. We\'ve lived on our wonderful street since 1999 and can\'t think of a better place in Portland to be. We are both long-time vegans and have enjoyed exploring the world through our taste buds. As hosts, we strive to give our guests the privacy they desire while still being available to offer insider tips on the best places to eat, play, and explore in and around Portland. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2592211/profile_pic/1383783071/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4966686,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4966686','Marc','Portland, OR','Despite all the hats I\'ve worn: actor, waiter, teacher, mortician ... Did he say mortician? Yep - just hung that hat up and am on to learning hair (even scarier)... Portland has been a constant, ever-changing, always cozy place to call home.  I love our four seasons, the art scene(s), eating my way through town and poking my nose into other people\'s gardens.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4966686/profile_pic/1382918842/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3379729,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3379729','Dana','Portland, OR','We are Dana and Misha from Portland Oregon. We are friendly outgoing folks who love living in Portland. We take full advantage of the amazing food and art in our city. We also love the easy access to the outdoors living here provides us. We love hiking, skiing, camping and traveling. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4bba3f0e-373e-446b-858f-17a75ca4a518.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5907304,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5907304','Sari','Portland, OR','Hi here are a few fun facts about me.  I love coffee ice cream, but do not drink coffee,\nI love to ride my bike on vacation, but do not ride to commute in Portland. I am a massage therapist working for 30 years. I love to receive massage just as much as I love being a massage therapist.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5907304/profile_pic/1404169112/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9319397,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9319397','Nicci','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Nicci. I have been here in Portland for 25 years and love it. I am originally from New Jersey. I have two teen kids . I’m a social worker at an amazing non-profit called, IRCO (Immigrants and Refugee Community Organization). I also am a Massage Therapist. We are always on the move in this beautiful city. Come stay with us! \n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bad12a12-6d0d-4541-b5a7-df6ccf1d1665.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2916925,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2916925','Margaret','Portland, OR','Hi! I enjoy visiting family/friends and exploring new places. I prefer a home space (shared or private) and love finding the local quirky stuff.\n\nI get along well and love meeting people. I also enjoy independence and privacy. Things I appreciate:\n- cleanliness, no perfumes\n- wireless internet\n- a spot for my suitcase\n- a welcome feeling\n\nIn 2021, I started offering a private suite in my home with the same standards I enjoy. Check it out!  :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2916925/profile_pic/1382933751/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9943209,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9943209','Brendon','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland, Oregon. I love the outdoors, travel, hiking, camping, fly fishing. I also coach high school baseball in the spring and summer. Love music, and going to live shows. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/34968e52-76fe-40ed-89cf-d4c358ab558c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3519465,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3519465','Carolina','Portland, OR','  Portland residents and world travelers.  Carolina and Brad enjoy fine art, antiques and traveling.  Airbnb hosts for 9 years with excellent ratings.  Our hosting motto is \"I want my guests to walk into an airbnb that I personally would feel is a 5 star rating\" nothing less.  Comfort and having essential amenities is critical when traveling.  Enjoying a fine bottle of complimentary wine awaits you after your long travel. Welcome to the world of airbnb!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/053ed818-64a5-4997-b585-dcb5c02340cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10385699,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10385699','Katrina','Portland, OR','I\'m from Flint, Michigan and I\'ve lived all over from New York, NY, to Squamish, BC, Canada.  I love to travel!\r\nI bought the house a few years ago and I’ve been remodeling it ever since. While being as eco-friendly as possible, wherever possible I used recycled or reclaimed material for the remodeling projects.\r\nI am an entrepreneur and my many endeavors keep me pretty busy! I have an event rental company (Night & Day),in which I try to make couples dream day come to fruition!  \r\nI am also the founder of Apples to Applesauce a non-profit dedicated to ending child hunger by ending food waste.  \r\nI remodeled the main floor and lower level into private apartments so that our friends, family, and Portland visitors could have a home away from home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10385699/profile_pic/1386007654/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10386316,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10386316','Kenan','Portland, OR','We are an active family of 4 (5 if you include the pooch!) on the go.  We have lived in the Sellwood neighborhood of SE Portland for over 20 years now and absolutely love it.  It is a friendly neighborhood where you can experience the feel of the city while being incredibly close to quiet and natural surroundings of the river and forest.  We love to escape to the coast and mountains as well, but are always are so happy to be back home.  \r\nWhen in town, we like to run, ride and walk, and venture into the hood for good food and drinks. If there\'s a Timbers or Thorns game on or at Providence Park, one of us will probably be there!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/280e5683-d8f5-46ee-8202-0f79e10ece5c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10438539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10438539','Michael','Portland, OR','Hi! Im a professional musician who has lived in Portland Oregon my whole life. An accomplished singer, keyboardist and accordion player, I make my living performing, teaching, and recording all styles of music - jazz, rock, country, etc. Besides my love of music, I also enjoy movies (all-time favorite: Charlie Chaplin\'s \"City Lights\"), books (just read \"True Grit\" and loved it), and pretty much any passionate artistic endeavor - theater, painting, architecture - you name it. Having grown up in the Pacific Northwest, I\'m a lover of the outdoors, especially hiking trips to Mt Hood and the Columbia Gorge, and camping trips to the Oregon Coast. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10438539/profile_pic/1386207026/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2687437,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2687437','Diana','Boise, ID','From Boise, Idaho and own two rentals  in Portland. \r\nwww.diazandpartners.com\r\nBlazer and Ducks enthusiasts along with lover of cats and motorcycles.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2687437/profile_pic/1340325122/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(729625,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/729625','Kerkyra','Portland, OR','I\'m from portland, oregon. I work in production whenever there are tv shows or movies filming around town. I love travel & coffee. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3eedaafb-e21a-46a7-b732-5022ef9a06ff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11446106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11446106','Logan','Portland, OR','5 Things I Can\'t Do Without (in no particular order): Great Food, Well Made Movies, Travel to Exotic Places, My Sons and A Healthy Dose of Exercise. \n\nI\'ve been to my fair share of places around the world and am always looking for more travel. I\'ve been to Korea, Sweden, Germany, Italy, France and England and Scotland. Most recent trip was Vietnam and Cambodia. At some point, South Africa is a must do along with New Zealand.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/11446106/profile_pic/1401642147/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11456606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11456606','Donna','Portland, OR','We bought this Condo to view the River every day to live in the Prestigious Pearl District Downtown in the walkable neighborhood.   We moved out since we had a child and the condo is not at all safe for small children with  2-3 story easily climbable decks it is dangerous for children, now it is our vacation home and romantic getaway.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b0e03471-66f8-4c45-9c45-97c3d9fd6b79.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(829833,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/829833','Kristen','Portland, OR','Our little family lives here in my hometown of Portland, where we now have the delightful adventure of exploring our town from the perspective of our newest member. \r\n\r\nI\'m a host at heart, always have been and really enjoy providing a comfortable, inviting environment for my guests as well as meeting all the fantastic people traveling through town!\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-829833/original/5cfd2efc-4b6e-4b8b-b074-2fb7f70862dd.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5229526,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5229526','Jere','Portland, OR','My husband, two sons and I got this big house in 2009 so when I retired, we could rent rooms to travelers. I retired in 2013 from teaching middle school science and spent the summer traveling.\r\nIn July I went on the Trans Siberian and Trans Mongolian Railways from St Petersburg by way of Lake Baikal and Ulaanbaatar to Beijing with fellow geography teachers. In September my sister and I walked the Coast to Coast in the Lake District and Yorkshire National Parks in northern England, which I\'m doing again this summer. Also, I\'ll visit Thailand and India later this fall.\r\nI\'d love to share travel stories with you. \r\nNow I love to walk, hike and bike around Portland most days. Ask me about where to go when you visit. I have many maps and books about getting around Portland and the Northwest.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4ce1f234-b53d-43ec-90bb-f363b83109e3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11995752,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11995752','Peggy','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-11995752/original/6b226599-8dcb-4e7c-bad2-b1ad94c9d138.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3521268,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3521268','Constance','Portland, OR','I am from Portland.....originally the SF Bay Area.   I was an urban planner & project manager for Portland\'s development agency, building housing near transit stations.  I love to bike, kayak, explore cities.  I travel a lot and have found cozy Airbnb’s in Amsterdam, Barcelona, England, Port Townsend, Ireland.  I have appreciated the personal connection with hosts and I\'d like to pass some of that good karma on to visitors in Portland',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d08e88b6-dbaf-4b99-9c51-e09a218fc381.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2333787,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2333787','Genevieve','Portland, OR','We love sharing our house with friendly travelers from across the globe. It\'s been so fun to create a space that makes people  feel right at home.\r\n\r\nA little bit about us...\r\n\r\nDuston - a father, a native Oregonian, a musician, a surfer and a DIY-er. He works in urban development and usually has some building or remodeling project in the works. Currently, he is immersed in building plans for a tiny cabin situated within a little wooded area out on the Oregon coast. It\'s a spot where you can hear the ocean, pick fresh huckleberries and cook over a campfire. It is wild & off-the-grid, so he is learning more about sustainable power, water and food sources for this new adventure. \r\n\r\nGenevieve - a mother, a California native, an animal lover, a gardener and a creative at heart. She is usually dreaming up interior designs and photographing her surroundings. An avid traveler, she is always up for the next adventure...especially if it includes time outdoors. She relocated from the desert 12 years ago for the greener scenery of the beautiful Pacific Northwest. She is happy to share her favorite Pacific Northwest hikes and secret river spots.\r\n\r\nOur daughter Sophie - an adventurous and carefree kid. She can often be found running around without shoes on, climbing trees, making mud balls, foraging in the garden, collecting rocks or crafting an art project. She is currently into swimming, bouldering and learning to surf on the Oregon coast with her dad.\r\n\r\nWe all love that our little Northeast neighborhood is so walkable and unique. Need a recommendation...we got you covered! The surrounding area allows for an  ideal experience for those who are visiting Portland for the first time or those who are familiar with the city and looking for a \"home away from home\". ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bee97fc3-b56f-4086-a29c-30fe63186280.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12272370,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12272370','Jeff','Portland, OR','i am an active married adult  male who enjoys golf , tennis, travel and work.   I enjoy exploring all parts of the world and learning about different cultures. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12272370/profile_pic/1392599057/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8927355,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8927355','Michele','Portland, OR','We are retired teachers who met while rowing on the Willamette River and competing at the national rowing championships.  We hike, garden, ski, and backpack.  We love Portland… it\'s microbreweries, awesome restaurant scene, farmers markets, parks, and book stores.  We also love how close it is to Mt. Hood and hiking trails in the Columbia River Gorge.  We are happy to answer any questions you may have about the city!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8927355/profile_pic/1393107810/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12483794,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12483794','Kurt','Portland, OR','My friendly, down-to-earth hospitality style reflects my Midwestern roots, but I\'ve found my true home in the natural beauty and cultural openness of the Pacific Northwest. I\'ve lived in Alberta Arts for more than a decade, and I\'ve enjoyed watching it become the mecca of food, drink, coffee, shopping and relaxing that it is today. It\'s a privilege to share this great neighborhood and region with friends, family and visitors from all over the world.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/da8ae369-6ded-4f21-b332-89ed3cef738c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12579841,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12579841','Kevin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/854d40af-ddaf-4f4b-b737-b27a898ddb13.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13032937,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13032937','David','Portland, OR','Welcome to my profile - I\'m as easy and chill as they come!  \r\n\r\nA bit about me: I am a career professional in the digital space who has worked corporate for nearly twenty years, believes in Karma, Midwest born and raised, kind, lover of laughter, listener, giver of savvy wit and sarcasm, gentle and anxious to meet you!\r\n\r\nI welcome you to my nest of a home during your travels to Portland. So as you \r\nformulate your travel agenda, please send me an Inquiry regarding any questions, needs/wants, or special circumstances. \r\n\r\nTravel safe and thanks again for considering my home as yours during your trip to Portland! Cheers, David',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67cc13fd-c634-482e-81e0-0c7a1afce4f0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5074035,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5074035','Rachel','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, Oregon. I am involved in art, music, design, gardening and community development. I am a vegan and I love cooking at home and shopping at local farmers markets and supporting my favorite local restaurants and shops. I have a teenager and we both enjoy riding bikes. Due to my own chemical sensitivities I use only unscented products in my apartment and in the laundry room of the building. Natural products with plant based essential oils are OK too. Reading books is one of my favorite activities. I feel extremely lucky to live within bike, bus, train or urban hiking distance to almost anywhere in the city. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9f3ee134-e24e-4a41-bb26-4f2d9c8eb467.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12807678,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12807678','Noel','Portland, OR','I  love living in Portland & sharing it with guests. Our city is so amazing there is never a day without something interesting going on here. I work from home managing our airbnb here and we also have a vacation rental out on the Washington coast in Long Beach.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcf01e40-cc31-4ac5-8fc8-c2b7fb0e2d06.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7409866,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7409866','Bryan','Portland, OR','First thought in the morning: Coffee!\r\nLast thought at night: Whiskey.\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3e388d8b-32ab-4fe4-8f0e-4721b316242d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1483711,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1483711','Caroline','Portland, OR','I am a progressive easy going responsible woman who loves to travel, eat, laugh, spend time with friends, family and explore the outdoors. Like most Portlanders, I thrive on living a vibrant life and I love sharing our great state with others! \r\n\r\nYou can be assured that you will be well taken care of here. My extensive travels throughout the world and my experience hosting guests at one of the wests premiere hunting and fishing lodges can assure you an enjoyable and comfortable stay in Portland. Community is important to our city, for my neighborhood and myself. I am lucky to be in a neighborhood filled with wonderful small businesses and great people of all colors and professions.  In Portland, our community is your community. You just may end your travel wanting to stay right here and become a Portlandian. \r\n\r\nHOSTING/TRAVEL: I search to find those who point me in a safe direction and allow me to create my own adventure. I strive to do the same for others.\r\n\r\nLIFE MOTTO:  While I don\'t live by one motto I do keep close the following advice I\'ve been lucky to receive...\r\n1. Life is always grey - don\'t live in the black and white..\r\n2. Being compassionate, generous and open will move the world in wondrous ways.\r\n3. Rules are meant to be blurred.\r\n4. Keep your word. Authenticity is a rare and valued quality. Get it and keep it. \r\n5. Wear horizontal stripes and crazy socks. A natural mood elevator, they make people smile. \r\nThere are so many more but these come to mind. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/066bf0b5-9369-4b30-b7a2-0858d65d5bb5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13462816,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13462816','Peter','Sunriver, OR','Im an outgoing Oregon native (Oregonian:) who loves the outdoors.  \r\nIve traveled extensively and worked for 5 years as a tour guide all over N America.  \r\nI lived on the road out of backpacks for years and so I know how things go jet setting all over the place.   \r\nOne thing you can expect when you decide to come visit the St Johns area of Portland is how convenient everything is.  Plus you can relax knowing that your Tour Guide host will have plenty of the details you\'ll want to know sorted out.  \r\nOutdoors, Music, Nightlife, Food, Culture and Portland style Weirdness - We\'ve got it all!\r\nFeel free to contact me anytime in advance with questions about what going on, what is available to do, generally what to expect.  \r\n  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13462816/profile_pic/1395847120/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13506616,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13506616','Joel','Portland, OR','We like to travel and know the value of a nice clean and comfortable place to relax. When such a space is affordable even better.  That is what we are providing with our space. \n\nMy wife Betsy and I moved to Portland in 2004 with our daughter.  I worked for the Environmental Protection Agency and retired in 2018.  We\'re now traveling some and enjoying the bounty of Oregon. Making wine and cider. Fishing, camping, Hiking biking etc.  We\'re happy to share what we know about this beautiful state and activity around Portland. \n\nI was a Peace Corps Volunteer in Sierra Leone from 1986 to 1988.  I love sailing, Morris dancing with the Bridgetown Morris Men, camping in my Westfalia camper van and I am also a scooter enthusiast. \n\nBetsy also worked for the U.S. EPA in Washington, DC, but has primarily been a stay at home mom since moving to Portland. She is primarily responsible for managing our Airbnb rental and advocating for public education with a couple of groups she co-founded.\n\nOur daughter is a Sophomore at the University of Oregon and is a talented artist, dancer and former competitive baton twirler.\n\nWe look forward to meeting you and helping you have a wonderful time in Portland, OR.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/50bd77df-2f3f-4eb7-8f10-6147a5ad6074.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2723562,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2723562','Judy','Portland, OR','I am a transplanted Western New Yorker. Portland became my home 10 years ago. The City and surrounding area is truly a wonderful place to live and explore. My passions are family, the out doors, hiking, gardens, cooking, and exploring the world!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cdd5e44b-3f01-4f97-a9ee-8ffeaa888f7f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5445817,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5445817','Laura','Portland, OR','I am an East Coast transplant but other than a 4 year stint in LA I have lived in Portland since 1992. I am a mother of three amazing girls and up until this year, I co-owned a small boutique in North East Portland.  I am currently testing the waters of home staging -which I love - while I explore new opportunities. \n\nI love Portlands local shopping and food scene and will be happy to provide you with recommendations of some of my favorites. I know from experience that traveling is not always comfortable or easy, so I have tried to create a space I\'d be thrilled to spend time in myself. \r\n\r\n* We live across the street from an elementary school so during the week from *8:30- 9:00 am and again at 2:45 -3:15 pm there is some congestion with parents dropping off/picking up their kids. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5445817/profile_pic/1441215850/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13267370,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13267370','Keith','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/78dd55b5-e5be-4cb4-ba5e-28b137004560.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10873863,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10873863','Roger','Portland, OR','My partner, Josh, and I  have been together for 32 years.  We relocated to Portland, Oregon from Vermont in 2010 and love it here.  We are both professionals who work full-time.  We enjoy local restaurants, theater events, hiking and cycling.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10873863/profile_pic/1399164060/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11551162,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11551162','Lacy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1c14e736-a968-4c95-b619-1098ac290cf8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15239348,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15239348','Andrea','Portland, OR','I am a marketing executive who travels frequently and loves all that Portland has to offer. Yoga studios, coffee shops, the amazing culinary scene, hiking, and amazing vista views are just some of the things I love about the Rose city. Hope you enjoy my beautiful city and cozy home as much as I do!\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/21d29842-0005-4193-9084-11bec0b228b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15346651,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15346651','Trish & Todd','Portland, OR','Hi Friends, we love being ambassadors for our city! I am originally from Canada and my husband is from Colorado. We enjoy traveling and exploring new places as well as showing off what we find special about Portland! By far our best trips were staying with friends or friends of friends in a neighborhood. We believe it is the best way to see a city and we enjoy helping our guests learn a little more about Portland too. Feel free to let us know what kind of experience you are looking for and we will be happy to help.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9c841243-2fa2-4c82-ab9f-00216d0b55c4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1243625,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1243625','Michelle','Portland, OR','Hello!\nI\'ve been fortunate to call Portland home for nearly 19 years now. I founded The Peoples Yoga in PDX and now work as a biodynamic craniosacral practitioner and somatic therapist.  I am an avid outdoor explorer, traveler, and river swimmer. Happy to share all my recommendations for all that Portland has to offer!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1243625/profile_pic/1363570557/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2051547,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2051547','Matt','Portland, OR','I\'m an engineer for a software company based in Portland, OR. I\'ve been travel across the globe quite a bit for work and I\'ve found that Airbnb is a great alternative to staying in hotels.  I usually travel light, so I always appreciate when a rental is conveniently located and takes care of all of the necessities.  \r\n\r\nI also just recently took the plunge and bought a house in SE Portland and I\'m enjoying the experience of hosting Airbnb guests!  I love to chat about books, movies, hiking, art and music, so if you\'re staying in Portland, I\'d be more than happy to make some recommendations.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2051547/profile_pic/1400372722/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4333411,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4333411','Mike','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m Mike.  I am the founder/owner of an IT services company.  My other interests are art history, traveling, (especially internationally), 50\'s modern houses, 70\'s BMW cars and Boston Red Sox baseball.  Come be our guests and enjoy the AMAZING city of Portland you\'ve been hearing about.  We love meeting interesting people from all over the world. \r\n\r\nSome of our favorite trips have been to\r\nKyoto\r\nCopenhagen\r\nParis\r\nBerlin\r\n\r\nThe best part about returning from a trip back to Portland is the relatively low cost of living, the ease of getting around and the super delicious food options.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4333411/profile_pic/1381261066/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11158071,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11158071','Karri','Portland, OR','Ciao People!\r\n\r\nI love traveling and I LOVE even more being a host of travelers - whatever brings you on your journey, work or love or experience!\r\n\r\nI started traveling by myself when I was 18 in 1989. Long before there was email and all of the cool things to support backpackers today, I had traveled many places; I survived and thrived because people gave me food, took me around, gave me lodging, rides to the airport and took care of me when I got sick. So, I am always looking for the opportunity to help people out on their journeys!\r\n\r\nMy greatest travel passion is visiting national parks in eastern and southern Africa - so far I have been to 17 parks and I am in love with African wildlife and cultures.\r\n\r\nBut besides Africa, I love SE Asia culture - especially the food; I love Italian culture - especially the language; and, more than anything, I want to go to Mongolia, Bhutan, Khazakstan and Wales.\r\n\r\nI am very much into the Slow philosophy as a lifestyle - I am an avid gardener and adventurously good cook.  \r\n\r\nMy biggest dream is to travel the world via dirigible.\r\n\r\nAs your host at PandaFaerie House here in Portland on Mt. Tabor, you will always find local roasted micro lot organic fair trade coffee or organic hand picked tea, a nearly complete Charles Bukowski collection for your reading voyeurism and a totally friendly greeting committee comprised of my dog, Bunny aka TACO.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/11158071/profile_pic/1390239211/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15910930,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15910930','Thanyaluk','Portland, OR','Sawaddee ka!\n\nMy name is Joy Hemphill, a mother of two who loves to meet new people and travel the world. Born and raised in Bangkok, Thailand, I have called Portland my home away from home in the past 20 years. \n\nWhen I am not working, I enjoy walking in the woods, picking fresh berries, foraging mushrooms. I love yoga and I brew my own Kombucha. \n\nMy children and I enjoy meeting people of all nationalities and different backgrounds. When we travel, we enjoy the comfort of staying in an Airbnb so we opened our home to allow the same pleasant experience to travelers visiting Portland. Since 2014, we have welcomed hundreds of visitors from all over the world. \n\nBefore booking, make sure to read the reviews of my previous guests and feel free to contact me if you have any questions about my listings. I am looking forward to welcoming you. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5a9a9635-9f37-4509-af9b-79ad622f392a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15975696,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15975696','Jennifer','Portland, OR','My husband and I have lived in Portland for 20 years. We have traveled a lot and would love to share our guest house with other travelers. We love new cultural experiences and value diversity. We enjoy hiking, biking, skiing, and pretty much any outdoor activity. We can provide information about activities in and around Portland. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/15975696/profile_pic/1401059632/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9260383,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9260383','Wei','Portland, OR','I have owned this house and have been living in Portland since 2006.  I worked at a job for a couple of decades that required frequent international travel. I have traveled to 29 countries & 4 continents.  In addition to travel, I love Argentine Tango, playing fútbol, crafting, cooking, board games, reading (non-fiction and alternative medicine), snowboarding,  interacting with international-minded people, and studying the Spanish language.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3259d9f4-9d3f-4d60-92b3-9d502d3477e6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8637203,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8637203','Justin And Sarah','Portland, OR','Justin and Sarah are from Portland and have three kiddos. Justin has travelled moderately through the world and we love meeting new people. We know what makes us excited about travelling and want to help others enjoy their adventure.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8637203/profile_pic/1405491376/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9132065,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9132065','Jodi','Portland, OR','I am a Northwest native and in Portland since 2005. I am frequently outdoors gardening, hiking and biking. Sustainability and the environment are important to me and I strive to recycle and lessen my footprint where and when I can.\n\nI love living in Portland!  It\'s easy to get around by bike, bus and MAX train to all the great parks, restaurants and diverse neighborhoods. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9132065/profile_pic/1401772157/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3022845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3022845','Joel','Portland, OR','I am a retired physician who has been active in hosting and an experienced landlord.  I have rented out parts of my house for 30 years, which has been a very positive experience.  I get very energized by meeting new people and in maintaining connection with community.\r\nI am partnered with Kelly for the last 20 yrs.  He works for the airlines so I get to fly a lot using his benefit. It also means that he occasionally has very early mornings, so we tend to go to bed between 10 and 11 and get up early.   The 3rd floor is right above us, so we appreciate people being quiet after that time.\r\nThe 3rd floor also has very dramatic windows but with unusually low window sills and I am very uncomfortable having younger kids up there. We love having kids in the house otherwise.\r\nI have lived in Europe for a number of years, mainly in Sweden. I am passionate about choral music and sing in a number of really good choirs.\r\nOur house is smoke free. We prefer more than a one night stay.\r\nI do give preference to people with a more complete profile and to those with more references.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3022845/profile_pic/1407951745/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10160131,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10160131','Patricia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10160131/profile_pic/1402942627/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5462607,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5462607','Joel','Portland, OR','Hard-working and fun. More about me: @siedenburg and LI /joelsiedenburg/',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3a3f1e23-31af-436d-b6f1-d912f0361351.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(887013,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/887013','Rob','Portland, OR','I currently live in Portland, Oregon.  I love to travel every chance I get and eat all the new things.\n\nAfter school, I lived in SEA (Thailand, Indonesia and Malaysia) teaching English and working in a Dive Shop as a Dive Master, spent a couple years back in the USA, ended up in Dublin, Ireland for a year before coming back to Portland to fall in love with the city all over again.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/030082ed-b563-4928-a796-3e53463939ee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7239911,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7239911','Gibran','Portland, OR','I live with my wife and daughter in Portland, OR. We love this city and have been here for two decades. We also love traveling and being in the great outdoors. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7239911/profile_pic/1403502297/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17293984,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17293984','Denise','Portland, OR','I\'m from San Francisco, moved to Portland with my family years ago. I have loved ones all over the world. It’s so wonderful to be a host for travelers! I garden, cook, dance, rollerskate & DJ records. Ran and volunteered the nature/gardening program at nearby grade school. We love our relaxing neighborhood. Our home is on 1/3 acre lot, so it\'s like country living in the city,  the best of both worlds! We walk over to Mt Tabor park every week.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17293984/profile_pic/1443230845/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17264703,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17264703','Bob And Karen','Portland, OR','We were born in Oregon and love living in Portland. Both from working class families, we keep active and athletic, and are rather art-obsessed.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/b45f2ec1-c8ef-44a0-ae62-2622722d0c05.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11853939,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11853939','Kristin','Portland, OR','I grew up in Oregon, but after nearly 20 years of living in various cities around the world, my husband and I moved from England to the wonderful city of Portland to put down roots.  We have grown very fond of Portland; I\'m so happy to be able to show it off to visitors and potential new residents! We love the local food & wine scene, amazing scenery, enormous musical variety, plethora of outdoor activities, and all the weird and wonderful things Portland has to offer.  We have always favored B&B\'s on our own travels, staying in all types across Europe, Asia and the US.  We are very happy to be able to use all these wonderful experiences (and learn from the bad one\'s!) for our own personal vacation rental. Welcome!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/11853939/profile_pic/1392315401/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6864209,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6864209','Arlene','Portland, OR','Social, outgoing woman dedicated to community and family.  I love gardening, cooking, hiking, traveling and enjoying the natural beauty in the forests and the oceans.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c22b5c5-0c90-4190-a5d1-526e98b4d04f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4241752,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4241752','Bay And Mike','Portland, OR','My husband, Mike and I are in love with Oregon, both natives.  We currently split time between Mosier Oregon (Columbia Gorge) to work in our garden and Portland Oregon.  In Mosier we attend to a garden that we sell locally to farmers markets and a couple restaurants. We love traveling, hiking, cycling, gardening, and meeting other travelers.  We find a real joy in hosting.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4241752/profile_pic/1414727298/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17509708,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17509708','Armond','Portland, OR','Easy going and friendly. I know this city very well and can help you understand the lay out of the city and location of most must see spots.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/75cd044c-34ac-452f-9006-031acf894857.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17530443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17530443','Jenni','Portland, OR','Hey! I\'m Jenni, an avid traveler who likes hosting to indulge my travel bug and curiosity about the world and its inhabitants. I\'d love to hear your travel stories and learn more about you!\n\nMy other main hobbies are languages, the sciences, and new experiences in general. I also love to cook with friends.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-17530443/original/fb407680-e203-470b-8bb0-9b20745adc3f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4716299,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4716299','Tamara','Portland, OR','In 2011, I renovated an old Baptist church, where I now live with my partner, Seren, 3 cats, 1 dog and a chinchilla. We love to travel using Airbnb whenever possible and we are seasoned super-hosts. We are so grateful for the opportunity to rent a portion of our home, meet so many amazing travelers and share a little slice of our beloved city. \nI like to make stained glass, cook, watch movies and visit thrift stores, indie shops and galleries.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4716299/profile_pic/1411887438/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(891590,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/891590','Eecole','Portland, OR','I am a foodie and farmers market fan, massage therapist, nutritionist and now a real estate agent with Hearts 4 Housing.  I love to dance and sing, share amazingly delicious and healthy food and play with friends as often as possible. I also work hard and LOVE my job helping hospitals increase their purchases of local and consciously grown food.  My partner John also lives here and enjoys metaphysics, dance, & singing.\r\n\r\nWe have an abundant garden that we look forward to sharing with you! And, i\'m kind of an ambassador of Portland. I LOVE this city and happy to share my favorite spots with you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/891590/profile_pic/1435302898/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8587273,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8587273','Kanchan And Peter','Portland, OR','We are a couple living in North Portland since 2012 and love traveling , connecting with people and learning about different cultures. \n\nWe love sharing our home with our guests and that reflects in our relationships. People come here as strangers but leave as friends.\n \nIf you are new to Portland or just passing through, our place can be a  home away from home  and we would love to host you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8587273/original/f3db3ae7-7115-4148-8f94-e1ff9f1be5b5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17934290,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17934290','Kathy','Portland, OR','There are so many things I wouldn\'t want to live without. I will name a few:\r\nmy family and friends\r\nour dog, Breezy\r\nthe sunrise behind the Cascade mountain range each morning\r\nferns, moss, forests and waterfalls\r\nadventure and travel\r\nartists, writers, musicians, singers, dancers, actors and comedians\r\ngreat food and wine\r\ntop chefs and cool restaurants',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17934290/profile_pic/1413600257/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17615383,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17615383','Patrick','Portland, OR','I love to travel and to meet other travelers!I\'m a certified personal trainer and work for the city of Portland. I also love anything outdoors, music, history, and foreign language.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17615383/profile_pic/1411941337/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10433870,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10433870','Alysia','Portland, OR','I have three boys (twin 6 year olds and a 10 year old). We love our neighborhood - there is something for everyone. \n\nLanguages: English and Spanish\n\nLoves: Traveling, eating, running/hiking, exploring new parks with my kids, and sleeping - in random order.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c9bbddb6-0b13-4390-b1bd-360c8521cc6f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7379278,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7379278','Susanne','Portland, OR','Portland has been my \"Home away from Home\" for the past 24 years & will be for the remaining years ahead. I\'ve traveled extensively throughout the world & can\'t think of a city as friendly, entertaining, environmentally conscious & visually beautiful as this one. I enjoy sharing what I love about Portland & Oregon.\r\n \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0c02d1ab-e5ce-48cf-9f59-200e3840d335.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(274455,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/274455','Eugenia','Portland, OR','I am a fully vaccinated artist living in Portland Oregon. I received my M.F.A and taught college courses for 10 years. I create beautiful white on white paintings. I have done commissions for The Grand Dame Raffles Hotel Presidential Suites in Singapore, The Nines Luxury Hotel Presidential Suite her in Portland, Tiffany\'s & Co. The Marriott, The Ritz Carlton in San Fransisco and the Tyson Center in D.C. and many others. I am have had museum  and gallery exhibitions and am collected all over the world. In 2013, I created Beaux Arts Contemporary (a gallery) to show case my art along with other artists to do national and international art fairs. I love to cook, travel, I love new experiences, museums and meeting new people from all walks of life.\r\n \r\nCheers.\r\nEugenia Pardue',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/274455/profile_pic/1339890341/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13695963,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13695963','Jason','Portland, OR','I am an arborist living in Portland, Oregon. I spend my free time hanging out with my daughter riding one wheels and walking my dogs in the neighborhood. \r\nAs a host, I’m more than ready to help in any way I can with info and supplies, but I’ll also leave you to enjoy the room with respect for your privacy. I’m easy to reach on my cell phone if anything comes up, and when I’m around the house I love to give recommendations of things to do.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f9f1bd5-166c-491b-ade4-6757234893db.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18590525,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18590525','Tom','Portland, OR','We\'re so glad you\'re interested in staying with us! Our household in the pulse of Portland is a snapshot of family life in this terrific city. Our children, ages 13 and 18, inject moments of silliness, laughter, and drama into an otherwise tranquil and serene environment. \n\nWe\'ve called Portland home since 1998. We know it well, love sharing our experiences and observations, and learning from our guests.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5bcb2bf-eba0-4e01-8e58-8df32046eadb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13351238,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13351238','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I am a Neonatal and Pediatric Physical Therapist and I love working with children and families!\r\nGiven a choice, I would rather be outside than inside, but I can be a homebody too. \r\nIt might be nerdy, but I like to read books about the brain. I also like historical fiction above other types.\r\nI stay busy with my singing group Choral Arts Ensemble which pushes me to learn great music with great people. \r\nI love to travel and have done many house trades all around the world. \r\nAttitude, awareness, appreciation.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13351238/profile_pic/1396028698/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1795731,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1795731','Matt And Emily','Portland, OR','I work as a designer for a remodeling company.  In my off time I love to hunt mushrooms and enjoy the amazing pacific northwest.  We have a chocolate lab named Myrtle.  When I am at home I usually like to cook and watch a movie on Netflix or play music with my wife Emily.  She teaches 7th and 8th graders in the Art of Language.  We also have two daughters, ages 4 and 6.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/633e0a88-129e-4469-a798-0b29d95f5d31.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2410278,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2410278','Donna','Portland, OR','I\'m from Portland OR.  I am a dance teacher, performer, and choreographer. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2cae95c7-9951-451a-b575-de37695c2c3c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18846362,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18846362','Ian N Fam','Portland, OR','Very laid back, happy go lucky, very personable just enjoying life.\r\n5 Things cannot live without: Food, Water, Air, Laughter and Love',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/97f3dcc9-3c30-4d83-973e-212e72d752d1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(847543,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/847543','Stephani','Portland, OR','I am an avid travler! Experiencing new cultures is a passion of mine.  When I\'m not traveling I love having people over, eating, drinking, and doing lots of Yoga!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9a29a445-5bce-4946-99a8-8116535f3701.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(748943,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/748943','Gabriella','Portland, OR','  :-D. Fully Vaccinated including all Boosters!\r\n\nEvery moment counts… \r\n\r\nYou\'ll find me to be organized and passionate about most of the things I enjoy which include, my home, the outdoors, gardening, fitness and animals including my dogs, Beau, Clarke and Lyla.  My home truly is \"my\" castle :-)).\r\n\r\nI love the concept of the ‘Airbnb Home Share Community’  including time spent, laughing and sharing ideas and world views with guests of all backgrounds and cultures . (I’m not however comfortable with guests who use my home as a cheap alternative to a hotel)..\r\n\r\nBorn and raised in Portland, You’ll me familiar with the city and a good resource.  Happy Hour, Coffee houses and locally owned business are places I frequent so please don\'t hesitate to ask for my input or opinion of where to go for great eats of all origins, coffee and artisan drinks.  There are always venues for music close by as well.  Just ask....\r\n \r\nMy life motto is: Treat others and their belonging as you would like yourself, your home and your loved ones treated!\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-748943/original/0ca2ce38-96b6-41d5-9454-381fe0153d28.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2738309,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2738309','Neha','New York, NY','I love (Website hidden by Airbnb) the new kitchen is a treat for me! Location of an apt has always been very important for me no matter which city I travel to. I love to walk, so if the location is great, it makes it easier to explore! \n\nMy mom always taught me growing up...to take care of another person\'s place better than I would take care of my own! So I have tried to live by that motto when I\'m a guest.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2738309/profile_pic/1340659765/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76618979,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76618979','Riika','Vancouver, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/93fe1f4c-193f-4edb-9dbd-7844121b695e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19817453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19817453','James','Portland, OR','James and Clarissa have lived in Portland since 1999. Clarissa is in education and James is a designer and they are originally from Texas. They have lived in North Portland for the last 12 years and have been hosting Airbnb guests for nearly 10 years.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/788419dc-a251-4fca-8ca8-e5452da963df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19252862,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19252862','Kelly','Portland, OR','I am a nurse with a family. I have traveled quite a bit and stayed in many different types of places. I like meeting new people and having new experiences.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f2527f85-d53b-4714-b5b5-694e522c1a99.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20091250,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20091250','Amanda','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c234d425-8347-4684-8780-9592b5844678.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20180480,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20180480','Martin & Grace','Portland, OR','We enjoy living full-time in our Richmond neighborhood home in SE Portland, being very close to work, and within easy walking distance to much of the best and most popular shops, restaurants, parks, and amenities of Portland. We have lived in the Portland area for about 30 years (her) and 20 years, (him), respectively. We are professionals working full time. Grace speaks some Spanish. We enjoy gardening, biking, yoga/jogging/gym, walking the neighborhood and area streets, home improvements, attending shows, the Portland Art Museum, camping, hiking, skiing, surfing, eating out, having backyard barbecues and hanging out in the tree-covered back yard. We love spending time at the Mt Hood/Columbia Gorge and Oregon Coast areas that are about 1 or 2 hours drive away. The Hawaiian islands, Ft. Collins Colorado, and the Asheville NC areas are our favorite long distance travel destinations. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/31cbefac-896d-4b4a-9f67-4682e8aaf042.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4701601,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4701601','Kyla Ley','Portland, OR','Hey there! We have 4 Air BNB\'s in Oregon - mostly long term stays. I\'d love to host you for your next stay. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d861506b-9d6c-4bdb-8e57-f81438d136f9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9494168,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9494168','Sue','Portland, OR','I am an east coast lady who made my way west. I have been living in Portland for almost 16 years and feel lucky to call it my home.  I love to cook, travel and snowboard.  I play second base on a competitive kickball team and live music fills me up.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a0d2074-a672-4cda-963b-8265811bb342.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8761908,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8761908','Ryan','Portland, OR','Hello! I’m a freelance web developer who works from home, and my wife Courtney works at OHSU in Portland, OR. We live in Portland with our two daughters, ages 5 and 7. After years of being Airbnb guests, we\'re thrilled to have an opportunity to become hosts. We\'re happy to help make your experience as comfortable and easy as possible!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/413a63fa-a7f0-45e5-9bfe-89c153c505d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7029980,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7029980','David','Portland, OR','I’m renting out my home occasionally when I\'m out of town. I love my space and hope you will too!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3fef2d68-6b8c-4855-9420-385da530c486.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(128686,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/128686','Leah','Eugene, OR','Friendly, older, nonsmoking professional, upbeat but a bit on the private side. When traveling, I try to avoid hotels, preferring to explore places by staying in residential neighborhoods and chatting with my hosts and neighbors. I\'ve had wonderful experiences through airbnb, and hope I can match the graciousness of some lovely hosts. I\'m a distance runner, and would appreciate your help finding good routes around your home. And for you runners, cyclists and cross-country skiiers out there: I\'ve got guidebooks and tips galore for you, just ask. I like to try out new restaurants, especially neighborhood places that are not especially glamorous, but where the food is good. I\'ll recommend my favorites when you stay at my place, and I hope you\'ll share yours, too. Finally, I work a lot. So I may not be around much during your stay, and when I\'m traveling it may be that I just hole up in the cosy space you\'ve provided and focus on getting my stuff done. \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/128686/profile_pic/1276569026/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14055038,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14055038','Alex','Portland, OR','I am a self employed mother of two, originally from England. I have lived in the US since 1988, mostly in Portland. I love to travel & before coming to the US traveled to many countries in Europe & also a little in Asia.\nI have lived in 6 states, including Hawaii & Tennessee, and travelled to about 35 others, as well as Canada, Mexico & Costa Rica.\nWhen I\'m not dreaming of traveling, I enjoy hiking, walking & running & relaxing with my friends. I love to read installed a Little Free Library outside our house several years ago. \nI love to cook and have owned/operated two breakfast cafes and a Jazz club. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/14055038/profile_pic/1396993824/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20955728,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20955728','Cristy','Portland, OR','My husband and I share our home here in Portland with family, Lee & Quiana, who reside full time on the property, holding down the fort. Both work in the city and Q is also acquiring her Masters at PSU. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b16c9999-861a-4dd2-adc7-807029deb46f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21024600,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21024600','Barbara','Portland, OR','Barbara and John are both art school graduates from opposite coasts. They raised their kids in Portland and hope for them to return after they are done traveling the world!\r\nWe love living in the Reed College area. It feels like the suburbs, but is so close to everything. We had a great time remodeling our home to create two separate living quarters and keep both spaces light and airy. We hope you will spend some time outside and watching the neighbors go by with their dogs and you may even see our neighborhood goats!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21024600/original/e22c92e1-f65b-4670-ad43-a08b811f4a58.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18861712,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18861712','Ilana','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in the Pacific Northwest all my life, with about 9 years in Vancouver Washington.  I\'ve been blessed to travel to France, England, Greece, the Caribbean and several states in the US.  I love meeting and talking to people and hearing about their travel experiences.   I purchased my row home in 2008 and love living close to my family, downtown; and the energy of Alberta Arts, Mississippi Historic District and the Pearl.  \r\n  \r\nIf you love food, you\'ll love this location, I\'m surrounded by amazing restaurants, bistros, and food carts.  I\'m self-employed so I work out of my home.  I don\'t smoke, and don\'t want smoking in my home.  \r\n\r\nI enjoy an occasional glass of wine, good food and close friends.   I think you\'ll really enjoy your experience here in the city of Roses.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e8fa86b6-9a0a-424f-85eb-c62666bdac28.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13825879,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13825879','Ed And Kym','Portland, OR','Ed is a retired Amtrak engineer who loves to golf. Need a tee time? Just ask! Kym  retired from work in apparel and can tell you the best places to shop for fabric.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13825879/profile_pic/1411884267/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3867866,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3867866','Maren','Portland, OR','Maren is a Nevada native and Kevin is a Colorado native. We both moved to Oregon 10 years ago. We like calling Portland our home, but we love to get out and travel too, whether it\'s a day hike in the Cascades or a week in Havana.\r\n ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3867866/profile_pic/1415587417/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21846830,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21846830','Deb','Portland, OR','The \'small city, big town\' aspect of Portland is what drew us to Portland 25 years ago. I\'m a Montana girl who loves the vibrancy of an urban atmosphere and the culture of both the countryside and the town. We have put a lot of love into the Portland Belmont House. We now enjoy sharing it with others.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c5952a8-b6ab-4d3c-927e-b53530a49634.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22096995,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22096995','Diana Louise','Portland, OR','Diana is a midwife/nurse practictioner. She and partner Ryan host an AirBnB in Portland, Oregon. Ryan, an illustrator/cartoonist. She was born in Boulder, Colorado; Ryan in Oakland, California. Ryan and Diana love people and carry this passion into hosting. They expand their horizons through teaching and learning, reading, food, travel, art, conversation, painting, meditation and exploration of the outdoors. Their beloved feline companion, Rusty, is a long furred orange tom cat. He is dedicated lap cat and a fan of naps any time of day. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3a9c4d70-cf76-4a73-ae35-898e5c4f9c76.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22131920,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22131920','Mary-Margaret & Greg','Portland, OR','We’ve lived in the neighborhood since 2001. We\'re both from Portland originally and love sharing what we know about our hometown. We\'ve always loved hosting guests, and Mary-Margaret has been a landlady for many years. We want people to have a pleasant time, and we love thinking of everything someone might want to be comfortable. We\'re both respectful, curious, and love to laugh - but not so loudly that it keeps you up at night. :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-22131920/original/d761f4e0-828d-41db-bf7e-19a5b478fee8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20090994,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20090994','Lill','Portland, OR','I was born in Norway, raised inner city Chicago, and educated in Northern California. I moved my family from Santa Cruz to Portland in 1991. I have watched  Portland grow into an amazing urban center over the course of the past 23 years. We are vibrant, alive, and exemplary in nature. \r\nI have traveled to more than 30 countries and adore the adventure. As a designer and contractor, I love the modern, minimalist movement of architecture that this city wraps its arms around now. Come explore why I love North Portland and this specific location. Be prepared to be impressed!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49f7ee5d-3f9e-4d73-b7bd-573bda04a822.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22404852,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22404852','Malia','Portland, OR','I\'m an artist and designer, capable of finding satisfaction is most anything analog or off the beaten path. I enjoy meeting new people and will be happy to tell you where the great spots are for coffee or a beer. I work at home most days in a studio separate from the house and my spare time is spent taking in local culture and sharing experiences with close friends.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49c75c84-2e0f-421c-aeb5-3c419bb989ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22461545,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22461545','Robert','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22461545/profile_pic/1413173541/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9624551,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9624551','Cheryl','Portland, OR','I\'m from Portland, Oregon, but have been teaching abroad at 10 different international schools for the past 25 years.  Now I am semi-retired, and living half the year in La Ceiba, Honduras.   I\'m in the process of buying land on Cayos Cochinos, an amazing coral reef paradise - where I can go snorkeling off my front porch   Between living in the Caribbean and wonderfully weird Portland, life is good...... \r\n\r\n My motto is \"live your passion.\"  I\'m friendly, helpful, and like to get to know my guests.  But I also respect people\'s need for privacy, and leave it to guests to socialize or be alone as much as they would  like.  If guests suggest preparing a shared meal, I\'m always pleased to take part.  Having lived many places in the world, I enjoy having the world come to me these days.  I enjoy learning people\'s ideas, insights, opinions, and having a stimulating conversation over a glass of pinot grigio.  I love exploring:  places, people, ideas, and new talents and skills.  \r\n\r\nLike most people in Portland, I\'m an avid gardener, conservationist, and a recycler.  If you are not interested in recycling and composting your garbage, this would not be the best choice of a place for you to stay.  \r\n\r\nMy feline buddy, Pepino, is a shy fellow who you will rarely see.  He\'s a 12 year old rescue cat who I absolutely adore.  If he checks you out and allows you to pet him, consider it a high compliment!!!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9624551/profile_pic/1386013368/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22541617,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22541617','Cynthia','Portland, OR','We have lived in Portland for over 35 years in the hawthorne neighborhood. When we aren\'t traveling, we enjoy eating and drinking in the many Portland neighborhood restaurants. We enjoy sharing our knowledge of the city with travelers and think this is one of the best cities to live in and visit.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22541617/profile_pic/1416601862/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18163672,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18163672','Melissa','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/18163672/profile_pic/1411826727/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4099316,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4099316','Traci','Portland, OR','We\'re a family of native Oregonians with two rescue pups and a Lynx Point Siamese. When we\'re not working, our favorite activities include traveling, whitewater rafting, renovating old homes, restoring the family’s farmhouse in the country, and trying as many new restaurants as is physically possible. After 15+ years in the neighborhood, we were lucky enough to be able to build our dream home in our dream location, and included an apartment to be able to share our love of Sellwood with others.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4099316/profile_pic/1415136614/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22906371,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22906371','Ben','Portland, OR','I am a 43 year old self employed musician / music teacher.  Father to one amazing 8 year old boy and 3 year old English Pointer named Blue.  Avid outdoorsman, yogi, traveler.  \r\n\r\nI\'d be happy to help you get to know Portland.  Or I can just stay out of your way so you can find all this wonderful city has to offer on your own!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22906371/profile_pic/1420201832/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23051392,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23051392','Nick&Shelley','Portland, OR','I\'m originally from Colorado and I\'m a writer and a reluctant handyman. My wife Shelley is a rare native Portlander and Physical Therapist. We love the water, the outdoors, delicious beer and good food – all that great Pacific Northwest stuff. We have two aggressively friendly young kiddos who will chat your ear off and a dog named Otis who just wants to be your best friend.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0136af8c-2350-4d42-aeb1-29ab36fb7072.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3022438,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3022438','Erin','Portland, OR','My name is Erin (she/her) and I am from Portland, Oregon. I am an apparel designer by trade, and world traveler when work permits. I love to design, cook, and travel the world. I am easy going and love to meet new people. We love sharing our family home with new travelers and have loved all of the AirBnB homes that we have visited.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d10250a7-ba2f-4bbe-a5b7-707c9108fea0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2623945,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2623945','Jeff','Portland, OR','Raised in Cleveland, schooled in Tucson, in Portland for 27 amazing years!\n\nI entertain myself by watching my beloved Cleveland sports teams, gardening, cooking, doing house projects and hiking/skiing/fishing around Portland, Mt Hood, The Gorge and The Coast, touring the beautiful neighborhoods looking for interesting architecture and houses, spending time and money at local businesses, going for bike rides, hanging with my close friends and going to Portland Timbers soccer games. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca4536fe-af02-4344-9b5e-099882809fce.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66254675,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66254675','Kara','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff4667be-2a91-494a-b9c7-af9ecd581467.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17225282,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17225282','Jay','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/66cac721-7e03-42ee-ac09-c339e9f02055.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(477663,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/477663','Joelle','United States','As Airbnb Super hosts we care about creating an inviting and fun space for our guests.  We want you to be comfortable and enjoy our vacation homes. \nAs avid travelers we enjoy exploring the world.  We love to live local, and explore. We love kind people who bring joy and peace to the world  As guests we are quiet, respectful seniors who work online.  We travel w/our service animal Marv W.  a sweet well behaved Bichon who loves to cuddle.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/396da314-2b4d-4002-91b7-5d84c553d9c8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22904946,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22904946','Sibyl','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-22904946/original/fa9dfba3-63a5-44e1-841d-33a0e56db5f1.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4702598,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4702598','Loretta','Portland, OR','I am a private practice attorney specializing in corporate, contract and real estate law. I live in Portland and am available for any questions.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7c36391-1240-485c-a548-a959155dc489.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8474325,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8474325','Kristin','Portland, OR','So you are visiting Portland huh?  Well you\'ve come to the right place.  More than just a place to stay, we are committed to helping everyone get the most of their time here.  We have made a full time cause of learning and experiencing the best of Portland\'s culture, be it food, nightlife outdoors or any of the myriad of \"quirky\" events that \"keep Portland weird\".  Seriously, whether here for business or vacation, Portland is too much fun to miss out by staying in a hotel and not knowing what to do or where to go.  We like biking, drinking beer, listening to local bands/DJs, going dancing, watching soccer, exploring the wilderness and participating in anything that is new and sounds fun!  We enjoy our city every day and want to share that with you. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/25e8ca25-0569-434a-ba90-4d2c56a37f7c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2312710,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2312710','Laurie','Portland, OR','I am a Wisconsin native but have been living in Portland for the past 16 years and love calling it home.  I share your love for traveling and am happy to help out with suggestions hoping see all the beautiful things the PNW has to offer.   I have traveled all over the world using Airbnb as well and enjoy getting to know people from all walks of life.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bac243c9-69cd-48cf-883e-83026f136c7e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8530650,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8530650','Virginia','Portland, OR','Real Estate agent, Designer, Educator, world traveler, foodie, arts patron and grandmother, I have lived in the Portland area for over 30 years. I love what the city and the greater Northwest have to offer. I can tell you about some of my favorite hikes, restaurants, boutiques, etc.  If you are considering moving to Portland, I am happy to show you neighborhoods and houses, and provide tips on maneuvering the wild and crazy Portland real estate market.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8530650/profile_pic/1442801579/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21691680,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21691680','Lori','Portland, OR','I am someone who tries to live life full! I believe it is a gift that should be cherished through respect of others and myself. I would not want to live without great friends, great food, worthy projects that stimulate my creativity, my health and my home. \nI have traveled fairly extensively in Mexico and speak simple Spanish. I\'ve also been to Europe, Canada, Hawaii and Alaska. \nI love to cook and most meals are made at home with fresh meat and vegetables (some from my garden).\nI love meeting people from other countries and have been a \"homestay\" host to students from Japan and Saudi Arabia. I also had a lovely Persian woman renting my spare room for about a year. I have always done my best to make my guests feel a part of the family and give them the opportunity to experience the best of American life.\nWhen I travel I usually go by public transit and would say I keep it on the cheap in general. I like to be close to the center of the action, but also enjoy going to the countryside.\nMy life motto is, \"life is too short to be dull, so embrace it with excellence and make as many memories as possible!\"',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21691680/original/a46460c9-e931-4d94-b65a-d142bad49943.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15693905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15693905','Susan','Portland, OR','My husband and I are empty nesters with four adult daughters between us; we both have two.  We love bicycling and try to incorporate it into our travel adventures near and far.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f51cd155-e22d-4701-894f-800f61c159d7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9032075,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9032075','Ben','Portland, OR','Accountant, world traveler, socialite. \r\n\r\nI recently took a year long sabbatical before setting back down in my hometown of Portland, Oregon. One of my favorite joys about traveling was meeting other interesting people from around the world, and that is also one of the joys about hosting an airbnb. \r\n\r\nCountries visited: Canada (cerca 1993, 2003, and 2014), Italy (2003), Mexico (2005), China (2007/8), Hong Kong (2008), Japan (2009, 2010), Vietnam (2009), Philippines (2009), Poland (2011), Israel (2011), India (2012), Sri Lanka (2012), Thailand (2012), England (2013), Spain (2013), Morocco (2013), Turkey (2013), Singapore (2014),  Malaysia (2014), Cambodia (2014), Laos (2014), Peru (2014), Bolivia (2014), Ecuador (2014), Colombia (2014). \r\n\r\nStates visited: Washington, Oregon, California, Nevada, Idaho, Montana, Utah, Texas, Arizona, Oklahoma, Ohio, Illinois, New York, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Maine, Rhode Island, New Jersey, Maryland, DC, Florida, Hawaii. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9032075/profile_pic/1416445697/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23159593,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23159593','Annie','Portland, OR','I am a native to the NW. Extensive travel and I have lived and worked in Norway, Denmark and New York City. I have been here in Portland in the same hood for 20 years. Love to garden and entertain my friends with my cooking. Lifes feels good and complete. When we are able to schedule around school we love to travel and explore the outdoors. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e488e352-d8cf-4769-a40f-7d88c5dae06a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2200022,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2200022','Ted','Portland, OR','I am a Chemistry teacher for Portland Community College.  I am also an active co-parent.  I’m a foodie and always happy to offer suggestions on where to eat depending on your tastes.   I make it out to the Gorge to hike at least a few times a year as well as the coast to enjoy the near freezing Pacific Ocean.  When I\'m not catching up on my favorite shows on Netflix, I like reading fantasy/science fiction.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/21ddcfa7-2980-4aab-89bf-ae8ad2380642.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24064951,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24064951','Kristen','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/399220cf-46f2-41bc-ae42-1fd685287fbe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24167390,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24167390','Katherina','Portland, OR','I am a whale researcher, community builder, artist and instigator of good things in the world. I run a whale research and education project in Mexico. My three big passions are whales, Mexico and making good things happen for people. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/24167390/profile_pic/1416969394/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24465004,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24465004','Gregg And Nikki Team','Portland, OR','Nikki grew up in Texas and claims Austin as her hometown; Gregg grew up in Michigan and claims Detroit as his. We met in Austin and fell in love while traveling together. We\'ve been traveling together (and separately) all over the world and this country for most of our lives. After living together for 7 years in Oakland, CA, we decided to move to Portland, OR because it matched our lifestyle of community building, music loving, hiking, biking, tree loving, gardening and art making. Then we had twins. Having two babies at once sure is a great way to put the breaks on travel plans for a while!\r\n\r\nI think it only natural that Gregg and I would eventually transform a large part of our home (where we remain happily held hostage for a period of time) into something that would continue to connect us to those that are in the midsts of their travels. \r\n\r\nWe love living here and we love sharing our maps and guide books of the area. As well as portable cribs, highchairs, boardgames, and other supplies to loan you, we also have bicycles, camping gear and other equipment to rent out for a small price.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-24465004/original/33eba307-b317-48df-b954-16661ade9725.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2695720,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2695720','Katherina','Portland, OR','Writer, sculptor, traveler, epicure, whale nut.\r\n\r\nI run a community-driven whale research and education project in the state of Guerrero, Mexico. When I\'m not in Mexico studying whales and working to heal and protect the ocean, you can find me in my studio in Portland, Oregon making sculptures, travel writing for magazines and newspapers and making good things happen for people. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2695720/profile_pic/1368655972/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1007790,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1007790','Emily & Chad','Portland, OR','We are an adventurous family from Portland, OR who love camping, eating delicious food, and exploring Portland. Chad hails from Phoenix and is a huge AZ Cardinals fan. He also loves rock climbing, animals, and eating thai food. Emily hails from Sonoma County, California and is an urban planner who loves adventurous baking, gardening, and eating pie. Emily studied abroad in Denmark in high school and again in Germany in college. She loves meeting people from other parts of the US and from other countries and pointing them to the best things Portland has to offer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1007790/profile_pic/1418692182/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14802436,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14802436','Kristi','Portland, OR','I’m an expert marshmallow roaster',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf980de6-d51c-401c-b8ca-7c578b0b2cef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24711856,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24711856','Vicki','Portland, OR','I am a single young 74 yr old woman who lived in Honolulu for 29 years.  I have traveled to 96 countries, many of them several times for extended periods.  For me it\'s always the people, food and weather that make my experiences memorable and  I pride myself in being Portland\'s good will ambassador.   I really want my guests to love this area and want to come back so I try by best to deliver the experience they are aiming for..',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d81229b6-c016-4f8a-bbb3-72d9691ffefc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4817279,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4817279','Susannah','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m glad you are thinking of staying in inner SE Portland during your visit. Our cozy garden suite will meet all your needs and have you ready to go in the center of Portland. I\'m Susannah, I manage the apartment and live just upstairs with my partner, Mike and our dog, Tally, and two cats. We moved here 4 years ago because we wanted a walking lifestyle and to be in a place filled with progressive minds and creative small businesses. We live in our dream location and we look forward to sharing it with you. Though we still love travelling the world (mainly the Spanish speaking world) and get out as much as our busy schedules allow. I\'m a massage therapist and Mike is a Software Engineer who has a short commute downtown. When I\'m not working or managing the garden suite I\'m either hiking with Tally, getting time in the sculpture or painting studio, or exploring the neighborhood with Mike. I\'ll personally make sure your Portland home away from home is ready for you, fresh and sparkling. I look forward to meeting you and getting you all settled in. Take care ~Susannah',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/444e0e3d-9084-4520-8100-a3f8d37f4f2c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25016067,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25016067','Rebecca & Kevin','Portland, OR','We\'re a married couple that has been living together in Portland for more than 15 years. Rebecca was born and raised here, worked in the nonprofit arts for many years, and is now a graduate art student. She can provide endless suggestions for happy hours, art viewing, and navigating mass transit. Kevin is a painter and media artist from the East Coast. You can count on him for conversation about punk rock and getting around Portland by bike.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-25016067/original/f11705f9-b6bd-450e-b28c-911cec332ea6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2111718,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2111718','Lauren','Portland, OR','We bought and remodeled our home here in Sunnyside neighborhood of Portland in 2014. We are a family of 3; Shad and I are both nurses at OHSU and we have an 8 yr old boy Jon who keeps us busy and active. We have a friendly little goldendoodle Wendy who you may see as you come and go.  \nWe enjoy playing in the great outdoors, hosting guests and providing a cozy, family-friendly home base while you explore the PNW.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/195be741-5469-4cd7-828b-3f48fecc11c9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25267321,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25267321','Jennifer','Portland, OR','My husband and I have 2 young boys and love our neighborhood. We have been living in our home since 2007 and built this studio guest home in 2008 when I was pregnant with my first son.  And yes, when I say we built it...I mean we physically built it ourselves with some very generous friends.\r\n\r\nWe love doing home projects and spending time with our boys camping, hiking, etc...\r\n\r\nPlease let us share our wonderful city and neighborhood with you. :)\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25267321/profile_pic/1420411903/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25307230,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25307230','Mia','Portland, OR','I arrived in Portland in 1990 to attend graduate school.  In 1993 I rented this home and purchased it in 1997.  In the summer of 2014 the garage that housed the tools for the remodel was converted to a new lovely studio.\nI am a retired art teacher.  My two biggest hobbies are creating art and gardening.  I have had chickens for 24yrs. I also enjoy hiking and getting near water, whether it be the coast, lake, ocean or river.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-25307230/original/d092fcd6-16b6-4e89-b820-986532acdecf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25347302,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25347302','Chayo','Portland, OR','I am From the SF Bay Area now living in Portland Oregon near my children and Grandchild. I am a Ceramic artist with a home studio. I teach private ceramic classes in my studio. (Ask me if you would like a class while you are here)I enjoy gardening and have a large lush back yard for my visitors to enjoy. I also enjoy cooking so there will be treats for the travelers. I love living in the Mt Tabor Neighborhood near walking trails and the 60th Max line.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e5a390f7-2547-4bae-a559-52085a9faeab.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25357111,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25357111','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I tutor children with dyslexia and my husband is a Salmon Biologist.  We have lived in Portland Oregon for over 20 years and love it.  We love to travel, and are big foodies.  I am a Nourishing Traditions follower, so there will be lots of bone broth on hand!  We roast our own coffee, make our own goat cheese grow our own hops and make our own beer. Oh, we also have 2 beautiful boys age 22 and 24!\nOur motto is \"Have no regrets!\"',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bcd76dd0-9abe-43b9-8526-6d8127d32506.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7389792,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7389792','Carolyn','Portland, OR','Portland Native who Lived in Mexico for several years.( Hablo Espanol Bien)  I am a  Nurse and Ayurvedic wellness Practitioner. Lately I have been really into being creative with my home and enjoying my guests as well as super busy working   doing Nursing.  My partner Mark is here a good share of the time - He is a Portland native also and is happy to share his knowledge of the area,  as am I . ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7389792/original/8c3f46f6-311d-4509-b7af-b0dae045b024.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(375683,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/375683','Luisa','Portland, OR','Worked as a Child Welfare Caseworker. My  Friends and family are immensely important to me.\nLife is short, enjoy yourself, love abundantly.\r\n\r\nOne of my favorite sayings:\r\n\r\nIf you want to be loved, be lovable. \r\n      -Ovid \r\n\r\nAnother favorite saying:\r\n\r\nIf you can talk . . .sing\r\nIf you can walk . . .dance\r\n\r\n      -African proverb\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b68d1795-1088-4e4f-bfe8-1cd8b2f5ed2d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15103041,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15103041','James','Portland, OR','Hi!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-15103041/original/d7afeaf6-f297-4ded-a6b6-06298ece1dad.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4497071,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4497071','Veronica','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Veronica. My partner, Mike, our baby boy Sage, and I live in beautiful Portland, Oregon. We love to hike, camp, and truly appreciate nature. The Pacific NW has so much to offer and we try to spend as much time as we can out in the woods. But we also love city life as well! Portland is such a fun place to explore, with great food, music, and culture. \r\n\r\nI work as a counselor, mainly providing therapy for children. Mike works as an engineer in the green energy sector. Both of us come from all over...Myself growing up in Germany and Florida, while Mike is from Missouri. All very different places which probably is telling of how we ended up in the Pacific NW!\r\n\r\nWe also really enjoy meeting new people! We use Airbnb regularly as guests, and are really excited to host folks. We hope you get to experience a bit of where we call home :)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a80f14e7-328b-4111-89e7-5f84cdaec10d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23400410,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23400410','Bryan','Portland, OR','Hey! I\'m Bryan. My partner and I travel a lot and want to share our home with others when they travel! We\'re into the outdoors and when we aren\'t home we are usually out there in the wild doing nature things like snowboarding, surfing, hiking, camping and more. We love eating out - that\'s why our home is so close to some of the best Restaurants in Portland. If you need any help during your stay just let us know! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/23400410/profile_pic/1439406144/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25897935,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25897935','Sarah','Portland, OR','Willie and Sarah Gore...the carpenter and the gardener.  We are your hosts!  We have lived in the Concordia neighborhood for 15 years. Sarah is a native Oregonian and Willie has been here for over 25 years, originally from Arizona.  We are world travelers but love coming home to our beautiful NW home. Willie is the man behind the construction of both our home and new cottage.  Sarah is the gardener and interior planner for both abodes.  We love working together to create unique indoor and outdoor spaces for ourselves and Air B&B guests.  Sarah enjoys cooking and currently works part time as a private chef.  She enjoys baking so be prepared to sample some delicious fares!  The garden provides many seasonal fruits and berries that she uses in her baked goods.  Both Willie and Sarah enjoy outdoor activities; walking, hiking, biking the neighborhood and golf.  Sarah is an avid reader and is happy to share her books.  Both know the the NW well and can recommend many sights to visit and good places to eat and drink.  We look forward to hosting you soon!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25897935/profile_pic/1421208868/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26081771,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26081771','Chuck And Annika','Portland, OR','We are a fun-loving, professional couple with a passion for our town! Chuck is a Director for a Software Company, Photographer, Home Cook, Semi-professional Mixologist and Runner. Annika is a Licensed Clinical Social Worker, Dietitian, Baker, Knitter and Purveyor of Portland’s Boutiques. Chuck came to the Rose City almost 20 years ago via Santa Cruz, CA and NYC. Annika moved from Idaho to Portland over 10 ago and we were married in March of 2014 surrounded by friends, family and a marching band! We are long-time residents of the quiet, yet vibrant Richmond neighborhood, owning and extensively remodeling our home for over fifteen years. Portland is where we love to staycation and we dig exploring everything from our town, to the coast, to the Gorge and high-desert beyond. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/26081771/profile_pic/1421716789/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21379161,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21379161','Jeff','Portland, OR','30 year resident of Portland with my wife Susan hailing from Chicago. Me: General contractor (I built the home) Her: City Planner and former Chair of the neighborhood organization. Specifically built our guest room for maximum privacy but will welcome you into our home and help you with your visit to Portland. We built the homes surrounding this one and have an intimate micro-community. We like camping, crossword puzzles, movies and travel. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/abbe34d0-2f90-407e-a131-5603504c59f6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26381987,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26381987','Kim & Shawn','Portland, OR','We love having friends over and created a space to accommodate that by remodeling our guest home. Since we love entertaining and traveling, we thought Airbnb would be a perfect way for us to utilize our extra space when its available. We\'re big beer and wine enthusiasts, love dining out, cooking and cherish our animals. We can\'t wait to meet you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee58cbde-4195-42fa-adda-080fbf32dff3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7630516,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7630516','Linda','Portland, OR','Linda is a former Waldorf teacher, retired restaurateur, with a new career in medical billing. Missy is a full time artist with a passion for acrylic painting, glass mosaics & making tie dyed clothing. We love to cook, bake, garden, car camp, play poker, see live music, meet new people and hang out with family & friends. \n\nWe love the idea of connecting with people from all over the world through Airbnb. We are ready to host you and help you enjoy our great city. Please come and stay at our comfy home!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7630516/original/a014cf62-e3e8-44a9-9d05-be4cd6c3dd8d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14540855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14540855','Jordana','Portland, OR','Enjoying the great outdoors from the mountains to the oceans with family and friends is where you will find me the happiest!  Traveling, hiking, camping, yoga, arts and crafting, snowsports and outdoor concerts are some of my favorite activities.  I like to live by the motto of \"someday is today\"  Dreaming Tree Rentals is proud to book with Airbnb and I am passionate about designing accommodations that make the average stay extraordinary.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-14540855/original/5371f606-d09d-4ef1-af08-a63d9b675a32.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4611659,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4611659','Art','Portland, OR','We have owned the home since 2000.  \r\nBettina and I met through cycling. \r\nWe have a male black lab Tucker, and female black lab Nikki.\r\nWe enjoy cycling, yoga, and hiking with our \nWe enjoy Portland and the food it has to offer.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5bc1b187-3a00-4e3e-b9fb-20e7d01b1b54.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26822355,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26822355','Todji','Portland, OR','Your host Todji is an artist.  He is a sculptor, musician, curandero and hospitality artist!  \n\nTodji has been restoring The Magic House since the year 2000, when he arrived as a renter.  \n\nTodji purchased the Magic House as a self employed artist in 2004 and continued to rent rooms to friends and artists while he restored the house during the day and sculpted at night.\n\nTodji was born in SF & has lived in Brazil and Peru.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0198f992-37ba-43bd-a2c8-b28fc91ec426.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26929359,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26929359','Ed & Mary','Cathedral City, CA','Welcome to Portland! We have been hosting on Airbnb for over 10 years now!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/26929359/profile_pic/1425083965/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16217416,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16217416','Kristi','Portland, OR','I have had such a great time being an AirBnb host.  It\'s like opening my home to family or old friends.  I have met such great people from all over the globe.  One overnight guest from Germany ended up staying 4 months and is now an \'adopted little brother\'.  I love living in the northwest.  Portland is such a fun, eclectic city...so much to do!  I love to play outdoors whether it be hiking, biking, rafting, gardening, or exploring the different neighborhoods on foot with my Labrador or a friend.  Listening to live music is a favorite pastime whether it be at a small venue like Mississippi Studios or getting sun baked at the Waterfront Blues Festival with thousands of others.  And food!!!  So many great restaurants to choose from!  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cd505cbc-7af9-4931-8e7f-c98d3d1da5fc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7358871,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7358871','Michael','Portland, OR','We are a house of creative and mindful individuals who love gardening, crafts and home improvements.  We are a queer-friendly, feminist, diverse, environmentally conscious househols. We love to grow fruits and veggies, cook and throw an occasional dinner party.  Our guest suite is set up for you to be as private and self-sufficient as you like, but we are here on property if you need anything or would like to say hello!  We love to meet new travelers and can offer tips and ideas for activities to enjoy here in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57ec247a-2854-47ca-97c6-60c1182d8907.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27071792,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27071792','Scot & Karen','Portland, OR','I\'m a freelance video editor and home builder.   I\'m friendly, but respectful of a person\'s private space.   I\'m very into walking (I hike in Mt. Tabor park every morning), photography, racquetball, reading, movies, and craft breweries, of which there seem to be no end around here.  I like socializing, and getting out to see what this amazing city has to offer!\r\n\r\nMeeting my guests is like having a little holiday without leaving Portland, as I get to hear what their home countries or regions are like.  This is the best part of Airbnb, and what keeps me excited to open my home to people from all different walks of life.  It\'s a pleasure and an honor to have people stay at my place, especially guests who are visiting this lovely country for the first time.   I also travel as much as I can, with an eye for what makes for a terrific stay, and incorporating the best of the great ideas I run across at other Airbnbs I see. \r\n\r\nMy partner Karen (who co-manages our listings) does community outreach, marketing, and large group mediation.  She is an amazing cook, a nascent wine expert, a hiker, movie buff, and part time caregiver for her mom.\r\n\r\nWe can give you lots of ideas about pubs, restaurants, hikes, things to do while you are in Portland, but we am also fine leaving you alone to explore on your own, if you would prefer that.  There are a TON of different food types and styles within walking distance of here.\r\n\r\nI believe the best of life really happens when you\'re outside.  But if the weather won\'t behave, this great house at least allows one to sit in front of a cozy fireplace and look out at the amazing view and watch the world go by. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/99ecc83f-11ec-4f4f-878a-45c3e67fbcd6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27506814,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27506814','Lilly','Portland, OR','I am a mother to two fabulously fun to be with kids, a sweet and excitable dog, and a talented, knowledgeable and exceptional husband.  I teach art in a local public high school where I spend my days with students I feel lucky to work with. Art making and apprecaiting is an integrated part of our world. Travel is  essential as extended family are far away in other states and we like to get together often! We love life through laughter and exploring new directions of places, people, foods, music and artwork.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/27506814/profile_pic/1424149365/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27956806,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27956806','Mary Beth','Portland, OR','Female couple \r\nlove people, love travel; love portland, esp. it\'s food & natural beauty!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/27956806/profile_pic/1424293676/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6298174,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6298174','Sara','Portland, OR','Hello! I am excited to host you and happy to help you with any questions or tips for your trip. I\'m available if any questions come up during or prior to your visit. Just reach out.\n\nWhen I\'m not playing hostess, I love my work as a freelance designer and artist, working in the garden, riding my bicycle, exploring hidden eats around town with my partner and playing with our two rescue mutts.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6298174/original/47d9cbe1-d283-4170-8b7a-d1ed20641635.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28017147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28017147','Stephanie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/28017147/profile_pic/1424390319/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28190369,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28190369','Maria And Pete','Portland, OR','Maria grew up in southern Oregon and Pete in southern California. They currently live in Portland and spend their free time traveling or thinking about traveling. When in a new city, they love to hop on bikes and find places to eat. They also love to hike, camp, surf and wander. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/28190369/profile_pic/1429734663/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22375978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22375978','Jeffrey','Portland, OR','The Boly family, Jeff (a retired tax and estate planning attorney), Linda (a Registered Nurse, who works at Portland-area hospitals) and Michael (a recent college graduate) and our manager Brianne Fagan look forward to welcoming you as guests to the Boly House. We are confident that you will find our location, our interior and exterior site improvements, as well as our amenities to be pleasing and reasonably priced.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22375978/profile_pic/1426199604/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22576469,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22576469','Joshua And Renee','Portland, OR','We love the city and the outdoors. Portland is the perfect blend of all the wonderful things a city offers combined with adventures galore. We continue to run competitively in addition to our day jobs working for the University of Oregon and working in the sports industry. \r\n\r\nWe really enjoy meeting new people and helping them to discover some of the wonderful things the Northwest has to offer. Having moved from the east coast six years ago, Oregon has truly become home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22576469/profile_pic/1425423962/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2783582,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2783582','Oceana','Portland, OR','PLEASE NOTE:\n\n\n\nWe love living in Portland! This is a great city with more greenspace and good food, coffee and beer than just about anywhere in the world. Our goal is to offer a beautiful little home away from home in order for you to be able to experience this great city. We love to garden, hike, and ride our vintage tandem Schwinn all over North Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2783582/profile_pic/1425853468/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11358484,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11358484','Rachel','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5e18bcac-023f-4f63-8adb-2d3d16010298.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19711951,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19711951','Peggy','Portland, OR','   I\'m native Californian who fell in love with Portland when visiting my daughter  five years ago.  A week later, I bought my home and never looked back!  I am passionate about the lush green landscape and the rain as well as the Portland art and music scene.  As an artist and illustrator, I find continuous inspiration here.  I love to travel, entertain friends, am a voracious reader. \r\n   I enjoy meeting new people and I celebrate both our similarities and differences.  I am a hands off host - respectful of your privacy, but am also happy to suggest great local restaurants and fun things to do in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19711951/profile_pic/1407561261/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3519870,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3519870','Steve','Portland, OR','I\'m from Portland Oregon, formerly from Northern California by way of the metro New York City area. I have my own business in the Nutrition industry and love music, travel, nature, comedy, spending time with friends. I got married recently (2015) , Nelga is from the Philippines and a wonderful woman.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/16898bba-fd4a-420b-a094-b77d20418464.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26905222,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26905222','Ines','Scotts Mills, OR','I\'m an avid traveler and lover of adventure. \nI cherish culture and lifestyle diversity.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c7c2e0b-9492-478d-8f77-4492a697a866.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17783032,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17783032','Sara','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17783032/profile_pic/1426024651/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20930553,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20930553','Justin','Portland, OR','I was raised in Washington DC but have lived in Portland since 2009. I have been happily hosting AirBNB guests in my finished sub-main apartment since 2015. I generally leave it to the discretion of my guests to introduce themselves so they can maintain privacy if desired. That being said, I\'m just as happy to share stories of travel and adventure with them as I am to have them enjoy their  stay in peace and quiet. \nIt\'s my pleasure to recommend favorite dining spots to my guests and to hear about new ones they may have discovered during their stay. \nI love skiing, biking and basketball. I enjoy reading, cooking and gardening too. Also admittedly a bit of a sci-fi nerd. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f1dbab05-4f54-49b8-90c6-f7140dd4cbe4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30549717,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30549717','Raquel','Portland, OR','Hello - Thanks for visiting.  \nA little about me.   I am originally from southern California, lived in several US states, and speak Spanish. I have traveled to Costa Rica, Puerto Rico, and have cruised both the east and west coast of the US. I like meeting people from different cultures, and learning what it is like living in other parts of the world.  I look forward to your visit',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/30549717/profile_pic/1440964283/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30708290,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30708290','Evan','Portland, OR','My name is Evan. I\'m a native Portlander who has lived, worked and traveled elsewhere but now feel fortunate to be living in my beautiful home town. I recently spent two years leading the complete renovation of this 1902-built house, and very much learning how to do it on the job. I enjoy playing music and going to local live shows, chatting on porches and taking walks in the neighborhood. I used to be a journalist and lived/worked as a writer in Lima, Peru several years ago. Now, running 1234 House is my primary focus.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3bec6522-2542-4f6d-afb8-41760fa00d15.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24909901,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24909901','Wendy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bcf4e82f-2a34-40ff-8895-1619eb8f4915.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31042891,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31042891','Darlene & Dan','Portland, OR','Love to travel - love to be outside - love to garden - love people - love life!\r\nA former tour guide in Europe, I\'m looking forward to sharing the Pacific NW with visitors - you\'ve just gotta come to Portland!\r\n\r\nGrew up in Denver Colorado. As a kid, was lucky to travel throughout the West - mostly camping adventures.  As an adult, lived in Europe, on Guam and seven different states. Traveled A LOT, but the bucket list just keeps getting longer! My favorite cities (besides Portland): New York, Denver, London, Paris, Munich, Strasbourg  - and any place with great architecture and interesting museums.\r\n\r\nI love to eat at new places I haven\'t tried yet - Portland is a foodie town, let me help you plan your trip and places to EAT! Oh yeah, it\'s also a brew pub town and a happy hour town!!! \r\n\r\nWe love to have guests. Your apartment is private, but we love to host you on our back yard patio - our neighbors even want to meet you! We\'ve had great conversations under the stars or next to the firepit!\r\n\r\n\"Live in a state of uninterrupted marvel\" - Jack Gilbert, poet',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/15e5fc3e-5ae3-48cf-8a7b-b29eb9a3c482.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31093263,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31093263','Ed And Cheryl','Portland, OR','Our family built a \'mother-in-law\' apartment on the side of our house. Complete 800 sqft , full kitchen and bath.  Our 96 year old mother in law needed more help so had to move into our home. Hence we have an available one bedroom apt.\r\nMy wife Cheryl and I have lived here for the past 30 years. We enjoy good wine, movies and food as well as have interests in green technologies. I  also have the hobby of Ham Radio and also do  a Folk Music Radio show twice a month on  a community radio station.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/31093263/profile_pic/1442612259/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31813936,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31813936','Carol','Portland, OR','I am a person that loves living in Portland, Oregon or Sky Valley Resort in California.  My joy is my family, friends  and pets.    Things that I like to do are gardening, walking, camping, traveling and having friends over for dinner.  My travels have brought me to Europe, Africa, Central and South America and all around the USA.  It is so fun to make connections with people from around the world.  My style in hosting is to warmly welcome you to my home in Portland OR or  Sky Valley Resort in California.  My goal is to provide you with tips on places to eat & visit and to assist you with any needs in regards to the apartments or my home in the desert.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-31813936/original/38f7a16b-8d60-42ed-8c77-9dc4f7b703bf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4635967,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4635967','Jesse & Jeff','Portland, OR','By day, Jesse works at a foundation focused on health and Jeff teaches special education in our public schools.\r\n\r\nWe spend our free time cooking, gardening, traveling, doting on our honeybees, and enjoying the marvelous food, drinks, friends, and sights Portland has to offer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f109e6ac-31be-402c-b902-f258bae4e035.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(851489,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/851489','Jingzi','Portland, OR','I live with my husband and our daughter in Portland.  We have lived and worked in three continents of the world and love to share our apartment with travelers.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/851489/profile_pic/1365571315/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30384117,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30384117','Bryce','Portland, OR','Hello! My wife Julie and I have traveled around the world together staying in Airbnbs along the way. We\'re happy to host people in our home to give other travelers that same local experience we\'ve come to love and appreciate throughout all our journeys. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5b39ef2b-414b-432c-9d78-853079e37a84.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9681458,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9681458','Kim And Carl','Portland, OR','We love to ride bikes, golf and  go on urban walks.\r\nCarl works at a golf course \n and I work as a nurse.\r\nOur most recent air bnb was in Iceland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9681458/profile_pic/1398750209/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2519473,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2519473','Andrew','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d85a20ce-519f-4076-a29d-cfa90e60e0e1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19632445,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19632445','Donna','Portland, OR','I am a business executive that likes to travel and host travelers. I have 3 grown daughters and 5 grandchildren that bring me constant joy. Life is good. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19632445/profile_pic/1431475471/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21134004,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21134004','Deborah','Portland, OR','I am an artist and my partner and I work together creating and showing at art shows around the country.  Love travelling and seeing new places.  Fond of the outdoors, good food, reading, movies, art, music. Favorite recent travel destination: Prague and the Czech Republic.  Especially loved the bone church or ostuary in Kutna Hora.  Loved the movie Birdman: The unexpected Virtue of Ignorance.  Like Eliza Gylkinson and other Austin musicians.  Also like jazz.  Most music, really.  Favorite people to spend time with:  my two granddaughters, 9 and 12 years old (and my partner, Richard).  We also have a new grandson in London who is big fun!  We make art, go on adventures, watch movies, cook, sew, all fun.  Also love time with friends and time alone, yoga and meditation.  And travel!!  Going to Iceland this spring -- a new country for us; we are psyched!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/21134004/profile_pic/1430954169/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33056989,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33056989','Franz And Teresa','Portland, OR','We are a retired couple, and we enjoy traveling. I was born and raised in Karlsruhe, Germany my wife was born and raised in Lima, Peru. Our family consists of multiple language speakers. Our kids are grown and moved so we have quite a lot of space. We hope to make this space as comfortable and accommodating as possible for our guests. \r\nBienvenidos, Willkommen, Welcome,\r\nFranz and Teresa',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/33056989/profile_pic/1431295920/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32509067,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32509067','Kun','Portland, OR','Parent to 2 cute Cavlier King Charles Spaniel: Charlie & Chili\nWorks in private equity focused on entertainment\nSurfer/diver (in dreams when my boss spares me to sleep)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-32509067/original/e0648d81-f83a-43ad-9c79-33fd210cea5c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5744484,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5744484','Lisa And Bill','Los Angeles, CA','we love to travel, Bill loves to bike and brew Belgian Ales\r\nLisa teaches pilates, zumba and loves all things creative!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5744484/profile_pic/1364964399/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1825887,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1825887','Danielle','Portland, OR','My husband and I are true Portlanders, born and raised! I work in the event planning industry and he works at Nike. We recently purchased this beautiful home that has been in my family for over 100 years. The home was lived in by my father and his father, when the neighborhood used to be all Italian immigrants in the 1950\'s. We can\'t wait to share with you our many restaurant, bar and coffee shop recommendations, along with must-see Portland traveling tips;  only people born and raised in Portland know :). We are conscientious roommates, who are active, respectful and who welcome all types of travelers to our home. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/89632d54-03eb-4c87-88ef-a777ce82c86c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16113117,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16113117','Kristen','Portland, OR','I love skiing, fishing, traveling, any activity that takes me outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e31b6a07-abf4-45b8-ac44-588b24c162c4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(347470,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/347470','Daniel And Tori','Portland, OR','Daniel is a professional photographer and runs the adventure biking website Benedicto. He is a world traveler and fluent in Italian.\r\n\r\nTori is the owner and operator of Gracie\'s Wrench, an education and consulting service that offers classes in bicycle riding and repairs as well as workshops for businesses that want to encourage people to commute by bike. She also is a freelance writer and the author of \"Bicycling Magazine’s Big Book of Cycling for Beginners\".\r\n\r\nBoth love food (cooking, growing and harvesting), travel, bicycles and their sweet little white dog, Memphis. \r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/347470/profile_pic/1432159965/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32342870,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32342870','Stephen','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m Stephen\n\nI am a life long avid sailor who grew up sailing and racing on the Great Lakes. At 12 years old I had the great good fortune of getting aboard a famous old 1938 racing sailboat: the 12 meter US 14 \"The Northern Light\", and pretty much spent my summers aboard cruising and racing all around the lakes. I love being on the water and under sail... After having had a blast working for years in film and television as a \"Props guy\" I have gotten back to a deeper passion: teaching sailing again. (I am a USCG Licensed Captain and an American Sailing Association Certified Instructor). \n\nI am also the owner / operator of a sailing school and club that has been located here in Portland for over 40 years - Island Sailing (check out our website!) - and most every day I\'m up at the club on The Columbia working with our many students and members, our crew, and our fleet of 20 sailboats.\n\nI also lived in Germany for many years (my family is from a small village there) those were incredible times... ask me about Berlin in the early 90\'s...\n\nI went to school at the University of Oregon and from there found my way to Alaska and before I knew it I was a commercial fisherman for some years and worked throughout the waters of Alaska - experiences I will treasure all my life.\n(Umm, after my first very successful season fishing I never really went back to school... I think I\'m still owing some fantastic professors a few papers on European intellectual history...)\n\nI fell head over heals in love with Portland in the 80\'s when my travels and education brought me to this part of the world. I settled here year round in the mid 90\'s feeling still as I do today that Portland is an absolutely wonderful \"town\".\nI\'ve owned and managed rental property here in Portland for years now and have really enjoyed it. I am so looking forward to creating great experiences serving and helping my future guests have a great stay here at the Historic Gustave Bartman House!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/32342870/profile_pic/1431895799/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26263678,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26263678','Adrienne','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9de52428-7899-408f-bbb6-f0e1691626ce.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14954072,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14954072','Inge','Portland, OR','I love to travel. I grew up partly in Germany, and back in the day, we\'d stay in Pensionen in Vienna. In China and Nepal, in Guatemala and Colombia, I have always most enjoyed staying with families. I love giving back the kind of homey feel that I like to find when I travel. These days, my kids are in college and my dog and I are often the only house residents other than  you!\nPortland is a great town and we can point out our favorite haunts. Though very urban, we are also lots of small neighborhoods, and here, we know all the neighbors.  \nWe kept bees and chickens and goats for more than 8 years, and it was a wonderful way to grow kids, community and food! These days, I am slowly downsizing though I still grow veges and have fruit trees.\nI hike a lot and can help point you to trails in the gorge, on the mountain, or at the coast.\nI love dancing tango, painting, hunting for mushrooms, sipping tea and learning languages. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/14954072/profile_pic/1432621948/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34286584,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34286584','Kristy','','She/her. Raised in Australia, I moved to Portland in 2006 and love it! I enjoy traveling with my 4 boys and skiing.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/507442fc-feca-4e20-8446-6157dae23d5e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3440675,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3440675','Juliet','Portland, OR','I have lived in Northwest Portland since 1984.  I know the area, the city and the transit system thoroughly.  I love Portland\'s pedestrian and bike access, parks and political climate.  My hobbies are hiking, cycling, reading and neighborhood activism.\r\n\r\nI enjoy being an airbnb host.  I will give you complete privacy while you\'re here, unless you need something from me.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3440675/original/cd888046-7102-4653-9c8e-bab29bd2670a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6621463,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6621463','Luke & Rachael','Portland, OR','We are musicians living in Portland. We hope to share our space and our love of this city with others traveling through!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3663d1f6-2beb-42e5-8626-c8e6519e0271.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2711731,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2711731','Melissa','Portland, OR','I\'m a typical Portland person who likes to try new things and travel.  I work in IT and have a middle school aged son.  I\'m an avid skateboarder, love tropical vacations, and aspire to move somewhere with warmer winters.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e401850-3446-4da2-973a-65f1c2820685.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4256569,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4256569','Carie','Portland, OR','I am a mediator living in Portland, Oregon, on the brink of finishing my studies to be a Feldenkrais practitioner. I have found that I really enjoy providing hospitality through Airbnb. It is a unique, beautiful, welcoming house to people of all ages and interests. Let us know what you like and need--after 30 years here, we have things pretty well figured out and are happy to organize whatever you need however you need it. (Just--no parties!)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7b723fb4-5336-4d4a-ad3d-5844112df495.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35482861,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35482861','Hunter','Portland, OR','Hi! \r\n**Please read ALL things in the listing! Most of your questions can be answered right here! Hello / I\'m Hunter! Welcome to Portland! I would love to have you as my guest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/758671e3-41bd-447b-b301-a1266e995631.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35596135,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35596135','Anisha','Portland, OR','Hello all! My name is Anisha and I live in Oregon (USA).',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fb445205-4b24-4d3a-a550-1e9db8e644f8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1495776,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1495776','Stacy','Portland, OR','Hi there!  I am originally from Idaho and its been great to be back and closer to my family in the beautiful NW.  This is my 2nd Airbnb location as I set up my condo in SD and had great success and wonderful guests that visited.  Guests that visit Portland will absolutely love this  location with fun street views and shops, restaurants, and services located along popular Division St!  My guests will be provided with a complimentary bottle of wine, or drink of choice as well as coffee, and their choice of creamer.  I will be meeting you upon your check in to orient you with this location, let you know the closest markets like New Seasons and will provide a guide book of local favorite restaurants & haunts, as well as fun city and bike maps!  It will be adventure whether you choose to walk, bike or drive! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1495776/profile_pic/1418789735/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35716158,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35716158','Sarah','Portland, OR','I love to travel, do art projects, cook, and explore the local food scene with my husband and two sons.  My oldest son is at college starting fall 2019.  We love living in the Buckman neighborhood, because it is nestled between downtown, Belmont/Hawthorne, Burnside, and NE Portland.  Professionally, I divide my time between teaching at Portland Public Schools and pursing the completion of random art and film projects.  We have two cats—Harlow and Shade and two chickens--Daffodil and Ginger.  We love Portland because of the fabulous friends we have made here, the abundance of beautiful parks and nature spaces, and the outstanding food!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/35716158/profile_pic/1434221095/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6744152,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6744152','Jennifer Martin','Portland, OR','Greg and Jen have lived in Portland for decades.  We love it, and can offer you many suggestions for local and regional adventures.  We have two teens, so we can also advise parents on Portland kid places to go/things to do.  Greg is a software engineer and avid cyclist.  Jen is an environmental activist and farmer.   You will have complete privacy, but please feel free to ask us about hikes, bike trails, breweries, farmers\' markets, events, etc.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6744152/profile_pic/1396880918/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13818089,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13818089','Holly','Portland, OR','Matt and I are a fun-loving couple who work passionately to improve our energy systems and built environment in the Pacific NW for greater sustainability. Our house is home to 4 delightful, towheaded lads, half the time. We love reveling in Portland\'s food/drink/natural goodness almost as much as the sun, beaches and exotic destinations. Perhaps posting our home will help us sneak away more often :) I am adamant that one\'s surroundings should bring joy and a sense of peace. I hope you feel super at home in our house!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcccf85f-8cf9-4184-a3a3-33f619854dfd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31117446,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31117446','Clare And Mike','Portland, OR','We are a mixed family (Australian/American) of four that stays busy with kids\' activities. We love the healthy, active lifestyle that Portland offers.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/56d3b1e4-0902-4daf-ae09-d8daed79938c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14933969,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14933969','Angela','Portland, OR','My husband, Erin, and daughter, Magnolia, and I moved to Portland, OR from Los Angeles in 2015 and are loving life in this beautiful city. We try to explore the world, have done a lot of that independently and as a family - teaching our young daughter about different cultures and lifestyles is very important to us. We are loyal and respectful Air B&B users and grateful to  list our own property here : our family home in NE  Portland has a separate one bedroom apartment on the bottom level for vacation rentals. \nA bit about me: I cannot begin to list my favorite foods and books, I feel like I eat and read way too much for that. We see live music as often as possible - my favorites: Jack White, Conor Oberst, M Ward. My husbands favorites: Grateful Dead, Phish, ALO. Our daughters favorites:  Bille Eilish, Taylor Swift and Beyonce. We proudly wave the Third Man flag (for me) and Phish flag (for him) outside our home and at some point you\'ll probably see our little one practicing her moonwalk on our way to the neighborhood coffee shop.\n\"Try to be Someone on Whom Nothing is Lost\" - Henry Miller',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/58a19e0b-9593-41e0-aefa-89c73ebbba61.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15850938,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15850938','Dave','Portland, OR','I\'m a family man who loves the outdoors, adventures, and travel.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/15850938/profile_pic/1435193444/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36909902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36909902','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I am an artist, and I love decorating and designing space. I  aim to keep my homes in excellent condition, and for them to be both beautiful and well considered while still being approachable. I have loved Portland from the moment I arrived, and 20 years later I still do. This beautiful city has great weather, wonderful homes, beautiful trees and plants, great restaurants, amazing markets, a true passion for arts, walkability, bike-ability, public transportation and easy enough driving. (compared to other west coast cities). I am happy to share what I know and love abut portland with you if you are interested in getting in touch.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/36909902/profile_pic/1435515235/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37060525,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37060525','Mari & Zach','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fcffcfe6-dd2b-41a6-ae5c-d0a930c99a41.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(373733,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/373733','Alex','Portland, OR','My partner Liz and I have owned the Turret House for nine years and call it our home for much of the year. We have a toddler and an old black lab named Tucker who is very friendly. We love hosting and are around whenever people need help or Portland tips!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a42f6b1-164e-4e01-83d5-7fcc680f97b4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3220022,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3220022','Julie','Portland, OR','Portland, OR\nFamily run home stays with my cohost brother and me',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/45d56470-fb00-447f-863a-47ec3477a23d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13322905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13322905','Sarah','Portland, OR','I\'m an easy-going, fun person who loves to travel!! I\'ve been to 26 countries and counting...  Meeting people is one of the best things about traveling. Therefore, I am really excited to be hosting on Airbnb to help other travelers to make the most of their adventures!! I\'ve been a massage therapist for 18 years now, and I feel privileged to assist my clients in their well being. I typically practice my own style of intuitive slow deep pressure massage combined with relaxing transition stokes and some Thai type stretches. Of course I customize the massage to accommodate your needs on that day.   Always relaxing, always therapeutic...I give the massage I want to receive!! So come unwind, get a massage, and revive in a beautiful setting in the best city in the world!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13322905/profile_pic/1435709338/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29874534,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29874534','Lisa','Portland, OR','I am a retired teacher of 3rd through 8th grades.  I enjoy people and love Airbnb as a way to earn additional income and meet interesting people from around the country and around the world.  I, too, love traveling. Enjoy your stay!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/15a3a533-26c0-4007-b051-950033c9b04f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37575586,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37575586','Elie','Portland, OR','I was born with a camera in my hand, and never tired of taking pictures.  After years of travel, I made Portland, Oregon my home in 1994.  Nowadays I can usually be found shooting portraits in my studio and around the Portland metro area.  I have a fascination with old abandoned cars and nearly tumbled barns, and I\'m  happiest when my four wheeler is covered in mud. I live my life following a few principles:\r\n* People are amazing\r\n* We learn something new every day\r\n* Tremendous beauty is everywhere\r\n* A man without tea in him is incapable of appreciating beauty\r\n* It\'s about the journey',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/37575586/profile_pic/1438108979/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37410089,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37410089','Tricia','Portland, OR','Hello, I’m a single mama living the dream! (No, really!) I love my home and neighborhood in Portland. I have been here for 20 years now (15 in this home). I have a very spiritual side and am also laid back and enjoy hitting the summer festivals. I love to help my guests find out what’s great about Portland, so feel free to  ask questions ( just don’t move here, it sucks! Ha!!). One thing I really appreciate is when guests let me know if there’s something they need, has been forgotten or is not going well so that I have the opportunity to take care of them! I also love to hear what you love about staying here, too!! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/62295fba-1a14-481b-9f23-441bf4be89cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1312929,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1312929','Kara','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, Oregon and work as a freelance illustrator. I love food and treasure hunting in second-hand stores. I often scour for mid-century items and gifts for friends. For exercise I jog year round and cross country ski in the winter.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e271d2bf-4d18-4137-a4bd-740d4d6105ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5401489,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5401489','Rachel And Bob','Portland, OR','Having lived in Portland since 1976, we think it\'s absolutely the BEST city around and we are always excited to share it with others! Don\'t just take our word for it: Portland was the ONLY U.S. City to be voted in 2015 as one of the top 25 most livable cities around the world and 2022 TOP Foodie City in U.S. \r\n\r\nWe started hosting Airbnb in May, 2016 and are so deeply touched and humbled by the amazing guests we\'ve met so far and look forward to those of you we\'ve yet to meet.  We absolutely love entertaining and sharing the many treasures of Portland and the great Pacific NW with others.  \r\n\r\nAs fairly seasoned travelers ourselves, we also know what makes for a great stay and are invested in providing that for YOU as our guests.  \r\n\r\nNow that we\'re retired from being public servants for years, we have lots more time for our hobbies and travels. You\'ll often find us being \"groupies\" for The RT’s; our son\'s band. The RT’s play energetic and thought-filled originals that blend New Orleans Jazz, Delta Blues and Rock and Roll.  Before the pandemic they played concerts and festivals all over the world and now, when covid permits, they may even be touring near your city.   Who knows?!  One day you might be able to say \"I slept in the Portland Home of The R T\'s!\" \r\n\r\nPortland\'s own musical treasures, The Norman Sylvester Band, keeps us dancing (we\'re teaching ourselves swing dance from youtube) to the blues around Portland.\r\n\r\nWant to learn how to make wine?  Be a guest next Fall and go wine picking at a picture perfect u-pick farm; Z Farm-Hubbard. In September we picked over 1300 pounds of Pinot Noir grapes and always make it quite a party.  We\'ve made wine for the last 11 years.  Bob also makes some of the best beer around from our homegrown hops.\r\n\r\nEnough about our adventures; here\'s to YOUR NEW ADVENTURES!\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/07f4a025-fc86-4416-a11c-536bb672a866.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34867239,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34867239','Jacci','Portland, OR','I\'m Jacci, and I live on the property, with my partner Dave, and our two corgi dogs (sometimes three dogs, when we have a  corgi mix foster).\r\nWe are clean and pretty quiet (you might get a barking acknowledgment next door when you arrive).  We both work, travel, and are on outings with the dogs frequently.\r\nWe want you to enjoy your time in Portland.  We are happy to offer as little or much guidance as you would like.  (if you are looking for hiking sites, kayaking sites/rentals, stand up paddle boarding sites/rentals,  and wineries, we would love to offer tons of advice).   \r\nOur neighborhood is pretty quiet, but just a short distance away from the excitement.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6314252-b063-4f23-b1ce-198938229ac0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12923876,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12923876','Lee','Beaverton, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/967ada0b-4c3b-464b-9370-072d5e8f81d7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38007422,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38007422','Angela','Portland, OR','I’m new to short-term rental hosting, but my passion for hospitality and creating inviting and welcoming spaces is in my DNA. I also work professionally in the hospitality and tourism industry and genuinely love my job.\n\nI put a lot of time and care into curating The Black House Studio, a small and quaint space, into a cozy oasis. My main goal is to ensure that everyone who enters the space feels the warmth of a home away from home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/56cc7a9c-c709-49d1-8f0f-30c112bd2ed4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38113379,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38113379','Kurt & Nathalie','Portland, OR','Originally from Baltimore and Biarritz, we put down roots in Portland in the late 1990\'s. We enjoy the outdoors, yoga, cycling, ayurvedic cuisine, pets, poetry, our 1908 craftsman and new studio, and always look forward to amazing Portland weather and socializing with the great people it brings.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dee6a810-4216-4e3a-bed4-f74c098e5ea4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36446072,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36446072','Pamela','Portland, OR','My life is quiet as a retired professional living in a lovely neighborhood in North Portland.  My passion is teaching and facilitating lively discussions. Taking walks/hikes into the northwest hiking trails is a favorite. Gardening is my hobby.\nI like meeting interesting intelligent people and love to share travel stories. \nMy life motto is \"Create the life you truly want now\".',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2389c9e6-9d15-4077-bcf2-8400b11ef3a0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22112041,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22112041','Dona','Portland, OR','I am a semi-retired artist/designer. I love being creative, the arts, great food, travel, people, interesting conversation and laughter. I have always loved welcoming people into my home and look forward to opening my doors to you. I have just listed my second Airbnb and they are both on the same property which makes them great for guests coming for weddings, graduations or other special events! MI casas es su casas!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3334ad74-d79e-4b88-95d5-70ba29e3406b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2135653,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2135653','John And Fran','Portland, OR','Live in Portland, Oregon. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2135653/profile_pic/1438215961/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23955222,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23955222','Jodi','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Jodi and have places in Portland and Park City.  I\'ve lived in Portland for 17 years and love it, and bought my place in Utah in 2019!  I love to travel and have toured 31 countries and all 50 US States.   I\'d be happy to share all of my favorite Portland/Park City sites with you so you can have the best travel experience.  I am a volunteer Ski Patroller at Mt. Hood in Oregon, and a volunteer ski guide at the National Ability Center in Park City, Utah.\n\nJodi',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/094ea6fb-e4ef-4436-aeb6-ca17333d26a4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8179306,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8179306','Karen','Portland, OR','Karen Hery is 58 from Portland, OR.  She loves Portland and spends lots of time in the out of door in the Pacific Northwest and enjoys traveling near and far.  Her and her friends and beloveds are big foodies having sampled many of the restaurants around town at all price points.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/023ee54a-c047-4226-835b-f4285f67786b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1377982,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1377982','Amanda','Portland, OR','I am an RN living in Portland, OR. I enjoy recreating outside, reading, and spending time with my dog.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1377982/profile_pic/1376754669/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39028080,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39028080','Geoff','Portland, OR','We are a family of 5 living our dream in a house we love surrounded by neighbors we love even more. Our three kids are 8 and 6 (Twins). ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/39028080/profile_pic/1437407005/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13531661,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13531661','Meredith','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13531661/profile_pic/1395864917/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1770933,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1770933','Anastasia','Portland, OR','Welcome to Portlandia, I live in a old house in NE Portland with a couple of roommates and two chihuahuas. I have chickens in my back yard, a garden in the front yard, I go to the dog park every afternoon, I make jewelry in my living room, and .............. I have an airbnb  ;o)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/90947647-b60f-4d8b-81a4-e423abd18e53.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12340051,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12340051','Mike','White Salmon, WA','I live about an hour away from the Airbnb in the gorge and rent out the upstairs of the house.\n\nLove the outdoors in the area and think the PNW is the greatest place in the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57f2d85e-2fde-422c-aa69-7e232248e807.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23836921,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23836921','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I enjoy design as a hobby, but work in natural medicine. I love traveling, and I have stayed at a number of Airbnb’s across the country. We have found that communication can make your stay everything you want it to be. Arriving to a clean, beautiful environment brings a feeling of reassurance, knowing that you can relax and enjoy your stay.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/23836921/profile_pic/1438196378/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19538819,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19538819','Louise','Portland, OR','We have lived in our beautiful Northeast Portland home for 25 years. \r\nWe are both physicians with Louise now being happily retired. When not working, we love to putter around in our house and garden, read, follow the Portland Trail Blazers, watch British TV, travel, visit our two grown kids, and go for walks. We love to try new restaurants as well as visit old neighborhood favorites.\r\nWhen we travel, we most value being able to slow down with few responsibilities to take care of.  As hosts, we want to provide you with that same experience. We hope you\'ll let us know if there is anything we can do to help you enjoy your stay and leave feeling refreshed and renewed.\r\n ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19538819/profile_pic/1407292985/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1197719,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1197719','Nora','Portland, OR','Travels\n\nAustralia\n\nEurope: Austria, France, Austria, Germany, Italy, Poland, Spain, Slovakia, United Kingdom,\n\nNorth America: Canada, Mexico, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Guatemala, Honduras, Belize, \n\nSouth America: Argentina, Ecuador, Peru, \n\nAsia: China, Vietnam, ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/eb84c370-a3c9-444c-b65c-4be2fd08e9fb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(770134,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/770134','Jeff','Ashland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/27439c6b-d107-467f-85cc-97d3a7162bf8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33149703,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33149703','Beau','Portland, OR','Our family loves Portland Oregon/Pacific Nw area as well as Puerto Vallarta, Mexico.   As East Coast transplants over 20 years ago, we are very familiar with the Pacific Northwest and will gladly help in anyway to point you in the right direction or answer any questions you may have.  We also have a beautiful villa for rent in the Amapas Neighborhood right in the middle of downtown Puerto Vallarta.  We have been going to Mexico for many many years and know the city and surrounding area quite well.   We do lots of different things for work and work out of our homes.  Our biggest joy is raising our only child who is 7 this year.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/33149703/profile_pic/1442972065/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2000049,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2000049','Adam','New York, NY','Hello!  My fiance and I are working professionals in Portland and are frequent travelers.  We love to both host and visit using AirBnB.  We enjoy getting to know our guests and sharing our favorite local spots.  We hope we can host you soon!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2000049/profile_pic/1418505756/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38953564,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38953564','Casey & Berdell','Portland, OR','We are two women who have lived in Portland, Oregon since 1984, and we love it here! When we realized we had a beautifully remodeled basement suite that sat empty most of the time, we decided to join AirBnb as hosts. Today, that basement suite is a warm, friendly and comfortable space that makes a lot of people feel at home and welcomed when visiting Portland.\r\n\r\nBerdell is the daughter of a career military father and mother, who were stationed primarily in East Asia. They brought their family along wherever they were called to duty, and Berdell has a love for the people and the food where she lived. Her many homes included Laos, Thailand, The Philippines, and many different places in the US as well. She attended college at Florida International University where she earned a Bachelor\'s degree in Sociology, and did her Master\'s degree studies at the University of Nevada, Las Vegas. Her real love is creating art, and her works have hung in several galleries and shows over the years.\r\n\r\nCasey\'s father and mother were in show business, her dad a comedian/musician and her mom a professional tap dancer. Casey inherited her dad\'s musical talent and her mom\'s rhythmic expertise. She grew up in Southern California and Portland, and went to college at the University of the Pacific in Stockton, California, where she earned a Bachelor\'s degree in Music Education. Casey taught music in the public schools for 10 years, and wrote two self-help books on character building.\r\n\r\nCasey and Berdell have one son, Corey, who is married to Angie, and they live about 7 minutes away.\r\n\r\nWe enjoy time with our two rescue cats, Mitchell and Flopsie, and our rescue dog, Joey (who do NOT get to go into the suite, despite the fact that they are very friendly—since our guests might have allergies). We love ballroom and square dancing, dragon boat racing, being with friends, eating out, and taking long walks together. We recently purchased a 1994 Toyota Motorhome and are learning the art of camping a few days at a time. We also love to cruise on big ships when possible, and visit new places.\r\n\r\nI almost forgot to mention that we and our son, Corey, invented a cat product several years ago, and we sell it right out of our home to people all over the world. We call it a MeowSpace. See if you can find out what it is!\r\n\r\nWe look forward to meeting and hosting you, whoever you may be, from wherever you may hail. The world is a wonderful rainbow of life! We open our arms to your many colors and cultures. We wish you safe and joyful travels.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/38953564/profile_pic/1438911233/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40454925,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40454925','Jack','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/87af828a-a262-4ce1-b2c4-95751a80ad16.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40829795,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40829795','Colleen','Portland, OR','I enjoy working in the garden, the kitchen or on creative projects; traveling, yoga, dancing, eating out and meeting people.\n\nThese days I teaching dance classes 3 nights a week, lead occasional workshops as a life coach, maintain rental spaces, and dream of my next trip. Mostly I ENJOY life as I count my blessings.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-40829795/original/c6dcbe62-7467-4db7-b458-d0532968937f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4112255,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4112255','Kyle','Portland, OR','Hi there, I live in Portland, Oregon with my partner and 2 cats.  I have lived in many places in my time from California to Colorado to the Virgin islands and Washington.  I now call Portland home.  I am an herbalist, urban farmer, and builder of things with a love for the Pacific Northwest.  I enjoy hiking, camping and many other outdoor activities.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4112255/profile_pic/1420786402/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13938342,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13938342','Erin','Portland, OR','Married, mother of two kids who works outside the home.  I love the outdoors and travel, so feel free to hit us up with any questions about the area.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13938342/profile_pic/1401842305/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(344295,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/344295','Kim & Richard','Portland, OR','We are a couple, who loves art, education, city living and our share of pop-culture.\n\nOur apartment is a small (500 sq. ft) modern one bedroom in a converted triplex. The building is a rough-around-the edges converted older home (1923). The apartment is on the second floor atop a tall enclosed staircase. This apartment has a narrow bathroom with a narrow standing shower stall and a fully equipped kitchen (with pans, dishes, silver ware, utensils, etc.). It\'s comfortable, quiet, has seven windows and in the heart of the historic and inviting Irvington neighborhood. The apartment is about a mile away from the Oregon Convention Center, close to public transit (buses, the street car, and MAX (light rail)), close to many restaurants and bars. The apartment is about three blocks away from a major grocery store (Safeway). It takes about 15 min. to get downtown by public transit and if you choose to walk about a 30-minute walk. It is located in inner NE Portland, which is extremely walkable and bikeable. We likely would give you the key through a lockbox and would expect you to put it back when checking out. \n\nWe are open to long-term tenants and have coin-operated washing and dryer machines for tenants that book for seven or more days. We are open to giving reduced rates to such tenants and tenants we have hosted prior. So if you are one of those people please let us know. \n\nNo cleaning fee for this apartment (hurray!), so we do expect tenants to clean as they go and to take their shoes off when inside. If you have any questions please feel free to ask. Thank you for looking. \n\nSorry street parking only, no pets, no smoking and no candles. Also we do not take reservations from third parties. \n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/344295/profile_pic/1302399484/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41571033,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41571033','Sari','Portland, OR','I was born in Canada and came to Portland to go to college. I fell in love with the city and never left!  I love to travel and have had such fun hosting people through Airbnb from all over the world. I am active and enjoy skiing, biking and exercising.  We have a wonderful community and I am excited to show people all the different and interesting things Portland offers. I have always worked in social services and have enjoyed my current job as an adoption counselor for over 15 years. I have two amazing daughters who keep me on my toes and running!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b200cd9b-4d28-4146-a468-4e548a1546a0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32847442,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32847442','Ryan','Portland, OR','I work from home and have two wonderful kids.  We love staying active,  sports, going on vacation and traveling the world. I am an entrepreneur and do whatever I can to help my family have the best life possible. I have lived in Portland my whole life.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/29b5eefd-1e1d-4944-a248-06f8957679be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41780011,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41780011','Ariel','Portland, OR','Hi, I’m Ariel! I have been an Airbnb host for many years along with my husband Mario and daughter Dora. We host our beautiful, 1929 Portland home and have wonderful reviews from our many visitors. We are a family and are family oriented. Please check our house rules. We also live with our dog, Nala and we love dogs but sadly do not allow them in guest spaces since the next guest might be allergic. Please also note that we have a large private studio as well as shared spaces in the lower floor - they are different rentals! \n\nTogether we have lived and traveled in many places, both within the United States and throughout Europe and Latin America. We also speak Spanish and I can try my rusty German with you as well!\n\nAll three of us work and/or attend school right now, so we are in and out throughout the day and very busy with a lot! I love to run and walk and am busy studying for a Masters in Linguistics at PSU. Mario and I are also active in the Latin Dance scene here in Portland when we have free time.\n\nWe are very quick with responses, so please let us know if you have any questions at all! Best of all, check our amazing reviews of both our attention and our location. \n\nAriel ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a791d7dd-4320-4c30-b356-bffe2ff58d11.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3849293,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3849293','Jim','Portland, OR','Jim Heuer and Robert Mercer from Portland, OR.  Jim owns a software company; Robert is a recently retired administrator from Portland State University.  We are interested in architectural history, English literature, and railroading, not necessarily in that order.  We love Portland and are happy we can share our city with our guests.  We also are frequent travelers, and look forward to our trips to foreign countries.\r\n\r\nWe are happy to assist our guests with advice and suggestions about what to see and what to do here in Portland.  But we have provided lots of information in our House Book, and are just as happy to let our guests explore and discover the City on their own.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/518379d8-74da-4ea0-9241-ce0fe1011c8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12099165,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12099165','Catherine','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12099165/profile_pic/1392081791/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42431331,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42431331','Terri','Vancouver, Canada','I love urban landscapes and I love tropical climates.  The architecture, the people and pulse of the streets energize me while the sway of the palms, the warm air and white sand beaches lull me.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/42431331/profile_pic/1443562256/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42139754,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42139754','Lee Wyatt','Corbett, OR','We love to share Portland - ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/77248c9e-0d62-42b0-b61e-5227ecb4413c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1735359,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1735359','Matthew','Portland, OR','I love food and cycling, music and the outdoors, and travel and fun. I\'m a long time Portlander and can give you lots of recommendations for exploring this great town.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1735359/profile_pic/1441147692/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42533657,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42533657','Joan','Portland, OR','I am a retired environmental scientist and my partner was a photojournalist. We travel around the world documenting environmental  protection, animal habitat and people\'s lives, health  and their communities',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/42533657/profile_pic/1440556336/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27974994,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27974994','Nathan','Portland, OR','I\'m a Portland-based, full-service guest manager focused on helping our clients enjoy the perks of being an Airbnb host without the hassle of the everyday stress, and helping our guests have the most enjoyable vacation, ever. Our home owners get to relax, knowing they\'re in the hands of five-year Airbnb veterans and Super Hosts, and our guests can rest assured we are available 7-days a week, and have a response time of less than an hour - go ahead, try us! Our company is built upon trust, communication, commitment, attention to detail, and a big ol\' dash of OCD for good measure. \r\n\r\nLooking for something in particular? Please feel free to message me, and I\'m happy to help you find the right house. And, once here, I\'m your concierge, and take great pleasure in doting on our amazing guests. \r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with and/or hosting you! \r\n\r\nWhite Spider Rental Concierge\r\n\r\nwww.whitespiderpdx.com\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/27974994/profile_pic/1425852245/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1022102,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1022102','Laura','Portland, OR','We are a family who loves Portland and all the adventures that the city has to offer!  We spend part of our time up in WA and are excited to share our home in Portland with you - please don\'t hesitate to let us know if you have any questions or requests, we\'d love for you to enjoy Portland as much as we do.\r\n\r\nEnjoy!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c0012a8-cacf-43e9-bd74-32213e52a0a0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(869605,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/869605','Danny','Portland, OR','My wife, Maria and I teach Pilates and yoga respectively. We enjoy hiking, dining, meditation, sports, movies and the arts.  We have a Boston Terrier named Posey.  We like clean well lighted places and a welcoming atmosphere which we strive to provide in our Portland Airbnb.  We like to meet people from many places and countries.  My wife is from Italy and speaks Italian, French and some Spanish.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fb5f4d41-e8ee-4562-b23b-04ca729fbe79.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13303946,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13303946','Satish','Portland, OR','We travel a lot. Exploring cities around the country and abroad. We had very pleasant experience staying at various airbnb places. Hence we wanted to share our second home with the broader airbnb community. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13303946/profile_pic/1441895487/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15280606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15280606','Kathleen','Portland, OR','I am an ecologist and social scientist and divide time between Portland and Orcas, Washington . My husband Peter and I love meeting new people and traveling, cooking, gardening, hiking, etc. We hope you love your stay in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/15280606/profile_pic/1413732145/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37100855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37100855','Joshua','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/37100855/profile_pic/1441643197/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(456853,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/456853','Ann','Portland, OR','My husband, Lee, and I are both retired. Lee was the finance manager for one of our large local food co-ops and I was a medical technologist and then taught English to speakers of other languages. We are interested in building local economies rooted in sustainability, resiliency, and community. We love relaxing at home with our 3 cats, making our yard beautiful, growing organic veggies and exploring Portland. We look forward to meeting you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/03d53014-507c-4f51-b040-c3090549f1a6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43706954,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43706954','Ron And Misti','Portland, OR','We are creative professionals who enjoy traveling, eating good food, and sharing experiences with friends and family.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-43706954/original/3615f52f-c1a3-4b41-98b8-d47041ccd0fb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9603365,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9603365','John','Portland, OR','I am a single gay male in my 40s.  I am a non-smoker and very clean.  I love to travel.  I love theatre.  Travel to NYC and London each year to see theatre.  Also enjoy travelling to Europe and Australia.  As a guest, I\'m friendly but quiet. I\'m a homeowner and I will respect your space. As a host, I\'m mostly hands off but respond quickly to requests for info or assistance.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/853afaed-c873-4b64-b9b0-094d64e7d212.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2381917,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2381917','Kellie','Portland, OR','I am a naturopathic doctor and acupuncturist. I have lived in Oregon since 1997 and I love hosting people in Portland. When I am not in clinic I like to see live music, enjoy the outdoors in the beautiful pacific northwest, and travel.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7674f83e-889d-4e09-bf4e-92e20b7ec465.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44216258,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44216258','Mark','Portland, OR','Hi there, \nI’m an outgoing person and am excited to host my self recreated home.  I\'m an artist, father, builder, yogi and co-owner at Forage Design Build in the great Historic Mississippi District in North Portland. \nWe love Portland-the people, the huge variety of things to do, the food, the vibe and, yes, the rain. Why? Because it allows such splendid spring, summers and falls....and winters.  There is definitely something magical here.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4325c30e-6956-471f-a2ef-112fd128b4c4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44293276,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44293276','Melinda','Portland, OR','I moved to Portland from Tennessee to start a new adventure in my life.  Airbnb has been a perfect fit to foster that adventure!  I love hosting and meeting people from all over the world.  \r\nI work part time as a math teacher and part time in the restaurant business.  Cooking is a passion and serving others is a pleasure.  Southern hospitality is real, and I have combined it with the great opportunities available in the Northwest to offer you a fabulous stay in Portland. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af014fc9-8ab5-48ac-bd57-b8cc6f5e3f35.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1511460,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1511460','Summer + Patrick','Portland, OR','S + P\nBoss Lady + Industrial Design Engineer\nYogi + Foot Racer \nVegetarians + Animal Lovers\nEntrepreneurs + Inventors\nHonest, hard-working, passionate\nCOMMUNITY.\n\nUnion Pine\nBar West\nDeep Creek',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1511460/profile_pic/1428687473/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44519913,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44519913','Ariel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/44519913/profile_pic/1442604741/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2884284,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2884284','Ryan','Portland, OR','I\'m originally from Portland Oregon.  After graduating from Oregon State, I\'ve done a lot of traveling which brought me to this site.  As a guest, I\'d love any recommendation about where the best spots for good eats are. As a host, and native Portlander I\'ll look forward to pointing you in a good direction so you can get the most out of your stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/de2dc72b-e281-4745-9763-bb30ddd9e01c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21655715,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21655715','Villa Serena','Portland, OR','Locally owned and operated building with direct access to the owner.  Quick, polite, responsive and dedicated to making sure everyone has the best stay possible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/233afe09-216c-4520-8c88-cc160ccd02bb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41290032,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41290032','Steve','Portland, OR','I am a hard working single dad with two older daughters. I like to travel when I have time. I also have an airbnb in Portland that I host.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a5064f50-9b81-47c6-a6ed-fcf2f4cdf77b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45613100,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45613100','Colleen','Portland, OR','I grew up in the PNW, and moved to Portland in 2000. I moved here to be close to friends and I loved how friendly Portland was. After I moved here, I began to appreciate our long growing season and now I love spending as much time as I can in the yard. I can never spend enough time with my kids, and/or outside! I love getting out in Portland. I have 2 kids who are firm Portlanders, but in different ways.  We like to cook and be somewhat active, but we\'re not avid sports players. I did a lot of traveling and adventurous things in my 20s, but these days I\'m much more of a homebody. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45613100/profile_pic/1443819868/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45394187,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45394187','Rhonda','Mission Viejo, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcf0e69d-83d2-4c1d-980f-2819f5ef8e27.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6544470,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6544470','Amy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6544470/profile_pic/1443980711/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45007538,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45007538','Ngone','Portland, OR','My family and I have lived along the west coast from Southern California to Alaska over the past 20 years. Our property recently underwent extensive renovations, which was a tremendous effort, and resulted in a number of improvements. We work and study hard, but when we have time we enjoy fishing, gardening, and taking care of our chickens. We also get out and hike, ride bicycles, and try to enjoy Portland\'s music and food scene. We hope you enjoy our spacious, updated, private studio apartment. We have a busy and active lifestyle, but are happy to help with anything you need.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d1b0249a-11db-4fd7-9de6-584ca385b452.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45865050,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45865050','Juli','Portland, OR','I love where I live and love that people here know that they are somewhere unique and special. I spend most of my free time in the neighborhood community garden. Cooking is my passion but I also love kitchen science! Fermenting pickles, brewing kombucha, and canning produce are the things I thrive on. I really enjoy being a host and love to welcome guests, family and friends into my Airbnbs.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/d9d2a4a0-9669-47d6-aa80-d93cad1e8edd.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45926254,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45926254','Erica','Portland, OR','Rob Hemmerling and Erica Dagle are Portland natives. They have lived on the inner east side for the past 14 years and love the proximity to Portland\'s finest restaurants, local coffee shops, parks, boutiques, public transportation and specialty grocery stores. Rob is an owner of a local restaurant and Erica is the owner of a Portland based Real Estate company. They are passionate about being in the hospitality industry, love the character of older homes and enjoy making people happy.\r\n\r\nIn addition to their careers, they have a 5 year old son, Cole, and a 2 year old daughter, London, who keeps them busy around the clock. They are excited to host you in this tastefully updated older home, to welcome you to their amazing City and to help connect you with local resources to make your stay most enjoyable.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/48d9b4ae-acde-4275-837b-02250aaee5c3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46173088,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46173088','Christopher','Portland, OR','I\'m a freelance advertising creative director/writer and a real estate investor/developer. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8bbba0a2-c06d-4c42-8f13-a6d4373e74d6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46341450,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46341450','Judy','Portland, OR','The Boston-Belle is named in honor of my father and mother as a tribute to the hard work and loving dedication and devotion to our family.  It is because of their exemplary example that I learned about hard work, dedication to my career (aerospace engineer), drag racing, and family.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/46341450/profile_pic/1444634008/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7810808,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7810808','Paola','Portland, OR','I am an east coast transplant. Originally from NY but with Argentine roots, i consider myself more of a nomad (having lived in Washington DC, Arizona, Seattle in addition to NY and Argentina). I am grateful to have had the experience of travel, and a bilingual upbringing but equally happy to have most recently settled my roots in Portland. I have 2 young kids who are the apples of my eye, but really what parent does not feel that? When i am not working or raising kids, i love LOVE to explore the dining experience of whatever town i am in.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7810808/profile_pic/1444584788/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46814135,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46814135','Bee','Portland, OR','I am a relative newcomer to Portland, and moved here from the Bay Area several years ago.  Prior to that, I\'ve also lived in Chicago, Boston, London.  I love to travel and so have enjoyed traveling all over the world, often staying in homes with hosts such as airbnb.  My special interests are good food (especially vegetarian), hiking the outdoors, running, yoga and meditation.  I\'m super excited to now have enough space to host other travelers and \"give back\" to the hosting community. \nTambien se habla español, entonces puede escribirme en español si este mejor para usted.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3ffc14d-d54b-4784-9c88-9a4d921fb251.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4609035,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4609035','Wendi','Portland, OR','I moved to Portland 25 years ago and I\'ve completely fallen in love with the city and all it\'s fun quirks - but that doesn\'t keep me from exploring new places and meeting new people every chance I get. My favorite cities (so far) include Buenos Aires and Barcelona. Most interesting adventures include Chitwan Jungle (Nepal), Jomson (Nepal), sailboat/swim in caves (Spain), kayaking Zaton Bay Croatia. Vacation time is best when it\'s spent with my family and incredible friends, both new and old. \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dbc421da-c470-4c90-9209-080ab1c983df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7644885,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7644885','Joanna','Portland, OR','Traveling is a great love of mine and I have been so impressed by the gracious hosts & guests on Airbnb. Thank you for making this community a welcoming and friendly place!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ba45d1ac-170e-4271-975b-32dbc323faa5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20410856,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20410856','Abbie','Portland, OR','Hi there! I\'m a property manager in Portland, Oregon specializing in short and medium term rentals including a tiny house in my own backyard. I adore Portland and hope you do to.  \nHolistic Home Property Management LLC\nOREA 201224970',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20410856/profile_pic/1408743124/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44211105,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44211105','Lesley','Portland, OR','We are Oregon residents who love the outdoors, be it the mountains, rivers or coastal areas. We love to travel the world and have fell in love with Bend, which reminds us of time we spent in Taos, New Mexico. The high desert sun, smell of the sage and pine, the Deschutes River, surrounding lakes, and mountains all make Bend a wonderful place to get outdoors. Though we have to admit, the many good restaurants and breweries have us staying close to our home-away-from-home for an easy walk to dinner or a drink with friends.\n\nOur children love being close to the park, Goodie\'s (ice cream parlor), Cravin\'s Candy Emporium and a short walk to home after a float down the river.\n\nWe hope you will enjoy Bend and the surrounding area as much as we do.\nCheers! - Lesley & Daniel, Portland, Oregon',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0a851975-9d50-4a8e-bc5b-7df1644fea9d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12846561,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12846561','Kerri','Portland, OR','We are a very happy family of 4 who love to travel and who love to experience the architecture of old school buildings throughout the world.\r\nWe are thrilled to acquire and be able to share with visitors a piece of Portland History and our well furnished home.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ab414f78-a1f4-4c57-96fc-cebc0eddcdc2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(137869,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/137869','Tara','Portland, OR','Originally from Ireland, I returned to Portland several years ago after a decade in New York.  I had forgotten how beautiful it is here and it\'s good to be back.   I live with my two kids, who are 18 and 11, and our two cats.  We try to make our home, and our guest house, peaceful and relaxing, and hope that will be our guests experience.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a89d34d1-1cf9-4f14-8158-da387ca4e363.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25200663,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25200663','Jordan','Portland, OR','Hello there!\nIf you want to enjoy a cool spot in St. John’s and are comfortable with dogs, this may be a good spot for you. It’s myself and Watts, an 8-year-old healer mix. It’s a comfy spot, fully furnished, and relatively quiet. I’m particular about who I let around my dog, as she can be picky, but ultimately if you’re cool she’ll welcome you to her pack. Looking for the right guest, with potential for a long term roommate.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/861cedbb-ec61-4aa4-8ce4-98d5526e4c9e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47514269,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47514269','John','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0e3b020e-e872-4089-a3ab-bfd2ba06b658.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47516888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47516888','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1f2618a4-f7fa-4435-96d6-8de6ff67708a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(263312,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/263312','Barbara','Portland, OR','I am a long time Portlander, since 1968.  I love the people, the food, the recreation, the art and music, the nearby mountains and beaches.  I have traveled the world as a professional photographer since I finished college, but don\'t want to live anywhere else.  In my spare time I love to garden, read, watch films, knit, sing, hike, bike, kayak, cook and do yoga.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/263312/profile_pic/1347076653/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40548274,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40548274','Derek','Portland, OR','Been a Portlander since 2000. Always exploring...constantly curious. So far I\'ve traveled to Norway, Spain, Mexico, Czech Republic, China, Viet Nam, Japan, Australia, Canada, UK , France, Iceland and New Zealand but that\'s in no particular order.    ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3a0ad7a6-e9b7-4dd6-a53f-e11974b5be93.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10255733,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10255733','Kevin','Portland, OR','I am an easy going, very clean, respectful and thoughtful person/traveler/host.\r\n\r\nI am also an owner and active landlord for 12 rental properties as well as a small business owner, so, I understand the value of respecting others space. Of course from the host side, I am realistic but assume people/visitors will treat my place with the same respect I\'d treat theirs.\r\n\r\nOn a more general note, I truly value people and relationships and this carries over to my life in all ways.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/77a113b4-e120-4695-86c5-87b78b10582c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35075353,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35075353','Alison And Dan','Portland, OR','Dan is in the lighting industry and he is originally from Chicago. Alison is a Hypnotherapist from Los Angeles. We enjoy living in Portland and the beauty of the surrounding mountains, waterfalls and ocean, as well as the unique energy of Portland. We ready to help in any way we can with information but we\'ll also leave you to enjoy your stay with respect for your privacy. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96510f9d-9278-4f69-a2c0-daeaf8d93caa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47656356,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47656356','Diego','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f12ddeaa-56b5-4863-9c89-c6e2cb10ef20.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47731731,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47731731','Marissa','Portland, OR','Scotty is a lifelong Oregonian and Marissa has called Portland home for well over a decade.  We love this city for its amazing restaurants, art, music, unique movie theaters and proximity to some of the country\'s most beautiful places.  Travel is a passion of ours and right now we are focused on exploring Latin America.  Staying in locals\' homes when traveling is always a treat and we are so happy to share the home we built with fellow travelers.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a9a4ac98-c9e9-4eca-a2aa-1a6b5f8cd4de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6063183,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6063183','Katherine','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland, Oregon. I am an avid traveler and adventure seeker!  I have been to over 15 countries in Asia, South America, and Europe.  I have been a host for over 6 years, renting out my personal homes that I have lived in. I love hosting families, travelers, professionals, and furry friends. Thank you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0619b1a6-eec9-4d23-b15a-34755961606f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41571405,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41571405','Kate','Portland, OR','Welcome to the comfort of my home! I am currently hosting my seventh season on Airbnb. I welcome everyone to stay and hope you will enjoy my place in Portland!Now for my profile!\n\nI was  born and raised in upstate New York, I came to Portland in 1977 and a few years later moved to SW Washington where I raised my son. I happily gardened on my property there and hiked the backcountry of the National forests and parks. I moved back \n to Portland in 2015 and into this beautiful historic 1915 Craftsman  home owned and renovated by my son.  I\'ve been hosting Airbnb guests since 2016.  I hope you will enjoy your stay here, relax and take in the creative energy of Portland and the artistic talent involved in preserving this historic home! I look forward to hosting every guest and do my best to help you with anything you may need. Thank you to all my past, present and future guests. Feel the love...of Portland,  Oregon! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9853c06b-a325-4af6-bb6a-82c144ecf501.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10088347,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10088347','Mollie','Portland, OR','I run my own home organization business and Airbnb at our home. Happily married for over 23 years and mother of 2. We love traveling and meeting new people. Thank you so much for hosting I look forward to staying in your home!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/407ab943-809e-40ba-92be-abea720d047f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43717096,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43717096','Ken','Portland, OR','Hi there! I am Ken. I have been hosting since the early days of Airbnb and absolutely love it.  I love providing a unique space for you and your family to enjoy and create special memories.  My goal in hosting is to make your stay comfortable, memorable and safe. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/41cd1a62-265a-4654-8508-9a5bfedf53ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28235833,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28235833','Deborah','Portland, OR','I am a born and raised Oregonian, interior designer, hiker, local wine and food lover and traveler. Our home reflects our style, our cookbook shelf reflects our love of food.  We live in a region with great food, wine, coffee shops, Forest Park and indie shopping and I wouldn\'t live anywhere else.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/28235833/profile_pic/1424722530/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31927943,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31927943','Sid','Palm Desert, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f3bb69b0-2f84-45f7-8643-06b5c9c83298.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22412761,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22412761','Lynne','Portland, OR','Patio has taken on storm damage, working on getting it back in shape.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/18405966-0091-48ff-92a6-92ffccc25f82.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48026802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48026802','David','Portland, OR','Outdoorsy guy, born and raised in Portland. \r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/48d4d15b-9fe8-4517-a8e5-ce6bbfd7153b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10928596,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10928596','Benjamin & Jamie','Portland, OR','This is team Jamie and Ben, who would be your awesome hosts. Since both are so awesome, they both need an introduction.\r\nBen: Explorer, enthusiast and engineer at large. I used to utilize couchsurfing for my first steps of meeting and getting introduced to people and place, and have from that established myself a nice network of friends and family here in the US. \r\nI seem to have embarked pretty heavily on a career in research and academia, hence my days are quite defined by that, and exploring the wild, both outdoors and indoors (concerts, venues, restaurants, etc.) with my lovely better half. \r\nIf not that, then I enjoy a good run, ski-trip, a good newspaper and a good read, certainly some really terrible action movies. \r\n\r\nJamie: \r\nIs also pretty great, by being a very seasoned world-traveller, French teacher and entrepreneur and house plant extraordinaire. And so many other things she will only tell you when you are staying here. \r\n\r\nUpdate: We also welcomed our daughters in May of 2016 and 2020! Such a joy!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10928596/profile_pic/1431583675/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48595009,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48595009','Stephen & Tina','Portland, OR','We are Stephen, Tina, Anthony and Theo. We are blueberry farmers in Harrisburg, OR in the summer. In the winter, we will spend our family time in Portland',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-48595009/original/168dd105-13cb-44a0-a0bf-aaa438da8c9e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20414851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20414851','Mark','Portland, OR','I am an active guy who loves to travel and does so often.  I grew up in So Cal, lived in Seattle, London,  New Jersey, and now I call Portland home.  I am a foodie/wine lover, avid soccer player, Timbers season ticket holder, mountain biker, and I am digging this Airbnb opportunity to meet wonderful people from all over the world. Are you next? I would love for you to stay at my cozy place in the happening part of town.  You won\'t be disappointed.  \r\n\r\nSee you soon! \r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMark\r\n ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a9818fc7-29e1-408d-8882-054de061fded.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49110034,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49110034','Chrysalis','Portland, OR','I\'m married and a mother of two wonderful kiddos. I enjoy the outdoors, travel, art and delicious food. Born and raised in Hawaii, I moved to San Diego for college and found my way up to Portland after graduation. I have done a lot of travel, including the majority of Europe, Canada, Mexico, SE Asia, New Zealand, Australia and a good bit of the United States. Though I\'ve seen a lot, there are still many more places on my bucket list.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d580f69b-0d78-47b3-8fd3-0980aad17e85.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1886383,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1886383','Eric','Portland, OR','Hi-I\'m from Portland but have lived around the US in Boston, Phoenix, and San Diego.  Like to ski, go boating, bouldering, wine tasting. I\'ve travelled a lot in Asia and a few times in Europe. My favorite destination is Thailand, but I\'m happy with just a west coast road trip. I feel like I have a good balance in my life with friends, career and fun. \r\n\r\nIm a frequent user of AirBnB, and actually lived on a property that had an AirBnB\'d room, so Im familiar and enjoy hosting. Im very easygoing, and am the only resident of my house. (there aren\'t any pets here either)\r\n\r\nExcited about all the future AirBnB possibilities- I hope to meet even more cool people through hosting as well as being a guest.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1886383/profile_pic/1399654662/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49426376,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49426376','Tiberius','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7b284fa4-b556-4728-a203-b5389f15db90.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47141750,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47141750','Lance','Portland, OR','Hello, I\'m Lance.  I generally travel with my family: me, my wife, my son and my daughter.  I/we like active stuff like sports and hiking.  We hope to follow the Golden Rule: treat others like we would want to be treated.  I recently built a second home on my property and am getting started renting it using Airbnb.  I think I\'m a considerate owner and guest/renter.  With my construction/engineering experience, I have an interest in keeping things tidy and working efficiently.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a1e78ffc-d86e-4d05-aaef-a7c5d08a8909.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25235410,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25235410','Elaine','Portland, OR','Friendly, fun, relaxed Hawaiian but there for you if you need me!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9d911a23-7cb7-4357-bdc7-1cea00178499.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46497916,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46497916','Yvonne','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6f1294ce-89d8-4493-8a20-a3f919242f3e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15310395,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15310395','Ildikó','Portland, OR','Hi, I am a software professional, I enjoy traveling and talking about travel experiences. I love sports and sunshine. Known by my friends to always answer Yes  to a question that starts with \"do you want to go.... \" (sometimes even before I know where). I value trust as a virtue above anything else. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7e6e2874-0e29-4105-8eac-60ad8be738ed.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22298379,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22298379','Marcelo','Portland, OR','Happy to share all that Portland and Pacific NorthWest have to offer with YOU!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22298379/profile_pic/1433793636/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33451922,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33451922','Sandy','Portland, OR','My husband, our pups Nina & Simone and I feel very fortunate to live in SE Portland. We\'ve been in our home for over 14 years and in Portland for longer and love it here. We also enjoy traveling and take our pups with us whenever we can and thought we could offer this same option to others. We\'ve put a ton of love into our home and want to share it with others and hope this will also help us with getting to see more of this amazing world and what it offers. \r\n\r\nIn addition to world travel, we enjoy hiking, swimming, snorkeling/scuba, great cities with equally great art, restaurants and unique individuals. We love all animals and incorporate travel with our pups whenever we can. We look forward to hosting you and hope you enjoy your stay in our own personal home! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/93d83789-c93d-42c9-b4cb-dbe2674f769c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50332020,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50332020','Moussa','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bce86cbc-a224-4065-8597-089a5afb5127.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7858592,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7858592','Dana','Portland, OR','My name is Dana and my partner is Jon. I\'ve been an Airbnb Portland host for 4 years and have loved the experience of bringing people together. My passion is entertaining and creating once in a lifetime experiences for family, friends and now even strangers through Airbnb\'s platform. My partner, Jon, and I are also starting Airbnb experiences in Santa Barbara. Jon knows the ocean like no one else. He\'s been a lifeguard for 14+ years, a surfer for even longer, an Island Channel Kayak Guide for 8+ years, as well as owns a boat and is an experienced fisherman and diver. He\'s also an avid mountain biker, knowing every adventure trail in the Santa Barbara mountains. As for me, in addition to loving to host, I\'m also a high school soccer coach where I love teaching teenagers how to become better athletes and individuals on and off the field. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e738e6e-6dbb-490a-a788-8217129d5c6c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13676520,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13676520','Sherold','Portland, OR','Hi - we’re Sherold and John, and we’re Super Hosts so your experience with us is a cut above your usual Airbnb. We love being Airbnb hosts and enjoy meeting new people and sharing our beautiful home.  John is a retired emergency physician; I\'m a writer and a coach.  We\'re both outdoor enthusiasts and love world travel. John is a fantastic tour guide if you need help with directions or local sites. \n\nWe love gardening, reading, hiking, snowshoeing, camping and being out in nature.   We have two friendly Australian Labradoodles, Lilly and Teddy, that play in the backyard. Our goal is to offer you a serene location to stay, so that you can work remotely or play.    \n\nWe\'re 15 minutes from downtown Portland, NW 23rd Ave. or the Pearl District.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/057fb104-b6ab-4499-ba54-38b2600e93ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2409849,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2409849','Mike','Bellevue, WA','Originally from PA and now live in the Seattle area.  Avid traveller with wife and 3 daughters.  We\'re always ready for an adventure and visiting new places!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8e52cd72-2f1a-474e-814a-495c1d83757e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50860253,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50860253','Brian','Portland, OR','I am a computer systems administrator. I don\'t smoke, and like to go for walks, or ride a bike around when i am not working. \r\n\r\nI am former military, one tour years ago, and i mention this to indicate that generally, i am fairly \"squared away\", and keep things neat and tidy. (thinking about the way i left hotel rooms during the recent stays while traveling.)\r\n\r\nI think i am fairly laid back, easy going, but who does not think that about themselves.\r\n\r\nbest regards,\r\nBrian',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/69f1915d-aa61-4fb1-bb77-4ba222d3ddc6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20727837,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20727837','George','Portland, OR','I love Northwest Portland!  I bought this home because I couldn\'t bear to leave my beloved neighborhood with everything imaginable within walking distance.  Now I am thrilled to have the opportunity to share it with family and friends, like you!\r\n\r\nAfter living in San Francisco, New York and Chicago, I found that NW 23rd Ave had not only the amenities of Union St in SF or Armitage Ave in Chicago, but also the small-town feel and quirkiness that is uniquely Portland.  I\'ve lived in the same 3-block radius since 2010 and plan to be here for decades to come.\r\n\r\nI am happy to give you recommendations on everything from city hikes and dining, to day trips to the beach, Mt Hood or wine country.  If you\'re traveling with kiddos in tow, I have all the gadgets and gismos to make you feel right at home.  And if you prefer your space, I\'m happy to leave you to explore on your own.  \r\n\r\nMake your stay what you want it be in the best location (and cleanest apartment) in Portland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d6e7ea44-e403-4d80-9edc-4c7be90cc6f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50929838,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50929838','Fernando','Rivergrove, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a36457ea-362e-46fd-ad36-2b6663416f74.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50933310,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50933310','Nan','Portland, OR','I\'m a professional singer and voice teacher. My studio is in the front house where I live, so if you need anything, I\'m close for convenience but not in your space! Gardening is obviously an addiction: I keep planting more bulbs every year, so I might need an intervention on that. I\'m an Air Force Brat so I love meeting new folks and traveling. I can muddle through in several European languages and I sing in a bunch of them, but I\'m most comfortable in German. I love riding my bike (not so much in the rain, I\'m a fair weather biker). A Sci-Fi & Mystery book reader, and have now added regular Cross-training/Bootcamp to my life. Don\'t wait so late in life to do that is my advice, but I\'m doing it! Must haves: Good coffee, good chocolate, good books, good kitties, and music of all kinds. I mostly sing classical for the dough-re-mi, but I love all kinds and teach all kinds. My motto: If it\'s not in writing, it doesn\'t exist!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/14d365b6-39db-47a6-8bb7-e9cf5e6f433b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51019210,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51019210','Tracie','Portland, OR','I love Oregon --particularly NW Portland, and I want my guests to love it too!  I am a friendly host with high regard for your privacy-- happy to assist when you need help. \r\n\r\n I\'m a fine art painter who loves to travel, and when I’m exploring a new city I want the inside scoop on what to do, where to eat and how to get around as well as a quiet and cozy place to nestle in at the end of the day. Oh and I’m crazy about listening to all kinds of good music! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c0ff835c-2930-4b78-96dd-6d76b2da3bbc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28029219,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28029219','Kelly','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-28029219/original/2dfe5532-5426-43d0-9d2d-1e6fb8188523.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51154190,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51154190','Richard & Jacquie','Portland, OR','Jacquie and I have lived here in Sellwood for nearly 30 years and love this area.\r\nWe love to travel to Ecuador whenever we can. \r\nWe love to get out and hear local music and dance to Salsa, Zydeco, Swing and other music.\r\nWe love to eat Lebanese food at Nicolas Restaurant, Sushi at Sushi Kata\r\nor Tanis, Pho at Pho Hung, Pizza at Pizza roma of Pizzacato, late night eats at The Hotcake House, Breakfast at Bertis Lous or Fullers, etc...\r\nWe love movies at our local Moreland Theater',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ad911bae-83d4-47af-aa78-91074a37f7af.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27447858,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27447858','Christine','Portland, OR','Hi there! I\'m a born-and raised Portlander who absolutely loves this city! I\'m a mom of 3 sweet girls, and we spend a lot of our time outside enjoying the beautiful City of Roses! My husband, Joel, is from another pretty cool town about an hour east of Portland (Hood River, OR) so we also like making trips out that way to visit his large family (he\'s one of NINE kids!)\r\n\r\nWe love our \"Airbnb Friends\" as my kids have come to call them...and our family is happy to help make your stay as great as possible!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/31ae34b4-2bd7-477d-836c-ec541ce3ac77.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51273080,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51273080','Danny','Portland, OR','Howdy, I\'m Danny.  20 year transplant, originally from a small town in the Midwest, now loving the Pacific Northwest! Since I have 2 little ones, I am not able to travel as much as I once did.  I love to live vicariously through travelers like yourselves, and help people explore the beautiful Northwest, and the city I LOVE!  Also, I like food, a lot.    \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e1fb21c-f3cc-4c66-b482-5533d22118e2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51352005,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51352005','Harold','Portland, OR','I am a musician and college professor with a lifelong love of learning (and apparently, alliteration!)  I love theater and live music, and perform regularly in the Northwest.  My favorite travel destinations include Italy and Hawaii.  I am an easygoing person who values honesty and integrity, and have lived in Portland since 1999.  I share my life with my wife Mindi, our two cats, and many lifelong friends.  I particularly enjoy meeting new people through Airbnb.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/95cf81e3-7a73-424a-b145-e370d2e0542a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1586097,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1586097','Elena','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1586097/profile_pic/1418243423/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(141076,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/141076','Jane','Portland, OR','I\'m a psychotherapist, creativity coach and artist.  I love hosting people from all over the world.  I love to travel and I love to create unique places for people to hang out in when they\'re visiting Portland.  This is an awesome city and I feel blessed to have a house to share while I\'m here. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/141076/profile_pic/1379801904/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52959802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52959802','Mia','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b46a5f14-ff85-4b14-b142-ea7e301ec085.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53232555,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53232555','Dawn','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Dawn. I am a Portland native. When you are born in the best city in the world there is no need to move! I love Portland and the Pacific Northwest. I am an avid traveler. I speak Spanish, love to read, dance, and cook. I would love to share the best of Portland with you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca5f4ae6-f34b-4bcc-93d3-873142f17e79.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42719900,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42719900','Matt','Portland, OR','I\'m super into micro-farming and ecological systems.  And raising ducks, which are 1,000x better than chickens (don\'t get me started on that!).  I work from home and the huge garden and greenhouse constantly need attention.  I designed & built what I think is the only self-cleaning aquaponic (quackaponic!) duck compound.  \n\nGetting away usually means kayaking, camping and fishing.  Occasional backpacking.  Lots of pool shooting and live music.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cc691431-7c1a-4d6d-b4b6-250388661c8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45402529,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45402529','Dan','Portland, OR','Hi, my wife, three kids, and I live in Portland, Oregon.  Some of our favorite activities are road trips, camping, skiing and international travel.  \n\nWe also love hosting visitors at our guesthouse in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-45402529/original/57be3dc9-489d-4b6a-8726-93ab0c41cb82.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13263099,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13263099','Suzy','Portland, OR','I’m a mature and responsible person who likes a clean, smoke and scent free, quiet environment to relax in. \n\nI’m a fine artist (painting, drawing & photography) , art instructor, and professional chef. I love to explore new places and meet people .\n\nI have some health issues that guide my physical activity and my need to rest. I’m also allergic to cats and dogs.\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-13263099/original/e65a33db-e7ca-4e13-a469-f5dcea2702b9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45609473,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45609473','Becky','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-45609473/original/51cd302e-0c58-4efa-a854-e79bdc1129ab.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54390576,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54390576','Dresden','Portland, OR','I\'m an advocate for Portland\'s values of inclusivity and embracing your weird!\n\nI actively plug into everything that I feel makes Portland special, and I share what I find with the hope that the magic of this city spreads.\n\nAs Alan Watts said, “The Menu is Not the Meal,” so rather than just educate you on the culture, I immerse you in what I’m talking about through a memorable and unexpected experience.\n\nYou may find me on IG as ThrowSnakes!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5056adec-302f-481b-ac4b-ce72507f8fb9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31480744,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31480744','Mark','Portland, OR','I\'m originally a Minnesotan.  I\'m a surgeon, a scientist, and an educator.  I chose to live here in the Pacific NorthWest for all the awesome terrain and outdoor experiences, and here in Portland for the wonderful quality of life. I am looking forward to sharing my home and this experience with visitors and travelers.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f9e2e82-12a4-4b4e-99fb-df1da02417fc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6486134,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6486134','Hannah','Portland, OR','My husband Don and I are from Portland, Oregon. I\'m a freelance journalist who writes about food, agriculture, integrative medicine, and travel. Don is also a journalist, but his focus is labor issues and politics.  We love to explore new cultures, hike, dance, read, and cook and eat yummy local food. My favorite destination so far is Slovenia; Don\'s is either Cuba or Latvia. But we also love exploring our corner of the U.S.: the Olympic Peninsula, the Wallowas, Seattle, and the Oregon Coast. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5d913666-1cab-405f-b824-05edaba77952.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18516233,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18516233','Marcia & Ray','Portland, OR','We feel fortunate to live in a home that we love—and enjoy sharing—in a city where so much is happening. Having traveled the world, we find ourselves in heaven right here. We spend a lot of time together in our upstairs office. We like to cook, garden, take walks, watch movies, read, write, and do the New York Times crossword puzzle. Foodies and wordies welcome. Best cup of coffee in Portland: right here.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/18516233/profile_pic/1405968203/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7380909,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7380909','Greg & Beth','Portland, OR','We believe in Portland and truly enjoy hosting!  In our spare time, we like to play with our dogs, garden, spend time with friends, cook and play board games.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6e49f736-7866-4100-9a00-db18338064c0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21848715,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21848715','Rich & Patsy','Portland, OR','Rich & Patsy are your hosts. Rich is owner of NW Mobile kitchens, a Food Truck Design/build company.  We\'re always happy to recommend our favorite Portland Food Carts to visitors and friends. Patsy works at Portland State University.\r\nMy wife Patsy & I love Oregon wines and local restaurants - a big part of what makes Portland such a fun destination. Hiking local trails, biking in the neighborhood and gardening are all reasons why we live here.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f50f7665-6489-4807-b4d1-a5868e892428.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30814658,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30814658','Doug','Portland, OR','We have lived in our great, old Portland style house for more than 31 years. We are excited to have our guests experience the wonderful diversity, rejuvenation of many old buildings (including the Bagdad theater) and incredible eating experience our neighborhood has to offer! We are close to one of Portland\'s most beautiful parks (Laurelhurst) that is just a short walk away!\r\nWe love to travel and have also stayed in many Airbnb locations. \r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b8b09bfa-1fe6-4e72-9d47-3239343b0da3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28179125,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28179125','J','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-28179125/original/bd75d951-cec3-41a1-9128-3f1c30eafc47.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56920726,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56920726','Belladonna','Portland, OR','With a love for travel and a love for design, I really enjoy what I do for a living: Creating living spaces that are lovely, useful and inviting. My neighbors are fantastic, and Alberta Arts is so easy to enjoy. \nEnriching my children lives,  playing my instruments, and listening to podcasts are other things I enjoy. (Thanks for asking.)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-56920726/original/2309422e-52a3-495f-80c6-1e1ba1d5ed9a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53497477,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53497477','Lucky','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/bdc36fbc-2c7c-468b-824e-1125ad240a23.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33606696,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33606696','Hayden','Portland, OR','Hi Airbnb! My name is Hayden and I am a native to the Pacific Northwest. I grew up in Portland and recently graduated from Arizona State University with an accounting degree. I have had great experiences staying in Airbnb\'s and am looking forward to becoming a host. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/681fe8b9-31fd-4c42-ac4a-8117a85a69fa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20227116,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20227116','Christi','Portland, OR','I\'m a Montana native living in Portland, Oregon.  I love traveling and my goal is to visit all 7 continents in my lifetime (I\'ve only got South America and Antarctica left!). I love to have adventures and explore all a place has to offer, but I like to balance my adventures with relaxation and a good book.\r\n\r\nI love hosting guests in my tiny North Portland home and that has helped me to become a kind and conscientious guest myself. Getting to know new people is one of my favorite things and I pride myself in my ability to make connections with just about anyone.\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0a1526dc-41ec-46b5-84e5-0d40e4d42ec3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57657995,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57657995','Amanda','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bdc2ad98-37e2-4463-a817-436e73fedae0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84784','Peter & Kate','Portland, OR','We love to travel...our list of places to travel is consistently growing. We are both photographers and love finding beautiful spots to stay. We are out traveling whenever we get the chance, but we also love coming home to Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ec3d1ccd-215f-4e0b-8972-82e46b523df9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57864996,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57864996','Scott','Portland, OR','Married parents of two who enjoys outdoor activities, working around our house and making things. (From ceramics to beer) We love meeting new people, getting to know them and getting to know the world a little bit better through them.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8ef4f932-e332-4172-bdeb-67a0955ab1ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36040407,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36040407','Jaime','Portland, OR','We have been hosting since September 2016 and absolutely love having people from all over the world stay with us. \n\nWe love the Pacific Northwest, the great outdoors, motorcycle rides, family, friends, and welcoming guests to our home.  We also love supporting local businesses by sharing our favorite neighborhood places to eat, drink, shop and hangout. \n\nWe hope you choose to stay with us while you enjoy Portland. We look forward to meeting you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af088976-4189-4fdc-8441-cac7c82b6316.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13602640,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13602640','Judith','Portland, OR','love adventures and travel, but also love my home base. Im pretty solitary and introverted but love to chat sometimes with folks. Overall I love life and the stillness of its beauty. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d412d1c0-11ad-49e2-b4f5-45d0497f5115.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41333497,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41333497','Katya','Portland, OR','I am an Artist and an Acupuncturist. I have a daughter who is also an artist. We also have a housemate in the house and also have 2 cats and a fishpond\n\nOur house is from 1890 and we call it the Mallory Homestead. \n\n\nMy daughter and I love meeting new people  when we travel and also through visitors at our house. Our goal is to make our house a magnetic attractor to super interesting people. To make more friends and bring the world to our house.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cd5a3170-1b63-4896-863d-63700a292dd1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53233824,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53233824','Heidi','Portland, OR','Hi Airbnb! I am a local, born & raised Oregonian. I love living in Portland, where I have raised my two boys for over 20 years now. I run my own ad agency, which focuses on clients across the nation. I feel very blessed everyday to serve my clients! When I am not working long hours with my business partner, I enjoy my down time with my family. I take one trip every year to Hawaii! I am looking forward to traveling more this coming year.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f5e05d66-9b96-4765-997f-1b8905ea7687.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5790741,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5790741','Ofer','Eugene, OR','I am a busy professional who own apartments in several countries. These are not your typical AirBnB rentals: these apartments are regularly used by me and my family, and are equipped for full living comfort.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/91f0b6ad-23db-4e6a-84d9-1b42b6a35def.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3040408,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3040408','Kelsey + Quentin','Portland, OR','We love to travel in our spare time and we\'re always looking for our next adventure - whether it\'s a day trip across the state or a vacation out of the country. Born in Portland, Oregon and Lyon, France, we appreciate both small town charm and chill, as well as the eclectic energy of international hotspots.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ceb3a18-a1cc-45c6-8cbc-a844431bf0be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1602024,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1602024','Oliver','Portland, OR','Hi!! I\'m Oliver. I love traveling the globe!!  Much of the artwork, blankets, carpets, etc are from my travles to India, Egypt, Morocco, Mexico, and other places. I look forward to sharing my experiences from my travels and offering a welcoming vacation rental. I look forward to hosting you!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/95520f62-e0ab-4aa1-be67-b3038ac8f615.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60500778,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60500778','David & Jamie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0d7dcc91-1eb1-4a3b-90df-22aeeb930a4c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8762054,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8762054','Becca','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8762054/original/fdee10a0-3506-4e8d-9f1f-ab79e21efdbd.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6805954,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6805954','Felicity & Michael','Portland, OR','We are two working artists living in Portland, Oregon, USA.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f966cdde-e69b-48a7-bc77-a04335052c97.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19264481,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19264481','Matthew','Portland, OR','We\'re Matt and Jody! Nice to meet you. We\'re native Northwesterners, born and raised in the great Pacific wonderland! We\'ve lived and worked in Portland for about 11 years and LOVE it. We\'re happy to show off our great city and make your stay as memorable as possible. We\'ve traveled all over the world (Mexico, Croatia, Africa, Costa Rica, Germany, Dominican Republic) but are happy to call Portland home. We love our neighbors and we think we get the best of both worlds...urban living on a quiet tree lined street!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0bec2479-237b-4b90-9d85-b60bace4530d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62203396,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62203396','Nancy','Portland, OR','I am 71 and grew up in this area and attended PSU and Lewis and Clark College. If you want ideas of where to hike or sights to see, just ask. I have had years of experience hosting people from all over the world as well as people receiving medical treatment at OHSU. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd68f3d1-0067-4c07-8d82-a89af18c9fbe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(803501,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/803501','Jaynie','Portland, OR','My name is Jaynie Farnsworth and 5 things that I can\'t live without are as follows: yoga, music, international travel, being in the outdoors, chocolate, and community. My favorite countries that I have visited are Indonesia, Brazil, and Cuba. I absolutely love Afro/ Cuban music! I have traveled to 40 countries and most recently came back from Spain. I am a professional swimmer and own a swim school. Additionally, I have a private acupressure healing practice, an Ayurvedic wellness practice, and I teach yoga. \r\n\r\nMy life motto is follow the drum beat of your heart! My home is a healing sanctuary and perfect for someone who wants to be in a tranquil environment arm\'s length from the excitement of a city. I live with my partner, Mark and we are happy to welcome people into our home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/186efede-ffd5-4996-821c-43c780b5895c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58609749,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58609749','Tim And Pru','Portland, OR','We are a retired couple who married a few years ago. We have 5 grown children between us and 6 grandchildren (ranging in age as this is written from 27 to almost 1 years old) so built this space primarily for their visits but decided to list it.  We are, we think, friendly and sociable but do not impose on our guests.\n\nWe are active with hiking on Mt Hood, kayaking, Zumba, yoga, etc.  Tim is a lifelong alpine skier trying to decide whether to follow his doctor\'s advice to give it up.  In 2014, we spent 2 weeks hiking the Swiss Alps portion of The trans-Europe Via Alpina trail and the past two springs multi-day hikes of the Sheeps’ Head Way and Beara Way, both in West Cork, Ireland).  We\'re members (subscribers) of the Oregon Shakespeare Festival and travel to Ashland each spring and fall for a series of plays. We both do volunteer work, especially Pru at a social service agency and the Oregon Food Bank and Tim at the VA and in the recovery community (he\'s a longtime \"friend of Bill W.\"). We enjoy dining out and can recommend some superb restaurants at all price points, from food carts to James Beard finalist chefs, in this city known for superb dining. Some are even within an easy 10-minute walk of our home. \n\n Pru is known throughout the neighborhood for her street-side garden\'s vegetables, blueberries, raspberries and figs, as well as lots of blooming plants.  \nK',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a0aedfc2-7d16-46eb-b12f-bd9651db519a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62992553,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62992553','Lori','Portland, OR','I am a private practice attorney specializing in contract, corporate and real estate law.  I live in Portland and   I am available to answer any questions .\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/da77fa40-2d5f-4e9d-93f9-1b231974e5b3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38404817,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38404817','Curtis','Portland, OR','After 18+ years as an executive in the hotel industry I am excited to share my passion for Portland’s culture, travel, and human connections with launching my own brand called IndigoBirch™️.  \n\nSince I was a young kid, I have always wanted to have my own hotel or BnB. I have a passion for people and all of the details that come with travel.  After traveling the world for work & leisure I want to invite guests to see what makes genuine hospitality so remarkable and seamless. \n\nOften in my travels I have been inspired to think bigger and bolder. Our guesthouse studio space is meant to provide a peaceful and transformative experience that will be enjoyed and shared with others. Allow me to host you magnificently. So, sit back & relax, and explore what makes this region and city so unique. From its urban wineries, world renown restaurant scene and over 70+ microbreweries, Portland has so much to offer.  Please let me know how I can personalize your stay at IndigoBirch Guest Home. Until then, take amazing care and be safe! I hope to see you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5a32f5a-eb8b-47ff-ad1c-9b975a6cf02b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(585047,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/585047','Heather & Topher','Portland, OR','Hi, \n\nWe are self described lovers of life, music, fun, travel, art, music, gardening, food, wine, bikes & adventure!  Together with our daughters Stella & Maddi, we try to live each day to its fullest with the understanding that life is short, so enjoy it!\n\nNow that we live in Bellingham, WA, we have co-hosts Kathleen and / or Christine & Linda helping us with messaging, booking & on-site management of our units.  Rest assured, someone will be in touch with you as soon as possible to answer your question or help you complete your booking, or with any issues that arise during your stay.  Your inquiry & your experience is very important to us & we make it a priority to respond in a timely manner.\n\nWe have extensively traveled in South America, Central America, North America & Europe & we have toured as percussionists with MarchFourth Marching Band in many of those places as well.  We love that we have been able to create a place now that we are settling in as a family where travelers can come visit us & share their vacations with us.  We truly love hosting & our dream is to build more cottages, at some point - we’ve always got another project brewing!\n\nWe have been told we are laid back, generous hosts & we will be able to give you many spot on recommendations in the city or in the region as we have lived in & explored this area for over 25 years.  We love to share our insider knowledge of the quirky, community spirited, eco-minded \"Portlandia\" that everyone is talking about.  Portland is still our heart & soul & we now enjoy splitting our time between Bellingham & Portland.\n\nWe absolutely love where the cottages are located in the city with easy access to I-5, public transportation, bike routes & the fun-filled Mississippi & Alberta Arts districts.  We hope you will join us & share the spaces we have created for your enjoyment.\n\nBest,\n\nHeather, Topher, Stella & Maddi (& Olive ~ the dog)\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/936788ad-7727-4acf-92bd-708cfaa10ddf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(474837,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/474837','Peggi','Portland, OR','Hi, my name is Peggi . I work professionally as an art director and prop stylist. I get be creative on photo sets near & far!  I\'ve applied all my creative energy to my beautiful home  and so take great pride in sharing it with fellow AirBnb travelers. I love to travel  and frequently find myself away from home - which is good for you!!! I  tried very hard to think of every little detail to make your stay in Portland absolutely perfect. I\'ve styled out my home with unique artwork and cool touches found on my never ending treasure hunts.I hope you\'ll love it as much as I do. Welcome!!!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/20f0856f-1e95-48d0-8228-8a758b7dbcb2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64184222,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64184222','Martha','Portland, OR','We are Portland natives and have been in our North Portland home for over 25 years.  We are both from large boisterous extended families that mostly live in the area and enjoy hosting family meals.  We are now empty-nesters with our two young adult children finishing up grad school and pondering whether or not they will come on home.  We enjoy hiking and biking (both road and mountain) in and around Portland and Oregon.  We also enjoy international travel including the completion of the 540 mile Camino de Santiago Pilgrimage.  We also huge fans of all the great food and drink that the area has to offer, local cheese, berries, produce and craft beer, especially IPA.  Looking forward to sharing Portland with our Northberry Guests.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5fd1ddeb-8a37-476c-b310-6cb2c488e5c9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64329418,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64329418','David','Portland, OR','Hi my name is David and my wife Emily and our sone Ezra (age 13) are excited to host you! We run a deconstruction company called Good Wood. In our free time we like to work on the house and garden, make and look at art, eat berries, swim in the river, go to the dog park with our dogs Levy and Jude, and share meals with friends. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/61e23acc-c971-43aa-a98d-935c24b06b14.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53357613,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53357613','Eric','Portland, OR','I am an artist and musician who moved to Portland in the late 90s from upstate NY. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6ea5dfdb-2a72-4c64-9587-4cd13fe2a423.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27382737,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27382737','Bridget','Portland, OR','Frank and Bridget have been married for 34 years. We have three children - Matt (Ellie), Zach and Anna - all graduates of the University of Oregon (hooray!). We like to do stuff with our kids. We love our garden, a good red blend, St. Rose of Lima, chocolate, Tacovore and Dave Matthews. We are grandparents and loving every minute with our granddaughter and new grandson. We want our guests to enjoy their stay, but they should really get out and see Portland. It\'s awesome!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55bc71f2-20e9-4a28-b21b-69ee16bf02f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64693840,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64693840','Jenna','Portland, OR','I am an outgoing and friendly woman who loves to travel. I teach and manage a college ESL service learning and volunteer program for my school. I also love films, writing, and performance art, both in the audience and as an artist. I love puppets.\r\n\r\nMy life motto would be: Participate with Curiosity.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9cdb2952-262c-454b-83df-3a4046d54a05.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65753023,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65753023','Shelly','Portland, OR','Mother of 3, Wife of 1',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f7d48c6-95bd-4758-a011-460c520cdd45.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14477524,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14477524','Reatha','Portland, OR','Hello!!! \nI am a lover of travel and have enjoyed staying at Airbnb’s all over the world. So I decided to join the Airbnb community and be a hostess to my global neighbors. I love meeting new people and am so happy to share my entire home for a more local and unique visit experience to Portland!!\nSing, Dance, Floss, Travel',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/27ebd272-0051-423d-b756-da4a2f5a08ff.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(327040,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/327040','Jacob','Portland, OR','From San Francisco originally. Moved to Portland in 2015, and love it! Met my husband Matt here a couple years ago. He helps me manage the Airbnb, so you will probably see him around, as well as our pups, Asuna and Dex \nI just recently retired from my job as a corrections nurse and Matt is an elementary school PE teacher. We love to travel (both foreign and domestic), hike, camp, ski, bike ride, cook, and of course, check out new restaurants and food carts. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57a264be-c673-4961-a05c-8cad64d75dd4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24772821,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24772821','Tony And Alix','Portland, OR','Tony and I are a newly married couple living in NE portland. He works in Insurance and I am a full time student. In our spare time we love to catch a movie or try out new places to eat. We also enjoy biking around our neighborhood and spending time with our two french bulldogs Napoleon and Marie. \r\n\r\nWe love hosting and meeting new people and also enjoy using AirBnB when we travel, so we have stocked our place with little things that we would like when we stay other places. We put a lot of love into our apartment to try to make it a home away from home. We love our neighborhood because there is so much to do and are happy to make suggestions on things to explore around here or other parts of Portland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55cc0c32-ddc5-44af-b0c1-188d88ac635c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66990216,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66990216','Jeanie & Taylor','Portland, OR','We love to explore our favorite city and we are lucky to live here. From trying new restaurants, attending Portland events, and staying active on the trails, mountains and the city. Our goal is to add more pins to our world map with 40  between us but home is always here in Portland. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fde9e5e8-08f9-4c3b-ac91-a72599c44bd2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20320140,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20320140','Jason','Portland, OR','I\'m a full-time nursing student in Portland, Oregon. I have a glorious mutt named Forbin that you may see through the window if you stay in my rental-- he\'s a sweetheart that LOVES new people! I\'m a music nerd, outdoors enthusiast, coffee/beer snob... which makes Portland a great place to call home. Feel free to say hi if we cross paths coming or going, I love meeting new people almost as much as my dog does!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/658a73b0-c9b1-4598-b1f7-e8dafe1b6f05.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31761206,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31761206','Andrea','Portland, OR','I moved from San Francisco to Portland, & am thrilled to be living here! \n\nI am a PsychoSpiritual Practitioner studying for my MA in Counseling. I work with women, combining a background in trauma psychology & using my intuitive abilities. \n\nConnect with me @psychiccheerleader',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/479567d4-4263-4b0a-8583-9f62875678c0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(67395194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/67395194','Sheilah','Portland, OR','I own a small business that specializes in Danish and American Mid Century furniture, housewares and lighting. I have traveled to Japan, India, Central America, Indonesia, Asia and Eastern Europe. During these travels I traveled by plane, train, car, bike and one time on an elephant. Love discovering new places and cultures and have learned over the years to be flexible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/41a09a94-2fe1-4a62-bcab-9f5da58ab209.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45543392,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45543392','Melissa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45543392/profile_pic/1443734826/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11430120,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11430120','Janet','Portland, OR','I\'m a DIY, craft, garden, travel and food obsessed mother of two girls, wife, and Maker. I\'ve stayed in some lovely Airbnb’s and really appreciated having a home away from home.  Now I\'m thrilled to host my own. I look forward to hosting guests in our sweet little Alberta Guest House.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2c52ca74-6f4e-42d9-baf1-6c2f94de4fee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12523076,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12523076','Kim Huong','Portland, OR','I grew up in Portland and I’ve been living in Portland for many years, primarily on the eastside of Portland. I’ve seen quite a few changes in Portland. In recent years, Portland is growing fast, and becoming a popular travel destination. I’ve seen Portland change and grow over the years to become a culturally rich city with its uniqueness. Portland is also known as one of the best foodie cities. I enjoy the city life in Portland, its diverse cultures with an array of ethnic cuisines. I also love its beauty, whether walk to the café for morning coffee, take a walk in the neighborhood park in the evening, or going for a hike on the mountain right in the city, two miles away from the guesthouse. (Mt. Tabor, a beautiful forested park covering an extinct volcano, water reservoirs, a 360-degree views, along with play grounds, and walking/running/biking trails).\r\n\r\nI appreciate the splendid of natures that Oregon has to offer, whether spending a day at the Gorge, snowshoeing on Mt. Hood, or heading to Oregon Coast for ocean breeze. I love traveling, going places, and meeting new people to share traveling experiences as well.\r\n\r\nWhen in Portland, I open up my home to host guests, and I hope all my guests enjoy their stay and have positive experience in my city.\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/634a869d-de40-4bba-b2c7-2c396a0ddf0d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47289428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47289428','Gwen','Portland, OR','I have 2 incredible kids, a husband, mother and Himalayan cat, all of whom live in a 1906 craftsman home in Portland, Oregon. We\'re often exploring nature in our little airstream trailer, or finding new places to play in the city. I worked at Nike for over 10 years in design and innovation, launched a start-up to help people find joy in movement, and now run a creative agency designing experiences that connect with people. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/368b2f74-ad69-4e4a-a5bc-1ad93dfb56ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(69029284,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/69029284','Jenni','Portland, OR','Hey Everyone! My husband Matt and I are Oregonians, born and raised. We have lived in our wonderful Rose City neighborhood for over 20 years and love it! Our 3 boys have kept us a bit busy over the years, so we are a couple of home bodies who enjoy a good night out. Thankfully, we live in a great town, with wonderful food, beer, and entertainment!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a1caa46a-a511-48f9-8bca-61b26e626556.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7008585,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7008585','Emma','Portland, OR','Dustin and I are young married couple from Portland. I love great food, interesting wine and visiting new places. I’m a buyer for a furniture store in Portland. We’re also Airbnb superhosts so if you ever visit our great city please consider staying with us! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e6b1b8ae-1d41-4c86-9e2a-1df22cc7fd37.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57521274,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57521274','Jeffrey','Portland, OR','I am a native of  San Francisco who was raised on the Peninsula and have lived in Los Angeles, Tokyo, Beijing, Honolulu and Seattle; I  love calling Portland home.\nI hope you enjoy Portland just as much as I do - ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3ce4ad55-3cff-4ac8-8d57-55b37fd6dc30.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39078640,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39078640','David','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/373ce351-1562-410b-b2c2-6204cc58ad04.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40218250,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40218250','Nancy','Bend, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fee4bb1e-00c7-4019-a7d8-c09b30366199.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44840316,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44840316','Jeneen','Portland, OR','Oregon native. Small business owner. I\'ve always enjoyed welcoming people into my home. I believe that traveling to new places and opening up to new experiences is essential to living life to it\'s fullest. \r\n\r\nI love food. a lot.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7a553559-d3d1-4ff4-bd0b-b7b54e6e9ca1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3888703,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3888703','Wojtek & Trey','Portland, OR','We love to travel, food, and Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/71a4ec67-f23f-4254-b571-ac373ab2d419.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(71376038,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/71376038','Laura','Portland, OR','I am clean, organized & busy.  \nI love to bake so fresh cookies or a pie will probably be available.  I can\'t live with out coffee, red wine, dancing, traveling and entertaining.  I have a wonderful front porch for morning coffee or a glass of wine in the evening.  \nI\'m relaxed and positive! My motto is: Flexibility is the key!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-71376038/original/77029d4d-7e07-43ee-9ce2-b94ef9d655f9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19266','Chris','Portland, OR','We have lived in Portland since 2010.  We own and run a successful small business in Portland. We are foodies and explorers at heart and would love to share our city with anyone who feels the same.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d4d6526c-47af-46ed-9920-4dc934cf73af.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25461561,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25461561','Paul','Portland, OR','Loves to travel!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f041125-da52-44f7-96fc-bd0f800e32c2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(72417286,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/72417286','Stephen','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8be0fc5e-6b1f-400d-a7aa-d7baf04af405.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(714512,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/714512','Dan & Jackie','Portland, OR','While not Portland natives, we boast a combined 45 years living in Portland. Jackie hails from NYC and Dan from both Israel and the SF Bay Area. We both agree that Portland is our favorite city and one we are excited to call home. \r\n\r\nPortland is such a natural setting, sometimes we even camp in the backyard with our eight year old. We enjoy live music & comedy, cycling, photography, cooking, game nights, reading and film. We like entertaining and feel that hospitality and service is essential to a happy life. \r\n\r\nPortland is an incredible city that continues to evolve faster than we can keep up. We look forward to helping you experience it, while continuing to discover it anew through your eyes. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/baf093e7-d610-495d-89a1-8ad2c37a5ea2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24172332,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24172332','Michele','Portland, OR','We are an adventurous couple who share a love of travel both individually, together, and with our two children.  We try to stay at Air BnB\'s whenever we travel, especially internationally! Eating good food and drinking great wine and beer are just some of the joys of living in Portland, in addition to having easy access to the ocean and the mountains. \n\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/75eacdd6-7840-431f-b9f6-a2670f44f557.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62110493,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62110493','Christine & Ellis','Portland, OR','We love our urban farm and our close-knit neighborhood. We enjoy sharing company with friends and family and all that the Portland-metro area has to offer. It\'s a good life!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/472604e9-a889-4ba7-ac68-1eac4ab41b94.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21193811,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21193811','Sally','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f6d81095-bc10-46ee-828c-8752efb00d40.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(72968932,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/72968932','Neil','Portland, OR','Love living in Portland with my family and sharing our new finished basement space. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57f8075b-c5bb-481b-a588-feeac18c70fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8119693,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8119693','Anna','Portland, OR','I’m a Michigander by heritage but moved to Washington at a young age and have been in Oregon for most of my adult life. I love to travel and enjoy hiking and finding new delicious restaurants.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/05e1df3f-6c0b-48c3-a453-98ef15fb1427.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4441147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4441147','Tracey & Justin','Portland, OR','We are a family of four and have lived here for 21 years. We are officially empty nesters. Our son is attending U of O. Our daughter is a Miami City Ballet dancer. We are originally from Marin. We love the river, mountain, and ocean- which are all drivable for the day. Justin manages Sunbridge Solar. I\'m a clinical herbalist and a licensed psilocybin-assisted therapy facilitator, so let me know if you\'re curious!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/190ac73b-34b5-4c23-a42f-ca38a4c5ac8c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75083765,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75083765','Mary Beth','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f21c872e-c1e4-4821-82a6-9e562956cfcf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28410788,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28410788','Janet','Portland, OR','Our guests experience is really important to us, their comfort & enjoyment of the property provides us with joy.  We\'ve traveled extensively. We enjoy music, wine, movies, books & travel.  Favorite destinations have been to Italy, France, Chile, Greece, Hong Kong, Mexico, The Caribbean, Argentina, Australia, New Zealand & most of the United States.  We have family in New England, Alaska, Washington & Arizona - all fun destinations!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b3c91ff3-5954-4adc-961b-5117b3fcfb8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66230687,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66230687','Carin','Portland, OR','I’m a longtime Portlander, with the travel bug—Even made a career out of it—Rich and I built a business importing handicrafts from Latin America and SE Asia way back in 1987 and we’re still doing it.  32 years of adventuring around the world has been enlightening and a tremendously good time!  Having an Airbnb is our way to share Oregon\'s beauty and our place on the planet!\nUpdate: We now have 2 Airbnb\'s! \nhttps://www.airbnb.com/h/lovelyirvington\nhttps://airbnb.com/h/brightandfunloft ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cc94049c-855d-42c0-814c-42147f27edc6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28894059,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28894059','Diana','Portland, OR','World traveler living in the Pacific North West, for now at least. Wife, Mom, educator, traveler ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/28894059/profile_pic/1440200027/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76057995,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76057995','Erin','Vienna, VA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e41ec66-8d20-44d7-b424-6f6ae525248c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42870763,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42870763','Doreen','Portland, OR','I love traveling with Airbnb! It really allows you to get to know the culture and people of the town your visiting!\n\nWhen home in PDX I enjoy working on the garden and spending time in the neighborhood parks.\n\n*Vaccinated* ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff3d9c11-04d4-4523-8058-4f16b9283986.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76194443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76194443','Lorie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/7917952b-c656-4891-aff9-dac9c7c7dd83.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44210890,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44210890','Benjamin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96f65b2e-be14-4341-9524-842a2cf9d38d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14482835,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14482835','Bonnie','Berkeley, CA','I am a world traveler who is happily at home in the three best places on earth - the San Francisco Bay Area, the island of Maui and Portland Oregon where my little grandson and his family live.  My husband Jim and I are excited to become AirB&B hosts, sharing our Portland townhouse, which we bought as our \"granny flat\" when visiting the new little guy.\r\n\r\n I am a thoughtful guest, anxious to know the place you love the way you have learned to love it.  I like my privacy, but leave my space at least as nice as I found it!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1f797d88-aa26-4d2a-9f9d-bd0d4b17e08d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76780292,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76780292','Chris','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e0cda86-d038-48ba-b283-37e6dce64827.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38278246,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38278246','Victoria','Portland, OR','While I love hosting guests from all over the world,  I want to see the world,  too!\n\nMy husband and I travel with our kids so it was important for us to have a guest space that welcomes families. If you need any recommendations,  we\'re happy to share our favorite spots; we love sharing our beautiful city!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fa7d49b7-ea76-43fd-9c09-f81d5b6532ee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75800876,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75800876','Anna','Portland, OR','I pride myself in paying attention to detail and care about the wellbeing of people . \r\nAs an Airbnb host of beautiful properties that are tastefully decorated and suitably equipped,  I offer my guests an amazing stay in our beautiful Portland, OR. \r\nMy guests have fond memories of their times at our condos which have  been a \'home away from home\' for their stay.\nI enjoy travel myself and these have enriched my knowledge in many ways. \r\nMy favorites are island destinations , sun drenched beaches , places steeped in history and culture. \r\nI enjoy music concerts --jazz, rock n roll; comedy shows ; fine dining ; hiking and exploring the outdoors .... Portland has much to offer in all these areas . The \'total package\' ! \r\nCome enjoy and experience it for yourself ...... \r\nIts my pleasure to welcome you as an Airbnb host ! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ce788d67-80a5-4607-8d47-b7b58efa74d2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53052399,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53052399','Paul And Carmenza','Portland, OR','Warm, friendly and fun couple. Paul is originally from Canada and Carmenza is originally from Colombia. We met in Portland and love living here. When we are not traveling or out enjoying festivals and the beautiful nature in this area, we like to relax our spacious and colorful back yard. We have an indoor cat Gia who is friendly - please let us know in advance about any pet allergies so that we can accommodate you.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ae4688da-d627-4fff-a323-48f994fae0ef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45164806,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45164806','Mark','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/83f23f23-eb9a-40f0-bfe0-682160667d72.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2038566,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2038566','Jooyoung','Portland, OR','I am an experienced traveler of many years. I travel frequently for work and fun. I work as an equity-centered design consultant working at the intersection of racism and poverty. I love tea, time in nature (following the giggles of mushrooms), and movement. \n\nI would especially love to host international travelers.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2038566/profile_pic/1431063337/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18774457,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18774457','Harriet','Portland, OR','I and my husband, Jon, a retired high school chemistry teacher, love building and making spaces more beautiful.  We have three adult sons and seven grandchildren so we are busy! We love meeting new people and we love using our home as an oasis for others. I am biracial Japanese/American having been born and raised on Okinawa. You’ll see elements of my Japanese heritage on our property including a large torii gate.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-18774457/original/5c2853d0-cfc2-4316-b611-c9d1682b5ae0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75240152,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75240152','Tava','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-75240152/original/e2ecee65-03ab-4f04-8bcb-d337fdc1364a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5622521,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5622521','Earl & Hien','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3c27433-39c5-45b9-aef2-de0bbeb70a47.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(79737835,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/79737835','David','Portland, OR','Hi I\'m David',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b39c995-4901-4d35-9076-867bdd9608ae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9510170,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9510170','Jessica','Portland, OR','I hold a deep respect for the environment and all living things. For ten years, I worked as a freelance makeup artist and eco beauty educator.  In 2019 I got my MS degree in nutrition. As of 2024, I am a Registered Dietitian Nutritionist & vegan chef. In my spare time, I enjoy cooking for friends and family, growing vegetables with my husband in our organic home garden, spending time with my companion animals, and exploring new, beautiful places.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-9510170/original/49981aca-ee08-4ba8-9a3b-3048c0c974ae.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3454923,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3454923','Heather','','I spend a lot of time volunteering, and I’m also a mom. I love hiking in beautiful places! We are based in Portland, OR, but love to travel and experience different cultures. Meeting guests from around the globe is the best part about hosting!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/27107e8e-65b2-4f7b-9eda-727775d121a9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10354567,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10354567','Paula','Portland, OR','Yoga, hiking, and gardening are among my favorite things to do.  Just returned to living back in Portland after 5 years in S.E. Asia.  Hoping to make this a retreat like setting for you with lots of opportunities to soak in the Pacific Northwest vibe.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10354567/profile_pic/1443148521/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23464398,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23464398','Nicole','Portland, OR','I own a boutique design agency in Portland that specializes in hospitality-based brands, like coffee roasters, wineries, restaurants, wellness, events, and hotels. All the things I\'m personally interested in. We host guests at Sorta Summer House in Portland & Sorta Summer Rowhouse in Tucson. We snowbird between the PNW and the Sonoran desert.\nFollow my adventures here: @factorynicole and my life partner here: @truenpence',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-23464398/original/2133a142-0edd-406f-ad08-c5b0ac072cee.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10458442,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10458442','Natasha','Portland, OR','We\'re just some nature-loving folks living the Portland dream! We love tromping around the woods, playing music, going to endless potlucks, practicing acroyoga, eating a wide variety of amazing food, and introducing people to our wonderful city. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10458442/profile_pic/1434320135/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1332315,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1332315','Jessi And Nick','Westfir, OR','Travelers.  Adventurers.  Parents.  Mountain Bikers.  Musicians.  Lovers of the Northwest.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/23d9c296-6e95-4f29-8939-ad20e09ba724.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52202264,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52202264','Kalyn','Portland, OR','Hi!  My name is Kalyn, I\'m 37, I was born and raised in Portland and love the opportunity to share my apartment with people traveling in the Portland area! We have a lot of great shopping and food places that are all within walking distance!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-52202264/original/0c9a10e9-cbbb-4afb-b684-ce0a54e572c4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70547018,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70547018','Lucy','Portland, OR','Hi I\'m Lucy! I\'ve been lucky enough to open my home to so many travelers over the years, whether they\'re coming from abroad, or seeking a quiet staycation, we\'ve got the perfect place to land. Let us help you relax just steps from busy Hawthorne Blvd!\n\nI\'ve hired Dynamic Home and Guest, a professional guest management company to host my wonderful home. Please feel free to reach out if you have any questions!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/554a58b8-ea5e-431f-b352-c2237a6bb490.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1339136,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1339136','Jodi','Portland, OR','In 2002, I left Canada to travel the world as a documentary photographer. In 2008, I met the love of my life in Abu Dhabi. In 2013, we moved to Portland, Oregon where I can\'t seem to get enough of the innovative food scene, creative culture, and natural beauty of Oregon.\r\n\r\nWe are quite particular when it comes to travel accommodation. We want to be surrounded by a simple beauty that represents the culture of where we are, with seemingly effortless luxury and comforts.\r\n\r\nSome of our favourite boutique hotels from around the world are: \r\nTalaa 12 in Marrakech, Morocco\r\nCosta Lanta in Koh Lanta, Thailand\r\nRiva Lofts in Florence, Italy\r\nSumahan on the Water in Istanbul, Turkey\r\nBab Al Shams in the middle of the desert, UAE\r\nLa Sacristia in Tarifa, Spain \nPlaya Viva Eco-Lodge, Mexico\nLa Donaira in Montecorto, Spain\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1339136/profile_pic/1385486362/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13926479,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13926479','R.J.','Portland, OR','I\'m a professional Fine Art & Commercial Photographer, and a published author. I have traveled and or photographed in 35 countries. I cook several cuisines. I feel food  is a remarkable culture exchange.  Many of the ingredients come from a bountiful organic garden behind my my studio.\r\n\r\n I spend a lot of time hiking, canoeing, kayaking and photographing nature. The doggie love of my life Duncan NotaBeast is my constant companion.  \r\nWhen time permits I enjoy preforming arts.   I\'m currently working on my 3rd and 4th Fine Art Books. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/daf37a67-29fc-4d52-b33d-797add2360f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40342841,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40342841','Laura','Portland, OR','I love the outdoors and I love city life so I find Portland to be the perfect place to live and Mount Hood the perfect place to play. I enjoy camping, cooking, hiking, skiing, working out, traveling, watching old movie musicals, listening to music  like Beatles, Harry Connick Jr., Ella Fitzgerald, and Laufey. I especially treasure hanging out with friends and family. I\'m super active, love people and sell real estate.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2cccbaf1-8350-4fd8-beab-7a286095e8aa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1705386,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1705386','Kate','Portland, OR','Jason and I have been living in NE Portland since 2006. Jason was born and raised in Seattle, and I am originally from Western Massachusetts, specifically The Berkshires. We have two school-aged daughters who attend our neighborhood school. I work as a Certified Nurse Midwife, catching babies at a nearby hospital, and Jason is a woodworker/furniture maker/artist/Super Dad! We love our neighborhood. Fernhill Park is just two blocks away and is the perfect place to play, picnic or exercise. Our block is full of families with young kids who play outside rain or shine. \nWe spend our time together exploring Portland and the beautiful Northwest, hiking, berry picking and eating all kinds of bakery treats, especially donuts! We love bike riding, hiking in The Gorge, eating good food and drinking good IPA. Jason is a great cook- ask him about his homemade corn tortillas and pizza cooked in our pizza oven! We love mid-century modern style and architecture. I am a women\'s health, OB/Gyn/midwifery geek and can spend hours discussing this with anyone interested. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b24dd1a-d0a7-4d18-9764-4fd5b167b273.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84485898,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84485898','Morgan','Portland, OR','Eat well, travel much!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/03e7738f-d3bf-45cc-97c7-ec3ac309ed7e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1218855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1218855','Suja','Portland, OR','Greetings fellow travelers! \r\n\r\nBorn and raised in northern California, I have made Portland my home to live, work and play in, since 2010.  As a traveler myself, I sincerely love providing an elegant, stylish, and comfortable home base for guests to enjoy and explore Portland.  I always am brainstorming new ways to tweak my units to make them more pleasing to stay in.\r\n\r\nPastimes I enjoy include Swimming, Running, Acrobatics, bicycle commuting, SUP, endurance training,  and \"Adventure Travel\".  I also volunteer for a Portland-based Youth Moutaineering group.\r\n\r\nMy favorite foods are Thai, Mexican, and Indian, all spicy cuisines.  Mmmmmm!\r\n\r\nPast Travel: Spain, Portugal, India, Iceland, Argentina, Chile, Bolivia, China, Australia, Canada, France, Netherlands, Israel, South Africa, Namibia, Swaziland, Indonesia, Uganda, Rwanda, Mexico, El Salvador, Nicaragua, Panama, England, Myanmar, Thailand, Cambodia, Belize, Bahamas.\r\n\r\nIn my life, I seek both movement and settlement, city and country.  I seek to create a meaningful and enjoyable life through appreciating the present, cultivating relationships with friends and family, giving back, and continual growth and expansion.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1218855/profile_pic/1386887678/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22320983,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22320983','Winston','Portland, OR','Hi. I’m a journalist and I love traveling and exploring the outdoors. Hosting is one of my favorite ways to share my home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d2ca6e82-43f1-4357-996b-5a58a5015d42.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21571871,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21571871','Victoria','Portland, OR','I\'ve just resumed hosting in Summer 2024 after taking a much needed break to repair and rejuvenate my place, The Clay House. My partner Joshua has put a lot of love and elbow grease into modernizing the necessary features of our classic home, which was originally built in 1891. We love hosting on Airbnb because it allows us to share our unique place with guests who appreciate creativity and convenience. We also love to travel as much as possible!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79078177-dba1-411a-97b2-ddb512ae0cba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73257018,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73257018','Leah','Portland, OR','We keep things elegant, uncluttered and neat and we are obsessive about providing a clean and organized house. I am originally from the Philippines, my husband is a professor here in Portland. I love gardening, movies and food and being a host!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/366e3b9b-4cf6-4938-bf4c-e325c5b0260d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5403721,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5403721','Amy','Portland, OR','I am a mom of 2, wife of 1, and Founder and CEO of the only parental leave consultancy in the country. And I LOVE houses. I especially love finding the oldest, most dilapidated, neglected diamonds in the rough and fixing them up with the help of my hubby, brother (best carpenter/contractor ever!), and a crew of brilliant artisans. Mostly I just work and work, hug my people, and try to find time to sleep. I also spend a lot of time thinking about how lucky I am to have all of the support I have to chase my many (and often conflicting) dreams. My husband and I have been landlords for a long time, but this is our first airbnb hosting. He said to me recently, \"Do you remember 24 years ago when you got back from Europe and said you wanted to run a youth hostel?\" and I said \"No\" (because thank god his memory is better than mine) so he said, \"Well, I feel like this is finally making that dream come true.\" And he was right. So, apparently I have been waiting 24 years to welcome YOU! Very exciting!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f7242bb1-f6a4-425f-a92b-a8b97774806d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(87276189,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/87276189','Marie','Portland, OR','I am a foraging, gardening, bird-watcher who spent many years working in the restaurant industry and am now taking life more slowly.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/83e782dd-8c6b-4bde-a9df-dff227f68f7f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12872871,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12872871','Chris & Banning','Portland, OR','We love to travel and live like locals when we’re in a new spot. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1ae811c3-5134-4f14-a939-3162e8ec2006.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1576231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1576231','Gary','Portland, OR','Gary & Roberta Dossick\r\nWe are a couple in our early 70’s enjoying our retired life style. \nWe like creating our own trips , hiking, adventure,  music, sports/recreation, experiencing and learning about different cultures.\r\nWe have been residents of Portland.  \r\nfor 11 years after living in the Bay Area for 30+ years raising our children and building our careers as professionals. Our married son and three year old granddaughter live in the Bay Area and we have a daughter living in Portland.\r\n\r\nEastmoreland Community\r\nPortland OR ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ce17039c-6272-45ed-98d4-81809ec678d1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88997237,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88997237','Adam','Portland, OR','Adam and Dulce',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c694a517-3857-4f17-94df-67de36cf0e1d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1186587,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1186587','Mike','San Francisco, CA','Mike is a designer, husband, and dad of a rambunctious 3yr old, Penny and our latest addition, PJ. We all love to eat, enjoy the outdoors, and most importantly, create meaningful, shared experiences. As guests, we are respectful, relaxed, and considerate. As hosts, we are thoughtful, passionate, and generous. We are excited to be part of the Airbnb community, and look forward to the many adventures ahead.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/df8db4dc-da5b-4e5c-83fa-c0588ebb14fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18925199,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18925199','Cecilia','Portland, OR','Love adventure and travel to new places, I like to feel welcomed wherever I go, for that reason, I like to welcome other travelers and ensure they leave with good experiences to share with others. \nTravel opens our eyes to other things that we may not experience in other ways.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/93042900-84ed-4769-8bb9-3c9810f5a521.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42715966,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42715966','Andrea','Portland, OR','Andrea and Andy love life in the Pacific Northwest as well as exploring in many other directions.  We are thankful for the many positive travel experiences we\'ve had on Airbnb and are thrilled to offer a space for fellow adventurers to visit!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7e9fdb9e-344d-458d-b19f-4b2f5f3154c0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45410272,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45410272','Omar & Amanda','Portland, OR','Amanda is an Adapted PE teacher who enjoys sports, nature, a good read, and exploring new places. She is a California native living in the unique city of Portland. Omar is a realtor who came to the states from Peru as a young adult. We got hitched in 2014. We have two little boys with big hearts and lots of energy. We get along with almost anyone and love getting to know new people. We are sensitive to others\' needs and have easy going personalities. I think that’s what makes us good house guests or hosts. Hope to connect with you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45410272/profile_pic/1443588773/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49123414,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49123414','Jessica','Portland, OR','After retiring from a decade in nursing I found that I missed caring for people. Although I have moved to a more creative career path I look forward to pampering my guests. Whether that means I am there for you in person or behind the scenes I hope you leave feeling perfectly happy with your stay. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3d9d0526-610b-432b-99fc-543f5b5360ff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6446118,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6446118','Buck','Portland, OR','Family man, father of two. Engineer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/6fe7356f-fc34-4bc2-8fe4-2227fa778a7f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51175099,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51175099','Robert','Portland, OR','Originally from Eastern Europe I set roots in Oregon in 2002 and quickly fell in love with the Pacific Northwest. I love spending time outdoors, running, hiking, cycling, kayaking and skiing, and I also love Portland’s amazing food, coffee, beer and music scene, not to mention the beautiful Oregon wine country. I traveled extensively around the world, lived in many countries and states and I couldn’t be happier to call PORTLAND my HOME and to share this amazing city with visitors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2266c5f0-4c03-4379-b37a-742b54eca07b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(86128240,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/86128240','Josh','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9c9f9d2c-30ce-46fc-9494-c122ddc7dd21.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37683790,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37683790','Joshua','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bc8c1d8f-2b90-43c2-b57c-79a08e3e04de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6586631,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6586631','Wayne','Portland, OR','Artist',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eb354529-a9e1-4b10-8976-75f42d1ac87e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51738043,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51738043','Doug','Portland, OR','Hello! We are a Portland-based, full-service rental concierge focused on helping our clients enjoy the perks of being an Airbnb host without the hassle of the everyday stress, and our guests have the most enjoyable vacation, ever. Our home owners get to relax, knowing they\'re in the hands of seven-year Airbnb veterans and Super Hosts, and our guests can rest assured we are available 7-days a week, and have a response time of less than an hour - go ahead, try us! We\'ve made the mistakes so you don\'t have to, and our company is built upon trust, communication, commitment, attention to detail, and a big ol\' dash of OCD for good measure. \r\n\r\nHave a rental in the Portland area? Ready to become a host and don\'t know where to start? I can help, and it would be my pleasure to do so. \r\n\r\nWe look forward to working with you! \r\n\r\n~ Guest Services\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/333785c7-3067-4423-b7cd-acba00cc3977.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26701213,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26701213','Carrie','Portland, OR','My husband, Dave, 14-year old daughter, Evelyn, and I live in SE Portland, Oregon.  We love to travel around the world, but also spend a lot of time white water rafting on all the great rivers in our state.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/66b44fa5-1a46-4d21-990a-28b3bdb59e10.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1586012,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1586012','Lucy','Portland, OR','Hello!\n\nWe are Lucy and Ian, Portlanders who like to explore the world and our city with our kid in tow. We love walking and biking around Portland and sharing our favorite local restaurants, bars, and parks with our guests. \n\nWe look forward to hosting you!\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fa2787e3-2e77-496f-857f-04b3722decd4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5670387,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5670387','David And Debra','Portland, OR','We are both teachers: David a professor at Lewis and Clark College and Debra an ESL teacher.  We love to travel, especially to Spanish speaking countries.  We love music, theatre, nature and comedy.   ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e3ad9c69-1414-4458-a6e4-675f5af4de0f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2503251,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2503251','Laura','San Diego, CA','Hola Guests!  \nViva Beach Life (website) Vacation Homes, myself, my co-hosts, my housekeeping & handyman teams have a passion for buying, remodeling, staging, marketing, hosting and entertaining guests in our Viva Beach Life Coastal Beach vacation homes with a local design vibe as Super Hosts!\n\nYes, enjoy 9 Viva Beach Life Casa’s closest to the BEACH/Water! \n\n• Here is the link to ALL my COASTAL entertainer homes.  (VivaBeachLife website) https://www.airbnb.com/users/2503251/listings\n\n www.airbnb.com/p/vivabeachlifewebsite\n\n• Viva Beach Life buys, remodel, stage, market, sell, and manage Viva Beach Life OWN coastal vacation homes that entertain guests located on the coast of San Diego, CA to Portland, OR!\n\n• Let us help your Coastal home to entertain guests!\n\n• What sets us apart:\n-Coastal Homes with Views\n-Homes Close to Water\n-Remodeled Entertainer Homes\n-Large Entertaining Spaces Inside and Out\n-Entertainment Services\n-Super \"Local\" Flair \n\n•We\'re super proud of Viva Beach Life 100s of five-star reviews on Airbnb, (Hidden by Airbnb) / (Hidden by Airbnb) , TripAdvisor/ (Hidden by Airbnb) , Turo (Car) and 225+ other websites.  (Coming Soon!  Book Direct to Save!)\n\n• We\'re always trying to enhance your entertainment experience.  We LOVE input as we act on it immediately!\n\n• We support the shared LOCAL economy (Vacation Homes, Cars, Lyft, etc.) as we provide unique LOCAL entertainment accommodations to host your vacation, work travel, temporary living, stay with friends and families.  \n\n• We pay 31+ contractors a month from construction, remodelers, handypersons, housekeepers, inspectors and buy lots of remodeling, hospitality products daily!  \n\n• If City\'s like Portland, OR, San Diego, Los Angeles and HOAs restrict vacation homes they displace:\n-Awesome families who want to enjoy FREE Beach access\n-Their tourism dollars \n-Viva Beach Life 31+ contractors a month\n-My business and passion\n\n• I and these folks are trying to make a living and we pay Viva Beach Life taxes to support tourism, housing, welfare, and civil services.\n\n• How I got started:  While pursuing my 20+ year career in sports marketing and sales (Adidas, NBA, Ticketmaster, SKECHERS, etc.) I moved every few years.  So in (Phone number hidden by Airbnb) I bought my first home and started the \"shared economy\" by renting rooms to colleagues and friends while remodeling the homes on the side too.  Before you knew it I had several homes. \n\n• After surviving hardships that almost killed and destroyed me (domestic violence, $300K forgery, insurance fraud, guns (illegal assault weapon/ convicted felon), maybe drugs, alcohol and finally a divorce) I fought for \"justice\" and earned my safety independence back to control my own destiny!  So I started converting my homes into entertainment vacation rentals to pay the forgery/theft, legal bills, and my mortgage.\n\n• My house contractors inspect, stage and manage the home remodel, stage, clean, fix, replenish, garden and we offer special request services.\n\n• For help with the above homes, please reach out to my home local coordinators:\n#415\n#895\nCASA Too, too, seven, too\n\n• I\'m an e-commerce digital marketing executive/consultant and I live in my vacation rentals to improve the entertainment experience.\n\n• I\'m super active and rent my homes in La Jolla, Pacific Beach, Newport Beach, El Segundo Beach/Manhattan Beach, California and Portland, Oregon to preferably vacation renters like you!\n\n• My Passions:\n• TRAVELING, VACATIONING, Beach volleyball, fitness, running, soccer, mountain biking, snowboarding, surfing, tennis, design, and landscaping.\n\n• I would love to host you!  \n\n• Life is too short not to incorporate a vacation every chance you get.  Live it up with family and friends.\n\nCheers,\nLaura\nHere is the link to ALL our entertainer COASTAL homes.\nhttps://www.airbnb.com/users/2503251/listings\n\nwww.airbnb.com/p/vivabeachlifewebsite\n\nVivaBeachLife website\nCall or text our co-host team: \n#415, #895, Too, too, seven, too or CASA',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2503251/original/0fed4c2c-b179-4c49-a0d0-d45931e88af7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(92302331,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/92302331','Scott & Cliff','Portland, OR','The kids are grown and gone and we have plenty of room. We love to eat and drink all over Portland, hike, play tennis and hang out with good friends. We\'ve traveled a lot over the years and we look forward to having guests in our beautiful home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1ab517ef-ba6e-4065-b60c-dcc5c51b9488.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17456214,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17456214','Tom','Portland, OR','I am a transplant from Tucson, AZ but have been in Portland long enough to call it home.  I work on a small vineyard south of the city, and spend weekends gardening and knocking about Portland.\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef7f69c1-4dfa-4386-b9cf-806649c718f9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3597843,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3597843','Deborah','Portland, OR','I\'m a children\'s book illustrator, and live in Portland Oregon with my husband Jay and our standard poodle Luna. We love exploring the Pacific Northwest and traveling as much as possible! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/08d73eb6-3cf8-4454-ae1b-1281562abbc9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90701654,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90701654','Kevin','Portland, OR','Self employed, active. Live & let live.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-90701654/original/b4f81748-373c-41dd-9f6c-8bb5f549ad67.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62043803,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62043803','Jennifer','Portland, OR','My husband James and I are multi-generation Oregonians. Our roots run deep in the Pacific Northwest, and we have cherished the privilege of calling this breathtaking region our home for our entire lives. Our deep love for the Pacific Northwest will always remain unwavering, but we are grateful for the chance to explore beyond its borders and be captivated by the beauty and diversity that awaits us in the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-62043803/original/970fdd42-171b-4ea3-bfd3-c1d62a190a2b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1638505,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1638505','Nancy','Portland, OR','I am Nancy.\nI enjoy spending time with friends sharing dinner we’ve cooked together while drinking delicious wine.\nI live to travel & explore new territory around the world.\nWhen home, I spend a lot of  time wrestling with my 5 year old labradoodle, walden.\nI like milk chocolate, music from various genres, staying active; cycling, dead lifting & restorative yoga.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65163bba-d91c-4db8-ad60-da913b5793d2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3611030,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3611030','Daniela','Portland, OR','I am from Asuncion,Paraguay. Have been living in Portand since 6 years ago. I am very laid back, love traveling and like to keep myself busy enjoying this amazing city!  I work from 9-5 ish and i love enjoying a movie or shows by the fire place, once in a while :) I can totally point you to cool activities, places to go and even introduce you to my friends if you want to do fun stuff with us! +1503 4218239',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3611030/profile_pic/1348031206/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49343,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49343','Kyra Anastasia','Portland, OR','Welcome! Please do visit my Zen properties in LA and Portland. I really enjoy sharing my homes with others and giving you an opportunity to explore a new place. I have traveled extensively throughout the world and on several occasions have stayed with other airbnb hosts. Most recently, I traveled to Bhutan and Nepal and stayed with a lovely family in Kathmandu. To me, staying in private homes, in different parts of the world, enhances a trip and is a wonderful way to make new friends. Please feel free to contact me and do let me know if there is anything I can do to help you with your visit! \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/49343/profile_pic/1338695474/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12095190,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12095190','Shawn','Portland, OR','Family',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/68d55694-aaf2-4e29-bee2-e938118eba30.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25595028,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25595028','Aimee','Portland, OR','Aimee and Roll have lived in Portland since the late 1990\'s.  Roll is an artist and Aimee works at a university.  We have two school aged kids.  We love traveling, trying new things, riding bikes, reading, and exploring.  Our family goal is to travel to every continent.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/53f04683-d6fd-4665-9fc5-546d649d7b93.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8873069,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8873069','Jupiter','Portland, OR','The Jupiter offers crisp, minimalist guest rooms honoring the 60\'s pop culture scene.\nAmenities include: complimentary coffee from local roaster Happy Cup, free wifi throughout the property, and front desk concierge service.\n\nHUNGRY? THIRSTY? Hey Love features international fare in modern, tropical interiors with plants & local art in the Jupiter NEXT Hotel. They won 2023\'s Spirited Award for best hotel bar in the country! Come have a relax.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/74e87234-1a1d-4227-9afc-82da4334492c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2874362,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2874362','Amalia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/3b0c2425-94b8-49a4-b5b5-0c4262bce0f5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17366389,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17366389','Erin','Portland, OR','I am a native Oregonian and am married with 5 kiddos. I love walking, yoga, meditation and working in my garden. I am madly in love with my husband and am grateful everyday that I wake up',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/93be60a0-0051-4320-be2f-d61d28dec34b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(94248402,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/94248402','Seth','Portland, OR','Connecticut and I are both born and bred Portlanders. We both work for small family businesses. We have 3 children who all attend local public schools. We love that Portland is a great place to raise a family, that it is close to so many beautiful places and is attracting people from all over the world to its beautiful confines. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aecc9bbf-2efc-466e-9dd9-bb864877f9a9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56903072,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56903072','Simone','Portland, OR','Hello- \nWe will be staying at your property while in town for our cousins wedding... looking forward to the trip!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2336fd99-006f-4e3a-80ec-6efe12f23260.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2820851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2820851','NW Portland Hostel','Portland, OR','Located in Portland’s vibrant Northwest District, our family-owned hostel offers a prime location with easy access to downtown, Washington Park, the Rose and Japanese Gardens, and nearby hiking trails. Enjoy our daily free events, such as walking tours, tap tastings, live music, and trivia nights. For over 25 years, we\'ve provided a welcoming, affordable, and safe space for travelers from around the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/6eabebc6-42c1-47c0-b0cd-3e2cd890171b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95484731,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95484731','Ben','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e9b46e7c-0611-48af-8ac8-0f607e397fea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59002572,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59002572','Anne','Portland, OR','I am a world traveler, artist, poet, mother, grandmother.....and BnB host. I believe that travel helps to build world peace through mutual respect and communication across cultural divides. \r\nI once had an import business and took my two kids with me on purchasing trips so they could see the world. \r\nI have a passion for riding my bike around the city and sampling the many healthy restaurants. \r\nMy favorite quote is \"All I know, I know because I love.\"',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6d23b0cd-a853-467b-9fed-f079936e6954.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50536855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50536855','Michelle','Canby, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e89ebb5a-af97-45e5-9694-a7e52d014801.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(218151,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/218151','Clifton','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/792cee5f-8943-4f49-9cea-3b6a2d8216f4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(237041,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/237041','Kimberly Meade','Portland, OR','I love to travel and see new places! \nBorn and raised in Northern California - \nI have raised my family in Portland and it’s magical here.. the mountains and proximity to the coast are terrific.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/83998353-4809-4d8e-bf61-a4305f9f13cf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62035184,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62035184','Beth','Portland, OR','Wife, mom, friend, cook, hostess, I love being outdoors for gardening, hiking, rafting or reading.  I really enjoy spending time my friends, family and our dog.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-62035184/original/f94f766c-b2ea-4f0a-8c50-0546ab06b16a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17575711,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17575711','Saskia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/59ed6901-9303-4478-8088-b3b68c697376.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42092967,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42092967','Valerie','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7885dd62-6ace-411c-969c-81be045c5c35.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48430655,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48430655','Kelly','Portland, OR','I\'ll be in and out of the country for the next year and would love to have some wonderful people enjoy my space while I am away. Marketing director of a law firm by day, world traveler by.... accrued vacation time. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/df553081-628a-4509-a44b-a7a97211474f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2207146,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2207146','Suzie','Portland, OR','I grew up in the beautiful Pacific Northwest on 10 acres of farmland.  My family hosted a number of exchange students during my childhood which I loved.  At age 12, I moved to Japan for two years and got to experience that myself.  I came back to the States, and after graduating from college, returned to Japan to teach English to elementary and junior high school kids.  Living abroad and traveling has cultivated a great passion for making connections with people from all walks of life.\r\n\r\nHaving been a guest and received so warmly by so many myself, I want to reciprocate that as I open up my North Portland home to fellow Airbnber’s.  As a proud native, I am thrilled to share my love for this amazing city of Portland.  Not only is Bridge City beautiful, but if you’re into food like me, there are endless opportunities for culinary adventures.  I happen to think Portland is the perfect blend of eclectic neighborhoods throughout the city, with the rugged beauty of the Oregon Coast, mountains, and wine country just a short drive away.\r\n\r\n 私は太平洋北西部の広大な美しい農地で育ちました。私の家族は私の子供時代に多くの留学生を受け入れ、私はそれをとても気に入っていました。12歳のころ、経験を得るために2年間日本で暮らしました。そしてアメリカに戻り大学を卒業したあと、再び日本に戻り小学生と中学生に英語を教えました。海外で生活したり、旅行したりすることは、人生の中で出会う人々とのつながりを作るための大きな情熱を育むことになりました。\r\n\r\n    私自身、Airbnbのゲストになり他の家族に暖かく迎えてもらいました。そのため私も彼らへの恩返しがしたく、我が家にに迎えたいと思います。ポートランドを愛する一人として、ポートランドの素晴らしさを皆さんと共有できることを楽しみにしています。ブリッジシティと呼ばれるポートランドは美しさだけでなく、もし食べることが好きだったら、美味しいものに囲まれているので、食べ物の冒険が尽きることはないでしょう。ポートランドはオレゴン海岸やワインで有名で、車で少し行くとすぐに自然と触れ合える街です。\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c09ee00-11c2-4042-a8cb-371ac0f72ff6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(97118810,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/97118810','Defne','İstanbul, Turkey','Hello, \nI am an author from Istanbul, Turkey. I write novels, short stories and some non-fiction texts. I live part time in Portland and other times I reside in my hometown, Istanbul. When I travel I would love to have guests at my place. I made a beautiful home that I truly love and I hope you enjoy it too! I teach Shadow Yoga classes in Portland and in Istanbul. I love novels, bicycles, traveling to unknown parts of the world and learning languages. See you soon! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4a310071-c24e-4180-a851-d877a4940ee5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(97295503,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/97295503','Stephanie','Portland, OR','We are a small family who loves travel, culture, and nice food.  We like to treat others the way we like to be treated: with tolerance, respect, generosity and above all a great welcome! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f768f0d-4d2f-4035-a073-819cd3c040ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24370022,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24370022','Stacy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/24370022/profile_pic/1417463079/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43635238,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43635238','Sherree','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eee8f56d-c013-445e-a967-a7996205703d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(71038689,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/71038689','Julieann','Portland, OR','I have lived in New York City, San Francisco and Seattle, but Portland is may favorite home of all.  As a mom in a blended family, I love the proximity to mountains, oceans and rivers for hiking, skiing, local culture, and roaming around.  I am an avid fitness buff with running and yoga being my foundation. I can\'t wait to try kite boarding and I would love to get back into cyclocross.\r\nMy motto is: \"Life is not a spectator sport.\"',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e04b1671-170a-4692-a92f-cead0925eeb9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54436471,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54436471','J Brooke','Portland, OR','I\'m a naturopathic doctor living in Portland, Oregon. I love the outdoors, travel, backpacking, rock climbing, meditation and yoga. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/237654e4-909c-4685-aaf3-f8aa01d67ba1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78494301,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78494301','Pamela','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a165892e-45ec-4382-84dd-1ab85f5101a2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13580938,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13580938','Bradford','Portland, OR','I came to Portland over 6 years ago. I enjo the outdoors and the beautiful Oregon landscapes. I play disc golf , soccer , love camping and being outside. I\'m a musician as well and perform in Oregon and Washington. \r\nMy family has relocated with me. We are now sharing our beautiful home with the air Bnb community. We would like you to be comfortable in our home. We are in southeast Portland centrally located to public transit , parks , trails , food pods , bakeries , breweries. We are within 10 minutes of downtown, come explore the best Portland has to offer while making yourself comfortable within our private suite. You have your own bedroom , bathroom, living room and kitchen with fridge , toaster , electric stove and wok, coffee, sink and laundry facilities. We have a private entrance and a backyard oasis with gardens and fire pit. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/29958328-ddab-44f3-8fcb-d3c49f6d345d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4649264,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4649264','David','Portland, OR','I\'m an easy-going guy, grew up in the Midwest but Portland has been home for about 17 years (2 stints). I take pleasure in the simple things in life: nature/camping, seeing/playing music, sports, good stories (in any medium), and being with my family and friends. Love to travel, especially off the beaten path. I\'ve also lived in Argentina, Chicago, and Jackson, WY. Favorite travel book: Travels With Charley, by John Steinbeck.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/73f98043-b61a-423d-a797-a544d2db97a8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1610080,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1610080','Sean','Portland, OR','Civil Engineer, semi-retired, long term traveler. Have worked professionally or volunteered in four countries overseas for 8 years and traveled to another 40.\r\n\r\nI own a home in Portland, Oregon which I also lease out via AirBnB.\r\n \r\nI don\'t smoke and am low key when indoors, spending my time reading and on the internet.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0f3c4a8f-219d-47b2-b12a-aaf31836a7c4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(98202133,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/98202133','Toney','Portland, OR','Hello.  I am Toney, owner of this property. I moved here from Michigan 13 years ago. I enjoy art, music, people and creatures-(from all walks of life) in addition to bringing this old building back to life.  I\'ve created an Airbnb space that is eclectic, interesting, and has an inviting, homey feel.  It makes me happy to hear that my guests are comfortable and enjoyed their stay in Portland. I hope you enjoy it if you stay here.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-98202133/original/c083ef43-e09d-4bd9-b20f-1e6993ae99a0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(98845081,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/98845081','Jill','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/857fabc4-da35-4ee1-a485-636ed3bf5002.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(99163732,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/99163732','Randal','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8615b8e5-e165-4b80-8bb5-0e0267fc7d89.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25596073,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25596073','Emily','Portland, OR','5 things I can\'t live without:\r\nMy family\r\nMy friends\r\nFabulous food (at home or restaurants)\r\nCocktail hour(s)\r\nThe Oregon Coast\r\n\r\nLife is GOOD!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ac9eddd9-fd32-4911-a1d5-211220d088ef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32619683,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32619683','Julie','Portland, OR','Hello fellow travelers!  \r\n\r\nMy husband and I travel extensively but spend a lot of time in Portland Oregon with our family. When we\'re not in Portland we welcome you to share our home and treat it as if it were your very own. \r\n\r\nIt\'s a special light-filled happy place. Walking distance to charming coffee shops, a great bakery, restaurants, and stores. A short drive or Max ride takes you into downtown. A public golf course is minutes away. Easy access to all over Portland makes our location ideal. \r\n\r\nWe have traveled around the world and have learned a lot about what makes for a great rental experience; quality beds, pillows and linens/comfortable places to sit/nice dining area/throw blankets/good shower water pressure/well equipped kitchen. You will find all of these things in our home. \r\n\r\nWe love so much about Portland and hope you will enjoy your time here!\r\n\r\nKeep exploring the world,  \r\nJulie and Bob',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9491fa78-d0fc-483d-89af-efabaa7d0a73.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5202775,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5202775','Lindsay','Portland, OR','Love to travel, spend time with family and explore new places. I love Portland and think you will too! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a15d5fa-98df-4ece-8107-161468fe96df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9423242,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9423242','Adam','Portland, OR','I currently live in Portland, Oregon working as a Realtor, in interior design and teaching hot yoga, while also performing as an actor throughout the Portland area. Previously I lived for 15 years in NYC, where I owned a Bikram Yoga studio and volunteered for The Trevor Project as a suicide prevention counselor.  I am loving the west coast, the amazing food, and the gorgeous nature!\n\nMy home is also occupied by my adorable Dachshunds.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3db2dad6-895a-46c5-92d7-b21ef53dd715.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(91753188,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/91753188','Brandon','Portland, OR','I have lived here in Portland since I was four years old, attending Alameda grade school, Benson high school, and graduating from the University of Oregon.  My wife and I first experienced Airbnb overseas and it was great fun. I\'m excited to embark on this journey as a host and making your stay as comfortable as possible!  Our place is a completely renovated as of October 2016 both inside and out, 1920\'s Craftsman!  Brand new full kitchen with full-sized stainless steel appliances, quartz countertops, brand new hardwood floors, subway-tiled shower, washer and dryer, Netflix, WiFi, and more!  Welcome to Portland!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4d0be4b7-aae0-4909-ad9c-17cd620b9844.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39865353,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39865353','Lee','Portland, OR','Hi! I \'m Lee, a retired Respiratory Therapist. I recently moved back to the NW from San Diego to be near my sons and granddaughters! I love cooking and gardening and spending time with my family. I love to travel, and hope to do some in the near future! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/39865353/profile_pic/1438129014/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2576419,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2576419','Maura','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2576419/original/5ec41d09-7fff-4108-9cac-815516f47a99.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100441836,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100441836','Loren','Portland, OR','I am a single dad, artist,and teacher here in Portland.  I grew up in Pennsylvania, around the corner from Amish country.  I went to school in Philadelphia and London and am currently in graduate school.  I make music using rocks, paper, sand, leaves, obscure string instruments, drums, and electronics (but not when I have guests!).  I have performed my music in many countries  The ones that have stuck the most are Estonia, Cambodia and all places Mediterranean.  I know what it\'s like to be a guest and to make a connection with someone\'s home through its books, curios and ambience.  I\'m happy to let you have a private experience in the apartment attached to my home but I\'m just as happy to meet, have a conversation and point you out in the directions you are seeking here in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3de081f2-be79-46bb-9a60-35ffc60330c1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1495645,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1495645','Lucie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1495645/original/0daff08b-2fce-4599-b1d2-8646fde85558.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8260857,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8260857','Amber','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8260857/profile_pic/1376940800/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11423234,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11423234','Dana','Portland, OR','Award-winning daily journalist now making a transition to courteous Airbnb host in Portland, Oregon. I\'m a long-time home winemaker (we always pick our own grapes) and enjoy playing music as much as listening to it. I\'m an avid reader, usually opting for non-fiction. My wife, Peggy, and I have been happily married for 30 years and we have two daughters in college. My amazing mom, hard-charging at 87, also lives with us. We travel whenever possible, but usually, we only have enough time to see the myriad stunning sites around our home state. We are relaxed folks who love good humor and comfortable relationships with others. Our motto? \"Fit for Life.\" Whether that\'s running, walking or rolling up the miles on my road bike, it\'s the best prescription we\'ve yet found to enjoy each and every day.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff3d0d3d-dfef-4d44-b73f-437253370efd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(99762997,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/99762997','Jennifer','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f61b8931-59bb-4a27-a2be-72481725284c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21621478,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21621478','Karma','Portland, OR','Native Portlander! I love this city and continue to eat my way through the always-changing food scene here. I am a psychotherapist by trade, but as it turns out, designing and building small spaces has opened up another passion. I live in a smaller home next to the rental that I spent two years designing and building. Being on-site, so to speak, allows me to assist in any way I can to make sure your Portland adventures are amazing. Please ask me for anything. I pride myself in being kind, thoughtful and most likely one of the funniest people you\'ll meet. Looking forward to meeting you! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/20c8df94-f000-41cf-a2bc-cb8640350818.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9467415,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9467415','Ashley','Portland, OR','I am an ASL/English Interpreter by trade, a self-taught DIY/builder, and an adventurer and lover of all things Nature, art, music, creativity. I have two canine companions who get me outdoors as often as they can! ;) Thank you for staying with us!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9467415/profile_pic/1382050997/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9292540,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9292540','Ana','Portland, OR','Professional woman with two grown daughters.  Love to travel, cook, exercise and be outdoors. I enjoy reading and movies.\r\n\r\nMy traveling style is pretty casual.  I am quiet and relaxed. \r\n\r\nI visit the LA area frequently to visit my daughters and also travel internationally quite abit. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9292540/profile_pic/1381240535/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8202650,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8202650','Siobhan','Portland, OR','Hello:  My husband and I live in lovely Portland, Oregon and we look forward to welcoming AirBnB guests to \"The Urban Owl,\" our deluxe private sanctuary located in the Hawthorne/Division \"Foodie Paradise.\"  We love to eat and cook and are excited to live blocks away from some of the most popular restaurants in the US.  We also enjoy hiking in the beautiful Columbia River Gorge, and closer to home in Portland at Forest Park.\n\nWe work hard and travel often for a refreshing change of scenery.   Some of our favorite travel places are Vancouver, Victoria, and Whistler in British Columbia.  We love the Riviera Maya area of Mexico, and Kauai, Hawaii for relaxing beach time.  So far Thailand, Bali, Ecuador, and Scotland have been the highlight of our adventures.  We enjoy eating and taking cooking classes whenever we can, often during our travels.\n\nCheers!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47b3e030-092f-4265-862a-37ec33f15276.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8825,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8825','Beth And Robert','Portland, OR','Hi!\nWe take Covid 19 very seriously. Our stellar cleanliness reviews prove that we have have always strived, achieved and maintained the highest in cleanliness standards. And to that end we clean surfaces with antibacterial cleaner.\nIn the bath, we have supplies to help stay as safe as possible: antibacterial wipes, gel, hand soap and spray. We have paper towels at the bath sink. \nAt the make-up vanity in the bath we have a bowl of one-use gloves to help stay as safe as possible. \nIn the kitchen we have anti bacterial dish soap.\nWe use an air purifier between each guest with all the windows wide open. We also spray with anti-bacterial Lysol in between each guest.\n\r\nThanks for checking out our profile :)\r\nWe live in awesome Portland with our gray cat Sheila. We love it here because there\'s so many diverse things to do. \r\n\r\nWe live near a cupcake bakery, coffee shop, a latino food pod, a park and rec center. \r\n\r\nCute Woodstock Village is nearby for everyday needs and restaurants.\r\n\r\nDivision Street has dozens of fun fantastic restaurants. Hawthorne Boulevard is great for shopping. \r\n\r\nThe Eastbank Esplanade is great for walking around the Willamette River. If it\'s summer, Saturday art market willbe there every weekend and in the spring the Rose Fesival with carnival rides, parades and fireworks. \r\n\r\nThe Chinese Garden and Portland Art Museum downtown are great for docent tours. Try the fun streetcar.\r\nThe Pearl near downtown is great for shopping. And so is NW 23rd. Nearby is the world class rose test garden, Japanese Garden, World Forestry Center, Hoyt Arboretum and Pittock Mansion. Omsi, a great childrens interactive museum, is near the Willamette river. Close by is the Oregon Rail Heritage Center and Tilikum Crossing pedestrian-only bridge that goes over the river. On the other side is the Aerial tram offering great veiws. \r\nMt. Hood and the ocean are each about an hour away. \r\nSee our photos and Guidebook for more info. :)\n\nHave a great stay in Portland! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be9317b7-d6db-40d2-86aa-8a91d140ac6c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(103138695,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/103138695','Heather','Portland, OR','I am a good witch. I am also a collector of oddities. Pine Manor has held a lot of magic for me throughout the years. I hope you feel its magic too. I look forward to your stories of the Portlandia experience . \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/594f078a-d427-44ce-a4df-50f9934e56b0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3158903,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3158903','Sara','Washington, United States','World wanderer, nature lover.  Trying to see as much of this beautiful world with a toddler in tow.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3158903/original/27bf1978-c62f-451b-9547-b50e69471139.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27370966,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27370966','Kellie','Portland, OR','Avid and fit travelers!  Easygoing, quiet, clean and friendly.....the  perfect guests and wonderful hosts.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/394e3c8d-3728-45cd-9da5-e82ad24999e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14968156,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14968156','Michael','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Michael, I work in High-tech industry, I love travel, sports and adventure. My favorite destination is a small Caribbean island, my sports are: Muay Thai, Skydiving, Scuba diving and flying aerobatic airplanes. Not long ago I discovered AirBnB for traveling and liked it so much I decided to become a host myself. I hope you\'ll love my house.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a1c9b696-b9d5-46f6-be9f-cde1122e4417.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3014197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3014197','Whitney','Portland, OR','Head in the clouds, feet in practical footwear. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3014197/profile_pic/1342943948/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2673359,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2673359','Nathan','Portland, OR','Portland\r\nMusic and outdoor activities',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8b500a89-08ed-4b18-9f28-721f8e07d264.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(672152,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/672152','Maura','Portland, OR','I\'m originally from California, but Oregon has been my home for 20 years. I love road trips, great design, cooking and eco living. I have a knack for finding delicious bakeries and cute, vintage purses. I take pride in creating a beautiful space for my guests and helping visitors make lifelong memories.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/769422e1-9b98-49d0-81cd-0f60094d2876.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52170945,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52170945','Carol','Portland, OR','I\'m a lively happy 70+ year old retired teacher who still loves to learn. I\'m originally from the Midwest but have lived in Oregon more than 30 years. I love the outdoors, gardening, children and books!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/607ba5af-d735-4ec3-a850-09f798d547ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(105257516,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/105257516','Kyra','Portland, OR','I have three children (mainly grown), a great husband and I work in development.  I  am known for building relationships, getting the job done and a garden enthusiast.   I enjoy a good book, great food and love to explore Portland.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a25b38e7-b88c-46e8-871e-11b24931cd03.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3901470,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3901470','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I love to hiking, cooking, and traveling!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/81b246be-8f19-4829-9a9f-44d28aa528cc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39660315,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39660315','Jenny','Portland, OR','My husband Cory & I are road trip enthusiasts and fly-by-the-seat-of-our-pants adventurers! You\'ll find us hiking & kayaking in the Columbia Gorge, SUP-ing in the Pacific, or getting cozy in the great indoors with a couple local beers. We are also doting parents to two four-legged fur babies, Loki & Thor. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/43696fff-642f-49ba-abe5-be6cdac03215.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57792832,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57792832','Joi','Portland, OR','I\'m a veterinarian by profession, but I love to travel.  I used to run spay/neuter campaigns in undeveloped countries (volunteer work)—that was fun travel!  It was great having unusual experiences when traveling.  Airbnb is great in that of offers an unusual travel experience as well.  Who wants to stay in another boring hotel!?\n\nI enjoy staying at Airbnb homes, and as a host I’m happy to share our beautiful river house to responsible mature business professionals.  When we have Airbnb guests we occupy only the downstairs half of the house. We wish to share our home with business professionals who are weary of hotels. The upstairs has its own full kitchen, 2 bedrooms for Airbnb guests, bathroom, laundry room and office desk with wifi, and work desk and even a humble computer.  We book 6 days minimum to avoid chaos.  If you are thinking to party on the river please pass us by.  We cater to business professionals who want to relax on the deck with a glass of wine after work.  Come relax in a gorgeous home and watch the majestic Columbia River pass by.  It\'s 10 minutes to the Portland Airport.  We always keep some pasta and red sauce in the cupboard so you don\'t have to go out to dinner.  We have a Keurig and creamers.  We keep oatmeal and Dave’s killer bread (the best bread ever) and butter for your breakfast ease.  Come home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bbafba52-112a-4a29-b258-61cbbf3b7c7b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2915808,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2915808','Stephen','Portland, OR','International education professional. Guesthouse owner/operator. Traveler. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2915808/profile_pic/1409702404/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6946676,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6946676','Scott','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in Portland for a long time and know the city and region well. I\'m an easy-going guy with some world travel under my belt. I\'m into natural and sustainable living, culture, and Oregon\'s countryside and wilderness. \n\nWhile giving you all the space you need, I am friendly and welcoming, and I am happy, if you ask, to recommend any local sights or experiences you may be in the mood for.\n\nIf you are vegetarian, vegan or just curious about or enjoy plant-based cuisine, I have been vegan for longer than I can count and am tuned into the plethora of vegan/plant based shops, restaurants, bars and activities in town and can give you some ideas of where to grab that kind of grub to your heart\'s delight.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4d2f6382-4c74-4446-9ae8-4e7a2442343d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7323422,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7323422','Bryan','Portland, OR','I enjoy renovating older homes to making unique spaces. I love art and sculpture and try to bring original art into all of my spaces, Indoor and out.\nI moved back to the Northwest 18 years ago and discovered the intrinsic value of St. John’s. I love walking to Cathedral park and the St. John’s Village. Great location!\r\nI hope you enjoy my place!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1355d9c2-a721-4005-ae8c-802799c4e435.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60426753,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60426753','E Malcolm','Vancouver, WA','I own the house I grew up in and I\'m doing my best to restore it to the grandeur of the 1950s. It has been an adventure. Sharing this space with people and making some income is the best of both worlds. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1ece9872-a347-4b70-ab18-b5e5af43fdc8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7698196,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7698196','Maggie & Peter','Portland, OR','From LA & NYC, but finally \"at home\" in Portland, OR.  Maggie: My brand in 140 characters or less is:  \"badass adjacent. some days I crush it. most days i\'m just human.\" Peter: just walking the walk. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fcb21559-cce4-4bcc-8099-3c95a5414adc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1166453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1166453','Blaine','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, OR and absolutely love it here! I work in the Financial Services industry for a local credit union. I also run a food blog here in town, which is a ton of fun! \n\nI have been fortunate to travel to many countries. I love being an Airbnb host because I get to share my city with so many guests. \n\nMy favorite things to do are travel, bake in my brick oven, cycle, play soccer, spend time with my friends and family, and work on my house. \n\nI am a long time Portlander, who has lived here since 2001. I know a lot about the city and look forward to sharing information with future guests.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f977000-879e-4d8d-ae47-3630580f6ffe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34947896,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34947896','Karine','Portland, OR','I’m a transplant from France, who has been living in Portland for the last 25 years. I love to travel and I’m very outdoorsy. My weekends are usually spent out in nature.  For me, life is about gathering experiences, not things. \n\nBonjour! Je suis française et je vis à Portland aux États-Unis depuis plus de 25 ans. Je suis une amoureuse de la nature et j’adore voyager, découvrir de nouveaux paysages et rencontrer des gens de cultures différentes. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b516bf3c-befc-49cc-a248-bcae9cd7be37.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6628318,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6628318','Marianne','Portland, OR','We are a family of three always looking for the next adventure. Rich is a carpenter by trade and Marianne is a landscape architect. When not working, we can be found cooking, gardening,  exploring Portland and adventuring through the Pacific Northwest. \r\n\r\nWe enjoy our city and the surrounding area, so if you need any recommendations for places to see and things to do while visiting, don\'t hesitate to ask!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af3bc00c-b254-44ad-a988-8423cf32093e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4955204,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4955204','Erin','Seattle, WA','Originally from Arizona and lived a few places in the US.  Like shopping and movies and my cat.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4955204/profile_pic/1361598920/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(107557224,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/107557224','Robert','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ecbd72eb-cdbb-4d9f-bf92-0077709fa1a1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(108190308,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/108190308','Amy','Portland, OR','I am a Portland Native! I enjoy road trips via small towns, exploring small antique shops and bookstores. I love my garden, which you will see in full bloom during the summer. \nI adore my pets and  built a Catio so my cat may have outdoor time. I adopted my two dogs from a local rescue group. \nI very much enjoy hosting guests from all walks of life and all locations.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d2ba809b-7b19-4b71-866a-d6d921950122.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(108570373,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/108570373','James','Portland, OR','Being a native Oregonian ( My family came out here in covered wagons in 1856 )) I have had the pleasure of camping, fishing and hiking throughout the Pacific Northwest my entire life.\r\nIt\'s great to be able to give visitors information on where to go and what to do throughout the region.\r\nThe city is changing rapidly and there are many things to do and places to go.\r\nBeing a Custom Cabinetmaker for decades I spent 14 months building out the apartment into a space I would likely live myself at some point in time.\r\nWould look forward to your visit.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f23f3d62-9187-4721-8d85-7a9cb8c277b2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109032237,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109032237','Shannon','Portland, OR','We are hard working grandparents who have been living in Portland for over 40 years!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bbdad2bd-d123-4078-91df-71ca0681f182.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109143261,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109143261','Sun','Portland, OR','I am an easy going person, fantastic to deal with.  I have been in Portland for about 40 years now and love it here.  Would love to have any visitor visit PDX and our beautiful and comfortable home.\nIf you are a foody or like good food, Portland is the place to be.\nIf you love to go to the theater, you would love Portland.\nIf you like to hike and bike you would love Portland.\nIf you like books and like to read we have the world famous POWELLS\'S  BOOK store.\nIf you like to see the boats sail by while you are having your morning coffee or a glass of wine in the evening or having your meals you would love our 2 decks.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ec4cbf7-c12b-45f1-8cba-66a03dbdcfa3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50541937,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50541937','Zoe','Portland, OR','Native Oregonian. \nRaised in the Siskiyou mountain range. Loves the Cascade and Olympic ranges too. I have owned and lived at the property for 22 yrs. \nLoves books, gardening, cooking, backpacking, cycling, yoga, hiking, skiing, outsider art, history, etc.\nHumanist household and all people are equal here.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-50541937/original/75eb0c41-649f-4939-9caf-7c7d9c265294.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16693663,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16693663','Will','Anaheim, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/35df5e4e-c9c2-4099-8bd2-09d9ae0aa185.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3794426,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3794426','Cass And Renée','Portland, OR','We have been making our home in The Pacific Northwest for the last 15 years. \n\nWe love biking, wine drinking and adventuring together all over the world!\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bbdd954f-7b97-44ff-b047-ab3487ac8242.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28000582,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28000582','Gail And Molly','Portland, OR','Hi! We\'re Gail and Molly and we\'ve been sharing our lives, home, and hearts for 25 years. We love to travel and have been all over the world: Mexico, Canada, Australia, Hong Kong, Greece, Spain, France....and we\'ve got lots more we\'d love to see in the years to come. We love to cook, enjoy dinners with friends, and play games. And we never say no to an opportunity to get out into the woods and camp. We enjoy meeting people from all over the world and believe respect and communication are the foundation of being both a good guest and a good host.\r\n\r\nWe live in the downstairs apartment below our guest rental and if you stay with us, we hope to have a chance to say hello. But we also understand if you prefer your privacy and will respect whatever boundaries our guests want to set. When staying with us, please let us know what you need to make your stay in Portland special and comfortable. We\'ll do our best to help! \r\n\r\nOh, and our beloved co-host and tail-wagging greeter is Alva, an adorable white Labrador Retriever. She will always be overjoyed to say hello to you. Please let us know if you prefer to avoid doggie greetings during your stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a1ab158d-f31e-4a57-84e2-0cb8b684b572.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111643390,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111643390','Vanessa','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e583b29c-654f-457e-a64e-b679f1709c9f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53588039,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53588039','Matthew','Portland, OR','Angela and I are excited about becoming Airbnb hosts. We have stayed at other Airbnbs many times and have enjoyed the experience. After two of our children have left for college, we found ourselves with extra room. Angela and I are both educators, I teach 7th grade science and she is a district office administrator and former principal. We are active people, both socially and physically. We love Portland, we hope that you will too.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/018b3be2-27d5-47b8-adc1-a72774842948.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49356222,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49356222','Paul And Kelley','Portland, OR','A passion for running, fishing, archery, biking, gardening, bee keeping, hiking, and camping rain or shine. I grew up in Minneapolis, MN and moved to Portland, Oregon ten years ago. The power of the huge trees, mountain air, vast beaches, and pulsing rivers was too much to resist. I love it here. My wife and two kids bring constant joy and laughter to where ever they happen to be. I just try and stay close. \r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you into our little corner of this world and are happy to help ensure your stay in Portland is everything you\'re after. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1481e0c6-2332-4739-b191-079e4d28282a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(246080531,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/246080531','Val','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eac3bf46-fa91-48ce-b726-029626f2d5b8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(113557299,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/113557299','Jeff','Portland, OR','Fun and punchy',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67c01223-d028-45a1-b408-55f49f3c4df6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7281995,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7281995','Mary','Portland, OR','I am a semi-retired perinatal nurse that has lived in Portland for years raising kids and building community.  We love where we live, and have recently been working on creating our \"family compound” in our hip inner SE Portland neighborhood which has been home for 3 decades.  We have family and community closely knit into our lives. We welcome diversity. We welcome you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b378ff43-d63d-4460-80be-ba6d223c3946.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6789678,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6789678','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/733bf0b1-ad42-4684-8c35-614380e5c097.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7635902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7635902','Zachary','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is Zac, and I love creating relaxing, enjoyable experiences.  I\'ve worked hard to renovate my home and design a great Air B&B experience. I look forward to meeting you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6aa1eb1a-ca53-4d17-941b-e7d04fddfcd5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(170065,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/170065','Hope','Portland, OR','Hope is an Architect, & Sebastien works for a wine importer. We love music, travel, & trying (and cooking) new foods.  We are spontaneous & enjoy meeting new people, although we also like time to ourselves to cook & sew & create new things.\nOur favorite trip was walking the Camino de Santiago. We completed the 500 mile journey on foot in 30 days! We also love to explore our home turf in the NW, like the Oregon Coast and camping on Whidbey Island.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5793e9ab-4372-4cf2-a8ec-92a0567c956d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14088213,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14088213','Erik','Portland, OR','I am a professional artist and entrepreneur and have lived in Portland since 2005.  I inlay stones into burl woods and make sculptures and wood jewelry.  During the Summer I travel the west coast doing regional art shows and also sell my work at the Portland Saturday Market most weekends March - Christmas Eve.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/14088213/profile_pic/1438179167/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8584999,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8584999','Timothy','Portland, OR','We live in Portland, OR, with a family of four young kids who keep us pretty busy. We work in healthcare and enjoy an active life. We also host on airbnb so appreciate what it means to be good guests!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8584999/profile_pic/1432242634/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(79068987,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/79068987','Diane','Portland, OR','   My husband and I are very outgoing, we love adventures, work hard and take great pride in our yard, garden, and our family owned business.\r\n   We are very outdoor oriented, we camp, fish, garden and hunt. We raise our own chickens for meat and fresh eggs. \r\n   We like to travel to Hawaii and Mexico.\r\n   My husband loves his barbecue and spends as much time as he can perfecting his smoked meat. Myself I\'m always after that perfect cup of coffee or that fine glass of wine.  I also love to bake.\r\n   We look forward to hosting you in our home.  We have spent allot of time remodeling our apartment to make it comfortable and charming with your own private yard.  We look forward to meeting you.\r\n   I grew up on the Oregon coast,  my husband was born and raised in the Portland area.  We take great pride in our home and surroundings.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/058fddb2-d158-46ed-ad39-57cfe69e3900.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10354978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10354978','Alice','Portland, OR','I live in Portland OR, and work for a non-profit organization.  I enjoy travel, and love meeting people who have had different experiences than I have and sharing stories.   ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-10354978/original/08450e17-0422-4977-aedd-42ffc2af3583.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115783024,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115783024','Wendi / Ramy','Portland, OR','Hi! We are Wendi and Ramy. We resettled in  Portland, Oregon after living in Central Asia and Washington, D.C. for several years. We love hosting guests in our Airbnb! Wendi is originally from Oregon - a runner, hiker, yogi, and gardener. Ramy is a Quebecois - a big Habs fan, photographer, guitarist, martial artist, and jack-of-all-trades. We live with Ollie, our adorable and quirky pitbull mix.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c11b6051-1971-44b8-85c9-3236b35c8ea3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11236598,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11236598','Catherine','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b02cbea3-13b9-48e7-b66b-8c7a3cdda509.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6628849,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6628849','Inger','Portland, OR','I live in Oregon and I like to ski, hike and kayak.  I also like to travel internationally.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6628849/profile_pic/1369805816/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42694776,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42694776','Kim','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fff53c51-b73a-4bac-9124-127ede6b2d4e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8335229,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8335229','Poppy','Nashville, TN','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/afc7aeff-1727-4444-8525-413a3682be14.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(940836,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/940836','Tiffany','Portland, OR','As mentioned in my message. I’m a Portlander looking for respite from the rain:',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/940836/profile_pic/1426804123/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36014626,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36014626','Diego','Portland, OR','We are an easy going and friendly family that enjoy sharing our townhouse with friends, family, and Airbnb guests.  Maritza is a high school counselor and Diego works for a tech company.  In our free time (when not chasing around our 9 and 1 yr. old) we enjoy heading out to parks, trying new restaurants, and catching a Blazers or Timbers game.  \n\nIf this is your first time visiting the Rose City and need some suggestions on things to do or places to eat, we\'d love to share some of our favorites!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7d237fdb-21af-4f2a-935d-4dad333c607f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6514453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6514453','Annalisa','Portland, OR','We are a young family with some space to spare!\r\n\r\nOur household is quite busy these days (Read- you may not see much of us) with two young children and two dogs.  When we\'re not working, we try to get outside to show our kiddos (all four of them)  the splendor of life in Oregon!  We enjoy hiking, biking, and just generally walking around and stopping to play in parks (many near our house).  \r\n\r\nIn our life before kids- Brandon and I traveled around the globe on the cheap.  So while we are on hiatus from far off travels, we would love to host people from far off lands, and live a little vicariously.  We know we\'ll be back to it before long and would like to grab some hosting Karma while we can!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6514453/profile_pic/1373849470/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14008197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14008197','Antony & Fotoula','Portland, OR','Ciao! Fotoula and I are traveling foodies! Fotoula was born in Canada and raised between Vancouver B.C. and Greece, I was born in the UK and raised between Vancouver B.C and Barbados and now we live between Florence Italy & Portland doing volunteer work with refugees. With backgrounds like that how could we not love people, traveling, food and history! \n\nAfter staying in Airbnb\'s all over the world we think we have a pretty good idea what makes for a great stay so we decided to build (literally!) our own spaces and share with you what we love about Portland. Come be our guest and let us share the best this cool city has to offer!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5290ca5d-fcdb-43a4-a714-ac35a0b1c24e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23043981,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23043981','Carole','Portland, OR','We are Carole & Oz, married 32 years. We moved to Portland in 1993 & fell in love with City the Pacific Northwest. We\'ve traveled extensively in the US & abroad & know what it\'s like to have lovely as well as not very nice accommodations, so we want to provide a wonderful place for people to stay when they come here. \n\nWe look forward to meeting you & helping to make your stay here in the Pacific Northwest all you hope for it to be and more!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7908773e-69d5-4f78-b0e5-d419995b56ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1778883,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1778883','Jon','Portland, OR','I am a fun, easy-going guy who loves to travel to new places, spend time outdoors and stay physically and mentally healthy. I try to travel as much as possible and would really enjoy living seasonally at some point in my life. I am a field service engineer for a global manufacturer of photo-lithography systems for the semiconductor industry (if this leaves your head spinning don\'t feel bad, I hardly even know what that description entails!). My job allows me to travel frequently, both for work and pleasure, leading me to new experiences in places I never dreamed of visiting only a few years ago. I am an avid snowboarder and powder junkie during the winter months, while during the warmer seasons I mountain bike and cycle recreationaly. I typically travel light and prefer to explore any new environment either on foot or by bike with minimal planning. I enjoy visiting both cities as well as more remote destinations - and I truly believe the best way to experience any location is not necessarily to hit all the tourist spots, but rather take suggestions from area residents and do as they may on any normal day.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4a94898e-b040-4b39-adf1-4a2a6f61eadb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(118408050,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/118408050','Dan','Portland, OR','I\'m from Oregon, and have lived in Portland most of my life.\n\nI have had a variety of jobs and careers.  I\'ve worked in advertising sales, retail, ski instructor, yoyo salesman, analyst, software engineer, Airbnb host, and amateur actor.\n\nI have degrees in Advertising, Management, and Software Engineering, with a Math minor, but I\'ve left those worlds behind.\n\nI\'m currently in a 2-year acting conservatory program to become a stage actor.  FUN!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a40d8d59-3faf-4a81-8db9-4425088ecc00.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(444759,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/444759','Robert','Portland, OR','Robert and Rhonda are long term Portland residents and homeowners. Now retired, our life work has been in midwifery, education, and social services. We have grown children and grandchildren both here and in central Oregon and love to travel to see them as well as to Mexico, Asia, Europe, ... well almost anywhere. Things we love (in addition to travel): being w each other, our kids and grandchildren, the sun, music, art, movies, coffee (we maybe should list that ahead of the kids), going out to dinner, our friends, neighbors and the block, long walks, and like Tony Roma\'s, a whole lot more... This AirBnb listing is our home and residence which we open up to guests during times we are away. As a lived-in home it has its nicks and chips, and but will very clean and welcoming.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6864776c-3778-44a3-a579-f0837ea35d8c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5666531,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5666531','Marie','San Francisco, CA','I am originally from San Francisco, CA, and moved up to Portland on a whim for a job. I was supposed to stay for only 3 months, and then relocate back to SF....but I just loved Portland too much!!\r\n\r\nI love exploring, meeting new people, trying new foods, and all things furry on 4 legs. I\'ll never say no to a new adventure, and I\'ll always be happy to make a new friend!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/575af3fa-e58b-47f3-af62-2a840c6be4a2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(92031924,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/92031924','Theo','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0bda8f7c-88ac-4054-80a0-afecc4576e95.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(103713628,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/103713628','Eva','Portland, OR','I am a huge people person, always have been. I am also a life-long learner and a sponge for information. At a very young age, I realized photography and videography are a way of learning. Through these visual arts, I connect to my subjects, learn who they are, what they love, how they look at the world and then I  translate that learning into a story. \r\n\r\nIn my spare time, I love to go on long distance bike rides, and mushroom forays, and to travel to small corners of the world and take it all in.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-103713628/original/452ee7ae-af2a-4f47-b9ff-82bd8a4060ad.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17932869,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17932869','Adam','Portland, OR','I\'m a Portland native. Happy to host you and share this wonderful town!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17932869/profile_pic/1405026001/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10161853,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10161853','Villa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1e173b45-8353-4f56-9010-3c40dfb77d05.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22498676,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22498676','Aradia','Portland, OR','Hi Everyone! My name is Aradia. I\'m originally from Eugene but have lived in Portland for the past 10 years.  I own a small massage spa, and I have been an Airbnb host for the past 6 years.\n\nI co-host with my partner Justin in our newly renovated 1906 home in the Alberta Arts district of NE Portland.  Together, Justin and I make a great team. He grew up in Virginia, works from home as a data analyst, and coaches high school Rugby.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aa89e05d-37d9-493a-9b30-892440718182.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121088523,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121088523','Ry','Portland, OR','I am father, a world traveler, and an Air BNB superhost.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3093253f-5776-4bfc-ac04-9d6f55e62482.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8793178,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8793178','Zachary','Portland, OR','I\'m Zach. I\'ve lived in Portland since 2007. I\'m from Maryland originally. I\'ve lived for a few years in Savannah GA and Albuquerque NM.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8793178/original/a0885dce-b77c-40df-815d-f0aeeaf0cb01.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(495089,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/495089','Erika','Portland, OR','We are design enthusiasts who are native Oregonians. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b1b7b21-0e24-4678-9d04-b08629ec909f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121884165,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121884165','Villa','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dfc1a70f-f0c4-44c4-a334-390a61ac12d5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1239203,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1239203','Shana','Portland, OR','I live with my family in Portland,OR.\nSelf employed, working in the Arts.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1239203/original/821a5f6f-38ac-4045-919f-f063cd767f2e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15081218,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15081218','Linda','Portland, OR','I am a world traveler and a real estate broker.  My other favorite things are scuba diving, international travel, cooking spicy food, gardening & enjoying the outdoors with my friends and dog Whiskey.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-15081218/original/ca436bb4-f92c-43a3-ab50-64d3aaccd896.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12591253,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12591253','Abby','Portland, OR','I moved to Oregon from Michigan. I have found home here with the ocean, the mountains and the city...a perfect trio! I live with my fun-loving, adventurous husband who also moved here from the midwest. We love doing just about anything outdoors from mountain biking to hiking and camping...we live a pretty active lifestyle. If we\'re not outside playing, then we\'re probably checking out one of the unique events Portland has to offer from Blind Tasting Bingo to a pop-up dinner. \r\n\r\nI love Portland so much that I should probably work for Travel Portland, so my husband says ;) We enjoy having visitors and sharing all of the wonderful places to experience while here. When traveling, we also enjoy seeking out these experiences, as well as meeting new people to enjoy them with.\r\n\r\nWe\'ve been very fortunate to have traveled around the world, and we\'re always thinking about where to go next. We love traveling with Airbnb as guests and love hosting in this amazing wonderland of Oregon! \r\n\r\nLastly, Airbnb asks for 5 things I can\'t live without. Here goes: my husband, friends & family, passport, spontaneity, food carts, trees, kettle korn, adventure, gut wrenching laughter, national parks, creativity, the outdoors, dark chocolate, weekend getaways, any kind of game, surprises...Yup, that was more than five.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12591253/profile_pic/1393398826/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9180789,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9180789','Helen And Ethan','Portland, OR','Portland has been our home for the last 18 years.  We are both educators.   We love to travel, read, backpack, play soccer (football) and cook.  We have used AirBnB throughout Spain, Portugal, Ireland, Budapest, France and the U.S. and have had great experiences.  We have been hosting for several years now and it’s been wonderful.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a0a04c9a-e6e9-4bb8-a9fb-6dbacceabf85.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(92867046,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/92867046','Patrick','Portland, OR','I\'m a detail-oriented, super clean, stylish, intelligent, and excellent communicator ready to help guests explore Portland in the finest AirBnB spaces. My experience as a host has been fantastic and very satisfying for all guests. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a3a9369e-754e-4ecf-b627-c56918bfb7e0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12223228,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12223228','Aysu','Portland, OR','I moved to Portland in 2010 and lived in several cool neighborhoods before I moved to here, where redwood house is, and fell in love with it.   \nOur neighborhood has many wonderful restaurants, bars, cafes and unique shops and boutiques.  We are walking distance from Hawthorne Blvd which is another cool area to explore.   Beautiful Mount Tabor is a 5-minute drive away - I\'m there every day with my dog!  \r\n\r\nEvery aspect of this neighborhood inspires me to live Portland life to the fullest. Now I am opening my house for my potential guests to live it too. I am sure you will have priceless memories here.\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3daf3b4f-42e9-4ca0-b3d3-aa3e0f2eebf9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(123760860,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/123760860','Karen','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ced4924-2538-40ce-9189-21b552143428.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28583708,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28583708','Patty','Portland, OR','I\'m the loving mother of 4 adult children and a school nurse. As a 4th generation Asian American, I\'m proud to call Portland my home. Our family has deep ties to the city and I can\'t wait to share some of my favorites with visitors!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/28583708/profile_pic/1425254589/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1096266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1096266','TaMAra','Portland, OR','I was born in Canada but I grew up in Portland, OR.  Traveling is my number one passion.  You learn more about other cultures by immersing yourself in them than you can ever learn from reading a text book!  I have stayed in Airbnb places around the world and I am also a host.  I worked hard to create a space that other travelers would love to stay in.  I hope to have the opportunity to host and meet people from all walks of life!\r\n\r\nI am a kombucha brewing, worm wrangling, mason bee \"keeping\" organic gardener.  In my business life, I sell real estate and have been in the industry since 1995.  I love working with people to get their homes sold and find their dream home!  In my spare time I enjoy hiking, wine, great food with friends and growing organic vegetables in my beautiful garden.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d8771fa0-bace-4f6d-a5ab-e55d8b54eab7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2021272,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2021272','Erik','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a2ede977-87d1-4f04-b190-d6381ef54f98.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17527121,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17527121','Jesse','Portland, OR','just coming over from Portland for a few days of relaxation.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bc8bef2f-0b54-47dd-b654-fe61b9f469cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32635358,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32635358','Ellen & Mark','Portland, OR','We love our neighborhood and community of friends.  Mark is a retired urban ecologist, and we are both gardeners.\n \nWe enjoy taking unhurried road trips to visit family and friends throughout the PNW and California. When we book an AirBnb, we look for a comfortable bed, a kitchenette, and a walking neighborhood.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d421259f-6d85-4df0-9f7f-9b7e25ba4fea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(491984,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/491984','Amy','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland, but I\'ve lived a bunch of places, including Brooklyn for 10 years. My NJ-transplant husband is an architect & he built the apartment. I\'m working as a copywriter now, but I\'ve done locations in the past for shows like Portlandia & I\'m always happy to help you find fun places. We\'ve lived this 100 year-old house for over 25 years and we raised our daughter here -- she just headed off to LA after college.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/da6a3050-c89c-4633-bcc5-68993b9b7ddc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11875534,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11875534','Becca','Portland, OR','Anthony and I have lived in Portland for 7 years and love it! We love to travel, getting out in nature, and community living. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/74e21ff4-2151-49bd-9f71-e786e051bc24.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109509841,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109509841','Doug','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(1176871,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1176871','Linda','Portland, OR','I am a retired freelance writer living in lovely Portland, OR. I currently volunteer in the community, play golf and travel, although I always try to be close to home in summer.  \n\nYou\'ll find our city as inviting and friendly as I do. I  have lived in my home for more than 30 years and recently decided to share the downstairs suite with AirBnB guests.  My neighborhood is very walkable and close the mass transit and minutes from PDX.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/df8516ed-9e2d-4ea7-8b9b-8f38e102f87e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20395786,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20395786','Julia','Portland, OR','My husband Rich and I are grandparents with 8 grandchildren. Besides spending time with family we like to garden, bike and hike on the many urban trails in Portland and also on Mt Hood and the Gorge. We enjoy being hosts and meeting our guests when possible. Our co-host Sharrie is available on the rare occasions when we are not. We have lived in our house for over 10 years and created the apartment in 2017 when we did a whole house remodel. We hope you will feel free to ask us any questions that might arise about activities, food, shopping or other points of interest in the area.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20395786/profile_pic/1432613376/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(126524556,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/126524556','Michael','Portland, OR','We don’t get to travel as much as we would like with our busy work schedules but when we do we like to explore as much of our Pacific Northwest as possible. We are airBNB hosts ourselves and as such we are respectful of our hosts. We are easy going and enjoy being out and about wherever we visit.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-126524556/original/343707d8-6401-42f7-9b78-28b8eac8ea31.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15063380,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15063380','Jessica','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/449cfa03-3c12-4d6c-8aa5-728aefd5d2f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63559052,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63559052','Dylan','Portland, OR','I am a professional in my 30\'s. Been living in NE Portland since 1991\'. Moved up from Santa Cruz, California. My family has a couple vacation rentals, we\'ve really enjoyed it. Now that I am a home owner, I wanted to open doors to others. Love meeting new people from all around the world!\r\nMy favorite hobbies include; Fishing, Hiking, Camping, Skiing, Soccer, Tennis, Traveling, Wine, Cooking for friends and family, traveling, and experiencing the wonderful culture the NW has to offer.\r\nI would love to help you plan a spectacular trip to Portland. I can offer many suggestions on where to go out to eat, things to see and do. Want you to have an amazing trip!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3fc4e64e-80ed-4e4e-a8d4-341e76764d7a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121923954,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121923954','Steve','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2d1a7a24-9667-4d70-a3e9-e57925af00fb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9931242,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9931242','Mindy','Portland, OR','Howdy! I\'m a Portland native who has lived all over the world. I love people and their stories more than anything in the world. Every two years I take off a few weeks to watch the Women\'s and Men\'s World Cup across the bars and coffee shops of Portland. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/94113fda-669c-4ac4-af2a-713d223a2e6b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127253367,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127253367','Scott','Portland, OR','We love living in Portland, Oregon. We have raised our family here.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1ceca64-18e9-4d06-bc36-1223bc99235f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17292270,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17292270','J\'Aime','Portland, OR','I am a world traveler (Americas, Asia, Europe), for both work and play. A life long gardener, animal lover, gourmand, writer, teacher and therapist.  I am also a Airbnb Superhost in Portland.  I make every effort to leave the faintest footprint when I stay anywhere.  My favorite quote: \"Kindness is my religion.\" (Dalai Lama)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-17292270/original/c9c4796a-5674-4b6c-bf0b-56956fd843e9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56983408,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56983408','Melanie','Portland, OR','I am a NZ native with a passion for creating and sharing beautiful spaces. \n\nMy love for old Portland means that I know a lot of out-of-the-way places- from private tea ceremonies and temple spaces, to bath houses and massage therapists. I am also tapped into some of the alternative events for those interested in Kirtan, sound healing and circus shows.\n\nIf you are interested in henna body art, you can easily make an appointment with me!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-56983408/original/b427da26-89d0-415b-8624-5ca1d596d3db.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127584615,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127584615','Carole','Portland, OR','I’m an artist, single Mom,  and an Environmental Activist. My past work involved my own photoretouching business of 19 years in San Francisco, a short time as an Ultrasonographer and an Oregon Real Estate broker. After much inner contemplation, I focused on serving the greater good via Social/Educational Justice work and then followed my heart to Environmental work. This work involved getting solar installed on Portland area roofs and then getting lots of trees planted…sometimes, sadly, mutually exclusive. The environment is my greatest concern, in tandem with my daughter.\nI’m well educated and have traveled the world in an adventurous fashion, such as trekking in the Himalayas. I’ve lived here 13 years and know the Portland area extremely well and can direct you to whatever is your interest. Mainly, this is for peacefulness, especially in the morning, but I am quite friendly and will say howdy every now and then, and if you are so inclined, we could have a nice chat. I have  2 indoor/outdoor cats, both sweet..1 is just a bit shy.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d08c698a-0273-4531-9a18-3ff44dd728b9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53953234,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53953234','Ryan','Portland, OR','Forests, mountains, craft beer, bike lanes, and smart land use planning drew me to Portland from my Michigan homeland after college. I\'m a natural resource ecologist and spend my days managing urban natural areas and green infrastructure. My wife, Anna, is a science teacher at the local middle school.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d3fd777e-43e4-4816-9116-2d51a5e658fc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127777784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127777784','Samantha','Portland, OR','I enjoy getting outside for a hike, and looking forward to exploring more nooks and crannies of this amazing city. I have visited many places around the globe and love to talk travel. :) I also enjoy long runs around town, puppy play dates at the park, and I am generally working on something crafty around the house.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5e9e23ed-46be-4aae-b2ea-80dbaeefe04d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77382200,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77382200','Jennifer','Portland, OR','Originally from NYC I’m a Fine Art Photographer and love talking about what to see and do in Portland! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5091a22b-0999-4a52-8d44-7ef3c24b697b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57187286,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57187286','Taariq','Portland, OR','I\'m a Graphic designer ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c86c3cd-a1be-4ed2-ba25-aa8a0d185c5e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48023979,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48023979','John And Mary Ann','Portland, OR','John and Mary Ann have lived in St. Johns for many years and are active in the community. We can tell you the best places to eat, hike, or otherwise enjoy the this great neighborhood.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef0f52b9-fcb5-4992-a141-8ca59c9a6722.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2322279,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2322279','Andy','Portland, OR','I\'m a photographer, specializing in shooting action sports. I attended college in Salt Lake City, which is also where I\'m originally from. I lived in San Francisco for 5 years before moving to Portland in 2007.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2322279/profile_pic/1336497317/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14513978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14513978','Erica','Portland, OR','I\'m an artist, designer, and creative consultant, originally from Ohio/Kentucky. I\'ve been living in beautiful Portland, OR since 2008. I love the vibrant culture of my city and also love to travel to visit other cultures and wild places. You can learn more about me on my website: (Website hidden by Airbnb)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a999ec2e-9f61-4f45-9fc7-c5922cc83c44.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(128887124,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/128887124','Kate','Portland, OR','Easy going and independent, enjoy a good laugh. Love to garden, read, eat, be in nature, like meeting new people, movies, culture, art, eclectic music,  films and animals in general. As a host, I\'m easy going, helpful, try to make you as a guest feel comfortable, help you get around with maps, and good information about cafe\'s, restaurants, fun things to do here.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1555dd7a-201c-41e0-8b18-9fca21c660bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30883612,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30883612','Mary','Portland, OR','I\'m a nurse who loves to travel! I have a small family. We are clean and respectful of other people\'s property.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a2949e69-fef5-46cc-8581-581b3f3853d1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7187155,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7187155','Kara','Portland, OR','We are seasoned international travelers, who have used our experiences to create a space that caters to visitors.  We are from Portland, Oregon, USA and New Zealand and love travel, walking, hiking, biking, sailing and spending time as a family.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7187155/original/bfce9cfd-4a53-4908-b2b3-9b13a7abcf49.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17022261,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17022261','Bryn','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7bd2e1b6-4de5-4745-812d-9e0b799e43dd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2783158,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2783158','Summer','Portland, OR','Portland, Oregon. I work in renewable energy. I love the outdoors, slow food, hanging out with my kids and husband and German film.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55d2b150-9d54-4fbd-82d4-e3f7d55ddab5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129344634,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129344634','Jody','','Welcome to the happy home I share with my cats, Moisel and Choo-Choo. I work in events, love theatre and books, dream about travel, and am strongly attracted to yard sales. \r\n\r\nI am always making new discoveries about this wonderful city and the  stunning Pacific Northwest.\r\n\r\nI welcome visitors to my home, where respect for difference and the duty of kindness to one another are the main house rules.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf27c821-6907-40e3-85fa-aa34412f9607.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129428891,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129428891','Randy','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bdfcdce7-f634-4ae5-9d69-ac676aa185ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129435693,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129435693','Braulio','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6a678cd5-039b-4fc6-a72c-d404907774a4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129473003,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129473003','Cory','Portland, OR','My name is Cory and I\'m a native Oregonian. \n\nI recently purchased this home and love my quiet neighborhood. I have great neighbors and enjoy the walking trail around the golf course. \n\nThis is the second Airbnb I\'ve hosted. I helped run another one with my ex-partner. I think Airbnb is a great way to travel.\n\nI also love music, hiking,  remodeling my house, gardening etc.  \n\n\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/92102a2d-cf65-45e2-bfb6-80eae65e8297.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17733541,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17733541','Tony','Portland, OR','I\'m a Midwest-born, Northwest-loving physician and father who loves living life like every day is my last.  My hobbies and interests include traveling, hanging with my kids, skiing and exploring the food and culture of the cities that I travel and of course my hometown of Portland, Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cfa56ee2-d1c2-4a15-afe0-a350002ee72e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1627089,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1627089','Alejandra','Portland, OR','I am an educator, my husband is an environmental planner. We spend as much  time as possible in the great outdoors and love the quirky culture of Portland, as well as spending time at the Oregon coast.  We also like to get away to my home country of Mexico or explore a variety of countries and cultures whenever possible. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1627089/profile_pic/1394577648/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2936952,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2936952','Wes & Gissel','Portland, OR','We love traveling, experiencing other cultures, meeting new people, and eating good food!  Some of our favorite adventures have been to Iguazu Falls in Brazil, the Amalfi coast in Italy, and Japan during the blooming cherry blossom season.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d537657c-2c79-4153-a62e-6e2dfe4f1120.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4880727,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4880727','Marnie & Kim','Portland, OR','We moved to Portland from Virginia 20+ years ago and live in the historic Laurelhurst neighborhood. Marnie is a technical program manager for Firefox and works from home. Kim is a xray tech and works at a local hospital. We have two kids (11th grade and a senior at U of Oregon) and love traveling with them. \n\nWe have 2 spoiled rescue dogs, Hazel and Piper, who hog the couch and love to go on walks. They will happily lick you to bits.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1fb4e3fa-6f11-42e1-8453-f202eea175d7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21270012,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21270012','Lorell','Portland, OR','Jason and I live in Portland with our son. We are both from Oregon, love biking, traveling and exploring the outdoors. \n\nWe love to travel and love to stay in AirBnb when we travel. We started hosting in 2017 and look forward to meeting more travelers.\n\nLorell (she/her) & Jason (he/him)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21270012/original/8d9f1287-6d9b-40cb-956e-20d7c907e559.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2399422,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2399422','Jane','Portland, OR','We are family of three from Portland, Oregon. My husband and I are in the 40s, we have  a daughter who is 12 years old. We love where we live, but we also like to travel whenever we can, loves beach, hiking, sight seeing.......',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4392c26e-823b-44a1-9052-6c08b4badedb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31862405,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31862405','Emily','Portland, OR','Hi there! I\'m Emily and I\'m excited to be hosting folks at my great North Portland property. Professionally, I\'m a licensed clinical social worker practicing in the Portland area. Personally, I\'m passionate about the great outdoors and spend free time camping, hiking, paddle boarding, etc. I\'m a Portland native and I\'m proud to call the City of Roses my home',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e5e505a5-8a29-40ec-95aa-5a5a8df794f0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1153199,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1153199','Phil','Portland, OR','I work as a writer and filmmaker, and seem to not stay in one place too long.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1153199/profile_pic/1323821313/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15422453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15422453','Kathleen','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fca16752-9548-4c12-ab2c-94235becd444.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(131613511,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/131613511','Amy And Wes','Portland, OR','When we were younger we lost moments by thinking there\'s more out there.  But the lessons of time (being parents has helped), has made us try harder to be present, to let the future be special, but not more special than the now.  When the day in day out pushes us too far into the future, traveling always brings us back to how lucky we are to have today. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e66bff3b-7b34-4e72-b035-00de4c4ac3dc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(442446,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/442446','Owen','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a5e94e8c-d154-4016-92e3-f697ef386ddd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9078003,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9078003','Veronika','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9de05cd4-91d0-44bb-a7ab-0b2680e40bb3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7872197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7872197','Chad','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96a4c127-a3f4-4a1e-8550-18503bfb4290.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2760621,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2760621','Lily','Portland, OR','Hello, hello! My name is Lily and I\'m an emergency and trauma nurse practitioner, and health equity/population health professor. Portland stole my heart when I came out to visit in 2002, and I’ve been here ever since. I hope you’ll enjoy our fair town as much as I do!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/22a8624b-5e59-40a3-ae34-e64192290b8d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132519510,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132519510','Pamela','Portland, OR','I am an avid hiker, backpacker, kayaker, and traveler.  I work remotely, so I may be home or away, while you visit.  I love gourmet cooking (I am an author of recipe books listed on Amazon) and love helping people achieve their unknown bucket lists!  I have an active lifestyle and will include who wants to come along for the fun, if possible.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c8e74471-173f-4466-9422-7509524a92d0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11311261,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11311261','Robert & Lauren','Portland, OR','Work from home folks who love board games, traveling, and hosting people in Portland! Let us know if there’s anything you need.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1248e0c9-3581-4303-acd2-f9761bca86ad.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12222973,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12222973','Lindsay','Portland, OR','My husband and I live in PDX and love the PNW. We love to travel, hike, eat good food and enjoy good wine/beer. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12222973/profile_pic/1413267928/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(74852933,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/74852933','Kyr','Eugene, OR','Creative, Writer + Maker.\n\nA weaver of stories and wool seeking to engage, inspire, and provoke.I am the great-granddaughter of a talented fiber artist who offered my first introduction to working with fiber. I feel my connection to her, and all the many Celtic wool witches who came before her, in my hands when I work with wool.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/118ea62c-36a5-4f63-8c8c-0b38b003968e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132980319,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132980319','Sara','Portland, OR','Native Oregonian. Creative, passionate about travel, interior design, friends, fun and wine!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-132980319/original/7407505e-487b-4c81-8306-7cc500057507.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40607528,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40607528','Suzanne','Portland, OR','Welcome! I moved to Portland over 20 years ago. I make a living as an artist and energy worker, including oil painting, graphic design, and emotional release bodywork. I\'ve lived and travelled in many places all over the world. With it\'s accessibility, food scene, music, art and offbeat nature, Portland is hard to beat. Our neighborhood is close to the airport, MAX train, Trader Joe\'s, Whole Foods, Hollywood Farmer\'s Market, several restaurants, food carts, the highway... you name it. We\'re central, and a hop, skip and a jump from anywhere in the city or it\'s environs that you care to visit. There\'s loads to see and do in Portland. Come see what all of the fuss is about. Warmly, Suzanne. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a0437938-d5e9-4a98-bdce-35b7d51348e4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(133774958,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/133774958','Tessa','Portland, OR','Hi and welcome! Thanks for choosing us for your stay! We always try to get back to guests right away...usually within an hour. See you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6d0496da-6f14-4e01-a809-5ebf87094b91.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(133785686,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/133785686','Jill','Portland, OR','My passions include traveling, people watching, language learning, getting lost, walking with my best buddy (Martin, my dog) and being with good friends. I love watching my kids grow up. I enjoy music, art, theater, reading, good podcasts, gardening, hiking and food. I ‘m easy going and like to meet people, and I\'m excited about hosting on airbnb.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d2317487-3b0b-47c1-8800-576f36e3438c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1792734,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1792734','Libby','Portland, OR','A little bit about little blue.\r\nAdam, my husband and I bought a house  6 years ago -a couple of weeks before I gave birth to our little firecracker of a daughter Mabel \r\nWe took a 1907 weathered house + tiny garage, ripped it to the studs and built them back up again. Adam wanted to do the work himself but also wanted to start a design agency. I\'ll spare you guys the drama in between- but as you can imagine: new baby, new business, renovation and no family close by took its toll.\r\nBut......\r\n\r\n\r\nAdam, a thru-hiker has collected some of the most amazing friends. We wanted clean sheets + a cozy bed for them. Me, a family girl from the south wanted space for her parents + siblings.\r\nAnd while our original intent was to take care of the people we know- it’s actually turned into this lovely space for new friends. And we couldn’t be happier!\r\n\r\nWe love the space because it represents the end of a very  long journey. And while the story brought out the best and the worst in us- it\'s all the good stuff that makes us want to be a community for travelers. It\'s the late night porch chats over oregon pinot and saying hello to perfect strangers that made us keep going.\r\n\r\nWe want you all to enjoy our space and make it your own. We want to hear your stories- whether face to face or written in our tiny journal.\r\n\r\nPlease, make yourselves at home.\r\n\r\nLibby, Adam & Mabel',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/afecefc7-d6d9-4782-9a60-af3779d79803.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(134280900,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/134280900','Paulla','Portland, OR','A true Oregonian, I love all things outdoors - hiking, biking, skiing, golf and surfing. Singing and traveling are other pursuits that I enjoy. An Art Teacher for 38 years, I enjoy museums and galleries. \n\nI am a host/owner at the 1898 Urban Victorian,  a restored Neoclassical Victorian in Portland, Oregon and Shore Pines @ Lakeview Drive, a MCM beach home in Manzanita, Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/559c0971-412c-496c-a596-f08beb2e2bbf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(134299336,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/134299336','Holly & Sky','Portland, OR','When we aren\'t traveling around the world on photo shoots, or just for fun, we live in both Portland, Oregon and San Miguel de Allende, Mexico. We take our little LukaJack almost everywhere we go; he\'s three. We love just about everything life has to offer; we seek beauty in all things. Mostly, we imagine we are just like you. We love to read and get out into nature, laughter is awesome and we focus on love. We enjoy hosting Airbnb in both of the cities we live in because we find joy in providing rich experiences for our guests. Thank you for considering artFlat, Portland for your next adventure!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3c166d8-53da-4314-b047-858a38738ef1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22809489,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22809489','Matthew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff13e412-4db6-4242-8921-4c47bce6f048.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(106287972,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/106287972','Joe','Portland, OR','I love to travel and know how important it is to come home to a comfortable, warm place after a day of sight seeing.\r\nI try to make my home a place where travelers will feel safe and comfortable.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c91e06e8-e7cb-452a-8c33-41e7d95a1b51.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(134574350,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/134574350','Mark','Portland, OR','Mark and his two girls, Sloane and Charlotte are Portland natives. Mark grew up in the neighborhood and is passionate about this city and all the fun things to do here! He and the kids love to cook, travel and be outdoors as much as possible--if you say it\'s okay, we\'d love to pet your dog! Mark is in renewable energy, loves to host and meet new people and is excited to be sharing part of his new home with guests!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-134574350/original/4febf3b4-687f-4969-91da-43a2bbced032.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29172616,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29172616','Chris','Portland, OR','I like doing stuff and meeting folks! Educated in Finland and married to a fifth generation Portlander who brought me to this great town.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/29172616/profile_pic/1426104735/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25278503,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25278503','Lauren','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/88801a08-13c2-4b86-9b1c-c5439e4ac9e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16918919,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16918919','Jason','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef2a5292-79ce-45a2-99a6-c911bf4bc311.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16176539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16176539','Jay','Portland, OR','Native to  Bar Harbor Maine transplanted to Portland Oregon where I run a non-profit called Still Standing Oregon, which we created to advocate for measures that increase the market value of seismically retrofitted homes. It turns out that extremely liberal Oregon is not as farsighted as one might think regarding planning for the risks associated with a major earthquake. My wife and I vacation in places on the water. We love to kayak.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/16176539/profile_pic/1401488185/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(135429095,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/135429095','Rebecca','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b616038b-fa0b-4a62-b039-2e0091e5ff8d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(135879197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/135879197','Angie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2b0555a9-218a-4a95-9f4b-16ad4764d6e1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9584819,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9584819','Ozzie','Portland, OR','Architect, artist, and empty nester with extra space at home and a penchant for adventure.  I love great food, art, and enjoy immersing myself in local life wherever I go.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9584819/profile_pic/1398896172/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(136020511,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/136020511','Elisabeth','Portland, OR','I am originally from Sweden but have spent most of my life in California and Oregon. Before retiring I was a nurse practitioner and worked on clinical trials in many part of the world. I love travelling, hiking, working in the garden and restoring this old house. \r\nMark taught political science and co-owned and ran several restaurants in California. Over the last twelve years he has volunteered his time with organizations that are focused on providing vigorous response to the profound challenges presented by climate change.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a6aa8524-0ee0-485c-8d63-a7b996e21b57.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40426471,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40426471','Neil','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/40426471/profile_pic/1439134136/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3119225,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3119225','Grace & Michael','Portland, OR','Grace & Michael are long-time residents of Portland, Oregon.  Grace is a fine art photographer and Michael is an architect.  They both enjoy art, travel, good food, friends, and cats. Grace swims and Michael road bikes.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/245c1f48-8549-41f1-83f7-4ff2a08f6cf0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(136858425,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/136858425','Kim & Alex','Portland, OR','Kim is an Idaho native who moved to Portland in 2012. She is an avid Ashtanga yoga practitioner, fluent Spanish speaker, world traveler, hula hooper, cyclist, hiker, scuba diver, and snowboarder. \nAlex is originally from London, England, and moved to Portland in 2011. He is a photojournalist who loves the Pacific Northwest and all the amazing scenery and outdoor activities in abundance here. He enjoys exploring nature, traveling the world, and telling compelling stories through the images he captures. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5bcdf90a-f44f-468a-a969-8268a118a029.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7580556,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7580556','Alexander','Portland, OR','I\'ve been married for 16 years and enjoy traveling, a plethora of physical hobbies (surfing, boxing, cycling, swimming, hiking, etc.) cooking and good food and drink. I enjoy exploring new locales just as much as I enjoy introducing visitors to my favorite places around my chosen home of Portland, OR.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3935ece9-4d1e-4863-9683-b94273449c25.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3630538,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3630538','Nathan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fa5152c2-1794-4c8b-8cd9-5dadd3ebae4c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11076206,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11076206','David','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in Oregon most of my life. Started in Eugene and ended in Portland. I\'ve worked in the footwear industry for the last 30 years. Designing, developing, marketing, and you name it. I like to travel light, fast, and for a purpose. I really need to relax more!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5a332390-7410-48f0-af77-4322dbe3580b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(415258,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/415258','Emily','Portland, OR','I’ve met so many wonderful guests hosting on Airbnb over the last 12 years! \n\nI grew up in Washington Heights, NYC and have lived in Portland for the last 15 years. I love to travel and hunt down delicious food & meet other travelers. My most recent trips have been  to Greece, London, Thailand, and Costa Rica.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49bff1b0-92e5-4bfb-a5ee-67940b82d4e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21288777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21288777','Sharon','Portland, OR','Theatre, Music, Travel, ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0ff83589-9dee-47de-b8c2-75d9cb381fd9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1510664,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1510664','Jessica','Portland, OR','Oregon Native. Lover of the world. I enjoy travel, exploring, learning, adventure, spirituality, connecting with people. \nI love to decorate and create cozy spaces. I love hot springs, healthy food, nature, HeartMath, backpacking and car glamping, hiking, nordic skiing, swimming in lakes, SUP\'ing  and all forms of motor-less watercraft.\n\nI am a quiet, respectful guest.  I enjoy being a gracious host myself.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6dd6673f-7fb2-4279-ab89-80ba447019e2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(137895170,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/137895170','Matt And Nicki','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-137895170/original/4b113c61-cc43-4473-be33-ab7781ad6631.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4901178,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4901178','Christopher','Astoria, OR','I\'m a well traveled Airbnb host & guest that is passionate about exceptional service. I\'m a Welshman who moved to Oregon in 2002. I Was A professional landscape painter for 20 years (See all the paintings in my listings www iambibby com). I now I live to travel & design/build beautiful mindful spaces that people can relax into & experience happiness & peace. I live between Portland & Astoria in my RV called Wanda with my desert dog called Moses.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4901178/original/311a906b-e1dd-4dbe-a956-a68e51ec8809.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(417776,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/417776','Laura','Portland, OR','My husband and I met in Austin, TX where I performed as an aerial dancer and he performed in a rock band and ran a small record label. We moved to Portland six years ago and have two kids ages 5 and 1. After years of travel around the country and globe, we find ourselves happy in Portland, but travel with kids is harder and we miss meeting new people.\r\n\r\nMy husband loves literature, and our guest room is filled with many of his favorite classic novels. I have a passion for fabric art, and have hand made many of the curtains and pillows in our home, including the guest room.\r\n\r\nOur guests are afforded a good deal of privacy. They have their own bathroom, connected to the guest room, that has both a shower and an oversized clawfoot tub.\r\n\r\nMore than anything, we want our guests to feel comfortable. We love our neighborhood with restaurants, bars, yoga and tons of shopping all within blocks. We\'re happy to share our favorite spots and stories about the area or leave you to explore on your own.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f7f69136-807d-4b46-ac1a-bd7c65ccb7a6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100656896,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100656896','Inna','United States','We are a family of 6 that works hard and loves to travel and enjoy spending time as a family. We love sharing quality time with our friends and loved ones, and hope that you are looking to do the same. We can\'t wait to be your host and help you make your stay memorable. Come visit our place and learn what we love about our area!\r\n\r\nCheck out our listing, and if you have any questions, get in touch. We\'d love to help you plan your perfect getaway!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/bc004e53-8197-4a9d-b0f0-c009d0ad1cc9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1895446,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1895446','Marsha','Vashon, WA','I\'m a lifelong learner, widely read, fit, married, though I do travel alone for work and pleasure.  \r\n\r\nI\'d say I\'m an adventurous introvert: like to talk some,  but need quiet and privacy.  Appreciate art, theater, movies, books, animals, food;  light but discriminating drinker, gardener, often go to sleep early, happy to help \r\nclean up.  \r\n\r\nI\'ve worked for myself for 36 years: www.BestWork.biz; and free tools I created to help small businesses thrive: www.GoodLittleBiz.com   and www.5Moves.com.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1edac3b0-6190-4eac-bc87-20f1d9b9bb79.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36382116,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36382116','Jon','Stevenson, WA','I\'m an outdoor enthusiast that enjoys a wide variety of people, books, movies, music and food ;-)\r\n\r\nIf a guest would like an introduction to local hikes to panoramic vistas, I will be happy to provide such.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/36382116/profile_pic/1434929849/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(139541066,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/139541066','Ticari','Oregon, United States','I teach yoga, run, cook and love to travel. Always excited to try out something new and not afraid to venture into the unknown. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9a493f92-f911-411b-b84d-9167d88e7740.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31304088,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31304088','Leslie','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, OR. Love to travel and eat good food.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c0a64ee7-486a-43eb-8908-81414ab3c96d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(137846612,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/137846612','Lorrie','Portland, OR','Southwest Portland has been our home for more than 25 years. We share our lives with a goofy dog and two loving cats and engage in an active lifestyle, enjoying as much of Oregon as we can--kayaking, camping, biking, running, and getting outside--even in the rainy months! Our family members are musicians, artists, DIYers, students, and volunteers.  Staying healthy and being a part of our community is important to us and we feel blessed to live in such an amazing area.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/56a06c75-7e23-43a1-997d-35191cd1ce33.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63788073,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63788073','J','Portland, OR','I\'ve done a lot of traveling in my life, and am really happy to now have the opportunity to host my fellow travelers in my family home.\r\nI love reading - favorite books: The Famished Road by Ben Okri; Against the Day by Thomas Pynchon; Parable of the Sower by Octavia Butler; Looking Backward by Edward Bellamy.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0002b1b8-90c9-4de3-8a23-bba5c694d4bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32601622,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32601622','Katherine','San Francisco, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/11344ebd-f8fb-4446-b804-8869a963ebab.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1743188,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1743188','Chrystal','Portland, OR','I was born and raised in Portland, Oregon and have traveled widely including living in both India and Japan. I love staying with Airbnb hosts and lately have been dabbling in Airbnb ‘experiences’ like hosted day trips. \nI love to help you to have a great stay in our vibrant, walkable neighborhood, our growing city and our gorgeous, diverse region. \r\n\r\n‘A stranger is a friend you haven\'t met yet’ Looking forward to meeting you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3710427-8a46-439a-b43e-2993dcf3ca38.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11740189,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11740189','Tony','Portland, OR','I work in the Travel Industry and have been to a lot of places around the world. I have met many interesting people and have experienced many different cultures. I have loved hosting my place on AirBnB. I like to do home projects as I have been renovating and remodeling my 1923 Portland Bungalow for the past 27 years. I also enjoy Gardening and Wood work. Me and My Husband enjoy traveling and spending time with our Friends and Family.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/590a7f85-8ff3-49f4-aa69-004a7b45e370.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20413267,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20413267','Lindsay','Portland, OR','Full time mom and real estate investor with a passion to live and travel. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20413267/profile_pic/1408749785/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7316008,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7316008','Jodie','Portland, OR','Fun loving, adventure seeking mom who loves to host her home and share her little cozy corner of the world.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2a12b221-ed4b-456b-b088-17180ad61325.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10514300,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10514300','Julian','New York, NY','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8275a568-4b86-4847-9f76-a5bc4c12a664.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(94888093,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/94888093','Jennifer','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m Jen. I love to travel and have had many wonderful experiences exploring places both overseas and in the U.S. Hosting with Airbnb feels like a full-circle opportunity to get to host visitors in our beloved city of Portland. Our family keeps honey bees, gardens and enjoys sports and the outdoors. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf8e1069-6173-441e-9a48-3a13fece7b74.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2644422,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2644422','Linda','Portland, OR','I recently retired from my job at Oregon\'s largest community college, where I was the campus president. My husband is a retired college teacher and an accomplished carpenter.  We love having the time now to devote to our extended family.  If we\'re not  on vacation, you\'re likely to find us at our family farm where we raise cattle, hay and grandchildren.  If vacationing, we\'re likely scuba diving off the shore of a tiny pacific island, or taking in the food, music and other cultural life of a major American city.   We love hosting people from all over the world in our home through Airbnb. It\'s a great way to meet the most interesting people!  What could be better. BTW:  Can\'t live w/out yoga, fresh fruits and vegetables, and a good book.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fe3b762a-fb67-4e89-9189-1827ac52aea5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32292601,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32292601','Jack','Portland, OR','My family and I love to travel. We are lifetime Oregonians and proud members of the Pacific Northwest. We enjoy exploring new areas and experiencing this beautiful world!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a4df7b54-11e7-4708-a0a0-d2e33143f6f7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2215281,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2215281','Leah','Portland, OR','I love book recommendations, so send them to me!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5e9b7fc6-ddee-4d5e-be5c-48a772b6e34e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2086378,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2086378','Kathryn','Zagreb, Croatia','I am living in Zagreb and maintain my home in Portland, OR where my daughter lives.  We love to travel and enjoy meeting people from around the world.  She is the main contact for this house.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7d67a896-1063-4321-95b4-3c2b0bcae56d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24551609,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24551609','Jeanine (She/Her)','Portland, OR','We have been privileged to have been welcomed and hosted by  amazing people all over the world- living and working in, volunteering and visiting so many beautiful places...we have tried to reflect  that gift of hospitality we have received  in our own home throughout the years. We want to welcome you to Mallory Tiny House and Portland! \r\nWe hope we can make your time in Portland relaxing and memorable.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4c8ec856-73c9-4008-ae7e-c8778e7fc459.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42731803,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42731803','Andreas','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/20300e46-35dd-49d4-845a-5780e005952b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(143962583,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/143962583','David','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef57dc61-5c9c-4e84-85f0-c5333579ed4e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(139135055,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/139135055','Charles','Portland, OR','Nice person',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9afce49a-cb08-469f-bb2e-3de82d864016.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15152314,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15152314','Matt','Portland, OR','As a Pacific Northwest native and avid explorer, I find joy in welcoming visitors to my Portland home and sharing memorable experiences around the area. When I’m not crafting inviting spaces, I’m likely out exploring the wild beauty of the world. Hosting lets me share the spaces I’ve built, the adventures I love, and create lasting memories for every visitor.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4a6563d6-fc30-4d05-a263-2f66adaa15ea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13376106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13376106','Carissa','Portland, OR','Nature and exploring this beautiful city are biggies for me - backpacking, yoga, and the amazing culinary paradise in this town. I also love working on house, making beautiful things out of wood, hanging with my furry friends, and spending time in my own backyard!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/580673eb-a7ff-4e17-b98a-d54ec4ffec69.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5341424,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5341424','Sue','Portland, OR','From Portland, OR--special education teacher and mom of two grown sons who sometimes land at my house. I love to travel, fix up my house, act in murder mystery shows,  do guided tours of the Portland Shanghai Tunnels, do crafty projects, and host Airbnb!\nSue',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96c01b19-88d4-42d8-9126-ec94e0c6ec8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16155383,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16155383','Nadene','Portland, OR','A host and a traveler. Love airBnB! I am a respectful guest. I also really enjoy hosting. I can’t wait to check out your space. Not only so I can enjoy my travels, but also to take notes!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5a5282c5-0268-474a-bac4-fe61f21afb83.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13008180,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13008180','Christophe','Portland, OR','French expat proud to call Portland home for the past 20+ years. I love cycling around the PNW and taking in its beautiful culture and scenery. And the food, coffee and beer!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b001e95-f47d-47b7-9d87-0ad9524196e9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8955868,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8955868','Sean','Portland, OR','I’ve had the pleasure of living in Oregon and Washington for three decades and enjoy the diversity of terrain and recreation we have. Our family hope you enjoy your stay with us and hope we can make it a pleasurable experience.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/14b7fc64-9402-407e-94e5-7760bb980ca2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22344380,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22344380','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','Easy-going girl who wants to see the world, ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22344380/profile_pic/1412896595/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(509244,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/509244','Jim','Portland, OR','We are native Oregonians and have lived in Portland for the past 20 years. We love the pioneer spirit of Portland, the DIY, bespoke, earthy ethos of the city.  The urban amenities of Portland are fantastic, but we also love the easy access to towering mountains, sleeping volcanoes, deep forests, sandy pacific ocean beaches, etc. We have two school-aged sons whose primary interests include reading, soccer, soccer, and soccer, but not school so much.  \r\n\r\nWe are also experienced travelers who appreciate and practice the art of hospitality. We have traveled and lived in Europe, Central America and Asia, and many times in our youth we relied on the kindness of strangers to ease our way.  We take very seriously the trust our guests place in us to provide a home away from home, and we manage to have good fun doing so. We look forward to hosting you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a878a408-6a49-4a24-9901-3673e5d7ff8c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(98837449,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/98837449','Amy','Portland, OR','I was born and raised on the East Coast and thoroughly enjoyed my 20\'s having started my career in advertising in NYC; but, I have now lived on the West Coast for the majority of my adult life.  My husband, Bob, and I met through the SF Advertising CoEd Softball League where we played on opposing teams - and now co-host the Blue Moon Suite in Portland, OR - that should tell you a lot about our sense of fun, teamwork, adventure and, oh yes, compromise!\r\nWe love to travel too (We were married in Florence, Italy); but, right now the Great Northwest is our adventure with all it has to offer ... especially the great outdoors.  We no longer play softball; but, are avid bocce players and Blues music aficionados in addition to being great hosts.\r\nWe enjoy sharing the beautiful and FUN place in which we now live and love the sense of community and exploring spirit that hosting an Airbnb fosters.\r\nWe will be happy to share our recommendations for some of the interesting things there are to do around Portland; or, if you\'ve already got it covered, we know how to respect our guest\'s desire for privacy and comfort.\r\nLook forward to meeting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aa6d16f7-728e-409d-80db-1c2151aec0f1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65297739,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65297739','Albert','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55ec5338-1fbb-4ff8-bdd6-85c814870370.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3645233,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3645233','Marina','Portland, OR','I\'m Argentine and currently living in the US . I love to travel and when I do location matters a lot  because one of my favourite activities is walking the cities I visit . Eating out and visiting street markets is also what I enjoy the most. I love to soak up places by being in the streets, checking out all the oddities and different things you can come across when you travel.Only there is where the magic is found.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/19cb9f30-add0-483b-a8cc-0de135d12e74.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2967070,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2967070','Jeff','Portland, OR','We are from Portland, Oregon, USA.We are interested in traveling the world and experiencing the cultures that we visit. We prefer to understand this by being part of the every day and through food and drink, not normally museums and \"traditional\" tourist attractions.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2967070/profile_pic/1395527746/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12299929,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12299929','Mo','Portland, OR','I live between the US and Spain. I love my homes and rent them to those who might enjoy them as much as I do. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-12299929/original/2176debe-0afc-4721-a30e-ae52d1369564.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46324976,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46324976','Josie','Portland, OR','We have traveled the world and have enjoyed staying in our fair share of Air B & Bs.  We love it when our host (s) offer insight to the area, nothing better than a local giving the inside scoop!  We enjoy skiing, hiking, backpacking, traveling, windsurfing, SUP, biking, running, and scuba diving.  We enjoy getting to know new folks and look forward to hosting. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/46324976/profile_pic/1444605437/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21427983,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21427983','Ryan','Portland, OR','Husband and dad to two darling girls. Philippine-born Chinese, with a short stint to Taiwan. Graphic artist, comic book aficionado, Christ-follower. I love traveling and seeing beauty around the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6bf6a782-bf11-4542-846d-4a75e2e9b9fa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(119485170,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/119485170','Nina','Portland, OR','I love Portland and living in this city.  I\'m originally from Vancouver, B.C. but Portland is my home now.  I am happy to share these wonderful spaces with visitors and locals alike.  I tend to give my guests privacy but if you would like some help or suggestions, please ask.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/163e63ec-1a10-4a0f-a538-5be83cb097e9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1674967,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1674967','Marina','Portland, OR','My husband and I moved with our 2 daughters to Portland 30 years ago. Our kids are grown up now, got married and our home feels empty nested. \r\nWe love Airbnb and the experiences it has enabled in our travels, and we look forward to sharing our house with fellow travelers. \r\nFavorite places: Paris, Sydney , Bruges (Belgium), Guilin(China), Rothenburg ob der Tauber (Germany), New York, Sedona. \r\nLove to entertain friends from all over the world.\r\nEnjoy travel, family, friends, dancing, movies, museums and gastronomy.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3f552d11-a17b-4e43-b6c9-44f9b6e610af.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39925570,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39925570','Ray','Portland, OR','I love hosting and helping people to feel comfortable in our home. I am a businessman and have a small business. Customer service is very important. \n\nI love to take on new ventures and develop things.  I enjoy traveling, reading, watching movies,  eating out and going to the beach or mountains.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/39925570/profile_pic/1438713776/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(146196024,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/146196024','Jeff','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d01ae4cb-b554-4a2f-8e82-32344ba0eef1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(146344153,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/146344153','Leslie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/acadd6ca-9199-43d7-9c33-2c2354c406e6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(153132135,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/153132135','Jackqueline','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/32ecafe5-0799-439b-8163-404d64f94c2e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44474897,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44474897','Jonathan','Portland, OR',' I graduated from Seattle Pacific University where I majored in chemistry. I also studied music at Portland State University. I\nam now a professional pianist and composer. I enjoy performing both jazz and classical music. I also enjoy doing nature photography. \n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/227218c0-e6e9-4d3d-bd06-3fbdbe807ec9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23416496,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23416496','Donna','Portland, OR','We are native Portlanders and love our beautiful city! Our home is situated in a quiet  and very safe neighborhood perfect for walking with trails and a park close by. We love biking, golf, books and good food as well as spending time with family and friends and Portland provides the opportunity for all of these things. We are excited to have you stay with us and hope you enjoy our city and surroundings as much as we do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5861ae9b-e84c-4df3-868e-2a05a130181d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109799233,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109799233','Dannelle','Portland, OR','I am a retired professor from Portland State University in downtown Portland.  I taught in the Education department for over 20 years.  I love to garden, especially cultivating cut flowers.  I have traveled in many countries as part of my work at the university.  You will see some artifacts from Turkey, Egypt, Colombia and Guatemala in the apartment.\r\n     I find that I really like hosting.  In my university work, I met people from all over the country and the world.  I just like presenting a cozy spot for my guests to land after a busy day of sightseeing or visiting friends.\r\n    My life motto is \"life is a journey, not a destination.\"  I like traveling and exploring and learning about different cultures.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7cba852-f86b-49c8-a234-d79785d4278a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(147284022,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/147284022','Erin','Portland, OR','I really enjoy meeting people & learning their stories.  Love traveling, good food, painting, photography, entertaining, movies, gardening, boating, being on the water or in it,  outdoor activities, skiing, walking/hiking, yoga, cycling, dance, music, art, design, fashion, giving back, living in the moment, enjoying life & spending time with family & friends!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-147284022/original/c9eadba4-063e-4849-bb5e-d024899cb8ba.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(552766,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/552766','Patrick','Portland, OR','I moved to Portland from NYC in 2008 and have been madly in love with the Pacific Northwest ever since. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/cca8b5bc-bdad-4c8a-b2bf-77eba26e59ab.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22613181,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22613181','Susan','Lake Oswego, OR','I\'m friendly, usually high energy, fun and love meeting new & interesting people. I Love the water and have lived almost all of my life on the lake. I care for the yard, like to grow things, have enjoyed a variety of sports, like music, science, art, have 2 kids out of HS for a start...  My passion and business is in \'health\'-care. I facilitate and support clients in anti- aging technologies and nutrition that repairs and restores youthfulness and overall health. I truly care about people personally and as a health care professional.  Airbnb has been a fun way to share a special place and meet great people.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22613181/profile_pic/1417562037/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148253043,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148253043','Matthew','Portland, OR','I am a easy going adventurous person that loves to travel and experience new things. Trying new food or experiencing a new culture or simply lounging around at home all sound like a good time to me.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49a31727-45b7-44f2-9797-6d252b23e6d1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25514905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25514905','Emily','Portland, OR','A working mom that enjoys gardening, decorating, and entertaining.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25514905/profile_pic/1421020165/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33616213,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33616213','Lenore','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b1c562d-987d-45cc-954f-5439e07f0e36.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148452836,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148452836','Mac','Portland, OR','Outgoing, love the Northwest... Big time Foodie, so I know a lot of the hot spots and new places. I also love many of our local breweries and can recommend anything! Plus if you want a great meatball sandwich, fried chicken or Philly Steak sandwich or even the best ice cream - just ask!!!!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c63823c4-4e2f-4b21-b47e-b524fd99e243.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2076827,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2076827','Shelley','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m a full-time writer from beautiful Portland, OR. I rent my cozy home when I travel and hope to share its good vibes with nice, responsible people. My home is located close to everything PDX offers. It\'s very clean, and I\'d like to keep it that way, so no smokers or partyers, please!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/db5f4169-3c8d-4fd3-abe6-771053e4ecbb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36435346,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36435346','David','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/061d54ee-400e-4730-aef9-dbc1a73d4352.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9996037,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9996037','Peter','Portland, OR','Native Portlander born and raised!  Work in music publishing and travel as much as I can.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9996037/profile_pic/1397494300/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45465987,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45465987','Amy','Portland, OR','Hi. \nI am a mom, wife & business owner, ~60 and I love to travel so I know what it\'s like to be \'the foreigner\'. \nThe place is quaint, but not perfect&that’s why it’s so affordable. We hope to expand the bath & a few other updates but we rarely have a free week on the rental calendar. \nPersonally, I enjoy the outdoors, exercise, gardening, a good book, but being w/family & friends is best, playing games or sharing a meal. Let us know if any Q’s.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45465987/profile_pic/1443647458/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(143163862,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/143163862','W’oape','Portland, OR','My name is W\'oape, my husband Mark I are both Portland natives. We are long time small business owners who are vested in this great neighborhood. While we love to travel, we also love the Northwest and all that it has to offer including the Oregon Coast, Mt Hood, and all things outdoors.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f950e0c1-b666-4426-96d7-80ac6254193b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26679646,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26679646','John','Portland, OR','Gay male 60ish lol!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/26679646/profile_pic/1422205101/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111643457,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111643457','Ken And Amy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/544d95dd-4943-4f3e-8b7e-d7014896dea6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2145885,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2145885','Emi','Portland, OR','I’m an architect in Portland, Oregon. I\'ve lived here for 10 years and love backpacking, hiking, design, and traveling to a new country every year. My favorite thing to do is cook for my friends, host dinner parties, and share recipes with my neighbors.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2145885/profile_pic/1421614960/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(67834636,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/67834636','Gregory','Portland, OR','Professional traveler for both work and play. Respectful of other people\'s homes and property. Also an Airbnb host that seeks to fulfill the needs of our guests.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca5ab1ef-b916-451b-9219-73873c6261fe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150440935,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150440935','Joe','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/91faf28f-92ee-4cab-a89d-9fe4cfca7b79.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49136460,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49136460','Sarah','Portland, OR','\n\"We wander for distraction, but we travel for fulfillment.\"\n-- someone brainy',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ea27833-0050-43cb-b8c7-755993a50529.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1828909,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1828909','Shona','Portland, OR','At Cedar & Porch Properties we specialize in hosting families & provide corporate rentals & housing for professionals. We specialize in 30 day+ stays through our extensive B2B network. We work directly w/ insurance companies & policyholders in need of temp housing. We\'re travelers, business owners, & enjoy hosting friends. \n\nWe love providing pet-friendly, comfortable, stylish properties so guests have peace-of-mind & all the comforts of home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/036057f6-f630-4cf7-a864-9bc3a2b9983d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150888783,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150888783','Jenny','Portland, OR','Family of four living in Portland, OR who love to host in our newly constructed 1-bedroom ADU.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-150888783/original/2c6482db-3998-45b3-b432-64548797b604.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(951583,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/951583','Charles S','Portland, OR','I\'ve traveled many years, staying with Airbnb hosts, and have had great experiences.  Now that I\'m semi retired, living in Portland OR, I\'m looking forward to meeting new people while providing them a quiet, private, safe space.  Yoga and meditation are key parts of my day!  I have a private practice in clinical psychology, and conduct compassion based yoga classes.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-951583/original/99af3e01-fbf0-450f-bf5f-380d548eadd9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5053719,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5053719','Sophie','Portland, OR','I live in Portland Oregon with my husband and two dogs. I work in documentary film production, own my own home and love to travel.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5053719/profile_pic/1360632678/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7902031,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7902031','Jessica','Portland, OR','About me: I have a long history of being a \"do-gooder\" (aka I\'ve worked in non-profits for quite some time).  I\'m originally from Syracuse, NY and spent a decade living and loving Brooklyn.  I am pretty mellow but the east-coaster in me re-surfaces on occasion (which is a good thing!).  I love the water, adore the sunshine and appreciate it even more now that I live in Portland (absence makes the heart grow fonder, right?  And summers here are spectacular -- they almost make you forget about the drizzle.).  \r\n\r\nAbout the other guy that lives here: My fiance, Ethan, is a chef and restauranteur.  He co-owns two restaurants in Portland:  Eat: An Oyster Bar in N Portland and The Parish located in the Pearl District.  He is a southern gentleman from Arkansas and he is obsessed with college football (Go Hogs!).\r\n\r\nAbout us:  We are a laid back couple that enjoys life and loves to entertain.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7902031/profile_pic/1375498276/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7391129,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7391129','Wallis','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Wallis - roller skater and sewist. \n\nI work full time for an merino wool apparel company in Portland, OR. \n\nWhen I\'m not working I\'m typically roller skating or sewing outfits to skate in.\n\nIf you’re staying in the Blue Cottage you might see our dog, Aspen, playing in the yard or going on a walk. He is a gentle giant who needs a lil time to warm up to strangers. \n\nI look forward to meeting and/or hosting you :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/356cc7fa-1a91-4ad7-a59b-15b8f272629f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13240293,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13240293','Sierra','Portland, OR','Hi. Welcome. We are a little family living in Woodlawn. The guest apartment is super cozy, just beneath us in the basement. \n\nWe are thrilled to have guests but because it’s our home, we can only take reservations from seasoned airbnb’rs.\n\nCome stay! Or send an inquiry for more information.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-13240293/original/4c2ddbac-b5ac-4268-8f79-693aa29e2753.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13604254,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13604254','Grant','Portland, OR','Once upon a time we owned a full fledged boutique hotel/hostel called Travelers\' House that has now downsized to this single apartment rental. We are so excited to get back to hosting folks after a long break. The neighborhoods nearby our place are what makes Portland so special and different from other cities that only have nightlife in the downtown area.  We like to have fun but we are not a party place. We are a LGBTQIA+ friendly and queer owned Airbnb. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d2295a4a-0bc0-4713-bab7-6b4000a2ec34.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1030342,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1030342','Shannon','Portland, OR','I\'m a friendly and curious person who has done a fair amount of  domestic and international traveling. I have a clean, comfortable and stylish studio to share with people, at an affordable price. I am happy to share my knowledge of the area with you. I have lived, mostly,  in Oregon 32 years, and lived in Portland nearly 15 years. I am happy to interact with you and share a coffee or glass of wine or let you do your own thing in private.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1030342/profile_pic/1361294453/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7634865,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7634865','Claire','Portland, OR','I\'m a Portlander with a wanderlust! I drag my intrepid daughter with me all over the world in search of butterflies, zebras and moonbeams....',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0481e7bc-ad15-43f9-b931-89f8a56a1457.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26818733,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26818733','Kelly','Portland, OR','Hosting is in my blood. My great great grandmother managed a boarding house during the gold rush.  \nSo, the obsession for housekeeping passed down. It’s an exhausting genetic abnormality :)\n\nI hope you\'ll stay and make great memories!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ac92c76f-37c9-406f-b12b-b63e6658c24b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6589054,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6589054','Linda','Portland, OR','Traveler at heart enjoys Portland as home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6589054/profile_pic/1369606612/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45434894,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45434894','Leah','Portland, OR','I am an artist and my partner is a writer and a stagehand.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4cacc2db-0ae6-4e70-a87c-2be25c70b965.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(89239158,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/89239158','Jeremy','Portland, OR','Greetings. I love to host, and I love to travel. I have had the chance to travel to Africa, Europe, Asia, the Carribean and all 50 US States. Some of my favorite recent travel memories include AirBnB stays in Barcelona, and on a boat in the south of France. I\'m a single Dad and I own a design, video production and branding firm in here in Portland. Many of my clients are in the food, coffee, cannabis, wine and restaurant industries here in town, and happy to share some tips on great places to eat & drink. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1ce6cb82-bdf1-45d5-906e-a7236a1dc1aa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10218720,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10218720','Ann','Corvallis, OR','I am originally from Chicago, so I love a good city...and I also love Oregon.\r\nPortland has the best of both worlds...a great city in a beautiful state!  There is so much to do in the city and incredible nature all around!  All of the fun urban things to do (restaurants, bookstores, bars and coffee shops) and then there is nature all around you, (gardens, forests, mountains, river and ocean) and all so accessible!  I am happy to help you with recommendations and info! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10218720/profile_pic/1385769978/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3519216,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3519216','Daniel','Portland, OR','I am a User Experience executive with interests in holistic nutrition, fitness, and media psychology. I love live music. I live in Portland with my wife and am thrilled to finally be back home in the city where I grew up, after many years away in Seattle, California, Tucson, and Boston.\r\n\r\nI am a Superhost, renting out an apartment, attached to my home that I now live in.\r\n\r\nYou can check out my professional website here: smileux com.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0fa844c4-d498-4916-9e30-3e201b37799b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33109623,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33109623','Janel','Portland, OR','Originally from the Bay Area, then raised in Seattle. I chose to go to school in Arizona and started my career in NYC. Now currently I am back and forth from San Francisco and Portland because I work remotely as a graphic designer. I\'m always down to meet new and exciting people and host a great experience for your Portland stay! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cbaf2653-6cf8-4c68-ae21-25759e61dd4b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28595712,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28595712','Niki','Oregon, United States','Love to live in the NW. love the outdoors and everything about Portland. Happy to share my list of what I love best about Portland. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f47cc62-7c1a-44ef-93e3-f8c7fc520638.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(145210319,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/145210319','Vacasa Oregon','','Vacasa\nVacation Home Management\n\nVacasa unlocks the possibilities of how we enjoy vacation homes. We take care of managing our homeowners’ vacation houses so they can have peace of mind (and their home when they want to). And our guests book vacations confidently knowing they’re going to find exactly what they’re looking for without any surprises.\n\nEach vacation home is always cared for by our professional local teams who implement our high cleanliness and maintenance values, while the hands-off tasks of vacation rental management--marketing, filing taxes, and maintaining a website--are handled by a specialized central support team. Our passion and focus remain true: to empower our homeowners, guests, and employees to invest in vacation.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0ad3ec30-00cb-436b-828f-a7a61b51914f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9268124,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9268124','Andrea','Portland, OR','My husband and I live in the Kenton neighborhood of Portland, OR.  I am a transplant from Idaho but have lived in Oregon since 1994.  We love our neighborhood and are excited to share it with travelers.  I work as a physical therapist in both Portland and Vancouver, WA.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9268124/profile_pic/1385918899/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12556069,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12556069','Rosemary','Portland, OR','I\'m a teacher living in Portland, Or and have taught at international schools in Asia with extensive travels in Asia, South America and Europe under my belt.  I am originally from San Francisco though I love it know there is more in the world to see and am determined to get to as much of it as possible.\n\nI\'m a big fan of traveling (obviously) but also yoga, healthy eating, being outside, amazing architecture, authentic cultural experiences, meeting new people and hearing their stories, public radio and making things.  Oh, and food.\n\nI love to meet new people and find connections and commonalities. When traveling, my daughter is usually with me and sometimes my mom.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/62095de7-1beb-4bc8-a858-e096da08f46a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(156366214,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/156366214','Paul','Mountain View, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5e43bd0e-5c5c-4c0f-a6e2-abdd84ed5e11.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(124649867,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/124649867','Kanika','Portland, OR','I’m a business professional living in Portland, OR. I’m originally from India and love rock climbing, hiking, field hockey and soccer. \n\nA seasoned Airbnber, I’ve hosted three properties and been a guest at 50+ all over the world. Looking forward to meeting you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/62f7b2ce-7608-4fb4-b950-a25b61041019.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(124293,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/124293','Angela','Portland, OR','My home (and favorite city) is Portland, OR. One reason I prefer to stay in private residences versus hotels is the opportunity to be in a neighborhood. I like to visit the local market, make my own dinner and explore a new neighborhood on my morning runs. Too often when I stay in a hotel I end up running next to a business park or busy freeway - not very scenic, safe or enjoyable. \r\n\r\nI\'ve stayed with many great Airbnb hosts and now I\'m looking forward to hosting guests in my house. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/124293/profile_pic/1383955474/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37422309,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37422309','Peter','Portland, OR','I was raised in the Midwest and have happily lived on the West Coast since going to University in California. I had a career in Advertising and Digital Marketing, but recently decided to focus full-time on creating beautiful, clean, and thoughtful places for people to stay in while they visit Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/13d7f4ed-c12d-4bb1-ba72-a4be05afce87.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6162657,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6162657','Mark','Portland, OR','My wife and I have lived in Portland since 1977. I like gardening, hiking, playing ping pong, woodworking and reading non fiction (please don\'t hold that against me). We have two kids that live in the area and much to our joy one of them got married and has produced our first grandson. We like to travel, but only in the last couple years have we started getting to places well off the beaten path. Trips have taken us to various spots around the world. My hiking has included the John Muir Trail, the passes of Northern Peru and lots of time in the Columbia River Gorge near our home. We have taken up white water rafting and have done the Grand Canyon twice. I have also been active in volunteer projects in various wilderness areas throughout the West. When I was younger I was a smoke jumper for the US Forest Service so I guess my hiking is an attempt to relive my youth. \r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8e84396f-fbe2-4b6d-9345-41e90cb0da55.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30438500,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30438500','Nell','Portland, OR','My husband, Preston, and I moved to the Portland 14 years ago and have been happy ever since. We love all that the Pacific Northwest has to offer, but we also like to travel to far-away places.  Thus, we joined the airbnb community both as travelers and as hosts.  We enjoy getting to know the places we visit and the people that live there. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3e3314b5-881b-4727-86d3-ce71b4d4dff3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25190618,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25190618','Sarah','Portland, OR','An 80s baby, currently residing in Portland, OR. A lover of nature and music. Always searching out new adventures. Being a host, as well as a guest, gives me great perspective on all that it takes to run a vacation rental!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e6c645ee-dbce-4de6-a846-037903efe234.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(158343305,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/158343305','Erik Brakstad','Portland, OR','I am a longtime Portlander with deep roots here. I work as a construction trainer for a non-profit and built this freestanding ADU in 2017, utilizing green building practices and lots of reclaimed fir. Our family has lived in the adjacent house since ‘96. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3ca2669d-88df-456a-b7c6-1e76d7ec3e40.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148139307,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148139307','Lucia','Portland, OR','I enjoy helping people and, and make people happy \r\nI can not live without listening to the music, cooking, and traveling.\r\nMy Moto to transform the world.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f4f67cc4-a090-4476-9e4d-e5e94b9e37b8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37620967,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37620967','Curt','Portland, OR','Social Worker and all around nerd. Live here with my husband Chris, who works in Higher Ed and is working on his PhD in Education. We share our home with our dogs Lana and Sterling, and cat Spiral. Its a coffee, beer, and NPR kind of household with Plenty of board games and video games as well. We are continuing to make improvements and adding amenities, so hopefully you like what you see when you arrive :-)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/37620967/profile_pic/1436150019/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54808736,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54808736','Kim','Portland, OR','I adore Portland and feel very fortunate to live here.  The brand new guest house has been a long project, but I\'m delighted with the outcome.  I\'m an art teacher and artist working in printmaking and encaustic.  My dogs, Roy, the Chiweagle and Potato, the fuzz ball live on my side of the property.  Though guests are separated from them, if they need some puppy love, the boys would be happy to oblige.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1fba57f-6af1-461a-bbec-27d408ce4d7a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70330470,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70330470','David','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bca51bf3-94a2-48fa-b759-5d0a46eaa31c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50608466,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50608466','Lisa','Portland, OR','I love my work and my free time equally.  I work in health care, and  in my free time I enjoy music, food, gatherings with loved ones, hiking, reading, movies, and dancing.   As a guest I will be respectful of the rules and appreciative of the little things that make your space special.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5bbf962e-cc81-4f45-83d3-40e99695bea3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58470243,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58470243','Timothy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c0b7515-10f0-4248-8e47-7b03acabcba6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2341031,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2341031','Melody','Portland, OR','I split my time between NYC and Portland, OR. I am a theatre director. I love to travel and meet new people and places. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55a14156-ae09-4186-a67a-c838ab89070a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5946065,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5946065','Brian','Portland, OR','Love my city and happy to help you enjoy it too.  Biking, hiking, skiing and the food scene are some of my favorite things.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/38890dd4-8549-432d-a205-5affc725444a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34691278,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34691278','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I\'m a French woman who has lived in the USA since 2007. Being a very outgoing person, who has traveled a lot, I love to share experiences and to learn about yours too! I\'m a grade school teacher and I love my job. \n\nMy husband Matthew and I have been Airbnb hosts since 2017 when we built our new guest house here in Portland. We love meeting our visitors from all over the world.\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/402064fb-1dea-4b7d-b0d6-a80e5289b6bb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1313392,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1313392','James','Portland, OR','We\'re a married couple, James and Jennifer, from Portland, OR. We have been airbnb guests since 2011 and hosts since 2017. We have both traveled widely for work and leisure.  We love to meet people and learn about new places.  \nJames especially enjoys getting the local scoop on where to go and what to see when he travels (as opposed the tourism office version).  Likewise, we really like sharing our insights on our hometown and state with people who visit.  \n\nJames can speak German quite well and Spanish pretty well, while Jennifer has enough French to get by.\n\nAs hosts, we are excited to welcome you to our unique and wonderful town! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1313392/profile_pic/1420528982/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4426437,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4426437','Emilie','Portland, OR','I love art and design.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9466e963-c455-4a87-bb99-93c82226a2c6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(71495475,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/71495475','Rob','Portland, OR','Friendly and adventurous. Love travel, good food, exploring new places. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/101bc78d-84e5-4ac5-b21e-b1d10e1b0436.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9724899,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9724899','Amy & Ryland','Portland, OR','We have a love of travel. Seeing new places. We took a year off and traveled Central and South America with our two children. We stayed in hostels to hotels, and of course Airbnb’s. Which is why we wanted to host travelers. In traveling we really got a feel for what we wanted in our accommodations and what we didn’t necessarily need. We designed our place to be open, comfortable, and full of everything for you. We welcome you to Your Urban Nest. Your home away from home. \nIf you need assistance we can help with directions, activities and/or recommendations. Whatever you need, we are both native Portlanders. Ryland grew up on the same block so we really know the area. \nWe are hosts that love interacting and assisting guests any way we can, but also respect the importance of privacy and total relaxation. We live on the same lot with our children, our Shepard Modie and our two guinea pigs. None of our animals enter your space. \n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/29e4c9c2-e54f-4cf8-a5b4-25ce55a30ae8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1397292,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1397292','Holly','Portland, OR','I am married to a wonderful French man named Fred, and we have a beautiful son and daughter together. I am a marketing and brand strategist, and founder of Green Rising Marketing.  We work exclusively with Green & socially conscious companies.  I love Portland, OR, and am happy to welcome people to my home.   I am originally from Texas, and am 5th generation.  I get out into nature and the outdoors as often as possible.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1397292/profile_pic/1352868772/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129257796,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129257796','Dan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-129257796/original/94040860-355e-4129-b398-c70c31260379.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1680036,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1680036','John','Portland, OR','Hello! I am an architect, and love to make stuff. I\'ve been a daily bicycle commuter since moving to Portland 25 years ago. Janet and I love to travel, most recently in a campervan, but we\'re looking forward to Mexico and beyond again someday.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0c016a29-48b9-4721-86d5-1693bd01cf29.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(123234322,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/123234322','Bart','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ecc3b62c-8a6a-42cb-9ca0-0d86793d44e1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3917228,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3917228','Christopher','Portland, OR','Aloha,\r\n\r\nMy name is Christopher.  I live and work in both Portland, OR and Honolulu, HI having been blessed with the opportunity to experience life between these 2 great cities.  I love to travel, surf, and snowboard.  I am an adventurous gormand, a light-footed guest, but a meticulous host.  When visiting, I want to make sure to leave your home exactly as I found it.  When hosting, I hope to make your experience love our city as much as I do.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/599af48d-7c8a-41b8-b303-2648e9c1c65f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(126371404,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/126371404','Krista','Portland, OR','Living in St. Johns since 2004, Portland since 2000.  Originally from Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.  We love to camp and travel especially on Motorcycles.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8ae7110b-ee5e-40a3-af6b-29fd95415098.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10468278,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10468278','Sherry','Portland, OR','I am a retired school teacher. I have taught yoga as well. I now enjoy hiking, practicing yoga and arranging flowers.\n My husband Chuck and I relocated to S.E. Portland from the East Coast and absolutely love it. We purchased our 1906 bungalow in 2012. Our yard needed some updating and out of that project our \"cottage\" was born!.\r\nWe enjoy taking walks to Mount Tabor, visiting with the neighbors, going to local coffee shops and restaurants, and hiking the beautiful Gorge. We both enjoy music and go to local concerts. We love sampling the great beer and food that Portland has to offer. We are home bodies but enjoy traveling as well. We like to camp but as we have gotten older we often stay at airbnb\'s when we travel. We like meeting new people and staying where the locals live. We always find our hosts to be friendly and informative. After our cottage was complete we had more room when our 6 children from our combined marriage visited. It wasn\'t long before our kids were recommending the cottage to friends of theirs for conferences as well as vacations. We decided to open it up to others and are excited about meeting new people and sharing our love of Portland with them.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10468278/profile_pic/1386346155/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(161360298,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/161360298','James','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e6c1cc3b-adeb-4cc6-b86e-27642f13d6bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12801017,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12801017','Rebekah','Portland, OR','I make pretty things with my hands. I\'m a maker/doer/go-getter/handyman/chicken friend/dog mom. I work for Anthropologie as the Display coordinator and spend my free time going on outdoor adventures, doing house projects, and crafting a cocktail.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12801017/profile_pic/1393965286/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13187107,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13187107','Lisa','Portland, OR','My husband, Jim, and I love to explore new cities via Airbnb. Our family loves people watching,  food and wine, and making new friends along the way.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be873125-43da-4799-9c04-bcc9350c838e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22901192,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22901192','Cody','Portland, OR','Adventurer. Food & Travel enthusiast. Living to build memories.\n\n—>Girl Cody <— ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca3096b4-db4c-4dbc-af11-067c6a58e104.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3228077,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3228077','Jura','Portland, OR','Hello, \nI live in Portland, Oregon and work as a emergency room nurse. I have a 21 year old son who I love to travel with he is fun and introspective. We enjoy the outdoors and spend the northwest summers backpacking and enjoying the outdoors. I own my own home and enjoy remodeling projects and gardening. I also Airbnb out an apartment in the basement of my home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3228077/original/85e6bf80-3491-430c-b69d-5f984a0c3f4b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(162425891,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/162425891','Carmen','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6973f78-aa41-4bb1-806d-eb1a33ef7fcf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49306713,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49306713','Sarah','Portland, OR','I am a graduate of the University of Oregon and a CPA, currently working in downtown Portland. I love the outdoors, water sports, and reading.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef019e2f-553d-4790-9ec7-db8bf028e184.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49871309,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49871309','Whit','Portland, OR','My kids and I love hosting guests in our space. I spend much of my time in my shop converting vans to help others live the #vanlife dream. In my past life I was a video editor, but I spend most of my time as a carpenter now. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/080006c3-dbee-4dde-852b-3f5870b83cf7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(162827036,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/162827036','Dallas','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cd4b39dc-d571-4094-8a76-67304c1a5038.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127253983,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127253983','Tucker','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ce4d6c0-4615-4dc9-9044-e74987e3d7b0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(161634806,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/161634806','Lori','Portland, OR','I have always loved to travel from a young age and have enjoyed all the different people you meet along the way. Hosting airbnb helps a bit with the travel bug!\r\nBorn here in Portland and raised in Seattle, I am a Northwester you could say. My job as a realtor takes me all over the city and beyond which is the best!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a6444e5b-a1c4-40af-920a-d02eca241afb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33153648,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33153648','Laura','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/33153648/profile_pic/1431390577/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25135442,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25135442','Ellen','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e48d13ac-fb82-4af9-b285-77ea4f0bfa36.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12516331,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12516331','Reenie','Portland, OR','I am a semi-retired teacher. My husband Jim and I split our time between Portland and Corvallis. We enjoy traveling, gardening, nature, camping, hiking and sharing time with friends & family. Meeting new people through Airbnb is enjoyable and gratifying to both of us.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3949a566-78e0-4be5-a305-6c0701856a82.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(164911609,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/164911609','Shonnett','Portland, OR','I enjoy walks to NE Alberta and surrounding neighborhoods.\nGardening in the spring and summer just getting into winter gardening.\nMy home is LGBT friendly, cannabis friendly and at times small pet friendly:)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bd588c3a-9a8c-43f9-b94a-0c7752c72847.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40729073,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40729073','Diane','Portland, OR','I moved to Portland after graduating from U of O in 1995 and have been living in NE Portland ever since.  By far my favorite quadrant of the city, I enjoy what everyone in Portland enjoys....great coffee and waiting in line for an hour for brunch!  I also love hiking in the gorge and trying new restaurants with my friends.  I am a Realtor, by trade since 2005, which doesn\'t allow a ton of time for the above mentioned but I love helping people and I am always honored to be the advocate for such important transitions in clients lives.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1575ad31-43d7-4a7d-95a8-3067a248267a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41514066,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41514066','Zoe','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d21db0ca-54a6-435a-a494-810931118679.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32163035,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32163035','Marc','Portland, OR','I completed a 2,653 mile thru-hike of the Pacific Crest Trail (Mexico to Canada) in 2019.  I played collegiate tennis at Oregon State University.   I\'m currently active with the United States Tennis Association playing competitively in local leagues and also a USPTA teaching tennis Professional.  I\'m a season ticket holder for Oregon State University football (25 consecutive years) and big fan of Portland Thorns and Portland Timbers, professional soccer teams.  In my free time I enjoy spending time with my two teenage daughters,  hiking difficult trails,  backpack and climbing trips, talking to strangers randomly, and playing an occasional game of poker.  Hosting out of town guests is very fulfilling as I\'m proud of everything Portland has to offer.  We have the best micro breweries in the world, an amazing bicycling culture, great coffee, and central access to the many natural wonders of Oregon.  These treasures include the Columbia Gorge, Mt. Hood, the Oregon Coast, Crater Lake, and other scenic lakes, mountain ranges, and Eastern Oregon desert.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d978f2fc-9f8f-43c7-b586-912b600a0f7f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11122733,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11122733','Lucy','Portland, OR','Hi, my name is Lucy! I am an active non-profit professional living in Portland, OR. I am an outdoor enthusiast, in love with the Pacific Northwest\'s great places to hike, ski, backpack and swim. I bike quite a bit around Portland, being the great biking city it is, and also enjoy reading, traveling and spending time with family and friends. My life motto is how I was taught to ski: point downhill and lean forward.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-11122733/original/acc5e85d-1c7a-45f5-b2f1-4401f96ccb2e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3285925,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3285925','Alexandra','Portland, OR','Hi, I like to travel and discover interesting places and people. I am welcoming and want to offer guests a great Airbnb experience. I know what it means to be a good host and a good guest, at the same time. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1d628d8-fad0-484c-a2e9-91c180ca5f11.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22042161,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22042161','Karin','Portland, OR','I\'m a mother of two teenagers and urban farmer/fiber enthusiast living in a quiet neighborhood where I keep a rabbit, a few chickens for fresh eggs, some guinea pigs (sometimes lawn mowers), and enjoy the company of three cats and two miniature poodles. My rabbit is a Giant Angora rabbit that grows incredible fiber that I harvest for spinning and knitting. During dry months, I might be dying fiber in big pots in my backyard. During cold and rainy days, I tend to spin yarn on my spinning wheel or knit yarn up into projects. I like to grow my vegetables for meals and keep a bunch of raised garden beds. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b0d0283f-06ef-4633-a33b-896c4a37af19.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(142027593,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/142027593','Erin','Portland, OR','I’m a wildly happy, busy mom of two wonderful children. I’ve worked or lived in the Woodlawn neighborhood of NE Portland for a decade and am excited to share this amazing neighborhood with guests.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e6f59aa4-9b9a-4912-bac3-92e2a8d43d7b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45329606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45329606','Jack And Cris','Portland, OR','We have lived in our Old Portland home for over 30 years now. As artists, musicians, and coffee shop/wine bar owners, we’ve been a part of Portland’s transformation into one of the most dynamic and colorful cities in the U.S. Our neighborhood was recently voted one of the most livable in the country. We are fortunate to have a large lot with a pond, giving us sanctuary from city living.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55ee9c49-f1f0-4ebd-af1d-a4a5fccfcf40.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(167221905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/167221905','Shireesh','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Canada and now have lived in Portland since 1997! Obviously can\'t live without my wife Nicole and our wonderful son! Love soccer, squash, and golf. An avid foodie, I feel so lucky to live in Portland that continues to amaze!\r\n\r\nDuring your stay with us, you will be well taken care of by Dusty, our resident host. She and I are delighted to help with all things Portland, from the big hitters to the hidden gems. \r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b7e7c54-7bad-47b3-b03e-82286b703105.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27752797,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27752797','Katie','Portland, OR','I am a portrait + life photographer in Portland, OR, USA.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-27752797/original/f30fbf58-0b1e-4e86-bd3b-cd76158488bf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6917563,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6917563','Diana','Portland, OR','I’ve been hosting our AirBnb for over 5 years. I love to create a stylish, modern and clean space with all the amenities our guests need.  I’m here for any questions but with self check-in and out you have the privacy you need.  I hope you enjoy your stay!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c4d5a1d-b741-40f5-823f-5b709ebe2488.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24365988,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24365988','Jeremy','Portland, OR','I am a utility consultant and travel all over the US.  I am married with two lovely girls and I live in Portland, Oregon.  I love great food--I cook a lot at home--and love local recommendations.  I\'m a quiet, tidy and respectful guest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/24365988/profile_pic/1417458928/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6468837,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6468837','Rachel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6468837/original/5449a837-b627-4a7b-aaa2-1ee154f38f59.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9111756,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9111756','Clarissa','Portland, OR','I am 8 years in Portland, a transplant from SF/Bay Area. Love the NW activities (hiking, biking, running around the city). ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9111756/profile_pic/1380430671/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63619764,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63619764','Roy Lynn','Portland, OR','loved to meet guests from all over the world',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/194e54cb-04bf-4941-87fe-a639f90f9684.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(168264312,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/168264312','Matt','Portland, OR','Husband, father, cook, baker, musician, hiker, traveler, I like to explore new places, get out into nature with my family and try out the latest new food place in town!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/044c8302-76b3-4269-b0bc-177a628a276a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9691781,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9691781','Rosanna','Portland, OR','Hi, I’m Zanna!\n    Though born in California, I grew up in France (age 6 to 14). I went to UC Berkeley at age 16. I’m an artist, and earned a BFA. My father was an academy award-winning screenwriter; my mother, a pioneering woman architect. I have two grown daughters and a granddaughter. I like people of all ethnicities, cultures and places. My best job (of many) was art teacher & art therapist in a creative program for artists with disabilities.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/20f346d8-7de3-4448-9d35-8ee4da086337.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19143593,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19143593','Monica','Portland, OR','We are married professionals with 3 children aged teen to preschooler.  Monica works in healthcare technology and Alex is a mental health therapist who is currently staying home full time with our kids and managing the guest house. We used to vacation in time shares and know how to make a space comfortable for a week or more. (We’ve been known to pack our own kitchen knives - which is why Fowler House provides good ones.)\n\nWe have enjoyed being guests in AirBnBs and appreciate the community and discovering new places. We enjoy meeting new people from a variety of cultures, backgrounds and abilities.\n\nWe both grew up in the Pacific Northwest and have lived in North Portland since 2006. Hobbies include cooking, cycling, volunteering, and spending time with friends.  Our family loves music and 3 of us are currently learning Suzuki violin. Alex’s first language was German and he would love to talk with you about Bavaria, beer, or philosophy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19143593/original/33c555dd-8240-45d5-b38d-81661d745ae2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70200278,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70200278','Yongping','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/72f8888d-a334-4e1f-8b2f-364b3cc86685.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20705013,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20705013','Constantin','Paris, France','I\'m a foreigner everywhere I go, but I feel a little bit at home almost everywhere as well. My native languages are French and Spanish, but I also speak English fluently. My husband and I split our time between France (Paris), and the United States (Oregon). We\'ve stayed at great Airbnbs across the world, and have met wonderful hosts — they inspired us to become hosts ourselves.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-20705013/original/b6b92025-b1f5-4d61-b68b-2793c394d413.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(113106891,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/113106891','Sherry','Portland, OR','I have lived in the PNW my entire life. I call Portland Oregon home. I enjoy traveling, camping, gardening, time with family, good food and wine. I am self employed now, but worked corporately for many years. So glad to have more freedom. We love our 12 year old springer spaniel and bring him along when we are able. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a7f62d9d-545d-49b8-b13e-a0fe69151616.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20418871,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20418871','Ignacio','Portland, OR','I\'m a cloud computing technologist, runner and aspiring globetrotter. I\'m originally from Oaxaca, Mexico and Portland has been my home for the past 12 years. I know the city pretty well so I am happy to recommend a good restaurant, bar, shows, etc.\r\n\r\nFavorite places I\'ve visited: Varanasi, India / Granada, Spain / Machu Picchu, Peru\r\n\r\nWhat\'s on my list: Fez, Morocco / Salvador, Brazil / ... the world',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8abd4409-ba80-4712-bf76-650bc4bfafb8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(108079827,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/108079827','Colleen','Portland, OR','We are both University of Portland graduates and retired teachers.  Ken taught elementary education for 32 years.  Colleen taught elementary and then Montessori education.  She owned and taught at Kaiel Montessori for 27 years.  We\'ve been married for 45 years, raised four wonderful children and enjoy spending time with our five grandchildren.  \r\n\r\nWe love to travel and visit new places and we walk everyday trying to explore new areas in Portland.  We both love to cook and enjoy all the fabulous Portland restaurants.  We\'re excited to be hosts for Airbnb travelers.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be6e5e85-1296-45bc-a135-aff95cb20b82.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56540131,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56540131','Scot And Trish','Portland, OR','We are interested in meeting people from all over the world.  We have a lifelong sense of adventure and are constantly looking at the positive side of life.  Trish and I would pause important things that are going on in our lives if it meant helping somebody else with theirs.  We work with kids and adults, have for our entire career.  We have been fortunate enough to establish and maintain lifelong connections which are so important to us. We are spontaneous and love taking on new adventures.  Some of the places we have traveled include Indonesia, eastern and western Europe, and the South Pacific. Our latest trip was to Bermuda where we met new friends and connected with family.  We truly believe in living life to its fullest!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/63637743-3975-4b2c-8362-193040dae79f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5755250,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5755250','Molly','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5755250/profile_pic/1418707361/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5769084,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5769084','Miriam','Portland, OR','Traveling the globe in search of beautiful places and awesome experiences!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ae35750-9c09-4ce4-bd2e-7bafa1ff5d10.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50972958,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50972958','Mark','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fe58966a-d855-4a0f-85d4-160853aa7b15.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(140115987,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/140115987','Alycia-Matthew','Portland, OR','   There are many homes in Portland owned by outside investors who purchase property, displace the folks who live there, and short term rental out the home. This has had a severe negative affect on the community as we have a housing crises but lots of homes exclusively for short term rental. It is of the upmost importance to us as hosts to provide a wonderful and unique lodging experience while honoring our city and community. We are not investors who know nothing of the city and hire folks to clean and communicate with guests. We live in and love this city and want to open our home to you. We clean and maintain the space allowing us to add thoughtful touches that are inclusive to supporting our community. We are here to respond to any needs and provide personalized local recommendations. \r\n\r\n    We are a mountain mama from Tijeras New Mexico and her mountain feller From Colorado, hunkered down in Portland raising a daughter. We are driven by passion, creativity, and a thirst for knowledge and adventure.  Being raised in the desert, the Pacific Northwest\'s majestic landscape keeps us inspired and in constant awe. We spend every chance we get exploring and appreciating. Jumping in swimming holes, exploring abandoned farms, finding waterfalls, or just laying in the soil  watching clouds and telling each other stories. \r\n     \r\nAs a host we feel honored to be a part of folks journeys. Our hearts are forever traveling and enjoying life to-the-tooth and we take pride in implementing our passions into giving our fellow wayfarers a truly unique and \'us\' experience. We strive to provide the lodging and host experience that we would want and that honors the hard work that comes before plane tickets and lodging and the sensation of which lingers long after the return trip home. \r\n    \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/a5e5dd23-772c-4ca6-8325-d687c83b79da.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(173567336,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/173567336','Jake','Portland, OR','I love to travel and believe the best experiences are ones where you get to know the local culture. Between travels I\'d love to host you on your adventures to Oregon and the beautiful Pacific Northwest I call home!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/93c833c7-2f77-4a16-884c-15a8faf27d3b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38610656,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38610656','Kari','Portland, OR','Hello! I am an acrobatics coach and variety performer (circus and dance). Like any good Pacific Northwesterner, I love the outdoors! I spend my free evenings salsa dancing, and I share my home with one awesome cat and two fabulous housemates on the main level. I\'m always game for Vietnamese food, and will never turn down a bite (or two) of dark chocolate.\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ed3e5b69-d61a-4a60-afec-f4e21f9d1745.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34537748,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34537748','Richard And Maureen','Portland, OR','I have lived in Portland, Oregon  since 2000.  I live with my wife and our son and love to be outside and learn new things.  I work as a cook and union activist. We are excited to share our new guesthouse after a year of getting it built.  We love Portland and  our neighborhood and we hope you do too. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-34537748/original/587bd52d-c2ab-44a3-98d9-e3c973fbb9b1.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(97623766,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/97623766','Sarah','Portland, OR','We’ve lived in our neighborhood for 17+ years and love recommending local spots to our guests! We provide a binder  with a lot of recommendations for restaurants, hiking, and other Portland adventures. \n\nWe are both working professionals, and our dog Dobby is a professional door greeter and napper. Sarah was previously a property manager and Burton can fix just about anything. We do our best to keep our Airbnb current and fresh for each guest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ab3aa7b-1c1d-4e3d-8919-1c21d33db889.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(86380272,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/86380272','Raychel','Portland, OR','I love to cook, eat, garden, work with my hands, build and design things.  I Cherish time to be with my friends and family.  I love the rain. I love a good bottle of wine with good company.  I welcome book recommendations and recipes you can’t live without.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-86380272/original/978e5f48-6d23-4783-95cb-7e483418fbcc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18671930,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18671930','Robin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/18671930/profile_pic/1406065627/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31768062,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31768062','Faith','Portland, OR','I am a creative, independent, self-employed artist and designer. I have a small hat company sewing hats from recycled materials. I also founded, toured and performed with,  and continue to manage a big band performance ensemble called MarchFourth! (www.m4mb.com)\r\n\r\nI love to travel, make art, sew, read, dance, cook, ride bikes, hike and explore nature, celebrate, and make new connections. Right now I\'m learning to play double bass, my first instrument! I love music. I\'m also an identical twin!\r\n\r\nI\'m a mellow person, very self-sufficient and easy-going. I like people but do just fine on my own too. I am respectful, tidy, and conscientious, especially in someone else\'s home.\r\n\r\nThanks for reading!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3ecdee25-1988-4af6-a8b6-a945332497fc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6034282,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6034282','Laura','Portland, OR','Hello! I am a nurse with a love of gardening, hiking and food. My husband Michael and I enjoy sharing our home through Airbnb, and look forward to hosting you in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6034282/original/e7af5f32-104f-4643-881c-c80702094814.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65899399,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65899399','Liz And Brian','Portland, OR','We are two Portland makers — Liz, an artist and designer, and Brian, a boatbuilder and carpenter. We just renovated our 110-year old home top to bottom, with lots of custom-built, locally salvaged touches, and we’re excited to share it with you. You may see us around — gardening or working on a project in the yard, or building a kayak on our front porch mini-shop. Say hi — we’re always happy to share our favorite spots both in and out of Portland. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/82cb9732-6a8d-4fc2-98fe-1d712fff66c3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25806993,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25806993','Carol','Portland, OR','I am a retired teacher.  My favorite things in life are my husband, grandchildren, gardening, travel, books and friends.  Best things: wine and conversation in our garden ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25806993/profile_pic/1420748819/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12575059,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12575059','Pascal','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12575059/profile_pic/1433699935/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4162970,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4162970','Petra','Portland, OR','I am an Airbnb host by day, glamorous circus performer by night! My hobbies include exercising, drawing, watching movies, and eating snacks. My favorite food is popcorn! I am an extremely clean and tidy person because my house is my sanctuary.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4162970/original/66bcc2ee-2497-457c-929e-1745c452efbe.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14796564,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14796564','Chad','Portland, OR','I am a soccer fanatic!  I coach, play and I am a fan of the Portland Timbers, Liverpool Reds, USWNT and USMNT.  I have traveled to watch 6 FIFA World Cups!  I have 3 kids and have been married over 25 years.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/150cdcb5-0f1f-4a7f-aa18-62cbe4c2778c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4702475,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4702475','Cj','Portland, OR','No description on file.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e7c91ab0-724f-4340-80ce-3bcaaf9a68a9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4564432,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4564432','Ann','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4dff5630-686a-4b5f-becf-d8f79a0ed98e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(83388023,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/83388023','Geoffrey','','I am a middle aged man with two AirBnb spaces of my own. In addition to hosting many amazing guests, I also run a small plastics business that has a focus on automotive products ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3f4665d5-3420-434b-bd65-05a6e3637028.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25079470,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25079470','Rachel','Portland, OR','I am originally from England, but lived in California between 1996 and 2017. I love  the outdoors and recently moved to Portland for new adventures. On the weekends you will find me biking or hiking.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bbf5e8a3-d03c-4945-8db1-c3003d7ca72c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51010038,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51010038','Martin','Portland, OR','Widower.  I am starting a new life after living with my late wife for 35 years.  \r\n\r\nGrant me the serenity to accept the things I cannot change,\r\nthe courage to change the things I can,\r\nand the wisdom to know the difference.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/871f2ce1-4c3f-4aaa-afa6-bb3160883458.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7288374,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7288374','Tina','Portland, OR','Hi. I\'m Tina. I have traveled the world over yet I am happy to have called Portland my home for over 30 years. I can\'t imagine a more amazing place to live. I work from home as a counselor and math coach, helping kids on their way to college. Naturally I enjoy kids of all ages and I particularly welcome families in  my home. There used to be three kids running around this house. Now I’ve got plenty of room! I look forward to sharing my favorite spots with you and helping to make your stay in Portland fun, nourishing, and comfortable. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7288374/profile_pic/1403938499/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(177257126,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/177257126','James','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d8969fbc-2b11-4be4-9dd8-d357e26e626a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2135334,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2135334','Todd','Portland, OR','Surfer, traveler, lover of fine food and drinks. I was a coffee roaster in an earlier life and a maker of fine cocktails in this current one. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e80bb2c-c882-43d5-a56f-91f7b42edf8a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(98560,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/98560','Michelle','Portland, OR','We lived in Portland, Oregon, for 23 years.  We now spend as much time as possible in our vacation home in Central Mexico and traveling the world, but keep a townhouse in Portland that we rent out as a vacation rental when we are not using it.  So, we look at renting from an owner\'s perspective and will take great care of any place that we rent .  And, since we also rented out our home in Mexico for many years, we truly understand what it takes to make a great vacation rental and how to assure that our guests are very comfortable and happy with their stay.  \r\n\r\nMichelle and Terry Fitzpatrick',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a74b9453-5d42-458b-948f-aad042df8307.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(178501752,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/178501752','Victor','Portland, OR','Hello to all my dearest Airbnb guests! I love to travel whenever possible and appreciate the various cultures around the world. I want you to enjoy your stay in this space that I\'ve designed with travelers in mind.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/27f87470-b029-4cee-b523-21783330c39a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(99241770,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/99241770','Annie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/53d57049-ddb3-4ee5-9713-054ce814c6cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1396103,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1396103','Mary And Stephen','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in Portland since college (20+years) and absolutely love it here! I\'m well suited to the weather, both gloomy days and sunny, and love how wonderfully weird Portland can be. In addition to hosting this airbnb, I am employed as a social worker, photographer and mom to two rowdy boys. My partner Steve works in construction and is always available if any issues arise during your stay. We hope you enjoy your time in Portland as much as we do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1396103/profile_pic/1321031241/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(486872,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/486872','Marla','Portland, OR','Love to travel and eat good food. Also love Calvin & Hobbes :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9e668933-dbf6-4a92-ab2a-9f8eb07fea6f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(72165971,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/72165971','Anna','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0e7873fc-e55a-4bc4-9041-34b9239ac5f7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21774902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21774902','Tony','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd536c2d-8cd7-4559-911d-5d8253ccc91d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18775566,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18775566','Scott','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/25688518-11b9-4fe9-bb96-3a77a1df365e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(164140913,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/164140913','Eric','Eagle, CO','I’m the father of 2 great boys.  I work hard,love to spend time with my kids, love the outdoors/travel.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/eae9f040-700e-4a83-809f-2011fab70b06.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45297070,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45297070','Mark','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1e3b92f8-8328-4732-9f49-71898b3568f1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(97329823,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/97329823','Amy & Becca','Portland, OR','We are sisters, housemates and travel buddies.  We grew up in northern Arizona but have lived in and loved Portland for 20+ years.  We enjoy exploring our own city as well as neighborhoods, cities and countries around the world.  We\'ve been happy vacation rental users for decades (long before the convenience of AirBNB) and when we recently added a guest cottage to our home (known as an ADU here in Portland) we were thrilled to get to return the favor we\'ve enjoyed for so long and share our cottage with fellow travelers. Our travel wish list is long, and we look forward to many new adventures.   (Hablamos español, y queremos decir \"bienvenidos\" a nuestros huéspedes quienes hablan español.)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3919a285-1f88-4742-86d8-2c04e9e3cc43.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2393210,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2393210','Melissa','Portland, OR','After growing up in Hawaii and being in the hospitality industry for over 10 years,  I now rent out my own family condo, as well as help close family friends with their rentals-by-owner. I pride myself on knowing that these wonderful rentals are truly a perfect oasis, and our guest’s comfort is our top priority.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/44bb5e2b-f240-4fb4-bf1a-e46466c0414f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(181896912,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/181896912','Jennifer','Portland, OR','I’m a single mom to a teen boy; I am a nanny to a sweet 4 & 5yo. I adore my rescue puppy & our 7 chickens (5 raised from chick & 2 rescues); I volunteer with the Scouts; I enjoy spending time working in my native habitat garden; I enjoy geocaching, traveling, spending time with family, hiking/biking/camping/kayaking, exploring our amazing city and state, as well as taking trips to Disneyland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-181896912/original/e866a842-dd73-4c40-a12e-b2c58caaf7b4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3587672,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3587672','Susan','Portland, OR','I’m an at-home mom of one teenager and one young adult. I enjoy traveling, cycling, and spending time with my family.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/322cb39d-8dd7-4c12-ab6b-2f615886ce71.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31725411,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31725411','Stephanie','Portland, OR','I\'m a minimalist who enjoys travel, social justice, culture, and outdoors shenanigans. Currently live in beautiful Oregon and frequently visit the East Coast to spend time with family and friends. Cheers!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-31725411/original/ee583eac-3d0e-444a-aebc-c9000bea24fd.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73175514,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73175514','Eli','Portland, OR','I teach at Portland State University. Love outdoors and city life in Portland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e82e939f-53e4-46bb-b294-87b9bb397344.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46600469,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46600469','Matt','Portland, OR','I love travel - work or pleasure, with my kids or with my friends, old places and new!  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ad3124d3-23cc-4e20-baf1-68f1861d6a20.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42090658,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42090658','Nick','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/9b603dd8-c975-48cd-a075-29da7cfebb74.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25375623,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25375623','Ileana','Portland, OR','I’m from Massachusetts but I’ve lived in Portland since 1998. My husband and I are both professionals in health care. We have 2 sons: ages 7 and 10 and a family dog. We enjoy spending time outdoors gardening, hiking, at the mountains and cooking at home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6dab62a7-472a-4d82-b0fb-9fe4e6037f53.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56752027,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56752027','Abbie & Jeff','','Hi!  We are Oregonians that live part of the year in Guatemala City where we do humanitarian work.  We have 3 girls and keep our family home in Portland which we love sharing with other people when we are out of the country.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/21f91f28-3ba5-4a0f-8a9e-d7cdc4017ba4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(184330974,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/184330974','April','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/217431b5-a17b-4f73-ab35-9e0d39fa7aff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50378629,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50378629','Milinn','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a691e00c-85dc-48f4-a9c7-634e86019541.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(185071931,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/185071931','Aimee & David','Portland, OR','We are thrilled to be able to offer our space to guests near and far. We both love to travel and spend as much time as possible outdoors. We love hiking and gardening, and have explored much of the city and the surrounding area. If you need any recommendations for places to see and things to do while visiting, don\'t hesitate to ask! We look forward to meeting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f4361b7e-556f-423d-b56f-e368cea84066.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111978787,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111978787','Chris','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/407351fb-e6a8-4e16-8275-66df2fbe3e3b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5302649,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5302649','Emily','Eugene, OR','Carpenter and archivist. We love traveling, dive bars, reading books and our kitty Fancy Feet.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/abe1b325-8719-4839-bb0b-f6c1bb4274d5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6746145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6746145','Dana','Portland, OR','I am from Portland, Oregon by way of California and New York.  I work as a nurse practitioner and I love to ride my bike, dance, swim, hike, work in my garden, look at mushrooms, eat chocolate, make pottery and travel.  Some of our favorite vacations have been to Spain (Mediterranean), Costa Rica and Cuba. We love hosting travelers in our Portland garden cottage! I use she/her pronouns.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b82f4eba-f8ef-40dc-aa31-e8dfc1d3a995.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3823371,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3823371','Zoe','Portland, OR','I am originally from Sun Valley, Idaho but after moving around quite a bit, I have settled in the best neighborhood in Portland, OR... the NW/ Pearl District. I travel quite a bit for work (and play), enough where the TSA agents at the airport know me by name!  Text: 310.902.818\n\nThought it would be fun to rent out my place while I am gone and meet some other people while traveling. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eaa9fc44-1cc7-4255-b3aa-cd0d0e00b5e6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3635384,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3635384','Brianna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/633b4a44-2f84-4354-8f70-ba78828ea30e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63093092,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63093092','Ken','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ba1e2dd8-f18c-4809-bae7-63e26c2b4f34.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(186181978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/186181978','Robert','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d3187b97-c4c6-422d-9151-2c230bae949f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121596159,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121596159','Alex','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/13793764-6c35-4584-87d1-5d0b4b1ce950.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48754857,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48754857','Beverly','Allentown, PA','We are a retired couple from Bucks County, Pennsylvania. We visit our daughters often in Portland. We enjoy being downtown in the bustling city but love that we can enjoy the mighty Willamette river right outside our door. The walking biking/ bath is steps away. Our little Bischon loves her walks too.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47f6b31b-817f-4c00-8945-cbf8b2c5205d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(186502539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/186502539','Teddi','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-186502539/original/5a1353c6-5211-490c-9e38-344e1b226aa2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(529068,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/529068','Trish','Portland, OR','I am an Artist and Interior designer! Trishgrantham.com \n\nTrishgranthamdesign.com ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-529068/original/9045d986-13cb-4809-b22b-3e075eaf9f95.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1538000,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1538000','Aidan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0909ac1f-a1df-43e5-9ed7-ee16ac7dd5b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11816483,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11816483','Atty','Portland, OR','I\'m a licensed Acupuncturist and also host our cottage with my husband Otto.  We love to see new sights, explore cities and also get out into nature and the big trees.  So happy to live in the Great NorthWest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3a7f4d38-8f58-454b-9887-63e7e2ab42b1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(164973855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/164973855','Dave','Portland, OR','Dave and Kerri are long-time Airbnb Superhosts committed to a clean, safe and enjoyable experience in their bungalow, located in Westmoreland and near Sellwood. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c240650-35d9-4258-b7d2-37d16171524c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(187734201,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/187734201','Mike','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b66ee464-1f5b-4fe9-88c5-d09483873a78.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4105484,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4105484','- We Are Mary & George','Portland, OR','Welcome!\nWe met in San Diego where we bonded with each other and with the sea. We were married in 1980 and raised our family in this house. Now, just Mary and George live here. We have two grandchildren and several great nieces and nephews. \nMary is a popular health and fitness specialist, Pilates and MELT instructor at a local college and in her private home studio. She is passionate about her work and loves working with her many clients.  \nGeorge is active in property management when he\'s not serving as a teacher, counselor and group facilitator. He likes surfing and listens to Latin and finger-style guitar music. \nMary was born here, went to Portland State... So be careful, because she\'s a proud native Oregonian!  \nGeorge grew up in Los Angeles County, but don\'t tell anybody. He\'s still infatuated with the Golden State, even though he\'s lived in Portland longer than most locals.  \nWe\'ve hosted friends from all over the world and we\'re eager to meet you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/14d8aa88-5857-4066-ad8e-eeac8215023a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4089776,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4089776','Joseph','Portland, OR','I\'m a native Oregonian and Portlander. I work as a free-lance user experience designer which is a fancy way of saying I listen to people and use common sense to make products more user-friendly, intuitive, and delightful. I\'ve used my craft to design and perfect our short-term rental spaces and service offerings. This creative process has been incredibly rewarding and fun. \n\nI\'m well traveled, a nature lover, and just generally curious about the world around me. Wonderful to meet you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f215e6e7-6ad8-4622-bbf0-e6920ae67e32.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10872163,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10872163','Melissa','Portland, OR','Artist, educator, urban cyclist who loves to travel but loves coming home to The Rose City. We fell in love with the PNW and relocated to Portland a few years ago after living in the Bay Area and east coast. Our Little Garden House was born in the spring of 2018, and since then we\'ve made constant improvements to the house as well the landscaping to create a more serene and comfortable experience for our guests. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10872163/profile_pic/1390168573/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6989528,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6989528','Erin','Portland, OR','I enjoy traveling, eating good food and relaxing. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/76dfa49c-4f61-4bd7-830c-8beecb2823ad.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21443934,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21443934','Eric','Portland, OR','I Moved to Portland in Oct. 2013. I am an engineering/physics geek who likes bicycling, hiking and occasionally go out for a beer/wine.  I enjoy meeting from all around the world and exchanging culture.  I like gardening & little bit of house projects as a hobby.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/09d898c7-9758-4a4a-b93d-baf0e3f59237.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(188778344,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/188778344','Daria','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9e1cd85b-ffad-4e1d-8533-d3cee05578cc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42173408,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42173408','Barbara','Portland, OR','Living in Portland for 28 years - 27 years in our current home - we are now hosting guests in our newly constructed Guest House!   As an architect, I focused primarily on historic properties most frequently located in National Parks. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d871996f-cb2a-4763-ab5c-eb0d12879735.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4687912,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4687912','Amrita','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Bangalore India, but happily call Portland, OR home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/754b9045-271b-4098-ad3a-2d90db7998eb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2066656,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2066656','Greg And Sarah','Portland, OR','We are a couple who moved and married here 23 years ago. We love to travel and meet people from around the world.  We have two beautiful daughters who are venturing out in the world to do amazing things.  We love where we live and are excited to share the experience of the North West with guests. We love the outdoors, good food, good friends, caring for our century old property, and our dog Theo.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ddd2da9d-398e-4b32-96db-a45ee3ddd34f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(189444467,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/189444467','Madison','Portland, OR','I love to travel and am excited to share the condo I love with other fellow travelers.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f50020e9-c535-4f62-9cf2-983dc5bd38d4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(168608697,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/168608697','Lee','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/91031db7-31d1-4c5c-8e38-236fd7565331.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21467169,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21467169','Margaret','Houston, TX','After living in Houston for 30 years, we finally visited the Pacific Northwest and fell in love with Portland. We love the wonderful, sometimes quirky, neighborhoods and the beautiful outdoor spaces. The food scene is pretty fantastic, too. It\'s great to be able to share our Portland house with others, but keep in mind that you may not want to leave. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0543f7df-369e-403b-aae4-e848e7e72b47.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(190340428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/190340428','Slabtown','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57f0580a-b237-4f80-bdc1-e389ef3b3d40.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52609760,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52609760','Becky','Portland, OR','Mom/entrepreneur/traveler',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/ed1915b2-06b9-4837-a365-03e63f2bdf0d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20955447,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20955447','Helen','Portland, OR','最大的梦想是周游世界 有了Airbnb可以轻松的梦想成真 每一次身在异国他乡 都会遇到贴心的房东 终于有一天 自己也可以做房东了 结交世界各地的朋友们',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9668860e-4366-433d-a4d4-e25fb997a3ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(190656099,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/190656099','Aaron','','Life long Traveller and now a gregarious host!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4cf6d00a-df99-4071-ba33-98bd7bbb05bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20950189,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20950189','Justin','Portland, OR','Father, husband, runner, aspiring golfer, infrequent homebrewer. @talkamile Cofounder.\n\nIt took me 4,641 days, but my run streak has now circled the equator (24,901 miles).',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d829f7a2-7fc5-4de5-9805-661593bec796.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114699668,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114699668','Andy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/515d0b51-de42-444c-bd06-49016b5e7a69.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1858382,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1858382','Lisa & Harvey','Portland, OR','We enjoy traveling, sailing, biking, hiking, dancing and birding. We are easy going, quiet, responsible and interested in other cultures.  I speak a bit of French and Arabic and learning Spanish. Harvey speaks Italian, Spanish, Portuguese as well as some French and German.  \r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1858382/profile_pic/1340176427/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12447921,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12447921','Ali','Portland, OR','We are a family of four women! Two moms and two daughters. My wife and I are both in education. We love being outside, gardening, camping, biking, and exploring the Pacific Northwest. Our guest house was built in 2018. It\'s nestled in our backyard and we\'ve enjoyed meeting many of our Airbnb guests!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/310ab929-6112-426d-b576-744917de5759.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8138210,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8138210','Clea','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d23a9ad0-ca5a-4904-b754-af463457b0b9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16996867,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16996867','Melissa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2b74bc87-c01e-4ca8-9b71-d000e25281e4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(191982844,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/191982844','Mark','Portland, OR','I love travel but call Portland home.  I love it for the community, access to the outdoors and commitment to craft that it provides.  In my free time I enjoy cycling, photography, and coffee. I love to travel and host people who do. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/639946e6-95e1-4a97-8c5c-d85e412be99e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50525845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50525845','Andria','Portland, OR','I am a winemaker and also work in the wine industry as a wine competition consultant and tech support for wine competition software',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24d0682b-f129-49d8-a49b-a77dadb5321b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35257956,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35257956','Jill','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b6b92829-6e79-4646-8856-96a06becaac4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(192136110,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/192136110','Dave','Portland, OR','Hi everybody I\'m David. My wife Tammi and I live in Portland, Oregon, have two Golden Retrievers Gaia & Elli  and a cuddly caddy Nala. Tammi and I love traveling as well as hosting and we\'re very excited to be part the air BNB community!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ab9d2bdc-d01e-4714-bb80-d36c87095678.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5337178,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5337178','Selena','Portland, OR','Hello,\r\nI\'m very excited to be here! I have had so many friends tell me how wonderful Airbnb and I plan to use it whenever I travel.  I\'m a very open-minded and relaxed person, that loves different cultures and languages. One of my goals is to see as much of this earth as possible in this lifetime. I\'m very respectful of others and will respect your home that you so graciously allow me to stay in. I\'m looking forward to meeting new people and creating new connections with people from all over the world. \r\n\r\n Music is something I cannot live without. Everywhere I go I like seeing live music. I cannot live without music, good food, love, and water. I enjoy sports and having a good conversation with good company.\r\n\r\nAs a guest I am somewhat independent, but love to get to know people as well. I like to travel to places tourist do not go to. Spending time with the locals is more important to me than with other travelers. Although I like spending time with anyone who is nice and I especially like funny relaxed people.  I love seeing the real culture (not tourist culture) of a place I visit is important to me.\r\n\r\nI believe as humans we are fundamentally more alike then not. We all want love and respect and to make meaningful connections.\r\n\r\nI\'m truly looking forward to meeting new friends an making some meaningful connections.\r\n\r\nWith peace,\r\n\r\nSelena :) ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5337178/profile_pic/1398716016/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(844971,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/844971','Laura','Portland, OR','Can\'t live without: sunshine, salt water (swimming!), a good book and The New Yorker, exploring new places and, most of all, my family. \r\n\r\nA few of the most memorable trips I\'ve taken: Western Ireland, Panama, Paris, Madrid, Zihuatanejo, and Sooke Harbor.\r\n\r\nI am ever hopeful. Also: passionate dreamer, nonrev traveler, someday sommelier, living proof of severe mercy, and...very lucky auntie.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/844971/profile_pic/1336356440/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3142393,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3142393','Amy','Portland, OR','Outgoing, outdoorsy, mom and small business owner. We have homes in Oregon, Idaho, Utah & Washington. Whether you are looking for an adventure, business trips or a longer term visit, we want you to feel at home when you #StayinMyDistrict.\nLooking for a longer Stay? #InvestREPM We market furnished rentals with all the amenities of a vacation rental, set-up for 30+ nights. Great for relocation, temporary assignments and for those in transition.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b93ea6f-9fca-446d-b92b-fa87d33320f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121226154,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121226154','Cam','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2570e885-141d-46e1-826a-4fe92cff58ef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10375423,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10375423','Myrhiah','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m an avid traveler and Airbnb Superhost. I\'m excited to explore your amazing city.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5bcd81b-3c88-4736-873f-87a113e64b2b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32534040,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32534040','Leslie','Portland, OR','We are long-time Portlanders, and feel lucky to call this awesome city home.\r\nWe live upstairs in the main house of the Airbnb rental. We won\'t be banging around or keeping you up late with revelry. Portland has plenty of places for hi-jinx, home doesn\'t need to be one of them.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ae906081-1b6d-483e-9a2e-a9f9c4f96bfb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25328937,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25328937','Max','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e3734ea8-5320-465e-b2aa-93d9262480b3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(193265498,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/193265498','Daniel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-193265498/original/b6ff539c-2c0c-4043-ba33-37bde3f0dd26.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115974453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115974453','Beth & Dan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/483500d9-ade0-49e7-b0e3-dafeb066e39e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1770572,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1770572','Matt','Portland, OR','My wife and I love to travel and have been to lots of great places around the world..We love to share travel with friends and family and try to involve others on our outings. We try and do at least one international travel annually, while we sprinkle in lots of little fun trips along the way. Hopefully we have as much success on AirBnB as we\'ve heard others have. Call with any questions....503.849.9712',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1770572/profile_pic/1329688421/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19936260,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19936260','Laura','Portland, OR','Our family of four loves the outdoors. We spent a year traveling around the world staying in Airbnbs and it is our pleasure to host people from around the world at our properties. I love meditation, yoga, scuba diving, hiking and spending time with family / friends. As a guest, and fellow Airbnb host, I try to be low maintenance, eat simply and can be social or not.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19936260/original/74513d42-1441-445e-ae2a-707a6a9f3fe2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(193973403,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/193973403','Matthew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/14de5d0c-4857-4ed1-81db-a378eccb2ddb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(176106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/176106','Laura','Portland, OR','I am a story midwife and memory activist. I am the co-founder/co-director of a local non-profit that amplifies, honors Amd preserves silenced histories of our region. I am originally from Milan, Italy, and now live in beautiful Portland, OR with my husband Andrew and our bambina Viola.\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cfdd2dda-e6fc-451e-9dad-74643a1d7a3a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23432303,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23432303','Eric','Portland, OR','Friendly and laid back healthcare professionals living the good life in Portland, Oregon  :-)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f0e0f217-0a58-4c15-8559-eeb0e671a61e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32875749,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32875749','Nadia','Portland, OR','Hi there!  We love Portland and hope you\'ll love it too! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a1da12bc-28b0-4936-8ced-863e68135962.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9649928,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9649928','Linda','Portland, OR','Leonard is a retired orchid grower. Linda is a semi- retired psychotherapist.\r\nWe enjoy our traveling guests, as well as traveling ourselves.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f1d7ffe3-59cb-48fb-810a-bc27f7ddb331.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(138761774,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/138761774','Aaron','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6171631a-52ef-478c-b296-6f46209d2966.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(156967556,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/156967556','Inna','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24ae1102-6bea-47e1-9693-3318111808ff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54782133,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54782133','Jim','Portland, OR','Hello! Welcome to  Portland!\nI  am Jim, together with my wife and two kiddos, we have lived in Portland for the past 20 years .\nWe love to travel and we love to help people enjoy the places we live in or have traveled to. \n Jenn is a teacher and Jim is a realtor. Our kids speak Japanese and Jim can speak some Spanish. \nWe love living in Portland and all that this city have to offer.\nIf you have any questions about things to do in the city, please don\'t hesitate to ask.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3f5eb6c2-8e84-422c-9534-89d3ea1d0872.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(194980036,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/194980036','Ben And Emily','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/badd6b2a-8927-46d5-a746-d4657d250702.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(194952414,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/194952414','Ashley','Portland, OR','Hi I\'m Ashley!\n\nI play banjo, write screenplays and novels for children, and teach little girls self-defense throughout Portland Public Schools. I also study Mandarin and  practice massage and somatic trauma therapy. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bdb6de8a-489a-41bb-927d-f951c2305450.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(173625187,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/173625187','Kylie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a1903d0-4d4a-4d51-bbac-44dcc0a2667d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(195007597,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/195007597','Lisa And Frank','Portland, OR','We are a family of four and my children are school aged. We love to shoot the hoops and play frisbee in front of the house when we are not hiking or exploring Oregon. We love Portland and have a lot of friends in the neighborhood.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/925aee33-f0ad-4b0c-bbc4-43bb87f796c8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4506845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4506845','Mary','Portland, OR','I\'m from Portland, OR and I love spending time with my family and friends in the outdoors and at breweries. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1ecdd3ab-a568-4670-be68-319844f9a12e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13080438,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13080438','Stacy','Portland, OR','When I travel, I prefer Airbnb accommodations because I enjoy staying in neighborhoods and away from touristy areas. The Airbnb apartment that I host offers travelers the same opportunity.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b3ca476e-3312-4364-b3b9-a3588eda8027.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76347703,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76347703','Drea','Portland, OR','We believe the best travel experiences are when people get closer to locals and local experiences. When that happens, people learn to cross cultural divides, gain an appreciation for their own lives, and bridge connections with those they never would have otherwise. This makes the world a better place.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/04f0dcf7-1efa-48ee-b112-13520654f253.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114569265,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114569265','Neil','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6346a55c-e1df-4698-ae9b-39d8f4474b11.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13281214,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13281214','Kate','Portland, OR','Hello!  I am an active, involved, long-time Portland resident who loves the easy access to nature that our city offers. Our beautiful parks, strong neighborhood communities, many cultural events and organizations, our commitment to recycling and sustainability, the Multnomah County Library and Powell\'s Bookstore, and the river that runs through downtown are also wonderful assets that I love.\r\n\r\nOne of the many reasons I am looking forward to being an Airbnb host is being able to offer the same opportunities I have enjoyed as a guest staying in others\' Airbnbs, Bed and Breakfasts, hostels, and hotels all over the world. I\'ve lived in France (Paris one spring and in Bordeaux for my junior year of university) and have traveled extensively throughout Europe and Asia. I have also traveled in Canada, Mexico, Central America, Morocco, Kenya, and Ecuador as well as almost every state in the US.   In opening up Grant Park Haven, I look forward to offering you the same opportunity to connect across cultures, and will do my very best to make sure you are very comfortable!\r\n\r\nSinging and music bring great joy to my life.  Currently I sing with the Portland Threshold Choir, a group that offers comfort and support to people at bedside, most often at the end of life. In the past, I\'ve sung with choirs of all kinds, as well as with friends and the folk music community.  Gardening, contradancing, camping, hiking, backpacking, and swimming are also some of the things that I greatly enjoy.  I volunteer at the library, and with other community organizations. I also take pleasure in and appreciate connecting with people from all walks of life through good conversations over a cup of tea or coffee, or a glass of wine.\r\n\r\nI have been a Licensed Massage Therapist for 37 years and have a part-time practice in my home.  Please let me know if you would be interested in scheduling a massage while you\'re staying here.\r\n\r\nMy aspiration is to live this amazing life I\'ve been given with kindness, empathy, deep listening, and joy.  I look forward to meeting you, and to sharing Portland with you.\r\n\r\nKate',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b2f6f6e5-1586-468c-b5e6-6acaab91ae22.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(101565574,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/101565574','Keely','Portland, OR','We are a family of four living in the beautiful Pacific NW with a love for nature, arts and culture, music, travel, exploration, gardening, hiking, discovering the best picnic spots around, reading, writing, learning, relaxing, and more!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cd6fac7c-aa35-456b-864d-b4404a303af3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73663145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73663145','Julianne','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65d84396-3e4d-4155-943d-e9726590d611.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(190120922,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/190120922','Louise','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Louise, I\'m a  life long Portland resident..\r\nMy husband and I enjoy traveling, especially beach time, spending time with family and friends.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/35356855-a4cb-4a41-a6ad-ee1cb0c73a10.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(196865274,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/196865274','Loretta','Portland, OR','Hi!  I am a private practice attorney specializing in contract, corporate and real estate law.  I live in Portland and am available to answer any questions.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/11b7eb57-0b39-4c36-ad86-74ec57e12125.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(92131086,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/92131086','Lauren','Portland, OR','Native Oregonian.\n\nI have two cats, who are like my children! Their names are Gus-Gus and Scout.\n\nNext on my travel bucket list: New Zealand, Hawaii, Wales, and Greece.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a3f3e22a-dc1f-45ec-9322-164b668b241f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62800380,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62800380','Kelbe & Susanna','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7f59c2a1-e772-4189-b621-a6e612a8b682.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(197760682,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/197760682','Lynn','Portland, OR','Software industry management turned happy Airbnb host… but mostly a mom to my three kiddos. Happy Portlander since 2012 by way of Boston and Charlotte, NC. Originally from Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3e80b5d9-4d39-4996-a7a8-c1b9a2d0b42b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7488923,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7488923','Aric & Erin','Portland, OR','Aric & Erin are based in Portland, OR, and are lovers of architecture, design, and the outdoors. We\'ve renovated both a Saul Zaik home (\"Holzhutte\") and Pietro Belluschi\'s first commissioned home (The \"Sutor House\" - featured in Dec 2017 Dwell Magazine). When we\'re not playing with power tools, we\'re skiing or hiking on Mt. Hood, enjoying great food & wine in PDX, or traveling ourselves.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e3a3a883-7cf9-4724-b6fb-80ed0f6bff4e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29763138,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29763138','Amelia (Mengmeng)','Portland, OR','I love traveling and staying at different Airbnbs when I travel!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ed2a960-f40c-4a61-9b38-9ea1453d729a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34926669,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34926669','John','Portland, OR','As a Traveler\r\nI enjoy being with my family and whatever makes them happy makes me happy. You will never find me backpacking through Nepal or going to places where no one has ever gone before. Give me electricity, clean running water and modern plumbing. My first questions when traveling are is there Cable TV (it doesn\'t even have to be in English) and is there A/C? It is not a deal breaker if not but it tells me a lot about the level of comfort I can expect (I am a reluctant traveler).\r\nAs a Host\r\nI am a life long Oregonian and LOVE Portland. We moved to this neighborhood in 2018 but moved here because there is so much to do. Please let me know if you have any questions that I can help you with.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be5ea2ec-6b1f-4833-aa01-fc04a7eac314.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(421792,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/421792','Jesse','Portland, OR','I love guests and have a desire to share the world with my children. A background in event planning, hospitality, journalism and education has given me the opportunity to host in many venues--but my favorite is here at home. Im a forest therapy guide, flower essence alchemist and childbirth educator/doula. I spend my spare time in the garden, hiking and reading about sustainability or meeting the flower fairies in the woods. I love local food feasts, storytelling, yoga, gardening and meeting new people. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a268daf7-8042-4cc4-bb67-9e8e9ab75767.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1308879,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1308879','Laura','Keizer, OR','I\'ve traveled all over the country and through Europe. There are only 4 states I have not spent at least a week exploring, and Portland was my favorite city to visit. I loved it so much I moved there in 2004 and lived there for over 12 years! I love the music, the people, the art, the rivers, the hiking, the food, and the proximity to the mountains and the ocean. Oregon truly is a beautiful place from top to bottom!  That\'s why I host Airbnb travelers in my downtown condo. \n\nWhen I travel, I look for places that have unique and cozy Airbnb\'s near my favorite things - nature, amazing food, and live music or experiences. \n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e6f6de93-33da-4e3d-b2ce-915e49bd7420.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44119978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44119978','Laura','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f818f2f5-b703-48f5-bb54-9b2b84dbd9ff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2917007,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2917007','Gray','Portland, OR','I am an avid outdoor enthusiast and nature lover. I also enjoy spending time exploring cities old and new.  I am always up for new adventures.  I am kind, respectful and eager to share...',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9036d5f2-983b-463a-af8e-a13d95799f75.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5190363,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5190363','John','Portland, OR','I grew up in Ohio and lived in Colorado, California, Boston, Idaho and Washington State before moving to Portland in 1990. As a longterm volunteer with The Borneo Project and Green Empowerment I\'ve taught alternative technology and mapmaking to indigenous peoples in Malaysia and learned about their ancient cultures and endangered forests. I\'m a retired builder, I bake sourdough bread and I\'m a licensed Shiatsu massage therapist. My wife Edith Mirante is an author of travel books and we have enjoyed Air Bnb stays in locations including Vienna and New Orleans. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/51ba5d81-9ea3-4d2b-a372-839a1bb69996.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13080376,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13080376','Don','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b09d5f0e-9771-4839-b6ff-7f469278b781.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18835888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18835888','Nate','Portland, OR','My wife, Stephanie, our toddler, Beatrice, our two dogs, Rudy and Lurtz, and our cat, Tiny Nuggins welcome you to our guest house (don’t worry, our animals are never invited into your space)!\n\nStephanie and I have traveled extensively with Airbnb and hope to offer you the same fantastic experiences we’ve enjoyed during our adventures!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8aacf739-a939-4dbf-a200-a6b96a7be41f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1326395,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1326395','Catherine','Portland, OR','I have now been in Portland for twelve years and I love to share what I know of the city with others. My own free time is spent doing yoga, reading books, dancing, cooking, sking, going to book readings, or trying new things. I\'m early to bed, early to rise, responsible and honest. \n\n I really can\'t wait to travel but have been spending a lot of energy getting rooted here in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6607be15-a600-40ea-938c-fd1cffca5de8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50687779,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50687779','Julie','Portland, OR','Educator, wife and mother of a wonderful 19 year old. My husband and I have over 60 years in public education and have decided to share our love of learning to take a risk to open our new, beautiful second home to new people. Love of travel, animals, reading and working out we aim to make your stay with us second to none. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/99883551-b7aa-49a5-89a1-78827713042e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3239276,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3239276','Randy','Portland, OR','portland oregon writer',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/60d20366-67da-4548-8458-f9ac89d7a229.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11476964,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11476964','Darlene And Michael','Santa Rosa, CA','Hi! We are your hosts! We own the main house and are available to you for any questions or concerns. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-11476964/original/c8f43650-0474-4cae-98df-f03219bd939a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6236702,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6236702','Joe And Debbie','Portland, OR','Joe and I are Portland educators (PPS).  We moved to the pacific northwest for its beauty.  We love to backpack, canoe, kayak, raft, climb and hike.  We are empty nesters during the school year but our two children join us during most summers.  Portland provides the best of city life and backcountry access.  Our home is ideally located in the SE Portland; just an hour from the mountain, 1.5 hours from the coast, close to wine country and more.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6236702/profile_pic/1396216962/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33471709,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33471709','Jeff & Kim','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/33471709/profile_pic/1431753112/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(203150897,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/203150897','Craig & Sawv','Portland, OR','My husband and I, along with our two girls, have lived in Sellwood since 2003.  We love Sellwood so much we\'ve lived in 3 different houses in the neighborhood. \r\n \r\nWe spend our leisure time gardening, biking, eating, and traveling.  We enjoy exposing our kids to lots of experiences and different cultures, but we always find we love coming back home to Portland at the end of the day.   ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/32fe23f1-2b22-4aa4-8e90-89ee0941b538.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(120016557,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/120016557','Jean','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m a native Oregonian and I was born and raised in southern Oregon on the coast.  I have lived in Portland for the past 20+ years working and raising 2 daughters.  Living in the PNW affords so many opportunities to experience life at it\'s fullest. Some of my favorites are shopping the small, local districts in Portland, finding delicious food at every turn, and as often as possible heading out to the wineries to see what\'s new or driving up the Columbia River Gorge to hike or bask in it\'s beautiful terrain. I\'m also a Real Estate Broker, Licensed in Oregon and love that job too. If you\'re planning a move to Portland or the surrounding areas and need help, feel free to reach out. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4881bd97-4fbd-48d9-8cba-4624158df25b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(102525527,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/102525527','Angela','Portland, OR','House lover, design lover, travel lover, business owner and mom of 2!  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-102525527/original/4bfd3058-4376-464c-b9e4-65fb8f652da5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1978398,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1978398','Sydney','Portland, OR','I love to travel and find good food! My company, Habitate, was launched from my interest in Travel, Airbnb Management, and Property Management.  We have a great team of service providers from Designers, Revenue Managers, Reservationist, Cleaners, Handy people.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1978398/profile_pic/1332294250/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(983107,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/983107','Theresa','New York, NY','World travel addict.  More for work, less for play.  Sports marketing entrepreneur. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/50bac19e-2eee-480e-8baa-11676c13a2d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(328095,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/328095','Lisa & Stew','Portland, OR','We\'re a husband and wife entrepreneur team living in Portland, Oregon. We love building projects and hosting and are hoping to one day have an actual bed and breakfast. In the meantime, we\'re loving learning the ropes through our airbnb experiences, both as hosts and guests. We\'re up for all kinds of adventures - traveling to foreign lands, swimming, biking, hiking, hosting dinner parties and dancing as much as we\'re able to while still keeping a home base in the place that we love the most, the beautiful Pacific Northwest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/19cf1dd3-fd0a-4565-b7ce-80d4b3e46f48.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(205064625,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/205064625','James','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/867e5616-46c3-43db-85ab-bcb8f2aca133.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(205079895,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/205079895','Mike','Portland, OR','Hi, airbnb helps me join two of my passions: people and real estate. I love meeting new people and learning about what interests them and where they\'re from. I have worked in residential property management and real estate sales for over 10 years. I\'ve been lucky enough to live in a number of incredible places across the country and abroad and even luckier to now call Portland home. I look forward to sharing my favorite places and experiences in Portland with you! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4fa9182f-476a-43fd-b268-818cf2d6c3cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(185187318,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/185187318','Roger','Portland, OR','I have lived in Portland for 10 years. It feels like more like home than anywhere else i have lived, I love it here. \r\n\r\nWhen I was engaged to Martha we talked about building a tiny house on our property. After weighing up different options we went ahead at the beginning of 2018 to start the build and  finished it this summer. We had been collecting reclaimed wood and American antiques for a lot longer than that to furnish it\r\n\r\nI made several furnishings myself such as the sliding barn door, tables and shelves, all from reclaimed wood. We have loved incorporating our finds and ideas into our tiny house and hope you enjoy it.\r\n\r\nI also love to paint and have several art pieces in the courtyard and designed and painted the greeting sign post too. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e3b50891-e889-406e-abf4-8c325ab29c32.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62261998,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62261998','ITrip Vacations','Portland, OR','Our core focus is to be the best property managers in the small region we operate in. We live and die by our guests, our owners, and the experiences they have while working with us.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8bf554c4-a565-4172-b058-08f0de291dca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32155407,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32155407','Jeff','Portland, OR','I live in Portland with my wife, Sue, and our two Jack Russells, Bucky and Louise. We\'re empty-nesters now (both kids on the East Coast).   While Portland has been our home for more than 30 years,  I’m often out enjoying the great Oregon outdoors on the Coast and in Central Oregon.  Any suggestions on how to improve our house hosting are most welcomed.  Thanks.   ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/edf0f4df-4be3-47ad-ba3c-9c9c6408c48d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(71968406,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/71968406','Brenda','Portland, OR','I have traveled extensively as a solo female, am very easy going and have been hosting since 2017. I understand traveling solo as a female!  I put my heart and soul into creating this sanctuary!\n\nCurrently I live in Mexico for about 6-7 months out of the year. I practice Bikram yoga and love hip hop dancing, Latin dancing and prehispánica cultura.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/abc8152e-9a20-40d0-a97f-1c714b19c20d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1912227,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1912227','Cristin','Portland, OR','Active and outdoor loving woman living in Portland, Oregon.  I have an amazing career that keeps me busy, but in my free time I love to travel, spend time with friends, and stay active biking, hiking, and snowboarding.   I live in a beautiful place where I have amazing access to the outdoors and city life.   Portland has an amazing food and wine scene, music, and the arts.   ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f2f138d-8200-45b9-a2ff-4703bc1ce15a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11674194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11674194','Cobalt','Portland, OR','I\'m an LMT, Tensegrity Medicine Practitioner and Bowen Instructor in Portland, OR. I love hiking and outdoor activities.\r\nMy partner is a poet and I have a 7yr old daughter who loves dinosaurs and nature.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8c8fca1b-6dce-4bea-b687-980e121e9f23.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(176094166,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/176094166','Kate','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/013032ee-8630-419d-980b-501e7ba45eae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56493074,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56493074','Gala','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-56493074/original/3c233f9d-749c-4692-aada-38933e3609fa.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19259335,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19259335','Kelley','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/828c558d-45d6-435f-84f8-0b3c575dca16.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6473368,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6473368','Aimee & Shawn','Portland, OR','Prior to becoming parents, my husband and I loved to travel to see what the world has to offer. Some of our favorite spots have been Jordan, Bhutan, Myanmar, and Belize. As our family grows and matures, we hope to return to our travels and share our love of exploration with our children. With this goal in mind, we are able to offer our home to others looking to explore Portland!\r\n\r\n\'Every day we are born again. What we do today is what matters most.\' ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f7dea64a-026b-4b3b-868b-cb27f99fd6d7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29196049,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29196049','Brian And Fiona','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aeb561cd-297f-4dad-bc79-7cc3a4091d40.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(208306655,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/208306655','Erin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6249bb12-7da2-403b-bf73-3e2b09945b08.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60300963,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60300963','Naomi','Portland, OR','I’ve always loved traveling but call Portland home. I’ve been to more countries than I have states!  I’ve lived in many parts of Oregon- even Crater Lake National Park for a summer. I love training for MMA, going outside and enjoying the outdoors, working on the house or reading a book in the yard. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-60300963/original/f19f2b1a-322b-48e7-a6fc-9d688e086f2d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(208901740,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/208901740','Erica','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4aebde13-14b0-42d4-86eb-d815bd030f62.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13079204,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13079204','Evan','Portland, OR','Psychologist and social justice advocate, father to an amazing 14-year old boy... musician and wannabe chef',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-13079204/original/0ba61db5-4c93-4b51-9734-b6e77f407437.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48368540,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48368540','Ian','Portland, OR','Ian has lived in Portland for four years and loves the outdoor surroundings of Forest Park which are a short walk from the house and apartment.\n\nIan grew up in the UK and has lived in the US since 2001 and somehow kept his accent over the years. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fc367500-9527-420f-8599-d5e19f894b2c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78379504,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78379504','Angela','Portland, OR','House lover, design lover, travel lover, business owner and mom of 2!\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-78379504/original/6f1f7663-b3e7-46e3-8833-5384342ca4d0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48015500,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48015500','Bill','Portland, OR','I\'m a shoe salesman. I travel for work quite a bit. I love people & have a big old Farmhouse to share. NE 28th is an amazing place, with lots of food, wine, & great people. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5988d042-5669-48bd-9eb3-046ce669df82.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(209826108,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/209826108','Cherice And Michaela','Portland, OR','My name is Cherice. It seemed a waste to not put so much space to use. So this empty nester decided what better way to share the space then through AirBnB and what better partner than My daughter, Michaela.  Together we enjoy, travel, music, & event planning. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-209826108/original/c776d1af-8097-4e49-ad7b-220a215220d2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9819141,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9819141','Jacob','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9819141/profile_pic/1383625767/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(210219190,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/210219190','Rikki','New York, NY','My life consists of my passions for cooking, eating, music, concerts, working out, and my lovely high school sweetheart boyfriend. Born and raised in Portland, I love being able to share a taste of my city whenever I can!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6ba7e722-3ec4-4700-a997-c6e12890881f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12319817,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12319817','Mary-Yoko','Portland, OR','Retired professor of anthropology married to a professor of international business.\r\nWe share a love for travelling, intercultural studies, and are conversant in many languages including French, Spanish, German and Japanese.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/7505552e-ce10-4162-9b2e-253d05baf2ff.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132998741,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132998741','Gabrielle','Portland, OR','I’m a mad gardener, walker, reader and cat person. \r\nMy hosting style is attentive, but I work both weekend days, so you may not see me!\r\nI am always available by messaging.\r\nMy favorite thing about hosting is having people come from all over the world and, hopefully, giving them a positive, relaxed experience in my part of the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/441a567f-6696-474d-8acb-35b34222e3d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66668669,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66668669','Paul','Portland, OR','Chill N Fill',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a966c0f7-4155-4d30-8b8d-81003a2537c2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(212276052,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/212276052','Villa','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b56c579c-c221-42bc-9ab4-382b45c89161.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6127388,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6127388','J-Anthony','Fort Lauderdale, FL','Easy going traveler that likes to explore the world on my vacation time.   \nI respond fast and I prefer direct communication to explain the apartment and it\'s amenities.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/44bfbe35-3eba-4cf0-bd78-b33d27b70837.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(405092,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/405092','Brendan & Yuting','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b5d130b5-b0d7-44ee-882e-c75969eb2162.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(212650552,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/212650552','Matt','Portland, OR','Hello I\'m Matt! I enjoy spending a lot of my time traveling. When I\'m not home, my home is yours! Myself and my friends Paul and Brit are here to make your stay is as easy and comfortable as can be.\n\nEnjoy life, travel more!\n\nMatt',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/66c03635-b5a0-4a07-b003-cc8ccff74fe9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70094369,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70094369','Liam','Portland, OR','Strangely enough when I was younger I worked as a butler on an estate in NY. It was an interesting job and it taught me to have very high standards for cleanliness and service. I really enjoy being able to help provide a good stay!\n\nI\'ve also spent more than a year traveling through sites like couchsurfing and airbnb so I\'m really happy to finally be in a place to host. I know what it means to arrive in a clean,  luxurious, well thought out space when you are on the road and that\'s exactly what I can provide with my recently remodeled home.  \n\nI work as a facilitator and I\'m in graduate school to become a psychotherapist. I use to be a designer and  I built a lot of the furniture in the house. Don\'t\' worry it\'s all durable hardwood, steel, and leather that\'s designed to be used!  When I\'m left to my own devices I read fiction, psychology, and seek out real food. I stay in my airstread at another location in Portland when the house is rented but I\'m available to guests to answer questions, fix something, or give you advice on where to eat!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3ee7990c-c85d-4a14-8371-dad92b2ba77b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52327539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52327539','Camron','Portland, OR','My husband and I are fathers to two kiddos and own and operate a luxury Pacific Northwest tour company. If you\'re interested in exploring, we\'re more than happy to be a resource for your journey.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/388d4bac-ea25-473a-9cb9-62a7517a8a68.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24966798,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24966798','Patricia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c34fc9c-a599-4eeb-af21-d748927970c8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2801498,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2801498','Shannon','Portland, OR','I live in Portland - I\'m a City Planner. I love all things outdoors (soccer, climbing, surfing, backpacking). I love to explore and get to know new places. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2801498/original/3f253f3c-ca4a-4601-b966-118b92f6fdcb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4810546,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4810546','Kayla','Portland, OR','Hey there, I\'m your host, Kayla!\nAs an experienced  host, I  am truly grateful for the opportunity to share my home with folks from all over the world! I love to spend my free time gardening, going on hikes, or spending an evening reading on the porch.  I like to afford my guests as much privacy as possible and I believe my reviews speak to the experience I provide. I look forward to meeting you and opening up my home for your adventures!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5f0e6b84-c6f3-432a-b4dd-3ee7e01005d3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1797565,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1797565','Brian','Portland, OR','We love travelling and meeting new people. We like to hike, bike, paddle, garden, and cook. As travelers, we respect others’ space and leave it as good as we find it. As hosts, we try to provide all you need for a great visit. \n\nCombined, we’ve lived around the states and internationally including Ariz., Ireland, Calif., Colo., Hawaii, Maine, Mass., Mich., Minn., Mont., Nev., N.H., N.M., S.D., Utah, and Wash.\n\nWe both work for the State of Oregon in health and human services.\n\nWe are vaccinated and fully boosted for COVID. \n\nWe’ve been Airbnb hosts since 2012 and hosting at The Monta-Villa Garden Cottage in Portland, Oregon since 2019. \n\nWe’ve lived in Portland since 2013 — a medium-sized city with great food options, an eco-ethic and lots of green space. We moved to the Montavilla neighborhood in 2014 and instantly fell in love with its charm, hardworking residents and businesses, and spirit. We enjoy sharing our space and what’s great about our neighborhood. \n\nWe provide a safe and welcoming space for people identifying as LGBTQ or BIPOC and others. \n\nWe’re happy to chat or leave you to your space. Maybe see you in the garden! \n\nPlease let us know if you have any other questions!\n\nBrian & Max — he/him \nJennifer — she/her',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1797565/original/38c4dece-e41f-4344-8088-e85903f573dc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51953429,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51953429','Kenji & Lindsey','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/242ec956-4d2e-4d71-b703-0844ebbba94e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5941807,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5941807','Amber','Portland, OR','I’m a Project Manager and Producer in commercial photography, marketing and design. When I’m not working I keep myself busy with creative projects and remodeling my house. I love gardening, knitting, googling, coffee, yoga, my coyote/canine companion Arrow, and watching my plant army grow. I’ve lived in the Pacific Northwest since the early 90’s and love sharing its secrets with travelers.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b4b2e5ce-02e9-4e80-9ee1-43cac10b82cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(106844415,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/106844415','Lois','Portland, OR','My husband and I love architecture, home designs and living like a local when we visit other cities. Places we have loved to visit include: Chicago, Phoenix, San Diego and Mexico. Each city has its own vibe and architectural stamp and that is what we love about traveling.\r\n\r\nTogether we decided to bring that experience to others in the Portland area through AirBnB. We strive to give our guests the best experience when visiting the Pacific Northwest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aebfafd4-6e74-4ba2-a0db-db2ca8f5a677.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127774398,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127774398','Frank & Jessica','Eugene, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4fd7150d-9bfe-484a-8798-f830aa09a4e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(176661808,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/176661808','Angel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/51a49d99-a127-4d10-b916-47c5491c7b8d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(168060332,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/168060332','Jessica','Portland, OR','Originally from upstate NY, moved here in 2015, bought this 1st home of mine in 2018 and love this neighborhood!  Moved here to explore the outdoors, which is where you can usually find me -  hiking, xc skiing, paddleboarding and camping.  While away, I like opening up my home to anyone looking for a place to stay. I always appreciate any feedback you may have.  Enjoy your stay and look forward to having you!  - Jess',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5d8ffbdc-ee3f-4588-a55c-e5d823bfc866.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(149028,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/149028','Adrienne','Portland, OR','I\'m an artist who loves to travel. Most of the time my husband Aaron comes along on my adventures. We\'ve been using Airbnb for our stays since 2010 and we love a home away from home feel. Not only are we guests, but we are vacation rental hosts as well in Portland. I respectfully treat the homes we rent just as I would expect for mine.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8570bfd4-e989-404b-86d1-4c904ff1b7d0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(217425750,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/217425750','Brock','','I am an architectural designer, and builder, and this vision of \"Going Home\" is my latest creation.  I also teach yoga and meditation, hence you will see a lot of that influence here.  My primary passion is composing music. My biggest love is my family. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0fbf4337-84ab-4889-8a17-5c6682e947d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(994334,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/994334','Grace And Hasan','Portland, OR','We love the arts, architecture, travel, and meeting new people. We love living in Portland and are excited about sharing our city with visitors. We live with two adorable little kitties in our dreamy old Victorian home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/994334/profile_pic/1406586023/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27903183,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27903183','Farid','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/27903183/profile_pic/1424200938/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5575780,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5575780','Regan','Portland, OR','Hello! I\'m Regan. Life is for living and I enjoy the details through the simple pleasures of time in nature, special time with loved ones, two-wheeled travel and the perfect cup of coffee.\n\nI live in Portland, OR and love to travel, but honored to call the Pacific Northwest my home.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/04480741-5633-46db-be2b-315567e1963e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(112893366,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/112893366','Sam','Portland, OR','I\'m into dance, spirituality, our planet, supporting each other, healing sexuality and relationships...\r\n\r\nI do love to travel, New Zealand and Bali are on the docket.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1bbe06ce-2da9-47ad-837e-3725580986b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(155811819,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/155811819','Mazana','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fc90d962-4a37-41fc-a2c5-0df4aae105f8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18479582,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18479582','Jenny','Portland, OR','Jenny and Zak love the opportunity to host guests in their Portland home as well as stay as guests in others\' homes. While we have been very fortunate to live as a family in many parts of the U.S. and overseas, the Pacific Northwest is a special and breathtaking place for us to call home. As hosts, we look forward to being part of your travel journey.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-18479582/original/db029c97-6c09-4e4d-9a33-23f0583c20bc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(210522729,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/210522729','Jeff','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ce00d9a-ef6c-4ab8-898b-4e643905a911.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1197739,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1197739','Heather','Portland, OR','Living in the Pacific Northwest is an absolute honor. I know how lucky I am to have made my way to Oregon & Washington, lands thick with lush forests and full of life. I am an Oregon Principal Broker at Think Real Estate helping others to find, buy, &/or sell their own piece of Portland. When I am not working, I am enjoying time with my husband, my dog, and traveling. I am passionate about spaces and how they can have an immediate affect on one\'s mood and a long term affect on one\'s perspective. I strive to create comfortable, visually appealing, and functional spaces to be enjoyed and savored.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2902aa16-c27a-4fdc-9d05-328ffe5c78b0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30878885,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30878885','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/30878885/profile_pic/1429211711/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(220235042,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/220235042','Jean','Beaverton, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/686e00bb-17f7-46f5-b06f-7a76341139ce.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(220757080,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/220757080','Christine And Charles','Portland, OR','We are Christine and Charles Claringbold, known by our friends as \"The Bolds.\"\r\n\r\nChristine is the artist who does all the psychedelic mandalas. \r\n\r\nCharles is the leader of local rock band Dartgun & the Vignettes. He\'s an amazing chef!\r\n\r\nWe love camping, hiking, traveling, gardening and decorating our colorful home so we can host awesome guests like you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7aca0a69-2b27-4296-9490-deabf96dbd1c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29407157,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29407157','Jennifer','Portland, OR','My husband and I love to travel and enjoy exploring the outdoors.  Our favorites are visiting hot springs, hiking, backpacking, snowshoeing and skiing.  Both of us are Portland natives and love this city!  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5310dd4f-d5b2-4894-a391-68a545f807e8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4540216,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4540216','Ashlee','Portland, OR','I\'m a Los Angeles native currently living and working as a CPA in Portland. Easy going, clean, and respectful. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4540216/profile_pic/1381770556/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26630104,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26630104','Deborah','Omaha, NE','My husband, Michael, and I are both retired.  We stay active with our grandchildren, travel and volunteer work.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6fff3922-dc91-43cf-b8c1-3f83c55837b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9042332,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9042332','Jahan','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland, OR. My better half hails from the U.K. and we welcomed our daughter into this world in September of 2020. We have a very friendly Australian Labradoodle named Douglas Fur (Duggie for short) who you may see wandering around the yard at times. \r\n\r\nI\'m an avid sports fan and car fanatic.\r\n\r\nI’m passionate about traveling and exploring the world. My favorite destination has been Chamonix, France where I ran sections of the UTMB trail race course in the Alps - absolutely stunning. Favorite running experience was Speed Project, running a relay through Death Valley, from Santa Monica Pier to the Las Vegas sign.\r\n\r\nI enjoy a good espresso in the morning and a glass of PNW red wine in the evening.\r\n\r\nI believe that one of the greatest things in life is the interactions and relationships we make with others both locally and around the world.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/695ef9f6-8655-4c5b-87b0-d63ade25dd75.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(221580026,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/221580026','David','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aa6062b3-63e1-4d17-bcf1-4d570cc18b92.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(294378,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/294378','Karen','Portland, OR','a retired commercial real estate professional who is enjoying all that I missed in the journey to where I currently find myself.  It\'s quite an adventure and we are enjoying traveling, meeting new people and exploring the world.  We love to sail and you will often find us sailing to new destinations',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/605b36b9-44c4-477a-99cd-f25880536091.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111041622,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111041622','Carol','Portland, OR','My husband Bill and I are long time Maplewood residents. I\'m a residential real estate agent. Let me know if you\'re interested in knowing more about Portland\'s housing market. I also moonlight at Annie Bloom\'s Books in Multnomah Village on Friday nights. Bill is retired and enjoys golf and photography. We love reading, movies, martinis on the back deck, and entertaining friends and family.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/13a8136d-4b3a-4730-bc88-a9921c8a8e9f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(222596780,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/222596780','Heather','Portland, OR','I am happiest when spending time with my family. We enjoy all aspects of travel, exploring new places, and visiting familiar places like my birthplace in Hawaii. We especially enjoy being connected to nature. This is one aspect of why we love our home in Portland and the Pacific Northwest. We take in all the joys of city life and revel in relatively short trips to the our nearby mountains, lakes, and coastline.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-222596780/original/fa8c16ed-0109-4ff0-b836-7cfb781d8c4d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19605982,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19605982','Liya & Parker','Portland, OR','Parker (they/she) is an acupuncturist, and Liya (she/her) is a professor. We have four small mammals under our care - two human kids and two dogs (Sammy, a mini Aussie who loves to herd, and Cooper, an accordingly naughty labradoodle). Parker enjoys cooking and reading up on current events. Liya enjoys hiking and fitness. She teaches Pilates and yoga at a nearby yoga studio, the Bhakti Yoga Movement Center.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19605982/original/f76f31af-44dc-499a-b34d-8a13368b6725.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19594248,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19594248','Tiffany','Portland, OR','  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7b5468fc-43ce-43c1-a600-ea9574ff8a01.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1777366,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1777366','Kat','Portland, OR','I love Portland and love to get out of Portland too!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/558c2de9-eba5-49d7-a297-a444ab7792bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(85235637,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/85235637','Kellie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b788674c-9675-4eac-9bb1-1d3f90531639.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10954552,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10954552','Aletheia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f3542cd7-70e9-42a2-bc08-849fee684aeb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(189099,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/189099','Jen','Portland, OR','We look forward to hosting you in our quaint, quiet, beautiful Portland neighborhood.  We live on the property in the main house, the guest cottage is a brand new ADU and it is all yours with a small, private, enclosed back yard.  We work during the day, but are available to answer questions as needed.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/808cc013-50e8-4ae5-90f1-753e8581e83d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5223057,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5223057','Mitch','Portland, OR','Professor',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5223057/profile_pic/1361815576/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9373771,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9373771','Tanja','Portland, OR','Hi-  I  love living in Portland & sharing it with guests... our city is so cool, I never want to leave.  I work from home - water fountain sales, internet marketing, & beach vacation rental management (WA coast).  I am an animal lover & usually share the home with a foster dog or two.  I\'m vegan (no meat, dairy, eggs). I speak a little Spanish (Hablo Espanol). I am usually around during the day working - if around in the evening, I am usually watching some bad TV.. LOL. I enjoy live music/theater & often will go out in the evenings for shows. In warmer weather, I try to sneak off as often as possible for tennis, biking, hiking & anything else outside.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b2eb9a41-bfb5-4caa-9091-d50784139eba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(221193381,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/221193381','Aaron','Portland, OR','I run a personal training business in Portland. I enjoy being active and am an avid backpacker, and explorer. \r\n\r\nI am a Portland native, who loves the local cuisine and culture. I am happy to share my knowledge to help you plan a memorable experience here in Portland. \r\n\r\nI work varied hours, but will be available to respond by text during most hours of the day.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-221193381/original/33d8f46b-c1bc-4d02-b4f9-15addc7eb80b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(152202888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/152202888','James','San Francisco, CA','I live and work in San Francisco but plan to retire here soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be7e2a9b-3ea3-4196-afdb-75dec5783048.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57471246,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57471246','Chris','Portland, OR','Owner-Operator of DCT Properties & Investments, a small family run business and MadHousePDX Entertainment (Concert / Promotions Company).... make sure to ask about deals and discounts for local events!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/e229718d-411b-450f-b3eb-5c35e5b028a9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(71520174,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/71520174','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0bb1276e-19ae-4679-a516-3ef8f3e30d87.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(133425745,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/133425745','Deborah','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/29324e89-0c6e-48eb-a1e2-527032d62ff9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39165671,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39165671','Leslie','Portland, OR','I love to travel and I also love to share my homes with travelers....',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/39165671/profile_pic/1437510593/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13588271,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13588271','Amy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/85667236-2585-41f1-bb14-ff74f7e2e4f0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7512487,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7512487','Emily','Portland, OR','I\'m a designer based in Portland Oregon, marginal singer of karaoke, climber and distance runner. I love to explore the pacific northwest and more distant places, sometimes with my 2 amazing kids and sometimes without. \n\nAs a guest, depending on the host and situation I could enjoy chatting it up over a beer or coffee, or just tend to my own exploration. I\'m pretty good at reading people and making the best of it.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7512487/original/213099bf-69d8-474b-a3ad-95a685a4c7a2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1172796,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1172796','Colleen & Scott','Portland, OR','Hello All!\n\nI\'m from Portland Oregon and right now my husband Scott and I are enjoying our new house featuring amazing new guest rooms for rent. When we\'re not busy working, we\'re training for and racing marathons. Next up: London!\n\nWe tend to finish our day early so we can get up to do all of the things we love: run, bike, hike, backpack, and mountain climb! We also love to cook, sip cocktails on our porch,  and drink many of the great beers Oregon has to offer!\n\nWelcome to our home, we hope you enjoy it!\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e292560d-77db-42bb-bce2-5c3a52b5a925.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90414561,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90414561','Carrie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/45eaeafd-9672-4a05-b53b-c6d815c357cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18935456,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18935456','Tyler','Portland, OR','Hello!\r\n\r\nI am a 5th generation Oregonian born and raised in Portland.\r\nI work in the logistics industry, and when I can I love to be outdoors.\r\n\r\nI am looking forward to staying at your Airbnb, and also hope to see you staying at my Airbnb!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-18935456/original/bcf794fe-a3d6-4b33-8674-6a32a46412c4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38307544,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38307544','Natalie','Portland, OR','World traveler, mom of two boys, and a real estate broker in Portland. My husband and I are into community building through travel, work, friends, school and shared interests. You\'d likely find us x-country skiing, mushroom hunting, hiking, and exploring our extraordinary Oregon outdoor home. Our family dog Tucker keeps us happy and active! If you happen to want to relocate to Portland and want to the inside scoop about real estate, reach out!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/20d3ce22-8523-4883-948f-e95b9d723fed.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(105882281,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/105882281','Corinne','San Diego, CA','I am a retired cardiac nurse. I am a mother of 3 beautiful adult girls. I love to travel internationally.  My hobbies are yoga bicycling running and cooking. Enjoy trying new challenging recipes. My favorites are Mexican and Thai.  I live on my boat in San Diego harbor and can’t think of a better place to land after my travels!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/74360f71-1c73-4c52-9cce-8c16e705b22b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2682677,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2682677','Bethany','Portland, OR','I have lived in Portland for ten years with my husband Chris and we co-manage our listing.  I love to travel and have been all over the world, but I still have a long list of places to see, and would love your recommendations. As a family we used Airbnb all over Europe to have a comfortable and private space, and I think it\'s the best way to feel local!  We built our guest cottage so that family can have a comfortable spot to stay while visiting us, and we are participating in the Airbnb community to utilize the space and share our love of travel with others.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2682677/profile_pic/1340471859/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1204761,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1204761','Molly & Dan','Portland, OR','We moved to Portland in 2000 from the other coast after realizing this was the place we wanted to call home. We love the walkable neighborhoods, support of small businesses, the food and arts scenes, the biking and transit options, and the connection to the outdoors. \r\n\r\nDan edits documentary films and runs his own video production company. Molly buys flowers from Northwest growers for a national flower wholesaler. \r\n\r\nWe enjoy meeting new people through Airbnb, both as guests and as hosts. We love to visit National Parks around the west, and pretty much anywhere in India or Southeast Asia — although we usually roam closer to home. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3941b0f5-ea61-49a1-9efb-6e24bac56fe9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(128850,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/128850','Kelly','Portland, OR','I work full time as a registered nurse.  Have a high energy dog to keep me busy and love hiking and being outdoors.   \r\nI enjoy traveling as much as possible and prefer to explore where the locals go if possible along with a few high volume tourist activities and \"must see\" spots.   \r\nI can\'t live without my morning coffee and some fresh air.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7112ceeb-0a2c-477d-9df2-05fb6a16df83.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22650127,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22650127','Cynthia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22650127/profile_pic/1425403882/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(638465,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/638465','Robby','Portland, OR','Wilderness Family Therapist (see granitebridgesdotcom), Psychiatric Emergency Department Social Worker, climber, biker, skier, traveler, and lover of life. \r\n\r\nI Airbnb my space when I am gone since I travel frequently both for work and pleasure. Obsessed with Mexico right now but have been to over 25 countries. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/638465/profile_pic/1418283768/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6358589,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6358589','Connor','Portland, OR','I am an Designer/artist, maker, and photographer who loves to learn! I am originally from Indiana and have ventured out across the United States, into Europe, and even as far around the globe as Nepal and New Zealand. I am happy to call Portland, OR my home.\n\nI am a big fan of films as well as old things with a lot of character. I do my best to be as mindful as possible when interacting with others.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6358589/original/b0ad3ab5-af1e-4de7-b40d-0802202234b8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14970082,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14970082','Graham','Portland, OR','Engineer by day, bnb host by night (...and day also :)\n\n**Be nice... you\'re in Oregon now :)**',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/31b30ad3-616e-4870-b823-6090076a6502.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150768243,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150768243','Charles','Portland, OR','I am a native Portlander, was actually born downtown, which is a rarity these days. I am a Massage Therapist and artist.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1cc27a5e-7f77-47d1-b481-c8eda8169c08.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58599742,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58599742','Kristy','Portland, OR','I\'m a nature lover who loves hiking to waterfalls, relaxing on a tranquil lake and camping by a river. I love music, good food and wine and enjoying the company of friends. A perfect day for me starts with a paddle board float with my dog and my kid followed by an afternoon of lounging in my backyard with a refreshing beverage while my husband is cooking on the grill. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bd7bafbc-e273-4a62-9af7-46d96e613391.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8076457,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8076457','Monica & Mikael','Portland, OR','We moved to Portland from Minnesota in 2006 and love living in North Portland. We have both travelled the world and share a love of Mexico, the Pacific Northwest, and Spain. We love meeting travelers eager to explore the world, or locals just checking out a new city. \r\n\r\nWe are both steeped in food systems work. Mikael works for a non-profit called that operates a youth farm on Sauvie Island and I work on improving public health through food systems improvements and food policy. We are both avid gardeners, eaters, and entertainers. We love cooking and sharing food with friends and enjoying the many eateries around town. We also love to get out of town to the beach, the Gorge, or Forest Park for hikes, runs and walks. \r\n\r\nOn any given night, you may find us grilling up something delicious, enjoying a cocktail at the picnic table out back, making popcorn for a movie, or working on an art project of some sort.\r\n\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8076457/profile_pic/1402339723/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11886279,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11886279','YouKyoung','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af163a1e-4ac3-4d1c-af53-cd6abc6f4d74.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(204559,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/204559','Charlie','Portland, OR','I work downtown so if you have any questions or want places to check out, just ask!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/204559/profile_pic/1441176394/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14855444,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14855444','Tracy','Portland, OR','Hello there! My name is Tracy and just re-started hosting my place on Airbnb in December.  I am a native of Portland and love our city of roses.  I am a musician and enjoy writing, recording and playing live shows.  Prior to Covid, I also worked as a mobile DJ for private events and local bars and restaurants which included Karaoke!  I also dabble in Real Estate.  I consider myself a people person with experience in the hospitality industry, so being an Airbnb host has aligned well with all of my other interests!\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1fb7268b-091b-4a44-84ec-01ffd1a8c209.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(272956,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/272956','Meg And Craig','Portland, OR','Meg is a lactation consultant and childbirth educator.  Craig works for a design agency. We have three grown children and one who is in college and coming home for the summer. We love to travel, hike and bike and spend time with family and friends.\r\nWe have stayed in Air b&b’s everywhere we have traveled and we love the personal nature of getting to know an area from the standpoint of someone sharing their home.  As hosts we hope to do the same for our guests.  We love the Northwest and feel that Portland has a lot to offer and we love letting people know about the best spots to explore. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf2bda8a-d000-4663-9e2b-dd5cb1303240.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(141166845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/141166845','Blake','Portland, OR','Devoted husband and dad, driven business professional with a deep-rooted passion for diverse outdoor adventures: skiing, snowmobiling, surfing, paddle-boarding, hiking, running, swimming, & various biking forms. My vibrant, clean lifestyle is a testament to my utmost respect for spaces I step into. Eager to share tips on summer/winter fun? Reach out anytime!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-141166845/original/2832070d-5315-4439-bae9-9d17d52c99a8.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21707201,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21707201','Allen','Birmingham, AL','Mostly Retired psychologist',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/21707201/profile_pic/1411531038/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6431,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6431','Paula','Portland, OR','We are from Portland, OR USA. I am a psychologist, my husband is a chiropractor and we are passionate about Portland and backpacking the world.\r\n\r\nWe are clean, conscientious, and have experience renting apartments/homes when we travel. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6431/profile_pic/1338222294/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84575822,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84575822','Sylvia','Hillsboro, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6030dbf8-3bc5-458b-9355-9d983521be46.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36670674,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36670674','Rachel & Sam','Portland, OR','We love to travel, spend time with our family, support our community, and explore all the great adventures Oregon has to offer. We enjoy hosting quests from all over the world in our AirBnb!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/31d0fcba-068e-46e5-9e18-d31bf693fba2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25976548,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25976548','Sarah','Portland, OR','My husband and I love to run, swim, ski, travel and adventure!  We take pride in hosting guests. We split our time between Portland and Central Oregon and enjoy all the aspects that both have to offer.  We are always available to help with recommendations on activities for summer and winter as far as the good places to eat and fun things to do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-25976548/original/23be7ed7-15c6-4ab8-8b7b-01cd97e6cbbb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(142326751,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/142326751','Bryan And Rhonda','Portland, OR','We were married in 2000 and have 3 lovely daughters.  We moved into Eastmoreland in 2008 and have loved every minute of it.  Our biggest hobby is our home and when Bryan came to me with the idea of building a new garage with an ADU above it,  I was all in.  We have refurbished 3 other homes as well as our current 1937 year old home.  We take pride in our home and even though it is a slow process the transformation has been one of our biggest accomplishments.  (Our first 3 being our daughters...)\n\nI was born and raised here in Portland, OR and Bryan was born in Minnesota, lived in North Dakota until his parents moved to Oregon when he was 3.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f6e33555-2d44-4f14-b59e-97229766f799.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(152120973,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/152120973','Tambra','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/50bb2f34-370a-40af-80fa-b380c976ff64.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(231857120,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/231857120','Kathryn','United States','I moved to Portland from Phoenix about a decade ago to attend PSU for a master\'s in book publishing. I love this city and am happy to give recommendations on places to go, things to see and do, and the best restaurants around.  My schedule is varied, so I ask that you please either text, email, or call me (rather than knock on the house door) should you need anything, and I\'ll get back to you as soon as possible. Thank you for booking your stay at our guesthouse. We appreciate you very much!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e4a177ed-984e-4c2f-a8be-170d3462fb12.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(176371931,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/176371931','Michelle','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7fa5ec83-0035-45da-91dd-30ad7e308a9f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1314197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1314197','Jeff','Portland, OR','I moved to the Pacific Northwest to study Chinese Medicine following 10+ years in client services with agencies and tech in NYC. As a sort-of innkeeper, I\'ve hosted travelers from all over the world in both Brooklyn and in Portland. I enjoy cooking delicious food and exploring Oregon\'s beautiful nature. I practice ashtanga yoga and I\'ve also been a bike messenger. Portland has been good to me so far, and I\'m excited to share my home with you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3440fcd9-c226-497c-ae25-92d326aa3960.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28892696,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28892696','Miriam','Portland, OR','I am a DNA lab tech at OHSU.\r\nI am an avid outdoor enthusiast and can often be found mountain biking, road riding, cyclocross racing, motorcycle riding or wrenching in my garage.\r\nI volunteer for trail maintenance and the feral cat coalition.\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e333ddff-3ec8-4adf-9678-1c94dda7ecf8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3588025,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3588025','Oliver','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Oliver and I\'m a Portland native loving being back in my hometown after 10 years in Australia. I\'ve been a part of the Airbnb community for a long time both as a host and guest. If you have any questions, please don\'t hesitate to ask! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/02184e10-d6d4-4d49-8206-77b54edc1bdb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(123968362,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/123968362','Arvell','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/06d5b040-cb64-4219-87b1-05fb7889b15b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19204617,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19204617','Steve','Georgetown, TX','Enjoy International travel, enjoy good cuisine, wine, meeting new people, running, camping, boating, biking, hiking, most all outdoor activities, enjoy spending time with my dogs, friends, and family too.\n\nI am a very clean, neat person that will leave a place in which I stay very clean and just exactly how I found it.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19204617/original/700600fd-27b2-458b-907f-ea6e8f4fefc2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(234182512,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/234182512','Mickey','Portland, OR','We love our neighborhood and look forward to sharing our basement suite with you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/80afffd1-7c6c-460e-a365-ae32cdb93093.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30942269,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30942269','Nancy','Portland, OR','My husband Matt and I host The Little Cedar House - a stand-alone ADU on our property and a 31 night Airbnb duplex for longer stays.   We built and designed the Little Cedar House ourselves and love hosting guests in the space.  I’m an experienced local realtor and have helped several guests moving to Portland find their new home here.  I  love to hike, paddleboard and do yoga when I get the chance.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5c4b08aa-6c95-4a87-a07d-07152d31710e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6933405,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6933405','Amelia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a95632fa-721a-4659-b187-4f98f764b29c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21441201,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21441201','Andrea','Portland, OR','I am a playwright and college professor',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b3ea6290-8761-4e26-a13e-389efe4a7b75.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19475324,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19475324','Morgan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19475324/original/aba6ecb0-361e-4dea-97f2-2116d53e5e5b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5433404,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5433404','Emily + Christian','Portland, OR','We are both from the Pacific Northwest and are happy to call Portland, Oregon home for ourselves and our two young children. Our family loves to explore new places and spend as much time as possible in the outdoors here in beautiful Oregon (surfing, hiking, running, camping, snowboarding, fishing...). Whether hosting or traveling, we\'re respectful and easygoing.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/41a17f4e-2bf0-4be6-ae9f-18db77b609cb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(89919003,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/89919003','Abbot','Portland, OR','Hello I am a friendly human who loves to see new places. My wife, daughter and I usually only do short trips because we have a small puppy at home. We both love good food, backpacking, long runs and new people. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6fa39356-a4e5-41a9-9135-04b8fdb91b20.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3302285,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3302285','Charles','Portland, OR','I’m from Portland, Oregon, the City of Roses.  I love to go on adventures, travel, eat good food and spend time with family and friends.   If you are coming to Portland, ask me about good restaurants, cafés, places to hike, short day trips and places to bike.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/07cffa5a-58c1-41b3-bdcd-882a9336f3e9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(158074447,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/158074447','Sarah','Portland, OR','Place Property Management is a small residential property management company based in the Sellwood neighborhood of Portland, Oregon. Dedicated to the smaller investor seeking to improve and maintain their investments as productive assets for their future, let Place Property Management manage your place through our collaborative and transparent approach today.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2a78588f-5670-4d1c-94f8-0ccd81e0ff2c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(235588475,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/235588475','Liz & Grant','Portland, OR','Hey, we\'re Liz & Grant!\r\n\r\nBack in 2011 we made the decision to leave big city life in Chicago and head out west to live a slower-paced, outdoor lifestyle in Portland, OR. Trading traffic congestion for bike commuting and late night bar hopping for early morning hikes. \r\n\r\nWe settled down in the Richmond neighborhood with our two cats, Barley and Hops, and recently fulfilled our dream to buy a house. We love the walkability and community feel of our neighborhood, not to mention all of the fabulous restaurants.\r\n\r\nWe love all that Portland offers, including the top-notch food scene, diverse craft beer selection, easy access to the outdoors (Mountains!), artisan coffee, and community feel that comes with living in a smaller city. \r\n\r\nWe enjoy getting out and adventuring, including hiking, mountaineering, rock climbing, and backpacking. \r\n\r\nWhen we\'re not in Portland, we love traveling abroad and experiencing different cultures and landscapes including trips of a lifetime in Nepal, Patagonia, and Thailand, to name a few. \r\n\r\nWe look forward to connecting with you and will do our best to make your stay as comfortable as possible.\r\n\r\nCheers and beers,\r\nLiz & Grant',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bca4462b-dd23-49f0-acc1-3ee239a8fe66.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19686646,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19686646','Vivian','Portland, OR','I\'m an Acupuncturist, Herbalist and Ayurvedic Practitioner. I\'m also a singer/songwriter. \r\n\r\nI grew up in coastal Northern California (Southern Humboldt county). I lived in Seattle, WA for 8 years where I met my husband and Airbnb co-host Mike. Most recently, we lived for 10 years in Austin, TX. \r\n\r\nMike and I have been together for 20 years! We enjoy hikes with our dog Lucy and going out to great restaurants. \r\n\r\nFun fact #1: In 2017 we traveled all over the country to see Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds play -Portland was our favorite show! \r\nFun fact #2: We love Star Trek. \r\nFun Fact #3: Mike and I made a record together in 2006. It\'s called Watch the Light Fade.\r\nFun fact #4: My mom has a scene in a Netflix documentary mini-series. \r\nFun fact #5: My great grandmother was one of the first female lawyers in the country! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9631da05-6eb5-4c92-853f-a4c9280a2bd6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(155027096,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/155027096','Tracey','Hanalei, HI','We are a family that loves to travel and meet new people! We spend time on Kauai, in Portland OR, in the Northwoods of Wisconsin and love to see new places too. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-155027096/original/d7f309e2-d7f2-4d59-8f8e-2fcc237be341.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(202400439,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/202400439','Brad And Ching','Portland, OR','My wife and I enjoy the great northwest. Travel is a joy of ours as we have family around the globe we love to visit. Our son, film, the symphony, art, food and laughter keep us excited and hungry for that next great adventure. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/418006db-69cc-4258-b2b5-a2c770aa9596.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(236328262,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/236328262','Gregg','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d7fba1db-f5b5-43ad-9411-36e9b4172494.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1608236,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1608236','Rachael','Portland, OR','I am married and have twin daughters. I love to travel, cook, make art, take photographs, discover new music, read, laugh, sing, explore...',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1608236/original/b315a2cf-89f3-4bd0-a7ca-57dbef49784b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11182438,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11182438','Brooke','Portland, OR','I\'m a Colorado native and moved to Portland 20 years ago. I am a busy mom of two teenagers and full time Realtor in OR and WA. My family loves the outdoors,  Portland Timbers and our pug mix Meatball. We love to travel and experience as many new adventures as possible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a05b9d4-d032-4d49-9bd0-dd3876d15bc5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35082631,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35082631','Eddie And Ann','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-35082631/original/f2fc13f0-6445-4cc5-8216-c2a9e022e5c9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(237714363,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/237714363','Jacob','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c7a47e0b-5171-4915-bee2-19abc7ca6028.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5241391,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5241391','Natasha','Los Angeles, CA','Hi! I am a creative director from Portland living in LA. I love eating out, wine, art, traveling and hiking with my dog Penelope.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b4504623-2e76-4064-9530-3d0b17e851ee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114337777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114337777','Natalia','Portland, OR','Teacher, traveler, mother.....Born in San Jose Costa Rica, living in Portland Oregon. I love traveling the world and meeting people from all walks of life. \r\nFavorite (Website hidden by Airbnb) Habana Cuba and Paris France. Passionate about dance, theater, music.... the arts. \r\nWhen I travel I want to meet the locals, inmerse myself in the authenticity of a place and connect with people as much as possible. \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6905b29e-b449-4f18-82a8-dfb696de5ca3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121932858,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121932858','Trang','Portland, OR','I\'m Trang Sharbaugh and will be your host while visiting the stylish residential home in bustling Foster-Powell. My husband and I spend lots of time exploring the world and made the Pacific Northwest our home spring 2018. We have been together for 13 years, living in four different continents. My husband is a human-center design educator and workshop facilitator. I\'m a Techstars startup founder with a passion for local regenerative farming. I love plants and pollinators, home decoration, cooking fresh food, visiting farmers market, traveling, and exploring new experiences. \n\nWe absolutely love the variety and small lovely elements staying in an Airbnb offers. It’s something truly special and fun to stay in a unique property. When we design our home, we often think about how to make our friends and family enjoy it as much as we do when they visit us. We hope you\'ll feel the same. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e772ae0d-708b-4f06-8024-1ec812a99def.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5863705,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5863705','Alexandra','Portland, OR','I love to travel, garden, and provide a great place to stay when visiting Portland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e0acdbd0-0edf-4e10-b762-1571be68ad20.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65277088,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65277088','Reza','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-65277088/original/4dbcb6b2-b66d-4851-804d-9884298499f9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88253867,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88253867','Jordan','Eugene, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2a4d0d01-b564-4775-96a2-8c2ebbdaab45.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31143498,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31143498','Brandt & Chelsea','Portland, OR','Pacific northwest natives and passionate owners of interior design studio, Kaemingk Design.  We are constantly striving to find unique and off the beaten path travel destinations and highly appreciate high style design, fantastic food and well crafted cocktails.  We hope to add more rentals to share our passion for travel, food and design with others.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ccaa8bb-d4c8-474b-9da5-a627196d2e6d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36981269,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36981269','Lance And Nicole','Portland, OR','Greetings! We are Lance and Nicole and we enjoy the adventure of being air bnb hosts.  Lance is a Portland native and Nicole is from Southwest Colorado. We are excited to offer travelers a locals experience of what Portland has to offer! We really love all the good food and brews located within close proximity to where we are.  We love this city and are happy to offer any suggestions for places to visit and things to do.  We look forward to hosting you and hope you\'ll love Portland as much as we do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/816f46d7-d70d-400f-b42d-30e06e1c56f6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4507214,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4507214','Jeremy','Portland, OR','My family and I live in Portland, OR! We love to travel and adventure to new places near and far. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aacaaaf7-06c3-4b29-b56e-9f88d69ea9b6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(241446961,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/241446961','Ashley','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/53447313-a83c-45b9-a0f6-c3d082e6df17.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(241675301,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/241675301','Jovenco','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eab47aa2-3eac-4447-81b9-ad6136891b70.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(242772784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/242772784','Pinping','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2b8fc8f3-d613-4ca5-8ced-fc39a7127be8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33648860,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33648860','Laura','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f5d04846-0688-416f-86e7-92716f0489ec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(243140548,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/243140548','Laurie','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bbf923b0-d5fa-4619-ae08-388c86a68b78.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(238984344,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/238984344','Thomas','Portland, OR','Phyllis and I are both well-rooted and active in the Portland community and well-traveled throughout the world.  We have raised five children, and have both served in the Peace Corps.  Tom works for the Forest Service as an ecologist, and Phyllis runs her own bookkeeping business, specializing in supporting non-profit organizations.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f92adda4-f25d-4845-a185-843dcdb556b0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(415758,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/415758','Esther','Portland, OR','A native Swiss, having lived my entire adult life on the west coast. \nI am an early musician, playing in a variety of groups. You may hear music coming from upstairs during your stay. I have hosted guests and managed properties for a long time, internationally and locally. \nHaving worked as a tour guide, worked in hotels and done real estate, I am pretty familiar with all aspects of traveling and hosting. We are looking forward to having you as a guest. \n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/415758/profile_pic/1312225264/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70062145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70062145','Kevin','Portland, OR','I am originally from the Twin Cities area of Minnesota and have been living in Portland, Oregon since 2015.  My wife, Sidney, and I love hosting travelers from all over the world in our adorable tiny house that has be recognized by many publications including the New York Times.  \n\nIn our spare time, we also enjoy traveling to other towns, cities, states, and countries.  We love to check out the local experiences including food, beverages, architecture and scenery.  \n\nWhen staying in Portland, we take advantage and visit our wonderful restaurants, breweries, and wineries.  We also try to get out to our amazing selection of hikes in the nearby area.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2c43cf9c-5181-4afe-bf8a-7d83a9617dcb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(244187765,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/244187765','Kris','Portland, OR','Travel has been a passion from an early age. Traveling provides a perspective and a unique understanding of people, culture and surroundings that can only be experienced by doing. Growing up in the Midwest, a childhood train ride opened my eyes to the gorgeous Northwest. There\'s no better place in my opinion. An hour from the Cascade Mountains hiking trails, 90 minutes from a Pacific Ocean beach walk and steps away from amazing craft beers, wines and delicious local fresh fare via nearby cafes, food carts, restaurants and farmer\'s markets. My interest in hosting stems from a love of meeting new people, of gathering friends and family together and a career in marketing, communications and event planning.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3c9574d3-9e10-4208-8956-1cfbc1c464e0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(213350724,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/213350724','J, S & P','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-213350724/original/c1d8309a-e140-4151-aa81-993eac15bec7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49957564,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49957564','Kyle','Portland, OR','Kyle is an elementary school teacher in Portland and Stephanie is an auditor. We love traveling as well as hosting travelers. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cecd0f95-f289-43ed-a6f2-ac240635280e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32902791,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32902791','Karyn','Portland, OR','We\'re a family of four Canadians who moved to beautiful Portland, OR. We enjoy travelling, utilizing Airbnb wherever we go, and want to provide the opportunity for others.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f7bdd21e-fd26-4ff2-91b0-96d2815706ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(373547,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/373547','Vinay','Portland, OR','I love the outdoors and enjoying all the Pacific Northwest has to offer, I also really enjoy traveling, running, listening to music, reading, yoga, and relaxing. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/373547/profile_pic/1396318940/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9061399,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9061399','Sara','Portland, OR','Working technical writer, graphic designer and jazz dancer from lovely Portland, OR.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9061399/profile_pic/1380210525/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9930480,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9930480','Trace','Portland, OR','I am a remodeler, woodworker and designer. I have lived in the Portland area since 1976.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9930480/profile_pic/1384713062/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(154575784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/154575784','Gitta','Portland, OR','I\'m a San Diego native who moved to Portland 25 years ago to go to college.  I fell in love with the Pacific NW and decided to make it my home!!  I enjoy time with family and friends, hosting travelers from allover and exploring the many activities that Oregon has to offer. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7bce6447-653b-4f54-8c61-e4f5cdcbcc89.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(246070767,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/246070767','Jed','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d7c5bf0e-cdc6-4594-87d0-bc343de039ef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90662593,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90662593','Emily','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-90662593/original/053dc1d4-e67b-497d-beae-26bf1a722928.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73398160,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73398160','Magie','Portland, OR','Hello! I’m Magie (pronounced: Ma-jee), married and have 2  boys. We love to travel and enjoys outdoor activities. With my husband’s construction skills, he built our guesthouse and we turned it into a cozy place that we want to share to our guests.  As a registered nurse, safety and infection prevention is my goal so rest assured that our guesthouse is thoroughly cleaned and sanitized. We enjoy hosting and our ultimate goal is to make sure that our guests are having an exceptional stay!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1d8af711-8a3a-4f86-ab31-c429223f32f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5627019,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5627019','Janet','Portland, OR','\nLove living in gorgeous, green Portland!\nBe sure to visit downtown Saturday Farmer\'s Market!\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65d4a684-572c-4749-8901-7cd7e823c363.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25375592,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25375592','Barbara','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/071b555a-f89d-4abb-ab68-9e5b7ca25c24.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(69201599,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/69201599','Lisa','Portland, OR','I love coffee, bourbon and biking. \r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d6797f1d-fd55-4699-b56a-6fe946d20c80.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49136577,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49136577','Colleen','Portland, OR','I\'m a Realtor in Portland Oregon, USA. I feel lucky to live and work in the vibrant city of Portland, and I love to explore new far-away places.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7dcc88a3-05cf-4844-ba76-8e8b8e26d311.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(158873581,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/158873581','Kate','Portland, OR','Hello there!  I very much enjoy the experience of hosting and getting to know folks from all over. I take great pride is quick responses, immaculate cleaning standards and am happy to help guide my guests as best I can as they think about what to do in beautiful Portland, Oregon. Thanks for reading and I hope you consider my lovely bungalow!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7e51948-8613-40f2-b126-476bc84e2174.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4519200,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4519200','Cindy','Portland, OR','Oregon',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4519200/profile_pic/1356760395/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29487483,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29487483','Andrew','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/29487483/profile_pic/1426577578/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(654280,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/654280','Anthony','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m Anthony. I work from home and travel frequently, so know all the secrets to making an airbnb spectacular - because I\'ve both encountered them, and also missed them when they weren\'t there. I also know how important answering questions quickly is - If I\'m not sleeping or on a flight, me or my cohost Kat usually answer within 5 minutes! \n\nI love cooking great food, drinking wine (specifically, Oregon pinot), exploring our unparalleled neighborhood, and meeting new people.  I love to host friends and family, and can\'t wait to share our fantastic guest suite with you. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a04cb0d1-5692-4b1a-bc28-6a8eab486081.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(249670904,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/249670904','Nang','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/605739d6-c3d0-465e-8d9b-8211460dfa02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25566155,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25566155','Jason','Portland, OR','My house is a wonderful way to experience Portland. I\'m a frequent traveler and use AirBNB often, so we try to deliver a really exceptional experience and value as a host and to be extremely respectful as a traveler. I love Portland and Oregon and enjoy welcoming new people to explore our wonderful home. I spend a lot of time working on the outdoor space around the house and generally love the outdoors, camping and hiking, as well as travel and music.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9fb0f7d2-2ad2-41c9-88b8-4333883e4c8f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(249746109,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/249746109','Andrea','Portland, OR','Baker, dog lover, blueberry eater',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c3cac8a-886c-4c36-9940-68a7b99904f9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(103922819,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/103922819','Elizabeth','Long Beach, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4d17b632-47ee-4794-b24e-8d016abfa351.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(251575849,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/251575849','Jody','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee937846-e9dd-4709-b2e3-a596df2145b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129582844,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129582844','Karen','Portland, OR','My husband and I love to travel and host! We want your stay to be a serene experience.  Somewhere you can just relax, unwind, and explore!\r\n\r\nI love to cook, sing, play piano, explore, and learn about new places!  My husband is a craftsman, and we built the getaway home ourselves. We love hosting, and are so grateful for every host that has welcomed us into their spaces too!\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/196f0ed2-532d-42c6-aeb8-900260b35d7d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(94889798,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/94889798','Ken','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-94889798/original/562c56fb-d3fe-4408-986c-95524b057f3b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(252219155,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/252219155','Matthew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ee7df4d-9e12-4e7d-b48b-d28c704b053e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65222350,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65222350','Molly','Portland, OR','I love exploring new environments ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/08ac5b63-1b3e-4bbc-8ad1-a79ecc541a9a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28688984,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28688984','David','Portland, OR','travel with my family .\nsuper host / super guest .',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d3fb361b-ba92-4c09-847f-2b62a4b09aea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(145659006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/145659006','Tj','Portland, OR','I\'m a juggler and a teacher in Portland. I enjoy spending time with my boys, woodworking, brewing beer and fixing up my old house. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/807127b8-282c-4ca0-8e02-0b1280a8eb3a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53371722,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53371722','Alex','Portland, OR','I grew up in Portland, Oregon and lived there most of my life before my wife and I moved to Tampa, Florida with our beautiful daughter! A few random facts about me...\n\n1) I played D1 Rugby in college and continued to play for years afterwards!\n2) Mushrooms are my favorite veggie :-)\n3) My wife and I did long distance for 6 years... which was wild! \n\nI love being a host on Airbnb and ensuring that my guests have a wonderful stay!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a96f85a4-287d-4a56-b825-0a4633ce0582.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24385374,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24385374','Chris','Portland, OR','Traveller, teacher, runner, husband!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/72547c4c-be80-4f49-b5a7-0be75335d28c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(254586465,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/254586465','Rosemary','Portland, OR','I\'m a journalist and travel writer and mostly work from an office at home. I spend most of my free time hiking in Oregon or Washington, gardening and cooking. I enjoy good coffee, good conversation, movies and photography and am happy to offer my local tips on things to do including hikes and where to eat and drink. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/acf168b2-9b36-46b9-be1a-a0347461306e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5424140,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5424140','Nate','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Nate and I love traveling with my wife Frances. We have lived in Portland for a while, but also Shanghai, Belgium, Beijing and Seattle. I speak Mandarin and a little bit of Spanish, and I really like meeting fellow travelers.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1d1c125f-f320-4a88-8248-cb9b244c0241.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30415706,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30415706','Mark & Kylee','Portland, OR','We have been hosting guests with Airbnb for many years and strive to give our guests the best experience. We also love to travel as a family and visit new areas and learn from those around us. Always happy to help out, just ask!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/30415706/profile_pic/1437177541/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(252680829,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/252680829','Clarissa','Portland, OR','Friendly Portland native ready to welcome and accommodate travelers from near and far in an awesome centrally located location. Both my mom and I are here to help assist you in having the best adventure Portland has to offer by hosting a location that allows you to live and experience Portland as a local.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff7700bf-ce93-4922-a7b5-b4b344411bc7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13162607,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13162607','Alfred','Portland, OR','I like the outdoors and being in nature',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f112337-b42f-42ab-9825-1bf41c542a0d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1458369,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1458369','Charlie','Portland, OR','My wife Anne and I love traveling the world and exploring.  I am a rock climber biker and runner and want to be outside whenever I can.  We seek out exciting places and experiences, love good food, and trying new things.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/12f54b7b-1427-434e-9643-9da910bc89ec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(204626355,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/204626355','Lori & David','Portland, OR','Fun-loving couple excited to share our love of architecture, food and outdoor adventures in the Portland area with our guests.  Come see what we have created for you. We think you\'ll love it!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a5aac0b9-032a-4644-a08c-f3ba025217b7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24306194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24306194','Robbie','Portland, OR','Originally from Southern California, I have lived in the Concordia neighborhood in Portland, Oregon with my husband and family for 25+ years. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b5bc899-4d37-414f-ae0d-011598740ef2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(224911430,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/224911430','Robin','Portland, OR','Robin and Brian love to stay in unique, small and interesting lodging facilities where they meet people from all over the world and learn about local cultures. And frankly, they would travel a lot more given the opportunity. So they decided...\"why not bring the \'travel\' to us?\" \r\n\r\nThey wanted to create a cool space where people experience that same \'travel adventure\' feeling  right here in Portland. So they took the plunge and found a house they could convert, in one of the hippest neighborhoods in Portland - The Alberta Arts District, where there is an abundance of amazing restaurants, cool shops, food carts, a theater, bike shops, coffee houses and so much to offer tourists.\r\n\r\nAn important part of their vision was to create a fun, warm, comfortable, safe and open space for people from all walks of life - for women, people of color, the LGBTQ+ community, immigrant populations, international travelers, etc. Additionally, the well-being of the planet was extremely important to them when creating the space. Therefore, a lot of time, effort and resources went into making this business as sustainable and environmentally-responsible as possible. That means they worked very hard to make sure the materials, furnishings and products that were purchased were top-quality, reused or salvaged when possible, organically grown, sustainably-sourced, made by local people, etc. Another aspect they are focusing on is to showcase Portland by utilizing Portland artisans and sustainable Portland-created products.\r\n\r\nThey hope you\'ll consider staying in their little hotel and experience the awesome neighborhood it\'s located in.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b769fba4-5fe5-4538-b336-5c195ab35537.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(257005682,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/257005682','Monica','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/915cfa08-1315-457c-8248-184c333be675.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(479684230,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/479684230','Judy','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd723e70-da4e-4dc7-9cf9-6fbdad152155.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22615259,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22615259','Erin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22615259/profile_pic/1413482309/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22697835,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22697835','Seth','Portland, OR','I have been an Airbnb super host for ten years.  I have enjoyed meeting many guests and have made some good friends in the process.  I have also stayed in a number of Airbnb homes around the country.\n\nI am a single gay man.  I run a non profit called Oregon Parks Forever.   I look forward to meeting you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b2dd07d-9b3f-42e9-9da5-0cb2088ab3b4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1032014,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1032014','The Society Hotel','Portland, OR','Welcome to The Society Hotel, where we redefine and resurrect history in what was once a sailor’s hotel.  Come experience the intersection of the past, present and future Portland, tucked away in the historic neighborhood of Old Town Chinatown. Change your hotel perspective, where true originals are appreciated, and adventurous travelers meet.\r\n\r\nAt The Society Hotel, we believe in making every traveler feel authentically connected to our community so they are ready to enjoy our beautiful city from day one. We offer three ways to experience our unique hotel: bunk rooms for the affordable community experience; private rooms with shared bathrooms for comfort without excess; and suites for a bit of affordable luxury. All of our rooms come with plush beds, 10-foot windows, high speed wifi, and a hospitality experience unlike any other.\r\n\r\nWe also offer two ADA compliant rooms for guests requiring greater ease of access. Book your room or suite today and come be a part of the Portland experience.\r\n\r\nWe only list half of our available rooms on Air BnB because of possible overbooking with our other booking avenues.  If we are sold out on Air BnB, check out our website! www.thesocietyhotel.com',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f1462e3-c64d-476d-8778-c7123ac1b300.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(248930295,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/248930295','Dharma','Portland, OR','I grew up moving between various countries and ended up in Oregon for college. I settled into this user-friendly city near beautiful wilderness with my husband, Andrew, our daughter, and our family dog. As a traveler, I like to take time to sink in to a place. Enjoying good laughs and great food anywhere is the best.  As a host, my goal is to provide a clean and cozy space to help guests feel comfortable, refreshed, and serene.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-248930295/original/2f54ff39-ac30-44bb-b6cf-6f7396487f61.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29167392,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29167392','Nam','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland, OR. My wife and I have one toddler and love everything about being a parent and love living in the Pacific Northwest. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-29167392/original/b65205c4-2c67-4d20-8b88-757ca72347fc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(135322695,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/135322695','Trisha','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/35b49101-74ff-4936-a0ba-fcae9ea7439e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17378091,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17378091','Erin','Portland, OR','Hey there! Thanks for checking out my profile. I\'m a native (4th generation!) Oregonian and lifelong Portlander. Need a restaurant recommendation, kid-friendly activity idea, or Portland geography lesson? Hit me up! \n\nWhen I\'m not hosting, I stay busy as a local realtor, helping clients buy and sell homes. If you\'re coming to town with real estate on the brain, feel free to get in touch, I\'m always happy to break it down for out-of-towners.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c2e8165b-061f-4be1-bb8b-6f0d40a5830b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(369441,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/369441','Michelle','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/93fed3e4-b9fb-497f-9414-166df0cde115.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23083044,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23083044','Ryan','Portland, OR','I\'m an artist and travel a lot to sell my work at art shows, which is awesome!  I hope to meet you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/498d0c7c-1381-4529-84ab-e314aaaea0d2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(156237727,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/156237727','Gwen','Portland, OR','My husband and I love to travel and explore. We’re usually pretty independent and low-maintenance, but love recommendations from locals in the places we visit!\r\nAs new AirBnB hosts we are still learning how this works and we appreciate feedback from our guests on how we can improve the experience for people staying in our basement apartment!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f0dce191-d499-405f-913a-fa808264ddf1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16627549,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16627549','Tawny','Portland, OR','I\'m a professional Event Planner and travel extensively. I\'ve visited many Airbnbs around the world, and I’m an Airbnb host myself in Portland, Oregon! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/16627549/profile_pic/1402428703/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(177429857,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/177429857','Christopher','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/354e2e19-43b7-454a-99e9-d248a3d7bf4e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182053001,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182053001','Veronica','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be5ad9d9-3578-4427-b2de-0b5ea7c799b4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(258045340,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/258045340','Luay','Portland, OR','I am an engineer who travel frequently and love exploring the world.\n\nI have lived in Portland for the last forty years and I love this place so much that I hope you will like it like I do.\n\nPortland is alive with cultural happenings, musical entertainment, theater, and a selection of other fun things to do. But those same rains also nourish the city\'s impressive gardens, one of the city\'s top attractions. Green spaces range from colorful plantings of roses and rhododendrons to a classical Chinese garden.\n\nPortland, the largest city in Oregon, straddles the Willamette River and is considered by many to be one of the most desirable places to live in the United States. \n\nEnjoy Mulnomah falls,   Columbia River Gorge, Powels City of Books, And you’re only an hour to Mt. Hood and an hour and a half to the beach.\n\nThe Art scene is unbelievable and don’t forget to check out OMSI.\n\nDon’t start me talking about the Microbrewery’s in Portland and Hood River.\n\nI hope you have a great time in PDX as much as I do.\n\nI hope you like my house, and I hope that you will enjoy the house and Portland.\n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9a867bab-79a3-4a62-9116-74872c28fd4f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(232864151,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/232864151','Cynthia','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cdee39e4-5d15-4621-bfb1-da76dd4b3570.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10437867,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10437867','Camille','Portland, OR','I grew up in the bay area, but I\'ve been living in Portland  over 40 years and it\'s been a great place to raise my kids.   I love hiking  and dancing.  I love passing my time by  doing art and craft projects.  I have 5 wonderful kids and 13 lovely grandchildren.  I  enjoy traveling so I can keep up with them all.  I work as an acupuncturist in private practice and in a chronic disease clinic.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10437867/profile_pic/1387062074/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8876448,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8876448','Marshall','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/251df4d1-098b-4699-9284-f1c30fef82a8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1909916,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1909916','Courtney','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96530aab-c96b-44c9-83e7-f721c8d56a83.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(259852767,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/259852767','Jermaine','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b6ed9c64-50bb-42bc-a6c7-634f4ccda148.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(259462630,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/259462630','Ben','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c736ef08-0854-48d1-8a19-5520c8640847.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66965972,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66965972','Merry','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2b1e9d4a-363c-44f8-a5e5-2ae75811b345.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(218234644,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/218234644','Jennifer','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/deb5cb37-43e3-4609-886b-7e85e3e71e24.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44352149,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44352149','Aiden','Scottsdale, AZ','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b1366e62-d761-4582-9e7a-769803dc597a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(103126489,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/103126489','Ethel','Portland, OR','We are an active family !\nWe love to travel and explore nature’s wonders: we also camp and visit national parks, ski during the winter, hike and enjoy local festivals, in short, we enjoy the gift of life! along with our two wonderful children. During those travels, we see an array of places to stay and we like to stay on higher end hotels and decent Airbnb.\n           We take pride and committed to making our haven comfortable, clean,safe  place that you can call home while away from the comfort of your own home. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1e9fb465-e3c8-4a67-b07c-ec99211243e2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26073388,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26073388','Lindsey','Portland, OR','I am a native Oregonian and I love living in Portland.  For the last 18 years I have been a teacher, working with students with disabilities.  In my free time, I am part of the local band \"The Ukeladies\", I love to get outdoors, spend time with my sweet husband Dan,  and our AussiePoo, Mila, and explore anything new.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/26073388/profile_pic/1421552959/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13109128,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13109128','Forest','','Welcome!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13109128/profile_pic/1394760986/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53617916,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53617916','Lisa','Corvallis, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9920aca7-99bc-4d69-8db9-e376a3700697.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23750692,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23750692','Qian','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Canton region of China, I have lived in 2 different countries and traveled across the world. Located in the Pacific Northwest, Portland is a place after visiting so many I want to call home.  It is a beautiful city close to the sea and mountains. I am a food scientist by trade, \n but I also enjoy hosting people on the side. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dfd6e61e-a636-4440-b8fe-3d2e1b0a94c2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5603277,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5603277','Nathan','Portland, OR','Heyya, I\'m a art director/ industrial designer and art curator who has been living in Portland for 13 years now. Before that I lived in NYC for 10 years, and Hong Kong for 2.\nI am into most things encountered at Comic Con, and 90s hip hop. I would rather spend a day vintage hunting than hiking. Other interests include art books, baseball, The Portland Trailblazers and mid-century design. I have never smoked a cigarette (but don\'t judge). I have been accused of having a great sense humor, and being very tidy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5603277/profile_pic/1364147847/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88039293,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88039293','Dave','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1d79a162-c022-4334-acdb-45ac69634614.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14513197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14513197','Marta','Portland, OR','We built this studio with an amazing contractor and we put a lot of hard work and love into it.  We hope you enjoy. \n\nMy life motto is to be kind to one another.  Life is fleeting and we never know how long we will be here. Why not be kind.\n\nStay awhile, take off your shoes, relax and share a drink and story with us if you like. If you want your privacy we respect that. \n\nWe hope you will book your next trip with us.\n\nMarta and Steve',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-14513197/original/cac97496-d791-43fb-9d44-e8c46e797822.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3700834,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3700834','Cathy','Portland, OR','Born in Canada but moved down the coast via Seattle and now to Portland.  A working professional who has a zest for life, travel and food.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9f3a2c15-4779-4250-bb64-583714b4a7e3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6949748,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6949748','Candice','Hamilton, Canada','I love the outdoors!...camping, canoeing, gardening, hiking, you name it.  I’m also into reading, antique hunting, food, beer/wine, good music, and travel.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/98db4259-5ec5-416c-bdc6-1407cc756a2f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4580020,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4580020','John','Portland, OR','Host of the guest house. I live in the main house with friends. I love to help answer any questions or with tips on things to do in the area. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4580020/profile_pic/1375211129/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(263251243,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/263251243','Sebastian','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0fdedf70-4a8a-4551-ab05-95eb1b6acf48.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(289998249,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/289998249','Lana','Portland, OR','Neighborhood gal that loves to keep exploring what Portland has to offer! Hosting an Airbnb with my mom <3',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ae5d5370-ed1f-4fb3-9a7e-45e6659de7d1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21101389,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21101389','Salvador','Portland, OR','Hello, we live in North Portland where we work in the design and education industry.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21101389/original/e2b0a18f-57d7-4f55-8298-920220a28095.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(117204372,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/117204372','Jamie And Senna','','Hi there, we are native Oregonians, have three kids and two sweet black labs.  We love adventuring together, and sharing our amazing neighborhood with everyone.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0dfd42fd-cca9-483b-9d3e-492b4707e18d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(264765755,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/264765755','Paul','','We live in Portland part-time and are making our second home available to others to stay in. We absolutely love it here and plan to move in permanently one day.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c078268-75b9-466c-bb55-f586cb140ce1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8804265,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8804265','Rick & Allegra','Portland, OR','We\'ve lived in Portland for more than a decade. We\'ve explored, hiked and eaten our way across the state. We\'ve hosted friends and family, with and without kids, and now we\'re opening our space up to others who are visiting Portland for work or fun. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/22f92e17-3748-4680-95ca-c02b386e3754.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26712397,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26712397','Julie','Portland, OR','Well-traveled! Aware, friendly, approachable, respectful, easy to get along with, foodie, wine, books, blogs, music, movies, documentaries. \n\nLove gardening! The Mad Planter! DIY projects!\nLife with teens!  \nPet lover!  \n\nWe’ve got a beautiful young Golden Shepherd mix. \n\n\"There is a crack, a crack in everything\nThat\'s how the light gets in\"\n\nAnthem by Leonard Cohen',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1e6e2c71-8b2b-466f-8dee-d5b8b8001810.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51858478,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51858478','Trevor','Portland, OR','I am a project engineer original from Detroit, MI.  I am a huge sports fan and still play sports multiple days a week.  I enjoy traveling to see new places and try local beer and food.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcfce4f4-e7c1-4e58-b8a1-fb6add1ea388.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(498934,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/498934','Matthew','Mars Hill, NC','My name is Matt I grew up in North Carolina most of my life and have always loved the outdoors.  I now live in  Portland OR  with my wife Lindsay and We love it out here.  We keep a small studio Airbnb a our home and often travel with Airbnb. We love experiencing all that the world has to offer and have had the great pleasure and privilege to experience places near and far. I formally studied Landscape Architecture and currently run a small landscape construction business Check us out (www.whereisthegnome.com) .  When I am not at work which is way too often I am at the dog park on a hike, camping, skiing, or at a watering hole adventure with my patterned in crime Lindsay and our two fur children Emma (woof) and Toby (meow).  I like constant movement in my life so the more travel I can cram into this great life the better. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/27cc2028-0fbc-4604-9065-9935bf12bfab.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(793916,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/793916','Liz','Portland, OR','Hi! My husband Ben and our two little kids live here and we love love love our little corner of the city and spend most evenings exploring our neighborhood, finding great coffee, beer, food, books and places to spread out a blanket for a picnic. \r\n\r\nWe started a social enterprise HQ\'d here in Portland called Sseko Designs. We love taking our pop top Eurovan out on adventures around the Northwest and we love renting our home out while we are busy playing in the Great Outdoors!\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aed72ab5-167c-4711-9202-d8197522c64a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6484099,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6484099','Sarah','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6484099/profile_pic/1425765382/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27977619,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27977619','Julie','Portland, OR','I\'m a native Oregonian, retired, but active. I love hiking here in the Northwest, walking Portland neighborhoods, and finding new places to explore. I\'m not a real foodie, but sure enjoy the restaurants in my community!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c5458f08-9322-47f2-8908-079b80ec0252.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(448315275,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/448315275','Geoff','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8668a206-b0ee-445c-8266-02a087850794.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8013108,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8013108','Bri','Portland, OR','I was born and raised in the PNW, so I love all things Portland. Specifically, the food! But I also really love playing outdoors with my family (the hubs, dog and two baby girls).\r\n\r\nWe like to travel. One of our favorite trips was to the Iditarod. I\'m a big reader and usually have a book with me. The best book I’ve read recently is Anxious People, by Fredrik Backman. I\'m an Enneagram 3, Philadelphia Eagles fan, retired school counselor (for now!) and wine enthusiast.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/72b809d0-b6c8-43c4-8657-874c5b30ae4e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5231006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5231006','Dawn','Portland, OR','I am an Oregon native from Eugene to Portland.  I enjoy traveling the world, hiking, gardening, giant bubbles, sing along\'s with friends by the fire and most of all SCUBA diving.   I am always up for an exciting adventure!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5231006/profile_pic/1363667832/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3005870,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3005870','Jiah','Portland, OR','I have lived in Portland my whole life.  In my free time I’m spending time with my family, gardening and cooking.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ecb6cbb-ad98-46e4-a9c5-6dd376ac1e4c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16213970,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16213970','Susannah','Portland, OR','A community builder and urban farmer from Portland, Oregon!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f475eedd-d553-4dc3-838f-e82b241d13dc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(215058058,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/215058058','Josh And Carlie','Portland, OR','Hello! We are the Burgeson family (Josh and Carlie) and we run \"Stay Awhile Cohosting\" a professional cohosting service based out of Portland, OR. We aim to provide comfortable, clean and rejuvenating accommodations for any traveler that stays in one of our Airbnb units that we cohost.  We love our hometown in the Northwest and spending our spare time exploring the unique neighborhoods and experiences in the beautiful city of Portland. If you are looking for a solid food spot, we are eager to offer our recommendations... we spend a lot of time scouting out the best local eateries :)\nWelcome to all of our future guests.\n\nCheers!\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0df9589f-2752-4ee9-bfb0-e2fd54a1cc20.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(85513975,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/85513975','Erik','','I\'m a Business Manager. I travel often for both work & pleasure, and love being the best host I can be to my guests.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f3146380-9e96-47e9-a3f0-d4d4c0d139ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16783762,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16783762','Andrew','Tucson, AZ','Hi!  I live in Tucson with my wife Julia and son Luciano.  Durango is a second home for us, discovered when we lived in Northern Arizona.  We hope you live our place as much as we do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c0b2f2b0-ec18-4bf6-a848-1562b200b6cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76418105,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76418105','Estelle','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e80540f9-3d8c-427a-babf-4b6fcfe49356.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1406738,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1406738','Michael','Portland, OR','We are a small family who loves hanging out! We both were born in Portland, but met in LA and moved back in our early 20s. We love hosting and meeting new people - we believe Every Day is a Big Day. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ec1e78c3-9b04-4974-8381-12b1fbee429b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(94623462,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/94623462','Kathleen','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a22d0659-c2de-46b6-b365-dd60123c35fa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(488928,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/488928','Ben','Portland, OR','Originally from Chicago.  Living in Portland, OR since 2013.  I started in health care as an RN and now I buy and sell, as well as manage, real estate as a licensed broker in the state of Oregon.  I am a hiker, biker, runner, eater, and more.  We are super neat when we travel and can see things from a \"host\" perspective.  We travel to do all the things we love.  We love to share our favorite activities and advice on places to eat, things to see and explore, as well as try to be \"local and respectful\".  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/063e1456-4162-4d2a-8615-379eb9937a30.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(103005225,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/103005225','Zosia','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is Zosia and together with my husband, James, we live in Montavilla, a lovely neighborhood in east Portland, Oregon. We both love traveling and even though we are currently working in Portland, we try to get out of the city as often as we can to enjoy the beautiful Oregonian nature. We are happy to share our home with other travelers who enjoy peace and proximity to great Portland\'s bars, movie theaters, parks, and others.  More description of our house in the part about the space. We hope you like it!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8c7db6e7-b7ce-47c4-aea2-eee3ed8ff1b7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(200194273,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/200194273','Susan','Portland, OR','(Susan, your main hostess): I grew up in the Pacific Northwest (Washington and Oregon), and although I have travelled internationally and nationally, I have lived and worked in the PNW all of my life. I’m trained as a botanist and currently for work I manage an outdoor-focused volunteer program. I\'m also a licensed massage therapist. I like animals and have a (usually) adorable and (always) precocious little black cat named Middie, who has the run of the house and yard. I enjoy time with family and friends, gardening, local live music, good food and drink, international and local travel, and most outdoor pursuits, including camping, hiking, foraging, biking, and paddleboarding. \n\nNote: the first Review listed for me as an Airbnb guest is actually written about my Austrian hostmom; I set up an Airbnb stay for her in the Columbia Gorge while she was visiting me. In addition, my nephew Andreas lives in the main house, is a secondary contact for guesthouse guests, and speaks and understands very basic Japanese. Я також трохи розмовляю українською, але не дуже - Я вчився лише останні два роки!\n\n(Susan, deine Gastgeberin): Ich bin in Washington Staat geboren, in der Nähe von Seattle, und wohnte seit 1997 in Portland. Mein ganzes Leben habe ich in Washington und Oregon gewohnt und gearbeitet, aber ich reise gerne, und habe Kanada, Japan, Thailand, Europa, England, Skandinavian und anderen US Staaten besucht. Ich bin Botanikerin, und arbeite für das Stadtpark Büro. Ich bin auch Massagetherapeutin. Tiere habe ich gerne, und ich habe eine kleine schwartze Katze, die “Middie” heißt. Sie ist (normalerweise) lieb und (immer) lebhaft, und wird oft im Garten sein. Ich genieße den Garten, Konzerte, Restaurants und Lokale; auch Camping, Wandern, Nahrungssuche (für Pflänze herumkramen), fahrradfahren, ˵Paddleboarding” und Familien und Freunden zu besuchen. Mein Deutsch ist beschränkt, aber ich werde bestens versuchen, alle Fragen zu antworten!  \n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9f8165e4-4ae5-40a5-b1ab-c6d8de0c2fb0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(270114277,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/270114277','Hotel Rose','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/92e962d6-5485-431b-a6e7-de9eacbf08f8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(272318368,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/272318368','Adam','Portland, OR','Hey!\n\nI’m Adam. I live in Portland, Oregon. I grew up in Montana. I spent a large part of my life as a professional musician and the last decade running an innovative technology firm which specializes in scaling digital brands. Most of my travel is search of opportunities and thus, that feels relevant :)\n\nTY!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2399d6f7-0198-454d-b5a5-0056c08081c3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5524096,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5524096','Virginia','Portland, OR','Virginia spent the first decade of her adult life in hotel management, ensuring exceptional hospitality to guests in hip boutique hotels, full-service resorts, and intimate bed and breakfasts across the United States. She also traveled internationally, selling hotel software and providing guest service training. Born and raised in the American West, she is always happiest when sharing its wonders, whether they be the tide pools of the Pacific, the rugged mountains, the valley vineyards of Sonoma, or the incredible local food. When she’s not busy welcoming folks to her city, she’s likely chasing down her two kids or twelve chickens, growing as many vegetables as possible, or writing fiction about the American West.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8100243e-e3c1-4185-a013-daecd9d54bb5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(273076012,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/273076012','Dalouny','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6f365d5c-be00-4ecb-9437-1b229750ada2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6326768,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6326768','Debra','Portland, OR',' I have lived in Portland, OR for over 20 years (Kansas transplant).  I work too much, but enjoy watching sports (horrible at playing sports), being a foodie, hanging out with friends & family, and loving on my two Ridgebacks.  I mostly travel for work, which is terrible.  I should change that.  I recently became a host on here and have loved every minute of welcoming guests to the Studio! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6fe04166-76b8-4d39-84dd-f846b6a7a03d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16297531,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16297531','Jodie','Portland, OR','Hello! I’m a native Oregonian. I own a hair salon and a yoga studio in Old Town Portland. I’ve lived in this neighborhood since 2006. I have a 21 year old son and a 14 year old tiny Australian Shepard named Coco. I love traveling in my van to stay in nature as much as possible, which is how I am able to share my house when I am gone.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24279ef6-d1a1-4d5b-982a-c9a250b60f39.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111797565,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111797565','Vacasa Oregon','','Hi, we’re Vacasa, North America’s largest vacation rental management company. Owners of vacation homes around the world trust us to deliver exceptional service throughout your entire vacation. Professional housekeepers clean and stock each home, and our customer care team is available around the clock—with a local property manager ready to show up and help out. We like to think we offer the best of both worlds: you can enjoy a one-of-a-kind vacation experience in a unique property, without compromising on service and convenience. Check out our listings, and get in touch if you have any questions. Your vacation is our full-time job, and we\'d love to help you plan your perfect getaway.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee725bea-59fa-4967-8225-1051e1512ed7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(266083019,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/266083019','Extra Holidays®','Orlando, FL','Stretch out and relax in spacious resort suites while experiencing all the comforts of home. Most suites are equipped with a full kitchen, washer/dryer, private bedrooms, separate living/dining areas and unbeatable resort amenities for everyone. Extra Holidays® is the official resort condo rental source for Club Wyndham®, WorldMark by Wyndham®, Shell Vacations Club® and Margaritaville Vacation Club® by Wyndham.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f330d996-10f2-476c-a784-7cbc23df3804.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30323140,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30323140','Ely','Portland, OR','Its great living in Oregon. Love outdoors, design, art and food!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/906a4f71-1a5e-41cf-9d08-7ba2eb1200ec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9195404,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9195404','Dixie','Portland, OR','We enjoy hiking, exploring nature and different cities and towns, from a comfortable launchpad.  Time well spent when we watch movies, read, eat, laugh, and not have too much fuss or attention. Healthy, happy and love what I do.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f0b429f-a0d7-4749-96c0-2bd556f1edba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(231707604,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/231707604','Charles','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-231707604/original/9ae73bc5-0b2b-4582-9cc3-9783a14a3176.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6692974,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6692974','Paul & Mandie','Vancouver, WA','We love to travel! Most recently we went to London, Amsterdam and Germany. \r\n\r\nWe have rented to long term tenants for over 18 years.  We have now been renting short term for about 10 years.  We hope that each of our guests feels as comfortable as any family or friend that stays with us. \r\n\nDue to our work schedules one of us is usually available most hours of the day and will make ourselves available as needed.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6692974/profile_pic/1370170534/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36442855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36442855','Stephy','Portland, OR','Hi, we’re Portland natives. I’m a personal stylist and my husband Danny is in Human Resources. Our children are off to college now, so we\'re enjoying this new phase. We love hanging out with friends sharing good food and drink around a bonfire, inventing stay-cations, attending a local soccer match, hiking in the Columbia gorge and riding our bikes all over Portland.  We look forward to hosting you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/dc2a8b63-2e0b-4eb3-a7fe-26fe9e3f6fbf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(147708508,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/147708508','Deborah','Portland, OR','I live in the area of the apartment and enjoy walking to all the nearby local restaurants and night life!  I am always planning my next adventure...wandering our many parks and gardens, hiking or hanging in local brewpubs to play pool, shuffleboard or watch a game but, nothing beats the ocean!! I’m a little bit of a thrill seeker! I love zip lining and the Willamette Jet boat tours!! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d7bb2a48-ada6-4182-80c1-3d6c50d93552.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18796965,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18796965','Sara','Portland, OR','I am a traveler, artist, mother, animal lover and I love remodeling old homes. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/18796965/profile_pic/1406204763/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(277105198,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/277105198','Tim','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-277105198/original/35da6723-58a0-4958-b293-f75a51b17ca3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5237519,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5237519','Lee','Portland, OR','My family and I love traveling the NW and Beyond. We also Host.\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5237519/profile_pic/1363276362/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(113311649,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/113311649','Christina','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-113311649/original/fe97bc0e-1453-4bee-b31d-79a9ad89a9ce.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(159041849,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/159041849','Sam','Portland, OR','My girlfriend Laurel and I are both employed in the field of social work.  I have resided in Portland, Oregon for over 20 years and Laurel moved here from LA in 2011. Aside from our jobs, we enjoy exercising, traveling, camping and probably above all reading while relaxing together.  We appreciate and celebrate differences, and are always trying to be thoughtful in our dealings with others.  We enjoy hosting our home and get immense satisfaction from others enjoying a space we’ve created that fits our aesthetic.  We additionally enjoy staying at other Airbnbs and experiencing the personal touches others have put into their homes.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/376d82a9-9ee5-4d67-9419-e196a4b8b758.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(245001079,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/245001079','Tissa','Portland, OR','I would describe myself as friendly but private! As your host you will find me responsive to your needs and eager to accommodate. I have loved working to make my home the kind of place that I would relish spending time in! Creating comfortable living areas has always been a favorite activity along with cooking and gardening and walking with my dog.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4eacae96-96b7-420f-adcf-82aa04a4d20b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33769719,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33769719','Scott','Portland, OR','I work in Information Technology. Own my house in Portland, Oregon. Enjoy going on hikes or to live music at small venues.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/42ad07da-fe5f-47b0-ba21-74ae820f98c0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77990596,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77990596','Jodi','Portland, OR','Hello! I\'m Jodi (pronouns: she/her)\n\nAs host, I\'m keen to help make your experience in Portland as comfortable and homey as possible. I enjoy sharing my tranquil backyard setting with guests and have a healthy appreciation for a balance of both adventure and quiet solitude. \n\nPortland has been my home for 20+ years and I\'m happy to provide local recommendations and insights or simply a friendly wave in passing, depending on your preference. \n\nTravel is also one of my passions–I\'ve been lucky to explore much of the U.S., Costa Rica, Canada, Mexico, Fiji, Ireland, New Zealand, Bali, and Thailand so far. I enjoy scuba diving, surfing, learning new cultures and languages, discovering great food and wine, catching art house flicks or local bands, playing tabletop board games, and I also love curling up with a good book - whiling away a day with no obligations. \n\nI\'m a non-smoker, courteous and responsible, liberal and open-minded. As both a guest and host I\'m friendly but independent and it\'s most likely you won\'t hear me or see me much at all. \nWhen traveling I appreciate local recommendations and like to plan very little, allowing my experiences and adventures to unfold in the moment. \n\nAnd I\'m always open to answer more questions should you have them! : ) ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3142f9eb-a7b5-48e6-814f-ca5b2ee4a050.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(275151873,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/275151873','Kip','Portland, OR','Hi. I\'ve lived in Portland since 1993.  I like golfing, blazer games, going to live music and hanging out in this fun town. If I get a chance,  do a little traveling. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-275151873/original/4e8f7b2c-098f-48aa-bcf6-bb2ea0bd6d0c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(278674051,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/278674051','Sarah','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4096ef9b-5637-4b17-bdf4-00bc21785124.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1618,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1618','Elaine','Portland, OR','A little about me:\r\nI a young professional female, working on drinking water\r\nand watershed protection issues. I love independent art, music and\r\nfilm and try to get out as much as possible to check out as much independent art, food or music... On weekends and whenever possible, I try to get outside as much as possible - mountain biking, surfing and hiking are some of my favorite things - I\'d love to share recommendations for the area to help you make your trip a wonderful one!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f05f4a8-983e-492f-91a8-9b204184c80a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3240723,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3240723','Mark','Portland, OR','We are a middle aged left leaning empty nest couple consisting of Mark the lawyer/kayaker/cyclist and Lois the social worker/artist',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3240723/profile_pic/1344832182/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(280375947,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/280375947','Angela','Portland, OR','Pronouns:  She/Her \nI am a proud mom of two boys, and lover of adventure! A midwestern girl at heart (grew up in Illinois), I now have a Pacific Northwest flavor swirled in. While I have an advanced degree, my favorite job is raising two young humans and teaching them the importance of trying to make the world a better place. I hope to be able to meet you during your visit and say \"Hi!”  My motto in life is to \"live without regrets.\"',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/b8c03b1f-a862-460f-bf26-1daefa4f43f9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64846618,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64846618','Ryan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/87e74509-2683-4a62-8baf-f95e38f7413d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49879856,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49879856','April','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79c58137-1a6d-4c41-916a-742d930db234.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59272527,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59272527','Alyssa','Portland, OR','I was born and raised in PDX, so I love showing people my city!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/39697831-c9e5-41b2-86a3-4da80fbfe8d8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(282238879,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/282238879','Estelle','Portland, OR','I grew up in the Willamette Valley and finally settling in Portland after college. As a NW native, I love and appreciate the outdoors including all our lovely liquid sunshine. My family is here. My friends are here. It is home. I\'m excited to share my home with others passing by or settling in. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c9a4607a-2111-4436-81be-25b224ef7c57.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3983058,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3983058','Lindsey','Portland, OR','Hi there,\nI am a Portland native--which is almost the same as being a magical unicorn these days;) I love this city--and especially this neighborhood.\n\nHISTORY:\nI grew up in Eastmorland and realized that that is the only part of the world that I want to live in. My all time favorite thing to do is to walk down Reed College Place--it takes my breath away.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ae5a55ea-f436-4292-9b9a-6a4288c25757.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(282537740,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/282537740','Kerry','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3327a98-cad7-4d82-aaa9-4bd6e9637d30.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(283783090,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/283783090','Natalie','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland.  I love the opportunity to show people my city! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b3feca9-e9f3-406c-8d7f-9406ae139550.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17054337,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17054337','Molly','Portland, OR','I am an adventure-loving person who enjoys nature and the outdoors, as well as hanging inside with a good book and a cup of tea. I\'m a teacher to many and mom to one. I also have the world\'s most adorable and well-behaved labradoodle. I\'m very responsible and will treat your place even better than my own home! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8af30cbc-77f3-4edf-bfc9-3a16db80cae1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65785806,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65785806','Charles','Portland, OR','Tidy traveler, happy hoster, amateur gardener, bicycle rider.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aaceda2e-864f-454b-9a0b-2cb7a1084e48.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21967638,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21967638','Hannah','Portland, OR','Hi there! I am an electrical designer who has lived in Portland for 7 years. I enjoy exploring, food, tea, reading, bicycling, and playing with my dog Millie. I work  as an engineer and I love to travel!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af1dd798-fa05-410b-8a0e-255ba4f8667e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48377732,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48377732','Andy','United States','I\'ve spent most my life in the Pacific Northwest.  My family currently lives in Portland, OR and we love it. My wife and I take every opportunity we get to travel with our 3 kids and we are always up for an adventure. One of our favorite vacations was road tripping from Whidbey Island to Nashville, Tennessee. We took our time hiking, swimming, and eating our way through 23 states.  We have enjoyed our Airbnb experiences and are looking forward to more! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0f9b717a-d043-4e89-9f05-dd19fbd5c3c1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4135090,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4135090','Brett','Portland, OR','I love travelling to great places and meeting great people (obviously). As a host, I also love ensuring all our guests have a convenient, amazing visit. When I have free time I enjoy woodworking, craft cocktails, biking, building, and creating. As a traveller, I love to get out and experience as much as I can and more than happy to help you do the same as your host.  Feel free to ask me any questions about staying in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4135090/profile_pic/1352788499/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182183418,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182183418','Massène','Lake Oswego, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f6e0b859-00ce-4b3b-bc55-c7e3b8d14ad3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19350780,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19350780','Bryan','San Mateo, CA','I love travelling around and exploring local cuisine. I\'m a big fan of bbq and recently went on a bbq tour across the United States.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee6e0f7c-905d-453c-8def-fd576a3639bc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(285663945,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/285663945','ThreeWishes','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/77c6ffbf-e8a3-4e04-8145-3ae278418f7a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4484796,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4484796','Nicole','Portland, OR','Artist who loves to travel and be outdoors. I garden, cook, paint, bike, hike, run and read. Fascinated by what drives people to do what they do and learning about other cultures. There is always something growing in the yard and cooking in the kitchen and I am more than happy to share. Looking forward to meeting fellow travelers and learning about their experiences.\n\nI speak very basic conversational Spanish, but I am far from fluent.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4484796/profile_pic/1356424309/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(87625287,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/87625287','Dan','Portland, OR','I am a retired university professor and live a simple life. I like to travel, and use AirBNB often, although home is best. I\'m a hands-off host and try to maintain a quiet, welcoming atmosphere. I enjoy reading, spending time with family, movies, coffee, and more.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef650bf5-5922-4475-99b8-5f016a8538d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22122683,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22122683','Susan','Portland, OR','Traveler, volunteer, kayaker, adventurer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f3e06565-813a-4100-9fae-5974ee5863c3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4139334,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4139334','Kristine','Portland, OR','Hi my name is Kristine and I’ve lived in Portland almost all of my life.  I love to travel, laugh and enjoy life. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4139334/profile_pic/1352829251/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(152882319,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/152882319','Shannon','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d3472b99-f991-4ddc-98c0-093fa0709bd8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12993408,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12993408','Hunter','Portland, OR','I\'m a 30-something who loves to travel and learn languages. I\'m interested in the world and how everyone fits into it, and of course, in meeting people! I also dig exercising, hiking, cooking and reading. I\'m also pretty fresh and pretty clean. \n\nI use rentals as a home-base usually in places that I haven\'t explored very much.  I have hosted dozens of people at my home in Portland and the experience has been great!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12993408/profile_pic/1401995639/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(288537764,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/288537764','Kate','Oregon, United States','I am a born and raised Oregonian, and love how much the pacific northwest has to offer. I love it so much I decided to start my family here! I come from a background in hospitality and am so excited to return to that with my home on airbnb. It’s just the greatest feeling ever when a guest is able to create a good memory and to have helped make that happen. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a90818eb-4e2f-4d1c-a671-09753926dfb1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27703529,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27703529','Laura','Portland, OR','I\'ve had many memorable Airbnb stays -  with gracious, friendly hosts and it\'s my pleasure to pay it forward. Welcoming travelers makes me happy. I try to cross paths at least once to make the stay personal. I’ve lived in Portland a long time and can recommend restaurants/bars, breweries and local activities.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-27703529/original/09fb9643-85b1-4686-94c6-f41276aba516.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(290147674,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/290147674','Jade','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3e5d9876-1c72-48b0-b62a-16c0aec12c7c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(274097987,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/274097987','David','Portland, OR','We are a travel loving couple from Portland, Oregon looking forward to enjoying time in your area. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/02fbd50b-9298-49f9-82da-dd101fc11745.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52253283,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52253283','Carrie','Portland, OR','Lover of nature, animals, and all things design. I\'m the owner of Planet Design, a residential interior design firm specializing in high end new construction, remodeling, and furnishings. \n\nI\'ve lived in Portland for 25 years, 23 in my current home, and I fall in love with my little city a little more each time I\'m able to share it. \n\nCreating a place to host my family and guests has been a dream come true. \n\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0ac6abd8-5734-4427-a51a-b19924a672b0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(83532914,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/83532914','Alex','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5b61d3e4-4650-4fa2-b6a7-8e3b5c0bc0f4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25370041,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25370041','Amaranth','Portland, OR','I was born and raised in Oregon with a deep love for nature and being outside. I have a grown daughter and now host out of my home.\nI play with aromatherapy using essential oils to help people\'s moods. I\'ve worked in the food and wellness industries and have extensive herbal knowledge and like helping people in their self care journey. I like to think of my place to rejuvenate.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-25370041/original/d4223e04-dcc5-43b4-8fb5-b7d7b6ccf391.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56432819,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56432819','Larissa','Portland, OR','I\'m Australian, from Tasmania. These days I\'m based in beautiful Portland, Oregon where I own a lovely house. I love to travel, sail, trail run, and generally be in the great outdoors. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/002fcb9d-d6e5-4ead-bc83-ef70e6c490c4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150316808,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150316808','Karen','Portland, OR','Outdoorsy Portlander.  I love camping, hiking, biking, paddle boarding, gardening, cooking and PORTLAND THORNS FC!!!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/785d01d0-b8e1-47b6-ae9c-fec7cd7c063b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2574467,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2574467','Jennie & Kevin','Portland, OR','Jennie is a scientist (and knitter, runner, etc) and Kevin is a contractor (and surfer, large calorie consumer, etc) from Portland, OR. We have an adorable (and crazy) cat named Meatball and the sweetest rescue pup in all the land named Pico. We love to travel and explore using AirBnB.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2574467/profile_pic/1402708132/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114861645,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114861645','Nina','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ef29f66-d0b9-44e0-be6b-d348cbd88c6c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13540222,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13540222','Jay','Portland, OR','My wife and I own a large health club I Portland, Oregon. We appreciate the effort that people put into their health (as well as the effort they put into decorating) \nWe are mostly stay-close-to-home folks, but definitely like the occasional getaway. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0add9aa0-b8a0-4eed-8b14-371c09b0fccd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59233279,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59233279','Michele','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/97635267-2472-461d-8660-a409b69a4ea6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12056976,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12056976','Heidi','Portland, OR','Hello! Mike and I  have lived in our SE Portland home for over 15 years. We have 2 sweet dogs and we enjoy taking them on walks and hikes around the city. We love traveling and spending time in nature.  Mike is an arborist and I am a massage therapist.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e3528ad-e055-4a4c-ae97-0f47e95373f0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(96243932,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/96243932','Hussam','San Francisco, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f76ef5c0-81d4-49c4-8e9c-b51ed8d426d8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88749047,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88749047','Anne','Portland, OR','Hi there!  I\'m an acupuncturist in Portland who loves bikes, critters, & playing on the water.  \n\nMy husband and I are also AirBnB hosts, so we understand the concerns of a host, and the kind of guest one hopes to attract.  (I am that guest.)   \n\n5 Things I Can\'t Live Without:  Hot sauce, a good night\'s sleep, exercise, sunshine, & comedy.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/382fee95-71ae-40f1-ada2-52f5353c01a8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(774106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/774106','Sharon','Oakland, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f36b9763-4968-41c9-93cf-a6c5d90cd86b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(272145512,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/272145512','Amy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eb280add-626a-46d5-99ca-5235f9b88136.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1723786,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1723786','Ella (Helena)','Portland, OR','Lover of lemony desserts, direct flights, bidets. \n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1723786/profile_pic/1418059236/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9745512,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9745512','Jim','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f641c1aa-94bf-4929-a881-d4a898286c64.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10525989,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10525989','Tamara','Portland, OR','I love supporting all the amazing small businesses in Portland and wherever we travel!\n\nI own a consignment shop in the Portland area. I have been an Airbnb host for 4 years now and we love hosting and sharing our love of travel with our guests. I absolutely love staying in airbnbs when we travel and to be able to cook some meals at “home”. \n\nOur goal is that you feel you have everything you need to be comfortable so please always let us know if you need anything. \n\nMy husband, Nathan, works in healthcare. Miso, is our quiet, strange Japanese chin/long hair chihuahua dog.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-10525989/original/80e8b905-5bfd-4874-ad41-0d2da86e9731.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7219122,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7219122','Peter','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f55c80d9-15f7-4938-8ed2-f6943bd124cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(319750330,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/319750330','Frankie','Portland, OR','Portland native.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-319750330/original/2d8b353d-2c1f-4b9c-b4c9-a20d616857d0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11439956,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11439956','Adam','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/10747973-260f-4811-8b11-3477b9349782.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40890090,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40890090','Sara','Portland, OR','I\'m a working professional and a mother of two who has had the pleasure of calling the Pacific Northwest home for over 15 years. I love meeting new people, experiencing new places, and being outside as much as possible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/139c0e57-d56a-4ba0-b904-2a2674448aef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(200142887,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/200142887','Punneh','Portland, OR','Looking for new places to see',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1be00275-f7b8-420b-a858-2e0c86d1fe9e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(623138,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/623138','Nick','Portland, OR','Traveler extraordinaire',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a191a746-23df-4559-a4c2-fdc9520d958a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(300761993,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/300761993','Mari','Portland, OR','Originally from Hawaii, i moved to Portland almost 25 years ago. As a foodie, lover of arts, and outdoor enthusiast, it has been a joy to witness Portland’s transformation into one of the most dynamic and livable cities in America. \n\nOur Historic SE Portland neighborhood is consistently voted one of the most accessible in the city --  beautiful, well kept rose gardens for warm-weather enjoyment, great routes for walks, jogs and quick bike rides to wonderful food, coffee, shopping and lovely parks. We love our quick access to just about anywhere in our fine city.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/03239f57-c69f-43f2-9a48-aea962842483.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4580337,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4580337','Keiran','Portland, OR','A long-time collector of treasure and maker of home, curating a comfortable and lovely place to lay my head, gather, entertain and create has always been a priority for me.  Though I have lived in Portland, OR for 13 years and love it here, I am a bit of a nomad myself.  I was raised in the Midwest , went to school on the East Coast and have lived in 6 different cities since.  I own an beautiful shop in the Pearl district downtown and travel quite a lot for work and for pleasure.  When I am home I spend much of my time in my garden or in my studio where I make ceramics and jewelry.  When away from home, as much as possible, I like to stay with family and friends, preferring the comforts of home to those of a hotel.  I hope you will enjoy your stay in my house, my neighborhood and my city.  Welcome!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4580337/profile_pic/1357256489/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(155798693,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/155798693','Courtney','Portland, OR','Welcome! For as long as I can remember I have loved to travel, and after enjoying Airbnbs around the world, I am delighted to have the opportunity share with you some of the outstanding hospitality that I have been shown here and abroad, and share with you this unique and beautiful city that I call home.\n\nIf you have any questions, or there is anything that I can do to improve your experience, please do not hesitate to reach out.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-155798693/original/12b6f629-e462-44ee-b751-f40dbefd59be.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46411027,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46411027','Rosalind','Portland, OR','In regular times, I love to travel! I work in technology and love rock climbing, cycling, food, and the outdoors. I have a young son and we enjoy adventures together. \n\nAs a guest and host, my goal is always to make our interactions pleasant, purposeful, and empowering. We are delighted to host from our home, and over the years have been blessed to stay at many awesome rentals!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c5e540a-7162-4291-a547-dc9a74b4eb59.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13642877,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13642877','Gabe','Portland, OR','I\'ve been living in Portland since 2011 and enjoy everything the city has to offer as well as the outdoor adventures that Oregon provides. I\'m a single dad raising two boys so I\'ve decided to host our home on AirBnB to bring in some extra income. I look forward to meeting you!\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13642877/profile_pic/1399175984/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20913493,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20913493','Rachel','Los Angeles, CA','Hi, I’m Rachel. I work mostly in LA and travel often for work. Air bnb has been so good to me so I’m now opening my home for guests! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20913493/profile_pic/1409797793/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11187732,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11187732','Rayney','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-11187732/original/897c638b-94cb-4fa5-aafe-4257a58b11ec.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(284536420,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/284536420','Ann','Portland, OR','I grew up in Portland. I like Portland for the variety of things to do. \n I like reading going for walks or hikes and beaches. \nI have two cats Cookie and Chloe.  \n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3802cc04-3b65-4e66-80da-2c025c77f292.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8193204,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8193204','Becca','Portland, OR','Flight nurse who likes to travel, play & adventure near and far.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a7fd1088-875d-496a-abd3-a85a3d6a997a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(91318098,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/91318098','Katelyn & Ryan','Portland, OR','Hi Airbnb friends, \n\nWe are Katelyn and Ryan! \n\nKatelyn, born and raised in Southern California.  A private play-based behavior interventionist and recipe developer for kiddos with Autism. A lover of nature, live music (remember that?),  a good bonfire hang,  traveling and experiencing different cultures. \n\nRyan grew up here in Portland and moved to Southern California (where we met <3 ! ) 15 years ago. Ryan works in apparel and is a co-founder of an e-commerce/direct to consumer brand, and advisor and consultant to other DTC brands. Passionate about photography, tech, and finding all of the best restaurants and eclectic places to visit while traveling. \n\nWe are excited about hosting you on your next adventure in PDX! \n\nCheers,\nK+R',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd75aff3-b7f6-4415-bd2b-224b162d7e09.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66078799,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66078799','Shana','Portland, OR','Former Angelino, now making my home in Portland, OR. I love to travel and host traveling friends.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3bf1926b-8a40-4375-ac0f-30d7ebf6eb4e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(156974251,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/156974251','Melissa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3d2cc013-299f-4842-8ec9-c6be816121aa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20165180,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20165180','Alex','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20165180/profile_pic/1439258772/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56994880,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56994880','Kathy','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/598e16d2-7b5c-45be-b631-e34c057962e7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(354428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/354428','Julie','Los Angeles, CA','love to travel and a real hippie at heart\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9a966ac7-db29-4e23-84a8-ec40e3be22bc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(298839013,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/298839013','Antonio','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9196ecf8-7340-42cf-97a6-34f210ba6653.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(147102358,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/147102358','Michael','Portland, OR','Hi I’m Mike, \nI’m a chef here in Portland and I absolutely love the food scene here in town. I’ve lived here almost four years but I’m still discovering all Portland has to offer, so if you find something fun, let me know!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a633e6f5-f3c9-4019-89f7-6771735040eb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20936849,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20936849','Jiying','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f0cdb554-0ec4-4cc2-8ddf-9b496d692cc1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(241947014,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/241947014','Sarah','Portland, OR','Mom of three, business owner, outdoors lover. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-241947014/original/4431745f-d566-4817-b096-cd85f914a8bd.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(766064,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/766064','Carla','','My husband Rex & I love sharing our vacation homes in Bandon. The beaches are just wonderful and never crowded. We also enjoy golf in Bandon, especially at Bandon Crossings (ask me about it!) Maybe we\'ll retire someday and spend more time there! In the meantime we also travel to Portland and have a vacation rental house there as well, Cora Street Retreat.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/28ad56a5-6cec-4ad3-a7be-c3abc849e007.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45233333,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45233333','Josie','Portland, OR','Hello I\'m Josie. I love to travel and am always looking to explore new places. Most of my travel has been in Latin America and SE Asia. I’m a native Oregonian but my second home is Mexico City. Some of my favorite things to do while traveling are exploring local markets, getting a bit lost, and eating street food.  In Oregon you’ll find me exploring new hikes, cycling, dancing, and cooking. As a guest/host I will be very respectful of your space.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e4541b9f-92dc-4548-b4a6-258f10ed243f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(241041292,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/241041292','Malia','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7593593e-d0ea-43e9-8221-4d01923ac4d4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(307898087,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/307898087','Jordan','Portland, OR','I’m Jordan Polk, a husband and father of 2girls. I really enjoy sports traveling and hanging with my family. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7f33c834-d5e3-4b29-b35d-e18e09d61d34.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(807266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/807266','Kim','Portland, OR','I am a crafty, arts administrator from Portland, OR who loves gardening, the great outdoors, good food, and live performances.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aea6f752-c1cf-48c5-b181-3d5ecc3cb97a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(137104652,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/137104652','Susan','Portland, OR','I love Portland and can provide info on what to do and where to go during your stay. Just ask. Or, if you prefer, we also provide in apartment QR codes with smartphone accessible recommendations and info on what to do and where to go.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3ce23180-eaa6-4b8a-8340-f8421d8a329a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13285949,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13285949','Daniela','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m an international wanderer who loves exploring cities on foot. I believe that it\'s the little things that matter most, and you tend to notice them best when you\'re strolling around. I\'ve also got a passion for picking up new languages and diving into different cultures, so don\'t hesitate to strike up a conversation with me. I\'m fluent in three languages: Portuguese, English, and Spanish. Let\'s chat!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d80cd65d-0410-43c4-973c-bf3637cd44fb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19929626,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19929626','Joy & Josh','Portland, OR','Hello,\nWe welcome everyone into our happy home!  We spend half of our time in Portland, OR and the other half in Trout Lake, WA.  We love to travel by bicycle and enjoy hosting to fellow travelers. We spend a majority of our free time being outdoors, wing foiling, Mt. biking, road biking, white water kayaking, and gardening.  Our goal is to provide a quiet comfy atmosphere during your stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ea71ea53-d71a-4834-84a7-07aee341a503.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(237669885,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/237669885','Joanna','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/77f2f4c7-fd4a-4dde-8a4a-779855be4501.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70796747,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70796747','Lillian','Portland, OR','Stay at home mom with two kids. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f4d8d02e-3c09-41bb-9e3a-ac9b4d48f5ed.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(120600285,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/120600285','Sara','Los Angeles, CA','Live, Laugh, Vine.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f00defb8-5e78-44a8-b2d3-82daefef261f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6877671,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6877671','John','Portland, OR','I\'m a Traffic Engineer with years of experience bicycle touring, and as a result CouchSurfing and now Airbnb.\n\nI’ve hosted guests in my home from six continents, with travels spanning six continents over more than a decade.\n\nIf you\'re planning a bike tour anywhere in and around the Portland metro area, or anywhere in Oregon and Washington, I\'d be more than happy to give you plenty of tips.\n\n\n\nIn the summer of 2009, I cycled over 1,000 miles around Washington state and 1,500 miles down the Pacific Coast to Mexico, including my first time CouchSurfing. In the summer of 2010, I cycled over 4,000 miles from Portland, Oregon to New York City. Since then, I\'ve done smaller tours all over Oregon and Washington, including a week around Central Oregon, a three-day marathon of 400 miles up I-5 to Canada, and a few days on the northern Oregon coast, to name a few. In 2013, I cycled for two months through a dozen countries in Western Europe. More recent excursions include many trips through the islands of Puget Sound, including multiple rides between Seattle and Bellingham, all over the San Juans, as well as the Gulf Islands and Vancouver Island. In 2018, I cycled across England en route from Amsterdam to Dublin via Dover and the Isle of Man.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6877671/original/f0be302d-e11e-4d1e-8c19-32cf3e2575ef.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51832729,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51832729','Benjamin','','I love showing people my city!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f47be68-7a7b-4e35-aada-79d5c986b031.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2205701,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2205701','Eleanor And Elias','Portland, OR','Natives of Portland, OR and Santiago, Chile respectively. We love to travel and have stayed in Airbnb’s in five countries and counting. We also deeply appreciate home and the city we live in. We enjoy hosting folks who come to visit beautiful PDX. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e717fa9-f9b8-472e-9354-3fdd359a537d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30290883,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30290883','Amy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/30290883/profile_pic/1427741809/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20335532,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20335532','Devon','','We’re actually a four person team here at 5615. \n\nDevon (Cancer sun/Virgo moon) uses she/they pronouns, cooks dinner daily, and teaches pleasure and presence practices for embodiment, integration with elemental existence, and the dissolution of capitalist white supremacy. Look for them: in the garden. Ask her: what’s good at the farmer’s market. Let her know: if you need fresh towels or a good book. \n\nJeff (double Libra) uses he/him pronouns, likes Jazz, and makes mostly steel things that transform a space while also disappearing into it. Yes, he built the swing, also he did the garage-house build out, with the help of a few friends. Look for him: washing the mud off his bike in the driveway. Ask him: which local beers you should try. Let him know: if something isn’t working or makes a weird noise. \n\nZelda is 12 (she/her, Aires sun), draws a lot, likes pop music, and makes a lot of smoothies. Look for her: cat herding. Ask her: why no one should be talking about Adele’s weight, one way or the other. Let her know: if the bunnies escape. \n\nClara is 7 (she/her, total Capricorn) can make most things out of cardboard. Look for her: playing in or under the dogwood. Ask her: if there are any ripe strawberries. Let her know: if you see one of her dolls laying around in the rain. \n\nAlso we are: Fuzzball and Graham Cracker (cats, will seek to invade your space but you don’t have to let them!) and Peanut Butter and Jelly (rabbits, like to be feed grass through the bars of their exercise yard). \n\nWelcome!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9af54db8-b373-4f2c-bd85-0e8ab7fced79.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18749328,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18749328','Reagan','Portland, OR','I am a local photographer and owner of an indoor plant installation business! You will see glimpses of my work throughout my home. I have been working very hard to remodel my home myself, and am so excited to share it with you. I love to give advice about things to do in my city, so feel free to reach out! If you happen to want to set up a photo session during your stay I would love to arrange that with you as well :)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/82c84434-a818-4802-876e-59cc31a8b103.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(221421926,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/221421926','Descansa Property','Portland, OR','We are a woman-owned property management company that offers stellar service to our guests, tenants and clients. We manage properties throughout Portland Metro area. Our range of services includes long-term residential, vacation rentals, interior design and set-up, and commercial property management. It\'s our pleasure to host you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-221421926/original/32cf3f53-ab93-4713-8aab-ae22ad147f69.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43716054,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43716054','Maggie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47a92efe-0c10-4d1f-b8ae-edeaee3bca7e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(310753989,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/310753989','Erin','Portland, OR','Born and raised in the Portland area! I try and use Airbnb whenever I travel because I love the neighborhood feel. I love bringing that perspective to other travelers to my city. Don\'t be shy with questions!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ce51e98a-92dd-4d3a-9dfe-33171e3c2349.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35707797,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35707797','Daniel','Portland, OR','My family and I moved to Portland after living in Mexico for about 4 years.  We feel lucky to call Portland our home.  We really love this town!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-35707797/original/9ed32778-f6b4-436f-9ee4-4ea85c0ed332.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20828305,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20828305','Yelena','Portland, OR','“Travel and adventure are my passions”\n\nI live between Park City,  Portland, OR and Miami and at the time of peace Odessa, Ukraine. All of my Airbnb locations are hand picked for best locations that offer incredible experiences. Whether you love serenity of the river flowing, ski in ski out lodging in the mountains or livelihood of being in the middle of the action surrounded by best restaurants and bars - check out my different Airbnb locations.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bc1160b6-68f9-4e52-9842-47dc82955834.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121280844,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121280844','Marlane','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/92407877-d197-4fea-9255-add9c565297c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(400281,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/400281','Christina','Kailua-Kona, HI','My husband and I retired after traveling the world for 25 years with the Department of State Foreign Service. We have lived in China, Serbia, Luxembourg and Italy. We now call Hawaii and Oregon home, and we live an active lifestyle. My husband is an Iron Man and I am an Iron Fan! We love the beaches of Hawaii and and the food, culture and vibe of Portland, and we feel so fortunate to be able to share our favorite places with others.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/400281/profile_pic/1356312796/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8183063,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8183063','Trent','Portland, OR','Trent and Mel are avid travelers and have stayed at many other airbnb\'s across the US and the globe.  They love getting to meet others from around the world and truly enjoy hosting at their home base in Portland. They are intrepid back and bike packers and spend a lot of time exploring the wilderness around the Pacific Northwest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8183063/profile_pic/1425019464/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(316013466,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/316013466','Pamela','Portland, OR','Native Portlander, mother, grandmother, gardener, needlewoman, reader, writer and photographer.  I enjoy designing eclectic spaces using family heirlooms and found objects. I love art!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6e22b610-3ebe-44ff-834c-5ccada789110.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4967953,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4967953','Kerry','Portland, OR','My hobbies vary greatly, but include hiking, camping, juggling, watching both art-house films and really bad action/adventure flicks, eating ice cream, bicycling, singing, dancing, playing with kids, roughhousing with the dogs, BBQs, reading, eating yummy things, traveling, writing, and going on adventures. I am at peace when surrounded by trees, mountains, and water. \r\n\r\nBelow is an excerpt from my travel journal. To read more of my adventures, visit www.oddkazoo.com. \r\n\r\nWe are Indiana Jones! We are National Geographic! We are fearless explorers! A hike through the jungle and then we are swimming (swimming!) into the vast maw of a cave, helmets and headlamps, absolute darkness with the lights off. No difference between eyes open and eyes closed. We splash along an underground river, sometimes knee deep, sometimes treading across deep pools, squeezing under boulders, into fissures, over rockslides, the stalactites sometimes brushing the tops of our heads, sometimes towering ninety feet above. Crystaline rock flows, sparkling in the glow of our tiny lights, shadows and browns and greys and greens. \r\n\r\nWe are travelers in Xibalba, the ancient Mayan underworld. \r\n\r\nAfter an hour we climb a rock face, steeper steeper higher higher onto a plateau, cavernous, winding, bats, space, darkness, the headlamps barely piercing the depth of the darkness. And then, and then! There is a jug, half buried in the calcite. And there is a metate, and a plate and a bowl and they are impeccable and painted and carved and 1200 YEARS OLD, all just resting on the ground, not behind glass, no railings, no ropes, no signs. The archeologists left everything just as they found it, untouched, a living breathing museum, and I am imagining the elite Mayans with their bloodletting and sacrifices and ceremonies and everyone is whispering because this is a sacred place, a place of desperation for a failing civilization, a place of last hope for rain, please Chuc, rain. \r\n\r\nWe traverse the flats amongst a hundred hundred artifacts, and then there is a ladder, which brings us to a deep alcove, high within the cave. Ten steps and there she is, the Crystal Maiden, a young woman, sacrficied to the gods, her bones crystalized and perfect. She lies with her legs straight but her arms splayed. Her mouth is wide open. She was strangled to death. And she is still there in her dark and cool and cavernous tomb, and we are there, breathing softly, averting our eyes out of respect for the dead, but also longing to watch the bones, watch their stillness. We turn back and she is once more plunged into darkness and I tremble as I descend the ladder.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4967953/profile_pic/1360026311/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31648101,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31648101','Ryan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-31648101/original/664617e0-d3f6-4ff6-a321-08c00d134fc0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35830853,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35830853','Charlie','Portland, OR','Hi. I live in Portland with my wife Libby and daughters Marigny and Shelby. We love exploring the region and hosting folks from all over.\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-35830853/original/224525a8-cfbb-415b-86de-bf5000dba301.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7611748,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7611748','Kim','Portland, OR','My husband Andrew & I always dreamed of buying a home where we could create a beautiful space for hosting & growing our family’s roots in a local neighborhood. After an incredible decade-long adventure in Eastern Europe, our dreams were fulfilled with the purchase of the main house next to the Bungalow, which was the house’s original garage built in 1940. Since then we have been imagining, planning & renovating and look forward to hosting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcedf414-4bf4-47df-88e0-e38538fce9f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(317918819,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/317918819','Phil','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f47691f3-46ec-4986-9f8e-b6a2a33e3074.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(318184666,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/318184666','BIll','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47a1a54a-c132-45b2-b36f-aa9931dd5cfd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4139648,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4139648','Marcia Lynn','Portland, OR','My husband and I have lived in Portland for 7 years now and we love it.  We moved here from a small town in Colorado and find Portland to be super friendly and offers so much to do and see that we didn\'t have in a small town. \nWe respect your privacy but are available anytime.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e2cbb37b-cd4f-4233-aa97-0e8a60270d1c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(320016841,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/320016841','Jarred And Emily','Portland, OR','We love living in the Alberta Arts neighborhood for the many delicious restaurants! Everything is very walkable and there are lots of close by parks for the kids. It makes us happy sharing our cozy property with those traveling to Portland. We enjoy going camping at the coast and visiting cute farms on Sauvie Island during long weekends.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca5fb41e-df7f-47c4-bfcd-74140c3b4684.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(321695747,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/321695747','Rajinder','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b6816959-261e-4e41-b477-73db150d24c4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(141351418,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/141351418','Alina','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-141351418/original/1f36373d-9188-42d1-b1fa-5e09084696ac.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(112798186,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/112798186','Delanie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7785e671-1604-46d1-a90b-760d26567b39.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13821627,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13821627','Rob','Portland, OR','Portland native, love music, gardening, kayaking, great food & wine, reading + travel as often as possible. We are small business owners who love to share our beautiful city and all it has to offer!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13821627/profile_pic/1437001378/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21502012,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21502012','Kelly','New Almaden, CA','I\'ve used Air BnB for years and love it.  Now I am able to return the favor and share my newly remodeled home with others.  I like to meet new people and have a passion for sharing all the wonderful things about Oregon and Portland (food, unique places and neighborhoods to visit).  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/21502012/profile_pic/1411488497/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(322907763,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/322907763','Villa','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/adf766e1-f201-44a9-9983-ea4733918e7d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57373623,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57373623','Sebastian','','Welcome! \n\nWe are Sebastian, Jay and our pup Luna. \n\nWe are passionate about travel, and hosting friends and family. We\'d love to share our favorite things about Portland with our guests. We\'ll be happy to give you tips, and recommendations for local experiences, perks, and hidden gems to make your stay a truly memorable one. \n\nBook your stay today and come experience Portland the way it\'s meant to be!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ebae7df3-19b3-4802-8ee2-32b7c573c0fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6648334,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6648334','Lisa Maurine And Alex','Portland, OR','Alex is a real estate agent and musician and Lisa Maurine is an entrepreneur and mom. We have been living in Portland, Oregon since the early ‘90s and we especially love adventuring to hot springs, hiking to remote Gorge views with our family and keeping up on the best restaurants in the PNW.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/840f92da-ebe1-4df3-8a80-fd69a0eeabc8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(149538332,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/149538332','Amir','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6046696-b1e4-467d-a7d3-483180632d2b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(323243651,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/323243651','Ricardo','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b397696-11a7-4ab1-89d1-73d26eae2747.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3948888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3948888','Dederia','Portland, OR','We are grandparents, low key, I’m an introvert and he’s an extrovert.  We love to travel and love our home.  If you are staying with us we welcome you.  If we are staying with you we will treat your home as our own.  If you are going to be guests at our lake house in the Catskills, our daughter Ashley cohosts with us and lives in Brooklyn.  That space was lovingly remodeled as a mom/daughter project.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/387a3d2a-ba26-475b-94a7-e92ad32ef3d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31289780,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31289780','Addy','Lodi, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/31289780/profile_pic/1441131187/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(325943042,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/325943042','KEX Portland','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e81dbb3f-6163-475c-8f1a-2195ea3b2997.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(534482,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/534482','Andrea','Portland, OR','I love to read, travel, and eat good food.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a0fa2a9e-2f4c-4580-8c52-ed145c6801f6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(326526800,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/326526800','Villa','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7584cf7-fe1a-4e20-8639-d52eb774ad0c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18042309,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18042309','Anne','Portland, OR','I\'m a happy, easy-going traveler, trying to learn something new every day :) ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0966f2bf-16b6-4544-8396-a4e4b0de350b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(806654,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/806654','Briana','Portland, OR','I\'m a wedding & portrait photographer living in Portland, Oregon.  I love snuggling with kitties (and our whippet puppy!), discovering local shops, sipping tea, and capturing life on Polaroids.  I have a soft spot for travel, amazing food, and house plants. Oh and I love to read + decorate my home.\n\nMy Frequent Travel Buddy:\nMy husband, Andrew, is pretty rad too.  He works at a local boutique hotel and helps me with my photography business from time to time.  He likes to philosophize about life, work in the yard, enjoys snuggling with furry creatures,  and wishes he could spend 100% of his time traveling and making connections with people all over the world.\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-806654/original/3b05bd76-9df3-4dc1-9682-a8c26cb0107c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2200710,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2200710','XXVI Rue Des Arts LLC','Austin, TX','Love to walk and bike aimlessly, cook, eat and sleep(!) when not working.  Mostly chilling with a glass of wine or a beer, or dreaming of a trip faraway of some sort. I hope to get to 80 countries in the next 5 years (crazy dream!) and still be Scuba diving at 80 &;-) Have two chihuahuas a teacup and toy. They make us better people. Love it.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c38c3b05-7a33-4801-97ad-bd9f3244aa9b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18198220,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18198220','Susan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/792bf8d1-c127-42d2-ab22-d9f2201b6e6d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7748525,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7748525','Wendy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b882048c-8c97-447c-a0c5-41d717c37024.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(327787591,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/327787591','Katrina','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b2a5004-68e2-40f7-9cdd-097b45a08159.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3261680,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3261680','Carl','Portland, OR','Hi, my name is Carl, I\'m a very amateur traveler but I\'m looking to fix that!\r\n\r\nI live in Portland in the Alberta Arts District but I\'ve been fortunate to live all over the west coast: San Diego, Seattle, Portland, Eugene, Maui, and SF.  \r\n\r\nMy foreign travels include a lot of time in Baja Mexico, the Caribbean, Italy, France, Germany, and Spain.  \r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/44f92941-359b-4a4a-94cf-a7702f2cd31b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(165621351,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/165621351','Jeremy','Portland, OR','My wife and I have been hosts for 8+ years and love offering our space to those who are on short term assignment here in our beautiful city. Please feel free to reach out with any questions!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2d1c20bd-97e1-4f6d-8c98-c6528f167bd5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(327888532,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/327888532','Jason','Portland, OR','Hello! I live in Portland, Oregon with my family and have been in the wonderful Pacific NW for 20 years! I\'m an avid surfer and spend my time in many different pursuits.  Having worked as a Sound Designer for film and television for the better part of two decades I\'ve recently shifted my focus to remodeling, creating creative spaces for creatives, and pursuing my passions in art, writing and music. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ab937a4b-3149-4164-a2f8-a322327ca54d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(328120961,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/328120961','Damon','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/362b1252-b8d7-4756-b628-3ea496929c8d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8944230,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8944230','Peter','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5b48e6e1-a7d1-41e3-a243-f461737d4bd4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90127719,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90127719','Aubry','Portland, OR','I a medical professional living in Portland, OR. I have a dog and cat, who sometimes travel with me. I love exploring new places and going on adventures. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/41929ff3-5c81-4863-bea8-d6eca374efae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13376116,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13376116','Ashley','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13376116/profile_pic/1429119928/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(998681,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/998681','Rebecca','Portland, OR','My husband and I live in beautiful Portland, Oregon.  We love to travel are self-sufficient and low maintenance guests.  \n\nWe help our family host an apartment that is attached to their home. Unlike the majority of Airbnb’s, we host only one family-run property.  Our unit has been inspected by the city and is a permitted and legal short-term rental.\n\nWe always strive to be responsive and thoughtful hosts.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/998681/profile_pic/1313904827/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(233209184,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/233209184','Katy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c273a25-3243-40a4-a1b2-874ed59a1c59.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(273386591,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/273386591','Marissa','Portland, OR','Forty-something who occasionally rents their house out on the weekends in the summer. Likes: skateboarding, volleyball, pickleball, biking, and strolling around my hometown, Portland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/85f18ad3-3148-47da-b09d-0c4b505e8e24.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26919028,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26919028','Katrina','Portland, OR','I love old houses, birds, cooking and eating, hiking,  travel, and learning about people, politics and history. Oh, and plants! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f020498-d8ff-47fe-b531-a754df69e005.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4121479,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4121479','Angelique','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4121479/original/c42a1da5-9ecb-4b56-8bb6-d86c4c8a7422.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15451664,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15451664','Laurie','Portland, OR','40-something yr old professional. Portland native. I\'ve enjoyed living in Austria, Mexico, Lake Tahoe, and Argentina but ended up back home.  Love to workout, travel, and garden as well as support local restaurants, breweries and wineries! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/72ffe356-fbcb-4e87-8a24-ed09789752a7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59546078,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59546078','Stacey','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65406c51-ba9a-4b19-a10f-4b5b30f94b7b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28829879,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28829879','Alisa May','Portland, OR','I\'m a New Yorker living in Portland. Filmmaker, writer, and adventure connoisseur.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f2b6400e-b8a2-4ec1-9fed-0fce3dbe3e06.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88040415,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88040415','Heather','','Hi, I\'m Heather from Portland! As a local enthusiast, I\'m excited to share my cozy ADU. My place offers comfort and convenience, perfect for your long-term visit (30+ days).\n\nI\'m an individual host and this is my only property. I built it with the plan to live in it eventually, but that\'s down the road. I also occasionally rent AirBnb\'s, so I have the guest experience. I look forward to hosting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-88040415/original/c382b759-508f-4ef8-8521-32e5cfae2f18.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63796820,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63796820','Kristine & Nik','Portland, OR','We are professionals who are quiet, easy going, and love to explore Portland and travel. We live above our basement apt and give you privacy at your stay. We’ve stayed in 100s of Airbnb’s and hope you feel at home. \nWhen not traveling, we enjoy our corgi, Kaju, family, movies, music and shows. We are very clean and respectful of other peoples\' homes and belongings.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-63796820/original/4214fa98-cbac-44d9-95f8-046de07a5609.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10472485,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10472485','Melissa','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m a designer and my husband, Fredrik, is a writer. We are very clean, considerate, and thoughtful of other people\'s property. We appreciate new experiences and thoughtfully designed spaces, however grand or humble.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6b076e42-b93c-4713-a459-4aee5fbefe1e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(79151801,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/79151801','Jeannette','Portland, OR','Hi. I am mostly retired and work a few hours here and there in my home, doing a wonderful therapy called John Barnes\' myofascial release. We love this area because of the easy access to hiking in forests and hills. Great work-out! We love the views over the valley, river and Mt. Hood when driving or walking in this neighborhood. From our home, the views are very limited due to dense forest. We call it our green cocoon. A 3 minute walk to Terwilliger Blvd. gives a big view. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/95a66de2-109f-44d2-a520-2ace78125320.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100676307,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100676307','Brad','San Leandro, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6109632d-9d42-4066-976f-191d53e2c736.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42701935,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42701935','Jim','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in NE Portland for 25 years and I love being within walking distance of some of the best restaurants, shops, and bars in the city.  Getting downtown is any easy bike ride or accessible by several bus lines nearby.  Being outdoors and being with friends/family are how I love to spend my time.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/42701935/profile_pic/1440702238/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(191661378,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/191661378','Marvin','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/70ec45ad-acfd-41c0-b06d-8b9d091aa45f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8680367,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8680367','Michael','','I live in Portland OR but i\'m from Ohio originally',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cc339e3f-2e3d-4b2f-9788-6db6d6a338e4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148312450,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148312450','David','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fa711d97-b89a-4d47-841e-1515386d6b37.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73445044,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73445044','David','Lake Oswego, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/918f433e-8e40-4666-9da4-42d67873c67d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1185199,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1185199','Kathryn','Bend, OR','World traveler, nature lover and dog mom, splitting my time between Lisbon, Portugal and Oregon.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/633cbb70-df40-4559-a08f-92df20f9156f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(261456584,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/261456584','Frances','Eugene, OR','I\'m enthusiastic in doing hospitality business.  Now I\'ve turned an empty nester; I\'m  ready to use my household skills to host guests.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d0855e9a-196f-4139-8b1a-559ae6434213.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13315319,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13315319','Lauren','Portland, OR','I am an event/lifestyle and editorial photographer originally hailing from the Bay Area. I moved to Portland for the incredible access to nature and amazing culinary scene.\nIn my free time, I enjoy traveling and using Airbnb as a platform for seeing new places, fly fishing, hiking, and exploring new restaurants. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6412767b-3d9b-4729-bd09-8c8572918fc2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30125965,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30125965','Leigh','Portland, OR','Hi!  I am Leigh.  I work as a freelance graphic designer by day, and a rock climber  for all the rest.  My partner and I love our pets, we road trip, rock climb, fly fish, and generally get out of the city as much as we can.  But we also love all the good pizza and beer that Portland has to offer.  \n\nPre-covid-19 we would rent our house while out on road trips.  In late 2019 we broke ground on our new backyard guest house - and now finally as of July of 2020 - it\'s ready for guests to enjoy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/30125965/profile_pic/1433782026/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2517273,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2517273','Susanne','Portland, OR','Professional couple from Portland Oregon. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2517273/profile_pic/1403979927/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9811068,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9811068','Avery','Portland, OR','Hi All! \n\nRecently transitioned out of Portland for work and absolutely love my condo and want to keep it - therefore, I am looking to AirBnB to folks to enjoy! .  I am meticulous, a neat freak, and look for people to rent my place that also have a strong track record of being great guests!  Look forward to hearing from you! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/936d69b9-3d7c-4e6b-84f2-bc70a543cd88.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(271575145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/271575145','Patty','Portland, OR','I enjoy traveling, hiking, yoga and gardening. I offer my newly remodeled space as a comfortable place for travelers to lay their heads. I guarantee a clean and sanitized space during the current Covid-19 pandemic. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcf3feef-3e9b-4001-b6be-de55bc0087a4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66001964,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66001964','Chip','San Anselmo, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2a1cadbb-a869-468f-8dd7-da25c8f56ade.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11629153,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11629153','Jason','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/11b39930-fa52-4be0-b7f0-45d429a38e3e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50415523,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50415523','Robert','Portland, OR','We are Bob and Kristie - we have lived in Portland for many years. We love it here and are eager to make sure our guests do too. Come stay in our new house that we built behind our 100 year old parsonage, next to the old church.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/84de600d-9327-4180-b475-dad7727e0f80.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36057135,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36057135','Kim','Portland, OR','I love all sorts of outdoor activities from hiking, to biking and snowboarding. I love to try new food and visit new places. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff130b15-a74d-4406-bf77-ca17b44ec3d3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60440751,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60440751','Amy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-60440751/original/e7180e5d-1827-41ee-9548-88025b403a5c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19836266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19836266','Kev','Portland, OR','I love to travel and my home is occasionally available for short term stays.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67d59d13-36dd-4188-a9a6-8af9203dd746.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10042363,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10042363','Diana','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/10042363/profile_pic/1431385932/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(675365,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/675365','Shannan','Florida, United States','Hello I’m Shannan, I’ve lived in Portland for 13 years and absolutely loved all that the PNW has to offer! I currently split my time between Florida and Colorado, I’m always just a text/phone call away. Looking for a great restaurant? I’ve got you covered! Best bars for craft cocktails and breweries, I’ve got you! Parks for picnicking or trails for nearby hikes? Yup, that too! Want to take a yoga class or a climbing lesson? You guessed it, that too! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2be31fa0-3afc-4a9e-abec-a6830e156edd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38622835,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38622835','Brook','Portland, OR','I live in Portland with my wife and two kids. I love traveling, meeting new people and enjoy the outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/38622835/profile_pic/1437026298/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(243717356,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/243717356','Joe','Portland, OR','I’m a Portland native who loves art, food, wine, and gardening.  I would be happy to provide recommendations for all the best things to do and see in Portland, especially where to eat!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65b19557-39d4-447c-850e-041a65f0f34d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(197531214,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/197531214','Nancy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f5c11a57-a62c-4bf7-9728-b351ea3e3ccb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(160352710,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/160352710','Wesley','Portland, OR','A happy couple who love people and traveling. We enjoy time with friends and family and spoiling the grand kids. Everyday is a day something AMAZING can happen...',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0df6dd78-1d81-4539-b47f-11467287ffc0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32935900,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32935900','Jim','Portland, OR','My wife Magdalena was born in Romania and I was born in the U.S . We now live in Portland, Oregon and own a Senior Care Home in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/32935900/profile_pic/1431138816/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8996240,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8996240','Meg','Pensacola Beach, FL','I’m a food entrepreneur, massage therapist and ultra runner. I love the outdoors and the simple life. If I’m not in the city, I’m out exploring trails and finding new adventures.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8996240/original/58fc3d94-ff13-46d6-b746-103811d0c985.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(140171773,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/140171773','Daniel','Portland, OR','Designer and artist looking to explore and learn',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-140171773/original/8d679860-f75a-46d6-a68c-6dd2ab64040b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(352184767,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/352184767','Desiree','Portland, OR','Mom  to 2 energetic little boys, 2 sweet dogs, and 6 chickens!  I manage and teach at a local spin studio.  I love gardening, hiking, and reading. I absolutely LOVE living in Portland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/55541fb4-bed3-4933-92b0-e8a452a6f75c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31102773,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31102773','Lauren','Portland, OR','Pizza-loving Portlander originally from the good old cheese state of Wisconsin! \n\nI love being an Air BnB host and do whatever it takes to ensure that our guests have a lovely stay. \n\nNeed recommendations? My husband, Jerry, and I are obsessed with food. We are in the process of opening a tavern in NW Portland. Follow @jerrystavern for details!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ced7ebfc-c4c7-4a9f-9e9b-8ad7fe3525e7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(352768058,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/352768058','Mark & Celeste','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/32bfdbb7-d6a2-4d35-a35c-cfcbf344f93b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(339414830,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/339414830','Campbell | Skye','','Welcome to Campbell Skye!  We have a passion for providing stays that strike the perfect balance of traveling with the comforts of home, while also enjoying the amenities of an upscale resort.  Our spaces are thoughtfully designed to provide you with a platform to conveniently discover the distinct qualities found in every location. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/278533df-9aec-4616-b128-667f37c98019.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10194150,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10194150','Benjamin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e965caa3-cf33-4cde-a420-9aba048c0627.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27275907,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27275907','Albert','Portland, OR','Originally from Dallas, TX. Physician and a foodie ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ea195ef-e3ac-4009-89b2-e96e999601b1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9494009,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9494009','Molly','Portland, OR','Life is too short to be in one place. I cherish my home but also love sharing it with others.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3002302e-19ac-4188-85aa-d197404a0fa0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16083734,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16083734','Nate','Portland, OR','You have chosen wisely! Parents to an amazing 17yr old boy. We both love to Paraglide, Ski, white water Kayak, Bike, Hike, Camp, play Soccer, Basketball, Scuba / Snorkel, Tango! We love the foodie scene. \n\nMy son is a fluent Spanish immersion student.  We travel so he can become a world citizen. Our travels have taught us that not all hosts are the same. We host the way we would want; Clean, Safe, Private, and with a Super Comfy Bed.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/879597e9-0dad-47c5-9b31-9c17d982e803.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(143183280,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/143183280','Kim','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b1d747ff-4789-427c-b534-7a80840cb07e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100593625,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100593625','Caglar','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f995acea-9d7f-442f-8357-b1dcc7355094.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5780178,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5780178','Katrina','Portland, OR','Hello! I have a few great furnished places to rent in Venice Beach, Portland, OR and Missoula, MT! \r\nGreat for vacations, working remote or artist getaways!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b8f896e-c21b-4dda-b915-53ecaa949783.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4632981,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4632981','Alli','Portland, OR','Since 2013, I\'ve traveled extensively around the globe using Airbnb, and have had overwhelmingly positive experiences. There\'s just something so wonderfully human about being welcomed as a guest when you\'re on the road, and also opening my home to travelers, as a host!\n\nAs a guest, I\'m respectful, clean, and am mostly tucked away in my room. And as a host, I\'m committed to doing my very best to ensure that my guests have a perfect, 5-star stay.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4632981/profile_pic/1427143617/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(143049389,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/143049389','Matthew','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/06dc61e8-ab91-48b9-9ddb-fb503dc8541d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(199117713,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/199117713','Kaley','Portland, OR','My husband and I are lifelong Oregonians who love living in the PNW. We are excited to have you stay with us and hope you enjoy our city and surroundings as much as we do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/48fcc023-b166-47c6-91c7-b0e3bbd26172.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(131642463,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/131642463','Jason','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/886418e9-c149-4739-92a7-998582ecd79c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23224611,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23224611','Angela','Portland, OR','Hi! I’m Angela. I love traveling and meeting new people and learning new things.  I have traveled to over 90 counties and I love using Air BnB. I am currently a host, as a want my guests to have as nice as an experience I have had. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dc716d75-ef83-4f37-a9d0-825731f367e3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(265007684,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/265007684','Kathryn','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/88777e43-36cd-4a29-9515-330ff0a09dd4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(83619132,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/83619132','Eddie','Carlton, OR','I am a retired animator, a contractor, licensed realtor, and I live in the Pacific NW. I love to travel. I love exploring new cities and countries. I am currently remodeling a 1890 farmhouse in the heart of Wine Country in Carlton.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-83619132/original/2688ef16-cef1-4fbd-be23-30ebf17e16e0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3508484,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3508484','Josh','Portland, OR','Marybel is a working artist and Josh is a contractor and actor.  They enjoy thrifting, singing and dancing, and dressing their dog Yoshi up in ridiculous garb.  He is a good sport about it.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b2baba6d-63ca-40df-a014-e6aa895f60e2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(89400,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/89400','Alex','Portland, OR','I\'m both an Airbnb host and a frequent guest.  When I host, I treat guests like I want to be treated as a guest.  And when I stay, I treat the unit as I\'d want when I host.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e42232a1-616d-4af2-a574-255fe13b6c0b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29807354,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29807354','Melanie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c4aa7ff-b670-4d95-a967-c3799cae8325.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(225046440,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/225046440','Julie','Portland, OR','I\'m a mom of two young daughters, a folk musician and lover of languages and nature. I live in Portland, Oregon and host an AirBnB with my partner Olga. We love to explore and find new beautiful places, whether in the middle of civilization or off the beaten path.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b51dcfd-c610-4af3-9e62-cb1a5a724cb9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1207025,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1207025','Laura','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'ve lived in Portland Oregon for 20 years and love to eat good food and have outdoor adventures. Oregon has a lot to offer with hiking, camping, skiing and surfing right here close to home. Hope to see you soon.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1207025/profile_pic/1357495426/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150212199,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150212199','Wilson','Portland, OR','Experience in short term rentals and top notch customer service. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1a6d165b-4bb5-4ec2-92c5-26c7b3f63b2a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(97856002,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/97856002','Andrew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7cd51b7c-df95-484e-978e-f9524578a899.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1978950,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1978950','Spencer','Portland, OR','Originally from Nashville, Tennessee I lived in Tokyo, Japan with my wife and now Portland where I work for a tech  company called Gengo. My wife and I have 2 amazing  boys — 4 and 6 . When were not playing at the park or cycling around town, we enjoy good beer, food, wine, friends and music. We love meeting new people  and look forward to hosting you at our place. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1978950/profile_pic/1429460536/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26576587,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26576587','Todd','Portland, OR','Hello, we are Todd and Rebeca.\nHe is a nurse and she is a CNA.  We have traveled the world together and now live in Portland, OR.  We enjoy music, travel, and culture.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9e6e01d7-e83f-421e-8488-8f08cc78b8e1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25354695,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25354695','Meirion','Portland, OR','I enjoy travel, art, science and a bit of sport too. \n\nI am originally from Wales in the U.K. And am currently living in Portland, Oregon. Prior to this I lived in London and New York',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f2211132-fb34-46f6-a1d3-60a8516c378a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2407869,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2407869','Yvette','Washington, DC','I live to create experiences for people, and love the adding the little touches! When I\'m not cooking for a group of friends, checking out cool new spots in the city you\'ll probably find me at the rock climbing gym! Look forward to hosting you soon!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7a1440d7-24d9-481e-82b5-d16ca338cf7a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(367272339,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/367272339','Don','Portland, OR','I retired recently after nearly 40 years working in the Financial Services industry.  This lovely 2 bedroom unit is a recent remodel of my basement in my 1942 home. One of my passions is gardening, so you can also enjoy my \"Dionysian Gardens\" during your visit.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67b66bb3-ec82-41be-b310-0dcbe291801b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150524647,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150524647','Adrian','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9858e0b4-8a75-4cc8-93c1-03481e5a2617.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115052133,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115052133','Austin','Portland, OR','Growing up basketball consumed at least half of my waking hours. If I wasn\'t at practicing, I was in class thinking about being at practice/in the game. I played for two years at the University of Oregon before transferring to Northwest Christian University. After graduation, as much as I have a love for the sport, I was thrilled to venture into new passions. I currently am working on my pool game, and love trying to find new up and coming musicians. Welcome to Portland! I\'m excited to share my home with you. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee778d8a-51da-48a2-96d5-23f0f8f1892b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2233241,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2233241','Fabricio','New York, NY','Brazilian / American designer and skateboarder. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2c456951-88e6-4240-b668-0d092a9370ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10376990,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10376990','Lena','Portland, OR','I live in our home with my partner, Seth, our child and our doodle. I was born & raised in Portland and have spent the last 10 years living in SE close to Mt. Tabor. Before I became a mom, I spent many years traveling, hiking and backpacking through Oregon. Now, most of our adventures are kid-friendly so we spend lots of time outdoors at the Gorge or the Coast. Feel free to ask me for recommendations if you\'re looking for something to do outside.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/95cbff4d-22c9-42e6-a385-d4e6a89f74c2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(177026402,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/177026402','Katherine','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fe3252cf-2d15-45e3-8890-aa4b2eefd456.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36094011,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36094011','Matthew','Portland, OR','I grew up in New England (Vermont) and have lived in Pittsburgh, New Hampshire, and San Francisco. Currently I am a physician living and working in Portland, Oregon. My wife Alison is an educator, and we have a lovely daughter named Sylvia. We like exploring new cities to discover great food and beer, and to spend time in parks or on hikes. But often, we just sit around and relax!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/36094011/profile_pic/1434684897/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2479544,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2479544','The Joneses','Chicago, IL','My husband and I are super laid back, well traveled and enjoy learning from the places we visit. We are parents and entrepreneurs spending most of our time between:  Chicago, Pacific Northwest, Central America and the Caribbean. We often are out of the country and hosting units in various places so we know what guests need!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/632b4c44-84fe-46d9-8668-10c2a2328175.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27168187,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27168187','Timoney','Portland, OR','Hey there, I’m Timoney and this is Nanner, the greatest dog in the world. We’re big Schitt’s Creek fans, Nanner particularly likes Mutt, and we wanted to create an immersive experience inspired by the show for traveling fans and to keep things weird here in Portland! I’ve always dreamed of having a dog and cannabis friendly spot for travelers. I’m a major global traveler myself and I appreciate the nice extras like bathrobes, giant towels, non-contact stays and not worrying that I’ll be arrested for smoking a jay while cuddling with my jet setting dog. I wanted to bring those luxuries and a neat booping experience to others, so here we are, no longer toweling the door. In addition to The Schitt’s Creek themed RoseBud & Barkfest we also rent out the upstairs 1 bedroom. This side hustle helps me take care of my co-hosting mom, who I rescued from a horribly uncaring senior apartment complex in upstate New York during the pandemic. She lives in the apartment next door but keeps to herself. In my other life, I work as a television producer, creating, producing and directing bonus content for TV shows, so this passion project is like my job but IRL. It’s been an incredible artistic outlet and I hope you love it as much as I do! Say hey or don’t, it’s all cool! \nBest Wishes, \nWarmest Regards ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1a70a34c-52a1-4fe3-9e1d-3ecf6213d25f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(191471402,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/191471402','Gerald','','I enjoy traveling and meeting new people\'s,  and learning new things. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b974f81a-37b2-4b7f-952c-c4750a0f2f29.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(137112232,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/137112232','Bailey','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is Bailey. I love to travel and experience new places. Thank you to other hosts for welcoming me to your homes! To our future guests, welcome! We look forward to hosting you. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c44ff36-fb72-4c43-a74c-72e0f9bf07f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19298739,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19298739','Molly','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19298739/original/60b0c28d-42f7-4296-80d9-648959bdf966.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(108866481,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/108866481','Zach & Lera','Portland, OR','We love to travel together! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8be64576-2950-4031-be10-592a1d7e6ed3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75800543,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75800543','Mary','Portland, OR','I work in supply chain management for a major sporting goods company in Portland. When I\'m not working or traveling for work, I like to hang out with my friends, go out to eat, hike and enjoy spending time hanging out in my backyard or walking my dog.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/11e4e601-62ba-476a-b05d-f64936f2e3c3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(180053286,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/180053286','Tom','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/354f8f6c-6798-4019-b085-6eef848177db.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76621559,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76621559','Edward','Portland, OR','I\'m an outdoor enthusiast, that\'s why I live in OR.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9e2f961b-c0d4-4924-8b84-c0cded29c076.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5323164,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5323164','Amanda And David','Portland, OR','A family of four who loves to travel.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5323164/original/c846095d-1cf2-4093-a14e-1de8925c2dd0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(238937333,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/238937333','Josephine','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Jo... Originally from New England, I’ve lived mostly in Berkeley, CA and am now in Portland, OR developing more skills in Permaculture. I’ve worked as a meditation teacher since 1988 and as a nonprofit director since 1992. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d6d01db1-bf48-4321-bfd7-562e5b0d7dcb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(372581905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/372581905','Alexi & Paulette','Portland, OR','We are a married couple. We love our city and hope that you have a positive experience in Portland too.  We reside in the Portland metro area, which helps keep us connected with the local community and also allows us to respond timely.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1196662b-e137-44b2-868f-d387789833a0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10295660,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10295660','Brad And Meg','San Diego, CA','We have a passion for traveling nationally and internationally and can’t wait for our next adventure. We enjoy live music, writing,  photography, time with our children, and eating delicious cuisine from all over the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9e53b411-bf62-4059-9724-1edc78f84c11.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5772713,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5772713','Anna','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Anna! I love sunshine, working in my garden, and all things vintage.  \nI like to explore various hobbies and have dabbled in darkroom photography, jewelry smithing, pottery throwing, furniture reupholstering, and other creative ventures. \n ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5772713/profile_pic/1435169976/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1839539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1839539','Adam','Santa Monica, CA','I\'m 25 from Chicago Illinois and a dedicated yogi :) I also own a small creative agency.\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/90cf28c4-63b8-458b-b848-a77a2a3276a4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57438652,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57438652','Tani','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-57438652/original/28be78bb-c56c-416a-89b0-250e1eecab10.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5378497,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5378497','Michael','Portland, OR','Music, adventure, nature, experiences, family and cycling. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/620f06d1-c2d1-40c4-b893-ea29c8b199c7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(244759635,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/244759635','Pham','Portland, OR','Family guy. Father of twin boys and two baby girl in diapers still. Graduate from PSU in supply chain and logistic management. Love sports and food :)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e50a01c4-cdfb-4248-8720-63cab07e1cd1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(133290539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/133290539','Davis','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/841bbaae-a228-426f-a964-1e3976603d03.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(349910377,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/349910377','Tony','Vancouver, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24931475-8302-49da-b908-23f5e2f08070.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(374441262,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/374441262','Pat','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e638fd1b-dca3-4690-9abc-4e25d8be6370.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70801266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70801266','Erica','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/17939201-962e-4668-a7f5-b2bdbaeef081.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6604696,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6604696','Sir Pho','Portland, OR','Graduated from The School of The Arts. \r\nNow living and working in Portland.\r\nLikes: traveling and experiencing new people and cultures. \r\nLife motto: Never leave an opportunity unturned\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6604696/profile_pic/1438205702/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(242195896,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/242195896','Joe','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bb41da95-0657-49bb-9655-fe4276242f38.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182822950,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182822950','Angela','Portland, OR','Mother, hairstylist, garden, love flowers multitasker entrepreneur.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cfd6f9be-432b-41cb-8383-73a776b33ac9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33081979,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33081979','Elsa','Portland, OR','I moved to Portland, OR in 2020 and fell in love with the people, nature and food instantly. It was the easiest life decision to put down roots here. I\'m thrilled to host you and I hope to introduce you to the many bliss and joy of Portland!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6d99a259-d06a-46a6-a667-8c022d2f9788.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(376770709,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/376770709','Lisa','Coronado, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af23c1c9-a271-4b5b-bd09-f9b07097a77b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23862030,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23862030','Grey','Detroit, MI','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f789d6d2-0c77-4474-8af3-ed2f9a9b0317.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2084230,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2084230','Dave','Portland, OR','Love to explore. Can operate a whisk.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2084230/profile_pic/1333741670/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58611997,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58611997','Carmen','Portland, OR','I love the outdoor adventures the pacific northwest offers.  I spend a lot of time in my own back yard gardening!  My husband and I both work for ourselves. I own a lovely children\'s resale shop and my husband is a general contractor who specializes in home remodels. We are currently living in a house we are remodeling and we have just finished our own little airbnb on our property.  When we\'re not in nature or working on a home project we enjoy family adventures, games, biking, hiking and cooking or ordering  new foods. Portland is a splendid hub for a lot of delicious EATS!   \n\nIn our quest to stay at other airbnbs please know that we are both tidy and like to leave things cleaner than when we found them.  We enjoy visiting new places however due to working more than vacationing it is rare that we get to see all that we\'d love to. When we do vacation it is usually back-packing or car camping. So when we rent  it is a big deal for us and we are excited to see all the sites, cook our own food and try out some new restaurants.  We have a junior high aged child so evenings are reading, playing games or watching a movie.  Our son is a delightful person: Kind and considerate and eager to see the world. \n\nWe are happy to be part of the airbnb community.  \nKindly,\nCarmen',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c06ed3d4-996f-431a-bea8-2059f19c946d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8060830,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8060830','David','Vancouver, WA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8060830/profile_pic/1376126165/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95866386,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95866386','Ben','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1d3b36f6-7e15-4a86-b203-8afec38f75ad.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18607098,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18607098','Ted & Lori','Portland, OR','Married with two kids.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e5bc339-72e6-41aa-92ef-0ef1f61ca003.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45404378,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45404378','Noa','Portland, OR','Waldorf school teacher based in Portland, Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45404378/profile_pic/1443580106/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2054100,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2054100','Lexi','Portland, OR','Hello Airbnb community!  I am a bit of a travel bug and have lived in Italy, France, Argentina, and Brazil.  I am a big fan of sushi, Brazilian fruit, coffee, the beach, music, and art.  \r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c1ef87bf-ccfc-4b70-a834-9cf63213d7c5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1237783,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1237783','Cass','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/382a1de4-2ffc-40aa-b815-52869c2d1969.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32095394,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32095394','Angela','Portland, OR','Dog and outdoors loving Portlander, by way of Chicago suburbs.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/01145cfa-2eea-4d92-b8a1-dddfc649146f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(380057237,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/380057237','Yon','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bb4ae89e-1873-4d1d-9a6e-1c64c7ef6b17.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(879106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/879106','Jeremy','Portland, OR','Greetings! My name is Jeremy and I have called Portland, OR home for the past 8 years. I love the outdoors, consider myself easy-going, respectful, private, and enjoy travel when time allows. Whether you are looking at my Airbnb rental or I am inquiring about yours, hopefully our paths cross.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6619144e-8702-4cfb-9a9e-09bc01a8abed.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29629823,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29629823','Sarah','Portland, OR','I\'ve been in real estate for over 18 years am now a ceramicist on the Oregon coast & love to travel everywhere! I use Airbnb in my travels & love offering my places for guests to enjoy as well. I\'ve been in the Airbhb biz for years & value my guests comfortability & experiences in my homes. I absolutely love giving tips on the best local spots to hit when staying. Just ask me',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1a8c00e5-6eb6-4c71-9ae5-b898c19c5729.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8804048,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8804048','Janet','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8804048/profile_pic/1379040020/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(382375965,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/382375965','Luxury','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79ed9708-853d-4688-838c-86234a816720.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(382376559,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/382376559','Neha','Portland, OR','We have lived in the main house on the property since 2003.  Sam is an animator and I work with food co-ops. We have two kids: 19 and 14 years old.  We enjoy spending time outdoors, cooking and travel.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/80ff70e5-66a4-4a42-ac32-daaf4052aecf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6297763,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6297763','Katie','Portland, OR','My husband Thomas and I are both employed in the healthcare field. We have lived in Portland, Oregon for over 6 years; we moved here from Seattle in 2016. We enjoy traveling, hiking, gardening, crafting, working on our old home (built in 1910), and spending time with our two young children, Arlyn and Laurel. We enjoy hosting in our home and get immense satisfaction from others enjoying a space we’ve created that fits our aesthetic. We additionally enjoy staying at other Airbnb\'s and experiencing the personal touches others have put into their homes.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aa8e9d0c-7fff-4e15-a2f4-c6716b6ce081.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(68945849,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/68945849','Christopher','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2602e86f-e8ce-444f-bd01-141d922af9a2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(293772932,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/293772932','Kim','Glenwood, OR','Hi world! My name is Kim. I am born and raised in Portland. I love getting outdoors every weekend! Please don\'t be shy if you have any questions about my beautiful city :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49be75c1-ba33-48ab-8ce4-65f8f5bbc608.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(383671492,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/383671492','Alex & Renee','Portland, OR','Welcome to Hurst Haus!\nAlex and Renee bought this home in 2012 and have been working on it ever since.\nWe are ecstatic to host you and share our home and labor of love with you. Large open kitchen perfect for large family gatherings and entertaining. Luxurious bathroom addition with skylights galore and deep soaking tub... come experience it for your selves, we look forward to being your favorite home in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cc53e4e5-7ce7-426d-bb06-ba667c6af716.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(153163152,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/153163152','Katelin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bc549c46-1632-4f86-baba-6a924f8a3ce3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1588473,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1588473','Kate','Portland, OR','Creative Director, lover of long walks to coffee shops, dog lady forever.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b4c7527d-d82d-442c-b8ea-94e50741a23d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(120448545,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/120448545','Susan','Chicago, IL','Hello! Brett and I recently moved to Chicago and share our time between the Midwest and Portland.  We love to travel and enjoy the great outdoors and meeting new people... ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9885f5fd-3df6-467f-af31-09175e32a5fb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18137420,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18137420','Sarah','Bend, OR','Hi there! I\'m based in Bend with my husband, Chris. Our cozy South Tabor bungalow is our home when we\'re not exploring the PNW. We love to live seasonally and travel whenever we can, so while we\'re away, we\'re thrilled to share our space with you. Enjoy the comforts of our home and the unique charm of Portland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/3905f286-1daa-4bd2-afb4-3f785c104ffb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15284638,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15284638','Marlena','Portland, OR','Hello!  We love to cook, especially paella.  We also enjoy hiking, biking and traveling.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c55a0be-7c29-4333-a38e-3a5ab5b812e9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1501859,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1501859','Belinda','San Diego, CA','Hi there!\r\n\r\nAs an avid traveler, I\'ve been lucky enough to travel to some pretty far-away places.  Along the way I\'ve met some amazing people.  Some of my best experiences have been out in the middle of nowhere, having a conversation with people who can barely speak English, yet somehow we can have a smile and a laugh, especially if there\'s a cold beer involved.  These are my favorite experiences in life.  My best accommodation experiences have always been in either someone\'s home, or a very simple setting.  Yes, I like 5 star travel too, but I really prefer the simple things in life.  \r\n\r\nI\'m excited you are checking out Midtown/Mission Hills.  Not only is it super central, it is one of San Diego\'s best and oldest neighborhoods!  Please see my \"guidebook link\" for all my personal favorite restaurants and bars within walking distance. \r\n\r\nI hope you enjoy our  home, \r\nBelinda\r\n\r\nPS Despite my busy schedule, I do like to share what I know about San Diego, so let me know if you have questions prior to, or during your stay.  I\'m always on my hand-held and usually can reply within a few minutes.\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1501859/profile_pic/1336516642/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(195673,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/195673','Alison','Portland, OR','I\'m a food and design entrepreneur living in Portland, OR.  I love to hike, play around in the kitchen, design spaces and plan new adventures.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1a5e8411-c2c6-473f-a7cd-d269c96c189d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20171998,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20171998','Christopher','Portland, OR','Hi! \nMy name is Chris and I am super excited to join the Air BnB community.\n\nTogether with my wife Alisa we live in Portland, OR and are enjoying the Oregon Outdoors.\nSince 2017 we call Portland our home and are originally from Germany.\nWe love to travel the world,  meet new people and get to know new cultures.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e603b53a-9137-4656-81d5-746d7976e092.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13282596,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13282596','Sarah','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-13282596/original/1f1dba9c-4c43-400e-8398-c8f5bbc76ce4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1822800,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1822800','Astrid','Portland, OR','Hello! We live in Portland and truly enjoy this gastronomy rich city- a food lovers heaven. Although born and raised in Montana, the Pacific Northwest is our home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/546bee8c-dbd7-4104-9745-1eff8cee1576.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(283266891,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/283266891','Madeline','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b6ab6114-1f1b-44d7-9066-df5b3663710d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(118237877,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/118237877','Connor','Portland, OR','Hello my fellow Airbnbers! My name is Connor. I am a Portland native. I enjoy all types of food, so naturally I love my city. I\'m a proud Superhost!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-118237877/original/2df1cdac-bddb-49e8-ace6-bc715da93359.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23866529,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23866529','Briana','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Briana, I own a tea company and general store in Portland, Oregon. I love to travel, hike and ski!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3181daae-c882-470c-a330-dbc7908db0d5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(172940497,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/172940497','Amy','Portland, OR','We love living in Portland. It has great restaurants, beautiful parks and neighborhoods and has an unique vibe. Plus it is only a short drive to both the coast and hikes at the Columbia River Gorge. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a770a017-e5d2-4a6e-ab34-edf934331a7e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5761215,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5761215','Brad','Portland, OR','A native Oregonian, I went to school at Lewis & Clark College, have 3 boys, play the drums and like to travel. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5761215/original/45bc0781-a685-47d4-af0a-4d5c5ee47e0e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(156222385,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/156222385','Chelsie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bd4ae051-080c-4f8a-bfec-c1b7ac477746.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7758368,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7758368','Jake','Portland, OR','My name is Jake and my family and I live in Portland, Oregon.  My wife\'s name is Cory and my two respectful and well-behaved children are 13 and 10 years old (updated 2021). We have a 13-lb pug mix who is quiet and loving. We like the outdoors and enjoy visiting interesting cities and neighborhoods. We love to take family adventures to new places and host people in our warm and welcoming home in return.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/44513226-2dc0-49d2-af35-858926d617ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(61848539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/61848539','Heather And Andrew','Portland, OR','My family and I have been long time residents of Portland Oregon. We love travelling and meeting people from all over the world. Our daughter recently graduated from the Air Force Academy (USAFA) and our son from High School.  We hope to do a lot of travelling as we become empty nesters. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47da73be-0f02-4514-bcc5-5e99cf0d981f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36813422,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36813422','Brian','Portland, OR','I grew up in California and Oregon and have had a career in the media for over 30 years. I have recently changed direction and am enjoying selling real estate in Portland, Oregon. I am an avid outrigger canoe paddler, cyclist, hiker, snow ski and mt. bike rider.  I love to travel and have visited over 37 countries in the world. I love great food, culture of all kinds, red wine and good conversation.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf479461-784f-47a0-86ea-904366fcf3e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(387205363,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/387205363','Gracie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0e2f107c-a317-473a-b928-3666ae8a7da2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4195708,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4195708','Aaron','Portland, OR','I am a Tech PR executive (yes, I can geek out with you on business tech stuff), “self-professed superdad”, creative fiction writer and massive music nerd.  I love Portland, street photography, people, literature,  jazz, architecture, local food, shopping, exploring new places, podcasting, travel and socializing with good friends.  I have one amazing son who is a great host, too!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/299c9bf2-54cf-49e1-9159-a4095b481d78.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21854745,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21854745','Julie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/38d84559-2a79-4c7f-94c7-66205fabf056.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53371324,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53371324','Laura & Steve','Newport, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d34be09b-ff21-4772-b16a-0f19af8343b0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19354543,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19354543','Megan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b05b6e3e-9614-47ed-9f53-c1bed37fd71a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45217575,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45217575','Joel','Portland, OR','Proud dad and husband.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45217575/profile_pic/1443377715/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(389142726,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/389142726','Jeff','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/68f6489c-48b2-47b3-8380-1487d6ea5c44.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(201594889,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/201594889','David','Portland, OR','Myself and my friend Ron will be working the Pronto Pup Stand at the Wayside for the Kite Festival.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/69be9924-7b01-4772-9779-3f0ffedaa702.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(389635591,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/389635591','Lauren','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/97289a26-d058-4ca9-bb31-5637e9999e3c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1679756,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1679756','Kate','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/80045d08-1c83-4321-9c46-9b45fdb6edf6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59218361,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59218361','Wanda','Portland, OR','Always on the lookout for creative inspiration.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-59218361/original/c5ee99cc-7ccf-40e5-bf3c-cafd93234a14.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8777676,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8777676','Amanda','Portland, OR','Hi! We are Cody & Amanda. We love the PNW and all the fun adventures it has to offer. Amanda is a Portland area local. Cody came from the SW 20+ yrs ago. We and enjoy our leisure time with family & friends -  traveling, camping, boating, hiking, biking, skiing/snowboarding, singing karaoke, live music watching, wine tasting, food eating, and always making time to appreciate Nature!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/db9215bc-d993-4cce-98e5-e411d1c0c060.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9929351,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9929351','Jennifer','','Avid Traveler and manager of real estate vacation properties',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/faa230f4-d9b8-48f4-aa8c-41a7d04ba7bb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(378229923,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/378229923','Lori','Portland, OR','Be one of the first to live in this new, lower level studio located in a charming English cottage on a garden-filled corner lot. Located in NE Portland, the Roseway Neighborhood is highly walkable to retail, coffee shops, restaurants, and groceries. Walking trails and scenic views of the local golf course bring the neighborhood together with biking, walking, running, and dog strolling. The newly retired homeowner lives an active lifestyle.\n\nEnjoy your privacy while having peace of mind knowing that she is accessible if anything needs attention. There is a friendly, loving Labrador named Cairo who lives in the main home.\n\nThe studio features a full sized bed, cozy seating area, cute kitchenette, and a beautiful tiled shower. Light and bright! Plenty of closet space. Laundry available in the next room.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/30fdadce-3393-4078-bfac-94672da2afda.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31051978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31051978','Heidi','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Heidi. \nOC ￫ PDX\nOur Airbnb is named after my first service animal, Lambie. \n\nIf you happen to see me around with a little white floof, that is her sister, Happle.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/894c4d33-1b11-4aa9-b225-5d83651568f4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36568283,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36568283','Donald','Portland, OR','I’m a solo dad with two kids I love and share time with. In addition I have two wonderful dogs, Cali and Jack, and three egg-laying chickens. I’m very happy to host you and appreciate all the positive feedback the ABB has received. This was never about making ends meet but rather trying to create a welcoming and superior experience for visitors to Portland. I’m here to help - let me know if you need anything!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-36568283/original/3da55250-8341-4446-9e51-ef9f53f4eef3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35707376,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35707376','Lara','Portland, OR','Architecture and Interior designer in Portland Oregon. Love the whole experience of Airbnb and being able to experience other peoples homes and getting to host them in ours.  Cheers to safe and wonderful travels. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/89ac5871-bc81-4958-97a1-fa1e85e0f89b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(247400,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/247400','Gretchen','Portland, OR','Travel-Adventure-Mom-type gal - I love exercising, coffee, cooking, reading and outdoor activities.  I love to travel and see new places!  I first used AirBnB in 2010 in Palermo, Sicily - now I\'m a host!  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/247400/profile_pic/1285671569/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(254477581,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/254477581','Lin','Portland, OR','We have lived and traveled in Asia, the Middle East and Europe and have stayed in many Airbnb\'s as a family of three. We have tried to bring all of our travel experiences to create a comfortable and welcoming space for all of our guests. We have settled in Portland since 2020 and enjoy allowing our guests to experience everything the city has to offer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ba525adf-5a86-4e4d-9c34-3ecafdf35d77.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(354325027,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/354325027','Tara','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c61a2a67-6fdb-42a7-99aa-72971dbd77b2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(68847451,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/68847451','Kendra','Portland, OR','I\'m a lifelong Oregonian that took a quick hiatus in Los Angeles for school and work.  I love to read, travel, cook, hike and exercise! Please let me know if you have any questions about Portland or my home!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/592bfe5f-6352-4f3e-bd9d-b659b046285f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(286367128,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/286367128','Kevin','Portland, OR','Hello,\r\n\r\nI\'m a lifelong Oregonian that loves travel, food, reading, writing, and the great outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/efc36ecf-aeb4-4813-a23d-c58dadac556e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1631848,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1631848','Brandon','Portland, OR','Hello, my name is Brandon :) I live in Portland, Oregon. I work in health care. I love to travel and explore new areas. I’m typically quiet, relaxed, and easy to communicate with. Let me know if you have any questions about myself. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/380ced3a-7adb-488e-bb22-0d5cd3ce21b7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9668663,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9668663','Tiffany','Los Angeles, CA','I am a medical professional from Portland, OR. After living in sunny Los Angeles for 12 years, I now travel for work! I enjoy good food, Latin dancing and outdoor activities.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-9668663/original/bf7c1f82-f1fd-4f9a-9e26-5390cb53635b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(83848664,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/83848664','Michael','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/badfe529-9e3e-408e-8154-e0bf0b55730c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5733558,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5733558','Kristin And Chris','Portland, OR','Hi! We are Kristin & Chris. We have lived in California, Austin, Chicago and now Portland. We love to be outdoors, eat and explore! We have been fortunate to travel a lot and stay in Airbnb\'s across the world!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d7220f21-7774-488f-9714-58d46df936d8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(126824075,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/126824075','Month2month','Irvine, CA','With a No.1 Furnished Single Family Home Portfolio in the U.S., Month2Month delivers a AI-driven and personalized temporary housing experience to career-driven individuals and insured families across 14 states.\n\n-Preferred Partner of Fortune 500 Companies\n\n-Flexible Lease Terms and Move-in Ready\n\n-24/7 Customer Support and Professional Maintenance\n\n-Unmatched Nationwide Presence\n\nWelcome to unparalleled comfort, convenience, and flexibility!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9842ce17-ddfe-4c10-b64d-062aa52a0fae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6591194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6591194','Erin And Nick','Portland, OR','Erin is originally from Berkeley, CA, and Nick is from Putney, VT. We’ve been happy to call Oregon home since 2009. We met studying architecture at the University of Oregon and moved to Portland in 2013.  Erin works from home for a small architecture office and Nick works for a home energy performance contractor. We enjoy many hobbies including hiking and camping with our dogs, kayaking, cooking, home improvement projects, and traveling.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/317aefc7-62b6-4dff-9cc6-2e27b8f46657.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(393441074,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/393441074','Don','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a0fdd7b1-48fd-49d1-9f6f-2dbc8e5f3481.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(394600132,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/394600132','Hannah','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b1aa4c05-a742-40a0-83ee-177bae08789e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7092501,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7092501','Courtney','Portland, OR','Portland, OR ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/02d9cd1c-3226-4e3d-b43b-50c7416bc8cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(187761372,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/187761372','Bob','Portland, OR','I am an Architect and have a firm in Portland.  I enjoy Volleyball and play a couple times a week.  My wife and I love to travel when we can and really enjoy meeting people through Airbnb.   We\'ve stayed in quite a few places in the United States and also enjoy times we\'ve been to Europe.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/20af55ef-7ba7-4ccb-a1c9-7c9c752f19c9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3139720,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3139720','Nick','Portland, OR','I\'m a software engineer who likes tech stuff like videogames and servers. I also enjoy connecting with people by playing boardgames.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f725cd5d-c88d-483f-b279-6b701393d587.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4322400,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4322400','Grey','Mill Valley, CA','We hope you enjoy our home. We hope you love it as we do and make some good memories!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/6c887239-c541-481b-8e8e-ea8e08e322f3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(61310355,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/61310355','Thomas','Portland, OR','Thomas went to college near Boston where he became an avid surfer on the north shore.  Following graduation he travelled to Colorado, where he became enamored with mountaineering and eventually became a rock and mountain climbing guide. Ten years of this work and play took Thomas to every corner of the country as well as up the Nose of El Capitan. He has held teaching certifications in both New York and California, which allowed him to bring his love for learning into the classroom. In more recent years, family became Thomas’ primary focus and that has provided him with unprecedented fulfillment and a new pastime of skateboarding. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d20ca9b6-7257-4130-8bf3-ec6f55f4c232.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(237270930,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/237270930','Tahlia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ac49f436-4160-4ca1-a45c-389695433e86.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2506795,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2506795','Phalon','Portland, OR','I found my love of hosting guests growing up in a home where we regularly had foreign exchange students as part of the family. The last seven years I have been dedicated to creating a safe and inclusive living environment for both short-term and long-term guests. It has been one of my greatest joys! I also love: plants/gardening, reading, writing, music, art of all mediums, quality time with my elderly pup, and connecting with nature.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dce9eef5-fa78-4ff7-b0cf-c93ae56c20de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10593145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10593145','Monique','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3bed20e9-875a-4400-8b03-c0499d07dc24.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(396155463,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/396155463','Robert','Lake Oswego, OR','I enjoy hosting and meeting people from all sorts of backgrounds and locations.  I love fly fishing, hiking, cooking, making wine and my special hot sauces.  My wife and I love to travel and spend time with our two grown son and daughter anytime we can. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6a0c785-d375-45a5-a8df-2f6a6fd6b969.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9065073,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9065073','Gary','Portland, OR','Gary here... a very friendly, easy going, and welcoming fellow who truly loves the Airbnb experience both as a traveler and especially as a host to guests from around the world.  My first guests arrived in November of 2013 and I\'ve since opened my front door to over 1400 others from 25 countries.  Each of my guest rooms are cozy, welcoming, and unique.  I have a simple goal to provide a comfortable, special, and inviting place to call \"home\" when visiting our beautiful and vibrant city.  My guests are welcome to enjoy a movie in front of the fire in the living room, have a candlelit dinner in the dining room, cook up a tasty meal in the kitchen, and enjoy relaxing in the hot tub & yard surrounded by fountains, flowers, greenery, and serenity.\r\nI\'m really just a renaissance man. I\'ve worked as a high school teacher, a behavioral health therapist, small business owner, gardener, builder/thinker/crafter, and most passionately as a professional actor for 40 years, mostly in musical theatre but also on camera.  ** I\'m also a grateful \"friend of Bill W.\"\r\nI\'ve always enjoyed meeting new people.  Local theatre, music, books, restaurants, being outdoors, gardening, movies, are just a few pieces of my life (not forgetting karaoke).  I also love a road trip, traveling, any \"water destination\" (ocean, river, lake, stream, or pool!), and enjoying the sunshine whether it\'s in my convertible, on a hike, diggin\' in the garden, or just a walk.  I do clean up quite well and can be found in a suit & tie, or even a tuxedo. \r\nMy home, URBAN HAVEN as I call it, is my castle!  I share it with my two adorable pups, SeeBee & Mannie; they\'re really my kids.  I\'m also caregiver for my dad, Gary Sr., who spent a decade on the streets of Santa Cruz County until 7 years of searching led me to him.  Dad is a quiet and extremely kind man enjoying our being together and grateful for his 2nd chance at life.  \r\nI take extreme pride in my simple home of 22 years. I welcome every guest with a smile and a \"make yourself at home, relax & enjoy,\"  invitation.  I\'m happy to give suggestions of things to do and see, let guests explore on their own, and even get suggestions from my guests about \"what\'s new\" that I haven\'t even seen yet myself.\r\nI consider myself a very genuine and authentic gentleman with healthy sense of humor,  with a goofy and even mildly devilish side.\r\n\r\nMy simple motto ... \"the only way to true happiness & real freedom is from doing the right thing, not because you have to but because you want to!\"',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af7ff048-5275-4a08-b517-c06c03f47a05.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13107606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13107606','Bob And Hilda','San Francisco, CA','Hello! Welcome to our home. We are avid world travelers. When we travel, we like to stay in either an Airbnb or a 5 star hotel. This little black house is our vision for a curated travel home that has familiar comforts and the luxury of a 5 star hotel. We are happy to share our personal getaway with you and hope you enjoy it as much as we do. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-13107606/original/c396ebd1-3d83-4fb8-bdfb-bbef738f790d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19539687,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19539687','Allen','Portland, OR','Back in 2009 Angie and I quit our jobs, sold everything we owned, and hopped a one-way flight to Ecuador.  Thus began our amazing two-and-a-half year RTW journey taking us all over the globe, meeting new people and doing crazy and unexpected things.  Our travels gave us the opportunity to slow down, take a step back from the typical 8-5, and figure out what we want out of life.\r\n\r\nOur current home-base is in Portland, Oregon, but we take every opportunity to get out and see more of the world.  Airbnb has definitely made this easier (not to mention more affordable).',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19539687/profile_pic/1415237291/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1919627,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1919627','Rob','Portland, OR','I enjoy being part of the Airbnb community and being able to share a slice of Portland with adventurous travelers. I have a wonderful family that includes my partner Catherine, two energetic teenage children, and loyal mutt named Hank. I founded and run an NGO dedicated to equitable and green development throughout the US. Our crew loves to travel, backpack, ski, bike, cook, craft, skate, game, and generally stay in motion.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1919627/original/bec69662-8ef0-45d8-b35c-7a77a96aae22.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15385820,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15385820','Scott','Squamish, Canada','Couple from Whistler BC, we love to travel and eat great food. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a7b851bd-2fd0-406c-826d-d220b44dd981.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(396682935,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/396682935','Cliff','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6dddd8ca-6555-4c0e-b115-47898a464d8d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60624037,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60624037','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-60624037/original/6a9cbef9-54fa-442f-b658-a9833ca5964b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(193574092,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/193574092','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/98a3cf34-ebf0-4157-8f84-ee9006c3e9a6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7749342,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7749342','Cara','Portland, OR','I’m a mom to a youngster, a psychotherapist, and an aerialist. I grew up in Portland and I keep a running list of all the amazing food here I want to try. Ask me, and I promise to share without talking your ear off.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7749342/profile_pic/1395974440/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42642669,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42642669','Sarah F.','Portland, OR','Welcome!  I love the outdoors and traveling! I bought this house in 2018 and remodeled it inside and out. (Still more to do.) I am happy to share my serene home and yard with you.  (Please be kind to my neighbors and be mindful of kids on bikes, big wheels and skateboards. We use the street for fun too!)\n\nPlease enjoy and be at ease. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/351c3b8b-d806-4779-9242-f13e52efd5fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2188267,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2188267','Aaron','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aea7b87d-27af-4263-82f8-2a149e4bb08f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58056821,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58056821','Annie','Portland, OR','I stay busy as a wedding & event floral designer, plus property management for short, mid and long-term residential rentals.  I work hard, so I can have a relatively flexible schedule with my family.  I also love ocean activities like fishing, crabbing & clamming plus home-based activities like sewing, crafting and cooking gourmet meals.\n\nI loved being an airbnb guest over the years, so I try to design our spaces to be stylish and functional by anticipating the needs of our guests.  Being a host has really been a challenge & great joy!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/de953138-6b01-4b90-9e27-9f3470690721.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36242933,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36242933','Joe','Portland, OR','I am an energetic 50’s-ish guy with too many hobbies including but not restricted to:  Irish fiddle, windsurfing, home remodeling/improvement, hindi, piano, swimming, drums, biking, guitar, golf, travel, snowboarding. I have been building a cabin out in the gorge for the past two years by myself. Originally from the Midwest, I’ve been in the Pacific Northwest since 1993 and can’t think of a better place to live.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-36242933/original/bfcae965-1cf0-4133-9e8e-72ea8ae7fb7d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4431797,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4431797','Anita','Eugene, OR','I live between Eugene and Portland, Oregon.  I am a professor of Political Theory.  I love to play and write music (I\'m a cellist and singer) and to do yoga. In the summers, my husband and I travel to Italy where he\'s from and we love to open our home to airbnb guests.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4431797/profile_pic/1355808879/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(397878148,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/397878148','Rebecca','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-397878148/original/b3652629-9abd-4cb9-8da6-3f6ae2812191.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(87307571,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/87307571','Tera','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a33ac9f0-5dd2-42a6-92f4-b78066d51493.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(396842792,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/396842792','Vector Travel Kenton','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f64a028b-04aa-4872-893b-33a4b44c22f5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(236175312,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/236175312','Allison','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/4578110a-d4e6-46f0-a6c3-30b24326b47f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15691945,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15691945','Bryce','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/95c68c1b-5989-4b2c-8a75-ec9fe9ac5177.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(212832096,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/212832096','Priscilla','Tualatin, OR','I absolutely love hosting guests!! I meet such wonderful people (who totally fascinate me) from all over the United States; and even from out of the country and it\'s such a great feeling being able to provide a beautiful space for people to fully unwind in a home away from home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/330a5b6f-1aee-41ca-8260-2b3c35b0cd8d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(229783607,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/229783607','Reed','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5b1cbdf2-107f-42d5-95ac-daf889ac68ab.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33002914,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33002914','Alison','Portland, OR','I am a designer and educator based in Portland, Oregon.  Jason and I enjoy hiking, eating delicious food,  and traveling to interesting places.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/460cbbaa-e942-4dc6-8f38-57f8c46e60d0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12183426,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12183426','Catherine','Portland, OR','I\'m an illustrator and a dog lover. If possible, I\'d prefer to walk. I don\'t mind the rain. I\'ve been to all 50 states and 15 other countries, but I\'m happy to stay in by the fire.\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12183426/profile_pic/1392234443/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(375827199,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/375827199','J','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/45b33635-f452-41f1-8825-2fd512cd82ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(158406511,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/158406511','Joshua','Portland, OR','I love working on my home and creating a beautiful, comfortable place to live and to share with guests.\n\nI designed the Zen Room and transformed it to the Zen Studio for more privacy.   It is, and has been, a place for me to heal and rejuvenate.  I’m grateful to all of you who come and share the space.\n\nNow that my boys are grown, I share the Healing House, which is the entire downstairs.    I have a studio upstairs where me and or my son stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-158406511/original/7bd761df-832c-4249-b2b1-5343b6c83d9e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90876848,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90876848','Yls','Portland, OR','It\'s a pleasure to meet you virtually;  I\'m YLS Homes, LLC. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aaf9c05d-bb7d-460b-ae3f-f2d63680eec1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3098124,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3098124','Rebecca','Portland, OR','Whether it\'s food, decor, clothing, houseplants or anything else that catches my fancy, I\'m always balancing my love of curating against my obsession with collecting.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5fe8bf60-c403-49b3-9fb0-a07207a7e2f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15880952,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15880952','Daniel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d942a4f1-e49b-4dde-95cc-65cadf86d435.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2830008,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2830008','Katie J','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f818c1a7-789e-45a7-9e55-9091082cbf3c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(396146761,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/396146761','Rachel','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cd2d11c2-2975-4b22-80d5-d3f02aad6b0c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(193445376,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/193445376','Brett','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e51719c5-8fb1-4a40-a092-8c5453c32cb9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(338853836,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/338853836','Armon','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c75f34c0-459c-4cc5-8053-30f66855367c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(98199385,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/98199385','Samuel','Portland, OR','From Hawaii. Living in Portland. Always hungry to expand my perspective by experiencing different cultures, cuisines, and beliefs. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f6d68bc4-9310-4400-a94a-8965cb68028c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16835758,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16835758','Ashley','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Ashley. I live in Portland with my husband, JB and my 5-year old son. I think the best way to explore a city is on a bike, and I think that anything worth eating should be probably be spicy...',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/2e111dde-0ccb-42b8-aa47-fc5c53625813.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(401737101,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/401737101','Tricia & Alex','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ddc18a80-0a88-43ed-91f8-83f245ea6a31.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(91978403,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/91978403','Carol','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/86c7c23e-57c5-4561-be93-f15f219bdbe5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(367109006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/367109006','Jordan','Happy Valley, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b76ad22-3515-45b3-aada-b37f675d515b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(161426342,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/161426342','Lucas','Portland, OR','Dedicated to providing the best possible guest experience.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f1348469-c2c2-4c4a-aa6d-c1f8e0408f51.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26808667,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26808667','Derrick','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/26808667/profile_pic/1422394956/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(368663,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/368663','Taylor','Portland, OR','A kid from California, I grew up spending most of my time outdoors.  That early pursuit of adventure has taken me around the world- I\'ve now lived or worked on every continent (save for Antarctica).  \n\nI\'m a small business owner in Portland, OR\n\nAs a traveler I like to think of myself as observant, empathetic, and curious. I\'m always excited by new foods, cultures, and stories.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/368663/profile_pic/1402757588/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(306295610,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/306295610','Bryan','Portland, OR','We\'re in love with everything Oregon and enjoy hosting people from all over the world and showing them what is so great about Portland and the Oregon Coast!\n\nWe travel as much as we can and love meeting new people!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c7f981ad-ecbe-4fe5-8c38-9618fcd4ae7a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1766073,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1766073','Svetha','San Francisco, CA','I currently work as an urban planner, and my husband works in marketing. We love hosting guests at our house and try to make every experience unique and enjoyable for our visitors. If you need any recommendations on things to do or places to see, we are happy to share our favorites!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/06296103-bba4-4a82-a19c-9e0d1d475e45.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20045488,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20045488','Negar','Portland, OR','Let’s travel!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-20045488/original/e8743acb-4b31-4d9e-a3f0-09e432eb7c2a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(314503963,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/314503963','Amy','Twin Falls, ID','Stay in My District specializes in furnished vacation rentals. We have multiple properties available in Portland Metro, the Oregon Coast, Washington, Idaho & Utah. \n\nI am a Native to the Pacific NW. Business owner. Mother. Trail Runner. Lover of the outdoors, travel, running in the rain, soaking in some sunshine, coffee & wine.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ccf390b-d9f3-4f1b-9ca2-269f23b79d84.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(410009654,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/410009654','Kenny','Portland, OR','I am an avid adventurer who enjoys the great outdoors, hiking, backpacking, fishing, snowboarding, and traveling the world. When I have some downtime, I love spending time at my cabins to reenergize. When I\'m not there, I look forward to sharing my cabins with wonderful guests from all over the world so they can make memories to cherish for the rest of their lives!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1959c92c-b59b-4c5c-aa9e-0d3c2bcf23d6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7883814,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7883814','Lee','Portland, OR','I\'m a professor who lived abroad as a child & has continued to travel consistently in the years since. I\'ve stayed in many AirBnBs & appreciate the unique character that traveling outside of hotels presents. Even if you have been to a city before, when you stay in residential areas you experience different neighborhoods and activities than when you stay in the big hotel downtown...',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7883814/profile_pic/1375412631/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(405603990,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/405603990','Jeremy David','Portland, OR','-originally from MA\n-Husband/Dad\n-self employed residential general contractor',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3580748b-c5b5-4d30-9956-b502336414b5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78142863,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78142863','Stephanie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e01716a-e3c0-4b53-a5d0-f3db59098784.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(312469677,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/312469677','Walter','Portland, OR','My name is Walter Grace. I happily married for 18 years and I have 4 beautiful kids. I work as uber/lift driver. Also I own properties for long/short term rent and always try to make my tenants feel comfortable at their living spaces. I am very sociable and kind person and always willing to help. Welcome to my hosting house!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1ac05db-d9d4-44ed-82b3-27b67c98066b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(48600979,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48600979','Terrence','Portland, OR','I\'m a father, oil painter, and art teacher. I have had the great opportunity to teach abroad and I take advantage of traveling whenever I can. I am from Portland, OR and enjoy time with my girls, the ocean, the forests, winning games, funny movies, and meeting new people. I often carry a sketchbook, and I travel pretty light.\nSalud.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4189545c-a9b2-4905-9364-3f383b65cf45.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(222322282,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/222322282','Melanie','Wellington, New Zealand','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0286a984-63bd-4acf-b293-22ac5b3fe649.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(404975802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/404975802','Michelle','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5d8d9859-9d7c-4310-aa80-347b77d217b4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8552848,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8552848','Sam','San Francisco, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a3e01cf4-b643-4de6-9f6a-448ba4c4c62d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(345383116,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/345383116','Abby','Portland, OR','Hi I’m Abby. I am a native Oregonian that loves the outdoors. My husband, kids, and I live here in Portland. In our free time we like to travel, try new restaurants, camp, paddle board, practice hot yoga, and take our boat out on the river. We have a big chocolate lab named Tucker. If anything comes up please do not hesitate to reach out. We are available via text or email. We will get back to you with in the hour. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/31fa9d11-da53-4e62-b97b-5f78c9390b07.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5777981,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5777981','Bj','Portland, OR','We love living in Portland. We enjoy the beautiful, local parks, downtown, and watching sunsets from our deck. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5777981/profile_pic/1365182556/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1840596,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1840596','Ariel','Portland, OR','I\'m a freelance illustrator and artist, food enthusiast and amateur chef with a passion for travel.  I love to wander around cities and enjoy a local pastry, seasonal meal, trip to the beach or lazy day in the park.  When I travel, I love living as much like a local as possible! I love design and creating an environment that feels both interesting and comfortable. When you step into my home, I hope you\'ll feel the love and care I\'ve put into the space.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1840596/original/ccddc020-42a9-446d-ae58-866a041b8b9f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30153456,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30153456','Tim','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf3987f3-70ce-4e26-8d82-e7abc960ec51.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11482545,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11482545','Kristy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/11482545/profile_pic/1390247153/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66928057,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66928057','Kimberly','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/087768b9-f4e2-47bd-b64d-1c2f68465136.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8525373,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8525373','Cynthia','Portland, OR','Welcome to the Joshua Roberts Mead House built in 1903. My partner and I bought this grand home with a vision to Airbnb a couple of rooms and eventually open up an acupuncture community clinic in the storefront.  We moved in June 2021 and will start converting the interior slowly to make what used to be a dorm for international students, feel more like a home ... with Airbnb guest rooms too:)\n\nThanks to the proceeds from a previous Airbnb (see reviews below), I\'ve completing a 5 year doctoral program in Chinese Medicine. I\'ve started my practice, Equanimity Wellness, out of my house in 2023 until I have converted the storefront space. If you\'re interested in getting treated please let me know or go to my website: EquanimityWellnessPdx dot com.\n\nBefore having a family and settling in Portland, my most valuable possession was my passport. Over the decades, I\'ve lived in three continents and have consulted for governments and businesses before settling in Portland. Portland is a great little city to retire to motherhood and a second career because of the great appreciation for the farm to table movement, the sharing economy, and a supportive vibe around children and family diversity.\n\nMagazines to which we subscribe:  The Atlantic, Mother Jones, Bitch, The New Yorker, and Portland Monthly\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8525373/original/9d739636-2ffc-45d0-b336-1ada61b3eae6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(236211324,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/236211324','Steve','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2652a888-829c-4023-a7bf-f2242cdb8ad5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1631616,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1631616','Philipp','Portland, OR','I am originally from Germany but have been living in Portland since 2009. Love to travel and explore new places.\r\n\r\nI was born and grew up in Germany, did a High School exchange in Portland and lived for College in the Netherlands and Canada. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4849a7b0-bd7d-41b6-9295-032059fc0076.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(85763112,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/85763112','Jory Janet Lee','','I\'m an Early Childhood Music Specialist and an artist.  My front yard is a native plant garden, by the curb are the raised beds, and you\'ll see a sculpture of a bicycle made out of recycled parts on the wall at the top of the driveway. My artwork is throughout both airbnb units. I\'ve lived in Portland for over 20 years. Your privacy is respected but know that I am here to help when needed: by text, phone call, or even a loud knock on the door between our areas. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/35112c4b-3a27-4407-b0de-6b3212c6822d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50556182,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50556182','Caryn','San Diego, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/81a2bc4c-7605-4fcc-b27c-1bfa0383d336.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41664565,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41664565','Travis And Laura','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1e800b4f-59a9-4c4c-bfb0-76a6d9be01d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(608006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/608006','Karen','Portland, OR','Greetings!   \nI\'m an artist and chef in Portland Oregon and Provence France. While I\'m in France, I invite you to stay in my beautiful home three blocks from Alberta Street. Also, every Sunday enjoy the Farmer\'s Market two blocks from my house!  There are plenty of restaurants, coffee shops and boutique shopping on Alberta Street as well as the new trendy Williams District only 10 blocks from my house. \n\nPortland is an amazing place with many top chefs, fantastic wines from the Willamette Valley, breweries and distilleries. Plus you have nature at your doorstep with the Columbia Gorge, Mount Hood, and the Pacific Ocean an hours drive west.\n\nI will leave information about where to go and what to do. Plus, you can cook in my fantastic kitchen and enjoy sitting under the fig tree. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e83cd08b-287e-487f-aba8-dc52386a66ae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(187129548,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/187129548','Jessica','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/df553696-a100-4cbe-9aa2-33d60d301fa0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(152385858,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/152385858','Erik','Portland, OR','middle aged pacific nw architect. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/272041ad-9248-4b4e-946f-5b1d82b61684.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(116018201,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/116018201','Elexis','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3819be06-10e7-427e-8a20-bd86e70bbeb9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(410071283,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/410071283','Delia','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(17742907,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17742907','Miley','Portland, OR','My husband Travis and I are long-time Portland residents with a thirst for adventure.  We love traveling in our repurposed skoolie bus and seeing all the world has to offer.  When we\'re home, we like going out with friends, paddling the nearby rivers and lakes on our paddle boards, and quiet nights in.  Hosting others so that they can see the beauty of Portland is something we very much enjoy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-17742907/original/9c632740-0ee3-42d9-9d66-678f382fdcc4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9171462,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9171462','Jay','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in Portland for a decade and just love this city, enjoying each neighborhood I\'ve lived in along the way. I enjoy local craft beer and coffee, trail running in Forest Park, and taking day trips around the region whenever I can.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fdc19aaa-7876-476b-8e18-ab196643f834.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4057428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4057428','Brian','Portland, OR','I\'m from Portland, Ore.  \r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4057428/profile_pic/1352062556/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(390362157,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/390362157','Hannah','Portland, OR','Hiii! Thanks for checking out my profile and my rental. I have lived in Portland for over 20 years and love this city. Rose City till I die bayyybe! \n\nI started renting out the basement suite after my (covid) divorce to help me stay in the house my son was born in. He loves this blue house and goes to school in the neighborhood. \n\nGuests not only help me keep his home but have also been a great source of enjoyment. We love meeting new people and enjoy hosting! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/eefdfa99-dcdd-4a91-9823-b48fb0bd326a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22843577,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22843577','Brandon','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22843577/profile_pic/1413990395/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(410702782,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/410702782','Trevor And Gina','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0f0ddaaf-23a0-4cb2-94fe-0e4bc970bbbb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58415337,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58415337','Jenny','Portland, OR','Hello,\n\nMy name is Jenny. Meeting new people and going on new adventures is always a valued experience on any of my journeys. \n\nCheers!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-58415337/original/c92e4b12-3d82-49ab-afb9-2d15e2ba2fc0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1794276,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1794276','Kathleen','Portland, OR','From PDX, OR. A stay busy kind of gal, I hike, camp, jiu jitsu, weight lift, and get outside with my german shepherd puppy, Akela!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f0e05ef2-8db2-4a72-942a-465582efae80.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(411719178,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/411719178','Melanie','','I am a local RN originally from Canada but I have lived in Portland for 22 years. I love the friendliness of Portlanders!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a66d11e-e663-426f-90d7-c338f97be056.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8325660,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8325660','Elle','Portland, OR','My name is Elle Nigh and I live in Portland, Oregon. I\'m a design operations lead at a sports company here in Portland. I love interior design, running, and exploring all of what the PNW has to offer. I am originally from Montana, but am so happy to call Portland home now. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9856a47f-6e3a-40bf-9f08-265bc714bdfa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65298032,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65298032','Celia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8d7ce3d2-8941-4d98-a91b-e23521895dfd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7190217,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7190217','Ryan','Portland, OR','I\'m an explorer and a denizen. I delight at experiencing new things and relish in the familiarities of home. I am most happy sharing discoveries with others and creating comfortable spaces to call your own.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7190217/original/7a0535a8-7c2b-4f0e-a546-2627739181d6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(412106184,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/412106184','Judy','Portland, OR','I became a transplant from Walnut Creek California to Portland Oregon in February of 2012 after visiting one of my five children, who had already called Portland home.  Instantly I was attracted to the slower paced, artsy energy here, and yes, I love the rain.\nAs a retiree, I find joy in writing, walking, laughing, gardening, sharing great food with family and friends, and hosting my little cottage. I know you will feel the tranquility in this space.\nA wellspring of activities, adventure and exploration waits for you in Portland.  I have a list of suggestions to get you started, but most of all, feel at home and enjoy your time here.\nJudy',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-412106184/original/cf6e1dbe-5333-4d13-aac7-c101f83a54dc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(201285877,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/201285877','Emily','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3442223-63a4-494e-9f1f-c83e0633feab.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17150339,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17150339','Bryan','Portland, OR','I am a traveler hiker and over all chill person',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e8438da-9eb4-49fe-a4be-98c5911902be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(516025,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/516025','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','Where to begin?\r\n\r\nWhen I\'m not working I\'m happy to be at home knitting or cooking with a movie on the tv. On the weekends I love to throw on my dancing shoes and go out with friends (without getting *too* crazy).\r\n\r\nI love meeting new people and getting to know new places. Point me in the direction of a good cup of coffee and some fun shops to check out and I\'m a happy camper.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3f2cc45f-6f4f-45ee-907f-eae9c752f057.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(356211715,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/356211715','Cheyenne','Portland, OR','Hello world! My name is Cheyenne! I am a brand manager at Nike. As a Portland native, I love showing people my city! I like anything outdoors! If you have any questions about my property or Portland, please don\'t be shy. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1509bb29-4b94-4058-9d0e-e5a640b83190.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3851254,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3851254','Chelsie & Todd','New York, NY','Todd and I have been traveling together for over 10 years and hosting for 3! We currently call Brooklyn home with our two children. \n\nWe are excited to welcome guests from all over the world to our house in Portland! I grew up in this wonderful city, and we love being able to provide a home where folks can have an amazing and comfortable experience. We are happy to help with any travel needs you have - just message us with questions or comments!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3d6a41c1-6008-4bf0-9d37-5157e60ddbec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(260686384,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/260686384','Muneeb','Portland, OR','Just a California native enjoying life in the PNW alongside my cat, Pixel. Making new friends along the way through our Airbnb journey :) ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-260686384/original/c35e28b2-a195-47bc-8ead-3dfe39e1457a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(412930905,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/412930905','Waira','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e9950e4d-50cd-484b-8335-8423c4ebfd2b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(79941643,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/79941643','Abigail','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-79941643/original/f1c2089e-0b64-479e-b88f-5b97eadde3da.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(298041369,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/298041369','Russell','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d8b655e2-1aa9-49ea-aaab-891819ba9c44.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(413396493,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/413396493','William','Portland, OR','My wife and I have lived in this special space for over 15 years. Our kids have grown up here and enjoyed so many wonderful memories between these walls. We\'re proud to offer this special place to guests from all over the world. We look forward to helping you make your stay the most comfortable and memorable it can be. And we hope you\'ll give us a try next time you\'re in Portland. Cheers!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/212d2636-29f1-4171-9582-3ea62f55a79e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8946045,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8946045','Craig & Lisa','Portland, OR','Lisa and Craig live in Portland, Oregon, USA with their children, who are 18 and 21. They like to travel individually, as a couple, and as a family. Craig is a craft food maker and avid gardener who enjoys exploring local foods, and Lisa works in Learning and Development at a major technology company and loves exploring new places.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8946045/original/c5559cca-7e2a-4646-9aa1-93373d1459bf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7076896,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7076896','Jayme','Portland, OR','I\'m Jayme (she/her) and will be your host while visiting the Clinton St. Guesthouse. My family and I spend lots of time exploring areas of Oregon and Washington. My husband and I were high-school sweethearts and have been together for 22+ years. We have a 6 year old son and two Great Pyrenees rescue dogs. I\'m an Educator, Small business owner, and find so much joy in hosting people.\n\nI love growing my own food, spending time with family, home renovations, working out, wine tasting, traveling, and exploring new experiences with my family. \n\nI absolutely love the variety and small lovely elements staying in an Airbnb offers. It’s something truly special and fun to stay in a unique property. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/8373aa94-a606-420c-94bb-d9165b8ec943.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5335159,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5335159','Juan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2a49580d-27a4-41c8-9fda-d861fe368f5f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(116397710,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/116397710','Tyler','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/339218e7-0104-4ec7-a2ef-d87d9f694ccc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1458575,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1458575','Melanie And Ronaldo','Ajijic, Mexico','Hi! We are a couple of adventurers who have been  traveling the world together for some 35 years now....We are an integrative (wholistic minded) MD and a hospice nurse, yoga enthusiasts, parents of two grown daughters (twins). We currently split our time between Portland and Mexico but our daughter Ayla lives in the Portland house full time and helps out with the Airbnb. We would love to have you stay with us and have done everything we can to make your stay feel like home while allowing you your privacy.  Let us know how we can help!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1458575/profile_pic/1443453888/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32831349,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32831349','Tristan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6a3697af-c7ef-43f7-bd39-0a7101d7d04f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(415317125,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/415317125','Megan','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Megan!\n\nI love to travel, read, try new foods, and host travelers in my wonderful city of Portland, Oregon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8afc5d9e-03f6-4127-ad29-730df103e6ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(103330725,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/103330725','Nickisbnb','Portland, OR','We love travel. We have stayed in many hotels, b&b’s& homestays. So we have a lot of experience regarding nice hosting but also know about bad hostings.\nWe use these experiences to help you guys have the most comfortable stay possible. \nWe are open to advice and love to talk about the area or travels.\nWe love to listen to your travel storries, or share ours.   We speak Mandarin, Taiwanese, English and Dutch.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-103330725/original/a992415e-83a0-45e7-946a-ea5b4e3ded4a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5888241,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5888241','Yuting','Chandler, AZ','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5888241/original/131322e2-a3d8-4e95-bf1d-416466ba4d53.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51249144,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51249144','Bryan','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m a Chicago transplant who stereotypically graduated from college and moved to Portland \"where young people go to retire.\"  I\'ve worked as a mortgage processor, then as a criminal defense attorney but about a decade ago I finally found my forever career as an organic veggie farmer (I promise I have not appeared in Portlandia, but I do know the farm in the pilot episode with the chicken).\n\nI bought my listed family home over 20 years ago.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/1344ab6d-5979-4930-8238-7fb5669ad3e4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100544418,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100544418','Dominique','New York, NY','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b97fe0e4-9a45-418f-8688-5c70a5228ab3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78879277,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78879277','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','Lover of adventuring. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c9de9e55-517a-4cf9-ab03-02572843a094.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95479282,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95479282','Brandon','Portland, OR','Newly settled into Portland and excited to explore both this city and other parts of the world. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cf72fa66-5378-44dd-87b9-fe84f3d1aedd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19162027,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19162027','Siri','Portland, OR','Hello there, I love to travel the world and I’m extremely grateful to be able to show off my little slice of Portland with you! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7bfce2bb-4601-4736-b17b-e843867cf1cd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(350032602,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/350032602','Kelly','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7b2f2d5e-6091-45f4-9eec-735b98e0c284.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51450038,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51450038','Carrie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/935bedf7-381e-467c-88c1-11a24ff5bc71.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(359037027,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/359037027','Vladimir','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ff16832-c533-4144-b297-547bfb7fc650.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(702623,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/702623','Tyesha','Portland, OR','We live in Portland Oregon. I\'m a strategist at a digital product design company and he\'s a massage therapist. We have two girls 10 & 5.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/29f8e333-c124-463b-bf2f-76d779857b71.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15916244,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15916244','Nancy','Portland, OR','Hi, I am Nancy.  I am an avid traveler having spent time in over 50 countries and not as many states.  I have lived overseas for eight years and love integrating cultures and foods into my everyday considerations.  I am a bibliophile and moreso as I age.  I enjoy yoga, running and scuba as well as time with my family.  I have stayed in backpacker joints and five star hotels.  I like the people in backpacker joints best!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6f35cc17-4e87-4797-a189-22c73f377272.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57554369,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57554369','Kayla','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/89a25136-44b7-4d5a-a9be-5ea2122623d0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(357126676,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/357126676','Richard','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eddb1895-c72b-4dd5-80ef-1d256878da2d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115674426,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115674426','Blake','Portland, OR','I\'m a French translator who loves reading, hiking, urban exploration, and ice cream.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3171d8a3-fd4f-41de-a20a-d6831cdc7eb0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10489925,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10489925','Marcella','Portland, OR','True Oregonian who loves hiking and good beer! :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ec6e2f11-0274-4d74-8545-cad708147b22.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(351653210,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/351653210','Christiaan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/16fd86f0-a967-47d0-866f-6d4a4163863f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3790403,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3790403','Martha Fabiola','Portland, OR','I\'m from México and South East Border of Texas and been in Portland, OR @ 11 yrs.  I like to play music and enjoy outdoor adventures such as camping, kayaking and canoeing.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/87b8766f-0446-47d1-8c86-3c41f5353a07.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17216363,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17216363','Austin','Portland, OR','Hey, I\'m Austin and live in Portland, OR. I love it here and would be happy to share all the wonderful things it has to offer. \nI love hiking, playing board games, good food, and always love to make new friends.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-17216363/original/6fa536fe-f661-4b51-98cd-739349b3f0d3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121688409,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121688409','Evolve','United States','Hi! We’re Evolve, the hospitality team that helps you rest easy when you rent a private, professionally cleaned home from us.\n\nWe promise your rental will be clean, safe, and true to what you saw on Airbnb or we\'ll make it right. Check-ins are always smooth, and we\'re here 24/7 to answer any questions or help you find the perfect property.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-121688409/original/eec7553b-57a8-4a2e-a10c-95c2111ae2fb.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(417913151,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/417913151','Sean','Portland, OR','Having been with my Tummy Bear for nearly a decade, this is a space of sheer joy. As a strictly-therapeutic LMT who knows 102+ unique musculature, I live life making the condition of others better with our time together. While being a university professor, Mitch is finalizing his MD in computer science simultaneously. Our true home is in the Columbia River Gorge. Of course, LGBT+ friendly. But honestly, if you are not friendly, why bother at all.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-417913151/original/df543c16-8674-45ff-864e-ebfcb0c73ebb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5375520,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5375520','Zeb','Portland, OR','Hi there!\n\nI\'m an airbnb host who loves to travel and stay in wonderful Airbnbs. I read a lot, cook a lot, and try and get out into nature for a long weekend at least once a month. \n\nI usually travel with my wonderful partner Tory and our dog Ziggy.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e9647189-ab28-483e-b333-8d7332e037d8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42734493,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42734493','Chad','Portland, OR','Freelance Producer. Making films by day and traveling the world whenever I can!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/927e402c-f309-4520-a6f0-305759641be0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3423772,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3423772','Dustin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c9f14acd-de2c-4494-ac35-ddf13eff77fc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(72716191,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/72716191','Adam','Portland, OR','Hello, we are Adam and Erin, the owners and hosts of this charming duplex in the trees. We have lovingly restored and furnished this classic Portland home to provide our guests with a comfortable and unique stay. \n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/02d809ad-fdf3-4658-9fb5-4de96498946a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14854564,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14854564','Melanie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f06f92e5-1f79-4ee7-b012-1b9975d52c66.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78821885,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78821885','Shelby','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Shelby! I’m passionate about traveling, and I LOVE Airbnb, both as a host and as a guest!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2892b717-f064-4969-92a6-a1e9b582b265.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132869260,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132869260','Aaliyah Mumtaz','Portland, OR','Aloha,\n \nI lived in Hawaii for 23 years, and recently moved back to my home town, Portland, Oregon.\nI love meeting ALL KINDS of new people!\nI am very appreciative of all the Airbnb hosts for opening their homes to all of us travelers looking for safe adventures, and a home away from our own. \nI\'m pretty independent, and usually on the go. \n \nDue to Covid-19, I give people their space, and socially distance. \nI\'m vaccinated, and wipe common surfaces frequently.  \n\n Mahalo & happy travels!\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/873e4c3d-ccd3-47e9-bc76-2f0f5fda232b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12773385,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12773385','Ryan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6f687124-5f91-48b7-a810-bbb7f54a1ce2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148285986,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148285986','Phillip','Portland, OR','Love the Pacific Northwest! Tattooed fun loving bike racer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/945ff49b-5fb1-4e33-8268-6d27fe23b715.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23942166,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23942166','Paula','Portland, OR','Hi, my name is Paula and I would love to have you as a guest at my cottage. I am down to earth and very easy to talk to. All my guests are respected and treated equally. I keep to myself and do not monitor or distract my guests, but I am very easy to get a hold of if anyone ever needs anything.\r\n\r\n:)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/23942166/profile_pic/1416428818/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(711089,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/711089','Abby','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, Oregon, with my husband and young son. I enjoy eating, exploring, swimming, reading, coffee, art, and people. I grew up in rural California and lived in Sydney, Budapest, Washington DC, Buenos Aires and Seattle before moving to Portland. I  appreciate cities, and I like towns, but I especially love the mountains. I work at Portland State University and can offer lots of good, off-the-beaten-path Portland recommendations. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/830939e5-de07-4168-ba91-1b80272fb654.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(420599486,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/420599486','Jeffrey','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5bf229bd-d367-4977-a976-3708bfa48f54.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43317498,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43317498','Hannah','Portland, OR','West coaster passionate about supporting local businesses. Ready to recommend hidden gems!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/efd98975-6cb9-4646-ba13-37c61583dc8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(421181207,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/421181207','Bendrea','Portland, OR','Just a young man trying to inspire ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8c0a7231-c6be-4694-b23d-ec25d8982ec4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(120715259,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/120715259','Katy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6f26f869-fb8e-4abe-8de6-6a5067bcbf9b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(271565231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/271565231','Austin & Raze','Portland, OR','We\'re a Portland couple that love to travel, meet new people, and share our space.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a10ab0a8-ca6c-4ef1-9f31-5f01776a04e9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(102654383,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/102654383','Michelle','Portland, OR','Hi. Born and raised in Portland and love my fabulous city.  During the work week I am a nurse in a surgery unit. On the weekends and holidays I am Always looking for an adventure as I am eager to explore the world. I am active and work out as much as time allows.    I have: taken my bike 60 miles along the Oregon and California coast on highway 101 near the Red Woods and camped along the way, hiked and back country camped in many magical areas in the Pacific Northwest, rock climber on single and multi pitch climbs all over, like Smith Rock and City of Rocks in Idaho, red Rocks in Las Vegas and many more, Canyoneering in Zion, MOAB and in Eagle Creek, mountaineer, skydiver, snorkeler turned free diver and spear fisherman in the Sea of Cortez, the Caribbean, and Maui, Hawaii .  I am eager to meet new people for interesting conversations.   A mom of two amazing people:  Tao is off in college in Texas and Emmy is in Poland. I am an empty nester! Life is good.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/adca5f06-859f-4f4e-a40d-ca6ba7621ff6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15324875,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15324875','Jody','Portland, OR','I\'m an Australian living in Portland, Oregon, USA with my husband (from Singapore), two cats and dog. We\'ve been living in the US (Pennsylvania, California and Oregon) for over 20 years, which has mysteriously flown by.\n\nI love tea, travel (as much as I can get!), photography, literature, hiking, the coast, books (with a particular love for crime fiction), unique little shops and cafes, old houses, museums, galleries and unexpected discoveries.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7fae9c64-8ff3-4db8-871d-36e19ab958b2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28313660,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28313660','Maria','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7823f241-17f8-4e88-9df8-a503370f522b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(392859086,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/392859086','Thomas','Portland, OR','A creative, fun-loving individual who has a passion for designing unique and quirky living spaces. As an Airbnb host, I am dedicated to creating unforgettable experiences for guests by providing them with more than just a place to stay.\n\nI am committed to ensuring that your stay is as enjoyable and memorable as possible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-392859086/original/2b598fad-f95e-4556-93ae-e53bac11115d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(417919018,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/417919018','Nicole','Portland, OR','Plant mom, traveler, business owner and foodie. I love sharing my perspective of the city through cozy and convenient home stays. My passion for travel is only second to my love for my family and my plants. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ba1c642-dcd1-4654-989a-01e030eac245.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44169147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44169147','Spencer','Portland, OR','I love Airbnb. It’s how I choose the places to stay during vacation, and now I have the pleasure of sharing my home with people from all across the world. I hope you enjoy the beauty of Portland as much as I do. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-44169147/original/3592e5ad-57b5-4d94-b5ca-bbbac0786441.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7182995,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7182995','David','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e2e35f3a-90a1-4261-b47f-9ff823af822d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25637387,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25637387','Ryda','Portland, OR','We are educator’s  and friendly people who love to travel our world. We also host Airbnb’s! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f23877ae-4ecb-4f4d-b9c6-dd3aef3e8436.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95508244,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95508244','David','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a66511a5-f75e-40e5-98a6-d7828b6d81bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26060885,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26060885','Marc','Portland, OR','I am a working professional in the sports apparel industry living in Portland Oregon.  Work consumes the majority of my time but in my spare time I love traveling, cooking and making art.  I look forward to hosting you or staying in your place as a guest :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/18fe1c99-679f-4a98-871d-8049c7be4068.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(180951800,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/180951800','Ember','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland, OR, but always looking to travel and explore new places. I love spending time with family and friends, and I especially enjoy game nights, campfires, and my newest hobby, trying to keep a growing collection of houseplants alive! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/34c07f29-fc6b-4515-8046-81030881a1e9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(374459836,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/374459836','Chloe & Jason','Oregon, United States','Chloe and Jason Sweet with Sweeter Homes LLC here! \n\nLittle bit about us! Jason works as a Construction project engineer and Chloe works as a tool engineer at an aerospace company! Jason is an avid hunter and fisherman, while Chloe loves ballet and fixer upper house projects. We love the outdoors, traveling to new places, experiencing new cultures and learning their history. \n\nFamily is everything to us, and we like our guests to feel like they are staying at a home that is loved and cared for - because they are! While you stay at one of our properties, we are available if you need us, we like to give our guests space to enjoy their stays with as little intervention as possible!\n\nWe started hosting our home with Airbnb and loved it so much we\'ve started hosting other homes in our community!  Give us a shout if you\'re interested in listing your home or have questions - we can help!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/604bb542-435f-4aef-b4f9-81c2cbc8e96b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(306489174,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/306489174','Jennifer','Marlin, TX','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1a3d1ee2-edd9-4bb6-ac8c-ff6bf5dbda0e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5268931,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5268931','Logan','Portland, OR','Hello! My name\'s Logan, I\'m a small business owner in Portland, OR. I love Portland! I\'ve lived here for 14 years, it\'s my happy place and I\'m happy to provide a place for others to come experience the city. \nAbout me: Easy going. I love the outdoors, camping and hiking with friends. Oregon allows me the privilege of the mountains, the beach, the river and the desert. I hope you have as much fun during your stay here, as I do living here!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/28b1f48c-08c4-4d9c-93dc-6aefd6db731d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(424758888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/424758888','Krista','Portland, OR','Hi I\'m Krista,\nWe are your hosts: Mama, Papa, Fia & Xoco - ready to welcome you and share this beautiful place - both in New Mexico and in Oregon!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c2f387e9-95a4-4cf6-93b1-cca000508ab2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111798260,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111798260','Vacasa Oregon','','Hi, we’re Vacasa, North America’s largest vacation rental management company. Owners of vacation homes around the world trust us to deliver exceptional service throughout your entire vacation. Professional housekeepers clean and stock each home, and our customer care team is available around the clock—with a local property manager ready to show up and help out. We like to think we offer the best of both worlds: you can enjoy a one-of-a-kind vacation experience in a unique property, without compromising on service and convenience. Check out our listings, and get in touch if you have any questions. Your vacation is our full-time job, and we\'d love to help you plan your perfect getaway.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9d09c0e9-3d36-4615-9c3b-3451325faadd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8898956,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8898956','Devin','Portland, OR','Hello! I am a Systems Strategist splitting my time between Portland, OR, Orlando FL, and wherever else I find my path taking me! I work remotely and hope to explore the world this way.\n\nIn my free time I roller skate, try to cut my own bangs, read up on the latest celeb gossip, travel constantly, and study the Enneagram (I\'m a type 7!)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8898956/original/fec263c1-e8ae-4bc4-9232-7dc73892a648.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(425076265,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/425076265','Reg','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7ad2a13-6a2f-4bb6-a59b-4de213a40fb1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(233640130,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/233640130','Melissa','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b6d10e98-dd41-4bd0-ae7d-fdf12379a662.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38262590,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38262590','Lilli','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/16ce2609-0d38-4053-adb4-91f9b2523db5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(198019,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/198019','Jodi','Portland, OR','I love to travel and eat good food.  I live in Portland, Or and love taking advantage of everything the city and surrounding area has to offer. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d93b40d3-5d5e-4764-a88c-107629ac0d73.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(79757839,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/79757839','Gianna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/372ce821-1d45-49dc-8368-be1d2c8d6cb3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(330040000,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/330040000','Meredith','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6102f3a3-0798-427f-a630-a9ade54d19be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(426942173,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/426942173','Brent','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/efb9b10a-d69a-4398-bcc4-8b5466e9831e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(427162525,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/427162525','Jay And Rachel','Portland, OR','Hello! We are Jay and Rachel and we are both passionate about making sure you are the most relaxed and comfortable during your\r\nstay here with us! We are Local realtors and real estate investors here in Portland so we built this Unit to fit what we love in a Airbnb \r\nWe are a energetic family and we are always on the go! please feel free to contact us with any questions you might have as we are always ready and willing to help! Enjoy your stay!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b35e66ba-1d4e-4a3a-9b0d-0a3ebfcd3d30.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63604806,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63604806','Julia','Portland, OR','I am excited to see the world and all the beautiful people in it. Whether we meet in my home town of Portland OR over a beer or in France over a croissant , I look forward to sharing our stories and adventures.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/202dc227-52d5-4874-9999-0b1d39752027.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75641753,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75641753','Grace','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9def5189-49af-4ccc-b83f-2066259e1f7b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(284121454,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/284121454','Ria','Portland, OR','I\'m compassionate, respect views, friendly and very clean',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f693c8f5-42d0-43ed-8c43-b7eb7e065658.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1217742,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1217742','Frankie','Portland, OR','My husband and I love to travel. We have stayed at many AirBnBs and are happy to now be hosting guests in our NE Portland suite as well. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ccfbdefc-851e-4f25-bc48-21ddd2ed3704.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(55428340,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/55428340','Taylor','Portland, OR','I am a realtor based in Portland and love traveling when I get the chance.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-55428340/original/b5a9383f-37ce-48ee-8088-11d280e6ad3b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(101889896,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/101889896','Cam','Portland, OR','My wife and I love to travel which is why we are passionate about hosting guests from anywhere and everywhere. We do our best to implement the things we love in our travel experiences into our home and are always open to more suggestions!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e5d822ea-7c33-41d5-a113-7e00759f668f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(199501890,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/199501890','Deb','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9fd63a2f-aa6b-444f-a8e8-46b11188e341.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2283444,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2283444','John','Portland, OR','I live in Portland with my wife.  We enjoy traveling. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/81a77446-46f1-419e-80c1-76ded28f22ed.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(119494333,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/119494333','Daniel','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c044457c-4fb3-49fc-9d39-44237381295e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8738428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8738428','Laura','Portland, OR','Artist, Consultant, Educator',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d832e067-2af4-40d8-bc07-007c0de07010.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(426716618,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/426716618','Charmaine','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-426716618/original/03a693e1-5a2e-4205-8721-a0d27a39a283.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(53037521,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/53037521','Bharti','Portland, OR','I am a semi- retired Science Teacher.  I just love the North West and was drawn to the City of Portland which is so unique from all the other cities that I have seen. My daughter and her family drew me to this beautiful State.\n I  like to meet travelers and more than happy to share the wealth of knowledge and recommendations I have accumulated. I travel as often i can from camping to Hotels.  I have seen much of the world and will continue .',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/409870fb-133a-433e-806e-779fe2ff16cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100815695,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100815695','Merideth','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c06cab4e-5796-48ac-a7fe-a6db29710c9d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7205630,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7205630','Lynzy','Portland, OR','I’m an Oregon native, who grew up exploring the Northwest and gaining a deep appreciation for all it has to offer! \r\nI love roughing it in the outdoors, but I also appreciate a delicious meal and good drink. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/08c28f6e-c7ac-49b4-b717-4ec1cb078fda.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4006487,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4006487','Kathleen','Portland, OR','Born in Montana; followed my sister to Oregon for college. I have lived in Salem, Corvallis, Eugene, and Portland. Also Hawaii and D.C. I have two awesome adult children, one exceptionally gifted and/one exceptionally challenged. I speak some Spanish and have studied sign language, French and Mandarin. Have JudeoChristian&New Age perspective; friends of many faiths as well as agnostic or atheist. My dreams oft foreshadow the future. Love is love!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/35162be1-6f9e-4943-b245-794f97452bf3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(221744485,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/221744485','Shanon','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/34d5b059-288c-4ffe-b4fc-b9c84ae807dc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45560716,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45560716','Sean','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bb9672d3-c799-46e6-908a-1b1938c52410.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19969093,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19969093','Buckley','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fc2b8bb6-d88d-4f48-b95c-b8a245f2723b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19813706,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19813706','Preston Andrew','Portland, OR','Usually traveling with my family of four.  Looking for good food and adventure.  I am a retired chef/restaurant owner and now a stay at home husband. Enjoy making furniture, jewelry and other crafts in my spare time when not working on my home. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3900d0ce-442e-47c2-bb19-c64c83629be8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20863371,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20863371','Steph','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20863371/profile_pic/1409694925/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1656510,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1656510','Paige','Portland, OR','We fell in love with Portland and PNW region area nine years ago when we moved out here from Brooklyn, NY. We love to explore the city and outdoors and excited to share some of our favorite spots with you.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1656510/profile_pic/1349269891/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(131697,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/131697','Michael','Portland, OR','Portland resident and explorer since 1996.  \r\n\r\nI am happy to share adventures in and around Portland that you should experience.  These include hikes, bike rides, festivals, foodie events, and more.\r\n\r\nGlad we can share our homes on Airbnb.  They are comfortable for groups and families (as we have 5 kids).',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/131697/profile_pic/1410384083/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36297855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36297855','Sam','Portland, OR','Hi there!\n\nWell, what is there to say? I grew up in Portland and just moved back after 10 years in San Francisco. I\'m super excited about being an airbnb host and welcoming people to a great city with lots to offer. \n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e050c699-7f4c-4c53-85d9-ee80faec589e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(223054857,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/223054857','Marcus','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7d4f6892-4739-4268-9e6e-5b3dff7125ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(428415856,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/428415856','Ashley','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/481ca668-a514-4291-9312-cc88f2ed38e7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(141058023,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/141058023','Colin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e56dcfc1-98ed-46c4-a1b7-9e6464eeba0c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5154051,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5154051','Anna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5154051/profile_pic/1441395799/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(162283241,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/162283241','Kimberly','Del Mar, CA','Hi! I\'m Kimberly & I am the founder of Vacation Rentals by Kimberly. I started VRBKIM over 13 years ago. Our company specializes in short-term stays @ the beach in San Diego. I was born & raised locally here in San Diego, & many of the VRBKIM Team was too! We are so elated that you are considering one of our homes for your visit to San Diego! Thanks for considering Vacation Rentals by Kimberly!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96bebd1b-b325-4e8e-807e-deb091adf332.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36988436,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36988436','Alyssa','Portland, OR','I live in Portland with my husband and kids. I love traveling, being outside and exploring the northwest. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/475987f1-75aa-4291-b2de-c71dbf5e1023.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(136086564,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/136086564','Rhonda','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/967b59db-c5d8-4f42-996c-34241c087803.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(409693567,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/409693567','Patrick And Sarah','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d36fb84f-5c9d-45ff-a6e4-8879fefc933c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40079083,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40079083','Julie','Portland, OR','Hi, I am Julie.\nCome enjoy our cottage.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-40079083/original/072a6e5e-48d6-4dc5-96e7-f0a5a3b8222f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5389533,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5389533','Yvette','Portland, OR','My husband Joel and I live in a very special 80s - Art Deco home in Portland, OR. We\'re so excited to share our unique downstairs suite with guests!  Eventually, we hope to give tours of the rest of our unusual house as an \"Experience\" through AirBNB.\nI am a hobby opera singer and small food business owner, he’s a DJ and works in urban planning. I\'m originally from New Orleans, so once we saw the \"Deco Dream House\", now our home, we knew it would rekindle our Mardi Gras spirit in Portland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5a1bc06d-da01-4302-a8d3-2a645d030595.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(432518724,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/432518724','Lonnie','Portland, OR','My wife and I are native to Portland.  She is a writer and I am an illustrator. We believe in our city and are deeply appreciative of the nature that Oregon is known for.  We enjoy exploring local and distant places which has inspired us to share with fellow travelers our own unique forest stay. Welcome.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4f28951b-bd8a-4bce-ad49-8831c0717b78.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(828654,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/828654','Rochelle & Tom','Portland, OR','Back in Portland OR after some years of Midwest living. Eager to continue our annual long distance walks in England but in the meantime we\'ll be adventuring a little closer to home. We\'ve hosted many thousands of guests over the last decade, though currently on hiatus as we focus on new callings.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cdac02c1-3f54-47fa-9ceb-db4e3350886e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6564786,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6564786','Sarah','Portland, OR','My name is Sarah (she/her) and I enjoy traveling, foraging, camping, rockhounding, and eating delicious food in my free time.  I’m a quiet and courteous guest and host!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7fc4916-a96e-4c5b-89dc-6dc4b553cbc4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(433340907,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/433340907','Larry','','My wife Carolyn and I are new to Airbnb but look forward to meeting our first guests and becoming Super Hosts in the near future. We love to travel ourselves and wanted to provide a safe and comfortable place for travelers to stay.  Our goal is to make our guests feel welcome and at home. We have an open communication policy, and your personal feedback will be appreciated as we establish ourselves in the Airbnb community.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5774a28-db9c-42b0-b867-be850e2db4bd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(169538028,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/169538028','Oleg','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3eae2a08-d05f-441a-9a4a-7da385455a8f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2141579,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2141579','Karen','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, OR where I own and operate a photography business and a pottery studio.  I love the outdoors, art, traveling, dining, exploring, hiking and hosting dinner parties.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7fbf2a0a-a027-4049-9bb5-7f7a6f83a691.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2199289,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2199289','Sarah','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67dbea0a-8dd5-45ac-baa4-1f3a2e7b6029.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2516802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2516802','Kelly','Portland, OR','Alohas! I\'m more than happy to host you in my home! I also travel around the world quite a bit, so will do my best to make you as comfy and cozy as possible -- I want the space to serve as a sanctuary for you, where ever you are coming or going from. \n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2516802/original/52b2867c-e091-44be-a846-15b1317361cc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35305959,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35305959','Byron (Hüga Homes)','','Our #1 goal at HüGA Homes is to ensure you have a comfortable and enjoyable stay. We firmly believe that living like a local is the best way to experience any city, so we aim to provide an all-around guest experience that you will remember. \n\nWe are available to answer any questions you may have about our home or about the locale such as recommended restaurants/bars/attractions, etc., so please reach out!\n\nAs for us, we love exploring different cultures (been to 30+ countries), spending quality time with friends/family,  and sharing our spaces with others. We\'re thrilled to host you and your loved ones!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4585dcc5-c9fb-4268-addf-a0917f63fce3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(130350094,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/130350094','Micah','Portland, OR','I love traveling around the world with my family and meeting new people! My wife and I are both teachers who live in Portland, Oregon with our son and daughter. Now we host people who travel around the world. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b9cd2b2-2733-4e63-948c-37fd6aef4274.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11054611,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11054611','Oranuch','El Cerrito, CA','I am originally from Bangkok, Thailand. Design and food are my passion. I have been living in Asia, Europe, and now the US. I believe in traveling and understanding how you want to be treated, and will keep your place cleaned!\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b812b82e-4bc0-4278-973f-efd9e9d8a489.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(217988597,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/217988597','Johnathan And Cassie','San Francisco, CA','Hello!  We are Johnathan and Cassie and we fell in love while traveling the globe together in 2008.  We now love exploring new areas and cultures with our three amazing kids.  In 2021 we got rid of almost everything we owned to travel.  Living full time in Airbnb’s gave us great insight and inspired us to host our own in Sonoma CA and Portland OR!   ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-217988597/original/329842a0-e5f0-437a-84db-5548c122fba6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127848804,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127848804','Phoebe','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0d00a2b2-3091-49e7-a204-1cca03c5ead3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(141751197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/141751197','Irene','Portland, OR','I have been living in Portland for 21 years and have found much comfort amongst its natural beauty. I am a local artist and designer, originally from Carmel California and find that the ocean heals all things. I LOVE to travel and enjoy meeting people from all over. I naturally enjoy creating a clean and relaxing environment for folks to come, relax and experience our beautiful city. I look forward to meeting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2d5c2336-5583-4d1d-b036-5febbadec437.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(150582690,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/150582690','Shay','Oregon City, OR','Constantly on the search for my next adventure. I love seeing new places, meeting new people, experiencing new food. I travel as much as I can, meeting friends around the world and also doing some local experiences.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6ded969d-d4bd-4349-bef2-0833c6596edc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7241632,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7241632','Samuel','Portland, OR','I am a health care researcher from Portland, Oregon. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/689292ac-9f40-4869-b6a3-6384004cece8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(241007470,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/241007470','Pete','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fb80c3b4-b5e1-4793-a01b-756736da2a37.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(253495113,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/253495113','Jerry','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e59f5174-0ad0-4227-9a54-1c6fdc853030.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3656451,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3656451','Jessi','Portland, OR','I am a full time artistic professional living between Montreal and Portland by way of Los Angeles. I own a business in Montreal and Portland and have a wonderful spouse. We are responsible, respectful and love cool spaces!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3656451/profile_pic/1388370307/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1125850,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1125850','Angelle','Portland, OR','I love having a warm and amicable relationship with my tenants. Community is a deep value of mine, as is clear, kind,  honest communication. \nI love living in the PNW and enjoy SUPing the lakes and rivers all summer. \nWant a massage while you\'re here? My home studio is right next door!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1125850/original/558eab9f-83c5-48eb-ba4f-ab9e6aa580e0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47581293,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47581293','Kevin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-47581293/original/2962b6e0-3844-480e-841f-3004b2d82f1f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(435909602,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/435909602','Corey','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived, worked, and raised a family with my wife in Portland for the past 32 years. We love getting out and exploring the beautiful Pacific Northwest, whether it’s camping and hiking in the forests, skiing on Mt. Hood, beach combing at the coast, or just checking out a new microbrewery, or restaurant close to home! We are excited to share our fully renovated guest house, and give you the chance to make some Portland memories of your own!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/030abe96-9456-4e41-873f-88e50eefef46.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(99516147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/99516147','David','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ab62b18-a96c-4e76-83af-ed25189561d4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(374074476,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/374074476','Kaiya','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland. As an Oregonian I know all of the great hiking spots or restaurants in town! I love using Airbnb when I travel and I hope to return the same service to my guests. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b233615-d12d-4a78-9962-302f640ca90b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(436807306,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/436807306','Patrick','Portland, OR','Hi Traveler! A little bit about us - I (Patrick) was an avid globe trotter before meeting my partner, Naomi. We explored several countries and countless cities together before deciding to settle down and starting a family. Naomi always wanted to host her own bed and breakfast, so eventually we decided to work and make it happen! 9 months later, we created a space that we are proud to have available for visitors. Hope you enjoy our space as well as your stay here in Portland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/40405e00-e007-4a72-a036-acd5b7539d18.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27512730,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27512730','Taylor','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f4d3aca-1f1b-4cd7-b325-c144661ca317.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5259991,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5259991','Colin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65d102ce-c3ad-4f47-a113-591397fd32fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4332497,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4332497','C. Nicole','Portland, OR','Traveler, entrepreneur, author, runner. Love exploring and meeting interesting people. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4332497/profile_pic/1354730472/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(437576977,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/437576977','Erin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/560affc6-bcc0-4c24-8024-7ce040ea1a6b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62953164,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62953164','Jesse','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c56815c5-0977-49e7-9225-56cf442dd8d7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6024930,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6024930','Emily','Portland, OR','I\'m a behavior analyst, writer and musician...and amateur gardener and remodeling junkie. I love working with kids and adults with learning and social cognitive disabilities and supporting their families on their journey. \r\n\r\nI am married to a wonderful man, who is a faculty member at a local university and loves serving people. \r\n\r\nWe have a dog and a cat who are truly best friends. They are very sweet together and will probably provide hours of entertainment for guests. \n\nWe could not live without great coffee, good friends, road bikes, books and the ability to travel. \r\n\r\nWe\'re super flexible travelers. We love B&Bs because it gives us the opportunity to meet new people. We are also very respectful of people\'s homes, as we would hope for the same for those we host.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/256673af-57d5-4d5c-9410-2a86d20c8c5f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11001258,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11001258','Elliot','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e154491-bb03-4c0c-986b-91f927f815cd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11016312,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11016312','Sarah','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ca82ad4-263b-4155-bb03-9b3045b5c16c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20742544,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20742544','Shari','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff29dc38-12ab-438f-8095-2842ba5f7e72.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(168130537,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/168130537','Michelle','Albany, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-168130537/original/53894971-c035-48b6-8915-8fb48d8fb594.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19977865,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19977865','Sabrina','Los Angeles, CA','Venice Beach couple with a passion for traveling... 40-something countries together and counting! We love opening our home up to fellow travelers when we are on adventures of our own.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19977865/profile_pic/1412177280/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6530677,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6530677','Nicole','Portland, OR','pdx-based iowan. black coffee drinker and celebration enthusiast.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6530677/profile_pic/1369270794/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(439397034,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/439397034','Alex','','Hi I’m Alex, I love to travel and explore the world. In my travels I’ve always preferred to stay in Airbnb’s over hotels and it was a dream of mine to open my very own listing to host people. Some of my hobbies include rock climbing, backpacking, board games, and I’m learning to sail and garden. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f5600ce4-295b-4bf3-aced-e824faf2bfcc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4099644,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4099644','Kayo','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/124a005e-5e6c-4fa2-9a7b-090c85b33424.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64092580,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64092580','Darlene','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fa0c3ea9-889d-4b44-ab64-db1b8220240a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54934802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54934802','Michael','Portland, OR','Hi! I’m Mike! Husband. Father of 2. Portland Teacher. Sports enthusiast.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d03643dd-63a6-442b-8732-f574aece9044.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51085562,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51085562','Jesse','Croton-on-Hudson, NY','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e8ca5da9-fd1b-4f75-9684-2da00c747ace.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29713998,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29713998','Sally','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d385e64c-24df-4350-bb5a-2822fd436217.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(779984,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/779984','Dylan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65d3b50d-1b59-4155-ba22-17320f491e6b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5272495,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5272495','Giselle','Portland, OR','(she/her) First-gen oldest daughter, partner to Adam, mom to Huckleberry and Tallulah. AirBnb is my side job-- I work full time in a helping profession with children + families. I lived in NY, LA, Chicago, and Dallas before settling into my natural habitat (the PNW). Our little family loves living in Portland— and especially our Foster-Powell neighborhood.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5272495/original/36df8fa5-9f27-4d96-a6f3-847d3c1e0083.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3912693,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3912693','Nicole','Portland, OR','Runner, reader, traveler. Loves chai lattes, yoga, red wine & naps. || When you do things with your soul, you feel a river moving in you, a joy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65632408-b42d-4dbe-b7c8-bb70ad8ed53c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31406893,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31406893','Jackie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/31406893/profile_pic/1429291684/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14736623,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14736623','Alex','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/53cc2e67-a754-4f1d-a8ec-e5d18906b692.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27978474,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27978474','Julie','Portland, OR','I am an energetic and easy-going traveler interested in learning more about the world around me... wherever my travels lead. I enjoy learning about other cultures by admiring all of their beautiful facets: the people, history, art, music, food, dance and all else that makes them unique among others. I am an educator by profession, so I feel very comfortable engaging with people of all ages and walks of life. \nI am  kind, respectful, and responsible both as a guest and a host.  I have a wide variety of interests - reading, art, music , sports, camping, hiking, cooking, and of course travel. \nI try to live life in the moment, cherishing every day and experience I am given. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/27978474/profile_pic/1424323645/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43443423,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43443423','Erik','Portland, OR','Born and raised in the Pacific Northwest, I have developed a love for its natural beauty and vibrant culture. I\'m passionate about creating memorable experiences for my guests, ensuring they have a wonderful stay in Portland. I look forward to hosting you and sharing the best of this amazing city!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-43443423/original/b0fef465-12d3-473b-8cc0-98ba4a6007ba.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1142106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1142106','Pat','San Francisco, CA','SF homeowner.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1142106/profile_pic/1393095339/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(153766232,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/153766232','Eliav','Portland, OR','I love the outdoors, family, my partner and puppy.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-153766232/original/fde9bcc2-d652-4447-88b3-91dddfa6b36a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23683530,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23683530','Pasha','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/97b5407c-42c7-4393-a630-020193e2552e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(163250650,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/163250650','Jack','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Jack. I love traveling around as well as hosting people at my place as well in Portland. I really enjoy being outside and staying active in a variety of ways.\n\nI\'ve lived in Portland a long time so let me know if you\'re looking for something to do. I\'m always happy to share some ideas!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f800e174-31ec-4f2f-a729-8f3916ae923c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(400364710,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/400364710','Charles','Lake Oswego, OR','Hello!  My Name is Charles.  I live here on the Willamette River in a floating home.  I love all things on the water.  Surfing, scuba, paddle boarding, you name it, I probably have done it!   I am a  USCG licensed boat captain and I do boat tours.   I do these things for fun.  For business I am into real estate finance.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf56b23d-00cf-490e-a8e9-d64138430021.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2996481,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2996481','Peregrine','Portland, OR','We met salsa dancing. Love biking in SE Portland, geology, and volunteering in our community.  Along with our daughter, we host two AirBNB units in our home in inner NE Portland, Oregon.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5cc1ff1d-776f-4250-b839-c24bfe3a2565.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(120568465,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/120568465','Nunzio','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Puerto Rico, living in Portland, Oregon. Love to travel by bicycle, climb big peaks and explore our beautiful Earth.\n\nOur goal is to provide a comfortable, relaxing and safe ‘home away from home’, for all guests during their travels.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/04e70255-f7fa-4e87-803e-f7880077e21a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3662791,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3662791','Jamie','Portland, OR','My husband and I are veterans of the Portland scene having lived here for over 20 years. We love our city and its unique access to so many different environments, from urban life, to forest, to beach.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3662791/original/b004b546-92b1-4af6-86c5-30c4240b78e9.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6903632,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6903632','Terry','Portland, OR','Hi and Welcome to Sweet Siskiyou Suite from host Terry and co-hosts Mochi and Yuri!\n I am excited to be reopening my space to airbnb travelers to Portland, home to me of many decades. Safe and joyful travels to you.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f2d450a9-a063-4451-a807-7f2ed2b0c4f5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33154064,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33154064','Connor','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f1a83abe-87d0-4779-9bb6-9bf660df6aee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20673854,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20673854','Harry','Portland, OR','I love to provide a local experience where guests have a private space in a home in a 10 minute neighborhood.\nI’m always down to share a drink and chat, exhange travel stories, even show you around if I’m free!\nI want everyone to have an authentic and uniquely Portland experience.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-20673854/original/0ea96071-69cb-4a74-897b-311d7942f4ac.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8118413,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8118413','Tracy','Kansas City, MO','I was born and raised in Portland and am still in awe at all this amazing city has to offer; particularly the food, music, walkability -and proximity to the mountains and ocean. The Urban feel and amenities seamlessly mesh with the relaxed and friendly city.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/11048aa8-0a57-4013-be7a-0e15ecfc3b05.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6827749,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6827749','Maureen','Portland, OR','From Portland, OR, USA. II am a retired teacher who has lived in Portland for 20 years. Love the outdoors, hiking, walking, international travel and summer hammock lounging. I currently tutor students with dyslexia and work for Lewis and Clark college as a university supervisor for teachers in training. You\'ll enjoy staying in my comfortable home',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6827749/profile_pic/1370841555/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(184659909,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/184659909','Terrica','Portland, OR','I love animals, motorcycles, road trips and playing the drums. My fantasy trip is motorcycle camping through the old roads of the Southwestern US. https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/24450251?s=51',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0808d99c-d0b6-4dd2-ab9c-0a1f1509c6c2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5192007,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5192007','Kelly And Rich','Portland, OR','My name is Kelly and  I recently relocated July 2018 from Albuquerque NM to Portland OR.  I  love traveling, use Airbnb a lot, and  know what travelers need to be comfortable and happy for their stay.  We have been renting out our places in Albuquerque for over 10 years,  and now in Portland for the past 2  years and have been very successful, hosting over 300 \"extended stay\"  travellers over  the last 10 years.  We want you to feel at home, and cared for during your stay in our unique apartments  and homes.   ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0f36feee-be92-49b3-ba13-cf324c996b35.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25503645,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25503645','Meagan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25503645/profile_pic/1420401431/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(67230784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/67230784','Emma','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ea3efb18-8409-4098-96f2-fdb4002ac225.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6646221,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6646221','Jesseca','Portland, OR','Lover of travel, family, food & wine. Bobby and I have created such good memories  staying in vacation rentals when we travel. As our family has grown with 2 young boys now we get to enjoy hosting guests, and providing luxury family travel services with Travel Breasy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d6af2e98-84b6-4590-94a5-7dac701a8ec4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73444161,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73444161','Oasis Properties','','We are Portland, Oregon natives and absolutely love the outdoors, great food, and being active in our community! Please make our home your home for your next visit to the Northwest!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/625ae46f-19cf-4aad-9f40-90b51593ebfb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31337921,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31337921','Gabriella','Portland, OR','Welcome to Portland!\nHere are some of my favorite local places:\n\nTimberline Lodge\nThe Columbia Gorge\nPortland Rose Test Garden\nForest Park\nThe Oregon Coast\nHawthorne St. (Shopping)\nNW 23rd (Shopping)\nOHSU SkyTram (stunning city views)\nPowells Books (One of a Kind)\nPortland Art Museum \nOregon Zoo',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/31337921/profile_pic/1429194340/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(130948759,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/130948759','Rina','Portland, OR','Hi my name is Rina and one of my favorite thing is to meet new people from all ove the world .\nI love to host and to make people comfortable in my place.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c43a48b2-9279-45dc-9429-72cd79e8d252.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57470546,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57470546','Brian','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/db4c0453-bb17-46d5-bb43-85ade38933f5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14103566,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14103566','Michelle','Portland, OR','Love hiking,biking, cooking, gardening,  and traveling. The Northwest is my adopted home. I\'m originally from Indiana. So I love to chit chat.Married  for 17 years. I love meeting new people and talking about traveling.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/14103566/profile_pic/1430095308/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2369443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2369443','Kevin','Portland, OR','Hi. I\'m a writer, musician, creative type. I also love sports and travel. I\'m generally quite positive. I\'m social but also enjoy privacy and quiet. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2369443/profile_pic/1377047330/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47212384,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47212384','Emily','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/1f93a42b-ae6f-408d-b485-2fe4165fd010.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21645947,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21645947','Brandon','Portland, OR','I\'m an American in London for my work as a journalist, and am keen to explore new places!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21645947/original/01f14eaa-c529-4eb8-87d9-21d47e5f2d3a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14175188,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14175188','Elise','Portland, OR','Hi! I’m Elise. I’m fortunate to work from anywhere. I’d like to take advantage of that and open up my home to visitors while I explore new places. I was born and raised in Oregon, and Airbnb is simply a way for me to share my love for the Pacific Northwest with others when I occasionally get out of town myself. I do not own multiple units across various cities. I have but one precious home. As a guest, I will treat your space with care and appreciation, and as a host, I hope you\'ll do the same in return. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1deb9d8b-7bf8-4a31-888a-5c3fd1c3cf32.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73418489,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73418489','Lori','Portland, OR','I am a writer, blogger and avid traveler. While traveling through the US, Canada and Europe I meet new people, learn about other cultures and embrace new experiences. Being an Airbnb host provides another opportunity to meet new people. It gives me great pleasure to create a beautiful, safe and relaxing travel experience for others. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6cf76ddd-b373-4b14-9e32-2ed726027565.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(80819602,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/80819602','Regina','Portland, OR','Always looking for a beautiful new adventure in the NW! We love Portland and the variety of experiences and food here! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fa31f4f1-1d13-4efd-8ae8-de201829335e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7012341,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7012341','Jane','Portland, OR','Lover of animals, travel, music and good conversation. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/16d9e487-0fb1-499f-9a9e-ec6ac950d2cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32149569,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32149569','Ellen','Seattle, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/32149569/profile_pic/1430255063/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(136930286,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/136930286','Ethan','Portland, OR','I am a dad, musician, and a nurse. I like food, wild places and motorcycles.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4c513ead-da31-472a-a250-ffc4ced014a3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8375241,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8375241','Darcy','Portland, OR','We love travel, fun, and family!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8375241/original/f525af9f-04f2-4c44-acaf-db411ac352a6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51534523,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51534523','Annie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f52bfc32-5b2c-4563-9aa0-a3581671ee55.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46855862,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46855862','Kendra','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dedf8a02-53de-4d24-89b8-69cfe0bbc208.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14476211,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14476211','Xica','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f925f4af-0f27-4a2d-afe9-e337e20b7c51.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(292874,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/292874','Rob','Portland, OR','Hi, \r\n\r\nI have lived and worked in Northwest Portland or the past 25 years. I have raised my family here along with having a retail business on NW 23rd Ave.for 20 years. \r\nNow I travel to Bali and Italy often where I have property.\r\n\r\nI hope you enjoy my home!\r\n\r\nwww.sojourn-ventures.com\r\n\r\nRob',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/292874/profile_pic/1371053634/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40623772,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40623772','Kelly','Portland, OR','I am a third generation Louisianian that relocated to Portland, OR in 2014 with my high school-sweetheart husband, our three kids, three pets, and five bikes.  We are car free, and I’d love to help you experience the fun of adventuring in Portland without a car!  Portland is a wonderful place to call home, and I’m thrilled to share my enthusiasm for my adopted hometown with travelers!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b968c8c-9d02-4a1b-87cd-0d7b8da9cf5c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3041413,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3041413','Katie','Portland, OR','I am a Portland native! I work as a freelance commercial wardrobe stylist so I basically play dress up for a living. My high school self would be dumbfounded. \n\nI had a vintage boutique for 8 years and now I don’t have an excuse to keep collecting amazing pieces but I can’t help myself. Lucky you, my place has a great vintage collection you can peruse.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/22b593fb-ca29-4736-9954-e3ad27ba3b88.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1911650,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1911650','Jon','Portland, OR','I enjoy travel, cooking, family and friends.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee4a6eea-3a62-4205-939c-2f7d81c9fcc1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(55354381,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/55354381','Li','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b1cbdbf-e8df-4f6b-a316-5eefdcf0e431.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(210856519,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/210856519','Scotty','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b75eaf3f-7bca-433d-82b1-3d1130c6b1fe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40807533,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40807533','Juli','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/962aec2b-89c8-4bbb-ba86-933c32738a0f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(433110508,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/433110508','Riley','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2fff266d-1650-4299-b44d-bc3671b3e42c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7797921,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7797921','Julie','Portland, OR','Love to travel and prefer to learn about the neighborhood and town from the locals instead of the concierge.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aa4d07b4-e0a4-48c0-8075-c172c29d9ecc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(457924,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/457924','Sally','Portland, OR','I\'m a native Portlander with 4 girls. Two off at University, one overseas and one who lives in NYC.  I\'m a writer and have lived in Hong Kong and Korea before moving back to Portland where I lived for 25 years.  I love to travel and have spent a great deal of time in Europe as well as Asia.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/adede8b1-6ca5-4cc8-bcb4-22d915136d13.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26768350,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26768350','Yusuf','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c28be86-f4e1-4cfb-9508-783bda564e74.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64117148,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64117148','Anna','Camas, WA','A short story about us\n\nWe are 1st gen immigrants from Ukraine. We lived in different counties and cultures. Our three kids were born in Israel, grew up in the USA.\nRecent 11+ years we live in PNW. \nWe love the greenest of the area, endless outdoor opportunities, openness, and friendliness of Oregonians and Washingtonians.\nWe hope you will enjoy the Portland stay. We gathered ideas in the home book. \nSincerely, Anna and Alex\n\n\n\nThank you for reading.\nAnna',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf215030-24c8-4210-8ff1-7a86cf2e696e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182476151,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182476151','Julia','Roberts Creek, Canada','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/980b53da-1ada-4bd9-928d-3aeadf5bd07d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(82861962,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/82861962','Zach','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4fbbe250-0549-4038-80d7-e8f7ff7ad478.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(449764124,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/449764124','Lowell','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6b15a305-fd88-4d78-893f-235e1a20649a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(169608443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/169608443','Michael','Silverton, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/da58e7af-906e-413f-bd28-086308bf41cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18679173,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18679173','Misha','Portland, OR','I’m a world traveler and photographer and mama to three kiddos. I love cities and have lived in Boston, San Francisco, and New York City-now the PNW is my home. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f6067bf-4857-43c7-aa8c-a34fe5523535.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2775670,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2775670','Dave','Portland, OR','Native Oregonian and lover of travel, documentaries, and wildlife.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2775670/original/fe1e27e8-1422-41b1-a1b6-f36922945494.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29651367,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29651367','Gabrielle','Portland, OR','I’m an American millennial currently residing in the  beautiful Pacific Northwest. I am a fellow airbnb host and I enjoy the outdoors, travel, and learning new things. I speak English and a little French.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-29651367/original/961ebcfb-43d1-4ca3-a535-259e63d05e1a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(426284483,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/426284483','Jake','Portland, OR','I love to play music, paint, and hang out at the river with my pup and friends. \n\nI love hip hop and indie music and try to catch live music in Portland whenever I can. \n\nOne of my life goals is to get my pilot\'s license and explore the Americas with my dog and cat :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2c8d0170-7e04-41bb-b739-14d93ed1ae8f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(121902321,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121902321','Micha','Portland, OR','I\'m a dual citizen of the UK/US;  a bit of a historian; I love to travel; I\'m married to a brilliant Native American author/horticulturist. \n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7697a751-a623-4697-a0fd-ce2ed63c1c94.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12190351,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12190351','Nathaniel','Corvallis, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-12190351/original/59267bf4-1a4d-4324-81e3-5ee3afafb098.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(187362053,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/187362053','Jiaming','Portland, OR','My name is Jiaming. My husband, Dan, and I have a lovely historical home in Northeast Portland for rent.  Please let me know if you have any questions or concerns.  Thank you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3954e715-bdda-4b90-aeba-ad3e28168e69.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25814596,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25814596','Kate','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25814596/profile_pic/1420758819/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13973351,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13973351','Rafa And Marina','Portland, OR','We are outdoor enthusiasts who love traveling, hosting, eating great food, and spending time with our husky, Archi.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-13973351/original/a0be67c9-8e62-46f0-9e5e-ef6416448a56.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(451252593,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/451252593','Beva','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5431eb38-4f1b-49ce-b78d-1f5203507e53.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(198422777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/198422777','Michelle','Portland, OR','We are a bi-racial, bi-cultural, multi-lingual couple who love equal parts home & travel. Food, art, reading, hiking, gardening, friending, hummingbirds, and hosting make us happy. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0c648c68-b90b-4d51-bc4c-cdae23284936.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(257453618,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/257453618','Jacob','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b69d9bd0-dd06-4564-87a0-74ddf813d9cf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(61157693,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/61157693','Marleigh','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-61157693/original/ead72d7a-f44f-4d2d-9fc3-3e8bc7c7d3ac.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43004730,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43004730','William And Kieren','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b1a57af-a82b-4d40-9832-4fbe4b02398a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(452253100,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/452253100','Alan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/257ab4e2-e70e-4d46-807c-23392d61039e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1972773,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1972773','Cynthia','Portland, OR','I\'m a ceramic artist and a vintage home renovator. I spend my free time cooking, working in the yard, making things, and enjoying good wine, beer, and food. I\'ve been in Portland for over 20 years and living here suits me well! I love the food and drink scene here, and regularly go out to visit art galleries and live music.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1972773/profile_pic/1338939598/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14821108,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14821108','Calvin','Portland, OR','\'Shrinking the world\' as a traveler, homeowner, and host. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-14821108/original/06111eef-0271-40c5-87b1-270af0e94489.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2195060,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2195060','Leslie','Joshua Tree, CA','Hi. My name is Leslie. I\'m an artist and designer. I enjoy creating spaces and hanging out with my pup and the people I love. I put my everything into creating the three spaces that I host. I’m here to make your experience an incredible one.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/84962913-2d89-4618-a1a2-8db789c47269.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(247551553,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/247551553','Brad','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7576dde3-3b6f-4552-af76-2e3147212c1a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12269741,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12269741','Aaron','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12269741/profile_pic/1403197234/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(126914888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/126914888','Sophie','Gresham, OR','Seeking adventure at all times! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2e66de95-4f67-48e2-abb9-1a20ed296a88.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(395594834,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/395594834','Your.Rentals','','At Your.Rentals we provide you with the best selection of vacation rental properties in Europe and beyond from trusted local hosts. We\'re here every step of the way to ensure your booking and stay create an amazing travel experience - every time.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f81db9b6-08e9-4091-87d9-16a68d2dbf8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24044328,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24044328','Chris','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0076eb0f-ced9-46e2-aff0-d07d920f7ac9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63872052,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63872052','Tina','Beaverton, OR','We are a household of car enthusiasts constantly expanding our horizons through travel, fun, friends, and food :) We look forward to hosting and meeting our guests and exploring new places when we are out of town (as often as possible!). We love to watch films and tv shows on our projector, have movie nights, enjoy BBQs with friends on the back deck, and go for walks around our quiet neighborhood.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c67364c-41de-4795-8fa5-d1de8687c1d0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45684193,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45684193','Jesse','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/46ea1e81-445f-47a0-a513-eeb0401bbb8a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6215522,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6215522','Kara','Portland, OR','I\'m a friendly, outgoing person and look forward to hosting you! I am an avid traveler and have loved using AirBnB on my trips abroad. \n\nI am now excited to host people here at my home who are visiting the Portland area. I love hiking and biking and am an artist currently enjoying leather working as well as other mediums. \n\nDuring your stay, I\'m happy to orient you to fun and interesting area attractions as well as help you with the logistics of getting from A to B. If you have any questions please let me know.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6215522/profile_pic/1369085968/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(147096437,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/147096437','Sherry','Rhododendron, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b2537c7-5ffd-4a2f-ac8c-7abfbf4cdfdf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2293902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2293902','Garrett','Portland, OR','My name is Garrett, currently residing in Portland, OR. 39 year old male, social worker, love live music and being outside as much as possible. Amiable and easy going, I am respectful of the property of others. I love traveling as much as anyone else.\n\nNon-smoker, not a heavy drinker. Quiet and prefer to keep a low profile, particularly when traveling.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/564e8596-8129-4aaf-a040-84d6e12cd968.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6690245,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6690245','Siena & Eric','Portland, OR','Eric and Siena are experienced Airbnbers who love to welcome visitors to our beloved Portland. We are avid restorationists focused on creating a sense of \"place\" in the spaces we create for our guests. We share a love of international travel, landscape photography, design, and craft beer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca4f90b2-5bef-4f72-abe1-ae2421cce444.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(211556672,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/211556672','Esther','Idaho, United States','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3081451d-079a-4fe0-8333-d1d913278f70.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14438067,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14438067','Alisa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e6dcd98-d38f-4a74-900a-579d09e0b262.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(210378179,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/210378179','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/953993bf-02d5-44b0-8b15-0a2023268ad6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15940055,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15940055','Holly','Portland, OR','I love to travel and do so on a budget. I spent 10 days in the Hawaiian Islands and stayed at hostels out there. That is why I love the idea of Airbnb. My partner, Joni, and I love the Pacific NW and do a lot of traveling here. I work in radiology. Joni works in maintenance. We both love antiquing, breweries/wineries, biking, kayaking, and eating! We are friendly and accepting but value our privacy. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2dfe113d-99e0-4dc8-8be8-55b2db19fe87.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8878148,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8878148','Laura','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4208bac4-9df4-4519-9ea4-cd1fd687617a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(456011177,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/456011177','Chico','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/027294f6-548d-4902-b975-81f72be7583d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10610412,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10610412','Alex','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0f57398d-fc8d-4073-8cce-a377b5ed96f5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(191010968,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/191010968','Jeff','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2093d8a2-b550-4667-b0f0-69465d6cb7e6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77736302,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77736302','Angela And Craig','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-77736302/original/0b983771-f41a-41b5-b628-34856f3ee07b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21665606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21665606','Theodore','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ca40d97b-5316-4acc-8303-48e023f7679b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7718259,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7718259','Yasmeen','Portland, OR','We are  easygoing, quiet, clean, and organized professionals with an athletic teenager.  We\'re into gardening, travel, dance, meditation, yoga, riding bicycles, and reading lots of books, among many other things. Most of all we love community building and spending time with friends and family. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/773793e4-36fa-4ea9-a961-cf35fcae740b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(453359527,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/453359527','Crystal','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/090a5ff5-120a-4e63-ad68-dfc3db9d6b8f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(456375182,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/456375182','Amanda','Portland, OR','Enjoy entertaining and meeting new people! Avid traveller, looking to share my love of the Rose City, Portland, Oregon. <3',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/adadc215-3b3c-4cb7-ab03-45354dbd8aec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(130776600,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/130776600','Michele','Beaverton, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a5646787-374e-4f89-babd-4c80e8898595.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(532092702,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/532092702','Connie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(390757744,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/390757744','Jessica','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3318191b-ddf9-4963-9673-c38e2113bbb2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115728998,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115728998','Rachel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96b7f569-a3f6-441d-ba94-91a7aa9e8341.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182289060,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182289060','Dale','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5dbc0ffb-18ba-40e0-8b3c-a6a8c8b3973c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2367709,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2367709','Michael And Tracey','Portland, OR','We are fun loving, laid-back Portlanders from Oregon USA. We love all things international, from traveling, to learning languages to meeting people, to food... we love it all. When we travel, we believe in treating the places we visit with respect; both culturally and in terms of cleanliness. We try to leave the places we stay, both in the city and out in nature, as we found them - clean, and undisturbed.   We believe that space is an important project of the person who creates it. We are excited to share our space as hosts, as well as experience the spaces of others as guests. \n\nPortland is a truly fantastic city, with amazing food options, a fantastic arts scene, and the best beer in the country. It is surrounded on all sides by natural beauty that will satisfy any desire - from oceans to mountains, to deserts, to plains. Come for the hiking, stay for the food! \n\n\n\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6e2aa7d5-0e13-4750-8750-9d92942493de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22546228,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22546228','Mary Carroll','Portland, OR','Hello! I\'m an Emergency Medicine doctor in Portland, Oregon. I love rock climbing, swimming, backpacking, gardening, and biking. I have chickens that run around my yard and give me great eggs! They are friendly and will eat from your hand if you don\'t mind the occasional peck.\n\nI\'m happy to interact with guests and give local tips or leave you to your privacy. I love exploring the Portland area and look forward to sharing it with you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22546228/profile_pic/1414446565/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(339880364,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/339880364','Journey','Portland, OR','Hello! my name is Journey,  i was born in Tanzania but grew up in america, I love spending my time with my family and meeting new people and swimming. i enjoy activities like playing sports, football, basketball and soccer. i like to hang around downtown portland because there\'s so much to do and so much to experience, i love spending my sundays at church and eating lunch with family \n\nYou will be pretty charmed to have me as a host. i truly love meeting new people and guiding them on what to do here in Portland Oregon. Coming from customer service experience for 5 years, i value my service wherever i go and creating memorable experience for all my guest.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6fb8d51d-72b9-430e-ac91-1b939d19860c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(457168395,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/457168395','Leif','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/09eee548-130b-470d-86c1-a7b3446befc4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18210091,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18210091','Quinn','Portland, OR','Born and raised in the NW I am a real estate investor and broker. I Enjoy modern architecture, golf, traveling and  exploring Portland\'s restaurant\'s. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a7092b57-3f02-49f4-a3f0-a329c5e0eb3c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(457970492,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/457970492','Autumn And Zach','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a13f68a5-0e17-41f1-8883-4c7c6d47a340.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(94891193,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/94891193','Patrick','Portland, OR','I enjoy traveling, drawing, beach volleyball, soccer, live music, and trying out new foods. With AirBnB I get the real character of the cities I\'m in with a personal touch in the comfort of a home. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a4b4f5cb-d974-4d67-a1af-72cb21d7e5e4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(458090816,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/458090816','James','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b1a3c41-8202-4f5a-8472-48c988fa2e1b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7869789,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7869789','Mohammad','San Diego, CA','When I\'m not traveling up the Pacific Coast Highway to see family in Portland, I’m exploring San Diego, CA. Check out my Guidebooks for recs on where to go! \n\nI love to always plan my next trip abroad - a great reminder of just how vastly beautiful every inch of this world is. Planning my next adventure! Recs welcome!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4553aed3-1787-493c-b42a-ff844c32c216.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78966103,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78966103','Jodi','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5425ffb8-cb4e-4025-a121-90f942f24119.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(456959973,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/456959973','Mayra','Portland, OR','Hi! Mayra here! I\'m a CNA in the Portland area, studying to become a Midwife. I host with my partner, Aidan, who\'s a full-time student, and our pup, Sunny, who\'s a full-time cutie! We both moved to Portland a year ago, Sunny and I from LA and Aidan from Utah and have loved living in the North Portland area. We both enjoy what Oregon has to offer, beautiful hikes, delicious food/drinks, and amazing art/music! Hosting has been such a fun experience and we enjoy sharing our Casita with other travelers.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79ed3dc0-5330-4f69-811e-7ce7a8d9d173.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(131228804,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/131228804','Scott','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/af4adb55-cdd0-4b46-90ec-c93952ed9396.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5786616,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5786616','Brandon','Portland, OR','I love Airbnb! Love to travel and love to host!\n\nI’ve been to 66 countries and I value a unique experience.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a55a81b3-58c5-46c6-b6a5-ce91f0b33db8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(189105426,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/189105426','Deej','San Diego, CA','Hello, I go by deej (non gender conforming)! Thank you for viewing my profile. For work, I remotely manage properties, individuals, and businesses. Physical and mental health are important to me, so I nurture my growth with weights, yoga, running, and rollerblading, and I am an absolute sun slut. Some of my favorite things in life are a colorful sky and a functional/aesthetic living space.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-189105426/original/75ad9830-de56-4b6f-a643-2f0cfda0829b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26968463,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26968463','Tanya','Portland, OR','Tanya Woods is a native to Portland, Oregon. A few of Tanya\'s favorite things to do is travel,  being active in the outdoors, and creating and designing art. She is a local yoga instructor and massage therapist. Tanya loves children, she has two teenage girls, and works in pediatric, prenatal, and postpartum massage. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/26968463/profile_pic/1432223665/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57930851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57930851','Tan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/692a6b04-1e12-49ee-a66f-5179cede7dd4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32448313,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32448313','John Paul','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ec838f83-d097-4bf7-a44c-4904f78625a8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37348111,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37348111','Heather','Portland, OR','I love Portland and am so excited to share my home and my city with you. I have lived in the Portland Metro Area my whole life. My grandparents bought their home, just down the street from me nearly 100 years ago. Formerly a school teacher, I have worked in the financial industry since 2011. I live upstairs with my fabulously creative daughter, Eloise (age 11) and our big blind lazy dog, Titus. I love garage sales, thrifting, trying new restaurants, hiking, trips to the coast, listening to live music and exploring Portland\'s various neighborhoods. Eloise loves anything art related, cooking, music, softball and organizing random things. We are very busy with work, school, sports, etc. - but we are looking forward to meeting new people and will be available as needed. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0a8944e8-fff8-444a-a3fc-a7ff8b6f4cd0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34903010,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34903010','Kerrie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-34903010/original/226c22aa-7c0f-456d-aaa7-e41b90afddd1.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13136838,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13136838','Sarahjoy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/13136838/profile_pic/1417669561/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5726659,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5726659','Bridget','Portland, OR','From Portland, OR. Small business owner. Mom of two wonderful daughters. Super host for years. Loves travel and meeting new people. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b8fef08-7bcf-4a8b-953d-6683a027b58e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1965498,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1965498','Ashley','Portland, OR','Passionate about exploring new places and cultures calling the Pacific Northwest my home.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1965498/profile_pic/1440625995/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(453377594,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/453377594','Christopher','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3c60b32c-402a-47ba-8a9d-5d2a09f956d8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(459821523,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/459821523','Harry And Christina','Portland, OR','We love to travel around the world and celebrate different cultures and customs! We\'ve both lived, worked, and studied around the world. Now that we\'ve settled down with our 2 little girls, we want to share with others our favorite place -- Portland, OR!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fc538fa3-1dea-405b-b64e-20fb78972e19.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8026442,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8026442','Dan','Portland, OR','Dan: Writer, speaker, marketing strategist, zen priest, surfer, farmer, ultramarathoner. Lauri: painter, sculptor, shaman, sustainable landscape designer, runner. Both of us: dedicated to seeing everyday life and everyday actions contribute to the shared and common good.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/408f4674-0021-40fa-b6c3-bbe159679f54.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(124142815,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/124142815','Shannon','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-124142815/original/76c502d0-4088-4b95-b7af-e0c93ce3fbec.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(460379593,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/460379593','Marsha','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/38a5cc7f-2e0a-4827-954e-16bffe00ce95.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115378511,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115378511','Jonathan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79a74406-c3b5-4a12-83db-50fd49922b33.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(66636612,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/66636612','Mary','Portland, OR','My husband Marion is typically home to greet guest and answer questions if I’m not home and I’m quick to answer questions if you message me.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/91a4c596-a27d-4f6d-a48b-d53d58d68b88.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7915925,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7915925','Kate','Portland, OR','Professional mom from Portland, two girls 14 and 16.\nStager, Oregon Estate PDX owner/operator and event space owner. We are respectful, tidy, grateful and responsible!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7915925/original/beb9b570-5818-4276-8912-4856ff8410be.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(777447,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/777447','Michael & Lesley','Portland, OR','We are a family of four + doggie. Michael is a Software Security developer & Lesley is home with the kids (and pup).\r\n\nWe love traveling, nature, hikes & eating delicious food. \n\nProbably the most fun loving, happy family you\'ll ever meet. :)\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a2d505ca-e86f-46bf-9ed8-d47686f3c11f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24152318,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24152318','Jeremiah','Portland, OR','My name is Jeremiah. I\'ve been doing Airbnb for about two years. I\'ve enjoyed meeting travelers and introducing them to a small slice of Portland, the city I\'ve called home for nearly 17 years.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/fbf02e6e-829d-40b3-9e34-771333adc105.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4830078,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4830078','Wesley William','Portland, OR','Hi!  I\'m originally from the Oregon Coast.  I lived in San Francisco for six years after high school and attended college in the Bay.  I lived in New York City for 8 years and before that, I was teaching English in Buenos Aires for one year.  I love traveling, growing, cooking, and eating delicious food and having a good time whenever necessary.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8deb4c6f-6fb8-4f5d-ac8f-4742078edb54.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6549255,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6549255','Michael','Portland, OR','Portland is home and love to travel! Work in real estate, big on community and giving back.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c9dbe330-c87b-4550-aa10-ea22ab482e22.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109920552,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109920552','Emma And Zoey','Portland, OR','Hi! I’m Emma, and my partner Zoey and I use Airbnb to both host guests ourselves and for our own travels! We’re both teachers from Portland, Oregon. Live music, restaurant hopping and spending time on Mt. Hood are just a few things that keep our cups full. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/01b23865-e435-4a18-81a7-3b3bddda88bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(462051434,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/462051434','Stephanie','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9f524851-50e3-428a-8614-700304f55de5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4539980,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4539980','Beth','Portland, OR','My partner Bud and I have traveled around the world so we know what it is like to use Airbnb. We continue to travel  part time and have chosen to list our home on Airbnb for fellow adventurers.  \n\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4539980/original/cc5066f2-187e-4080-a8e8-94ef2cf0457d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22664095,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22664095','Nicole','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/445d8644-d9b7-4acb-a290-0b4ccce7ff7c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39712312,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39712312','Andres','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/39712312/profile_pic/1438012551/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(181702616,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/181702616','Vishnu','','Hello there! I\'m a Portland native for the past 20 years who loves the seasons, the warm people, and the vibrant vibe the city provides. As a proud husband of a superhost wife, hosting is something that we have always enjoyed as a family. I spend the day working for a tech company and the evening with my two young kids.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/977a4efd-94c6-41ec-8982-b5377ae7e74c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(384749573,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/384749573','Beth','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7de73723-da13-49ab-a9d6-61acc1cc9c87.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(462279303,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/462279303','Blaise','','Blaise and Mckenzie here! We just started hosting and are loving it so far - it’s so fun to share our beautiful city. On a normal weekend you can catch us berry picking, going for long walks, watching lots of bad reality TV and cooking something with Blaise!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4171145a-e454-4f1a-a7ff-8d9d94c56700.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3299455,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3299455','William','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Bill, a native of Portland, OR. I have used Airbnb for years as both a guest and as a host and have always had great experiences. My favorite activities include rock climbing, skiing/snowboarding, soccer and ping pong. I look forward to meeting you either as a host or as a guest. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5fbf05d-ec3b-4826-9a3d-7f4983ac7b19.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(463215630,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/463215630','Garrett','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e9f8033d-4521-4f33-966c-2cdf5fe39192.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109008901,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109008901','Alexa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c83b634c-1d2e-4244-a5ca-11670a300d58.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(464103968,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/464103968','Kathryn','Portland, OR','Katie, Jase, and Bev: Katie moved to Oregon for collage and made Portland her permanent home in 2015. She was fortunate enough to meat her partner Jase when he moved west from New Hampshire. Katie\'s older sister also lives in Portland and they are fortunate to have this unite as a place for their mom Bev to stay when she is in Portland. Katie, after a career in the arts, now manages properties in OR, AZ, and UT.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/40811ef3-9cd1-44e6-832b-b8a98bb539df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11575758,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11575758','Jonathan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c64546b-37b2-4e5c-9209-6d9b9c9c0064.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2549488,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2549488','Richard','Portland, OR','I am from Arizona originally but currently call Portland home. I have three amazing children who were born and raised here. I am a sign language interpreter.  I also work as a whitewater raft guide during the summer. I love to snowboard; enjoy backpacking and climbing. The PNW is the perfect back drop for my many and varied interests.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/de74f8a8-8411-41fd-bbe2-bd787a059c28.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1581273,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1581273','Paige','Portland, OR','Creative Director. Connector. Eternal optimist.\n\nI LOVE.\n. having a home everywhere\n. people with passion\n. public speaking\n. digital design \n. unplanned road trips\n. the redwoods\n. Olympic lifting\n. board games\n. thai food\n. hot springs\n. helicopters\n. downhill mountain biking\n. the roosters outside my bedroom in Honduras\n. mud fights\n. scuba diving\n. baking cupcakes and giving them away\n. trail running \n. adventure races\n. building businesses',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1a0d54ec-7c0e-48c4-a583-f07022faadd3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(104388,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/104388','Caitlin','Portland, OR','Hiker, biker, traveler, friend',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/104388/profile_pic/1270770349/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(946587,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/946587','Janine','Portland, OR','I\'m a professional Graphic Designer living and working in Portland Oregon. I\'m British but have been in the U.S for over thirteen years.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c6e52c3-39b5-4765-b49c-61fdd4fc6e47.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(465222953,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/465222953','Kevin And Kelly','','Kevin and Kelly',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bd8a1b2d-bfcd-47d6-ad41-936af630f8dd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(93224502,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/93224502','Erin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f2d7f515-5123-47d3-a80c-f26ec5b1b166.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(115269561,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/115269561','Whitney','Portland, OR','Hi I\'m Whitney! My dog, Rey, and I live in Portland and love to enjoy the outdoors and find delicious local spots to eat. We have lived in Oregon for the past 10 years and love the rain and diversity of seasons. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0d337644-988f-4203-b6e6-99a286f88360.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(154270631,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/154270631','Tanh','Portland, OR','A professional who loves to travel to explore, be immersed in the culture, and take in the local foodie scenes.  \n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-154270631/original/cd256766-f98d-41af-bdd7-636f04d207af.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41397606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41397606','Cinna','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/345500c2-6fae-4101-9af1-038b1007406f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2027604,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2027604','Logan','Portland, OR','Easy-going disc golf addict with a propensity for IPA consumption',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f87f922d-a96f-4b44-a1ca-4527c30e4211.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(275331592,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/275331592','Amy','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dc7f2fd6-b400-4167-bdaf-02d850c35dcf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54429267,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54429267','Bonnie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cb0cddf0-f81b-457e-a5d2-2b828895572b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45108209,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45108209','Benjamin','Portland, OR','Father, husband, cyclist, children\'s musician. We enjoy traveling the world, meeting people and building community. Thanks.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/460353b2-9897-4814-97b6-18a8abb33eb6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(174792040,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/174792040','RoomPicks By Victoria','','Going someplace new is always exciting. And what would that adventure be without a great place to lay your head at the end of the day? That is where I come in!\n\nAs an avid traveler myself, I know how the little things can set the pace for a new experience! You want something hospitable and inviting to give you a remarkable experience that no one else can give you. A heated pool, or jacuzzi at the end of the day to relax in, or a nice meal within walking distance? Down to beds that cozy and homily. Sounds good? Well, you have come to the right place.\n\nWe offer handpicked accommodations in remarkable properties for a  top-notch experience with a few added extras. As well as tips, recommendations, and 24/7 customer support to make sure that your experience is the best it can be! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3cde5e3-af70-4765-8d7b-a7e22c805882.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(466054612,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/466054612','Vanessa','','I’m Vanessa and I am a Real Estate Agent! When I’m not showing a home or negotiating a deal for my clients, I am sipping coffee in the sunshine, exploring trails down the street at the Loll Wildwood Natural Area or on a walk around the neighborhood, stopping to smell the roses and dreaming up my next local adventure. Feel free to ask me about my favorite places!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/901b0740-0c38-4111-8a29-e7936c0599c1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27983728,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27983728','Cris','Portland, OR','Hello, and welcome to our listing for the Tiger Lily. Our family has lived in Portland since 2011, and we love the Pacific Northwest! We are happy to give you recommendations for our favorite restaurants and activities in the area, so please feel free to ask. We look forward to hosting you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/541756a6-cdc8-4310-a8af-5ac98dfb3b60.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(179283335,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/179283335','Joanna','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8236a717-3ee8-4932-85e3-d531b3d5ebf7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6989662,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6989662','Manly','Portland, OR','Nature Lover. Traveler. I love tennis, photography, reading, writing, and being outdoors. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf1714f8-8f3f-49f5-82b7-ae0a76ec3ab1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(102800396,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/102800396','Andy','Portland, OR','Friendly and working in real estate! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/54df285e-6f5b-4960-ab03-a6f0496ea5da.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16870156,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16870156','Kelly','Portland, OR','My husband and I love getting away for the weekend for a quick adventure.  We enjoy finding the best local spots for food, drinks and nature – with a few of the touristy spots sprinkled in the mix. Our young son has added extra fun to our travels and we\'re excited to show him around the world.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/357450f8-3589-489c-ac65-db285ac3f14b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20542428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20542428','AnJulia','Portland, OR','Portland PA',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/db6bef65-cb98-4bef-8af4-6f721a6b22ef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47895705,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47895705','Dawn','Portland, OR','I’m an entrepreneur who works nationally as a coach and consultant. I lived in the Bay Area for many years, as well as New Orleans (but originally from Oregon). I’m enjoying all Portland has to offer! I love animals, gardening, art, facilitating, quality time with loved ones and exploring nature. I value community, respect, kindness, creativity and joy. \n\nMy goal is to provide you a restful, beautiful home to recharge at the end of a long work day or after a day of exploration of Portland.\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-47895705/original/0c25d1f7-7885-4516-90e7-fbcdc3eabdb0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1450850,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1450850','Tanya','Portland, OR','A family of 4. Love traveling and adventure. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/be44ef59-5bd6-456e-b63b-be34fe1acccc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1696816,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1696816','Rochelle','Portland, OR','I enjoy live music, home diy projects, travel, food & coffee!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/db493b9a-37c9-4298-a765-4a440dc7e526.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78620294,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78620294','Sasha','Portland, OR','Living in Portland, OR by way of HI, IN and FL.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0c7a4b08-f0d5-4a8d-be1e-da75abfc1bc3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23251845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23251845','Paige','Portland, OR','I have grown up in Portland, OR and can give you all kinds of tips of things to do in the area! I am passionate about traveling and eating good food and finding the best spots in town!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d40c3b04-78b9-4433-8cbe-352051415905.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(466495851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/466495851','Joan And Juliana','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bf99fb17-f6f1-4798-942c-b518fedeb260.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88152288,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88152288','Daniel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fbe96d70-b04c-43f5-9335-5c526dbe678f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6739097,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6739097','Holly','Portland, OR','Lover of travels, animals, foods, and finding ways to make it all easier and more fun. \nAlways thoughtful and take care of places we stay. \nA wellness coach and co-owner of a small winery- sourcing organic and biodynamic Spanish grape varietals from the PNW. \nWe love hosting and enjoy creating a home away from home for travelers.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6739097/original/27781179-0ee6-4414-8643-d32287e46231.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(371974160,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/371974160','Abraham','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-371974160/original/623a5a81-f9cd-4d63-80c7-9b356819e11f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60630727,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60630727','Olivia','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/77a4f2e5-d69b-4864-a497-9c3815bc2220.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(469701702,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/469701702','Mike','','Hi my name is Mike. I’m an Aussie tri-citizen with USA/Australia/Mexico. \nI love demolishing properties and rebuilding them and looking for another one to add now. \nI live in the sun all year round because I’m not used to the cold! \nI own and operate this property, and looking for another one right now. \nI can speak some Spanish, however my accent is still a very strong Aussie one and I travel a lot, as to many of you here.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dae8f8bd-5f05-4a46-a476-0138b17ad642.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2526625,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2526625','Kim','Portland, OR','As an Oregon native I have kept my roots deep into the Pacific Northwest and have called Portland home for the last 30 years. I have built a life where kindness matters, creativity reigns and curiosity guides. As a designer, pro photographer and friend I love to discover beautiful places and meet interesting people. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2526625/original/f47b55e6-4495-4e0a-9bf3-e66d1f35aab8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(85798968,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/85798968','Lorena','Portland, OR','Hi, my name is Lorena, I live in, Oregon USA. I work as a social worker and a producer/host for a local TV Program.\n\nI love to travel all over the world and meet people from different cultures. My hobbies are reading, writing, gardening, cooking and capturing people\'s stories with my camera.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6ebea4b6-2184-42f2-920a-2d8a3bb73b83.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32630833,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32630833','Darro','Portland, OR','My husband, Steve, and I host an airbnb in Portland, OR where we reside.  It\'s called Heron Cottage PDX.  We strive to make our airbnb a place where everyone feels safe, respected and uplifted.  We also have a small farm in Clatskanie, OR where we grow garlic, tend bees and sell at the Clatskanie Farmers Market and  Portland Farmers Markets - PSU and King.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/61dc08cc-31bf-4af2-867e-f0dacc0f3377.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(189964332,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/189964332','K','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-189964332/original/a681f046-9ef1-46eb-8c90-8e8d2263bdb8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22682285,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22682285','Isa','Portland, OR','Bohemian metaphysical artist type - loves new food, and living organic and green. I love to travel having now been to Sweden Egypt Jordan Jerusalem Istanbul Rajasthan Costa Rica Jamaica Mexico Guatemala Belize Thailand Cuba and Hawaii. I love to check out lectures, music, kirtan, art exhibits, yoga classes, cooking classes,  Jungian talks, performances and get out into nature ad much as possible. I heart Portland because on the east side it\'s like small town living with big city options. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dc10945e-258f-4d7c-a849-755975734c55.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9013078,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9013078','Neysa','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e2298ddc-f98a-430b-aed9-5ddb614f57fe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114720959,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114720959','Hanna','Portland, OR','Hello! I\'m Hanna, excited to share Portland with you! I\'ve lived all around the city for over 10 years now and would love to welcome travelers to the City of Roses. I am a Park Ranger passionate about nature and community, true Portland hippie, and herbalist/healer. Come share space in my cozy inner city retreat! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c7276772-1a26-46a3-9e8f-28fe0c44717d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(46669750,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/46669750','Brittini','Portland, OR','I am a wife and mom of 2 littles, boy & a girl. Me & my husband are originally from Southern California and have been living in the Pacific Northwest since 2017.\n\nWe love trying all the new and old hot spots in Portland, so if you want any of my recommendations, I am happy to provide!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/17d77fcf-5b66-4074-b3ea-cb1bc0887141.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77156023,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77156023','Marcy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4a851cb2-d622-469e-a056-d0c21e3d3661.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15054186,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15054186','Luna','Portland, OR','Originally from Northern California, though I\'ve spent the last decade in Portland. I\'m a professional tattoo artist by trade, but I have endless creative hobbies including interior decorating, which I hope is reflected in my loft\'s kitschy, 70s-inspired vibe! I know all the best thrift spots in town (and outside of town), and my partner is an expert on all things outdoors if you need recommendations for day hikes or camping in the area. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd8f30e1-2595-4347-8746-2778a25bb9c6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(387932205,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/387932205','Olivia','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/23963537-0355-4d56-affe-1a44032af086.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(219462395,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/219462395','Mark','Portland, OR','Hello! My wife and I are Portland natives. We love walking, biking, and trying new restaurants. We\'re happy to give recommendations!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/28106948-14f7-462c-8bee-4a66680113be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6541481,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6541481','Sara','Portland, OR','Life is an adventure!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/901f8e7d-387f-4039-88b6-86f237feedc7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(434667229,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/434667229','Amy','Portland, OR','#InvestREPM manages Furnished Monthly Rentals in the State of Oregon. We specialize in providing fully furnished spaces for relocation and temporary jobs assignments. Locally owned PNW Native with a love for trail running, coffee, and my girls.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/233000ba-fe47-42e4-9abb-24fd1bd4dac8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(469663895,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/469663895','Yvonne','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a16bc0a1-6400-4841-841a-f0e669173929.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32168092,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32168092','Stuart','Portland, OR','Writer and published author about craft beer and spirits, mostly whisky. Managed the first brewpub in North America and created/managed the BridgePort Brewpub at Portland, Oregon\'s first craft brewery. Former owner of WhiskyBack Brewing, craft beers designed to pair with spirits, and current owner of Ramsay\'s Dram Academy of Whisky.\n\nMost importantly, father and friend to two wonderful (grown up) children.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6daba0f7-28fe-46a5-aae8-2099cb9ef1ea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(205093579,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/205093579','Ryan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/61200197-389e-457d-b571-d142afdd0411.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(92277999,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/92277999','Felix & Stella','San Francisco, CA','Travelers, music lovers, foodies and just pursuing things in life that make us happy.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-92277999/original/265a8500-306e-4544-ba02-63a5c213757e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1676487,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1676487','Robyn','New York, NY','Hello, we are from New York and love the outdoors. Zak, my husband is a photographer and I am finishing my doctorate in neuropsychology. Our 4 year old daughter loves to draw and is learning to read.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1676487/profile_pic/1327981368/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40159913,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40159913','Kathlin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/40159913/profile_pic/1438397575/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19393124,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19393124','George','Bellevue, WA','Professional, active , loving travelling, photography, and hosting.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-19393124/original/05593d1d-7dbc-4445-9ad3-94c1b6639ce1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(149555015,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/149555015','Rachel','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4132b0f0-512f-405e-89e6-d3f7ad009864.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35847109,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35847109','Bobby','Detroit, MI','I’m energized by travel. So much so that I live in two places- Portland, OR and Detroit, MI. My family and I have homes and family in both places, and travel back and forth. I love having people at our place when we aren\'t there to enjoy it, and look after it.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/08a87d52-ffe0-45b7-affb-c65a2887a641.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(120621079,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/120621079','Betsy & Forest','Kihei, HI','Aloha, and thanks for your interest in our refreshingly redone little slices of paradise. We LOVE Maui and our newest place \'ONE MISSISSIPPI AVE\' in the vibrant Mississippi Avenue area of Portland, OR, and we\'re guessing you will love them too!  Please let us know if you have any special needs for your stay and what we can do to make it more enjoyable! If anything comes up that needs our assistance, before, during or after your arrival and stay, please contact us at once and we\'ll be there to support you. \n\nWe are proud to be Airbnb SuperHosts and our places exemplify pride of ownership. We are hands-on owners and embrace the Japanese concept of \'kaizen\' - constant improvement, so we\'re always striving to make our places and your stay more enjoyable. Plus, our team of Bryan in Portland and Marie on Maui are also available to assist us to promptly attend to your needs!  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1f15c623-8a71-410c-859c-661c89b29b28.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(354945893,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/354945893','Amber','Phoenix, AZ','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/45a1b7fc-92bc-4b32-9a39-8752ffae0970.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(473884242,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/473884242','Isaiah','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e670455a-d445-47a5-9ba7-54633dc0e3f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(329081,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/329081','Anna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-329081/original/5953453f-3e08-49b2-9a71-1cb5217abfaf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24496266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24496266','Kelsey','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f7ccc7b-8717-4396-a941-5c2b7967c896.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(139193165,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/139193165','Will','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/223a2716-6ab8-418e-8f9c-764891052413.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(434785,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/434785','Gino M.','Portland, OR','I am a designer, artist and creative coach (uncomfortable.club) living in Portland OR.  I\'m a music nerd and lover of art, performance, film, thrifting, exploring, experimenting, traveling, cooking, new friends, old friends, and exploring the lovely Pacific NW. I am a clean, respectful guest. Looking forward to all the adventures! -Gino',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-434785/original/f3da28fb-8264-4b0d-b4fa-618a4384f167.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10039803,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10039803','Ivan','Montecito, CA','We live/own in the Hollywood Hills, Montecito CA, Santa Barbara, Big Bear, CA and Portland OR. Work in tech/digital media. Love to eat, travel, and be merry!\n\nPlaces we often spend time: Portland, LA, SF, Big Bear, Santa Barbara, New York, and Palm Springs (Parker, please)\n\nFavorite places we\'ve traveled? Vietnam, Thailand, Costa Rica, S. Africa, Brazil, all over Europe, SW US, many others ...',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a2735e05-efaa-4f0e-8702-4b409e93742c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57431738,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57431738','Heather','Amsterdam, Netherlands','Being food, design and language enthusiasts, my husband and I love traveling.\n\nWe have stayed in many Airbnbs around the world - we much prefer the local experience to hotels - and each time find it to be an interesting and unique aspect of our trip. \n\nSome of our favorite places include Taiwan, Basque Country, Oaxaca, Mexico City, Greece and Amsterdam. \n\nIn my free time I enjoy photography,  hiking, and walking our two dogs, Marty and Camila.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/591f5aab-d897-4a8a-8341-735091141b31.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59068154,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59068154','Dana','Portland, OR','Family Nurse Practitioner living in Portland, OR via the midwest.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d6163f03-0b57-4472-909d-0b929924154f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(473913292,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/473913292','Christina','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f06920c1-80f2-445c-beea-2d794a568a71.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(474734231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/474734231','Parker','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-474734231/original/1d0f7954-a72c-40e1-a30d-51183fe3a8a0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10612299,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10612299','Teylour','Portland, OR','Hi I’m Teylour! \n\nThere is nothing I love more than creating and dwelling in thoughtfully designed, comfortable spaces. I’m a creator at heart. \n\nHome, at its core should be a space of safety, security and most of all, regeneration and restoration. We often seek these things externally, but home lives within. My hope is that we find spaces that feel like home, no matter where the journey takes us. \n\nw. gratitude, \nTey\n-good taste in good faith',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ff947abf-26c5-4965-b127-5841e413774d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5742402,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5742402','Mark','Portland, OR','Mark writes science fiction and teaches for LinkedIn Learning. Janell is a retired midwife. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c2f4317a-2c40-4a63-aaf0-ba9acec5a2d2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(68306541,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/68306541','Melissa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-68306541/original/8ed20f26-cfcc-4d9c-bc93-efc619f0c8e2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6240473,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6240473','Marisa','Pasadena, CA','I\'m a textile designer and mother who has lived in Portland, New York, Chicago, Atlanta and Los Angeles and love finding a cities secrets. Ive worked in theater, sports, hospitality, art and manufacturing. I think spreadsheets can be as creative as a painting, but find the most pleasure off line and soaking in the messy magic of life.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6240473/original/5e51835b-7511-4b0b-a421-44c67b204106.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(87103452,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/87103452','Louis','Sacramento, CA','Hi, I\'m Louis. I have a passion for traveling and the outdoors. One of favorite things about being a host is being able to share my home and give others a warm and welcoming experience when they travel.  Airbnb offers an alternative to the hotel/motel room guest experience and that is what I love about it. If there is anything, no matter how small or large, that I can do to make your stay (or the stays for future guests) even better, please just let me know!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e14673e2-6717-469f-ae58-f1fc9781c1c5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(154338,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/154338','Christina','Portland, OR','As and avid traveler myself I understand the desire to stay in a place that feels like home, but easier!  I hope that my condo feels comfortable, and convenient for visitors!\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6ae8dbb9-e6ad-4ea8-b77c-ccd96123dc39.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1125772,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1125772','Eileen','Portland, OR','I spent several years traveling and working remotely.   Traveled some of Europe, Malta, Australia, Nepal... \nNow I\'m happy to offer my space that hopefully you will find unique and would love to add it to one of your great places to have experienced.  (Phone number hidden by Airbnb) \nKind Regards,\nEileen',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1125772/profile_pic/1375047654/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95543760,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95543760','Nicholas','Portland, OR','Professional living in the Portland, OR area',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4264b001-68c6-4465-a11b-3726638386af.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6568816,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6568816','Marilyn','Portland, OR','I\'m a born and raised Oregonian and for the last forty five  years have been the proud owner of Piece of Cake Bakery in Sellwood. We have been on the food network and won! We gave the $10,000  to PSU  special Ed teachers. I also have a passion for design and have found great joy in renovating my properties -  please take a look!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/6568816/profile_pic/1384717537/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(459788767,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/459788767','Jojo','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2a096137-1b44-4e71-bae2-9cefda9d2771.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20082274,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20082274','Shannon','Portland, OR','I live in beautiful Portland with my partner and our daughter. We love adventuring and visiting new places. We are so happy to offer our space and share some of our favorite things to do for guests who are traveling through Portland! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f45fed5-c26d-477f-82c0-fd9833a88406.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(101246805,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/101246805','Aguendine','Hillsboro, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b0b7d3e3-b7aa-489b-80ad-bea82e1748df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(354869636,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/354869636','Timothy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/84365be0-14aa-42d8-9115-e12f9ef9459d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49218021,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49218021','Brian','Portland, OR','My name is Brian, I am born and raised in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eb34137b-d81a-43a8-90c1-9f2e79a16b29.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(222472596,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/222472596','Vanessa','Bowling Green, KY','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/929830e9-b227-4841-8bec-af5f87aed3e7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12568111,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12568111','AMS Dynamic Realty','Los Angeles, CA','I\'m a family and business woman who likes to travel. I became a owner of vacation clubs many years ago and used to share my vacation condos with just friends and family, but decided to extend them to others to make vacationing more comfortable. \n\nI also have a few residential listings in the LA county area, along with a small fleet of Turo rental cars available in Palmdale, CA  if you are in need. \n\nThanks for checking out my profile!\nAntoinette',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-12568111/original/3e3d9591-8895-48a2-b4ca-2e4e743540ee.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5617147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5617147','Sadie','Portland, OR','Hello! I live in Portland and love the PNW. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5617147/profile_pic/1364243827/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(952325,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/952325','Robert','Portland, OR','Sometimes I go places.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57cba3ea-a033-4e4c-bd7a-bedbb230c868.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(165841,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/165841','Kirstin','Portland, OR','Married, 2 Grown human kids, 2 freeloading rescued English Bulldog kids.  I love Animals, History, Halloween, old buildings & houses, and Exploring.  I foster for a Bulldog Rescue and always have at least 1 or 2 Bulldogs on my property.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/165841/profile_pic/1297377803/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(183340435,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/183340435','Kiaro Atlas','','Kiaro Atlas (key-aro) - Love, Hospitality & Wanderlust\n\nOffering fully furnished, flexible lease homes to the new era of renters. When we\'re not curating our spaces for guests, we enjoy traveling, live music, cooking and exploring Mother Nature.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/94afc272-1f02-4bd2-bfa4-4834d1ad5e25.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7637370,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7637370','Allison','Portland, OR','I have lived in Portland since 2005 and moved here for the water, mountains, and lifestyle.  We have such a fun city and surrounding landscape to explore. I am happiest when I am outside and adventuring with friends.  \n In the summer, I love hiking, mountain biking, and being on the water.  In the winter, I ski and snowshoe.  I also enjoy music, theater, the Portland food scene, and wandering around our beautiful parks.  I try to stay busy with activities and friends and I enjoy meeting new people.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6e0198f6-5104-49cb-b5b1-781309390b9d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(477999674,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/477999674','Steve','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5e111fff-6c10-4a8c-84fc-01192cd0e122.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75631543,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75631543','Leah','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b6db0d79-814a-407e-bc77-d2d7cbc9cd8b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(471726253,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/471726253','David','Portland, OR','Dream Stays is a boutique short-term rental provider that hosts properties in Portland and Phoenix, started by those who love to travel and work from anywhere and everywhere!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4257d787-ee43-4e48-b3ee-37b05ef9f2d4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(453525127,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/453525127','Marcus','Vancouver, WA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2091734c-afd9-409e-80e9-a7c72706b9bc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35982517,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35982517','Kerry','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-35982517/original/d6228852-83e0-486e-a1ca-3a6163c176bb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60432956,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60432956','Jessica','Portland, OR','I was born and raised in Oregon and love Portland and everything this area has to offer. As an avid traveler myself, I have created a space that I would love to stay in - and I hope that you will too! \n\nWhen in town, I enjoy hobbies such as reading, gardening, and bike riding. I also have a love for ceramics and hope you will enjoy using one of my handmade mugs while drinking a cup of Portland roasted coffee during your stay. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f42e1a1-bcc7-458f-9ebf-0acdf49a9589.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19634831,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19634831','Briana','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in Portland for about fifteen years and I love the Pacific Northwest.  Midway through a PhD program and travel a lot for school and life!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19634831/profile_pic/1407432725/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(590514,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/590514','Jayne Jensen','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6d05695e-e931-4807-bfb5-5ac4e0170ab3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4084831,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4084831','Miriana','Portland, OR','travelers',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f0ad6812-98ac-49d7-a87c-c57165571447.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22262180,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22262180','Ellie And Emilie','Portland, OR','Hello! We are Ellie and Emilie. We\'ve been together for 13 years, married for 3.5 We\'ve travelled all over the world together using AirBnb. We\'ve also hosted for multilple years, in different states. We currently live in Portland, Oregon and have been hosting guests since 2017. We are happy to recommend spots for whatever you may be traveling to Oregon for - outdoor adventures, delicious food, beautiful urban landscapes, or just visiting for work. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/22262180/profile_pic/1412735236/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(184323147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/184323147','Jason','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/296ad814-82e1-46b8-a722-dbad6b504242.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(464680245,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/464680245','Evan','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/628ee522-46d2-42b1-bd79-f2e271455987.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111511932,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111511932','Miguel','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4c6bd85e-0926-4e76-a553-4f11c4debc8b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54662569,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54662569','H','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aa6788c7-5012-4259-b1a2-cd747de441a5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40115262,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40115262','Cynthia','Portland, OR','Portland, Oregon is my city and I love it. I recently retired from my corporate communications job and am working in the studio I built next to my house. I live in the apartment above my garage studio and rent out my 100+ year old cottage to people who want to visit Portland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/abb2da08-0204-4831-bae8-edfd4d2726db.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64689549,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64689549','Sonja','Portland, OR','We enjoy traveling and experiencing the community and cultures where we visit. We have been hosting guests since 2005, before Airbnb existed :) It\'s always fun to help guests book their vacation and feel their excitement for their getaway!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a6251d7f-e0e4-4ed8-9a09-4a2fa65d184d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2292620,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2292620','Lizzie','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Lizzie.\r\nI live in Portland with my partner and our pup. I love to travel, love nature and the outdoors, enjoy exploring and experiencing new places, cultures, music, food, etc.\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2292620/profile_pic/1336167251/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20985428,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20985428','Will','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/609f420b-a376-417d-84dd-fbc5f75d2cfd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(480100048,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/480100048','Scott','Jamestown, MO','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47f0bf2c-b31a-4cac-95e1-cd958a18e532.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(462390230,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/462390230','Forrest','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/abd1e894-3b85-4ed9-8165-a628abf791eb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(480665927,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/480665927','Michael','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b5803455-4675-4134-b964-c9395fb65b91.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(472195025,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/472195025','Joe','Portland, OR','Love being around family/friends funny and a very good cook ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b9dfb067-488e-46c7-843f-1dd8d3221095.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10783143,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10783143','Lenore And Mateo','Portland, OR','Welcome, my name is Lenore , my partner Mateo and I take a lot of pride in our living environment. We built this space with our own hands and it took the better part of the year. We are so proud to say we built a home!\r\nWe love to travel and meet other travelers to share stories about this amazing world! \r\nWe both study Acupuncture/natural medicine and want our home to have a healing peaceful vibe!\r\n\r\n\r\n ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/94a4b72b-3dfc-44d5-ab2f-dc797a00e31d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(112457577,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/112457577','Michelle','North Miami Beach, FL','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ce16938-7e99-4782-9105-977a7f7caf6f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(234902210,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/234902210','GiGi','Lafayette, OR','Hello, my name is GiGi, and I live in Salem, OR. Growing up, I faced many challenges, including homelessness at the age of 14. Despite these hardships, I never let go of my dreams. While I couldn’t attend college due to financial constraints, I always aspired to own property and create a better life for myself. Today, I’m proud to say that through hard work and determination, I’ve achieved that dream.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/db7793f8-9f4b-45b7-a123-69c8a4bd43be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19700666,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19700666','Brian','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4428be2e-111d-42eb-bd9d-d548433a1d81.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(481269461,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/481269461','Barb','Portland, OR','My husband John and I love to be outdoors and discover new places. We’re clean, quiet, respectful. The perfect guests',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0ffad73d-0dd0-4fba-9a76-c6a3599f0ca2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(348361462,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/348361462','Tia','Tulsa, OK','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ad8505e-9b54-49dd-a54b-bd569bbc2500.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(159947287,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/159947287','Brenson','Portland, OR','Hello All, \n\nMy name is Brenson. I am from Hawaii and I take pride in spreading the aloha spirit. I obtained my MBA in organizational leadership and relocated to Portland in 2019. I fell in love with the vibrant culture of Portland. I am proud to call Portland my home base and look forward to supporting your positive experience. \n \n I love fitness, nature, and food so please ask for recommendations :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-159947287/original/258d72cc-2caa-4a36-aacc-cd1ab77d754e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3666843,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3666843','David','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/4ea4c60a-7605-4002-903c-7bdc04e2d478.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(971012,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/971012','Cynthia','Los Angeles, CA','art director in film industry...lives in LA.  owns furnished rental properties in portland and LA, successfully for last 30 years.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24caa187-0634-4e50-93d1-0e0fc76fe2cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23113393,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23113393','Stephanie','Portland, OR','Spring/summer Portlander, fall/winter Phoenix dweller.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/077c00b0-91c0-41bc-82ea-2283b1c6da0b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(379187817,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/379187817','Dana','Portland, OR','Hello, my name is Dana. My partner Jennie and I moved from Nevada City, CA to Portland, OR this last July. We are thoroughly enjoying the community that thrives here and the fun that comes along with facilitating blissful spaces for others to enjoy; as well as ourselves. Feel free to reach out to us. We look forward to meeting like minded and proper vibed people. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4e51c66d-f981-4e78-acb4-35038971919c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10920081,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10920081','Maureen','Portland, OR','An east coast  transplant for the past 25 years in lovely Portland, OR. The beauty and ease of getting to amazing places from here is incredible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7901b5dc-ca58-44bc-84cf-822c90f1f262.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(927951,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/927951','Debra','Portland, OR','Love living in Portland for the last 28 years.  Kids were raised here - now on their own.  Recently retired from Intel Corporation.  Love entertaining, cooking, and pairing food with wine.     ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2d38a50e-25fc-4450-8ec5-5e2c3117f94c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6243014,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6243014','Pierre','Portland, OR','I’m originally from Normandie, France. I moved to the USA in 2006 and never looked back. I have lived in Wisconsin, Washington DC, California and Oregon. \n\nI have a passion for the outdoors. I love backpacking, fly fishing, mountain biking... ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/97a127a6-c133-4949-8977-94a52aba8bcd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(457161382,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/457161382','Mike','Beaverton, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/60cd66e7-d3d5-4935-a676-de8b5f22a517.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20743858,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20743858','Tiffany','Portland, OR','Professional healthcare worker and mom to 2 little girls. I love traveling and exploring the world with my husband and our 2 daughters. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b5f5b25-2049-4b59-afec-4188fbd639ef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(483342821,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/483342821','Essayas.Martha','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(483735464,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/483735464','Kimberly','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2485fdfb-62d5-4084-8b55-6196933b85d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(264587074,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/264587074','Virginia And Kyle','Portland, OR','Hey there! We have lived in Portland for over 10 years. Virginia is an Oregon native and Kyle is originally from the sunny state of Florida. We love all that Oregon has to offer us and want to share that with you. We\'re happy to chat all things food, the local music scene, and pet stories (we have a lab mix who is a sweetheart).',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dadffa74-32df-446c-86fa-32dfcded1f4f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13613391,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13613391','Christopher','Portland, OR','Acupuncturist.  Minimalist.  Happy.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0bcec40a-1e30-4f31-a5a7-c83de520b449.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(289572266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/289572266','Frank','Eugene, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(22737017,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22737017','Bill','Tempe, AZ','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4bf3ad98-475c-42dd-8f54-354ebe5ba4bc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(143151,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/143151','Margaret','Portland, OR','I recently moved back to Portland, Oregon and bought a cute little bungalow.  Most of my travel relates to work, but I also love a cozy beach getaway.  I love to stay active no matter where I go and am interested in local food, culture, and running and biking routes! I am always curious to learn more about local civic life, politics, quirks, and economies. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/143151/profile_pic/1401890348/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(375783,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/375783','Lyndsey','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-375783/original/8bd8d3c0-b945-483d-80b8-8d03c307f9ce.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5839728,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5839728','Robin','Portland, OR','I  enjoy coffee, dogs, trees, adventure, art, exploration and participating in random acts of kindness.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f0c8717-e636-4d20-bc73-aa1547a94084.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22667801,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22667801','Camille','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-22667801/original/c9c63a42-71d9-4e25-b325-6854b91c1f74.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37853275,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37853275','Mina','Portland, OR','Hi there! Thanks for visiting my page. My name is Mina, and I have lived in Portland for 20+ years. I travel quite a bit for work, school, and fun. My interest in hospitality has piqued as a result. Having been on the other side of Airbnb, I have an eye for everything that you need to make the most of your stay - whether it\'s for work or fun! I love to read, cook, and move (hiking, dancing, running, etc). I love learning about different cultures.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9c87a0dc-f431-486d-8b19-1ef0e83b7769.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17654502,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17654502','Lade','Portland, OR','I am  relatively laid back and easy going. My Wife and I enjoy traveling around the world and country in our leisure time. We enjoy trying out new food and restaurants. I enjoy working on pet projects- construction, building furniture etc. I also enjoy athletic endeavors, running biking, hiking etc.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17654502/profile_pic/1438884738/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56527701,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56527701','Ariel','Portland, OR','We are Ariel and Nick Piazza, true Portlanders that love bikes, and good beer. \n\nNick is an Energy trader, skier, and mountain biker who loves doing the dishes, Ariel is a designer, artist, and outdoor enthusiast who dirties a lot of dishes. We like to think we’re a good match. \n\nWe spend our weekend\'s trail running, hiking, or mountain biking with our dog. We like to work on our 1950s house, have backyard campfires, and take care of our garden. We like to cook, travel to new US cities, and enjoy spending way too much money on organic produce. We\'re early risers who like to think of ourselves as conscientious, on time, and organized. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3190af79-9fff-4e16-b1ad-87d7146b9fc6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(485855141,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/485855141','Danny','Portland, OR','Danny (and his wife, Beth) have lived in North Portland for over 20 years. They love the Pacific Northwest for all it’s natural beauty. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/83d0cdfc-8994-4588-975f-de189dddb88d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(485867552,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/485867552','Daniel','','Am very kind funny friendly and very nice very easy to communicate with and so positive..',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ccf85e5f-c583-4af1-8bcd-f93f1eefe827.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(82716541,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/82716541','Christine','Portland, OR','I grew up in Washington state but also lived in North Carolina for several years. I am a nurse practitioner and feel grateful to do the work I do, being able to serve people with advanced illnesses. I love traveling, meeting new people, and sharing stories.   Some of my favorite things to do are reading and hiking.  I have a black lab pup named Bruce who also loves people, other dogs, and eating bugs.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1f2b0c8-db0a-4687-b320-86a25005e2e0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(135529356,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/135529356','Jami','Portland, OR','Based out of Portland, OR., I’m on the go as much as possible for adventures sake. I hit the rivers/ outdoors and any local spots I can along the way. As a frequent host and guest, I love experiencing new and unique homes across the globe and find it an absolute pleasure bringing the same hospitality and accommodations to others :) ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d55c1bae-6514-4d02-9b7e-728ecabf1a08.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41102088,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41102088','Natasha','Houston, TX','I’m a Production Manager working in the content world. Travel a lot for work, always looking for cute places to stay! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-41102088/original/2e8e2fda-e2ac-4b5c-8336-c6ee03992e02.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1872896,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1872896','John','Portland, OR','From Portland, OR.  I am a 40 year old male who has been lucky enough to both travel and host guests from around the world! My partner and I have two kids now and still do our best to take long trips to beautiful family friendly locations when able to get away from our day to day lives to still fulfill the pleasantries of seeing and feeling other cultures and lifestyles.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c8da848f-117e-4a92-8a9a-d403e0c431a0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(486782124,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/486782124','David','Portland, OR','I\'m a 50 something lifelong carpenter and maker. Was a general contractor for the past 16 years. Now I am working for a plant based cutlery and straw distributer, but still build furniture when I have spare time. Father of a daughter in college, married 23 years. Love to cook, travel  and entertain.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a19895e2-1333-49e0-a072-fdcaf1178929.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(138656740,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/138656740','Mykajah','Portland, OR','Mykajah Jackson is my name, she/her pronouns ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/309784ca-a0a6-4566-bb7d-5c23f3084e36.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(96898246,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/96898246','Amy','Oregon, United States','I am an avid traveler and adventurer. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/21994117-fe33-4d6a-8b0a-47b17e61793e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(487307218,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/487307218','Theresa','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5727f57c-fbe8-46d2-80d0-2882e6cab43f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(487407932,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/487407932','Divine Dwellings','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8e0691b3-27c5-4d1f-8d00-5bd5fdb168f6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(192117374,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/192117374','Clarissa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/08e43079-f22a-4983-b0ca-1c658f081f02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(487868768,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/487868768','Barbara','Portland, OR','Hello! I live upstairs. This is my home and I have enjoyed renting out the downstairs space for several years, to traveling medical professionals. This is my first time hosting on Airbnb. \nMost of my time is spent with my grandsons and their family. I moved from Ohio to be a daily part of their lives, and I\'m so happy I did. I\'m a Reiki practitioner.  I also enjoy baking (and often leave treats, if you like that sort of thing!) and making  my own greeting cards.\nI\'m very quiet and respectful of anyone\'s space that chooses to stay here. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1822155e-dd60-4df3-81f6-814f13feb3bd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127449972,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127449972','Joanna','Norwalk, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-127449972/original/6f240bdb-6779-4540-8d7c-bbbd12037a9a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(488015807,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/488015807','John','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3f10fbee-e4be-4c35-8250-978508c93b02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(340860910,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/340860910','Francois','San Clemente, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d22ef6f2-bcf2-41da-8b83-5abe35bef050.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5386496,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5386496','I-Hua','Portland, OR','We are a professional couple. Jonathan is an Army retiree and a CrossFit coach. I-Hua (pronounced eeewah) is a graphic designer and novice gardener. Together, we operate a small design firm from our home. When we are not busy with our design projects, I-Hua loves to spend time gardening, and Jonathan can be found at the Woodslawn CrossFit gym nearby. Jonathan also speaks Arabic, and I-Hua is fluent in Mandarin and Taiwanese.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5386496/original/05bf7c9b-1883-4e7d-a882-1e4bc253fc20.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(488672037,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/488672037','Dar','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-488672037/original/e1c7355e-5f57-45fc-bfec-d32ed46b8a8f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(89844621,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/89844621','Katya','Portland, OR','I\'m a Canadian born Creative Director who lives and works in Portland, Oregon. I\'m passionate about traveling, slow living, and design. I run a peaceful airbnb guest suite with my friend Aubrey.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/27f0d458-659b-4677-b6f6-5e4aa3be050d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33928647,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33928647','Eric','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/33928647/profile_pic/1432420113/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38738358,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38738358','Natalie','Portland, OR','Hey oh! My name is Natalie and I’m excited to host you. \n\nI love to travel and to meet those who are traveling. When you’re in my home, I aim to help you feel at home, whether that means chatting through local recommendations or keeping a quiet atmosphere so you can relax and unwind. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/16eb6f6e-e29c-417b-9b18-d2fc8a01687e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(128635441,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/128635441','Anna','Portland, OR','I am a high school teacher and professional personal finance coach. I have lived in China for about 4 years and traveled across many places in Asia. I am always on the lookout for the best local places to eat. \nOriginally from Portland, Oregon, I enjoy traveling, hiking, eating, dancing salsa, and visiting museums in new places. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/29081797-e864-4704-92b8-2e065e348fff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43639745,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43639745','Brendan','Portland, OR','Hello! I\'m from Cleveland, Ohio and have been in PDX for 8+ years. I absolutely love exploring all the PNW has to offer as an avid snow skier, mountain biker and water skier. \n\nOn the weekends you can find me either up at the mountain or one of the local breweries with friends. \n\nMy fiancé Lea and I have been in our home for about 2 years. \n\nFeel free to ask me any questions and/or recommendations during your stay and I am happy to help!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/d57082e1-e9d1-419d-84db-26f0776079e2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(128445968,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/128445968','Micaela','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7c30c5c4-f42c-41d6-a5da-37985ce05dd0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23534283,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23534283','Stephen','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Stephen! I\'m originally from Wales, UK but have been calling Portland home for over 5 years. I love the outdoors and often snowboard at Mt Hood, just outside of Portland. As a foodie, I love trying out the amazing cuisine Portland has to offer, and as a traveler, I\'ve been to many amazing places including all over Europe, SE Asia, and South America.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f99c8450-c9a2-4f37-a714-5aa5a2730811.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20452429,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20452429','Brennan','Portland, OR','I am a Portland Firefighter as well as a Portland native. I have a lot of info about restaurants, bars and nightlife as well as hikes and recreational activities. In my free time I am usually adventuring outdoors.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b19fefd6-1cca-4a17-b698-7d4ca72df782.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(489883774,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/489883774','Catie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eb6cf3dc-3d34-4c17-9964-4eb93d51259e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(145813310,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/145813310','Clarissa','Carney, MI','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0c4f7172-b78d-4b02-ac7a-65fbed89e38e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11194078,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11194078','Jessica','Portland, OR','I\'m a graphic designer living and working in Portland.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/790329a3-fe6c-4d23-854a-dad04cc3ef02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(100110020,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/100110020','Sophie','Portland, OR','We are life time Portlanders with a beautiful family living a creative and fulfilling life!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-100110020/original/39bfe745-afef-42f4-b104-cc3d0ac01749.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(174855751,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/174855751','Kai','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/973d0f54-59af-4a3c-a34e-61d486a7ac2a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9313887,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9313887','Kate','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0705e1e3-a0b5-42e7-995e-c0ed934a6a9c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1810577,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1810577','Corey','','Hi, I\'m Corey! I\'m an active, adventurous person with a love for nature and experiencing this planet’s natural beauty. Big into hiking, camping, and exploring - particularly mountainous regions. I love sharing my passion for nature with like-minded people, especially when it comes to hosting or staying with others!\n\nMy other interests include chill music (tropical house or chill mountain beats), good food, great cocktails, and photography!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c442d2f2-bdfb-4435-804a-fbef7898793c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(930613,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/930613','Gregg','Portland, OR','Hello!  I\'m an easy-going, professional home-owner who feels fortunate to have such a great spot in which to live.  For over fifteen years I\'ve been sharing a previous condo on Airbnb, and have now relocated to a larger space more central to the charm and life that makes Portland so special.  The money earned goes right back into the home for continual upgrades and modifications.\n\nI\'m a travel enthusiast, and have enjoyed trekking around our country and world for the past many years. I love good food & drink and enjoy the opportunities that dining provides to bring people into community with each other. Some favorite places include the many neighborhoods of SE Portland, often focused around nearby streets such as Stark, Division, Hawthorne, Belmont, and Burnside.  I love the many food cart pods around the area, and how you don\'t have to go far to have authentic, high-quality food from a wide variety of cuisines.\n\nI know the area well, and always look forward to finding a new trail up Tabor, a hike along the Columbia River Gorge, a walk through one of the many eclectic Portland neighborhoods, or just sitting with a book inside by the fire. Let me know if you need any recommendations!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f538f8e5-caf5-4065-a26a-98b9f73327d8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(490942213,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/490942213','William','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m William and she is Sam! We\'re just a new family starting out in Portland and we\'re so excited to share our beautiful space with you! Sam is a quilter and a wonderful artist, while I\'m learning to become data analyst! We have a sweet babe named Heart and another sweet dog named Tehachapi. We go on long hikes on the weekends or go shopping/eat out other times! Let us know if you need a recommendation because we know all the good spots.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f428a09c-a92c-4c56-9c8d-264f742f9f83.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(491213027,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/491213027','Samantha','Portland, OR','Engineer by day, Portland connoisseur by night. As a host who loves the authenticity and values of my city, I try to share them with everyone who visits by offering a hyper-local experience.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5b7618bf-86b7-4d9c-8c7a-897976763f7e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1626000,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1626000','André','','I\'ve used airbnb in London, Nice and Marseille in France and I love it! Traveling is the best way of experiencing the many cultures and cities of the world. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f7cdc67e-1737-4ef1-ae38-04a72a5cd653.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(491435195,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/491435195','Kingdom Capital','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0543f4aa-1ace-4aa2-9fa2-eb15bb7df4c5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(191758910,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/191758910','Laura','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e9a7fd83-b6cb-4cb1-ac40-ff226b5a2e17.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18704603,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18704603','Shiva5623','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is a Shiva, I\'m a pastry\nChef and I live in Portland Oregon with my husband Farzad, We have 2 adult boys and own a Mediterranean restaurant nearby so life is busy!\nWe enjoy traveling and have been to many Airbnbs and have learned a lot along the way. \nI’ve tried my best to create a cozy house and provide everything that’s needed to make your stay comfortable and more enjoyable. \nCheers!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/611350b4-03fc-49d8-ba19-6c94046634b3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(101992842,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/101992842','Eric','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/12acfbe6-2535-491f-a743-f5116e7bc5ae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30171544,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30171544','Susan','Portland, OR','Wandering soul in service to humanity. Love the Arts, food, bodies of water, nature. Kindness makes me cry. Sensitive warrioress. Can-do mentality. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/33560cc7-bc81-49fd-b816-08efa93bfd71.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14992703,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14992703','Malinda','Portland, OR','Hi! We are from beautiful Portland Oregon. I am  an RN  and my husband is a writer/author. We love to travel, read, hike, swim, ski, do yoga, play board games and dance!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-14992703/original/8a68c41f-31fc-4be5-9356-dd4fa764f8e5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(492280709,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/492280709','Tara','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8f0cdfe8-1bf1-49cc-8d4f-f8ef83ec9700.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59070590,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59070590','Adam & Hannah','Vancouver, WA','Hey, we\'re Adam & Hannah! We live just outside Portland, Oregon in our new home where we got our start managing rentals in 2018. \n\nWe now professionally manage over 10 short term listings in the Pacific Northwest. We love what we do and are committed to providing a quality experience for our clients and guests. \n\nSome of our hobbies include: creating music, good food, traveling and spending time with our closest friends and family. \n\nWe both can\'t live without coffee, fried foods, and seltzer water. \n\nWe really enjoy giving recommendations on what to do and places to eat. We think the PNW has some of the best food & activites on the planet and would love to share our favorite spots with you. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-59070590/original/30232682-ffdf-42bc-847f-4cbde55e9a7f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(263333566,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/263333566','Lamont','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/016ba5b3-b9ac-4115-9992-7e671227a0b8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(514724040,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/514724040','Palarcello','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(54667782,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54667782','Fatima','Portland, OR','I love real estate! and remodeling is my passion. The process of visualizing a more beautiful space, and working to make it all happen gives me a deep sense of fulfilment and happiness.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ce4c2983-0ef9-4ccd-8a58-f085034d03f2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84008197,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84008197','Pam Westra','Muskegon, MI','Dreamer, doer, and builder with a love for travel. I have a true passion for creating unique experiential 5-star stays for our guests. The Tiny Digs brand has become a family project. Tiny Digs Hotel has 12 themed tinys and Tiny Digs Lakeshore has 7 custom-themed tinys. Our latest creation, THE HIVE Tiny Digs, a bee-themed dome structure is one of the Airbnb OMG Contest winners. Coming soon! We look forward to hosting you and your loved ones!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/315a3b48-2edb-4ee9-a004-c67d95f2d67e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(442663509,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/442663509','Monica','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7d9f1e44-95e1-410d-840c-faf41e7cd9ae.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(493461219,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/493461219','Nathan','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e0746959-4fa0-4eba-9d2d-b28365ca8ee5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32365096,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32365096','Erin','Portland, OR','I enjoy the simple pleasures of life and consider the whole of life a learning experience. We are always in process of learning and this is what makes traveling and sharing experiences so meaningful. I\'ve traveled much throughout my 20\'s and 30\'s, through Europe, to Peru and around the US in a Volkswagon camper. I always consider every trip I take a mini pilgrimage, no matter how far away or for how long. When I am on the road or in flight or on a train, I feel like I have time to reflect and I revel in that! To me, that is what life is really about. Yes, we all have to pay our bills and give back to society, but if I could, I would release all of life\'s expectations to be totally present with the world. That is what traveling gives me. By trade, I am a social worker/life coach and a family person. But at heart, I am and always will be a bit of a wanderer! I still have hopes of traveling east, perhaps when I am retired. For now, I am excited about hosting other travelers/wanderers/ seekers in my home and sharing my love of Portland. I have lived here for 17 years now and really enjoy helping orient those who need  some assistance finding their way! I can suggest destinations, restaurants and secret beautiful spots I have found to find peace and solitude in the city. Please ask!\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/32365096/profile_pic/1430588786/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182966,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182966','Ian','Portland, OR','Architect turned Filmmaker living in Portland who co-own a video production agency.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49a10260-7e8a-4c6d-8a66-deb2a34c7e3e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(554332,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/554332','Pamela','Portland, OR','We  like to travel.  We enjoy meeting people from other countries and cultures.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/554332/profile_pic/1304451139/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(494658346,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/494658346','Mark','Portland, OR','Retired chef with a guesthouse ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-494658346/original/15fdb19c-50a3-48a1-b806-b70278086869.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90342574,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90342574','Anna','Portland, OR','I was born in Brooklyn, NY, moved to Portland in 2022, and I love it here! I work as a consultant in the energy industry and enjoy cooking, dancing bachata, hiking, and discovering new places and experiences, especially outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/08b87d26-15fa-4ed3-927c-8f58e4e7f70c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(163637443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/163637443','Nichole','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-163637443/original/47d39200-ef9e-449a-b021-39ca0602ecf6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(166070389,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/166070389','Niall','Portland, OR','Biology & Art student that loves travel ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d2f176a9-6a23-492c-b67c-7cccec3d279a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23777060,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23777060','Celia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-23777060/original/31dab8cd-c62e-4b82-928a-a6447e65e786.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(494186847,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/494186847','Ella','Portland, OR','As a host, I bring a touch of German warmth and hospitality. Married with four lovely children, my love for the outdoors and passion for travel inspire me to offer guests a cozy and modern retreat, ensuring they have a delightful stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-494186847/original/6b28b326-72b0-4d75-84e6-83f0c01cdd61.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16105357,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16105357','Chris','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/16105357/profile_pic/1402515909/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(81958224,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/81958224','Juan','Portland, OR','I’m a full time nurse and am dedicated to working with youth experiencing mental health crisis. On my free time I’m usually exploring the outdoors, snowboarding, surfing, camping, or hiking, and spending time with family and friends!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-81958224/original/ec70ccc6-3acc-4242-9ca5-da0c23cedd69.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(496303106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/496303106','Emma','Portland, OR','I travel a lot for work, so I am happy to offer my home to guests to enjoy Portland while I am gone.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a92d747f-6d92-4848-80e7-c89a90a9a1de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32309322,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32309322','Nya','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m Nya.\nI live in Portland, OR. I love living in unique urban areas. In my free time, I enjoy exploring many other types of landscapes across the globe.\nI love riding horses, gardening and having new and amazing culinary experiences.\nI look forward to meeting you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/91aae80e-b0dc-47f6-b952-77cb1e123fc1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(97003928,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/97003928','Andrea','','Happy to host as well as travel! Reach out to me with any questions!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6724894f-bd29-4754-a95b-ebce49e240e2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(496493404,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/496493404','Shawn And Jessy','','Hello, my name is Jessy and I\'m your host. I\'m  managing the property for Shawn (owner) and Journey & Gabe (residents). My job is to ensure you have the very best stay and overall experience so feel free to reach out with any questions or needs. \nNote...This is an updated listing, of a 5 star rated property with numerous positive reviews from happy guests. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2911812d-59d7-4d77-bd9c-1156c92064de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16963809,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16963809','Valentino','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cf42b552-9582-423c-b27b-851ef330f9e7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12300845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12300845','Maria','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-12300845/original/1d5f45ca-6814-4387-a63c-528becae45e6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16400193,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16400193','Tri','Da Nang, Vietnam','From Portland! Love traveling the globe with my family. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/2c5d51e1-7c49-4ff7-a208-dd619b5db06a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27309396,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27309396','Nicollette','Portland, OR','My name is Nico and I work from home as a documentary film editor. My husband, Charles, and I have lived in Portland for almost three years. I love the cozy misty winters and warm sunny summers that the PNW has to offer. For fun I enjoy playing board games, drinking coffee, karaoke, and working on home projects. We have a friendly dog named Bruno and two rescue cats, Juicebox & Bubbles.\nnicoedits[dot]com',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/47680b98-956c-41f3-810d-034755155441.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8232906,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8232906','Kevin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b19ac6c-8e83-4025-9ede-ecc9899ae104.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12303711,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12303711','Erica','Portland, OR','Hi! I\'m a digital producer based in Portland OR. I love climbing, dogs, local food, plants, colorful places, and kind people. Favorite places include Bangkok, Barcelona and the Nayarit coast. Often traveling with my partner (and sometimes our dogs, if they’re lucky.)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/00cc19dd-d549-40c2-b26e-80bc0879ee11.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(265276953,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/265276953','Austin','Portland, OR','I love to travel and experience the finer things in life but also am not afraid of going to remote places and enjoying culture. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dfd59510-1475-483b-8931-e21b9f20a570.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(125074133,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/125074133','Lydia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/daeac101-6b8e-4fef-b4bb-3dbbbc129954.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33654666,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33654666','Mike & Hallie','Portland, OR','We are travelers, parents, and overall explorers. We recently moved and started hosting as a way to help encourage people to travel more! We enjoy the PNW but have lived all over America. \n\nWe hope you enjoy your stay(s) with us!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a776c686-fcbf-4fd6-bd09-3db8cb6febaf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(381904802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/381904802','Mack','Portland, OR','A long-time Portland resident and graduate of University of Oregon (Go Ducks!) with a brief stint at Auburn University (War Eagle!), I come from sunny Tampa, Florida. My world revolves around Archie, my long haired wiener dog and work-from-home employee of the month for 3 years and counting. Realizing that I\'m a restless soul, wanting to see everything the world has to offer. Love all things live music, thriller / true crime books and social justice. Looking forward to hosting you! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b4097046-af5e-4179-b7c8-70d46ac8e29f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(145095859,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/145095859','Grace','Almaty, Kazakhstan','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e7ef764e-00b3-4159-bec8-73c5d6718627.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(434311611,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/434311611','Jin','Portland, OR','I am a Portland native pretty much born in Oregon.  Moved to Oregon from South Korea when I was about 6 months old.  Been to many other states but there\'s just something about Oregon that just feels right.  Love to Hike, take strolls in the neighborhood, Bike, Long board, Eat good food.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-434311611/original/ff44084f-d5d8-46db-8a70-2e04a2327f4f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2601420,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2601420','Kyl & Brent','Portland, OR','Hello Friend - we are Kyl and Brent, an American sociologist and Australian art director living life in Portland, Oregon. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ea8f1320-d6f3-4e67-b671-14ba1a408ab6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35288585,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35288585','Corissa','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(105280373,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/105280373','Alea','Portland, OR','Hi there! Love to travel!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aad19e20-c027-48a9-89bf-7d4eddf01be6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64817798,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64817798','Sadie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c9147a1b-23be-41b8-83fe-9452fabfcc3b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7488253,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7488253','Zach','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a48eef7e-b8ed-4dd0-9951-bb214355388a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small');
INSERT INTO `hosts` VALUES (94702,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/94702','Edwin','Portland, OR','I\'ve lived in Portland since 2014 and particularly enjoy active outdoors pursuits such as trail running and Nordic skiing.  My background includes a PhD in Plant Biology from Cornell University  I currently work from home as a partner in a company that develops software for plant breeding.  I volunteer with local dogs rescues and on hiking trail maintenance.\n\nI am fully vaccinated against SARS-CoV-2.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/967f1d56-5e86-46ea-a72b-0fe3aa71f34a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9073779,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9073779','Tanna','Portland, OR','I\'m from VT but I\'ve called Portland OR home 20+ years. I work remotely as a therapist in private practice. ‘09-‘21 I ran a food truck business. I love food, art, language, lit, outdoors & travel. I am comfortable w/Spanish & can speak a little French (spent a year in Paris ‘01) I’ve traveled in Mexico, Central America, Europe, India, Morocco & parts of the Middle East. I am sociable but can just as easily entertain myself & enjoy solitude.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-9073779/original/33817050-8893-4bc8-88e7-c7b03d036f12.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32425053,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32425053','Alison','Portland, OR','I am an elementary school teacher. I enjoy walking, reading and keeping up with my kids.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9600e9ac-bf0c-442a-a07d-7cd879b62be6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(499594361,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/499594361','Allie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c1e7fe0b-74bd-4ee9-b204-d8bca7fb5206.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(287402927,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/287402927','Chris','Wood Village, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-287402927/original/c152ad60-3e8a-4128-a87a-1a3f99baa0ed.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(116888183,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/116888183','Dina','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/28dc1f0c-9659-4526-a49f-e726879261da.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(67795266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/67795266','Ruby','Portland, OR','love to travel. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9c9e2494-1f27-4862-a1ac-1c7440672003.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(500247539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/500247539','Jeff','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8df04f2b-6c47-4014-8a2c-8987ce0804bf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16581727,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16581727','Debbie','Portland, OR','I run the snowshoe program at Mt. Hood Meadows and have grown up in Portland my whole life. \nLive up the hill right across the water from St. John\'s Edison house. Love to hike, bike, ski, garden, backpack and drink vino!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67776e99-d16e-4f54-9f22-f6c3cf0ddc1d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4153980,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4153980','Dani','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/63bb7db9-acfc-445a-989c-3c0c3d158d46.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(123105551,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/123105551','Derek','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/37d4403c-8429-42b8-9deb-7cbe13c8b1e6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(500642386,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/500642386','Jeremy','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/57689363-3586-4ff1-a400-65db38e3f68b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(87322583,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/87322583','Kenya','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f28d646-6027-44d6-9dad-4531da080ee7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(500850476,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/500850476','Adam','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9116c655-ee6a-4598-a4a7-9aa0cd60632c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24000631,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24000631','Jason','Portland, OR','I\'m a filmmaker and photographer, often traveling for work. I work on documentary films and commercial work. I am excited to meet people and love to hear stories from those that I meet. I think there is nothing more powerful than a well told story.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0586fd09-a39f-4fc9-9706-2294382e5a37.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(109508502,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/109508502','Mavix','Portland, OR','Creative. Artist. Poet and photographer. Outdoors—often with the sea or traveling to new cities.\n\nI seek out places that nurture the soul and spark inspiration. Tend to land near well-roasted coffee, organic produce, purveyors of natural wine, and diverse live music.\n\nThey/them.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-109508502/original/0d5b04c0-2abb-4371-8748-7a5a2f49e8cc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12273725,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12273725','Allison','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-12273725/original/40fab358-715e-44dc-8d1a-e80f72b31a4e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20940822,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20940822','Ben','Portland, OR','Easy-going, creative professional (UX Designer) with family in Portland and Los Angeles. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/217cab9d-d607-4d5b-af8e-7a6c1663fc8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4935076,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4935076','Devin','Portland, OR','I\'m a writer and reporter, originally from Los Angeles,  now living in Portland with my husband and three-year-old son. I mainly write about immigration. Youngest of seven children and very good at sharing bathrooms.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c3c66da6-f2df-4cbd-8aea-c928bde4a9fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10075773,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10075773','Liz','Portland, OR','My husband & I live in Portland, Oregon and have 2 daughters (4 and 7) and an English Golden Retriever. We\'ve lived in North Carolina, NYC, SF. We travel as a family for fun, to visit friends, and for weekend get-aways.\n\nI appreciate recommendations on your favorite coffee shops, restaurants, things to do, or things you love about your home. \n\n\"The best gift you could have given her was a lifetime of adventures...\" - Alice in Wonderland',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-10075773/original/2846d73d-59d5-4320-82c8-ed7064fbac48.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(501414071,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/501414071','Sorcha','Portland, OR','At Brightly Furnished Rentals we offer flexible stays for those encountering home repairs and/or relocation. We also work directly with insurance companies to place those in need of temp housing, travelers coming to Portland for longer trips, and short term stays at our vacation focused locations.\n\n- temporary housing\n- extend stay as needed\n- pet-friendly\n- fenced-in yard\n- dedicated office\n- fast internet\n- fully stocked kitchen\n- Smart Tech',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/bab85f50-dd93-49ac-a9b8-6054297fd5eb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(116596023,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/116596023','Melissa','Portland, OR','We\'ve lived in Portland for 30 years. We love our home in SW Portland, but realized we really only use 2/3rds of it. And so our Airbnb was born. We enjoy great food, Timbers soccer games, traveling, gardening and our pets.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/357df006-94b6-42c0-994f-444d6bbace13.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5467063,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5467063','Had','Portland, OR','Artist, illustrator.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/066d85c8-4d1e-4f21-8f6e-ee438b528ceb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(501694949,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/501694949','Itai','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f1901520-52d6-491b-b12a-79535c4bd76a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(227683766,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/227683766','Olivia','Portland, OR','Hey, I\'m Olivia! \n\nI was born and raised in Portland, OR and my partner and I recently bought our first home in northeast Portland. We listed our guesthouse on Airbnb in 2023 and we are so excited to host guests in our cozy, bright space.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7a90a8e6-0827-42a4-ba2d-030fa34e3bd5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(442029804,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/442029804','Live Suite','Princeville, HI','At Live Suite Resorts, we help timeshare owners rent their suites to cover their HOA fees.  We ask that you support our wonderful owners instead of the big hotel chains! Thank you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f267d8b6-b293-48f1-8b3b-4f16a0f57f00.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(480237365,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/480237365','LiveSuites','Pompano Beach, FL','Please support our private owners instead of the big hotel chains. Thank you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/567f50f2-0aa2-4102-80bd-b72718a7dc4b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(482174715,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/482174715','Suite Life','Rockford, MI','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b24daff-6267-4ab8-b3c9-beb0db1c9606.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(389697794,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/389697794','David','North Myrtle Beach, SC','From the beaches to the mountains, and any cityscape in-between, my portfolio of resort style, fully stocked condo accommodations will provide you the ultimate vacation experience! \n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7b02c7e0-81c6-41a9-bda1-e19db00af062.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6242935,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6242935','Leslie','Portland, OR','Two empty nester professionals. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/924e2b80-90c7-45e5-b88f-8e39a08f570e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(439103919,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/439103919','Justine','','Welcome to JKD properties! My husband and I have designed these lofts for you because we absolutely love this city and all it has to offer. We are huge Trailblazer basketball fans and enjoy going to as many games a season as possible. We hope you enjoy your stay and love this city as much as we do!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/699bd2f7-b0a3-4ef7-a318-5b6e0a3303a4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(434680279,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/434680279','Jamie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1bda1417-b0a8-461c-b758-a3b7935c2600.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(502209389,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/502209389','Pat','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7168594f-a6cf-43bc-8832-48de8100f49e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41313924,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41313924','Emily','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/41313924/profile_pic/1439419263/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4747418,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4747418','Jen','Portland, OR','Welcome to the Kenton House! My family and I have a passion for travel, exploring parts of Portland and hiking all over Oregon. \n\nWe have spent the last couple of years renovating this house and we look forward to being able to share our home and labor of love with you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e316a5f3-c93a-46ae-9004-2ae6969dff7b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59627203,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59627203','Majd','Portland, OR','New homeowner and new to Portland! I\'m a gay man living alone in my new house with my dog, Rocko, and I\'m hoping Airbnb guests can enjoy this gorgeous house and help me keep improving it! Love hiking, gym, theatre, and art.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-59627203/original/b4ce0b6a-0cd2-4cfe-b434-b0979c4849d6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(356648186,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/356648186','Joe','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-356648186/original/ef8cf5ab-8132-4721-b07d-bb54cc0ca592.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35669572,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35669572','Sam','Portland, OR','Currently living in Portland, OR.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-35669572/original/ed854e86-312f-4832-87bf-8e57ee8c18bc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(30079973,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/30079973','Marc','Eugene, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/30079973/profile_pic/1427430683/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(502965969,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/502965969','Matt','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8187b3df-882e-4d82-bfc0-ccaff9b01e84.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(65276444,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/65276444','Laura','Portland, OR','Laura is a flight attendant- Scott a work from home software engineer. Jinny & Moody are currently unemployed doggos but will work for treats.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fb781dbc-adc3-4bf8-8e2c-4922ae36da60.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17946344,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17946344','Jane','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17946344/profile_pic/1413316701/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(503453546,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/503453546','Michael','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-503453546/original/266517a0-aeb9-4c09-902a-2fe0260a5dd7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111797012,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111797012','Vacasa Oregon','','Greetings from Team Vacasa! Yes, we\'re a professional property management company—but we\'re also real people, trusted by the owners of vacation homes to take care of all the heavy lifting like housekeeping, reservations, maintenance, and guest care. (Because, to be honest, renting out a vacation home really can be a full-time job!)\n\nWe have local teams on the ground to take care of our homes and our guests. We like to think of it as the best of both worlds: you can enjoy a one-of-a-kind vacation experience in a unique property, only without compromising on service and convenience. You can trust that your home will be cleaned by professional housekeepers, and your calls will be answered (right away, around the clock!) by our dedicated Guest Services team. \n\nCheck out our listings, and if you have any questions, get in touch! We\'d love to help you plan your perfect getaway.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0e020ef7-b02e-487c-b828-253a9aa1863a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(503514196,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/503514196','Ralph','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0ea02a54-eb0a-49bf-a6e7-d5ba485a5f56.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(212998892,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/212998892','Maria G','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-212998892/original/48a8d5cf-25c6-4e66-9ad8-8417dbea2414.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(16029200,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/16029200','Natalie','Portland, OR','I love this town, and I want to help others discover its magic. I believe that a better world is possible, and I think that Portland is really doing some things well. \n\nPreviously, I hosted a room in my home in southeast Portland, and it was so much fun. After a hiatus (construction, and then a pandemic!), I\'m back and hosting a brand new separate apartment at the same address.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8075ecf9-5575-47af-873b-a90bf4ca7fdd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76761573,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76761573','Demetri','Portland, OR','Born in Portland, raised in Athens Greece. Father of one, lover of music and anything mechanical. Travel enthusiast.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bd741de3-6abe-4c00-973d-4667c167d391.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(469941472,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/469941472','Philip','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cd31fcd8-d09c-44d5-955e-2d55bb0c0922.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95203243,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95203243','Ryan','Portland, OR','Jimmy is an avid snowboarder and a trainer and teacher of snowsports at Mt. Hood. He is also known as the Gold Miner and co-creator of the popular TV show \'Gold Rush\' on Discovery channel. His grandfather helped build Timberline Lodge, and he has a passion for the hospitality industry, which is reflected in his exceptional skills as a Bed & Breakfast host.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c78e93f-26f8-437d-8b23-121a8dffda47.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(411850,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/411850','Yichel','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0a601612-4b93-4cc7-b7d8-91028bd996f1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(504645540,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/504645540','The Casa','Portland, OR','Hey folks, we’ve (brother and sister with our spouses) teamed up to create a restful and enjoyable space for folks to enjoy the city of Portland that we’ve collectively fallen in love with. All done with love and in honor of our late mom, “Nena”. \n\nThe Casa Nena Team ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9e56d15a-87ae-45f4-b370-6905db80a7b8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15248312,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15248312','Chris','Portland, OR','Hello! \n \nWe are Chris and Jeremy, world travelers.  After our formative years in Alaska and Oregon, we have spent the last decade living abroad. Staying in many Airbnbs ourselves, we know exactly how to make a space hospitable and homey.  We live for the outdoors and love traveling by bicycle.  \n\nThough Northwesterners at heart, you will find artful references to our travels throughout our place.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/15248312/profile_pic/1399613453/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41664793,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41664793','Laura','Portland, OR','Originally from California, I have lived in Oregon since college at University of Oregon. My family and I love all the Pacific Northwest has to offer and are avid skiers, mountain bikers, climbers, hikers and yogis. We also love food, traveling and staying at different homes and are excited to host you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d82ba407-897a-4d94-b6bb-3cac368035ec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(505113577,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/505113577','Scott','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/293f5fa0-92e1-4558-bca5-4fecbc7cf362.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3334615,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3334615','Dana','Portland, OR','Hello,\n\nI am a Portland, OR resident, grew up in Michigan and work as nurse practitioner.\n\nThe community through AIrBnB is so unique, and personally I think it\'s the best way to travel. My favorite destination this year was Hawaii. \n\nWhen I am not working or traveling, I enjoy a combination of outdoor adventure mixed with city life: snowboarding, running, music, canoeing, camping, coffee all day, and cooking. \n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d1f8cbe0-0f24-459a-9b79-603f2503db44.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10977609,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10977609','Sam','Lakeview, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8fb45046-5546-4c0c-9f63-22deb8bd5208.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(73065974,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/73065974','Ryan','Portland, OR','Software engineer from Portland, OR.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/17b5975d-19c2-40e2-94d9-e77bea783b39.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9583289,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9583289','Pamela','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Pamela!  I\'m a world traveler, I\'ve lived in 7 different countries, and visited many more!  I moved to Portland, Oregon from New York City a few years back and I love it here!  I enjoy meeting new people, and sharing Portland’s many charms with visitors.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9583289/profile_pic/1430273781/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50684661,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50684661','Lizzy','New York, NY','I am a San Francisco native, chosen Oregonian, and current New Yorker. I am a nurse and am all about a healthy and active lifestyle! I love to bike, hike, climb, and explore all over the world. I lived a short time in Taipei, Taiwan and have traveled a bit through Asia, Europe, and the US. I love food, reading, and making new friends.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-50684661/original/5198b52b-cd33-400d-9b90-debbd150ad7d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22732353,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22732353','John','Portland, OR','My wife and I have lived in Portland for the past 8 years and love the area. It is a wonderful place to live and raise a family. We love the outdoors and the wide variety of restaurants and cafes that Portland has to offer. We hope you fall in love with this city as we have. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/89b33e17-d292-40bd-947a-1deb8231ffc2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58277473,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58277473','Lori','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a67f47e8-60b8-4076-a90d-96f68ae2c69c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(57539574,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/57539574','Alisa','Portland, OR','I am a student who loves to travel. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b25e8de-87ea-4600-81b2-2a90f790c4de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(69574685,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/69574685','Doug','Portland, OR','Very quiet and look for relaxing places to stay while working.  Travel extensively so a quiet comfortable place is important ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-69574685/original/585c54f1-6928-4754-a3df-7881e38556c1.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(72711647,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/72711647','Chris','Vancouver, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5a07e926-b0d7-4126-8a3b-072c0543649d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(931231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/931231','Katharine','Philadelphia, PA','I\'m from Philadelphia, though originally from Portland, Oregon and still feel like an Oregonian at heart!  I am a dancer/choreographer, Pilates teacher and movement educator.   I enjoy working with kids and animals too.  I enjoy traveling, adventure, cycling and being outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f210e61d-de90-40cd-9f84-9e19b88501ec.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(113067946,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/113067946','Dan','Portland, OR','My day job is in IT, but my true love is building things with my hands. I particularly enjoy finish carpentry and home restoration (as you\'ll see throughout this listing) as well as fixing up anything with an engine and wheels.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c604042c-f5b2-4345-a3cf-95c0ef12a68f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(506655551,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/506655551','Corbin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-506655551/original/3aebba09-74c9-4e34-a171-8c0d8fb8a854.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33760108,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33760108','Jessica','Portland, OR','My husband Bobby and I live in beautiful Portland, Oregon. We love taking advantage of all the Pacific Northwest has to offer -- the great outdoors, delicious food, world-renowned coffee, a vibrant creative scene and a welcoming vibe.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-33760108/original/828548dd-0811-4c79-a514-923dad52102d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(154094191,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/154094191','Bubby','Portland, OR','My pappy was a pistol, I’m a sonuvagun! \n\nAvid traveler and larger than life character. I work in IT consulting and settled in Oregon after leaving the Midwest at 18. I’ve been to nearly 20 countries across three continents and hope to travel much, much more!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-154094191/original/acc0eb6d-59aa-4592-a6e8-3c55a3c440ca.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(370017367,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/370017367','Jeremy','Portland, OR','I\'ve been an Oregonian nearly my entire life and love it here. In the summer, I often adventure in the woods. During the winter, I am usually reading or playing games. I work standard hours during the week and my girlfriend and I are in and out through the weekend.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5f15bad9-4db5-46b3-b4e5-6ad289c5fe52.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(691959,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/691959','Leah','Portland, OR','I\'m a conscientious, fun-loving individual based in Portland. I love to dance. I write haiku. I nerd out about graphic design, user experience design, tech, travel and natural remedies. I can tell you where to find a good river to jump into around Portland. :)\n\nAs a guest, I\'m conscientious, clean and friendly. With hosts, I\'m up for lively conversation or quiet meditation. I enjoy good food, coffee shops, great places for photo walks, hikes and views to take in.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/49aa5ad0-bc0e-44bc-a020-468db314cebb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(58501537,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/58501537','Leslie','Portland, OR','Born and raised in Portland Oregon. I love to travel and visit friends!!  I’ve lived in France in High school my senior year and lived for 6 months in Israel and Egypt while In University.  I’m currently a relocation consultant.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dcef13fe-3aac-4cd6-8b50-2698813c0cb0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21382575,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21382575','Whitney','Austin, TX','I moved to Austin in 2003 from Portland. I miss Oregon but this town  has become my #2 choice. Ladybird Lake Trail is 50% of why I like it in Austin. The two cities are becoming more alike and I feel blessed to be able to call them both \"home\". \r\nI took Airbnb\'s suggestion and answered the question below....\r\n\r\nFive things I can\'t live without : my kids, dining out, wine, running, and making to-do lists!  Five things I could live without (or wish I could): my phone, driving, fast food places, mean people, my to-do lists.\r\n\r\n',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/21382575/profile_pic/1410837174/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1839219,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1839219','Derric','Portland, OR','PNW native. Originally from Seattle, but I\'ve lived in Portland since 2014. By day I work in software, and by night I\'m a radio personality. My wife and I  (and sometimes our 2 dogs) love to travel; our favorite thing is to find flight deals to a city we\'ve never been to and just go! We primarily use Airbnb when we travel; it makes visiting new places a lot more interesting.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1839219/original/280449f2-42c7-492e-bebf-e5ccc98e2c71.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34150929,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34150929','Carissa','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-34150929/original/73fe16cc-db10-4590-af69-57bd02bf8822.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(501999514,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/501999514','RoomPicks','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b3450012-4b09-455a-a3e2-88f517994f55.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(459606784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/459606784','Sonia Jaqueling','Portland, OR','Dedicated to ensuring your satisfaction, we prioritize every aspect of your experience with us.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-459606784/original/7b68a805-b56f-4e12-b630-991421925aab.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(393324690,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/393324690','Taylor','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/9e7a92e3-4de0-4edd-8fdd-88078d145c82.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(181205324,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/181205324','Plushy','Scottsdale, AZ','Hello from the team at Plushy! We are a technology-driven professional hosting and hospitality management company comprised of full-time Airbnb hosts, expert property managers, developers, designers, financial analysts, marketers, innovators, and above all else dedicated operators who share an uncompromising passion for providing excellent hospitality and service to our homeowners and guests. From full-service management duties, to 24/7 interactive booking and guest support, our team provides professional, technology-driven hospitality services that makes Airbnb hosting easy for everyone.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e39e3f0f-c7e3-4e9d-bcb0-47dab3a42e36.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8762773,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8762773','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','graphic designer + illustrator. coffee + food lover / photographer / blogger. vintage collector. loves to have travel adventures (primarily metropolitan and culture-focused cities) to visit coffeeshops, restaurants, and go thrifting/antiquing. did a cross-country-camper-coffee-crawl in my tiny teardrop camper, when relocating from ATL to portland. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8762773/profile_pic/1411010876/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(501999278,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/501999278','RoomPicks','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/878362e2-a2de-4cea-a340-58d2bac8641e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5758142,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5758142','Victoria','Portland, OR','Greetings!\r\nI would love to welcome you to the City of Portland!  Portland is awesome. I have been her for almost 40 years. I am a transplant from an Iowa farm. \r\n\r\nI lived in \"My Home Away from Home\" for six years and totally enjoyed my walk every day to Pennisula Park where you will find one of the most beautiful Rose gardens and pools in the city.\r\n\r\nAs a Real Estate agent, I understand transitions. If you have sold your home and/or are waiting for a closing on your new home or even coming from another state and need a short term rental, this home will provide you with every comfort you need while waiting for your new home to close, visiting your college kids (University of Portland is very close by), or just checking out Portland as a possibility for you.\r\n\r\nI have lots of experience in property management and understand the need for accessibility. No matter where I am, I can be reached via email, text or an old fashioned phone call to take care of your emergencies should there be any.\r\n\r\nLet me know if I can welcome you to one of my homes!  Victoria',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5758142/profile_pic/1406071165/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41949398,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41949398','Natalie','Portland, OR','Hi I’m Natalie!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/4e8fa208-fdcd-4317-a7d7-693859e19b1f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9075051,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9075051','Myra','Richardson, TX','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65fc0a11-3cb9-41f8-9fd2-736a1d0d1ce8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(102637138,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/102637138','Ruben','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-102637138/original/a8b182ee-17a4-4d97-ae73-c4d98ddc4794.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7284060,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7284060','Maja','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1f6753c5-8f34-442e-8ac2-12d8b97c355a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23087686,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23087686','Luke','Los Angeles, CA','I graduated from USC a few years ago and have just finished a stint in Korea teaching English. I love taking pictures, like to go hiking, and have recently started painting. A few months ago, I was in Thailand. Years before that, Prague.\r\n\r\nMy roommate is a local barista and musician.  She is a UT art school graduate (yeah, Austin, Texas), and she\'s very friendly.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/904c3b92-69dd-45f4-8d33-ea1f57766f7e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29819283,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29819283','Cole','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/29819283/profile_pic/1427063590/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25667842,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25667842','Jonathon Dakarai','Portland, OR','Hi there!  :) I\'m Jonathon, a new host on Airbnb, but an avid traveler using this platform for years. When I\'m not exploring the world, I enjoy discovering new flavors and recipes in the local food scene, as well as outdoor activities exploring local parks, cycling, urban exploration. As your host, I\'m committed to making your stay as enjoyable as possible, with recommendations for local attractions & insider tips on navigating the city.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/40fee704-6e0c-488c-bc35-1f625a3c7863.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(509275508,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/509275508','Robert','','I was a social worker for 20 years and fixed up houses as well.  I\'ve enjoyed airbnb as a guest, and now becoming  a host! I also host a hipcamp.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-509275508/original/2b8e6804-1d87-42cb-94f7-9b39c34ca85c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(509450167,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/509450167','Matthew','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(56078136,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56078136','Colin','Portland, OR','I am a writer and environmental communications professional in Portland, Oregon. My partner Maddy is a social worker.  We love to travel, hike, camp, and taste craft beer. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8c17dd5d-cbcf-4f50-8cbf-9c1442bbe165.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20275483,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20275483','Norbert','Portland, OR','Born in France, I have lived around the world for the past 25 years. I have an engineering degree and worked all my life for the 3 stripes, in product quality management. I have a 9 year old Frenchie and a beautiful small house in portland that I love. I compete and train in Ballroom dancing and use my spare time to create outfits and garment for dancers. Life is good really :) ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/20275483/profile_pic/1408475524/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(52252008,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/52252008','Amanda','San Anselmo, CA','We are a family of 3 who have always loved traveling and sharing our homes with others. One of our great passions is bringing beautiful old homes back to their former glory.  It is a joy to be able to share our spaces with others and helping people to make new memories in special places.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79963958-c22a-438e-8d27-be82469839ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(323829992,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/323829992','Stacy','Marysville, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-323829992/original/85742b38-7f43-4e79-8570-1a9b32b281e4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77828962,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77828962','Matthew','Portland, OR','I can tell people are judgmental just by looking at them.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ce02fa5c-0a67-40c6-a7be-6d82108fd1b2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41852577,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41852577','Andrew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/446cf382-1c2f-45c6-aca4-192b070e69d3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(510247615,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/510247615','Sarah','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-510247615/original/36b75488-b91f-40bd-a74c-bb839bc49905.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(510394122,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/510394122','Sukey','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67f2c1bd-3fcb-4edc-ac4c-cca5f32a9704.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40890310,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40890310','Vacasa Oregon','','Vacasa\nVacation Home Management\n\nVacasa unlocks the possibilities of how we enjoy vacation homes. We take care of managing our homeowners’ vacation houses so they can have peace of mind (and their home when they want to). And our guests book vacations confidently knowing they’re going to find exactly what they’re looking for without any surprises.\n\nEach vacation home is always cared for by our professional local teams who implement our high cleanliness and maintenance values, while the hands-off tasks of vacation rental management--marketing, filing taxes, and maintaining a website--are handled by a specialized central support team. Our passion and focus remain true: to empower our homeowners, guests, and employees to invest in vacation.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/71b06072-1e9a-42e8-ad05-584beed0a120.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(270612196,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/270612196','Ghazal','Portland, OR','I love to cook, paint, hike, and travel! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/00344489-5517-4539-b665-7c5c0f4081ba.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(452555665,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/452555665','Demetria','Portland, OR','Laid back.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(24118107,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24118107','Brenda','Portland, OR','I am an urban planner that loves to explore cities and their transit systems. I look forward to exploring your city as a guest, or welcoming you into Portland, Oregon as my guest! ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-24118107/original/8733b36d-6966-4ee2-aead-3044b02dc942.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27701355,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27701355','Traci','Portland, OR','Now an empty nester & Mom to a US Marine; I’m getting to embrace my creativity and, as it turns out, I’m an entrepreneur at heart. \nBTW, If there’s Organizing Tasks to be done, something you dread … Let’s Talk!!\nFamily Archiving?! We can talk about that too :) \n I, thoroughly, enjoy the attempt at balancing my time between the all to familiar dental field, expanding my wheelhouse and just plain connecting on this incredible earthly plane :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/da40536e-019e-4c9d-ac11-9e98bba406d3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20899071,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20899071','Carmen','Portland, OR','I was born and raised in Homer, Alaska where I hosted airbnb guests in my little cabin for years.  I now live with my wife and children in the Kenton neighborhood of Portland, Oregon. \nWe worked hard to build an addition onto our home which we just finished in 2020, and are excited to share the new space with our guests!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e21bf20e-939e-411c-9220-a1db7e35a87d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(384690762,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/384690762','Zach','Portland, OR','Hello all,\n\nMy name is Zach. I was born and raised in Portland, OR and am proud to call Portland my home. I\'ve traveled around the city of Portland and all of Oregon my whole life -- so I have plenty of recommendations to help out your travels. I look forward to supporting your positive experience -- please, let me know how I can best help!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-384690762/original/b6c2346a-572c-44b0-8b8c-55e01947a971.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5054191,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5054191','Lindsey','','I love to explore the world, try new food, meet new people, and enjoy life to the fullest. I am passionate about people and learning new things!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d0dc3921-0d7a-4ae9-b7db-bd0582a8e797.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31679049,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31679049','Reese','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-31679049/original/c6855fbc-dff2-4746-8b0d-dcd2a37cf6cc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(37834902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37834902','Karoline','Portland, OR','I am a Portlander and love gardening, cooking, and outdoor adventures',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-37834902/original/b7b9fe2c-cc69-465f-8720-a8fe90c87568.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23781261,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23781261','Melanie','San Francisco, CA','I\'m a tea enthusiast, juggler, and traveler. I am trying to make my way to hot springs, waterfalls, a good hike or mushroom picking in the woods. \n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7180034d-da8f-4d10-b46f-f2fbaaafd86f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13526464,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13526464','Meg','Portland, OR','I live, work and play in Portland, Oregon. I\'m the founder and teacher of an ecologically based preschool in the Cully neighborhood of NE Portland. \n\nI think airbnb is great for travel and use it often! I also am a big fan of couchsurfing and home exchange and have used that locally and internationally.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24e7beee-1d7f-42b0-8581-3a6f04bcd070.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3604636,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3604636','Marion','Santa Fe, NM','Designer / artist / yogi  - Living in Santa Fe NM and Portland OR. Straddling the desert and the forest life is pretty idyllic.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3604636/profile_pic/1432171193/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35575489,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35575489','Ryanne','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/558e712b-44bd-4353-947f-58132603a9ea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(512501431,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/512501431','Carla','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-512501431/original/dd739d9e-e7f1-4401-b0cb-f9c3425056e0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(281637273,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/281637273','Thu','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-281637273/original/11c25e5d-6e60-415a-9dc8-f43c81de5da5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(234801624,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/234801624','Petra & Thomas','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/602e44e6-c713-4a5e-8530-50d3a6301113.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(230664404,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/230664404','Peter','','I’m an active and adventurous Airbnb host in Portland!\n\nDuring the week, I paddle along the waterfront downtown, walk my dog Oatmeal at the nearby park, and explore the beautiful waterfalls along The Gorge. I’m a volunteer with Make a Wish and stay active in a few local hobbies. I believe that exploring new experiences is what makes life exciting.\n\nI’m always happy to share my knowledge of the city to help my guests make the most of their stay!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-230664404/original/0b4ba2a9-a20d-42f5-a2c3-6b593e8ad499.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(455346786,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/455346786','Gail','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-455346786/original/aa6da41b-575f-4883-a926-1064ddf1a040.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38713113,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38713113','Beth','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7aa72927-65a8-4cfc-9dbf-88f5da451f06.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31920019,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31920019','Lynn','Portland, OR','Hello! I’m an electric vehicle executive and real estate investor who travels very often for work and pleasure. I recently moved to Oregon from Kauai and originally from Southern, CA.  I also have a beautiful vacation rental in La Quinta, California called, The Lone Palm La Quinta that will soon be available for monthly and seasonal rental on airbnb. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/11c2e58a-f68f-410f-9338-401afde5f29f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(203219784,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/203219784','Val','Portland, OR','My name is Val. I am Airbnb host in Portland, OR.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/517bde90-94b5-4a60-8bd8-e550d382ba8e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(89222626,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/89222626','Randall','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-89222626/original/dede851e-3666-4054-a446-87851d839a99.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39378828,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39378828','Jennifer','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-39378828/original/2c3acbe9-8c80-4963-96fb-0db55bd3c181.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(81740738,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/81740738','Isabella','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3b511e4b-ff5f-41e9-acca-7666ca002e56.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56229591,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56229591','Susan','Corvallis, OR','My husband and I and our four adult children love to travel and spend time in the outdoors - skiing, hiking, biking and water sports.  We lived in Europe for four years and whenever possible travel back to there to visit good friends (and now that two of our children live in Manchester, England we are frequent fliers to there as well!).   When closer to home, we love to spend time in Sunriver enjoying everything it has to offer.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9b8f13c2-de6d-4ed4-9779-88d555bdb970.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(239624495,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/239624495','Pat','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ed961ad0-cd8a-4388-80c1-93c3039164cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(514114443,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/514114443','Rebecca','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-514114443/original/0679d149-f06e-462d-8433-9cc86d756424.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36901481,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36901481','Hayley','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-36901481/original/e286085a-7e45-415a-9bcb-94d03a7cc16d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(122732291,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/122732291','Astrid','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/857f68f3-6de5-4a61-a6ab-c75d2f96383d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3105723,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3105723','Mark','Portland, OR','Generally I like to stay fit/active... I hike, run, bike, workout, rock climb, whitewater kayak, flyfish, surf, and ski.  I really enjoy photography, too. I love cooking and hosting friends for dinners and planning adventure travel, too. When I\'m in a new city, I enjoy checking out the notable sights, but also explore outside!\n\nWhen traveling regionally/locally, my husky Akira usually joins me.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e9c37290-5b98-4fd1-9eb3-91b493414341.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28263687,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28263687','Vanessa','San Diego, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/56a3a395-5882-467f-a460-acb86b84dfdd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(92215419,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/92215419','Amy','Portland, OR','Home in OR for 20+ yrs now, I\'ve been relishing the music and foodie scene here. Filmmakers call me a Hospitality Ninja. Friends call me a Hyperphonic Space Witch. Either way, I\'m excited to help curate a rich experience for you if you need anything at all. My 4-legged sidekick, Salita, will also help welcome you. \n\nSpecialties range from the music scene/record stores to justice work to the queer social scene and of course, outdoorsy play.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a98b15a4-0be0-4e87-bbcc-884928db0005.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51264241,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51264241','Alison','San Francisco, CA','Hello, I\'m Alison. My husband, Chris and I are friendly curious people and competent travelers. We have a magical dog named Feather who has won hearts up and down the west coast and in Mexico.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/85bfc119-d9be-4852-bc8e-720c5d26bb5f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(107922685,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/107922685','David','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c0e3888-84fd-4ebd-b2a6-bcb83d401324.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95030930,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95030930','Martin','Portland, OR','Retired executive.  Traveled  the US and Canada, and a bit overseas for 39 years.  Married for 30+ yrs.  Two children.  Grew up in Seattle.  Have lived in several places but mainly Portland since 1989.  I enjoy bicycling, hiking, camping and running as well as movies, the theater, and music.  I read a lot. Vegetarian for over 40 years.  When we can, we visit state parks in our small travel trailer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e248d74e-1420-48f7-a1c1-661c6089bc87.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(479014456,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/479014456','Sygarry','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2b599522-79d1-43b9-94b7-db9b8058a4cd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(515297813,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/515297813','Boruch','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4aa8cee3-cd0c-4e4c-bdc9-096c9613c089.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(64363482,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/64363482','Emily','Vancouver, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d2550c07-6e5b-44ee-99ab-6ec78d9f2178.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148853179,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148853179','Lixin','Oregon City, OR','Hi my friends,\n\nI\'m Lixin Wang. I\'m a proud mother of 3. One daughter and two twin boys. I like traveling, cooking and exercising. I love to make friends. I believe I can make a lot of friends from all around the world from here. Was raised by a family of doctors, they taught me the habit of clean and disinfect my room when I was a child. Defiantly help me set a high standard when I run Air B&B.  I also ran a hotel business for 4 years. Come to stay in my houses, everything is  five-star hotel disinfection requirements level. I do my best to accommodate my guests and make their stay as enjoyable as possible.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3a6be083-23f1-4f17-b0b4-41bab5e81053.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6492281,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6492281','Shannon','Mountain View, CA','Freelance french-trained Chef, owned & operated neighborhood bistro in Santa Cruz, CA. Past/present BoD member of American Institute for Wine and Food, Old Mountain View Neighborhood Association, Tahoe Swiss Village HOA, Tahoe Yacht Club. Previously spent 25+ years in high tech as a software engineering product and program manager. Successfully launched three children into productive adulthood. Still training the husband tho.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8285fe98-ef82-4a2e-be97-57afa3aa8234.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(118259966,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/118259966','Kyra','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cdf077ac-7845-44b9-8ba2-e87332f3ed1a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(136296935,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/136296935','Hannah','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f9faef5e-82c6-4941-bfff-e5a028826339.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(400237209,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/400237209','Victor','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-400237209/original/e94c5466-a36e-4a27-9649-4a8752a9ad8a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(516390143,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/516390143','Mia','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/8d8068dd-bb84-4a47-9545-0a61aa835fae.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(516607928,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/516607928','Theresa','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-516607928/original/947e749c-468b-4a98-9893-3122289cfde6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6339111,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6339111','Megan','Portland, OR','I love traveling to new places or even discovering different neighborhoods in my own backyard. Lover of local food joints, parks to take photos, and anything that brings a smile to my face.  For fun, I like to cook food, bike around town, pack a picnic, and grow my own veggies. \n\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7a9bc7c2-d889-46b9-b55f-9948d995365f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(88737989,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/88737989','Timothy','Portland, OR','We are a married couple who recently sold a Thai restaurant, love travelling and meeting other travelers. Meeting people (especially during adventurous times in their life) bring such a positive atmosphere to our home. We only hope to repay the favor to our guests, making them feel equipped and comfortable in Portland. We look forward to meeting you in your visit with us in the future!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-88737989/original/e0117d12-dc03-4729-8ef7-fc97ae199b34.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23133356,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23133356','Farhad','Portland, OR','We are a married couple that really enjoys traveling and seeing new places. She likes to cook awesome Persian food while He loves to help where he can.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/23133356/profile_pic/1414647831/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2032871,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2032871','David','Portland, OR','David from Portland! :) want to know anything else? Feel free to Ask!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dc49a034-09a9-404e-9305-ed8985fa352f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(98430746,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/98430746','Nic','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-98430746/original/f5001449-cefb-44b2-92ab-8ba4142df6f1.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(497612770,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/497612770','Corey','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/88118abc-0e9f-40f9-8a0e-c41eb4c0e545.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(377397572,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/377397572','Abraham','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7d598dae-2f15-42aa-abbe-9497e35131e5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3380883,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3380883','Marc','Portland, OR','From Portland Oregon. Enjoys spin class, cats, live music, and is a social worker that loves all wine and Latin America.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a4e4672d-cd35-4c3e-992f-53a371e65010.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(167270,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/167270','Bree','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/27348e67-36ce-42af-b7ed-7b286dc25149.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12727712,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12727712','Joselyn','Portland, OR','I\'m a writer who lives in Portland, Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12727712/profile_pic/1393789142/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(188588035,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/188588035','Watson','San Francisco, CA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/59c18db0-158f-4409-bdc8-d569b6ee04af.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6647211,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6647211','Tally','Portland, OR','I love to travel and find unique places to stay as well as create comfortable places to stay. I have rented out homes in the Portland area since 2013.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee52728c-f83f-4dd2-a505-42aa6564a637.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(519271828,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/519271828','Juan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-519271828/original/6e633427-aa89-47ad-9cef-a03eda2ff1cb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33434004,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33434004','Kara And Dana','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-33434004/original/b9e0458e-da03-469e-8a7c-cb77d1063e3a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(154340661,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/154340661','Andrea','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/59f2d5c6-044b-44d8-8d4c-a51e1511d630.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(145090401,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/145090401','Kara','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/33351cc0-4d82-46b7-badf-54b44877e67c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32095859,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32095859','Michelle','','Hi, I\'m Michelle! I\'ve lived in several wonderful places, including PA, AZ, CA, and OR. I’m a mom (dog & toddler!) and I work remotely as a Program Manager at mindbody + classpass and love all things wellness! One of the things I love about the PNW is experiencing the beauty of various seasons. I can\'t wait for you to experience our thoughtfully curated spaces, The Vic PDX & Studio 5304!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-32095859/original/e0ba74e1-4309-4aa2-aa26-a9596348c8dc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29056793,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29056793','Juliana','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/29056793/profile_pic/1425937476/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(80824107,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/80824107','Toni','Portland, OR','I am a kind, conscientious artist into healing, nature, live music of all types and good people. I’ve lived and travelled all over the world and finally came home to me.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/cf28b7d7-1988-45b5-9754-ebeb1e66313f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(249997321,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/249997321','Raja','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-249997321/original/a7b2ad15-0276-4069-baa5-169b14635dd5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(258097276,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/258097276','Dustin','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e735bb6a-d7e2-4087-b780-16e52baca487.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(794622,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/794622','Dave & Robyn','Portland, OR','We first came to Portland while working in the art department on the film Mr. Holland’s Opus in 1995. A few years later we decided to come back and stay.   We are loving every minute of it. It\'s a great city that we have no doubt you will also fall in love with. We are thrilled to have the opportunity to make our space available to other adventurous travelers!\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-794622/original/961cb3d3-a0b6-481d-9682-2108c8cc2717.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2275772,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2275772','Stephen','','Family man, traveler with a passion in accommodations. Nothing makes a trip better than a great place to stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2275772/original/d0ac4303-009c-4b7b-a1b7-3e7e86a4b01a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(368211725,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/368211725','Thomas','Portland, OR','We have four dogs that you may see running around and approx 100 plant children! So we have a huge family! \n\nHere open hearts and open doors embrace individuals from all races, faiths, genders, and sexual orientations. We celebrate diversity, and everyone is valued, respected, and supported in this safe haven for all.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5c2cd34d-ba5c-40ff-a727-55d3ec68220c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(715222,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/715222','Tiffany','Portland, OR','We are from Portland OR and design a kids line www.Prefresh.com, we are coming to meet with our reps in the LA Marketplace.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/67711297-cb1c-4ce9-a0ef-b496b1c6a014.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1795866,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1795866','Louis','Portland, OR','I\'m a Portlander with two young kids.  I love skiing, mountain biking, playing guitar and hanging with my family.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1795866/profile_pic/1329978185/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22331368,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22331368','Margueritte','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-22331368/original/19d14eae-816d-4866-bda1-634ddc4f6021.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10548064,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10548064','Therese','',' ',0,'https://