gs.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-79759220/original/4dbb6102-e581-4655-bd52-bc136ae8f5fa.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(198328059,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/198328059','Marieta','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-198328059/original/a4c97973-255a-473e-91be-24bcdd256468.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(41117487,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/41117487','An','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/41117487/profile_pic/1439270160/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(240078487,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/240078487','Steven','Myrtle Beach, SC','I have access to many locations not listed here, so if you\'re looking - let me know where and I\'m happy to check in to it for you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3858ab67-7809-4948-84ed-77214021d1aa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(469644788,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/469644788','Trevor','Portland, OR','I like to spend my time traveling, hanging out with friends and family, and working. I enjoy exercising, learning a new skill, and practicing Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu. I have traveled to 6 foreign countries including Ireland, England, Norway, Sweden, Denmark, and Mexico.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-469644788/original/f70f1f7f-d7e5-45be-9aad-a5dff3880470.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18300162,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18300162','Katelyn','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a75f5236-494e-438e-8b1f-cfa1d1897e4f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21252430,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21252430','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6356025-11bd-4527-be4b-a1f57d4e30b6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111817270,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111817270','Ahmet','Myrtle Beach, SC','I have access to many locations not listed here, so if you\'re looking - let me know where and I\'m happy to check in to it for you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/3d8b4405-b276-46af-8c58-2e7e479651a0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(96996221,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/96996221','David','Portland, OR','I\'m a fitness-creation-exploring-life-experiencing enthusiast.  I enjoy working out, playing violin and guitar, being an afterschool Teacher and running my small freelance business.  I have traveled to Germany, Switzerland, Austria, France, Serbia, Hungary, Zambia, Papua New Guinea, Japan, Korea and have lived in Canada.  Growing up I had many homestays at my house from Japan and other countries.  Look forward to having you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-96996221/original/180a0fad-1bcc-4b72-bfbf-a97bc55d53bb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(529731294,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/529731294','Tessa','Portland, OR','Living that PNW life! My whole family is here and I grew up on a farm outside of Portland and the beaches of southern California. Love sharing our fair City of Roses with new and old friends!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-529731294/original/f98bfcc5-ef2a-4121-986b-3c31c3a17c03.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11579,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11579','Adela','New York, NY','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/11579/profile_pic/1330920061/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14636342,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14636342','Rob & Sara','Portland, OR','We are married with 2 mostly grown children .Have lived in Portland since 2005 and enjoy the Pacific Northwest .',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/14636342/profile_pic/1409611347/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(414420881,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/414420881','Eric','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-414420881/original/f4e6c41e-ee67-435d-9b98-52b484f9edc4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(504252105,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/504252105','Guesty','','Welcome to Guesty Budget Homes! We offer fully furnished, high-quality homes that are private, professionally cleaned, and always safe. \n\nEnjoy excellent customer service, quick responses to inquiries, and a comfortable stay at an affordable price. \n\nOur team is available 24/7 to ensure a smooth check-in and address any concerns during your stay. Book with us for a comfortable and enjoyable experience that fits your budget.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-504252105/original/dd74bd9e-6ac4-4e06-928e-a57cad7ef71d.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(49352828,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/49352828','Autumn','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c0a7a786-9034-4384-97d0-fd044ba064de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3936317,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3936317','Jocelyn','Portland, OR','Texas transplant living in and loving Portland, Oregon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/78f001cb-8c0e-44bd-a2b4-363329dab2c8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(82348342,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/82348342','Ced','Portland, OR','I love to travel and enjoy finding special places to soak up the local community. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9643372c-b727-408d-979b-f39bb11c1fea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4844054,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4844054','Erica','Portland, OR','Hi, I’m  Erica! I work from home doing part- time property management and freelance writing as I slowly heal from my second shoulder surgery. \nWhen there is time, I work on my true passion, which is medical advocacy for invisible illness patients, like myself. Having invisible illness can leave me drained so I don’t get much time  to focus on my hobbies these days, but I do love to garden, road trip, and spend time in nature as much as I can.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/636ee9f3-bb1b-4ddf-a641-b5d8dd1d73b6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3064751,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3064751','Emily','Portland, OR','Hi there! Originally from California, I now live in Portland, OR with my husband, toddler, and our rescue pup. We love to travel and have been all over the world, although these days we mostly stay closer to home.\n\nWe love to cook, listen to music, and hang out with friends. We spend lots of weekends in the hammock on our deck, gardening, and exploring Portland\'s incredible food and drink scene.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-3064751/original/b20af562-eb5e-4b53-bc41-009f99cc4fed.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38193018,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38193018','Justina','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/060e2bbf-3d5e-4489-8603-62b9e3702350.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(531181880,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/531181880','Peter','Portland, OR','I came up here in college and fell in love with the area. Over 7 years later I’m still in love with how many unique things there are to do here!\n\nWeekdays you can find me paddling along the waterfront downtown, working from home with my lapdog, Oatmeal, or catching a standup comedy show downtown! \n\nWeekends are full of friends, laughter, and excitement for all the amazing things this area has going for it. Can’t wait to share it with ya. :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-531181880/original/df0e5724-eab2-48fd-8707-f4f6a1ac0006.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(531225529,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/531225529','Matthew','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-531225529/original/7348e72d-18a9-4b4c-9c85-7c39cad217d3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7660282,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7660282','Sait','Portland, OR','I\'m a self-employed credit underwriter specializing in direct lending. After a decade of living in NYC, I\'ve returned to my hometown, PDX, to be surrounded by family & friends. I\'m also a BJJ practitioner, which has taught me discipline, strategy, & resilience—skills I bring into my professional & personal life. It\'s not just about mastering moves on the mat; it\'s about applying the same dedication & problem-solving mindset to life challenges!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7660282/original/f100ffa6-04e7-4a42-b86b-50e2e73bee68.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(141693638,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/141693638','Christopher','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-141693638/original/5b50feb3-99aa-4635-83e2-7454b64e709c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127919376,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127919376','Michelle','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/097dc1ea-f2e0-43ec-be1e-47ac49251d68.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(82507993,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/82507993','Freja','Portland, OR','Hello! I’m Freja. \n\nI love to travel with my partner and I am usually busy working or being a mom to 2 adorable Frenchies. \n\nI also enjoy welcoming travelers into my home,  helping them navigate PDX and providing a clean and comfortable place for guests to rest while they’re in Portland. \n\nI look forward to meeting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b170ee1c-77ee-4e5f-8913-c1446c4f8503.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(531726605,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/531726605','Jin','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dfcd1510-5535-4a71-822e-11ad35939775.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(108772508,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/108772508','Victoria','Portland, OR','Adventurer from San Francisco, California!\nAirbnb Host in Portland, Oregon.\nI love traveling, astronomy and I\'m a foodie! \n\nAs a host, I will make sure my home is always clean and ready for guests. In return, I expect my guests to take good care of my home during their stay.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/a31899a3-a638-49fa-a297-069ca6b0cb06.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(308999019,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/308999019','Santha','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5337cfab-b4a0-4260-8a0c-d8114b71bf20.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90355699,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90355699','Mark','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4ce6ea4a-91a6-4de3-b7cb-cb21795d7a52.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8641229,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8641229','Garrett','Portland, OR','We have a lovely view on top of Alberta park. I love to travel and host a private room. Come visit!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/34faadc0-e88c-4dbc-9d6f-4a9f336898ee.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5068356,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5068356','Karla','Portland, OR','Having responsible fun since 1980. I’m a former author-turned-copywriter who moved from NYC to PDX four years ago. (I really miss the city!) Now I spend a lot of time working on my house, hiking with my dog, and discovering life beyond work.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2ed424cd-648d-493a-b44d-02fd5b4aa4c1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12802704,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12802704','Olivia','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-12802704/original/0905df21-92e9-4300-bc98-156c408e30c5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(357891266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/357891266','Jacob','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-357891266/original/c5d0d859-422e-4dd3-8381-051998aa5766.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(657231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/657231','Laura','Los Angeles, CA','Hello! I am a freelance designer who has a vacation home in Portland and loves to travel!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-657231/original/8625ae4c-51ac-4c28-9b7a-067c745dface.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(116576921,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/116576921','Angie','Portland, OR','Remote software worker living in Portland!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/591317bd-f29d-4bac-9ae8-7af477debef1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7718653,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7718653','Andrew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7718653/profile_pic/1374766691/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1337759,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1337759','Ana','Portland, OR','I love traveling (sometimes by myself) and getting to know people, and airbnb has been really great to me so far!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b3b7d412-037d-425b-a13f-0df99b346a31.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40800680,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40800680','Sarah','Portland, OR','We live in Portland Oregon and love it here. Our neighborhood is full of hidden gems and delicious food. We also love to travel. Whether it’s a mountain cabin, coast retreat or experiencing another culture, we enjoy exploring the world around us.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9c767a2f-5c47-47d2-9c7d-8bece3891fc7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63532777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63532777','Stella','Tucson, AZ','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/387201c8-8044-4320-9757-38538973d527.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77981704,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77981704','Matt','Hood River, OR','I’m a California native who got exposed to Portland and ultimately decided to live up here in Oregon full-time. I work in software development in Hood River, and have a great home close-in on the east side in Portland which I AirBnB. I love to travel and see new places and am happy to host those trying to do the same in Portland.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/386c4a64-2991-444c-97ec-57cf0a11e4c8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(534173163,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/534173163','Brad','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-534173163/original/af185674-a1cc-4919-b266-ffebbeeb4727.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95307476,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95307476','Thom','Portland, OR','Professional who loves to travel. For me, travel is more than a vacation, it’s an opportunity to learn and explore. I love learning about the people and culture of a place, experiencing the local cuisine, and finding the beauty of everyday life. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-95307476/original/857a96da-ea8b-4d64-8a3e-ae534321f267.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9296727,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9296727','Jesse','Fort Lauderdale, FL','I rent out hundreds of Resorts Worldwide. My best deals are last minute requests (within 60 days).\n\nMy job is helping people to vacation with their families or loved ones for affordable prices and I feel pretty good about it.\n\nA bit more about me .... \n\n I  have worked in travel for 10 years. I am using AirBnB to add more credibility to the rental process and to make my clients feel at ease. AirBnb has been such a blessing because it allows me to focus less on marketing and more on customer service. Thank you for considering my rental and I look forward to doing business with you now and in the future!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6afd986a-cd19-4aec-9d1d-3af21b7d98b7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(528153813,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/528153813','Justin','','World traveler expert in real estate all over the world. Gathering inspiration and business partnerships worldwide as I explore all the best the world has to offer. Into all kinds of outdoor activities from hiking, Boat/water life, Motorcycles and Beaches.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ae191cb9-242e-4cb8-9f69-7e2b604abc36.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(320949994,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/320949994','Emerson','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-320949994/original/5ebedcbe-c7cc-4bbd-bc1a-955d8719753c.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28015540,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28015540','Heather','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-28015540/original/b772035b-b425-4891-becc-8bbe4ad39de7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17083437,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17083437','Lauren','Portland, OR','I\'m slightly obsessed with traveling and meeting new people. I\'m secretly a sailboat captain and force my dog to go on ocean adventures with me. I love a good cup of coffee while sitting on my front porch while visiting with neighbors.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/17083437/profile_pic/1403391086/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(445417507,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/445417507','Jason','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d4140774-33a3-4909-b48f-206f9e4aee80.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(299702617,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/299702617','Debbie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/15b6fd62-7b69-4409-95c9-6e8656e83490.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(408641058,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/408641058','Christy','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-408641058/original/d2d8059b-b4f4-4ac8-8cae-871300f9a4df.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(127445547,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/127445547','William','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-127445547/original/c1b147be-8634-4817-9b4a-f66ac136380e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(130967908,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/130967908','Jessica','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-130967908/original/414fb5d1-a3e7-4ee9-abef-84de506c6d54.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9377224,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9377224','Georgi And Petya','Portland, OR','Hey ! We are Petya and Georgi - new Oregonians, moved to Portland from Orlando, Florida. It is so much fun to explore the Northwest! We love the weather here. We love going to the ocean or mountains, to the wine country and Portland\'s  so many unique breweries.There are so many things to do-fishing ,hiking, exploring this amazing place in the USA. We are originally from Bulgaria. Hope to see you soon and talk in person with everyone of you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5878c595-ec0e-4ba9-9cc9-72039bc27a80.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4884977,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4884977','Shane','Portland, OR','Hello, I’m Shane-a Portland native! I love sharing the Villa with fellow travelers and locals I like :-) I’m a massage therapist LMT & obsessed with dance, hiking, traveling and fitness :-)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/ef8acd04-599f-4f32-8426-4e7a8faf748a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(146445726,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/146445726','Liz','Portland, OR','My name is Liz and I live and work in Washington, DC, USA with my partner, Jack, and our two cats, Max and Tibby. We love exploring new places and meeting new people! When we are relaxing in our own city, we enjoy finding new neighborhoods via bike, visiting museums, and eating great food (we\'re always on the hunt for the best beer and wings!).',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/46570ea7-60d7-483c-ad34-eab201107d53.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(74481791,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/74481791','Michael','Portland, OR','62 year old owner of construction business in Portland and vineyard in Washington County, father of 3, grandfather of 4.  Wife is a retired hospitality designer.  Not much time for pleasure, but when we do enjoy ourselves, it usually involves food and drink with our family.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/46115870-49b4-4088-a452-8f3769973be7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(151457231,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/151457231','Landon','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(1782525,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1782525','Nicole','Portland, OR','Portland, Oregon',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1782525/original/d1b01126-e1a3-471f-8f89-452a50fdca5e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(182137080,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/182137080','Roba','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-182137080/original/5aa3f1a9-18e0-4630-bb90-19ec638a4b47.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(123106801,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/123106801','Grethel','California, United States','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/30db38fb-f658-4a97-8696-4369a4a8c210.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(537908933,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/537908933','Charles','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5c3716e-9eb0-4748-bef0-1c551e72aa83.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84376678,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84376678','Minh','Portland, OR','My wife Tracey & I have 2 young children.  My favorite quote is: \n\n\"If happiness is the goal – and it should be, then adventures should be a top priority.’’ – Richard Branson. \n\n\r\nTraveling has enriched our family in so many ways!  I\'ve stayed in AirBNBs wherever possible for my travels from personal to business.   Creating a smooth and relaxing experience for guests is the core of our hosting responsibilities.   We strive to do everything we can to make guests feel at home when they stay in our house.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9647d812-d309-4c84-940e-8c37cb7b3b87.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(90138486,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/90138486','Richelle','','I love to travel,  bake and watching Netflix during my free time! I travel between Portland, Seattle and California every 2 weeks!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e8733405-7414-4aa6-85fa-56a14a251426.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(36400059,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/36400059','Cody','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-36400059/original/0ccfbc10-cf7f-42ca-9ad7-4c176213d94d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(531116583,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/531116583','Melody','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c7643ac-3600-4165-9cd1-0b9ca9ef5e40.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(538252368,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/538252368','Paul','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-538252368/original/80141d1a-6eba-41d1-bd30-2f33f8da5e09.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(112452733,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/112452733','Vacasa Oregon','','Hi, we’re Vacasa, North America’s largest vacation rental management company. Owners of vacation homes around the world trust us to deliver exceptional service throughout your entire vacation. Professional housekeepers clean and stock each home, and our customer care team is available around the clock—with a local property manager ready to show up and help out. We like to think we offer the best of both worlds: you can enjoy a one-of-a-kind vacation experience in a unique property, without compromising on service and convenience. Check out our listings, and get in touch if you have any questions. Your vacation is our full-time job, and we\'d love to help you plan your perfect getaway.\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/76decf3d-3656-43c3-a5c4-861c94cf1586.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(76259815,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/76259815','Wendy','Portland, OR','Ward and Wendy are retired educators who have lived in this fabulous neighborhood for over 20 years. We\'ve been renting our parents\' home across the park for the last 12, and enjoy getting other folks hooked on our hood!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b2f9004e-6a5c-4bf6-957c-7273bedd821b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5460298,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5460298','Whit','Washington, DC','I\'m a huge foodie (great way to build friendships), love listening to and playing music, getting outside to do something off the beaten path and taking long exposure night photography.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c251ef97-b2d4-47e1-bd3e-99ccf0e5a7df.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(34601684,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/34601684','Stephanie','Portland, OR','As a mom of three kids ages 5, 3 & 1, my work-from-home conversations sound like, “take that hot wheels car out of your yogurt cup.” Oslo, our hungry husky is always on toddler food clean up crew. When I’m not photographing weddings, families or brands, you can find me hiking to a PNW waterfall, camping with my favorite little backpackers, baking all the things, or snuggling on the couch with my hubby watching the office for the 500th time.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-34601684/original/3d4cb347-6751-43c2-ab5a-68935bd4ab8a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23545520,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23545520','Jia','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b427a379-1526-4308-b8ba-b44a5089a66c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(539403040,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/539403040','Cullen','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-539403040/original/c1029eb4-57d1-4741-8c61-da55d74ce20e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(68571913,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/68571913','Lacey','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-68571913/original/4298aa2b-ff5f-478c-bfd3-60e265f18a47.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56928924,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56928924','Ali','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ca5a615-7d76-4c2d-b3e6-e397d1b08e2a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23120473,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23120473','Katie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/2c59f071-c441-47eb-acf2-14fc54bd4edf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29156235,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29156235','Adinah','Portland, OR','I love to be physically active and to challenge myself, especially in dance and Acroyoga.\n\nI get the most joy from doing fun outdoor activities with people. I love being shown something I would have never found out on my own, and I love taking people on adventures. \n\nI do massage therapy and life coaching in Portland, Oregon. \n\nI am now a mom and, although it is challenging, love it so much!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-29156235/original/00b7d740-25c7-4e70-89b8-92a7802c5ae3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(196930510,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/196930510','Mindy','Portland, OR','I grew up in Oregon, and enjoy all of the outdoor PNW joys - hiking, camping, kayaking, and snowboarding, along with all the indoor joys as well - playing board games, drinking coffee and/or whiskey, and listening to the sound of rain from a cozy spot on the couch.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/ab7dc7f2-3912-4b21-9470-587632862dbf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20684802,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20684802','Anne','Cypress, CA','I realized I wasn\'t made for corporate America a few years after graduating from college. From that point, I decided that I would go as far and wide as possible. I moved to Beijing, China, by myself, and started a career in international marketing. My career has allowed me to live in Australia and Thailand throughout my 20s, which allowed me to visit over 30 countries during those years. \n\nNow, by day, I work as a product manager in the healthtech space. By night, I\'m working on a personal project, exploring a new restaurant or happy hour spot, or taking time to relax by practicing yoga or walking in the neighborhood. \n\nFor me, traveling is the secret sauce to creativity and growth. It allows us to see things from different perspectives and forces out of our comfort zone. How can we grow if nothing ever changes?',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c75ac9e9-d2ba-4ce2-9bab-4bfc4d320827.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23227876,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23227876','Isaiah','Austin, TX','Hi, I\'m Isaiah.  I\'m both a superhost (Portland OR and Austin TX) and avid traveler.  I love long walks, good food, and I\'m a social introvert.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/23227876/profile_pic/1414893409/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(540374904,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/540374904','Bradley','Portland, OR','Hello, We are Brad and Cori, your hosts. We moved to Portland 27 years ago from Minneapolis, and have been in our beautiful 1911 home for 17 years. Through our life we have lived and traveled extensively through out the world, Including 2 years living in Amsterdam, NL, and 3 years living in Jakarta, Indonesia. Between the two of us, we have traveled to over 75 different countries, and have explored almost every state. Hospitality is our pleasure.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d4a534d8-d3ee-4337-982a-092822814aa7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22827926,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22827926','Jennifer','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-22827926/original/0f1c46fd-e8b2-4602-84e7-0bcf46957b1c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18930985,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18930985','Hayley','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m Hayley. I was raised in Texas, spent some time in NYC, and have been loving life in Portland, OR for the past 6+ years. My partner and I recently bought our dream home that we share with our 2 young children and 2 pups. We listed our basement apartment in 2023 and we are excited to host guests. When we are not hosting, we love checking out other people\'s Airbnbs and exploring new destinations, particularly in the great outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-18930985/original/b6d6c46d-ad7b-4d8a-ba9b-1b723a4e2a9f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27645822,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27645822','Kuang-Chung','Portland, OR','Hope to travel more and appreciate the surprises during the trip.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-27645822/original/5e82678a-9db1-4802-8fd7-aa5959946c3a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(147133852,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/147133852','Natalya','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f11750c3-d3fa-4112-9eb5-2861ffe1ca94.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5728075,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5728075','Elizabeth','Portland, OR','I’m an artist and designer. .',1,'https://a0.muscach