ything it has to offer. We are proud to welcome you to our beautiful and historic victorian queen ann home built in 1892!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/33439d38-5fff-4da2-a90e-8ea8c24c16d7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(309962671,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/309962671','Courtney','Portland, OR','Hello there! My name is Courtney. I am from the PNW and love showing people my city. I try and get outdoors every weekend! I hope you have an amazing day! Please don\'t be shy to ask any questions. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/175c2f84-dcff-4eff-a086-76f5876bc85c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5722606,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5722606','Sandra','Portland, OR','I am a semi-retired business owner who grew up in a Portland and spent my childhood exploring the backwoods of the great state of Oregon.  I love escaping to the the mountain for a quick ski weekend or soaking up the sun in the California desert.  \r\n  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5722606/profile_pic/1364857709/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(451514691,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/451514691','David','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/15a7b28e-775c-43b9-9954-46622ef0e594.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33316274,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33316274','Matt','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/601a9b53-d0a8-4083-9550-8c4e756901a6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15443948,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15443948','Michaela','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is Michaela and I live in Portland, OR with my husband Alex, our sweet and busy toddler Naomi, and our cuddly dog Hank.  We love exploring all of Portland\'s neighborhoods and food scenes - and strive to do the same when away from home.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eb74b6eb-8794-49e9-af7d-ec4708159269.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8106668,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8106668','Gina','Portland, OR','We live part-time in Portland, Oregon with our two Labradoodles, (David) Bowie and Eddie (Vedder). We split our time between here and Bend, OR, enjoying the best of both worlds. We love traveling and exploring new places with furbabies. We look forward to welcoming you to Portland!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/befa4d69-5740-409f-abbe-dcc62e3edcac.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19786705,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19786705','Bert','Malibu, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/19786705/profile_pic/1407691392/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1094944,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1094944','Sara','Portland, OR','Native Portlander in the food & beverage industry. Happy to provide suggestions & recommendations throughout the city & beyond.  Portland has a host of wonderful art galleries, parks, restaurants, bars, shopping, museums, wineries, breweries, wine country, independent bookstores, movie theaters, outdoor stores & plenty of outdoor activities & festivals year round.  Social, outgoing & love to travel.  Happy to have you stay.  Cheers!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-1094944/original/3d9c7b5a-41a0-43dc-bfaa-5b3436e4511d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(544788956,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/544788956','Zachary','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(48325865,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/48325865','Clay','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-48325865/original/f4e81b0f-2504-4842-83a4-3fa64a88baa0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(55659355,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/55659355','Brielle','Portland, OR','I\'m an adventurer, living in PDX and traveling the world!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/cb36f1d1-fae3-4685-99f9-2a7500e0c5c5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(285147,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/285147','Wildwood Collective','Vermont, United States','Wildwood Collective is a curated collection of unique Airbnb homes and experiences created by Lauren and Chris Krieger, a husband-and-wife team of adventurers. Inspired by our own travels, we created the Collective to offer unique vacation destinations for those looking to reconnect with nature all while enjoying the comforts of home. We currently live in VT with our three wildly lovable German Shorthaired Pointers. Hope to host you soon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/02a8c917-57bc-4571-94c2-6098d86b14ea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(104330986,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/104330986','Evy','Portland, OR','I am a nature and dog loving small business owner. I have lived in Portland for 24 years and am originally from Maryland. My background is in Wildlife Science and Women Studies. I love Portland and love making recommendations, so hit me up!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e93095f2-ecd0-4c6e-999f-04c501ac63a2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1150087,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1150087','Elisabeth','Portland, OR','We travel as a couple, sometimes with our college-age son, and often with our extended family. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1150087/profile_pic/1316202030/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(378901,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/378901','Victoria Yia Wei','Portland, OR','I am originally from Taiwan.  Lived in US, Vancouver, Canada, Taipei and Beijing.  Loves travelling and meeting people from different cultures.  Favorite destinations: Iceland, India, Africa.\n\nMy interests are good food, photography, dancing, and just chilling at home.  I used work in tech but now enjoying the artistic side of things being an interior designer and a florist.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/86aac617-f007-472d-ad05-1bb8680ce238.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(545874741,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/545874741','Shelley','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/74e2b382-5303-4724-8070-2f6c75aa2ab4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6048666,'https:/