aveling physical therapist. Settled in Portland, OR. In my free time, you can find me outdoors enjoying the majestic PNW!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f35cf8f1-12cf-48b2-a779-20d11f9c95f9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(546492960,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/546492960','Hospitality','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/28afe2c4-6f06-42a5-9569-6906d223e97a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(428157777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/428157777','Tadele','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(25690568,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25690568','Michael','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/25690568/profile_pic/1420564548/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26873626,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26873626','Jaime','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d7e6b0b5-eeb0-4312-a842-6da0491215ed.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(345143977,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/345143977','Natanael','Portland, OR','Hello, I am Nathan and have been local to Portland for over 2 decades. I enjoy home remodel and design and have loved remodeling my home for traveling guests.\n\nI hope you have a great time exploring Portland while you are here!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-345143977/original/52021635-8511-4936-8fc5-5a9dffc34d61.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4691790,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4691790','Matthew','','Family guy working from home. I\'m a coach and my partner is a facilitator. We like projects and company. Please come stay!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(83088925,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/83088925','Julie','Portland, OR','I love traveling, surfing, singing and working as a CPA! Welcome to our airbnb, we hope you enjoy it!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-83088925/original/a80265bc-d7ab-4ec3-bce6-e6a0a517910b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(424871150,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/424871150','Tiana','Portland, OR','Hello friends! Im Tiana! I enjoy anything that involves makeup and fashion, i\'m a super girly girl with a side of hippy. I am plant-based and enjoy trying out plant based eateries which we have a lot here in portland! You can find me at the farmers markets on sundays or picking out flowers at trader joes.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-424871150/original/f2e86a5e-9ecd-4c20-8a57-e4c33806b960.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21064444,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21064444','Amanda','Portland, OR','My Name is Amanda and have lived in NE Portland for over 20 years. I love Portland especially NE. I have a small dog who is very friendly. I have used Air B & B in my travels and I enjoy being a part of this community.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/21064444/profile_pic/1431570822/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(199362727,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/199362727','Tedros','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6049c6ab-eb64-4680-9652-2cc49276a5b7.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5887595,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5887595','Anne','Portland, OR','Lover of snow and the great outdoors!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5887595/original/47d311f7-0d06-4975-a49e-02b86e493ffe.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44542145,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44542145','Shawna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/44542145/profile_pic/1442632057/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(155841507,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/155841507','Andrew','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e364c8e0-a3db-4662-8331-753b2b9176b4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(27232037,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/27232037','Ryan','Portland, OR','As a profession, I am an educator. When I am not teaching, I am an outdoor and activity enthusiast. My partner Scott and I enjoy being outdoors, experiencing what life has to offer.\r\nAlong those lines, we enjoy skiing/snowboarding, mountain climbing/hiking/biking, trail running, river rafting, fishing in oceans and rivers, traveling and meeting new people, and most of all; living life to the fullest.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d40f4178-b644-4f54-ad84-5ac3957ff8ca.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63116772,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63116772','Beth','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-63116772/original/173f8dd3-a334-4299-9974-b10c2752e1b5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114037020,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114037020','Paul','Mount Hood Village, OR','Corporate lawyer and former Army officer. I grew up in Portland and graduated from Andrew Jackson High School in 1982 (the last year it was a high school).',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2bc444f7-daeb-433d-a226-e44b7d75ddfd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(550374755,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/550374755','Kealii','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e7b02cc2-d7b5-40bb-af96-c52156a0b00d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(550583144,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/550583144','Ken','Portland, OR','I am a professional photographer for wedding or modeling shoots.  My job requires me to travel a lot.  I have stayed in a lot of Airbnb’s in different cities. I would love sharing my space with you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-550583144/original/45ed450f-be76-4323-bf24-c21cd6e5fbd5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(107434423,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/107434423','Blueground','New York, NY','We’re Blueground, a global proptech company with several thousand move-in-ready apartments in a growing number of major cities around the world. With flexible terms and homes in vibrant, centrally based neighborhoods, you’ll feel at home and free to roam for as long as you want — a month, a year, or longer. \n\nEach apartment is thoughtfully designed with exclusive furnishings, fully equipped kitchens, and incredible amenities – making every day a five-star experience. From day one, you’ll enjoy high-speed Wi-Fi, premium linens, and smart home entertainment. Plus, access to pools, gyms, and outdoor spaces in select buildings.\n\nWhy stress over your apartment? We provide a hassle-free alternative — a consistent, quality guest experience that starts even before you arrive. Because we let you book our most up-to-date apartment listings online, confirm with a click, pay securely, and check in easily. \n\nEven better? You can enhance your stay with car rentals, grocery delivery, laundry services, and more through our special partnerships. \n\nDuring your stay\nUpon arrival, you’ll either be greeted personally by a Blueground team member or given self-check-in instructions. The entire apartment is yours! You’ll enjoy reliable support via email, phone, and our Guest App, where you can request everything from a home cleaning to extra towels. \n\nWe’ll share all details upon confirmation of your stay.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d0ad9599-6fc0-4be6-865e-ffe99142517c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(209964089,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/209964089','Jessica','Vancouver, WA','Hi there, we are a local Real Estate brokerage and short term rental company, licensed in WA/OR/CA. We love making our guests feel at home in any of our properties. If you have any questions regarding our properties and the area, I’m only a text away!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7f79162c-a657-4c15-8d4f-1201c1b490b9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(20033141,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/20033141','Ryan Carter','Portland, OR','Creative individual living in Portland, Oregon. Looking to explore the parts of the world I have yet to see. I am very laid back and quiet, tend to keep to myself. I love the small & simple things in life, prefer to stay somewhere not in the middle of all the action. If I want excitement, I will go find it. :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ab7bc669-b64b-4b5a-bdd3-515be1e48821.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31006771,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31006771','Matthew','Redmond, OR','As an Oregon native I can help you find all the hidden treasures of Central Oregon and any other part of Oregon for that matter.  I\'m more than happy to help you organize day trips and/or take you out and about to see some of the wonderful things around us.  Have a question, here I am, ask away.   ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1b81e51a-b4f5-4758-916b-fdbeef98757d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5181286,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5181286','Thomas','Portland, OR','Portland Oregon',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5181286/profile_pic/1410394065/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(107286245,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/107286245','Marta','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3a285fa5-d2e6-4761-802e-e99ec402bc7f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132230840,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132230840','Jacquie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-132230840/original/370c18fe-0d3d-42fa-88a2-6d44054d783d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17505595,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17505595','Elliott','Portland, OR','I work as an ER doctor in rural Minnesota.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c0b65a3-6eda-4b3b-8830-67c106dbc788.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38041116,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38041116','Jessica','Portland, OR','Hi there, \n\nI believe in a sustainable and kind life, respecting everything and everyone around me. \n\nWhen I’m not working, you can find me outside exploring the Pacific Northwest. \n\nI’m an Airbnb super user. I spent the pandemic on a long road trip, staying at Airbnbs across the country, so I understand what you\'re looking for both in a guest and a home!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/38041116/profile_pic/1438733578/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(552766988,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/552766988','Joey','Portland, OR','Hello - welcome to my family’s home. We are a family of J’s - Joey, Jess and June! We love staying active (gymnastics, ballet, working out) and eating healthy, sushi being our favorite. \n\nWe own a home staging and furniture company that serves the Portland metro. We take pride in creating spaces that are tastefully designed, but, most importantly, inviting & comfortable.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-552766988/original/d75e6e29-5cc1-44a9-8290-e9abee092016.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44524705,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44524705','Jeffrey','Portland, OR','Through the years, I have used Airbnb for travels all over the world, eventually meeting my wife and starting a family in my hometown - Portland, Oregon.  As travelers first, we experienced first hand what makes a rental feel like home, and we hope you\'ll feel at home while staying in our place.\n\nI speak English & Spanish, though translating apps are so good these days, choose any language and we\'ll make it work.  :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/44524705/profile_pic/1442687036/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9811187,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9811187','Alan','Portland, OR','Hi! I grew up in the US (Alabama). I am a web developer in digital marketing, and work in construction. I enjoy traveling, philosophy, tennis, snow skiing, reading, working with kids at church, backpacking, and more. I\'m a very clean and simple person when it comes to living.\n\nMy motto? Do unto others as you would have them do unto you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-9811187/original/327f4c3a-0c30-4f82-888b-c6ca6d70ae64.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9052047,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9052047','Julien','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9052047/profile_pic/1380324023/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39825650,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39825650','Wendy','Portland, OR','I LOVE Portland! I love to eat, drink and be merry! SE Portland is my home and I can\'t wait to introduce you to all it has to offer!\r\n\r\nWelcome!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/39825650/profile_pic/1438526891/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21238112,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21238112','Shannon','Portland, OR','Arizona transplant living in the Gorgeous PNW. When I\'m not providing outstanding customer service to my guests, I enjoy spending time with my three adorable pomskies, checking out new restaurants and traveling with my husband and our friends.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/19021a2e-2500-4b70-9674-0fef63de550a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21189128,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21189128','Charissa','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7477e722-7d1a-4c56-af27-7de476ef5b27.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(529320812,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/529320812','Louis','','',0,'https://z0.muscache.cn/im/pictures/user/8de2d0f1-064a-471a-aebf-ce6df4ab8224.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(17566672,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/17566672','John','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-17566672/original/674456e5-4947-46e9-85e9-5f9955f71808.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60370460,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60370460','Ramona','Portland, OR','My husband John and I found this 2.5 acre gem after living 9 yrs in Portland’s Pearl District. After 10 yrs of work developing our urban lavender farm we are ready to welcome guests to stay here at Sunderland Acres. Our sweet farm crew, Jack & Emily (miniature donkeys)  Fern & Clover (Holland Lop bunnies) Clementine & Maggie (babydoll sheep) & Daisy (Suffolk lamb) and Jasper (our feral kitty), are all ready to make your stay a very memorable one.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-60370460/original/b4ac0800-5e31-4452-b714-9ae6177342be.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12337434,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12337434','Max','Charlotte, NC','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6c9ba2f3-c3d0-4c52-8a90-d85d7181e643.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(554673566,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/554673566','Mike And Ashley','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9932740c-a298-49db-b5d7-9551fbb6a4bb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(424626768,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/424626768','Tracy','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/41034950-51c9-4541-b75b-f726184efd4d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2470117,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2470117','Brenda','Portland, OR','Hi I\'m Brenda, a Portland local—yes, there are a few of us still around! I’m grateful to call this city home and love getting to share it with others.\n\nWhen I\'m not hiking, reading, hanging out with my family, doing a creative project, discovering new restaurants, or fixing up old buildings, I work as a Realtor. Helping people find their new home is thrilling, especially in Portland, where each neighborhood is unique.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2470117/original/dd14e842-0f6d-4bdc-82bf-7e1c32ee4733.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12668677,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12668677','Lurelle','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is Lurelle, I have just returned from 24 days visiting Central America and staying at AIR BNB\'s.  I hope your stay here in Portland will be as enjoyable as our many hospitable places were.  I may be traveling some in which case you will chat and meet Linda.\r\n\r\nI\'ve lived here in Portland for 13 years. I love the culture, food, friendliness, and energy of the city.   I enjoy walking out my front door and in 20 minutes I can be in the forest or in the city center, at the Rose Gardens or sitting in a fine restaurant. It all depends on which way you turn out the front door.\r\n\r\nWhen traveling, I like to visit the beautiful cities across the United States and around the world. I enjoy the livable and walkable neighborhoods, eating in nice restaurants, exploring  and buying chocolate.  My favorite trips include Mexico beaches, The Grand Tetons, a small town BBQ in Texas, Italy, Norway and many others .\r\n\r\nMy other interests include: walking, hiking, yoga, reading, cooking, and travel .  I have learned some Spanish on the beaches of Mexico and  working in the back of an ambulance along the Mexico/California border.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d0f86198-22a4-414f-bc62-62040dd86a9f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(61936045,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/61936045','Etty','Portland, OR','Hi,\n\nI am an Occupational therapist who used to do a lot of travel work so I am familiar with sharing my space with others. I now work full time near Portland and love the area for hiking and exploring.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e48955df-2f72-4549-bb04-8a0d670558b3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(156806237,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/156806237','Lisa','Portland, OR','Hi there! My name is Lisa. I live in Portland and work for a youth organization. I also do facilitation, specifically around racial equity work. I love cooking, spending time with the people I love, hanging with my cute cairn terrier, and learning.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6456e20-8191-4405-8535-b5819b27ed49.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(263502162,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/263502162','Landing','San Francisco, CA','Landing is a membership-based network of furnished, flexible-lease apartments across the country in in 375+ cities. Each Landing is thoughtfully designed and includes essential homewares. Each unit is professionally managed and includes 24/7 customer support. Whether you are staying for 1 night or 3 months, rest assured, we\'re here for you.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1567535f-99cd-4c14-95b3-2bb134463ebf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13838016,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13838016','Julie Adrianna','Portland, OR','I am a traveling dog trainer, artist and person in general. I live in Portland. I like to leave the homes just as I found them. I love tacos,  Fried chicken, nature walks, Zumba, sci-fi movies or TV and Krav Maga. I always travel with my pets for work or for my anxiety. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/0fd287f5-42cc-4b05-83dc-a6cf47a850ad.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(556708963,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/556708963','Mekuria','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/19178767-6cf9-457a-a598-3441ec7f87f6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18842072,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18842072','Grant','Santa Barbara, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d5a81c9b-fc31-4950-861b-660c83bb6f88.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(498770647,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/498770647','Paul','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f501eb58-3aef-462b-96d7-96885dc81ab3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25081175,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25081175','James','Sebastopol, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/bdc7f604-eb95-47d8-8489-4647ece4ba74.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59478478,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59478478','Claudia','Portland, OR','Since my early 20\'s  I\'ve  enjoyed traveling the world staying in hostels because I really think it\'s a great way to expose yourself to the world. I feel so lucky that now I\'m able to do the same for other travelers. I couldn\'t imagine doing this without my partner, Boone. Together we created this lovely space we call home now. We both love connecting with people, gardening, travel and outdoor adventures. There are still so many places left on our bucket list. Hope to meet you soon and learn from your experiences.\r\nBoone will tell you more about himself later or when you meet him. Just ask him about book recommendations, politics or mustache waxes and you\'ll surely strike up an interesting conversation. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/200f3c68-fc13-4de4-ae10-5af141b0da0d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10463034,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10463034','Alisha','Sacramento, CA','Hi!\n\nI\'m originally from Hawaii, but now I live in Sacramento, CA.\n\nI\'m a military helicopter pilot and enjoy traveling to new places, mostly in my van. \n\nI also have my home listed on AirBnB while I travel. So I understand being both a guest and a host :-)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd441a01-2400-4b73-aba7-e85cf50b1d9e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18687988,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18687988','Diana','Portland, OR','Hi - We\'re Diana and Mak. Excited to welcome you to one of our favorite cities! You can usually catch us traveling, enjoying happy hour on a patio, or cheering on our local Portland Thorns soccer team. We\'ve got all the best recommendations for whatever vibe you\'re looking for!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-18687988/original/e1f80b97-5c2f-4647-913d-82073b455b11.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(373393835,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/373393835','Alessandra','Portland, OR','Hi world! My name is Alessandra. I am a Portland native. I love kiteboarding and chasing sunsets. If you have any questions about Portland, please don\'t be shy to ask!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6255b190-dee9-4b65-9cea-0f6e4a40fbf2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(203913060,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/203913060','Hailey','Portland, OR','I am originally from the south, but I love living in the PNW now! I am currently studying to become a nurse! Feel free to ask away any questions you have about Portland :)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/04034eec-223b-4513-9afd-29746d2ac3c1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(113868705,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/113868705','Darise','Portland, OR','I was born in the great city of Portland! Airbnb has introduced me to such amazing people!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/de08d8cd-9d41-4d53-b353-ccef9f16589f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(208515091,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/208515091','Robert','Portland, OR','I am a friendly guy that loves to travel and find new places to eat, drink, and be merry! My life motto is \"to thy own self be true.\" Happy to be a part of the Airbnb community and look forward to traveling the world and meeting new people along the way. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee7b0c46-c487-41a8-95bf-4f9a92d2a5bb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24461064,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24461064','Bree','Portland, OR','Hi, I am a nurse in the bustling city of Portland, Oregon\r\nSome info about me: \r\n5 things I can\'t live without:\r\n1) Coffee\r\n2) Good Friends\r\n3) Long walks in the forest\r\n4) My family\r\n5) My cat\r\n\r\nI look forward to meeting you and am grateful for your booking!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-24461064/original/cf9fcc14-7810-4bf6-a19f-fbf668aed0c7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(210156506,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/210156506','Chris','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-210156506/original/c13a9f1e-35d2-43a3-94be-0532625294f6.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4490212,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4490212','Jeremy','Los Angeles, CA','Single working professional who lives between LA and Portland, OR',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-4490212/original/c8ca1e4a-ea38-4c1d-996f-574225714120.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32262937,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32262937','Austin','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Austin; I live in Portland following an 8-year stint in Seattle. I’m on the lookout for nature, great food, good people, and new experiences when I travel.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e7b5a9e9-2522-41d9-b956-34a2dbf1b32a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38402006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38402006','Remi','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-38402006/original/555fc2ae-21ee-403d-a6da-f62b5ac7ab80.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5650853,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5650853','Bianca','Portland, OR','I grew up in Tucson, Arizona where I went to the University of Arizona (Go Wildcats).  \n- I\'m very family orientated and grew up with a large family. \n- I\'m a mom to a newborn daughter and a wife to an Irish man from Belfast.\n- I enjoy practicing yoga and going for a walk around our neighborhood.Sitting on the front porch and drinking coffee. \n- I speak Spanish & Portuguese.I\'ve traveled to 26 countries and hope to add some more on my list.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-5650853/original/75713861-ee90-4a92-8b8b-b24d1c4cc2bd.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(43620911,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/43620911','Janine','Portland, OR','CA native who\'s made a home and family in Portland, OR since 2004. My property is co-hosted with my partner Izzy.',1,'https://z0.muscache.cn/im/pictures/user/User-43620911/original/db8a4bc6-37ed-4e17-91d4-a91d0a9395b0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(561398399,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/561398399','Andrea','','Hello, my name is Jessy and my team and I are hosting this property on behalf of Andrea. We are your local hosts and are here to make sure your stay is unforgettable in the best way!\n\n** This listing has a 5 Star rating but we recently had to move it to a new account and unfortunately Airbnb doesn\'t allow the reviews to transfer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-561398399/original/6fb9f71d-fd7b-4662-a884-2faf29ac713a.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(12828580,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/12828580','Sarah','Portland, OR','I\'m a native Oregonian and a traveler at heart. I love creating things with my hands - whether that\'s through cooking, gardening, knitting, or sewing. I grew up near Multnomah Village in Portland, Oregon and now enjoy hosting others from our home in the same area.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/12828580/profile_pic/1430457728/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(562070728,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/562070728','Villa','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(121897264,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/121897264','Thomas','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-121897264/original/733d9180-4684-44e6-b319-e70414ff0367.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(149635641,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/149635641','Anna','Central Point, OR','I\'m very easy going & get along with most anyone.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c23fe883-c933-4bc5-870b-3b9248b2e736.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1176730,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1176730','Paolo','Florence, Italy','I am an Italian/American living in Florence Italy with my French wife. We raised our two now grown-up kids here and now that they are out of the house, we dedicate time to travel and hosting guests at either our country house La Buca, or here in Florence. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5de16020-157e-4d61-87a7-df57cf3b9013.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29871450,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29871450','Marshall','Camas, WA','Hi, I\'m Marshall and that little guy in the picture with me is my son Gus. We are very excited to start hosting folk in our awesome little house while we go camping on weekends and spend summers in my native Alaska.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f76bec84-5746-443c-af17-42f60f2f8361.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(489775282,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/489775282','Kristi','Austin, TX','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c0021f6b-5895-4de2-a02a-3322ec3427fd.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3260464,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3260464','Jonathan','Portland, OR','PDX. Love music and the outdoors.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5c7e26a2-64dd-4b28-8617-84213f839af0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(563281325,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/563281325','Moxy Portland Downtown','','Moxy Portland Downtown is located in the West End Downtown district, bordered by the Pearl & Culture districts, and just steps away from downtown Portland\'s amazing tax-free shopping. You\'ll be tempted to stay out on the town during your visit, but will be quickly pulled back into the vibe of the hotel when you walk through the front door.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-563281325/original/faff85e0-9a71-4de4-93cd-f0ddce8c8671.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(261804158,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/261804158','Taylor','Portland, OR','Hi I’m Taylor! I’m 29 years old and have been calling Portland home for almost 7 years now. I live with my boyfriend Jimmy and our little dog Tuna who has become our whole life.\n\nI work remotely doing marketing for a nonprofit and try to get outdoors as much as possible! You\'ll find me at a local dog park, rollerblading, playing pickleball or finding a hot tub and cold plunge. If you ever need food/activity recommendations, I\'m your gal!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d3690919-0fd7-4bd8-b64a-ccc6777b42e2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(563993949,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/563993949','Felicia','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-563993949/original/a369bea2-38b5-4b86-814b-9a5d0cd4f756.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2401950,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2401950','Alley','Portland, OR','Queer web engineer and writer who loves to cycle and travel. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f951f7d3-a8c2-4039-837b-a4605814d876.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11334723,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11334723','Chris','Portland, OR','Hey!\r\nI\'m a music lover, an engineer/designer, and a home chef.\r\nI always keep my apartment super put together.  A clean home is a happy home!  \r\n\r\nTravel is a big part of who I am.  I try to do at least 1 international trip per year. \r\n\r\nEstoy un hablante de Espanol intermedio\r\n\r\nOne of my favorite quotes is from Wade Davis:\r\n\"The world in which you were born is just one model of reality. Other cultures are not failed attempts at being you; they are unique manifestations of the human spirit.\"\r\n\r\n',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3eafe806-bb76-49fd-82a8-b52f796ac563.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(558047525,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/558047525','The Bidwell Marriott Portland','','The Bidwell is a boutique hotel in downtown Portland Oregon, offering guests easy access to Oregon tax-free shopping and attractions like Providence Park, Multnomah Falls, and the Pearl District. We\'re located in Portland\'s Living Room: restaurants and bars are right around the corner, along with parks and outdoor spaces for endless entertainment.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-558047525/original/c4fa5013-717e-49ef-95f4-55ff8824becf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(540946370,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/540946370','Sue','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-540946370/original/1265db6b-164e-464c-9e1d-35b64d04f376.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(18223920,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/18223920','Sophie','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a1a5ee6-8956-4710-b3bd-01b40a322df8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60223816,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60223816','Sara','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-60223816/original/4c230e34-c0dc-4b72-85ef-17c994c03eab.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15042017,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15042017','Edwina','Portland, OR','Excited to meet you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/532b6ab0-cd08-4ba5-ad6e-1ade11056da9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7548435,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7548435','Michelle','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dd5f3503-cd81-4d8f-b66f-5e879c1b1e9e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10368260,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10368260','Cara','Portland, OR','I like to travel, read, start projects and not finish them, and eat cheese (I was a cheese seller in Chicago). I\'m passionate about community and carbs.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a73bab90-72b6-4266-8e24-44481771ba3e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132726838,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132726838','Wayne','Newark, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c7cd65a5-cef2-4c83-a89e-716596b13ea3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(47299013,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/47299013','Sinéad','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e79d8f07-d440-4586-9cd2-a27259e38656.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(499873467,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/499873467','Faith','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-499873467/original/015e6137-251b-418c-b20c-1738f4186871.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19133557,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19133557','Kidest','Lake Oswego, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/afcb9aa0-e794-4b18-aaff-6aa84402f8ea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(63249978,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/63249978','Samantha','Portland, OR','Frequent traveler for work and school, but love to still cook for myself when on the road.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/22d3663c-576e-41fe-8804-ea5a850e2c84.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9605653,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9605653','Alma','Portland, OR','UX designer in love with traveling.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/9605653/profile_pic/1382587171/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(62789472,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/62789472','Ariel','Portland, OR','We live in Portland, Oregon with our two striped cats, Bento and Clarice.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-62789472/original/0896de99-ef23-478b-9ada-bf192ad6d97b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(89568523,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/89568523','Lindsay','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ec5d5cf-f33b-477b-b426-74c8925ea0d9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10330653,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10330653','Kristen','Portland, OR','Hi, I\'m an East Coaster who moved to Portland more than twenty years ago. I love the outdoors, especially hiking, camping, skiing, and stand-up paddleboarding. Living in the West Hills of Portland is a dream come true, and I\'m thrilled to share my beautiful home and neighborhood with guests.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1068bea0-27d2-4a36-a80a-bc1583c56111.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4847328,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4847328','Sarah','Portland, OR','A love for adventures & creating beautiful spaces for people. \nInterior Designers + Home staging in Portland, OR. \n\nCheck out who we are more on our website. \n :)\nhttp.// (Website hidden by Airbnb)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/bf825edf-4643-40b7-8b9f-de7e407d78da.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(332266235,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/332266235','Dan','','We like traveling',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-332266235/original/8a84b9f1-f5b9-4350-b0d9-9c3a25aea99b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(367248748,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/367248748','Mike','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/b0c08676-aa6c-4f0d-b47b-bdce752bfe80.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(267863188,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/267863188','Katherine','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-267863188/original/b9b673fe-5dc3-4476-ba6f-6747d1957a88.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(567828185,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/567828185','Matthew','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(8333670,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8333670','Lora','Los Angeles, CA','Originally from Europe, I am laid back and enjoy a great conversation, music and the arts. I joined Airbnb because I secretly dream of opening my own bed and breakfast one day. I spent my teens and twenties traveling the world and my stays in hostels and the people I met there have left a lasting impression. I look forward to welcoming you. Good natured and responsible travelers from all over the world, welcome!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/da3b60b7-2822-497c-b636-086120f48cde.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(50747753,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/50747753','Jimena','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/91895976-3ebf-4b9a-a7d0-d2842241f477.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(133384876,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/133384876','Tara','Tulsa, OK','Hello! I’m a Realtor from Tulsa, Oklahoma! I love traveling when I get a chance, which isn’t as often as I’d like. My hobbies include reading, gardening, hiking, outdoor adventures (like kayaking and snorkeling!) and spending quality time with friends. I also LOVE cats. I am open minded and inquisitive. I am absolutely, positively a non-smoker. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/41e8a39d-b8fe-4149-ace7-5bdb915b6a5b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75969980,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75969980','Anh','','I am originally from Vietnam and have stayed in America since 2009. I come here for studying, love  to travel and travel with family is my top pleasure. \r\nTravel means to learn something new and meet new people. Also, travel and stay in American homes means being apart of their family and exchange cross-culture. I love to experience new things and make friends to new people.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/4e3af020-79f5-4483-a612-3673a4ca0209.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(60374968,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60374968','Guy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ea06477e-9885-4675-ad04-ffb7a9536051.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(40231311,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/40231311','Michael','Portland, OR','I\'m an artist from Portland, OR, Baja, and the Gorge. I\'ve managed AirBnBs for several years, but I\'m new to having my face on the profile.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-40231311/original/b3b49e47-f275-41fc-9002-c26c5d119bff.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(569132554,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/569132554','Park Lane Suites Inn','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fd70050a-ed6c-42ce-9204-778925d27608.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39653154,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39653154','Kendall','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5ac68cc9-405c-4e96-b06b-2ed7b8b7d48b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(421805892,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/421805892','Preston','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(37615397,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/37615397','Kayla','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-37615397/original/e702485c-6f55-4040-ad1c-fa4daceeaf6b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2498133,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2498133','Sakina','Portland, OR','Work in venture capital. I was an OG Airbnb host in Seattle and San Francisco for many years. I love to travel and try to visit a new country every year. I\'m obsessed with food, dogs and lifting weights.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-2498133/original/1a9541a9-7157-4007-bcd4-638f852e5baf.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(473872760,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/473872760','Kristy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eaaf9253-eeac-4ac4-a245-5fa47b04ac42.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(78533154,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/78533154','Barbara','','Retired couple with 2-3 dogs .We do rescue so the number can change at anytime!  We love this town , having lived here for 40 years we know the area well.\nThat is my intro for my Eugene rental. I live down in Eugene - in Portland my tenant has been with me for 10 years. She lives with her adult daughter and her daughter’s wife.  \nThey have 4 little chihuahua mixes and they have their own yard with no access to your little yard.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/70e96fb9-1323-480c-8ee5-3f6f3aa32cd4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(493660370,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/493660370','Darin','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d48bcd84-6b78-4df8-b513-9542f50dd814.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(122948453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/122948453','Zach','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/136d1e6a-0e98-4142-8061-82a5f98559af.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(395535389,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/395535389','Stephanie','Portland, OR','Lived in Portland for 47 years, semi-retired. Worked in family pottery business and outside that too,  putter around in art, sewing, crafting, gardening  movies, games,  hand-drumming, neighborhood and park walks with my dogs, playing with my cats.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3bbf2419-48bb-42b5-bda6-ba948b3776bc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(562929837,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/562929837','Mark Spencer Hotel','','Opened in 1907 as the Nortonia Hotel, the property became a hit with traveling theatre performers & celebrities looking for a stylish hotel close to the city’s theatre district. The hotel was rebranded in 1966 & renamed Mark Spencer Hotel, still retaining its intention to act as a home away from home for artists, performers, tourists, & business travelers looking to enjoy well-appointed accommodations, excellent services,& an unbeatable location.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/68078b94-fd38-4995-a7b4-93ed85f95b9b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33397453,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33397453','Maggie','Portland, OR','Hi there, I\'m Maggie, I live in Portland, OR with my two adorable tabby cats. I\'ve lived in many places including Chicago, New York City and now call Portland home. I\'m a classical homeopath, flower essence practitioner and herbalist. I see clients and run a botanical online apothecary making flower essences and tallow based skincare. I enjoy going to the local farmer\'s market, trying new restaurants, being outdoors and travel.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-33397453/original/24c99399-151b-45fb-bb0a-79b4f614bdff.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(419836336,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/419836336','Orion','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-419836336/original/ccb07abe-c075-44c4-954f-9dc2798516d9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(872359,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/872359','Isaac','Portland, OR','Former resident of Augsburg, Stuttgart, New York City, Philadelphia and currently Portland, OR. Builder of software for a professional sports league, and general tinkerer. Recently completed renovating my basement which I’m pleased to share with travelers coming to Portland!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/c7011db5-37f4-46be-b8fb-b0cd09a5040d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25561,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25561','Ariane','Portland, OR','Ariane and Kent. We travel often and now in the company of our two boys. Kent travels for work 1-2 times per month. Portland, OR is home where we also host travelers on Airbnb in our ADU.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-25561/original/b151a4a8-89a8-4a95-8bca-f2e869afe20a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(385154341,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/385154341','Marcos','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f164c272-f967-4da8-9f21-704a1863043d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(125873825,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/125873825','Benjamin','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1261584-8b7a-4c26-a954-5a2e73b2467c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(338977,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/338977','Helen','Portland, OR','I\'m Australian-born, US naturalized.  I\'ve been in Portland since 2004 so it feels like home now.  It’s been a while since I rented our apartment on AirBnB (that’s why the reviews are old). I\'m getting back to hosting as I’m a nearly empty nester. One son is in college in Melbourne, Australia, and the other is thinking of going there when he graduates high school.  And I’ll get to visit!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-338977/original/74a69070-60b9-499a-bd4f-cc8292d5fee6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(214513900,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/214513900','James','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-214513900/original/f5bdca05-6dc3-45a5-b90f-f64cc21e1d5a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(179379371,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/179379371','Becca','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef77a89b-febe-43a9-9a34-ea600d564d39.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(253123241,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/253123241','Dave','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-253123241/original/5cace4e5-c933-430e-81e4-d878acfe5e4d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21334909,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21334909','Brandi','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21334909/original/b8d82f3a-3202-4b76-b208-dea3dd671eed.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(271096946,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/271096946','Lou','Beaverton, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-271096946/original/5c62b9c4-7198-447f-97b1-16f37d47a4de.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(301247738,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/301247738','Tyler','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-301247738/original/dea86b13-da07-4872-808a-ef0638ee3d1b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(573243587,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/573243587','Sonia Marie','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/740c883f-70c5-42cf-b9af-acaabe069006.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(22568116,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/22568116','Nellie','Portland, OR','Love to travel and experience new things. Obsessed with food and love a good brewski. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b7700628-59fb-4569-af81-8af209250d0f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(2676892,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/2676892','David','Portland, OR','From Portland, OR.  Other than my favorite city, I like to travel in general.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/2676892/profile_pic/1340079512/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(462140560,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/462140560','Shaunita','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/33e78879-586c-41ab-bdd4-ee2664b63492.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4732860,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4732860','Jing','Portland, OR','I am a mother of 3 boys. I was originally born and raised in Beijing China. \nFor most of my career life, I had been working in E-commerce and mobile application making. Now I run my own startup focusing on parent education.\nI am a diver, and a cycler. I am fascinated by new technologies and love to meet interesting people.\nI hope I could be that person to bring good experience to your travel too.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7cc7eb0c-d292-4cf4-8f68-42d47b4379d5.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132257876,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132257876','Andy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-132257876/original/4ebd6da0-2ddb-4062-a4c3-c6551c586267.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(522779263,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/522779263','Lacey','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-522779263/original/074204ea-03d6-4321-8f5a-deec2e166d9f.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1922050,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1922050','Natalie','Victor, ID','I am a journalist, the mother of a border collie, a reader of books, aspiring bird-watcher. I jog and do yoga some days, and other days I sit on my  porch and drink beer with my pals. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/1922050/profile_pic/1440916241/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(126192938,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/126192938','Chantel & Mackenzie','Portland, OR','We are two good friends & business partners living in Portland, Oregon! Together we help our friends, who can\'t be around full time, run successful Airbnb rentals and we love every minute of it! Being stellar co-hosts and helping our guests have the best possible Portland experience is our mission! ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/a22493dd-7b5f-4a38-92d5-a9bcd823654f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(146505239,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/146505239','Nelson','Portland, OR','I have passion for technology and I like working with numbers.  I enjoy hosting people.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-146505239/original/285cdbe9-1595-475c-a944-cbf6a2f42652.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32636156,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32636156','Stacey','Portland, OR','I am a small business owner of a Spanish Immersion preschool in Portland, Oregon and I am a certified parent coach.  I grew up in Chicago, but currently love living in the natural beauty of the Pacific Northwest.  In my spare time I enjoy hiking, baking, gardening, and other crafty projects.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-32636156/original/ff42cfd3-6415-41a4-9f24-8c848c43cfc1.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(555170698,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/555170698','Pratika','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-555170698/original/5d3c2ca4-ba0d-4b9a-a8c6-80094d7b96a2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14355701,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14355701','Lauren','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/18888222-57b6-454c-8df9-c49a91eaeee0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(111039325,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/111039325','Chase','Portland, OR','My name is Chase and I\'ve spent my entire life living in the Pacific Northwest.  I love to read, travel, and try new foods!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/aca4c0d2-0fa7-4b68-86e5-282d849723de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(570756621,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/570756621','Leavetown','','Here at Leavetown we are passionate about providing our guests with genuine, local engagement that goes above and beyond expectations. When you choose to book with Leavetown, you are guaranteed to receive a personalized and simplified vacation experience. We are your complete travel solution for booking a fabulous global getaway from start to finish.\nCall or email us anytime, we’re available 24/7.\nMake the world your home & Leavetown with us!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9387877f-e4d5-41b0-97ed-4d3aa42141a1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(431780069,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/431780069','Joshua','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/78db4965-56de-4ce7-9bea-c192d58e9558.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(205408873,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/205408873','Angel','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-205408873/original/9846c040-4211-4c1a-a82c-fae2c4d861b9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(329177157,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/329177157','Stephanie','Portland, OR','I’d rather be on vacation, preferably somewhere tropical, poolside. Being able to bring the vacation to you, as a host, is the next best thing. My passion lies in curating inviting living spaces which balance creativity with practicality, all while evoking a sense of leisure and, well, vacation! Traveling is hard enough! I’ve made sure to provide the utmost in quality touches and amenities to ensure an stress-free stay.  See you in Tulum ;)',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/e30c2076-bfc2-461d-8927-7a6fea5bb048.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1239735,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1239735','Triska','Portland, OR','Currently living in the funky and colorful Portland, Oregon. Lover of social sports, knitting, coffee shops, rock climbing, foreign films, gelato, and furry animals. Near or far, I like to experience different cultures & neighborhoods, get to know the locals, people-watch, visit markets, and eat as much local cuisine as I can manage.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/3a9677f3-321d-4db9-a76f-7d3aae0981ee.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(577541645,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/577541645','Ron','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-577541645/original/b5fa7eca-9056-4770-8d0c-4689074fca6e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(564381482,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/564381482','Michelle','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-564381482/original/3700dbe7-37ec-4ec4-aaba-fc7a1a36a4ac.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(570762701,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/570762701','Leavetown','','Here at Leavetown we are passionate about providing our guests with genuine, local engagement that goes above and beyond expectations. When you choose to book with Leavetown, you are guaranteed to receive a personalized and simplified vacation experience. We are your complete travel solution for booking a fabulous global getaway from start to finish.\nCall or email us anytime, we’re available 24/7.\nMake the world your home & Leavetown with us!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/69132dc2-d93f-4eb9-8b0f-afea87bd590a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132991485,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132991485','Brendan','Portland, OR','Portland is home but I also love to explore new places.\n\nI love to cook amazing meals for friends, find new off leash dog hikes, bike rides around the city when the sun comes out and going to music shows. \n\nI enjoy meeting new people and sharing my love for the Northwest!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c109a78d-623e-4f63-9d3c-b3bc840acdb0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(206288980,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/206288980','Esteban','Portland, O