le_small'),(263115950,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/263115950','Carol','Portland, OR','I’m a recently retired psychologist. I love to travel, especially to places off the beaten track.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-263115950/original/939a63ad-97e0-47a3-b8f3-446a1f8bfb19.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(157840706,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/157840706','Sean','Portland, OR','I am a health professional and my husband is a home maker, taking care of guests and volunteers for hospice.  We are foster parents for Pacific Pug Rescue, so guests will always have friendly greetings.  We look forward to meeting new people and sharing what Portland has to offer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4b752f54-7839-4ea1-b51f-74e942f95e02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(570763898,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/570763898','Leavetown','','Here at Leavetown we are passionate about providing our guests with genuine, local engagement that goes above and beyond expectations. When you choose to book with Leavetown, you are guaranteed to receive a personalized and simplified vacation experience. We are your complete travel solution for booking a fabulous global getaway from start to finish.\nCall or email us anytime, we’re available 24/7.\nMake the world your home & Leavetown with us!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2f2b9571-6d2d-4680-870a-b850313d7017.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14517914,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14517914','Ryan','Portland, OR','I have lived in the Portland area since 1994 and fully embrace the pursuit of outdoor sports and culinary adventures in the area.   when not playing outside,  I\'m working in high tech and spending time with family. \nI have traveled extensively to over 45 countries and strive to offer an inviting, comfortable and relaxing experience similar to what I hope for when booking an Air B&B stay.   I look forward to the opportunity to host you.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a569c955-ee53-40eb-811d-6ff3e04c9346.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(6328036,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/6328036','Kelly','Portland, OR','I am an artist, designer, and healthcare worker. \nI am a responsible homeowner, landlord, and property manager for 17 years. \n\nI love design and enjoy creating sacred places. I have remodeled 2 homes, and project managed new construction; to include building a 2 story tiny house tower.\n\nI am a first generation midlifer with roots on the east coast (Maine) and west coast (Oregon). \n\nI adore dogs, nature, and quiet time.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-6328036/original/9e3008ea-66a1-44f6-bd1b-6ab561a388e8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77871519,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77871519','Holly','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6cc9e00d-f2b6-4129-ae73-27d6bea7e5be.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(283383512,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/283383512','Cinese','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-283383512/original/879f5b43-49a4-4d4c-a5fa-a25bafb5998f.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33745235,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33745235','Zia','Seattle, WA','I’m passionate about creating warm, inviting spaces where guests can relax and enjoy their stay. With a background in interior design, I’ve designed my place to feel both stylish and comfortable—perfect for unwinding or exploring the area.\n\nWhether you’re visiting for work or leisure, my goal is to provide a seamless and welcoming experience. I look forward to hosting you and making your trip unforgettable!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/818a0484-337b-4fe8-a48b-0815cee114c2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(580874341,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/580874341','Chris','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(240319855,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/240319855','Stephanie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9ca79c16-4b1a-419b-b07e-93590d2b6aef.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(558049539,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/558049539','Dani','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-558049539/original/a503f93b-df50-420f-961e-70203fb8678b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(135228378,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/135228378','Tim','Port Townsend, WA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6bf99c38-5f16-4d43-b086-796f1ac8495c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(576715754,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/576715754','Royal Sonesta Portland Downtow','','Stay at The Royal Sonesta Portland Downtown for a quintessential Portland experience. Tour Portland\'s top-rated attractions within minutes of your suite, including the Portland Art Museum, Portland University, Providence Park, and more. Enjoy a wide range of delightful amenities including access to our full-service spa, business and fitness facilities, and 8,000 square feet of adaptable meeting space.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/c9ff4996-3f25-4f1e-86f5-d1e26f80eca5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(59649194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/59649194','Kenny','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4ced8bbe-05e3-4359-b497-6ecbcfd855a6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(309781078,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/309781078','Sofia','Portland, OR','Hi there! My name is Sofia and I am a shoe designer for Keen! I travel a lot for work. When I am in town, I like to spend it outdoors as much as possible. Weekend warrior for the mountain or Oregon coast! Please feel free to ask any questions about Portland or Oregon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1bc1f701-8f2f-43c6-becf-eea5579d822b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8321125,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8321125','Erika And Tad','Portland, OR','My partner and I are vegetarian creative types  and have lived in New York City and traveled for work and pleasure. We have a 8 year old and run a premier boutique, metaphysical shop in Portland and offer a safe and clean space with a focus on eco cleaning, access to laundry, low odor (natural cleaners) household, LGBTQI and BIPOC friendly.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-8321125/original/bb85dd68-060c-4819-9b95-dc3a07a6848c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(503160365,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/503160365','Kara','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d7bc16c6-66d9-431a-9cd9-4ce4978ce59e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4227812,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4227812','Diego','Portland, OR','A New Hampshire guy and an Uruguayan happily living together in Portland. \n\nAbout Mike: I work in film production and like to spend free time outdoors, playing music, cooking and sharing a good meal with friends.\n\nDiego: Originally from Uruguay. I worked at the United Nations for 6 years, and now I work as a Digital Strategist. I love experiencing new places and cultures, meeting new people, movies, Etta James and any type of food.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/4227812/profile_pic/1412168444/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4133563,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4133563','Adam','Portland, OR','I enjoy spending time with my family traveling, listening to music, exploring food, sampling craft beer, being in the outdoors, petting dogs, learning about technology, relaxing and watching television, and more. I love to meet people and explore new places!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5c1d4bfc-0598-41bb-bcb0-c1eac893e04f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56148412,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56148412','Carla','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-56148412/original/686665e1-00e6-4f99-b184-bb42a104b214.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(424564457,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/424564457','Zongyin','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/65babf0e-f57f-40ea-b34d-c11eb55a442a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(172846341,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/172846341','James','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/194b3d03-9727-4e67-8dee-9c908a6a908a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(157314777,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/157314777','Angela','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7ebf862f-1b8e-4799-84e5-63b207e87cad.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23710045,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23710045','Missy','Portland, OR','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/23710045/profile_pic/1415912164/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(61445011,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/61445011','Aj','Portland, OR','My name is AJ, and I am very excited to host with AirBnB. I am an Oregon native and have lived here my whole life. However, I travel often for work and am usually sleeping in a different state! I love hiking, exploring new places, and most of all SUSHI. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8a1d3e24-8186-4d82-a439-0edf237624f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(583279973,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/583279973','Nicholas','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(580802357,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/580802357','Samantha','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-580802357/original/09752bfc-9ce9-4296-8766-9641451bc050.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(433692207,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/433692207','Denise','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dca83c75-0ba1-40ce-b879-c0d6a2d604ea.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(4328483,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/4328483','Chrissy','Portland, OR','Originally from Texas. Like travel, triathlons and drinking with friends.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/06da9fd4-a812-4222-8d6a-6fd5679045dc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(56716111,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/56716111','Matthew','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/834082a3-5968-4756-99b7-de465b3c28f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(295718411,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/295718411','Martha','Fremont, CA','I am a traveler, a writer, a field organizer, a parent, partner and friend.  My pronouns are she/her and I live primarily in the Bay Area with the love of my life, Larry.  Our kids are in Oregon (they are your fabulous hosts) and we are transitioning up to the PNW.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-295718411/original/38ff634d-bf2e-4886-9173-582b9103d9d9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(310317194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/310317194','Celina','Portland, OR','Hi there! I am a kindergarten teacher. I love music festivals, and anything that gets me outdoors! I love to use Airbnb whenever I travel to feel like a local!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/006a6681-99fb-4888-aef1-117f36f05e6c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(576475782,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/576475782','Robert','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/51a27421-7c1a-493f-8d13-b952c30585b1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(256681,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/256681','Meghan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6a1ee568-2d45-440c-8f56-45550c378f9f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(14130724,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/14130724','Jessica','Portland, OR','My husband and I own a small produce store here in Portland in one of the city\'s best markets. Ask us about restaurants, farms and hikes and we\'ll hook you up!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-14130724/original/d13e01da-5202-4a75-9d93-4552b3e81bd5.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8760931,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8760931','Michael','Portland, OR','Enjoying the PNW outdoor life and Portland’s amazing coffee scene. Originally from Southern California but moved around a bit between college and work, having spent time in the Midwest, East Coast, and Europe. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3232d719-1537-47cc-b6b2-13e12aae23aa.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24050247,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24050247','Jennifer','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-24050247/original/b8025e23-937d-4e74-95b4-434f67da757a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5669604,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5669604','Gil','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f475eb73-8fe7-49e1-aeb6-8e72383e996f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11015194,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11015194','Emily','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/11015194/profile_pic/1440116111/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(255230861,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/255230861','Tonya','Portland, OR','Hello Airbnb! My name is Tonya. I was born and raised in City of Roses (Portland)! I love the opportunity to host people from all over the world and show them my city. If you have any questions, please don\'t be shy to let me know. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/96d908bc-f21f-4a3c-bd64-1d46770e76c3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5689232,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5689232','Ash','Portland, OR','Open-minded, friendly and respectful. I love to travel and meet new people! :)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e55001bf-73fc-4762-9f7a-e4d176dd9670.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5050600,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5050600','Zoe And Jonathan','Portland, OR','This is our adorable story. It was Nashville in the 80s when we met and fell madly in love at first sight. After a couple of angsty teenage years together, we went our separate ways until…25 years later, destiny (or My Space) brought us back together! First we went on a glamping trip with my dog for a month. That was fun so packed up our separate lives and moved to Portland. Then we got married, bought a dog farm and lived happily ever after.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5228d8f9-ff26-4367-bf2d-d91cdee2ce6f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9829273,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9829273','Lisa','Tualatin, OR','Real Estate & Property Mangement Specialist in Oregon & Washington',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f71383ee-9919-4585-9bb8-92329004d470.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(588905578,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/588905578','Berley','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/66b49527-84b8-4742-afbd-07116b930f71.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(251587005,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/251587005','Erika','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/54433853-549c-495c-b2a8-56390c29003a.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(154267216,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/154267216','Yaroslav','Battle Ground, WA','Easy going',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f11db791-edd1-482b-b6bc-bdd468408d7b.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(136757844,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/136757844','Michael','Portland, OR','Welcome to my home! My name is Michael, I’m a Portland native and have lived here my whole life. I work as an RN in/out of Portland and love the outdoors, summer nights with friends, and making new experiences ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/2800bb26-20d5-45ba-a5c9-573561919ad8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(590060758,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/590060758','Evan','Port Ludlow, WA','I\'m an avid outdoorsman. I love taking my wife 3 sons into the mountains and rivers locally, hiking, kayaking, and hanging out on the beaches of the Olympic Peninsula. I also love traveling to beautiful places, from Alaska to the Hawaiian islands. There is so much to be seen! \n\nSchedule permitting, I\'m happy to interact with guests, whether you want a tip on where to eat, or are looking for something fun to do.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-590060758/original/b1d10ce2-f16c-446b-b068-d77a119f365f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7263006,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7263006','Diedra','Portland, OR','I aim to make the world more friendly and interesting and take exceptional care of my property! You will see this reflected in many ways when you stay in my suite. I appreciate hosting to those who reciprocate those values.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-7263006/original/d1e32b38-f0a3-491b-86e4-979b8dfb415b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(77167680,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/77167680','Alison And Greg','','We\'re entrepreneurs, parents, and lovers of nature & adventure living in Portland, Oregon. For work, we run a design and branding studio helping businesses and entrepreneurs in their success! We purchased a Saturday Cabin in 2022 and completely transformed the Bavarian 60\'s chalet into a modern forest retreat. Now, we get to share it with our community, family, and friends. We\'re excited to welcome you to Rhododendron - you\'re in for a treat.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-77167680/original/1934b7b9-299a-4372-a2e3-a4b42658014c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(590091685,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/590091685','CityNights','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(60068989,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/60068989','Cory','Portland, OR','My partner Tina and I are Air bnb hosts and guests.  We are avid travelers.  I love travel, food, cooking, music, and building stuff.    I work in technology and real-estate.  Tina owns her own business and loves hiking, food and travel.  We look forward to meeting you, as guests or as hosts!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fb9f2968-e727-4f68-b584-dd2cdc5a7e89.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(493756268,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/493756268','Eli','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(590666605,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/590666605','Jonathon','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-590666605/original/85224562-e2d3-4ed1-96c3-685b8e268a29.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31560564,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31560564','Maria','Portland, OR','We have traveled extensively and love our peaceful beach getaway and hope you do too!  We own the local coffee house, Rockaway Roastery and wine/beer cafe, that opens this August.  ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/1f8b1360-cea7-49d2-aa26-7881274d90e9.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(124334269,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/124334269','Susan','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/660d1aee-44f1-4008-88b8-14e9554c0b97.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45533700,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45533700','Nick','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/24949518-0892-447e-8a02-92730ff0821f.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32859540,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32859540','Traci','Battle Ground, WA','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/32859540/profile_pic/1431036564/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(7598561,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/7598561','Sam','Scottsdale, AZ','I love to play soccer, working out and going out with friends for drinks. I know Scottsdale very well and can tell you about some of the fun places to go. I grew up in Africa and Switzerland and here as well. I also speak French and Arabic.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/7598561/profile_pic/1374369412/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(508682112,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/508682112','Noemi Yoliztli','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/08ec24d5-75da-490e-8f18-ab94d470d029.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(592522307,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/592522307','Trevor','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/11aa590f-67d7-4b87-ad4e-7650f42ee605.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44962730,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44962730','Brittany','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/6ce48b6d-fb98-4a3e-8b65-e3b0d5eddec8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(82748736,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/82748736','Brian','Depoe Bay, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-82748736/original/409e0f0d-fbbb-4dad-96b5-8665fb0a5b6a.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(44771610,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/44771610','Ashley','Portland, OR','We\'ve lived in Portland for about ten years. We are going on a six month sabbatical and looking for someone to love our home for in the duration. We have fruit trees, garden beds, herbs. We also have two hens if someone likes free eggs, otherwise we can make accommodations for them :) Ashley & Tim',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/fbc5e39a-8665-4158-8c7d-627b12a9b9c1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(527520179,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/527520179','Lina','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/4f30eb7e-3d0e-4f3c-a563-fc865427d0e0.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23383138,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23383138','Kayla','Portland, OR','Living in the stunning PNW with some ducks, cats and chickens, and lots of plant friends.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/50c4432c-57a8-43f2-9d51-690dd5e50369.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(19929352,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/19929352','Rory','Portland, OR','I am a nurse/traveler that grew up in Eugene, OR.  I currently live in Portland, OR.  I love everything about the Pacific NW, and I plan to continue climbing in its beautiful mountains for as long as I can!  Though I have lived in Seattle, Portland, Grants Pass, and Ashland, Eugene will always be my home.  I\'ve also wandered through Europe and South America, China, Costa Rica, the Philippines and much of the United States, and I hope to never stop seeing new places!  I love playing music, reading, hiking, swimming, writing, hanging out with my cats, and learning new things.  \r\n\r\n5 things I can\'t live without: peanut butter, novels, my guitar, m & ms, rain.\r\nFavorite travel destinations: Manchu Piccu, Tierra del Fuego, New York.\r\nBooks: One Flew Over the Cuckoo\'s Nest, I Know This Much is True, The Brief and Wondrous Life of Oscar Wao, Into Thin Air\r\nMovies: Shawshank Redemption, American History X, The Lion King\r\nShows: The Office, Sons of Anarchy, Trailer Park Boys\r\nMusic: Anything but New Age Country!\r\nFood: Anything sweet, anything Indian, peanut butter\r\n\r\nI\'m a super low-key traveler, in that I can sleep just about anywhere, and I love meeting new people!\r\n\r\nLife motto: once you set your mind with enthusiasm and persistence, nothing is impossible.  ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/ccb3aefb-58a9-4a19-b287-1e008a490b45.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(350073109,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/350073109','Brianna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/d8e2b87c-9b01-45b6-bcc4-d8a672983792.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(8467436,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/8467436','Corrine','Morgan Hill, CA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/8467436/profile_pic/1416711216/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(38024828,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/38024828','Kristin','Portland, OR','I work in aviation and I travel a bit, have one son in college and three pets: a rhodesian ridgeback and two cats and a permanent housesitter. You can see our trinkets on the walls from our travels and hope they give you a sense of our eclectic tastes.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f4278204-6407-4be6-93cd-0ee74b02d661.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(504516689,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/504516689','Hive','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/04c06826-4417-4329-8877-d93e61f0d961.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(28882446,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/28882446','Andy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/28882446/profile_pic/1425753732/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(95218588,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/95218588','Joshua','Portland, OR','I\'m pretty easy to deal with',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/edd1cf2e-c14e-4c3b-88d0-807104567c55.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23709045,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23709045','Fiona','Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/dc6c702c-fbe9-4d9f-96bc-3fba62c37057.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(511957285,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/511957285','Tessa','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/8374e1ea-8ebe-4e2e-86e2-e9bd4d664d8f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3236741,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3236741','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3236741/profile_pic/1386439537/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(383472892,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/383472892','Jody','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-383472892/original/15db7fcf-0237-4ed0-ac12-9c502cbca192.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(69442902,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/69442902','Hali','Salt Lake City, UT','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ee3349b6-425e-4e88-a1c6-e79d70177c25.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(108509736,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/108509736','Thibault','Portland, OR','Grew up in France. I’m a digital artist, cat lover, and dad. I Lived in NYC for 10years and moved with my wife to Portland, OR in 2016.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/9748bfb7-fdf3-4817-97e7-51a3de1fa096.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(283837381,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/283837381','Annie','Battle Ground, WA','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b75e4ff1-9f6e-454f-b895-3b0fb1cb9c8c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(15428093,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/15428093','Destiny','Portland, OR','I love the ocean and the mountains.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/15428093/profile_pic/1400024693/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(11970785,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/11970785','Brian','Portland, OR','Self employed.  Dad to 2 awesome girls, 50% of the time.  Enjoying life in Portland and playing lots of pickleball.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/a299abed-b35e-4ace-b82e-fdbddf895b19.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(61699098,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/61699098','Shelby','Portland, OR','We are a family of 4. We love the outdoors, camping, good food, wine tasting, live music, Seattle Seahawks and our Oregon Ducks!!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/fbc5aed7-e6df-457b-94b9-a789af01e12e.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(598450021,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/598450021','Frederick Robert','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(531286691,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/531286691','Okaidja','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/eafcbccd-4ac2-412d-8592-3aa0356e1562.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5504418,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5504418','Audrey','San Francisco, CA','I love traveling, arriving in new places, and letting the journey take me where I need to go, letting the road be my teacher, a true and deep teacher about what it is to adapt, to find contentment, and to choose happiness. \r\nI am blessed to always come back home to San Francisco, the city that I love so much, in the house and neighborhood I have lived in most of my life, across from the Zen Center, my community and extended family. I love feeling the history of the city around me, the stories it has to tell, the views, the hidden gems and wild parties.\r\n\r\nI am a mother, an artist and a yogi. I am primarily a painter but have worked in a lot of different mediums and have done a lot of random jobs all over the world. I have studied yoga for over ten years teaching on and off, but always coming back to my practice as a guiding force in my life. I love community and working on things as a team. \r\nI also really enjoy decorating my space, and have done a lot of work on our place my self, besides just painting and furnishings. I love building and making things, figuring out how things work and fixing them, as does my dad, who lives down stairs.  \r\nI take good care of my home, as I would any other place I stayed!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/e531f5e0-352e-4e0b-9853-078723b7fb30.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(582763053,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/582763053','Zhanna','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5858879f-bf6c-45c0-917f-505c906482b8.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(485364133,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/485364133','Karen','','Welcome to my NEW corner of the world! My name is Karen and I’m thrilled to be your host. \n\nI am an avid traveller, having lived long-term in a number of city\'s over the globe, resting my head in Oregon for the past 15 years.\nI’ve come to love everything this Dynamic state has to offer; the city of Portland, the Oregon Coast and majestic Mt Hood.\n\nThank you for considering my place for your stay. I am Looking forward to hosting you!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/75a5e547-2ecc-403b-920a-330d783c8a7c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(587095918,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/587095918','Mohamud','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/e2c1436d-5840-4ef2-a4b1-6c7b8ca6f6b4.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(471976098,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/471976098','Dawn','Bournemouth, United Kingdom','Originally from Scotland, now live in London. Love to travel!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/ea51509f-936e-4a09-95ff-0c99c5fc094b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(419668128,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/419668128','Antonette','Portland, OR','Hi! My name is Antonette! I love to travel, eat, read, and host in my hometown of Portland, Oregon!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5fca67c3-42fb-46c6-af03-bae7892dbccf.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(148150029,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/148150029','Laryssa','Portland, OR','here to make people comfortable and feel safe while traveling :)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/39cc3946-9eb5-415b-be63-3648ebd87f6d.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(51025954,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/51025954','Ramtin','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c0bb0f82-5498-4030-a871-dc1aa7ea2592.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(25618931,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/25618931','Hans','Portland, OR','Love food, reading, and hiking. Grew up in Portland, OR and happy to share a slice of it with you.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/87abb02d-51dd-4e7d-aec9-75dfb8de9bf1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9966834,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9966834','Jonathan','Portland, OR','I\'m one of those creative-types who always has the travel itch. I am a television producer, podcast host, musician, etc, etc, etc. I was born in New Jersey, then lived in Philadelphia, Los Angeles, and now Portland, OR (since 2015). I have a two fun pups and one silly kiddo. I am also a vegan, so I like to find places to stay that aren’t covered in leather :)\r\n\r\nAll in all, I think I\'m a pretty alright guy. At least that\'s what my dogs say.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/6472c68e-a53a-4d8e-b90f-f53d409b7fba.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3903828,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3903828','Tomislav','Portland, OR','Native of Vancouver Canada who has called Portland home since 1998. Love both cities. Love to travel. Pleasure to help host your perfect Portland experience.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/3903828/profile_pic/1350508666/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(213363744,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/213363744','Rene','Portland, OR','Hey there! My name is Rene. I\'m an absolute foodie and love living in the amazing city I call home, Portland.\r\n\r\nIf you don\'t find me at a new restaurant trying out different cuisines then you\'ll probably find me at a funky concert or hip bar. Love my family and friends more than anything, and when I get the chance to combine being with them and traveling to unique places nothing is better!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ba7ba3c2-397d-42a3-ae83-f92ebe957a9c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(471402019,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/471402019','Hossein','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ef413d3b-fcf3-4108-a118-17b970006a62.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(650485628,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/650485628','Michael','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/e4cbd526-8e3b-4b21-96bb-3da7222904d6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(455398,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/455398','Janell','Portland, OR','Born in Cali but moved to NYC in 1999 and got my cosmetology license. 16 years ago I linked up with two of my stylist friends and we opened our beautiful little salon in the East Village; Twigs!\nMet my boyfriend along the way and 5 years ago we moved back to his hometown of Portland to buy a home and try our hand at a big diy renovation. …So here we are now traveling and sharing our home with others in hopes you love it as much as we do!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/ddbabe25-2dac-40dc-a885-bf306fc8bcae.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(112013387,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/112013387','Jenn','Portland, OR','Hello! I have a lovely little home in NE PDX, that I enjoy sharing with my fellow travelers. I work full time as a Chinese medicine herbalist and acupuncturist. In addition to that, I dabble in urban farming, gardening, building, home renovation, sewing, outdoor adventuring and, of course, world traveling!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/899b6273-ba89-4ed9-93f5-05a73c72b5b2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(75574560,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/75574560','Iryna','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/8fabb0d5-8f8d-4b08-9855-3fc5c207ed52.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(291835749,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/291835749','Bianca','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e1075c5e-0fd1-41f9-831a-2f7087b35dc1.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(117337305,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/117337305','Keturah','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/5477b8ba-8444-4209-8a7f-67ba5a152b16.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(132746867,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/132746867','Philip','Portland, OR','Oregon grown! I love the Pacific Northwest. I am happy to share insider tips for me city. I work and Nike, so staying active and getting outside is a big part of who I am. My favorite Airbnb experience thus far has been on a quaint beach in Italy. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/714f5c90-9ca4-4c1f-84b4-8813b8e17837.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(591868335,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/591868335','Janelle','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b29148a1-700a-4174-beb3-22d61ff2e5de.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(567081251,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/567081251','Hyatt House Portland Downtown','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-567081251/original/b5338271-b733-47fc-8a4c-a1c6d6235a1c.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(426638857,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/426638857','Future Rising','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-426638857/original/823e66c4-3c22-4252-851c-b752c124357d.png?aki_policy=profile_small'),(384758373,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/384758373','Sangyoun','Mineola, NY','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/fa850525-c1cd-4801-8d92-39a3d7732fd2.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32200220,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32200220','Mickayla','Portland, OR','Originally a Vermont-native, I have been living and working in Boston for the past four years in clinical research including at Brigham and Women\'s Hospital and Boston Children\'s Hospital. More recently, I got a job at Butterfly Network so work from home in East Boston. Out of all the areas in Boston, Eastie is my favorite, as its super close to downtown but out of the chaos of the city center. The suburbs, ocean, beaches, mountains etc. are easily accessible. I cannot wait to teach you about our home & share this lovely space with you. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/83b32ac5-a443-43c9-8582-f3c2db4eb005.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(651909792,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/651909792','Susan','Portland, OR','Portland-based porcelain designer and fabricator',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/33555173-c525-4ecf-b3d2-5e4533a137e0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(54135056,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/54135056','Christina','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/befe7fa4-5ca4-49e2-b931-95bade359457.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(449432266,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/449432266','Dawn','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/37e8e63e-0473-4286-b95f-bda763dd3d02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10664501,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10664501','Ginger','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/da487f6d-3493-4c97-8abd-96d804bc42cb.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(652450228,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/652450228','Sara','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/6e20d85d-bdc1-4b33-ae57-7d0e1af87242.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(23017900,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/23017900','Woodrow','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/388a3545-046b-4ec4-8b35-f081aacda230.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(260822168,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/260822168','Carol Bonds','Oregon, United States','Retired',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/61613321-3d3b-457c-b747-ee11875b4abc.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(32524294,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/32524294','Nicole','Oregon, United States','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ac9a403b-8d66-468b-ac8b-8c958a66f8c2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(71212009,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/71212009','Monique','Portland, OR','I currently live part time in New Mexico and in Portland. I love being outdoors and exploring new places. I am an administrative assistant. I like to use my days off to explore new places and take my dog Brisket on adventures with me. I look forward to the many trips the future has in store for us. I very much look forward to hosting you, your family and friends. My goal is to make sure that my guests experience true relaxation and comfort.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/d3359b76-f091-42c4-9f5f-7ce5ab910778.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(653700983,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/653700983','Yanea Lee','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/99c28cbe-32bd-483c-b4bf-f6f662316db6.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(26378984,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26378984','Joshua','Portland, OR','An Industrial Designer married to a Graphic Designer.\nBig fan of board games and unicycling.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/f959d998-8fde-4e5f-b179-363534016d81.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(29604513,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/29604513','Kerry','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/29604513/profile_pic/1426740607/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(653650992,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/653650992','Dwayne','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/2d55d6b8-4723-4df8-9469-18a2efff95ec.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(31457203,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/31457203','Hayley','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/7793f32d-659b-43bc-828f-0b1540e770b0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(10853655,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/10853655','Cullen','Portland, OR','We are a couple living in Portland Oregon. \n\nI often like to get out of the city to relax for a couple nights, or take extended trips abroad to experience food and culture.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/788a3cff-b611-4bf2-9316-c147027f0f61.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(595813530,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/595813530','Alexander James Rae','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(3035263,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3035263','Renea','Portland, OR','Been apart of Airbnb for over a decade! My fella & I love to travel and are excited to have spaces to share with those who do as well. Typically, you’ll find Keith playing bass, playing soccer or making everyone around him laugh.  Me, I like to garden, get crafty, workout, cook delicious things and dance around the house. Together, we enjoy: exploring, good coffee, great food, adventuring outside, seeing live music and being silly.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/23382103-dd5e-47e3-beb8-069ed621ec80.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(654982020,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/654982020','The Hoxton Portland','','Discover the 119 boutique hotel rooms that range in size on offer at our Oregon location. Every room features rich walnut panelling, mid-century touches, artwork curated by local Portland gallerist, Upfor, and ceramics by Clay Factor. Enjoy a slice of luxury as you settle down after a day [or night!] of exploring everything the heart of Oregon has to offer.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/e08855e6-5dde-4aef-b484-5afe45317fd8.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(70146531,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/70146531','Michael','Portland, OR','I work as a humanitarian storyteller and writer. My job takes me all over the world to gather stories and meet interesting people. When I’m not traveling for work, I love traveling for friends, surf, and good food.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/f0477dbb-f1a0-49ae-882f-825fef82f88c.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(13747851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/13747851','Robert','Sherwood, OR','',0,'https://a