e','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(26626812,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/26626812','Zoe','Portland, OR','We are a family of three, a nurse, a chef, a kid. We live in the main house and if it is nice out, we will likely be on the back patio. \n\nWe are into gardening for native plants and wildlife, art, food,  books, friends, camping and swimming in the rivers and lakes of Oregon. \n\nHappy to say a friendly hello and leave it at that, or glad to answer any questions and give local advice. Weve been in Portland for 30 years and love it here.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/01a8945f-5772-48f0-b73c-7d028c165021.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(147951910,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/147951910','Julie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/a4975112-de05-4bfa-901f-5063e477ec97.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(655053851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/655053851','Julianna','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/87377973-3be1-48f4-9dcd-1404b765e293.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21469538,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21469538','Nick','Portland, OR','Hello! My name is Nicholas and I am a filmmaker/photographer who enjoys visiting Japan and SE Asia when my schedule allows. I am happiest when I am near the coast and cannot get enough seafood recommendations.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/10532ff1-4d3a-4267-ae21-d6ad4d5925c6.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(84180202,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/84180202','Leanne','Portland, OR','Hi! I’m a Portland native with a love for travel, cozy tea spots, and exploring the outdoors through hiking and backpacking. In my spare time, you’ll find me reading a good book or baking gluten-free treats. Excited to welcome you and help you enjoy Portland!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/53b042ab-5e94-4644-b1bf-a06a6ba328b7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(172553029,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/172553029','Eddie','Portland, OR','Trying to retire before my midlife crisis. \n\nI help my wonderful mother manage her condo. Hope you enjoy our spaces!',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c6deffbe-15b0-46c4-a03d-b8d3fe47e901.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(405693839,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/405693839','Jessie','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/99f5ebd6-fc08-4189-9a5e-6fd2bc5e9a43.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(658977106,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/658977106','Russell','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/defaults/user_pic-50x50.png?v=3'),(9181734,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9181734','Pamela','Portland, OR','I\'ve been living in Portland since 2021 and am enjoying playing tourist in Oregon.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/5bb8603c-eefb-4b1e-8e9f-9e72a911b681.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(248639891,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/248639891','Dana','St. Louis, MO','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/63a83027-685b-458b-9e05-5af7757581a3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(21616055,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/21616055','Sara','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-21616055/original/aa39ee9b-ac66-4030-9a46-5e4a775534a3.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(9463317,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/9463317','Jennifer','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/64e4ffd8-5cbf-4caa-a25d-826c31265706.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(660514419,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/660514419','Lauren','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/fa50e45e-e1a5-4e43-a79d-3d4323d923bc.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(370069479,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/370069479','Erin','','While we\'re here, let\'s do something fun.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/14da9574-05fb-4774-a129-514f4728e7fb.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(24150641,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/24150641','Gina','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/098168bf-945f-4365-a8d5-b93dbe8b3316.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(563061,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/563061','Krista','Portland, OR','Krista is a doctor of classical Chinese medicine, a bonus-mom, culinary creatrix and avid gardener.  The US is the fourth country in which she has lived, with Canada being the first, where she was born and raised.  Since moving to Portland, she has managed several different busy Airbnb listings all while raising step kids and attending a 6-year Master\'s and Doctoral journey toward her dream of practicing natural medicine. \n\nMy husband and I moved into our home in the Spring of 2017.  While it was only constructed a few years prior, we renovated it to better suit our family\'s functional needs and aesthetic desires.  Our home is a sanctuary for us, and we take pride in keeping it fresh and well-maintained.  We hope you enjoy it as much as we do!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/c7101c86-ea00-470d-8274-79f16fe49c02.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(372413573,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/372413573','Ensemble Five','San Francisco, CA','Ensemble Five has designed and operates multiple vacation rental properties. We have a network of local professionals including agents, cleaners and maintenance contractors.\n\n\nIG @ensemble_five\n\nTikTok @ensemblefive',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/79de0367-5c8d-4ef6-9c87-ba630d6fcdb4.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(45681974,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/45681974','Pina And Jaime','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/45681974/profile_pic/1443908362/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(661317538,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/661317538','Matthew','Portland, OR','We\'re a husband and wife team dedicated to offering high-quality rentals that exceed your expectations. Our personable and efficient service ensures a smooth and pleasant experience from start to finish. We pride ourselves on providing not just beautiful accommodations, but also kindness and support every step of the way. Come stay with us and feel at home, wherever your journey takes you!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/27ce79fe-c0ba-48dc-8637-554941c42aca.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(33038338,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/33038338','Radhika','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/92ef2274-3a45-4bd1-80c3-32e1980276a9.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(347291255,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/347291255','Rebecca Lyn','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/d8515651-fbf5-471f-a5dc-ce497e20d172.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(74887347,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/74887347','Bill','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/55605ec3-3bf4-45ea-bd2b-47ffa326336f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(392860183,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/392860183','Dustin','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/3fc4a93a-a872-4cf0-a7b6-100031f8f40d.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(67772888,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/67772888','Nancy','Portland, OR','I love co-hosting and interior design.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/0a28df69-e33f-4d9c-be3c-2b1329a81843.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(35390809,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/35390809','Nelly','Houston, TX','Born and raised in Houston. My wife and I love dogs, music, food, nature, and meeting people from different walks of life. Our families, working, traveling, and volunteering takes up our entire lives. We would love to host you in our home and share our wonderful little town with you. ',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/7bdb1ff9-5570-43af-baf0-4b37c2f957ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(381505779,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/381505779','Eran','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/9dee6129-075f-4a6a-9a0a-dd5da89c3094.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(5382362,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/5382362','Regina','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/users/5382362/profile_pic/1362803491/original.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(323461842,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/323461842','Holly','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/60da0302-03e5-4372-bbf7-fdd7c9a75a94.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(74140845,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/74140845','Michelle','Oregon, United States','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/562bf7fa-44bf-4de0-9acb-2c88500a1e67.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114431678,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114431678','Sarkawt','Portland, OR','Hi there! I\'m a proud Kurd originally from northern Iraq, aka, Kurdistan, now calling Portland, Oregon, home. I work full-time as a substitute teacher with Portland Public Schools and run an online tutoring business, specializing in Arabic language and culture. I’m also pursuing my second Master’s in Education at PSU.I love connecting with people from diverse backgrounds and am excited to share my space and be part of your travel journey.Welcome!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/9119dac6-1a90-422a-a45c-05db90ca7be0.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(42022271,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/42022271','Janet','Boise, ID','My partner, Asa, and I are both acupuncturists and have lived in Boise for the last 17 years.  We have two boys, 15 and 19, with our oldest now at Boise State!  Prior to Boise we lived in San Diego, NYC and Portland, Oregon.  We love to travel, but now welcome travelers to join us in enjoying the pleasures Boise and Idaho have to offer.',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/10ec7df4-d3d1-41e0-b280-6a16ade3d0fe.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(217683281,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/217683281','Eric','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/fc546bab-cdd5-4835-ae4a-aa6976287b2f.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(568213949,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/568213949','The Hotel Zags','','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/b066ef95-d625-4d14-a647-6efa3df48fb2.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(1886343,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/1886343','Lauren','Portland, OR','I live in Portland, OR and grew up in Los Angeles, in the coastal communities of Venice and Santa Monica. \n\nI would say I\'m a very curious and adventurous person and I get really excited about visiting new places and seeing what they have to offer, no matter how modest. There\'s probably nothing that thrills me more than a long ramble through a new place, with unexpected discoveries!',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/ed3503c8-ca9d-44d7-83bb-49e571c470ff.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(129809851,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/129809851','Catherine','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/8cc1cfb9-f071-47d7-a3f9-5b45ad1cbaf3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(663853304,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/663853304','Lucy','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/b01df1ad-4a7d-4b70-b9a4-dd114d7d798b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(226607963,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/226607963','Artem','','',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User-226607963/original/4cea363c-b253-4e97-a7d8-409abf38d7c7.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3382661,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3382661','Andrea','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/01a67bea-0b8f-4407-923e-b1999b2df5f3.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(39047000,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/39047000','Clo','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/06824639-90b6-4ba3-939a-acd089fc9b4b.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(180955538,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/180955538','Georgia','Portland, OR','Room available in my residence that\'s walking/biking distance to everything in NW, Pearl District, and downtown.. I\'m a fun Portlander. I can be either social or gone, depending on circumstances and guest needs.. This building requires you to pass a quick background check for stays over 14 days (which is all I\'m interested in hosting.)',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/User/original/b95753ad-2253-4045-9ed2-fb0837f4a175.jpeg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(201130357,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/201130357','Stacey','Portland, OR','',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/80606313-f061-48d4-8961-0f5d28d886ac.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(3844402,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/3844402','Steve','Corvallis, OR','Live in Corvallis, Oregon.  Enjoy traveling and meeting new people.  My wife and I are both retired school teachers.  When traveling we enjoy just hanging and not being in a hurry to get some place.  Focus on the moment. We did an adventure when we first married looking for a place to settle down for awhile and left Long Beach, Calif. to Vancouver, Canada and took 9 months.  We believe its the journey not the destination.',0,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/20072206-a26f-45ca-a743-24b72ccb3144.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small'),(114549297,'https://www.airbnb.com/users/show/114549297','Sarinya','Portland, OR','Mother of two beautiful daughters, originally from Thailand. I enjoy hosting friends and showing off amazing my hometown \"Portland \". Also love to cook thai food and explore the new different taste of food. ',1,'https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/user/162a00db-bb21-4532-aa45-9ff8d40cd96e.jpg?aki_policy=profile_small');
