tes.  coffee shop  StarBucks drive thru down the street with restaraunts close by and mall 205. Lloyd center and Clackamas short drive. The gorge just 30 minutes is beautiful, nice hiking trails. Mt hood is an hour drive for those who like to ski or snowboard. Beach about 1 1/2 hour drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-39337587/original/6f4ed9f1-033c-467d-afbb-1c3da8bad17f.jpeg',284536420,63,'45.51995','-122.54099',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,40.00,30,1125,5,4.20,39337587),(1704,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39355967','Private Apt/Loft Craftsman House NW Portland','Our home has an extremely spacious, sunny private loft apt, with  bedroom queen size bed, living room, studio space, kitchenette,  refrigerator, microwave,  private full bath with tub. Also use of beautiful large private back deck and front  porch overlooking Overton St. Our neighborhood is very convenient to shops, galleries, cafes, restaurants, great  markets and all public transportation','Great NW Portland neighborhood!!  Nearby restaurants, galleries, bars, library, bakeries and wonderful stores and markets for fresh local food.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/102640955/d589b0f5_original.jpg',42533657,27,'45.53133','-122.70133',1,2,2.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,3,350,14,4.71,39355967),(1705,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39415580','Beautiful Vintage Home near Peninsula Park','Cozy 1940\'s Cape Cod full of vintage charm - perfect for a weekend with friends or a home base for a business trip. Tucked away on a quiet street but close to some of Portland\'s best food and neighborhoods: Williams, Mississippi, Alberta and the Dekum triangle. The perfect spot to call home for all your PDX adventures from downtown to the gorge and everywhere in between!','Head to the Dekum Triangle (walk south from the house to Dekum St. then a 5 minute walk east) for the best coffee in town at Woodlawn Pastry and Cafe or grab a beer next door at Breakside Brewing! You\'ll find more tasty options in the Triangle at The Firehouse, Good Neighbor Pizzeria, The Oregon Public House and the Grand Army Tavern. Just down the street is P\'s & Q\'s market for quick supplies & a great deli. The High Water Mark is a delightful dive bar with some delicious vegan options.<br /><br />Take a 5 minute walk straight down Williams to Peninsula Park and enjoy one of Portland\'s best rose gardens! <br /><br />Message your host for more recommendations in the area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9e6ae2c2-13d7-42b0-988c-918023e4450a.jpg',8193204,48,'45.5745','-122.6659',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,1125,88,4.88,39415580),(1706,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39441888','Alberta Arts Happy Home - Walk Score = 92','2 Bed, 2.5 Bath Alberta Arts Townhome. <br />Enjoy this stunning townhome built in 2015. Contemporary cutting-edge design worthy of Dwell magazine. Located in Portland\'s popular Alberta Arts District - over 20 blocks of restaurants, bars, cafes, galleries, boutiques and Alberta Rose Theater.<br />-Hardwood floors <br />-Chef\'s kitchen with basic pantry supplies available. <br />-Roll-up garage door off kitchen to balcony bring\'s the outside in!','The house is located in the Alberta Arts District which is anchored by Northeast Alberta St. where guests will find an eclectic mix of restaurants, cafes, boutiques, shops, bars and a theater along 30 city blocks. This pedestrian friendly corridor is buzzing with activity all week long including weekends when locals line-up for a table at one of the many delicious brunch restaurants. You’ll find everything from locally made ice cream and locally brewed beer to unique galleries, shops and many dining options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6257508f-5109-4864-9cf5-675689fc5ae4.jpg',205079895,29,'45.56216','-122.64672',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,111.00,2,151,259,4.93,39441888),(1707,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39526527','William\'s Dwelling (basement apartment)','Private space great for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers. Centrally located on the hip N Williams Ave and in the middle of Alberta Arts and Mississippi Districts. Take a short stroll to nearby restaurants and boutiques. Close to public transportation.','The neighborhood is nestled in a great location, 5 miles to downtown Portland. It\'s located in the middle of the Alberta Arts and Mississippi St districts. It has a high walkability score of 91 out of 100 with coffee shops, bars, restaurants a short walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8fd41f48-8020-410a-8d6d-abfb218ea48b.jpg',91318098,24,'45.55771','-122.66637',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,73.00,2,45,131,4.88,39526527),(1708,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39533139','Cozy Clinton Cottage (close-in SE off Division)','Our lovingly renovated guest cottage is detached from the main house, with a private entrance and outdoor seating area. Our central location is great for exploring all of the best that Portland has to offer, with easy access to public transit and bike routes. The space is very cozy and has everything you need for a fantastic Portland vacation or work trip.','The Division Clinton neighborhood has some of the best Portland has to offer. Our favorite places nearby are Jacqueline, Coava Coffee, Bollywood Theater, Bagdad Theater, and Mt. Tabor. Not too far across the river are Maurice for delicious daytime food, the Chinese Garden for magical urban strolling, or Forest Park for hiking. Southeast Portland is close to everything and puts you right in the heart of our lovely city. Portland is a treasure trove of sights to be had. Please check hours and access of your destinations.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6935a70d-1f12-4e0d-ae4e-dcdd5f9168eb.jpg',66078799,25,'45.50451','-122.64563',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,105.00,1,5,269,4.99,39533139),(1709,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39533952','Apartment suite in daylight basement','Kick back and enjoy our newly renovated, stylish apartment suite. Centrally located  in a quiet cul-de-sac less than 10 minutes away from the airport and close to two main freeways (I-84 & 205) to great adventures in the coolest places in Portland or excursions further out of the city. <br /><br />It’s set up with all the amenities to make your stay cozy and serve as a comfortable landing pad for your vacation adventures. This suite is ideal for a small family, a lovers getaway, a work trip or sabbatical.','The location is ideal for relaxing and vacationing. It is central to multiple parks, freeways, and walking distance to Glendovere golf course, tennis & brewery.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/75d3280e-587e-4492-8038-1019b0e6a7f7.jpg',156974251,82,'45.53392','-122.52731',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,1,365,150,4.83,39533952),(1710,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39535594','Private Two Bedroom Woodlawn Guest Suite','We\'d love to welcome you to our private retreat in Portland\'s Woodlawn neighborhood!<br /><br />Easy keypad check in process. 15 minutes via car to the airport, 15 minutes to downtown, easy access to I-5. 5 minutes by foot to some of the best amenities in the city. Woodlawn park, Breakside Brewery, Firehouse, Tough Luck, Ranch Pizza, Tamale Boy and Woodlawn Coffee and Pastry are all nearby. We love living in this vibrant and diverse neighborhood and we\'d love to welcome you to stay with us!','Woodlawn Coffee & Pastry is undeniably one of the very best coffee shops in Portland. Unlike most shops they make all their parties in-house and their coffee is the typical Portland standard of excellence. <br /><br />Breakside Brewery is just down the street and is a favorite of not only locals to the neighborhood but the whole city over. Great brews and a excellent outdoor sitting area that\'s dog friendly (like us).<br /><br />We also have a great park nearby if you\'re into that.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/pro_photo_tool/Hosting-39535594-unapproved/original/a6d5257d-cc2e-428c-ba10-f804390cdd44.JPEG',20165180,45,'45.57535','-122.65143',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,70.00,1,365,348,4.84,39535594),(1711,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39627133','Historic Hafner Haus Bed and Breakfast, Unit 3','Please see our other listings for additional pictures of the Historic Hafner Haus.<br />this listing is not necessarily assigned a specific room, as we upgrade to the best room that we have available. <br />this is a private bedroom in a large house that operates like a bed and breakfast with some simple self-serve breakfast options.<br />The common areas are shared and  there is a shared full bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6Mzk2MjcxMzM%3D/original/dc25e76e-012a-4534-add3-cac811b1af9a.jpeg',8207605,44,'45.51632','-122.68639',2,3,1.00,0.00,4.00,24.00,30,120,32,4.94,39627133),(1712,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39637107','Downtown Portland Condo with water view','Book your extended stay in this great downtown NW Portland condo with water view. Off Naito Parkway, walk to the Pearl, Moda Center and all downtown amenities. Summertime pool and hot tub. Own parking space and convenience store in complex. Waterfront access with running and walking along Tom McCall waterfront park. Full kitchen with laundry in the condo. Expect train noise. Is ground level unit so may hear normal upper tenant activity at times.','Walking distance to Moda Center for concerts or special events. Walking, biking, and running path along waterfront. Can Uber or walk to Pearl, downtown, saturday market and other events that are often held right downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/01bc2a5f-576c-4695-acb7-c24bfdf2ece2.jpg',56994880,43,'45.52705','-122.67164',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,30,90,17,4.94,39637107),(1713,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39643910','Simple and Convenient.','This place is located in a very convenient casual location near max line and bus lines surrounded by shopping and restaurants it’s also 13 min from airport. Very cozy room nothing fancy friendly casual environment. If you stay here you will feel comfortable and no one gets into your business you will have your privacy. The room comes with mini fridge, microwave leather couch, desk , Bed, TV, WI-FI and lots of space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5fb14ced-fe01-4f17-ba58-9f8d03381d6e.jpg',96243932,63,'45.52688','-122.53263',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,33.00,30,1125,10,4.90,39643910),(1714,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39671760','Private 2 Bedroom Apartment w/Healthclub - Pets OK','Luxury unit for the fitness enthusiast. Rent the entire space and have the place to yourself.  Full health club membership included during your stay. New construction in 2019 on the second level of this 1914 building. Stylish and eclectic with a high sense of flair. Original artwork, high ceilings, huge amount of light. Comfortable with plenty of space to relax. Feels like an oasis in the city.<br />Breakfast items as well as other snacks and goodies will be pre-stocked for your first morning.','A perfect location to experience one of Portland\'s oldest neighborhoods. So much is available when you stay here. St. Johns feels like a village on the edge of the city. Our community is located close to the Willamette River and is filled with locally owned shops, pubs, outdoor activities, and a wonderful riverfront park below the famous St. Johns Bridge.<br /><br />You will be surrounded by a huge array of fitness opportunities. The property features a hot yoga and barre studio on the main level. Right outside your window is a boot camp exercise yard with an obstacle course layout. Across the street is a 23,000 sf health club with yoga, Spinning, boxing, Zumba, senior fit classes, olympic lifting, Hydromassage, steam room, sauna, and more! All these health club options are included in your stay!<br /><br />Each apartment has free parking, air conditioning, weekly cleaning, washer/dryer, full kitchen, streaming and live TV, and WiFi.<br /><br />Many activities and venues are within eas','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/42effeed-0cbc-4d7b-934f-245e8699be4e.jpg',13540222,58,'45.5887','-122.7443',1,4,1.