eets.<br /><br />Those who appreciate top-notch cuisine, fine wines, microbrews, and craft cocktails are in for a real treat as Portland boasts the greatest number of critically acclaimed restaurants, wineries, microbreweries and bars per capita than any other city in the nation. We also count scores of Food Network stars and James Beard award winners whose creativity has kept the city front and center on the epicurean scene.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a029eee1-0eff-4973-9b0d-9ef8abb65dbf.jpg',318184666,7,'45.53773','-122.64147',2,2,1.50,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,40874580),(1777,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/40889962','⭐️ Tranquil Hidden Gem in the ❤️ of Woodstock ⭐️','Relax in this enchanting cottage in beautiful Woodstock. This Cottage Core style residence sits on a lovely corner lot with beautifully maintained front and back yard space with mature landscaping.  Inside features classic Arts & Crafts style with minimal steps and direct access to the private backyard courtyard.  Comfy queen bed, queen fold out couch, kitchenette and shower with tub.  Many restaurants, coffee shops, grocery stores, bakeries, etc. are all just 3-4 blocks away.','We are three blocks from Woodstock Ave where you\'ll find Coffee Shops (Papacino\'s,  First Cup, Heart),  Bakery (Yummy Grand Central), Groceries (New Seasons and Safeway with Starbucks), Restaurants (Double Mountain Brewery, Delta Cafe, Ate-oh-Ate, Bergerac, Pizza Roma, El Gallo, Shoko Sushi, Nudi Asian Noodles, Primal Burger and don\'t forget Otto\'s Deli and Cloud City Ice Cream)<br />Woodstock Park is two blocks away:<br />Woodstock Park<br />SE 47th Avenue and Steele Street Locate this site in PortlandMaps<br /><br />General Info<br />Acreage: 14.11<br />Acquired in 1921<br /><br />Amenities<br />Includes accessible play area, accessible restroom, BEECN - basic earthquake emergency communication node, dog off-leash area, horseshoe pit, paths - paved, picnic site - reservable, picnic tables, playground, soccer field, softball field, statue or public art, and tennis court.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/75d3ed9a-0b13-4814-ae6d-115ea8e6a716.jpg',4139648,38,'45.48106','-122.61451',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,142.00,2,1125,81,4.98,40889962),(1778,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41010362','Alberta Farmhouse Nest Studio','Welcome to the Alberta Farmhouse Nest! Located in a quiet neighborhood just a few houses from the fun & funky Alberta Street. Walk to delicious food, galleries, boutiques & bars! Make yourself at home in this cozy, private upstairs studio apartment (in a duplex) boasting of modern-rustic charm. Make homemade meals & memories in the updated kitchen or take soak in the tub. This space is super clean, newly remodeled & ready to host your PDX stay!','Alberta Art District is a bold and vibrant neighborhood lined with countless murals and quirky shops to fill your stay with adventure. Alberta\'s eateries supply flavors from around the world, fragrant coffee shops and treats for all dietary restrictions. Most of the fun is on Alberta St, but there are some more great options on Killingsworth as well! During the Summer months, there is a street fair on the last Thursday of each month and a big festival in August. However, there is plenty to do in this outgoing community year round!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41010362/original/80deaf56-9337-4881-9736-3231e4080b71.jpeg',320016841,1,'45.55907','-122.63292',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,71.00,2,1125,250,4.94,41010362),(1779,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41113886','Welcome to the Pear tree house','Newly constructed, detached bedroom with all modern amenities and furnished with style. Located in the heart of Laurelhurst (national historic neighborhood).  Within a block from frequent bus route. A short walk from restaurants, boutiques, microbreweries and grocery stores.','We are located close to the historic Laurelhurst park, popular restaurants such as Pambiche, Epif, Guerro, Sudra, Pollo Norte etc. You can also enjoy micro brews from Migration Brewing.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/86af094c-32b3-4c60-a6ca-a1237515f827.jpg',321695747,23,'45.52637','-122.62875',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,2,14,52,4.90,41113886),(1780,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41132879','Trendy 4BR/2BA Bungalow in Alberta Arts District!','This charming and spacious 4-bedroom home is conveniently located just steps away from the popular NE Alberta St. and just a couple of blocks to the NE Alberta Arts District! You won\'t have any issues getting around or finding fun stuff to do in what many regard as the most hip area in the city of Portland. Some of the best restaurants, bars, and shopping are all within arm\'s reach from this lovely home.','A stone\'s throw away from Alberta St. and a very quick walk to the hot Alberta Art\'s District. Being born and raised in Portland, this is my favorite area in the entire city!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41132879/original/5825fec0-d8d4-43ad-a616-32623f4fcf5a.jpeg',141351418,14,'45.55832','-122.66182',1,10,2.00,4.00,5.00,285.00,1,1125,291,4.84,41132879),(1781,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41160733','A Bohemian Paradise - Walk to Hawthorne/Division','My duplex is in the Industrial Central Eastside, nestled between the popular streets of Hawthorne and Division. It\'s within walking distance to some of Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, craftspeople, and all types of services! My home is also just over a mile from the downtown financial district via bike, walking, or bus. The interiors are designed to create a bohemian paradise, ensuring ultimate relaxation for your getaway!','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This vibrant area boasts a Powell\'s bookstore, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more. Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, get messy with wings at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or enjoy a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. The vibrant indie spirit thrives in Hawthorne, with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at the Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of fun, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park atop a dormant volcano ven','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41160733/original/d1ed7297-c537-4229-b6c3-e1031ca37a8e.jpeg',112798186,25,'45.50776','-122.65538',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,30,1125,416,4.83,41160733),(1782,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41179269','Center of SE PDX, beautiful 2 bedrm-no clean fees!','A completely separate two bedroom suite (900+ sq.ft.)with beautiful bedrooms, living room and new bath with rain head shower. Comcast WiFi and Xfinity 65\" HDTV with ESPN, Disney, etc. Located a short walk from either the Hawthorne and/or Division Streets Shopping and Eating areas.   Quiet and peaceful.','Neighborhood restaurants include award winning AvaGene\'s,  ¿Por Qué No?, Cibo, and many others.  Groceries are very close at New Seasons;  just .2 miles away.  Over 60 restaurants within 1 mile of home; all ethnic types of food, great  desserts also, with Salt & Straw and Lauretta Jean\'s Pies','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5f2fd8fe-ed71-4df9-967f-a6dabd238b60.jpg',13821627,8,'45.50937','-122.62062',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,132.00,2,28,276,4.98,41179269),(1783,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41179310','King bed, New, 15 min downtown, near Reed College','Brand new, light-filled unit with private entrance. Gorgeous kitchen, brand new Tempurpedic King bed and beautiful new shower with large family room.  You will enjoy exploring this Thomas Kincaid- neighborhood. Walkable, easy to get to public transportation and there are numerous parks nearby. Parking is plentiful. It\'s a short 5 block walk to Reed College and restaurants and coffee shops 1 mile away in Sellwood, Moreland, Woodstock.   Super fast Internet and 50 Inch TV<br />Permit # TLT-0922667008','Eastmoreland is in SE Portland and is a picture perfect walkable, historic neighborhood with 100 yr old trees. It is 1 mile from the trendy Woodstock, Sellwood and Westmoreland bars and restaurants. We very close to 7 parks! - Including the Rhodendron, Bybee, Oaks Bottom and Sellwood parks (where you can SUP or kayak). The Spring Corridor Bike Trail is right around the corner making it easy to bike to Sellwood, Portland Farmers Market. The trendy Hawthorne and Division/Clinton areas are a short bike ride away or 7 minute car ride.<br />Each July 4th there is an American Independence Day parade through our neighborhood and at Christmas, there is a Holiday home tour with a festive trolley that shuttles you around.  It truly is a \"Leave it to Beaver\" TV show neighborhood that is walkable, welcoming and accessible to everything Portland has to offer!!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41179310/original/cfa52e87-7188-4af8-8146-d2f2ce02d3db.jpeg',21502012,5,'45.46782','-122.62692',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,2,730,93,4.83,41179310),(1784,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41181567','BEST NEIGHBORHOOD IN TOWN! 20','NORTHWEST PORTLAND: Completely furnished studio in a beautiful Mediterranean building located in friendly, close-in Northwest Portland. <br />This convenient location with a 98 Walk Score is close to some of the best restaurants, bars and cafes in town.','Close-in Northwest Portland- Nob Hill.<br /><br />This convenient location, with a 98 POINT WALK SCORE is blocks from trendy NW 23rd AVE, Dragonfly Coffee House, St. Honore Bakery, McMenamins Pub, a natural foods grocery store, the public library, as well as the post office. <br /><br />Window shop at all the lovely boutiques located just blocks away or hike/bike/run/explore the 80 miles of trails and over 5,000 acres of Forest Park; one of the largest urban parks in the United States! <br /><br />You can quickly and easily reach the Pearl District, the Brewery Blocks or Downtown Portland in minutes by foot, bike or streetcar; no need for a vehicle when living here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4c6263b6-5996-494b-b5c5-20a71d62f499.jpg',322907763,27,'45.5358','-122.70347',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,56.00,30,1125,5,4.40,41181567),(1785,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41192687','Blue Cottage with Stunning Views','Welcome to the Blue Cottage, a serene retreat nestled in the picturesque West Hills of Portland. Prepare to be captivated by breathtaking vistas that encompass the majestic Mt. Hood, the meandering Willamette River, the imposing presence of Mt. St. Helens, and the vibrant tapestry of Downtown Portland. The Blue Cottage is located on a small hill. For those who rise with the sun, witnessing its ascent over Mt. Hood from the Blue Cottage is an unforgettable spectacle that simply must not be miss.','Our neighborhood rests in the West Hills at the top of Corbett Ave, with walking distance to coffee shops and restaurants, such as Elephants on Corbett, Jola Coffee, and more. The neighborhood is warm and welcoming, as well as very safe.<br /><br />Home is in close proximity to I-5; Shops, public transportation, restaurants, downtown, trials and parks are minutes away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41192687/original/09b1b97a-d280-466f-bca9-f9e96ad3b639.jpeg',57373623,22,'45.47092','-122.6763',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,190.00,2,1125,104,4.93,41192687),(1786,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41195216','Little House PDX','Our sweet and modern little house is centrally located in NE Portland within walking distance to Mississippi Ave, the Alberta Arts District, and the Williams Corridor.','Although we are on a residential street, we are so close to it all! Just a ten minute Lyft to Powell\'s Books, a twenty minute walk to Eem, or an hour and a half drive to the coast or the mountain.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDExOTUyMTY%3D/original/9c035d75-7cf7-4cb5-a760-2ae60ccf66e6.jpeg',6648334,24,'45.56309','-122.66564',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,1,27,312,4.99,41195216),(1787,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41232955','Downtown Loft-Modern and Close to everything','Welcome to our newly built  Downtown/Historic Lair Hill loft. Centrally located with access to  front porch with downtown view makes this loft a perfect couples or a small group of friends  getaway.  The loft was built in Winter of 2020. The loft has private entrance. Loft  is perfect for couples, solo adventurers, business travelers. There is a locked door separating main portion of the house from the loft. Guest will have complete privacy. Complimentary high-speed WiFi/Netflix/Amazon Prime.','About location: <br />Loft is conveniently located to number of downtown amenities; restaurants, bars, parks, food carts, fresh food markets etc. Number of amanitas are walking distance from our loft. Public transportation is also nearby. It is about 0.2miles to public transportation, busses , street cars and light rail.  Condo offers Downton and Tillamook bridge view. Three  major freeways (I5 , I84 and i26 ) are nearby and southeast Portland is approximately 2miles away. Portland airport 10.5 miles away (about 15 minutes driving off peak hours).    In addition to restaurants and bars nearby below is the list of other noteworthy places close to our loft.    <br />•	0.3 miles from OHSU southwester front<br />•	0.3 miles from Lair Hill Park (play area/tennis)<br />•	0.3 miles from OHSU tram<br />•	0.4 miles from Under Armour Corporate office<br />•	0.4 mile to Willamette river<br />•	0.6 miles from School of Dentistry<br />•	0.8 mile from PSU<br />•	0.9 miles from River Place Marina<br ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d8205965-7632-47c5-a86a-91ae3e88f0ee.jpg',149538332,22,'45.49918087948977','-122.67548829062692',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,107.00,1,365,105,4.82,41232955),(1788,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41238072','Secluded 2BR home, washer/dryer, private parking','Welcome to our home!<br />Here you will find a clean cozy home with everything you need when travelling with children or a group of friends—full kitchen,<br />washer and dryer, private yard, off-street parking. Convenient location near public transportations. Short distance to grocery stores, restaurants, and shopping malls. 15 minutes to downtown and airport by car.','The neighborhood is fun and lively. There are so many cool ethnic groceries stores and restaurants. Easy access to public transportation, downtown, and airport.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c3fe7085-9b18-426e-be2d-976a0f0587cb.jpg',323243651,78,'45.50118','-122.56841',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,59.00,1,14,291,4.78,41238072),(1789,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41242041','Small room for a minimalist','\"The Fir\"<br /><br />Cozy room with a skylight for a solo traveler on the 2nd floor of a North Portland craftsman home.  Desktop and chair in the room as a workspace.<br />House has keyless coded entry.  Large living room and kitchen available for use at all times. Monthly discounts.<br /><br />Portland has a occupancy tax if the rental is less than 31 days so if you want to save approximately 200 dollars of tax, book for  31+ days !','5-10 min walking distance are the St. John\'s bridge , McMenamins St. Johns, Soma Kombucha Speakeasy, Occidental brewing company, Stormbreaker brewing St. Johns, St. John\'s twin theaters, St. Johns food carts. Paiku , Louie\'s pizza, Rockabilly cafe and several other restaurants and coffee shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e532b3f6-f5ad-4258-bb59-95c358830f16.jpg',8587273,58,'45.59045','-122.74738',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,37.00,30,1125,35,5.00,41242041),(1790,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41264644','Portland\'s White House B&B - Teddy & Edith','Welcome to Portland\'s White House, one of the Rose City\'s most luxurious and elegant historic homes that now houses a high-end bed & breakfast. Dating back to 1911 when it was originally built for wealthy lumber baron Robert Lytle and his family, the neoclassical mansion is situated in the heart of the exclusive Irvington neighborhood with lots of restaurants, shopping and public transportation within walking distance.','Portland\'s White House is centrally located whether you are here on vacation or for business. Lloyd Center, the Convention Center and MODA Center are mere minutes away and the exciting downtown and Pearl districts are just over the bridge. The Japanese Gardens, Washington Park with its Rose Garden, Chinatown, Oregon Zoo, Mt. Hood, Timberline Lodge where \"The Shining\" was filmed and plenty of shopping on trendy NW 23 Ave, in downtown or on the Eastside\'s North Mississippi and NE Alberta streets.<br /><br />Those who appreciate top-notch cuisine, fine wines, microbrews, and craft cocktails are in for a real treat as Portland boasts the greatest number of critically acclaimed restaurants, wineries, microbreweries and bars per capita than any other city in the nation. We also count scores of Food Network stars and James Beard award winners whose creativity has kept the city front and center on the epicurean scene.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c60f09c4-4520-4cb3-b8a4-562b1976c1e3.jpg',318184666,7,'45.53573','-122.64192',2,2,1.50,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,41264644),(1791,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41314631','N. Portland Quiet Place','No checkout cleaning list!  Exceptionally clean/sanitized.  Located in a quiet neighborhood . Two blocks from public transportation.  3 golf courses close by.  <br /><br />PDX airport - 7 miles<br />Univ of Portland - 2 miles<br />Downtown Portland - 8 miles<br />Downtown St. Johns - 1 mile<br /><br />Kitchenette with microwave, small refrigerator, coffee maker/coffee, dishes and utensils. Pull out couch in living room with 75\" TV with Apple TV.  King size bed in bedroom. Bathroom with shower and tub.<br /> <br />Backyard space too!','Quiet neighborhood.  3 miles to University of Portland.  Within walking distance to grocery stores, cafes, movie theater and St. John’s shops (1-2 miles).  Easy drive to all areas of Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d42a6fbe-3b2d-44f2-b913-30773d465741.jpg',3948888,58,'45.59659','-122.73204',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,1,28,124,4.87,41314631),(1792,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41402809','Cozy apartment in the heart of it all!','Cozy studio apt just steps to downtown and NW/Pearl District.  Great location for shopping, bars and restaurants.  Short walk to Providence Park, 23rd Avenue and Powell\'s Books.','The neighborhood has plenty of shopping, restaurants and bars.  The location is walkable to many desirable locations.  99 Walking Score<br />7 minute walk to Powell\'s City of Books<br />5 minute walk the wonderful 23rd Ave district<br />2 minute walk to McMenamins Mission Theater<br />6 minute walk to Providence Park<br />6 minute walk to 10 Barrels Brewery','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/973ef292-edfb-438e-b116-9e86d86deebb.jpg',31289780,27,'45.52481','-122.68771',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,115.00,3,730,130,4.92,41402809),(1793,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41431514','KEX Portland-Deluxe King Ensuite','Our Deluxe King Ensuite room is over 320 sq ft and features a single king-sized bed uniquely designed with storage custom built from reclaimed 100 year old ponderosa pine.  A small sitting area provides space to relax with refurbished, mid-century furnishings.  Additional finishes include a closet, desk, Smart TV, bluetooth speaker, hair dryer and mini-fridge & freezer.  The private ensuite bath offers separate spaces for toilet & sink and a stand-up tiled shower.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41431514/original/3763cc3c-411d-4426-a84b-d7feb7a668cc.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.52452','-122.66206',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,225.00,1,28,12,4.33,41431514),(1794,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41433875','Luxe Pink Bungalow in Inner NE Portland','Come and enjoy this luxurious, light-filled retreat in inner NE Portland! Brand-new and ready for its first guests.<br /><br />The kitchen is stocked to please a chef, the incredible bathroom shower is designed to ease the soul, and everything we love about Portland is just steps away. You could have an amazing, restorative stay without ever leaving the premises, or you could walk to some of Portland\'s best shops and restaurants, or drive an hour to some of Oregon\'s most beautiful hiking trails and parks.','Located on a bike-friendly greenway, you\'re only 2 blocks away from a bike share kiosk. One of the best grocery stores in Portland is down the street. Some of Portland\'s best restaurants, parks, and small shops are just blocks away, and many more are within a mile radius.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41433875/original/8c6e348b-8c59-4adb-8b76-aefddd820579.jpeg',534482,9,'45.54918','-122.66476',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,1125,4,5.00,41433875),(1795,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41434986','Cozy Little Nest in SE Portland','\"Cozy furnished one bedroom with private patio located in SE Portland.  One block from SE Belmont. The home is upstairs of a duplex with its own secured entrance, has its own kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom, and wifi access. This unit is situated in Portland\'s most walkable neighborhood with many restaurants, bars, and coffee shops nearby. The home is very secluded and private, decorated with many indoor plants, a home away from home.','The home is in the Sunnyside Neighborhood.  One block from Belmont St where coffee shops, restaurants are.  H-mart, a Korean supermarket is two blocks away.  Laurelhurst Park is four blocks away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d7c459e7-faf3-44da-bab5-924fe6949c06.jpg',2399422,16,'45.51605','-122.62702',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,5,5.00,41434986),(1796,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41480727','Best Neighborhood in Town!!! 12','A quiet, perfectly located studio for visiting Portland\'s best spots. Beautiful Forest Park and NW 23rd - with all its fantastic food and shops - are a few minutes away (by foot) and Powell\'s, downtown Portland, the Rose Garden, and really anywhere else you\'d like to visit are easy to get to by bike, public transport, or car. Our place is equipped with a full kitchen so you can enjoy meals at home with all the amazing produce Oregon has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/110bbeb5-59f9-461a-a35c-ca9b8e360294.jpg',326526800,27,'45.53679','-122.70148',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,1125,13,4.77,41480727),(1797,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41508403','The Urban Treehouse','This newly constructed, light-filled house is located in one of Portland\'s best neighborhoods.  The house is perfectly situated in between bustling Hawthorne and Division Streets, but far enough away from the noise that you\'ll find a peaceful retreat.  Located on a bike street and walking distance to some of the city\'s trendiest restaurants and bars, shopping, movie theaters, arcades, parks, and more.','The Urban Treehouse is located on a busy bike street; great for joining in on the action by renting a Nike bike and talking a ride to Mt Tabor or excellent people watching.<br /><br />Our nook of SE Portland has some of the best restaurants in the city: Ava Gene\'s, Pok Pok, Oui Winebar, Tasty and Daughters, and the original Stumptown Coffee Roasters, to name a few. It\'s a foodie\'s paradise; you\'ll never run out of new places to try in this neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0b919571-feeb-471b-baf8-d27a545f29a3.jpg',18042309,8,'45.50705','-122.61765',1,4,1.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,3,1125,52,4.98,41508403),(1798,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41508683','Cute Room in Artist\'s Home | SE Portland','Your room was decorated with original art, vintage treasures, and natural textiles to give the space a cozy vibe. <br /><br />As long as the sun is out, our home is filled with natural light and fresh air. We\'ve got a beautiful garden in the summer, two beehives on property, and loads of books and games for you to enjoy during your stay.<br /><br />Our three fur children, two Savannah cats and a dog, are all very friendly and excited to meet you!','There are so many gems in our neighborhood! Here are just a few:<br /><br />Good Coffee -14 min walk<br />Tea Bar - 14 min walk<br />Keeper Coffee Co. - 17 min walk<br />Super Deluxe (a local fave for fast food) - 4 min walk<br />Pho Hung (the best Vietnamese food in town) - 2 min walk<br />Portland Wine Company (wine bar) - 4 min walk','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41508683/original/f72686dd-e88e-49c1-911b-5d79e75b1a2b.jpeg',806654,67,'45.49728','-122.61259',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,2,14,50,4.94,41508683),(1799,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41558609','Central Location: Alberta Arts Dis. North East:','This modern home features bright and inviting features, with large windows and an open floor plan, which are perfect for gatherings. <br /><br />Located steps from coffee shops, restaurants, and grocery stores in the Alberta Arts District, it’s minutes from downtown and easily accessible via Interstate 5. Multiple bus stops are nearby, and the airport is just a 15-minute drive away making it an ideal base for exploring Portland.','Alberta Arts consists of some 30 blocks of shops, restaurants, bars and lots of coffee. Walkable also to NE Williams which has fantastic spots too.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7603c155-ad39-4bab-8dae-5352b1720ab6.jpg',2200710,14,'45.56072','-122.66011',1,8,2.50,3.00,4.00,97.00,3,730,133,4.93,41558609),(1800,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41584806','Cozy Base Camp','This comfortable air-conditioned gem, with a Hot Tub, is located in the Hillside neighborhood of Portland and is 2 miles from downtown Portland. <br /><br />Woodsy people will love the neighborhood as Cozy Base Camp is located in the middle of a quiet, tree-laden, and family oriented neighborhood with Forest Park, the Wildwood Trail, Pittock Mansion, Japanese Garden, Rose Garden, and NW 23rd Street restaurants, all close by.','Portland\'s top things to do list are within a 3 miles radius from Cozy Base Camp. These include, but are not limited to, Pittock Mansion, Rose Garden, Japanese Garden, Hoyt Arboretum, Audubon Society, Oregon Zoo, Children\'s Museum, OMSI, Providence Park (watch a live soccer match), and Moda Center (basketball, ice hockey, concerts). We are located about 2 miles from NW 23rd Street\'s restaurants, coffee shops, bakeries, boutiques, and local microbreweries in the Pearl District.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41584806/original/50c25c88-3abc-435f-b75e-732f3a0bd835.jpeg',18198220,79,'45.52279','-122.72445',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,170.00,2,730,45,4.96,41584806),(1801,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41587291','Great Location!  River View','Located in desirable Old Town/Pearl District. Many of the best restaurants, music, museums and cultural activities are within 3 miles. <br /><br />Apartment feels like home!  Second floor deck over looking the river.  Includes internet and streaming services.  Upgraded appliances and comfy bed!<br /><br />Steps to running/bike path, light rail, streetcar, busses, Grayhound and Amtrak.  Walk to Saturday Market and Tom McCall Waterfront Park. No car necessary - direct from the airport on MAX (light rail).','Old Town/China Town/Pearl District Neighborhood is considered one of the most desirable spots in Portland.  Easy access to Downtown area by streetcar or light rail.  Nearly all the main entertainment and cultural locations are within 3 mile of us.  Easily walk to shopping, groceries and restaurants.  Saturday Market and summer concerts and activities at Waterfront Park 10 min. walk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41587291/original/914d0f64-4b63-4f5e-9c41-8f186a7a0f58.jpeg',7748525,43,'45.52864','-122.67285',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,150.00,60,120,2,5.00,41587291),(1802,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41588378','Park Place Condo Steps from Washington Park','Spacious one bedroom condo in SW Portland available for rentals of 30-Days or more.  Rental includes one parking space and a great balcony overlooking the tree lined Park Avenue.  Unbeatable location steps away from Washington Park, Portland International Rose Test Garden, and from some of Portland\'s best shopping and dining. Full Kitchen, Tub, Summertime Outdoor Pool.  Perfect spot to launch your Portland adventures from!','This condo is located in the Goose Hollow neighborhood, tucked into the foothills of Tualatin Mountains (or \"west hills\").   Literally steps away from the entrance of Washington Park one of the gateways to Forest Park (8 miles of urban forest overlooking the Willamette River with many hiking and biking trails).  The Condo is walking distance to NW Nobhill, the Pearl District, and Downtown.  While located in one of the most popular and vibrant neighborhoods in downtown Portland, it is just a few streets removed from the hustle bustle on a quiet tree lined street lined with historic homes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/45a611ae-9ff5-45c9-8ef3-2ecc720696ea.jpg',327787591,3,'45.52281','-122.69972',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,91.00,30,1125,7,4.57,41588378),(1803,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41592247','1911 Portland Craftsman - perfect for hosting Xmas','This is my own house that I rent out while I\'m out of town so it has the genuine Portland soul and vibe you\'re looking for - which you can\'t find in a typical space that\'s only used for Airbnb.  <br />This also means you get high-end amenities like a great mattress, Sonos, Weber Grill, Nespresso machine, fire pit, hammock, and a horseshoe pit.  The kitchen is also fully stocked with all the plates, silverware, cups, wine glasses, and cooking utensils/miscellany that I use and you can use as well.','The Alberta Arts District is exactly what you imagine when you envision Portland.  Independent coffee shops, cool bars, great restaurants (from cheap to fancy), tons of shopping, and the neighborhood\'s claim to fame: tons of great murals that are perfect for your @instagram feed','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c7bac76d-2739-4e40-a6f2-7b0235ca1431.jpg',3261680,1,'45.56084','-122.63192',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,25,4.88,41592247),(1804,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41592760','Airy & Bright 2 Bd Home - Fully Fenced Yard','Our bright and light filled apartment sits high above all of the other surrounding homes allowing for lots of light and beautiful views through every window. Extra tall, vaulted ceilings make the 800sq ft space feel exceptionally large. The space features 2 bedrooms, a spacious bathroom with glass shower, A/C, in-unit washer/dryer, and a private, fully fenced yard. The home is fully furnished with all essentials you will need for a comfortable stay. We allow pets to stay with approval.','This is a quiet residential neighborhood in SE Portland. You’ll see many neighbors walking their dogs to the park nearby and they’re always waving to say Hi!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0bd0d914-1360-4ee0-8e26-797165798a01.jpg',165621351,69,'45.46255','-122.59932',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,60,180,11,5.00,41592760),(1805,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41593925','SE Portland Carriage House','This beautiful Carriage House is located in SE Portland. You can walk to the Woodstock neighborhood, Mt. Scott Community Center/Park, the Portland Mercado and lots of restaurants and bars. Downstairs there is a full kitchen, living room, and garden yard. Upstairs there is a bedroom, bathroom, and office space. *Please note we do not allow pets. **Door frames are LOW! If you are over 5\'10\" you will need to duck your head in the doorways upstairs. ***Only the upstairs bedroom has AC. A window unit','We live in a very quiet neighborhood in SE Portland. Just a short walk from Mt. Scott Community Center and Park, the Portland Mercado, lots of restaurants, coffee shops, bars and pizza joints.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/64351042-72e5-4187-ba1d-ded11bd34684.jpg',327888532,65,'45.48121','-122.59265',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,3,30,40,4.98,41593925),(1806,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41614898','Bright and Airy Brooklyn Cottage','Enjoy the charm and walkability of one of Portland\'s oldest neighborhoods in this bright and airy Brooklyn Cottage.  Great space with newly remodeled kitchen and bathroom, original wood floors, and located blocks away from the MAX Orange line.  Making it minutes to downtown and the waterfront on public transport. Tastefully decorated,  this home has smart updates, comfortable beds, and is a great location to launch your Portland adventures from.','Quiet, tree-lined residential neighborhood,  close to parks and maybe 8-10 minutes walking to retail and coffee shops. Walking distance to Pok Pok Wing\'s, Bushwacker\'s Cider House, and other local neighborhood haunts like the Aladdin Theater, warehouse Cafe, Kombucha Bars, and other great restaurants. (Close to SE Division \"Resturant Row\" which is home to the original Pok Pok, Ava Gene\'s, Xico, and other great dining. About 10 minutes on bike or car - maybe 20 -30 minutes walking.)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/94a99023-f20d-42f2-b965-d55312734975.jpg',328120961,56,'45.4981','-122.65118',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,114.00,3,190,68,4.88,41614898),(1807,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41715191','KEX Portland-Family Room Ensuite','A great option for families, friends, or small groups, our Family Room Ensuite features one queen bed with two sets of bunks, a small sitting area with refurbished mid-century furnishings, Smart TV, an en suite bathroom, desk, closet storage, and mini fridge & freezer.  Each of our modern-industrial bunk beds is equipped with canvas privacy curtains, a reading light, and large drawers to store belongings securely. The size of the room is 324 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41715191/original/09e3f4d8-e7ee-4f42-9f57-58f74b61f3b8.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.52464','-122.66039',2,6,1.00,0.00,5.00,248.00,1,28,65,4.88,41715191),(1808,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41715321','KEX Portland-Queen Shared Bath','While it may be our smallest room, our Queen Shared Bath has its charms.  We call it \"the most comfortable shoebox you\'ll ever stay in.\"  This room is perfect for adventurers looking for a comfortable place to lay your head after a day of exploring Portland and the surrounding area.  Just down the hall and throughout the building are multiple shared, individual locking bathrooms, each with its own shower.  Linen & personal bath towels included. The size of the room is 100 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/efd53223-fd8a-432b-a1a6-2a0f976ffe1e.jpg',325943042,12,'45.52501','-122.66261',2,2,11.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,1,28,83,4.80,41715321),(1809,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41715367','KEX Portland-Small Bunk Room-Mixed','Our Small Bunk Shared Bath offers 2 sets of our modern-industrial bunk beds.  Each bunk is equipped with privacy curtains and storage, electrical outlet, reading light, and large drawers to store belongings.  Down the hall are multiple shared, individual locking bathrooms, each with its own shower.  All beds come with linen & bath towels. Prices are based on selected occupancy.  Size of the room is 130-160 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41715367/original/aac40228-d11a-4499-b7aa-5911d2fb7e9b.jpeg',325943042,32,'45.52292','-122.66126',2,4,11.00,1.00,4.00,179.00,1,28,5,4.60,41715367),(1810,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41715417','KEX Portland-Double Queen Shared Bath','Our Double Queen with Shared Bath offers two queen beds, a comfortable sitting area and a Smart TV. Spacious enough for four guests, this room is a perfect home base for your Portland adventure. Just down the hall and throughout the building are multiple shared, individual locking bathrooms, each with its own shower. Shampoo, body wash and conditioner provided. Linen & personal bath towels included. The size of the room is 225 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41715417/original/f00971eb-e573-43d1-a275-bb2b1fc0ea0e.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.52495','-122.66083',2,6,11.00,1.00,6.00,142.00,1,28,14,4.86,41715417),(1811,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41715735','KEX Portland-Bunk in Sixteen Bed Shared Room','Single bunk in 16-bed shared room. Utilizing facilities located down the hall and throughout the building.<br /><br /><br />All beds come with linen & personal bath towels.<br /><br /><br />Each Bunk has an assigned luggage drawer that can be locked with a padlock of your own, or buy one from the Front Desk for $3.<br /><br /><br />Amenities Include:<br />24hr Front Desk<br />Free public WiFi<br />Daily housekeeping service<br />Guest kitchen facility<br />Sauna access 7am-10pm<br /><br />The size of the room is 582 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41715735/original/3a8d0128-b7b0-4fb0-83bc-0818ab9c2beb.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.52317','-122.66134',3,1,12.00,1.00,16.00,50.00,1,28,68,4.59,41715735),(1812,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41741290','KEX Portland-Sixteen Bed Room','16-bed shared room. Utilizing facilities located down the hall and throughout the building.<br /><br /><br />All beds come with linen & personal bath towels.<br /><br /><br />Amenities Include:<br />24hr Front Desk<br />WiFi<br />Sauna <br />Gym<br />Morning Coffee Service<br /><br />The size of the room is 582 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/36e73641-4bd3-4af2-b50f-bcbb0ac976ff.jpg',325943042,12,'45.52316','-122.66239',2,16,12.00,1.00,16.00,499.00,1,28,2,4.50,41741290),(1813,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41780299','Bright Garden-View Studio','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish studio. This Southeast Portland 2nd floor mother-in-law-apartment is a lovely retreat, overlooking a lovely garden space. Tons of windows and skylight make it a beautiful bright space, and the angles and mature cedar trees provide plenty of privacy without sacrificing the natural light. Exterior stairs up from the garden with a small private patio. Full kitchen, spacious shower, vaulted ceiling, large closet, 65\" TV with sound system.','Residential neighborhood, 5 blocks from Foster Ave, which has shopping, restaurants, and bars. 5 minute drive to I-205.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-41780299/original/2ecf363e-ccbc-478d-bb39-3e3f43959f35.jpeg',8944230,65,'45.48324','-122.59477',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,79.00,30,365,2,5.00,41780299),(1814,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41796434','Northrup | Heart of the NW | 2 Apartments','Experience Portland city life in our newly-constructed garage conversion. This multi-level apartment is perfect for families or work associates with two queen bedrooms and two bathrooms in a spacious layout apart. Parking is easy to find on nearby streets. You\'ll love the stunning views overlooking the city & the proximity to shopping, dining and hiking. Right in the heart of the Alphabet District, we are close to downtown and perfect for your Portland stay!','We love our neighborhood and are sure you will, too! We\'re just a few blocks from NW 23rd Ave where you\'ll find tons of dining and boutique shopping and are in close proximity to trails leading into Forest Park. There\'s so much to do, see and eat even in our immediate area not to mention the rest of the west side including Downtown. This truly is a wonderful home-base for exploring the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-41796434/original/37123805-7675-481e-bd25-a680b562f0b9.jpeg',215058058,27,'45.53128052','-122.70561218',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,130.00,2,365,72,4.97,41796434),(1815,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41800138','Pettygrove | Heart of the NW | Guest Studio','We designed this guest suite with travelers in mind &  are excited to provide the perfect home-base for exploring the city. Our newly finished studio has a comfortable queen Murphy bed, a SmartTV, a kitchenette with a mini-fridge, microwave and Keurig, and a lovely bathroom with a large shower stall. We\'re right in the heart of NW Portland & are walkable to all the dining & shopping on NW 23rd Ave and just a quick trip to Downtown PDX. This location can\'t be beat!','We love our neighborhood and are sure you will, too! We\'re just a few blocks from NW 23rd Ave where you\'ll find tons of dining and boutique shopping and are in close proximity to trails leading into Forest Park. There\'s so much to do, see and eat even in our immediate area not to mention the rest of the west side including Downtown. This truly is a wonderful home-base for exploring the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-41800138/original/66aa2d8a-b1f4-4f7d-9645-243ea61ee96a.jpeg',215058058,27,'45.53128052','-122.70561218',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,2,365,39,4.77,41800138),(1816,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41812444','NE Haven (Bedroom 2)','The perfect combination of city and suburban life, NE Haven is a 1500 sq ft 3bd/2ba house settled in a quiet neighborhood close to Alberta Arts district in Northeast Portland. I currently live on the property and rent two bedrooms. For everyone’s comfort, I only accept guests with positive reviews.','NE Haven is a 5 min drive/bus ride or 7 minute bike ride from Alberta Arts district which has abundant walkable shops, restaurants, and bars. Ecovibe, Petite Provence, and Rosie\'s Lounge are a few favorites.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2e1f0ff0-e331-4152-8835-243de1e4602f.jpg',90127719,21,'45.56258','-122.61504',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,38.00,30,90,21,5.00,41812444),(1817,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/41816505','Cozy SE Apartment with King Bed','This recently remodeled  SE Portland 1 bedroom 1 bath is comfy, trendy and nestled right in between Sellwood and Woodstock. Within walking distance to coffee shops, resturants, Trader Joes, New Seasons and several beautiful parks.','SE Portland is a great neighborhood filled with coffee shops, boutiques, resturants and overall charming vibes. Check out Keeper Coffee and Wyrd Leather and Mead a block up the streetaway, walk around 