af-93cd-411f-9706-ea64d697fdfb.jpeg',1185199,81,'45.53964','-122.7592',1,5,2.50,3.00,3.00,400.00,31,120,81,4.96,42714237),(1853,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42777186','Montavilla manor #2','Charming 2 bedroom, 1.5 bath in hip Montavilla neighborhood. Great restaurants, bars, breweries, coffee and movie theater just a 3 minute walk away. Full use of space. Large yard with fire pit and views of Mt. Hood. Use of grill for summer grillin\'.  Easy access to downtown, 3 to 5 minute walk to three major bus lines that run late (one is 24 / 7).  Close to beautiful Mt. Tabor Park.  Office space with desk and printer. Dedicated coffee bar.  I live in this property when not rented','Located in hip Montavilla neighborhood.  Lots of cool bars, restaurants, breweries, a movie theater and more!  Close to beautiful Mt. Tabor park.  Close to three major bus lines, easy access to highways and close to downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-42777186/original/e0f39618-1d5c-46b5-bcb3-fa2f812f295e.jpeg',138761774,15,'45.52044','-122.58624',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,95.00,3,100,24,4.71,42777186),(1854,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42778000','Welcome to \"The Gladstone House\"  Enjoy your stay.','SUPER CLEAN 2 bedroom 1 bath. Brand new kitchen with plates, glasses, pots, pans, etc. Like new HOT TUB.  FREE 2 car parking in driveway. Great neighborhood.  Close to restaurants, bars, breweries, golf courses, parks and bike trails. The coast and Mt. Hood are 1.5 hours away. Downtown is 10 minutes away.  Mt. Tabor is super close.  Multnomah Falls is a half hour away.  Hood River is 1 hour.  Buss is two blocks away. Airport is a little over 20 minutes away.','It is a quiet neighborhood in a cozy part of town.  Close to parks, grocery stores, restaurants, bars, hiking, biking, 1.5 hours to coast or Mt. Hood, hour to Hood River.  15 minutes downtown','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/94c69e5e-3c11-43d1-80b8-5e2ebc65a3b2.jpg',275151873,36,'45.49235','-122.60052',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,133.00