om and full bath with shower/claw foot tub.<br /><br />Superb walkability: two blocks from bustling Williams (Eem, Either/Or coffee, Migration brewing) and 4 blocks from Mississippi (Lovely 5050’s pizza, Mississippi food carts, Por Que No).<br /><br />Fast Wi-fi, luxe linens and contemporary furnishings.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/166a0dc9-4c36-43df-8a97-1d15c77f01ea.jpg',13315319,9,'45.55102','-122.6692',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,250.00,30,1125,26,5.00,42878671),(1858,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42901591','Willow Tree Guesthouse','Pet friendly guest house in SE Portland 1 block from the heart of SE Division street.  Located on a quiet dead-end street, with a full kitchen, ground floor bedroom/bathroom, spacious walk-in shower, and super cozy upstairs loft makes for the perfect work remote office.<br /><br />Grocery stores in every direction, neighborhood wine shop, and weed shop, restaurants and bars right around the corner.  <br /><br />Location and walk score - 100!','So much to say about our neighborhood!  We are located right in the heart of SE Division street.  ** edited for post-pandemic life.<br /><br />Restaurants and bars are all opening back up for inside/outside dining - so you have an option in every direction based on your preference.<br /><br />We love eating out and we love sharing our favorites - so feel free to ask us about our neighborhood.  Pizza, taquerias, cocktails, burgers...we can recommend based on what you\'re after.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7510a2a3-244b-4106-96c6-0104e4e7d67d.jpg',30125965,8,'45.50457','-122.62614',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,137.00,5,1125,169,4.99,42901591),(1859,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42927674','BEST NEIGHBORHOOD IN TOWN! 24','NORTHWEST PORTLAND: Completely furnished studio in a beautiful Mediterranean building located in friendly, close-in Northwest Portland. <br />This convenient location with a 98 Walk Score is close to some of the best restaurants, bars and cafes in town.','Close-in Northwest Portland