W Portland !','Penthouse unit loft overlooking Jamison Square Park with views to the South. High ceilings open | floor plan offer amazing urban living. One bedroom with 2 full baths and gas fireplace. <br />Enjoy the changing seasons and the access to the park. High end finishes, electric shades and more!<br /><br />99 walk score!! Just steps to Starbucks, Safeway, Lovejoy Bakery, Yama Sushi, and many other restaurants. Also, close steps to the tram.  Amazing getaway for any couple hoping to get away and enjoy city life!','99 walk score<br />Literally steps to Starbucks, Safeway, Lovejoy Bakery, Yama Sushi, and many many other restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9da63fe3-4c8f-49ed-b57f-e02a0c18c157.jpg',9811068,2,'45.52933','-122.68305',1,3,2.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,120,1125,2,5.00,43117017),(1864,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43118109','comfortable and relaxing room','I live in a townhouse centrally located close to all major transportation.','Close to Ventura Park and mall 205','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43118109/original/a58309fe-bda8-438a-baff-61b40e612f84.jpeg',284536420,90,'45.51886','-122.54234',2,4,1.50,1.00,1.00,40.00,3,30,36,4.86,43118109),(1865,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43124643','Cottage, Walk to MAX, Drinks, Dining, Full Kitchen','Wonderful detached cottage in the heart of Northeast Portland. Sitting in a beautiful neighborhood you are just five blocks from the North Prescott St. MAX Station, restaurants, bars, and just minutes from downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-43124643/original/7edbd987-d7dd-47eb-88ef-1c5a25ada86f.jpeg',62261998,13,'45.55393','-122.68529',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,2,29,70,4.77,43124643),(1866,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43205207','Luxury Private 2 Bedroom Apartment w/Healthclub','A beautiful place to spend your days and nights. 1,100 sf second story apartment has all you need plus more!<br />Luxury unit for the fitness enthusiast. Rent the entire space and have the place to yourself.  Full health club membership included during your stay. New construction in 2019 on the second level of this 1914 building. Stylish and eclectic with a high sense of flair. Original artwork, high ceilings, huge amount of light. Comfortable with plenty of space to relax.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/42effeed-0cbc-4d7b-934f-245e8699be4e.jpg',13540222,58,'45.58895','-122.74267',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,180,11,4.73,43205207),(1867,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43236902','Angel\'s Rest','Located in North Portland close to the St. John\'s area.  Separate entrance to a new basement space with sleeping area and bathroom. One queen size bed and a sofa. The sofa is not a bed. There is a beautiful backyard, deck and propane fire pit to enjoy. Bus lines easily accessible one block away. Walking distance to University of Portland, short ride to the Moda center and 10 minutes from downtown Portland. Street parking is available.','The Portland airport is 10-15 minutes away. Close to  the University of Portland and hiking trails located just past St. John\'s.  It\'s a quick bus ride or Uber to the Moda Center and downtown Portland. Walking distance to several restaurants and local dive bars.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43236902/original/f5872bd8-1616-4179-a049-e4657964e214.jpeg',271575145,60,'45.58544','-122.71861',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,70.00,1,15,192,4.95,43236902),(1868,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43280700','Turn-Of-The-Century Meets Modern','A beautifully re-imagined, impeccably maintained 1900 Victorian located in the heart of SE Buckman. This space artfully mixes turn-of-the-century craftsmanship with modern details and amenities. Originally curated with our family of six in mind, it has been carefully designed to inspire a creative, playful and refined approach to life as a modern family.<br /><br />We offer one to four month rentals (additional months negotiable) beginning in 2021. Availability begins Jan. 1st.','The neighborhood offers a delightful mix of urban character and close-knit neighborly vibe. Centrally located our home is only a few minutes from downtown Portland, while just steps from popular retail, restaurants, and coffee shops as well as Revolution Hall (one of Portland’s premier music venues). In this location you are assured a convenient, well-rounded Portland experience with virtually all your daily needs right at your finger tips.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/249cd08f-4f26-429e-863d-ec544ca09650.jpg',66001964,32,'45.51952','-122.65196',1,6,2.00,4.00,5.00,170.00,30,1125,10,5.00,43280700),(1869,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43328124','Best neighborhood in Portland- 25','Completely furnished, modern, private. Located in friendly, close-in Northwest Portland. This central location with a 98 Walk Score and is next to some of the best restaurants, bars and cafes in town.','Close-in Northwest Portland- Nob Hill.<br /><br />This convenient location, with a 98 POINT WALK SCORE is blocks from trendy NW 23rd AVE, Dragonfly Coffee House, St. Honore Bakery, McMenamins Pub, a natural foods grocery store, the public library, as well as the post office. <br /><br />Window shop at all the lovely boutiques located just blocks away or hike/bike/run/explore the 80 miles of trails and over 5,000 acres of Forest Park; one of the largest urban parks in the United States! <br /><br />You can quickly and easily reach the Pearl District, the Brewery Blocks or Downtown Portland in minutes by foot, bike or streetcar; no need for a vehicle when living here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/46aa5acb-819b-4348-8c01-516c0c7720b8.jpg',121884165,27,'45.53714','-122.70373',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,58.00,30,365,8,4.25,43328124),(1870,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43381222','Central Portland Neighborhood - Tudor Style','Excellent Central Location - 5 minutes to downtown located within the Inner SouthEast district.  Comfortable and updated Tudor style home with easy access to the MAX light rail and tri-met transit stops.  Directly across the river from OHSU and downtown Portland. Timeliness access to all areas of the city is one of the best things about this location!','Brooklyn is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Sellwood, Hawthorne, Division and Clinton. Residents have plenty of coffee, pub and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br /><br />Brooklyn is definitely a favorite and in-demand Portland neighborhood and feels very community-friendly, safe and family-focused.  Dog walkers, runners, babes in strollers and people of all sorts busy the streets.  Brooklyn, like most of its close-by sister neighborhoods, is fiercely independent and has a high number of locally owned businesses that thrive due to overwhelming local support.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/85312920-e3a7-4e1d-85f6-86ed86b6df51.jpg',11629153,56,'45.4981','-122.65845',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,190.00,2,1125,172,4.87,43381222),(1871,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43413841','Lovely Cottage in a wonderful location!','Nestled in the leafy Kerns neighborhood, this bright and breezy cottage is ready to embrace and delight you. Your hosts, Robert and Kristie, live in the century-old parsonage on the same property. The lot is divided for your privacy, but we are close by if needed. Our co-host Nancy is also available for any questions or concerns.','Located on one of Portland\'s designated bike routes, our location offers quick access to beautiful Laurelhurst Park, a first run movie theater, and more delicious dining options on \"Restaurant Row\" than you will have time to explore. Seriously, Portland\'s best sushi, pizza, and Thai are within three blocks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7bc33a6e-3552-4400-a5c3-f1cefbb8f3a6.jpg',50415523,12,'45.52076','-122.63451',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,160.00,3,1125,105,4.98,43413841),(1872,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43414626','Cozy + Modern in NE Portland by Mississippi Ave','A comfortable and convenient 2-bedroom (sleeps 5) basement suite in the heart of Portland’s world-renowned foodie/arts district, North Williams. Trendy, modern, and unique bars, food carts, cafes, restaurants, parks, and shops are all at your fingertips. No pets please.','The apartment is in the perfect NE Portland location, the Williams District. No need to have a car with a walking score of 93 and a bike score of 100. It’s only a few blocks from Mississippi Ave., Alberta arts district, and the Moda Center. We have some of the best restaurants and bakeries in Portland right in the neighborhood, including Eem, Ox, Quaintrelle, Matt’s BBQ, Jinju Patisserie, and Coco Donuts. You can walk to New Seasons grocery and Whole Foods in under 10 minutes. Numerous parks within walking distance. <br /><br />We are 2 miles (an 8-minute drive) to downtown Portland and 15 minutes from the PDX airport. Both Mt. Hood and the Oregon coast are 90 minutes away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/41cd9b49-79ab-4c42-8172-80f5bb7e3a72.jpg',36057135,9,'45.55124','-122.66582',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,135.00,2,1125,117,4.97,43414626),(1873,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43450548','Big Tastefully Furnished Well-Lit Downtown Studio','Delightful big and tastefully furnished downtown studio apartment, 516 sf, big windows (two opposite directions), near everything: walk to the restaurants, museums, the Schnizer Concert Hall,  breweries. Right by the Blue Line+Red Line Max Light Rail station. Big windows, eat-in kitchen, wonderfully maintained apartment building.Bicycle parking, free washer/drier. 1 month minimum<br />There is presently a low-key repiping project in the building during some working hours.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3f2e4657-9c14-44cb-86d4-12e621fc2aaf.jpg',5790741,3,'45.52065','-122.68754',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,60.00,31,1125,4,4.75,43450548),(1874,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43457851','Pier Park Studio','I have a lovely fully furnished STUDIO APARTMENT in a quiet neighborhood in St. Johns, Portland. The studio is on the 2nd floor of a 1957 home. The studio is one block from Pier Park, a mile from downtown St. Johns, Cathedral and Forest Park, 4 miles to Kelley Point Park and a 15 minute drive to downtown. The studio has a private entry up a spiral staircase with an outdoor patio space and mudroom.','St. Johns is a quiet neighborhood with lots of green spaces for trail running, disc golf, beach time at the river and hundreds of miles of hiking through Forest park just a walk over the St. Johns bridge. There is a quaint downtown with excellent restaurant options, bars, boutiques and coffee shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8969aed1-8fe7-4a3f-b09b-5706963ea4dc.jpg',60440751,58,'45.59784','-122.7513',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,180,1,5.00,43457851),(1875,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43460057','Entire House  | Alberta St. | NE Portland','Clean space with all the amenities you need. Located in Alberta Arts District, walking distance to restaurants, bars, galleries, and parks (Walk Score: 86!). 6 miles from the airport.<br /><br />• Free onsite parking<br />• Ductless Minisplit AC/Heat<br />• Fast WIFI w/ desk<br />• Ideal for individuals, families, mellow groups<br />• No cigarette smoking,<br />• Keypad Entry<br />• Washer/Dryer<br />• Record Player<br />• Audio Receiver w Bluetooth<br />• Games<br />• Hammock','Everyone loves Alberta. Two blocks from the house and you are on Alberta street with its endless stream of food trucks, bars, and art galleries. There\'s a Salt n Straw just blocks away. Alberta park is around the corner.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-43460057/original/b17f6d13-f1f9-421a-b3d0-91a0efea7c9d.jpeg',19836266,29,'45.5623','-122.64921',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,280.00,4,70,39,4.90,43460057),(1876,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43505870','NoPo Comfy Studio Private Bathroom & Mini Kitchen','Welcome Solo Travelers!! Wonderful Studio in North Portland  close in.  Walk 