re just off the hustle and bustle of Division Street where you can easily assess a bus to take you down the street to the countless bars and restaurants, or downtown. Easily walk or bike to popular bakeries, neighborhood grocery stores, food carts and restaurants. Rain or Shine Coffee house is across the street and is one of three walk able coffee shops, including Stumptown Coffee.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f8d7e036-f208-48cb-96ad-8d6cdedc02a7.jpg',10042363,15,'45.50603','-122.60372',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,120.00,31,90,16,5.00,43612262),(1880,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43613723','Cute St. John’s Home w/ fenced backyard & patio','Cute newly renovated furnished home in North Portland. The house is located in the St. Johns Neighborhood, a hidden gem in Portland. Enjoy newly updated kitchen, bathroom, and new appliances. With a cozy fenced in backyard and patio you can enjoy an oasis in the city. There  is an extra storage unit in the 2 car carport to keep extra belongings plus ample space for parking. The location is a short walk to downtown St. John’s shops and restaurants but is in a  residential neighborhood.','St. Johns is a destination neighborhood that is characterized by the beauty of Cathedral Park under the St. Johns Bridge. The house is walking distance from Pier Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d5896f94-58c8-48d3-9bd3-9e712aa46f51.jpg',9111756,58,'45.59861','-122.74441',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,30,200,1,3.00,43613723),(1881,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43628652','Classic NW Studio on the East Side','Located minutes away from all the hip Portland neighborhoods, walking distance to public transportation, parks, restaurants and bars. Built in 1928 this brick building is the quintessential Portland \"double-studio\" with a pull down Murphy bed, separate kitchen and dinning spaces, in-condo laundry and a deep ceramic bathtub. A corner unit on the 3rd and top floor with amazing morning light and evening shade, a great space for a single person or a couple. Pets welcomed.','The Lloyd District is in the heart of the city with easy access to popular neighborhoods/bustling streets like Hawthorne, Division, Alberta and Mississippi. On Broadway you’ll find fancy frozen yogurt at Eb & Bean, karaoke at Capitol Bar,  fish tacos at The Taco Peddler,  the best croissants at Twisted Croissant and my  favorite baristas at St. Simon Coffee.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDM2Mjg2NTI%3D/original/44d49c7e-889d-4f82-9b78-d757e3cce17d.jpeg',675365,59,'45.53305','-122.65535',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,55.00,30,1125,14,5.00,43628652),(1882,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43691971','Spacious, cozy home near Happy Valley, PDX Airport','Spacious home with 5 bedrooms, 3 full bathrooms, fast Wi-Fi, a fireplace, private office space setup for remote work, and free parking.  The main bedroom has in-suite bathroom with soaking tub and a walk-in closet.  One of the bedrooms is on the main floor and is adjacent to a full bathroom.<br /><br />The backyard is fully fenced and has fruit trees, shrubs and flowers. It backs into a green space along  Springwater Corridor Trail, creating a quite and tranquil space in the middle of the city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7fc5bb21-38d2-4b07-897b-5a151f22402e.jpg',38622835,78,'45.48117','-122.53659',1,10,3.00,5.00,5.00,321.00,2,360,11,4.82,43691971),(1883,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43701179','Garden Studio in Backyard Oasis','Looking for a uniquely Portland experience? Come stay in a cozy cottage nestled into the lush backyard of a beautiful neighborhood! Becca and Anthony are your hosts and invite you to stay in the cottage while they are traveling (it\'s usually their primary living space).<br /><br />Becca is a designer by trade and converted their garage into a comfortable garden-centric retreat perfect for 1-2 guests.','Visit our village just around the corner! Have a leisurely breakfast at Milk Glass Market or indulge in an Old Fashioned at one of the best whiskey bars in the city, the Old Gold. There are numerous restaurants, bars, and coffee shops within walking distance of our home. Our favorites spots within a short walking distance include Stacks for delicious Coffee and books and Milk Glass Market for a refreshing bottle of rose. <br /><br />Mississippi Avenue is a 5 minute drive away and has more food trucks and restaurants with dine in options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/dffc4fac-13be-4ce4-b470-a21342826ecf.jpg',11875534,13,'45.56403','-122.68947',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,1,5.00,43701179),(1884,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43766909','Stylish and Spacious NE Portland Retreat','This newly renovated, spacious, and luxurious studio apartment with its own private entrance and plenty of natural light is located in the Rose City Park neighborhood of Portland.<br /><br />You will be right in the heart of the city — close to both downtown and PDX.  Restaurants, coffee shops, a wine shop, a brewery, a bagel shop, a grocery store, a golf course, and parks are all within easy walking distance.  There is plenty of free street parking, as well as access to multiple types of public transit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8514d8c7-eaf3-417d-8602-69d620307098.jpg',243717356,39,'45.54248','-122.59392',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,75.00,1,1125,303,4.96,43766909),(1885,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43788324','Artist #8--Just Steps from the Max','Our home was just completed, new construction features one bedroom and one bathroom. Only steps away from the Max/Train-experience Portland like a native rather than a visitor. Situated in North Portland aka NOPO-the Kenton Neighborhood is true Portlandia. A two minute walk puts you in Kenton Historical District with plenty of shops, pubs, restaurants, and beautiful park.','Our neighborhood is special because it\'s right off the Max Line (public light rail), but still feels like a Portland neighborhood.  We are only steps from some of our favorite places to eat, or grab happy hour. In season there is also a farmers market once a week. Our neighborhood park is only a couple blocks away and has a new play structure and splash pad.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a97cced6-403d-4721-92e0-01c5b755aec8.jpg',6692974,55,'45.58451','-122.6844',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,30,1125,9,4.78,43788324),(1886,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43788586','Cozy private studio in SE Portland','Perfect for 2 people!   <br /><br />Bright Basement studio unit with private entry, queen bed, kitchenette with coffee, microwave, toaster oven, small refrigerator, bathroom w/full shower.  <br /><br />In the Foster-Powell area of SE Portland, close to the Holgate Max Station, Pickles semi-professional baseball games, Lents Farmer\'s Market, Reed College, Foster-Powell area. Woodstock and Sellwood area are near, along with SE Division Street, and Portland Community College.  Restaurants and shopping are steps away.','SE Portland, Powell-Foster area - Food CORE carts,  EastPortland Food Carts, the El Mercado Food Carts, along with the Woodstock and Sellwood area. Max Metro train within walking distance, Lents Park','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43788586/original/1fb43e4e-dab6-4556-b32f-78f300a23bbc.jpeg',197531214,72,'45.485039','-122.576141',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,2,12,117,4.93,43788586),(1887,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43788776','Entertainer #7–Just Steps from the Max','Our home is just a few years old, newer construction features two bedrooms and two bathrooms. Only steps away from the Max/Train-experience Portland like a native rather than a visitor. Situated in North Portland aka NOPO-the Kenton Neighborhood is true Portlandia. A two minute walk puts you in Kenton Historical District with plenty of shops, pubs, restaurants, and beautiful park.','Our neighborhood is special because it\'s right off the Max Line (public light rail), but still feels like a Portland neighborhood.  We are only steps from some of our favorite places to eat, or grab happy hour. In season there is also a farmers market once a week.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43788776/original/6119a3cc-5246-4080-b617-ec4061de325f.jpeg',6692974,55,'45.58466','-122.68287',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,150.00,30,730,0,1.00,43788776),(1888,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43788892','Chill Out! Beautiful 2BR with Cozy Queen Beds!','Located on one of Portland\'s hottest and desirable neighborhoods, this cozy, clean and quiet 2-bedroom has many activities and entertainment to choose from. The Portland airport (PDX) is just 13 minutes away and cost around $20 for an Uber/Lyft ride.','Enjoy some of Portland’s parks, biking/hiking trails, top restaurants and bars including Tasty and Son\'s, Gravy, Miss Delta, Knock Back, and many others... Minutes a way you will also have Safeway, Fred Meyer\'s, Starbucks and New Seasons Market.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6b2849ab-7fdd-4213-8785-30cdcf06e2cc.jpg',160352710,48,'45.57774','-122.66792',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,2,45,48,4.90,43788892),(1889,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43797942','Plenty of Room, 2100 SF, Close to I-5, Large Yard','Conveniently located just off I-5 in the far SW Portland, NW Lake Oswego area. Costco, Walmart, grocery stores and restaurants are only 1/2 mile away. Modern 2100 square foot, 2 bedroom smart home with 3 queen beds and a large private back yard shaded by a 300 year old fir tree and a covered deck. Central heat and air conditioning for year round comfort. Room lights can be controlled by voice or with smart dimmers. Whole house audio with Alexa, 4 smart TVs thousands of free movies for streaming.','This neighborhood contains many large trees and wildlife. Birds, rabbits, and an occasional deer can be seen in the yard.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-43797942/original/f4303d0f-ad1a-42cd-ac82-d5455f03d0b9.jpg',32935900,68,'45.43714904785156','-122.74223327636719',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,175.00,5,28,46,4.96,43797942),(1890,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43819014','Peaceful oasis in the heart of Nob Hill','Historic home with thoughtfully curated spaces and modern amenities in one of Portland’s best neighborhoods. Our design ethos can be felt throughout the home; the philosophy that simplicity is the ultimate sophistication. Heirloom quality comfort in a timeless setting. Enjoy a light and plant filled Portland home in the heart of the City.','Our charming home is tucked in the heart of Nob Hill. Surrounded by wonderful restaurants and shops of 23rd. Only a short walk to explore and enjoy our most famous parks like the International Rose Garden, Japanese Garden, Washington Park and Forest Park. Return to wellness in the copper soaking tub after hiking in the lush forest.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/35849501-2b33-4ee0-853d-2559abd116d1.jpg',7008585,27,'45.52583','-122.6968',1,4,3.00,2.00,4.00,171.00,30,1125,16,4.88,43819014);
INSERT INTO `listings` VALUES (1891,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43859590','Serenity Pearl-private terrace, & reserved parking','Nestled in the heart of Portland’s chic Pearl District, our upscale condo offers the epitome of urban living. Immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of this trendy neighborhood with renowned restaurants boutique shopping, art galleries, and gorgeous parks.  On our private West-Facing terrace you can soak up the sun and unwind. You’ll have access to the city’s attractions via pedestrian-friendly paths and Streetcar; enjoy luxury, convenience, and urban chic at the Gregory Condominiums','The Pearl District is in the center of NW Portland. It’s considered an upscale side of downtown and is conveniently located to highly rated restaurants, shopping and galleries all within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-43859590/original/6c773c5a-75c5-4914-adc7-8f111dfe988d.jpeg',8996240,2,'45.52605056762695','-122.6822280883789',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,138.00,30,1125,10,5.00,43859590),(1892,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43870675','Spectacular Views, Huge Deck, BBQ, Pet Friendly','After winding up the road through one of the most affluent regions of Portland you will find this wonderful home nestled in the hills above Northwest Portland and the Pearl District just a mile below.  This home is the perfect blend of style, location, and incredible views.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-43870675/original/ce993723-0519-4adc-a396-b6af923ea059.jpeg',62261998,79,'45.53183','-122.7132',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,227.00,2,29,60,4.83,43870675),(1893,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43910673','The Cascadia Retreat - Luxury Home ~ 90 WalkScore','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43910673/original/11d9b7d9-4a94-4d00-8f43-896cd291fdba.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55822','-122.66845',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,251.00,1,1125,291,4.89,43910673),(1894,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43911827','Stylish Luxe Suite N Williams & Alberta Districts','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43911827/original/65910981-c05f-4cfb-b62d-dd5d5b68a7f6.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55903','-122.66712',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,251.00,30,1125,270,4.90,43911827),(1895,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43916302','Mt. Tabor Manor - Elegant Getaway','Stay on your own private floor with all the amenities of a fully furnished 900 sq ft. apartment plus washer/dryer. <br />Close to Mt. Tabor, great location with easy access to parks, restaurants and coffee shops, Public transportation and Bike paths. 90” projector for games and movies, laid back neighborhood with grocery store across the street, and outdoor patio for guests. <br /><br />PETS: Only allowed on a case by case basis. We love them but also host others who may have allergies or other issues :)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/22fdcd55-018b-445e-be24-06f39dcf9092.jpg',140171773,52,'45.5235','-122.60884',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,3,730,28,4.68,43916302),(1896,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43946632','City Serenity: Stylish 2-Bed Alberta Haven','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43946632/original/ebc016c3-58c4-428f-95ee-8ee0fc1b52c7.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55796','-122.66787',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,94.00,1,1125,318,4.88,43946632),(1897,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43946701','Designer 2BR Alberta Arts District 90 WalkScore','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! There\'s no better spot to stay in Portland as we are a mere 20 minutes from the airport and just a short jaunt to Alberta & Mississippi! The Alberta neighborhood boasts many hot spots whether that be shops, restaurants, coffee shops or parks! The selection for foodies on Alberta is second to none, my stomach can attest to that. The PNW is full of outdoor activities within an hour drive, so don\'t be afraid to venture out if wanted! Our quiet cozy neighborhood is also close to private Concordia University for people who may be looking to visit a loved one at the school. There are 2 food cart villages within walking distance as well as public transportation lines literally right up the street if you want to make a quick (25 min) cruise into downtown Portland. Would rather take an Uber? You\'re looking at about 10-15 minute drive. Within 10-15 minute walk.. (Portland Famous Spots) - Kennedy School McMenamins (Soak tubs available) - \"The Worlds Best\" ice cream :','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-43946701/original/e8779ec2-75f9-4e75-bcfe-5e96f2593225.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55886','-122.66937',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,89.00,1,1125,397,4.93,43946701),(1898,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43969621','Stunning Guest Home with Beautiful Garden','Stunning backyard guest house in beautiful Portland Neighborhood.  Garden setting inside the city! A short walk to restaurants, grocery, shops, and parks. Easy parking. Full, well-stocked kitchen. Coffee and tea provided for your first day. <br /><br />Please note that there are chickens and dogs on site. This home is not appropriate for people who are not comfortable with animals or children.  <br /><br />Ample street parking.','Wonderful Sunnyside neighborhood!  A quick walk to Never Coffee around the block, the Multnomah County Library down the street, a few blocks from Beautiful Laurelhurst park, within walking distance of numerous restaurants on Belmont and Hawthorne.  A short bike ride to Mt. Tabor. Quintessential SE Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/bd8e9100-7881-4847-b7d5-21a2b3e4b8e2.jpg',352184767,16,'45.51582','-122.61871',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,2,21,200,4.95,43969621),(1899,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43987879','Division Street Suite- Pet friendly!','Location! Location! Location! If you want the true Portland experience, this is where you must stay. Located directly on Division Street- one of Portland\'s most vibrant streets. Walk out the front door to restaurants, bars, coffee shops, boutiques and brew pubs. Blocks away from Portland staples such as Salt N\' Straw Ice Cream, Bollywood Theater, Blue Star Donuts, Oma\'s Hideaway, Eb & Bean and Scottie’s Pizza.','We live in the highly coveted Richmond (also known as Division/Clinton) neighborhood. Steps from Portland staples including Salt N\' Straw Ice Cream, Bollywood Theater, Blue Star Donuts, Fifty Licks, Scottie’s Pizza, Kati Thai and Nossa Familia Coffee. <br /><br />Stellar location surrounded by markets, parks, shopping, bike greenways, award-winning eateries and pubs in all directions.  Walkscore = 93. Bikescore = 95.<br /><br />Easy access (via bike/scooter/public transit/car) to downtown, the Pearl District, Goose Hollow, Alberta Arts District, and Nob Hill/the Alphabet District.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/32cfe202-d756-4416-987e-ebf6c5b9651c.jpg',31102773,25,'45.50348','-122.63663',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,2,1125,226,4.91,43987879),(1900,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44030346','Modern Cabin with exposed brick and cozy gardens','Welcome to Portland!<br />This is a beautiful and spacious brand new1bd/1ba basement apartment built in an 1884 Victorian home, ideal for relaxation and a perfect spot to stay at, to explore downtown Portland. 1 pet weighing max. 25 lbs is allowed for an extra $50/month.  <br /><br />This is a professionally managed listing, so feel free to contact us through the platform and we\'d be happy to help.','The property is listed on the Historic Registry. Lair Hill is centrally located and is just blocks away from Downtown Portland, OHSU, PSU, and the South Waterfront. Lair Hill Park is only a couple of blocks away from the property. If you are a fan of hikes, feel free to follow a hiking trail through the west hills. Some recommendations on restaurants and cafes that are located within walking distance from the apartment are:<br />Caro Amico’s Italian food, (directly across the street from house), Lair Hill Café, Lovejoy Bakery, Pizzicato, Green Leaf Juice, Cha, Cha, Cha Mexican Restaurant.<br />Don’t forget to try an authentic Portland food cart experience located within walking distance in the South Waterfront!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6b0b2c48-07be-4838-bf31-375e5b306810.jpg',352768058,30,'45.49764','-122.67949',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,77.00,31,1125,13,4.77,44030346),(1901,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44046518','Downtown Pearl District Upscale Apt. w/ Rooftop!','Upscale apartment with unbeatable location featuring luxury amenities including a rooftop deck with fire pit  & Sky Entertainment lounge. <br />Located in the heart of the Pearl District, you will find endless opportunities to create new memories!  This famous  neighborhood is a travelers top travel destinations when visiting Portland.  This popular destination features art galleries & cultural institutions, as well as stylish shops, acclaimed eateries and brewpubs all within walking distance!','The Pearl District is one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods! Housing world-class art galleries, vibrant shops and boutiques as well as some of the cities best chefs and restaurants.  <br />At The Pearl you will find many bars and restaurants from craft breweries and artisan coffee shops to fine dinning mainstays. <br /><br />Whatever your travel adventure vision looks like, you can see it come alive here at the Pearl District!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3dabef6a-6aa0-4f93-9b16-fab538806038.jpg',339414830,2,'45.52547','-122.68544',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,30,1125,231,4.98,44046518),(1902,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44049778','Hawthorne Crash Pad~Private, Tiny Garden Retreat','Brand new, clean, stylish, & private converted garage in the bustling Hawthorne neighborhood. Walk to restaurants, coffee, music venues, theaters, bars & food carts. We are located on a quiet street across from a city park. The \"Pad” is a freestanding tiny home with a comfy queen bed, large tiled shower, private outdoor garden space and wifi. Tons of free street parking!','Location! With virtually everything you might need within walking distance and the rest of the city easily accessible by bus or bike, this area is thought of by many as the heart of Portland. Come stay and enjoy this cozy place while taking in the lively Hawthorne District.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/03ba9e5a-53c2-455e-9083-06d12f7bd9e6.jpg',45865050,8,'45.50993','-122.63352',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,77.00,1,21,364,4.95,44049778),(1903,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44063478','Bright & Airy Craftsman in trendy SE Portland','Beautiful Craftsmen house with large porch for extended outdoor living experience. Located in Portland\'s Richmond neighborhood, one of Portlands most desirable urban neighborhoods. Our house is a renovated 1914 craftsman with a balance of period charm and updated modern details . High ceilings, lots of windows and a bright light airy open floor plan. Comfortable beds with thoughtful design touches in every room. Fast wifi for work or streaming movies. Plenty of room for parking by the house.','Our neighborhood is on top lists of best places to live, eat & work! Nearby SE Division street is one of the most exciting streets in Portland for culinary enthusiasts, coffee aficionados & bike corridors.<br /><br />Our home is blocks away from Division\'s \"Restaurant Row\" which has some of the best restaurants in all of Oregon. Great food, shopping, small unique boutiques and coffee are a walk away. We are two blocks away from the Clinton Bike Corridor and world famous Stumptown Coffee. Minutes away from Hawthorne Street and 10-15 minute drive to downtown and about 20 minutes from the airport. A 5-10 minute drive away from Mt. Tabor,  a Portland park favorite with forested outdoor walks and sunset views of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0ab4199f-f387-496b-9453-cb5618fcce64.jpg',10194150,8,'45.50272','-122.61808',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,200.00,14,1125,17,5.00,44063478),(1904,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44075074','Sunny Treetops in the Heart of Nob Hill','Light filled charming nest tucked up in the trees in the heart of Nob Hill. Just steps away from lively 21st and 23rd Avenues. This thoughtfully renovated and updated space comes with modern appliances. A well appointed kitchen with plenty of space for cooking beautiful meals. A deck for sunning and people watching.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/143b8b32-b17d-4dc0-8f17-49ef7c4be562.jpg',7008585,27,'45.52533','-122.69603',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,129.00,30,1125,133,4.83,44075074),(1905,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44075682','Blocks from Mississippi, Williams, and Alberta!','This private entranced 1-bed studio, located in the King neighborhood, sits near many of Northeast Portland\'s most visited areas. There are endless local shops, bars, and restaurants within walking distance. Just 5 blocks away from N Williams Ave, 13 blocks from the amazing Alberta Arts District, and 13 blocks from the vibrant N Mississippi Ave! <br /><br />This listing boasts a Walk Score of 88 (Very Walkable) and a Bike Score of 94 (Biker\'s Paradise).<br />There is a bike rental station within 2 blocks.','The King neighborhood is a quiet area located right next to some of Portland\'s most talked about areas.  <br /><br />Whether you\'re looking for the shopping of the Alberta Arts District or the nightlife and restaurants of Mississippi and Williams streets, you are just a short walk away.  <br /><br />A quick drive or rideshare can get you to our bustling downtown, posh Pearl District, or just about anywhere else in the metro in no time!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44075682/original/5ae46643-5e8f-44ed-be97-8ef34a2af495.jpeg',27275907,14,'45.55414','-122.66008',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,92.00,2,14,172,4.93,44075682),(1906,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44161966','Your Portland home away from home','A lovely home in Southeast Portland.  Blocks from Trader Joe\'s, Safeway, coffee shops, restaurants, bars, and parks.  <br /><br />Enjoy the summer in this gorgeous backyard, perfect for lounging and full of fruits and vegetables (yours to enjoy). <br /><br />A perfect place to get settled and see what Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/55aae5cb-55f7-4909-a7d6-ed4484d21c9d.jpg',9494009,67,'45.49076','-122.62052',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,140.00,3,90,8,4.88,44161966),(1907,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44206632','All Roads Lead to Vintage Rose Quarter 1-Bedroom','Charming corner 1-bedroom/1-bath condo located in the vintage Lloyd Park Condominium building in Portland\'s famed Rose Quarter. The Rose Quarter is the hub of Portland sports and entertainment and is home to the Moda Center, Veterans Memorial Coliseum and Oregon Convention Center. The Rose Quarter Transit Center, within walking distance, provides access to three MAX lines and six bus routes, so all things lead to the Rose Quarter.<br /><br />**Please review House Rules prior to booking**','Located in NE Portland, this condo is within walking distance to NE Broadway where you can eat, drink and shop your way along one of Portland most noteworthy streets. Legacy Emanuel, Kaiser Permanente and Providence Medical are all within a 3-mile radius. <br /><br />Parking: Directly adjacent to the building, parking is metered through the City of Portland’s Pay to Park program. Meter hours are 8am to 7pm Monday through Saturday and from 1pm to 7pm on Sunday unless otherwise posted.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e0acee6c-0e57-4d1b-b8d0-63e6485cd505.jpg',158074447,59,'45.53335','-122.6567',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,54.00,31,1125,17,4.82,44206632),(1908,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44210810','Chic Cottage Studio by Hospitals & Airport','Modern Luxe Studio in Portland<br /><br />This modern studio sleeps 3 to 4 guests in a quiet, detached guesthouse. <br /><br />Chef\'s kitchen w a Kitchen Aid oven & induction cooktop, along w an Adjustable Queen Murphy bed and a pull-out sofa bed. <br /><br />Relax in the luxurious bathroom featuring Italian travertine tile & a Toto bidet toilet.<br /><br />Near airport, downtown & Hospitals, with free street parking & easy access to restaurants & shops. <br /><br />Perfect for longer-term stays!<br /><br />Reach out for Monthly Discounts!!','My guest house sits on a designated city bikeway.  People bike, take their dog for a walk to enjoy the neighborhood.  There are fab restaurants, and parks and golf too (rose city golf course). <br /><br />A must is <br />Du\'s grill (top 40 cheap eats in the state and fab bento)<br />Clyde\'s prime rib for a steak and funky music scene<br />A brewery 2 blocks away with amazing wings<br />Pip\'s donuts for chai and DONUTS! (Always a line!)<br />Freemont Street<br />The Grotto Spiritual park is 20 blocks away for an amazing portland experience<br /><br />No metered parking in this Neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-44210810/original/3ad6ad6a-706b-4547-880b-3ceeb8db2edf.jpeg',16083734,11,'45.54824','-122.60458',1,3,1.00,1.00,3.00,120.00,30,299,9,5.00,44210810),(1909,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44251824','The Artist\'s Oasis on Alberta ~ 90 WalkScore','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44251824/original/7e1f3898-4add-4ad9-8b8f-444eb7328ea0.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55874','-122.6691',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,152.00,1,1125,347,4.89,44251824),(1910,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44306125','Luxury Midcentury Apartment in NE Portland','This spacious and well-appointed subterranean apartment is located within a beautiful craftsman home, and includes a separate private entrance, large living room, bedroom, kitchenette and bath.  <br /><br />Walk to WholeFoods (3 blocks), pack a picnic and head to Grant Park (9 blocks), or stroll into downtown Hollywood (3 blocks) for lots of great (COVID-safe) food/drink options like Killer Burger (3 blocks), Bitter Rose Coffee Bar (5 blocks) and Gado Gado, one of PDX’s best new restaurants (5 blocks).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/47fcaf91-d47a-4573-9715-57ec47c7511d.jpg',143183280,33,'45.53934','-122.61616',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,21,100,4.94,44306125),(1911,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44316706','Modern Entire House in a Green Neighborhood','3.5 miles from Airport! It takes 7 minutes to get home!<br /><br />Cozy bedroom with warm, lively colors. Near Airport, NE 42nd Ave, Fremont St & Alberta Arts Districts. 15 min from convention center. <br /><br />There is plenty of street parking available.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1882bcdf-d940-48f6-b209-6dcf4643add6.jpg',100593625,21,'45.55763','-122.58872',1,2,1.50,1.00,0.00,0.00,60,100,4,5.00,44316706),(1912,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44318730','Alberta Arts house walking distance to everything!','Sweet Alberta Arts bungalow, walking distance to great coffee shops, bars, restaurants, Alberta Street Co-op, live music, yoga/ pilates studios, ice cream shops, massage studios, and hair salons and more! Enjoy your morning coffee on a large wrap around front porch, or with more privacy in the back yard under a beautiful large fig tree. 2 bedrooms + an office with a desk & a day bed.  Living room has a pull out futon. It\'s a short uber ride from the airport. No car needed here!','Alberta Street is just a couple blocks away!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44318730/original/1c37e5a9-4d3c-4c9a-bee8-697801fb0d42.jpeg',5780178,1,'45.56042','-122.64011',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,76.00,30,1125,9,4.22,44318730),(1913,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44325859','Room in Stylish Mid-Century Tree House + Hot Tub!','Looking for a calm, quiet retreat outside of the bustle of Downtown / Eastside, but still close-by? This is the spot! Located in a forested neighborhood, this clean & stylish home is perched high above street level, giving you a leafy sense of floating in the trees. Cook in the well-appointed kitchen, soak in the hot tub under huge trees, light a fire, and walk to nearby food carts. Save city vibes for AM touring, but choose PNW nature vibes in the PM for a relaxing, safe, and cozy stay in PDX!','The neighborhood has tons of old growth trees and a lovely leafy vibe. Just a 5-7 minute walk to Hillsdale Town Center which has Basics Market, an organic grocery store with a deli counter, Gurton\'s, an adorable plant shop, Baker and Spice, a beloved bakery, Sasquatch Brewing, a cute brewpub, City Thai, a decent Thai joint, McMenniman\'s Bar and Cafe, as well as a Starbucks, Einstein\'s bagels, and the Hillsdale Food Cart Park, a pod of different kinds of ethnic food carts.<br /><br />If you\'re looking for a bit more of a stroll, ~20 minute walk will take you over to the very cute shops and cafes of Multnomah Village, where I recommend the AMAZING mediterranean food at Yalla. You won\'t be disappointed.<br /><br />This is a great spot to book if you want to run around and have a fun urban experience during the day, but retreat to more of a quiet, chill nature vibe at night.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44325859/original/4d36b85c-6ead-4614-b587-27b2c94db2f4.jpeg',4632981,31,'45.478928','-122.701378',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,90,6,5.00,44325859),(1914,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44353594','Cedar House in North Portland','Featured in Design Week Portland in 2019, The Lone Cedar House offers a unique stay for your visit. Private entrance with access to shared back patio area. Great sunlight. Walking distance to the Portland bluffs for a great evening sunset walk and a short drive to the Mississippi, Alberta, and Kenton Neighborhoods. Parking is easy and always available, and for those with pets, or who just want to enjoy a good park, there is a dog park at the end of the block where your dog can run off leash.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/068fe8c8-d5b0-47cf-a3c4-c08e89ae18ca.jpg',205079895,51,'45.56938','-122.69587',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,69,4.84,44353594),(1915,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44378620','Mediterranean Manor PDX','Sandwiched between two of Portland\'s most bustling streets, Hawthorne & Division, my 1927 Mediterranean home features original hardwood floors & tons of amazing natural light. With a 91 Walker\'s score and 97 Biker\'s score, blocks from public transit, close to restaurants, cafes, shopping, & one block off of historically zoned Ladd\'s Addition, you will find this Airbnb space provides the best of both worlds...Portland city life and quiet refuge.','Your neighborhood<br />Once a sleepy thoroughfare, Southeast Division Street is now one of Portland’s most dynamic and stylish neighborhoods. Spend a day wandering its many blocks, stopping along the way to snack, sip, and shop. Read on for our favorite things to do in Division/Clinton.<br />These cozy neighborhood restaurants, bakeries, and coffee shops are local favorites.<br />Palio Dessert and Espresso<br />A neighborhood bakery and cafe in Ladd’s addition. Palios is 4 blocks from my house at 1996 SE Ladd Ave Portland OR 97214<br />Nuestra Cocina <br />House-made tortillas and Sangrias set the tone at creative, warmly decorated Mexican restaurant and bar.  I love the atmosphere.  2135 SE Division St. Portland OR<br />The Richmond Bar<br />Cocktail spot with a cool vibe plus daily happy hour and modern bar snacks like poutine and hand pies. I love this place because there 3203 SE Division St. Portland, OR 97202','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/21424e6d-e137-4f3f-8d6f-c97129e85639.jpg',143049389,25,'45.50643','-122.64288',2,4,1.50,1.00,1.00,119.00,3,21,25,4.88,44378620),(1916,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44395944','Monthly- Cozy suite -Bedroom, bath & living space','\"The Birch\"<br /><br />This is a clean , beautiful space full of light and unique charm, located in the quiet St. John\'s neighborhood in North Portland and walking distance to brewpubs, restaurants, food carts, coffee shops, movie theaters and the St. John\'s bridge. <br /><br />It is a self contained suite with king size bed, cozy living space with wide windows and attached bathroom. The home has 5 other bedrooms  they are rented out to other guests.<br /><br />House has keyless coded entry. Monthly discounts.','The home is 15 min from downtown Portland and Vancouver by car and close to public transportation. Tucked away in the quiet St. John\'s neighborhood in North Portland and walking distance to brewpubs, restaurants, food carts, coffee shops, movie theaters and the St. John\'s bridge. <br /><br />Here is a listing of Restaurants in the beighborhood that are open for business! So many good options in walking distance!!<br /><br />https://sites.google.com/wayfindingacademy.org/stjohnsbusinesslisting/restaurantsfood?authuser=0','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/98f8251a-a945-4396-bc0a-10aa47edda0a.jpg',8587273,58,'45.59125','-122.74751',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,180,10,5.00,44395944),(1917,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44415532','Private Entry Basement Room in the Heart of NE','Stay in a private room with a separate entrance in the hip Hollywood District of NE Portland. There is a desk and seating area, in addition to a queen bed. This address has a walk score of 86 and a bike score of 99. Everything you need is within a couple of blocks. We are 15 minutes from the airport and 10 minutes from downtown.<br /><br />If you ever need recommendations for what to do or where to eat  - just ask! We are both native Oregonians who love the food and drink scene in PDX.','The nearby Hollywood District is home to the historic Hollywood Theater and several small businesses and restaurants. The year-round Hollywood Farmer\'s Market is open on Saturdays just a few blocks away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44415532/original/48800d85-cc73-4d53-92e7-d86f7c3d1f9d.jpeg',199117713,11,'45.5375','-122.61114',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,1,365,23,4.87,44415532),(1918,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44431794','A sleeper in a basement with private rest room','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b1296f53-dad2-4ea3-a0f8-89bb3bdd18f6.jpg',96243932,63,'45.525','-122.53328',2,1,2.00,1.00,0.00,30.00,30,1125,6,3.50,44431794),(1919,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44436888','Elegant World\'s Fair 4BR Home w/  97 WalkScore','Nestled in one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods, this elegant home has been thoughtfully refurbished to blend its original charm with modern amenities seamlessly. Originally built for the World\'s Fair hosted by Portland at the turn of the century, this home exudes all the old-world charm you can imagine. Step out the door, and you\'ll find top-rated bars and shopping just blocks away, ensuring you never have to stray far for a fantastic experience.','Portland is renowned as one of the best food cities in the country, making it a paradise for foodies! Located in the heart of the NW district, also known as the Alphabet District, you\'ll find yourself immersed in quaint shops and endless superb dining options. History buffs should stop in for a Spanish coffee at Huber\'s, Portland\'s oldest bar, and you can\'t miss trying a unique flavor of ice cream from Salt & Straw, just a few blocks away.<br /><br />The neighborhood offers a delightful blend of historic charm and modern conveniences. Wander through the tree-lined streets and discover beautifully preserved Victorian homes, charming boutiques, and artisanal markets. For those who love the arts, the nearby Portland Art Museum and various local galleries offer a feast for the eyes.<br /><br />Coffee enthusiasts will be thrilled with the selection of local coffee shops, each with its unique ambiance and expertly brewed coffee. Powell\'s City of Books, the largest independent bookstore in th','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44436888/original/e49622cb-c916-4029-8122-f3191b1f28ea.jpeg',88253867,3,'45.52307','-122.69805',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,278.00,1,365,281,4.87,44436888),(1920,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44437109','1906 Carl & Margaret Hoeber World\'s Fair House','Nestled in one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods, this elegant home has been thoughtfully refurbished to blend its original charm with modern amenities seamlessly. Originally built for the World\'s Fair hosted by Portland at the turn of the century, this home exudes all the old-world charm you can imagine. Step out the door, and you\'ll find top-rated bars and shopping just blocks away, ensuring you never have to stray far for a fantastic experience.','Portland is renowned as one of the best food cities in the country, making it a paradise for foodies! Located in the heart of the NW district, also known as the Alphabet District, you\'ll find yourself immersed in quaint shops and endless superb dining options. History buffs should stop in for a Spanish coffee at Huber\'s, Portland\'s oldest bar, and you can\'t miss trying a unique flavor of ice cream from Salt & Straw, just a few blocks away.<br /><br />The neighborhood offers a delightful blend of historic charm and modern conveniences. Wander through the tree-lined streets and discover beautifully preserved Victorian homes, charming boutiques, and artisanal markets. For those who love the arts, the nearby Portland Art Museum and various local galleries offer a feast for the eyes.<br /><br />Coffee enthusiasts will be thrilled with the selection of local coffee shops, each with its unique ambiance and expertly brewed coffee. Powell\'s City of Books, the largest independent bookstore in th','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44437109/original/11e2778d-fd4e-4b63-a1e6-729008a4d670.jpeg',88253867,27,'45.52421','-122.69769',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,148.00,1,365,295,4.78,44437109),(1921,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44447316','BEST NEIGHBORHOOD IN PORTLAND! 24','Completely furnished, modern, private. Located in friendly, close-in Northwest Portland. This central location with a 98 Walk Score and is next to some of the best restaurants, bars and cafes in town.  Full kitchen.  Private bath. Beats hotel pricing.','Close-in Northwest Portland- Nob Hill.<br /><br />This convenient location, with a 98 POINT WALK SCORE is blocks from trendy NW 23rd AVE, Dragonfly Coffee House, St. Honore Bakery, McMenamins Pub, a natural foods grocery store, the public library, as well as the post office. <br /><br />Window shop at all the lovely boutiques located just blocks away or hike/bike/run/explore the 80 miles of trails and over 5,000 acres of Forest Park; one of the largest urban parks in the United States! <br /><br />You can quickly and easily reach the Pearl District, the Brewery Blocks or Downtown Portland in minutes by foot, bike or streetcar; no need for a vehicle when living here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44447316/original/307e73ff-8bd8-4833-8453-2f885b9f835b.jpeg',21655715,27,'45.53716','-122.70361',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,54.00,30,1125,6,5.00,44447316),(1922,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44461752','Waterfall Lodge','The Waterfall Guesthouse is a mix of modern and cozy rustic nestled in the Woodlawn Triangle. If you have ever wanted to experience living in a tiny house...This is your chance!','The guesthouse is located in the Woodlawn Triangle. It\'s a charming neighborhood and we are just 2- 3 blocks from Breakside Brewery, Bushwhacker Ciderhouse, Firehouse Restaurant, Woodlawn Coffee and Pastry, Woodlawn Farmer\'s Market, Woodlawn City Park, etc.<br /><br />It\'s conveniently located 1-2 miles of N. Mississippi, Alberta and N. Williams Street Neighborhoods.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3a5f44b1-4cce-4b72-b7cf-1904fbd67094.jpg',131642463,45,'45.57088','-122.65353',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,2,350,159,4.98,44461752),(1923,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44465083','The Best of All Worlds in NE!','Welcome to the best of all worlds. Located in the heart of wonderful NE Portland. This eco-friendly home received a 10/10 energy efficiency score with solar panels, bamboo flooring and a tankless water heater, it is made to be friendly to the environment as well as comfortable for our guests. Only about a 15 min walk from the trendy Alberta St. and the up and coming Williams St. or about a 25 min walk from Mississippi St!  The location of our home is truly unique, we hope you enjoy your stay!','The location is the best of all worlds! Walking distance from the trendy Alberta Street and upcoming Williams Street. The wonderful Mississippi Street is also not too far. Amazing location! Guests will find an eclectic mix of restaurants, cafes, boutiques, shops. This pedestrian friendly area is buzzing with activity all week long. You’ll find everything from locally made ice cream and locally brewed beer to unique galleries, shops and many dining options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cc0a1d41-bdef-4848-a4d0-13050d1051f8.jpg',23224611,14,'45.56144','-122.66141',1,3,2.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,60,334,4,5.00,44465083),(1924,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44477098','Hidden gem N. Portland, office, garden, pets OK','Find serenity in this lovely executive home in the heart of North Portland.  Secluded from the street, enjoy stunning gardens while you listen to the calming sounds of the waterfall in the back garden. Conveniently located in the Overlook Neighborhood walking distance to shops, restaurants, food carts, and parks.  Easy access to I-5.  Walking distance from the Adidas Campus, 4-min. to Daimler or University of Portland.  8 min. to Downtown Portland, 10 to Vancouver. 18 min. to Portland Airport.','Overlook neighborhood is one of Portland’s favorite neighborhoods, especially the section that is in the Overlook Triangle, and close to the Overlook. As you are going out along busy bustling Killingsworth headed from I-5, suddenly you are hit with breathtaking views of Downtown Portland and Mt Hood looking out across the river. You can also see Forest Park and the West Hills over the Industrial River area. As you curve around you see the arched bridges of Portland silhouetted by Downtown. People are walking and biking all along the way. You are in Overlook. Overlook is bordered by the Willamette River on the SW, the Fremont Bridge on the south, I-5 to the east and Ainsworth and Willamette to the north. It is just minutes to downtown by car of bike or just hop on the MAX. It borders Arbor Lodge neighborhood, University Park, Boise–Eliot and the Willamette River!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44477098/original/6cb2a649-9d34-4298-bb02-9d05c27ec31c.jpeg',126371404,13,'45.566','-122.69464',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,280.00,30,180,5,5.00,44477098),(1925,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44536250','Studio Bliss: Dual-Queen Stay in Vibrant Alberta','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44536250/original/261f7f47-3b0b-451b-9d39-ab2cb2bb94be.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55731','-122.66793',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,77.00,1,1125,377,4.85,44536250),(1926,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44540886','Overlook Gem Tiny House','Fantastic Location!! This Tiny House (or ADU as Portlanders call them) is the perfect place to call home. Fully furnished with everything you need for stays of one to nine months. Walkable to Kaiser Permanente Interstate Medical Center. Easy commute to adidas. Walk to Overlook Park MAX Station. Tons of fantastic and iconic Portland food carts and restaurants including Matt\'s BBQ, Alibi Tiki Lounge, Prost!, Por Que No, Ecliptic, Fire on the Mountain, and many more!','You can\'t get a better location than Overlook! Easy public transit from the MAX station. Tons of iconic Portland restaurants and bars within a short walk. Bike friendly paths and a short walk to Overlook Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/04a8c754-c887-4b0a-91bf-14952df74518.jpg',20410856,13,'45.55084','-122.68427',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,40,220,5,5.00,44540886),(1927,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44572017','Pet-Friendly Work from Home Haven, fully stocked','Clean and bright, this newly restored two Bedroom, one Bathroom 1910 Duplex is in the heart of the Alberta Arts district. Inside the house is freshly painted making it light and bright, and the original wood floors are refinished throughout. Outside, features a giant front porch and porch swing to sit and watch the festive, fun neighborhood. Walk to restaurants, coffee shops, New Seasons, The Kennedy School and the Last Thursday art walk.','The house is located in the heart of the Alberta Arts District, and the Killingsworth restaurant corridor. Expatriate, Wilder, Beast, DOC, Jinx, Yakuza and Extracto Coffee are less than 1/2 a block away, and three blocks away are the innumerable restaurants and galleries of Alberta Street. Concordia New Seasons is a four block walk from the house as well.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44572017/original/5b574b6b-3e5f-4a6c-b209-dd475d1ef6ab.jpeg',36909902,1,'45.56142','-122.6359',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,30,1125,1,5.00,44572017),(1928,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44572216','Rose City Studio','Spacious, newly remodeled, light filled,  basement studio with bath, featuring private entry, queen bed plus futon, wifi, cable TV, microware, refrigerator, Nespresso coffee and tea selections. Walk to the golf course and park. Off street parking. Easy access to I-84, I-205 and just 10 minutes to Portland International Airport.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44572216/original/7cccbeb7-3b10-444f-af2a-c808a13825e3.jpeg',265007684,74,'45.53735','-122.585',2,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,62.00,2,28,87,4.95,44572216),(1929,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44629380','Walk everywhere. Heart of NW Portland.','Make yourself at home in this charming vintage condo in the heart of the Nob Hill community, just steps from all the coffee shops,  bagel stands, restaurants,  bakeries, and bars that 21st Street has to offer.  New AC, near Cinema 21  theater, the condo is located down the street from a Trader Joe\'s and only two blocks from the European vibe of 23rd Street, with its dining, shopping and people watching opportunities.  Streetcar nearby. Access Pearl District via the Flanders St footbridge.','The surrounding neighborhood is dominated by circa 1910 architecture.  It\'s a fun place to wander.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44629380/original/22a1a4e9-4931-4a0b-b2e8-a071b29a3af8.jpeg',83619132,27,'45.52831','-122.69519',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,71.00,31,180,10,4.90,44629380),(1930,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44652009','Spacious Modern Home in St Johns - Gorgeous Views','Fantastic newer construction family house. Conveniently located in Cathedral Park close St Johns. Stunning views of the St Johns bridge & river views. Short walk to downtown St Johns, theaters, bars, coffee shops, farmers market, restaurants, shops, and a stone\'s throw to Forest Park! <br /><br />Modern floor plan with a spacious gourmet kitchen opens to the dining area with a large deck area. Huge family playroom area with vintage pin ball machine. Fully fenced back yard.  Bikes included.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/070bd26e-877a-4f82-a945-d2d84683f024.jpg',1828909,42,'45.59253','-122.76243',1,6,2.50,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,1,5.00,44652009),(1931,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44687427','Light-Filled 1927 Bungalow - Grocery + Food Carts','Hi from Heppner House! We hope you\'ll enjoy our fully remodeled 1927 bungalow, curated over the last six years by owner/ builder with foundations in salvage and reuse. 2 bedrooms + two full bathrooms (one with antique soaking tub) living room, dining room, and a freshly tuned 1918 piano! Natural light galore! Fred Meyer across the street, 10 minute walk to food carts and New Seasons. Our only goal is a perfect stay for our guests! Welcome!','Welcome to our incredible neighborhood, situated just 7 miles north of downtown Portland. St. Johns is a must-visit area with a unique blend of attractions and natural beauty.<br /><br />Discover the iconic St. Johns Bridge, a majestic structure spanning the Willamette River, offering breathtaking views. Adjacent to the bridge is Cathedral Park, a picturesque spot nestled beneath its arches, perfect for relaxation and capturing memorable moments.<br /><br />Venture across to the Linnton side and explore the multitude of forested trails that are part of Forest Park, one of the largest city parks in the United States. Immerse yourself in nature\'s beauty and embark on invigorating hikes or tranquil walks.<br /><br />St. Johns is also known for its vibrant culinary scene. Indulge in the variety of restaurants, coffee shops, and food cart pods offering delectable delights. Don\'t miss the farmer\'s market, where you can experience the local flavors and fresh produce. Take a stroll along the c','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c5776541-68e2-4127-b193-8a7e0040742d.jpg',3508484,58,'45.58615','-122.73727',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,165.00,3,89,129,4.95,44687427),(1932,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44687526','3B/3b Craftsman- Yoga Studio & Dog friendly & AC','This cozy and quaint 1905 Portland craftsman home is updated with all of the modern amenities you could ask for - A/C, heat, gas fireplace, high speed wifi - perfect to work from home.<br /><br />3 bedroom + 3 full bathrooms. Cozy backyard w/ fire pit and foliage. Includes a separate office space on the main level.  Separate heated detached yoga/ workout room. Central to many things in NE Portland- a few minute walk to great restaurants, breweries, coffee shops and 4 dog-friendly parks.','Just 10 min walk to the famous Alberta street & a few blocks away from the up and coming Dekum Neighborhood - with a cute local coffee shop, pizzeria, brewpub and more. <br /><br />4 great dog-friendly parks in walking distance:  Alberta Park, Peninsula Park, Dekum Park and Fernhill Park','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c5b96804-0fc1-4aec-b658-fb7738fe9bd6.jpg',4701601,45,'45.56792','-122.65395',1,6,3.00,3.00,3.00,130.00,30,1125,17,4.94,44687526),(1933,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44697307','Modern Central Portland House','Stay at the coolest house in Portland!  Built in 2020, this modern three-story attached house features 2 bedrooms with king beds; 2 full bathrooms; 2 half-bathrooms; an office with a spacious desk and pull-out couch; new stainless steel appliances; a laundry room with washer and dryer; and an enclosed patio with firepit.  Walk or bike down Division/Clinton, through gorgeous Ladd\'s Addition, or across the Tilikum Bridge to get everywhere in Portland!<br /><br />Pets are welcome, no fee!','Just south of gorgeous Ladd’s Addition, in the Division/Clinton area (north of Powell), with tons of hip bars and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-44697307/original/27df7a1d-9abc-44cb-9f69-419e7db7ae31.jpg',89400,25,'45.50119','-122.64785',1,5,3.00,2.00,2.00,208.00,2,27,144,4.96,44697307),(1934,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/44857809','N. PDX Serene/Art Filled Family Home','No checkout list! Exceptionally clean.  Quiet neighborhood . 2 blks from bus line.<br /><br />PDX airport - 7 miles<br />Univ of Portland - 2 miles<br />Downtown Portland - 8 miles<br />Downtown St. Johns - 1 mile<br /><br />You will have full access to the main house.  Owners/guests may be occupying basement apartment.  <br /><br />Home is fully equipped.  TVs in  bedrooms and living room.  Listed 3rd bedroom is an alcove with a single daybed & a single trundle underneath as shown in the picture of bedroom #2.','This is a quiet pocket neighborhood.  It is very close to access all you may want to do while here.  Easy I-5 access which leads to Mt. Hood, the coast, wine country etc.  We are close to New Seasons, Fred Meyer, cute cafes and shops in St. John’s and Kenton.  Forest Park is only a couple miles away.  Get downtown Portland in minutes or choose the new riverfront downtown Vancouver also just a few minutes away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/26ca5beb-dcb2-49cb-8f8e-115cb18efbed.jpg',3948888,58,'45.59658','-122.73369',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,180.00,2,30,65,4.95,44857809),(1935,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45040754','Pet Friendly, BBQ, Zoo, 5 Mins to Pearl District','This renovated two bedroom retreat sits on the edge of the Wildwood Trail that connects Washington Park and Forest Park. You will find this cozy in-law unit is nestled among the trees and foliage just over a mile from the heart of Northwest Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-45040754/original/f4ec0beb-5f76-4eda-af49-fa4fd4dcc8cb.jpeg',62261998,79,'45.52033','-122.72527',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,102.00,3,29,81,4.70,45040754),(1936,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45088488','Sweet Portland Suite','Private 1 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom Suite, complete with a Kitchenette (including a mini-fridge, microwave, electric kettle & dishes/silverware), & much more! The second bed is a small futon style sofa, in addition there is a very nice, double size air mattress.  The Suite is on the second floor with it\'s own entrance.  <br />Whether you are traveling for business or vacation, our private guest space has all you need to recharge and relax.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45088488/original/56595db0-b231-4bc3-a371-cf1a056d078f.jpeg',29807354,21,'45.54846','-122.60234',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,2,27,119,4.94,45088488),(1937,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45140159','SE Portland Dream Guesthouse','This is a cozy, stylish guesthouse with all the amenities and charm to make either a getaway weekend or long-term stay extra comfortable and special. The newly remodeled apartment has a spacious 540 square feet on the second floor of the garage with eclectic art and skylights in the main living space. It has a driveway and its own private entry separate from the main house.<br /><br />Please note: no smoking of any kind is allowed anywhere on the property.<br />We apologize that we cannot accommodate pets!','The guesthouse is situated right next to Errol Heights park, which has wonderful walking trails and gravel roads surrounding. There are also wild peacocks that live in the neighborhood that you don\'t want to miss on your evening stroll. We are about 5 minutes from the Woodstock neighborhood, where you will find plenty of shopping and takeout options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45140159/original/bee7e969-07a7-4f1d-bd20-7c4af6e41999.jpeg',225046440,38,'45.46468','-122.6163',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,3,31,73,5.00,45140159),(1938,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45164850','Spacious 1BR next to NW 23rd Ave.','Steps away from NW 23rd St, this is a 700 sq. ft., 1 BD/1BA apartment on the 3rd floor of a 1910 craftsman. If you\'re looking for a great location, you have found the place. Lots of space in the apartment to hang out, work, cook, etc. Fast wifi, easy street parking, plus restaurants and shops galore. Whether it\'s your first or fiftieth visit to Portland, this apartment has all you need for a fun and comfortable stay.','Literally, you can walk to everything. Super close to Salt & Straw, Barista, Trader Joe\'s, Ken\'s Artisan Bakery, Bentley\'s Bagels, Caffe Mingo, The Fireside and many others. About a 10 minute walk to Slabtown (Sunshine Noodles, Life of Pie, New Seasons Market) and other dining destinations including Bhuna and Bar West. It\'s about a half hour walk to the Japanese Tea Garden in Washington Park or to Forest Park for endless hiking trails. Easy stroll to Providence Park. Go Thorns! Great retail close-by: Paper Source, Prana, Snowpeak, The Meadow, Margaret O\'Leary, and Parachute Home to name a few. No sales tax in Oregon.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45164850/original/21be0828-bb04-4301-ad4d-d8aa9be26a65.jpeg',1207025,27,'45.52818','-122.69663',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,45,112,4.93,45164850),(1939,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45165226','Stylish Hawthorne 1BR w 90 WalkScore','Located in the heart of the eclectic Hawthorne District, you\'ll be within walking distance of some of Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, and craftspeople. If you want to explore another area of Portland, I\'m just over a mile from the West side via bike, walking, or frequent bus service. The place has been designed to create a sleek, soothing, and stylish feel, incorporating the highest-grade finishes.','Welcome to the heart of Southeast Portland! This charming neighborhood is nestled within the vibrant and eclectic Hawthorne District. Known for its lively atmosphere and bohemian spirit, the area offers an array of attractions that embody the true essence of Portland.<br /><br />Just steps from your door, you\'ll find some of the city\'s best restaurants, cafes, and food carts. Start your day with a delicious breakfast at Jam on Hawthorne or enjoy a leisurely brunch at Fried Egg I\'m In Love. For lunch and dinner, explore a diverse culinary scene featuring everything from the vegan delights at Harlow to the mouthwatering pies at Apizza Scholls, consistently voted one of Portland’s favorite pizzerias.<br /><br />Coffee enthusiasts will love the proximity to some of Portland’s top coffee shops, such as Coava Coffee and Stumptown Coffee Roasters, perfect for a morning pick-me-up or an afternoon break. If craft beer is more your style, the local brew-pubs like Hawthorne Hophouse and Cascade B','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45165226/original/bf708be3-283c-4b6d-94fe-f2aaca0d95e8.jpeg',146196024,32,'45.51338','-122.64726',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,1,1125,492,4.89,45165226),(1940,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45165665','Incredible unit for short or long term stay in SE','Stay in the heart of the Lents neighborhood - this unit is located less than a 5-minute walk to restaurants, bars, quirky shops, Planet Fitness, and the max station allowing you to travel around the city of Roses at ease. <br /> <br />Master bedroom with a dresser. For your security, the front door is keyless, with a unique code provided to each guest. Each bedroom door locks from the inside.','Walk to local bars, food carts, tea shop, park or gym all within 5 minute of walk. Neighborhood is safe.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1c349c7b-3d77-471d-92e4-c5a9bc3b9ea3.jpg',150212199,72,'45.47786','-122.56792',1,7,1.00,2.00,3.00,99.00,30,300,62,4.60,45165665),(1941,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45190185','Private Laurelhurst Studio With Hot Tub/Patio!','Our house is right off the Hollywood Light Rail stop in the heart of Laurelhurst, a historic neighborhood. Our studio, which is connected to our main house (still very private), steps through french doors out to a patio with barbeque and hot tub. It includes a mini fridge, Keurig with compostable cups, and microwave. We are walking distance to great restaurants, Trader Joe\'s, vintage, coffee shops, pubs, Laurelhurst Park, and 24 hour fitness. Catch the farmer\'s market on Saturday mornings!','Laurelhurst is a gorgeous neighborhood offering quick access to both the Hollywood and SE shops and restaurants. The neighborhood itself is covered with tall trees, and a 15 minute walk to Laurelhurst Park. New Seasons and Whole Foods markets, various sushi spots,  Gado Gado as well as some excellent pizza is all within a short distance!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5c6cd2f2-21ca-4fa6-b32c-c3c9c09b5ec2.jpg',97856002,84,'45.53316','-122.62038',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,118.00,1,1125,370,4.90,45190185),(1942,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45191294','Reed Residential Home - Modern Living • 4BR• 2.5BA','This modern and spacious home with craftsman detail and private garden backyard has all the comforts of home away from home. Located in the Reed neighborhood, enjoy convenient access to Woodstock/Sellwood/ Brooklyn neighborhoods. Walk to  Trader Joes,  Kenilworth Park, coffee shops, food trucks and dispensaries. Close to Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden & Oaks Bottom Park. Convenient access to bus & MAX lines. Off street driveway parking available and a 10 min drive to both I-5 and I-205.','Located in the Reed neighborhood, enjoy convenient access to Woodstock, Sellwood, and Brooklyn neighborhoods.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/72548413-9ea2-4fcb-af35-d0c47fb8f5ba.jpg',1978950,61,'45.48925','-122.62653',1,8,2.50,4.00,6.00,119.00,31,360,11,5.00,45191294),(1943,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45241064','5min to Freeway, 15min to Airport/DT','Two bedroom place in a plex. Private and your own entrance and parking in  NE Portland\'s Montivilla neighborhood. 2 bedroom, 1.5 bath, Kitchen and living room space (840 square feet).  Full kitchen, (stove, fridge, microwave, coffee pot ect). Dining table for a making meals or take out. Unit comes with a washer and dryer!  TV and WIFI! Shopping, freeway access, restaurants, public transit and more!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5da05768-45d7-4fab-83a5-4c970ce00525.jpg',29167392,10,'45.52726','-122.56563',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,1125,39,4.49,45241064),(1944,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45269553','#StayInMyDistrict Buckman Spacious Modern Rowhouse','#StayinMyDistrict Buckman neighborhood. Great location in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Walk to local shops, dining and enjoy one of Portland\'s favorite neighborhoods. Modern style and comfort in this bright & open space. Hardwood floors, modern finishes, high ceilings & tons of light, in this private 1bed/1 bath, Full Kitchen, W/D, FREE Street Parking, Smart TV & WIFI. Up to (4) guests. Dog Friendly w/addl fee.','Buckman is a neighborhood in the Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. The neighborhood is bounded by the Willamette River on the west, E Burnside St. on the north, SE 28th Ave. on the east, and SE Hawthorne Blvd. on the south. The Buckman neighborhood is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Residents have plenty of independent retail, coffee, pub, and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br />Buckman’s Hawthorne District is one of the most unique, and most popular areas in Southeast Portland. The area is known for its wonderfully restored Old Portland homes, liberal residents, and fun and funky feel. The street is lined with unique restaurants and shops and has a definite Portland-local flair.  Local area standouts are Slow Bar, Rontoms, My Father’s Place, and the Lucky Labrador Brew Pub.<br />Compared to most other are','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-45269553/original/56079143-1183-412b-bf54-25bcbd7e5228.jpeg',3142393,32,'45.516624450683594','-122.64197540283203',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,74.00,1,28,216,4.81,45269553),(1945,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45271882','Lovejoy | Heart of the NW | Guest Suite','Our spacious one bedroom guest suite has everything you need for the perfect Portland stay! The luxurious kitchen has a gas range and stainless steel appliances plus everything you need for dining in. The large washer and dryer just off of the bedroom and bathroom make keeping clean a breeze and you\'ll love the roomy shower with adjustable shower heads. We\'re located in a residential neighborhood just a few blocks from the hustle and bustle of NW 23rd and all your favorite restaurants and shops!','We love our neighborhood and are sure you will, too! We\'re just a few blocks from NW 23rd Ave where you\'ll find tons of dining and boutique shopping and are in close proximity to trails leading into Forest Park. There\'s so much to do, see and eat even in our immediate area not to mention the rest of the west side including Downtown. This truly is a wonderful home-base for exploring the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-45271882/original/0040b151-ec55-429f-9c8d-54d43996ec40.jpeg',215058058,27,'45.53128052','-122.70561218',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,85.00,2,365,68,4.97,45271882),(1946,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45286436','Charming room in an Urban Farmhouse','Welcome to my charming and artfully designed home! Built in 1912, this light-filled space is filled with vintage charm and unique details. <br /><br />Whether you\'re seeking a lively urban experience or a peaceful retreat, my home provides the perfect base for your adventures.','Welcome to the vibrant neighborhood of Foster-Powell in Southeast Portland! Nestled in the heart of the city, Foster-Powell offers a unique blend of urban energy and community charm.<br /><br />This neighborhood is known for its diverse community, eclectic mix of businesses, and welcoming atmosphere. Located just a few blocks from my property you\'ll find a variety of convenient amenities and exciting local destinations to explore. <br /><br />Grocery shopping is a breeze with Trader Joe\'s, New Seasons, Safeway, and Fred Meyer all within easy reach. <br /><br />When it comes to dining, The Mercado is a must-visit, offering a vibrant food hall experience with a variety of international flavors to choose from. Off the Griddle is perfect for a delicious breakfast or brunch, while Pizzeria Otto serves up mouthwatering wood-fired pizzas. Bar Carlo, 5 & Dime, Atlas Pizza, and Street Disco are my other walkable favorites! <br /><br />For coffee, tea, and pastries I recommend Carnelian Roasters','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-45286436/original/1301c475-85c3-4c31-9364-545ab1e19a92.jpeg',4810546,36,'45.48734','-122.59077',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,1,30,162,4.95,45286436),(1947,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45296630','Portland Purple House 3','1928 Portland Vintage home in the heart of eclectic Portland. near the airport, 3 bus lines, Max and Downtown.<br /> Simple, Quiet, clean. In a family friendly neighborhood,  full of homeowner pride.<br />Our street is constant with a parade of dog walkers, bicyclists and joggers.','Portland Charming','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c57e7bf3-87b7-4e91-aff4-82fa34f2ef6c.jpg',5707629,39,'45.55120086669922','-122.59297180175781',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,1125,7,4.71,45296630),(1948,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45344262','The Bluebell Casita','Create and unwind in this cozy Portland bungalow. Our house features a full kitchen, a large and private front yard, and a home office in a spacious sunlit room. Perfect for a short visit or extended retreat. <br /><br />Find yourself in the heart of the Mississippi Ave neighborhood and discover the best coffee, food, and shops Portland has to offer just steps from your door.<br /><br />Parking can be difficult in our neighborhood as it is such a hot spot to visit & you may need to park more than a block away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45344262/original/b902413e-adcd-4340-b773-7a39eb994b38.jpeg',7409866,9,'45.55062','-122.67605',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,83.00,1,365,95,4.93,45344262),(1949,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45356131','Enjoy your getaway in our retro chic basement apt!','This is a fun freshly-finished basement unit (literally early 2022) between Powell and Division along Cesar Chavez. The unit has a separate private entrance. The ceiling is well-insulated, it’s quiet, and there isn’t much overhead noise. Includes: retro-style fridge, dishwasher, garbage disposal, cooktop, convection oven/microwave, AC, queen bed, stand-alone claw tub, towels, walk-in shower, lift-top coffee table, couch, dining table with four chairs, Roku smart tv, and hi-speed internet.','The unit is walking distance to the charming Division, Powell, Hawthorne, and Holgate areas with tons of unique shops, restaurants, coffee joints, food trucks, a movie theatre with couches, excellent food, a float room, massages, and more that we haven’t discovered yet!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45356131/original/713fcf56-62a7-4489-9cb8-3510ce34e38e.jpeg',26576587,8,'45.500805','-122.622902',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,97.00,30,365,21,4.95,45356131),(1950,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45385809','Modern Designer Loft Studio','Enjoy your Portland stay in comfort and style. Modern designer studio situated in Portland\'s quiet and upscale Downtown Pearl District—within steps to cafes, parks, grocery stores, transportation, restaurants and more.','Fashionable and lively, the Pearl District is a shopping destination with hip brands, indie boutiques and the massive Powell\'s City of Books. Reclaimed warehouse spaces house The Pearl\'s many bars and restaurants, from craft breweries and artisan coffee shops to fine dining mainstays. Galleries showcase contemporary art, photography and glass works. In summer, families cool off in Jamison Square’s wading fountain. - Google','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45385809/original/75d736a2-c4a9-49da-9f08-b902e5c20b0c.jpeg',25354695,2,'45.53051','-122.68317',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,130.00,30,1125,8,5.00,45385809),(1951,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45401640','30+ day stays at Sunnyside Hideaway!','LOCATION LOCATION LOCATION!!<br /><br />15% Discount applied at booking! <br />This lovely 1 bedroom fully furnished Gem is located in a vibrant neighborhood in Portland, close to excellent restaurants, amenities, and entertainment. It is in the heart of the city, and is only a short walk from Belmont, Hawthorne, and Laurelhurst park. The apartment is bright and filled with natural light, and while there may be some street noise at times, it is generally quite peaceful. Neighborhood is safe.','The neighborhood is very charming w/ big beautiful trees and steps away from shops and restaurants!<br /><br />You are in a city so you may hear street noises but nothing loud as we\'re off a side street. So you shouldn\'t hear bar noises but do want you to know that city living can have sounds :)<br /><br />This property is in SE Portland, NOT in NW Portland (DOWNTOWN) but very close to a lot of \"Portland Style\" things to do.  To be honest this is my favorite area in Portland and I\'ve lived here for 11 years.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45401640/original/d43d7d86-2afb-4297-abc7-103c2db236dd.jpeg',2407869,16,'45.51727','-122.6325',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,84.00,31,180,166,4.83,45401640),(1952,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45413851','Dionysian Gardens Suite','My fully furnished guest suite is a recent remodel in my basement with a private entrance and access to a large patio and lovely gardens in back. It has two bedrooms with queen beds, a full kitchen, shower, washer & dryer, and powerful Wi-Fi.  Maximum stays in Portland: 30 days.<br /><br />IMPORTANT: I usually require guests to have recommendations from at least one other Airbnb host and no negative reviews, so if you have no track record with Airbnb, it\'s unlikely I would accept your reservation request.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45413851/original/7a7a01f1-0e54-450a-8145-4f47b51198fb.jpeg',367272339,48,'45.5794','-122.66946',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,82.00,4,30,130,4.99,45413851),(1953,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45434846','Modern space in Historic Irvington Neighborhood','Located in the historic Irvington neighborhood in Northeast Portland, this self contained unit with separate entrance is brand new construction.  It features a spacious living area with a desk for work from home guests supported by a fast mesh WiFi network. The kitchen has all new stove, microwave, refrigerator and dish washer appliances in a well designed space. Our treelined neighborhood boasts parks and bike lanes within easy reach of local restaurants and coffee shops','Irvington is a walkable tree lined neighborhood with access to bus routes, street trams and Portland\'s Max light rail system. It is known for locally owned restaurants, bars and coffee shops. It is within walking distance of the Portland NBA Trail Blazers home venue and the Portland Convention Center.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45434846/original/7144c25f-565b-4b1c-8c6a-a91898f8ce89.jpeg',150524647,7,'45.53999','-122.65574',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,2,1125,157,4.98,45434846),(1954,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45457300','Renovated 3BR Tilikum View in heart of SE Division','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 98/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee, and Portlandia, this is your place. Our private and spacious three-bedroom home sits in a historic building at the heart of the eclectic SE Division District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.','Talk about location! This is often referred to as Foodie row. You are a hop skip and a jump away from to two hot streets in Portland (Hawthorne and Division). There are many shops and restaurants that you can get lost in! You will even find a coffee roaster inside a double-decker bus! If vintage shopping, lifestyle boutiques, and novelty gift shops are your thing, you\'ll need a could days to work through Division.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45457300/original/04755d04-bed6-43c4-a58b-a6d99f5900e7.jpeg',115052133,25,'45.50485','-122.65702',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,147.00,2,1125,233,4.66,45457300),(1955,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45485579','Spacious 2 Story Home Near Alberta','UNDER NEW MANAGEMENT OCTOBER 2022<br /><br />Great 2 bedroom, fully furnished home in the Northeast Portland’s Alberta Arts District. A short drive from the Airport and downtown Portland area! <br /><br />Walking distance to Bars, restaurants, market, food carts and easy access to downtown as well as other hip shopping and dining areas around town! <br /><br />Walkability score: 93 / Biking Score: 80 / Good Transit: 50 Enjoy!','Alberta Arts district, as it is now known, is an epicenter of youth and culture, lined with art galleries, restaurants, clothing boutiques and gift shops. The surrounding area has become popular with both young urban professionals and counterculture groups.<br /><br />On the last Thursday of every month, Alberta Street is home to the Last Thursday art walk which takes place in galleries and shops during the winter months, and outdoors during warmer weather, with tables set up by local artisans and traveling merchants along the sidewalk. Street performers and food carts also participate in the monthly event. (Wikipedia)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6dbe68e3-7b96-4f34-94ff-1a395bb37e3c.jpg',2233241,14,'45.56208','-122.65607',1,5,1.50,3.00,3.00,154.00,30,120,54,4.74,45485579),(1956,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45508534','1br/1ba/W&D Cozy South Tabor Basement Apartment','Enjoy your stay at our cozy and private basement ADU in the South Tabor neighborhood. With a separate entrance and ~400 square feet of living space, it features a spacious bathroom with a washer and dryer. The kitchenette is stocked with everything you need to prepare and cook your meals. When you\'re not out exploring Mt. Tabor or enjoying the best Vietnamese food in town a short walk away, watch your favorite shows or movies on our 50\" TV from the comfort of your bed.','South Tabor is a quiet neighborhood nestled at the base of Mt. Tabor, a destination for locals and tourists alike. We are a short 5 minute drive from the bustling streets full of restaurants, cafes and boutiques on Hawthorne, Division and Stark. Walking distance from us are one of Portland\'s best Chinese and Vietnamese restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45508534/original/8e39ccdd-6980-4e5e-9797-e557706b624d.jpeg',10376990,37,'45.4986','-122.59396',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,76.00,1,1125,182,4.99,45508534),(1957,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45516508','Lively SE Buckman Neighborhood','Private, street level guest suite with a separate, front entrance . This 2-bedroom, 1 bath suite has luxurious linens, towels, and toiletries. The kitchen with stainless appliances and quartz countertops has all the essentials. Washer/dryer. Comfortable furniture, 50-inch Smart TV complete with cable, multiple channels, and high-speed internet. Working space with desk. Sit out on front patio or relax in backyard. Enjoy Portland while staying in my private guest suite! Excited to be your host!','Location is everything! This safe pocket of the city is in the heart of Portland two blocks from Restaurant Row on Burnside Street. A flat grid of streets makes it easy to walk, bike, use public transportation, Uber, or drive. Walk to our city’s finest restaurants, bars, coffee shops, shopping, and entertainment. Laurelhurst Park and Whole Foods are a few blocks away. It is a short car ride to Mt. Tabor, Revolution Hall, Downtown, the Convention Center and the Rose Garden.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45516508/original/0c9672ad-6404-4817-853f-4eb4af2cb1f1.jpeg',177026402,32,'45.52175','-122.63825',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,136.00,2,1125,160,4.96,45516508),(1958,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45521206','Portland\'s White House B&B - Abe & Mary','Welcome to Portland\'s White House, one of the Rose City\'s most luxurious and elegant historic homes that now houses a high-end bed & breakfast. Dating back to 1911 when it was originally built for wealthy lumber baron Robert Lytle and his family, the neoclassical mansion is situated in the heart of the exclusive Irvington neighborhood with lots of restaurants, shopping and public transportation within walking distance.','Portland\'s White House is centrally located whether you are here on vacation or for business. Lloyd Center, the Convention Center and MODA Center are mere minutes away and the exciting downtown and Pearl districts are just over the bridge. The Japanese Gardens, Washington Park with its Rose Garden, Chinatown, Oregon Zoo, Mt. Hood, Timberline Lodge where \"The Shining\" was filmed and plenty of shopping on trendy NW 23 Ave, in downtown or on the Eastside\'s North Mississippi and NE Alberta streets.<br /><br />Those who appreciate top-notch cuisine, fine wines, microbrews, and craft cocktails are in for a real treat as Portland boasts the greatest number of critically acclaimed restaurants, wineries, microbreweries and bars per capita than any other city in the nation. We also count scores of Food Network stars and James Beard award winners whose creativity has kept the city front and center on the epicurean scene.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fc079a0a-6fdf-4223-9c13-4790f41d1b7d.jpg',318184666,7,'45.53588','-122.64238',2,3,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,45521206),(1959,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45521255','Portland\'s White House B&B - Ulysses & Julia','Welcome to Portland\'s White House, one of the Rose City\'s most luxurious and elegant historic homes that now houses a high-end bed & breakfast. Dating back to 1911 when it was originally built for wealthy lumber baron Robert Lytle and his family, the neoclassical mansion is situated in the heart of the exclusive Irvington neighborhood with lots of restaurants, shopping and public transportation within walking distance.','Portland\'s White House is centrally located whether you are here on vacation or for business. Lloyd Center, the Convention Center and MODA Center are mere minutes away and the exciting downtown and Pearl districts are just over the bridge. The Japanese Gardens, Washington Park with its Rose Garden, Chinatown, Oregon Zoo, Mt. Hood, Timberline Lodge where \"The Shining\" was filmed and plenty of shopping on trendy NW 23 Ave, in downtown or on the Eastside\'s North Mississippi and NE Alberta streets.<br /><br />Those who appreciate top-notch cuisine, fine wines, microbrews, and craft cocktails are in for a real treat as Portland boasts the greatest number of critically acclaimed restaurants, wineries, microbreweries and bars per capita than any other city in the nation. We also count scores of Food Network stars and James Beard award winners whose creativity has kept the city front and center on the epicurean scene.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/35ab2d81-088c-41c5-bdc3-459feec6a84b.jpg',318184666,7,'45.53739','-122.64381',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,45521255),(1960,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45550231','Waterfront Pearl , Awesome Views, w/Parking','Beautiful Waterfront Pearl condo, open views of Willamette River.  Located about 50 feet from the waterfront and next to river boardwalk. Seasonal Pool and year-round Hot Tub are steps away.   Full size bedroom with King Bedroom set.  Remodeled with Samsung appliances and hardwood bamboo floors.   Couple hundred feet from market for beer and wine.  Xfinity 800Mbps Internet plan<br /><br />The HOA has 30 night minimum stay requirement ** PLEASE BOOK FOR 31 DAYS TO AVOID TOURIST TAXES**','McCormick Pier Condominium complex is one of the most desirable locations in the Waterfront Pearl District.  It has unique amenities, found now where else in downtown area such as an outdoor Swimming Pool and Hot Tub.  The security is great with a locked gate at nights and a manned security booth at the main entrance.  All of our guests have loved staying here whether for a month or 6 months.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45550231/original/dcd38438-9f3a-4233-bf8f-865d7653d6ba.jpeg',27903183,43,'45.53053','-122.67574',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,1125,9,5.00,45550231),(1961,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45562734','Bright, Clean & Spacious Apt\'. 1st pet stays free!','Welcome to a calm & open space to relax while you explore Portland. A new purposed planned apartment that is full of original art, murals, amenities  and peaceful design features. <br />We LOVE your pets & welcome them to stay with you!  Your first pet is free & any other pet is only an addition $25 . <br />The Light house is near great restaurants, fun Portland neighborhood bars, ice-cream parlors, famous Portland food cart scenes, boutique supermarkets, parks & much much more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45562734/original/cf4237f1-f644-44cc-bf42-9470e5352d5f.jpeg',4901178,38,'45.48348','-122.60746',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,55.00,1,120,276,4.89,45562734),(1962,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45605210','Hipster Vibe Apartment - Food Carts & Live Music','Welcome to the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and find endless restaurants, coffee shops, bars, and more just blocks away. With so many options, you\'ll always have something to do and new places to explore.<br /><br />When it\'s time to relax, enjoy the massive 4K HDTV or cook a meal in the spacious kitchen. Whether you\'re a solo traveler or on a romantic getaway, this is the perfect retreat in the heart of PDX. Enjoy the vibrant neighborhood, modern amenities, and the charm of Portland living.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45605210/original/d3d8920d-6286-45af-977d-b040aa627224.jpeg',36435346,9,'45.5527','-122.67469',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,30,1125,320,4.86,45605210),(1963,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45617837','Guest Unit in Walkable Sellwood','This is a guest unit in Sellwood, a quiet and walkable neighborhood in Southeast Portland, Oregon. Located in a residential area only blocks away from grocery stores, bakeries, public library, coffee shops, and local parks, it\'s the perfect place for a visit! Downtown Portland is only a short drive or light rail ride away.','Our home is on a residential street, with many amenities within 0.5-1 mile including grocery stores, a drug store, public library, bakeries, restaurants, food trucks, and bars. We are a few blocks from a large public park, and another park with a public pool is leas than a mile away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-45617837/original/74caadec-f87d-4fe2-94cf-7832deceae89.jpg',36094011,20,'45.46534','-122.64642',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,2,14,117,4.98,45617837),(1964,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45619382','GREAT! King bed, WiFi, parking,  Portland ❤️','Gorgeous two bedroom, two bath, in the desirable Sellwood neighborhood. It is located upstairs. It has private deck, backyard and dedicated onsite parking. A second living room, family room/office area with wet bar makes it ideal to work from home. Amenities include, air conditioning, living room, family room, kitchen, large bedrooms, washer and dryer, parking onsite, and large deck. Walking distance to restaurants, stores, coffee shops, New Seasons, CVS, Wonderful location, OHSU.','This neighborhood doesn\'t get any better! You have the water front, parks, great restaurants, bars, coffee shops and stores all within walking distance, making it really convenient for all your needs and JUST MINUTES AWAY FROM DOWNTOWN! <br />Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike, there are bike lanes and trails, road connectivity to Downtown and most of the attractions in Portland.<br />Sellwood-Moreland is considered one of the best places to live in Oregon. It offers residents an urban feel. Many families and young professionals live in Sellwood-Moreland.<br />One of the best things about this very walkable neighborhood is how incredibly friendly, safe and clean it is!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/28a38657-3ed3-4956-8949-4161badb4e84.jpg',213350724,20,'45.45908','-122.64634',1,4,2.00,2.00,3.00,175.00,30,1125,9,4.78,45619382),(1965,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45621583','Private Apartment. Clean & Modern Division/Clinton','Our new modern 1-bedroom apartment is located off popular Division St. in the heart of inner SE Portland. You\'ll be walkable to groceries, coffee, and meals, and very close to some of Portland\'s best dining and entertainment.','We can\'t say enough about this inner SE neighborhood. It\'s very close to downtown, and right in the middle of some of Portland\'s best cuisine such as Pine Street Biscuits, Ava Genes, Scottie\'s Pizza, and Bollywood. Quickly changing SE Division street is super fun with all of its food, drink, and shopping. There are great tree-lined streets and people who live here enjoy a vibrant urban lifestyle.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e4d539e0-f5a9-477f-8918-13a1c11b7228.jpg',847543,25,'45.50139','-122.64809',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,2,700,122,4.88,45621583),(1966,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45625003','Blue Alberta Unit on 14th','Perfect for long term staycations- close to all the necessities!<br /><br />This an awesome lower level basement unit. Perfect for families, friends and those who love to wander new cities by foot, this home sits just 1/2 block to the best part of Alberta Street, and boasts a walk score of 95.<br /><br />We are located on 14th Place & Alberta Street. Grab a cup of joe outside our door, walk to the Co-op for groceries, walk to happy hours or to rent bikes. Family w 2 small kids are tenants upstairs.','Just off Alberta Street and 14th Place','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45625003/original/5a9bc0f7-bfff-4439-ad6f-d35fbe4b1df2.jpeg',2479544,29,'45.56151','-122.65184',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,164.00,3,1125,23,4.96,45625003),(1967,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45625194','Schitt’s Creek Themed - The RoseBud & Barkfest','We love this journey for you! Welcome to The RoseBud & Barkfest where you and your dog bébés can enjoy a Schitt’s Creek inspired pot positive stay in Portland (pet fee free!). With a walk score of 96, we’re steps away from the trendy SE Hawthorne & Belmont bars, restaurants, vintage shops & dispensaries. Your stay at Moira’s loaded studio includes her wigs, Rosebud decor, a covered heated courtyard & so much more Schitt. 21+ Only, no cats. Need a bigger spot? We have a 1 bdr upstairs!','Welcome to Sunnyside! This adorable neighborhood is centrally located for all your Portland needs. We are 12 minutes from the airport and just 10 minutes from downtown and Sunnyside is walkable and bikeable. We’re smack dab in the middle of the SE Belmont St. and SE Hawthorne St. bars and restaurants many of which have outdoor (and heated when needed) dining and all the cool kids shop at the shops. We are on the bike path and .5 miles from Laurelhurst Park, which has a large off-leash area and 1.2 miles from Mt. Tabor Park which also has a huge off-leash dog park. We are just 2 blocks from Peacock Lane which is a Christmas light extravaganza and the Tetra Recreational Cannabis shop is just 2 blocks away as well. Skiing is just a little over an hour on Mt. Hood and there are plenty of day-trip worthy destinations including Timberlake Lodge, where the exteriors of Stanley Kubrick’s The Shining was filmed for The Grand Overlook Hotel as well as Cannon Beach and Ecola State Park where scen','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e251ce81-d507-471e-a69c-217b8c312633.jpg',27168187,16,'45.51486','-122.62014',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,87.00,2,28,192,4.96,45625194),(1968,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45636374','A cozy 2bedrooms unit in a dulplex.','This roomy apartment is located in a duplex in inner northeast Portland, close to lots of restaurant shops in everything that makes Portland great.<br />    It will be easy for you to get around the city from this location in the city.  You will have the unit to yourself. It close to the airport and public transportation. We are on a main street so there is some traffic noises.','you\'re in a northeast Portland so you close to everything restaurants stores clubs but the unit is on a Main Street','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45636374/original/b3548883-8f74-4758-beaf-6bf7217c6600.jpeg',191471402,21,'45.56898','-122.61779',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,3,30,3,4.00,45636374),(1969,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45658421','Alberta Retreat - Fire Pit & Driveway Parking!','AMAZING LOCATION! Enjoy a stylish, outdoor-lover’s experience at our home in the heart of the Alberta Arts District. Five minute walk to the very popular Alberta street. Everything is at your fingertips here - restaurants, bars, breweries, shops, parks, and everything the Arts District has to offer! Our modern space gives you priority access to our landscaped backyard, featuring a covered pergola and a fire pit perfect for relaxing outdoors. Safe neighborhood & free parking in our driveway.','Alberta is one of Portland’s most popular neighborhoods and we are so lucky to get to live in this beautiful new home just built in 2020. A quick walk to Alberta street will lead you to great coffee, snacks, and shops. Northeast Portland is popular for its lack of crazy traffic and awesome art scene. It’s also very accessible to the rest of Portland - pretty much 10 minutes will get you anywhere by car.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45658421/original/7895d3e1-95a0-431c-8cee-58a83cb11fd7.jpeg',137112232,14,'45.56142','-122.65344',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,97.00,2,28,161,4.96,45658421),(1970,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45673717','Casita Maria- Daylight Apartment','Built in 2018, 750 square foot daylight apartment with separate entrance. Full  kitchen with all appliances. Bedroom with a queen size bed and bathroom with shower and bathtub. Roomy living room with fireplace and small dining area..There is a small sitting area outside to sit and enjoy the flowers. Very short walk to University of Portland and restaurants on Lombard. Walking distance to New Seasons, Downtown St Johns and Food Truck Pod. WiFi, smartTV, washer dryer included. No smoking. No pets','Walking distance to University of Portland, shops and restaurants on Lombard. Walking distance to New Seasons and Columbia Park. 1.5 miles to downtown ST Johns, food cart pod, St Johns Bridge, Cathedral Park. Short 15 drive to downtown Portland, 5 minute drive to Forest Park hiking.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-45673717/original/81a9f769-dc74-4fe5-8bd6-7f58e7aa66e3.jpeg',19298739,57,'45.58018','-122.71807',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,120,12,4.92,45673717),(1971,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45682768','Luxe Pearl District Apt. in Downtown w/ Rooftop','Upscale apartment with unbeatable location featuring luxury amenities including a rooftop deck with fire pit  & Sky Entertainment lounge. <br />Located in the heart of the Pearl District, you will find endless opportunities to create new memories!  This famous  neighborhood is a travelers top travel destinations when visiting Portland.  This popular destination features art galleries & cultural institutions, as well as stylish shops, acclaimed eateries and brewpubs all within walking distance!','The Pearl District is one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods! Housing world-class art galleries, vibrant shops and boutiques as well as some of the cities best chefs and restaurants.  <br />At The Pearl you will find many bars and restaurants from craft breweries and artisan coffee shops to fine dinning mainstays. <br /><br />Whatever your travel adventure vision looks like, you can see it come alive here at the Pearl District!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a4d44f43-9097-44f2-94e5-ac1a945ba50c.jpg',339414830,27,'45.52584','-122.68705',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,127.00,30,1125,185,4.95,45682768),(1972,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45812832','Hawthorne/Division Gem','***Must confirm no one is a smoker!***<br /><br />Located in the heart of one of the best dining and shopping areas in Portland, this beautiful spacious home is warm, welcoming and fully equipped for a perfect \"home away from home\" feeling.  The primary bedroom is upstairs and equipped with a very comfortable high end Serta iComfort queen bed. There is free parking along the street, usually right in front of the home.<br /><br />Please click on my profile to see reviews for listings within this home.','My home is in a highly desirable neighborhood with dozens of restaurants, food carts and shopping opportunities.  This is not downtown but close enough to get there within about 12 minutes by car.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45812832/original/41a535e0-cd24-4afd-9612-39bc06987dae.jpeg',1096266,8,'45.50762','-122.61677',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,3,10,2,5.00,45812832),(1973,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45816517','NW Portland Studio','Cozy furnished studio with private patio located in NW Portland\'s Alphabet District. This 4-plex has a secured entrance shared with 3 other apartments. The unit has its own washer & dryer and wifi access. This studio is situated in Portland\'s most walkable neighborhood with many restaurants, bars, and coffee shops nearby. Street parking is the only option and unfortunately parking in NW Portland is limited and often difficult to find. There are multiple overnight pay to parks nearby.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4287f257-0999-4cb2-91a2-4d0417a90d64.jpg',108866481,27,'45.52549','-122.69622',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,93.00,30,1125,17,4.94,45816517),(1974,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45830825','Wildwood Oasis  (420 & Dog Friendly)','Two bedroom house with fenced back yard perfect for dogs or smoking marijuana (no tobacco). Renovated kitchen lets you cook anything, if you can avoid takeout or delivery from one of the amazing restaurants just down the hill! <br /><br />Located on the main floor of my 1930s home, you\'ll be nestled in the trees of Washington Park. Across from the Wildwood hiking trail, just up the road from the Japanese Gardens and the Zoo. Parking is easy to find on the street. Up to 2 dogs are welcome with pet fee.','My house is nestled in the SW hills above Portland with the Oregon Zoo, Japanese Gardens, World Forestry Center and Rose Garden walking distance away or a quick drive down the road. All of these top attractions are at your doorstep and the Wildwood walking trail has an entry across the street letting you hike away the cares of the world.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2f1aba71-38cc-475c-a976-4da599938a9f.jpg',75800543,64,'45.518334257212416','-122.71107146596114',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,149.00,14,180,34,4.91,45830825),(1975,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45850671','Overlook Cottage, Upscale 2 bedroom and 2 bath','Be our guest in a newly completed two bedroom two bath cottage designed specifically for short term stays and complemented with designer finishes and décor.  Located in Portland’s historic Overlook neighborhood; a short walk to light rail transit, Overlook Park, and Mississippi Street boutique shops and restaurants.<br /><br />We strive to provide a welcoming and hospitable environment with strict cleaning protocols.','Overlook is an established neighborhood with tree line streets, great for walking or biking. Homes are classic northwest bungalows Overlook Park is 5 minutes by foot and has a walking trail, play ground, and picnic areas with a view of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a4006cb4-24e9-4b4e-b61b-fdc1d534bdd7.jpg',180053286,13,'45.55261','-122.68402',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,165.00,2,1125,100,5.00,45850671),(1976,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45860330','BlackBox  Luxurious historic restoration with 5 beds!','This stunning remodel of a historic Portland Craftsman is the perfect spot for your next stay. This pet-friendly home is stacked with luxurious finishes, steps from the park and in a quiet neighborhood, while still easily accessible to dining, nightlife, and the freeway. Maximum 2 pets weighing max. 25lbs each are welcome for an extra fee of $60 per pet.','Kenton is bordered on the northwest by the St. Johns neighborhood, northeast by the Columbia River, south by Arbor Lodge neighborhood, west by the Portsmouth neighborhood, and east by the East Columbia and Piedmont neighborhoods.<br />East across the Willamette River from downtown Portland and just a short drive along North Interstate Avenue lands you in one of Portland’s smokin’ hot hoods.<br /><br />Kenton is a neighborhood much unchanged from the 50’s, with mostly modestly-sized bungalows, cottages, and craftsmans–plus a sprinkling of grander Old Portland and Victorian mansions. Nearly every home is well maintained, and flowering trees and overflowing gardens are the norm in spring. Pride of home and neighborhood, and an upbeat, creative spirit pervade this neighborhood.<br /><br />Kenton’s quaint downtown core lies along both sides of North Denver Avenue. So park your car, and take a stroll. There’s a lot to experience.<br /><br />North Denver Avenue is an old-time, funky strip wit','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45860330/original/82629903-f17c-4829-876d-3fa8b8c9bc92.jpeg',352768058,55,'45.58841','-122.70096',1,5,2.00,2.00,5.00,117.00,2,1125,229,4.95,45860330),(1977,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45869511','The Bohemian Spirit - Live Music, Eateries + Bars','Welcome to the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and find endless restaurants, coffee shops, bars, and more just blocks away. With so many options, you\'ll always have something to do and new places to explore.<br /><br />When it\'s time to relax, enjoy the massive 4K HDTV or cook a meal in the spacious kitchen. Whether you\'re a solo traveler or on a romantic getaway, this is the perfect retreat in the heart of PDX. Enjoy the vibrant neighborhood, modern amenities, and the charm of Portland living.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45869511/original/bce6f48e-896c-44f4-86b7-50a957e016f0.jpeg',36435346,9,'45.55257','-122.67539',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,78.00,1,1125,340,4.83,45869511),(1978,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45896835','Mount Hood Views Await!','This stunning newer construction guest house comes fully furnished by an interior professional.  It is in an established, quiet, safe, walkable SW Portland neighborhood.  Washer/dryer in unit. All kitchen amenities included, plus InstaPot, smoothie blender and excellent coffee options!  Enjoy breakfast on your private deck with unobstructed views of iconic Mount Hood. Minutes from downtown.','Our location in SW Portland is in an established, safe, suburb, close to downtown Portland.  Enjoy quiet walks through the neighborhood or runs on local trails.  Public transportation is easily accessible, you can also hail an Uber/Lyft within minutes.  Close to I-5 and only 25 mins to the airport!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5310f035-7749-4b3f-bb35-525193dbecbc.jpg',76621559,53,'45.44057','-122.71883',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,30,1125,15,5.00,45896835),(1979,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45938869','Modern townhouse -2 bed/1.5 bath with office in SE','A new Webster Wilson designed townhouse in Buckman SE neighborhood.  Close to downtown and all the great South East Portland neighborhoods.  Two bedroom, 1.5 bath with office spread out over 3 levels.','Walking distance to breweries, wineries, restaurants and shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a55b9796-47dc-4d61-b281-baaa209ba6b8.jpg',5323164,32,'45.52065','-122.64969',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,300.00,30,180,9,5.00,45938869),(1980,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45953350','Hartman House - Private home by rivers and forests','This mid-century rambler is located on a quiet street just a block from Pier Park and walking distance to St. Johns\' downtown, where you’ll enjoy the cafes, shops, restaurants and the farmer\'s market, as well as the parks along the rivers. You’re a short drive to Forest Park for enchanted hikes and Sauvie Island where you’ll enjoy U-Pick farm stands, wine tasting, nature preserve hiking and beautiful beaches.','Hartman House is ideal if you are looking for long-term Portland rental of a private house with a yard in an \"old Portland\" neighborhood village surrounded by nature to enjoy the lively St Johns downtown, hiking, kayaking and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/14e1829a-43c9-4cb1-b5af-e8917009725d.jpg',238937333,58,'45.59808','-122.75009',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,60,240,8,5.00,45953350),(1981,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45959031','Riverview Retreat near Pearl District Long Stays','Unleash tranquility at Riverview Retreat! Spacious 1BR condo closest to river & boardwalk (perfect for sunset strolls!). No stairs! Unwind by the pool or spa that are footsteps away from your doorstep. Gated community w/ security & covered parking for peace of mind. Non-smoking, pet-free for allergy comfort.','Our condo is located on the Northwest quadrant of Portland.  For those not familiar with the area, note that the Willamette River divides Portland East and West, and Burnside Street divides the city North and South.<br /><br />This condo is walking distance to the Pearl District, Portland Saturday Market in Tom McCall Waterfront park, and events in the Moda Center.  <br /><br />In the Pearl District, there are restaurants, cafes, shopping, parks, and more just a short walk away.<br /><br />The Moda Center stadium (Basketball/events arena) is just on the other side of the Broadway Bridge, which you can see from the patio.  Walk or ride to catch a game or event.  <br /><br />There is a convenience store onsite, McPier Market. We are walking distance to public transportation, including the train station and Portland\'s public transportation MAX (buses and light rail that can take you as far as PDX airport).','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45959031/original/c23d3791-c201-49c0-aa40-bfa1a33458cd.jpeg',372581905,43,'45.53074','-122.67466',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,82.00,31,370,12,5.00,45959031),(1982,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45969487','Window Filled Alameda Craftsman on the Bluff','This beautiful, fully furnished home is located on an idyllic street in a historic, quiet, and conveniently located neighborhood.  It maintains all of the original charm while enjoying all modern updates and amenities. This historic home offers five bedrooms,  two marble filled bathrooms, a spacious living room with a gas fireplace, complete kitchen, full basement with an updated media room with large screen TV, a fantastic front porch and large, fully fenced back yard, perfect for your dog!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fb7f899f-6de6-41a1-9256-da7e21f2afd4.jpg',10295660,19,'45.55295','-122.63556',1,5,2.00,5.00,6.00,150.00,90,1125,4,5.00,45969487),(1983,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46033556','Cozy bungalow in inner NE Portland','Stay in our cozy cottage while you explore all of what Portland has to offer. Just a 15 minute drive from the airport, it\'s located in the Woodlawn neighborhood in inner NE Portland. The house has been carefully curated with vintage art, textiles, and plants. During your stay, we will be located in our home next door on the same property. We encourage you to make use of the outdoor space, however please be aware that the houses share this area and you may encounter us gardening or lounging.','The Cottage is located in the Woodlawn Neighborhood in inner NE Portland. We love Woodlawn because it\'s super close to the airport, is quiet and quaint, and has an array of restaurants, a great park, and is walking distance to all of the action on Alberta Street.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/93607516-6a51-4fcb-87b6-0e4c02c71eeb.jpg',5772713,45,'45.57214','-122.64684',1,3,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,69,74,4.92,46033556),(1984,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46067020','*Brand New Modern Woods Home','Located in the heart of Forest Park, this beautiful stylish home is the perfect place to get away into peace and serenity for the holidays. This home is on 5 acres of nature-protected land, so it\'s completely immersed in the woods. Walk out the front door and you\'re on 40 miles of completely isolated Wildwood trails.<br /><br />Includes laundry, fully furnished kitchen and bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/bc644cf3-2149-4a39-831f-6b7bc7329de4.jpg',1839539,50,'45.58612','-122.80481',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,140.00,30,90,2,5.00,46067020),(1985,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46144002','Cute Cully Cottage','This vibrant and charming 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom home is centrally located in NE Portland and is less than a mile from the famous Alberta Arts District! Enjoy the full home theater for your viewing pleasure, beautiful neighborhood walks, sitting in the fully enclosed backyard, or cooking up a fancy meal. With easy access to several fun Portland neighborhoods and plenty of excellent restaurants, bars, nature, and entertainment nearby, this is the perfect calm getaway near all the action.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46144002/original/b40173a2-3085-4ea5-90c6-30da98d1edad.jpeg',57438652,21,'45.56489826356201','-122.61738313737116',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,220.00,30,120,1,5.00,46144002),(1986,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46146460','Modern and Bright Laurelhurst Abode','Our one bedroom cottage is completely private, accessible by a separate walkway, and has an outdoor patio. Extra time was spent choosing finishes and creating a modern, comfortable, and light-filled space. You’ll find everything you need for a weekend in Portland, or a long-term stay. We’ve outfitted a full kitchen, full bathroom with luxurious tub and plush towels, a bedroom with a queen mattress and soft bedding, washer and dryer, and lots of extra touches.','This guest house is located in the historic Laurelhurst neighborhood of Portland. Two blocks to the West is Laurelhurst park, full of beautiful trees and open space, perfect for a walk at anytime of the day. Belmont station, a biercafe that features 1,400+ selected beers is a block away. Three blocks to the Belmont District with \'Bites on Belmont\', Never Coffee and our new favorite, Ardor Natural Wines. Close to Hawthorne and Division neighborhoods as well!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d6a30e67-497b-48d6-af2e-a129eb65bde3.jpg',5378497,23,'45.51982','-122.61857',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,124.00,2,60,134,4.97,46146460),(1987,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46151721','The Launchpad: Tiny Home Heaven In SE Portland!','Unwind in minimalist heaven right at the heart of the FoPo Neighborhood in SE Portland!  A gorgeous sanctuary space in walking distance to fresh bagels, incredible pizza, coffee & tea shops, shopping, food carts, street art, all the things!  Nestled into the backyard, this private stand-alone structure, built in 2018, is your place to let the stress of life fall away and reconnect to what matters most.','This neighborhood is RAD!  Huge murals on the buildings, lots of small locally-owned shops, bars, restaurants, coffee & tea houses, walkability, bikeability, and a bus line that heads straight to downtown only a block away from the property.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c6e9cfd4-bb1f-46fa-9ecf-72c4441d41d3.jpg',7409866,65,'45.48996','-122.59787',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,87.00,30,121,209,4.95,46151721),(1988,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46154745','Happy Studio','Loctation:<br />Se 174th Division 97233<br />Near a very nice park 2-5 mins of walking distance<br />Close to buses and 10 mins to max line<br /><br /><br />Studio Features:<br />King size bed <br />Strong wifi included<br />This is a self contained unit with private entry to the studio<br />Washer and Dryer<br />Deck/Backyard/ Beautiful stringlights for outdoor summer nights<br />Brand New wood laminate flkooring installed<br />Microwave/Mini Fridge<br />Stainless steel sink/counter top<br />Brand New Air Conditioner unit installed','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46154745/original/c3227145-4769-4767-8d2e-00c0d213d2a6.jpeg',244759635,87,'45.51642688333036','-122.48413129553136',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,365,3,4.67,46154745),(1989,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46192896','Spacious Historic Home-Near Great Food & Shopping','This beautiful historic home built in 1910 has the best of both worlds; beautifully upgraded appliances and heating while still maintaining that historic home charm.  Features a large wooden porch swing on the front porch and cozy back deck to relax on at the end of the day. Located close to OHSU, the VA, and Providence Medical Center making this the perfect location for visiting/traveling nurses or doctors. Wonderful, quiet, walkable neighborhood close to parks, restaurants and local shops','This is a wonderful walkable neighborhood.  Close to lots of great local food, grocery shopping and local parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/858f09ec-40af-481f-aec2-8c30755f51d8.jpg',147708508,16,'45.51859','-122.63182',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,130.00,30,90,18,4.89,46192896),(1990,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46197188','Guests Will Play While I\'m Away','A charming little bungalow adorned with a mid century nudge towards the 70\'s style, swanky and comfortable.<br /><br />Historically speaking the house was built in 1911 as a workman\'s home for the stockyard in Kenton a blue collar neighborhood.','Kenton is a historic working class neighborhood in North Portland that was home to woolen mills, a stockyard and lumber warehouses. There are a few traces left of this history from the early 1900\'s<br /><br />Nearby Denver Ave is home to a small, quaint collection of fine restaurants, coffee shops, a liquor store, hair salons, record store and vintage shops.<br /><br />Within walking distance you will find a rock\' n roll, dive bar the World Famous Kenton club, an expansive park and evidence of the historic Portland protests against the Police at their boarded up union building.<br /><br />The neighborhood is diverse and friendly.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cdf01761-adf6-49aa-a7d9-43a010d02c6f.jpg',133290539,55,'45.58068','-122.68993',1,2,1.00,2.00,1.00,147.00,30,1125,6,4.67,46197188),(1991,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46202733','Charming metropolitan home  in Portland','Welcome to Portland, Oregon! This cozy home is located right in the heart of Portland, with as many nearby amenities as possible.This home is fully furnished, fresh paint, original hardwood floors and furnace; with access to kitchen, 1 bathroom, 2 bedrooms, laundry room and living room with an extra sleeper. If you choose to explore our beautiful city, I-205 is a few blocks away and downtown approximately ten minutes drive. Enjoy some of our hottest restaurants, local coffee shops and brewery\'s.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/00fddc2c-bb74-4126-a920-2d4a03683c64.jpg',349910377,10,'45.50671','-122.57327',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,80.00,30,60,12,4.75,46202733),(1992,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46236977','Riverfront Relaxation!','Watch the boats go by! Beautiful 2 bedroom apartment located on the Columbia River. Conveniently located in a quiet neighborhood between Vancouver Washington, Portland Oregon, and Portland International Airport. Features a fully appointed kitchenette, (microwave, two burner hotplate, toaster oven, refrigerator/freezer, tea kettle and K-Cup coffee maker) front patio and expansive back deck.','Bridgeton is the smallest neighborhood in the Portland metro area as well as being a hidden gem to even long time locals!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c9f6b699-ad53-4dbe-bd8d-b3d657816b6b.jpg',374441262,91,'45.60227','-122.66807',1,6,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,213,4.90,46236977),(1993,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46278079','Beautiful Home Close to OHSU and South Waterfront!','Enjoy all the comforts of home in a freshly remodeled vintage Portland bungalow. Large custom kitchen, washer and dryer, covered front porch, and  back deck overlooking a large partially fenced yard. Cozy library-like living room features a fireplace insert.  Bonus room with daybed, TV, high speed cable and internet. Located right around the corner from cherished neighborhood cafe and grocery. Close to OHSU, 5 minute walk to tram and street car. Easy access to downtown and east side.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a4bb7fcf-c7a1-40e2-a9cc-85f9867d4d3c.jpg',30878885,22,'45.49809','-122.67489',1,7,2.00,4.00,5.00,159.00,30,1125,11,4.82,46278079),(1994,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46279261','FoPo Craftsman, Vintage Charm and Comfort','Enjoy Old Portland charm in this historic Craftsman located in the hip FoPo neighborhood. Situated on a corner lot on a quiet street, you\'ll be close to all the action on Foster, Mt. Scott park and local favorite Latin food cart pod the Mercado, and 15 minutes to downtown. Spacious and bright with huge south-facing windows and charming original details, amazing front porch, backyard and upstairs balcony. Carefully curated local and vintage art, furniture, and treasures--including a clawfoot tub!','We are in the Foster-Powell neighborhood (FoPo) in Southeast Portland, right off Foster, which is one of Portland\'s hippest areas with many incredible places to go for food and drinks and cute eclectic shops. Just a few miles to some of the most happening spots on Division, Clinton, and Hawthorne. Downtown is only 15 minutes away by car, or you can walk a mile and get on the Max to go anywhere in the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/58e7713b-8ae7-4a8f-83bf-493689557c7b.jpg',70801266,65,'45.4844','-122.58656',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,32,7,5.00,46279261),(1995,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46314848','Cozy One Bedroom Condo NW/Pearl District','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/06328abb-8d82-4e84-a6a3-6652ccc14999.jpg',6604696,27,'45.52759','-122.69217',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,150.00,30,1125,0,1.00,46314848),(1996,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46315610','Private Room (Single Bed) at NW Portland Hostel','Experience Portland’s top-rated, family-owned hostel, in the vibrant Northwest District! Enjoy a FREE breakfast and explore nearby downtown attractions, Washington Park, the Rose and Japanese Gardens, and hiking trails. Join our daily free events like walking tours, tap tastings, live music, and trivia nights. For over 25 years, our mission has been to provide a welcoming, affordable, and safe space, connecting Portland with travelers worldwide and making a positive impact locally and beyond.','We are located in the Northwest district, just a few blocks from popular shops, cafes, pubs, cinemas, and some of the city\'s best restaurants. Many area attractions, including the Pearl District, downtown Portland, Saturday Market, Portland Farmers Market, Powell\'s Bookstore, art galleries, the Lan Su Chinese Garden, museums, the MLS Stadium, and Pioneer Square, are within walking distance. The Rose Gardens and Japanese Gardens are a short bus ride or a 25-minute walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDYzMTU2MTA%3D/original/b74c70ec-a439-4eb3-bac9-4eec444896a0.jpeg',2820851,27,'45.52684','-122.68856',2,1,2.50,1.00,1.00,54.00,1,365,51,4.76,46315610),(1997,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46374482','Historic Mississippi - Live Music & Local Shops','Welcome to the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and find endless restaurants, coffee shops, bars, and more just blocks away. With so many options, you\'ll always have something to do and new places to explore.<br /><br />When it\'s time to relax, enjoy the massive 4K HDTV or cook a meal in the spacious kitchen. Whether you\'re a solo traveler or on a romantic getaway, this is the perfect retreat in the heart of PDX. Enjoy the vibrant neighborhood, modern amenities, and the charm of Portland living.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46374482/original/51cbd12d-5dcd-4cf0-a5ca-0ce1013d82c0.jpeg',36435346,9,'45.55402','-122.67645',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,1,1125,255,4.82,46374482),(1998,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46471932','Division House','Fully renovated 2 bedroom 2 bath lower duplex unit. All new modern amenities while maintaining the charm of this 100 year old home in the heart of inner Southeast Portland. Individually controlled HVAC in each room. Brand new kitchen, both bathrooms completely renovated. Private washer and dryer. Off street assigned parking for smaller cars. Phase 2 Electric car charger. Large covered deck in the back yard. High speed WiFi, connected to a 65” smart TV with cable.  Alexa WiFi assistant available.','Home is located in the heart of inner Southeast. Walking distance to many shops, restaurants and night life. Hawthorne street shopping, Division street, downtown, waterfront, OMSI, OHSU, Portland State University, food carts, Aladdin theater, and Max are all very close making this location the perfect place for your Portland adventures.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8c863978-27bb-4c68-8ba6-a4b5a4fdb96d.jpg',242195896,25,'45.50597','-122.65476',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,165.00,2,1125,135,4.98,46471932),(1999,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46498351','“DaHouse” any nurses in the NE area, short stay','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.<br />Dine out enjoy the northeast prime area. Location in Uber area, walking distance to all restaurants.','North east the prime area. Located by bus, Uber, walking','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46498351/original/5b816d69-1d53-4149-99ec-9b8c99d2bf42.jpeg',182822950,14,'45.55322','-122.65966',2,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,1,5.00,46498351),(2000,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46516445','Private & Bright Guest Suite. Fast WiFi','This spacious guest suite is the perfect place to land in Portland. There is a small kitchenette and a wonderfully large shower! The guest suite is similar to a  hotel room.<br /><br />Use of washer and dryer is available for long term  (28 days +) guests only. A $60 fee per month for use. Ask Stephani!','Nationally recognized cuisine within walking distance. This a classic Portland neighborhood very close to downtown. Division St is five blocks away with nationally recognized cuisine in walking distance. Super close to the best local grocery store New Seasons. Pine State biscuits, pok pok, Ava Genes all in the neighborhood. Great bars, concert venues and nightlife all within walking distance. Great tree lined streets, community life and historic homes all within blocks. People here take care of their gardens, nurture their young, and enjoy a high quality of life outdoors.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46516445/original/7e12dd59-2c00-4256-9fd9-aa7f69921c86.jpeg',847543,25,'45.50143','-122.64779',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,66.00,2,730,98,4.88,46516445),(2001,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46568150','Master Suite, Walk to Alberta Arts & Mississippi','Have fun in the food, drink, and outdoor activity paradise that is Portland! Centrally located in NE Portland, the house is a quick 5-minute walk to N. Williams Street and 15-minute walk to Alberta Arts and Mississippi districts, where you will find many good restaurants, food carts, dessert places, breweries, bars, and coffee shops.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46568150/original/0e5d01a6-8498-4eb2-af14-c2fe2b6a09e9.jpeg',33081979,14,'45.55467','-122.65889',2,3,2.50,1.00,1.00,33.00,1,1125,305,4.84,46568150),(2002,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46602903','Poppy House: Private, 1-BR in NE; Saltwater HotTub','Fully furnished and private one-bedroom 1st floor apartment (newly built in 2021) in the heart of NE Portland. Located in a quiet residential area.  Shared salt water spa in backyard.  Queen bed in the bedroom and a queen sofa bed in the living area.  Will sleep 4 comfortably. The kitchen is fully equipped: full sized refrigerator, microwave and dishwasher. High speed WiFi, cable TV and large dining room table. Walking distance to many restaurants and coffee shops. Two blocks from Irving Park.','Centrally located between the Alberta Arts District, Irvington and Mississippi   Neighborhoods with so many bars and restaurants to choose from.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fc78f284-0ce4-4fd0-bc06-918f957f2fd7.jpg',376770709,14,'45.55110168457031','-122.65592193603516',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,98.00,2,45,126,4.96,46602903),(2003,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46608476','Walkable Sanctuary near Shops, Dining & Downtown!','Accepting guests and implementing extra cleaning protocols. No parties!<br /><br />Bright and clean two bedroom main floor of gorgeous bungalow just one block off of Mississippi St. Thousands of happy guests! Dozens of shops, bars, restaurants and things to do just outside your door!!! Free parking no permit required.<br /><br />Full kitchen and charming shared courtyard!<br /><br />Minutes from downtown via bike, light rail or car. Easy access to/from the Airport too! Ten years in and our five star rating is going strong!','Portland\'s Historic Mississippi District is definitely where you want to stay when visiting the city. A gorgeous and funky stretch full of great shops, award-winning restaurants, an incredible music venue and amazing bars with outdoor patios and inspiring craft cocktails. SUPER easy to get to other parts of the city from here too!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/033140b7-9da2-4ebb-9dd0-669c1b55f5a8.jpg',6416589,9,'45.55333','-122.67679',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,129.00,1,1125,105,4.88,46608476),(2004,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46617145','Stylish Townhome, Modern Comfort in Prime Location','Classic Mid-Century with modern conveniences. This thoughtfully renovated townhouse with garage has a light-filled open main floor living and is light and bright. Perfect for those rooming with friends, bringing the family, and working from home. The main floor bedroom and bath overlook the private backyard. Brand new kitchen with high end appliances, gas range and quartz breakfast bar. Private fenced backyard, and short couple blocks to excellent restaurants, boutique shops, and Alberta Park.','Our place is nestled in the thriving and industrious retreat for the creatives, and business owners who work and live here. The area is called Alberta Arts, and it\'s a welcoming area of Northeast Portland for residents and visitors. Alberta Street is the primary street through the neighborhood and is just a few blocks away. The many newly renovated retail storefronts and restaurants mix in well with the older businesses and buildings that have been here a very long time. There\'s trendy and unique shopping with many handcrafted and local items, and boutique shops. Don\'t miss the large Alberta Park a few blocks down the road. It\'s many large trees, dog park, and playground draw several people and families from this neighborhood and others.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2bf2410e-3cd0-4228-a87f-dc487f0898e9.jpg',23862030,29,'45.56495','-122.65151',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,160.00,30,365,4,5.00,46617145),(2005,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46625231','Historic St. Johns 1909 Farmhouse','Lovely backyard with bonfire pit, outdoor lighting, and plenty of seating options. Can sleep up to 6 people comfortably (2x queen beds, 1x full pullout). Spacious chef\'s kitchen with gas stove and many tools/staples. Bathroom has a comfortable soaking tub. Explore beautiful St. Johns all within walking distance.','Short walk to many great parks, including Cathedral Park, Pier Park and St. Johns Park. Short drive to Sauvie\'s Island, Forest Park and Kelley Pt Park (confluence of Willamette and Columbia river).<br /><br />Downtown St. John’s is 4 blocks away - grab coffee at Two Stroke, breakfast/lunch at Chop, 45th Parallel Wine Shop, Gracie\'s Apizza, Occidental Brewing, Stormbreaker Brewing, Angel’s Donuts and Ice Cream, Two Rivers Book Store - all in close proximity.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9d4a70a3-edfb-4e1f-b41e-4a05a04020a6.jpg',2084230,58,'45.59644','-122.75333',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,650.00,30,40,5,4.20,46625231),(2006,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46628896','Family Friendly Modern Bright (pics upon request)','Modern 4-Bedroom Home near Division Street - Inquire for More Photos<br /><br />Step into our fully furnished, 4-bedroom, newly remodeled modern home, ideally situated on a tranquil residential street, just three blocks away from the bustling Division Street. This is no ordinary house; it\'s a sanctuary meticulously designed for comfort and style. When we\'re not traveling, this is our family home, and we\'re excited to share it with you.','Inner SE Portland. Very walkable!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46628896/original/dac23f07-8183-4873-8349-9ec8ba85d0cc.jpeg',847543,25,'45.50308','-122.64627',1,4,2.50,4.00,4.00,400.00,30,120,1,5.00,46628896),(2007,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46643401','Beautiful Condo Near NW 21st','This remodeled vintage condo sits just steps away from hundreds of eateries, pubs, breweries and shops, with close proximity to the lushness of Forest Park. Across the street you can catch the Portland Streetcar and be on your way to The Pearl, Downtown and PSU within minutes. Perfect for single adventurers and traveling couples alike. Allow us to welcome you to your Portland adventure!','~ Located in the heart of Nob Hill in NW Portland<br /><br />~ With a walk score of 100 & transit score of 90, all you could need to explore is sitting outside the door <br /><br />~ Excellent shops, eateries, pubs & coffee shops in every direction<br /><br />~ A Portland Streetcar ride away from Washington Park<br /><br />~ Easy highway access for out of town adventures','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46643401/original/911148a9-9527-44be-9421-228605b54c77.jpeg',221421926,27,'45.52937042597713','-122.68913131132574',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,31,180,6,4.83,46643401),(2008,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46696578','The Little Red Barn - Quiet, Clean & Private','The Little Red Barn is sure to charm with lots of natural light & a cozy cottage feel!  Free standing & all to yourself this beautiful, clean, relaxing space has a full kitchen, queen bed and bathroom all on main floor w/ a cozy upstairs loft & pull out couch/bed, tv & books/games. Gardeners paradise in the city! In the Beaumont and Cully neighborhood it\'s close to restaurants, bakeries, groceries, parks, unique Portland shops and more! Great space for a getaway & <10 min from the airport.','The Little Red Barn is located in the heart of the NE Cully neighborhood where side walks are scarce but folks garden, keep bees, have chickens and goats. It\'s a lovely diverse neighborhood with easy access to unique Portland restaurants, bakeries and shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDY2OTY1Nzg%3D/original/0dc02fe9-e533-4c44-a4c9-6ae866d8c3a4.jpeg',58611997,21,'45.55406','-122.60783',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,30,60,137,4.96,46696578),(2009,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46715181','Alberta Arts Bungalow for Longer Stays (31+ days)','LISTING IS AVAILABLE FOR BOOKINGS OF 31 DAYS OR MORE. IF DATES SHOW AS UNAVAILABLE, ENSURE MIN DATES SELECTED.<br /><br />Located 2 blocks from the great boutiques and restaurants of Alberta St, this cozy craftsman bungalow oozes Pacific Northwest charm. Built in 1912 but updated with modern amenities, the home features original hardwoods, stainless steel appliances, and quartz countertops. Bus line that connects downtown is a 2 min walk.  Driveway parking with NEMA 14-50 outlet for EV charging.','Alberta Arts is known for quirky shops/galleries and great restaurants. Additionally, the main strips of Mississippi and Williams are within a mile and provide even more great dining options. The neighborhood is between downtown and the airport which makes ride shares quick to either destination.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/226bbe7c-e4bf-417d-93f0-03d38d059b79.jpg',8060830,6,'45.55701','-122.64884',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,31,90,20,5.00,46715181),(2010,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46715977','Alberta Arts Studio for Longer Stays (31+ days)','THIS LISTING IS AVAILABLE FOR BOOKINGS OF 31 DAYS OR MORE. IF YOUR DATES SHOW AS UNAVAILABLE CHECK TO ENSURE THE MIN DATES ARE SELECTED.<br /><br />Conveniently located 2 blocks from the great boutiques and restaurants of Alberta Street, this cozy basement studio features modern amenities and lots of natural light. Major bus line that connects downtown is also 2 min walk. Private entrance provides easy access along with plentiful street parking. Fast wifi!','Alberta Arts is known for quirky shops/galleries and great restaurants. Additionally, the main strips of Mississippi and Williams are within a mile and provide even more great dining options. The neighborhood is between downtown and the airport which makes ride shares quick to either destination.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b05e3fff-2501-472f-9dec-3b1bbeec2d9e.jpg',8060830,6,'45.55682','-122.64952',1,2,1.00,0.00,2.00,54.00,31,90,14,4.93,46715977),(2011,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46734349','Cozy Nob Hill Apartment','Enjoy your freshly renovated and furnished private apartment in NW Portland! Stay in a beautiful peaceful neighborhood. Restaurants, shops, parks, city hikes are also steps away! <br /><br /><br />Comfy one bedroom, with a stocked full kitchen, and a cozy living room to hang out. the sleeper sofa can be converted to host additional guests!<br /><br />discount pricing for stays that are 7 days or longer!','Steps to all the shops/ restaurants on 23rd, wallace park, new seasons grocery and more shops. Our neighborhood is private and quiet and super walkable!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/36590f5b-b22d-4858-8824-26d668ff2021.jpg',7409866,27,'45.53189','-122.69991',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,88.00,1,1125,162,4.92,46734349),(2012,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46773912','WATERFRONT condo with private balcony with PARKING','Amazing waterfront condo!  Close to everything.  Walking distance to the Pearl District and Downtown.  River walk path at the base of your own private balcony and beach.  Views from bedroom, living area and kitchen.  Very private and peaceful.  Also, assigned and covered parking space included with condo.  In unit washer/dryer, full Sonos surround in the bedroom and living area.  Access to pool and hot-tub.  Fire pit outside of unit and shared gas BBQ.<br /><br />*Peloton is no longer in unit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3f9c2b3d-1416-44fc-9980-3c8571492b2e.jpg',95866386,43,'45.52683','-122.67284',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,103.00,30,120,7,4.71,46773912),(2013,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46798301','Cozy Guesthouse in Quiet Neighborhood','Cozy guest house in quiet, family-oriented neighborhood of northeast Portland.  High speed wifi, beautiful yard. Only 15 minutes to PDX and three walkable blocks to two different business strips with cute shops, restaurants, post office and grocery stores.  Our family of five lives in the main house with our dog and cat.  We welcome all manner of guests and have been hosts for many years.  We do not accept smokers, as this has been a problem in the past with the scent seeping into the apartment.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46798301/original/89eecf09-6f16-4a5e-956b-dc1a76c9aa55.jpeg',18607098,11,'45.5439','-122.61111',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,52,4.87,46798301),(2014,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46819929','Peaceful Studio Cottage','Love the large windows and vaulted ceilings in this private cottage studio. Nestled in a quiet gated backyard with its own path and entrance, it\'s a comfortable spot for a self-sufficient retreat or getaway. Calm and uplifting!','Relaxed residential spot situated right between the neighborhood centers of Kenton and St. Johns. Walking distance from good food - Thai, Vietnamese, Chinese, sandwiches, five taco spots, food carts (Middle-Eastern, sushi, Tibetan, pizza, ice cream, beer porch, fish & chips, vegan & vegetarian, etc.)<br /><br />A stone\'s throw from Northgate Park, which is lovely. For a longer adventure, walk a mile to Columbia Park or bike to Kelley Point Park to explore the riverside beaches at the confluence of the Columbia and Willamette rivers. Cathedral Park and the beautiful St. John\'s Bridge is another waterfront option within a 9 minute drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fd84d283-63f6-4964-8936-fefd6f2ca837.jpg',45404378,60,'45.59029','-122.7222',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,100.00,7,90,45,4.89,46819929),(2015,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46895510','Cozy Oasis','The Cozy Oasis is a newly remodeled basement apartment in our home featuring lots of light, lush plants, new carpet, a projector, and 150 plus cable channels like HBO, Showtime, etc. We’re located across the street from the Mt Scott Community Center, that offers an indoor swimming pool with kiddie pool and lap pool,  hot tub, indoor gym, basketball courts, and workout classes. We’re also within walking distance of a coffee shop, The Mercado (food carts), and Ottos Pizzeria.','We LOVE the neighborhood. Mt. Scott park across the street is awesome for an afternoon stroll, a picnic, or if you want to play tennis. There is a coffee shop called Space Monkey Cafe, kiddie corner to us that makes delicious smoothies and espresso drinks. Three blocks away is the Portland Mercado, featuring food from Latin America, a bar, and a juice bar. There is also a bubble tea shop, Red Castle game store, and Pizzeria Otto\'s in the same area. Further down the street is Henry Higgins Bagels and a Vegetarian/Vegan restaurant called Off the Griddle. <br /><br />On Foster Street you\'ll find one of Portland\'s top hair salons (Ginger Salon) and our favorite bar: Bar Maven (Get yourself the $6 Greyhound and mezza plater, we dare you!).<br /><br />New Seasons market and Safeway are a just a five minute drive away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-46895510/original/a24e5c3a-043e-437d-9c68-fcdfc6688e73.jpeg',2054100,65,'45.482727353826235','-122.59198518835731',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,250.00,2,29,62,4.87,46895510),(2016,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46965190','Modern 1 Bedroom Apartment - Min 30 day stay','Modern fully furnished 1 bedroom apartment in the heart of division.  Walk to shops, restaurants, public transit.  Located on a quiet street, this 550 square foot one bedroom ground level apartment was built in 2019 as an ADU with a private home above.  The apartment has a private/separate entrance from the host\'s home above, and has all the amenities you\'ll need, including a washer and dryer, dishwasher, large bedroom and closet, desk, TV, and internet.','We are just a short walk in almost any direction from some of Portland\'s best restaurants, shops, and bars.  We are close to public transit to get downtown in 15 minutes, or a 10 minute drive to downtown, and there are a few large parks within a 10 minute walk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/90d85261-5baa-41f8-9704-8f79799bd1da.jpg',1237783,8,'45.49872','-122.63321',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,55.00,30,155,18,4.89,46965190),(2017,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46971277','Skinny house in N. Portland, 1/2 block from park!','\"Skinny House\" in Kenton!  Walking distance to downtown Kenton, with bars, restaurants, the library, thrift stores, boutiques and the light rail and bus.  Walking distance to Green Zebra grocery store.  One block from Kenton park!<br /><br />Quiet neighborhood with great access.  <br /><br />The house has an office and two bedrooms.  Living room is super cozy with a sectional and gas fireplace.  Small enclosed yard that is dog friendly.','Kenton is SO cute! It used to be a separate town, before it became part of Portland.  We have a huge Paul Bunyan statue, plus coffee shops, bakeries, restaurants and bars.  Kenton Club has a great outdoor area for Covid times.  <br /><br />There are two great thrift stores and a boutique shop as well.<br /><br />The Green Zebra grocery store is within walking distance and there are two larger grocery stores close too.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4ec6d5ef-cd6a-4eca-8d3f-399240d6f6ed.jpg',32095394,55,'45.58409','-122.69399',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,150.00,2,25,7,4.86,46971277),(2018,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47013456','whole Unit 2 bedroom With Free Parking','3 unit in one house. Rent out a unit in a near Portland\'s attractions. \"NO SHARED\" This unit, located on the first floor ensures complete privacy with no shared spaces. Enjoy easy access to Montavilla bars and restaurants, or take a leisurely walk to the top of Mt. Tabor Park for stunning city views during your picnic. The home is conveniently situated near the airport, downtown, public transit, and major freeways, making it an ideal starting point for exploring everything Portland has to offer.','The home is close to shopping, restaurants, and PDX airport. There are several beautiful parks nearby, including Mt. Tabor with hiking and biking trails and beautiful vistas. Take a short drive and explore the Pittock Mansion (20 min.) or the Japanese Gardens (20 min). Go shopping on Belmont St. or Hawthorne Blvd.  Or, stay close to the house, avoid the crowds, and bike to The Grotto, eat at the Observatory, and have dessert at Pinolo Gelato.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cde2c834-5562-4245-80de-44921090cb2d.jpg',380057237,10,'45.515965','-122.578148',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,108.00,2,1125,54,4.83,47013456),(2019,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47124122','1BR cottage in wonderful St. Johns','Built in 2019, the cottage is located in the homey and slower-paced St. Johns neighborhood in North Portland.  Shops, markets, theaters, restaurants, bars and several outstanding parks are just a short walk away.  <br /><br />The cottage is fully detached from the main house with its own private entrance.  Street parking is always easy and plentiful and access to downtown Portland is quick and convenient. The property is fully fenced if you have a pet.<br /><br />*The rental has a 30 night minimum. Thank you.','At heart, St. Johns is basically a town within the city. Everything you want and expect from city living but with a more relaxed pace and setting.  Cathedral Park and Forest Park, gems of the Portland park system, are walking distance away, as are shops and markets. Accessing downtown Portland from St. Johns is quick and convenient.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47124122/original/a5511cab-5d1a-4c87-973a-23b0f1864b5e.jpeg',879106,42,'45.59502','-122.76173',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,9,5.00,47124122),(2020,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47145105','Private Over Size in New House','Rent out a Over size private room in a near Portland\'s attractions. This private room , located on the second floor Enjoy easy access to Montavilla bars and restaurants, or take a leisurely walk to the top of Mt. Tabor Park for stunning city views during your picnic. The home is conveniently situated near the airport, downtown, public transit, and major freeways, making it an ideal starting point for exploring everything Portland has to offer.','The home is close to shopping, restaurants, and PDX airport. There are several beautiful parks nearby, including Mt. Tabor with hiking and biking trails and beautiful vistas. Take a short drive and explore the Pittock Mansion (20 min.) or the Japanese Gardens (20 min). Go shopping on Belmont St. or Hawthorne Blvd. Or, stay close to the house, avoid the crowds, and bike to The Grotto, eat at the Observatory, and have dessert at Pinolo Gelato.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/bec763db-f5e9-47f4-b2cc-a916b47b4658.jpg',380057237,10,'45.51517','-122.57897',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,39.00,30,1125,60,4.85,47145105),(2021,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47145424','Master size Private room in new House','Rent out a Master size private room in a near Portland\'s attractions. This private room , located on the second floor. Enjoy easy access to Montavilla bars and restaurants, or take a leisurely walk to the top of Mt. Tabor Park for stunning city views during your picnic. The home is conveniently situated near the airport, downtown, public transit, and major freeways, making it an ideal starting point for exploring everything Portland has to offer.','The home is close to shopping, restaurants, and PDX airport. There are several beautiful parks nearby, including Mt. Tabor with hiking and biking trails and beautiful vistas. Take a short drive and explore the Pittock Mansion (20 min.) or the Japanese Gardens (20 min). Go shopping on Belmont St. or Hawthorne Blvd. Or, stay close to the house, avoid the crowds, and bike to The Grotto, eat at the Observatory, and have dessert at Pinolo Gelato.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/db2ef1e8-2d94-418c-bc74-591c7799705f.jpg',380057237,10,'45.51538','-122.57862',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,45.00,30,1125,55,4.89,47145424),(2022,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47308618','THE BEST Portland Location! Hip Foodie Central','In the heart of amazing shopping & best restaurants/food trucks Portland has to offer. No car needed with a Walk Score® of 93/100. PLEASE NOTE this is rented to adults only.  It’s not set up for children.<br /><br />This is not your typical Airbnb stay. Uniquely interior designed home with full gourmet kitchen & all the charming qualities of an updated Portland craftsman home. Sit on the porch & enjoy your morning coffee like a local.<br /><br />Back deck, yard, & BBQ for warm summer nights','This is an iconic Portland neighborhood. Literally the \"Portlandia\" house is located on this street! Set between the two hottest travel destination areas for foodies & shoppers -Hawthorne & Division.  Steps from the best restaurants & local spots like McMenamins Bagdad Theater & Pub, Powell\'s Books, Bollywood Theater, numerous Vintage stores, Pie by the slice, & so many fabulous local shops to explore.<br /><br />Endless amounts of highly rated restaurants in easy walking distance include organic vegan/vegetarian & juiceries, bakeries, Vietnamese, Indian, smoothies, Pizza by the slice, delicious food trucks such as Matt\'s BBQ Tacos (A must try!!! Trust me) & two grocery stores if choosing to cook in the fabulous & well set up gourmet kitchen.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0013d752-1c1c-4d49-91b8-f95009043cf6.jpg',29629823,8,'45.50888','-122.62523',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,399.00,2,60,77,4.90,47308618),(2023,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47352401','Bright & Modern 1 bedroom Alberta Arts Small Home','Custom designed small home nestled right in the heart of the Alberta Arts District. This fully furnished, modern and light filled retreat includes 1 bedroom, full bath with rain shower, utility room with washer/dryer and lofted great room with full gourmet kitchen and living space. A short walk to 15 blocks of great restaurants, coffee shops, pubs and locally owned boutiques and art galleries. Unwind and relax in this true city oasis by booking today.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0cf83da2-cd7e-4a0e-a2fa-3ce85ee011ea.jpg',8804048,29,'45.55998','-122.64581',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,4,5.00,47352401),(2024,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47362022','Huge Luxury Home with huge Deck near Powell Butte','The Luxury House is a huge home filled with many comfortable spaces. Few walking minutes away from Powell Butte Park as the \"backyard\" of this home. Close to the freeway, about 25 minutes from downtown Portland and an hour to the Gorge. A huge deck offers beautiful forested and relaxing views. Home includes many extra amenities and a game room on the upper level.  Come and stay in the beautiful Luxury home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a7987a0d-5c57-4a2e-a815-5c70fbbad3c3.jpg',382375965,78,'45.4852','-122.51521',1,10,3.50,5.00,8.00,700.00,4,1125,13,4.85,47362022),(2025,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47362049','Kerns Neighborhood Cottage with Sauna','Oak St. Cottage with outdoor cedar sauna is a newly renovated urban oasis centrally located in Southeast Portland just steps from Restaurant Row, Whole Foods, Tri-Met Bus and Laurelhurst Park. Set back from the main house, at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, the modern cottage offers easy access to all Portland has to offer. When you are ready to relax, the private outdoor sauna and shower are waiting for you. We take great care to clean and sanitize the cottage.','Oak St Cottage is adjacent to the Laurelhurst, Kerns, Sunnyside and Buckman Neighborhoods.  We are in the center of all that Portland offers, but our cul-de-sac and the off street location of the cottage keeps things very private. Enjoy a 5 minute stroll through neighborhood streets to reach Laurelhurst Park. Countless dining and takeout options with Bamboo Sushi, Ken\'s Pizza, Crema Bakery and Canteen Juice just a block away, and dozens more including Whole Foods within a 5-10 minute walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ba9713a4-d0ae-4749-a55b-ac43f1745398.jpg',382376559,12,'45.52097','-122.63611',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,130.00,2,14,196,5.00,47362049),(2026,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47455439','New Daylight Basement Apt for Short or Long Stays!','Clean and comfortable 1 bedroom 1 bathroom basement apartment with private access in NE Portland. Convenient location with easy access to I5 and public transportation, and walking distance to the top-rated restaurants, bars and breweries of the Alberta Arts District, Williams Corridor, and Mississippi Avenue. Can accommodate up to 4 guests, with 2 in the private bedroom and 2 on the pull-out sofa, though this set up is more ideal for families with children than four adults.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47455439/original/e09e90cb-4348-4043-9840-277370b77c3e.jpeg',6297763,14,'45.56078','-122.66309',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,60,1125,12,5.00,47455439),(2027,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47490602','Luxury Townhouse 91 Walkscore 92 Bikescore!','Three-Story Luxury Townhouse in the Heart of Portland 3 BR 3.5 Bath. Great location with quick access to all parts of the city 91 Walkscore 92 Bikescore!. <br /><br />Each room has its own bathroom and shower. All bedrooms have TV\'s. The second floor is open concept and with high ceilings and a great place to hang out. Kitchen appliances are all very new and are great for those who like to cook.<br />Bedroom 1: King<br />Bedroom 2: Queen<br />Bedroom 3: Queen<br /><br />Great WIFI. There are 4 tv\'s, an XBOX One, N64, DVD Player.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/12db9bea-4334-4e27-abfa-b5c2eb826b4e.jpg',68945849,26,'45.5465','-122.6709',1,6,3.50,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,32,9,4.89,47490602),(2028,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47516744','Historic PDX Home - Sleeps 10, Perfect Location','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. This historic home (built in 1906) takes its place among Burnside\'s many photogenic charmers. Inside this worldly three-bedroom home you\'ll find period details like rich hardwoods and sunny windows combine with a minimalist, serene design for pure relaxation. When you\'re good and zen, head out to explore Burnsides\'s \"foodie row\" with some of the best restaurants in PDX at your doorstep','Across the Willamette River from downtown, this area blends industrial Portland with new restaurants, microbreweries and riverside recreation.<br /><br />Criss-crossed with train tracks and lined with old industrial factories, some of Portland’s favorite restaurants, boutiques and events call the Central Eastside home. Read on for our recommended things to do and see in Portland’s Central Eastside.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47516744/original/a5bacddb-d256-41e5-a615-ccb8868394ac.jpeg',293772932,12,'45.52398','-122.65407',1,10,2.00,3.00,5.00,320.00,30,1125,250,4.81,47516744),(2029,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47535373','Hurst Haus in North Portland','Lose yourself in this home. Victorian charm mixed with modern comfort creates a space that is both historically rich and easy to relax in. Cook a feast in the spacious kitchen, rock out while spinning records, or lower the projector screen and have a private cinema experience. Find inspiration while nesting or a home base for your Pacific Northwest adventures.<br /><br />Pet requirements: Only dogs under 30lbs--Please let host know upon booking!','The Painted Lady is tucked away on a quiet residential street between the historic and vibrant districts of Kenton and St. Johns. Walking distance to playgrounds, sports fields, tennis courts, and paved paths at Columbia and Kenton Parks.<br /><br />5-minute ride (car or bike) to Kenton District.<br />10-minute drive to St John\'s District, or 20-minute scenic bike ride via Willamette Blvd.<br />10-minute drive to the Mississipi District.<br />15-minute drive to the Alberta Arts District.<br />15-minute drive to Downtown Portland.<br />20-minute drive to Ladds Addition.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47535373/original/c335fbb1-07f3-49bc-aa71-47f91eff4322.jpeg',383671492,60,'45.58247','-122.70977',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,196.00,3,90,168,4.95,47535373),(2030,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47564484','Delightful Creative Oasis in Prime Location!','A charming Portland experience awaits in this beautifully appointed, sparkling clean, thoughtfully renovated home located in a prime walkable neighborhood. Owned by an artist + filled with original paintings and treasures from around the world, the Oasis features modern amenities, gorgeous outside spaces, comfortable beds, + everything you\'ll need to feel right at home. You\'ll find world-class restaurants, a large natural grocery, + one of Portland\'s most beautiful parks just a few blocks away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47564484/original/febe2815-2e2b-4c44-a65d-8560cbe81d51.jpeg',153163152,1,'45.56647','-122.62982',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,207.00,3,30,119,4.97,47564484),(2031,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47567322','Steps away from Wilshire Park!','Cozy basement apartment with full kitchen and private entry in one of Portland’s most serene neighborhoods. <br /><br />Just steps away from a beautiful park, walkable to coffee, tacos, shops and brunch. A 5 min drive to Alberta Arts and Kennedy School, 15 minutes to downtown. <br /><br />TV over the fireplace with access to HBO, Netflix, and Disney+.<br /><br />This is a nonsmoking unit.','Quiet, peaceful neighborhood with a lively park, with running trail, sports fields, dog park, playground, and live bluegrass on most summer weekends.<br /><br />A 10-15 min walk brings you to Beaumont-Wilshire, one of Portland’s cutest neighborhoods. Visit Grand Central Bakery, Little Griddle for brunch, Prince Coffee, or famous Pip’s Donuts & Chai (if it’s your birthday week you get free donuts!). <br /><br />We love our neighborhood and know you will too!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47567322/original/6b9e6f34-6c16-42e0-91bf-9439ded4d90e.jpeg',1588473,46,'45.5525','-122.62914',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,200,32,4.94,47567322),(2032,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47582540','Beautiful townhome on bike trail with river views','Welcome to Miles Street, a unique 2200 sq ft bright and airy 2 bedroom 4 story townhome on Portland\'s 26 mi riverfront trail with Willamette river views. An entertainer\'s dream with open concept 4th floor kitchen, dining and living room with fireplace, balcony, and river views. Two 3rd floor bedrooms including master with fireplace and balcony, & bathroom with heated floors, open shower & soaking tub. 5th floor rooftop deck has gas grill & firepit table with view of the Willamette and Mt. Hood.','Our townhome is located in a small enclave of homes, adjacent to Willamette Park and boat launch in Johns Landing, across the street from the Willamette river. It is a short walk (only one block) to Zupan\'s upscale market, several restaurants and coffee shops as well as Starbucks a half mile away. 2 miles to the South Waterfront/OHSU tram, 1 mile to downtown Sellwood with shops and restaurants, all walkable on the riverfront trail.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1e39b2b3-5725-40c4-8e9d-498d49cbf1f5.jpg',120448545,22,'45.47152','-122.66973',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,225.00,2,30,169,4.98,47582540),(2033,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47707533','Warm & Cozy Bungalow in Friendly South Tabor Area','Tucked away just off Division, this 2 story bungalow offers the perfect blend of comfort and style. The living room features a chic Article couch, perfect for cozying up with a book or movie. The newly renovated kitchen is fully equipped, ready for cooking meals. After a day of exploring, relax in one of the cozy bedrooms designed for a restful night\'s sleep.<br /><br />We are conveniently located:<br />3 mins to Division district<br />5 mins to Mt Tabor<br />7 mins to Hawthorne district<br />15 mins to Downtown Portland','1 mile from Mt. Tabor Trails, walking distance to Green Zebra grocery market, Good Coffee, delicious food carts and a mile away from the greatest shopping on Division!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47707533/original/66815269-973d-42e8-9f99-ce1fec8e5c2e.jpeg',18137420,8,'45.50014','-122.6111',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,104.00,2,30,56,4.95,47707533),(2034,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47717464','Modern Gem 3BR & 2 baths','Bright modern Townhouse.  This two story townhouse is an enjoyable stay next to the the quaint and popular Woodstock neighborhood.   Many restaurants, cafe\'s and grocery stores close by.  Enjoy staying  home and cooking  dinner in our fully stocked chefs kitchen with vintage wolf stove.  Enjoy a glass of wine in lovely fenced backyard, or dim the lights, and curl up on the couch to watch a movie.','Woodstock is a vibrant, hip, and conveniently located neighborhood in Southeast Portland with a bustling strip of shops, restaurants and bars. Attractions include Heart Coffee, Double Mountain Brewery, New Seasons market, Proper Pint, Cloud City Ice Cream, Red Fox Vintage and the Delta Cafe. Woodstock is near to Reed College, Division, Hawthorne, Sellwood and East Moreland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/73773c53-46da-43dc-a52b-777cb8b3bc40.jpg',15284638,69,'45.474503','-122.605972',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,180.00,30,60,5,5.00,47717464),(2035,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47730668','Quiet central home w/hot tub, king bed, fireplace','We are offering our family home, a 1905 traditional Foursquare house for rent. In 2021 we converted this house into 3 apartments, & kept the largest one for ourselves. You\'ll love the wrap-around porch, hot-tub, & heated bathroom floors. We are centrally located in Buckman, an eclectic neighborhood in the highly walkable, heart of the SE. We are 3 blocks from Hawthorne\'s popular food carts, plus 300 bars & restaurants including Kachka, & the famous Clark Lewis. Full grocery is 2 blocks away.','Buckman is one of Portland\'s best neighborhoods. It is characterized by turn of the century homes and apartment buildings. We are 13 blocks from the waterfront, which makes for a nice mile run or walk each way. The streets are tree-lined, and you can hear birds chirping among the typical sounds of the City.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-47730668/original/16d740bd-5569-45c7-9393-d4e976c6e978.jpeg',1501859,32,'45.51449','-122.65334',1,5,2.00,3.00,2.00,289.00,30,1125,16,4.81,47730668),(2036,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47732938','Patio Villa for 1-4 w/ kitchens & gas firepit','Book this entire 2-unit Patio Villa for 1-4 guests. <br />Each unit, the Patio Cottage and the Patio Suite, has its own private entrance from the secluded patio. Both feature luxurious queen beds, high-pressure showers with organic toiletries, and a well-equipped kitchen/kitchenette.<br /><br />(Note: Guests who wish to skip paying high commission fees are welcome to book direct on the Portland Eco House website.)','PERFECT CENTRAL LOCATION<br /><br />The location of the Patio Villa is unbeatable. The airport and downtown Portland are just a short drive away, and Alberta Street, Williams Avenue, Mississippi Avenue, and Killingsworth Street are within walking distance, offering a plethora of locally owned restaurants, pubs, and shops. <br /><br />The central location of the Patio Villa allows for easy exploration of the stunning Columbia Gorge and Oregon Coast.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-47732938/original/443568b7-af6f-44d3-937f-921559e22460.jpeg',6946676,24,'45.55827331542969','-122.66529846191406',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,139.00,2,21,4,4.50,47732938),(2037,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47738338','Chill Room $800/M No cleaning fee No tax','This place is located in a convenient location within walking distance to shopping and transportation. 11 minutes a way from airport and 15 minutes away from downtown. You do not need a car. This is a casual friendly environment. The room has mini fridge a desk single bed closet and storage. Taxes are waved on Booking for 31 days and more .','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ecc75706-9c4c-491d-96ed-3f05ba4fb959.jpg',96243932,63,'45.52642','-122.53304',2,1,0.00,1.00,1.00,30.00,30,730,5,4.80,47738338),(2038,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47757886','B House NW PDX Hillside w/sauna & Mt Hood view','Hygge at its best!  Renovated cottage nestled on the edge of Forest Park, set amongst a Japanese garden with views of downtown Portland Mt Hood and the Willamette River.  Walk to shops and restaurants on 23rd (15 min) and hike along the Cumberland trail (1 block).    Enjoy a forest walk followed by a sauna and cook a comforting meal in the kitchen with the forest fresh air amid the warmth of the fireplace.  Filtered water throughout and washer/dryer ensure you are fully refreshed.','The northwest Hillside neighborhood is known for its mansion lined streets and close proximity to shopping and hiking trails.  It is a peaceful neighborhood perched atop the hills with views of 4 mountains, 2 rivers and downtown Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/302c9672-1a8b-4891-950f-259d68a2fed0.jpg',195673,79,'45.52997','-122.7117',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,118.00,30,180,21,5.00,47757886),(2039,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47758484','Cozy 1 Bedroom Guest Suite in Great Location','Hi there,<br />and welcome to our newly remodeled and charmingly furnished apartment in the trendy Northeast neighborhood with many Cafes, Restaurants, Grocery Stores and little Shops nearby!<br />This stylish 1 bedroom basement apartment gets a lot of natural light and features a cozy living room with a 43” smart TV, modern and updated bathroom, a super-cozy bedroom, nice small kitchen and a dedicated working area.  We also offer a convenient off-street parking.','We are perfectly located in the middle of Concordia and tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac. Easy walkable to Alberta Arts, 33rd Ave, 42nd Ave, Killingsworth and Dekum Triangle. Lots of cafes, restaurants, foot trucks and grocery stores near by.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/12adcca2-840a-4077-ada6-78d03bb97a75.jpg',20171998,1,'45.57155','-122.63387',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,73.00,2,1125,38,4.92,47758484),(2040,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47773612','Modern Luxe Loft on the Hawthorne Strip','Welcome to your perfect Portland stay!  This cozy and modern  Loft is located steps from famous food carts and the Hawthorne strip, which is the best place to walk and shop in all of PDX. It is a brand new build with sleek, minimal fixtures,  mixed with vintage-inspired textiles and bold color pops- eclectic, just like our city!<br /><br />The space is perfect for stylish travelers or for the professional that wants a quiet yet luxurious place to work-comfort, style, and convenience! A perfect stay!','Hawthorne is sandwiched between Division Street and Belmont Ave, this east-side trifecta is what gives Portland its reputation and Modern Luxe Loft resides in the heart of it. This district has the best food trucks and shopping in all of Portland!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47773612/original/f58b2b9c-698a-4067-a217-f39a2a8a5c66.jpeg',13282596,16,'45.51331','-122.63247',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,102.00,2,30,159,4.92,47773612),(2041,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47779834','Riposo: A private artistic getaway','Looking for a cozy and restful getaway or simply to get some work done? <br /><br />Located off a quiet street, this luminous independent apartment is perfectly situated between three desirable neighborhoods of Alberta Arts District, Mississippi Avenue, and N. Williams Avenue. With a private entrance, this space is ideal for working remotely, equipped with blazing fast WIFI and an oak writing desk.','A highly walkable location, it is just minutes from some of Portland’s best restaurants, distilleries, bakeries, craft breweries, brunch hotspots, cafes, food carts, and shops. In addition to the kitchen that is supplied with favorite local Stumptown coffee, an Italian moka percolator, and a french press, the best neighborhood coffee (and breakfast sandwich) shop is actually one block away. Walkability to N. Williams neighborhood is 9 minutes, Mississippi is 16 minutes, and just 8 minutes to access the Alberta Arts District. With only a 16 minute drive to PDX Portland International Airport and 2 blocks from multiple Trimet bus stops, the public transit network makes it efficient to get around. There is also street parking available. If in need of an exercise outlet for longer stays, there is a yoga studio and fitness gym is one block away. Plus a bike tours/rental shop are also a block away. Natural Grocers is just one block away plus Alberta Food Coop, New Seasons, etc. are within min','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d466d061-1f97-4ab8-9425-8b9006d98389.jpg',1822800,14,'45.55793','-122.66296',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,98.00,2,730,41,5.00,47779834),(2042,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47800831','Beautiful Mod 2 Bedroom Suite in SE Portland','Enjoy this newly furnished 2 bedroom apartment in a prime Southeast Portland location! <br /><br />Private entrance and private patio for Airbnb guests. Full kitchen, dishwasher, WiFi, washer + dryer, bluetooth speaker and 50\" smart TV.<br /><br />Great walking neighborhood with plenty of coffee shops and amazing restaurants like Ava Gene\'s, Bollywood Theater, Broder Nord, La Moule and many more! Salt and Straw and Lauretta Jean\'s are great for dessert and only a few blocks away!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cf7be5ac-f936-4d1b-b9e7-f2f61210a1cc.jpg',283266891,8,'45.50354','-122.63095',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,80.00,30,1125,15,4.93,47800831),(2043,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47820771','3BR Historic Soul District Remodel','Welcome to my cozy and bright 3-bedroom home! Original hardwood floors, rustic doors, and updated appliances create a warm home that embodies the PDX charm. A 91 WalkScore and 99 BikeScore, steps to the best restaurants bars in town.<br /><br />With 1 full and 1 half bathroom, it is perfect for families or groups. Enjoy meals in the spacious dining room flooded with natural light. Relax on the huge and comfy couch in the living room with a massive TV. The kitchen is fully stocked for all cooking needs.','Welcome to the vibrant and eclectic neighborhoods of Boise and King in Portland, Oregon! Nestled in the heart of the city, you\'ll be just steps away from some of the best local eats, drinks, and shopping. Take a short trip to N Williams, Mississippi, and Alberta to explore a variety of top-rated restaurants, bars, and shops. Blocks away from the Moda Center, perfect for your night at the Blazer game or concert! Our neighborhood boasts a unique mix of historic architecture and modern amenities, creating a charming and lively atmosphere.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47820771/original/8ebf3f7f-f080-4b80-beb0-390399cd8104.jpeg',118237877,26,'45.54293','-122.66313',1,6,1.50,3.00,3.00,162.00,1,1125,244,4.93,47820771),(2044,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47832547','Northeast Bungalow Private Room','Cozy bungalow Portland home located in Northeast Portland. Clean and bright 1 bedroom available to airbnb on main floor with 1 shared bathroom. Room equipped with A/C, coffee & tea, mini fridge, microwave, ironing board and necessities. NO access to kitchen, living room or any part of the home. A cat and a dog do live in this house, but they will stay on top floor while you are staying with us, so they will not be a bother, though be mindful if you have allergies. This is a NO SMOKING property.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47832547/original/9744e610-1176-4fd3-b44b-a005b74145b4.jpeg',23866529,74,'45.53408','-122.56685',2,2,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,38,4.92,47832547),(2045,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47833375','Homestead Guest Suite','Sweet suite in walk-out basement overlooking luscious backyard. You have your own entrance. As you enter you get the feeling of being in a forest cocoon.  There are large windows on the backyard and all you see is nature. There is a dining table for two, a living room,  bed room area (open on an angle to the living room), a kitchenette and laundry room, and an open closet in the hallway.','My home is close to downtown (1 mile from the south end) and yet in the forest. It is off Terwilliger Blvd. which is also a park with a popular walking path next to it.  There are also bike lanes, but they are on the road pavement on each side. My home is at about 500 feet elevation (downtown is about 50 feet).  The views from Terwilliger are excellent, all across to the east, including Mt. Hood, Mt. St. Helens, and the Willamette River and Sellwood Bridge. You can walk to Marquam hiking trail in about 7 minutes, or drive 3 minutes to the Marquam shelter trailhead.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b595112a-309a-48a3-af08-117bc11fd5b1.jpg',79151801,30,'45.49239','-122.68283',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,2,5,57,4.96,47833375),(2046,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47833897','Comfortable room on main floor w/desk and FireTV','\" The Maple\"<br /><br />Comfortable bedroom in the quiet St. John\'s neighborhood in North Portland. Walking distance to brewpubs, restaurants, food carts, coffee shops, movie theaters and the St. John\'s bridge. Room has a desk, internet TV and a comfortable double bed.  House and the room have keyless entry. Monthly discounts are offered. <br /><br />Portland has a occupancy tax if the rental is less than 31 days so if you want to save approximately 200 dollars of tax, book for  31+ days !','At 5-10 min walking distance are the beautiful St. John\'s bridge, McMenamins , Soma Kombucha Speakeasy, Occidental brewing company, Stormbreaker brewpub, St. John\'s twin theaters, many local food carts offering delicious, diverse and affordable food options and numerous other restaurants and coffee shops. Right across the iconic St. John\'s bridge is Forest Park, a 5100 acre park with numerous hiking and biking trails.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47833897/original/53be2023-1091-41c0-8b6f-141d68a12dda.jpeg',8587273,58,'45.5907','-122.74724',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,46.00,30,220,7,5.00,47833897),(2047,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47845531','Cozy Guest Cottage in Woodstock Neighborhood','A bright and cozy cottage located near Reed College, Woodstock\'s restaurants/coffeehouses, Trader Joe\'s and public transit. This residential neighborhood is ideal for a quiet retreat for all visitors. The private guesthouse  is outfitted to make your stay comfortable including a spacious bathroom with a walk in shower and a heated floor. Plus, you may want to enjoy a cup of coffee on your own patio located behind the Airbnb. As an added bonus, breakfast items and home baked treats are provided.','Woodstock is a quiet and low traffic neighborhood with easy parking. Numerous restaurants and coffee houses are just a few blocks South of the Airbnb on Woodstock Ave. Woodstock\'s Farmer\'s Market runs June thru October behind Keybank on Sundays 10:00-2:00.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47845531/original/4e889f7f-e4d0-4157-ab8f-88e5973cbd9e.jpeg',172940497,38,'45.486855','-122.617455',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,78.00,1,25,442,4.98,47845531),(2048,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47860827','Mid Century Hi-Rise with Amazing Views!','Mt. Hood and river views in the heart of the city! Newly remodeled hi-rise condo with mid-century feel and  amazing views from your private balcony. <br /><br />Property has pool/hot tub, full kitchen, very rare FREE parking, and complimentary laundry facilities.  Enjoy your oasis in the middle of the city,   just blocks from food carts, farmers market, Keller Auditorium, miles of pathways along the river and some of the best food and drink the PNW has to offer.','Rare opportunity to be in the heart of the city in a safe, quiet, and secure property with FREE parking, FREE laundry, and pool access as weather permits. You\'re just blocks away from Pioneer Square, Oregonian Historical society, live music, fantastic shopping, happy hour drinks at the Nines Hotel, movie theaters, and the Schnitzer and Keller auditoriums.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2fc89cec-8343-42f4-9c0b-279add4c5181.jpg',5761215,44,'45.51083','-122.67908',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,31,180,16,4.94,47860827),(2049,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47920917','Waterfront living in the heart of PDX!','City living at its finest!  Furnished 1 BR condo for rent.  2 stories w/private deck.  Max/train access close by.  HS internet. off-street parking.  24/7 security.  Smart TV, Sonos, sound machines to help with city noise at night.  <br />- Built in desk for WFH ease<br />- 2-way blinds for custom privacy<br />- Fire-pits and BBQs for use throughout the property<br />- Market steps away with a pizza/pub next door<br />- Misc kids\' toys to entertain littles<br />- Renovated pool and spa (pool closed during winter months)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47920917/original/02d4ec93-65db-4eee-bc24-e0c8065bc58d.png',156222385,43,'45.52648','-122.67072',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,1125,13,4.69,47920917),(2050,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47952571','Cozy Studio Apartment in Prime Location!','Cozy, fully furnished and well stocked studio apartment.  Perfect location in the NW Pearl district steps from downtown with a walking score of 99!  Great kitchen for all your cooking needs.  Wifi included.  Washer and dryer in the apartment.   Walking distance to great restaurants, breweries, shopping and the MAX train.  We have parking passes for guests.','The neighborhood is safe and is walkable to many popular sites, restaurants , shopping and of course breweries.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d986978d-55b8-47f6-995b-a104e1cdf764.jpg',31289780,27,'45.52464','-122.68712',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,70.00,30,1125,90,4.88,47952571),(2051,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47964109','Centrally-located 1-bedroom escape in NE','This centrally-located apartment in Grant Park/Hollywood is bright, clean, and cozy. It gets a 97 Walk Score and offers comfort amenities including a King TempurPedic mattress, full kitchen, dining nook, washer/dryer, designer decor, free street parking, and non-toxic body and cleaning products. Our family lives upstairs but we respect your privacy. The airport is 6 miles away!<br /><br />IMPORTANT: No same-day bookings, no parties, no pets, no smoking/vaping, and must have a history of positive reviews.','The house is located RIGHT on the boundary line between Hollywood and Grant Park neighborhoods which means you have equidistant access to both!  It\'s close-in, centralized, and accessible to everything in the city including the airport, train station, public transportation, Biketown rentals, and more. The vibe is family-friendly, liberal, health-conscious, outdoorsy, and cooperative.<br /><br />You can\'t beat the walkability of our location. Within a few short blocks you\'ll find: <br />- 5 grocery stores<br />- 2 pharmacies<br />- a liquor store<br />- the public library<br />- a community center with day rates for working out (and indoor swimming)<br />- public park (Grant Park)<br />- food cart pods<br />- Hollywood Farmer\'s Market<br />- lots of neighborhood bars and restaurants<br />- an historic movie theater<br />- mountain gear rentals<br />- public transportation hub (Hollywood Transit Center), bus stops, and public bike rentals<br />- several dispensaries, and a cigar shop wit','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1b5393c1-49f3-4441-b227-ae6df32917a2.jpg',7758368,33,'45.53695','-122.62537',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,92.00,2,1125,198,4.97,47964109),(2052,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47995573','Three bedroom one bath home in NE Portland','Nice cozy private house in quiet & friendly NE Portland area. Close to restaurants and public transportation. Close to freeway.  Private fenced back yard.  High speed Internet with Smart TV & Free parking.  <br />30 night minimum stay.   <br />A/C (Mini-Split) & Gas heat<br />Small/Medium Dogs welcome with prior approval. Back yard fenced. (please clean-up after your dog)','the home is in a nice residential neighborhood not far from restaurants and shopping on 42nd avenue, Beaumont and Alameda.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/535e8d8b-4d81-4b49-93f3-c7332744a7d6.jpg',61848539,21,'45.561401','-122.613945',1,4,1.00,3.00,3.00,110.00,30,100,3,5.00,47995573),(2053,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48028611','Overlook/Modern condo w/private entry-yard-patio','Enjoy your visit to Portland while staying at our cozy light & bright guest apartment/condo. Built in 2018, this 1 Bedroom + 1 Full Bath, features a full kitchen, living & dining room with pull-out sofa, fresh high-quality linens, plush towels, washer/dryer in unit, workspace desk, high-speed WIFI,  55\" TV,  air conditioning, private entrance complete with patio/garden. Steps to the active Mississippi Street & Overlook neighborhoods,  full of restaurants, bars, walking trails, bus & train line.','The Overlook neighborhood sits on a ridge overlooking the Willamette River & Portland skyline. We are located 1 block from N. Willamette Blvd which is primarily used for walking, running & biking providing river & city views.  The neighborhood features a mixture of classic Portland bungalow, 4-Square, mid-century modern, atomic ranch, traditional and English Tudor style homes. This neighborhood gives you the feel of the typical Portland vibe where gardening, walking, and outdoor activity set the tone.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48028611/original/ea2bf1d7-5f92-4336-9c3a-b07e72b57ed1.jpeg',36813422,13,'45.56339','-122.69615',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,2,30,70,4.97,48028611),(2054,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48032415','Private Oasis! Cozy & Close to Everything!','Beautiful, one of a kind guest house nestled in one of Portland\'s most desirable locations!  This chic and cozy space features vaulted ceilings, all new appliances, comfortable furniture, and tons of natural light! A quiet street, peaceful atmosphere (and awesome soaking tub) make this the perfect spot for relaxation. Enjoy exploring the surrounding neighborhood and easily walk to shops, restaurants, bars and Laurelhurst Park!  <br />Central location allows quick travel to other areas of the city!','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s food and outdoor scene! Experience some of Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes & breweries. Soak in the beauty of the Pacific Northwest with walking trails and parks.  You are in the middle of it all!  <br /> <br />All this and more within walking distance: <br />Mt Tabor Park <br />Laurelhurst Park <br />Multiple thrift stores <br />Stumptown Coffee Portland Original <br />Salt & Straw Ice Cream <br />So many great places to eat!   (Por Que No, Malka, Xico, Kim Jong Grillin’ food cart, Petite Provence, Yatimura Maru, Harlow, Bollywood Theater, Farmhouse Thai, The Short Round - just to name a few!!) <br />The Sapphire Hotel <br />The Richmond Bar','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c72e83cc-bbe7-4321-81d6-325580e3abd1.jpg',387205363,8,'45.50792','-122.61747',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,48.00,1,1125,148,4.81,48032415),(2055,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48070870','D-Street Hideaway','Mid-century 2-bedroom/1 bathroom  in Victorian farmhouse (full lower level) offers modern convenience in adorable historic Portland neighborhood. Enjoy our open living room that doubles as a home theater, relax in deluxe shower, shop  boutique stores, bars, great restaurants, and desserts (Lauretta Jeans pie shop, Blue Star Donuts and Salt and Straw ice cream) on Division Street.   Richmond is the best of SE Portland, walkable to Hawthorne and bikeable to downtown.','Southeast Portland is the best of the best of Portland neighborhoods!  Portland is always in constant transition so it is a mix of modern and restored historic homes. If you’re up for an adventure rent a Biketown e-bike and experience Portland by bike!  Mt Tabor, Downtown, Hawthorne, Clinton, Division, Buckman, highly acclaimed restaurants like Ava Genes, Olympic Provisions, Salt and Straw and Blue Star donuts.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48070870/original/06db8863-dda2-45e7-beaa-d2aba9fe98ef.jpeg',4195708,8,'45.50312','-122.62249',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,72.00,2,10,254,4.89,48070870),(2056,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48071065','Division/Clinton Central','Come enjoy the coveted Clinton/Division neighborhood. Just a short walk to numerous coffee shops, restaurants, grocery stores and retail.  Downtown is 2.5 miles to the west and easily accessible by car, bike, mass transit or a nice urban hike.  Ample free on street  parking.','Location, location, location ... <br />We love our neighborhood!  Easy access to everything: Restaurants, shops, bakeries, food carts, coffee shops, etc. abound.  Ample free parking is on the street.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48071065/original/357d8620-9f49-428e-9024-94e33ab77a9b.jpeg',21854745,25,'45.50263','-122.6416',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,79.00,1,30,121,4.89,48071065),(2057,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48160008','A refuge in the heart of Alberta Arts District','Location. Location. Location! Perfect for your Flexcation/Staycation.  30 day minimum stay.  This gem is a block away from tons of restaurants, bars and coffee shops in eclectic Alberta- diverse, safe, clean and alive with community.  Bask in  60\'s artsy retro vibe.  Plenty of space for working, homeschooling, yoga, or just a refuge to relax, unwind and refresh.   You will LOVE this house- we designed it with all the goodies we want while traveling. Uber in 12 mins to PDX!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f608862d-dd47-46fe-95d8-c50c40aaffd2.jpg',53371324,29,'45.5606','-122.64439',1,5,1.00,3.00,3.00,190.00,31,150,11,5.00,48160008),(2058,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48167472','Cathedral Park townhome w Patio & Porch!','Enjoy St. Johns with breweries & coffee shops all within walking distance! Only a 10 minute drive from downtown Portland!<br />Enjoy this modern getaway with a front yard of cathedral park and scenic views of the St. Johns bridge from the bedroom window. Walk across the bridge to forest park and do a hike! Everything you need to get the Portland experience is within a few blocks: McMenamins, Sparrow Bakery & more!','-chill on the front porch with some beer from Stormbreaker brewing 3 blocks away!<br />-hang out at Cathedral park with your dog, 1 block away!<br />-take a walk across the St. Johns bridge and do a hike in forest park<br />-Sparrow Bakery (famous Bend bakery) now has their 2nd location 4 blocks away! get the famous ocean roll','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDgxNjc0NzI%3D/original/6ab5c6f5-2af6-457d-96d0-c6c209cb883d.jpeg',19354543,42,'45.58792','-122.75702',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,152.00,1,1125,75,4.88,48167472),(2059,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48227215','Renovated Large 2 Bed / 2 Bath in neighborhood','Over 2000 SQFT lives like a house. It was a owners unit in a four plex.  Large living room with formal dining room. Open kitchen with bar seating. Master bedroom with a tub and separate shower with balcony over looking back yard. Second bedroom has other full bath right outside. Full basement with finished laundry room. Great neighborhood which is quite. Right down the street from Target, HopWorks brewery, and close to many other restaurants and bars. In Division area which is restaurant row.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/02234c2b-83ca-4068-8799-9857cce6436f.jpg',8680367,8,'45.49934','-122.63472',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,84.00,30,1125,0,1.00,48227215),(2060,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48227530','Casa del Sol - Walk to Alberta Arts District','Sunny 2-Story Home in Vibrant Alberta Arts District<br /><br />Wake up in this radiant 2-story home where local artwork and modern furnishings blend to craft a unique, eclectic haven beloved by our guests. Take a leisurely stroll to savor dining, drinks, and boutique shopping in one of Portland\'s premier neighborhoods – the welcoming Alberta Arts district! Kindly review our Policies and Rules section before confirming your reservation.','Enjoy the many great restaurants, coffee shops, breweries, and unique local shops within walking distance. Immerse yourself in Portland food cart culture and enjoy live music at one of three venues. Easy access to other Portland neighborhoods and main attractions<br /><br />Lined with top-notch restaurants, art galleries, bars and shops Alberta St also hosts the Last Thursday street fair in the summer months. Last Thursday closes traffic along the main drag of Alberta Street, inviting local vendors, artists, musicians and some of the city’s most unique performers to showcase their talents and wares','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48227530/original/2ec33ea7-85a2-4c1d-b110-624faa473b76.jpeg',221421926,1,'45.55796','-122.63412',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,139.00,1,1125,122,4.74,48227530),(2061,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48230974','7BR 1906 Carl & Margaret Hoeber World\'s Fair House','Nestled in one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods, this elegant home has been thoughtfully refurbished to blend its original charm with modern amenities seamlessly. Originally built for the World\'s Fair hosted by Portland at the turn of the century, this home exudes all the old-world charm you can imagine. Step out the door, and you\'ll find top-rated bars and shopping just blocks away, ensuring you never have to stray far for a fantastic experience.','Portland is renowned as one of the best food cities in the country, making it a paradise for foodies! Located in the heart of the NW district, also known as the Alphabet District, you\'ll find yourself immersed in quaint shops and endless superb dining options. History buffs should stop in for a Spanish coffee at Huber\'s, Portland\'s oldest bar, and you can\'t miss trying a unique flavor of ice cream from Salt & Straw, just a few blocks away.<br /><br />The neighborhood offers a delightful blend of historic charm and modern conveniences. Wander through the tree-lined streets and discover beautifully preserved Victorian homes, charming boutiques, and artisanal markets. For those who love the arts, the nearby Portland Art Museum and various local galleries offer a feast for the eyes.<br /><br />Coffee enthusiasts will be thrilled with the selection of local coffee shops, each with its unique ambiance and expertly brewed coffee. Powell\'s City of Books, the largest independent bookstore in th','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48230974/original/50d3f0ea-2d32-48a7-ace2-e0d958ba9455.jpeg',88253867,27,'45.52435','-122.69765',1,14,3.00,7.00,7.00,814.00,1,365,64,4.92,48230974),(2062,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48231531','Hawthorne Heights, fam-friendly (no cleaning fee)','Family friendly, newly finished two-bedroom downstairs flat located a perfect walking distance between Mt. Tabor park and Hawthorne Boulevard shops. Enormous kitchen, laundry and bath in unit with private entrance and relaxing outside seating area.<br /><br />Windows in every room let in light during the day. Dimming led lighting throughout for relaxing evenings. Ceiling is double float drywall, great sound-proofing for a good night of sleep.<br /><br />No smoking in the unit and absolutely no pets, please.','Upper Hawthorne Blvd has some of Portlands best restaurants, shopping and nightlife. Mt. Tabor is a family friendly, safe neighborhood. The house is a short walk to coffee shops, bakeries, restaurants, nightlife and art galleries. The Mount Tabor neighborhood is a quick ten minutes to downtown in one direction and ten minutes to the airport in the other direction.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b490c2c2-96b3-425d-a089-5db42fd75abf.jpg',45217575,15,'45.51148','-122.61033',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,2,28,153,5.00,48231531),(2063,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48231783','Cozy, Stylish Bungalow w/ Fireplace & Full Kitchen','Enjoy a comfy retreat in this cozy and bright studio with a private bathroom, air conditioning, fireplace, full kitchen and work desk.  Conveniently located within walking distance to local restaurants, coffee shops, retail stores, and parks.  Centrally located in Portland and just 3 miles from downtown.<br /><br />Take a stroll through Historic Irvington and enjoy some of the most beautiful homes and old growth trees that Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2f65c30d-ae4d-45c4-a491-c459dd8b7804.jpg',389142726,7,'45.5362','-122.64465',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,97.00,1,14,331,5.00,48231783),(2064,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48234094','Cozy So Burlingame 2 bdrm. Close to I-5, OHSU, L&C','Comfy place to stay in Portland without being downtown.  Easy access to freeway.  Great walking, biking neighborhood.  Parks nearby.  Restaurants and shopping all nearby.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/eeadef40-6dea-4037-9a17-a46ea0f1542d.jpg',201594889,28,'45.46627','-122.68778',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,80.00,30,1125,9,5.00,48234094),(2065,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48255066','Historic Details + Modern Charm, Very Central 2BR','Welcome to our charming Airbnb nestled in the historic Sullivan\'s Gulch neighborhood of Portland, Oregon. This beautiful home, built in 1910, seamlessly combines the grace of the past with modern comforts to create a truly unique and memorable stay.<br /><br />To meet the needs of fellow travelers, our Airbnb is equipped with fast WiFi, comfortable queen beds for a peaceful night\'s sleep, smart TV w/ streaming logins (personal login required), and window A/C to keep cool during the hot summer days.','The historic surrounding neighborhoods offer a great mix of quiet residential areas plus an abundance of lively, walkable dining and shopping options. Here are a few favorites for starters: a 1-minute walk gets you to NE Broadway, with favorites Coco Donuts, Twisted Croissants, St. Simon\'s Coffee, Spielman Bagels, Hale Pele, and more. A 10-minute walk gets you to the Zipper food hall, and another 5 minutes lands you in the action around 28th and Burnside with Montelupo, Guero, Paadee, Fifty Licks, Laurelhurst Theater and more. This location also has extremely convenient grocery stores, with a Fred Meyer and New Seasons just steps away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-48255066/original/555298ee-507c-4b34-9d64-b282133ea933.jpeg',215058058,4,'45.53486','-122.63378',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,83.00,2,365,50,4.94,48255066),(2066,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48279749','Casa De Ama: Stylish & Spacious Home Near Mt Tabor','Stylish and updated townhouse just a few blocks from historic Mt. Tabor park! Central location with all the amenities, plus space for the whole family. Fast WiFi, full kitchen with gas range and stacking laundry machines for those longer work trips! Lovely back patio area to enjoy in Spring & Summer! You will want to call this place home for all your Portland visits!','Montavilla is primarily a quiet residential area. Our Airbnb is located on a residential street but walking distance to many shops, restaurants and attractions. The heart of Montavilla neighborhood is just a short 10 minute walk from the house up 76th Ave. This is a fun and built up area with many bars, restaurants, coffee shops and a theater. And if Montavilla doesn\'t suit your fancy Hawthorne, Division and Belmont restaurants and shops are only a couple miles away, the options are endless!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48279749/original/c818a21e-d81c-439e-9ad0-1e49911fffba.jpeg',389635591,15,'45.50993','-122.58602',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,119.00,2,28,104,4.98,48279749),(2067,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48304863','The Burrage House','Bright, 2 bedroom Bungalow. Great spot for small families and friends.  Located 1 block from Arbor Lodge Park as well as other parks.<br /><br />Easy access to the MaxLine and Interstate-5, which makes getting to Downtown or other destination points very easy.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48304863/original/acbddbd6-f0ab-4c63-99b8-8aa394f8be1b.jpeg',205079895,51,'45.56957','-122.69568',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,71.00,2,1124,105,4.93,48304863),(2068,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48319169','Bold Bungalow/House of Sarcasm - Psychedelic PDX','Psychedelic getaway in Southeast Portland!  As seen on Atlas Obscura Experiences, HGTV, and the Portland Weird Homes Tour. <br /><br />You get the entire house!<br /><br />This includes access to art studio, band room with fireplace, fenced back yard, and surprise rooms not pictured here. Private parking in our driveway. Giant main bedroom with king bed, workspace and reading nook. Smaller second bedroom with queen bed.','We are in the Mt. Scott-Arleta neighborhood, a short walk from lovely Mt. Scott Park. We are also close to SE Foster Road and the Lents neighborhood. We\'re just a few blocks from Shango cannabis dispensary, Lion\'s Eye Tavern, Joy Teriyaki, Cha Lua Deli, Portland Mercado, and so much more.<br /><br />We are located in Southeast Portland. The house is about 6 miles from downtown Portland. Depending on routes and traffic, it can take 20-30 minutes by car or 30-45 minutes by transit to get downtown.<br /><br />We are conveniently located near many transportation options, parks, restaurants, and shops, as you\'ll see in the guidebook. We hope you will book this room because you like the house, and that you will understand what to expect as far as proximity to downtown. If you have any questions about our location, please let us know.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/24ecfef2-8abc-41e0-85f7-a0a161531c98.jpg',220757080,65,'45.48163','-122.57937',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,14,14,1,5.00,48319169),(2069,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48324926','Casa Daté - Modern SE basement apartment','Location Location Location! Come stay in our brand new basement apartment in the best neighborhood in SE Portland','The perfect spot- close to all the action but on a quiet street for a relaxing escape after a day of exploring. Located right between SE Hawthorne and SE Division and walking distance (in any direction) to some of Portland’s best restaurants and local shopping! Our neighborhood is full of historic homes with unique architecture and a great place for an evening stroll.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1379e713-e44f-4c29-beb8-50f3c8152f14.jpg',1679756,25,'45.50995','-122.63779',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,6,60,4.95,48324926),(2070,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48351661','PDX Private Walkable Apt w Full Kitchen/Laundry','Beautiful Irvington Historical Neighborhood lower level apartment in NE Portland with bedroom, bathroom, full kitchen, laundry room, living room and dedicated workspace.  Centrally located within walking distance to the Oregon Convention Center, Lloyd business district, Rose Quarter, Willamette River waterfront,  restaurants, food trucks, breweries, grocery and post office. Close to TriMet Bus, Max Light Rail and Streetcar.  On biking greenway.  Everything you need for your comfortable  visit.','Walking distance to all the best of what Portland has to offer including the Oregon Convention Center (one mile), beautiful Willamette Riverfront, the Lloyd business district, the Rose Quarter and Moda Center.   Adjacent to the Irvington Historical Neighborhood and Broadway commercial areas in centrally located North East Portland.  Architecturally beautiful and landscaped neighborhood with walking distance access to public transportation, restaurants, post office, banks, pharmacy and grocery store.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/19b5c15f-8bfe-445b-b27c-23222cc6cbfc.jpg',59218361,7,'45.53685','-122.65793',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,4,14,52,4.92,48351661),(2071,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48379942','Charming St. John\'s Craftsman Bungalow','1920\'s Craftsman charm galore plus modern living comforts! Great location on a quiet side street. Classic built-ins and woodwork throughout. Welcoming clawfoot tub. On demand water heater. Original hardwood floors + heated bathroom tile floor. Central heat, A/C, gas fireplace, gas range, smart TV, fast WiFi, dishwasher, washer/dryer. Covered front porch with landscaped yard.  Quick walk to St Johns town center, Cathedral Park and the famous St. John\'s Bridge.  2 Bus stops within 2 blocks.','Super friendly tight knit neighbors and neighborhood. Small quiet side street. Walkable to St. John\'s Bridge, parks, stores, shops, restaurants, cafés, movies, food carts, and more! Check out the Cathedral Park Jazz Festival in July & St. John\'s Bazaar in May.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDgzNzk5NDI%3D/original/f9b60df3-791f-413e-b16a-7448f1a3745d.jpeg',8777676,58,'45.59342','-122.75729',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,59.00,30,180,9,5.00,48379942),(2072,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48382659','Modern Flat • Heart of NW 23rd, 1 bedroom/sleeps 4','Nob hill private one-bedroom,1000 sq ft apartment.  Located within the Sprague Marshall Bowie house and in one of Portland\'s most vibrant neighborhoods. Dogs are welcome, we ask that you let us know at time of booking so that the appropriate dog fee can be applied.','Vibrant NW 23rd ave in Nw Portland’s Nob Hill Neighborhood','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b7c5a6ba-9516-40fc-b533-670adc128ad6.jpg',9929351,27,'45.52749','-122.69668',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,189.00,2,1125,71,4.89,48382659),(2073,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48395581','Studio Cairo - New Roseway Dog Friendly Rental','Enjoy Portland from this brand new space! Fantastic, dog-friendly studio available in Roseway Neighborhood. Private entrance to lower level studio.','Bicycle riders of all ages, parents with strollers,   runners, walkers, and dogs and their owners equally enjoy Roseway\'s vintage architecture and beautiful greenery. Studio Cairo is walking distance to two fully enclosed designated dog parks, several eateries and coffee shops and two grocery stores.<br />Downtown Portland is a 6.7 mile car, bike, or transit ride.<br />Portland International Airport, 4.5 miles from the studio,  is easily accessible by public transit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48395581/original/e70e31be-d3b7-4054-8002-6091b8a058c3.jpeg',378229923,39,'45.54645','-122.59369',2,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,30,30,0,1.00,48395581),(2074,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48402404','A comfy, modern studio next to Mississippi Avenue.','Our private ADU is a modern, light, & thoughtfully designed studio. With AC, heating, free parking, all the essentials & more for your stay, you\'ll find our guest house perfect for your next trip to Portland. Situated by the bustling, historic streets of Inner NE Portland, a block from N Mississippi & close to N Williams. It is walking distance to countless wonderful bars & notable restaurants. Great public transport links & we\'re right on a charming Portland bike route.','From some of the best bars to incredible restaurants, food trucks to taxidermy stores, legendary ice cream to world-renowned breweries and abundant green spaces, this area of Portland is wonderful all year round. Right by the famous streets of Mississippi, Alberta, Albina and N Williams, there is so much to explore within walking distance. Downtown is less than 10 mins drive away, a 25 mins bike ride or you can get there via bus or tram, with many stops nearby.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2eef9dca-ce55-4db5-85be-a283ef2239f4.jpg',31051978,24,'45.557','-122.67318',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,72.00,2,1125,165,4.94,48402404),(2075,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48404757','Bright and Cozy NEPDX Suite','Bright, cozy and new garden suite in Northeast Portland! This pied-à-terre has a private entrance via the garage for access to your own living room, bedroom and bathroom. An exercise bike, mini-fridge, electric kettle and coffee machine are available for use while you relax with views of the garden out your window. The space is located within easy walking distance of New Seasons grocery and multiple restaurants and bars in the Alberta Arts district. A perfect spot for your Portland visit.','The ABB is in NEPDX, just beside the Alberta Arts District. These are some of my favorite spots within walking distance, but availability varies due to COVID:<br /><br />New Seasons - groceries<br /><br />Proud Mary - coffee, brunch<br />Tin Shed - brunch<br />Pine State - brunch<br /><br />Great Notion - beer and burgers<br />Les Caves - wine bar<br />Kennedy School - beer, bar games<br /><br />Chaba - Thai<br />Zilla Sake - sushi<br />Ordaneta - tapas<br />Yang’s Noodle - Chinese','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/162ad85e-6aa2-4755-90a8-e019d508455e.jpg',36568283,1,'45.5605','-122.62751',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,9,330,4.97,48404757),(2076,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48406101','Designers sanctuary - newly remodeled Pdx Bungalow','Holman house is a newly remodeled bungalow in NE Portland.  This house is filled with custom designed details from the very unique primary suite to the library stairs.  The location is walking distance to  shops, restaurants, and parks with access to a private back yard. The new bathroom on the second floor was nominated for Dwells 2021 Bathroom of the year.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48406101/original/30dfdc51-5f78-4fdb-a1a8-81075af40ba5.jpeg',35707376,1,'45.569','-122.6308',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,3,20,9,5.00,48406101),(2077,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48437025','Backyard Studio Hideaway - ECO FRIENDLY!','Light and bright outer SE Portland backyard studio has a tranquil and private atmosphere for enjoying a cup of coffee in the yard while birds chirp.  Fully equipped kitchen.  Close to food options galore at Cartlandia.  Steps from biking on the Springwater Corridor and close to bus lines.  Check out this little oasis in the city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/543aae11-3c0e-4f2b-998a-6e5ac075c467.jpg',247400,69,'45.4648','-122.58495',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,2,60,126,4.96,48437025),(2078,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48452391','Mystic Walk to Alberta Arts, Williams, Mississippi','Have fun in the food, drink, and outdoor activity paradise that is Portland! Centrally located in NE Portland, the house is a quick 5-minute walk to N. Williams Street and 15-minute walk to Alberta Arts and Mississippi districts, where you will find many good restaurants, food carts, dessert places, breweries, bars, and coffee shops.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48452391/original/f840e2e3-0551-417b-95b7-df397084de7b.jpeg',33081979,14,'45.55512','-122.65878',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,31.00,1,1125,278,4.81,48452391),(2079,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48452803','Cherry Wi-Fi Walk to 100+ food coffee bars transit','Have fun in the food, drink, and nature paradise that is Portland! Centrally located in NE Portland, the house is a quick 5-minute walk to Williams Street and 15-minute walk to Alberta Arts and Mississippi districts, where you will find many good restaurants, food carts, breweries, bars, and coffee shops. Get to downtown Portland in 15 minutes via Uber or public transit.<br /><br />I\'ve hosted many traveling nurses, students and remote workers. It\'s a perfect for those who wantto explore Portland.','The surrounding neighborhoods are very walkable residential areas, until you hit the commercial strips that are Alberta, Mississippi or Williams - and the fun begins. A car is not needed to enjoy the city but would be great for all the marvelous natural attractions: Mt Hood, Columbia River Gorge, the Oregon coast, etc.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48452803/original/2660ee2c-c6d1-412e-a9b4-5fa18ef62981.jpeg',33081979,14,'45.55483','-122.66107',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,35.00,30,730,105,4.81,48452803),(2080,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48490880','Cheerful home in a quiet neighborhood','This comfortable, spacious, fully updated house has everything you need to be comfortable during your stay in Portland. Located in the Foster-Powell neighborhood with a great SE Portland location. Half a block away from a neighborhood park with a playground and an off-leash dog area.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d8e74068-e63b-48fb-b02c-da431eb5f131.jpg',254477581,36,'45.49445','-122.59422',1,4,1.00,2.00,6.00,126.00,2,60,122,4.98,48490880),(2081,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48547413','Newly Remodeled Modern 1 BR in Alberta Arts','Newly remodeled one-bedroom, basement suite in popular Alberta Arts district. Walk to locally-owned shops, galleries, and restaurants. Close to public transit. Located on a quiet street, this bright, airy suite includes a sitting room, dining area, microwave, mini-fridge, coffee maker, queen bed and outdoor seating area. Private/separate entrance from the host\'s home.<br /><br />We prioritize our guests\' safety by following Airbnb\'s Enhanced Cleaning Guidelines. Please contact us with any questions.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b6414361-f154-4458-9492-37015139c35d.jpg',354325027,19,'45.55469','-122.63975',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,68.00,2,30,237,4.94,48547413),(2082,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48570957','The Fantastic Fargo Flat ~ Irving Park Oasis','Our spacious 1250 sq ft home is steps away from Irving Park in NE Portland. It\'s a short distance from the vibrant Alberta Arts District, Historic Mississippi Ave, and the Pearl District of Downtown Portland. Plus, PDX airport is just a 15-minute drive away! Fully equipped with stainless steel appliances, an in-unit washer/dryer, and sleeping arrangements for up to 5 guests, this home offers both comfort and convenience.','The Fargo Flats home is located in the Historic Irvington Neighborhood of Northeast Portland, with central access to everywhere in the city.  This neighborhood is very walkable and close to parks, restaurants, grocery stores and shopping. <br /><br />~The Neighborhood~<br />•Irving Park (Less than 1 block away) Basketball/tennis/volleyball courts <br />Soccer/baseball/softball fields <br />Picnic area, paved paths, playground <br />Horseshoe pit, off-leash dog area <br />•Centrally-located between the iconic Pearl District, Mississippi Ave District and Alberta Arts District with a walk score of 84 <br />•Walking distance from several restaurants, local businesses and grocery stores <br />•A short commute to Downtown Portland or the Moda Center <br />•We provide our guests with tons of local recommendations in the home','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/691071c4-64e9-407b-99c4-9f60127a8b88.jpg',68847451,26,'45.54735','-122.65907',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,94.00,1,1125,166,4.73,48570957),(2083,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48661212','The Garfield Getaway House ~ Luxury New Build','Welcome to The Garfield Getaway!<br /><br />Experience luxury in our brand new, modern 4-bedroom, 3-bath unit with a spacious backyard. This 2000 sq ft home features stainless steel appliances, a large in-unit washer/dryer, and sleeps up to 10 guests. Located steps from parks, food carts, and bars in NE Portland, we are close to the Alberta Arts District, Historic Mississippi Ave, and the Pearl District. Plus, PDX airport is just a 15-minute drive away. Enjoy the best of Portland at The Garfield Getaway!','Welcome to The Garfield Guesthouse, nestled in the heart of the Historic Irvington Neighborhood of Northeast Portland. This centrally-located area provides easy access to all that the city has to offer. The neighborhood is highly walkable, with parks, restaurants, grocery stores, and shopping all within close proximity. <br /><br />Enjoy a variety of recreational activities at Irving Park, which features basketball, tennis, and volleyball courts, soccer, baseball, and softball fields, a picnic area, paved paths, a playground, a horseshoe pit, and an off-leash dog area for your furry friends. <br /><br />Perfectly situated between the iconic Pearl District, Mississippi Avenue District, and Alberta Arts District, this neighborhood boasts a high walk score of 93, with several restaurants, local businesses, and grocery stores within walking distance. A short commute will take you to Downtown Portland or the Moda Center, making it easy to explore the city\'s major attractions. <br /><br />We','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48661212/original/9148660f-1149-4a61-8da2-f6e137c4ada5.jpeg',286367128,14,'45.55635','-122.66274',1,12,3.00,4.00,6.00,353.00,2,1125,239,4.91,48661212),(2084,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48664989','Private Studio in Overlook Park','Modern industrial Studio in North Portland centrally-located to many attractions and steps away from the Max, coffee, bikes, Bluffs, and trendy Mississippi district. Perfect for singles and couples. Opportunity for longer stays for travel nurses or other travel professionals as well.','Waking distance to trendy Mississippi and North Williams district','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48664989/original/8af4350c-3c5a-4aa8-8c2b-1dec1caac227.jpeg',1631848,13,'45.55471','-122.68291',2,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,3,90,47,4.98,48664989),(2085,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48676845','Super Large Centrally located house','Newley remodeled house inside/out, walking and biking distance to everything, downtown Portland 0.3 miles, Moda Center 1.8 miles, convention center 1.8 miles, OMSI 0.6 miles, Museums, Opera, all mode of transportation is just nearby, including Lloyd Center, etc.. Very quiet at night, strategic location for a large group or families.','The neighborhood is located on the edges of downtown Portland, you can walk to anywhere in downtown Portland in five minutes, very convenient safe neighborhood free public parking on the street, very close to OHSU.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5bfa3dad-6996-492a-9be3-a59d662392b5.jpg',258045340,22,'45.50383','-122.676125',1,16,3.00,8.00,9.00,695.00,1,1125,124,4.85,48676845),(2086,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48677305','Alberta Arts w/ Hot Tub & Yoga Studio!','Perfectly located between parks, food carts, eclectic local shops and bars in NE Portland, you can enjoy the best of what the city has to offer. Wake up in this spacious 4 bedroom house with an invigorating yoga session in the studio or take a soak in the hot tub amongst the trees. <br /><br />NEWLY REMODELED! Come check out the new bathroom remodel with lovely tile shower, new sink cabinet, flooring and more. Fresh paint in the lower bedrooms and updates to delight!','Offering an eclectic taste of city life with small town charm. We are a short distance from the Alberta Arts District, Historic Mississippi Ave, and the Pearl District of Downtown Portland. In addition, PDX airport is just a 15-minute drive away!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48677305/original/8d90f098-232f-499e-af37-5db5c1c5b6d1.jpeg',221421926,1,'45.56280891493196','-122.63595272372874',1,6,2.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,31,1125,11,4.64,48677305),(2087,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48680618','Classic Portland 1920s 2 bedroom bungalow','Soak up the modern and vintage charm of this fully renovated two bedroom classic Portland bungalow home. Step inside onto original oak floors in a thoughtfully decorated home with local Portland photography and a classic but eclectic style. Enjoy a fully stocked kitchen and the coffee station with organic coffee and biodegradable pods in true Portland style!','Neighborhood with plenty of street parking. Tucked close to major freeways and public transportation. Only 10 minutes to the PDX airport <br />and supermarket within a 5 minute drive. Only 10 minutes to some of the best food and coffee streets.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fb4ce420-803a-4727-b510-c5b58fdb8b2e.jpg',9668663,74,'45.54821','-122.57703',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,94.00,31,1125,8,4.75,48680618),(2088,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48717925','Spacious Woodstock Dream Home w/King Bed','Close to all the amenities on SE Woodstock! This trendy, updated home is full of cozy touches. Central AC. 3 bedrooms with comfy beds, vintage furniture & large closets. Owners suite is spacious with a king size bed. Sunny, quiet office. 2 ½ baths with plush towels and granite countertops. Fully stocked kitchen with new appliances and bar seating opens to a large living room full of natural light. Private backyard. 2-car driveway for off-street parking. Come & stay a while. 30 day minimum.','In the hip and bustling Woodstock neighborhood.  Walkable to coffee shops, grocery, bakery, bar, burritos and more!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48717925/original/372c4d6a-5a06-4779-a7b8-70681e20dfc9.jpeg',83848664,38,'45.47902','-122.6056',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,134.00,30,330,16,4.81,48717925),(2089,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48723476','Modern, Newly Updated Suite - walk to Mississippi!','Recharge after an adventurous day in Portland in this modern and newly renovated guest suite in a vibrant neighborhood. Under a 10 minute walk to the popular Mississippi district to some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, breweries and coffee shops.  <br /><br />Very close to Williams and Alberta Arts district, and <10 minute drive to beautiful hiking trails in Forest Park. <br /><br /><br />Comfortable new queen bed and plenty of space for lounging, working, and/or yoga. TV with fire stick and easy self-check in!','Located in the Mississippi district, one of Portland\'s vibrant neighborhoods. Plenty of restaurants, bars, breweries and coffee shops within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48723476/original/6d0971bb-4dc1-4aff-b1d7-8cc143c24019.jpeg',5733558,24,'45.558956','-122.674957',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,73.00,2,14,165,4.96,48723476),(2090,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48739618','M2M 20% Off 4-Bedroom Retreat in Portland','The house requires a minimum 31-day stay and utilities are not included.<br />Welcome to our property managed by Month2Month! We\'re dedicated to transparent pricing based on the Fair Rental Value (FRV). Our goal is to provide a fair and rewarding experience for our guests. Your satisfaction is our priority.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48739618/original/3d734d86-ad08-4532-a2ff-03e62d8625ff.jpeg',126824075,81,'45.53779','-122.76943',1,8,3.50,4.00,4.00,297.00,30,1125,1,5.00,48739618),(2091,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48754626','Freshly Renovated 2BD in Classic Portland Bungalow','Welcome to Hawthorne’s Sunnyside Neighborhood!<br /><br />The garden-level guest suite of this classic 1908 Portland bungalow welcomes you to one of the most historic and hip neighborhoods of town! You’ll have the entire downstairs to yourself - two bedrooms, one bathroom, a full kitchen and a cozy light-filled living room. Up to six guests can be accommodated with the queen-size futon.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9a424bba-bd72-4cb1-9ab8-2148fcecdad1.jpg',6591194,16,'45.51327','-122.63242',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,103.00,2,30,184,4.98,48754626),(2092,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48770826','Designer owned home on Vibrant Williams Avenue','After styling and art directing photo shoots for Rejuvenation Lighting and House Parts, being able to dial our home was like playing. Joyfully styled bedrooms include queen, queen-sized sleeper in living room. The kitchen is fully appointed with All-Clad, gas range, Cuisinart, blender and microwave. Williams and Mississippi are full of restaurants, bars,coffee houses and brand new food carts just a few doors away. New to Airbnb but you can read many reviews on another channel rhyming with turbo.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48770826/original/155cf27f-d1ce-40f4-907f-1a3e5043ca86.jpeg',393441074,9,'45.55334','-122.6669',1,6,1.50,3.00,4.00,145.00,2,1125,180,4.92,48770826),(2093,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48808806','Charming 1909 St Johns Bungalow','Explore the Charming St. Johns Bungalow! This 1909 gem has been thoughtfully refurbished, radiating vintage allure. Nestled near a cherished Portland district, it\'s a haven for cyclists, hikers, and kayakers. Savor local eateries and quirky stores just steps away. Delight in the Saturday Farmer\'s Market, food carts, & live music venues within a 5-10 min stroll. Easily reach more Portland treasures. <br /><br />**Please note that this property is shared with a tenant residing onsite in downstairs unit....','St Johns is the best!  The neighborhood is located on a peninsula on the north side of Portland and is surrounded by parks and green space.  We’re close to downtown and other districts, and St Johns has its own bustling commercial area with great restaurants, antique stores, boutiques, cafes and local shops.  Don\'t miss the Saturday Farmer\'s Market!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a71c2921-11db-4bb9-a87b-369c02589114.jpg',221421926,58,'45.59301','-122.74617',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,102.00,1,1125,142,4.82,48808806),(2094,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48898790','Luxe Dutch Colonial in the Heart of Laurelhurst','This serene Dutch Colonial (built in 1928) takes its place among the many photogenic charmers the Laurelhurst neighborhood provides.  Inside the home you will find many period details, rich hardwoods combined with thoughtfully curated furniture exudes pure relation.  Natural light pours through the windows during the day.  Minutes away from the famous Burnside \"restaurant row\" and with easy access to and from the 84 freeway this home is the perfect place to experience Portland.','The home is in Laurelhurst, one of Portland\'s oldest neighborhoods. It\'s a walkable area with great options for dining out, relaxing in a cafe, and going for strolls through the park. Public transport is nearby making it easy to explore the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/04baf9f1-7845-4f7c-ab54-4dd66d09e01d.jpg',35082631,23,'45.52992','-122.62509',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,169.00,3,29,186,4.88,48898790),(2095,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48915028','95 WalkScore on Division Quaint One BR Apt','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 98/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. Our private apartment sits in a historic building at the heart of the eclectic SE Division District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.','Sometimes compared to San Francisco’s Haight-Ashbury neighborhood, Portland’s SE Division District is known for its vintage shops, restored theaters, street performers, and overall creative characters, making it one of the city’s top destinations for both locals and visitors. Coincidentally, a standout food scene has developed in the neighborhood, making a day spent on the Southeast street a breeze.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48915028/original/68909a71-fa1c-4ee3-8bc7-1c84fcc62993.jpeg',115052133,25,'45.50507','-122.65796',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,67.00,1,1125,158,4.72,48915028),(2096,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48921368','Patio w/ fire pit home ✶ 10min to DT → Has it all!','Fantastic, fully furnished home built in 2017 in the popular West Portland Park area. This home offers nearby shopping, restaurants, coffee, schools, and parks in walking distance. 10 minutes from downtown Portland, Lake Oswego, Tigard and minutes from the freeway/transit. This rare rental has it all - two living room areas, brand new A/C unit, heating, open kitchen with tons of cooking supplies, private back patio area that has turf, a fire pit and is completely fenced and much more!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/da8fa931-6fae-4218-a590-e18ac5c055be.jpg',394600132,53,'45.44424','-122.72502',1,5,2.50,2.00,4.00,247.00,2,1125,54,4.96,48921368),(2097,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48936189','Desirable Studio in the Streetcar Lofts','Spend your extended stay in Portland\'s young, vibrant neighborhood that is the Pearl District. Walkable and diverse, it is not only a shopping destination but also home to award winning chefs and restaurants, world-class art galleries and spectacular parks and outdoor spaces. This contemporary industrial style condo is located in the heart of the Pearl. Just steps from the Portland Streetcar, providing access to the entire city. **Review all House Rules prior to booking.','A few local favorites include:<br />*Carlita\'s<br />*Via Delizia<br />*Yama Sushi & Sake Bar<br />*Daily Cafe<br />*Piazza Italia<br />*Cool Moon Ice Cream<br />*Low Brow Lounge<br />*Break Bread<br />*Montesacro Pinseria PDX<br />*Andina<br /><br />And these are just a few places to eat. Not to mention nearby Jamison Square, Tanner Springs and world famous Powell\'s City of Books.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a1b0d6e0-d143-4e3a-b6fa-70241a721e90.jpg',158074447,2,'45.53156','-122.68289',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,106.00,60,1125,12,5.00,48936189),(2098,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48979035','All NEW, Modern Guesthouse in North Portland!','Bright, beautiful and centrally located North Portland guesthouse – perfect location for exploring all neighborhoods in Portland!','North Portland is a centrally located, young and up and coming part of Portland! We are located in the Kenton Neighborhood which has it\'s own cute little restaurant/shop strip itself. <br /><br />With only a 10-15 min drive you can easily access: <br />-	Downtown <br />-	Providence Park (go Timbers!) <br />-	Moda Center (go Blazers!) <br />-	Popular Portland shopping and restaurants on NW 23rd , Hawthorne, Belmont, and Division <br /><br />We’re also 5 – 7 mins from the University of Portland and the Saint John’s neighborhood.<br /><br />We are surrounded by two beautiful parks – Columbia Park & Annex that is in walking distance and Kenton City Park which is just a mile away as well as tons of delicious restaurants and shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48979035/original/bc20b37d-70f6-4c2a-bd4b-7260fcd3f5f0.jpeg',7092501,55,'45.57783','-122.69972',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,79.00,30,1125,147,4.95,48979035),(2099,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48982663','✦ Gorgeous Home w. Jetted Tub & Steam Shower ✦','✦ Beautiful Tudor Home located in the Historic Irvington neighborhood.<br />✦ Located a mere 6-10 minutes from downtown.<br />✦ Lovely woodwork and a beautiful neighborhood<br />✦Walk, bike or drive to the many cafes, shops and restaurants at nearby destination neighborhoods, including Alberta Arts District (1.5 miles), Broadway, (.5 miles) Williams District (.9 miles), Mississippi Ave. (1.5 miles)','Go for endless walks in our gorgeous, calm, and lovely neighborhood. <br /><br />The houses and the yards are just stunning, We love to walk west, north and south.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1e57ed51-e278-4d38-b7c0-f4e18cbbcdff.jpg',1218855,7,'45.54351','-122.65543',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,5,5.00,48982663),(2100,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48985082','Walkable to Alberta Arts District, Single Level','On this wonderful corner lot sits Alberta Villa which is in one of the most sought after locations in Portland. Sitting just a handful of blocks from Northeast Alberta Street you are in a perfect position to enjoy everything the Alberta Arts District has to offer.  You are close enough for a short walk or a quick Uber while being far enough to not hear the hustle and bustle when you don\'t want.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-48985082/original/0dd6c45d-51a8-401a-b27d-4791a097b0f6.jpeg',62261998,45,'45.56871','-122.64882',1,8,2.00,4.00,6.00,159.00,2,29,37,4.81,48985082),(2101,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49013815','Sun-Filled Buckman Studio!','If you love great food, craft beer, and pour-over coffee, this is the perfect spot. Our apartment is in the famous Buckman District, close to Portland\'s top-rated restaurants, bars, and vintage shops, and offers excellent people-watching. Ideal for solo travelers, couples, and business travelers, my place is a convenient home base within walking distance of neighborhood hot spots. Experience the authentic hipster lifestyle of Stumptown and see Portland like a local.','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District puts you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!). Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, savor wings just around the corner at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or enjoy a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />Portland isn\'t just for foodies; the vibrant indie spirit of Hawthorne shines through with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews.<br /><br />If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park atop a dormant volcano vent. Here, you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible pano','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49013815/original/b59bc2f2-c0ed-4f8f-97db-364ee02db0f3.jpeg',187761372,32,'45.5208','-122.65392',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,67.00,1,365,356,4.80,49013815),(2102,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49016667','Recently Built 1BR Unit in trendy Vernon/Alberta','This is the perfect spot between urban access and suburban calm. A private attached dwelling located on a quiet street in the hip Vernon neighborhood, just around the corner from a half-dozen local restaurants along with bars, a bakery, and café. Recently built and fully furnished with modern appliances. It\'s just a 15 minute drive to the great Portland Airport for easy flights in and out of town.','We\'re on a quiet residential street but also literally around the corner from the Vernon commercial area. It has the following eateries which are all good:<br />- Taco Machine<br />- Mis Tacones (Vegan Mexican)<br />- Hot Yai (Thai)<br />- No Saint (Neapolitan Pizza)<br />- Podnah\'s BBQ<br />- Prospect Bar<br /><br />Walkable groceries within a few blocks:<br />- Alberta Co-Op Groceries<br />- 7-11<br />- Also note there are some reusable bags under the kitchen sink.<br /><br />In a 5-15 minute walk you can get to the whole Alberta Art District and several food cart pods with a bunch more tasty food options. Some favorites on Alberta<br />- Salt & Straw (Ice Cream)<br />- Bollywood Theater (Indian) <br />- Wild Child (Detroit Pizza)<br />- Mole Mole (Mexican)<br />- Paladin Pie (Neapolitan/NY Pizza)<br />But there\'s tons more all worth checking out!<br /><br />From May-Nov, there\'s a Farmer\'s Market on Sundays within walking distance (web search for \"king farmers market portland\" to fi','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49016667/original/b5c09ed5-39ad-4404-83f8-bb91abf53e51.jpeg',3139720,29,'45.56218','-122.64788',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,82.00,3,30,84,4.89,49016667),(2103,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49017087','Minka\'s Manor | Walkscore of 92 + Bikescore 100','This two-level private loft is hidden in a mezzanine garden courtyard located in the heart of north Mississippi Avenue. The grounds feature a 3-story bamboo garden and walking access to countless top restaurants, boutiques, boutique stores, and public transport to greater PDX attractions.','The only similarity the Mississippi neighborhood shares with other districts is that it is uniquely Portland. In fact, trying to describe it would be like trying to verbalize a color, but let’s say that it has a little bit of that ‘special something’ that comes to mind when thinking of PDX… a Mardi Gras parade of high school bands accompanied by unicyclists with flame throwers (yep), the annual Mississippi Street Fair (~45,000 people), a thoroughfare for the world naked bike ride, notorious music venues, outdoor movies with fire pits, over 12 great bars, food cart pods and great dining. This street celebrates 5 nights out of the week.<br /><br />More information<br />I encourage you to explore EaterPDX for a better idea of the local attractions, but know that there are many other things on this street. In my mind, here are the best features the street has to offer, and they’re all within a block or two of this residence:<br /><br />Coffee/Cannabis<br />* Nectar - for those that indulge','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c3b35e85-3c2c-4502-9c33-cd22cd866bd2.jpg',14970082,24,'45.55525','-122.67494',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,183,211,4.95,49017087),(2104,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49029576','The Kennedy School Consulate','Welcome to The Kennedy School Consulate located in Portland’s Historic Alberta Arts District. Our home away from home, is your perfect home away from home. Its clean and beautiful, decorated with modern and cozy furnishings, and is ideal for weekend getaways, family get-togethers, business travel, or extended stays over 30-days. Within walking distance to a variety of restaurants, food carts, bars, stores, parks, and of course, the Alberta Street strip.  You’ll love your time at The Consulate!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDkwMjk1NzY%3D/original/1adcec7e-3dab-438a-b81f-db168fdf0dd7.jpeg',5970172,1,'45.56322','-122.63211',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,225.00,2,60,80,4.89,49029576),(2105,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49055912','The Haseman House','Come stay in our Architectural micro home in NE Portland. Close to Mississippi and everything that NE Williams has to offer. Thoughtfully deigned with many amenities. A great WFH vacation retreat. This little house is located in the back of a main house. The backyard is shared  with the main front house. There is only street parking but it is free and typically available. We are close to public transportation and rental bikes as well as an organic grocery store... very walkable.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/63a21006-5525-4932-88bf-5d5e51d6eb9b.jpg',4322400,26,'45.54655','-122.66421',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,129.00,1,10,135,4.81,49055912),(2106,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49063029','Micro studio in Alberta arts district','Welcome to our second floor walk up NE PDX bedroom. Visit our awesome neighborhood, between Killinsgsworth and Alberta Streets. Easy access to N. Portland, Airport, Downtown, and all the fun & food the city has to offer. Enjoy a comfy, clean stay in a safe renovated space. There is a coffee shop downstairs that is open most days where you can grab a cup of coffee and a pastry to start your morning.  Please be aware of other residents and be respectful of the noise levels and the shared spaces.','One of the great Portland neighborhoods, Alberta Arts has many galleries, cafes, boutiques, restaurants, bars, grocery stores, bookstores and gift shops. Everything is in walking distance and downtown is just miles away via transit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49063029/original/fae8acee-f06f-46b9-a099-6f27d50ecebe.jpeg',61310355,1,'45.56143','-122.63559',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,1,66,32,4.72,49063029),(2107,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49076674','Charming Woodstock Tiny Home','This tiny home provides a great place to enjoy some R&R in Portland. Relax in this cozy Woodstock neighborhood just 3 minutes from Reed College and 15 minutes from downtown Portland. Enjoy an easy 5-10 minute neighborhood walk to many shops and eateries. Tiny is the perfect place for your stay in Portland as it boasts a beautiful shared backyard and relaxing haven.','Quiet neighborhood filled with many young families','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-49076674/original/6b54db0e-2a5e-49be-97c7-3f99185329d7.jpeg',237270930,69,'45.4746','-122.61396',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,6,100,80,4.90,49076674),(2108,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49076782','Stunning primary suite in LGBTQ+ sanctuary','Beautiful newly renovated primary suite in our serene LGBTQ+ sanctuary. King bed with brand new super comfy mattress. Mini fridge. Dedicated work space. Private bathroom with soaking tub and rainfall shower. Massive walk-in closet with built-ins. You have the whole top floor to yourselves so there\'s plenty of privacy. Total of 646 square feet. High ceilings, huge windows, and a wonderful view of the west hills.','**More pictures of the common areas coming soon**<br /><br />Beautifully renovated craftsman home in the heart of the Clinton Corridor in Southeast Richmond. A truly dreamy neighborhood, ideal for an authentic locals experience/introduction to the city! Steps away from Portland\'s best bars, restaurants, theatres, coffee shops etc. Right off Clinton Street Bike Boulevard. A quick walk or bike ride will bring you to the Eastbank Esplanade- a pedestrian & bike path along the shore of the Willamette River. Beautiful views of the city, and a pedestrian bridge that will bring you into Downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDkwNzY3ODI%3D/original/dfa036db-8a30-41b6-9efd-b1bd58e3b7b6.jpeg',2506795,25,'45.50354','-122.63941',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,30,1125,4,4.75,49076782),(2109,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49078310','Cheerful 2 Bed (+ Bonus Rm) 2 1/2 Bath Modern Home','Cheerful 2 Bedroom (+ Bonus Room), 3 Beds, 2 1/2 Bathroom. Centrally Located in PDX, Close to all Major Highways and Just Minutes to Downtown Portland, and the Airport. Short Walk to the University of Portland, Starbucks, and New Seasons.<br /><br />Home Includes a Washer & Dryer and Brand New Appliances in the Kitchen.<br /><br />There is a Bonus Lower Area  that Looks Directly into the Kitchen and Living Room. <br /><br />70 inch HDTV<br />Traeger Grill<br />(1) King Bed - Master Bd<br />(1) Queen Bed - Guest  bd<br />(1) Full Bed - Bonus Rm','Short walk (less than a mile) from the University of Portland,  Flying Pie Pizza, Starbucks, New Seasons and Just 10 Minutes from Downtown Portland.  (1) Hour from the beach and 50 Minute Drive from Mt. Hood.<br /><br />10 Minutes from Vancouver, WA and the NEW Vancouver waterfront boardwalk. <br /><br />Less than 2 miles from North Portland Historic Cathedral Park<br /><br />15 Minutes from the Portland airport','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49078310/original/217d37ac-d3a3-4de8-bca1-85fb3b913abc.jpeg',10593145,60,'45.59456','-122.7196',1,5,2.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,120,13,4.77,49078310),(2110,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49112878','NW Studio w/ A View - Close to Everything!','This remodeled vintage studio is just a short walk from all the best eateries, pubs, and shops of Northwest and downtown Portland! Close proximity to Forest Park, the Pearl District, Timbers\' Stadium, and the Waterfront, this quaint condo is has everything you need to enjoy Portland like a local. In-unit washer/dryer, full kitchen and a gorgeous third floor view! Cyclists will love for cyclists and The Max and bus routes are walking distance.','Stay in the heart of the city - our studio is just short walk from Portland\'s best restaurants and top landmarks including Powell\'s Bookstore, Forest Park, Voodoo Donuts, the Pearl District, Chinese Gardens, Timbers\' Stadium, and the Waterfront Park. Our quaint condo has everything you need to enjoy Portland like a local. Cyclists: Flanders Crossing is just around the corner, connecting you to bike paths that branch out all over the city. Private bike storage available.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c75e1fe8-11e6-4e26-a521-d8aef67b582c.jpg',221421926,3,'45.5225','-122.68733',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,31,365,5,4.80,49112878),(2111,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49112883','The Hawthorne Hideaway','Tiny house living at it\'s best! This is the perfect spot to feel like a local & includes driveway parking, a huge bonus in our neighborhood. Just a block off Hawthorne in the heart of SE Portland, our place is equipped with everything you need in your home away from home: a full kitchen, comfy queen bed, newly finished bathroom with an enormous shower, private covered patio and lots of space to unwind. Walk to tons of shops and restaurants and an organic grocery store - all just steps away!','We are located in the Sunnyside neighborhood of Portland just north of the very popular Hawthorne Blvd. Perfect for exploration of the city, we\'re 10 minutes from most everything in Portland with bars, restaurants, vintage shops, and even a New Season\'s market and Powell\'s right around the corner.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/93bf2e10-9179-4733-87f3-72ffa8a3ef90.jpg',221421926,16,'45.51209','-122.62136',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,102.00,1,180,137,4.95,49112883),(2112,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49117607','Oswego Empty Nest','The Oswego Empty Nest is a newly remodeled, cozy, one bedroom unit located in Lake Oswego with a private entrance and 500 sq ft of living space.  Prepare your own meals in the beautiful full kitchen.  Relax, work or entertain yourself in the living space with a large TV with Roku or rest in the quiet comfortable bedroom with an en suite bathroom.  <br /><br />Easy access to restaurants, New Seasons, Columbia Outlet, and hiking trails all within walking distance. Close to downtown and quick airport access.','It is located about 10 minutes from downtown Portland; within two blocks walking distance to New Seasons grocery store, Starbucks, nearby restaurants and a Columbia Outlet store. Tryon Creek State Natural Area is located less than one mile away with 8 miles of hiking trails.  Downtown Lake Oswego and Bridgeport Village shops and restaurants are only about 4 miles away.  Both I-5 and OR 217 are easily accessible.  There is a metro bus stop within less than one block.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49117607/original/bca9a5d4-0fa9-4fca-acbc-0b67160c57c1.jpeg',396155463,73,'45.43612','-122.69952',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,2,21,115,5.00,49117607),(2113,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49127182','Carriage House~Urban Haven, Unique Eclectic Charm','A true home away from home; PERFECT for traveling nurses, interns, business travelers (15-25% discounts on extended stays!!). Cozy, quiet, functional, roomy AND private! Most guests have described the Carriage House as a \"TRUE reflection of Portland!\"<br />Located in the HEART of the city! A lightrail transit station 1/2 block away makes travel so easy! Downtown-8 min, MODA Center-5 min, Historic Mississippi District-10 min walk. <br />A friendly & safe neighborhood with plenty of free street parking.','A Portland neighborhood known as Overlook. Friendly neighbors, a convenience store around the corner, several tasty restaurants a couple of blocks away. Great local shops, bars, eateries, breweries, live music, and so much more a few blocks further on Mississippi Ave. Alberta, Killingsworth, Williams/ Vancouver, the Pearl, and Lloyd districts all a short route away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49127182/original/cdae1fba-fbb5-49ee-9d9c-7b33ae5d1be1.jpeg',9065073,13,'45.555259704589844','-122.68392944335938',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,30,183,80,4.95,49127182),(2114,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49128804','Verdant Loft - Travel Home','Verdant Loft - an architecturally stunning loft built in 2021<br /><br />A private detached stand-alone modern loft with open floor plan and beautiful French door opens to your private garden.<br /><br />Modern, yet warm and inviting.  Tuft and Needle Mint queen bed on loft level and laundry plus bonus work space with skylight. Twin daybed in living room. 31 windows, skylights and 22 foot high ceiling brings in an abundance of natural light.  It\'s like living in a tree house with 5-Star hotel amenities.','This is a great neighborhood for biking or walking to Alberta Street and Killingsworth Ave for great restaurants, coffee and shops.  We are also close to Williams and Mississippi, several large parks and freeway access is a five-minute drive away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/97772a00-68a7-452d-9de9-0428117bae6c.jpg',13107606,14,'45.56484','-122.65534',1,3,1.50,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,30,268,4.98,49128804),(2115,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49129986','Garden House - 2 Bedrooms & Dedicated Office Area!','Welcome to this beautiful garden oasis, perfect for relaxing with family and working remotely.  <br /><br />This house is conveniently located just minutes from PDX airport, the MAX red line, multiple bus lines, and interstates 84 and 205.  Downtown Portland is only 20 minutes by car, and hiking and waterfalls just 45 minutes east.  <br /><br />Enjoy the privacy of our garden, with an outdoor dining and lounging area for the temperate NW weather!','We have lived on this property for 5 years, and love the access to the Columbia River Gorge to the east and downtown to the west.  Many of Portland\'s cute shopping and dining neighborhoods are only a 10 minute drive away, including Alberta Arts District and Mt Tabor.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDkxMjk5ODY%3D/original/b8169f92-73c8-443b-a448-33d1fe1bdd6b.jpeg',19539687,40,'45.55715','-122.55966',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,72.00,30,1125,6,5.00,49129986),(2116,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49131200','Garden Flat: Stunning Scandinavian-Style Retreat','\"Garden Flat\" is a stunning 1,200 sf ground level open concept one bedroom, 1.5-bathroom apartment - a calm Scandinavian inspired oasis in the heart of one of Portland\'s most vibrant neighborhoods. It has a clever and spacious indoor-outdoor floor plan that includes a galley style kitchenette, living/media room, garden facing master suite with large sun filled walk in shower, private office, and multi-purpose room with a dinning table, ping pong, and personal gym, and shared garden patio.','Our neighborhood sits squarely in one of Portland\'s densest concentration of award-winning and beloved restaurants and bars. A real foodie row! Within a few blocks, you will find a dazzling diversity of restaurants, an old-school theater, a couple of our best dive bars, specialty beer and wine shops, amazing food carts, locally-owned shops, and verdant tree-lined streets to wander.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-49131200/original/f1c3ee75-26f9-4069-865c-f3687da9f84d.jpg',1919627,25,'45.50321','-122.64243',1,3,1.50,1.00,1.00,200.00,3,93,39,4.95,49131200),(2117,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49158293','Modern, immaculate, waterfront Pearl Condo PDX','Located right on the Willamette river in the Pearl District, this stunning, modern, private 1-bed condo is a great location to provide a comfortable, quiet stay for long vacations, travel health care professionals or remote workers in Portland, Oregon<br /><br />Spacious rooms, open floor plan, water feature & river views, modern appliances, washer/dryer, gym, sauna and 24/7 security with superb access to Portland metro<br /><br />Includes a dedicated secure underground parking spot<br /><br />Only 10 mins from OHSU Hospital','Walkable to parks, the iconic Pearl district that hosts fantastic restaurants, bars, cafes and work spots. While the building gym and sauna are available to guests there are some fantastic walkable fitness studios in nearby Slabtown.<br />5 to 10 minute walks to multiple great coffee shops, restaurants and bars <br /><br />5 minute walk to The Fields Park, a large green space which also included a kids playground and dog park.<br /><br />Walking distance to the Pearl District, Downtown Portland, Slabtown and Northwest areas within 20 minutes','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49158293/original/952ac61d-77dd-477c-8898-8af116679be1.jpeg',15385820,2,'45.53231','-122.6785',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,130.00,90,180,4,4.75,49158293),(2118,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49187946','Kenton Hotel - Columbia Suite 1','Located in the heart of the Kenton neighborhood, we are a locally owned and managed boutique hotel with deep roots in the community. With 18 unique art-filled and eco-friendly rooms in a renovated 1962 property, we’ve combined all the things that make Portland great. <br /><br />Every room has a mural done by local artists painted directly on the wall, pet-friendly rooms, attentive décor, hand-crafted bed frames harvested from salvaged lumber, beautiful outside courtyard sitting area with a gas firepit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7a7ab6dc-4101-445c-ac2c-5ecdfce58711.jpg',396682935,55,'45.58243','-122.68467',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,8,4.75,49187946),(2119,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49193906','Great Location, Walk to everything! 10 min to DT!','The condo is located in the heart of the Lloyd Center District. Walk to public transportation to the airport and downtown. Grocery store, pharmacy, restaurants and coffee houses all within walking distance. 10 walk to the Convention Center.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49193906/original/87559a9f-3ce5-4fac-a3ae-f68e4937ae25.jpeg',60624037,59,'45.53436','-122.65656',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,59.00,30,1125,4,5.00,49193906),(2120,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49196317','The Highland Rose Retreat Awaits You and Yours','The Highland Rose Retreat is a newly constructed 2-bedroom suite in Portland\'s Sylvan Highlands Neighborhood that is available for monthly stays (30+ days). Less than five minutes from the historic Oregon Zoo and adjacent Washington Park, ride the park shuttle (seasonal) to see all that it offers. Explore winding roads through the West Hills, then drop down West Burnside for an award winning meal. Return to the comfort of your home away from home to relax before you do it all again the next day.','A few local favorites include:<br />*Cornell Farms Cafe<br />*Skyline Tavern<br />*Canyon Grill<br />*Pizzicato Pizza<br />*Ranch PDX, NW 21st<br />*Kinara Thai<br />*RingSide Steakhouse<br /><br />And these are just a few places to eat. Don\'t forget to explore Hoyt Arboretum, Portland Japanese Garden, World Forestry Center and the International Rose Test Garden.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49196317/original/dcb40412-bd6b-44cd-9eb2-82e5c855033a.jpeg',158074447,62,'45.51294','-122.73567',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,123.00,30,1125,6,5.00,49196317),(2121,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49196430','Modern PDX Home in quiet area- Long term welcome','This spacious home in a quiet neighborhood is perfect for families, business trips  or a quiet retreat away from home. Enjoy the deck with natural landscape views that can be appreciated from any of the rooms. Modern amenities will provide you with all the comforts of home and a pleasant stay.','Blocks away from Woodstock coffee shops, bars, restaurants.<br />Organic supermarket a few minutes away.<br />10 min from Rhododendron garden, reed college and Sellwood.<br />15 min from Downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/834fb59c-c551-4075-bed8-637498c9ef78.jpg',193574092,69,'45.46359','-122.60643',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,195.00,30,1124,28,4.79,49196430),(2122,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49217230','Cottage in the trees','This is a serene and spacious studio cottage in a wooded backyard filled with flowers and ferns. It is tucked away behind our house in a quiet neighborhood a few blocks from the Springwater bike/walking trail, close to many great food cart pods, and a 10-minute drive to Mt. Tabor. We are also near several neighborhood parks, Woodstock Boulevard shops and restaurants, and tons of amazing food.','The Brentwood-Darlington neighborhood is quiet, friendly, and laid-back, with a rural feel not found anymore in most of Portland. It’s close to all the exciting things that Southeast Portland offers, but far enough to be very, very relaxing.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/47c3dccd-fcb8-440c-8120-90fae6ddb70d.jpg',7749342,69,'45.4683','-122.58221',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,75.00,3,45,80,4.90,49217230),(2123,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49229089','Mt. Tabor Garden Retreat with hot tub & sauna','A comfortable home designed to help you relax. The backyard features a beautiful deck, a hot tub for two, and a sauna for four - the perfect spot to listen to the birds and unwind.  <br /><br />Inside, you\'ll find a bright eat-in kitchen, two bedrooms with comfy queen-sized beds and two bathrooms. An inflatable queen bed in the office adds extra sleeping space.  Walk to local parks and restaurants. This home is the perfect place to relax and recharge!  (Contact host for additional calendar dates.)','SE Portland is a relaxed neighborhood known for its walkability, restaurants, food carts, and live music.  Hiking/birdwatching on Mt. Tabor Park (our local cinder-cone) is just a 15 minute walk away.  Easy freeway access to I-84 (east to the Columbia River Gorge) or I-205 (airport access) and only 10 minutes by car to downtown Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/aca0998e-535d-4b4e-921d-a9946e857d7b.jpg',42642669,15,'45.51691','-122.60707',1,4,2.00,2.00,3.00,275.00,2,7,66,4.92,49229089),(2124,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49240825','Heart of SE Portland','Fully renovated bungalow in the heart of the Hawthorne District. Walk score 98.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/62da9ff6-b91f-4aba-b3f4-b799c09d9965.jpg',2188267,8,'45.51202','-122.62181',1,6,3.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,5,5.00,49240825),(2125,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49244342','Far Out Cottage, away from city riffraff','Far Out Cottage is nestled in the woods in the NW Skyline area. It’s far out like groovy and also away from the city but yet still conveniently located.<br /><br />This unique experience is a step back into decades past but with the convenience of fast internet, roku and a modern flatscreen TV. The highlight of all this new technology is a throw back to the 70’s with an Atari equipped with all the classics. Your stay also includes a 50’s style fully equipped kitchen, 40’s style bathroom and laundry room.','Close By Within 5-15 minutes:<br />- Easy commute to Nike, Intel, and other high tech companies in Hillsboro/Beaverton<br />- Hiking (Forest Park, Trail of Shrines, Sauvie Island, etc.)<br />- Kayaking & Paddleboarding (Scappoose Bay, Multnomah Channel, or Sauvie Island)<br />- Biking (Skyline, Sauvie Island, Hwy 30)<br />- Golfing (Wildwood Golf Course)<br />- Bird Watching: Sauvie Island (Wildlife Reserve), Forest Park<br />- Farms (fresh available for purchase or u-pick produce,  honey, concerts & seasonal festival/events)<br />- Beaches: Sauvie Island<br />- Shopping (Streets of Tanasbourne, small shops in St Johns)<br />- Fishing (nearby rivers & lakes)<br /><br />Other Possible Nearby Destination Day Trips:<br />- Mt Hood (skiing, snowboarding, snowshoeing, sledding)<br />- Oregon Coast (fishing, crabbing, clamming, long walks on the beach, sightseeing)<br />- Multnomah Falls (hiking, sightseeing)<br />- Columbia Gorge (windsurfing, kiteboarding, hiking, sightseeing)<br />- Wine ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9870c336-e93b-4b2c-b496-937650d55a69.jpg',58056821,50,'45.60266','-122.83264',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,113.00,2,1125,136,4.92,49244342),(2126,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49247221','Quaintly Remodeled 1900 Farmhouse','My home offers a comfortable stay in the city limits of Portland, in a great neighborhood called Montavilla. It is a 10 minute walk to beautiful Mt. Tabor park, 2 blocks away from delicious restaurants and fun bars, and a 15 minute drive to downtown. The home is comfortable with several seating areas to lounge and a newly remodeled kitchen ready for full use. HOWEVER, IT IS NOT FOR EVERYONE! Please read the listing thoroughly, particularly \"other details to note\"','Montavilla has historically been more of a working class neighborhood. However, lately with the influx of new residents to Portland, the neighborhood is seeing a decent rise in home value. The business district has also made substantial improvements in dining and shopping. Montavilla has really become another highlight in Portland\'s repertoire.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1171d9ca-5046-451b-b9ac-d58fcad59e0b.jpg',36242933,10,'45.51900880875986','-122.5812721348369',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,5,45,21,4.71,49247221),(2127,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49262762','Midcentury Case Haus','Welcome to Case Haus - a mid-century time capsule with fun modern twists and wonderful indoor/outdoor living space. This home features 3 bedrooms + 2 bathrooms with a two sided fireplace to cozy up to. A semi attached studio housing a twin bed and desk for work from home needs. Located in NE Portland within walking/biking distance to great restaurants and shops. Renovated by an architecture/interior design team with attention to detail. Don’t miss this unique home experience.','The home sits in NE Portland on a calm, narrow street. Walking distance to a wonderful park that has a track and dog park and restaurants such as, the Kennedy School where you can eat, soak, and watch a movie.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49262762/original/748ed066-5665-4751-b14b-da3dbddb6730.jpeg',35707376,1,'45.57165','-122.62512',1,5,2.00,3.00,3.00,100.00,30,1125,6,4.83,49262762),(2128,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49273485','Pearl river view condo with spa','This lovely river view condo is centrally located in the Pearl District. Quick walk to Powell\'s books, Waterfront park, fantastic restaurants, public transportation, and all that Portland has to offer. Enjoy the  outdoor jacuzzi and relax! Tastefully furnished with design elements and works of contemporary art. One covered parking spot included. 24 hour security in complex. 30 night minimum booking, 31+ days pays no tax.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49273485/original/4299750e-0a42-4b2b-8f52-5767d2ae02a5.jpeg',4431797,43,'45.52902','-122.67435',1,2,2.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,120,6,5.00,49273485),(2129,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49278231','The Retrouvailles Suite ~ Espresso & Craft Brews','Situated in the bustling and vibrant neighborhood of Slabtown in NW Portland, this conveniently located home places you just steps away from the city\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. With so much to see and do in this trendy and exciting area, you\'ll want to extend your trip just to fully explore all the neighborhood has to offer. Whether you\'re a foodie, a shopaholic, or simply looking to experience Portland\'s vibrant nightlife, this is the perfect location for you.','Welcome to your stay in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant and eclectic Alphabet District, one of the city\'s most coveted neighborhoods. Located on NW 23rd St, this prime spot offers an unbeatable blend of urban excitement and historic charm.<br /><br />NW 23rd Street, also known as \"Trendy Third,\" is renowned for its diverse array of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and unique boutique shops. Whether you’re in the mood for a gourmet meal, a casual coffee, or an afternoon of shopping, everything is just steps away. Indulge in culinary delights from local favorites such as Salt & Straw, known for its inventive ice cream flavors, or savor a meal at one of the many farm-to-table restaurants lining the street.<br /><br />For those who appreciate the arts, the area is brimming with cultural experiences. The nearby Portland Art Museum and the various art galleries along NW 23rd Avenue offer a taste of the city’s vibrant art scene. The neighborhood also hosts numerous events and festivals thro','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49278231/original/1814f7ad-ca63-41ba-93fc-ca3700a8cb8d.jpeg',33606696,27,'45.53308','-122.7002',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,2,365,313,4.77,49278231),(2130,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49320514','Historic Portland House','Situated on the edge of the city, you feel a little like you are in the country. Walking distance to downtown. Easy bus and freeway access. Near PSU, OHSU, NUNM, the Willamette river and parks. Our unique backyard has a fire pit available upon request, fire wood is usually ready for purchase at a nearby store. Driveway parking. Designated mini fridge in the kitchen and TV in your room.  Our style is quirky and friendly and we love to share our home. LGBTQA & 420 friendly but please no pets.','We are located in the second oldest neighborhood in Portland, so being, there is a historic feel to the area.  This is a quiet location, but downtown is just a walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5c7f176c-9566-4ffb-92fb-5c8860aa46f4.jpg',397878148,22,'45.50338','-122.68097',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,31,42,4.95,49320514),(2131,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49325836','Perfect location-- garden oasis apartment!','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to explore Portland and our surrounding areas. This fully equipped garden apartment is located within a 10-minute walk from Mt. Tabor Park, one of the most beautiful parks Portland has to offer--which is saying A LOT in our green city! There is a private entrance and no shared spaces, it’s all yours to enjoy.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1aefc955-1d78-42fe-8ad8-3e02b633b093.jpg',87307571,15,'45.51814','-122.59749',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,2,1125,80,4.93,49325836),(2132,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49347736','Playful Suite at the Kenton Hotel','The Alberta Suite at the Kenton Hotel is a boutique hotel room with a queen bed and a full bathroom. Each of the 18 rooms has a private entrance from the exterior and self check-in. Located in the heart of the Historic Kenton neighborhood, we are a locally owned and managed boutique hotel with deep roots in the community. With 18 art-filled and eco-friendly rooms, our newly renovated 1962 Motel features all the elements that make Portland (and Oregon) such a desirable travel destination.','Located in the heart of the Kenton neighborhood, we are a professionally managed boutique hotel with deep roots in and respect for the community. You’ll find many places nearby for your dining pleasure such as Kenton Station Restaurant and Pub, Presso Coffee Bar, and Posies Bakery & Cafe, just to name a few.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-49347736/original/59b4bf76-ea14-41c0-8e02-4ccb538bbc40.jpeg',396842792,55,'45.5837','-122.68467',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,62.00,1,27,83,4.46,49347736),(2133,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49360055','NE PDX 2Bed 1Bath w/Den Newly Furnished Apartment!','Come and enjoy a true NE Portland experience in our marvelous 2 bed 1 bath + Den new fully furnished apartment.  Kitchenette without oven. <br />This apartment is in the basement our house we will be residing above you but will not be in your presence. <br />apartment has a seperate entrance located at the side of the house with a custom key code for your entry on arrival!<br />This space is modern, cozy for style and grace for you to enjoy the duration of your stay.<br />* food carts, groceries stores, parks near','Location! You\'ve come to the right spot! With access to endless parks, groceries stores and food carts you won\'t need for nothing and if so youre 5 mins away from it all.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a14f1718-36c9-4816-9236-99e73be06a12.jpg',236175312,48,'45.57128','-122.66482',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,1,365,324,4.89,49360055),(2134,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49365778','Hawthorne Happiness','Experience the best of Portland in this HAPPY Hawthorne Craftsman with clean lines and classic details. Killer location around the corner from bustling Hawthorne Blvd. Walk Score = 90!','Enjoy walking to classic Portland hangouts like:<br />Mt Tabor Park<br />Apizza Scholls<br />Por Que No<br />Food carts<br />Fried Egg I\'m In Love<br />McMenamin\'s Bagdad Theater and Pub<br />Buffalo Exchange<br />House of Vintage<br />and much more!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49365778/original/177ecbda-b0be-4f6e-93ba-044064c26898.jpeg',15691945,8,'45.51086','-122.61267',1,6,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,7,4.86,49365778),(2135,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49367412','The Art Deco Lounge ~ 95 WalkScore ~ Live Music','Welcome to the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and find endless restaurants, coffee shops, bars, and more just blocks away. With so many options, you\'ll always have something to do and new places to explore.<br /><br />When it\'s time to relax, enjoy the massive 4K HDTV or cook a meal in the spacious kitchen. Whether you\'re a solo traveler or on a romantic getaway, this is the perfect retreat in the heart of PDX. Enjoy the vibrant neighborhood, modern amenities, and the charm of Portland living.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49367412/original/d212c3e4-f7b9-4b66-886b-7875cce4e0b9.jpeg',36435346,9,'45.55261','-122.67519',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,1,365,215,4.88,49367412),(2136,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49390590','Modern Luxury & Convenience in Serene Forest','Basement level of home. Owners live upstairs. Please inquire about unavailable dates - they can be made available <br />Newly built, luxurious, modern home in serene forest location. Surrounded by amazing scenery and gorgeous homes. Quiet, peaceful location while still within convenient driving access to tons of restaurants and shops. Just minutes to miles of beautiful hiking trails in Forest Park. <br />10-15 minutes to NW 23rd St<br />10-15 minutes to downtown Portland, Nike and Intel campus','It\'s an absolutely amazing place to live! We live within a large city with access to all city conveniences, yet it feels as though we\'re living in a peaceful and luxurious forest retreat.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49390590/original/e501ca5d-8ce9-40ad-a4ea-622e706a5d4a.jpeg',212832096,81,'45.54551','-122.76987',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,82.00,2,700,88,4.92,49390590),(2137,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49401898','Excellent Location, Close to Parks, Single Level','Rules note:  This property is completely non smoking of any kind. It is an adult only rental so please no kiddos for the reasons mentioned above. There are also no pets, no firearms, and no fireworks. Pets of any kind cannot be allowed as this property is an allergy sensitive area. There is room for one vehicle out front so please limit yourself to that. \"There is one security camera placed outside which is facing outward and not guest focused.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-49401898/original/ebfa3c25-4ce9-4573-99ed-4148641da909.jpeg',62261998,38,'45.48706','-122.61027',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,3,21,52,4.83,49401898),(2138,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49420291','Cozy Bungalow - Walkable to Dekum St & food carts','Well located, upgraded bungalow in walking distance of Dekum St, food carts, bars, and more!<br /><br />Recently remodeled, cozy, with plenty of natural lighting. Front room is set up as a home office, complete with a comfortable desk and high speed internet. Perfect place to spend a weekend away or a work from home vacation.<br /><br />The office, bedroom, and living room each have a mini-split - allowing you to  control the temperature in each room.','Quiet walkable neighborhood. A couple blocks from MLK Ave, a major street with plenty of business and activity, and Dekum Street, a quieter large street with cute bars, restaurants, and cafes.<br />A short walk from Woodlawn Park which has picnic tables, basketball courts, and plenty of space for a stroll.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/719b1ea6-2428-4b5d-a8a0-23748718d08e.jpg',229783607,45,'45.56963','-122.65975',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,50,9,4.89,49420291),(2139,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49420902','Kenton Hotel Blue Forest Suite','The Blue Forest Suite at the Kenton Hotel is a boutique hotel room with a queen bed and a full bathroom. Each of the 18 rooms has a private entrance from the exterior and self check-in. Located in