ed and managed boutique hotel with deep roots in the community. With 18 art-filled and eco-friendly rooms, our newly renovated 1962 Motel features all the elements that make Portland (and Oregon) such a desirable travel destination.','Located in the heart of the Kenton neighborhood, we are a professionally managed boutique hotel with deep roots in and respect for the community. You’ll find many places nearby for your dining pleasure such as Kenton Station Restaurant and Pub, Presso Coffee Bar, and Posies Bakery & Cafe, just to name a few.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-49437507/original/2d06b799-a3f1-4a23-afb3-5eb39f06b8bb.jpeg',396842792,55,'45.58254','-122.68624',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,64.00,1,27,94,4.66,49437507),(2153,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49445408','Luxe Apartment! 95 walk score, Laundry, Patio!','Enjoy your stay at the Evergreen Escape, a lux apartment perfectly located to explore the best of Portland. A short walk to amazing restaurants, bars, boutiques and the picturesque streets of Portland.<br /><br />Make yourself at home in a modern, thoughtfully designed open-concept space with comfy living room, fully-outfitted kitchen, and dining area. Sleep well on top-rated queen beds with high thread count sheets. Enjoy coffee or a cocktail looking onto your lush patio with with string lights.','Located only steps from the Boise neighborhood’s popular  Mississippi Ave and Williams Ave areas, and with the peace of mind and easy, stress-free parking of a quiet residential street. The vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood is a pleasant walk or quick drive away. Downtown is only 10 minutes away, the airport is 20 minutes, and countless other Portland neighborhoods are easily accessible.<br /><br />You are perfectly positioned to eat at some of Portland’s best restaurants and food carts, hang out at trendy bars, browse through eclectic boutiques, get a local beer at a nearby brewery, and stroll along beautiful, tree-lined streets; or if you want 