 from the exterior and self check-in. Located in the heart of the Historic Kenton neighborhood, we are a locally owned and managed boutique hotel with deep roots in the community. With 18 art-filled, eco-friendly rooms, our newly renovated 1962 Motel features all the elements that make Portland (and Oregon) such a desirable travel destination.','Located in the heart of the Kenton neighborhood, we are a professionally managed boutique hotel with deep roots in and respect for the community. You’ll find many places nearby for your dining pleasure such as Kenton Station Restaurant and Pub, Presso Coffee Bar, and Posies Bakery & Cafe, just to name a few.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-49637022/original/a6376fca-37ed-4ad4-887f-c36521f8e06d.jpeg',396842792,55,'45.58257','-122.68426',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,67.00,1,27,52,4.33,49637022),(2159,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49666797','Zen Den- Studio/Sauna/Outdoor Hot/Cold Soaking Tub','A private attached studio blocks from delicious restaurants. A queen bed, simple desk & bathroom, with indoor clawfoot tub and private toilet area.<br /><br />Kitchenette is minimal: fridge, microwave, and hot water kettle. <br /><br />Includes an additional shared back yard,  outdoor  hot/cold clawfoot tub and sauna.  <br /><br />*There is a shared wall with the front  unit.  Please be conscious of your volume and a family medical allergy risk prevent us from hosting pets of any kind.','This is a very quiet neighborhood with plenty of street parking.  Although it is a safe and quiet neighborhood, please bring all valuables in from car and don\'t leave any bags in view in your car. <br /><br />Walk to Division or Hawthorne in about 6-8 blocks and enjoy great dining, buses and/or cafes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b76a574b-5d41-4df0-b826-2c221272aa0c.jpg',158406511,8,'45.50841','-122.63057',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,2,30,83,4.90,49666797),(2160,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49684750','Healing House -Outdoor Sauna Hot/Cold Soaking Tub','Enjoy this cozy home and shared back yard sauna and soaking tub with meditation cushion, yoga space, free weights; tranquil living/dining room, sweet selection of books, front porch and a spacious kitchen.<br /><br />Walk to all your needs. Stay on quiet street near delicious dining and amenities.   And take in Portland with all it\'s wonders.<br /><br />*It has a shared wall with another unit. Please be conscious of your volume.  Family medical allergy risks prevent us from hosting pets, smoking or vaping','This is a quiet and cozy neighborhood. Yet, still walking distance to Division St. and the Hawthorne District which are must visit Portland areas.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/94ad28ea-2f01-493c-b14b-86138ff24cbe.jpg',158406511,8,'45.50774','-122.63142',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,85.00,2,30,23,4.91,49684750),(2161,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49710323','Million Dollar Downtown View Private Luxury Suite','million dollar view on this dream house guest suite. on top of Mt. Scott.  The apartment has a drop dead gorgeous view of dwntwn skyline. there are two very friendly dogs on site. there is a steep driveway and many stairs. so bring the right shoes. we are pet friendly on a case by case basis only. 1 dog max. wehave a couple units on site and live on the property. so there is potential for some noise.  big open community deck and enjoy your own private balcony. everything is absolutely exquisite!','Paradise custom built luxury home built with the trees. It\'s like living in a tree chalet on Mt Scott.  Walk to Leech Botanical Garden.. Bordering Happy Valley.  Nature living in Portland. All amenities airport, restaurants and shopping close by.  Busy city life just down the hill :)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/afb9b899-3379-4b3f-bd7c-ecff04f9ff0c.jpg',90876848,77,'45.471279','-122.541557',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,129.00,14,365,38,4.95,49710323),(2162,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49712426','Hawthorne-Division Craftsman Primary Suite 400sqft','Large primary bedroom in Classic 1913 Craftsman bungalow. Prime location on quiet residential street between popular Hawthorne & Division Districts!<br /><br />Walk score of 91 means a quick stroll to restaurants, vintage shops, parks, theaters, cannabis dispensaries & lots of fun!<br /><br />In addition to the 400SF private bedroom, enjoy access to spacious common living spaces, stocked gourmet kitchen, lush backyard w edible landscaping & a \"bohoasis\" under the covered patio.<br /><br />We are LGBTQ+, BIPOC & 420 friendly.','The Richmond neighborhood is one of the most popular areas in SE Portland. Our home is nestled on a quiet residential street between Hawthorne and Division, 2 of the most popular districts with lots of eateries, shops, parks and entertainment options. It is a historic neighborhood of quaint old homes, lined with trees, walkable and very safe.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49712426/original/83e3a360-37b1-4d39-b424-332c14ec8b68.jpeg',3098124,8,'45.50846','-122.61427',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,149.00,1,28,7,5.00,49712426),(2163,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49716474','Cozy Studio In NE PDX (Cully/Beaumont-Wilshire)','Cozy (240 sq ft), private studio space located in NE Portland on the edge of the Cully and Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhoods. We are located on a bike route and about a 12-minute walk to NE Fremont Street (many restaurants, coffee shops, bars), 12 min by car to the airport, and 15 min to downtown. Small kitchenette with microwave, mini-fridge, toaster oven, and coffee/tea supplies. Queen bed, new super comfy mattress.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-49716474/original/076aac56-93e3-431b-bd36-6aab9dc0ee8e.jpeg',15880952,21,'45.55583','-122.60789',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,62.00,2,14,411,4.98,49716474),(2164,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49717790','Modern One Bedroom in North Portland','***NEW LISTING***<br />Reviews are from a different location.<br /><br />Enjoy a stay in this modern, one-bedroom apartment in North Portland, offering a peaceful atmosphere and a beautiful view. One block away, you\'ll find a coffee shop, restaurants, brewery, and wine bar.<br /><br />Conveniently located six blocks from I-5, this apartment provides easy access to the entire city. It\'s a 7-minute drive to the Alberta, Mississippi, or Vancouver neighborhoods, and just 12 minutes to Downtown Portland and NW 23rd Avenue.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-49717790/original/3c186329-87bc-411e-b35d-6c4c62f4369a.jpeg',2830008,13,'45.56318','-122.68817',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,2,21,26,4.92,49717790),(2165,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49739224','Alberta arts studio with unique cafe downstairs','This is a multi use property with businesses on the ground floor and residential units up stairs. There is a coffee shop that opens at 9o’clock in the morning and a medical office that often opens prior.','The Alberta arts neighborhood as well as Killingsworth Street have many galleries, coffee shops, restaurants, bars, hey theater, boutiques and craft shops as well as parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49739224/original/0acff501-c03a-4eec-b2a8-9a2c7c793f8b.jpeg',396146761,1,'45.56226','-122.63529',2,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,70.00,4,66,8,4.75,49739224),(2166,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49739487','Comfy Alberta Arts Live/ Work Space','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located micro studio in Northeast Portland. This room is walking distance to amazing live music, breweries, restaurants galore, art, galleries, food carts, boutique shops, and more. There are three parks, each of which is less than a mile away. A vegan coffee shop on the ground floor, with amazing breakfast sandwiches to start your day. And your own personal Skate, Park in the yard is an added bonus.','This is an extremely lively part of the Alberta arts area. There are multiple restaurants and bars within close walking distance. There are three large and one smaller park or within walking distance as well.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49739487/original/03895556-8348-425f-bcfb-7f90f74973fe.jpeg',61310355,1,'45.56115','-122.63426',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,3,61,9,5.00,49739487),(2167,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49759579','Furnished 2BD side of duplex in quiet neighborhood','lt\'s like living in a tree house\"<br />One side of a 2-BD, 1.5 bathroom duplex on a quiet, dead end street.    Recently remodeled. Big screen TV, WiFi,  great deck with a gas grill.','Quiet neighborhood, with great access to freeways and downtown. Shopping, parks and Starbucks  a short walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/19fb55cc-2cc9-406f-b6ff-3ae9fbe78c4c.jpg',193445376,28,'45.46818','-122.68874',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,135.00,30,365,3,4.67,49759579),(2168,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49772920','Buckman Bliss: Quiet Oasis Near Portland\'s Pulse','As a Portland native, I guarantee our location provides the quintessential visitor experience. You\'ll be amidst parks, bars, and eateries, yet nestled in a peaceful, safe neighborhood. Dive into Portland\'s vibrant life or retreat to a tranquil haven when needed. Embrace the city\'s unique mix of natural beauty and architectural charm - Welcome to the best of the Pacific Northwest!','The Buckman Neighborhood is incredible. Within walking distance you will find some of the hottest shopping districts and commercial areas Portland has to offer, but it\'s on a quiet street tucked right outside of all the noise. Close by areas includes Burnside, Belmont, Hawthorne, and Division. You can also take a beautiful walk over the Burnside Bridge to get to Downtown Portland and/or NW Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49772920/original/1287a2d6-eabb-4153-8c83-b10a3cc1f660.jpeg',338853836,32,'45.52212','-122.65382',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,89.00,1,1125,296,4.83,49772920),(2169,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49777436','Hawthorne Hale - Ohana','Nestled between the popular and bustling streets of Hawthorne and Division in SE Portland, our home provides a tranquil retreat. Walking distance to many shops, restaurants, bars, and cafes. Across from Sewallcrest Park and only a few blocks from Bagdad Theater and Powells Bookstore. <br />Private entrance unit with kitchen, living room, bathroom, and bedroom. 82\" 4K TV + Apple TV. Shared back yard with sauna. LGBTQ+ and 420 friendly. A golden retriever lives on property but please no pets','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c676fc6b-1261-402e-9791-d2706641f080.jpg',98199385,8,'45.5108','-122.63203',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,121.00,3,90,71,5.00,49777436),(2170,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49812482','The Fox Den—Stylish Parkside Studio','Located on the edge of Irving Park, the Fox Den is a stylish 1-bed downstairs studio with a fully equipped kitchen and bath.','Irvington is the perfect combination of historic charm and tight-knit community vibes. Brimming with tree-lined streets, 1920s craftsmans, and a vibrant neighborhood park, you’ll quickly get a taste of what it’s like to live in Portland!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49812482/original/dc23f1c2-cf36-4991-8828-bd8e48e72113.jpeg',16835758,7,'45.54811','-122.65477',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,94.00,2,6,108,4.94,49812482),(2171,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49812801','Stunning 60s-70s Retro Apartment','I\'m Mod Abode You!<br /><br />A funky retro themed basement apartment inspired by the groovy 60s-70s, this spot is a vintage lover\'s dream. Kick your feet up, put a record on the turntable, play a board game, and peruse the vintage books. This quirky apartment has it all: a full kitchen, a clawfoot tub, and even a working Ms. Pac-Man arcade! The attention to detail is impeccable.<br /><br />Located in quiet southeast Portland, 8 minutes away from the lovely food and shopping corridor of the Woodstock neighborhood.','This unit is located in the Brentwood-Darlington area just minutes from the hip Foster-Powell aka FoPo and Woodstock neighborhoods, with endless restaurants, food carts, bars, vintage and record shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49812801/original/4c126cbd-4133-4ee4-84af-bbe837b5597a.jpeg',401737101,69,'45.46613','-122.59334',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,73.00,2,90,127,4.83,49812801),(2172,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49813450','Hawthorne Hale - Skylit Attic','Nestled between the popular and bustling streets of Hawthorne and Division in SE Portland, our home provides a tranquil retreat. Walking distance to many shops, restaurants, bars, and cafes. Across the street from Sewallcrest Park and only a few blocks from Bagdad Theater and Powells Bookstore.<br />Private attic space with living room, bathroom, mini fridge, and smart TV. Shared back yard with seating and sauna.  LGBTQ+ and 420 friendly. A golden retriever lives here but please no pets.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ef05abcc-fdef-4b11-bc4f-2a23ed826144.jpg',98199385,8,'45.5107','-122.63167',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,2,45,104,5.00,49813450),(2173,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49816474','Marguerite\'s Cottage Multnomah Village Portland OR','Entire cottage, private yard and dedicated parking hosted by Carol and Jim<br /><br />Marguerite’s Cottage is a lovely, newly built and very private one bedroom cottage that’s perfect for 1 to 2 people visiting Portland.    We are located in charming and historic Multnomah Village - an ideal location to explore the city and beyond.  After your visits and adventures, you can return to a quiet restful spot and enjoy.','We\'re located in the Multnomah Village area of Southwest Portland.  Multnomah Village is sometimes referred to as a \"village in the heart of Portland\".    While we\'re only minutes by car or bus to the center of the city, we also enjoy our lovely and walkable village center, nearby parks and safe quiet neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49816474/original/2cf58da0-ee1a-4872-9a51-800b845246fe.jpeg',91978403,18,'45.4752','-122.7124',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,2,30,150,5.00,49816474),(2174,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49861953','SE Portland Cottage in the City','Enjoy inner SE Portland\'s Richmond area w/our 2 BR, 1 BA cottage. Upstairs loft offers work space or loft area additional sleeping. Enjoy everything 39th and Division area has to offer. <br />Two car parking and plenty of free street parking nearby. Near Division Street entertainment.<br />Room one has a king size bed <br />Room two has a king size bed and <br />Loft area has a sofa<br />Two sofas for sleeping. <br /><br />No Pets Allowed without paying a $75 non- refundable pet deposit.','The Richmond neighborhood is located in southeast Portland and is bordered by the Hosford-Abernethy, Sunnyside, Mt. Tabor, South Tabor, and Creston-Kenilworth neighborhoods. The Richmond area is unique to Portland because it encompasses two unique “districts,” Hawthorne and Clinton/Division. Walk to local restaurants,  shopping, grocery, bus line.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ba9232de-67cf-4619-ae9f-2739f6fd6c0f.jpg',367109006,8,'45.50089','-122.62193',1,7,1.00,3.00,2.00,125.00,1,1125,131,4.78,49861953),(2175,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49874678','Cozy Bungalow in Historic Homestead Neighborhood','A charming little bungalow in the historic Homestead Neighborhood. You will be staying 2 miles from the heart of downtown Portland and just a minute away from OHSU.','Quiet neighborhood at the foot of the Terwilliger curves, OHSU, and minutes from downtown Portland. Take a walk up to the Terwilliger curves and experience the best views in all of Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-49874678/original/4ff382a7-04c1-416b-a954-85e1e653101d.jpg',161426342,22,'45.49082','-122.67865',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,64.00,1,30,134,4.94,49874678),(2176,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49877682','Modern & Chic, Set Up For traveling nurses','Enjoy the great walking amenities of food, breweries and Coffee. You are also 10 min from all of what Portland has to offer.<br /><br />This unit is new construction and newly furnished with great modern and chic style. Tuft and Needle bed with luxury sheets will have you rested to explore PDX. <br /><br />Great parking and secluded entry.','Woodlawn really is a little gem of a neighborhood that is being slowly but surely built into a wonderful family-oriented neighborhood. New businesses have popped up in the last few years such as Woodlawn Coffee and Pastry and Breakside Brewery. These are local hangouts and area favorites. Others like the Good Neighbor Pizzeria shop and The Firehouse, are well-known staples having weathered the early dormant years. The Firehouse is a must-visit restaurant, known for its excellent wood-fired pizzas and amazing locally-sourced dishes served in a beautiful and unique dining setting','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDk4Nzc2ODI%3D/original/1c388488-6ed5-4b80-a0bd-82f8338695ca.jpeg',26808667,45,'45.573','-122.65706',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,126.00,5,1125,9,4.89,49877682),(2177,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49882704','Spacious High-Ceiling Studio Near Mt Tabor','Welcome to our spacious, high-ceiling, basement studio apartment located just two blocks from Division Street. Our cozy studio is the perfect space for visitors looking to spend some time working remotely, re-locating to the area, or visiting family and friends. With a private entrance, modern kitchen, and laundry on-site, we have everything you need for an extended stay in Portland.<br /><br />You are only:<br />12 mins to OHSU<br />6 mins to Mount Tabor<br />7 mins to Reed College<br />15 mins to Downtown Portland','Situated on a quiet side street right in between Division and Powell, our cozy bungalow has everything you need within walking distance. We are a stones throw from some amazing coffee shops, food cart pods, and Green Zebra, a local grocery store with a massive selection of craft beer and natural wines. We\'d be happy to share other recommendations for your stay if needed!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49882704/original/f074c2b0-2378-4117-a24d-f4d43d846bb2.jpeg',18137420,8,'45.50032','-122.60905',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,64.00,28,180,22,4.91,49882704),(2178,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49907060','Enchanting Cottage in Woodstock','Relax in this enchanting one bedroom cottage in beautiful Woodstock. This Cottage Core style residence sits on a lovely corner lot with beautifully maintained front yard space and mature landscaping.  Inside features classic Arts & Crafts style with open floorplan and minimal steps with direct access to the adorable backyard oasis.  Comfy queen bed, large couch, full kitchen and shower with tub.  Many restaurants, coffee shops, grocery stores, bakeries, etc. are all just 3-4 blocks away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49907060/original/431724a1-9215-4c51-9578-d3d718ccf146.jpeg',4139648,38,'45.48141','-122.61495',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,158.00,1,62,11,4.82,49907060),(2179,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49924137','Stylish 2BR in Historic SE Ladd\'s Addition','This conveniently located and oh-so-stylish duplex in Portland\'s vibrant Hawthorne & Division districts is the perfect place to stay and experience the city. With a mix of mid-century modern and contemporary touches, it offers a fully equipped kitchen, spacious living room, office space and the comforts of home just a 15 min drive away from downtown. Get ready to enjoy all of the attractions the city has to offer in this dreamy little escape.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2e3b0bc4-e421-4bdf-adc9-192994923f1b.jpg',221421926,25,'45.50596','-122.64959',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,145.00,31,1125,5,4.60,49924137),(2180,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50002466','Hawthorne-Division Craftsman Bungalow 4br/8 guests','Classic 1913 Craftsman bungalow. Prime location on quiet residential street between popular Hawthorne & Division Districts!<br /><br />Walk score of 91 means a quick stroll to restaurants, food carts, vintage shops, parks, theaters, cannabis dispensaries & lots of fun!<br /><br />Enjoy our lovingly restored home, stocked gourmet kitchen, spacious living spaces, lush backyard with edible landscaping, huge welcoming front porch & one of a kind \"bohoasis\" under the covered patio.<br /><br />We are LGBTQ+, BIPOC & 420 friendly.','The Richmond neighborhood is one of the most popular areas in SE Portland. Our home is nestled on a quiet residential street between Hawthorne and Division, 2 of the most popular districts with lots of eateries, shops, parks and entertainment options. It is a historic neighborhood of quaint old homes, lined with trees, walkable and very safe.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/645cccb2-83eb-4f93-bc76-dd390ceaa09f.jpg',3098124,8,'45.50847','-122.6152',1,8,2.00,4.00,6.00,359.00,2,28,142,4.96,50002466),(2181,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50031321','Epic record collection & hot tub in bright home','Close to Willamette River waterfront trails. Two blocks from Ladds Rose Gardens, Clinton Street (several cool bars, patios, Loyly spa, and theater!) and Division Street - home to some of the city\'s best restaurants — Ava Gene, Omas, Fairweather, Quaintrelle, and more. My home is good for couples, solo adventurers, business travelers, and families. Enjoy the extensive record collection (old blues, rock, and jazz), relax in the covered outdoor patio and spa, and enjoy the well stocked kitchen.','My favorite neighborhood in Portland! Quiet streets, endless food, drink, and entertainment options - not to mention endless cool and unique portland shops all along Division and Hawthorne! Also - just 10 minutes from downtown, OHSU, the Convention Center and really any other major spot you might be visiting in town!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50031321/original/4db07f82-eb14-4a37-968b-c3dc5b32440c.jpeg',368663,25,'45.5054','-122.64317',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,175.00,3,1125,83,4.92,50031321),(2182,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50048204','Melrose Place','Light, bright, and airy modern corner townhouse with an abundance of windows looking out to a quiet maple tree lined street. Freshly remodeled house with no detail overlooked. Cook in the Chef’s kitchen or eat out at the numerous restaurants and food carts within blocks of the house. Forest park and hiking trails are just a couple blocks up the street! The house is a great spot to work from home, relax, cook and serve as your home base to see the best of Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50048204/original/58aa4389-3c24-4dc4-b3dc-3f4c1a716e17.jpeg',306295610,27,'45.53518','-122.70602',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,144.00,1,90,173,4.91,50048204),(2183,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50050810','Beautiful 2-Bed 2-Bath Guest House in Alberta','Gorgeous, recently renovated 2 bedroom 2 bathroom guest house in the sought after Alberta neighborhood. Private entrance, great kitchen for cooking, and washer/dryer in unit. Hardwood floors, bright light, and everything you need for a comfortable stay in Portland. <br /><br />Plenty of available street parking but also on a bike corridor for easy access to the rest of Portland. A short walk from amazing restaurants, bars, breweries, and lively commercial corridors.','Beautiful tree-lined streets and lively commercial corridors with great food and drinks. You will love the central location of this home - being a hop skip away from Alberta, Mississippi, and MLK Jr Blvd. Enjoy being super close to some wonderful parks such as Irving Park, Peninsula Park, and Alberta Park. We’re also right on a popular biking corridor (a Greenway) so bring a bike or rent a Biketown bike and explore the city!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/da7a33fc-12a9-429e-ae2c-42f1653d1feb.jpg',1766073,14,'45.5558','-122.65455',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,30,365,44,4.89,50050810),(2184,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50052706','Private guest house in the heart of Portland','Modern guest house in Montavilla/Mt Tabor neighborhood with lots of  restaurants and coffee shops within walking distance. The space is on the first floor, with it\'s own entrance, full kitchen, dining nook, and washer/dryer. We live in the upper levels. <br /><br />Five miles from the airport and ~30 minutes on public transit. Plenty of street parking for your car.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-50052706/original/dfeb72aa-7835-412f-83f9-2ff731a2fb67.jpg',20045488,10,'45.52712','-122.5876',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,2,95,79,4.95,50052706),(2185,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50087111','#StayinMyDistrict Buckman Open Loft-Style Townhome','#StayinMyDistrict Buckman. Loft style townhouse located in the heart of Buckman neighborhood and close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, & Belmont. Walk to local shops & dining. Modern style and comfort in this bright & open 3-level townhome. Laminate flooring, modern finishes, high ceilings & tons of light, private 2bed/1.5 bath, Full Kitchen, W/D, FREE Street Parking, Smart TV & WIFI. Up to (5) guests. Dog Friendly w/add\'l fee.','Buckman is a neighborhood in the Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. The neighborhood is bounded by the Willamette River on the west, E Burnside St. on the north, SE 28th Ave. on the east, and SE Hawthorne Blvd. on the south. The Buckman neighborhood is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Residents have plenty of independent retail, coffee, pub, and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br /><br />Buckman’s Hawthorne District is one of the most unique, and most popular areas in Southeast Portland. The area is known for its wonderfully restored Old Portland homes, liberal residents, and fun and funky feel. The street is lined with unique restaurants and shops and has a definite Portland-local flair.  Local area standouts are Slow Bar, Rontoms, My Father’s Place, and the Lucky Labrador Brew Pub.<br /><br />Compared to mo','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-50087111/original/18ec84d1-29a6-45d1-b578-4bc6ecc959bc.jpeg',314503963,32,'45.51661682128906','-122.64197540283203',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,87.00,1,28,234,4.91,50087111),(2186,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50089324','Walkable 2br in Vintage NE PDX Home, Quiet Street','Urban living at its finest in the heart of NE Portland\'s Hollywood District! Just 5 miles from downtown. <br /><br />Walk score of 84 and bike score of 98. Quiet residential street a few blocks from dining, food carts, transit, grocery and freeway access. <br /><br />New kitchen. Big windows in living room. <br /><br />This is one of three apartments in a home on a street rather than large apartment complex. Street parking outside. Shared back yard with bike parking. <br /><br />Within 5 miles of most hospitals.','Quiet residential street of single-family homes. Caring neighbors. Short walk to Hollywood shops with many amenities. Four miles to downtown Portland. Easy access to exit 2 on I-84 freeway. Half hour drive to great hiking and sightseeing in Columbia River Gorge. One hour drive to Mt. Hood skiing and hiking.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50089324/original/a7c79a29-1e6c-4e72-b00a-d910e4d5110f.jpeg',410009654,11,'45.53408286175004','-122.61374138060783',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,30,150,2,5.00,50089324),(2187,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50091923','1892 Bohemian Dream Studio in Ladd\'s Addition','Located right on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, this spot is a foodie\'s paradise. Walk to the food carts on Hawthorne or the top-rated restaurants on Division, ensuring every meal is a delight. Your biggest challenge will be deciding which amazing place to try first! This tastefully updated apartment has everything you need to make your time in Portland truly exceptional.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s culinary and cultural scene, commonly known as “Foodie Row.” Nestled in the vibrant Hawthorne/Buckman District, you\'ll find yourself within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This lively area is home to Powell\'s Books, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more.<br /><br />Indulge in vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, savor the wings around the corner at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for an elegant evening at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn’t just for foodies. The Hawthorne area boasts a vibrant indie spirit with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore. Immerse yourself in this hipster haven by catching a movie at the Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50091923/original/3da125e7-0efe-424f-b452-3a51b3dce2a9.jpeg',88253867,25,'45.50559','-122.65521',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,67.00,30,365,260,4.75,50091923),(2188,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50093741','STUNNING APARTMENT,WiFi,Parking, Sellwood/PORTLAND','Stylish apartment with an amazing open concept kitchen located in the desirable Sellwood, Portland. It has been thoughtfully furnished and decorated to make your stay comfortable, enjoyable and private. You can expect very clean, well appointed, turn- key accommodations.<br />It is the perfect alternative to a hotel Jr. Suite with all the comforts of a home, private  patio, providing a cost savings and convenience. Ideal for corporate housing, medical stays, work stays, or any relocation needs.','This neighborhood doesn\'t get any better! You have  parks, great restaurants, bars, coffee shops and stores all within walking distance, making it really convenient for all your needs and JUST MINUTES AWAY FROM DOWNTOWN, OHSU and other main hospitals! Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike, there are bike lanes and trails, road connectivity to Downtown and most of the attractions in Portland.<br />Sellwood-Moreland is considered one of the best places to live in Oregon. It offers residents an urban feel. Many families and young professionals live in Sellwood-Moreland.<br />One of the best things about this very walkable neighborhood is how incredibly friendly, safe and clean it is!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a7777e50-0cd9-4754-b013-1c51598bc00d.jpg',213350724,20,'45.45931','-122.64674',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,30,1125,9,5.00,50093741),(2189,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50098330','LUXURY 2 Story Craftsman Apt in FUN Alberta Arts','Welcome to our Craftsman style furnished rental in the vibrant city of Portland.  The apartment boasts a master bedroom with a luxurious king bed and a private balcony, a third-story loft bedroom/study with stunning views, and a spacious living room that can double as a third bedroom. <br /><br />Located just steps away from trendy shops, restaurants and bakeries, you will have the perfect home base for exploring all that the city has to offer. Book your stay with us and experience Portland in style.','Wow you couldn’t find a better spot to stay in Portland.<br />Alberta Arts neighborhood has the city life energy combined with a small village feel all in one!<br />Famous Podnah’a BBQ and many other delicious Portland food spots are within walking distance.<br />A French bakery is around the corner and many of the best single origin coffee shoots are few blocks away.<br />Bike to Lloyd Center area and the Max Train in 10 minutes or hop on the 8 bus stops across the street which will take you to downtown in 20-25 minutes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-50098330/original/a2c50006-85e5-4e65-9e55-da33fd985a17.jpeg',501715,6,'45.55702','-122.64943',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,187.00,30,365,4,5.00,50098330),(2190,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50132077','Sunshine Suite: Walkable, Sun Room, Quiet Street','Discover urban living at its finest in the heart of Portland\'s Hollywood District! This stylish home offers convenience at every turn. Immerse yourself in the vibrant local scene with a walk score of 84 and bike score of 98. Nestled in a quiet and safe neighborhood, this home is your gateway to the best of Portland living. Your perfect temporary home awaits – seize the opportunity to experience the city effortlessly!','Quiet residential street of single-family homes. Caring neighbors. Short walk to Hollywood shops with many amenities. Four miles to downtown Portland. Easy access to exit 2 on I-84 freeway. Half hour drive to great hiking and sightseeing in Columbia River Gorge. One hour drive to Mt. Hood skiing and hiking.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50132077/original/b8ae877b-5d3b-4ec9-9f8f-11ec182b22df.jpeg',410009654,11,'45.53528921590013','-122.61389322435363',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,31,180,7,4.57,50132077),(2191,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50188381','Stylish Deluxe Apt. in Pearl District w/ Rooftop!','Stylish Deluxe apartment with unbeatable location featuring luxury amenities including a rooftop deck with fire pit & Sky Entertainment lounge. <br />Located in the heart of the Pearl District, you will find endless opportunities to create new memories! This famous neighborhood is a travelers top travel destinations when visiting Portland. This popular destination features art galleries & cultural institutions, as well as stylish shops, acclaimed eateries and brewpubs all within walking distance!','The Pearl District is one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods! Housing world-class art galleries, vibrant shops and boutiques as well as some of the cities best chefs and restaurants. <br />At The Pearl you will find many bars and restaurants from craft breweries and artisan coffee shops to fine dinning mainstays. <br /><br />Whatever your travel adventure vision looks like, you can see it come alive here at the Pearl District!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-50188381/original/a083c9f5-7f43-4fb8-b18d-ad4c568e6e86.jpeg',339414830,2,'45.52588','-122.68483',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,119.00,30,365,146,4.97,50188381),(2192,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50196569','Lovely Ladds Addition Garden Suite','Sleek guest suite in the heart Ladds Addition. Newly renovated, this spacious apartment offers a tranquil location with great proximity to iconic rose gardens, dining establishments, and the best of inner-southeast Portland. Many destinations are walkable and transit options are readily available to reach downtown attractions. Private access, easy street parking, and fast wifi make time spent in the apartment relaxing as well. Ideal for couples or a small family.','Ladds Addition is Portland\'s first planned neighborhood and it is listed on the National Register of Historic Places. Two main diagonal streets, lined with elm trees, thread through the neighborhood and meet at a central circle. Four matching rose gardens are located one block off the center circle in each cardinal direction. The neighborhood is an architectural treasure designed for people, not vehicles, and filled with unique and captivating homes. <br /><br />Today, Ladds Addition is a pulsing hub of walkable, bikeable Portland: central to neighborhoods on both sides of the Willamette, as well as the neighborhoods to thd north and south of Portland. Cafes, bars, restaurants, food trucks, boutiques and other businesses line the neighborhood and many transit options (bus, light rail, and even streetcar) are nearby.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b3736be3-df2e-4d39-9892-646b5916bba4.jpg',7883814,25,'45.50637','-122.64771',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,145.00,3,10,35,5.00,50196569),(2193,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50210782','30 day + Stays at This Bright,  LIGHT 2 Bdrm GEM','15% DISCOUNT APPLIED<br /><br />Welcome to this lovely light-filled apartment in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant neighborhood! You\'ll be steps away from excellent restaurants, amenities, and entertainment.. <br /><br />This apartment is near Belmont, Hawthorne, and Laurelhurst park. Enjoy plenty of natural light and all the comforts of home. Whether you\'re here for business or pleasure, you\'ll love the convenience and charm of this prime location in the heart of it all! Book NOW 20% discount automatically applies!','The neighborhood is very charming w/ big beautiful trees and steps away from shops and restaurants!<br /><br />You are in a city so you may hear street noises but nothing loud as we\'re off a side street. So you shouldn\'t hear bar noises but do want you to know that city living can have sounds :)<br /><br />This property is in SE Portland, NOT in NW Portland (DOWNTOWN) but very close to a lot of \"Portland Style\" things to do.  To be honest this is my favorite area in Portland and I\'ve lived here for 11 years.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50210782/original/a61a8b5b-c1fe-4b11-b3d8-45b10060f38b.jpeg',2407869,16,'45.51611','-122.63402',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,31,366,110,4.77,50210782),(2194,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50212157','BRIGHT COTTAGE STYLE APARTMENT | ON BELMONT','Available for monthly stays only - minimum of 31 nights. Beautiful and spacious cottage-style apartment on trendy Belmont. This is the perfect base for exploring Portland\'s East Side and is within walking distance to some of the best restaurants, cafes, brew-pubs, vintage boutiques and galleries. This is an awesome place to come home to after a long day out and is fully equipped for remote working.','Belmont is a very trendy and creative neighborhood in SE Portland.  You\'re walking distance to so many amazing restaurants, cafes, bars, shops and galleries on Belmont and Hawthorne streets. This particular area stays pretty quiet and is very laid-back, making it the perfect easy home-base.Downtown, Sellwood, NE Portland and the Pearl District are easily accessible by bike or car.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50212157/original/09928f3d-736d-4cfa-9631-50cd41e502c0.jpeg',1185199,16,'45.51751','-122.62058',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,31,90,77,4.84,50212157),(2195,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50241524','Sellwood-Westmoreland Urban Guesthouse','This former 2-car detached garage has been transformed into a quiet and secluded private ~500 sq. ft. one-bedroom apartment Guesthouse. There is a private backyard with a covered patio and garden. Full kitchen, coat closet and bedroom closet. Located a few blocks walking distance to mostly everything with a walking score of 91 out of 100. Great places to eat, shop, parks, movie theatre only a couple of blocks away. A 9-min. walk to MAX train and 4 min. to bus stop. Free on-street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ebda668c-e830-4b16-9bb7-9e80a56f01a6.jpg',405603990,20,'45.47233','-122.64614',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,14,78,4.99,50241524),(2196,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50248316','Bright, Private & Cozy with Yard','Relax in this private, bright and cozy studio space with fully fenced back yard. Nestle up by the outdoor fire, or enjoy a beautiful sunset under the covered patio. Equipped with TV, WiFi, and FireStick so you can connect to your favorite shows easily. Kitchen has microwave, mini-refrigerator,  induction stove, dishwasher, and all of the supplies you would expect! Enjoy cozy Brooklinen bedding (it\'s the best!). Full bathroom with washer/dryer, walk-in shower, and ultra soft bath towels!','I am located in the Lents neighborhood, one block from Lents park. We are very close to many excellent locations for food, coffee, hiking, etc. We are blocks from primary bus routes and the max line. Lents park has multiple sport fields, and is the home of the Portland Pickles baseball team. We are 3 miles from the Powell Butte Nature Park with excellent trails and views of both Mt. Hood and Mt. St. Helens. We are 10-15 minutes from the Portland airport, and easy access to the freeway.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50248316/original/a86d0a3f-565e-4f4e-8ae7-ba7a933832bb.jpeg',78142863,72,'45.48581190816124','-122.57441030784686',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,86.00,1,365,154,4.99,50248316),(2197,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50260406','Colorful Room in Craftsman Guest House','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3d6db75d-1c6e-4738-93c7-b3f10893b68a.jpg',501715,29,'45.55782','-122.64836',2,1,3.00,1.00,1.00,34.00,30,180,1,5.00,50260406),(2198,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50262729','Freshly renovated 2bd   place close to airport .','This stylish place to stay is perfect for group trips.<br />  5 minutes to airport.<br />  15 minutes to downtown Portland.<br />  Easy access to freeway I205.<br /> Short walk to bus stop.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b1fc3eb8-142c-45ed-95ff-843ed9fe4ee4.jpg',312469677,80,'45.56079','-122.57815',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,78.00,1,60,83,4.57,50262729),(2199,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50288693','Spacious, Cozy, Artsy Flat w/ New Bathroom!','Located in the heart of inner Eastside Portland, you\'ll enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place. Many of Portland\'s best restaurants, coffee shops, breweries, and parks are within easy walking distance.<br /><br />This is a wonderful space and we put a lot of love into it... complete with a new bathroom and A/C. <br /><br />The space is great for couples, solo adventures, and business travelers who are looking for a convenient home base with easy access to all the Eastside has to offer.','The Kerns neighborhood is one of the most centrally located within Portland. This artsy part of town hosts many international restaurants both on 28th Avenue and Burnside Street, while hip cocktail bars and pubs mix with coffee shops and vintage-clothing outlets. Green spaces include riverside Eastbank Esplanade, with its floating walkway, and there are play areas in tree-shaded Oregon Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-50288693/original/fad4c431-d68e-450f-b15a-d13d357706d1.jpeg',48600979,12,'45.524353','-122.644806',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,2,1125,105,4.93,50288693),(2200,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50292843','Big, Bright, Beautiful Home in Desirable Area!','This is a gorgeous and spacious modern home with lots of colorful touches that really set it apart. <br /><br />Huge, well-equipped kitchen; bright and cozy common spaces, bedrooms with their own unique style, an office complete with sit/stand desk, and access to EV charging capabilities.<br /><br />We have endeavored to make sure you have everything you need to enjoy your stay here. You will love being so central, yet tucked away in the beautiful, and safe Richmond neighborhood with a walk score of 90!','Located between Division and Powell, this home is surrounded by nightlife, delicious eateries, shopping and plenty of people watching -  yet is also tucked back in a safe, quiet and clean neighborhood full of charm, beautiful gardens and stately Portland homes. <br />It\'s the perfect mix for any traveler!<br /><br />This is a great location!<br /><br />It\'s just a 10 min walk to the pubs and eateries on Division St, as well as 20 min walk to the desirable, Hawthorne District, with plenty to keep the whole family occupied! You will find a well-equipped local Theater, ample thrift and boutique shopping, delicious dining, nightlife and coffee to name just a few!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/26134391-6fcc-49d1-9f81-246d39badd7d.jpg',222322282,8,'45.49895','-122.63301',1,6,3.00,4.00,4.00,200.00,30,175,12,5.00,50292843),(2201,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50293008','Blue Door at the Heart of Mississippi Ave','Experience the luxury of the Blue Door Loft, a newly built and bright loft located just one block away from Portland\'s famous Mississippi Ave. Immerse yourself in the local scene as you take a one minute walk to Mississippi\'s outstanding restaurants, bars, boutiques, and coffee shops that make Portland truly special. We\'d argue being the best located Airbnb in Portland!','Mississippi St. is famous for its unique bars, shops and restaurants. Enjoy wandering the neighborhood for some of the best food, coffee, cocktails and boutique shopping Portland has to offer! We are also just an 8 minute drive to Downtown Portland and 5 minutes from The Moda Center (home of the Trail Blazers).','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50293008/original/cd7e7e8f-99eb-4ca4-888a-d4a22fe2daa5.jpeg',212650552,9,'45.54861','-122.67465',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,30,365,46,4.80,50293008),(2202,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50312370','Beautiful Waterfront Pearl Condo, View,  w/Parking','Beautiful Waterfront Pearl condo with full views of Willamette River.  Top floor unit set back about 50 feet from the river with paved path access to the river.  2-level condo, with loft style bedroom accommodating a full King Bedroom set.  Stylishly remodeled, including His and Hers offices.   Steps away from the Pool and Jacuzzi.  Dedicated covered  parking spot.  Couple hundred feet from market for beer and wine and walking distance to world famous Pearl District with unique restaurants.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50312370/original/263f039e-1ba8-40c1-bf80-021aebe74566.jpeg',27903183,43,'45.53096','-122.67347',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,30,1125,4,5.00,50312370),(2203,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50331334','Modern Alberta Arts District private apartment!','Modern private getaway in desirable Alberta Arts District! <br />This private apartment is located on a quiet street just steps away from shops, restaurants, and art galleries. This modern apartment features 1 bedroom, 1 bath with a cozy living area equipped with a 4k LED smart TV and a full kitchen.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a01d82c5-61db-4bca-92f7-d31902710f8e.jpg',404975802,1,'45.56025','-122.63392',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,2,28,125,4.98,50331334),(2204,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50337871','Luxury craftsman 5 bedroom Sullivan\'s Gulch home','Classic and elegant, this Sullivan\'s Gulch getaway is ideal for groups, families, or work retreats. Inside, new meets old. Built in 1906 this custom craftsman is equipped with a movie theater, 5 bedrooms, smart devices, and ample, plush living spaces.<br /><br />Two fireplaces and a chef\'s kitchen, including a Viking range and farm style sink, exemplify this unique travel experience. Located conveniently close to Downtown, NW shopping, and historic Irvington, this is a “must stay” while in Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50337871/original/30c3b339-56fc-4711-aced-b0f0e8794826.jpeg',8552848,4,'45.53266','-122.64626',1,10,3.00,5.00,5.00,270.00,30,90,5,5.00,50337871),(2205,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50342821','The Étoile Suite ~ Nob Architecture & Boutiques','Situated in the bustling and vibrant neighborhood of Slabtown in NW Portland, this conveniently located home places you just steps away from the city\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. With so much to see and do in this trendy and exciting area, you\'ll want to extend your trip just to fully explore all the neighborhood has to offer. Whether you\'re a foodie, a shopaholic, or simply looking to experience Portland\'s vibrant nightlife, this is the perfect location for you.','Welcome to your stay in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant and eclectic Alphabet District, one of the city\'s most coveted neighborhoods. Located on NW 23rd St, this prime spot offers an unbeatable blend of urban excitement and historic charm.<br /><br />NW 23rd Street, also known as \"Trendy Third,\" is renowned for its diverse array of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and unique boutique shops. Whether you’re in the mood for a gourmet meal, a casual coffee, or an afternoon of shopping, everything is just steps away. Indulge in culinary delights from local favorites such as Salt & Straw, known for its inventive ice cream flavors, or savor a meal at one of the many farm-to-table restaurants lining the street.<br /><br />For those who appreciate the arts, the area is brimming with cultural experiences. The nearby Portland Art Museum and the various art galleries along NW 23rd Avenue offer a taste of the city’s vibrant art scene. The neighborhood also hosts numerous events and festivals thro','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50342821/original/7d82b8c6-a678-4933-b6dc-b8c464994485.jpeg',33606696,27,'45.53511','-122.6981',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,78.00,2,365,368,4.74,50342821),(2206,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50342994','The Tournesol Suite ~ Leisurely Strolls on NW 23rd','Situated in the bustling and vibrant neighborhood of Slabtown in NW Portland, this conveniently located home places you just steps away from the city\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. With so much to see and do in this trendy and exciting area, you\'ll want to extend your trip just to fully explore all the neighborhood has to offer. Whether you\'re a foodie, a shopaholic, or simply looking to experience Portland\'s vibrant nightlife, this is the perfect location for you.','Nestled in the vibrant and charming neighborhood of Northwest Portland. This area, known for its blend of historic charm and modern conveniences, offers an exceptional urban living experience.<br /><br />Situated in the heart of the Alphabet District, your stay will be surrounded by tree-lined streets and beautifully preserved historic homes. Just a short stroll away is NW 23rd Avenue, one of Portland’s most popular shopping and dining destinations. Known locally as “Trendy Third,” this bustling street is lined with an eclectic mix of boutique shops, gourmet restaurants, cozy cafes, and lively bars. Whether you’re in the mood for a culinary adventure, a leisurely brunch, or a day of shopping, NW 23rd has something for everyone.<br /><br />Nature enthusiasts will appreciate the proximity to several of Portland’s most beloved parks. Washington Park, home to the famous International Rose Test Garden, Japanese Garden, and Oregon Zoo, offers a peaceful escape and numerous walking trails. Fo','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50342994/original/32b10738-5a66-442e-85de-2d28d7118522.jpeg',33606696,27,'45.53334','-122.69815',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,77.00,2,365,282,4.84,50342994),(2207,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50348348','The Nest, Gated Property w/ Park views. Fast Wi-Fi','Come stay at our beautiful home in the sky!  1 bedroom apt above the garage in our back yard overlooking Fernhill Park. All the trees make you feel like you are in the forest not the city! Short walk to groceries, restaurants and the world famous McMenamins Kennedy School. Quick bike ride or walk to the fun Alberta Street neighborhood with Salt and Straw, Bollywood, Bamboo Sushi and more!! Dog friendly (1) well behaved dog allowed with crate. No puppies and no smoking on property. =)','The nest is located on Fernhill Park. My favorite park in NE Portland! It has tennis courts, a nice walking/running track, and an amazing huge off leash dog park. Close to everything. 15-20 min to downtown and the same to PDX airport.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2fb5818e-e589-4306-bf00-5e6c67298215.jpg',345383116,1,'45.56699','-122.62606',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,28,90,48,4.96,50348348),(2208,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50385218','Private retreat in beautiful Southwest Portland.','Enjoy some peace and quiet with easy access to everything. We offer our downstairs apartment for your stay in beautiful Portland. <br />Uber anywhere within 10-15 minutes to take in the Portland life and get to Tryon Creek park in 5 minutes. This is a lovely Portland residential neighborhood. Very walkable and friendly. We are not interested in hosting parties. We offer a real (and great) bed in the bedroom and an air mattress in case more folks wish to stay over in the spacious livingroom.','Lovely residential neighborhood with an urban feel.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50385218/original/292f7950-31d2-4a2b-8016-ba167233c784.jpeg',5777981,28,'45.46672','-122.68698',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,89.00,2,30,0,1.00,50385218),(2209,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50404262','THE SPOT ON PRESCOTT: A NE PDX Artist Oasis','Welcome to the The Spot on Prescott! We\'re so glad you\'re here. :) Located in the heart of NE Alberta Arts District, you’re just blocks from some of the city’s best restaurants, parks, breweries, coffee shops and shopping. If you are looking for a hotel experience, and a space with artistry and flare, you’ve come to the right place!<br /><br />* Please note, this property doesn’t accommodate kids or pets.','A CLOSER LOOK AT THE NEIGHBORHOOD<br /><br />You’ll be staying in the heart of NE Portland, close to parks, restaurants, and shops!<br /><br />3 blocks from Alberta St (shops, restaurants, co-op, food truck pod, galleries<br /><br />5 blocks from Whole Foods, 0.4 mi<br /><br />3 blocks from Alberta Cooperative Grocery 0.3 mi<br /><br />A couple doors up on the corner of Prescott & 15th: Capitola Coffee, VilleVelo Bakery, Daisy, Grain & Gristle, Momiji sushi<br /><br />Parks (Sabin - 0.2 mi, Irving - 0.6 mi, Alberta - 0.7 mi, King 0.5 mi) - park blanket and cooler provided!<br /><br />Farmers Market (King: Sunday 10am - 2pm, 0.4 mi)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6a9c1ad5-ada1-4090-9715-852bcc7509f2.jpg',1840596,6,'45.55575','-122.65137',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,1125,48,5.00,50404262),(2210,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50413730','Stylish Open Studio | Mins to ❤ of Portland','Located within a charming Westmoreland bungalow home is this separate private studio just a short 7-minute drive to the heart of Portland.<br /><br />The studio features soft comfortable furnishings, access to streaming apps on the Smart TV, a fully equipped kitchenette, a sparkling full bathroom, and a spacious living area with a modern open plan design.<br /><br />Walk or bike to coffee shops, grocery stores, restaurants, breweries and the popular Westmoreland Park all right on your doorstep.','From its manicured green parks to its deliciously diverse restaurants and cafes, Portland overflows with cultural offerings. Browse through the stacks at Powell\'s City of Books then sample beers with over 100 craft breweries in the Portland metro area alone. <br /><br />Enjoy the city on foot with some of the most pedestrian-friendly streets in the country, many of which are lined with food carts that have given Portland some of the best, most affordable and diverse street food anywhere.<br />Adrenaline and nature lovers have plenty of trails for hiking and biking (miles of them are found in Forest Park), as well as access to water sports along the Willamette, Columbia and the volcanic Mount Hood.<br /><br /> Portland also delights its visitors with the simple things in life, a sip of locally roasted coffee, a late afternoon chat at a brewery, a stroll through open art galleries or just sitting by the water and watching the world go by.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3fb7894b-d41c-43b5-b053-ba913f38c476.jpg',30153456,20,'45.48446','-122.64589',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,39.00,1,29,135,4.87,50413730),(2211,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50419631','Modern Apartment/Great Location','Beautiful modern Apartment with great walkability.   2 blocks from NE Williams, close to Mississippi area and Alberta district.  Easy private self entry with code. Plenty of free on street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/dc0d6f58-56e7-477d-835c-f08b724f59bf.jpg',11482545,9,'45.54891','-122.6632',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,360,18,4.78,50419631),(2212,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50467427','Studio In Lively Nob Hill Neighborhood','Fourth floor corner cozy studio with lots of natural light, clawfoot tub and a walk in closet. Walk out the front door into the vibrant NW Nob Hill neighborhood with cafes, popular restaurants, night life, boutiques, Cinema 21, and Trader Joes.  Only a 10 minute walk to Providence Park and a MAX Station. Street parking. No smoking.','Less than a 10 min drive to Washington Park with great hiking trails, the Rose Garden, the Portland Zoo, the Japanese Garden, Hoyt Arboretum, and the famous Pittock Mansion.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3805429b-b415-4798-a000-5d05f50ddc0f.jpg',66928057,27,'45.52706','-122.69538',1,4,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,0,1.00,50467427),(2213,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50484567','Guest Suite in Alphabet/NW District w A/C, Parking','Charge your electric vehicle in our driveway while you walk 1 block either direction to great restaurants, trendy bars, and world class shopping. The streetcar and a topnotch hospital are 5 blocks away. Trader Joes is next door and the entrance to one of the biggest urban parks, Washington Park, is a third of a mile away. This 1 bdrm guest room in a large single family home that has a private entrance, kitchenette, no shared spaces with household, backyard access, and driveway parking.','This neighborhood is popular both among locals and tourists. Our Portland pride shows in the local breweries, locally owned restaurants, and unique (non-chain) boutiques on 23rd Ave. Please see our Visitors\' Guide for recommendations.<br /><br />This block has a walk-score of 97 of 100. You\'ll also find Trader Joe\'s one block over and Fred Meyer 5 blocks away. This neighborhood is alphabetically ordered south to north and numbered with the lowest numbers the closer you get to the downtown/the Willamette River.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e7f0d22d-cc95-414a-80d9-d4fe613d081f.jpg',8525373,27,'45.52511','-122.69574',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,88.00,1,4,169,4.84,50484567),(2214,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50542873','Woodstock Apartment','Newly constructed and furnished in 2021. Just a few blocks away from Woodstock Blvd, and a short drive or bike ride from Division and Hawthorne, this apartment gives you easy access to all of Southeast Portland\'s best spots and features! With a keyless entry, two deck areas, private hot tub and a full kitchen, your stay will be easy and comfortable.','Quiet, family centric neighborhood with many dining and recreation options within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50542873/original/147e8ccf-4e46-4ec1-8b6c-014b391437f8.jpeg',236211324,38,'45.48645','-122.61354',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,169.00,2,21,74,5.00,50542873),(2215,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50549203','Brand new condo in the lovely Mississippi Area','We are happy to welcome you to our guest suite, your very own home from home with a private entrance. You will have a spacious studio all to yourself with your own entrance, a separate closet/laundry room (with washer and dryer) and a bathroom with both bath & shower. You can also enjoy a full kitchen with oven, hob, fridge, freezer, microwave, dining table (extendable to accommodate remote working) and sofa. There is also plenty of storage space should you need it.','he Mississippi District in North Portland has the Bohemian, hipster vibe that visitors usually attribute to Portland. In the spirit of Keeping Portland Weird, the city is divided into quadrants – five of them. North Portland juts out from Northeast, and Mississippi Street is one of the most adorable parts of the quadrant.<br /><br />The district is readily accessible from downtown on the #4 TriMet bus; disembark at about Mississippi and Beech. Stroll down the street and enjoy the independently-owned shops, diverse eateries and uber-Portland bar scene. You will get the true Portland experience! This is where the locals hang out.<br /><br />The boutique shopping scene can’t be beat, with a slightly more eclectic vibe than Portland’s trendy Nob Hill or the Pearl District. Score some tax-free treasures to take home from Gumbo Gifts (family-friendly curios, etc.). You can find all your favorite books at Another Read Through. Or talk to the owners of Sunlan Lighting about the best bulbs for ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6494442e-12cb-4328-b3e5-aaf156650088.jpg',1631616,24,'45.555222','-122.67627',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,13,5.00,50549203),(2216,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50549734','Eastside Hideaway; 1 Month to 6 Months/One Dog','Welcome to a stylish, private apartment of 452 sq. ft., closed off at the back of a house. Facing a private fenced backyard and small deck, it has a keyless entry.  It\'s quiet and peaceful, with a small sleeping room, office/snug, kitchen/lounge, and private bathroom. You can really cook meals here! Walks with views of Mt Hood, Rocky Butte, & Mt Tabor. Nearby: Montavilla, Hollywood District, restaurants,  food carts, buses, The MAX, and the airport. Owner contact & rental agreement required.','The Rose City Golf Course, practically in my backyard, provides an active location that people walk, run, bike, and walk dogs around. It\'s a lovely public course with beautiful trees and rolling greens, backing up to the Alameda Ridge. Using the road that goes through the course to the top of the Alameda Ridge, you\'ll find beautiful, interesting homes and tree-lined streets leading to Sandy Blvd, restaurants like Pizzeria Otto, groceries, and more. Head East, and you can walk to Dharma Rain Zen Center, or Mekong Bistro, Pho Oregon Restaurant, and more. Head South and you can walk to Halsey and The Barley Pod food carts, or Glisan with its bakery, restaurants, and more. The MAX station is a short walk from the house.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50549734/original/077c745a-add5-43b6-b8aa-04df9790f965.jpeg',85763112,74,'45.53854','-122.58325',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,49.00,30,180,48,4.90,50549734),(2217,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50592918','Best Location! Private Jacuzzi & Sauna!','Brand new remodeled home in the best location (Hoyt Aboratorium). Private sauna and jacuzzi!<br /><br />Walking distance to:<br /> Rose Gardens<br />Washington Park<br />Japanese Gardens<br />Portlands Children Park/Muesuem<br />Washington Park Tennis Courts<br />Main trail heads to Wildowood and countless trails<br /><br />Only a 5 minute drive to the pearl and 23rd ave with all shops and nights life! <br /><br />amenities:<br />Jacuzzi/sauna <br />Dog wash <br />Kids games<br />fooseball <br />Cornhole<br />Bocce ball <br />PingPong','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50592918/original/21824b07-ca8b-4c97-8407-701783434e33.jpeg',50556182,64,'45.52215','-122.70893',1,8,2.00,2.00,3.00,699.00,30,365,32,4.81,50592918),(2218,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50595305','Centrally located 1 BR condo with King bed & W/D','This beautifully furnished, centrally located apartment has everything you need!  With a walk score of 98, transit score of 95, and bike score of 93, you can get around the city with ease. This 2nd floor unit is located within walking distance of the best restaurants and shopping in downtown Portland and the Pearl District, PSU, across the street from a Safeway, and directly on the Portland streetcar line.  Amenities include king bed, dedicated work space, stocked kitchen, and in unit w/d.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50595305/original/dfc17aa4-c5f9-488b-bb5e-8e708e2ed561.jpeg',41664565,44,'45.51638','-122.68509',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,30,365,5,5.00,50595305),(2219,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50621273','Master size privet room monthly rent','Rent out a Master size private room in a near Portland\'s attractions. This private room , located on the second floor Enjoy easy access to Montavilla bars and restaurants, or take a leisurely walk to the top of Mt. Tabor Park for stunning city views during your picnic. The home is conveniently situated near the airport, downtown, public transit, and major freeways, making it an ideal starting point for exploring everything Portland has to offer.','The home is close to shopping, restaurants, and PDX airport. There are several beautiful parks nearby, including Mt. Tabor with hiking and biking trails and beautiful vistas. Take a short drive and explore the Pittock Mansion (20 min.) or the Japanese Gardens (20 min). Go shopping on Belmont St. or Hawthorne Blvd. Or, stay close to the house, avoid the crowds, and bike to The Grotto, eat at the Observatory, and have dessert at Pinolo Gelato.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/27c24233-e9ee-4c10-ba50-23ace076de9f.jpg',380057237,10,'45.516037','-122.578171',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,38.00,31,1125,5,5.00,50621273),(2220,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50641137','Artist\'s Charming Craftsman 2nd floor space','Charming Craftsman house with private, 2nd floor apt. located in the creative Alberta Arts district. Walk to many coffee shops, restaurants, and boutique shopping. Also, enjoy this bike street with a City Bike stand two blocks away. This sun-lit apartment has all of the amenities you need with a large bedroom, a large bathroom and a kitchen with a full washer and dryer. Enter in the front door with your own private covered front porch.  It\'s lovely..','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/32e12da9-22d2-4c3c-9888-8c4b4a1c3e6e.jpg',608006,14,'45.55733','-122.65813',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,102.00,4,60,17,4.82,50641137),(2221,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50661616','Close-in but Secluded Private Guesthouse','Welcome to our private, quirky guesthouse in SE Portland\'s Ladd\'s Addition! Enjoy a dedicated bedroom, chef-friendly kitchen, fancy TV, and fast WiFi. Your own entrance leads to a secluded outdoor space. Despite the peace, you\'re steps from popular restaurants, bars, and local shops. As your on-site hosts, we\'re here if needed, otherwise, we respect your privacy. Perfect for leisure or business trips, this is your tranquil haven in the heart of the city.  High-quality HEPA filter on site.','Hosford-Abernathy is an eclectic neighborhood that is bordered by Hawthorne and Division- two of the most happening areas in SE Portland. With a 95% walkabilty score, you can reach restaurants, bars, boutiques, grocers and more within a 5 minute stroll from the property.<br /><br />* 10 minutes by foot from the Aladdin<br />* 8-10 minutes by foot from Jacqueline, Nuestra Cocina, and Yama Sushi<br />* 5 minutes by foot to New Seasons<br />* 5 minutes by Lyft/Uber/Auto to Revolution Hall<br />* 10 minutes by Lyft/Uber/Auto to OHSU<br />* 20 minutes by foot to A Roadside Attraction (3 minutes by Lyft/Uber/Auto)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-50661616/original/24511557-9acf-4822-bcc4-3316b267cc19.jpg',187129548,25,'45.504926373426294','-122.64973281375545',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,106.00,1,31,200,4.91,50661616),(2222,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50663158','Artist\'s Modern & Serene Home in the Alberta Arts','Situated on a bike street two blocks from the famous Alberta Street. This beautiful and spacious indoor/outdoor living space has three skylights with an open floor plan for comfortable and easy living. And the kitchen is designed for the gourmet with a steam oven and a Deloghni coffee/espresso machine!<br /><br />In the summer you\'ll find tomatoes, herbs, blueberries and figs in the garden for your pleasure! Enjoy eating inside or outside under the pavilion or under the fig tree!','Our neighborhood is fantastic with some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bakeries, boutique shops and festivals. Alberta Street is three blocks away for easy access to everything. To mention a few, Petite Provence to indulge in fresh pastries; Salt and Straw for the most unique ice creams; many boutique shops, foot wear shops, art galleries, and a coffee shop on every corner. On the corner of 30th and Killingsworth is a network of great restaurants! If you are here on the last Thursday of the month in the summer, Alberta street shuts out car traffic and vendors with jewelry, pottery, artworks, food carts, dancers and street musicians fill the street for the festive \'Last Thursday\'. Every Sunday from May to November, one block away from our house is a farmers market between 10am to 2pm with music, local foods and seafood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/60b3e5df-4056-44be-933c-39ab28d9608b.jpg',608006,14,'45.55717','-122.65642',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,156.00,6,90,10,4.60,50663158),(2223,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50674898','charming 1926 portland 2-bedroom bungalow','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.','just on the edge of the heart if richmond, a classic se portland bungalow neighborhood. steps from se division (10-15 walk depending on destination) and the many fine dining establishments as wells as bars/tasting rooms, etc. — se hawthorne is a 12 minute walk further north.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ad0bb7d2-0531-4a31-b37b-1cfdb958e90c.jpg',152385858,8,'45.50191','-122.61277',1,3,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,5,5.00,50674898),(2224,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50703679','Beautiful Alberta Guesthouse | Full Amenities + AC','Come & enjoy this custom-built, detached guesthouse in the famous Alberta Arts District. Our guests will find a peaceful retreat awaiting them in this open & bright, modern space featuring beautiful architecture with all the amenities one looks for during their PDX getaway. <br /><br />Inside, you will find a full kitchen, washer & dryer, AC, smart tv, fast wifi, a spa-like bathroom & more thoughtful touches to give you the perfect spot to rest and recharge in between your Portland adventures!','Alberta Street, the main drag through the neighborhood, has many newly renovated retail storefronts and restaurant space. These are mixed in with older businesses that have been there forever. The shopping area can now only be considered trendy. There is a strong focus on indie designers, handcrafted items, and boutique shops.<br /><br />Most of the shops lining Alberta Street highlight handmade local designer clothing, paper mache’ lamps, and imported gifts from afar. Alberta art galleries and shops showcase some fine local work. Smattered throughout are the requisite Portland coffee houses, seemingly one for each counter culture – there are no rules in Portland about having too many coffee shops on one street, and Alberta is no exception. You won’t find a Starbucks on Alberta, though, as it just wouldn’t seem to fit into the quirky individuality of the place.<br /><br />At first glance, the name “Alberta Arts District” may seem a little overstated when taking into account the number ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-50703679/original/4009a6e5-50d6-4d12-b71b-931390950b0e.jpeg',215058058,1,'45.55856705','-122.63024902',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,131.00,2,365,148,4.98,50703679),(2225,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50726900','Modern Stylish 2 bdr Home Alberta Arts District','This newly remodeled 2 bedroom home in the heart of Alberta district, offers new furnishings, a private back patio, and very fun technology such as speaker lights and defogging light up mirrors. We also provide great sized tvs and a comfy space to relax after a day of exploring. You will be within 5 min walking distance of amazing food, shops, and tourist attractions like Salt & Straw.  Public transit runs right along Alberta  and freeway access is a breeze! At only 10 mins to downtown.','Quiet and safe neighborhood. 92 score walk! A ton of food and shopping options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/567df555-ffc5-429f-91e8-80828e46ca4c.jpg',116018201,6,'45.55523','-122.64698',2,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,152.00,2,28,67,4.87,50726900),(2226,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50743758','Stunning 5th floor 2 bed/2bath condo','ONE MONTH MINIMUM STAY  in this Stunning space fully furnished in heart of NW Portland. Views, space, privacy everything you could need for your stay in Portland','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50743758/original/d0dac585-b41c-4cdd-95e4-45a14be15037.jpeg',410071283,3,'45.52212','-122.68939',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,60,0,1.00,50743758),(2227,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50749438','Delightful Room in Newly Updated Bungalow','Come enjoy this stylish, nicely appointed and well-equipped home in the peaceful Portsmouth neighborhood.  Just blocks from beautiful Columbia Park, and a quick drive/bike ride to University of Portland.  You’ll enjoy a cozy private bedroom with a king size bed. The bathroom, kitchen and living room are shared spaces, but much of the time you will have them all to yourselves. This home is also available to reserve as an unshared space. Check out our other listing if interested.','The Portsmouth neighborhood is a quiet gem in the heart of NoPo.  You can easily walk, ride a bike, or take public transit anywhere in the city.  Portland’s beautiful 35-acre Columbia Park is only two blocks away. Restaurants and bars are within walking distance and University of Portland is a quick 5 minute drive, only 1.3 miles from the house.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50749438/original/2dc9fb29-bc15-4ac1-8ef7-b88e0a06b4b2.jpeg',17742907,60,'45.58301','-122.7138',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,59.00,1,10,75,4.97,50749438),(2228,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50757309','Delightful Tiny Retreat in Northeast Portland','Welcome to the Magnolia Tiny House! We hope you enjoy this truly unique experience in tiny, eco living in the Cully neighborhood of northeast Portland. After designing this house and living in it for over a year, we’ve decided to rent our home to long-term visitors. With over 8 years of private landlord experience, we look forward to working with you to make your stay in this delightful space the absolute best it can be. Please don’t hesitate to message us with any questions!','Just off 42nd Ave in the Cully neighborhood of northeast Portland, the Magnolia Tiny has easy access to both the I-205 and I-84 freeways (along Killingsworth and 33rd Ave), in addition to close access to the Fremont and Alberta Arts Districts by foot, bike or car.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50757309/original/8a81703e-ec1d-42a8-a73c-316ddf8d81d0.jpeg',9171462,21,'45.56067','-122.61539',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,73.00,30,1125,8,4.75,50757309),(2229,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50762121','Residential contemporary on Slyvan Hill','A modern contemporary up in the hills.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50762121/original/2d009d3b-2628-45bf-863f-0fc637c60b97.jpeg',4057428,62,'45.51653','-122.73817',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,167.00,31,365,2,2.50,50762121),(2230,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50770348','Mid-century Modern PDX Escape','Perfect location to explore PDX just blocks to Williamette River, OHSU & South Waterfront. Located in the Corbett neighborhood in the heart of John\'s Landing in South Portland. Walking to great shops, coffee/cafe\'s, pubs and restaurants in the area. Quick & easy access to downtown PDX, Sellwood, and southeast neighborhoods. Take in the iconic PNW forests, just blocks to incredible Marquam NatureTrail and Terwilliger Parkway Trail systems.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7990af7b-2d00-4116-bbf9-652e4906ed32.jpg',25190618,22,'45.48911','-122.67836',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,2,365,34,4.76,50770348),(2231,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50771560','Cascadia Hideaway: Dreamy 1-Bedroom Basement Suite','Private space in trendy NE Portland neighborhood. 15 minutes from PDX. Ideal for longer stays. <br /><br />City\'s best restaurants, bars, boutiques,  parks, situated among picturesque urban forest streets in the Alberta Arts, Vernon, and Woodland neighborhoods just beyond your doorstep.<br /><br />Comfortable space for up to 2 adults w/private entrance. Crib available. No shared spaces. Full-size kitchen, private laundry. Tesla fast charger onsite.','Fabulous inner urban eco-hipster neighborhood with exceptional restaurants just beyond your doorstep.  Multiple grocery stores within a 5-minute drive include 2 full-size organic grocers, Natural Grocers and New Seasons Market. Safeway and Walgreens also within a 10-minute walk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50771560/original/ba9c2823-46d9-4dd4-b5bf-89b36b0ae2f5.jpeg',390362157,29,'45.56449','-122.65161',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,31,365,106,4.96,50771560),(2232,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50793301','Family-friendly, Modern Apartment Next to Park','The apartment is new, clean, comfortable and modern. It is on the 1st floor of a 3 story townhouse. It is perfect for a small family getaway (public park w/ playground next door), business travel, or for a fun vacation. It is very close and walkable to several lively Portland areas (N Williams, Alberta Arts, Mississippi) and a quick drive to downtown PDX or the convention center. If you love visiting new cities and exploring the local area on foot, then you\'ll love this place!','The apartment in located in the King/Sabin neighborhood, walking distance to 4 different trendy Portland areas.  Close to two beautiful Portland parks.  4 blocks from MLK which has bakery/coffee shop- Bushel and Peck Bakeshop and one of Portland\'s shining stars in the food scene- Ned Ludd.  10 minute walk to adorable N Williams Ave with dozens of restaurants and bars.  0.6 mile from the vibrant Alberta Arts district. 1 mile to N Mississippi Ave. 0.5 mile from Whole Foods Market or New Seasons Market for groceries. Also don\'t miss the King Farmer\'s Market every Sunday (10am-2pm) just a few blocks from our place from May-November!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c33f1905-80bf-4ab3-9593-186151a93fbb.jpg',22843577,14,'45.55204','-122.65972',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,1,5.00,50793301),(2233,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50811298','Private urban retreat, new build, 1bedroom, sleep4','Relax in this calm, clean and simple space.  Enter in from the sidewalk fence to a little patio great for enjoying your coffee and some fresh air.  There is a full kitchen that opens into the living area with a skylight and high windows that offer great natural light.   Walk down the hall and enjoy the spacious bathroom with our provided bath tray for real relaxation.  Tuck yourself into bed and enjoy the stars or choose to black out windows using our automated shades for uninterrupted sleep.','Neighborhood has a few nice walkable coffee shops and restaurants.  A few of our favs to mention:<br /><br />Kiss Cafe / Tamale Boy / Ranch Pizza<br />Dekum triangle (coffee, pizza, brewery)<br />30th and Killingsworth (many restaurants, coffee, bars)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50811298/original/7ad95ca7-3f1f-447e-a962-677f40f6bcc4.jpeg',410702782,45,'45.57172','-122.64369',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,125.00,2,30,76,5.00,50811298),(2234,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50813090','✶ Vibrant Master Suite at Amorcito de Jenny ✶','Luxurious private suite in shared home. <br />Make a new friend by inviting another guest to one of the walkable neighborhood restaurant/bars.<br /><br />Soak in your private bath tub after a long day of exploring. There are two yoga mats for your yoga/workout practices!','Walking distance to neighborhood restaurants & bars: <br />Atlas Pizza, Off The Griddle, Da’ Hui Bar & Grill, Starday Tavern, 5 and Dime, Bar Carlo, Pieper Cafe, Henry Higgins Boiled Bagels, and more…','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-50813090/original/a25d2d87-1970-413a-8ff8-bbf56f962585.jpg',58415337,36,'45.48968','-122.59605',2,2,2.50,1.00,1.00,119.00,2,30,112,4.95,50813090),(2235,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50896749','Home on Hassalo: PDX Apt','Garden level apartment!<br /><br />Close to the airport, I-5 and I-205, a perfect landing pad to visit the city of Portland! 10 minutes to downtown, and 30 mins to the Scenic Columbia River Gorge<br /><br />1 bed 1 bath<br />- large transitional living space<br />- living room transforms into second bedroom w/ a futon for privacy !<br />- brand new kitchen, bath, and furniture<br />- equipped w/ countertop appliances + induction burner<br /><br />*Resident occupies main floor of home*<br /><br />*home is built in 1908, may have noise transfer*','Montavilla restaurants!<br />Mt Tabor<br />The Grotto<br />Kelly Butte <br />Gateway Greens <br />PDX Airport','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50896749/original/468a9cfd-b099-48fd-b11c-43aba5f2b33c.jpeg',1794276,10,'45.53226','-122.57771',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,3,150,35,4.77,50896749),(2236,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50898082','Bright and beautiful 2 bedroom Loft','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.  Our loft is located right in the heartbeat of Portland\'s greatest neighborhood - NW 23rd and Thurman. Surrounded by the cities best restaurants, shops, coffee houses, bars and grocery stores. Cozy, modern and perfect for your Uptown stay. Welcome!','AWESOME DAY ACTIVITIES  Colombia River Gorge Scenic FALLS: If you drive out on I 84, there are multiple falls along the way. (about 30 min away)  -Multnomah Falls is a must see.  You can park at Bridal Veil and take a short hike along the road, which is fun and it takes you to Multnomah Falls. Also, there’s a mile hike to the top of Multnomah that’s amazing. -Bridal Veil Falls -Latourell Falls (our favorite waterfall. It’s a short hike to the waterfall) -Swimming holes at Dougan Falls & Naked Falls in Washington. (amazing!!! Go during the week, it’s about 45 min away) -Day Hike at Forest Park!! Park at the Lower Mcleay Trail head, and head up the path. You will see a bridge above you called Thurman Street Bridge above you.  -Pittock Mansion has amazing views, you can actually hike up to it from Forest Park trails. -Portland Rose Garden  -The Zoo -Powell’s Book Store -Overlook Park (amazing views of the city, bring a picnic!) -Brewery tours (or rent a bike and just bike to them all over','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50898082/original/a91a298a-338c-49be-a7f9-ce5bed190142.jpeg',317918819,27,'45.53622','-122.70002',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,31,365,7,5.00,50898082),(2237,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50916194','Sunny one bedroom flat  with private yard','Clean, modern  1 bedroom apartment with patio and separate fenced yard from main house.<br /><br />* 5 night special $500<br />* 7 nights $650<br /><br />One queen bed but extra room for an air mattress if needed. <br /><br />Centrally located in SW Portland close to Hillsdale, 15 min. to downtown PDX, 18 min. to NIKE & downtown LO. & a 6 min. walk to a park. <br /><br />***minimum 3 night bookings <br /><br />*No smoking indoors.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50916194/original/d153cfeb-0117-4803-8c08-c9bc317ef58b.jpeg',411719178,17,'45.48213','-122.7317',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,107.00,30,1125,10,5.00,50916194),(2238,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50920934','Modern private space close to Mississippi Street','Cozy retreat right off of Mississippi Street - close to some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, coffee, and nightlife. Perfect place to stay for those visiting and experiencing Portland. Centrally-located, easy to get to other Portland hot spots.','Quiet street, very walkable neighborhood. Family-friendly, close to many Portland sights.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50920934/original/3f5e229b-a522-44d0-950d-10b213402440.jpeg',8325660,9,'45.54836170375843','-122.67685632597862',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,1,365,201,4.87,50920934),(2239,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50935439','The Solo Traveler\'s Backyard Garden Studio','Please read all the information for this listing to be sure it’s a good fit for you. <br /><br />The studio is located in the corner of the fully fenced and landscaped backyard of my 1910 house. The space is small,  about 240 square feet. Public transportation is nearby, including 2 bus stops within 5 minute walks and the MAX train about a 15 minute walk. Several restaurants and food carts are also walking distance.','This is an older residential neighborhood that began in the early 1900s as housing for the middle class and, despite some gentrification, it still has that flavor. Most of the neighbors are families. It is normally quiet and family-friendly but you will hear the noise typical of an urban city. It is safe to walk in day and night. There are several nearby restaurants within a half mile of the residence.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50935439/original/17023bb9-fc05-43e7-a318-675a4b3b625d.jpeg',65298032,13,'45.56599','-122.69447',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,66.00,2,5,197,4.94,50935439),(2240,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50941469','Walk to Everything | SouthEast, Mt Tabor','Walk to Hawthorne, Belmont, Division, Montavilla, or Mt Tabor Park from this Mt. Tabor neighborhood private unit. The unit is on the lower level of the host\'s home with its own entrance.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/03d560cc-f2c3-4f81-8c86-41ff7c42d6d5.jpg',7190217,15,'45.51698','-122.60937',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,59.00,30,60,5,5.00,50941469),(2241,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50951780','Charming Crafstman Suite with Sitting Area and AC!','Walk into this house and say \"Ahhhhhh. This is going to be a good visit.\" It is airy, light and beautiful. Thoughtfully arranged for real human beings. Comfortable. Inviting. Nestled in a classic Craftsman neighborhood, it is minutes from downtown by car, Max or frequent close bus. It is an easy walk to grocery stores, great restaurants and the most comfortable bar in town. This house is perfect for business folk or travelers.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-6712131/original/f2e4c94c-18e3-463c-a8dd-ad0ee9ee4d3f.jpeg',4256569,23,'45.53202','-122.63018',2,3,2.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,35,4.94,50951780),(2242,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50956404','Finch Studio Cottage in Montavilla','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway in the Montavilla neighborhood of Portland. Walking distance to boutique coffee shops, locally owned restaurants, art deco theatre, farmers market and an antique mall.','Montavilla residents have excellent access to the expansive, 190-acre, Mt Tabor Park in the adjacent Mt Tabor neighborhood, they also have a lovely park of their own. Established in 1921, Montavilla Park covers nearly 10-acres. The park has play structures, picnic areas, and paved paths. In 2014, the Portland Timbers sponsored the construction of a futsal field within the park.<br /><br />A wonderful mix of vintage shops, services, restaurants, and watering holes. Lonely Planet voted Montavilla one of the best neighborhoods in the country a few years ago. There are a handful of long-standing business anchors like Flying Pie Pizzeria opened 35 years ago in Montavilla, beloved Lebanese restaurant YaHala that opened in 1999, and BiPartisan Cafe, the neighborhood fixture for coffee and pie since 2004. <br /><br />A handful of small boutiques and vintage shops keep this commercial corridor active during the daytime too. Union Rose retails locally made wares, Cactus Records thrift store sell','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c81d8449-4a34-44e1-af01-db0896741bfd.jpg',412106184,10,'45.52077','-122.57452',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,78.00,2,28,204,5.00,50956404),(2243,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50961355','Private Entire Guest Suite Near Arts District','Cute one bedroom near the coolest streets in town! Located right in the Alberta Arts district, you are close to the easily walkable Alberta St. A few blocks away is Mississippi St, known for great food and shops. There is no shortage of amazing restaurants near by. <br /><br />The rental has its own private entrance with full kitchen, laundry and cozy sitting area. Our queen size memory foam mattress will help you relax after a day seeing the sites. With plentiful free on-street parking right in front.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50961355/original/29ff1987-84c4-4e4c-9c21-3c953759ec4e.jpeg',201285877,14,'45.55852','-122.66337',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,35,95,4.95,50961355),(2244,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50978165','Stunning Apartment in the Heart of Mississippi Ave','Unwind in minimalist heaven right in the heart of the Mississippi Ave!  A gorgeous sanctuary space in walking distance to Por Que No (best street tacos in PDX!), Psychic Bar, Ecliptic and Stormbreaker Brewing, blue star donuts, shops, food carts, all the things!  You get the idea.. You won\'t want to leave ;-) <br /><br />This private Apartment with its own entrance completely separate from the rest of the property is your place to let the stress of life fall away and reconnect to what matters most.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50978165/original/b4c98e5e-709b-4817-bcee-469392fea16f.jpeg',17150339,9,'45.54978','-122.67435',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,180,166,4.89,50978165),(2245,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51003577','2 Bedroom Home near Mississippi Ave','Entire 2 bed house just blocks from trendy Mississippi Ave. You\'ll be a short walk to all of the restaurants, bars, and shopping on Mississippi, Alberta, and Williams, while still enjoying a quiet street. Amazing produce at Cherry Sprout Market and lovely brunch and dinner at Sweedeedee is just steps away! <br /><br />20 minute drive from PDX Airport, 10 minute drive to downtown Portland with easy street parking.','Our home is within a 10 minute walk to shopping and dining on Mississippi and Williams Avenue. Peninsula Park rose garden is a short walk away as well. This gorgeous, historic neighborhood has all the amenities you\'ll need while being centrally located to all of Portland!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51003577/original/0449a5b7-8ec1-4b39-89fe-79855e17cccd.jpeg',516025,24,'45.56043','-122.67445',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,120,12,4.83,51003577),(2246,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51004521','Portland\'s Finest - Luxury Pearl District 4 BR','Location, location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore ® of 96/100, this modern, newly furnished four bedroom Portland  can sleep up to 8 people comfortably. Our home is nestled between the Pearl District and Alphabet District in Northwest Portland, which boast some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. For guests that enjoy the outdoors, we\'re just minutes away from Forest Park\'s many hiking trails.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51004521/original/6641e732-5da7-4904-9f40-dcb883aa9171.jpeg',356211715,27,'45.53163','-122.68872',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,270.00,1,365,198,4.86,51004521),(2247