rbnb.com/rooms/51021251','Cozy & Modern FoPo Private Rooms, Self Check-In!','Newly built modern home, filled with plenty of space and convenient features to make your trip as comfortable as possible. I am central of Portland\'s southeast neighborhood which is filled with lots of charm and some of the town\'s best bars, restaurants, shops and more. This listing is for two of three rooms available for rent at this property.<br /><br />• 15 - 20 min from Downtown<br />• 10 - 15 min from Hawthorne Blvd.<br />• 10 - 15 min from Belmont St. <br />• 10 - 15 min from Mt. Tabor Park','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51021251/original/a91519b7-5dfc-49a5-b298-c9ae0ab63507.jpeg',260686384,65,'45.483272552490234','-122.60054779052734',2,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,64.00,1,30,117,4.99,51021251),(2251,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51038508','☆ Sun filled in heart of DWTN Portland #allwelcome','• 350 Sq. Ft. loft styled apartment on the 6th floor<br />• Onsite laundry located on the same floor<br />• Located in Downtown PDX<br />     //walking\\\\<br />          • MAX Light Rail (3 mins)<br />          • Food carts (5 mins)<br />          • Lime scooters/ bikes<br />     //driving\\\\<br />           • Chinese Garden (8 mins)<br />           • Saturday Market (10 mins)<br />           • Forest Park (10 mins)<br />• Kitchen amenities for a comfortable stay<br />•Walk score - 91 / Transit score - 88 / Bike score - 91','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51038508/original/3b8d4818-2588-4cd6-a58b-b70645dafabf.jpeg',412930905,44,'45.50708','-122.682175',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,336.00,30,30,15,4.93,51038508),(2252,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51038540','Ross Island Rooftop 2-bedroom with All the Views','Perched on the east side of the Ross Island Bridge with views of the Willamette River, Downtown Portland and the West Hills, this 2-bdrm, 2nd floor unit is dressed to impress. Open floor plan gives this bright cozy space a sense of grandeur. Private, spacious balcony; an oasis for guests to relax and enjoy the cool evening air with BBQ, Bluetooth speakers, table/seating, lighting, and vegetation. Easy access to Downtown and OHSU. Just blocks from eastside music, microbrews, restaurants, coffee.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f6e89186-428b-445f-9ad9-d49590effe7e.jpg',158074447,56,'45.5007','-122.65835',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,97.00,31,1125,7,4.43,51038540),(2253,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51059075','Urban Forest Getaway','Escape to a quintessential SW Portland tiny house, nestled in a wooded setting yet just 8-10 minutes from downtown Portland.  This is the perfect urban oasis! Relax on a peaceful deck surrounded by trees or read a book in front of the fire. This tiny house living experience is equipped with WiFi and a full kitchen, perfect for a weekend getaway.','Quiet SW neighborhood with east 1-5 access.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51059075/original/5c6947f9-f624-4750-86f2-77dd757c2db2.jpeg',79941643,34,'45.45576010570618','-122.73694560167738',1,4,1.00,2.00,4.00,62.00,30,120,31,4.87,51059075),(2254,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51083931','St. John’s/cathedral park private getaway','Brand new construction! You will be staying in a private 2 bedroom apartment, with a private entrance, and private driveway parking. Great view off the deck high above the  neighborhood. Super fast Xfinity Wi-Fi service. 800 mbps plan, with speeds of 720 mbps recorded wirelessly. Great for working remotely/zoom meetings. The modem is right in the apt. with you, for direct hookups via Ethernet. (Speed varies with time of day and area usage)','Close to Cathedral Park, St. Johns Bridge, pier Park, downtown Saint Johns, bars, restaurants, frisbee golf course, skate park,','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-51083931/original/1a5a66de-3e1d-4009-a2b5-f3fbd1f1da5e.jpeg',298041369,58,'45.59965','-122.74626',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,97.00,1,28,228,4.94,51083931),(2255,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51090503','1 Bedroom + Flex Room - Modern Condo, EV Charger','Inquire about discounts for stays of 3 months or more:<br />  3 month stay = 10% discount<br />  6 month stay = 15% discount<br />  9 month stay = 20% discount<br /><br />Looking for a stay with kids?  Look no further!<br />Our family friendly amenities offer fun and function.<br /><br />Enjoy all the benefits and ambiance of an award-winning neighborhood with cafes, shops, parks and amenities nearby. Go for a walk/run along the river or nearby west hills trails, catch the Streetcar and be downtown or on the east side in just minutes.','The chic Pearl District features galleries and cultural institutions, as well as stylish shops and acclaimed eateries.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51090503/original/7d74c160-7c3b-4036-a664-f33ad59c8059.jpeg',413396493,2,'45.531918','-122.680618',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,107.00,30,365,6,5.00,51090503),(2256,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51126705','Stylish 1BR garden guesthouse with patio near UofP','Are you looking for a convenient, close-in home away from home? Come stay in our separate guesthouse in a pleasant urban neighborhood. We are four blocks from the University of Portland, with easy access to downtown.<br /><br />Our guests appreciate how well-designed, quiet, and comfortable the standalone guesthouse is. With a high ceiling and a large skylight, the main room is flooded with natural light.','University Park is a friendly city neighborhood, predominantly of single family homes. The neighborhood was laid out in the 1920s, with relatively small lots and alleys down the middle of blocks. We have the typical noises you\'d hear in a close-in neighborhood, and neighbors close by.<br /><br />Because we\'re near a small college, we hear the bell tower and faint cheers from an occasional soccer game. Some students live in the neighborhood, and we enjoy the energy they add. <br /><br />New Seasons, a local grocery store, is a 15-minute walk away, with some restaurants and coffee shops along the way. A 5-minute drive will take you to St. Johns, an old neighborhood center featuring eclectic dining and shopping options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/126c5667-d06c-4c7b-bd87-8e2f6791a1e2.jpg',8946045,57,'45.57821','-122.72458',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,2,28,122,4.99,51126705),(2257,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51127176','Perfectly Portland Clinton St Guesthouse','This light & airy guesthouse is a private retreat in a perfect location, steps from Division St. Walkable to Salt & Straw & local eateries, food carts, and thrift shops. Prepare meals in the fully equipped kitchen or head out by foot to Oma’s Hideaway, a 2022 James Beard Award Finalists. Bring your bicycles to enjoy Clinton St Bike Boulevard or stroll to the Clinton St Theater. The guesthouse is family friendly, having special items to accommodate the littlest of guests.','\"Trendy Richmond is known for its lively main streets of Division and Clinton, home to a mix of high-end restaurants, buzzy destination eateries, clusters of food carts and cocktail and wine bars. Boho vintage boutiques and stylish women’s apparel stores sit next to quirky homewares, gift and stationery shops. The Clinton Street Theater shows independent films and plays, and hosts community events.\" -Richmond Neighborhood Association','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/39cea1c1-f311-4661-b314-0bef0f2765fa.jpg',7076896,8,'45.50359','-122.62998',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,124.00,3,21,215,5.00,51127176),(2258,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51141878','Beautiful 1 bedroom guesthouse with parking','Explore SW Portland while enjoying our quiet, private guesthouse. This is a detached apartment with it\'s own private entrance, parking and private fenced-in backyard/outdoor space. <br /><br />Lovely area to relax in both indoors and outside.','We are located 1 mile from Multnomah Village, a quaint area with local restaurants, shopping, coffee shops, food truck pod and bars.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-51141878/original/9cd655d9-2fcc-4eea-b13e-cd8a599ffda4.jpg',5335159,34,'45.45335','-122.73818',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,43,4.98,51141878),(2259,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51152002','#StayInMyDistrict Arbor Lodge & Popular Overlook','#StayinMyDistrict Arbor Lodge! The Ainsworth in Arbor Lodge is a bright and spacious, private basement apartment, recently updated with all of the amenities of home! Full Kitchen, W/D, PARK IN DRIVEWAY! Conveniently located in the popular Arbor Lodge, Overlook North Portland neighborhood. - walking distance to New Seasons, Restaurants, Shopping & amenities. Blocks to Peninsula Park Rose Garden, and the MAX light rail station. Easy access to I-5 and PDX.','Arbor Lodge neighborhood, Portland, is one of the most popular neighborhoods in Portland. It is full of historic homes, little shops and coffee houses, and the MAX light rail runs right through it. It is located in N Portland and borders Overlook neighborhood to the south, Piedmont to the east, and Kenton to the north. It’s southern border is Willamette Blvd, which has a walking bike path that goes all along the Willamette Overlook. Arbor Lodge Neighborhood is a great place for walking, bike riding and just looking at the view of the city and Mt Hood over the Willamette River and industrial area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-51152002/original/432faaa0-2c2a-4f43-9bd6-af110e73800f.jpeg',3142393,51,'45.566586','-122.685684',1,6,1.00,1.00,4.00,68.00,1,28,98,4.85,51152002),(2260,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51174832','Cozy 1-bedroom private bath in little Portlandia','Enjoy our little piece of Portland. Our private room in the growing & bustling neighborhood of Kenton is the perfect spot for your Portland getaway. Within walking distance of multiple restaurants on Denver Ave & the Yellow Max Line for those looking to explore all downtown Portland has to offer. <br /><br />Included:<br />Free coffee & wifi<br />Queen size bed<br />Portable AC unit in room <br />Board games<br />Full bathroom next to bedroom for privacy<br /><br />Please note: owners do live in the house with a small dog & cat.','We are within walking distance to Denver Ave full of shopping, coffee, the library, restaurants and a liquor store. You can also walk to the yellow max line that takes you straight downtown. There is also a large park, Kenton Park, a couple blocks away. The park has a large play structure, basketball court, baseball field and a splash pad.<br /><br />There is train tracks about 1/4 of a mile away. Not close enough to shake the house but if you are a light sleeper, ear plugs are advised. Most guests haven’t voiced a concern. Bring a port city, Portland has a lot of trains  especially the closer you get to downtown. We do provide ear plugs.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8547c542-48e5-4004-a483-b185f8358fc1.jpg',116397710,55,'45.58568','-122.69597',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,150,4.93,51174832),(2261,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51177526','Spacious King Bedroom with Private Bath, SE area','Perfect for a single or a couple who need a longer stay and a place to relax and call home. King sized bed and work areas. You will have privacy and space in this downstairs suite, updated with luxurious bathroom including rainshower and two sinks. Great set up for working from home folks. Designated kitchenette. Laundry. Lots parking.  Sweet neighborhood with restaurants around the corner. Host lives up and works from home. Please note: we don\'t have any reviews yet as we are new to this site.','Wonderful SE Portland, older neighborhood, close to everything and easy to get around by car, bus, or on foot. close to Reed college in the Creston Kenilworth area of Portland. Also bordering Brooklyn, Richmond, Woodstock, Foster-Powell, and Hosford Abernathy areas. 10 min to OHSU tram. Bus stops on Holgate or Gladstone less than 5 min walk. Many sweet small businesses within a 5 min walk too! coffee, a bakery, a juice bar, Mexican or sushi, and brewpubs. beautiful Kenilworth park has green space and tennis courts.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51177526/original/7db9c1ed-92e6-475d-b99b-406aee8c0ef5.jpeg',1458575,67,'45.49225','-122.63445',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,1125,0,1.00,51177526),(2262,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51236349','Rocky Butte Bohemian Retreat (8 min to PDX)','Enjoy this spacious, stylish and cozy basement apartment with a separate entrance, private living room, bedroom, fully stocked kitchen and laundry room. It is bright and airy with thoughtful design touches throughout. Free parking in private driveway. <br /><br />Conveniently located, just 8 min to PDX, 15 min to downtown, and close to major freeways. Walking distance to an espresso bar, Mexican restaurant, Dharma Rain Zen Center, hike trials and the Grotto. 42” smart TV & work desk.','8 min to airport, 15 min to downtown, and close to major freeways and hospitals. The house is also within a 5 mile radius of Alberta Arts, Hawthorne, historical Mississippi Ave, & Pearl.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8345fa01-6235-47a0-8a8f-3a4b236a1955.jpg',32831349,74,'45.55043','-122.57593',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,2,700,111,4.72,51236349),(2263,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51269549','Santa Monica Vibes in PDX ~ Food Carts & Roasters','My apartment building is located in the heart of the heart of the eclectic Hawthorne District, walking distance to some of Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, craftspeople, and all services from banks to massage therapists, and just over a mile from downtown via bike, walking, or frequent bus service. The place has been designed to create a sleek, soothing, California feel.','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District puts you within walking distance to a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!) Make new friends over some vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, get messy with some wings right around the corner at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for a fancy night out at Castagna - all within a 1.5 mile stretch. Portland isn\'t just for foodies. There’s vibrant indie spirit in Hawthorne, with lots of made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore here in hipster heaven. Or, catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park on top of a dormant volcano vent, where you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible pano','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51269549/original/a497d713-4118-4679-81e9-eb9be2f741ce.jpeg',193973403,25,'45.51205','-122.64695',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,87.00,1,365,292,4.88,51269549),(2264,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51287119','The Hawthorne House ~ Boutiques & Vintage Shops','Welcome to The Hawthorne House!<br /><br />Location, location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a walk score of 99, our 1600 sq ft home is fully equipped with brand new stainless steel appliances, blazing Wifi, and can sleep up to 10 guests comfortably.<br /><br />Built in 1907, our charming, yet modern and updated home is located just steps from historic SE Hawthorne Blvd - less than two minutes walk from bars, restaurants, independent bookstores and shops.','Sometimes compared to San Francisco’s Haight-Ashbury neighborhood, Portland’s Hawthorne District is known for its vintage shops, restored theaters, street performers, and overall creative characters, making it one of the city’s top destinations for both locals and visitors. Coincidentally, a standout food scene has developed in the neighborhood, making a day spent on the Southeast street a breeze.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51287119/original/d75dd6ef-67cf-477c-a175-bc58148e7455.jpeg',415317125,16,'45.51232','-122.62366',1,10,2.00,5.00,5.00,122.00,1,730,190,4.85,51287119),(2265,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51287230','Newly Renovated Hawthorne Retreat- Private Apt!','Walk to everything! Super close to restaurants, bars, parks and shops! Renovated & located just 1 block off Hawthorne, this spacious & bright 1-bedroom basement apartment is the perfect spot to relax after a day of hiking, biking or shopping. Smart TV in the living room & bedroom as well as an ample selection of board games. Couch pulls out into a futon for extra guests. Fully equipped kitchen & full bathroom<br /><br />**Please note that this property is shared with tenants in the main home upstairs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d7bb5083-08b7-4465-be71-c06adb7084a9.jpg',221421926,8,'45.51164','-122.61623',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,1,90,38,4.82,51287230),(2266,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51422753','River view, rooftop deck, 2bd 2ba','A rare find for work or play, this 2 bed 2 bath condo with 2 parking spaces is thoughtfully designed with intuitive decor and modern convenience. Nature in the city with river views and a calm, positive vibe. Spectacular rooftop deck. High speed internet, TV, pool, hot tub, bikes, 2 deeded covered parking spaces. Private washer & dryer. Onsite security & convenience store. Located on 15 mile riverwalk close to transit. No chores, no fees, no taxes on 31+ nights, no smoking, no children, no pets.','McCormick Pier Condominiums on the Portland waterfront. Closest to The Pearl District and NW Portland for grocery and shopping. Steps from Union Station, MAX light rail, bus and streetcar transit stops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51422753/original/5e7e4397-2ff6-4af6-912f-209d588447bb.jpeg',17264703,43,'45.5277','-122.67129',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,31,350,13,5.00,51422753),(2267,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51437092','Nicki’s City View Patio Downtown Free Parking','Conveniently located, bright Studio apartment with amazing views, balcony, private entrance, King sized bed, sofa bed, free laundry, self-controllable AC/heat, self-check-in and free roadside parking. Beautiful Goose Hollow Area, PSU is just across the street. Very convenient location with just a 7-minute walk to the MAX, all the restaurants, shops, galleries, and nightlife downtown has to offer. <br />PSU - 5 min walk<br />Supermarket - 12 min walk<br />Providence park (Timbers) - 13 min walk','Goose Hollow area<br />No need for a car here, everything is at walking distance, Providence Park (Timbers Stadium), downtown, MAX, PSU, restaurants and nightlife.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTE0MzcwOTI%3D/original/89e60a79-7519-4a70-ad46-f78097302f42.jpeg',103330725,3,'45.51593','-122.69253',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,79.00,1,365,341,4.84,51437092),(2268,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51448944','Your Stay in Pearl District','Experience the Best of Portland Living in the Pearl District! This 1b1b apartment is situated in a peaceful and safe neighborhood. From great restaurants and entertainment venues to public transportation and groceries, everything you need is right at your doorstep. <br />Located in a secure and well-appointed building that boasts a gym and dedicated garage space. Inside, you\'ll find a sleek and contemporary living space with all the modern amenities you need.','Fashionable and lively, the Pearl District is a shopping destination with hip brands, indie boutiques and the massive Powell\'s City of Books. Reclaimed warehouse spaces house The Pearl\'s many bars and restaurants, from craft breweries and artisan coffee shops to fine dining mainstays. Galleries showcase contemporary art, photography and glass works. In summer, families cool off in Jamison Square’s wading fountain. -- google','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2947c118-7e0a-43a3-897e-dd32636cdedb.jpg',5888241,2,'45.53118','-122.68092',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,105.00,30,730,46,4.89,51448944),(2269,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51510456','Kenton Garden Home: 2 min to shops, food & transit','Lovely 2 bedroom home built in 1938 and full of character with an abundant garden - a tranquil retreat perfect for friends, family, business, dogs, cats and other pets ($25/night/pet, $100/week/pet, or $250/month/pet, details in house rules). On a quiet street but 1½ blocks to the center of Kenton: MAX light rail station, shops, restaurants, cafés, bars and park. The ideal spot for all your Portland adventures from downtown to the surrounding wilderness and everywhere in between!','Incredibly walkable, just 1½ blocks to the center of Kenton with restaurants, bars, cafés, light rail station, park with playground, library, post office, convenience store, bicycle repair, auto repair, shops, and more! Fred Meyer (supermarket) is ½ mile away, New Seasons (upscale supermarket)  is 1 mile away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51510456/original/41bbec9e-d317-4893-9b48-5bd3fb522f67.jpeg',51249144,55,'45.582539','-122.683838',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,106.00,2,365,47,4.89,51510456),(2270,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51523122','Quite 1-bedroom Montavilla stay','Quiet and private place for traveling professionals. In the hub of Portland, 10-15 min to reach any destination in the city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3fb01c8e-534f-46a5-8d84-a54b8d3fd6b9.jpg',100544418,10,'45.51473','-122.57989',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,199.00,30,365,0,1.00,51523122),(2271,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51534118','Charming 2 Bd/1 Ba Home, Fenced Yard, W/D in unit','This 2 bedroom, 1 bath home is the perfect cozy home-away-from-home. The space features two bedrooms with queen beds, a full bathroom with tub, stackable washer/dryer, fully gated back yard, fiber speed internet, and free parking onsite. <br /><br />Located on a quiet block between the Woodstock and FoPo neighborhoods, this home offers guests the feeling of what local life in Portland is all about. Within walking distance, you can find multiple parks, coffee shops, and restaurants.','This home is in a quiet residential neighborhood in SE Portland. Drinking coffee on the front porch, you\'ll meet many neighbors who stop and say hi as they walk their dogs to the nearby parks. <br /><br />Our home is between two lively, character filled Portland neighborhood centers. We\'re located one mile from the heart of the Woodstock neighborhood where you\'ll find the  Woodstock Park, New Seasons grocery, multiple restaurants/bars, great coffee shops, Goodwill, and plenty of small, local shops. We are also one mile to the heart of the uniquely charming Foster/Powell neighborhood (FoPo), with multiple coffee shops, food cart pods, many bars, and classic Portland vibes. <br /><br />Reed college is only 2 miles distance from this house, being an easy 7 minute drive or 11 minute bike ride.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/97409159-b8bf-4a41-a469-91d430cf5fc4.jpg',78879277,65,'45.48143','-122.59633',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,60,180,7,4.86,51534118),(2272,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51554340','Comfortable Studio with free parking on premises','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space--full of light and life.  <br /><br />Whether you are looking for a place to home base while you visit Portland (or the Colombia Gorge or Mt Hood) or a place to call home all day while you work remotely, this comfortable space has all you need.<br /><br />Kitchen is fully stocked for any meal you wish to prepare.  Cleaning products are organic, compost and recycling are collected.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a1c147de-74e2-4969-8af9-d54041c89e65.jpg',95479282,72,'45.48173','-122.57361',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,28,4.82,51554340),(2273,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51559601','Modern and Fully Renovated One Bedroom Apartment','Send me a message if you need anything not listed here or something unique!<br /> <br />There\'s no better place to experience Portland than from this beautiful hideaway nestled in one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods!<br /><br />Join your friends and family at Irving park for a picnic, basketball, or a tennis match. Or, hop over to Williams and Mississippi for some of the best known restaurants in Portland. Very close to the convention and Moda center that give you tremendous options for entertainment.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51559601/original/f53846c8-50b1-4f94-a290-00822caa599b.jpeg',19162027,26,'45.54539','-122.66132',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,2,18,75,4.85,51559601),(2274,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51575566','Urban Nature Sanctuary','Stay in the country while being in the city! Located in an friendly neighborhood surrounded by lush nature along the Columbia River. Walk to a quiet arboretum park or visit the horse and sheep farm nearby. Watch migrating birds, deers, coyotes, and wild creatures from the peaceful back deck and yard. A true nature sanctuary with a hot tub!<br /><br />Only 10 mins to the Alberta Arts district with plentiful great foodie options and  groceries. Minutes to highway & Portland airport. 15mins to downtown.','The neighborhood is walking distance to the children’s Arboretum and there are also farms with horses and sheep nearby to walk to.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ed74675a-99c4-47a2-92e3-e585f06c5470.jpg',350032602,92,'45.5921','-122.64907',1,4,2.00,2.00,3.00,170.00,180,360,1,5.00,51575566),(2275,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51618968','Hollywood Haven Petfriendly Walkable Kitchenette','Location! 100 walkscore and awesome public transit, lots to see and do! Pet friendly home, private fenced yard and many parks nearby. We\'re in the heart of a beautiful bustling city, on the corner of an intersection, we provide earplugs if needed. Also, we provide a kitchenette: bathroom sink for water and washing, mini fridge, countertop, microwave, toaster oven, tea kettle, coffee pot and disposable dishes and cutlery, not a full kitchen. Not for children under two because of the stairs. 🥰','Our neighborhood is safe, very walkable, pet friendly, and beautiful as so many people plant flower and vegetable gardens. There are several beautiful parks within walking distance, the eclectic Hollywood Theater and many fantastic restaurants bars and coffee shops to choose from, most offering vegan and gluten-free options. Staying in the Hollywood District puts you in the hub of Portland with many spectacular sights, interesting venues and exciting experiences just moments away; The Washington Park Arboretium, Mount Tabor, The Colmbia Gorge waterfalls (Ainsworth is my favourite dog friendly camping spot as you can visit five waterfalls on one trail), and The Grotto are some of my favorite spots.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a35ec5ca-3465-464e-b02f-8325e5f977fc.jpg',59546078,84,'45.53361','-122.61585',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,77.00,2,1125,96,4.67,51618968),(2276,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51623504','Comfy, Private Suite Off NE Alberta Street','This modern one-bedroom retreat is perfectly located in the heart of the Alberta Arts District. Find tons of shops, restaurants, breweries and more just steps from your door. Amenities include: Smart T.V, WiFi, bedding, towels and kitchenette. Private access is through a side door, down one flight of stairs. The Nest is cool in the summer, warm in the winter and always a good space to relax away from the hustle.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/eb5a2ad4-8a6a-478e-b33a-d4dd742525ce.jpg',51450038,29,'45.55904','-122.64342',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,104.00,1,200,109,4.88,51623504),(2277,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51641308','Pdx Luxury family home','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51641308/original/2dbde5d2-eaac-45cc-a14d-a1465a70ec43.jpeg',359037027,35,'45.54497','-122.54664',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,119.00,1,1125,88,4.92,51641308),(2278,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51657495','Sunny & bright - close to everything!','Ask about future dates! I don\'t open dates too far out to prevent big gaps<br /><br />You\'ll have all the comforts of home in this thoughtfully designed home. Enjoy the beautiful, well-equipped kitchen, comfortable bedrooms, living room/dining room, and private deck. <br /><br />The neighborhood is quiet and beautiful, with many restaurants, Whole Foods & parks within walking distance.<br /><br />We reflected on our past Airbnb stays and have strived to take care of every detail. Great for couples, singles, or families.','Flat, walkable, well-maintained single-family homes. Sabin is situated right in the middle of all the popular NE Portland neighborhoods.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51657495/original/ffbaf524-aa22-41e0-a17c-d0d29a9b4a5c.jpeg',702623,14,'45.55429','-122.65748',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,130.00,60,364,3,4.67,51657495),(2279,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51696208','Garden hideaway steps from classic PDX favorites','Tucked away in a secret community of old Portland classic homes, we are perfectly situated for your visit to the Rose Garden, Japanese Garden, Providence Park, shopping on 23rd street or imbibing on 21st street. We are a are a nice walk from the culinary delights of the Pearl District and 7 minutes afoot from the Goose Hollow light rail stop.','At the intersection of Vista and Burnside, just down the hill, you’ll find Zupans Market and a Cafe Umbria for convenient grocery shopping and coffee. There’s also a Fred Meyer further down Burnside.<br /><br />For stellar views of Portland, just take a few steps up the hill from the house and turn left onto the Vista Bridge. The center of that bridge offers quite a view.  The entrance to the famous Washington Park is about a five minute’s walk up Park Street. If you stand in the center of the rose garden, you are offered a greater panorama.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51696208/original/c07dc2d8-7064-4e9b-a010-ce4d8102d787.jpeg',15916244,3,'45.52078','-122.6971',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,3,20,80,4.91,51696208),(2280,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51705207','Upscale 2B/2Bth Condo With A View!','With stunning city views, a flood of natural light, and fresh neutral decor, this upscale condo exudes a feeling of peace and tranquillity which you will notice as soon as you walk in!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51705207/original/00def25c-8ba4-4d54-a00c-8aade175fdbd.jpeg',57554369,44,'45.5094','-122.67866',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,132.00,60,365,1,4.00,51705207),(2281,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51715982','#StayInMyDistrict Woodlawn Eclectic -Walk to Dekum','#StayinMyDistrict Woodlawn & Dekum! You will feel at HOME in this Cozy and Eclectic private basement apartment, located in a vintage Portland bungalow. Conveniently located in the NE Woodlawn & Dekum Triangle Neighborhood- walking distance to coffee shops, fresh markets, local dining, shopping & amenities. Blocks to Woodlawn Park and Amphitheater and public transit. Easy access to I-5 & PDX Airport. Sleeps up to (4) King Bed & Sofa Sleeper set up studio style. Kitchen, W/D, FREE street parking!','The Woodlawn neighborhood is one of the most abundant neighborhoods in Portland. It is full of historic homes, amazing restaurants, little shops and coffee houses, and all within walking distance. It is located in NE Portland and borders Alberta neighborhood to the south, Piedmont to the west, and Concordia to the east. Its northern border is NE Lombard St, which can take you to just about any area of Portland. Woodlawn Neighborhood is a great place for walking, bike riding, recreation, and enjoying all of the sights, experiences, and eats Portland has to offer!<br /><br />Just blocks from the growing business district on Dekum street known as the Dekum Triangle.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-51715982/original/6dce5944-af5f-4c9b-ac85-3d7db2bc111b.jpeg',3142393,45,'45.573421','-122.649864',1,4,1.00,0.00,2.00,49.00,1,28,125,4.70,51715982),(2282,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51716811','Lovely 2 bedroom Presidential unit in Portland','Ideally located in the center of two vibrant communities including Downtown and Old Town Chinatown Worldmark Waterfront Park is walking distance to almost everything Portland has to offer. The original downtown is a bustling entertainment district home to the Portland Saturday Market, Voodoo Doughnut, Lan Su Chinese Garden, and the Oregon Maritime Museum. Cross the street and you will see the Willamette River rambling by, dividing the city while uniting fun-seekers and music lovers alike.','Enjoy a little retail therapy at Pioneer Place shopping mall or find your DIY dream at Crafty Wonderland. Indie boutiques and local brands reign supreme in the downtown area. Hungry? Get creative with everything from eclectic food trucks to black-tie seafood affairs. The Portland Saturday Market is also very popular and runs the gamut with live music, food and plenty of folk art. And speaking of art, the Portland Art Museum is an absolute must for those that are into Asian and Native American art. If the art of dance is more your style, book an evening at the Keller Auditorium for ballet or a live concert. For a city that prides itself with the motto, \"Keep Portland Weird\", there is never a shortage of things to do or see!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51716811/original/0d902884-a1b4-4b74-ba09-1498d52e29eb.jpeg',357126676,43,'45.51975','-122.67157',1,5,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,364,365,0,1.00,51716811),(2283,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51731517','Historic Mott Sisters Style Salon-Near Moda Center','Steps from the Moda Center and Cartside Food Cart Pod in the gorgeous Albina neighborhood of downtown Portland! This historic foursquare craftsman keeps you in the heart of the city, with a private backyard to wind down and relax. Once owned by Beatrice Mott Reed, this home is a testament to Black entrepreneurialism as it served as the Mott Sister Style Salon from 1943-1960. Come enjoy Portland and your stay in a piece of living history! <br /><br />Walk Score: 91 <br />Transit Score: 74','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51731517/original/3a2fc9c9-6ef7-4219-b9c1-59d04fe282f0.jpeg',115674426,26,'45.53892','-122.66848',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,160.00,1,14,97,4.79,51731517),(2284,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51732588','North Portland ADU Sleeps 3 Near UP & Adidas','Luxurious, roomy guest suite with kitchenette, full bathroom, including heated towel racks, and all the amenities needed for a comfortable stay. This private suite, with a separate entrance, is in an extraordinary, mid-century single-family home nestled into the Mocks Crest neighborhood overlooking downtown Portland.','Family-friendly, walkable neighborhood with city skyline views.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51732588/original/493385f6-c948-44aa-bf01-f90753ec44ed.jpeg',10489925,57,'45.575374603271484','-122.70933532714844',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,2,28,44,4.95,51732588),(2285,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51744955','Adorable 1-bedroom apt-historic Alberta farmhouse','Beautifully renovated 1-bed apt just one block off of Alberta Street. Walk to all the  cafes, shops, and public transit.  Our space is equipped with everything you need for any extended stay. A full chef’s kitchen, in-unit laundry, comfortable workspace area, excellent couch and great light.  We’re set up to host guests for 30 days or more. Our apartment is located in the lower level of a historic home, with a private entrance and stairs to access.','We’re located in the Alberta Arts District, a vibrant, walkable neighborhood. We have excellent shopping, dining, galleries, a music venue, and a park nearby.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51744955/original/7aae1b0d-a6e6-4bf3-9295-2722ced7a1f3.jpeg',56752027,1,'45.56173','-122.64012',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,365,9,4.89,51744955),(2286,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51764646','Beautiful Modern 3 bdrm home in great PDX location','Beautifully decorated modern oasis on a quiet street in the fun, hip, and trendy Sunnyside Neighborhood of Portland. Short walk to amazing shops, restaurants, parks and more. The kitchen is well equipped; the living room is bright and cozy and the backyard has a deck with BBQ;  Digital keyless entry makes it\'s easy to come and go. Our home has a Smart TV, free hi-speed WiFi and more. . Pets are allowed on a case  by case basis with additional deposit.<br />30+ day stays only.','Our home is close to amazing restaurants and shopping areas.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51764646/original/78808c77-19d7-4a8a-8521-613983aa5739.jpeg',351653210,16,'45.5149','-122.627304',1,6,3.50,3.00,3.00,180.00,30,120,3,5.00,51764646),(2287,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51766581','Cozy home near St Johns, w/ office & big backyard','Whole house to yourselves! One story building.  Get comfortable and enjoy plenty of extra room at this cozy space. Fully equipped kitchen, hi speed wifi and office room also available to you.','St. John’s/Cathedral Park/Portsmouth neighborhoods - gateway to Sauvey Island !','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51766581/original/2b67d9d5-95e5-4b83-bff5-d87326f94bb7.jpeg',3790403,60,'45.5863','-122.73117',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,185.00,30,730,7,4.86,51766581),(2288,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51771121','Detached Studio · Bright, Quiet & Private Parking','Cozy & bright detached studio with private entrance, 10 min from downtown, 2 blocks from the trolley and biking distance from many restaurants & stores, as well as the Willamette River for swimming in summertime.','Brooklyn neighborhood is a very central and quiet spot, with a few good eateries and a couple of cute parks - it feels like a small-town vibe within a big city. We are 10\' biking from Sellwood, where there are plenty more options to go out shopping, eating, go swimming, kayaking, or SUP on the riverfront. Lad\'s Addition is 5/10min biking also, and you can reach downtown both by bike, car or transports from here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51771121/original/d2e8b235-ffb4-4940-ac37-e42eee1b6a8f.jpeg',17216363,56,'45.49366','-122.65047',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,60,10,5.00,51771121),(2289,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51773701','Cozy Studio w/ Deck - 9 Mi to Dtwn Portland!','Feed your wanderlust and explore a new city on your terms when you stay at this adorable 2nd-story Portland vacation rental. The charming studio features 1 bathroom, chic decor, a Smart TV, a well-equipped kitchen, and a spacious yard perfect for relaxing after a day out on the town. With 3 bus stops within walking distance, you can tailor your getaway to your interests and explore local hot spots like Powell\'s Books, the Portland Japanese Garden, or one of the city\'s many food pods! Book today.','BUS STOPS: NE Stanton & 117th (0.3 miles), NE Morris & 111th (0.3 miles), NE 111th & Knott (0.4 miles) <br />PARKS & TRAILS: Knott City Park (0.5 miles), Luuwit View Park (1.1 miles), Powell Butte Nature Park (6.4 miles), Happy Valley Nature Park (8.0 miles), Spring Water Trail (9.6 miles), Woods Memorial Natural Area (14.2 miles), Tryon Creek State Natural Area (14.4 miles), Multnomah Falls (21.8 miles), Mt Hood (60.3 miles) <br />DOWNTOWN PORTLAND (~9 miles): Oaks Amusement Park, Portland Art Museum, Washington Park, Lan Su Chinese Garden, Oregon Zoo, Portland Japanese Garden, International Rose Test Garden, Powell\'s Books <br />REGIONAL WINERIES: Fullerton Wines (10.5 miles), Hawks View Winery (24.8 miles), Hamacher Wines (25.2 miles), Alloro Vineyard (26.1 miles), Blakeslee Vineyard Estate (26.3 miles), Cooper Mountain Vineyards (27.1 miles), Raptor Ridge Winery (28.8 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (5.1 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-51773701/original/3149463a-e4d2-43a4-8705-d70f90b08dcb.jpeg',121688409,35,'45.54528','-122.54571',1,3,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,51773701),(2290,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51804031','[7+ day stay] mountain suite w/ location + view','Being immediately outside of downtown Portland, this space is in the most affluent region of Multnomah County, The Southwest Hills. This space is priced against the cluster of hotels in the same area. This space is perfect for a working professional who is seeking an economic advantage. A private, interconnected suite of a queen bed, a full bathroom and a private patio with a view of the cityscape and The Cascade Mountain Range are equipped for your use.','Pleasant Goose Hollow neighborhood on a hill adjacent to downtown, but not downtown. Close to downtown and close to NW 23rd Ave. and a reasonable walk to the Pearl District and the SW Waterfront, as well as to Washington Park. Near the Goose Hollow Max train stop for easy access to the Vista Avenue stairway.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51804031/original/9710904e-9c49-496b-b0ad-0b28d030e0db.jpeg',417913151,3,'45.51506','-122.69578',2,1,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,31,62,85,4.80,51804031),(2291,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51806994','Fido\'s Retreat - Stellar Kitchen, Large Yard, AC','Our pet-friendly home is the perfect place to spend time with family or friends. The spacious living room and back yard, newly renovated kitchen, and two full baths give you everything you\'d want to feel comfortable and relaxed. The location is a 1 minute walk to a fantastic park for dog walks, and close to Mississippi Street + St Johns for great food, beer, and coffee.','Our neighborhood is very accessible to almost all of Portland - Downtown is 12 minutes away,  the Moda Center is 10 minutes, and the Airport is about 16. <br /><br />The neighborhood is a wonderful place to walk, run, or bike – Colombia Park is 1 minute away and is one of the largest parks in Portland. North Willamette Blvd is less than a minute in the other direction, and has amazing views across the Willamette valley to Forest Park and Downtown Portland. On clear days you can even see Mount Hood. <br /><br />Nearby, there are a number of food trucks, cafes, and beer gardens that are great destinations on a relaxing afternoon. Guests frequently use our bikes to explore the surrounding neighborhoods.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51806994/original/fd24b93e-9726-4e35-a5b5-d7f02b776da6.jpeg',5375520,57,'45.57558','-122.70988',1,5,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,21,5.00,51806994),(2292,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51820350','Private home, backyard escape, A+ walking score','Make yourselves at home in our cozy house that features a king size bed in suite that steps out into our tranquil and fenced backyard. Bring your kids or another couple, we have a nursery and comfy pullout sectional in living room with memory foam mattress available. <br /><br />Two covered patios, grill, and outdoor seating make it a year round retreat! Full kitchen or short walk to great restaurants and shopping! <br /><br />We look forward to hosting you and yours while we are out exploring the great PNW!','Centrally located, minutes from downtown. We love our quiet neighborhood in a great city. 1 -2 hours from great ocean beaches, mountains, waterfalls, etc','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d6a821e1-f0e7-4346-bd8f-894712683221.jpg',2673359,8,'45.49859','-122.62536',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,3,365,1,5.00,51820350),(2293,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51823507','Charming Stucco Bungalow across from Alberta Park','This Southwestern-style bungalow in beautiful NE Portland is located on the treelined street of Ainsworth in the Alberta Arts / Concordia district. It\'s across the street from Alberta Park and a quick walk to some of the best food and drink in the city.<br /><br />The home has been thoughtfully preserved and designed and lets in an incredible amount of natural light. The outdoor space offers an incredibly private area to relax or enjoy a meal on the deck. It truly feels like a home away from home!','The house is centrally located within 1 mile of the Alberta Arts District and Dekum Triangle and within 2 miles of the Historic Mississippi District. All of these neighborhood destinations have great coffee, restaurants, and bars worth checking out. Mississippi Street has the addition of many locally-owned shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51823507/original/17192c03-8db9-4ec6-b37f-3342be47288e.jpeg',42734493,1,'45.566628','-122.643074',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,157.00,2,21,111,4.95,51823507),(2294,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51825577','Great Downtown Location- Walk to Everything!','This studio unit has hardwood floors. Building is secured. Located in the center of everything. Walking distance to transit (Max line), Providence Park, walk to downtown, Pearl District and 23rd Street neighborhoods with in 15 minutes. Amenities include: Queen bed. Seating area w/loveseat, 42\" flat screen TV. Walk-in closet. Fully equipped eat-in kitchen, seating for 2.  Furnished with all linens, bedding, dishes and cookware. Includes - T-Mobile 5G Internet, utilities, free laundry onsite.','Parking is metered street parking and paid parking lots','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/31dfdc00-57b3-421b-9475-4e5478320ea4.jpg',60624037,3,'45.52181','-122.68936',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,57.00,30,1125,5,5.00,51825577),(2295,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51828909','Artists Loft Perched in the Heart of Nob Hill','Right in the heart of Nob Hill, one of Portlands most famed neighborhoods, is this sophisticated and tranquil oasis. This loft sits between NW 23rd and NW 21st street in a historic 1886 home. Although fully renovated throughout, this loft is full of historic charm. This is the ideal retreat to write your book or life your best work from home life at. Getting all the energy the city has to offer while being high above the noise of it all.  This unit has its own entrance, W/D, and 1gig internet.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51828909/original/6bf66d3e-9ddf-4322-800d-b1f5ea0ab4a0.jpeg',3423772,27,'45.52681','-122.69454',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,115.00,30,365,0,1.00,51828909),(2296,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51837051','Cheerful Upper Floor of Duplex in the Trees','Nice upper unit of duplex from 1909 in an old area of North Portland, close to I5 and the MAX.','Overlook neighborhood','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51837051/original/b308417f-64df-47ad-b29e-3cb082318af8.jpeg',72716191,13,'45.56036','-122.68763',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,31,364,0,1.00,51837051),(2297,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51843145','Comfy bedroom in Inclusive Home','We have lots of trees around our house and a pretty large property we\'re planting with native species. <br />We\'re a very relaxed home, open to connection when there\'s time and privacy if preferred.  <br />There are 2 young cats in the house and a very friendly dog- tho she often barks briefly at first meetings.','We are at the end of a dead end street with lots of beautiful trees around.  There\'s a grassy water tower park within a short walk.  And if you walk just a little further there is a wooded park with a stream running through it year round and a small playground. <br /><br />The charming Multnomah Village is 1 1/4 miles away with variety of restaurants, cafes and interesting small shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-51843145/original/c8950e31-4ebf-42e3-987c-4ee5c8839301.jpg',112893366,86,'45.45961','-122.7005',2,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,120,9,5.00,51843145),(2298,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51849527','Bedroom with workspace in quiet Hollywood apt','Clean, sunny bedroom in a quiet 3 bed/2 bath apartment. Room features a brand new hybrid Queen mattress, room darkening curtains, and a desk with full access to kitchen + living areas. High speed WIFI provided and space to store your bike inside. <br /><br />You’ll be walking distance to the beautiful vintage movie palace Hollywood Theatre, Whole Foods, Grocery Outlet, Sizzle Pie, Rose City food carts, and Case Study Coffee. <br /><br />Easy parking in our lot or off-street. Coin-operated laundry onsite.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0da0cf98-5445-4834-84fb-6cf197a5994a.jpg',14854564,84,'45.53535','-122.61623',2,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,33,4.85,51849527),(2299,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51851021','Private Guest Suite on Quiet Bend','Welcome to our bungalow! Take off your shoes and relax after a long day of exploring the best of Portland, hitting the nearby trails, visiting University of Portland or simply after a long day of work!<br /><br />This comfortable guest suite, situated facing the Willamette River, offers you a space to relax and recharge in a quiet environment in the city. Grab a bite to eat around the corner or explore the trails across the street; the possibilities are endless!','Our neighborhood has been coined \'Overlook\' due to it\'s scenic view of the Willamette River! It is quiet and safe, with many restaurants, parks and easy transportation in the neighborhood (including a park with hiking trails across the street)!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-51851021/original/9dd26dc8-b946-4d8e-8b46-cca4c0d8f8ca.jpg',78821885,13,'45.56285','-122.69717',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,110.00,120,1125,76,4.93,51851021),(2300,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51907361','Waterfront Views~Parking~ Wi-Fi & MORE','Welcome😀<br />This waterfront home is close to EVERYTHING you want, including public transportation, Nike Bikes, or electric scooters. <br />ENJOY-<br />FREE PARKING <br />Pearl District/ Old Town Restaurants, Wine Bars, Breweries, Nightlife<br />Moda Center/ Rose Quarter/ Memorial<br />Voodoo Doughnuts <br />International Saturday Market (Mar-Dec)<br />Portland Art Museum <br />Washington Rose Garden<br />Japanese Garden<br />Beach Access, Walking / Bike Paths/ fire pit<br />AC<br />Pool & Hot Tub<br />WE WELCOME EVERYONE!!!<br />My home, is your home.... Enjoy!','The BEST place to stay in Portland.Pearl District, Old Town, China Town, Downtown Portland area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6f515970-afd5-46e4-8a06-854a7f076999.jpg',132869260,43,'45.52672','-122.6705',2,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,82.00,30,30,106,4.93,51907361),(2301,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51907687','3 bedroom family friendly house in cul-de-sac.','3 bedroom ranch house perfect for families. Large yard, covered patio and quiet cul-de-sac perfect for kids to be outside. One bedroom has an adjustable bed and a desk. One bedroom is set up for kids with a bunk bed and small futon. The last bedroom has a futon, a couch-bed , and a desk. Grill and a fire pit are on site.<br /><br />This house is all one floor with an accessible bed and shower/tub.','St. John\'s/Portsmouth','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7089248d-0c8f-4d24-9360-1e18e92e065e.jpg',12773385,60,'45.58909','-122.73148',1,5,1.00,3.00,9.00,95.00,30,120,2,5.00,51907687),(2302,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51921983','Backyard Oasis 1 Bedroom Guest Suite near U of P','Entire charming garden suite with own entrance, located in University Park and St. Johns area. You’ll enjoy your own outdoor deck with an opportunity to share the garden space with owner Phillip.  Within walking distance to Cathedral Park, St. Johns Bridge, downtown St. Johns, one mile from the University of Portland. Your host stays on site in the family’s separate quarters of the main residence. Central AC works great!<br /><br />The City of Portland restricts the number of individuals in the unit to 4.','University Park is a charming neighborhood easy and wonderful to walk, Forest Park (GIANT urban park across the Willamette River), is a five minute drive over the St John\'s Bridge. Downtown St John\'s is a funky and colorful neighborhood just across the way.<br /><br />15 minute drive to downtown Portland. 20 minutes from Portland International Airport.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51921983/original/93459d4d-b3ef-4e7d-ba52-7d98d82815c4.jpeg',148285986,57,'45.58369','-122.73034',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,106.00,1,30,133,4.87,51921983),(2303,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51923722','Very Private Cottage Alberta Arts!','This is a very cosy and private cottage uniquely situated near the lively Alberta street hub. It’s newly remodeled and beautiful!','Alberta Arts is the number one destination neighborhood in Portland. It’s full of good places to eat and shops to visit, microbrewery’s to try. It’s an adventure to get to know the hub.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e91d96b3-fc06-484f-8764-55c96897fb10.jpg',23942166,29,'45.55834','-122.64514',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,115.00,1,1125,2,5.00,51923722),(2304,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51925459','The Redwood Shed','Modern tiny house in the shade of a huge Redwood tree in the Arbor Lodge neighborhood of North Portland.  Close to bars and restaurants, natural grocery stores, and public transportation, and within minutes of downtown Portland, The Redwood Shed is an ideal Pacific Northwest hideout.','Wooded parks, natural food grocery stores, freeway access, and bike lanes, cool bars and restaurants, and dense urban neighborhood feel, Arbor Lodge has it all, and we look forward to sharing it with you~','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51925459/original/214985c4-bcf8-42e4-af3e-8ab4073f5fb3.jpeg',711089,51,'45.57355','-122.68714',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,8,5.00,51925459),(2305,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51927854','Step Back In Time','Built in 1952 and in mostly original condition, this home has 2 bedrooms and 1 bath with shower.  Cozy living room and dining area with seating for 4.  If you like cooking, the kitchen is equipped with microwave, coffee pot, utensils and pots and pans that you can use on the vintage stove.  And you can keep your drinks cold in the vintage refrigerator.<br />The property has free parking on site in the driveway as well as free street parking.','Many 4 and 5 star restaurants close by in the Westmoreland/Sellwood area from 13th Avenue to Milwaukie Avenue and Tacoma Street to Bybee Blvd.<br /><br />There are countless shops and boutiques in the area to explore.  Collectible and antique shops, vintage clothing stores and a Columbia Factory Outlet.<br /><br />New Seasons Market and QFC are also nearby for your cooking needs at the property.<br /><br />And Westmoreland Park is half a block from your digs.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e3f2af8e-958e-420d-afeb-3144b4ea5709.jpg',420599486,20,'45.46925','-122.64149',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,30,30,63,4.87,51927854),(2306,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51958087','Huge Blue Casa 14th place Alberta Arts','Built in 1926 this Historic English Tudor home is ideal for mature travelers, or business groups looking for a solid space to work, relax or live in. This is a thoughtful home with global touches and remodeled recently. The rooms are spacious and the fire place is wood burning -ideal on rainy days.<br />House sits on 14th place and Sumner street dead ends at Alberta. Book a couple nights and you won\'t regret it!<br /><br />The House has few reviews because almost every booking have been extended stays.','Alberta Arts District off of Alberta Street and 14th Place<br /><br />Although Alberta Street contains much of the action going on in Vernon, Killingsworth Street also has more than a few places to visit when you’re here. Vernon may be a small neighborhood, but it packs a punch. <br /><br />Gems include: Salt and Straw, Podnah\'s BBQ, Collage art, Ya-ya Cantonese BBQ, Petite Provence, Radio Room, Tin Shed, Seastar Bakery, just web search Alberta Art and you\'ll be flooded with options for a true PDX experience.<br /><br />You can expect to find plenty of hipsters, working professionals, and young families here. Outside of Alberta, the neighborhood is quiet and welcoming to everyone. Overall the area is Inclusive focused, accepting of all persons and believes all are welcome.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51958087/original/437e8150-c583-4b0d-b645-befcc21fbc69.jpeg',2479544,29,'45.56092','-122.6507',1,6,2.00,3.00,4.00,876.00,4,1125,11,5.00,51958087),(2307,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51971055','New Construction, Open Patio, Deck, BBQ, FireTable','Sitting in the heart of Sellwood, this incredible newly constructed two bedroom guest house is a fantastic retreat. The location is truly special. Sitting just four blocks from Sellwood park and Oaks Bottom Wildlife Refuge you are just moments away from multiple parks and trails along the waterfront.  There are a number of restaurants, coffee shops, and entertainment options just a walk or a short drive away as well.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-51971055/original/92058a1a-d9cd-4f77-a8a1-1735f640f061.jpeg',62261998,20,'45.46832','-122.65086',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,125.00,3,29,51,4.76,51971055),(2308,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/51987642','Cozy lofted guesthouse near it all - kid friendly','Perfect home base after a day of exploring PDX! Your stay will be in the heart of the Buckman neighborhood just a few blocks from 28th Avenue and iconic Fifty-Licks Ice Cream. World class breweries, restaurants, pizza, and coffee shops are all within short walking distance. <br /><br />This cozy and well-stocked space can hold 3 comfortably (up to 6 if you don\'t mind a squeeze)! 1 full bedroom, 1 loft, and 1 pullout couch included along w/ private patio and shared backyard.<br /><br />Dogs welcome, sorry no cats :(','Your guesthouse is nestled in the midst of calm but active SE PDX city life, residential neighborhoods to explore, a private high school, and a historical cemetery/Portland\'s second largest arboretum popular for walks.<br /><br />Perfect walkable neighborhood for:<br /><br />Your morning coffee: Crema Coffee + Bakery, SORO SORO Coffee & Dessert, Kopi Coffe House, or keep it simple with Starbucks.<br />Incredible food - Baby Doll Pizza, Paadee Thai, Güero Mexican, The Sudra with vegan Indian, La Buca Italian, or Southern Inspired Screen Door.<br />Bars and Nightlife - Gorges Beer Co, The Goodfoot, Angel Face, and more. <br /><br />Less than 1 mile from Laurelhurst Park, .25 miles from Belmont street, and .7 miles from Hawthorne Street. <br /><br />87/100 walk score. 92/100 bike score.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51987642/original/8971ee4d-c7bf-4baa-96bc-12e1888e2c2b.jpeg',43317498,32,'45.51855','-122.64298',1,6,1.00,1.00,3.00,85.00,30,60,184,4.93,51987642),(2309,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52011583','Hip Modern Condo - black & gold theme','This unique place has a new age style that you will surely want to take pictures to remember. All black and gold down to the silverware and plates.','Close to stores — 20 minutes from down town - 40 minutes from the gorge. Centrally located','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52011583/original/290a25c9-b59a-4964-8650-c9c9fb7851f1.jpeg',421181207,78,'45.50403','-122.52234',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,300.00,30,1125,1,5.00,52011583),(2310,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52025018','The Inn at Hosford-Abernethy','For that cozy space to adventure from on your weekend get-away for two, look no further.  The Inn at Hosford-Abernethy is a clean and contemporary accommodation located in the heart of the famed Clinton/Division neighborhood in Portland, OR.  The neighborhood is itself embedded in the equally renown East Portland district, known for its dynamic food, rich cultural offerings, and quirky nightlife.  The locale is quiet yet conveniently accessible to all this great city has to offer.','Our home is located in the culturally vibrant, inexhaustibly dynamic Clinton/Division neighborhood in Portland, OR.  It is completely walkable with an endless array of restaurants and boutique shops.  If you feel like cooking, you can walk either 2 blocks south to The People\'s Food Co-op or 2 blocks north to New Seasons.  Eating out? Try Jaqueline for the oyster happy hour or perhaps Quaintrelle for their Pacific Northwest inspired cuisine.  Time for dessert? FiftyLicks on Clinton is a must try.  A little further east is Portland\'s famed Division promenade featuring notables like Ava Jean\'s, Salt and Straw, and Bollywood Theatre.  The choices are literally endless.<br /><br />Tired of eating? Attend an event at the Tomorrow Theatre.  Catch a viewing of the longest, continuous showing of the Rocky Horror Picture show at the veritable Clinton Theatre.  Boutique shop at Xtabay\'s on Clinton or perhaps check out Langlitz Leathers on Division if motorcycle jackets are more your style.  The n','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52025018/original/f5f8464e-ae73-4701-98ad-1af4c3be552d.jpeg',3917228,25,'45.50109','-122.64483',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,86.00,2,28,89,4.93,52025018),(2311,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52026807','Finished, private basement ADU in SE Portland!','Come stay at our cozy, finished basement ADU in SE Portland.  This unit is a fully functioning apartment that has an independent entry, washer/dryer, and full kitchen.  Great for extended stays or short trips and located next to many great neighborhoods in Portland!<br /><br />FYI: There are 13 stairs that lead down to the unit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52026807/original/ab608dc3-0b53-4935-b3f7-d3e05cb21071.jpeg',120715259,36,'45.48917','-122.58526',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,2,1125,104,4.96,52026807),(2312,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52042097','North Portland Artist\'s Bungalow','Our North Portland artist\'s bungalow is a great way to get to know the city. Near great restaurants, bars, grocery stores and public transportation, its within shooting distance of some of the best Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d913ec4f-771b-4386-be05-ba49dc87207a.jpg',271565231,51,'45.57415','-122.68202',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,3,5.00,52042097),(2313,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52072222','Sylvan Highland Townhome with a view','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place enchanting three story townhome with a view. Vaulted ceilings and light throughout. View of the west hills with trees in the skyline you’ll see from the large bay windows. You are just 2 miles from three major hospitals you are 1 mile away from the zoo where Max will take you downtown. Lots of walking and bicycle routes.','Deadend street close to the freeway and near downtown!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ed3deb15-1732-46f1-b5c1-b9bf5e998a8e.jpg',102654383,62,'45.50824','-122.74381',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,14,1125,3,4.33,52072222),(2314,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52078193','Sweet Hollywood Suite PDX','Walking distance to all the amenities you need, our luxe Hollywood suite is well-equipped, spacious and comfortable. Perfect for your getaway or working holiday. <br /><br />It is an ideal home base for all of your adventures to see Oregon\'s abundance of natural beauty (30min drive to Multnomah Falls!) as well as everything that Portland\'s eclectic neighbourhoods have to offer. Every neighbourhood is a little city in itself and you\'ll never run out of things to do and see. <br /><br />You don’t even need a car!','Hollywood/Grant Park (our address straddles both suburbs) is a neighbourhood of Portland that is located ~4 miles from downtown Portland. Everything is walkable and there is easy access to local transit. <br /><br />There are plenty of local restaurants and cafes, as well as the iconic Hollywood Theatre for a wonderful vintage cinematic experience. Our local library is also excellent and we have the beautiful Grant Park nearby for a stroll.<br /><br />We are walking distance from Whole Foods Market (2 minutes) and Trader Joe\'s (6 minutes). The wonderful, year-round (every other week in winter) Hollywood Farmers\' market is 5 minutes\' walk from our place.<br /><br />The Oregon Convention Center is two train stops (7 minutes) from our local station.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52078193/original/2fe823db-a060-4213-b5b1-5f2b39d9e87a.jpeg',15324875,84,'45.53758','-122.61928',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,2,14,124,4.99,52078193),(2315,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52086128','Peaceful house close to Alberta Arts District','Enjoy the best of both worlds, city and country living, in this beautiful house with awesome outdoor space. Only a few blocks away from bars, restaurants and shops on Alberta Street. <br /><br />Relax in the living room watching a movie in the big TV or get cozy in the outdoor fire pit while looking at the stars. Cook up a BBQ and enjoy the amazing outdoor dining space and living room, or enjoy the garden view from the comfort of your bed.','5 min drive to Proud Mary\'s and Alberta Arts District<br />5 min walk to 42nd Street where you can find bars and restaurants like Nepo 42 and a Vegan Food Cart Pod<br />15 min walk to Fremont street where you can find restaurants such as Grand Central Bakery or Red Sauce Pizza<br />15 min drive to the Pearl District where you can find the famous Powell Bookstore and several restaurants shops and bars<br />10 min drive to Broughton Bach Park where you can enjoy a peaceful Morning Walk on the Columbia River<br />15-20 min walk to beautiful city parks around<br />Easy access to Columbia River Gorge highway 30 and to Mount Hood, Hood River and surrounding nature escapes','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ab2c2e0b-2cbd-4fe1-94c3-bbc2ab05c6d4.jpg',28313660,21,'45.55982','-122.61629',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,175.00,1,350,46,4.74,52086128),(2316,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52108103','2 BR 1 BA - Cozy Home - Walkscore 98 - Porch','Discover the best place to stay in Portland! This cozy 2-bedroom home blends charm and modern comfort, offering a lush, greenery-filled interior perfect for relaxation or group stays. <br /><br />Located just steps from the vibrant Hawthorne and Belmont districts, you’ll enjoy easy access to top-rated restaurants, trendy bars, and boutique shops. With a Walk Score of 98, this pet-friendly Portland vacation rental is ideal for exploring nearby attractions or unwinding in style.','This neighborhood is full beautifully unique 100 year old homes and is centrally located in one of the most popular areas that visitors from all over come to see. <br /><br />You are only:<br /><br />2.5 blocks from Hawthorne and Belmont Street<br />5 Minutes from Burnside and Division<br />10 Minutes from the Moda Center<br />10 Minutes from Downtown Portland<br />15 Minutes from the Portland Japanese Gardens<br />15 Minutes from the Oregon Z00<br />Minutes away from dozens of Breweries','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52108103/original/08ce114e-cd5d-4105-9c23-1746ccd48aef.jpeg',392859086,16,'45.51382','-122.62662',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,132.00,1,365,158,4.87,52108103),(2317,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52147096','Top Floor View Slabtown/Pearl District Plant Vibe','Welcome to your Portland plant oasis. Enjoy all the city has to offer during the day and unwind with a top-floor view at night. Located a short walk from Washington Park, Breakside brewery and famous Portland food spots like Salt and Straw, VooDoo Donuts and Pine State Biscuits. This 1 bedroom has everything you need for your work or vacation stay.','The apartment is a short walk to coffee shops, bars, and restaurants. Portland is known for its iconic Pearl District and it\'s newly developed Slabtown area. All the hottest restaurants, bars, and coffee shops are in this neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52147096/original/49fc6cc6-0af3-476d-8162-faf94557bb71.jpeg',417919018,27,'45.53228','-122.68899',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,82.00,30,180,97,4.72,52147096),(2318,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52151828','*New* Remodeled pet friendly hip mid-century','Newly remodeled dog friendly  Mid Century modern duplex with off street parking, strong Wifi in a neighborhood with in walking distance to Mount Tabor Park, great restaurants and bars on NE Glisan and a short distance to Montavilla.  the Montavilla neighborhood has more great restaurants and bars, a movie theater, a farmer\'s market and more!','We are located in NE Portland within walking distance to Mt. Tabor Park and several great restaurants and bars.  We have a large Fred Meyers Grocery store about .5 miles from the house.  We are also about. 5 miles to the Montavilla neighborhood with more great options and they just opened up the Farmer\'s Market there again after being closed for 2 years!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52151828/original/3b93d866-b772-481f-9fd4-dd5ed97e8ba2.jpeg',30942269,10,'45.52484893798828','-122.58551788330078',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,30,365,11,4.82,52151828),(2319,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52152225','Cozy Portland getaway in the heart of the city','This Portland gem is everything  you\'ve been looking for. It features art and hand-made furniture from local artists and is located in the heart of east Portland. Great spots to explore within walking distance: <br />Breakfast/Brunch<br />-Jam, Screen Door, The Mont<br />Coffee<br />-Crema Coffee + Bakery, Stumptown, Coava Coffee Roasters<br />Restaurants <br />-Harlow, Tusk, Farmhouse Thai , Bamboo Sushi, Ken\'s Artisan Pizza<br />Drinks<br />-Sweet Hereafter, Midnight Society, Circa 33, Triple Nickel','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52152225/original/8427e983-d90d-458b-a6ad-9fb67221f15d.jpeg',44169147,16,'45.51585','-122.63383',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,360,13,5.00,52152225),(2320,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52165460','Terwilliger Place - No Cleaning Fees','Quiet suite five minutes from Downtown Portland, and two minutes from OHSU/Waterfront.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52165460/original/6ccae6b2-8d27-40fe-97c0-fc69441aae65.jpeg',7182995,30,'45.49195','-122.68248',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,95.00,6,210,43,4.88,52165460),(2321,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52166769','Vibrant Coze Cave by Airport w/ washer and dryer!','Immerse yourself in a vibrant, chic retreat right in NE Portland\'s Sumner district! Just a stone\'s throw from PDX and minutes to Alberta Arts, our basement ADU is your gateway to excitement and tranquility. Perfectly positioned for foodies, art lovers, and adventurers alike, it offers a cozy, quiet haven amidst the buzz. Discover the best of the Pacific Northwest with unbeatable convenience and charm. Your ultimate cozy escape to explore or unwind in style awaits!','Alberta Arts District -  Discover local art, live music and a wide range of bars and restaurants. (10 min drive)<br /><br />The Grotto - The Grotto offers a 62-acre sanctuary of peace, prayer and natural beauty for all people. (5 min walk)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1afe58b8-de7b-4eae-b9c4-56a6d45bfac7.jpg',25637387,80,'45.55598846244098','-122.57675218556996',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,90.00,2,730,51,4.90,52166769),(2322,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52198529','Adorable updated craftsman, great neighborhood','Updated 1919 craftsman with period charm and modern comforts in the safe and central Rose City Park neighborhood. Just three blocks from the Safeway supermarket and surrounded by abundant dining options. New smart appliances, fast internet, king bed, queen bed, twin loft bed, 2 full baths, full kitchen w/ all the essentials, 2 TVs, large deck surrounded by gardens/fruit trees/backyard chickens, private driveway. 10min to airport. 15 min to downtown. On greenway bike route. #12 bus line.','Our home is nestled in a quiet, residential neighborhood just a few blocks from a Safeway with numerous local restaurants  within a five minute walk. (Pizzeria Otto, Thai Seasons, Pho Korner, Second Profession Brewing Company, Ohana Hawaiian Cafe, El Burrito Azteca, and several unique local coffee shops, just to name a few.) En route to get a bite to eat, or just to explore and unwind, enjoy a peaceful stroll along the nearby streets and take in the lush PNW scenery and unique and quirky NE Portland vibe.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-52198529/original/37ca0f2a-9f02-4319-a375-74e888c6973f.jpeg',155798693,39,'45.54706','-122.59633',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,148.00,20,140,44,4.98,52198529),(2323,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52265505','3 bed/3 bath/office and patio. 100% walkable','Incredible 100% walkable location- Remote work dream -  40 restaurants and 3 markets very close by. Modern 3 bedroom and 3 bathroom (3 showers too) condo in the famous Pearl District next to the Fields Park.  Private patio & garden area with outdoor seating.   Building features elevators and a GYM.  Contemporary decor, TV in each bedroom, dual air conditioning controls (with Nest). Condo also has an office that you can use to work form home. Gigabit high speed wireless internet & wired ethernet','Located in the Pearl District at the Fields Park.  This is the best location in Portland!  It’s 100% walkable to multiple markets, retail shopping, coffee, bars, restaurants.   Of course the park is one of the coolest places in the city.  Coworking spaces are near buy.  You can walk to slab town, the alphabet district, 21st, and 23rd street to access so many more restaurants and shopping.  Whole Foods, New Seasons, and Trader Joe’s are nearby.  You can walk to the Willamette river in minutes to stroll along the river.  The street car is just a 5 minute walk and you can easily access the NS line and the B line so that you can get whoever you need to go. Dog park and play ground within 3 minutes distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52265505/original/60421f5f-85c5-4ae3-8b90-0cc8c7c4e4b4.jpeg',95508244,2,'45.53153','-122.68203',1,5,3.00,3.00,3.00,250.00,32,1125,0,1.00,52265505),(2324,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52267670','[7+ day stay] hidden sanctuary w/ location + view','Being immediately outside of downtown Portland, this space is in the most affluent region of Multnomah County, The Southwest Hills. This space is priced against the cluster of hotels in the same area. This space is perfect for a working professional who is seeking an economic advantage. A private bedroom with a double-sized bed, a private 3/4 bathroom, a (mostly, see below) private kitchen, and a private patio with a view of the cityscape and The Cascade Mountain Range are equipped for your use.','Pleasant Goose Hollow neighborhood on a hill adjacent to downtown, but not downtown. Close to downtown and close to NW 23rd Ave. and a reasonable walk to the Pearl District and the SW Waterfront, as well as to Washington Park. Near the Goose Hollow Max train stop for easy access to the Vista Avenue stairway.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52267670/original/479df886-540b-4eb9-9124-e1be27447c36.jpeg',417913151,54,'45.51351','-122.6964',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,160.00,30,62,76,4.71,52267670),(2325,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52283919','#StayInMyDistrict Buckman Lodge Popular SE Belmont','#StayinMyDistrict Buckman Lodge! Located in the heart of Inner SE Buckman neighborhood, walk to Revolution Hall, dining, food trucks, coffee shops, & shopping. Newly renovated to reflect a cozy, lodge-like sanctuary with quality amenities, local artifacts, linens & furnishings perfectly suited to the traveler used to higher end properties. Private 1bed/1 bath, Kitchenette, FREE Street Parking, Smart TV’s/WIFI. One Pre-Approved SMALL Dog','Buckman is a neighborhood in the Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. The neighborhood is bounded by the Willamette River on the west, E Burnside St. on the north, SE 28th Ave. on the east, and SE Hawthorne Blvd. on the south. The Buckman neighborhood is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Residents have plenty of independent retail, coffee, pub, and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br />Buckman’s Hawthorne District is one of the most unique, and most popular areas in Southeast Portland. The area is known for its wonderfully restored Old Portland homes, liberal residents, and fun and funky feel. The street is lined with unique restaurants and shops and has a definite Portland-local flair.  Local area standouts are Slow Bar, Rontoms, My Father’s Place, and the Lucky Labrador Brew Pub. The closest include:<br />- The','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-52283919/original/c0e2d179-9860-4d72-9dac-f3611041da50.jpeg',3142393,32,'45.518887','-122.645302',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,69.00,1,25,146,4.88,52283919),(2326,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52288350','Quiet Woodstock Rancher w/ Large Private Garden','The SE Woodstock Rancher is a clean and spacious home with generous bedrooms, a full kitchen and a large (fenced) wrap-around yard to enjoy during your stay.  The covered patio offers a great space for soaking in the outdoors.  Located one block from Woodstock Park and a few blocks from dining and shopping on Woodstock Blvd.  Also a short distance from many shops and restaurants in the Foster/Powell neighborhood.  If you are looking for a quiet, comfortable place to relax or work...this is it.','Quiet and charming SE Portland neighborhood of Woodstock','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52288350/original/064dec4f-ea54-4d5c-a738-88b442c9c342.jpeg',26060885,38,'45.485713958740234','-122.61225891113281',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,139.00,2,1125,27,4.93,52288350),(2327,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52309660','At Home on Holland St.','Located in the Piedmont neighborhood of Portland, this is a basement unit with plenty of space to make you feel right at home. Equipped with a full kitchen, bathroom, and laundry units. One large bedroom with a Queen size bed, closet, and sitting area. One smaller bedroom with a Queen bed, and closet. The unit has AC and Heat, along with additional cadet wall heaters in each bedroom. We hope you’ll stay and make yourself comfortable!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/84f56176-6eda-4635-a7fe-bbceab324b80.jpg',180951800,48,'45.57477','-122.66842',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,3,45,74,4.93,52309660),(2328,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52327219','Lovely 2 Bedroom Mt. Scott Duplex w/Patio&Garage','Enjoy an extended stay in this stylish duplex up on Mount Scott in SE Portland/Happy Valley, close to public transportation, I-205 & Clackamas Town Center. ***Calendar availability for longer stays available!!***<br /><br /> Equipped with a fully stocked kitchen, full size appliances, including a washer/dryer for your convenience! Work from home with sit/stand desk and high speed WIFI, attached garage and a private patio with a cozy gas fire-pit!<br />Plus enjoy stress free parking w/your own  driveway!','Older neighborhood - quaintly situated up on Mount Scott in East Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-52327219/original/0cbaaa78-b39b-489d-9f7b-6dd91e6154fe.jpeg',374459836,72,'45.46575','-122.55575',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,126.00,31,90,14,5.00,52327219),(2329,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52336830','New listing, modern, rooftop- 3 bed/2.5 bath','Location, location, location! Newly built Scandinavian modern home, with great views of downtown and west hills. 4th floor rooftop deck with 360 views of SE/Central Portland.   Setup for a family of 4-6 people.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52336830/original/3b2da4a4-59ec-4088-95f2-2adc0c4fc243.jpeg',5323164,32,'45.520653','-122.65004',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,350.00,30,180,0,1.00,52336830),(2330,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52351505','Private Luxury Suite B With a Kitchenette & View','This is a private entranced botique hotel like guest suite with kitchenette.  The french doors leads to a tiny  kitchenette/ main area. It has an apartment sized refrig, sink, micro / skillet/ Plug in burner pots and pans.<br /><br />The1 bedroom off of the main area is pretty nice and spacious.. there is a 32 in roku tv. Queen size bed and a pretty nice  view.. <br /><br />The small bathroom has a toilet & custom shower.  The vanity is in the kitchenette area as well as a sitting area. small table and chairs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b2a03117-7bc7-4779-bbd9-f3903784ba68.jpg',90876848,77,'45.47077','-122.54134',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,28,1125,9,4.89,52351505),(2331,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52391382','Warm Two Bedroom Residential Home with Game Room','Make some memories at this unique and family-friendly place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52391382/original/5600d38b-7dbd-4657-9279-05b9af93de0e.jpeg',306489174,69,'45.47453','-122.58367',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,7,4.86,52391382),(2332,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52407240','Candelabra House-Private, no shared walls, by Reed','Charming, peaceful, uniquely ornate 2 bedroom home in a beautiful Woodstock neighborhood. It features a king size bed master bedroom, guest bedroom, 1 full bathroom, living room, a fully stocked kitchen, AC, 55 inch smart tv and a private yard/covered patio. Full use of the entire house, front yard and back yard. No shared walls, floors or yard areas. Near Reed College, Woodstock\'s restaurants, this residential neighborhood is ideal for a retreat.<br />Message us with any questions you might have!','Within 10 minutes or less walking distance: Mehri’s Café and Bakery (at the end of the block), Heart Coffee, 7 Eleven, Ate-Oh-Ate Grill, Bridge City Pizza, Bergerac French Cuisine, Super Torta Mexican Food, Proper Pint Taproom, Dick’s Primal Burger<br /><br />Within 15 minutes walking distance: New Seasons, Safeway, Bi-Mart, Woodstock Farmers Market (seasonal), Papaccino\'s Coffee, Grand Central Bakery, Delta Café, Double Mountain Taproom, Lutz Tavern, Nudi Noodle Place, Otto’s Sausage Kitchen, Bai Mint Thai Kitchen and more!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52407240/original/2720c0a1-f237-4067-907d-517848cc79de.jpeg',5268931,69,'45.47243','-122.60928',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,118.00,2,20,32,4.94,52407240),(2333,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52464444','Tranquility House','This tranquil space located on the outskirts of Portland is a hop, skip and a jump to the world famous Columbia River Gorge and amazing day trips.  High clerestory windows give guests views of tree tops, the spacious living room opens to a large back deck and meditation labyrinth. Perfect for either a busy working-professional or travelers looking to experience a more relaxed side of Portland.','This home is located 15 Minutes from the PDX Airport in an eastside residential neighborhood about 30 minutes from downtown, and one hour from Mt. Hood. A short distance away is a community walking trail at the Glendoveer Golf Course.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c16945e8-61a1-4e84-a2b6-978a8f0395df.jpg',48595009,71,'45.5281','-122.50095',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,161.00,3,365,122,4.95,52464444),(2334,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52474903','The Portland Mercantile - Historic Mississippi Ave','The Portland Mercantile is an old-time grocery converted to a loft style studio. It is a unique, historic, and lovingly restored space from the early 20th century. Full of comfort and creative touches, The Mercantile is a delight whether you are here for work or play, a creative retreat, or urban adventure. The best of Portland\'s creative and culinary culture is right outside your door. The Mercantile and the Mississippi neighborhood will not disappoint!','The Historic Mississippi Ave. neighborhood is chock full of interesting sights and scenes, shops, boutiques, cafés and restaurants. Check out our favorites in our Portland Guidebook!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52474903/original/20a5225b-07f3-41c1-a424-8f7374833035.jpeg',424758888,24,'45.55594','-122.67644',1,4,1.00,0.00,1.00,125.00,30,90,41,4.98,52474903),(2335,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52489567','Classic 2BR Dog Friendly | Hot Tub | Deck','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-52489567/original/8e22c251-f857-481b-9215-51eff70ed760.jpeg',111798260,38,'45.47796','-122.60303',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,299.00,30,1125,13,4.46,52489567),(2336,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52505909','Large private upstairs space in Historic home','This historic home (1888) is perfect for your temporary stay in Portland. It is beautifully decorated and fully ready for you to live in.<br />The home is near public transportation and major roads, meaning you can get anywhere in Portland easily. The river, shops, cafes, restaurants, bars, food trucks, & more are within walking distance.<br />The entire upstairs would be a private living area for you, with a shared kitchen & laundry. The downstairs tenant is often at work or traveling.','Brooklyn is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Sellwood, Hawthorne, and Clinton. Residents have plenty of coffee, pub, and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br /><br />Brooklyn is definitely a favorite and in-demand Portland neighborhood and feels very community-friendly, safe, and family-focused.  Dog walkers, runners, babes in strollers, and people of all sorts busy the streets.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTI1MDU5MDk%3D/original/06703e8d-6d0e-46c2-8d89-39913e80eafc.png',8898956,25,'45.50169','-122.65812',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,26.00,31,80,7,5.00,52505909),(2337,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52517239','Concordia Apartment','New large 1 BR modern & private apartment (completely private, attached to our family home), 1 block to McMenamins Kennedy School & walking distance to Alberta Arts District. Queen suite w/ large living space & big open kitchen. New Article full size memory foam sleeper sofa in living room. Includes a fully stocked kitchen equipment and   private W/D.<br />Perfect couples retreat!  If you do not see the dates you want, send us a message and we will try to accommodate. We block out for family time.','Located in Concordia and a quick 10 minute walk to Alberta Arts.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52517239/original/1d9a6f73-7d4c-4fcb-b130-9b2097a30827.jpeg',425076265,1,'45.56678','-122.62847',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,3,90,77,4.83,52517239),(2338,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52551684','Elegant Historic Irvington Home','2 bedroom, 2 bathroom home in historic Irvington. All queen beds. Antiques and garden lovers will appreciate this 1906 Queen Anne Victorian home with a central gas fireplace and beautiful gardens.<br /><br />The entire house, front porch, and yard are for your exclusive use. The property is shared with the homeowner, who has a unit in the backyard and uses the basement and backyard. The entire house is available except the basement (for laundry/storage) and the attic (locked for personal items).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTI1NTE2ODQ%3D/original/3078d9ff-9814-40e1-a5e6-1c8231da30a6.jpeg',7409866,7,'45.5394244502062','-122.65264689068023',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,202.00,1,365,18,5.00,52551684),(2339,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52552937','#StayInMyDistrict Buckman Bright Spacious Townhome','#StayinMyDistrict Buckman neighborhood. Great location in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Walk to local shops, dining and enjoy one of Portland\'s favorite neighborhoods. Modern style and comfort in this bright & open space. Hardwood floors, modern finishes, high ceilings & tons of light, in this private 1bed/1 bath, Full Kitchen, W/D, FREE Street Parking, Smart TV & WIFI. Up to (4) guests. Dog Friendly w/addl fee.','Buckman is a neighborhood in the Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. The neighborhood is bounded by the Willamette River on the west, E Burnside St. on the north, SE 28th Ave. on the east, and SE Hawthorne Blvd. on the south. The Buckman neighborhood is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Residents have plenty of independent retail, coffee, pub, and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br />Buckman’s Hawthorne District is one of the most unique, and most popular areas in Southeast Portland. The area is known for its wonderfully restored Old Portland homes, liberal residents, and fun and funky feel. The street is lined with unique restaurants and shops and has a definite Portland-local flair.  Local area standouts are Slow Bar, Rontoms, My Father’s Place, and the Lucky Labrador Brew Pub.<br />Compared to most other are','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-52552937/original/356b6cc2-5a4f-4151-8e17-5687bab48a8c.jpeg',3142393,32,'45.51661682128906','-122.64197540283203',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,74.00,1,28,134,4.72,52552937),(2340,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52580034','Charming remodeled bungalow in trendy Westmoreland','Charming home recently remodeled with beautiful finishes and  new appliances.  Located in trendy Westmoreland.  Steps away from restaurants, bars, coffee shops, boutiques, parks, Eastmoreland  golf course, Reed college and many other amenities.  Walkable and bike friendly neighborhood.  The house is also just blocks from mass transit including a Light Rail stop, for easy access to downtown.  3 bedrooms with a huge finished basement.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f8a70503-e592-4454-a300-68f9d35adc82.jpg',233640130,20,'45.47734','-122.64256',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,180.00,30,365,3,5.00,52580034),(2341,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52584189','Private forest suite with kitchenette.','Cozy up in a tranquil city getaway. Nestled in a verdant forest, this private guest suite is just minutes from downtown, the Pearl District, OHSU, the zoo, Hawthorne Street / SE Portland, Beaverton / Nike / Intel, Fo-Po and other local attractions!<br /><br />Clean, quiet, spacious and well appointed, this tasteful apartment is the perfect spot for business travel or pleasure.<br /><br />Includes:<br />- Kitchenette<br />- Dedicated workspace, WiFi<br />- Memory foam mattress<br />- Forest views & trails<br />- Guest parking<br />-Bus service','(Easiest access to downtown Portland that you can find! Just 2 stoplights between us and the city, on a fast-moving, traffic-free highway! It\'s Portland\'s secret spot!)<br /><br />The house is located on a quiet cul-de-sac on the eastern edge of the desirable Hillsdale neighborhood (southwest Portland). Our property is part of a forest conservation area, with hiking trails that start right at our doorstep. Our closest trail takes you to a small beach and river walk/esplanade on the Willamette River waterfront (about 15-20 minute walk). <br /><br />Just down the street is \"downtown\" Hillsdale, a quaint commercial zone that includes food carts, restaurants, an ice cream parlor, coffee shops, a grocery store, and more. This laid-back area gives you the feeling of a quiet, small town, yet is just minutes from downtown Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52584189/original/e7df194b-793c-4c74-9c75-0a95f95dad66.jpeg',38262590,31,'45.47889709472656','-122.68685913085938',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,2,29,116,4.96,52584189),(2342,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52601051','Pet Friendly Studio with Fenced Yard','Welcome to The Studio in Portland\'s Piedmont neighborhood!<br /><br />This spacious Studio is 550 sq/ft with a 12x20 main room, large walk-in closet w/ in-unit laundry.  It also has a separate kitchen/dinning area with plenty of room for two to cook + a dishwasher to help with clean-up.<br /><br />In addition to a roomy living area, there is a large private fenced yard. This is the perfect place to travel with your dog!','The Piedmont neighborhood is the ideal urban village boasting easy access to other popular Portland neighborhoods such as Humboldt, Alberta, Arbor Lodge, Boise, Eliot, and Kenton to name a few. Piedmont runs alongside the Max light rail train allowing for convenient commuting to downtown Portland and other Portland neighborhoods. Downtown by car is less than five minutes and by bike is about twenty-five minutes. I-5 is easily accessed as it runs directly alongside Piedmont.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52601051/original/1c324dc2-37be-4c48-b944-18b0afa4540b.jpeg',198019,48,'45.57399','-122.6755',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,92.00,2,365,67,4.76,52601051),(2343,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52601863','Peaceful double bedroom with view of rear garden.','Kick back and relax in this calm, quiet room. This is usually the host\'s bedroom (clothes rail and drawers will be cleared but my clothes will be in the closet). Please see reviews for \"Clean, comfortable master bedroom\" for details on about the other room and reviews. The property is all on one level but there are a 1-2 small exterior steps to the front door and another exterior step down to the patio at the back. 50mbps internet. Sorry, no pets.','Close to the very pleasant Woodstock and Mt Scott Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52601863/original/1b733a19-5fee-4736-9cdd-212322a7b28f.jpeg',254586465,69,'45.47385','-122.5922',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,45.00,30,209,2,5.00,52601863),(2344,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52630652','Woodstock/Eastmoreland Fun Walkable Inner SE Apt.','Basement unit complete comfort. Walk to everything is this family like inner SE Woodstock neighborhood is only a a few blocks to Eastmoreland and Reed College.  2 full sized separate bedrooms. Keep it simple at this peaceful and walkable centrally-located place. Working remote, visiting PDX or families. Comfortable and accommodating with full apartment amenities and quiet office space.  See pics of Woodstock blvd neighborhood lively businesses.','Safe, clean walkable buzzing neighborhood that has all you need. Perfect whoever you are and including families find it quite welcoming. Whether is groceries, or choices of several restaurants are just a few places you\'ll find.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52630652/original/114a3512-1d30-4a30-b106-d4ba510ad6f4.jpeg',79757839,38,'45.477608','-122.618774',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,119.00,30,120,15,4.67,52630652),(2345,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52665330','Awesome Alberta Arts Apartment','This 1 bedroom condo unit is part of Fifteenth Avenue Condominiums, built in May of 2022.  The condo space for rent here is 505 sf.  It\'s modern, contemporary & brand new. <br /><br />The property is located in the highly walkable Alberta Arts district, with plenty of food options, great coffee, shops & easy access to the frequently running 8 & 72 bus lines.  There\'s also plenty of easy street parking right in front of the home.  The driveway is for the upper condo unit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52665330/original/4a28a675-68d2-400a-80e7-044229a128a1.jpeg',7409866,29,'45.56091','-122.65084',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,28,79,4.91,52665330),(2346,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52735036','Cheerful sunny  bedroom in artist bungalow','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway in artist bungalow. Peaceful, great location to all transportation, shopping, near Gorge, Glendovere golf course and beautiful walk trails,  airport, freshly painted, new windows, wall to wall carpet, new little frig, microwave, ceiling fan, full sized bed, desk, chair, shelving, curtains, off street parking, rugs, lots of art in home of artist, private tour of artist\'s studio out back and art for sale.Please no pets, children.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52735036/original/91250301-c07b-48ef-b4ac-128e2ad6257e.jpeg',330040000,63,'45.52961264168483','-122.5368713350562',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,365,0,1.00,52735036),(2347,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52737181','Alberta Arts Modern Vintage Gem!','Looking for a relaxing stay, with modern amenities, vintage charm, in one of Portland\'s best neighborhoods? Look no further!  Conveniently located only 10+ MINs from DOWNTOWN & PDX AIRPORT, The Alberta Arts Modern Vintage Gem is nestled perfectly among the Alberta Arts District,  beautiful parks & a short walk to Portland\'s famous Kennedy School!  The Vintage Gem offers a peaceful escape in a comfortable setting, and walking distance to restaurants, parks, shops, bars, cafes, and art galleries!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52737181/original/ed0f1493-5e0a-46b8-a345-b48d84738a9c.jpeg',426942173,1,'45.566','-122.63118',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,211.00,2,90,55,5.00,52737181),(2348,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52763423','Private Renovated Studio w full kitchen & Parking!','Enjoy a stylish and Private experience at this centrally-located studio in Portland.  2 mins from the PCC Sylvania Campus and just 10 mins from OHSU & downtown Perfect for travel professionals & vacationers !<br /><br />Remodeled with all new stainless steel kitchen appliances, Furniture, Freshly painted walls and new LVP floors! <br /><br />Included Washer/dryer, AC/Heat, air fryer, keurig Coffee maker, Coffee, comfy couch and a workstation! <br /><br />Netflix, Hulu, Disney+ Chrome-cast and WiFi all available for guests!','Our neighborhood is a small development that is established, quiet and safe.  Everyone is super kind and welcoming, we ask to please respect our neighbors :) <br /><br />What\'s nearby<br />1. Moda Center 7 mi<br />2. Jantzen Beach Center 12 mi<br />3. Oregon Convention Center 6.8 mi<br />4. Washington Square Mall 2.2 mi<br />5. Oregon Health and Science Uni 4.6 mi<br />6. Oregon Zoo 4.7 mi<br />7. Shriners Hospital for Children 4.7 mi<br />8. Washington Park 5 mi<br />9. Portland State University 5.4 mi<br />10. Portland Japanese Garden 5.4 mi<br />11. International Rose Test Garden 5.5 mi<br />12. Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden 5.5 mi<br />13. Nike world Headquarters 8.7 mi <br />14. Intel 12 mi','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f10948af-c34c-4b20-ab83-d4f5ce608965.jpg',427162525,68,'45.44152','-122.73695',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,3,90,72,5.00,52763423),(2349,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52795164','Beautiful Tudor style home in inner SE','My beautiful 1930’s furnished home is available for a minimum of a month. 3 bedroom 3 bath with beautiful stained and leaded glass, large picture windows, hardwood floors and gas fireplace. 2 queen beds and one twin. Office room and laundry. Private and on a quiet streets in a wonderful close in Southeast neighborhood with off street parking. Furnished and ready for you to move in. WiFi included. No pets and no smoking in the house.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/700b6cab-6f7d-48f3-aea3-a3d68f4b3899.jpg',63604806,25,'45.50798','-122.63716',1,5,3.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,90,3,5.00,52795164),(2350,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52812199','Cozy 1 BR Bungalow STEPS away from Hawthorne Blvd','Right in the heart of Southeast Portland, this Basement Bungalow is located in the idyllic Hosford-Abernethy Neighborhood less than 100 feet from Hawthorne Boulevard.<br /><br />Come enjoy the coziest home base for all of your Portland adventures. We are just blocks away from famous Portland restaurants and bakeries, beautiful rose gardens of Ladd\'s Addition and extensive bike and running paths. <br /><br />**The Bungalow is unfortunately NOT ADA accessible**','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52812199/original/fae79606-1ce7-4995-8423-ed0728fa041b.jpeg',75641753,25,'45.51099','-122.64395',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,88.00,2,40,107,4.84,52812199),(2351,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52816816','Our peaceful dwelling','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fe89bea4-8283-44fd-8496-285e714f4ebf.jpg',284121454,78,'45.49276','-122.53996',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,50.00,30,1125,19,4.58,52816816),(2352,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52841279','Private Guest Suite - In the heart of NE Portland!','Enjoy this perfectly private but urban hideaway. Nestled right in the heart of the Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood, within walking distance to 42nd Avenue, Alberta Arts District and Upper Fremont Street, each with a multitude of bars, restaurants, bakeries, coffee shops and locally owned gems. Easy access to freeways, Providence Medical, Legacy Emanuel, Convention Centers and The PDX airport is 15 mins by car. Downtown is a 10-15 min drive with plenty of east side neighborhoods in between.','Beaumont-Wilshire is a well established neighborhood in the heart of NE Portland. It has a nice mix of residential and commercial stretches making it easy to get around by foot. It is easily accessed from the Portland International Airport. The surrounding neighborhoods are also bustling with restaurants and sites to see.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52841279/original/50377ddf-8896-4f8a-8e47-a6f4ea19e80f.jpeg',1217742,46,'45.55544','-122.62241',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,180,365,34,4.91,52841279),(2353,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52843369','The Artist Sanctuary','Our home is located between popular Hawthorne and Belmont neighborhoods. Exactly, two blocks from Belmont St. and 4 blocks from Hawthorne St. You really cannot ask for a better location. Restaurants, vintage shopping, coffee shops, and more.','This location is one of the most desired in Portland. The home is located between two of the slot possible streets in Portland: Hawthorne and Belmont. A few blocks from both streets, you are able to walk to dinner, shopping, coffee shops, etc. this is a fun, exciting, and in-demand area that is perfect for visitors.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0da7fc00-2aca-484e-b956-223b086098fc.jpg',205079895,16,'45.51494','-122.62822',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,30,1125,17,4.88,52843369),(2354,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52859211','Roseway Retreat','Welcome to our guest space! We are conveniently located within a few minutes of the Portland Airport. Use the keyless private entry to access our basement guest suite we personally designed with comfort & relaxation in mind. Super close to parks, local bars & restaurants, groceries, and other local businesses.<br /><br />This is the perfect place to stay for someone wanting a comfortable, clean environment in a great location.','The Roseway neighborhood is a gem that is super close to the PDX airport. It is also home to some great local businesses. For your sweet tooth we have Annie’s Doughnuts, Bee’s Cakes & Bakery and Fairley’s Pharmacy (known for their milkshake bar). Groceries are easily found right up the street at Safeway. Head down Fremont a little ways and you’ll find a plethora of local bars & restaurants in the Beaumont neighborhood.<br /><br />Our street has a park median that can be used by anyone! Feel free to take a stroll or play some frisbee in the park blocks. Occasionally there will be events such as races or BBQ’s, but usually it’s just folks walking their dogs.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8552a410-b3d1-4076-a41c-80d824455e6a.jpg',55428340,39,'45.54964','-122.58944',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,62.00,1,1125,183,4.93,52859211),(2355,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52864168','Centrally Located Historic Hawthorne Home','Location, location in the heart of Southeast! A short walk to a variety of bars and restaurants, concert venues, parks, and shops. And a short drive to the Moda Center, Convention Center, OHSU, Nike and Adidas Headquarters and the PDX airport. Perfect for a family getaway, or weekend on the town with friends!<br /><br />2 bedrooms, an upstairs den, a modular living room couch, a fenced-in, turfed backyard, and an open floor plan makes this house perfect for hosting.','The charm of SE Portland is like no other. The thrift shops, Ma&Pa restaurants, local bars, dispensaries, hiking and lush tree-lined neighborhood walks and boutique fitness studios are unparalleled to any other city. Our space is 15 minutes from the Portland airport, 5 minute drive to downtown shopping and dining, 2 min walk to restaurants, bars, shopping and much more. Our home is just minutes to The Moda Center, Providence Park, Portland State, Lewis & Clark and University of Portland!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/01d1d5be-2cab-4d4f-8553-beec0ad2abaa.jpg',101889896,25,'45.51199','-122.64725',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,298.00,3,31,52,4.90,52864168),(2356,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52878944','Awesome location, lovely 3BR Alberta Arts District','The Alberta Petite Hotel is a very nice relaxing house in a perfect walkable location on Alberta St and 24th with galleries, local shops, restaurants and entertainment. The house is craftsman-style with modern and contemporary touches. Rent the upper two floors of this house which includes 3-bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, spacious and well-stocked kitchen, large dining rm, living rm, laundry rm and office. Enjoy the expansive porch and the many outdoor spaces. One parking space.','This is one of the best areas in Portland (in my humble opinion). The Alberta Arts District has so many cool art galleries, shops, cafes, restaurants and entertainment...you\'ll never run out of good food and fun things to do. The neighborhood is very walkable and good for getting some exercise in there are lots of cool older Portland homes in this area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTI4Nzg5NDQ%3D/original/c92ca3b1-62d9-4a67-b10d-ef2cefcafd45.jpeg',224911430,1,'45.55945','-122.6413',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,279.00,2,300,51,5.00,52878944),(2357,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52886721','Beautiful Tiny House on Sweet Property in NE PDX!','Enjoy tiny house living in this beautiful, one-of-a-kind tiny house called Pacifica, built by the famous Zyl Vardos in Olympia. Originally custom built for Caravan- The Tiny House Hotel, the world\'s first tiny house hotel in the Alberta Arts District, Pacifica has been revamped for monthly stays at my sweet property in NE PDX.  I\'m Deb, the owner of Caravan, and I\'m so excited to share this gem with people looking for monthly stays in the friendly, safe and quirky Cully neighborhood.','The yard for Pacifica has been completely renovated with cozy places to sit, a custom-made wine barrel table, a gorgeous antique Indonesian gate, Adirondack chair, covered bike storage, and more. It is totally private with a whimsical fence, and has a separate entrance and free parking spot. Utilities included and free high speed wi-fi.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52886721/original/d67895ed-8347-4b85-9d2e-d1db68aaf0af.jpeg',199501890,21,'45.55035','-122.60139',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,45.00,30,120,5,5.00,52886721),(2358,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52897209','HotTub, Fast WiFi, cozy & convenient-Casita Morado','Cute 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment with a well-equipped kitchenette offers a comfortable haven in the trendy Montavilla neighborhood. Take a relaxing soak in our sparkling clean hot tub, Explore nearby shops and restaurants, or venture further with easy access to MAX light rail and major highways (I-84 & I-205).','We are located in Portland\'s trendy Montavilla neighborhood, near the foot of mount tabor.  Max Light Rail is a five minute walk.  Interstates 84 and 205 are less than 5 minutes, so getting around Portland is super easy.<br /><br />Excellent location:<br />PDX airport - 10 minutes<br />Downtown - 10 minutes<br />Belmont/Hawthorne - 10 minutes<br />Alberta - 15 minutes<br />NW Pearl District - 15 minutes<br />Mt Hood - 60 minutes<br />Ocean Beaches - 90 minutes','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTI4OTcyMDk%3D/original/35d6119f-b1c3-49c1-ac2b-418b688dc16c.png',2283444,10,'45.53018','-122.57304',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,2,5,164,4.95,52897209),(2359,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52917118','Spacious home,private yard,off street parking','Spacious home with, family room, and workout area. Convenient location—close to grocery stores, OHSU, downtown, public transportation. Off street parking for 2 cars. Ideal for family or group of friends. Fully fenced private backyard with paved patio. Full kitchen. Washer and dryer. Easy check-in with lockbox at front door.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8af6e326-3b32-4761-8501-c5530a776721.jpg',119494333,28,'45.46624','-122.68619',1,4,1.00,3.00,3.00,158.00,1,60,79,4.86,52917118),(2360,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52920166','Downtown Portland Studio: An Artist\'s Retreat','2nd floor spatious corner apartment in downtown Portland. City views! Tons of natural light! Cozy! Central to everything & quiet! The area is a cultural hub with restaurants, shops & galleries. Apartment is equipped with a seperate kitchen & dining area; sit/stand workstation; 5G Internet; cozy queen bed; full bath;  walk-in closet with in-unit laundry; Sonos, & Amazon Fire TV.  <br />Aug/ Sept: The building is undergoing plumbing repairs.  Water restrictions may very ocassionally be needed.','North West Portland is a much sought after location, a cultural hub filled with restaurants, bars and galleries, catering to all and every diet and ethnicity.  A thriving area with a long tradition of being the place to be and actually enhanced by all the heated outdoor restaurant and bar areas. Powell\'s books is 3 blocks East, art house Cinema 21 is 4 blocks West, Whole Foods, Everyday Music is one block away. Public transit is on the South side of the building. Everything and everywhere Portland is right outside your front door!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52920166/original/ff4bc9a0-0e40-422f-b9c8-ea3bf735e639.jpeg',8738428,27,'45.523235','-122.687019',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,93,8,4.75,52920166),(2361,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52923271','Charmaine’s place','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. You have shopping, movies, food carts all within 3 blocks and Access to the bus line close by. I do have a small dog and 3 chickens. Fresh eggs are not a problem.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7e74ea26-a865-4b19-ba03-5d9b456aeeaf.jpg',426716618,87,'45.50613','-122.49608',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,25.00,31,1125,5,4.80,52923271),(2362,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52948652','Personal Sanctuary - South West Portland','Guests will enjoy the entire  570 SQ Ft  lower level of my home with a separate entrance.  Full Kitchen. Private bedroom.  Private deck for coffee/wine.  Self check-in & parking.  5 minutes from downtown Portland. Local transportation 3 min walk.  The coast & wine an hour drive.  Local eateries & food carts at Hillsdale walking distance. Multnomah  village. OSHU. Lewis and Clark.  Marquam Trails 15 mins.  This upscale unit offers the perfect blend of city and serenity. Safe Place','Lower part of Hillsdale. Downtown 5 min drive.  Lewis and Clark Collage.<br />OSHU. Reed College. Hiking trails.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52948652/original/33efbd9b-5b58-4c3e-8d44-04263deef010.jpeg',53037521,31,'45.47472','-122.68552',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,2,35,85,4.93,52948652),(2363,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52950061','North Portland Urban Cottage','Located on a quiet street known for it\'s trees the \'Apple House\' is dog and family friendly. It sleeps 4 with 1 King sized bed. Full sized pullout sofa and 1 twin air bed. You\'ll be set at this perfect little cottage 5 blocks from the North American Adidas Headquarters. Quiet home with a well lit driveway and fenced in backyard. No cats. 2 dog max with a pet fee of 20$ per stay. Extra pets include an additional fee of $20.00 per dog per stay.','Located 5 blocks from Adidas North American Campus. Nestled on a quiet street great for walks and bike rides to the bluffs overlooking the Willamette River and Swan Island.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52950061/original/7d52ff84-ebee-48e5-b761-096d292b45e5.jpeg',100815695,13,'45.56357068157594','-122.68525915520665',1,4,1.00,1.00,3.00,149.00,2,30,96,4.98,52950061),(2364,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52964179','NE PDX Bungalow','LOCATION: Stay in the foodie Mecca of Portland: Extracto coffee in the morning, Pine State biscuits for brunch, late lunch at Mis Tacones, walk the shops along Alberta with Salt & Straw ice cream, and finish the day with dinner at Gumba and cocktails at Expatriate - and that’s just one day!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTI5NjQxNzk%3D/original/9f5f3906-4b67-41d9-b4de-b6c76a096e3d.jpeg',7205630,1,'45.562832401005835','-122.63012688529805',1,6,1.00,3.00,4.00,188.00,30,365,2,5.00,52964179),(2365,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52994467','Five Star Location, Adorable Secluded Tiny Home','Cute, secluded tiny home tucked away in the heart of bustling Clinton/Division street. Within walking distance of dozens of restaurants and attractions yet this tiny home is extremely quiet and private. Private fenced yard, full bathroom, queen bed, refrigerator, induction stove, small oven and smart TV.','Once a sleepy thoroughfare, Southeast Division Street is now one of Portland’s most dynamic and stylish neighborhoods. Spend a day wandering its many blocks, stopping along the way to snack, sip and shop. Read on for our favorite things to do in Division/Clinton.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52994467/original/e9f4f80f-7070-4cea-a16e-f1e78846376d.jpeg',4006487,25,'45.50467','-122.63837',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,48.00,45,999,16,4.75,52994467),(2366,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53011315','St Johns garden retreat- bright, patio, big yard','Relax in St Johns with beer on draft! This newly renovated, private, ground floor studio apartment, detached from the main house. Bright and modern, this pet-friendly space is accessed from a private entrance off the oversized yard and has its own patio. And there\'s access to a kegerator that usually has a local ale on tap.<br /><br />2 blocks from Pier Park with its majestic trees and world-class disc golf, a short walk to downtown St Johns, and a short bike ride or drive to the University of Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTMwMTEzMTU%3D/original/8cde1641-afad-4c58-a7f7-61480bcbaca3.jpeg',221744485,58,'45.597397','-122.754715',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,2,365,112,4.98,53011315),(2367,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53031695','Modern Basement Apartment - Heart of Foster-Powell','Enjoy our comfortable and conveniently located FoPo apartment in the heart of Foster Powell. Walk to some of the best restaurants and bars that Portland has to offer, or jump on the freeway just 5min away, or downtown in 10min. You can get just about anywhere in town with a short drive or on public transportation to all the best spots in town. You\'ll also have access to a common space large side yard with a fire pit and a patio space with BBQ.<br />Free east on-site parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53031695/original/d15418ed-e3bb-444b-b036-31e664b642fc.jpeg',45560716,36,'45.49320078880211','-122.5983175068597',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,9,14,5.00,53031695),(2368,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53050479','Private Apartment - Concordia District','Quiet apartment with private entrance in the Concordia neighborhood. One block from the new UO satellite campus, 10 minute walk to restaurants and dispensary on Dekum, 15 minute walk to the Alberta Arts DIstrict.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53050479/original/a42da0f7-6847-4808-917d-abc28b4a4022.jpeg',19969093,1,'45.571938645261405','-122.63683710374322',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,45.00,30,365,8,4.75,53050479),(2369,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53051346','Cosmo’s House ~ Sunny Alberta Arts Bungalow','Enjoy a quintessential Portland neighborhood experience.  You can walk to dozens of great restaurants, coffee shops, galleries and boutiques or go for a run  in Wilshire Park.  Private 100-year-old home offers tastefully decorated space with fenced front and backyard for you and your guests. Entertain in the well appointed dining room, bathe in old world charm, dozens of houseplants. Great location to access Portland International Airport.','Alberta Arts is a thriving and creative neighborhood with galleries, restaurants, cafes, boutiques and food carts.  Over twenty blocks of fascinating and enjoyable things to peruse.  You are about roughly two miles to other funky and diverse Portland districts, being Mississippi Avenue and North Williams.  There are a variety of parks within walking distance to enjoy, and the house is located along one of Portland\'s greenways (reduced traffic where bikes and pedestrians have the right of way).  You can get by bike all over the eastside of Portland relatively easily, or take a trip over the bridge to the Pearl district.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53051346/original/2190c415-7f19-4c23-9c27-3f6fdb8e365a.jpeg',19813706,1,'45.55741','-122.63398',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,6,29,19,5.00,53051346),(2370,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53062253','Urban Victoria Historic Registry home with 4 beds!','This stunning renovation of an 1884 historic Victorian is perfect for your next visit. The home is stacked with luxe finishes, gourmet kitchen, charming antiquities, fenced yard.   King bdrm, Queen bdrm, plus 2 twin beds in bonus space. Central location with quick access to dining, nightlife and freeway. The ideal spot to relax and explore central Portland!<br /><br />As experienced SuperHosts with 4.97 rating and 100+ reviews, we can’t wait to welcome you to our latest offering. Welcome home!','The home is placed at a lovely location beneath the OHSU tram (walk to the tram) just off SW Barbur Blvd, which connects to downtown Portland and the Pearl where you will find fine dining and active nightlife to spend your most unforgettable vacation. For groceries, the closest supermarket you will find is Swan Mart and it is 0.5 miles away. More supermarkets, as well as restaurants and coffee shops, can be found in downtown Portland which is a short drive from the house. Numerous parks are only nearby -- Elizabeth Caruthers, Lair Hill Park, George Himes City Park-- whenever you wish to get some fresh air and stroll around. When craving for fun Oaks Amusement Park and Oregon Zoo are places that never disappoint.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-53062253/original/44ccaf57-e6b4-4d2e-a2d1-7513f5dcf311.jpeg',352768058,22,'45.49842','-122.67764',1,5,1.50,2.00,4.00,105.00,2,365,155,4.93,53062253),(2371,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53106866','Tiny Log Cabin ~ Walk to Local Shops & Eateries','Are you thinking about downsizing? Do you watch Tiny House Nation every week? Nestled in the heart of Southeast Portland, this beautiful wooded tiny house puts everything within walking distance. They say great things come in small packages, and that rings true here with everything you need for your stay. One visit, and you\'ll be inspired to embrace the Tiny Life!','Our charming home is nestled in the idyllic Division/Clinton district, also known as the Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood on local maps. Just four blocks away lies the historic Ladd\'s Addition, known for its beautiful rose gardens and unique diagonal street layout. While our home is situated on a bustling street, walking one block north will bring you to a serene residential area.<br /><br />You\'ll be steps away from some of Portland\'s finest restaurants, eclectic shopping, and convenient grocery stores, all within easy walking distance. Enjoy the vibrant local culture with nearby cafes, boutiques, and farmers\' markets. The area is also well-served by public transit, making it easy to explore other parts of the city. Whether you\'re looking for a quiet stroll through tree-lined streets or an evening out at a trendy eatery, our neighborhood offers the perfect blend of urban excitement and residential tranquility.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53106866/original/3ef75400-cdc7-47f9-b45e-ba1e17068e2a.jpeg',273076012,56,'45.49794','-122.64095',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,64.00,1,365,246,4.84,53106866),(2372,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53108500','Charming East Portland Base: Explore & Unwind','Whether you\'re a foodie, craft beer enthusiast, coffee connoisseur, or a lover of the great outdoors, discover what the City of Roses has to offer at our newly remodeled three-bedroom apartment in central downtown. Perfectly situated on the edge of the Belmont District, our private home provides a comfortable haven for you. Enjoy a home-away-from-home experience in a prime location, ready to explore everything that makes Portland uniquely weird!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53108500/original/f89da8df-ffe2-4473-9936-c380e54ca110.jpeg',293772932,15,'45.51648','-122.61204',1,6,1.50,3.00,3.00,147.00,1,365,204,4.79,53108500),(2373,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53133484','Stylish 2 bd home-gorgeous outdoor fireplace','Have fun with the whole family at this stylish place. This is a perfect Vacation home for a weekend getaway to Portland. Cutest kitchen ever full of sun and great amenities with French doors walking out beautiful patio stone fireplace.  There’s a gas fireplace in the living room and two queen bedrooms,  and two full bathrooms-one is attached to bedroom with a double sink and heated floors. The whole upstairs is another bedroom and a private area with a twin size day bed, perfect for anyone.','If you know Portland, the east side is the most eclectic best food area of the city. This house on Burnside is in the middle of everything. We love it and hope you will too.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4c0e016d-8c15-4122-8f71-cfd3bb3881a7.jpg',20863371,23,'45.52369','-122.61775',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,229.00,1,60,85,4.92,53133484),(2374,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53136399','Close-In Irvington Escape','The Irvington Escape is equipped with a full kitchen, bathroom, two closets, and a private entrance. Centrally located on an old growth tree-lined street, our 1913 home is nestled with fruit trees (apple, plum, and pear) and just steps away from restaurants and shops. Enjoy the tranquility of the backyard, dig your toes into the sand box (filled with Oregon beach sand), and relax on the covered deck.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53136399/original/50f97eda-327a-43a2-a819-a5a443a9e365.jpeg',1656510,26,'45.54393736787331','-122.66059504461086',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,30,365,0,1.00,53136399),(2375,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53164238','Lush Portland Flat w/ Fire Pit, 4 Mi to Dtwn!','Leave your worries behind and escape to this cozy flat. Located a short walk from Willamette River Park, this 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom vacation rental serves as a peaceful place to relax while offering access to all of the city’s best attractions. Start your days at the famous Baker and Spice, then spend the afternoon exploring the Portland neighborhoods or hiking on the Tualatin River Greenway Trail. At night, enjoy an al fresco dinner before kicking back under the stars; Oregon awaits!','DOWNTOWN PORTLAND (~4.0 miles): Powell’s Books, Portland Art Museum, Washington Park, Lan Su Chinese Garden, Oregon Zoo, Portland Japanese Garden, International Rose Test Garden, Portland Japanese Garden, Rose Garden, shopping, dining<br />EATS: Baker & Spices (1.7 miles), Voodoo Doughnut (4.2 miles), Whole Foods Market (4.4 miles), Nostrana (5.0 miles), Doug Fir Lounge (5.4 miles), The Eastburn Public House (5.5 miles), Screen Door Eastside (5.8 miles), Crema Coffee + Bakery (6.0 miles)<br />OUTDOOR OPTIONS: Willamette River Park (walking distance), Woods Memorial Natural Area (3.0 miles), Tryon Creek State Natural Area (3.1 miles), Tualatin River Greenway Trail (8.6 miles), Spring Water Corridor Trail (8.9 miles), Bryant Woods Nature Park (9.1 miles), Multnomah Falls (34.0 miles)<br />WINERIES & VINEYARDS: Fullerton Wines (5.3 miles), Hamacher Wines (11.7 miles), Cooper Mountain Vineyards (12.8 miles), Hawks View Winery (13.9 miles), Alloro Vineyard (15.1 miles), Blakeslee Vineyard E','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-53164238/original/da9b0f30-0f12-4d0a-bb5f-782f9ae30bb8.jpeg',121688409,22,'45.47274115581786','-122.67896137019974',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,126.00,2,1125,47,4.79,53164238),(2376,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53199808','Private Botique Guest Suite In The Hills Of PDX','pet friendly case by case basis. no excessively barking type of dog. one dog max.  the private entry suite is on the main area with a pretty tree view.  There are two very friendly dogs on site and stairs, so bring the right shoes. the driveway is steep but everything is worth the climb!  We have a couple units on site and live on the property. so there is potential for some noise.  big open community deck with a million dollar downtown skyline view everything is absolutely exquisite!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7ff0db9c-9196-4dea-8fad-ecdb3b26633e.jpg',90876848,77,'45.47040091742469','-122.54237332894758',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,120.00,25,1125,16,4.94,53199808),(2377,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53201045','Modern, Bright, Conveinent Sellwood-Moreland Home','Modern townhome in the Westmoreland District of SE Portland.  Easy out-the-door access to many Sellwood-Moreland shops, restaurants, bars, food carts, parks, and more.<br /><br />Conveniently located 3 miles southeast of downtown Portland; accessible by car,  bus, Tri-met light rail, Spring Water Corridor walking and biking trail.<br /><br />Nearby parks include Sellwood, Westmoreland, Eastmoreland Golf Course, and the Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden.<br /><br />While not a large home, it is very clean and comfortable.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53201045/original/58a5527b-9378-44cb-9e2f-142e67e66406.jpeg',131697,20,'45.47383','-122.65048',1,6,3.00,3.00,3.00,165.00,30,1125,6,4.67,53201045),(2378,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53201487','Rare & lush 1 BR in heart of the city!','Fully furnished basement apartment with lots of light, just blocks from the Willamette River in highly coveted John\'s Landing neighborhood. Enjoy the terraced private yard  backing up to forest space, with 25ft bamboo surrounding. Super central to everything you need in Portland, including OHSU and the tram, and easy freeway access as well.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/44f0a4f2-b246-4e33-a23c-60774301a3f2.jpg',36297855,22,'45.48674','-122.67604',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,5,750,27,5.00,53201487),(2379,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53215827','Private Bath - Upstairs Floor- Downtown - View','The rental space is the upstairs floor with a private bath. My girlfriend and I live in a room on the main floor. The living room space and entrance is shared with us. <br /><br />Private slipper bath tub, and shower. The room has a full mattress and a TV with VHS tapes. Spectacular cityscape view. Other side of space is a nook that faces the forest. The best thing about the location is the short walk to downtown, but also a short walk to the forest and trails.','Close to everything: OHSU, Portland State University, Downtown, Waterfront, Sw forest trails, Public transportation.<br /><br />Great location. Just on the edge of downtown. Peaceful and central.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/99424b44-84ab-4138-bc9c-988118b8f3ac.jpg',223054857,22,'45.50148745842035','-122.68138095989127',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,31,20,5.00,53215827),(2380,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53235251','Delightful Apartment In Historic Irvington Home!','Enjoy Portland while staying in our private studio apartment! We are the main residents of the property, and are excited to host you in our furnished guest space while you explore the city!  Whether you are traveling for business or vacation, our private guest space has all you need to recharge and relax.','WELCOME TO PORTLAND! With the city slogan of \"Keep Portland Weird,\" there is not a lack of unique things to explore in this very walkable city. Head downtown to visit iconic stops like Voodoo Doughnuts, Powell bookstore (among other small bookstores), the Portland Japanese Garden, or rent a bike along the waterfront path. <br /> <br />Local Attractions <br />-Irving park, Broadway Bridge <br />-Starlight Patio & Lounge at the Starlight Theater  <br />-Ground Kontrol Classic Arcade and Bar <br /> <br />Transportation	 <br />-PDX airport 15 minutes away <br />-Train station at Lloyd center 8 minute walk','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53235251/original/8a3f6833-d296-4d6c-b906-3bf4a5e0acf4.jpeg',428415856,7,'45.53609','-122.65082',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,92.00,2,30,121,4.80,53235251),(2381,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53256487','Spacious 2BR in Great Location w/ Workstation','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place. Two monitor setup to allow you to work remote. Walk to some of the best restaurants in Portland. Very convenient location for easy access to local grocery stores and adorable shops on Clinton and Division. This basement ADU has a fully stocked kitchen and ample space to hang out. Within a 10-15 minute drive to any iconic Portland neighborhood to explore all the city has to offer.','Walking distance to all great SE Clinton neighborhood restaurants. 2021 Portland Restaurant of the Year, Magna Kusina, is in the neighborhood along with $1 happy hour oysters at Jacqueline and the excellent Quaintrelle to name a few. Check out the wine bar Bar Norman. Looking to dine in? You are also down the street from local grocer People\'s Co-Op or 5 blocks up is New Seasons','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53256487/original/a7cfc441-8a97-4114-aed2-93e9523bcb33.jpeg',141058023,25,'45.50029','-122.64219',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,2,31,53,4.96,53256487),(2382,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53276897','SE Cottage Near Division Monthly Rental','This studio cottage is tucked in the back garden of a home and is fully detached and separate from the main house. It has bamboo flooring throughout with a vaulted ceiling, a full kitchen and full bath , a dining nook, and a queen size bed. The front door opens onto a patio with flagstones. All in a very private and fenced yard.','Close to many excellent restaurants and shops! Wonderful neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53276897/original/16ac34cc-a57b-4ce3-bcdf-2727cd273060.jpeg',5154051,8,'45.50325','-122.61861',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,150.00,45,365,4,4.75,53276897),(2383,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53280181','Hot tub, 3 miles from downtown- The Pumpkin House','Nestled into the trees, and just 3 miles from downtown Portland, our beautiful vintage Portland home awaits you. The HUGE covered front porch with a gazebo eating area is very inviting. Sit and watch the rain fall around you while you remain dry. Enjoy a cup of coffee in the morning and listen to the sound of the native birds flying overhead or take a soak in the hot tub. Our home is very family-friendly and we welcome pets!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-53280181/original/d4114ed8-f084-4b8c-93ea-886808953c14.jpeg',162283241,31,'45.48728','-122.70829',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,90.00,1,60,60,4.60,53280181),(2384,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53298476','Room in Stylish Mid-Century Tree House & Hot Tub!','Looking for a calm, quiet retreat outside of the bustle of Downtown / Eastside, but still close-by? This is the spot! Located in a forested neighborhood, this clean & stylish home is perched high above street level, giving you a leafy sense of floating in the trees. Cook in the well-appointed kitchen, soak in the hot tub under huge trees, light a fire, and walk to nearby food carts. Save city vibes for AM touring, but choose PNW nature vibes in the PM for a relaxing, safe, and cozy stay in PDX!','The neighborhood has tons of old growth trees and a lovely leafy vibe. Just a 5-7 minute walk to Hillsdale Town Center which has Basics Market, an organic grocery store with a deli counter, Gurton\'s, an adorable plant shop, Baker and Spice, a beloved bakery, Sasquatch Brewing, a cute brewpub, City Thai, a decent Thai joint, McMenniman\'s Bar and Cafe, as well as a Starbucks, Einstein\'s bagels, and the Hillsdale Food Cart Park, a pod of different kinds of ethnic food carts.<br /><br />If you\'re looking for a bit more of a stroll, ~20 minute walk will take you over to the very cute shops and cafes of Multnomah Village, where I recommend the AMAZING mediterranean food at Yalla. You won\'t be disappointed.<br /><br />This is a great spot to book if you want to run around and have a fun urban experience during the day, but retreat to more of a quiet, chill nature vibe at night.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53298476/original/aa3b3fcc-fbdb-4443-b902-9f92ee91a339.jpeg',4632981,31,'45.479153','-122.703156',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,90,2,5.00,53298476),(2385,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53337862','Urban Hideaway byWonder Ballroom/Moda/Williams Ave','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. <br />•Perfect for traveling healthcare workers and conference attendees <br />• Secluded Guest Suite.<br />• Private bedroom, bathroom and living room.<br />• Fantastic location for eating your way through Portland’s amazing food scene<br />• Easy keypad entry<br />• Beautiful & quiet residential neighborhood<br />• Easy, free street parking.<br />• Several coffee shops and restaurants just 5-minute walk from house<br />• Very comfortable queen bed <br />• Modern-chic design','The Williams District has become a haven for cheap eats enthusiasts and discriminating foodies alike. The neighborhood is lined with everything from award-winning fine dining spots to family-friendly eateries. For those who just need to wet their whistles, the street offers some of Portland’s most esteemed beer, coffee and cocktail destinations.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53337862/original/d7bd9ab3-9ba8-4208-a7ad-beef8fadab16.png',36988436,26,'45.54284','-122.66362',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,1,1125,252,4.98,53337862),(2386,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53345007','Bright & Stylish Laurelhurst Guesthouse','Filled with natural light, centrally located guest house in the upscale neighborhood of Laurelhurst in NE Portland. A short walk to beautiful Laurelhurst Park and minutes on bike or car to all Portland has to offer. Our newly built guest house has everything a traveler would want with private patio &  parking right in front. Stay cool in the summer and toasty in the winter with the newly installed mini split system.','The Laurelhurst neighborhood is one of the most walkable neighborhoods in Portland. In fact, it has a Walk Score of 81 out of 100 and is considered “Walker’s Paradise” by Walkscore.com. The bike score is at a whopping 94! This makes it very popular among families and young professionals who want to enjoy life in a community that is close enough to the city center but far enough away to be their own little slice of land. Walking around this neighborhood is super enjoyable because you’ve got the huge, beautiful old homes, friendly people, tons to do, and plenty of nature too.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-53345007/original/f0914247-39f3-440d-8a90-c5dd35c9898f.jpeg',136086564,23,'45.52012','-122.61927',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,3,365,64,4.92,53345007),(2387,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53346652','Luxury Open Plan Apt, Free Parking WFH Home Set up','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are located in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Pearl District, known for its rich culture and creativity. You\'ll find world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries just steps away. The Portland Streetcar stops right at your doorstep, and there are three nearby parks, making it a perfect place to live your best life.<br /><br />Here are some exciting things you can do in the area:<br /><br />The work score is 97, indicating excellent access to workspaces, and the transit score is 89, with many trams and light rail options throughout the city.<br />Feel free to bring your bike; there\'s a secured parking garage where you can safely store it for free.<br />Within a 10-block radius, there are plenty of attractions to explore. Be sure to check with the Portland City Council for updates on what\'s open.<br />You\'ll find a wide variety of delicious restaurants, both local gems and famous ones like Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop, Salt & Straw. The Pearl District and NW 23rd ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-53346652/original/651160d0-2b14-4d5e-8c3a-6a68e36f2a41.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53062','-122.68213',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,88.00,1,1125,2,4.50,53346652),(2388,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53379784','Autumn In The Lovely Maplewood Guest Cottage','31-day minimum saves on fees! Perfect for 1-2 adults. 535 sq ft all inclusive home plus cozy sleeping loft. A private and elegantly appointed centrally located Cottage; comfortable place to work, create, or just be in the eclectic, safe, and friendly neighborhood of Maplewood. Full kitchen, lovely windows, and high ceilings create a peaceful sense of space. Read a book under the apple tree or venture out. Much to explore and experience! Message me “ANY” questions, for I am flexible. Thanks-Julie','We  have loved living here for 28 years; our 100+ year old house has seen it all. A street walking friendly neighborhood, we look out for one another. It is quiet and safe, with a collage of homes, yards, parks, and trails. We have our own coffee house/restaurant in the hood. 1 mile from a variety of restaurants, pubs, and groceries, two blocks to the city bus, about 15 min to the city, 15 blocks to the community center if you want to work out, swim or enjoy the large park that borders charming historic Multnomah Village.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53379784/original/86fc14eb-6d66-4e95-b3b5-696f66cfebce.jpeg',40079083,75,'45.47587','-122.74001',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,69.00,31,1125,6,5.00,53379784),(2389,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53382149','Eclectic Deco Style with Sauna Near Hawthorne','Warm yourself in a private sauna & bathe in a claw foot tub just steps from your bed in this colorful, out of the ordinary suite. Enjoy the ever evolving, quirky style in the lower floor of one of Portland’s most unusual homes, the Art Deco House of Portland!<br /><br />Originally built in the 80s around a humble older home by the Art Deco loving creator of the iconic “Gardenburger”, you’ll find the wild blend of interior design has been carried on with our own flair :)','We have shared some of our favorite places in our “Guidebook” below… sooo many amazing places within a short walking distance!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/10be3b5b-f9ae-46f2-b9f5-38392b46a955.jpg',5389533,16,'45.51313','-122.62773',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,2,6,85,4.98,53382149),(2390,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53418182','Forest Lodge Nature Lookout 15 min to downtown','Cedar Lodge is a chalet cabin lookout on the North summit of Forest Park. Privately located in a wilderness sanctuary yet only 15 minutes to PDX city center by car & 10 minutes to Linnton, Bethany, Hillsboro and St Johns. Arrive & unwind in an elevated private spa overlooking a forested canyon. Relax beneath towering 300 year old Doug Firs under the stars. Listen to the native Pacific chorus tree frogs with a campfire, then retire to the best sleep in a while courtesy of a Tuft & Needle bed.','Immersed within an old growth Forest without any view of other properties','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53418182/original/43af5cf3-db2b-45b6-993e-aa0e3683ff03.jpeg',432518724,50,'45.60081318774047','-122.82583114864036',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,144.00,2,14,35,5.00,53418182),(2391,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53419379','Two Bedroom Unit in basement of Victorian','Located on NW 18th AV this unit borders the \"Pearl District\" and walking distance to the NW 23rd shopping district.  Restaurants, Bars, Theaters, Sports, Parks.<br />You can walk to everything.<br />The Portland Streetcar is 2 blocks.  This place is perfect for a temp stay in Portland for work, school, travelling.','This is a great neighborhood.  Wonderful area to walk.  Lots of shops, parks, beautiful architecture around.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTM0MTkzNzk%3D/original/312d8060-178a-479f-8fcb-4ac2857ca7b3.jpeg',201594889,27,'45.5279','-122.69009',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,58.00,30,1125,9,4.11,53419379),(2392,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53431263','Wonderful Hawthorne + Cat','Welcome to the Hawthorne/Tabor neighborhood! This stay is for approx Dec 15 - Jan 7. In exchange for an amazing price you\'ll be caring for Mush, a lovely Egyptian Mau cat. He enjoys soccer with his toy mouse and stroller rides in fair weather. The house comes equipped with wifi, kitchen basics, a great front porch and private backyard with BBQ.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2c9860ed-f5e2-43b6-bf2d-933c3ed9ec68.jpg',828654,15,'45.51061','-122.60987',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,0,1.00,53431263),(2393,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53432624','Cozy private room in a charming FoPo home','Enjoy this comfortable and cute room as a launching pad for your Portland adventures!   You can explore all that FoPo has to offer by foot or venture 10-25 minutes by car to reach the rest of Portland.  Start the morning with coffee at your bistro table and end it streaming your favorite shows in bed.','FoPo is up and coming, with great food carts at the Portland Mercado and bars and restaurants right along Foster—all within a 10 minute walk!  Try Carnelian Coffee or Off the Griddle for breakfast, Bar Carlo for brunch, and Da Hui, Street Disco, or Otto’s Pizzeria for dinner!  If you are in town to Tango, this is a great place to rest between sessions at Tango Berretin.  Check the guidebook I have prepared for even more local recommendations.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53432624/original/f60c9b63-319f-4a82-b01d-8e30d2092634.jpeg',6564786,36,'45.48493','-122.5845',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,52.00,1,365,111,4.96,53432624),(2394,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53532169','Parkrose Private Luxury Suite','Access to ONLY Lower Level of Home, this is covered by double lock security door on main level that is always locked when guests arrive.  keyless entry access code, 1,836 SQFT on a quiet cul-de-sac, 2.5 miles from the PDX airport, less than one mile from shopping and other restaurants. easy access to I84 E & I84W freeway.     This house is not ADA accessible.  We also have high speed Wi-Fi for computer access and access to Cable that includes HBO and Starz, Netflix and AP.','Quiet peaceful Cul-de-sac, some neighbors are enjoying their retirement.  Nearby running and walking trails and nearby access to I84 East and I 84 West freeway entrance. <br /><br />1 mile away from following (WinCo\'s grocery store, Taco Bell, Sharis restaurant, Subway, Starbucks, Black Rock coffee, planet Hollywood fitness, Dollar tree and other shops)<br /><br />2.3 Miles from Costco<br /><br />4.8 Miles from Portland airport<br /><br />2.5 Miles from Glendoveer golf course (great also with running or walking trail)<br /><br />9.9 Miles from Clackamas Town Center Shopping Mile<br /><br />21.5 Miles from Multnomah Falls<br /><br />53 Miles from Mt Hood Ski resort','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53532169/original/1246429b-145b-456b-bcf3-9a72c01f18fa.jpeg',433340907,82,'45.5456','-122.53342',1,5,1.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,30,53,4.94,53532169),(2395,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53540144','NEW! - Bright Modern Entire Unit KING BED!','Have fun with the whole family at this stylish space.Entire daylight basement to yourselves with two bedrooms and a roomy living area.First bedroom has a king bed, second bedroom features full over full bunk bed with a full trundle and full futon sofa bed (four separate full beds for your convenience)Fully equipped and stocked kitchen. Washer and dryer in the bathroom. Complimentary coffee and tea. Backyard is private property and is not included in the listing.Entire basement has heated floors.','Welcome to Parkrose Heights! Portland is a very bike friendly area so you can enjoy the town on bike. This location is particularly convenient because the PDX airport is an 11 minute drive away. Local attractions and scenic points  include the Columbia River Gorge, Multnomah Falls all within a 30 minute drive. Mount Hood is within an hour away depending on the traffic. Explore the Stunning Oregon Coast with the nearest beach-The Tillamook Beach being just an hour and a half away. If you\'ve brought your kids we recommend checking out Playdate PDX in downtown portland on a rainy day. For outdoor fun with the kids the Oregon Zoo is just a 20m minute drive. If you love to explore the town we suggest checking out Alberta Arts District with its wide range of bars and restaurants, local art, and live music.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ebc025b9-b7f8-46ab-be12-8052907360ec.jpg',169538028,35,'45.54353','-122.54451',1,6,1.00,2.00,5.00,98.00,3,700,60,4.80,53540144),(2396,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53547698','Dreamy guest suite in the heart of NE Portland.','Welcome to your new favorite Portland home-away-from-home. A beautiful, private guest suite designed with comfort, quality and aesthetics in mind.<br /><br />This guest suite has its own private entrance, a full kitchen, a very comfortable Tuft & Needle queen sized bed and a luscious, leather sofa.<br /><br />You\'ll be perfectly situated in the heart of NE Portland, walkable to all of the trendy streets such as Alberta, Williams and Mississippi which are jam packed with Portland\'s best food, bars and shops.','This guest suite is located in the King neighborhood of inner NE Portland. The King neighborhood is multi-cultural, socially conscious, and has become super popular in the last few years. It is full of cool, historic homes and is close to Downtown, the Alberta Arts District, Mississippi St. and N. Williams. It is bike friendly, pedestrian friendly, and has a really high walk score! <br /><br />King neighborhood was first settled in 1872. It was incorporated into the city of Portland in 1891, and has been a center for African American culture for many years. The Urban Renewal that Portland put in motion in the early 2000s has disrupted this in many ways, but the people who live in this neighborhood want to keep the heart and soul of their neighborhood alive!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53547698/original/c6c91d9c-c44d-4977-92f9-3c2464027cf4.jpeg',2141579,14,'45.56335','-122.6635',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,96.00,2,1125,91,5.00,53547698),(2397,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53547952','Peaceful Urban Farm Guest Suite','Welcome to our peaceful urban homestead located within walking distance of the heart of the Woodstock neighborhood. Private entrance to a private space with brand new bathroom with walk in shower, two bedrooms, and a cozy living room. We hope our home will be a perfect spot for you to rest on your visit to Portland! We cover your basic kitchen needs with mini fridge, microwave, and tea kettle. Brand new efficient mini split heating and cooling unit. Free and plentiful street parking. Welcome!','We are a short walk away from the heart of the Woodstock neighborhood that has grocery stores, shops, restaurants, bars, etc. New Seasons, Cloud City Ice Cream, Heart Coffee, Ate-Oh-Ate, are all within walking/biking distance. Brentwood Park is a few blocks away and it has a big dog park, tennis courts, volley ball courts, and a playground. There\'s also a big community garden/orchard a block away. Errol Heights is a small nature area that is a nice walk away. We’re also close to the Springwater Corridor bike path.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1423246a-f4eb-4105-94cb-bfe7fd351652.jpg',2199289,69,'45.47208','-122.60702',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,70.00,2,1125,106,4.93,53547952),(2398,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53603653','Cheerful, Modern 3 bdrm ; Remote work paradise!','*Ask about long stay & RN/Healthcare discount* This clean, and comfy townhouse is a perfect place to call home. It is a 3 bd, 1.5 ba, with a office space, printer, and monitor, so perfect for remote workers. <br /><br />It has a cooks kitchen, full of spices, and every appliance you might need (ninja blender, toaster oven, gas range). It is set up for long term rentals, and has even the small things you may have forgotten ready for your use. There is even a stand up paddle board you can borrow!','Home is located off the street in a quiet, safe community of 9 townhomes. The NE neighborhood has many walkable restaurants and coffee shops -- on 42nd avenue and Fremont Avenue, including Portland classics (Pip\'s Donuts, Grand Central Bakery, Oakshire Brewing, etc). Popular Alberta Arts district is only 1 mile away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53603653/original/459666b7-d063-4f21-b8cf-15c124ab87ff.jpeg',2516802,21,'45.55602','-122.61465',1,4,1.50,3.00,3.00,125.00,60,500,0,1.00,53603653),(2399,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53614032','Deluxe 2 BR Irvington Guesthouse with Hot Tub!!','Located in one of the oldest and most beautiful historic central Portland neighborhoods, this brand new deluxe  Irvington Guesthouse is 800 square sq. feet on 1 level with 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom and a 6 person Marquis Hot Tub!! <br /><br />The guesthouse is conveniently located blocks from the Moda and Convention Centers and you can walk, bike, drive or Uber everywhere.   More than 100 coffee shops, pubs, restaurants and grocery stores are within a short walk or drive!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53614032/original/213d162b-62ab-47ae-a986-faef693ab1d9.jpeg',236328262,7,'45.54511','-122.65694',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,165.00,2,365,137,4.99,53614032),(2400,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53649962','Brand New Designer Home in Prime Walkable Location','* Professional cleaning crew trained in disinfection and sanitation of all touch points<br /><br />* Brand new home with modern and custom finishes throughout<br />* Thoughtfully curated with premium furnishings <br />* 3 bedrooms (1 King, 2 Queens) / 2.5 Bathrooms + dedicated office with convertible sofa bed (Full)<br />* Fully equipped kitchen with large island and bar seating + dining table for 6<br />* In-unit washer/dryer<br />* Central A/C and heating<br />* Backyard with covered deck with patio seating and fenced-in grass area','The Williams District otherwise known as \"Boise-Eliot\" is a \"destination neighborhood\" in Portland for locals and visitors alike as one of the most vibrant, dynamic, up and coming neighborhoods. Williams Avenue and Mississippi Avenue are the two main streets in Boise-Eliot and are lined with over 150 independent and local businesses and their devoted customers. There are no shortage of must-visit restaurants, breweries, coffee shops, boutique shops, food carts, etc. that make up this unique enclave of Portland. Refer to our Portland Guidebook for specific recommendations.<br /><br />Need to shop for groceries? New Seasons, Whole Foods, and Vons are all nearby for your shopping pleasure. <br /><br />Nearby NE Portland hotspots are the Historic Mississippi District and Alberta Arts District with a bevy of other eateries, breweries, ice cream shops, and shopping.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53649962/original/b115130f-61a6-480b-82a1-7f56bb6792e0.jpeg',35305959,24,'45.55525','-122.66674',1,8,2.50,3.00,3.00,172.00,30,1125,115,4.97,53649962),(2401,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53650635','Minnesota Room (Located in Portland, OR)','This space is in a newly remodeled basement. The bedroom has a brand new queen size bed, a walk in closet and a table/chairs. The bathroom has a nice size shower. Laundry is available if needed. A fridge in the bedroom. We have two young children and we do our best to stay quiet. The house is 10 minutes from the airport. Perfect location to stay the night before an early morning flight or coming in late from a flight. Self check-in makes it convenient to arrive late.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53650635/original/4ff0bdbf-671f-4568-ac91-9157a9d237df.jpeg',130350094,39,'45.55291','-122.57926',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,54.00,1,28,282,4.97,53650635),(2402,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53665326','Willamette river tiny house with modern amenities','Beautiful floating tiny tender house on Willamette River in the Sellwood area. The tender house is in a gated community with parking with access to water at your door. Walk down the ramp and have a serene and peaceful view along the walkway. The living room has a 6\' sliding door connecting the private outdoor deck.','Sellwood-Westmoreland','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53665326/original/4fbb13af-68bf-4151-8d22-5fa014bb8ef5.jpeg',11054611,20,'45.474377','-122.660698',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,53665326),(2403,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53680383','Charming NE Portland 1 bedroom in Montavilla','Come relax in our bohemian and mid century inspired space in the NE Portland neighborhood of Montavilla. This 1 BR is the first floor unit of a 2 story duplex. Ourselves or our guests may be staying in the upper unit. The entrances are separate and there is no shared air between units. Come unwind from the day in the soothing neutral bedroom or work from home at the spacious and very groovy tanker desk. We hope you find this place to be a little oasis.<br /><br />Please review house rules before booking.','Montavilla is a classic Portland neighborhood.  You will find 100-year-old craftsman homes nestled next to newly constructed townhouses.  This is a neighborhood where people work and live so you may hear a truck starting, a dog barking, or even the occasional friendly neighborhood rooster.  This is a duplex so you may also hear the pitter patter of feet from the second story unit from time to time. This house is located on a quieter avenue that is off a busier mixed residential/commercial street.  There is a dive bar, and a “lingerie modeling” business (Portland is well known for having many of these types of establishments) on the busier street that intersects ours. We’ve never had an issue with either establishment and can recommend the cold beer and tater tots at the dive bar. Nearby street parking is usually plentiful. This location is convenient to shopping and has nearby access to the I-205 and I-84 freeways.  You can also take a 12 minute stroll to “The Yard” which is a nearby f','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4932fb5d-7b15-4337-82da-003d09d70944.jpg',217988597,10,'45.52807','-122.56731',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,93.00,30,365,11,5.00,53680383),(2404,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53684019','Wonderful Hawthorne + Cat','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2c9860ed-f5e2-43b6-bf2d-933c3ed9ec68.jpg',828654,15,'45.51046','-122.60769',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,0,1.00,53684019),(2405,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53685675','Quaint, cozy room in our welcoming home','We welcome you to stay in our peaceful, cozy guest room. We will do our best to make your stay as comfortable as possible.<br /><br />Great location right off of Mississippi Ave, which is abundant with good food, drinks, and cute shops. We’re close to lots to do in Portland, so it’s a good home base for you while visiting.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/87562deb-fc9c-47e3-84a1-6cd9ff19fac1.jpg',127848804,9,'45.55422','-122.67582',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,79,4.91,53685675),(2406,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53689406','El Rancho Fantastico#1(4.5 miles from pdx airport)','Traveler\'s retreat! A relaxing stopover for exploring the city. Enjoy your stay in our clean and comfortable 1950\'s ranch home. El Rancho Fantastico is located in the Alberta Arts district of North East Portland,  just a 12 minute drive from the airport. We are walking distance to coffee shops, restaurants, city parks, boutiques, grocery stores and bakeries. Our street is located near a main bus route and bicycle greenways for easy transportation. Downtown Portland is only 15 minute drive away.','Located in the North East Alberta Arts district. Cute walkable neighborhood close to main bus line, restaurants, coffee, bakeries and only 15 minutes from downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53689406/original/c116e8a4-9a7b-47f5-ac59-8fd4bbaf1c95.jpeg',141751197,21,'45.56004','-122.61671',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,39.00,1,5,268,4.97,53689406),(2407,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53704846','Central SW PDX 2 Bdrm GEM In The Heart Of it ALL!','Our Modern 3 level townhome boasts 2 MASTER suites, with private bathrooms, 1/2 bath on main level. Spacious kitchen with eating area and balcony. Enjoy open living on the main floor. 1 off street parking by front door and free street parking. Close proximity to downtown, the ZOO, public transportation, South Waterfront, & OHSU (great for traveling doctors & nurses). Walking distance to Delis, yoga studios, bars/ restaurants & more! Willamette Park, and plenty of outdoor trails and  activities!','The neighborhood is quietly tucked in right next to the south water front. A very safe neighborhood, whether it\'s walking to the market, biking through Willamette Park, or driving into Sellwood. It\'s perfect for anyone wanting to explore the Portland area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e1b9c969-e52c-4811-a15b-111962583567.jpg',150582690,22,'45.48548','-122.677',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,177.00,2,1125,86,4.92,53704846),(2408,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53708307','Spacious, dog-friendly 3bd home in heart of SE PDX','You will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located home. Hawthorne, Belmont, Division, and Burnside neighborhoods are all within a 10-15 min walk. Enjoy some of the best food that Portland has to offer. <br /><br />Make yourself at home in our classic Portland home from 1908 with a cozy fireplace and modern updates. Enjoy a clawfoot tub upstairs, an open floor plan down, and a deck out back. Other amenities include easy parking, a fenced in yard for your pet, and flexible check-in/out!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a96cce1c-810e-4ed7-bf8b-0469ca09b83d.jpg',7241632,32,'45.51523','-122.63738',1,7,2.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,5,5.00,53708307),(2409,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53709880','The best of Ptld. Step to Music, Dining, Downtown.','Enjoy this superb historic gem in the heart of Portland\'s vibant inner Eastside. Buckman is an established neighborhood less than 1 MILE from downtown and the Willamette River Esplanade. JUST 4 BLOCKS to restraurants, bars, coffee shops, breweries and an incredible music venue!  Walk to get groceries and anyting else.  The high end renovation was just completed in 2021.','The Buckman Neighborhood is an established neighborhood, and it is the heart of Portland\'s inner Eastside. If you want that good Portland vibe, nothing compares to this neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53709880/original/2266f551-fe3d-48b8-bf52-02359505f9dc.jpeg',30878885,32,'45.519115','-122.649849',1,6,1.00,3.00,4.00,157.00,30,120,11,4.82,53709880),(2410,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53718164','Studio | Deck | Fireplace | Garden','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-53718164/original/d757feaf-eefa-46ec-9546-a21b58385e67.jpeg',111798260,5,'45.47422','-122.63523',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,130.00,30,1125,19,4.63,53718164),(2411,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53778645','Office Space - Day use','Office (approx. 350 sq. ft), for day use.  We have fiber fast internet. <br /><br />The space is downstairs in the basement.  The space has a separate entrance.  You would have access to a shared bathroom next to office space.<br />-There are approximately 3 outlets and room for expansion.<br />-Space is available 5 days per week most weeks.  If you are interested in a long term rental, there will be significant discounts and options for parking, EV charge at the house, etc.  and flexibility in schedule.  <br /><br />Thanks!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53778645/original/9feca49f-56a8-4465-98e4-e28ee7f33f60.jpeg',241007470,39,'45.54188','-122.59482',2,1,0.00,0.00,1.00,160.00,30,230,0,1.00,53778645),(2412,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53784227','Newly renovated/furnished 2BR condo near PSU','* Conveniently located right in the heart of the beautiful Downtown Cultural District, within walking distance of all major downtown attractions, such as Portland Art Museum, Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall, and Keller Auditorium.<br />* 5 minutes walking to Portland State University<br />* 10 minutes walking to South Waterfront Park <br />* Walking distance to Portland Farmers Market and various Portland famous food pods. <br />* Streetcar stops outside the front door','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/aa08c244-5512-4fd3-a722-2d9f63e25284.jpg',253495113,44,'45.51083','-122.67964',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,95.00,30,365,6,4.83,53784227),(2413,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53784411','Entire Home: Cheerful 3 bed in historic St Johns.','Relax in this stylish house on a quiet street just a short walk to historic, downtown St Johns and the iconic St Johns bridge. The house has a sauna, covered patio area, large backyard and free street parking. A few blocks from several beautiful parks featuring miles of running trails, skateboarding, multiple sports, an off-leash dog park, and beach access to the river. Minutes from great cafes, shopping, two movie theaters, and great bars/restaurants. Less than 15 minutes to downtown Portland.','Settled into the Pier Park neighborhood of St Johns, this home is walking distance to some of the best perks Portland has to offer. Your are les than a 10 minute walk to historic downtown St Johns which has many bars/restaurants, boutiques, coffee shops and a beautiful movie theatre. Pier Park is about a 5 minute walk away. The 87 acre canopy of 300 year old Doug Fir trees hosts a legendary disc golf course, running trails, skate park, basketball, picnic areas, and Chimney Dog Park. <br /><br />A few blocks past downtown St Johns is Cathedral Park, underneath the incredible St Johns Bridge. This park has beach access to the Willamette river. It is an easy 15 minute drive to downtown Portland. A 10 minute drive to Forest Park, which has many miles of hiking, mountain biking and trail running paths. Basically in any direction, you will be in nature and hopefully having FUN!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53784411/original/3ccede1d-1ded-4514-b2e8-72efbbd8fcdf.jpeg',3656451,58,'45.59472','-122.75248',1,5,1.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,181,14,5.00,53784411),(2414,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53798332','Cozy Garden Sanctuary Home in East Portland','Come enjoy a nurturing stay on our quarter acre with beautiful home. Over 20 trees to rest under!<br /><br />Enjoy views of the backyard while you prepare meals, dine, or work from the red room’s desk.<br />The kitchen is well stocked with all the appliances you need to create your favorite dishes.<br />Meditation/yoga space upstairs will give you a quiet place to rest, read and recover.<br /><br />Pets ok with refundable deposit.<br />We have a pet door too. <br />Pretty park just a block away!<br /><br />Blocks to bus and Max (train) station.','Our beautiful neighborhood has larger lots than most of Portland proper, which is why I chose my home here.<br />It’s less densely populated, has plenty street parking, and way more greenery than most neighborhoods.<br />The house is just a block from a small but beautiful city park. We take our dog there daily to check his peemail. ;)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53798332/original/0d99cde4-208b-49a1-a9c8-71e754c4ae89.jpeg',1125850,63,'45.52805','-122.54244',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,125,0,1.00,53798332),(2415,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53812431','The Rex','This home is a 1 bed, 1 bath space with a flex space making it a great place for remote workers. The unit is fully furnished and includes all utilities and WiFi. If you like to cook at home, the kitchen has everything you need, plus you\'re walking distance to four local grocery stores. The location could not be better. Within a few blocks, you’ll find yourself in an ocean of Portland\'s famous restaurants and food carts. You will never go hungry here! Easy street parking access to local parks','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53812431/original/c8ee2709-f00c-4875-9087-9a0a635acdfc.jpeg',47581293,16,'45.51621','-122.63554',1,2,1.50,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,260,1,1.00,53812431),(2416,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53814867','Sunset Porch House - Inner SE Portland','We would love to host you in our newly renovated bungalow.  Architect designed with all new finishes, cabinetry, appliances and furniture will make you feel pampered in your home away from home.  Nestled between Division Street and Hawthorne Blvd, this is one of the most walkable neighborhoods in the city.  You\'ll never run out of new places to eat, drink, shop, or explore!','Portland is known worldwide for its creative cuisine, craft breweries and bike friendly culture.  The house is situated in one of the most walkable neighborhoods of the city, with endless culinary options from fine dining to food carts within minutes from your door.  <br /><br />SE Division Street is one block away and boasts an amazing selection of options for shopping, eating, snacking, drinking, or just people-watching! <br /><br />A short walk to SE Hawthorne Blvd. and you can drink a beer at the local movie theater or browse Powell\'s Book Store, with a wide variety of shops and treats along the way.<br /><br />There are a number of pictures in our listing to give you a flavor of the neighborhood, and I\'ve made a guidebook of some of our favorite places which is linked in my host profile.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53814867/original/eb18a5bf-2a63-4e9e-abee-7ba068f8ea89.jpeg',435909602,25,'45.505901','-122.636459',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,160.00,3,28,96,5.00,53814867),(2417,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53832633','Woodstock Townhouse, Open Floor Plan, Custom','For groups visiting Portland and the surrounding areas, the Woodstock Townhouse is a pretty special place. Sitting in the heart of Southeast Portland you are centrally located to most everything while at the same time well away from the bustle of downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-53832633/original/4ef2b335-eb72-41f0-8073-076146f49ad0.jpeg',62261998,67,'45.49038','-122.61991',1,8,4.00,4.00,4.00,278.00,3,29,27,4.70,53832633),(2418,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53883589','Close-in cozy 1-bedroom basement apartment','Stay in our cozy private basement apartment in the heart of the city within walking distance of the Alberta arts district. Great for visiting, traveling nurses, contract workers, and house hunters. Minutes to downtown. Bus is around the corner.<br />Approximately 550 sq ft. Private entrance and covered outdoor dining area. Lightly stocked kitchenette with large fridge, sitting room with 42\" TV, bathroom with custom shower, lots of closet/storage space, and bedroom with queen size bed. Fast internet','We are in the Sabin Neighborhood, walking distance from Alberta Arts district, great restaurants, bars, shops, and a Whole Foods Market.  Minutes drive to highway and downtown.  20 min drive to airport and most major hospitals.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53883589/original/c4b3099f-5902-423d-b9fd-251473c6085d.jpeg',99516147,6,'45.554','-122.65306',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,51.00,30,365,7,4.71,53883589),(2419,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53891208','Modern 4 BR Home Walkable to Alberta and more','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 90/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee, etc. this is your place. Our fun home sits at the heart of the eclectic NE District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around. With a convenient home base within walking distance to the neighborhood hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53891208/original/416ea750-82a8-4c46-b360-fbfe8a1b796d.jpeg',374074476,14,'45.56112','-122.66326',1,10,2.50,4.00,5.00,306.00,2,365,181,4.86,53891208),(2420,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53921672','1000 Sq Ft Guest Suite hosted by Patrick & Naomi','Welcome to our cozy 1000 sq ft basement apartment, filled with natural light. Enjoy the spacious private suite, complemented by a separate entrance complete with keyless entry for your convenience and peace of mind. <br /><br />Situated in the vibrant Rose City Neighborhood of NE Portland, our home offers easy access to coffee shops, markets, restaurants, a golf course, and parks, all within walking distance. Additionally, you\'ll find convenience in its proximity to the PDX airport.<br /><br />2-night min required*','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53921672/original/cfaac1a5-b71e-4222-8632-31591638e9c1.jpeg',436807306,39,'45.545942790618845','-122.58539629421124',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,83.00,2,30,107,4.98,53921672),(2421,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53942995','Modern touches in classic NW Portland 1 bed condo','Large, beautiful one bedroom condo with private, LARGE patio space in the NW.<br />- ideal location - walk to Pearl, NW 23rd<br />- great light, classic NW building with modern design<br />- huge bedroom<br />- close to Legacy Good Samaritan (walk); OHSU and Emanuel (<8 minute drive)<br />- individual W/D in basement<br />- wireless internet included<br />- large, private patio<br />- perfect for traveling employees','NW Portland / Pearl District / Alphabet District','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53942995/original/d75a43b9-66a4-43a9-964f-c219d2a5d422.jpeg',27512730,27,'45.5297','-122.69259',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,88.00,30,110,19,4.74,53942995),(2422,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53944741','Charming bedroom w/ private BA in historic home','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space in the heart of Foster-Powell. Comfortable queen bed. 40” tv in room. Heater. Solid Wi-Fi. Private bathroom. Full use of awesome kitchen. 65” tv in the living room. House is walking distance to food trucks, bars, restaurants, breweries, cafes, dispensaries. Near multiple bus lines with access to all parts of the city. 420 friendly but not indoors. Plenty of street parking also can park in driveway if you prefer. Let me know if you have questions.','In the heart of Foster-Powell! Too many places to list but ‘5 and dime’ is a five minute walk from the house - for reference.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f5210a5f-a5d5-4467-a5cc-11aac8daa997.jpg',5259991,36,'45.49114','-122.59389',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,1,11,95,4.96,53944741),(2423,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53970706','Beautiful, elegant house - walk to everything','Work from Portland with your own private office with fast wifi, desk, and big windows. Enjoy your own private, bright room with high ceilings and chandelier. Fully equipped kitchen, Peloton, washer/dryer, two TV rooms with HBOMax, Netflix, Hulu, Peacock.<br /><br />This peaceful, classic home in a bustling, historic neighborhood is 10 minutes via car to downtown and steps from every transit option. Well traveled host welcomes new friends from everywhere!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53970706/original/aee9c2fa-dc35-4619-a0ee-a9abe332c89b.jpeg',4332497,14,'45.55576','-122.65978',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,30,30,1,5.00,53970706),(2424,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54005359','Yellow House Cozy 2 Bedroom Serene Cottage Suite','Escape to a plant & music themed 100YO house:<br />-Luxurious garden vibes in historic home<br />-2 rooms: queen bed & twin bed<br />-Clawfoot tub & walk in shower<br />-Private deck entrance<br />-Free street & driveway parking<br />-Outdoor seating<br />-Large fully fenced yard<br />-Closets & storage<br />-Working desk space & video lighting for content creators<br />-Minifridge in bedroom<br />-Located near popular Alberta, Fremont, & Mississippi districts<br />-3 nearby walkable parks<br />-Easy access to transport<br />-Access kitchen for all you need :)','This is a very vibrant neighborhood with a healthy mix of residential and business, so there is always somewhere pretty to walk and always something fun to do! Cully neighborhood consists mostly of what used to be farmland, and is now mostly residential. Very close walk or bike to Khunamowkst Park and Wilshire Park, also groceries, dining, shopping, and much more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-54005359/original/426bff12-4644-49b1-889e-43e13bec294a.jpeg',437576977,21,'45.55486','-122.61132',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,69.00,1,9,53,5.00,54005359),(2425,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54014394','Corner 1-bedroom ADU off South East Division','Beautiful new construction, well appointed first floor mother-in-law unit a block from Division St. restaurants, bars and shops. <br /><br />This ADA accessible one-bedroom boasts a sterling location on a corner lot with south facing light and step-out-your-door access to Salt & Straw, Olympia Provisions Public House, Oma\'s Hideaway, and the Clinton St. bike way.','Southeast Division','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/209a73cf-27ef-40d4-b8ca-976244799e7b.jpg',62953164,8,'45.50309','-122.63126',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,109.00,30,1125,35,4.74,54014394),(2426,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54039058','The Hollywood House - Awesome Location in NE PDX!','Gorgeous restored four-square home in the heart of the Hollywood neighborhood. Three very spacious bedrooms, full bath with tub upstairs and half bathroom downstairs. Updated kitchen with all the essentials. Tons for natural light. Relaxing sunroom with workspace. Peaceful and private backyard w/firepit. Walking distance to restaurants, shops and grocery stores. 15 min walk to Providence Hospital. 20 min drive to downtown. Easy access to 84 freeway!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54039058/original/fa724521-a0fe-49bf-a236-c95e779c0499.jpeg',221421926,11,'45.53605','-122.61442',1,6,1.00,3.00,4.00,145.00,31,365,4,5.00,54039058),(2427,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54042121','Stylish MCM House in the Trees With HOT TUB!','Looking for a calm, quiet retreat outside of the bustle of Downtown / Eastside, but still close-by? This is the spot! Located in a forested neighborhood, this clean & stylish home is perched high above street level, giving you a leafy sense of floating in the trees. Cook in the well-appointed kitchen, soak in the hot tub under huge trees, light a fire, and walk to nearby food carts. Save city vibes for AM touring, but choose PNW nature vibes in the PM for a relaxing, safe, and cozy stay in PDX!','The neighborhood has tons of old growth trees and a lovely leafy vibe, plus tons of nearby trails to enjoy the gorgeous nature that the PNW is known for (visit swtrails dot org for maps!).<br /><br />Just a 5-7 minute walk to Hillsdale Town Center which has Basics Market, an organic grocery store with a deli counter, Gurton\'s, an adorable plant shop, Baker and Spice, a beloved bakery, Sasquatch Brewing, a cute brewpub, City Thai, a decent Thai joint, McMenniman\'s Bar and Cafe, as well as a Starbucks, Einstein\'s bagels, and the Hillsdale Food Cart Park, a pod of different kinds of ethnic food carts.<br /><br />If you\'re looking for a bit more of a stroll, ~20 minute walk will take you over to the very cute shops and cafes of Multnomah Village, where I recommend the AMAZING mediterranean food at Yalla. You won\'t be disappointed.<br /><br />This is a great spot to book if you want to run around and have a fun urban experience during the day, but retreat to more of a quiet, chill nature vi','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53980580/original/499b41ef-b589-4dbd-85ac-1bd4d8a5474b.jpeg',4632981,31,'45.47972','-122.70404',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,349.00,30,360,6,4.83,54042121),(2428,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54044572','Stylish MCM House in the Trees W/ HOT TUB!','Looking for a safe and quiet retreat outside of the bustle of Downtown / Eastside, but still close-by? This is the spot! Located in a forested neighborhood, this clean & stylish home is perched high above street level, giving you a leafy sense of floating in the trees. Cook in the well-appointed kitchen, soak in the hot tub under huge trees, light a fire, and walk to nearby food carts. Save urban city vibes for AM touring, but choose PNW nature vibes in the PM for a relaxing & cozy stay in PDX!','The safe and peaceful neighborhood has tons of old growth trees and a lovely leafy vibe, plus tons of nearby trails to enjoy the gorgeous nature that the PNW is known for (visit swtrails dot org for maps!).<br /><br />Just a 5-7 minute walk to Hillsdale Town Center which has Basics Market, an organic grocery store with a deli counter, Gurton\'s, an adorable plant shop, Baker and Spice, a beloved bakery, Sasquatch Brewing, a cute brewpub, Please Louise, a nice Italian/Pizza spot, City Thai, a decent Thai joint, McMenniman\'s Bar and Cafe, as well as a Starbucks, Einstein\'s bagels, and the Hillsdale Food Cart Park, a pod of different kinds of ethnic food carts.<br /><br />If you\'re looking for a bit more of a stroll, ~20 minute walk will take you over to the very cute shops and cafes of Multnomah Village, where I recommend the super delicious mediterranean food at Yalla. You won\'t be disappointed with a meal there.<br /><br />This is a great spot to book if you want to run around and have ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44325859/original/71af2deb-9c65-488b-bbfb-98ea62366f84.jpeg',4632981,31,'45.47889','-122.70359',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,299.00,3,90,40,4.98,54044572),(2429,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54068510','Scenic Upscale Apt. in Pearl District w/ Rooftop!','Scenic Upscale apartment with unbeatable location featuring luxury amenities including a rooftop deck with fire pit & Sky Entertainment lounge. <br />Located in the heart of the Pearl District, you will find endless opportunities to create new memories! This famous neighborhood is a travelers top travel destinations when visiting Portland. This popular destination features art galleries & cultural institutions, as well as stylish shops, acclaimed eateries and brewpubs all within walking distance!','The Pearl District is one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods! Housing world-class art galleries, vibrant shops and boutiques as well as some of the cities best chefs and restaurants. <br />At The Pearl you will find many bars and restaurants from craft breweries and artisan coffee shops to fine dinning mainstays. <br /><br />Whatever your travel adventure vision looks like, you can see it come alive here at the Pearl District!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54068510/original/923d4a5a-fd69-4888-bbed-d8940d4840e5.jpeg',339414830,2,'45.52642','-122.68634',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,149.00,30,1000,96,4.97,54068510),(2430,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54070480','One bedroom condo on the Willamette River Path!','Come experience zen in our lovely 1-bedroom condo next to the Willamette River. <br /><br />The condo boasts a large master bedroom, pullout sofa for extra guests, balcony with a peek-a-boo view of the river, full kitchenette, radiant floor heating in the bathroom, and plenty of storage space to keep your things during your stay. <br /><br />We try to provide all possible amenities to make your stay as comfortable and restful as possible, including yoga mats, local coffee & tea, guides to Portland and much more.','Our area of John’s Landing is a lovely, quiet neighborhood tucked up next to the Willamette River, adjacent to the river path that can take you all the way downtown. We would love to host guests who respect the quiet nature of the area, especially in the evenings. <br /><br />There’s so much to see and do along the path and in the park next door. And it’s an easy walk or bike ride across the Sellwood Bridge to enjoy that neighborhood and Oaks Park!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54070480/original/b3186840-9d88-4143-abab-e9e2af3f6aa2.jpeg',6024930,22,'45.47004','-122.67008',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,109.00,2,30,59,4.92,54070480),(2431,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54091757','Clean + Modern house in heart of NE Portland','Located in the vibrant Woodlawn neighborhood in NE Portland, this home has a perfect balance of neighborhood tranquility and urban convenience and excitement. Located within a short walk or bike ride from some of Portland\'s coolest districts, such as Alberta Arts, Mississippi, and Williams, you\'ll be near some of Portland\'s best restaurants, coffeeshops, and bars. Then come home to a relaxing and peaceful space with all the amenities you need to chill out.','Located on a peaceful bike thruway, you\'ll see more cyclists and cute dogs than cars in a typical day. But don\'t worry, there\'s plenty of excitement nearby. You\'ll be a few blocks from a fantastic coffeeshop/bakery, brewery, fine Italian restaurant, tamale shop, and numerous bars and other great places. A few minutes further and you\'re on Alberta Street where you\'ll find everything you could ask - Ethiopian injera, Australian hand pies, and craft beer and cocktails. Downtown is a short drive from here, as are the many other vibrant neighborhoods of the city. Whether you are exploring Portland by foot, bike, bus, or car, you\'ll be pleased to be in this neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54091757/original/7ebd9a01-1923-4c0b-bdd9-2d8b669568c0.jpeg',11001258,45,'45.56784','-122.65467',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,3,1125,43,4.88,54091757),(2432,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54095249','Bright and Modern Family Home','Modern and bright family home in the charming neighborhood of Sellwood in SE Portland. Located just blocks from parks, restaurants and the MAX line!','Charming Sellwood in Southeast Portland has restaurants, parks and the MAX line within walking distance. This family-friendly neighborhood is also famous for all is antique stores!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54095249/original/7ff6dff3-4609-4d09-bd96-4d3e729c1c32.jpeg',11016312,20,'45.46777','-122.64608',1,6,3.00,3.00,0.00,225.00,30,90,1,5.00,54095249),(2433,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54105121','Awesome location, Lovely 5BR Alberta Arts District','The Alberta Petite Hotel is a very nice relaxing house in a perfect walkable location on Alberta St and 24th with galleries, local shops, restaurants and entertainment. The house is craftsman-style with modern and contemporary touches. Rent the whole house which includes 5 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, a spacious and well-stocked kitchen, kitchenette in lower unit, large dining room, living room, laundry room and office. Enjoy the expansive porch and the many outdoor spaces. Plus two parking spaces.','This is one of the best areas in Portland (in my humble opinion). The Alberta Arts District has so many cool art galleries, shops, cafes, restaurants and entertainment...you\'ll never run out of good food and fun things to do. The neighborhood is very walkable and good for getting some exercise in there are lots of cool older Portland homes in this area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-52878944/original/589191e9-3d40-456e-b50f-d5d42be2c736.jpeg',224911430,1,'45.5598','-122.64091',1,10,3.50,5.00,6.00,450.00,2,365,59,5.00,54105121),(2434,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54106742','Private Studio in Northeast Portland','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space located within walking distance of restaurants, shops and theaters in the Portland Hollywood district.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54106742/original/b960895b-7b39-402a-9c35-1d4e69c6d085.jpeg',20742544,33,'45.54082','-122.62544',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,118.00,2,60,55,4.93,54106742),(2435,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54111795','Renovated waterfront condo near the Pearl District','Book your mid-term stay at this gem nestled on the ground floor, offering an extraordinary waterfront experience in Portland, Oregon. The perfect haven for activities in downtown Portland, OR! This delightful 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom condo offers an incredible combination of convenience, comfort, and a dash of riverside magic.<br />The best of both worlds – the vibrant energy of the city and the peaceful ambiance of the waterfront. It\'s the ideal blend of work and leisure.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54111795/original/8b2f7be3-acf2-4fee-a72c-d8bf3c2f75e3.jpeg',168130537,43,'45.52821','-122.67326',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,131.00,30,120,17,4.88,54111795),(2436,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54131693','Posh PDX Penthouse with Atrium Views','Indulge in the ultimate relaxation or work remotely in style at the extraordinary \"PDX Penthouse\". Nestled in the serene hillside of SW Portland\'s Fulton Park/John’s Landing neighborhood, this private and spacious loft-style home offers a tranquil retreat.<br /><br />As you step inside, be greeted by the magnificent floor-to-ceiling atrium, seamlessly merging the breathtaking beauty of the Pacific Northwest with the comfort of indoors all year round.','Our neighborhood rests at the top of Corbett Avenue in Fulton Park/John’s Landing, with walking distance to coffee shops and restaurants, such as Elephants on Corbett, Jola Coffee, Fulton Pub, and more. The neighborhood is warm and welcoming, as well as very safe. Our neighbors are friendly and greet each other. <br /><br />The PDX Penthouse is in close proximity to I-5; Shops, public transportation, restaurants, downtown, trials and parks just minutes away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54131693/original/096cd386-425e-4cd5-b660-6e588ee2f4f9.jpeg',57373623,22,'45.47196','-122.67566',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,241.00,2,1125,60,4.97,54131693),(2437,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54160738','Renovated Condo in the Heart of Portland','Perfectly located studio in the central heart of Portland - Where Downtown, Northwest, Goose Hollow and the Pearl district meet. <br /><br />Walking distance to:<br />- The infamous Powell\'s Books, Crystal Ballroom, Providence Park and Old Town.<br />- Whole Foods, Fred Meyer and Trader Joes markets<br />- Countless restaurants, bars, coffee shops and more!<br /><br />Our cozy condo in the historic Empress building is the ideal home base for your visit to Portland. Fully furnished with everything you need for an enjoyable stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54160738/original/c07279fb-7df2-4589-a8e3-2baa6737db39.jpeg',19977865,27,'45.5241','-122.6882',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,68.00,30,365,10,4.60,54160738),(2438,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54168405','Stylish Apartment in Historic Neighborhood','This stylish and spacious 2nd floor apartment is located in the Historic Mississippi District. The kitchen is extra large and has tons of storage space. The apartment has a stereo system with a turnable and a small curated collection of vinyl records, plus a flat screen TV. With street views of N. Mississippi Ave. this is the perfect perch to work from home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTQxNjg0MDU%3D/original/98733c51-b278-4a74-bc19-fb873d8910b9.jpeg',5074035,9,'45.55331','-122.67675',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,31,365,8,5.00,54168405),(2439,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54186522','Big family home. Pets okay. Close to parks & more.','Family & pet ready, beautiful 2-story craftsman w/ high ceilings & great light.  Includes 2 bdr , 1.5 bath + 2 offices & on-site laundry. Large fully fenced-in back yard w/ deck & garden beds.  Perfect for individuals looking for a temporary place to call home as they explore Portland. <br /><br />Home is in NE close to Alberta, 3 parks, lots of restaurants (Woodlawn Coffee & Pastry, Tough Luck, Tamale Boy, Breakside & more!), the airport, & a short drive to downtown. Please reach out w/ questions.','The home located in the Woodlawn/Concordia area within walking distance to three parks , Dekum triangle and restaurants like Hat Yai and Handsome Pizza on Killingsworth. Alberta is just a little further with lots of cute shops, restaurants and galleries to check out.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c94d129d-28f1-4218-841e-7bedaeab5874.jpg',6530677,45,'45.57163','-122.64561',1,6,1.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,18,4.83,54186522),(2440,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54194083','Spacious 2 Bedroom in the heart of Sellwood','Come stay in this spacious house in the heart of Sellwood. This is the perfect spot for someone looking to explore South East Portland. You’ll have the entire downstairs to yourselves with a private entrance via the front door. Enjoy all the amenities you need while away from home. Our neighborhood is walker and biker friendly. Free highspeed WIFI.  Just a short 10-15 minute commute to downtown Portland. Street parking is free and ample.','The Sellwood neighborhood is a quiet and peaceful place in South East Portland. This neighborhood is very walker and biker friendly. Our house is within walking distance of New Seasons (local grocery store), the Sellwood Riverfront Park and pathway (great for long bike rides and walks), close to SE 13th Street (an area with great food and cute shops). The house is across the street from the 70 bus stop and is a 5-minute drive from the Orange Max line that has a park and ride, giving it easy to access public transportation to different areas of Portland. Our house is a 25 minute drive from the Portland Airport.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54194083/original/17957020-30cd-49af-bf79-41d708a11d80.jpeg',439397034,20,'45.46229','-122.65032',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,77.00,30,59,45,4.84,54194083),(2441,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54208815','Dog-friendly, huge, & cozy home in best location!','Make yourself at home in our classic Portland home from 1908 with a cozy fireplace and modern updates. Easy driving to the beautiful Columbia River Gorge, Timberline Skiing Lodge, and the famous Willamette Valley wineries. <br /><br />Our home is equipped with everything you need. Full kitchen and dining room, plush beds, monitors (+keyboard to work from home), beautiful deck, front porch, and fenced in backyard for your pet. We are centrally located and in walking distance to anything you need.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a96cce1c-810e-4ed7-bf8b-0469ca09b83d.jpg',7241632,32,'45.51556','-122.64033',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,200.00,5,1125,4,5.00,54208815),(2442,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54245409','Contemporary Apartment in Alberta Arts District','Enjoy a great experience at this centrally-located place. It has everything you will need for a weekend getaway or longer stay.<br /><br />Walking distance to many local shops and great restaurants.','Take a short walk and you’re in the middle of the Alberta district with many local shops and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54245409/original/e328f791-5454-480e-99f7-825ba369bc76.jpeg',4099644,29,'45.55987','-122.6488',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,2,28,124,4.98,54245409),(2443,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54245996','El Rancho Fantastico  (4.5 miles from airport)','Traveler\'s retreat! A relaxing stopover for exploring the city. Enjoy your stay in our clean and comfortable 1950\'s ranch home. El Rancho Fantastico is located in the Alberta Arts district of North East Portland,  just a 12 minute drive from the airport. We are walking distance to coffee shops, restaurants, city parks, boutiques, grocery stores and bakeries. Our street is located near a main bus route and bicycle greenways for easy transportation. Downtown Portland is only 15 minute drive away.','Located in the North East Alberta Arts district. Cute walkable neighborhood close to main bus line, restaurants, coffee, bakeries and only 15 minutes from downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54245996/original/4387e29c-223a-46a8-a33f-ea31deb2a317.jpeg',141751197,21,'45.55833','-122.6156',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,39.00,1,7,251,4.96,54245996),(2444,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54247874','Private Garden Retreat in the City','This 2 story/townhouse/apartment is filled with art and handmade ceramics. The paintings are a collection of  work made by Pacific Northwest Artists. The apartment includes  an electric gate & private parking space (for 1 car) and private courtyard entrance into the space which also includes an outdoor deck and  a sculpture garden. <br /><br />There is a stereo and lots of vinyl to explore. Plus a kitchen filled with Japanese knives and many cooking tools.<br /><br />Absolutely no parties allowed on the premises.','The neighborhood is lively and walkable. Lovely\'s 50 50 is less than a half a block away and I think they make the best pizza in Portland. The Fresh Pot coffee shop is in the building and open 7 days a week. There are so many restaurants, boutiques, bars, yoga studios, music venues, and food carts, to choose from. The New Rite Way, a neighborhood bodega, is across the street and there is a larger market, New Seasons, a short walk away. You only need to leave the neighborhood when you want to explore other parts of the city or to take a road trip to the Oregon coast, the Columbia Gorge, or the mountains:)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54247874/original/5334cc6e-2bbf-49b8-abbe-a559f6eafbaf.jpeg',5074035,9,'45.55296','-122.6769',1,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,31,121,1,5.00,54247874),(2445,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54249504','Modern 1-bedroom with indoor fire place.','In late spring, summer, and fall, you may be treated to an up-close, incredible sighting of hummingbirds as they feast on the nectar-rich blooms surrounding the cottage. Hummingbird Cottage is a modern, carefree space in North Portland in the supercool, easy-going St. John’s area. HC (short for Hummingbird Cottage) is a well-equipped, fashionable work/live space designed for your comfort and convenience. It is a short walk to coffee shops, cafes, bars, and shopping.','A mellow neighborly atmosphere awaits you in true Portlandian fashion. You’ll find a strong sense of community in our hood. You’ll come across warmhearted people and easy conversation.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54249504/original/de45d76e-94c5-4a71-bdb7-8525292f7f59.jpeg',64092580,58,'45.59501','-122.75098',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,94.00,2,13,51,4.90,54249504),(2446,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54280360','Cozy and Walkable 1 bedroom daylight basement','Our basement has been newly renovated. Brand new bedroom, beautiful bathroom and living space. The living space includes a 57” Smart TV and couch. The wet bar features a mini fridge, sink and Keurig Coffee maker. The bedroom has 1 queen sized bed with hotel luxury 1800 bedding sheets, a dresser, full length mirror and natural light window. Our house is centrally located with dozens of restaurants, bars and coffee shops just a short walk away!','Our house is situated in a very walkable neighborhood. Within a mile walk are countless restaurants, bars and coffee shops! We are just a couple blocks away from bus lines 2, 75 & 66.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-54280360/original/335485e1-c419-4194-a44d-993c85274e88.jpg',54934802,8,'45.50095','-122.62322',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,68.00,1,1125,215,4.97,54280360),(2447,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54303512','Modern Portland Studio w/ Central Location!','Capture the essence of the Portland lifestyle at this 1-bathroom downtown studio with iconic spots and local scenes right outside the door. Featuring a well-equipped kitchen, Smart TV, high-speed WiFi, city views, and more, this ideally located vacation rental makes sure your extended home base is worry-free. When you’re not cozied up with a book or binging your favorite show, explore the numerous eateries, boutiques, sporting events, and parks, including the Portland Japanese Garden!','EXPLORE THE NEIGHBORHOOD (<1 mile): Providence Park, Pearl Shopping, Powell\'s City of Books, Oregon Society of Artists, Gilda\'s Italian Restaurant, Coco Donuts Uptown, HunnyMilk, Dutch Bros Coffee, Blue Star Donuts, The Cheerful Bullpen, The Commodore Lounge, The Soop, Papa Murphy\'s Take \'N\' Bake Pizza, Kells Brewery, Elephants Delicatessen, Kinara Thai, Leaky Roof Gastro Pub, Goose Hollow Inn Pub, Vtopia All Vegan Restaurant & Cheese Shop <br />DOWNTOWN PORTLAND (on-site): Portland Art Museum, Washington Park, Lan Su Chinese Garden, Oregon Rail Heritage Center, Oregon Zoo, Portland Japanese Garden, International Rose Test Garden, Oregon Convention Center <br />OUTDOOR ADVENTURE: Tom McCall Waterfront Park (1.1 miles), Eastbank Esplanade (1.5 miles), Marquam Nature Park (2.0 miles), South Waterfront Greenway (2.7 miles), Leif Erickson Trail (2.8 miles), Birch Trail (6.1 miles), Firelane 1 Trailhead (6.3 miles) <br />WINE TRAIL: Fullerton Wines (1.0 mile), Southwest Wine Collective (1.5','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-54303512/original/ec1008fd-97f5-4df9-a028-189099fedc5c.jpeg',121688409,3,'45.52149','-122.68853',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,54303512),(2448,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54305840','Charming Belmont Craftsman w/ Patio','Located on a quiet tree-lined street, this charming SE Portland house was built in 1909 and has 2 bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms, and an upstairs office. This area of Portland is full of character, extremely walkable, and has access to a wide range of shops and restaurants in all directions!<br /><br />Available for 30-night minimum stays and includes access to the entire house, basement, and private backyard/patio!','Southeast Portland has a great blend of a charming residential feel while being close by to some of the best restaurants and shopping that the city has to offer. <br /><br />There are many fun pockets nearby, along Belmont street you have Stumptown Coffee and the Sweet Hereafter. Hawthorne street is a short stroll away and is the best known street in the neighborhood with a ton of stores and restaurants. <br /><br />For everyday shopping needs, Whole Foods, H Mart and Safeway are all under a 5 minute drive away.<br /><br />The best part about this house\'s location is that in every direction there\'s something new to find. This being an extended stay listing you should have plenty of time to explore this amazing neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54305840/original/26d54928-642b-4ab3-8b7e-406364b6394a.jpeg',51085562,32,'45.51688','-122.64129',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,105.00,30,200,7,4.86,54305840),(2449,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54317587','Parkside Hawthorne Cozy Home','Our home is beautifully situated across from a quiet park. We are located just a couple blocks walk to restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques and bus stops on trendy Hawthorne,  Division and Belmont streets. LGBTQIA2S+ safe space.','Situated in the popular Hawthorne area, we are located between SE Hawthorne Blvd and SE Belmont.  Everything you want or need is within walking distance and we are just a few blocks from the Hawthorne bus stop which connects to all major routes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54317587/original/453667a7-cf92-40a1-b362-2f0566f23441.jpeg',3901470,8,'45.51113','-122.63286',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,1,14,120,4.90,54317587),(2450,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54319646','Studio steps from Mississippi Ave (94 WalkScore)','Enjoy your stay at a modern studio steps from Mississippi Ave- home to some of the best restaurants, breweries, and nightlife that Portland has to offer! Newly-decorated with a full kitchen and patio, this studio is perfect for a cozy place to stay while experiencing the Portland area!','This urban area is perfect for anyone wanting to experience some of the best spots in the city while staying in a classic Portland neighborhood. Mississippi Ave is steps away and home to numerous bars, restaurants, live music, dispensaries, unbelievable brunch, coffee shops, and boutiques. You\'re also a ten minute walk from N Williams, home to even more of Portland\'s best food and shopping. <br /><br />With the location being so close to Mississippi Ave, there could be some noise from time to time. We provide earplugs if this is bothersome!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54319646/original/3323cc38-feb0-4a7b-b56a-3c88ac331329.jpeg',29713998,9,'45.5481556','-122.674963',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,58.00,1,365,222,4.95,54319646),(2451,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54342436','Cheerful 2 Bedroom Home. Walk Score: 91 & Parking','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. You\'ll love the natural colors, thoughtful and fun decor and comfortable furniture. Natural light illuminates the living space through a wall of windows, yet the house and property feel very private as the house is set back from the street. The home is located in Portland\'s Sunnyside neighborhood, an apt name for a neighborhood cheery and bright.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54342436/original/e967e5aa-5d32-47d1-a6fd-9c3c0711a664.jpeg',205079895,16,'45.51772','-122.6189',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,71,5.00,54342436),(2452,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54354341','#StayInMyDistrict Piedmont Near Parks and Shopping','#StayinMyDistrict Piedmont! This home is perfect for those traveling for work, pleasure; whether it be families, solo travelers or groups. Conveniently located in the Piedmont neighborhood-- walking distance to restaurants & bars as well as shopping & many other amenities. Blocks to Farragut Park and public transit. Easy access to I-5 & PDX Airport. Sleeps up to (5) w/ two King Beds & a sofa sleeper. Kitchen, W/D, FREE street parking!','The Piedmont neighborhood is the ideal urban village, boasting easy access to other popular Portland neighborhoods such as Humboldt, Alberta, Arbor Lodge, Boise, Eliot and Kenton, just to name a few. It is full of historic homes, amazing restaurants, little shops and coffee houses, and all within walking distance. All of the necessities are close by as well, for easy central access all around! It is located in the Piedmont district of Portland, with Alberta and Mississippi to the East, Downtown is just across the river to its West. It borders Lombard St, which can take you to just about any area of Portland. Piedmont Neighborhood is a great place for walking, bike riding, recreation, and enjoying all of the sights, experiences, and eats Portland has to offer!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-54354341/original/7e96dd6e-6993-472e-834b-a42fb295c12a.jpeg',3142393,48,'45.579826','-122.673271',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,63.00,1,28,75,4.67,54354341),(2453,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54356926','Spacious 4 Bedroom Alberta Arts District Home','This beautiful craftsman home is spacious and filled with natural light and green plants. The flowing floor plan is built to entertain anytime of the year and sits in a stellar location. Centrally located in a historic neighborhood just blocks away from great coffee, restaurants, bars, street art, galleries and parks.','Alberta Arts district is known for creativity. Award winning chefs frequent the neighborhood and national muralists grace the streets with their work. Fantastic coffee is served next to innovate brewers, diverse cuisine can be found near late night bars with indoor and outdoor spaces. Multiple parks feature playgrounds for kids, dog park areas, covered basketball courts, tennis courts and scenic walking paths.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54356926/original/5841e520-f622-4167-b301-710b1753a740.jpeg',779984,1,'45.56429','-122.64208',1,8,2.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,5,1125,15,4.93,54356926),(2454,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54358401','1 bdr apt in SE- private entrance, w/d, parking','Tucked away in the heart of FoPo, this apartment has everything: dedicated WiFi, private entrance, keyless entry, brand new appliances… and it’s very, very clean. Walking distance to some of the most popular food carts, bars, and restaurants in Portland but still in a quiet neighborhood with easy parking. And PDX is less than 15 min away ✈️<br /><br />We love long stays! 30 days or more = 30% (or more) off!','FoPo = Foster-Powell. We are just around the block from Portland Mercado, Mt Scott park and community center, Foster Ave restaurants and shops, and foodcarts galore. Mt Tabor, Leach Arboretum, and all the downtown sights are just a bike ride/short drive away. Please see our last few listing photos and airbnb guidebook for lists of our (many) favorite neighborhood spots!  <br /><br />Foster Road, a diagonal street in a city of square grids, has long been part of Portland’s landscape and once served as a footpath for indigenous people who moved between the Willamette River and Johnson Creek.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-54358401/original/d46fb870-ffdb-445e-9790-455cdf9cf970.jpg',5272495,36,'45.48547759008582','-122.58303554822436',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,1125,71,5.00,54358401),(2455,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54367575','The Casita: Our cheerful 1BR/1BA near Reed College','Welcome to our home! Built in the 1920’s, this adorable bungalow with close proximity to Reed College has been updated with modern furnishings and all the top-notch amenities you may need! Come stay at \"The Casita,\" our cheerful 1-bedroom/1-bathroom in the heart of quiet and residential Woodstock neighborhood. We offer a comfortable queen-sized bed,  one full bathroom, lots of modern touches throughout (smart TV, Wifi), and a fully-stocked kitchen.','The Woodstock neighborhood is a quaint and quiet neighborhood in SE Portland. With our own little walking district filled with restaurants, breweries, coffee shops and grocery stores, you won\'t have to leave this part of town to explore the best of what Portland has to offer. Yet you\'re only a 10-15 minute drive from other parts of the city worth checking out too!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54367575/original/68b91fbc-1e18-44a7-8a28-12af286ba66e.jpeg',3912693,38,'45.48521','-122.61715',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,139.00,2,1125,107,4.93,54367575),(2456,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54391050','Chic Home Pet-Friendly + Private Fenced Yard','This cozy, fully furnished three-bedroom, one-bath (plus bonus room) North Tabor duplex is full of charm with hardwood floors, a full kitchen, two fully furnished bedrooms. The full kitchen boasts granite countertops, a dishwasher, microwave, full refrigerator, and under sink water filter. The floor plan features two fully furnished bedrooms with queen size beds, the third room set up as an office, and a bonus room features a couch and smart TV.','This location has fantastic access to everything that makes Portland great—restaurants, bars, parks, and more. The year-round Montavilla Farmers Market is within 1.5 miles, and beautiful Mt. Tabor Park is just a bit further. Trader Joe’s, QFC, Fred Meyer, and more are within a quick drive. In the morning, walk a couple of blocks to Seven Virtues Coffee Roasters for a latte. Plus, there are fantastic dining options within two miles, including Screen Door Eastside, The Observatory, Malka, Crema Coffee + Bakery, Coquine, and Vintage Cocktail Lounge.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54391050/original/536af1d8-30eb-4e54-bb12-797b83ceb5d7.jpeg',1828909,52,'45.5270326','-122.607338',1,4,1.00,3.00,2.00,108.00,30,365,1,4.00,54391050),(2457,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54392773','Cozy Garden Cottage Near Multnomah Village','Experience beautiful Portland from the comfort from our cozy and private guest cottage, located in the fenced backyard of my home.  This peaceful retreat has a calm and relaxing vibe, a quiet haven conveniently located in SW Portland and within walking distance to popular pubs and eateries in Multnomah Village. Whether you\'re visiting friends and family or here to explore this corner of Oregon, this is the perfect place for a couple or solo traveler to recharge after a busy day!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTQzOTI3NzM%3D/original/502f1970-0ddc-420c-9904-2d0f7c244785.jpeg',31406893,31,'45.4693','-122.69824',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,91.00,2,14,3,5.00,54392773),(2458,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54406248','Wilson Heights Studio at Forest Park','Welcome to your home away from home in the heart of Northwest Portland. This studio has a private entrance on a quiet street and has been newly renovated with a full kitchen, gas fireplace, laundry unit, and bath. You\'ll find this unit in a beautiful area of NW Portland - within walking distance to hiking & bike trails of Forest Park, fantastic restaurants and breweries in Portland Slabtown, a New Seasons Market, NW 23rd shopping district, the Pearl District, and more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-54406248/original/a1ca154e-3e0e-48b8-9bdd-62564ea9a86e.jpeg',14736623,93,'45.53843','-122.71455',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,78.00,2,180,108,4.95,54406248),(2459,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/505918970691939876','Peaceful Cottage: Fully Equipped 2BR near PDX & UO','A 10-minute drive from the airport and 1 block from the new University of Oregon - Portland, my bright cottage downstairs ADU features an open kitchen/living room floor plan with two bedrooms, one bathroom and 9-foot ceilings. Situated in the NE Concordia neighborhood near the Alberta Arts area and McMenamins Kennedy School. Neighorhood pubs, grocery stores, and public transportation are only a short walk away. One off street parking spot is available. No smoking of any kind on the property.','My home is located in the Concordia neighborhood only 1 block from the new University of Oregon - Portland and nestled among many other lovely neighborhoods including Alberta Arts, Woodlawn, Piedmont, Peninsula. Williams and Mississippi districts are not far away. These nearby locations offer many fun shops, restaurants, cafes, coffee shops, food carts, brew pubs and relaxing public parks. <br />My home is also several blocks from the historic McMenamins Kennedy School, a renovated neighborhood elementary school offering an outdoor soaking pool, a large movie and music performance theater with comfortable couches, several restaurants with indoor and courtyard seating and multiple themed bars throughout. <br />If you visit during the summer months, Alberta Street offers a street fair called \"Last Thursdays\" featuring local art, food, and entertainment. Less than 4 miles away, experience all that downtown Portland has to offer. <br />Here are a few of my favorites.<br />- A walk along th','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-505918970691939876/original/b9c3a77f-86bf-4e81-87b1-8363bda6a346.jpeg',27978474,1,'45.57118','-122.63335',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,92.00,2,30,157,4.94,505918970691939876),(2460,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/540629919638998108','Charming home on private street with hot tub','Keep it simple at this conveniently situated retreat, just a 10-minute drive from downtown Portland and moments away from Multnomah Village. Nestled at the end of a private street in a desirable neighborhood, this charming home offers a spacious interior (with recently added centralized A/C) and inviting shared outdoor spaces. Relax and unwind in the hot tub, gather around the barbecue, or enjoy the patio and fireplace. Remote worker? Come be productive in our sitting/standing desk station.','Beautiful, private, and forested neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e6f7bf32-c125-4e1a-9a5e-d43b56d3fbbb.jpg',43443423,73,'45.44681','-122.70821',1,4,1.00,1.00,3.00,134.00,1,29,117,4.80,540629919638998108),(2461,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/540829827019588024','Alphabet district home by Forest Park and 23rd Ave','Sweet single family home is exquisitely located in prime NW Portland neighborhood. It is on a quiet block close to Wallace Park, 23rd Ave shops, restaurants, coffee houses & food trucks. Fantastic location for hikers, bikers & runners. 2 Blocks from Forest Park with 40 miles of trails- bring your bikes and see Portland like a native. Alphabet District / Slabtown location, walking distance to The Pearl and entire NW district.','Close to coffee shops, parks and downtown shopping.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-540829827019588024/original/75e95206-fbea-43b1-bff2-4055611e7e29.jpeg',1142106,27,'45.53425','-122.70879',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,121.00,30,60,4,5.00,540829827019588024),(2462,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/543790091430453039','Modern SW Portland Smart Home','Welcome to your smart home oasis! This fully furnished contemporary 4-bedroom gem is the epitome of modern living, boasting a range of amenities that will cater to your every need. <br /><br />Step into the heart of the home, where an upgraded kitchen with quartz counters and state-of-the-art stainless steel appliances awaits. The open concept design, complemented by built-in speakers throughout the house, creates a seamless flow perfect for entertaining and facilitating multiple work-from-home spaces.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-543790091430453039/original/91177222-382d-420b-9a03-64cb8809ede1.jpeg',153766232,34,'45.45226','-122.73597',1,7,3.00,2.00,5.00,357.00,30,1125,0,1.00,543790091430453039),(2463,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/545780150951956079','1 Bedroom ADU  Inner SE Portland','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','Buckman','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-545780150951956079/original/c78fd766-5dd0-426c-b63c-5fc3b12421ab.jpeg',23683530,32,'45.5202568776585','-122.64923210729853',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,31,62,1,5.00,545780150951956079),(2464,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/547111719721943259','Spacious bottom half of house. private entrance!','Entire bottom half of a house to yourself with patio space and driveway parking! Less than a 10 minute drive to downtown and a great central location to explore the city. Host lives on top floor of the house.<br /><br />Clean and quiet space, a good cozy room for travel as well as living area and workspace.<br /><br />Includes:<br />-Central Location<br />-Bus/bike access<br />-Driveway<br />-Plug in stove/kitchen amenities<br />-desk/office/workspace<br />-weights for exercise','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-547111719721943259/original/6e5d6dc6-57c7-4b20-a114-a577ee8566c5.jpeg',163250650,31,'45.47526','-122.68289',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,84.00,1,60,70,4.90,547111719721943259),(2465,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/549520441803430046','Floating Home in Portland Oregon!','Private stand alone home with your own private entrance located on the lower Willamette River in Portland Oregon.  This unit is located in a clean, safe, quiet, and in a gated community.  Bike, kayak or paddle board from your own back door to downtown Portland.  Ride your bike or one of our beach cruisers on the connected bike paths to downtown Portland in 10 minutes.  Live on the water and in nature on a wild life estuary.  This home requires a minimum of a 30 day rental term.','Sellwood Oregon is a very popular and trendy neighborhood 5 miles SE of downtown Portland.  Sellwood is clean, safe and very walkable.  Great restaurants and bars within 1 mile of the home.  The Oaks Bottom estuary has more than 5 miles of walking trails just outside of our parking lot.  Oaks Park Amusement Park and the roller rink are walking distance from the property.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-549520441803430046/original/52c904c9-3a6a-4ee1-aa60-746fb940c6c9.jpeg',400364710,20,'45.47717','-122.65912',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,30,365,4,5.00,549520441803430046),(2466,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/549568993052279492','King Beds! Uniquely Portland, Luxury Craftsman','Stay at the \"Clover Craftsman\" with your family and friends to experience everything Portland has to offer. Use as a base to explore the mountains, coast, or wine country.  <br /><br />King beds in 4 bedrooms and Twin XL beds in the 5th.  Each showcases what makes Portland unique: stunning roses, 12 iconic bridges, nearby forests, bicycle-focused transportation, and TV show Portlandia.<br /><br />Only a quick 10 min. drive to trendy Division or Hawthorne areas and 15 min. to downtown or the airport.','Walking distance to the famous Portland Mercado food trucks and everything the Foster/Powell area has to offer, including fun restaurants, bars, breweries, food trucks, and coffee shops. Only a 10 minutes drive to trendy Division and Hawthorne neighborhoods or a 20 minute drive to downtown or the airport. Easy access to freeways to explore wine country, Colombia Gorge, the Cascade Mountains or the Coast.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-549568993052279492/original/659b8dd4-95dd-4f18-add8-189074a6c54c.jpeg',37422309,36,'45.48799','-122.58834',1,10,2.50,5.00,6.00,249.00,3,21,107,4.99,549568993052279492),(2467,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/550217872071953441','Walkable Foodie Heaven','Welcome! We\'re on a quiet side street – right around the corner from a dynamic restaurant scene in Kerns, the 5th coolest neighborhood in the world. Take a short stroll to parks, live music, vintage shops, and a vintage movie theater. Tall windows let in lots of light and overlook greenery, cozy porches, and a back yard. Our family\'s 1900 house has been divided into separate apartments.','Its foodie heaven! This friendly neighborhood is known for its restaurants. Walk to a gourmet grocery store or a Whole Foods in 6 minutes. Walk less than 3 minutes to restaurants, ice cream, a brewery, food carts, and an amazing chocolate manufacturer.  Walk 3 to 12 minutes to still more restaurants, 2 wine stores, a park, vintage shops, live music venues The Goodfoot and Laurelthirst Public House, Laurelhurst Theater (beer and pizza served to you while you watch a movie), a pioneer cemetery, and a record store. Yes, a record store.<br /><br />TimeOut rated our neighborhood the 5th Coolest Neighborhood in the World.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/034ff4b8-1a8a-458b-bbe8-1ee059337a09.jpg',2996481,12,'45.52616','-122.63801',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,79.00,30,180,204,4.99,550217872071953441),(2468,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/551339675550158111','Casita Mississippi - an Overlook gem!','Nest yourself in a cozy in-law suite on a dead end road that leads to Portland\'s premier sunset viewing park: Skidmore Bluffs! Great for a couple\'s getaway, a launchpad for a long awaited concert or just a snazzy spot to call home while you\'re off exploring the many parks, restaurants and bars that the area has to offer. <br />A separate door along the side of the main house leads you to the private patio and entrance to the Casita. There\'s no place like home, but this is a close second.','The Overlook neighborhood is quiet and friendly, so walking around is encouraged. The park at the end of our street is called Mocks Crest, AKA Skidmore Bluffs. It’s an iconic sunset/picnic spot with a beautiful view overlooking the Willamette River and the west hills - a ‘must see’ when visiting. Mississippi Ave, also within walking distance, is the main strip nearby and has a great food & bev scene - joy awaits!<br /><br />We are centrally located! 10min from downtown (NW/SW PDX), 10min from St. Johns (N. PDX) and 10min from Belmont and Hawthorne (SE PDX).','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-551339675550158111/original/b7565cc4-4596-48ac-872e-36266b04a0cc.jpeg',120568465,13,'45.55401','-122.68958',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,79.00,2,28,177,4.95,551339675550158111),(2469,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/551398401001977637','Queen Anne Guest Apt. In Historic District','Enjoy this private guest apartment on the bottom floor of our historic four story home. Located footsteps from Portland\'s best restaurants, shops, and our beloved Timbers and Thorns soccer stadium, you\'ll be central of NW 21st/23rd commercial districts, the Pearl district and downtown Portland. Whether traveling to visit loved ones, see a show, a game or enjoy some culinary maximalism, this is your hotel like home away from home. Business travelers will also love this central location.','Located in the historic NW Alphabet District, you\'ll find no shortage of stunning homes mixed with lively commercial districts. Walking here is a joy! From our home, you can walk to the expansive Washington Park, that includes the famous Portland Rose and Japanese Gardens. You can also make your way to Forest Park, one of the countries largest urban parks, with 8 miles of hiking trails and Mt Hood views. Explore the waterfront esplanade that loops from the west to east side for another perspective of the Willamette River. The success of the Portland Timbers and Thorns have also become an exciting area draw. You can reach the stadium within blocks of the home. We\'ve provided a urban hiking book for your perusal as well.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-551398401001977637/original/67756c41-bbf1-415f-8c0e-f0d6c5f99081.jpeg',3662791,27,'45.52899','-122.68805',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,92.00,2,60,134,4.96,551398401001977637),(2470,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/551576416242411206','Private Modern Bungalow','Modern open living home, Smart home, Built in sound system, with a  large kitchen, Large patio, Close to Alberta, Restaurants , Bars, Parks, Public transportation.<br /><br />On check out all we ask you to do is load the dishwasher and put dirty towels in one place.','The neighborhood is quiet, very walkable, has many restaurants, coffee shops, parks, and a grocery store within a short walk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-551576416242411206/original/9d3d84a9-097c-4188-bfb3-ea7fc9e466f6.jpeg',24385374,1,'45.566616','-122.63681',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,106.00,2,365,120,4.98,551576416242411206),(2471,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/551592062677838247','Large 1 Bdm Apt between the Pearl Dist & NW 23rd','Located uniquely between 2 of Portland\'s most popular districts (Pearl District & NW 23rd).  You can walk to everything.  Lots of great Restaurants, bars, coffee shops, theaters, grocery stores, parks, etc.  The Portland Streetcar is a block away.   Very bike friendly as well.<br />Very close to major Portland business areas.  OHSU, Good Samaritan Hospital, the entire downtown. All conveniently accessible.','Very nice walkable, bikeable, neighborhood.<br />Can\'t beat the location.  Lots of restaurants, bars, coffee shops to choose from.  Close to the \"Pearl\" district.  Close to NW 21st and NW 23rd areas.  Walk to everything.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/78e26af0-14b5-4667-904b-7f545d65c932.jpg',201594889,27,'45.52713','-122.68988',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,30,1125,12,4.50,551592062677838247),(2472,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/551670015393205562','Sweet Siskiyou Suite, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom.','This private upper floor bedroom, bathroom, and meditation space is located in the central Hollywood district neighborhood, nestled below the historic Alameda Ridge and Beaumont District. Lovely neighborhood  exploration immediately available and easy access to  Portland natural habitats including Columbia and Willamette rivers as well as  Forest Park, one of the largest urban forests in the United States.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ffba2274-c850-43e3-9422-2d13dc0f8cd7.jpg',6903632,46,'45.54589','-122.62772',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,1,15,0,1.00,551670015393205562),(2473,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/551742371275695683','The Charmante Suite ~ Breweries & Boutiques','Conveniently situated in one of Portland\'s most vibrant areas, our centrally located home puts you just steps away from the city\'s top restaurants, bars, and shops. Nestled in the heart of Slabtown in NW Portland, you\'ll find endless opportunities to explore the neighborhood’s offerings, making you want to extend your stay to fully experience all that this lively area has to offer.','Welcome to the gastronomic paradise of Portland, where foodies thrive! Situated in the heart of the NW district, also known as the Alphabet District, 23rd Avenue offers a culinary haven that will leave you spoiled for choice. Lose yourself in the