0,30,365,141,4.78,555824778380966061),(2486,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/556823735929845203','Nicki\'s Bnb Treehouse Patio @downtown PDX','Amazing downtown location with private balcony and shared bathroom, comfortable bed, self-check-in and free roadside parking. You\'ll be 7 minutes walk from the max. All the restaurants, shops and galleries are nearby. You’ll have, self-controllable heat and AC, water kettle, microwave, fridge, smart TV, and laundry (free).<br /><br /><br />PSU - 5 min walk.<br />Providence park (Timbers) - 13 min walk.<br /><br />Shared place includes dining table and couch. <br /><br />Bathroom is shared with other guests.','No need for a car here, everything is at walking distance,<br />down town, MAX, PSU, restaurants and nightlife.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-556823735929845203/original/dcf0f5d8-a2d0-4643-9e66-900c4d34b563.jpeg',103330725,3,'45.51584','-122.69336',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,51.00,1,365,90,4.88,556823735929845203),(2487,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/558027179659773700','Forest Park Sanctuary','Location, Charm, Comfort and Privacy! Just down the street from the largest urban park in the U.S. and up the street from one of Portland\'s trendiest neighborhoods, this apartment comprises the first floor of our historic craftsman home in Willamette Heights, full of charm with hardwood floors, built-in cabinetry and updated furnishings. A separate entrance provides complete independence and privacy. Come savor all that Portland and Mother Nature have to offer at our lovely retreat!','Relax in the swing and rocking chairs on the giant 450 square foot covered porch with views of Mount St Helens (and Rainier and Baker on a clear day!)  Enjoy fresh coffee with the sunrise for you early risers!<br /><br />For nature lovers and hiking/biking enthusiasts, our home sits just 500 feet from the entrance to Forest Park, Portland’s crown jewel and one of the largest urban forests in the US, with over 5,200 densely wooded acres and more than 80 miles of trails to explore, stretching for more than 7 miles along the eastern slope of the Tualatin Mountains overlooking Northwest Portland and the convergence of the Columbia and Willamette Rivers.<br /><br />It’s just a 15 minute walk to the fashionable Northwest District along NW 23rd Ave and more.  Portland’s TriMet bus route stops just a house away and connects to the rest of the city via Portland’s bus/streetcar/MAX routes. We also have easy on-street parking. <br /><br />For those of you visiting from afar, the spectacular scene','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-558027179659773700/original/82ee44d9-73c3-4ebf-8d8d-902968d8dba5.jpeg',25503645,27,'45.53884782379899','-122.71992846889306',1,5,1.00,1.00,3.00,140.00,2,1125,27,4.93,558027179659773700),(2488,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/558105582267879203','Stylish Mid Century Duplex -Woodstock/Reed College','This stylish duplex is located in the middle of Woodstock/Creston/Reed and steps away from bars, coffee shops, restaurants & shopping. The vintage/modern décor and cozy space will have you feeling right at home in Portland. The 2 rooms have queen beds, 1 full bath & everything you\'ll need in a stocked kitchen! Includes: Highspeed WiFi, TV/Netfilx, record player + vinyl, washer/dryer in unit, several outdoor seating areas/firepit and one free parking spot. Pets okay, come enjoy a 30+ day stay!','Woodstock/Creston/Reed College is one of the best areas in SE Portland. There are a lot of bars, restaurants, coffee shops, vintage shops & parks. It\'s all very walkable with pet friendly breweries, dog parks & much to do and see!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-558105582267879203/original/ecdff51e-b3dd-4686-985c-c5aecb3b109f.jpeg',67230784,38,'45.48805','-122.62194',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,79.00,30,365,9,5.00,558105582267879203),(2489,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/559310248140458462','Historically Renovated 3BR steps from NW 23rd','Situated in the bustling and vibrant neighborhood of Slabtown in NW Portland, this conveniently located home puts you just steps away from the best restaurants, bars, and shops the city has to offer. With so much to do in this trendy and exciting area, you\'ll want to extend your trip just to fully explore all that the neighborhood has to offer. Whether you\'re a foodie, a shopaholic, or simply looking to experience the best of Portland\'s nightlife, this is the perfect location for you.','Nestled in the heart of NW Portland, our location offers an eclectic mix of historic charm and modern convenience, making it the perfect base for your stay in the city.<br /><br />Northwest 23rd Avenue is a food lover\'s paradise, lined with a diverse array of restaurants, cafes, and bakeries that cater to every palate. From gourmet dining to cozy coffee shops, you\'ll find something to suit your taste. Don\'t miss out on iconic spots like Salt & Straw for artisanal ice cream or Papa Haydn for delectable desserts.<br /><br />The neighborhood is also a shopping haven, featuring a blend of unique boutiques, vintage shops, and well-known retailers. Spend your days browsing through local stores for one-of-a-kind finds, trendy fashion, and handcrafted goods. The tree-lined streets add to the delightful shopping experience, inviting you to explore at a leisurely pace.<br /><br />When the sun sets, Northwest 23rd Avenue comes alive with a vibrant nightlife. Enjoy a variety of bars, pubs, and liv','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-559310248140458462/original/ed199183-c982-47b5-99b0-31fbfb4a44cd.jpeg',33154064,27,'45.53309','-122.69857',1,6,1.00,3.00,4.00,176.00,2,365,146,4.78,559310248140458462),(2490,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/560020838456963301','Adorable 1 Bedroom Cottage — Walk to Everything!','Welcome to Baby Hep! Nestled into a private neighborhood alley, our newly built 1 bedroom cottage will keep you cozy during your stay. Need groceries? Walk across the street to Fred Meyer! Or walk to New Seasons in under 10 minutes! Don’t wanna cook? St Johns Beer Porch (food carts/fun) is super close. You’ll also be conveniently located just 15 minutes from downtown Portland, the airport, and multiple PDX neighborhoods! Bring your good pets!','Incredible location.  Situated 7 miles north of downtown,  St. Johns is a Portland neighborhood you can\'t miss when you\'re in town.   Known in part for the majestic St. Johns Bridge spanning the Willamette River, and Cathedral Park, which is situated just underneath it.   Cross over to the Linnton side and you\'ll find multiple forested trails which are all a part of Forest Park, one of the largest city parks in the United States.  St. Johns also boasts multiple restaurants, coffee shops, food cart pods, a farmer\'s market,  a cozy and fun downtown street with numerous locally owned shops and Castle Maplehold! The best news? WALK to all these locations from Baby Hep!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0516efc1-de93-4b44-832c-cad32819a604.jpg',3508484,58,'45.58788','-122.73771',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,31,89,10,4.90,560020838456963301),(2491,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/560330897729070240','Sellwood Library House, an urban stay in the trees','Welcome to Sellwood, a beautiful neighborhood in SE Portland. Our guest suite is surrounded by trees and gives you a nature feeling in the city. Across from the library, surrounded by many restaurants, and a 10 minute walk to the river at Sellwood park.','The heart of family urban living.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-560330897729070240/original/0c2b0957-4c69-436c-b981-a1f6a1f62089.jpeg',6646221,20,'45.46637','-122.65244',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,3,90,61,4.89,560330897729070240),(2492,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/562252356129091614','Work from anywhere, great amenities, free parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-562252356129091614/original/a5758afb-f190-401d-9322-a1765cd84352.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52905','-122.67985',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,89.00,1,14,2,5.00,562252356129091614),(2493,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/562393657998489615','Prime 94 Walk Score! Work/Play 3BR in NE PDX','Clean, Safe, Economical! 94 Walk Score!<br /><br />This home is a stone\'s throw away from Downtown Portland and is in the heart of the Mississippi/Williams corridor, home to Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. 5-min from the Convention Center!<br /><br />Cozy, comfortable, and clean with all the amenities you need to make your vacation or business trip a success. Property is a fully gated side-by-side duplex with a large shared patio/yard and is perfect for furry companions (requires pet cleaning fee).','Incredible Restaurants, Bars, and Shops all within minutes walk to Mississippi St and Williams St.  Extra wide and quiet streets with plenty of parking. <br /><br />Gravy, XLB, Porque No?, and Eem are our personal favorites!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-562393657998489615/original/1eb600ed-7fb3-4c0d-85e2-108e47b308ee.jpeg',73444161,9,'45.55101','-122.67349',1,8,1.50,3.00,5.00,80.00,30,365,91,4.89,562393657998489615),(2494,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/563003419630799024','Lovely 1BR unit with private patio','Steps away from NW 23rd St, this is an 800 sq. ft., 1 BD/1BA apartment on the 2rd floor of a 1910 craftsman. If you\'re looking for a great location, you have found the place. Lots of space in the apartment to hang out, work, cook, etc. Fast wifi, easy street parking, plus restaurants and shops galore. Whether it\'s your first or fiftieth visit to Portland, this 1BR apartment has all you need for a fun and comfortable stay.','Literally, you can walk to everything. Super close to Salt & Straw, Barista, Trader Joe\'s, Ken\'s Artisan Bakery, Bentley\'s Bagels, Caffe Mingo, The Fireside and many others. About a 10 minute walk to Slabtown (Sunshine Noodles, Life of Pie, New Seasons Market) and other dining destinations including Bhuna and Bar West. It\'s about a half hour walk to the Japanese Tea Garden in Washington Park or to Forest Park for endless hiking trails. Easy stroll to Providence Park. Go Thorns! Great retail close-by: Paper Source, Prana, Snowpeak, The Meadow, Sloan Boutique, and Parachute Home to name a few. No sales tax in Oregon.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-563003419630799024/original/31a22bda-0acd-4120-a499-e160e3b9616a.jpeg',1207025,27,'45.52909','-122.69773',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,90,53,4.96,563003419630799024),(2495,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/563223799929727708','Cozy Vintage Pub Theme 1 bd w/ private entrance','A cozy speakeasy vibe, filled with historic photos of Old Portland. Perfect spot to Netflix and chill. Month to month! We recommend 31 day min. to avoid the city\'s added fees, inquire for custom dates. Work from home location! <br /><br />13 min. drive or 45 min. via MAX Train to the Airport!<br /><br />Next to Lents Park - Astro turf, running trail, baseball stadium, playground, basketball courts, picnic area, and gardens.<br />* 7 min. walk to the Max. - 2 min. walk to Bus 17<br />* 8 min. walk to Eastport Plaza Shopping','The Rose Room is located near the Jade district and a perfect place for foodies! Our favorite nearby eateries include: Eastport food cart pod (25 carts), Core Food Pod (11 carts), Flipside Brewery and Food carts, Miss Saigon, Best Baguette, Humdinger Pizza, El Pato Feliz, Zoiglhaus Brewery, HK Cafe, Tokyo-ya Ramen and Chungdam Korean Fusion.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-563223799929727708/original/40114a11-df6e-4b54-a5e0-7910b4b6d7f7.jpeg',31337921,72,'45.49049','-122.571793',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,57.00,31,1125,8,5.00,563223799929727708),(2496,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/563269885626243151','Cozy & Fully Furnished  Residential Home','Come and enjoy this entire residential home in SW Portland. Cozy, Charming and quiet neighborhood within walking distance to restaurants, shops and parks .','Great neighborhood safe and quiet . Close to Moultnomah village with little shops and restaurants , Gabriel Park and more','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-563269885626243151/original/75bb4fad-9514-43a6-8343-a9825be9b967.jpeg',130948759,34,'45.46027','-122.727',1,4,2.00,3.00,2.00,96.00,30,250,11,4.55,563269885626243151),(2497,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565157987829085890','The Alberta Escape - 2br - Awesome Location!','Cozy, welcoming 2br basement suite ideal for travelers looking to explore Portland from a walkable location with easy access to public transportation. 94 Walk Score and 100 Bike score, this is the perfect home base for those who prefer to ditch the car & enjoy the Alberta Arts neighborhood cafes, breweries, restaurants, coffee shops, bike shops, galleries & boutiques. <br /><br />**Please note: Owners live onsite in main house upstairs. <br />*Pets allowed w/ host approval*','Nestled on a cozy, quiet and safe residential street, yet only 1 block to the charming bars, eateries and shopping of Alberta Street - this is the perfect location for any traveler! Albert Arts district is a quiet and colorful commercial area with a handful of unique bars, eateries and boutiques galore, as well as a full-service gym. Enjoy the amazing street art, as you stroll down Alberta Street - just a hop, skip and a jump from the Airbnb - and there is a beautiful park about a half mile away. It\'s a great location for all ages!<br /><br />Easy freeway access and just 15 mins by car from downtown Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-565157987829085890/original/03e2cae2-b3f4-4600-b50f-6ea57ffc6803.jpeg',221421926,14,'45.55887','-122.65072',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,122.00,1,90,84,4.81,565157987829085890),(2498,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565164765781227400','Craftsman line, Modern Design Near N Williams','Discover the exquisite charm of this remodeled craftsman, adorned with luxurious amenities like a soaking tub, large kitchen, and serene backyard patio. With three bedrooms, an office, and a cozy bonus carpeted area, this home offers versatility for various activities. The basement features a pull-out couch and a second home office for your convenience. Nestled in one of Portland\'s beloved neighborhoods, you\'ll relish easy access to PCC, Williams Street, Alberta Arts, and picturesque parks.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-565164765781227400/original/882dbf3b-a9c1-4359-8a89-25572bd80667.jpeg',221421926,24,'45.56558714580418','-122.66916986514474',1,6,3.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,31,270,1,5.00,565164765781227400),(2499,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565233589129171655','Pet Friendly Private ADU for work and play!','A cozy, pet-friendly basement ADU with full kitchen and big renovated bathroom.<br /><br />Our sought after neighborhood is centrally located and within walking distance to amazing restaurants and parks. It’s a lovely community with friendly neighbors as well.<br /><br />Expect to hear our family peacefully going about our daily living, but know that we go to bed early!<br />We are outdoor enthusiasts and foodies and are happy to provide information on our local haunts.','Our sought after neighborhood is centrally located and within walking distance to amazing restaurants and parks. It’s a lovely community with friendly neighbors as well. Within a few blocks (all walking distance) you will find:Whole Foods, Laurelhurst Theater, Dove Vivi (Pizza), Pambiche (Cuban), Stammtisch (German), Monte Lupe (Italian), Laurelthirst Pub (live music), Migration Brewery, Laurelhurst Market (steakhouse), staccato Gelato, Guerro (Mexican), City State Diner (breakfast), Paadee (Thai), Crema (coffee shop), The Zipper (micro restaurant pod)Navarre (French)Angle Face (upscale bar)Bheulaland (dive-y bar + food)Flying Fish (seafood)50 licks (ice cream)Oregon Park And more!!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-565233589129171655/original/f525da21-c2d5-4f54-89d3-8ae23e874f5a.jpeg',57470546,12,'45.52509','-122.63527',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,78.00,2,365,155,4.97,565233589129171655),(2500,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565305076210571097','Roseway Rendezvous: cool, comfy hideaway in NE PDX','Stylishly-appointed, 1-bedroom, 1-bath, private guest suite.Just 7 minutes from PDX airport and 15 minutes to downtown Portland. Perfect for a romantic getaway, long weekend, or as a home-base to explore Portland’s award-winning food scene. <br />Fantastic launching point to Oregon’s incredible recreation options (1-hour to Mt. Hood; 90 minutes to the ocean) and world class wine regions (1-hour to Willamette Valley and Columbia Gorge.)<br />Renovated in March 2020 and excited for your visit!','What you’ll love: Proximity to the airport(7 minutes) , downtown Portland (15 minutes), and everything fun on the East side. Quiet,walkable neighborhood with gardens and parks. Near public transit via TriMet bus lines #12, #72, #71, and #24 just blocks away. Bike boulevards in all directions. Short walk to lots of yummy food and drink options in our friendly Roseway ‘hood. Gazing at towering fir trees and shining stars through the skylight over your bed.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-565305076210571097/original/5c96402c-64ff-461f-ac6d-44dd9b3f72b4.jpg',14103566,39,'45.553062438964844','-122.58443450927734',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,2,1125,53,4.98,565305076210571097),(2501,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565771536311357698','Walkable Bikeable Mod Vintage Quiet Triplex w/Yard','NE Portland\'s Hollywood District! Walk score 84, bike score 98, transit 69. Quiet, safe street of houses. Yard & covered porch shared with 2 other units in home. <br /><br />Half mile to dining, health care, cafés, banking, gym, shopping, food carts, groceries (Trader Joe\'s, Whole Foods, Grocery Outlet), MAX light rail. Easy freeway access. 20 min drive downtown or hike in Columbia Gorge. 1 mi. to Providence Portland Medical Center hospital. <br /><br />Big windows southern exposure. On-site laundry new kitchen.','Quiet residential street of single-family homes. Caring neighbors. Short walk to Hollywood shops with many amenities. Four miles to downtown Portland. Easy access to exit 2 on I-84 freeway. Half hour drive to great hiking and sightseeing in Columbia River Gorge. One hour drive to Mt. Hood skiing and hiking.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-565771536311357698/original/ccd615f4-9797-4dc9-b6ea-b958d44a05a2.jpeg',410009654,11,'45.5341','-122.61159',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,172.00,30,180,6,5.00,565771536311357698),(2502,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565958500237128356','Sunny and spacious 2-br, 2-ba home w/ private yard','Relax in this calm, stylish space. All the comforts of home. A spacious and creative space with both mid-century and Southwestern style.  Close to parks (Mt. Tabor, Laurelhurst), walking distance to food, drink, coffee and groceries. Easy to get around from here. 10 minutes to downtown or the airport. Lovely, sunny and private backyard with deck and patio lights.<br />Downstairs master bedroom with queen bed and bathroom.<br />Upstairs bedroom has a twin bed. <br />New listing, thus the lack of reviews.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-565958500237128356/original/f674a7f4-1d5f-405b-b4b1-e72d75672586.jpeg',2369443,52,'45.52497','-122.60901',1,3,2.00,2.00,2.00,219.00,2,18,1,5.00,565958500237128356),(2503,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/566689378309988117','Luxury Spa Retreat Studio for 1-2 Guests','Welcome to your perfect spa retreat fit for any romantic getaway or a business trip. This luxury spa-like bathroom keeps comfort in mind with heated tile floors, dual rain-head shower, and a view of your completely private garden patio.  You won\'t miss a thing in the city from your centrally located private suite with light rail access to downtown, the airport, and central Eastside. Walkable pubs, restaurants, and coffee make this guest suite ideal for any trip to Portland.','With a name like Overlook, you wont be surprised to find many scenic parks with breathtaking, unique views of Portland\'s cityscape and bridges.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-566689378309988117/original/9a63f119-7fc5-49a7-aa3c-02a306b1aa3d.jpeg',47212384,13,'45.56425','-122.69027',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,2,29,128,4.93,566689378309988117),(2504,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/567050277741402991','Sweet Overlook Bungalow - walk to everything!','Centrally located Bungalow with all the creature comforts! You can stay in and make a meal in your fully equipped kitchen, or travel only a couple minutes to a nearby Portland eatery! In the spring and summer you can take advantage of the porch and luscious oasis of a backyard! The neighborhood is calm and quiet and a great place for families or couples visiting Portland, or those on a business trip looking for a quieter place to take those zoom meetings!','Central location in Overlook neighborhood. The Overlook neighborhood of Portland is home to The Stacks Coffee House, Alibi Tiki Lounge, and Overlook Park! Easy driving to Alberta Street, Mississippi Ave, Hawthorne Blvd, and Downtown!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-567050277741402991/original/3a436763-8207-4a99-bd02-d9f7c86d21c7.jpeg',7409866,13,'45.56143','-122.68817',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,19,5.00,567050277741402991),(2505,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/567527260414881064','Modern, central town home with en suite','Enjoy a stylish stay in this bright, modern townhouse a short walk from the river and some of Portland\'s best brewpubs. Heard of Apex and Double Dragon? They\'re your new neighbors. Curl up in front of the fireplace or treat yourself to a tour of the Central Eastside party district, located a noise-proof half a mile away. The MAX light rail stops a block away, as do several handy bus routes.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTY3NTI3MjYwNDE0ODgxMDY0/original/e2398489-5f56-4597-b567-fc043ce541a1.jpeg',21645947,25,'45.50539','-122.65397',1,2,1.50,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,15,4.80,567527260414881064),(2506,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/568119515572375230','Centrally-located and safe 1920’s PDX condo','Come savor some time in my centrally-located, vintage studio (with updates where they matters most!) Enjoy the Tempur-pedic bed, ample storage, keyless entry, natural light, well stocked kitchen, & views of the West hills. <br /><br />This condo is located just 1 block from East & West bound MAX transit lines, 2 blocks from i405, and totes a 99/100 walk score.<br /><br />Walk to corner stores, coffee shops, restaurants, Trader Joe’s, and event spaces like Providence Park and the Crystal Ball Room in just minutes!','Goose Hollow','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-568119515572375230/original/c03fa000-926e-483f-8acb-b10eda4c6672.jpeg',14175188,3,'45.52186','-122.68751',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,38,0,1.00,568119515572375230),(2507,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/568125476819434642','Luxury Richmond Rose Cottage Division & Hawthorne','Located in Richmond, one of SE Portland\'s most popular neighborhoods, our 700 sq.ft., custom-designed luxury cottage offers modern comfort with vintage flair.  Walk to Stumptown Coffee, Good Coffee, Woodsman Tavern, Petite Provence,  Hinterland Bar & Food Carts and other great restaurants, food carts and coffee shops. 90/88 Walk/Bike Score. Close to bus lines 2, 14, 71 and 0. Enjoy the private patio surrounded by nature.','Located in Richmond, one of Portland\'s most popular neighborhoods. Walk to Stumptown Coffee, Woodsman Tavern, Petite Provence, Green Zebra Grocery and other great restaurants, food carts and coffee shops. One half block to Clinton bike lane. 87/97 Walk/Bike Score. Close to bus lines #2 Division, and #14 Hawthorne.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-568125476819434642/original/f594ef87-a4cb-4edf-896b-68f50f929983.jpeg',73418489,8,'45.502232','-122.613274',1,4,1.00,1.00,3.00,116.00,2,60,86,4.97,568125476819434642),(2508,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/568403941306210017','Rocky Butte 2 Bedroom Basement Apartment','All the comforts of home! Newly remodeled and fully furnished 2 bedroom basement apartment. Located in NE Portland at the base of Rocky Butte. Close to Max stations, Park & Ride, bus stops and easy freeway access. Huge master bedroom (15x30) with lots of storage and Ethernet plug in for work-from-home needs. Cozy living room has electric fireplace with 50\" Smart tv with Roku.<br />Large stocked 10x10 kitchenette with great amenities including full sink with garbage disposal. Outside space with grill!','Walking distance to Rocky Butte and Park. Cycle up to the top! Gateway Green PDX and Gateway Skate Spot. Great neighborhood for walking.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-568403941306210017/original/3cf84624-ff47-4e1d-8fa3-8f8496e0038b.jpeg',80819602,74,'45.53484','-122.5686',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,30,1125,0,1.00,568403941306210017),(2509,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/568557312167290951','Pet Friendly Tiny Home Overlooking Peninsula Park','Sweet tiny home in an ideal location to explore Portland\'s coolest neighborhoods.<br /><br />Enjoy my lovely patio with a soothing water feature, fire pit & blooming garden during the summer.<br /><br />Located directly across the street from the spectacular Peninsula Park where you can rent bikes (helmets are in the closet), have a picnic and ppl watch!<br /><br />20 minute walk to trendy & fun Mississippi & Alberta Streets.<br /><br />Blocks away from coffee, groceries, bus stops & the MAX Line = easy access to the entire city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4bdf15c8-059f-4125-b2a5-1007f24b0fcd.jpg',7012341,24,'45.56559','-122.67178',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,90.00,2,28,129,4.99,568557312167290951),(2510,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/568864254943243954','The Del Rey','This comfortable and centrally located basement apartment is a wonderful home base for your trip to Portland! Private entrance to your own cozy oasis and a private backyard with a bbq. There is many great destinations just blocks from the apartment and everything else is at your fingertips via a short car ride or bike ride.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/45076ac1-2067-4fd9-b4b1-0ac28082512f.jpg',32149569,7,'45.53764','-122.65145',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,27,4.74,568864254943243954),(2511,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/568872341168920357','Bright, spacious studio in walkable Arbor Lodge','This newly remodeled basement apartment is steps away from everything North Portland has to offer: public transport (MAX yellow line), New Seasons grocery store, coffee shops, bars, diverse eateries, and the list goes on! The apartment is well stocked for weekend getaways or longer stays.<br /><br />Sushi, burritos, Thai, Papa Murphy\'s, and a nano brewery are just three blocks away.  This spot is ideal if you don’t have a vehicle, but has plenty of free street parking if you do.','Arbor Lodge is a historic neighborhood of Portland, with most houses being 80-120 years old. It is bisected by cycling routes (our house sits right on one) and is well connected to the rest of the city by public transit. The grand Peninsula Park rose garden is just down the street and is a must see throughout the summer.<br /><br />This area of inner North Portland is close to the city center, but still feels like your quintessential quiet city neighborhood. We love the walkability and neighborly feel of our little slice of Portland, and are excited to share that experience with you during your stay.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-568872341168920357/original/357cadb3-0150-4a6a-be3a-39a7a58a34e4.jpg',136930286,51,'45.57128','-122.68483',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,88.00,2,365,45,4.98,568872341168920357),(2512,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/570307973283448358','Iconic Portland Bridge View in Downtown St. John’s','You’ll love the sweetness of the Portland neighborhood that’s a little town in the city, St. John’s. Our home is perfect for walking to the local bars, restaurants, movie theaters, and parks.<br /><br />The iconic St. John’s bridge is just a literal rock’s throw away (please don’t throw rocks, the neighbors don’t love it), so you can walk over to get your perfect Portland pic, or drive across to the Alphabet District and Downtown in 15 minutes!<br /><br />We also have rental cars on Turo - see below for details!','St. John’s is a cute little neighborhood with a great family vibe during the day and a fun local night life. We have parks, hiking trails, beaches, disc golf, a local outdoor pool in the summer, and lots of place to eat and drink.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0e06ead8-73b2-4724-b8f1-366bbfb7ad6a.jpg',8375241,42,'45.58798','-122.75521',1,4,1.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,30,4.77,570307973283448358),(2513,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/571659881329048306','Portland Hillside Retreat near OHSU & river','This comfortable home, nested in a forest setting and located in a great central, and safe neighborhood. The space is functional, and well appointed. You’ll have a super functional kitchenette, private bathroom, living room / work space / dining area, along with two,  full bedrooms, and a very comfortable pull-out sofa that offers the space of a queen. Well stocked amenities with customization available on request. <br /><br />Within walking distance of the river, park, trails, and OHSU.','Walk to restaurants, groceries, shops, trails and bike paths. Minutes to Downtown Portlamd, OHSU, South Waterfront, Sellwood, Oak’s Amusement Park, Willamette River and Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/53e47764-5c27-4e72-9103-8b6273537564.jpg',51534523,22,'45.46955437507625','-122.6745619155026',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,82.00,2,365,139,4.88,571659881329048306),(2514,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/572485917343717247','Sunnyside Stay','Whether you\'re a family of four or a solo traveler, the historic Sunnyside neighborhood has tons on offer!  With walk and bike scores of 94/100 you\'ll have everything you need and more than enough to explore without stepping foot in your car.<br /><br />Your home base is a freshly renovated one bedroom apartment in a 1908 Sears Craftsman kit house.  Organic and relaxing decor amid thoughtfully selected and placed furnishings provide your repose between jaunts about the vibrant urban surroundings.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-572485917343717247/original/7b2c0d20-d0b9-4de3-8b7e-8a36a4b68664.jpeg',46855862,16,'45.51481','-122.63458',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,3,200,80,4.96,572485917343717247),(2515,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/572505670557685660','Outstanding N Tabor Townhouse Compound Sleeps 16','Experience effortless Portland living in this newly built townhome, designed with every detail in mind to make your stay unforgettable. Featuring high-end finishes and tasteful design, you\'ll fall in love at first sight. Explore Portland\'s exceptional restaurant scene, or enjoy a night in with the fully-equipped chef\'s kitchen and luxurious appliances. Your perfect Portland retreat awaits!','Located in the heart of the charming Rose City Park neighborhood, this vibrant area perfectly captures the eclectic spirit of Portland, offering a delightful mix of residential tranquility and urban convenience.<br /><br />The Rose City Park neighborhood is known for its tree-lined streets, historic homes, and friendly atmosphere. Just a short stroll from your doorstep, you’ll find a variety of local amenities that showcase Portland\'s unique charm. Enjoy a leisurely walk to nearby cafes, bakeries, and boutique shops that add a personal touch to your daily errands.<br /><br />Food enthusiasts will love the diverse dining options available within walking distance. Whether you\'re craving farm-to-table cuisine, international flavors, or a classic Portland food cart experience, you\'ll find it all nearby. The local markets and grocery stores ensure you have everything you need to whip up a meal at home in your fully equipped kitchen.<br /><br />For those who love the outdoors, the neighborho','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-572505670557685660/original/7f253a14-d5d3-443e-a45c-bbd51591a27d.jpeg',112798186,11,'45.5278','-122.60685',1,16,6.00,6.00,8.00,502.00,30,365,40,4.90,572505670557685660),(2516,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/572535440383228772','Spacious Townhome Combination for the Whole Family','Experience effortless Portland living in this newly built townhome, designed with every detail in mind to make your stay unforgettable. Featuring high-end finishes and tasteful design, you\'ll fall in love at first sight. Explore Portland\'s exceptional restaurant scene, or enjoy a night in with the fully-equipped chef\'s kitchen and luxurious appliances. Your perfect Portland retreat awaits!','Located in the heart of the charming Rose City Park neighborhood, this vibrant area perfectly captures the eclectic spirit of Portland, offering a delightful mix of residential tranquility and urban convenience.<br /><br />The Rose City Park neighborhood is known for its tree-lined streets, historic homes, and friendly atmosphere. Just a short stroll from your doorstep, you’ll find a variety of local amenities that showcase Portland\'s unique charm. Enjoy a leisurely walk to nearby cafes, bakeries, and boutique shops that add a personal touch to your daily errands.<br /><br />Food enthusiasts will love the diverse dining options available within walking distance. Whether you\'re craving farm-to-table cuisine, international flavors, or a classic Portland food cart experience, you\'ll find it all nearby. The local markets and grocery stores ensure you have everything you need to whip up a meal at home in your fully equipped kitchen.<br /><br />For those who love the outdoors, the neighborho','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-572535440383228772/original/a476345b-3cec-4de7-9ff4-0b31080e60f2.jpeg',112798186,52,'45.52593','-122.60515',1,13,4.00,6.00,7.00,501.00,30,365,26,4.73,572535440383228772),(2517,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/573419860729907053','Peaceful+Cozy StudioApt-Steps to Central Sellwood','Welcome to our sweet n’ cozy attached but very private studio apartment fully equipped with a luxurious iComfort king bed, fully stocked bathroom and kitchen spaces, and a comfortable seating area with a large high definition flat screen smart TV with a Roku. Guests have private access to the apartment and a small, exclusive, bright patio. Walk score 95/Bike Score 99!','Unique and funky antique shops and vintage clothing stores full of hidden treasures line the main streets in Sellwood, along with yoga and pilates studios, bike shops, and many delicious restaurants (most with great veggie/vegan options.) Strolling through the neighborhood is also a treat, with many unique sights. Sellwood is full of beautifully restored and quirky old Portland homes, incredible home gardens, and lots more to explore. With a short 5 min walk, you can enjoy observing backyard chickens and goats, to bald eagles, or red-tailed hawks from the bluff with views that span all of downtown Portland, the wildlife refuge, and the sunset. Our small town neighborhood, with all the perks of a big city, is consistently ranked one of the city\'s most unique, walkable, and family-friendly! We are also less than 1 mile from the closest MAX station.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-573419860729907053/original/5884c2f9-fc66-4e47-800c-f82e379af616.jpeg',14476211,20,'45.46555','-122.65363',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,106.00,2,365,80,4.90,573419860729907053),(2518,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/574017658254876369','Cozy 1 bedroom with amazing private patio','Welcome to our lower garden unit situated in the historic NW Portland district.  <br />Our place is in a Friendly neighborhood.It is also located on a major bus route .  The main future of our area is the Forest Park. Also we are:<br />3 Min walk to Lower Macleay Park<br />4 Min walk to NW 23rd<br />3 Min drive to St. Honoré Bakery<br />3 Min drive to Nob Hill Food Carts<br />4 Min drive to New Season Market<br />5 Min drive to the Hospital<br />8 Min drive to Pearl District<br />12 Min drive to Downtown Portland','Northwest Portland is the premier neighborhood. We have lots of restaurants, shopping, food stores, and an incredible urban park, Forrest Park, very close to my house. Whether you walk, run, bike. or drive, you will love the ease of access for all your needs.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-574017658254876369/original/f4a6668f-67e5-4269-885c-8d47b5e2a701.jpeg',292874,27,'45.53462','-122.71064',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,1125,55,4.96,574017658254876369),(2519,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/574134651877581961','Private 2-Bdrm Guesthouse w/ Kitchenette','Tree Alley Gallery Guesthouse is an ideal location basement suite, in sought after Sullivan’s Gulch, the center of the inner eastside.  A cheery 2 bdrm/1 bathroom, with queen beds, open concept great room, large kitchenette with full size refrigerator, dishwasher, 2 burner induction cooktop and hot plate, Breville countertop oven.  <br /><br />Access to 5 bus lines, three max light rail lines, and the street car a/b loop, Sullivan’s Gulch is the perfect place to explore all that Portland has to offer!','Sullivan’s Gulch is the densest neighborhood on the east side, well connected to public transit, smack in the middle of all of the inner east and west side hot spots.  Near Biketown stations, to enjoy the neighborhood’s 100 bike score!  We also boast the country\'s only sports bar that shows all women\'s sports - The Sports Bra.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-574134651877581961/original/a9eca7ba-e821-4ad0-9b48-773e3899cbcd.jpeg',40623772,4,'45.53272','-122.64441',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,29,5.00,574134651877581961),(2520,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/575966329558944757','Peaceful Retreat With Sauna + Outdoor Spa','Step into your own enchanted urban oasis nestled in the heart of Portland\'s finest delights! Behold our cedar barrel sauna, outdoor shower, and bubbling hot tub—all yours to unwind in bliss<br /><br />Stoke up the fireplace, sip on tea or coffee, and lose yourself in a whimsical tale amidst the sunroom\'s embrace. Or, spin a record and let the melodies transport you to a dreamy realm<br /><br />W/ nearby culinary wonders of our neighborhood beckoning, you\'ll be irresistibly drawn to dine out at every charming corner','Come with an empty tummy, you\'ve hit the foodie mecca jackpot! Steps away from a plethora of incredible restaurants choices, exquisite cafes,  stellar bars, live music, grocery stores, enchanting parks, a 1920\'s movie theater, ice cream parlors, vintage shops etc.. We\'ve got it all, right here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-575966329558944757/original/9676c2bd-56be-4430-ad62-8ae9a11e9e68.jpeg',3041413,12,'45.52626808406887','-122.63954066295453',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,300.00,2,1125,132,4.98,575966329558944757),(2521,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/576284484330485129','Stunning Central Home in Inner SE Portland!','4 BD 2 Full Bath Restored old Portland home of inner SE! Close to food carts , groceries, restaurants. Upstairs has downtown views. Covered Porch with sunroom and backyard oasis.','Buckman is one of the most vibrant neighborhoods in Portland. Shops, Bars, Restaurants are a couple blocks away in every direction.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-576284484330485129/original/ffbdabe6-396f-4e02-823a-716a63067dae.jpeg',1911650,32,'45.51774','-122.64797',1,10,2.00,4.00,4.00,150.00,30,83,0,1.00,576284484330485129),(2522,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/576978457059936511','Newly Renovated Beautiful Place for Happy Hearts!','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful, park-like 2-bedroom unit to stay! Separate entrance with office, kitchenette, laundry, dinning, outdoor space and more.  RV or Trailer parking upon request. Next to a park and close to light rail and bus lines. Convenient drive from Portland International Airport (15 min); a leap away to Columbia River Gorge Scenic areas (13 min), Hood River (50 min), Mount Hood (1 hr 10 min). Plenty Portland downtown, sightseeing and outdoor activities.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-576978457059936511/original/2bb36d20-9fb6-4ae3-a65a-e5177cd969ae.jpeg',55354381,76,'45.52281','-122.50551',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,2,90,40,4.93,576978457059936511),(2523,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/577031623587490648','Ainsworth Loft, Private Studio in Walkable NE','A quiet retreat among the trees. Welcome to the Ainsworth Loft, a bright airy studio. Perfect for a flexcation/digital nomad/or anyone new to Portland. 30-day minimum stay.<br /><br />This gem is located in a quiet residential neighborhood in Northeast Portland, nestled between trendy Alberta Street and charming Dekum Triangle. A great walkable location with easy access to public transportation. The unit has free off-street parking. 15-min Uber to PDX airport!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-577031623587490648/original/4501bef0-92a8-4970-b1dd-f99277fde5df.jpeg',210856519,14,'45.56633','-122.65914',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,1125,0,1.00,577031623587490648),(2524,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/577796909979736680','Artsy & Colorful Apartment - Backyard Access','A sweet neighborhood located in between two delightful SE Portland districts, Woodstock and Division, this light and bright unit is the perfect chic landing spot for your travels! Within walking distance are two grocery stores (Trader Joes and Safeway), a gym (Orange Theory), 2 coffee shops, a food cart pod, and a handful of bars and restaurants.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTc3Nzk2OTA5OTc5NzM2Njgw/original/7c60ec9b-c124-4e49-8c45-c1c4a46622d7.jpeg',40807533,67,'45.49281','-122.62055',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,74.00,2,100,56,4.91,577796909979736680),(2525,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/578134728854031308','Forest getaway- walk to trails/Zoo/Rose Gardens','Newly remodeled and sound proofed finished 5/20<br /><br />Gorgeous/Safe Arlington heights arboretum..surrounded by the forest but only a 10-minute drive to 23rd and all the restaurants/nightlife. <br /><br />Walking distance to tennis courts, Zoo, rose gardens, and countless trailheads. <br /><br />If you’d like to rent the entire 4 bedroom house sauna/jacuzzi feel free to inquire <br /><br /><br />Dog friendly! Dog wash in the garage!','Gorgeous upscale neighborhood very safe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a0d7ed20-e5f1-47eb-b25f-819bf54d0392.jpg',50556182,64,'45.51804','-122.71221',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,199.00,30,365,7,4.43,578134728854031308),(2526,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/578756788041470686','A private stay, tailored to fit your needs ^.^','Here to accommodate, all you have to do is ask. Need a larger bed? Need more lighting? Don\'t like the art work? <br /><br />Let me know how I can make your stay an easy and pleasant journey. <br /><br />Lots of shelving&closet space, full kitchenette, small pantry, TV xfinity cable/WiFi, twin/queen bed available, shared bathroom&full sitting room. Free stree parking. On site laundry. Small pets are welcome. Smoking of any kind only in designated areas. Near by Shopping&Food&Hawthorne blvd. Secured with key entry.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6e0772df-9fa0-4cdc-b4b6-bb2ccdc7b675.jpg',433110508,67,'45.49653','-122.62872',2,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,48.00,30,160,2,1.50,578756788041470686),(2527,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/579054109362360203','Gorgeous Bungalow in the Heart of Restaurant Row','We\'re in an excellent location in an upscale neighborhood with amazing restaurants, bars and shops. Beautiful walking streets with hidden staircases nearby. Three comfortable bedrooms with queen size beds, luxury linens and two bathrooms including a luxurious 12x12 marble bathroom that features a double slipper tub. There\'s a fully equipped kitchen with top-end appliances, streaming services, and an outdoor sitting area with fire pit and BBQ.','Our neighborhood has million dollar homes and has fantastic walking streets, especially in the spring and fall.  Great shopping and a wide variety of restaurants and bars are within walking distance.  The market just four blocks away is open until midnight and has a walk-in beer cooler, and a great selection of wines.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/505520f9-e099-4fd4-a4fb-8b78dee98a46.jpg',7797921,46,'45.54751','-122.62379',1,5,2.00,3.00,3.00,159.00,30,365,1,5.00,579054109362360203),(2528,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/579734705963048297','Private Garden Sanctuary','Located just two blocks from the funky and fun area of the historic Mississippi neighborhood of North Portland, with great restaurants and live music, our place is a sanctuary set in a lovely garden.  Easy access to busses and the Max train, there is also free parking all along the street.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NTc5NzM0NzA1OTYzMDQ4Mjk3/original/71b54f60-5faf-4d01-81bf-00ee068f41ab.jpeg',457924,9,'45.55054','-122.67716',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,139.00,1,7,21,4.95,579734705963048297),(2529,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/579767629210340854','Clinker Brick Detached Guest House','Welcome! Enjoy comfortable living in a spacious loft-style home. Located in a central part of Portland, near NE Broadway.','Irvington neighborhood is a historic district with beautiful homes dating back to the early 1900s. The neighborhood is great area for walking and close to NE Broadway. Enjoy access to multiple restaurants, bars, and bakery\'s. Access to multiple public transition options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0a6cc070-69f7-4e6a-a03f-f117a903db9a.jpg',26768350,4,'45.53499','-122.64138',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,115.00,2,365,70,4.99,579767629210340854),(2530,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/579917866864698124','Unbeatable 94 Walk Score NE PDX Work/Play 3BR+Yard','Unbeatable Location! 94 Walk Score!<br /><br />This home is a stone\'s throw away from Downtown Portland and is in the heart of the Mississippi/Williams corridor, home to Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. 5-min from the Convention Center!<br /><br />Cozy, comfortable, and clean with all the amenities you need to make your vacation or business trip a success. Property is a fully gated side-by-side duplex with a large shared patio/yard and is perfect for furry companions (requires pet cleaning fee).','Incredible Restaurants, Bars, and Shops all within minutes walk to Mississippi St and Williams St.  Extra wide and quiet streets with plenty of parking. <br />Please respect our neighbors and be cognizant of excess evening noise! Thank you!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-579917866864698124/original/50643399-2013-43a8-baaa-09cde1573772.jpeg',73444161,9,'45.54936','-122.67148',1,8,1.50,3.00,5.00,71.00,30,365,78,4.81,579917866864698124),(2531,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/580446669835502415','Exec. 3bm condo centrally located to tram \'n shops','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.<br />The condo is located on the top 2 floors out of the 3-floor duplex. You will have an entirely private place. Free parking on the street. High-quality living. Fred Meyer, Panda Ex, tram station, 3 dogs parks - in minutes-walk. Tram goes to PDX airport and Pearl district. Medium dogs -OK. No parties. Perfect for nomads, families, and relo. Min stay - 30days. <br />P.S. For SAFETY reasons we do not share the phone, address & email of the owner.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-580446669835502415/original/2ea386fa-3906-49f4-853e-318f355ae363.jpeg',64117148,51,'45.57409','-122.68039',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,118.00,30,180,1,5.00,580446669835502415),(2532,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/580619307646526349','Beautiful craftsman in quite SE PDX neighborhood','Gorgeous SE Portland 3 bedroom house for rent. It has 1.5 baths, a two car garage, a big fenced in yard up against a beautiful park, a fire place, large dinning room, cozy living room, patio furniture, a BBQ grill, a fire pit and a finished basement with washer and drier. Perfect for remote work or traveling work. There is a office with a standing desk and WiFi. The home is on a quite street not far from Powell Butte. It’s also a quick drive to Mt Hood and a 20min drive into Portland downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-580619307646526349/original/485c7b20-d58b-49aa-9943-817a744c19ed.jpeg',182476151,87,'45.5003','-122.48726',1,3,1.50,3.00,2.00,100.00,30,150,0,1.00,580619307646526349),(2533,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/581864471348852876','Boutique Williams District Studio - 95 Walk score!','Beautifull high-end ground level studio in boutique modern building. 95 walk score - walk to groceries, restaurants, hair stylists, pedicures, most anything you need on Williams and Mississippi Avenues! Quiet street with great neighbors, and just minutes from Emanual and Kaiser Hospitals, downtown and many other great local streets like Alberta Ave, Freemont Ave, Broadway Ave, etc.! Perfect for travelling nurses, or anybody looking for an economical, central location for 30 days plus!','You will stay on a safe, quiet street just a few blocks walk to Williams and Mississippi Avenues, filled with wonderful restaurants, bars, groceries, shopping and personal services such as barbers & hair stylists, pedicurists.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-581864471348852876/original/27733b18-b2c0-4265-89fd-8483ffe924ca.jpeg',82861962,9,'45.55235','-122.665',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,54.00,31,365,10,4.90,581864471348852876),(2534,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/583459079377815412','Pristine, spacious 1 bed apartment in Heart of PDX','New permitted downstairs one bed apt.  Perfect for a getaway or long term stay. <br /><br />Great location with close-in restaurants, bars, & coffee shops. Easy street parking.  New Seasons grocery less than a 1/2 mile away or walk to food carts. Easy walk to MAX light rail transit & just a 10 min. ride to Moda Center, or 15 min. to downtown.<br /><br />Mississippi Street & Alberta Arts District are about 1.5 miles away. If you are a traveling health care professional, Kaiser & Providence are within 2 miles.','Quiet residential, close-in Portland community.<br /><br />You’ll appreciate the great location with plenty of quirky Portland charm including distinctive restaurants, watering holes, and coffee shops. If you are bringing your car, there’s easy street parking. Stock up at the wholesome New Seasons grocery less than a half mile away or make a choice at the popular food cart pod. <br /><br />It\'s an easy walk to MAX light rail transit and then just a 10 minute ride to Moda Center and Convention Center, or just fifteen to the center of downtown. The unique Mississippi Street, and Alberta Arts Districts are about 1.5 miles away. If you are a traveling health care professional, Kaiser and Providence are within 2 miles. University of Portland is also couple of miles away. Major employers Daimler Trucks North America and Adidas are also nearby. <br /><br />Staying with us is a chance to experience the authentic charms of the Rose City.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-583459079377815412/original/fef3bc80-5349-4ea1-b059-199d6565a6dd.jpeg',449764124,13,'45.56557','-122.68675',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,52.00,2,28,61,4.95,583459079377815412),(2535,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/583556948734718930','Cheers from Mississippi Ave','Located in the hip & vibrant Mississippi Avenue, our sleek condo is nothing short of a good time! We are perfectly located so you can walk right out the front door to some of the best food, drinks, shopping, parks, and entertainment in Portland. Near the airport, and just a short drive/bike/scoot to downtown, the Moda center, and other happening neighborhoods like Alberta and North Williams, what more could you ask for? With a full bedroom and a pull-out couch, this condo can easily sleep 4!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-583556948734718930/original/c4abab88-55b3-4b3f-a5e5-2091b4a400d6.png',22901192,9,'45.554188','-122.675278',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,108.00,1,30,122,4.96,583556948734718930),(2536,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/584581362777076880','Timber frame guesthouse in NE Portland','Unique, beautiful casita! A prime example of natural/green building. Every timber was milled from our family land. Insulation is clay-straw and walls are natural plaster inside and out. We hope you\'ll enjoy the refuge and calm it offers in the heart of NE Portland, walking distance to many restaurants, cafes, parks, Alberta Arts district & more. 12 minute drive to PDX, 15 to downtown. AC, free street parking, full kitchen.','Central NE Portland location on quiet street in a safe, pretty neighborhood. Walking distance to Alberta arts district, cafes, Killingsworth restaurants, Dekum triangle, Alberta and Woodlawn parks. Excellent location.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-584581362777076880/original/a624b633-c0d5-46d0-8cf7-c9b78a03f7b7.jpeg',169608443,45,'45.56942831248423','-122.65142310240644',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,83.00,1,1125,166,4.92,584581362777076880),(2537,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/584742285862979544','Bright, Modern Home in Sellwood, close to dwntwn','This modern light filled home in Sellwood-Moreland-an inner SE family friendly neighborhood-is a perfect spot when visiting Portland. The Max line is just steps away providing a quick trip into downtown. And it’s a few short blocks from several of Portland’s foodie spots, bars, and boutiques, a local book store and movie theater. This home is walkable to Westmoreland Park, East Moreland Golf Course, Oaks Bottom Wild Life Refuge, the Spring Water Corridor, Reed College and the River Front.','Sellwood-Moreland is a tight-knit family-friendly community that is close to downtown but feels like it’s own village.  Boasting some of Portland’s favorite foodie spots (Bae’s, PDX Slider’s, Jade, Twisted Croissant, Bible Club, and Bastion a gluten free cafe) alongside old school neighborhood spots (Gino’s, Kay’s Bar) you’ll discover endless options. There are several coffee shops nearby (Fairlane, Either/OR, Blue Kangaroo). There is everything you need from grocery stores (QFC and New Seasons) to the Post Office and an urgent care (Zoom Care) a book store (Wallace books), library, movie theater, boutiques etc. Sellwood is surrounded by several parks and green spaces, and nestled against the Willamette River with quick access to downtown-just a 15 min drive to Powell’s books, or a 15 min bike ride along the Spring Water Corridor to the stunning Tillikum Bridge. In the summer the Oaks Bottom Amusement Park and Roller Rink are open! We are a 15 minute walk to Reed college! <br /><br />Y','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-584742285862979544/original/23074622-ffcc-440a-a80d-def35dabecfd.jpeg',18679173,20,'45.47518','-122.64455',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,22,4.95,584742285862979544),(2538,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/586558182228281903','Centrally-located waterfront condo in NW Portland','Enjoy a comfortable stay at this top floor, waterfront property.  Two-level condo has 800 square feet of living space with a private patio.  Open floor plan bedroom and bathroom upstairs.  Living room, patio, full kitchen, and dedicated workspace on entry level.  Only 10 minutes walking to The Convention Center, Moda Center, The Pearl District, and Old Town.  Dedicated and covered private parking space.  Just steps away from waterfront greenway walking path with easy access to downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4016acd1-fde4-4482-bff2-db24742fe31c.jpg',2775670,43,'45.52906','-122.673',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,280.00,30,60,0,1.00,586558182228281903),(2539,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/587973747440793800','Laurel House','Discover your home away from home in our tranquil and fully-equipped space, just a 5-minute drive from PDX airport and 10 minutes from downtown. Nestled in the picturesque Cully Neighborhood, your perfect stay awaits!','Cully is strategically positioned. To its west, it is flanked by neighborhoods such as Sunderland, Concordia, and Beaumont-Wilshire. The north sees it bordering the bustling Portland International Airport, offering connectivity and a touch of modernity. On its eastern side, the picturesque Sumner provides scenic beauty, while the south houses the iconic Rose City Park and Roseway districts. This unique positioning makes Cully a melting pot of various cultural and scenic elements, which blend seamlessly to create its unique character.<br /><br />The neighborhood also boasts a range of recreational spots that offer residents and visitors a chance to connect with nature. Parks like Sacajawea Park, established in 1985, and the more recent Kʰunamokwst Park from 2015, provide green havens in the midst of urban life. Additionally, the Rigler Community Garden, built in 2004, and the Whitaker Ponds Nature Park from 1998, underscore the neighborhood\'s commitment to environmental sustainability a','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-587973747440793800/original/2363798d-3dd9-48b1-b7cd-b5b0c1f9d40d.jpeg',29651367,21,'45.55996','-122.57972',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,152.00,3,90,117,4.96,587973747440793800),(2540,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/588293421871372350','Hazelwood getaway in NE Portland #1','Welcome to my Portland home!<br /><br />My name is Jake and I live with my dog (Peaches) and cat (Barnaby) in the Hazelwood neighborhood of NE Portland. <br /><br />Private upstairs bedroom with shared bath, super comfy queen mattress, and a TV!<br /><br />15 min drive to downtown 15 min drive to the airport. Very close to MAX light rail (closest station 3 blocks away) and a golf course with an amazing brewery.<br /><br />Perfect place to call home for a month+ while you settle in Portland :)  <br /><br />Very quiet neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-588293421871372350/original/6f08059f-41b1-4321-b5c8-71fcd5ff6100.jpeg',426284483,63,'45.52525','-122.51898',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,30.00,30,365,5,5.00,588293421871372350),(2541,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/588313139552208487','Peaceful, Close-In, Two Bedroom Flat','Located in the grove-lined streets of historic Ladd\'s Addition, this property is an oasis of calm at the center of the hippest area of the city. Across the street from a public rose garden, you are a short walk from restaurants, groceries, shopping, & bike rentals.<br /><br />This delightful flat can also function very well as a home office, and has the blazing fast internet (check the AirBnB verified speed under ‘Amenities’—>’Wifi’ 😁), CAT6A Ethernet, as well as a standing/sitting desk at your disposal.','Ladd\'s Addition is a  historic streetcar-era neighborhood in southeast Portland with a street and park plan that is unique among neighborhoods of comparable age in the United States. The plan for the neighborhood, which is located between Southeast Hawthorne and Division Streets and Southeast Twelfth and Twentieth Avenues, has been protected and preserved without significant change since it was platted in 1891.<br /><br />The completion of the first bridge across the Willamette River in 1887 and the consolidation of Portland, Albina, and East Portland into a single city in 1891 were triggers for an eastside boom. The opening of the Madison Street Bridge (now the Hawthorne Bridge) in January 1891 made Ladd’s land holdings in the future Ladd’s Addition the most convenient to the new city’s downtown.<br /><br />Ladd\'s addition is known for its iconic tree lined streets, as well as for the five park spaces that interrupt the hub-and-spoke street pattern. These parks form a compass when see','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-588313139552208487/original/f0f2f04c-29ca-4fc2-8db8-52f6ae0d0d6c.jpeg',121902321,25,'45.50946','-122.65236',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,163.00,3,30,45,4.98,588313139552208487),(2542,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/588648477122512439','Family Friendly SE Portland Getaway w/2 Bedrooms','Located in one of Portland’s most desirable areas bordering Woodstock & Eastmoreland this Guesthouse offers a quiet, spacious space while you explore the city. Just blocks away from Reed College and a 5 min drive to Sellwood/Woodstock restaurants.<br /><br />Highlights: <br />1,200 sq. ft<br />King bed<br />Gas fireplace & Range <br />Self check in<br />Washer dryer <br />Fully equipped kitchen<br />20ft lofted ceiling<br />75\' TV<br />Off street parking','Eastmoreland has become one of the most sought after neighborhoods in Portland. It\'s quite, safe and an easy 5-10 minute trip to the popular Sellwood and Woodstock area which offer a wide range or bars, restaurants and coffee shops.<br /><br />This guesthouse is right on the boarder of the Woodstock and Eastmoreland neighborhoods in a community called Eastmoreland Heights. <br /><br />We are located just minutes from one of the most popular public golf course in Portland (Eastmoreland Golf Course) as well as just minutes from Reed College.<br /><br />This is a very safe and quite neighborhood with many families.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-588648477122512439/original/3e88872b-1ff6-41fc-aa34-bacc095c36c1.jpeg',12190351,38,'45.46636','-122.61878',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,150.00,2,365,66,4.97,588648477122512439),(2543,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/589325732662252628','Charming Historic Portland Home with a Huge Yard','Charming 1930s historic Portland home near downtown.  The house has a beautiful front yard and a huge & fully fenced back yard.  Pack your bags and get ready for a fun-filled Portland getaway at this 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom vacation rental home! The home is nestled in Northeast Portland, which boasts popular attractions like The Moda Center, Rose Quarter, the Oregon Convention Center, the Hollywood Theatre, and more!  10 minutes drive to the airport. Bus & metro station nearby.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6852420d-f69b-4221-bc61-30ec5b84e4d9.jpg',187362053,74,'45.53931','-122.57667',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,365,1,5.00,589325732662252628),(2544,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/589887216411304890','Forest views, hiking, family friendly!','This family-friendly guest house is perfect for nature lovers. It is directly across from a trailhead to 26 miles of pristine Forest Park hiking trails. Relax in the evening and enjoy the beautiful forest views, or take a quick drive into the city for some fun.<br /><br />** Nurses and teachers, contact me before booking for a discounted rate, and thank you for what you do! **','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/25649f34-82d0-4f1b-8364-a69938848bf1.jpg',25814596,50,'45.582741','-122.799477',1,5,1.00,1.00,3.00,119.00,1,1125,168,4.93,589887216411304890),(2545,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/590345945313503903','2BR Basement Apartment - Central, Clean, Cozy','2-bedroom basement apartment in the heart of Ladd\'s Addition. Situated on a tranquil and secure street, you\'ll find in the middle of restaurants, bars, coffee shops, parks and actions. <br /><br />The home was fully renovated in 2021. We live upstairs with a 2y.o. husky and provide all you need for your stay. Please note that there isn\'t a 100% noise separation, but we offer earplugs and white noise machines for light sleepers and respect quiet hours.  <br /><br />We can\'t wait to host you!','Our place is right in the middle of Ladd\'s Addition, close to stores like New Seasons and Market of Choice, lots of good restaurants, food trucks on SE Hawthorne and Division, four beautiful rose gardens, bars, and fun stuff to do. You can walk or bike to downtown or the SW waterfront easily, and you can also visit places like Mt. Hood and the Columbia River Gorge within an hour\'s drive. There are two bus routes nearby, and our place is easy to get around on foot, with a high walk score of 93. It\'s a great spot to relax after a busy day exploring.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/855925fe-d711-4545-b332-1c7c08e0ea1b.jpg',13973351,25,'45.50967','-122.64511',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,144.00,2,1125,98,4.97,590345945313503903),(2546,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/590593706868229918','Nomads Nest - 2bdr, 1 mile from Convention Center','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful private suite, the lower unit of a charming Irvington Craftsman. Just a couple of blocks from shops and restaurants on NE Broadway,  and less than a mile from the Convention Center, our newly remodeled apartment is ready to welcome you in! Completely separate from the main house, it has 2 bedrooms, living room and bath. Whether you are coming to Portland for business or pleasure, this place is ready to be your home away from home!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-590593706868229918/original/d979ffe0-08e2-4b0d-b4b4-7ccbc03902a4.jpeg',451252593,7,'45.53739','-122.65597',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,2,365,51,4.55,590593706868229918),(2547,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/591818419575619351','Central PDX 94 Walk Score 6BR Gated Patio / Yard','Safe, Clean, Economical! 94 Walk Score! Access to duplex 2 Side-by-Side 3 bedrooms 1.5 Baths each! Sleeps 18!! Huge private gated yard!<br /><br />We\'re a stone\'s throw away from Downtown Portland and is in the heart of the Mississippi/Williams corridor, home to Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. 5-min from the Convention Center!<br /><br />Cozy, comfortable, and clean with all the amenities you need to make your trip a success. Pets are welcome but must be registered with an additional cleaning fee.','Incredible Restaurants, Bars, and Shops all within minutes walk to Mississippi St and Williams St. Extra wide and quiet streets with plenty of parking.<br />Please respect our neighbors and be cognizant of excess evening noise! Thank you!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-591818419575619351/original/288aeba7-5b02-4d85-9abb-7165959b44dc.jpeg',73444161,9,'45.55132','-122.67216',1,16,3.00,6.00,10.00,156.00,30,365,41,4.83,591818419575619351),(2548,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/592914094507369977','The Nest: Garden Oasis in Alberta Arts w/Fireplace','2-bedroom contemporary bungalow and stunning garden are an oasis of peace & tranquility in the city. 2 blocks from Alberta Street. Wake up to morning coffee in the garden, cozy up to the gas fireplace, or work from home behind a closed door in a dedicated office space. Stroll to restaurants, shops, a farmer’s market, Alberta Park, or the Kennedy School  soaking pool.  Hikes, waterfalls, and wineries a short drive away. Close access to public transport and the airport is a 12-minute drive.','The Nest is nestled on a quiet residential street 2 blocks from the dynamic Alberta Arts District. 2 minute walk to the food scene: many local restaurants and food carts (Salt & Straw ice cream, Kulfi, Bollywood Theater, Petite Provence, Dar Salam, T. C. O\'Leary\'s Irish Pub, Urdaneta, The Cave wine bar to name just a few), a gym, and galleries. Alberta Park with a nature path, running path, tennis, basketball, and pickle ball courts is one block away. 10 minute walk to New Seasons market, McMenamins\' Kennedy School Soaking Pool, pub and theater, and a neighborhood food co-op. 12 minute drive to PDX airport. 2 blocks to the 8 bus lines and just minutes to downtown. 10 minute walk to the new University of Oregon NE Portland campus. Great place to bike. Convenient access to Columbia Gorge waterfalls, hikes and fabulous NW wineries.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2a7470ce-fd7d-4a5a-967b-f11ec5402219.jpg',198422777,1,'45.56086','-122.6415',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,212.00,2,29,67,5.00,592914094507369977),(2549,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/593423013262443047','Charming Mt. Tabor Flat ~ Near Historic Montavilla','Relax in this basement private suite located right in the backyard of Mt. Tabor, one of Portland\'s beautiful natural wonders. This recently remodeled two bedroom unit has a full kitchen, full bathroom, and open concept living room with a full size futon to fit an additional guest or two.<br /><br />In addition to exploring Mt. Tabor and historic Laurelhurst Park, walk down to Tabor Tavern or over a few blocks to the Historic Montavilla neighborhood. There\'s no shortage of eateries or drink spots!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-593423013262443047/original/da0714e2-395c-474e-9297-dd9e546eff73.jpeg',257453618,15,'45.52223','-122.59604',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,66.00,1,60,120,4.83,593423013262443047),(2550,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/594772798810713701','Spacious 4 bedroom home w two kitchens','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 98/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. Our private and spacious four-bedroom home sits in a historic building at the heart of the eclectic SE Division District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-45457300/original/112fe83a-f341-47c7-8c4a-95745763b8ed.jpeg',115052133,25,'45.50707','-122.65638',1,9,2.00,4.00,5.00,264.00,2,365,18,4.56,594772798810713701),(2551,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/594843688164571339','Canopy Loft PDX','The Canopy Loft is a sun filled, second story studio designed and built by my husband and I to be a cozy home away from home. The window views are full of foliage making you feel like you\'re up in the trees, hence the name. Our neighborhood is quiet and calm, and we are walking distance from downtown St Johns as well as many parks. The studio can also be turned into your own personal movie theater!','Our little corner of St Johns is quiet and full of beautiful trees. Pier Park is just two blocks from our house and is a shady forest of towering Doug Firs with an amazing disc golf course and a public pool open in the summer. Downtown St Johns is a 10 min walk with coffee shops, local retail stores, restaurants, movie theaters and bars.  We are also within walking distance of the iconic St Johns Bridge and Cathedral park (home of the Portland Jazz Fest) beneath it.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-594843688164571339/original/9c1d7f37-3846-47e1-9e41-8d0226f34507.jpeg',61157693,58,'45.59656','-122.75612',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,96.00,1,7,88,5.00,594843688164571339),(2552,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/594940170120232078','Quiet, adorable guesthouse near Grant Park','Quiet, well-furnished studio apartment in residential inner NE Portland (Irvington/Grant Park neighborhood). Safely walk to large park, running track, tennis courts, grocery/drug stores, local eateries, bars or nearby bus stops; 20 min drive to airport.<br /><br />This property is ideal for those visiting relatives or friends in the neighborhood, someone in town for work who needs a central location, or anyone looking for a quiet, private place to “veg” between meetings, shows or visits in Portland.','Inner Northeast Portland in a turn-of-the-century neighborhood with distinct homes and beautiful yards. Very quiet and very walkable (and bikable), with ready access to large parks and neighborhood shopping and eating. Downtown Portland is only 10 minutes by car, and PDX airport is 20 minutes. Bus routes are a 5-7 minute walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-594940170120232078/original/8a2c59c1-ab71-4426-8f73-e737e7101442.jpeg',43004730,33,'45.54202','-122.63743',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,100.00,2,180,54,4.98,594940170120232078),(2553,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/595534429111070468','The Lily Pad is a place to come and relax.','Kick back and relax in this charming 2-bedroom home with its secluded(shared) back yard inhabited by a colony of quirky frogs.  The home includes a full kitchen with all the basic cooking supplies, as well as a washer and dryer.  For sleeping, the main bedroom has a queen size bed and the second bedroom has two twins and a trundle.  There are TV\'s with Roku in each bedroom and a Smart TV in the living room, and high-speed wifi .  The house  is not set up to accommodate children, no pets  allowed','Close to PDX, easy access to I-205.  Quiet, residential neighborhood in NE Portland.  Bike trails and lightrail close by, as well as Cascade Station for shopping and restaurants and Ikea.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-595534429111070468/original/716b5b83-6044-41a3-a704-5a9583184e00.jpg',452253100,80,'45.55958','-122.57093',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,135.00,1,10,89,4.97,595534429111070468),(2554,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/595680673819411804','1922 Craftsman Compound in Laurelhurst ~ Sleeps 16','Bring the whole family to this spacious home with plenty of room and separate spaces. Renovated in 2019, this Laurelhurst gem includes three combined apartments!<br /><br />Perfect for families or groups, everyone can gather in the large four-bedroom main unit and retreat to the two separate two-bedroom units for privacy. Enjoy the comfort and convenience of having the entire modernized property to yourselves.','Located in the heart of the vibrant Laurelhurst District, this neighborhood is a quintessential representation of Portland’s eclectic charm. Nestled on NE Glisan Street, you’ll find yourself immersed in a lively area known for its tree-lined streets, historic homes, and a welcoming community atmosphere.<br /><br />Laurelhurst is a food lover’s paradise, boasting some of Portland’s top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and trendy bars. Start your day with a handcrafted coffee from one of the many local coffee shops, then explore the diverse culinary scene, from food trucks to fine dining. The nearby Whole Foods and local farmers’ markets ensure you have access to fresh, organic ingredients for those nights you prefer to cook at home.<br /><br />For shopping enthusiasts, the neighborhood offers a variety of vintage boutiques, quirky shops, and independent bookstores. You’ll also enjoy the proximity to Laurelhurst Park, a beautiful urban oasis perfect for a morning jog, afternoon picnic, or ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-595680673819411804/original/8880d173-3cd0-4abd-9470-8f130a21ca2d.jpeg',190656099,12,'45.52712','-122.63236',1,16,5.00,8.00,0.00,0.00,1,365,35,4.97,595680673819411804),(2555,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/595962755524716138','Sunny Apt King Bed, Balcony and Office','This centrally located and newly renovated, tastefully furnished, spacious upstairs unit is fully stocked with all of the amenities you would hope to have. <br />*Walkable to several shopping districts, grocery stores, wonderful restaurants and bars, and a nice park with dog play area. <br />*Separate office with desk and laundry room. <br />*Curated with wonderful local and original artwork throughout. <br />*Luxurious king size bed with a comfortable high end organic mattress and natural latex topper.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-595962755524716138/original/330ccc7c-a86f-4982-8286-4fb8f6f5a001.jpeg',1972773,14,'45.55138952689832','-122.65732314381218',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,31,180,1,5.00,595962755524716138),(2556,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/595980252974395878','Private Room in a Peaceful Home','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful oasis. Beautiful view of the SW Portland hills from your bedroom in this updated 1962 ranch home in the Maplewood neighborhood. 1000 feet to Maplewood Coffee & Tea, 1 Mile to Multnomah Village business district. Ample off street parking with a security camera/ floodlight for peace of mind.','The Maplewood neighborhood is in Southwest Portland, west of SW 45th Ave. The neighborhood is connected by schools, walking, biking, greenspaces, hills, and creeks, including April Hill Park and its wetland boardwalk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/484c1400-3323-4a2d-88ec-15d874245134.jpg',14821108,75,'45.473419189453125','-122.73069763183594',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,5,60,11,5.00,595980252974395878),(2557,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/596241138749758390','Zen Escape: King Bed, Hot Tub, Private Yard','Delve into the unique allure of North Portland\'s Zen House—a unique dwelling with a relaxed ambiance. The main cabin offers two thoughtfully designed bedrooms, accompanied by a quaint Cobb house situated at the rear. Outside, indulge in the refreshing outdoor shower, unwind in the cedar hot tub, and enjoy a tranquil outdoor bath. The Zen garden, surrounded by bamboo, provides a peaceful retreat. This property stands out as an authentic gem, embodying the distinctive spirit of Portland.','5 Minute walk to Kenton, which is a very cute neighborhood and easy access to downtown via public transportation!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-596241138749758390/original/0d9b5134-5bc1-4740-afec-5226ad1cdfc3.jpeg',2195060,55,'45.58298','-122.69479',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,200.00,3,93,119,4.90,596241138749758390),(2558,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/596275878802657758','Modern, 2 bdr condo w/In unit gym, SW waterfront','Located on the willamette river, this modern 2 bedroom corner high rise condo w/ floor to ceiling windows is centrally located in Portlands beautiful South waterfront district. Enjoy a private gym with iFIT membership, spacious open concept living, 3 work spaces, and a fully equipped kitchen. <br /><br />Relax in the morning over looking the west hills,  Tillikum bridge, and OHSU tram with a cup of coffee made from your choice of Brevilles barista pro or drip coffee machines. <br /><br />5 min street car downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-596275878802657758/original/21b51c46-6ff7-41ab-81f3-a9f16e5c7849.jpeg',247551553,22,'45.49761','-122.66815',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,31,62,0,1.00,596275878802657758),(2559,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/596937331041495515','Upscale apartment with 91 walk score and laundry!','Explore the best of Portland! Only a short walk to the best restaurants, bars, boutiques and picturesque streets in Boise (Williams/Mississippi Ave), Alberta Arts and Irvington neighborhoods. <br /><br />Make yourself at home in a contemporary, thoughtfully designed open-concept space with comfy living room, fully-outfitted kitchen, and dining area. Sleep well on top-rated queen beds with high thread count sheets.','Located only steps from the Boise neighborhood’s popular Mississippi Ave and Williams Ave areas, and with the peace of mind and easy, stress-free parking of a quiet residential street. The vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood is a pleasant walk or quick drive away.  You are perfectly positioned to eat at some of Portland’s best restaurants and food carts, hang out at trendy bars, browse through eclectic boutiques, get a local beer at a nearby brewery, and stroll along beautiful, tree-lined streets; or if you want to stay in, take advantage of the fully-outfitted kitchen with two grocery stores just blocks away, or take-out that can be at your door in minutes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-596937331041495515/original/0c1bbba1-9e07-4d56-886c-912e4fae894d.jpeg',37422309,26,'45.54661','-122.66495',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,165.00,31,180,10,5.00,596937331041495515),(2560,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/597228897258705840','Cozy Williams District Guest Suite','Cozy, spacious basement optimally located close to Williams District, Mississippi & Irvington. Very walkable to some of the top restaurants, coffee shops and bars in the Portland area. Centrally located to many of Portland\'s hot neighborhoods and downtown.<br /><br />You have you own private keypad entrance at the side of the house which leads to the basement apartment with 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and a spacious living area / kitchen combo.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-597228897258705840/original/bb818c4d-2736-4ecd-97e2-df6005cc3639.jpeg',12269741,26,'45.54666','-122.66258',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,107.00,1,14,52,5.00,597228897258705840),(2561,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/598681847355970066','Cheerful and private 1-bedroom Woodstock home','Welcome! <br /> Casita is a brand new Airbnb centrally located near the Hawthorn district, Woodstock, Reed college. With one bedroom, a relaxation space, one bath and a spacious living room with a Queen futon, Casita can house up to four people. Keyless entry!<br /><br />Pets are allowed but we ask that pets not be left alone in Casita, nor outside for long periods of time. Three or more pets will be subject to an extra cleaning fee.','Located in the Woodstock Neighborhood','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-598681847355970066/original/6c86ca87-02aa-4acc-aa71-a1fc1ad71a44.jpeg',126914888,38,'45.48549','-122.60653',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,90.00,30,60,53,4.77,598681847355970066),(2562,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/599126587431788128','Comfy Getaway | No cleaning Fee | Private Fenced b','Comfy two bedroom home in convenient<br />location. Close to Airport, stores, restaurants,<br />freeways, and public transportations.\"','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-599126587431788128/original/8be755f9-247f-4778-8a73-06fdd12f2197.jpeg',395594834,63,'45.52278','-122.54312',1,5,1.00,1.00,3.00,245.00,30,1125,0,1.00,599126587431788128),(2563,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/599163505664898665','Wonderful Victorian Home Alberta/Mississippi','This centrally located and newly renovated private single family home sits in inner NE Portland, and is fully stocked with all of the amenities you would hope to have, the perfect place for your Portland stay! Steps away from Irving Park, bring your dog to the off leash area! As artists we\'re excited to curate the home with local art we love, and we have been 5 star Superhosts for over 10 years, loving what we do, and accommodating to all guests! You won’t be missing home while staying here!','The home is in inner NE Portland only steps away from historic Irving Park, which features a dog off leash area, multiple sports facilities, and nature walking paths. You’ll only be minutes away from popular and bustling Alberta Arts District, N. Williams and Mississippi Avenues which have a multitude of shops, grocery stores, bars, and some of the best restaurants in town!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-599163505664898665/original/c1602bf7-6497-4fe7-9d00-ca545e236a63.jpeg',24044328,7,'45.54808','-122.6584',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,31,180,8,5.00,599163505664898665),(2564,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/600657222777287734','Classic Condo w/ Charm & Parking in Alphabet Dist.','Off-Street Parking Included. If you are considering a 30-night stay, select 31 nights and the taxes will drop-off.  <br /> <br />This classic condo features Parisian Charm, a true Pied-à-terre. The sunlit cozy living room is anchored around a brick fireplace that is crowned by high ceilings and large windows. The kitchen’s coffered ceiling and crown molding throughout the condo give a feeling of luxury that comfort modern spaces lack. The fully equipped kitchen is pleasure to cook in.','The Neighborhood - Alphabet District<br /><br />Alphabet District’s Northwest 23rd Ave. is just two blocks from the condo and where you’ll find block after block of shops, boutiques, restaurants and bars. Just a bit farther west is Forest Park, the country’s largest urban forest at 5,200-acres, it boasts more than 80 miles of trails and forest roads for hiking, biking and running. And, if you love the water, the Willamette River can be enjoyed from nearby Tom McCall Waterfront Park - take the walking/biking path across the Steel Bridge to the swimming dock. So much to do within walking distance of the condo!<br /> <br />The neighborhood is a walker\'s delight. In addition to walking NW 23rd Ave.,  try walking east through the Pearl District to browse Powell\'s Books. The walk is perfect for spotting interesting cafes and restaurants and soak up the sun. Good luck leaving Powell’s Books without a new book, with such an amazing selection you’ll always leave with something.  <br /> <br />Gr','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NjAwNjU3MjIyNzc3Mjg3NzM0/original/ff53db15-32e8-42fe-8c82-0eb0e981a76b.jpeg',205079895,27,'45.53147','-122.69491',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,9,4.78,600657222777287734),(2565,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/600798276271356144','Lovely NE Portland 2 bedroom in Montavilla','Welcome to our bohemian inspired space in the NE Portland neighborhood of Montavilla. This 2 BR home is the upper unit of a 2 story duplex. The lower unit is also an Airbnb, where we or our guests may be staying. Entrances are separate and there is no shared air between units. Work from home with an electric sit / stand desk, Ergodriven anti-fatigue mat, and a Knoll Generation ergonomic chair.  We look forward to welcoming you to our PDX home.<br /><br />Please review house rules before booking.','Montavilla is a classic Portland neighborhood.  You will find 100-year-old craftsman homes nestled next to newly constructed townhouses.  This is a neighborhood where people work and live so you may hear a truck starting, a dog barking, or even the occasional friendly neighborhood rooster.  This house is located on a quieter avenue that is off a busier mixed residential/commercial street.  There is a dive bar, and a “lingerie modeling” business (Portland is well known for having many of these types of establishments) on the busier street that intersects ours. We’ve never had an issue with either establishment and can recommend the cold beer and tater tots at the dive bar. Guests of the upper unit may park 1 vehicle in the driveway and nearby street parking is usually plentiful. This location is convenient to shopping and has nearby access to the I-205 and I-84 freeways.  You can also take a 12 minute stroll to “The Yard” which is a nearby food cart pod, or Montavilla park which has an ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1d90e8bf-a8ca-4d1d-a01b-6edd1531ded5.jpg',217988597,10,'45.52805','-122.56941',1,4,1.00,2.00,1.00,113.00,30,365,10,5.00,600798276271356144),(2566,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/601370814317706176','Sunny & Bright 2-Bed Master Suite w/ Private Deck','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space- and stay cool with AC!<br /><br />The entire upstairs is yours, including a private bedroom with Queen bed, private bedroom with single bed, marble master bathroom with jetted tub, office space and large private deck- all with big windows, lots of natural light and views. Relax in the jetted tub, or enjoy a glass of wine or fresh cup of coffee on the deck.<br /><br />This Second story master suite is not ADA accessible. <br /><br />Host can speak fluent Mandarin.  我说中文','Lents Neighborhood is full of charm- from the local farmers market, a beautiful and expansive local park, and cute houses all around. Walkable and bike friendly-  consider a picnic at Lents Park or enjoy weekend dim sum at HK Cafe just blocks away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a1cd67d1-d40c-4640-add2-946db8394a9a.jpg',63872052,72,'45.4878','-122.57563',2,3,2.00,2.00,3.00,92.00,30,90,24,4.88,601370814317706176),(2567,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/602405826229282738','Room walk-in closet in spacious Mississippi Home','Bedroom right in the middle of Mississippi Ave neighborhood. Chill in living room or on the porch, if you can peel yourself away from the tons of great restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, & breweries nearby - Portland spirit!<br /><br />Public transit very close - both MAX & bus lines. About 10 min drive (and 20 min on bus) from Downtown hot spots like Powell\'s Books and Voodoo Donuts. Very close to other busy hangouts like N Williams Ave, Interstate, N Killingsworth and NE Alberta Street.','In the city that likes to “keep it weird,” Travel Portland has coined the phrase, \"You can, in Portland.\" North Portland is a prime example with delicious meals, tax-free shopping, one-of-a-kind bars and much more off the beaten path. Enjoy live music, tons of local shops, popular restaurants, breweries and great hang out spots on N. Mississippi Ave, one block from home. The many independent retailers of North Mississippi Avenue reflect Portland\'s eclectic tastes and DIY ethic. North Mississippi provides this vibrant neighborhood with ample watering holes and entertainment, one of the city\'s best concentrations of quality craft beers and brewpubs, and lots of yummy eateries.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2c518fa5-7451-49a1-bf96-694081744455.jpg',3220022,9,'45.55061','-122.67669',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,37.00,30,200,11,4.55,602405826229282738),(2568,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/602900041467654112','Bright & Stylish Home - Prime Irving Park Location','Comfort meets convenience with this bright, contemporary home in the quiet and coveted Irving / Sabin neighborhood a block from Irvington Park, 3 blocks from Whole Foods, 10 minutes in either direction to Alberta & Mississippi - and close access to downtown. High above the street with huge windows & vaulted ceilings, this spacious home features a large ensuite master with desk (king bed), additional bedrooms with desks (Queen + Full Beds).  + Brand new beds comfy!<br /><br />Message for longer stays.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b4e37766-22a2-4fe6-8f9e-a39bb68575eb.jpg',45684193,14,'45.54869','-122.65602',1,5,2.00,3.00,3.00,143.00,30,365,14,5.00,602900041467654112),(2569,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/602990319615833096','Heidi Haus | Walkscore of 92 + Bikescore 100','This two-level private loft is hidden in a mezzanine garden courtyard located in the heart of north Mississippi Avenue. The grounds feature a 3-story bamboo garden and walking access to countless top restaurants, boutiques, boutique stores, and public transport to greater PDX attractions.','The only similarity the Mississippi neighborhood shares with other districts is that it is uniquely Portland. In fact, trying to describe it would be like trying to verbalize a color, but let’s say that it has a little bit of that ‘special something’ that comes to mind when thinking of PDX… a Mardi Gras parade of high school bands accompanied by unicyclists with flame throwers (yep), the annual Mississippi Street Fair (~45,000 people), a thoroughfare for the world naked bike ride, notorious music venues, outdoor movies with fire pits, over 12 great bars, food cart pods and great dining. This street celebrates 5 nights out of the week.<br /><br />More information<br />I encourage you to explore EaterPDX for a better idea of the local attractions, but know that there are many other things on this street. In my mind, here are the best features the street has to offer, and they’re all within a block or two of this residence:<br /><br />Coffee/Cannabis<br />* Nectar - for those that indulge','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-602990319615833096/original/922c46c9-9486-463c-8987-cef27963e021.jpeg',14970082,24,'45.55498','-122.67623',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,183,105,4.97,602990319615833096),(2570,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/603075559269922598','Rare & lush 2 BR in heart of the city!','Fully furnished unit with lots of light,  blocks from the Willamette River in highly coveted John\'s Landing. Enjoy the terraced private yard backing up to forest space, with 25ft bamboo surrounding. Super central to everything you need in Portland, including OHSU and the tram, and easy freeway access as well.<br /><br />Upstairs bedroom has queen bed and also a built in desk/office space. Main bedroom has a full bed. Both bedrooms have private bathrooms w/ showers.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-603075559269922598/original/87a25752-4d0c-45d6-9734-27bd3842db53.jpeg',36297855,22,'45.48802','-122.67769',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,145.00,30,1125,49,4.96,603075559269922598),(2571,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/603162243177021900','Mid Century Modern Garden Oasis','Make yourself at home in this centrally located urban retreat. <br /><br />This 2 bedroom mid-century modern home is sunny (with huge picture windows), spacious (1200+ sq ft), and stylishly sits on a 1/2 acre lot, boasting flower gardens and a working organic farm. <br /><br />No need to lift a finger. You\'ll find everything you need for the most relaxing time away from home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-603162243177021900/original/a7dbe6dc-b09e-4ac5-b726-53343dce9c8e.jpeg',6215522,21,'45.55965','-122.60304',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,603162243177021900),(2572,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/603630561068645237','Private Botique Guest Suite In The Trees.','Enjoy the  million dollar PDX skyline view off your own private deck. Private upscale guest suite w separate entrance.  we are in the hills in nature. busy city life just down the hill.  This is a studio with a queen size bed, a beautiful kitchenette & a luxury bathroom. There are many stairs and a steep driveway to walk up. We have a couple units on site and live on the property. so there is potential for some noise. 2 friendly dogs onsite. we are pet friendly on a case by case basis. 1 dog max','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4863ea39-5d23-4965-a8f0-033b723852e1.jpg',90876848,77,'45.47091','-122.5408',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,99.00,28,365,16,4.88,603630561068645237),(2573,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/605902131279025050','Downtowns Portland\'s best kept secret.','Minimum 30 day rental.  Riverplace Condos have many amenities.  A short walk down a few steps to the Marina and local cuisine, yet you still have the privacy and security of being off the beaten path. Centrally located by the max and close to the OHSU Tram.   Spacious,  updated, and furnished, this 1 bedroom has a large patio and fireplace.  The condo also includes an updated kitchen and bathroom.  Secured parking garage/entry and elevator.  One parking spot included. WIFI included','South Waterfront Area, Above the Marina','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-605902131279025050/original/4b8fbfdd-d961-44d0-a29b-9324a46d9a00.jpeg',147096437,44,'45.5098','-122.6753',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,168.00,30,365,0,1.00,605902131279025050),(2574,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/606419833498564750','Spacious Forest Retreat w/ Hot Tub & Views','In the woods, next to a creek, but still in Portland! Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space.<br /><br />There is a private entrance to this large two story guest suite, which includes a family room, living area with dining area and kitchenette, bedroom and bathroom, central AC, and private balcony.<br /><br />Located in a quiet neighborhood, close to hiking trails in Woods Memorial Park. A 3-minute drive or 1 mile walk to popular Multnomah Village; 15 minutes from Downtown Portland.','Close to Multonomah Village and various bars, restaurants, and parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-606419833498564750/original/374a73ba-d39f-475e-9430-6a19ef9a8c6d.jpeg',2293902,34,'45.46484','-122.72748',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,70.00,2,10,183,4.93,606419833498564750),(2575,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/607369222838905613','Pearl District Art Loft: Urban Luxury with Parking','Enjoy true urban living in this art-filled industrial loft in the heart of Portland\'s ultra-chic Pearl District. <br /><br />This industrial loft on the 2nd floor of historic Irving Street Lofts boasts a 1763 sf open floor plan, 12-ft ceilings, live/work space, city-view windows, secure garage parking, and a stunning shared rooftop terrace.  Enjoy all that the Pearl has to offer: parks, restaurants, shops, galleries, and easy streetcar access to the whole city.<br /><br />Permitted for 30+ day stays only.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-607369222838905613/original/1d357ff8-8259-472e-b704-8f8db06c551e.jpeg',6690245,2,'45.52816','-122.68602',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,6,5.00,607369222838905613),(2576,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/607896545147923566','Happy Valley Home A+hot tub, Game Room, 8 beds!','INSTANT BOOKING ALWAYS. 8 person hot tub! Minutes away from Clackamas town center mall, 15 minutes to downtown and PDX airport! Spacious home with many kitchen amenities, new furniture — BBQ grill, a fun gaming room with pool table, air hockey, & table soccer! washer & dryer! Firepit, covered  patio with coffee table! Large flat screen TV in every room! 6 queen beds, 2 full & 1 baby crib. Huge private fenced yard. Comfortable spacious rooms, free wifi, hair dryers & easy smart lock check in!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7b6de914-a1fd-401a-81cf-455f13e19729.jpg',211556672,72,'45.4599818','-122.5702891',1,12,2.50,4.00,8.00,376.00,3,365,58,4.69,607896545147923566),(2577,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/608177009445182527','Guest House in the Heart of Nob Hill District','Quiet 2 story guest house is just steps away from NW 21st, great restaurants, shopping, public transit and Good Samaritan Hospital.  Can walk to Forest Park, Chinese Garden, Japanese Garden, Rose Garden, Washington Park and the Pearl District. <br />The main floor has a living room with a TV, dining table, sit-stand desk & monitor. Sunny upper level has a full kitchen, bath and sleeping area. <br />The guesthouse is secured behind a locked gate.  The street is generally pretty quiet.  Street parking only.','Nob Hill is a hip and active part of Portland.  There are many shops and restaurants to enjoy within walking distance.  The Pearl distract is only a few blocks east and is another great neighborhood to explore.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-608177009445182527/original/15031f5e-3512-454f-8416-333dabdf2aaf.jpeg',14438067,27,'45.52956','-122.69407',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,121.00,30,352,13,5.00,608177009445182527),(2578,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/608954805085707238','Hillsdale Spacious Comfy House','Close to Hillsdale shops, bus lines, 10 minute drive to Downtown Portland, 2 miles to Veterans and OHSU Hospitals. Walk to the Library - Bakery, Starbucks, ice cream store,  game store, over a dozen restaurants, food carts. You’ll love my place because of the location, the ambiance, the convenience and people. My house is good for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers. The living room has a Roku TV, a sofa and 2 reclining chairs.  Host lives in basement with separate entrance.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-608954805085707238/original/2b7d7de4-2b32-42af-be24-7e5486c1fb4f.jpeg',210378179,31,'45.47983800713817','-122.68917196349314',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,134.00,2,29,14,4.86,608954805085707238),(2579,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/609446006239624813','Classic 2nd Story Urban Oasis with Private Balcony','Welcome to The Murphy House, newly restored century-old home, in the heart of a vibrant and historic neighborhood.  <br />The living spaces are light-filled  with a balance between heritage and contemporary design.  <br />Bedrooms and TV room are adorned with thoughtful touches that evoke a sense of serenity, making it the perfect place to rest and rejuvenate. As dawn breaks, enjoy the sun\'s gentle embrace while sipping your morning coffee on the private balcony.','Discover Sullivan’s Gulch, a lively neighborhood in the heart of Portland. This historic area blends old-world charm and modern convenience for an unforgettable stay.<br /><br />Named after its challenging past as a gulch valley, the neighborhood now showcases a mix of Craftsman Bungalows, Old PDX, Victorian homes, and trendy condo conversions. Many homes boast hardwood floors and unique character, repurposed from historic buildings.<br /><br />With Loyd MAX station close by and downtown within easy reach, getting around is effortless.<br /><br />Foodies and shoppers will love exploring the nearby commercial hubs on Broadway and Weidler. The community also embraces alternative wellness, offering various holistic practitioners. Zama massage, Plumeria Nail & SPA, New Identity Nails are my favorites.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-609446006239624813/original/a958a392-86f5-4285-a59f-85c677c975eb.jpeg',13285949,4,'45.5331','-122.6428',1,6,1.00,2.00,4.00,117.00,2,28,57,4.93,609446006239624813),(2580,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/609519131963016645','Villa Montavilla - 1bd Guesthouse w Private Patio','Villa Montavilla is a comfortable, contemporary 1bd/1ba guest cottage in, you guessed it, Montavilla. This well appointed space is your home away from home with a full kitchen, in-unit laundry and private patio. Walk to restaurants, coffee and activities. Short ride to Providence Portland Medical Center, Adventist Health Portland, Portland’s Jade District, PCC Cascade Campus and PDX. Dog friendly (limit 2) with additional fee (sorry no cats).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-609519131963016645/original/e492553c-c184-498b-8422-e2938505cb6d.jpeg',158074447,10,'45.52116','-122.57585',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,31,365,10,4.90,609519131963016645),(2581,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/611170156873352062','Studio in Walkable Foodie Heaven','We\'re on a quiet side street – right around the corner from a dynamic gourmet restaurant scene in Kerns, the 5th coolest neighborhood in the world. Stroll to parks, live music, vintage shops, and a vintage movie theater. Walk, Lyft/Uber, bicycle, or use Portland’s amazing public transportation everywhere. Tall windows overlook greenery and a cozy front porch. Our family\'s 1900 house has been divided into separate apartments. Its like an artsy hotel room, but much more homey!','Its foodie heaven! This friendly neighborhood is known for its restaurants. Walk to a gourmet grocery store or a Whole Foods in 6 minutes. Walk less than 3 minutes to restaurants, ice cream, a brewery, food carts, and an amazing chocolate manufacturer.  Walk 3 to 12 minutes to still more restaurants, 2 wine stores, a park, vintage shops, live music venues The Goodfoot and Laurelthirst Public House, Laurelhurst Theater (beer and pizza served to you while you watch a movie), a pioneer cemetery, and a used record store.<br /><br />TimeOut rated our neighborhood, Kerns, the 5th Coolest Neighborhood in the World.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-611170156873352062/original/2780341e-d609-432a-832a-5daae2207a5d.jpeg',2996481,12,'45.52435','-122.6396',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,30,1125,263,4.97,611170156873352062),(2582,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/611468224506228628','New! No Pet Fees! Free Bikes!','Welcome to your cozy garden level apartment in the historic Mt Tabor Neighborhood, centrally located to popular Portland activities like shopping, gourmet dining, and entertainment. Included  amenities are free wifi, outdoor seating, is pet friendly with a comfortable queen bed, plus a sleeper sofa in the living room. We are 18 minutes to the Columbia River Gorge, 15 min to downtown Portland, and 1 ½ hours to Timberline ski lodge on Mt Hood or to the Oregon coast','From Columiba Redevelopment website: <br />\"Mount Tabor is actually a volcano. Don’t worry though, it’s extinct and completely safe!<br /><br />Mount Tabor itself is over 600 feet tall, providing incredible views of downtown Portland and beyond. The actual Mount Tabor neighborhood sits between Burnside and Division, from 49th to 76th Avenue.<br /><br />The crown jewel of the neighborhood is definitely Mount Tabor Park, with nearly 200 acres of tree-lined public space just a few miles from busy downtown Portland. The park includes:<br /><br />Three beautiful reservoirs that provide drinking water for much of the area<br />Plenty of tall trees, green grass, and picnic tables. The perfect place for spending a summer’s day.<br /><br />Miles of off-road running and walking trails. Frequent (and fun) races are held by a local non-profit with proceeds helping to maintain the park. Local Tip: If you’re looking for a lung-busting workout, jog or ride your bike to the top of Mt. Tabor starting o','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NjExNDY4MjI0NTA2MjI4NjI4/original/965111b9-ea26-4d27-ab9d-1ab2860a6fe8.jpeg',15940055,15,'45.5066','-122.60651',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,98.00,3,31,71,4.94,611468224506228628),(2583,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/612966287957061618','Mt Tabor Hygge - Comfort Surrounded in Nature','Located in the inner SE Portland neighborhood of Mt Tabor, this separate guesthouse studio invokes the Danish way to live well.  The hygge imbibes a mood of coziness and comfortable conviviality with feelings of wellness and contentment.<br /><br />My goal for your visit is to have each guest feeling calm, content, and comfortable during their stay.<br /><br />No cleaning fees or check-out chores.','The guesthouse is centrally located in the quiet and peaceful inner SE Mt Tabor neighborhood, with close proximity to the bustling Belmont and Hawthorne districts and the unique Montavilla neighborhood.<br /><br />If you are seeking nature - this is the perfect spot, with a less than a mile walk through beautiful tree-lined streets with historic houses to Mt Tabor park and about a mile and a half to Laurelhurst park.<br /><br />The immediate neighborhood is made up of primarily single-family residences with a few unique retail, dining, and shopping options.  Some of my favorite places to walk to include: the Bellwether Bar for a craft cocktail, Portland Nursery to view the expansive plant collection, Leikam Brewing for a delicious kosher brew on the patio by a fire, Coquine market for a creamy latte and pastry, BoneJax for eclectic vintage finds, Vino Veritas for a glass of Oregon wine, and of course Mt Tabor park for restoration in nature.<br /><br />There are two grocery stores in cl','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-612966287957061618/original/57a2a6ac-8130-4fac-a796-23429b95ebab.jpeg',8878148,15,'45.52146','-122.59924',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,3,16,93,5.00,612966287957061618),(2584,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613084418322731880','Studio C','We are so happy to share with you our tiny house project!  Sitting proudly at a mighty 200sqf come kick back and chill in this calm, yet stylish studio unit.  Conveniently situated in the heart of the Woodlawn/Concordia neighborhood with parks, eateries and pubs a few blocks down the way and only 10 minutes from PDX. So, whether you\'re vacationing or in town on business - we would love to have you stay with us in this cozy space!','Many of the names of Portland neighborhoods are significant. They can either refer to a founding member of the city’s elite, or have a connection to a historical aspect. In Concordia’s case, the neighborhood was named after this university, which was founded in 1905. <br /><br />Unfortunately, in 2020, the university decided to terminate classes permanently. While the structure is still up for sale, this news marked the end of a century-spanning area. The land reverted back to the Synod, and plans are still being developed for its future. <br /><br />Neighborhood Vibe<br />Edgy, fun, and creative, this area of Northeast Portland is seeing a resurgence  The homes come in many styles, and gentrification has hit this area with a mix of results.  Many homes have been revitalized and improved and this is a charming neighborhood with plenty of shopping, dining, and other amenities in the area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-613084418322731880/original/b464b531-cdfc-471b-bb34-bbfad174333a.jpeg',456011177,1,'45.57192','-122.64177',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,55.00,30,365,12,4.92,613084418322731880),(2585,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613325264407119295','New 2 Bedroom Condo Next To Irving Park','Two bedroom condo in NE Portland. Less than a mile away from Alberta and Mississippi Districts and just a few blocks from Williams Avenue. Enjoy next door Irving Park and take a beautiful walk or a bike ride around the historic Irvington Neighborhood. Close to local markets, shops and cafes.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-613325264407119295/original/b813a542-2e27-4173-9c22-a7b376b65546.jpeg',10610412,14,'45.54967','-122.65903',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,57,4.98,613325264407119295),(2586,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613604690767162952','Lovely 1 bed unit in sought after Hollywood','Luxury private apartment in this centrally-located home full of charm and amenities. Close to everything you could ask for. You won’t even need a car. Whole Foods, coffee shops, Trader Joe’s, 24 hr fitness, Target, Rite Aid Pharmacy, restaurants, the Max Line, busses, major arterials to the beach, Hood River, the ski slopes and mountains, and just a hop, skip and jump from the airport. This cozy retreat has everything you need to enjoy Portland and all it has to offer a guest.','This is one of the most walkable neighborhood locations you will find in Portland and with the Max Line and busses also within waking distance you can enjoy the city without a car including getting to and from the airport via the Max Line','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-613604690767162952/original/157d8b71-b432-474d-95ec-24bdf3cdf1a8.jpeg',191010968,11,'45.539608','-122.614708',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,29,365,32,4.84,613604690767162952),(2587,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613650619752848541','Classic 1917 Portland Home','You\'ll love staying in our comfortable, beautiful classic Portland home! You can walk to several restaurants and bars. It has easy access to downtown Portland by taking the bus, which is 1.5 blocks away or the MAX, which is a 12 minute walk for easy access all over the Portland/Vancouver area. Downtown Portland is a 10 minute drive. The Willamette Valley wine country is about an hour\'s drive away as well as the beautiful Columbia River Gorge and majestic Mt. Hood and Mt. St. Helens!','Wilbur House is located in the beautiful North Portland neighborhood of Overlook.   There are many restaurants and bars within walking distance as well as parks which some overlook the city of Portland. The house is located 3.5 blocks (7 min. walk) from Adidas corporate headquarters and a half mile from Daimler headquarters.  Access to the freeways are quick and close.  You can be on your way touring the Portland area in a jiffy!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-613650619752848541/original/4935513a-60b9-4261-82e9-800b5caf69b9.jpeg',77736302,13,'45.5645','-122.69412',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,154.00,3,27,83,4.99,613650619752848541),(2588,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613770853572112801','Charming 3 Br 2 Ba entire house w/ parking and gym','Come stay in this classic Portland style home in a quiet, family-friendly neighborhood! This property boasts parking space for 2 cars, 3 spacious bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a home gym, exercise bike, A/C, and in-unit laundry! Wander the charming and safe neighborhood, complete with tennis courts across the street, or make the quick 6-minute drive into incredible downtown Portland. Walking distance to Rose City coffee and the famous Botto’s BBQ!','Family friendly neighborhood situated right across from elementary school, dog park, and tennis courts','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/658a75e3-4a59-4327-b54c-bcf2955292a4.jpg',21665606,56,'45.49446','-122.64806',1,10,2.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,18,4.83,613770853572112801),(2589,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613792959738627888','Modern SE Portland Private Room, Self Check-In!','Newly built modern home, filled with plenty of space and convenient features to make your trip as comfortable as possible. I am central of Portland\'s southeast neighborhood which is filled with lots of charm and some of the town\'s best bars, restaurants, shops and more. This listing is for one of three rooms available for rent at this property.<br /><br />• 15 - 20 min from Downtown<br />• 10 - 15 min from Hawthorne Blvd.<br />• 10 - 15 min from Belmont St. <br />• 10 - 15 min from Mt. Tabor Park','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-613792959738627888/original/75b9163f-c5fc-4fc6-a212-ea085acac956.jpeg',260686384,65,'45.483272552490234','-122.60054779052734',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,42.00,1,30,53,5.00,613792959738627888),(2590,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613852331302199908','Spacious Home with King Beds, Roof Deck, Best Area','Stay  in the best area of Portland at the Chromatic Contemporary. Gather with friends or family in this spacious home on a quiet and safe street. Stunning views from the rooftop deck — perfect for morning coffee or evening cocktails. Enjoy restful nights on comfy king-size beds (4) or twin XLs (2) with luxe linens. Utilize the fully outfitted kitchen for gourmet meals or a quick bite. The dining area seats 10 for memorable meals or stimulating conversation. Your Portland adventure starts here!','Located only steps from the Boise neighborhood’s popular  Mississippi Ave and Williams Ave areas, and with the peace of mind and easy, stress-free parking of a quiet residential street. The vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood is a pleasant walk or quick drive away.<br /><br />You are perfectly positioned to eat at some of Portland’s best restaurants and food carts, hang out at trendy bars, browse through eclectic boutiques, get a local beer at a nearby brewery, and stroll along beautiful, tree-lined streets; or if you want to stay in, take advantage of the fully-outfitted kitchen with two grocery stores just blocks away, or take-out that can be at your door in minutes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NjEzODUyMzMxMzAyMTk5OTA4/original/5de1a78f-593d-4e27-a98f-8b4cfd2c20da.jpeg',37422309,26,'45.54674','-122.66301',1,10,2.50,5.00,6.00,273.00,2,25,121,4.99,613852331302199908),(2591,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/613891837460698696','Small bedroom walkable to 100+ food,drinks,coffee','Have fun in the food, drink, and outdoor activity paradise that is Portland! This stay is perfect for those working/studying remotely and exploring Portland! Centrally located in NE Portland, the house is a quick walk to hundreds of restaurants, bars and coffee shops on Alberta, Williams and Mississippi. It\'s also very close to a few bus lines. Perfect for exploring Portland and working/studying remotely! Monthly guests only.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48452803/original/2660ee2c-c6d1-412e-a9b4-5fa18ef62981.jpeg',33081979,14,'45.5539','-122.65943',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,33.00,30,365,5,4.60,613891837460698696),(2592,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/614461506383407967','Charming studio apartment with lots of character','Fully furnished basement apartment. Cozy, well-lit unit located in a newly renovated house in the quiet neighborhood of Roseway, NE Portland. Steps to bus stops and bike lanes, with lots of food stores, bars & restaurants within a few blocks. Central heat/air. Great for solo traveler or couple. 20 minute drive to downtown Portland (or ~40 minutes on a single bus line).<br /><br />Important: <br /><br />Booking price is for one guest. Extra guests pay $25/night.<br /><br />There\'s a cat in the house.','The basement apartment is located in an owner-occupied home. The house is a newly renovated free standing wood frame house in the sought-after, tree-lined neighborhood of Roseway in old Northeast Portland. Quiet residential setting two blocks away from bustling commercial area (Sandy Blvd). Minutes walk to grocery stores, food carts, shops and bus stops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-614461506383407967/original/6a1b0cf4-d0a8-4593-8f3c-d287a16da397.jpeg',7718259,39,'45.54442','-122.59324',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,82.00,7,200,15,5.00,614461506383407967),(2593,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/614610046466520787','Modern, Peaceful Apartment In Amazing Location!','Welcome to the City of Roses! Nestle into our modern, stylish ADU (with full kitchen!) in Portland’s incredibly walkable Creston - Kenilworth neighborhood! Quaint and cozy, this bright and happy space serves as the perfect urban retreat for couples, families, and groups of friends alike!  <br />*** <br />We\'re so excited for the opportunity to share a little piece of my home with you — your stay helps us achieve a longtime dream of owning a home, so thank you!','WELCOME TO PORTLAND! You are located in the Creston - Kenilworth neighborhood, a short 15 minute drive from downtown Portland. Less than 2 miles from Reed College.There are lots of bars and restaurants to explore within a 10-15 minute walk along Foster. Here are a few recommendations: <br /> <br />Carts on Foster on SE 52nd and Foster Road will give you the Portland food cart experience. <br /> <br />An Xuyen Bakery on 53rd and Foster has great Asian baked goods and banh mi. <br /> <br />Keeper Coffee Co. on SE 41st Ave and Holgate has great coffee and pastries. <br /> <br />Head downtown to visit iconic stops like Powell\'s bookstore, or rent a bike along the waterfront path. Other attractions near downtown include OMSI (Oregon Museum of Science and Industry), the Oregon Zoo, International Rose Test Garden, and Portland Japanese Garden.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-614610046466520787/original/7008156e-e923-4de1-ab6f-ccdb4193e36d.jpeg',453359527,67,'45.49219','-122.61141',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,80.00,30,30,50,4.76,614610046466520787),(2594,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/614617879754110110','Rose City Hideaway','Oasis for the traveler seeking culture, nightlife, music, food, and ease of access to the Oregon Convention Center, Moda Center, Kaiser and Legacy Hospitals, and Portland Expo Center. This tucked away space, with views of the public park with art installations, is located in the entertainment district. The Hideaway is the ideal landing pad for business and pleasure. After exploring, return to RCH for time in the swim spa, gym, outdoor kitchen, or relax by the gas fire pit to end your day!','Overlook is a charming and historic residential neighborhood located just 2.5 miles north of downtown Portland. We are tucked away, in a private park, with easy access to the freeway, and just a 7 minute walk to the trendy Mississippi Avenue., a short walk to Killingsworth St., Alberta St. and N Williams Ave. where you will find some of Portland\'s best restaurants, food carts, bars, music venues, and shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/83186935-b9a5-4fdb-960d-8c7c806d2068.jpg',456375182,13,'45.55721','-122.68286',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,121.00,2,90,91,4.96,614617879754110110),(2595,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/616012706973411711','This is Downtown Portland. 14th floor 2 BDR/2 Bath','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.<br />The  Condominium is located in the south end of beautiful downtown Portland, Oregon. One block away from the Portland Streetcar, along with adjacent tree-lined walking paths that can take you to dining, theater and shopping, you can\'t beat the location! <br />Some of the best amenities you will find in all of downtown Portland including indoor/outdoor pools (seasonal), outstanding parking facilities, 24 hour security and  exercise rooms.','The Condominium is located in a residential business area in the south end of beautiful downtown Portland, Oregon. One block away from the Portland Streetcar, along with adjacent tree-lined walking paths that can take you to dining, theater and shopping, you can\'t beat the location!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-616012706973411711/original/4e4c9da6-7550-497f-b95e-580696adfb9b.jpeg',130776600,44,'45.50772','-122.6803',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,92.00,30,180,3,4.67,616012706973411711),(2596,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/616076192948187513','Lovely one bedroom with instant access to OHSU!','A one bedroom modern apartment set among the trees at the doorstep of the medical campus on Marquam Hill. Forward architecture, contemporary interiors, a rooftop retreat, Momiji Sushi on ground floor, park-like surroundings and trails – all with instant access to OHSU and just minutes to the South Waterfront and downtown Portland, Oregon.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-616076192948187513/original/e045b5df-8479-4908-acb7-260294193df8.jpeg',532092702,30,'45.49739','-122.68795',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,31,365,1,5.00,616076192948187513),(2597,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/616602031996803343','Wonderful New Construction, Walk to Everything','This incredible townhome sits in the heart of Portland. The brand new construction combined with the fantastic décor boasting Swedish vibes provides the perfect blend of style and comfort.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-616602031996803343/original/dc2d3525-9a76-457f-a2ec-ba6524880d3b.jpeg',62261998,24,'45.555','-122.66897',1,6,2.50,3.00,4.00,233.00,3,29,53,4.83,616602031996803343),(2598,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/617981059317605637','‘The Owl’s Nest’ w/ Hot Tub & Forest Views!','Your next Oregon getaway awaits with a stay at this charming 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom vacation rental home in Portland. This home is nestled on 5 acres and boasts beautiful forest views, multiple outdoor dining areas, a fully equipped kitchen, and a fireplace to cozy up next to on cooler days. Venture out to explore downtown Portland, hike at Powell Butte Nature Park, ski at Mt. Hood in the winter, or take a day trip to explore Astoria. Head back home to take a relaxing dip in the private hot tub!','PORTLAND (~11 miles): OMSI Planetarium, Portland Art Museum, Alberta Street, Portland Japanese Garden, Oregon Zoo, Pittock Mansion, Moda Center, Powell’s City of Books <br />HIT THE SLOPES: Mt. Hood SkiBowl (45.5 miles), Timberline Lodge and Ski Area (52.6 miles), Mt. Hood Meadows (57.5 miles), Cooper Spur Ski Area (69.5 miles) <br />HIKING/TRAILS: Leach Botanical Garden (0.3 miles), Kelly Butte Natural Area (4.3 miles), Scouters Mountain Nature Park (4.3 miles), Powell Butte Nature Park (4.7 miles), Spring Water Bike Trail (4.8 miles), Mount Talbert Nature Park (5.6 miles), Tyron Creek State Natural Area (11.9 miles) <br />BREWERIES & COFFEE SHOPS: Refuge Coffee House (2.1 miles), Zoiglhaus Brewing Company (2.2 miles), Henry Higgins Boiled Bagel (3.6 miles), Black Rock Coffee Bar (3.7 miles), Assembly Brewing (3.9 miles), Von Ebert Brewing Glendoveer (5.1 miles), Jazzy Bagels (7.2 miles), The Hoppy Brewer (7.3 miles), Cafe Delirium (7.3 miles), Pioneer Coffee (8.1 miles) <br />DAY TRI','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-617981059317605637/original/448d0921-2dff-4f8d-bffb-fab19c39da90.jpeg',121688409,77,'45.472177388351014','-122.54014051998846',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,173.00,2,1125,72,4.96,617981059317605637),(2599,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/618751961512273622','Entire Guest Suite with Private Entrance.','Separate entrance to this three room basement unit. Includes kitchenette and microwave.','Prime location in Sabin, which is in inner NE Portland within walking distance to the Alberta Arts district, Mississipi bars and restaurants, and Irvington/Fremont Street shops, including Whole Foods and Starbucks and city bike rentals. Many excellent restaurants within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-618751961512273622/original/c9438412-2c7f-4a9c-b23f-5d556709b4ce.jpeg',390757744,14,'45.554653','-122.654266',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,56.00,1,7,123,4.75,618751961512273622),(2600,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/618932044225125014','Escape to the Roseway Retreat','Perfectly situated in Roseway. Our beautiful, light filled guest wing is perfect for your next peaceful retreat. Our guest suite has everything you need, whether you\'re working here or using our space as your home base to enjoy our vibrant city.','Roseway is a quiet, lovely neighborhood in Northeast Portland. With easy highway access, we\'re 8 minutes to the Airport, 10 minutes to downtown, and a quick walk to public transit.<br /><br />We\'re within a five minute drive of the beautiful Beaumont-Wiltshire district and ten minutes to the Alberta Arts district and Mount Tabor. We\'re in a great location to visit all of Portland\'s favorites!<br /><br />We\'re blocks away from parks and grocery stores and great neighborhood eateries. In the morning hit up Fairley\'s Pharmacy for coffee (or a malt), Annie\'s Doughnuts,  Rose City Grill, or Cameo Cafe Or hit one of our local food carts: Rose City Food Carts or Barley Pod. For other meals check out: Me Kah Noodles, Pizzaria Otto, Second Profession Brewing,  Namaste Indian Cafe, Seasoned or Exotic African Cuisine.<br /><br />Pop over to Sandy for a plethora of other interesting spots. Beyond grocery stores, pharmacies, and eateries, there\'s The Grotto for a contemplative retreat. If you\'re a ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-618932044225125014/original/121ee5d7-bce6-4e68-8a26-e198eb86f57f.jpeg',115728998,39,'45.550858','-122.586082',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,2,180,98,4.94,618932044225125014),(2601,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/619011420802106785','Brand New Alberta Arts District Gem','This brand new Airbnb is in the heart of the Alberta Arts District, you really can\'t beat the location! The space is located just a block from a stretch of restaurants on NE Killingsworth, two blocks from all of the restaurants and shops on NE Alberta, and a five minute walk to beautiful Alberta Park. This unit is equipped with a toaster oven, hot plate, full size fridge, and dishwasher. Please note this is the lower unit of our home so you will likely hear day to day noises between 6am and 7pm.','The Alberta Arts District is a lively neighborhood with countless restaurants, coffee shops, breweries, and shops. The Airbnb is within a block of a coffee shop and Thai, pizza, vegan, and BBQ restaurants and a short walk to many fun options to explore.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-619011420802106785/original/fab8facd-c49e-4c26-b01c-9844dd52250b.jpeg',182289060,29,'45.56235','-122.6489',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,1.00,2,365,109,4.91,619011420802106785),(2602,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/619057143342997125','Tiny Farmhouse - Walk to Local Shops & Restaurants','Are you thinking about downsizing? Do you watch Tiny House Nation every week? Nestled in the heart of Southeast Portland, this beautiful wooded tiny house puts everything within walking distance. They say great things come in small packages, and that rings true here with everything you need for your stay. One visit, and you\'ll be inspired to embrace the Tiny Life!','Our charming home is nestled in the idyllic Division/Clinton district, also known as the Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood on local maps. Just four blocks away lies the historic Ladd\'s Addition, known for its beautiful rose gardens and unique diagonal street layout. While our home is situated on a bustling street, walking one block north will bring you to a serene residential area.<br /><br />You\'ll be steps away from some of Portland\'s finest restaurants, eclectic shopping, and convenient grocery stores, all within easy walking distance. Enjoy the vibrant local culture with nearby cafes, boutiques, and farmers\' markets. The area is also well-served by public transit, making it easy to explore other parts of the city. Whether you\'re looking for a quiet stroll through tree-lined streets or an evening out at a trendy eatery, our neighborhood offers the perfect blend of urban excitement and residential tranquility.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-619057143342997125/original/5bc83a78-c5ce-420d-971c-58ee20764090.jpeg',273076012,25,'45.4984','-122.6404',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,66.00,1,365,214,4.83,619057143342997125),(2603,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/619059335522670748','Tiny Aztec - Walk to Local Shops & Restaurants','Are you thinking about downsizing? Do you watch Tiny House Nation every week? Nestled in the heart of Southeast Portland, this beautiful wooded tiny house puts everything within walking distance. They say great things come in small packages, and that rings true here with everything you need for your stay. One visit, and you\'ll be inspired to embrace the Tiny Life!','Our charming home is nestled in the idyllic Division/Clinton district, also known as the Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood on local maps. Just four blocks away lies the historic Ladd\'s Addition, known for its beautiful rose gardens and unique diagonal street layout. While our home is situated on a bustling street, walking one block north will bring you to a serene residential area.<br /><br />You\'ll be steps away from some of Portland\'s finest restaurants, eclectic shopping, and convenient grocery stores, all within easy walking distance. Enjoy the vibrant local culture with nearby cafes, boutiques, and farmers\' markets. The area is also well-served by public transit, making it easy to explore other parts of the city. Whether you\'re looking for a quiet stroll through tree-lined streets or an evening out at a trendy eatery, our neighborhood offers the perfect blend of urban excitement and residential tranquility.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-619059335522670748/original/1acd1664-2606-4304-9913-6276854ec482.jpeg',273076012,25,'45.49897','-122.64235',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,66.00,1,365,241,4.85,619059335522670748),(2604,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/619489034971227611','SE City Spa Retreat','Get ready for relaxation. This quiet and soothing getaway is a stand alone, fully equipped one bedroom, set behind our house offering privacy with a ton of charm. Enjoy our hot tub and fire pit on your very own patio. We\'ve outfitted the space in Portland Boho Chic style to delight your senses while embracing you in comfort.','Our neighborhood is quiet and your space is set back from the road. Yet you are close to many things and certainly a short drive to many of the main centers. The City Spa is right down the road from The Mercado a famous Latin American inspired food cart pod. Please refer to the welcome book for many more close by options.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/49115a68-82df-46e9-afe7-4fdb9306d40b.jpg',2367709,69,'45.47329','-122.59215',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,64.00,1,1125,129,4.88,619489034971227611),(2605,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/619788038237443752','✶ Dreamy Round-Bed Room at Amorcito de Jenny ✶','This beautiful bedroom is so fun and unique!<br />Room 1 of 5 in the home. Make a new friend by inviting another guest to one of the walkable neighborhood restaurant/bars.<br /><br />Our stylish home in FOPO has an open kitchen fully equipped with all of your cooking needs. With appliances such as air fryer, toaster, waffle maker, coffee maker, etc. you should have no trouble whipping up any meal you crave!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/321c5d7e-a1da-4e4c-989d-7fbf57e9c781.jpg',58415337,65,'45.48936','-122.59878',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,80.00,3,28,43,4.91,619788038237443752),(2606,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/619795601428053735','New! Eco-Friendly Garden Suite - With Chickens!','This newly renovated 900 sq ft basement suite is equipped with a king sized bed, living room, full bath, kitchenette, laundry, and an outdoor patio. You\'ll likely see chickens running around in the garden which is full of PNW native and edible plants. <br /><br />The area: Quiet and safe. Walk to food carts, Max line (train), grocery, Peninsula Park (PDX\'s original rose garden), Mississippi Avenue, and more. <br /><br />The owner lives on the top floor, but your space & entrance are separate and private from hers.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-619795601428053735/original/12eccb59-8f5f-43b1-b441-a23a9ff60b9e.jpeg',22546228,48,'45.5742','-122.67128',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,2,365,19,4.89,619795601428053735),(2607,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/620067234229371726','Adorable quiet Eco-cottage with a view','Adorable eco friendly tiny cottage on a mini estate with private parking and washer.   An amazing view of the city from your own porch, and high speed internet are perks as well as just feeling like you are close to everything, but away from the chaos.  We are only a few minutes to Trader joes and other stores as well.  The backyard is a forest, and the front yard is a view of Portland from your own private patio!  This place is not available very often, and most people want to stay!','We are up on Mt. Scott.  The neighborhood that we are in is quiet and safe.  We are up on a hill down a very private road and we feel very safe here.  Many people have commented that our place feels like you are away from it all, since we are surrounded by forest and we have an amazing view of Mt Tabor and the entire city up on Mt. Scott.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-620067234229371726/original/88577130-0ea4-4202-8a2c-f4035151a970.jpeg',5192007,72,'45.46066','-122.5637',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,350,2,5.00,620067234229371726),(2608,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/620292983138025643','The Câlin Suite ~ Posh Local Boutiques & Eateries','Situated in the bustling and vibrant neighborhood of Slabtown in NW Portland, this conveniently located home puts you just steps away from the best restaurants, bars, and shops the city has to offer. With so much to do in this trendy and exciting area, you\'ll want to extend your trip just to fully explore all that the neighborhood has to offer. Whether you\'re a foodie, a shopaholic, or simply looking to experience the best of Portland\'s nightlife, this is the perfect location for you.','Nestled in the heart of NW Portland, our location offers an eclectic mix of historic charm and modern convenience, making it the perfect base for your stay in the city.<br /><br />Northwest 23rd Avenue is a food lover\'s paradise, lined with a diverse array of restaurants, cafes, and bakeries that cater to every palate. From gourmet dining to cozy coffee shops, you\'ll find something to suit your taste. Don\'t miss out on iconic spots like Salt & Straw for artisanal ice cream or Papa Haydn for delectable desserts.<br /><br />The neighborhood is also a shopping haven, featuring a blend of unique boutiques, vintage shops, and well-known retailers. Spend your days browsing through local stores for one-of-a-kind finds, trendy fashion, and handcrafted goods. The tree-lined streets add to the delightful shopping experience, inviting you to explore at a leisurely pace.<br /><br />When the sun sets, Northwest 23rd Avenue comes alive with a vibrant nightlife. Enjoy a variety of bars, pubs, and liv','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-620292983138025643/original/97f2c77c-8ebb-441e-b562-6593975f4894.jpeg',33154064,27,'45.53371','-122.69935',1,6,1.00,3.00,4.00,176.00,2,365,113,4.81,620292983138025643),(2609,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/620313859717603008','The Câlin & Magnifique Suite ~ NW 23rd Wonder','Situated in the bustling and vibrant neighborhood of Slabtown in NW Portland, this conveniently located home puts you just steps away from the best restaurants, bars, and shops the city has to offer. With so much to do in this trendy and exciting area, you\'ll want to extend your trip just to fully explore all that the neighborhood has to offer. Whether you\'re a foodie, a shopaholic, or simply looking to experience the best of Portland\'s nightlife, this is the perfect location for you.','Nestled in the heart of NW Portland, our location offers an eclectic mix of historic charm and modern convenience, making it the perfect base for your stay in the city.<br /><br />Northwest 23rd Avenue is a food lover\'s paradise, lined with a diverse array of restaurants, cafes, and bakeries that cater to every palate. From gourmet dining to cozy coffee shops, you\'ll find something to suit your taste. Don\'t miss out on iconic spots like Salt & Straw for artisanal ice cream or Papa Haydn for delectable desserts.<br /><br />The neighborhood is also a shopping haven, featuring a blend of unique boutiques, vintage shops, and well-known retailers. Spend your days browsing through local stores for one-of-a-kind finds, trendy fashion, and handcrafted goods. The tree-lined streets add to the delightful shopping experience, inviting you to explore at a leisurely pace.<br /><br />When the sun sets, Northwest 23rd Avenue comes alive with a vibrant nightlife. Enjoy a variety of bars, pubs, and liv','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-620313859717603008/original/e0b98126-6e3b-487e-8db2-ee858aecd1d4.jpeg',33154064,27,'45.53378','-122.69886',1,12,2.00,6.00,8.00,433.00,2,365,38,4.84,620313859717603008),(2610,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/620397134602973513','New, Charming & Cozy ~ 5* Location ~ King & Queens','Welcome to a nice comfy home, our place is great for couples, solo adventures, travel nursing and business travelers. <br /><br />Enjoy a large backyard with beautiful greenery, private parking spot for 2 cars or more. We have washer & dryer inside home, cooking supplies, towels, high speed wi-fi, smart tv in all rooms and keyless entry.','This is a very quiet area and the Neighbor are very nice and respectful. There\'s coffee shop, bars, places to see and stuff to do.<br /><br />*We are 15 min by car to the airport and 15 min to downtown portland. We have a great place for hiking, mountain falls, museum and beautiful parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-620397134602973513/original/359044e5-64b5-478b-9944-b8852f92c311.jpeg',339880364,78,'45.48473','-122.54841',1,4,1.50,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,120,0,1.00,620397134602973513),(2611,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/620909105659221928','Comfy 2BR Suite In Amazing Mount Tabor Location!','Welcome to the City of Roses! Nestle into an adorable & freshly furnished 2 bedroom guest suite in the incredibly walkable Mount Tabor Neighborhood. <br /> <br />*** <br />I\'m so excited for the opportunity to share a little piece of my home with you. Your stay helps me achieve a longtime dream of homeownership through hosting & sharing my love of travel, so thank you!','WELCOME TO PORTLAND! With the city slogan of \"Keep Portland Weird,\" there is not a lack of unique things to explore in this very walkable city. Head downtown to visit iconic stops like Voodoo Doughnuts, Powell bookstore (among other small bookstores), the Portland Japanese Garden, or rent a bike along the waterfront path.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-620909105659221928/original/93f9a2d3-4fb2-4e12-8efa-de0a8b14bf84.jpeg',457168395,15,'45.51397','-122.60943',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,65.00,3,45,72,4.75,620909105659221928),(2612,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/620998257751566526','MODERN masterpiece in Portland! Dwell magazine','The whole group will be comfortable in this spacious and unique space. 2 bedrooms with 2 full baths,  corner unit with floor to ceiling windows.  Clean lines high above the street.  PENTHOUSE level high end finishes and gas appliances.   Huge island perfect for entertaining.','Close to N. Mississippi and other hot North Portland neighborhoods.  3 blocks to The Satellite tavern sports bar. 6 minute drive to downtown Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-620998257751566526/original/9b855b13-394b-452a-b613-b8b39b802c49.jpeg',18210091,13,'45.557716369628906','-122.68079376220703',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,149.00,30,1125,5,5.00,620998257751566526),(2613,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/621902800651198177','The Lanthorn House: Family Oasis in Central PDX','Stay in central Portland just minutes walk, bike ride, or drive from anything you could desire.  Our 1892 Victorian home and its surrounding neighborhood personify the classic Portland charm that you’ll love, whether you decide to spend a cozy afternoon in or venture out to explore.  With just the right balance of vintage character and modern touches of comfort, our home will provide for a fun and unique visit.<br /><br />Due to a few recent bad guests, we now require guests to message us before booking.','Centrally located on a quiet street walking distance from groceries, restaurants, parks, shopping, library, and community center.  Many historic homes and all the local flora make for pleasant walks or bike rides to wherever you’d like.  All the classic Portland charm you could hope for!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-621902800651198177/original/877938ca-5d80-477a-aaee-bd46f4e9590d.jpeg',457970492,26,'45.54311','-122.66451',1,5,3.00,2.00,4.00,138.00,2,60,31,4.77,621902800651198177),(2614,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/622055279108459593','Cozy Cottage in the heart of Clinton Division','Enjoy our cozy and comfortable home that\'s walkable to nearly everything in one of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhoods. Keep it simple at this charming and centrally-located place whether you\'re looking to relax, work from home, or just looking for a nice getaway.','The Clinton Division neighborhood is known for its charm and walkability.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NjIyMDU1Mjc5MTA4NDU5NTkz/original/02ab8567-95f8-4118-ad1b-d5f5b4161008.jpeg',94891193,25,'45.50251945096342','-122.64215555464332',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,3,60,23,5.00,622055279108459593),(2615,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/622446287862862243','Downstairs 1BR in historic Victorian with fire pit','Downstairs 1BR in a Victorian duplex. Located in the quiet Brooklyn neighborhood, but just a short walk to Sellwood and Clinton. You\'ll enjoy a patio and fire pit surrounded by trees, fully stocked kitchen, and laundry in house. Close to the MAX train, street car, and busses. Easy access to the East Bank Esplanade for biking. Near Highways 26, 99E, and I-5 for driving commutes. Storage options if you\'re hauling any large gear.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-622446287862862243/original/38ab4230-6537-4ceb-9807-9a2333f33ceb.jpeg',458090816,25,'45.50156','-122.65985',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,30,365,2,4.50,622446287862862243),(2616,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/622498954503960798','Family-friendly Portland Hills home with kids toys','Our family-friendly environment is ready for families with infants and toddlers, team retreats, and gatherings of every kind. Located in Portland\'s NW hills (the safest part of Portland), you\'ll fall in love with the views and serenity. Nike and Intel campuses, Forest Park trails, and Portland\'s best bike roads are all here. And the city is only 8 miles away!<br /><br />Our centerpiece is our common room - covered with books, board games, and a yoga-friendly deck.','We are in a residential neighborhood surrounded by beautiful hiking trails and bike routes. Naturally, most of our neighbors are very active cyclists, trail runners, and hikers who love their peace and quiet. If you want a quiet stay just outside the city, welcome to the woods! If you\'re looking for a party, this isn\'t your cup of tea.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-622498954503960798/original/8267f1cc-ea2b-4338-bc29-f00d2979084d.jpeg',7869789,81,'45.55201','-122.77666',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,220.00,2,90,5,5.00,622498954503960798),(2617,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/622758599369718630','Comfy Home Base on 1/2 acre in SW Portland','This is a practical home in SW Portland set up for families and with plenty of space to play inside and out. <br /><br />The home is set on 1/2 an acre with plenty of space to relax or play. Backyard has a play structure, slackline, and plenty of toys for kids. <br /><br />The comfy living room includes a desk and workspace setup. <br /><br />Walkable to Multnomah Village and Hillsdale, on bus lines, and 10 - 15 minutes to Downtown Portland and OHSU.','Conveniently located close to shops and dining in both Multnomah Village and Hillsdale. Very walkable and accessible by bus. With Gabriel Park just down the street, there\'s playground and forested trails just around the corner!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-622758599369718630/original/164b65ab-b7e4-42ac-9b9d-2aac17a9e04f.jpeg',78966103,17,'45.47661','-122.7146',1,6,2.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,36,0,1.00,622758599369718630),(2618,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623109568187912159','Lovely and Serene 2 Bedroom Pearl District Condo','Everything you could desire - location, amenities (Concierge), space, serenity, convenience, comfort, and style! Condo is new with high end appliances,  1GB wifi,  both bedrooms have on-suite bathrooms (one with a shower and one with a tub and shower, an additional bathroom for guests, a fully appointed kitchen, full size front-loader washer/ dryer, amazing gym, 5th floor outdoor garden, private balcony with BBQ grill, community work spaces,  stunning views, easy access to all things PDX','Portland\'s Pearl District is the fashionable and lively home to galleries, cultural institutions, shops, and eateries. Close to everything PDX has to offer (Powell\'s Books, Forest Park, Willamette River / Bike Paths, PDX Streetcar, Portland Zoo, Pittock Mansion, Rose Garden, Waterfront Park, downtown, sporting events...it\'s all steps away with a walking score of 94 and a bike score of 98!<br /><br />This safe, serene neighborhood is an oasis with proximity.  This is Portland\'s international destination.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fabefcf6-419a-4336-bc16-72c9d15abb16.jpg',22576469,2,'45.53259','-122.68295',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,365,1,5.00,623109568187912159),(2619,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623129553475381123','Recently Upgraded 1BR Apt – Downtown Location','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city near by<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates of what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland street car, A variety of bars/night life, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-623129553475381123/original/d0d5944e-8a63-44df-87ed-e5b9ef34a0e9.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53102','-122.68192',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,1,14,3,5.00,623129553475381123),(2620,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623146910332095873','Private Onsite Casita - walk to Everything!','Start your day off with coffee in the casita, walk over to La Bonita for a delicious lunch, and then head on over to Peninsula Park to experience the famous Portland roses! Finish off your day with a whiskey at The Old Gold before heading back to snuggle into our cottage, or sit out for a bit longer on the patio and listen to the world settle down for the evening <br /> <br />We’re so excited to share a small piece of our home with you — your stay helps us host and share our love of travel, so thank you!','Welcome to the city of Roses!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-623146910332095873/original/a289fb67-d9a3-4693-b363-2f59f0afb0a9.jpeg',456959973,13,'45.56525','-122.69686',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,3,30,84,4.87,623146910332095873),(2621,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623396095685323045','Lovely quiet home near N. Mississippi','Sleeps up to 5 people ( 2 queen beds and 1 twin). 1 bedroom and full bath on main floor plus a finished basement with 2 beds (1 queen and 1 twin). Easy walk/bike to N. Mississippi Ave. Large kitchen, comfortable furniture, and a beautiful back porch for lounging around in the summer sunshine! Unwind from your day by taking a walk around my gorgeous neighborhood, wide tree lined streets. Gorgeous Overlook Park is a few blocks away. MAX train stop is next to the park.','Beautiful and quiet tree lined street in the Overlook neighborhood. Please observe the quiet hours from 10pm-9am as my neighbors are very quiet and one works nights so he sleeps during the days. This is an ideal property for people seeking a relaxed, quiet, and peaceful stay!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-623396095685323045/original/1bc6867d-1ffd-472b-9e0f-ece1aee5ec1a.jpeg',131228804,13,'45.55138501839693','-122.68301677186862',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,135.00,2,15,37,5.00,623396095685323045),(2622,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623449445769546170','Basement Prime location walk to restaurants & tran','Welcome! My house is located in the historical neighborhood of Irvington. It is a very peaceful and safe neighborhood. It is very convenient to get to downtown Portland or the Oregon Convention Center.<br /><br />Below are the commute time/options: <br />-10 minutes walk to MAX light rail and buses<br />-10 minutes Uber to downtown Portland<br />-20 minutes walk/5 minutes Uber to Oregon Convention Center <br />-20 minutes Uber to the airport <br />-Walking distance to coffee shops, restaurants, bars, grocery stores','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-623449445769546170/original/9d760ca3-bbde-461c-8b09-576c12c2c0bc.jpeg',33081979,7,'45.53939','-122.65538',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,60.00,1,90,207,4.73,623449445769546170),(2623,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623578798384222992','*Sweet Sunshine Suite*- artistic & cozy & colorful','*Sweet Sunshine Suite* was created with the intention of making every square inch colorful, artistic, and whimsical. It was a true labor of love. The building process was filled with creative collaboration, spontaneous tweaks, and lots of laughter and joy. I love to create space, and after closing my business, Caravan- The Tiny House Hotel on Alberta St, I decided to turn my home property into an artistic and colorful oasis for guests to enjoy. Welcome to Cully Corner!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-623578798384222992/original/d566ed8e-2ede-4c2e-a2a5-8d2c2dff859c.jpeg',199501890,21,'45.55014','-122.60174',1,4,1.00,0.00,2.00,57.00,30,120,67,4.96,623578798384222992),(2624,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/623832582131923477','Laurelhurst Guest Suite Studio','Nestled in a vibrant, beautiful neighborhood, this travelers guest suite provides easy access to public transportation, groceries, parks and more ensuring you can make the most of your time exploring Portland.  Ideal for solo travelers or couples seeking affordable convenience. Private entrance, comfy full-size bed, bathroom, and an equipped kitchenette.  10 mins to downtown and the airport!  Stroll to transit and Hollywood district. <br /><br />**Please note: Property/Yard is shared with main house**','In the Laurelhurst neighborhood, but just across the way from Hollywood, there is lots to do and see in the area. The listing itself is apart of a lovely 1938 home in the heart of very much a neighborhood with sidewalks and bike paths.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-623832582131923477/original/386f21be-3c20-41b8-90c2-35e64fbb2f95.jpeg',221421926,23,'45.53124','-122.61963',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,69.00,1,90,41,4.66,623832582131923477),(2625,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/624053992012208991','Queen Bright  in historic neighborhood walk to MAX','I\'m glad you are looking at this listing because Portland is a city that brings joy. You are bound to love at least one of the great things it offers: cuisine, wine, beer, coffee, pastry, hiking, skiing, biking, paddle boarding, roses, friendly dogs and nice people. My home is located in the historic Irvington neighborhood where oak and fir tress line the streets and roses bloom in front yards. The house is within 10 minutes of walking the MAX train to downtown or the airport.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-624053992012208991/original/1f7618b1-458a-4705-a704-d6bce4969246.jpeg',33081979,7,'45.53906','-122.65548',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,35.00,30,160,7,5.00,624053992012208991),(2626,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/624067517826295928','King Prime location walk to foods,drinks','I\'m glad you are here because Portland is a city that brings joy. You are bound to love the many great things it offers: cuisine, wine, beer, coffee, pastry, hiking, skiing, biking, paddle boarding, roses, friendly dogs and nice people. This house is in a quiet, safe residential neighborhood 10 minutes away from downtown and it will be a perfect launching pad for you to explore Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-624067517826295928/original/ff7d2fec-7cf9-42a9-a7da-c1ad79b7c3ea.jpeg',33081979,7,'45.54074','-122.65524',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,31.00,1,365,219,4.74,624067517826295928),(2627,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/624789690871795521','Entire House in Foster-Powell','This stylish house is both a cozy neighborhood bungalow and a fresh destination for bars and restaurants.  It\'s all the fun Portland has to offer, with a quiet, comfortable, and private stay.','There are a wealth of fresh spots to eat and drink. Portland Mercado has been a place to find excellent chorizo to chile-coated sweets, an always-changing food cart scene, and freshly roasted Sandino coffee.  Pizza is a thing in Foster-Powell, with no fewer than five newcomers since 2019. The best and only Neapolitan pie can be found at Pizzeria Otto.  5 & Dime offers stellar, affordable cocktails and weekend DJ sets. Should you go a bit overboard, Rose VL, a sister to legendary Vietnamese noodle shop Hà VL, serves up the best brunch hangover bowl in the neighborhood, its turmeric yellow noodles topped with sesame rice crackers. <br /><br />Bread & Roses is a sweet little market with organic produce, an affordable, tightly curated selection of local producers, and Friday wine tastings.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4765d437-64a5-4864-b573-5a6c08766e56.jpg',5786616,36,'45.48741','-122.58652',1,4,1.00,1.00,4.00,93.00,30,1125,72,4.32,624789690871795521),(2628,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/625138968713318567','🧚‍♂️🐅🪞The Gem on Hawthorne🌱🌈 🪩','A quirky ornate studio located in the heart of SE Portland filled with ample natural light. A total of 6 windows (4 south facing and 2 west facing) bring in all the light and show off the cutie shops, cafés, restaurants, and vintage gems of Hawthorne. You’ll be staying with plants galore & gorgeous décor. Textures of linen, carved wood, metals, and velvet adorn our studio along with jewel tones, neutrals, & rich, warm design. The Gem is utilized for photoshoots, content creation & travel stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-625138968713318567/original/59c089cc-9bae-468c-a671-37e09d5b8c6a.jpeg',189105426,8,'45.51101','-122.6244',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,250.00,30,365,4,4.75,625138968713318567),(2629,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/625140933665613917','New and modern guesthouse with free street parking','Welcome to our detached studio workspace, perfect for those seeking a serene and comfortable retreat, explore the city with all of its delicious food or take a day trip to the gorge or beach!  Outside, enjoy the ample outdoor space with a covered eating area and BBQ, perfect for dining al fresco. Directly outside the studio is a beautiful, year-round flower garden to brighten your day. Book your stay with us and experience the perfect blend of comfort and tranquility.','Kenton neighborhood- a small neighborhood that is located in N Portland. It has a downtown that consists of one Main Street on Denver Ave.There are many restaurants to eat at here. There is  a library, thrift stores, comic store, liquor store, coffee shops, post office, and a farmers market on  Wednesdays, June 1 – September 28, 3 – 7 pm. <br />A small health food market is located 4 blocks walking distance from the Airbnb, Green Zebra. <br /><br />There are 4 parks that are walking distance:<br />Columbia Park<br />Arbor Lodge Park<br />Gammans Park<br />Kenton Park<br /><br />A great location to stay while enjoying Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-625140933665613917/original/f5c8a204-c4ab-4a0d-95e2-789d35ebd26e.jpeg',26968463,55,'45.57846','-122.69623',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,52.00,1,1125,156,4.90,625140933665613917),(2630,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/625918158290441750','Huge, Bright & Modern 5 Bdrm w/Fenced Yard','This enormous and well-stocked 5 bedroom, 3-level home is a perfect launch pad for any Portland adventure! Located in the heart of the Hawthorne District (a hip, commercial area in SE Portland), but on a quiet residential street, it is the perfect mix of safe and serene, yet easily walkable to a myriad of adventures, should you choose to find them! <br /><br />Plenty of restaurants, boutiques, night life and family fun within a few blocks and amazing trails/views at Mt Tabor park just a half mile away.','This is an amazing location! All along Hawthorne you can find delicious eats, boutiques, bars and nightlife, as well as family fun (including a hip, eat-in theater and an arcade to name just a few!). <br /><br />You have easy access to a Fred Meyer (grocery and department store) as well as New Seasons Market, which is a health food store unique to Portland. Both are great options and between the two, you should have everything you need!<br /><br />This is also an amazing location if you want to ditch the car, as there are ample bus lines in every direction, not to mention it is walkable to so many desirable destinations. Plus, Portland is one of the most bike-friendly cities in the country!<br /><br />Mount Tabor is only a half mile away and is a great place to hike, bike or have a picnic! The views from the top are unbeatable and it is easily one of the largest and most popular parks in Portland. <br /><br />You couldn\'t find a better location, in my opinion! We are excited for you to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-625918158290441750/original/fafc226e-d566-4a27-a2cc-5db7dfd8d4f3.jpeg',57930851,15,'45.51046763911121','-122.61093325958565',1,9,3.50,5.00,5.00,199.00,30,1125,6,5.00,625918158290441750),(2631,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/625963136297146006','Cozy Private Alberta Arts Studio - Fast WiFi 100mb','Cozy studio hideaway in the heart of Alberta Arts District with lots of light! We are just a 1 block away from several delicious, restaurants, bars and coffee! The cute front patio overlooks a quiet street. Clean, comfortable and totally private.<br /><br />High speed fiber internet (100mbps).<br /><br />Walk just a few blocks to some of Portland’s best restaurants, bars, shops and cafés (87 walk score). Close to multiple bus lines and great bike routes (76 bike score)<br /><br />See our reviews  here airbnb.com/h/28blue.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-625963136297146006/original/afdb31e8-4778-495b-83db-b3a91bfb22b2.jpeg',32448313,1,'45.56189065700736','-122.63544584933126',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,2,28,34,4.65,625963136297146006),(2632,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/626068463862576610','Spacious Apartment w/ Charm near Multnomah Village','Come and see all Portland has to offer while enjoying the charm of Multnomah Village. Just a short ½ mile walk to the heart of The Village filled with a variety of independent restaurants, coffee shops, bars and shopping. If it’s nature you crave, Woods Park is a mere 3 blocks away. Just 10 mins to downtown. 12 mins to OHSU. 15 minutes or less to most anything in the city! After spending the day around town, come back and relax at this beautifully remodeled home.','Multnomah Village is a charming neighborhood with a variety of restaurants, bars, coffee shops, dessert places, food carts and John\'s Market- home to most every beer known to man. There\'s also a fun assortment of local shops where you\'re sure to find treasures! <br /><br />Woods Park is just a few blocks away- A 50 acre native forest with several miles of scenic trails and a lovely creek.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-626068463862576610/original/433dfcc6-f5dd-4296-95b5-a4da63982af6.jpeg',37348111,18,'45.46025','-122.71784',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,96.00,3,30,85,5.00,626068463862576610),(2633,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/626117053091075620','Elegant Lovely Home in Portland close to everything!','Welcome to Elegant Lovely Home in Sellwood, a walkable location to many destinations in Portland! Comfortably accommodating 4 guests, it is equipped with 1bd/1bath, living area with a daybed, fully equipped kitchen, private patio and backyard. BBQ grill, Free Wifi, Washing machine & Dryer all available! Nearby a variety of cultural restaurants, cafes and top sights such as Portland Art Museum, Portland Japanese Garden and Oregon Zoo, to make memories never meant to be forgotten!','Being located in a beautiful and quiet neighborhood in Sellwood, it is perfect to go on a stroll, or a morning jog to get your body working first thing in the morning. Situated in a walkable location to many destinations, It is accessible to restaurants and cafes (Moreland Ale House, Bertie Lou’s Cafe, Taqueria Luna, Starbucks) supermarkets (New Seasons Market, QFC) attractions and places (Westmoreland Park Nature Playground, Eastmoreland Golf Course, Oaks Amusement Park, Portland Art Museum,Washington Park) you will definitely want to visit to spend your most extraordinary family vacation ever!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-626117053091075620/original/0e652656-323b-4c2f-8218-88df3417ccf1.jpeg',34903010,20,'45.46721','-122.64675',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,3,29,46,4.85,626117053091075620),(2634,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/627053377081285691','Chic 2-Bdrm Apt - Tranquil & Close To Everything!','Quiet yet desirable location. Close to local parks including a tranquil forested area, Multnomah Village, grocery stores, cafes + public transportation.<br /><br />Gentle natural light + plenty of privacy. Open floor plan with dining + living area with fireplace. Kitchen equipped with everything you need. Each bedroom is peaceful and inspiring with photos of India + Nepal and Oregon\'s natural beauty.  <br />Memory foam mattresses.<br />Chic bathroom with bathtub + shower.<br />Covered outdoor seating area with fire pit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-627053377081285691/original/80790d3a-f541-4620-ac2b-bac536a098c0.png',13136838,18,'45.46227','-122.72188',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,627053377081285691),(2635,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/628233626827163984','Spacious, Downtown Location – relaxing!','Welcome to The City of Roses and the Downtown Pearl District. Stay at a beautifully upgraded Flexcation apartment with free parking included for long-term stays and all the amenities you need! The apartments are ideal for a quiet escape and are not suitable for events, parties or groups. There is 24/7 security in the building to ensure the health, wellbeing, and safety of all guests.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-628233626827163984/original/13e59d84-0c94-4255-b612-156d632610a1.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52694','-122.68227',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,96.00,1,14,2,5.00,628233626827163984),(2636,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/628298167479598203','Historic Laurelhurst Dougan Suites : Suite 2','Newly remodeled, cozy,  contemporary, beautiful, and bright daylight basement suite in the elegant Laurelhurst historic James Dougan home. Built in 1922.  Walking distance to Hawthorne, Belmont, hundreds of restaurants and shops. Queen bed + convertible sleeper sofa,  kitchenette shared with suite across hall. \"Absolutely recommend this place! One of my favorite places I\'ve stayed, quiet & clean, great location, and the host is so sweet!\"','Historic Laurelhurst. Big trees, larger lots and homes. A block from beautiful Laurelhurst Park. A few minutes walk to food carts, restaurants, shops, gelato, and so much more! Easy access to freeway (I-84) and 10 mins to downtown or airport.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-628298167479598203/original/7466d9a3-b3d1-49dd-9dcf-654c79166e20.jpeg',5726659,23,'45.52450942993164','-122.62254333496094',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,133.00,1,28,33,4.97,628298167479598203),(2637,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/628422603835782481','Modern One Bedroom near Alberta Arts District','Thoughtfully designed with bohemian modern decor, Webster House is a comfy home base for you to explore Portland solo or with a plus one.  Walkable to raved restaurants and bars on both the main draw of Alberta Arts District and Williams Ave.  Explore even more NE neighborhoods thanks to nearby bike + scooter rentals!<br /> <br />Prefer to stay in? An apartment all to your self including Wi-Fi, an equipped kitchen and a quiet street all help you relax.<br /> <br />Looking forward to your stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-628422603835782481/original/c77ec3d4-3106-43d9-b41f-c1f9bac0e3b6.jpeg',1965498,14,'45.55893','-122.65761',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,4,365,45,4.96,628422603835782481),(2638,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/629022147577688909','Large GreenRM. PrivateBA. Separate Living Level.','Minimum 28 day-stays. Centrally-located .<br />Colorful Sunsets seen from inside the house & dyaswhile peacefulon the back decks<br />Mostayn-filled Moonlit Nights<br />Nature Abounds<br />Eagles, Hawks & Owls are watching smaller birds from all around<br />Seen grazing on the property, are young fawns to mature 6-points.<br /><br />Feel the Peace & Calm of nature\'s effect take over   Come enjoy nature at it\'s Best!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e6638e74-d12e-46c6-970d-440fa0bfbcb8.jpg',3190134,31,'45.48602','-122.68857',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,67.00,30,365,0,1.00,629022147577688909),(2639,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/629625460569836578','Spacious 1 Bedroom Apt in Alberta / Alameda Area','Cozy spacious 1-Bedroom, 1 Bathroom Apartment with Living Room, kitchen, and washer/dryer in the upscale, progressive neighborhood of Alameda Heights.  Centrally located, it is only a 5 minute walk to Alberta Street, which is full of restaurants, coffee shops, pubs/bars, and charming quirky shops; a 7 minute walk to beautiful Wilshire Park; and a 10 minute walk to New Seasons grocery store.  Downtown Portland is only a 10 min drive, and there is a bus stop 1 block away.','This is an ideal location in inner NE Portland that is walking distance to the vibrant Alberta Street alternative scene, the progressive but more refined Beaumont neighborhood, Whilshire Park, and Whole Foods and New Seasons grocery stores.  It is also only a 5 minute drive to the trendy Mississippi and Williams Streets neighborhoods and to the SE neighborhoods, while only a 10 minute drive to downtown, the Pearl District, and the trendy 23rd street neighborhood.  The Alameda Heights neighborhood, where this home is located, is a wonderful area to walk and bike - very peaceful with beautifully designed homes and gardens.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-629625460569836578/original/cc19ebb3-54fb-4197-b0c8-df34d78e627f.jpeg',453377594,19,'45.555264','-122.633476',1,3,1.50,1.00,2.00,99.00,2,28,49,4.96,629625460569836578),(2640,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/629962948597395551','Modern 3B/3.5 BATH - Walk score 90!','This newly built townhouse is stylish, fully stocked, and located near Portland\'s desirable Alberta Arts District and Concordia neighborhood. We are close to the Portland airport, and easily drivable to many attractions in the city. Our beautiful home is ideal for extended stays and business stays. A block away from Fernhill Park and within walking distances to many resturants, food carts, parks, bars, and grocery stores and much more!','Concordia / Cully / Alberta Arts District','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-629962948597395551/original/23bcc030-fc04-4c72-86e9-e67c532a41e1.jpeg',459821523,21,'45.56755','-122.61915',1,8,3.50,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,180,79,4.97,629962948597395551),(2641,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/630478819823567349','Pied a Terre PDX. Clean and Quiet. Dog Friendly.','This clean and quiet classic is a 1-bedroom fully-furnished lower-level basement apartment, with its own private entrance:<br />• Tuft & Needle queen bed<br />• Full kitchen<br />• 20 minutes to the airport, 10 to downtown<br />• Explore our neighborhood of Overlook to shop, drink, eat & people watch<br />• Nearby neighborhoods: Alberta Arts, Mississippi, Williams & Killingsworth<br />• 2 blocks-MAX light rail','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NjMwNDc4ODE5ODIzNTY3MzQ5/original/7af5d79a-6ef5-4c28-b394-20a0235cd802.jpeg',8026442,13,'45.55942','-122.68114',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,2,28,34,4.97,630478819823567349),(2642,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/630606067983802554','Fenced Yard! Pet Friendly, 3 Bedroom, no fees','Lovely 3 bedroom house with covered front and back porches and a fenced backyard. The home is a cozy 960 sq ft, but has great outdoor space for dinning. Complete private use of the house with no shared walls. Attached 2 car garage.<br /><br />Located on a residential street but walking distance to restaurants, a dog park, and coffee shops. <br /><br />The house was furnished for comfortable long-term stays. We receive complements on our mattresses.','Close to OHSU, downtown, and a dog park. The location is the perfect if you want a peaceful living while being close to everything!<br /><br />The house is just a 5 minute walk to several restaurants, bars, and points of interest, including a McMenamin\'s Pub & Eatery (a local favorite), a Bouldering Gym, and Marquam Trail. There is a kayak and canoe rental shop is right by the house. Willamette Park has a dog park, boat access to the river, playground, and tennis courts.<br /><br />Less than half a mile to L\'Etoile French Immersion School.<br /><br />Close to the grocery store Zupans Market.<br /><br />The house is 3 blocks from the bike path that follows the river. The bike path is an easy ride to OHSU, the tram to the VA, and downtown Portland.<br /><br />The neighborhood is referred to by locals as John\'s Landing, the Macadam neighborhood, or Lair\'s Addition, depending on who you ask.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-630606067983802554/original/e5b6accd-cfeb-4651-ae62-a8ab9f900410.jpeg',124142815,22,'45.4768','-122.67395',1,7,1.00,3.00,5.00,190.00,30,330,1,5.00,630606067983802554),(2643,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/632555496882768441','Stylish NE Speakeasy w/ Coffee Bar & Vinyl','Come enjoy a unique retreat in this Historic Portland home. You will be staying in the cozy, renovated basement of this gorgeous Irvington home with tons of charm and great amenities!<br /><br />We are conveniently located within walking distance to local restaurants, coffee shops, retail stores, and parks.  Centrally located in Portland and just 3 miles from downtown.','Irvington is the the largest historic district in Oregon, and one of the largest in the entire United States. The district is 98% residential structures, 1% commercial buildings and 1% other uses such as schools or churches.  <br /><br />Take a stroll through the neighborhood and enjoy some of the most beautiful homes and old growth trees that Portland has to offer!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-632555496882768441/original/93ec60b7-bc18-4949-ae5f-2c0898d58f0e.jpeg',460379593,4,'45.53483','-122.6437',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,111.00,1,14,148,4.99,632555496882768441),(2644,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/633301529898470441','Urban Hub, Alberta Arts','Fantastic one level condo in Alberta Arts district. We\'re located at the of 30th Ave and Killingsworth. Next to fabulous eateries, coffee shops, Art galleries, and public transit steps away. Come stay a while, you\'ll fall in love.','The corner of 30th and Killingsworth is home to fabulous restaurants like Expatriate (known for the best cocktails in the area and excellent eats) Wilder (a great neighborhood eatery and bar), Dame, (a wine bar with fabulous French faire), and Gabbiano’s (fine Italian dining). Freshly opened is the fantastic Boxer Ramen, Baes Fried chicken, and Kinnamons cinnamon rolls on the corner of Alberta and 30th. You can start your mornings by heading across Killingsworth to Extracto for coffee and a lovely pastry at Flour Market NE. We have lots of food options to explore.<br /><br />There is an excellent group of art galleries at 30th and Alberta where you can watch artists work their magic with clay and have a hand-made card designed just for you. Pull out the yoga mat we provide and head to The People\'s Yoga for a fantastic crew of yoga instructors in a plethora of yogic traditions. The Alberta Rose Theater and Kennedy School are blocks away if you want to take in a show. If you’re tired of ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1d436617-de35-4c02-a860-570bd71dd008.jpg',115378511,1,'45.56142','-122.63478',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,61.00,30,1125,8,4.88,633301529898470441),(2645,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/634795112915222477','Hawthorne Get Away','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.','Close to Hawthorne Blvd, with lots of restaurants and fun shops to explore, very close to Mt Tabor  park and downtown Portland. Close to Safeway and Fred Meyers grocery stores.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0c534353-34fb-45c8-a47c-7a5631f303df.jpg',66636612,16,'45.51255','-122.63253',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,30,14,4.93,634795112915222477),(2646,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/635413907290834919','Astroranchpdx  7acres, 20 min from central PDX','Two night minimum retreat, event, reunion property on private 7 acres only 20 minutes from central Portland. Private driveway to 4 cabins, two have 2 twin beds, other two cabins have queen beds. Continue on to the main one owner mid century modern main house with tons of covered space for entertaining out of the sun or rain. The price here can be discussed if you only need main house. astroranchpdx IG<br />2 day minimum possible. Great for hosting family for whatever get  together!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-635413907290834919/original/36a5f47f-f37c-4627-a366-00acbe89d6fb.jpeg',7915925,77,'45.46716','-122.52676',1,16,3.50,8.00,15.00,750.00,30,120,1,5.00,635413907290834919),(2647,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/635605057109350283','The Loft in Hawthorne Tabor','Loft style guest house with private entrance & private porch in a quiet and convenient Hawthorne Tabor neighborhood. <br /><br />Location:<br />Explore the many restaurants, bars, boutiques, etc in less than 10 min walk along SE Hawthorne Blvd including: Por Que No?, Tabor Bread, New Seasons, Farmhouse Kitchen<br /><br />Escape to the tranquility of Mt Tabor park & trails after an enjoyable 20 min walk through West Tabor neighborhood<br /><br />15 min drive to PDX Airport<br />15 min drive to Downtown','The loft is 2 blocks away from Hawthorne Blvd where you can explore the many restaurants, bars, funky shops that make Portland incredibly fun and unique. Some highlights that are within a 10 min walk include: ¿Por Que No?, Apizza Scholls, Tabor Bread, Farmhouse Kitchen Thai, Stumptown Coffee, Powell\'s Books, Baghdad Theater, New Seasons.<br /><br />Walk an enjoyable 20 mins through west Tabor neighborhood to the tranquility of Mt Tabor park and the many trails it offers leading to a beautiful city skyline at the top.<br /><br />15 mins to PDX airport<br />15 mins to downtown Portland','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-635605057109350283/original/5d72a46c-bd34-4b37-bb16-96f72c7a2cb5.jpeg',777447,16,'45.513363','-122.613922',1,2,1.00,1.00,4.00,114.00,2,90,108,4.97,635605057109350283),(2648,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/637004389047205785','Jeremiah\'s Rocky Butte Bungalow w/ backyard patio','Looking for a place to explore the city but don\'t want to be Downtown and would like your own space to relax? The Rocky Butte Bungalow is only 15 mins from the city center. This home is right on public transit, only 10 mins from the airport and has a great backyard space to relax, or work remotely. You will have your own large closet, a friendly feline friend to cuddle with if you choose (or not), and safe off street parking. Home is 10 mins from Providence Hospital and 15 mins from OHSU.','Roseway is a small cluster of single family homes, shops and commercial businesses between NE Sandy Blvd, NE 57th to NE 82nd Ave. Within walking distance there is a fun dive bar, a classic donut shop, several cafes, coffee shops, a Safeway market and just a block away is a Plaid Pantry convenience store.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-637004389047205785/original/12eabac6-fc90-4854-bbf8-763404ccc07b.jpeg',24152318,39,'45.54905','-122.58087',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,1,2,105,4.89,637004389047205785),(2649,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/637681336608019045','Charming Industrial 1 Bdrm Loft with Priv. Parking','Greetings!!  Welcome to true downtown Portland loft living!<br /><br />Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located apartment with everything you need.  <br /><br />Approx. 15 Minute drive to anywhere in Portland area, 5 minute walk to the Portland Waterfront Park, 1 to 3 block walk to all major public transportation including MAX, Union Station (Greyhound, Amtrak, etc), and Trimet bus system.  A hip, skip, and a walk away from plenty of bars, parks, cafes, restaurants, dispensaries, and so much more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-637681336608019045/original/fed694d7-f922-417a-8b0f-d8601219d29e.jpeg',4830078,43,'45.52678','-122.67392',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,30,180,9,4.78,637681336608019045),(2650,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/638467207947223081','Restaurant Row! Vibrant Lauralhurst Studio','Modern bright & open studio first floor apartment (no stairs, 800 sq ft) with chef\'s kitchen and dining table, bathroom with deep tub, newer memory foam queen size bed, living area with TV and gas fireplace. Lots of windows, Heat and AC that you control in an amazing walking neighborhood close to several dozen restaurants and bars that line nearly 5 blocks on SE 28th ave, also called Restaurant Row + a whole foods & one of the cities most cherished parks.','Kerns has many popular Portland restaurants and locally-owned businesses, making this a fun neighborhood to visit. The Buckman – Kerns shops, bars, and restaurants along Burnside and 28th Avenue are some of the best in town. The Laurelhurst Theater is a great old classic theater for catching a movie.<br />The Buckman and Kerns neighborhoods are also home to some of Portland’s finest microbreweries, including Migration Brewing, Lucky Labrador, Natian Brewery, Culmination Brewing, and the Cascade Brewing Barrel House. Both of these areas are perfect for a pub crawl since there are so many places from which to choose.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-638467207947223081/original/bb8bc707-bd11-477b-bfd6-4f5bc2d9d9ad.jpeg',6549255,12,'45.5210237','-122.634165',1,4,1.00,0.00,1.00,86.00,2,1125,72,4.99,638467207947223081),(2651,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/638671075277572670','Lovely 1 bedroom garden apartment in Portland','Kerns Neighborhood was voted #1 in the US and #5 in the world!  It  is wonderful to explore all Portland has to offer. Walk to restaurants, bars, grocery stores, cafes, and more!<br /><br />Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. Come and enjoy our garden oasis and shared outdoor spaces!<br /><br />The unit is unique and spacious over looking a lush and beautiful backyard.','Walk to get groceries, hair cut, dine in several amazing restaurants or food carts, or stroll in a few peaceful neighborhood parks! Our hood has it all!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-638671075277572670/original/26741fbe-6b62-4f80-9313-002d9dd90a6b.jpeg',10928596,12,'45.52671','-122.63425',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,71.00,31,120,7,5.00,638671075277572670),(2652,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/639182523533368756','Cozy Apt - Short Walk to Food Carts, Bars & More','Nestled between the Alberta Arts District and Mississippi Ave, your guest suite is surrounded by parks, local restaurants, food carts and community gardens. Don’t hesitate to reach out for recommendations! Here for the music? You are just moments away from some of the best venues Portland has to offer! Walking distance from bus stops, moments from the MAX station, 15 minutes from the airport, this central location is sure to make any traveler feel at ease.','If you need to do laundry, there is a laundromat across the street.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-639182523533368756/original/658f4750-ed9f-4dd5-b011-a82588cb1c4e.jpeg',109920552,14,'45.562103','-122.658989',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,99.00,30,180,31,4.90,639182523533368756),(2653,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/639767081128991992','Modern Style In The Pearl','Modern flare in the famous Pearl District, this unique space is on point with style and amenities whether you’re working or relaxing. We’re walkable to countless unique shops and restaurants for an authentic experience of our City of Roses, and close to public transportation and highways when it’s time to explore the coast or the mountains.','Located in the City of Roses’ famous Pearl District, we are nestled into an eclectic mix of historic homes and new, modern builds; a block away from a large city park and a half mile from the Stadium.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b1ac496d-dfa3-43e5-b574-9a5459434708.jpg',462051434,27,'45.52694','-122.68984',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,107.00,1,1125,75,4.91,639767081128991992),(2654,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/639869013921454238','Violet\'s Chalet A-frame Farm/Meadow Retreat','Getaway w/mountain valley views just min. from downtown PDX. Nestled by Powell Butte nature park on a  hobby farm, the A-Frame is cozy tiny 240 ft, double bed perched under the old growth Douglas Fir\'s, sunset views of  Portland. Enjoy a semi-off grid locale forest bathing  or in outdoor soaking pool in the clawfoot tub  (RSVP community hot tub in winter)  and our rustic outdoor bath house and compost toilet . It sits in a Mt meadow near our yurt and cabin, own private bath. Glamp adventure!','Our 5 acre west slope farm is on the bluff of Powell Butte Nature Park. Enjoy miles of old growth forest hiking, Butte-top panoramic views and your own cozy getaway on our little farm.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-639869013921454238/original/4237c16a-37d3-4903-a08e-44243e01228a.jpeg',421792,78,'45.48812','-122.51794',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,10,201,4.89,639869013921454238),(2655,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/639958185255346855','Downtown Condo Along River w/hottub and parking','* Our 2 bedroom condo is centrally located in downtown Portland.<br />* Two minute walk to the Willamette River<br />* From the back patio you will see the swimming pool and hot tub<br />* Year round hot tub access <br />* One dedicated parking spot included<br />* No river view but you are so close - just a 2 minute walk away to the beautiful pathway<br />* In unit new washer and dryer<br />* Fast wifi<br />* EV charger in complex<br />* Video available upon request','We are on the westside of the Willamette River. Our condo complex borders the edge of the Pearl district and Oldtown Chinatown neighborhood. There is nearby public transportation via Trimet Max and bus. The river front is a two minute walk from the front door.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-639958185255346855/original/819665b2-ab9c-45c4-bf65-fdc322ceb2fd.jpeg',4539980,43,'45.53073','-122.67414',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,114.00,30,365,12,5.00,639958185255346855),(2656,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/639982051854870330','The Wildflower Cottage','Come relax and recharge at The Wildflower Cottage. Whether you are looking to enjoy our walkable neighborhood, discover our exciting city or explore the endless nature that surrounds us, you will have your own separate, cozy place to come home to. There are many restaurants and shops just a short stroll away. Reed College, Westmoreland park, and downtown Portland are just minutes away by car. The MAX light rail station and bus stops are just a few blocks away. Come and enjoy the PNW!','We are located in an amazing neighborhood full of families, restaurants, shops and parks. In true Portland fashion, there are also plenty of bars and coffee shops to explore and try.  This neighborhood has its own walkable, small town feel with many lovely and friendly neighbors yet you are so close to downtown Portland and all the wonderful outdoors that surrounds us.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/33394063-4f3e-4824-84b8-0ea887c68c34.jpg',22664095,20,'45.48094','-122.64484',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,2,30,38,4.97,639982051854870330),(2657,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/639985681276299200','Natural light. Studio ADU + Loft. Parking on-site','Experience abundant natural light in this centrally-located studio featuring a loft area. <br /><br />Exceptional location, a quick less-than-10-minute drive from downtown Portland and Portland State University, and just 10 minutes from Beaverton. Within walking distance to the Oregon Zoo and Washington Park.<br /><br />Pets are warmly welcomed on a case-by-case basis, with a one-time fee of $200 charged to guests. The property provides only one parking spot; parking a second vehicle incurs a fee of $250/month.','10 minutes drive to hospitals:<br />- Oregon Health & Science University Hospital (OHSU)<br />- Providence - Saint Vincent Hospital<br />- VA Hospital<br />10 minutes drive to:<br />- Downtown Portland<br />- Portland State University<br />5 minutes drive to:<br />- Shopping<br />- Oregon Zoo<br />- Washington Park<br />- Gabriel Park<br />- Many amenities more','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-639985681276299200/original/86b31ce3-e2f6-439f-9182-ebd2e8af109c.jpeg',39712312,54,'45.50717','-122.73047',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,1125,7,5.00,639985681276299200),(2658,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/640131555489190388','Remodeled 1906 Craftsman home in Nob Hill district','Enjoy Portland from this centrally located, meticulously maintained Craftsman style home. Just steps away from trendy 23rd street, this cozy independent home lets you truly experience Portland. Original character with tasteful upgrades provides both comfort and style to make your vacation memorable. <br /><br />Please note that parking is either in the paid public parking lot or metered street parking  only.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-640131555489190388/original/190e64e3-5b80-410a-8704-043cd6e98300.jpeg',181702616,27,'45.52599','-122.69995',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,225.00,2,1125,54,5.00,640131555489190388),(2659,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/640328648437453436','Portland Bungalow Apartment','Welcome to this centrally-located Sellwood-Moreland 1-bedroom, 1-bath apartment. This very walkable apartment is located in the heart of the Sellwood-Moreland neighborhood. We are just 3 blocks from the business district with coffee shops, bars, restaurants, boutiques and antique shops. Centrally located in the center of Portland with close proximity to downtown, the convention center, and a quick 30 min drive to the orchards and wineries.','Sellwood is a lively and fun area with many local shops, restaurants, and bars. We have a historic movie theater, several parks and 2 grocery stores. Very walkable.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-640328648437453436/original/f8dd69a6-ea11-4823-9ec0-8690ed8385bc.jpeg',384749573,20,'45.4780982','-122.6480115',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,1,3,34,4.94,640328648437453436),(2660,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/641417904698519414','#StayInMyDistrict Buckman Loft Popular SE Belmont','#StayinMyDistrict Buckman Loft! Located in the heart of Inner SE Buckman neighborhood, walk to Revolution Hall, dining, food trucks, coffee shops, & shopping. Recent updates reflecting a modern Mid Century vibe, with a private and charming outdoor space for enjoying a morning cup of coffee or a glass of wine in the evenings. Full Kitchen, FREE Street Parking, Smart TV’s/WIFI. One Pre-Approved SMALL Dog','Buckman is a neighborhood in the Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. The neighborhood is bounded by the Willamette River on the west, E Burnside St. on the north, SE 28th Ave. on the east, and SE Hawthorne Blvd. on the south. The Buckman neighborhood is in a great location as it is in close proximity to some of Portland’s most hip and popular neighborhoods such as Kerns, Laurelhurst, and Belmont. Residents have plenty of independent retail, coffee, pub, and dining options just a stone’s throw away in most cases across several adjoining neighborhoods.<br />Buckman’s Hawthorne District is one of the most unique, and most popular areas in Southeast Portland. The area is known for its wonderfully restored Old Portland homes, liberal residents, and fun and funky feel. The street is lined with unique restaurants and shops and has a definite Portland-local flair.  Local area standouts are Slow Bar, Rontoms, My Father’s Place, and the Lucky Labrador Brew Pub. The closest include:<br />- The','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-641417904698519414/original/a77926aa-d454-40dd-9ee7-3d133d0498e4.jpeg',3142393,32,'45.518881','-122.6453477',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,109.00,1,28,117,4.84,641417904698519414),(2661,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/644229159812082280','Charming 1 BR Guest Suite In Richmond!','Enjoy Portland while staying in our private guest suite! We are the main residents of the property, and are excited to host you in our newly furnished guest space while you explore the city! <br /> <br />Whether you are traveling for business or vacation, our private guest space has all you need to recharge and relax.','WELCOME TO PORTLAND! We’re so excited to host you! Portland has so much to see and do, you’ll never be bored while you’re here.  Whether you want to wake up, get a coffee and walk through Laurelhurst Park or take the MAX (Portland’s light rail system) up to the Portland Zoo or International Test Rose Garden, Portland is a beautiful city. Our home is located in the heart of the Richmond District, which boasts some of the best restaurants and shopping in the entire city. We’re so excited to share our home with you!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-644229159812082280/original/2c920b49-76ae-40b5-9048-2f3cf99a1873.jpeg',462279303,8,'45.50392','-122.6219',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,69.00,3,30,60,4.75,644229159812082280),(2662,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/645176965112632079','Cute one-bedroom apartment w/ work from home space','Clean, renovated basement apartment with one bedroom located in the Montavilla neighborhood of Portland. <br /><br />The apartment is located below my home but has direct access from the street and is completely independent. I designed the apartment with longer stays in mind and the apartment has all the conveniences including a full kitchen, dishwasher, washer and dryer, and air conditioning. The apartment is also a great work from home option with two separate work spaces.','The house is located in the residential neighborhood of Montavilla.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-645176965112632079/original/d8e5a7e3-0f3b-4a6c-a0ac-7a617c451760.jpeg',3299455,10,'45.53195','-122.58366',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,35,60,17,4.94,645176965112632079),(2663,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/645741464416831099','Charming Suite In Great Location near everything!','Welcome to the City of Roses! Nestle into our contemporary and freshly furnished guest suite in Portland’s Madison South neighborhood! Enjoy the great outdoors at Rocky Butte Lookout, stroll among the gardens at the Grotto, and dig into some tasty Pips doughnuts and Chai! If golf is more your style, tee off at the conveniently located Rose City Golf Course!  <br /> <br />*** <br />Your stay helps us achieve our dream of owning a home: we appreciate you!','WELCOME TO PORTLAND! With the city slogan of \"Keep Portland Weird,\" there is no lack of unique things to explore in this very walkable city. Head downtown to visit iconic stops like Voodoo Doughnuts, Powell\'s bookstore (among other small bookstores), the Portland Japanese Garden, or rent a bike along the waterfront path. Check out north Portland\'s Cathedral Park, stroll along Hawthorne Blvd in Southeast and have a truly weird experience at Rimsey Korsacoffee House!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-645741464416831099/original/06684da2-b63d-4af8-b8d6-76070dfb81c6.jpeg',463215630,74,'45.53535','-122.57487',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,3,30,42,4.81,645741464416831099),(2664,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/645768712256126466','Luxurious Laurelhurst Speakeasy- Entire Home','Located in the prestigious Laurelhurst neighborhood of Portland, this luxurious property is located steps away from renowned Laurelhurst Park, shopping, and renowned restaurants on 24th Ave. 15 minutes from PDX airport, it is adjacent to the Hawthorne and Hollywood neighborhoods as well.','Laurelhurst is a neighborhood of vintage homes and undulating streets surrounding beautiful Laurelhurst Park , straddling the NE and SE sections of Portland. The neighborhood borders Sunnyside to the south, Kerns to the west, North Tabor to the east, and Hollywood to the north.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-645768712256126466/original/a0ceeff9-9126-4fe6-b549-e25c686326a1.jpeg',215058058,23,'45.5237748','-122.6233551',1,8,2.00,4.00,5.00,168.00,30,365,20,4.80,645768712256126466),(2665,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/646337184971927222','Modern basement apartment steps to Peninsula Park!','Spacious, newly renovated basement apartment one block from the beautiful rose gardens of Peninsula Park and walking distance to Killingsworth, Mississippi and N Williams neighborhoods. Bike friendly neighborhood and a quiet street but close  to amazing restaurants, bars and shops! Kids will love the playground in the park. One bedroom with queen bed and a double bed in a nook off of the living area. Kitchen is a wet bar with microwave, full fridge, coffee maker, hot plate. Shared backyard!','Piedmont is an historic neighborhood in North Portland. Only a 6 minute drive to downtown, NW, and the Pearl District, and walking/biking distance to Alberta, Mississippi and Williams neighborhoods. One block from the gorgeous rose-filled Peninsula Park! Our street is very quiet and safe, with lots of historic homes, but still so close to the excitement of the hip neighboring areas!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a18da80f-acdf-4145-900e-4a251e7d6e22.jpg',109008901,24,'45.56642','-122.67231',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,2,32,67,4.94,646337184971927222),(2666,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/647715294189889329','Paradise Haven 4 BR/2BA~Next to Park~ Walkscore 98','Experience the best of Portland in our 4-bedroom vacation rental, boasting a Walk Score of 98. Located steps from the city\'s top eateries, breweries, and boutique shops. This home is perfect for families and friends looking for the ideal city getaway.<br /><br />Relax in nearby parks, or enjoy our extensive collection of board games for fun-filled evenings. With a dedicated workspace and modern amenities, this Portland Airbnb offers the perfect mix of comfort and convenience for your Portland vacation.','Walk Score of 97/100 & Bike Score of 98/100!<br />Right next to 3 Acre Park! Perfect for Kids and Families<br />1 Block away from Migration Brewery <br />2 Blocks away from Food Carts<br />3 Blocks away from 28th Street (Absolutely full of restaurants and Bars). <br />10 Minutes from the Moda Center<br />10 Minutes from Downtown Portland<br />15 Minutes from the Portland Japanese Gardens<br />15 Minutes from the Oregon Z00','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-647715294189889329/original/746068d5-a10e-4272-acae-5eead5e34dcd.jpeg',392859086,12,'45.52601','-122.63609',1,8,2.00,4.00,5.00,188.00,1,365,149,4.95,647715294189889329),(2667,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/648444562194984347','Holiday Getaway! Single Level Garden Cottage','This cottage is a beautiful escape from the city.  Wander the lush gardens of this gated lake property and 7 acres that\'s surrounding it. Enjoy the quiet, peaceful cottage. <br />The cottage is equipped with everything you will need for a relaxing getaway, whether it\'s for work or just to relax. <br />This little slice of paradise is only a quick drive to restaurants, bars, shopping, and anywhere you want to explore in Portland or the surrounding areas.','Very safe with the gated entry, and towards the back of the property. Lots of room to park, and feel safe about leaving your car over night.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e2beca7f-6b1e-45c4-a5f4-7edc655fe551.jpg',150582690,77,'45.47612','-122.49694',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,252.00,30,1125,19,4.89,648444562194984347),(2668,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/648596664653633699','Private Garden Apartment in Woodstock Neighborhood','Kick back and relax in this quiet apartment on a private cul-de-sac. Walking distance to Woodstock Ave. near Otto\'s Sausage Kitchen & Meat Market (in Woodstock since 1922), New Seasons, Double Mountain Brewery, and more. Located walking distance to Reed College and Woodstock park. We are a quick 15 minute drive to Downtown Portland as well as Hawthorne/Division. This is a great home base to explore all Portland has to offer.','Bustling Woodstock Neighborhood in SE Portland','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-648596664653633699/original/6c851a58-34ac-4210-bfa2-73dd43b3954e.jpg',464103968,38,'45.48433','-122.61864',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,1,365,49,5.00,648596664653633699),(2669,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/649405848773318334','Always Sunny 1 Bedroom Flat In Buckman','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located Flat.<br />A cozy large suite with 1 queen bed,  a mid centry modern sleeper in livingroom,  1 Full Bath. Includes High Speed WiFi, internet TV, plus washer/dryer. Excellent location  very close in SE Belmont, walking distance to Revolution Hall concerts, close to downtown, many great resturaunts and bars close by as well as  parks, boutiques, and grocery stores.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-649405848773318334/original/7efc3601-d056-41a9-bc46-5bb8ee72c9bc.jpeg',1213257,32,'45.51984','-122.64742',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,30,90,16,4.94,649405848773318334),(2670,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/649856032550150644','Studio basement apartment in cute Piedmont','The map room is the perfect basecamp for launching your Oregon adventures.  Relax with you partner or dog (no 🐈, sorry) in this cute getaway close to Portland\'s culinary hotspots.','Located on the N/NE border of PDX - a short walk from Historic Peninsula Park and Rose Garden in the heart of Piedmont. Close to Alberta Arts District, Woodlawn, Arbor Lodge neighborhoods. Downtown, St John\'s and Forest Park are also within reach. Happy to provide recommendations for hikes and scenic walks when you book.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-649856032550150644/original/310e4806-5c6c-4469-8be8-69c19f6fe375.jpeg',11575758,48,'45.568786950571535','-122.66670374603272',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,93.00,2,25,37,4.84,649856032550150644),(2671,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/650810788579447500','Tabor Treasure Near Everywhere You Want to Be','Sitting high off the street you\'ll be nestled in your own sanctuary while blocks to all the goodies! This 2+ bed/2 bath home provides everything you need for a comfortable and relaxing stay. When you\'re ready to venture out, ten minutes walk will take you dining in the heart of Hawthorne or hiking up the trails of Mt Tabor. Front porch to dream on, back yard oasis for bbq-ing and lots of room inside. Be charmed!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1341192a-6e61-4dab-80e1-40db54a471af.jpg',828654,15,'45.51051','-122.6106',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,90,0,1.00,650810788579447500),(2672,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/651466256285936299','Dragonfly Retreat - launch pad to adventure','Welcome, Bienvenido, Aloha. <br /><br />Whether you are looking for a quiet place to escape, a remote workspace insulated from daily distractions or a launch pad from which you hope to explore/experience the numerous and varied activities the Pacific Northwest has to offer. I invite you to consider this newly remodeled, extremely clean, 1325 sq. ft. duplex located in outer SE Portland, two blocks from the Powell Butte Nature Park and 7.7 miles (30 minutes) from the Portland International Airport (PDX).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-651466256285936299/original/c95bc1ab-a8a2-41bd-babb-6c8b993ff2aa.jpeg',2549488,87,'45.49616','-122.51064',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,125.00,1,30,91,4.96,651466256285936299),(2673,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/652066519151494998','Modern Bright Home in the Hub of SE Portland','Located in a thriving neighborhood renowned for its eclectic dining scene, trendy boutiques, and artistic ambiance, our home offers a unique blend of tranquility and invigoration.<br /><br />Walk or bike down Division/Clinton, through gorgeous Ladd\'s Addition, or across the Tilikum Bridge to get everywhere in Portland. We are at an awesome location to connect to the rest of the city.  ','Southeast Division Street is a hub for Portland\'s creative community. <br /><br />WELCOME TO THE NEIGHBORHOOD! <br /><br />A charming Portland neighborhood that’s full of history and beautiful homes. It is close to  downtown and near shops, restaurants, and cafes. There are lots of  streets lined with big trees and lush neighborhood yards. <br /><br />While Hosford-Abernethy does not have huge acreage in parks lands within its boundaries, the neighborhood maintains a park-like feel because of its many large, older trees. When the Portland Parks Department did a tree study in 2012, they counted over 5400 individual trees of 97 different species within the neighborhood.<br /><br />The Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood is a convenient jump over the Hawthorne Bridge from downtown and close to the bustle of the Hawthorne District, yet it retains that quiet, residential feel we love so much. <br /><br />The neighborhood is best known for Ladd’s Addition, where the streets are liberated from Por','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-652066519151494998/original/0056d21c-8b43-4656-b568-75d8c57255fd.jpeg',1581273,25,'45.50602','-122.65197',1,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,195.00,2,16,31,4.97,652066519151494998),(2674,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653107050420875824','Pet Friendly 1-Bed 2-Bath w/Hot Tub','Relaxing house with nice neighbors. Easy access to PDX airport as well as Alberta Arts District.<br /><br />Enjoy the tree filled backyard while soaking in the hot tub.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1d87b387-1856-4f1b-96a8-146a9a1e45d9.jpg',104388,21,'45.56273','-122.61433',1,2,2.00,2.00,2.00,149.00,30,365,5,5.00,653107050420875824),(2675,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653318598593499467','University of Portland private Guest House','This architect designed private guest house is only two blocks from the University of Portland with easy access to downtown, as well as the Adidas offices. This fully private, one bedroom guesthouse has its own front and back patios. Entry is through a gate, with free parking easily found on the street.','Quiet, tree-filled neighborhood in North Portland. Blocks away from the University of Portland and parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-653318598593499467/original/968ddfac-0e2a-4ef4-a67e-927e86b013d2.png',946587,57,'45.57645','-122.72791',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,114.00,2,370,82,4.99,653318598593499467),(2676,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653427872638765940','Hillsdale Private Studio Oasis in Portland','Enjoy a warm, cozy lodging experience during your stay at this centrally-located home in stylish Hillsdale - a quiet community just 10 minutes south of Downtown Portland. Quick access to surrounding communities, colleges & hospitals. This newly renovated 400 sq. ft. daylight studio apartment sleeps 2 comfortably & includes private reserved parking, a private entrance, bath, kitchenette, & laundry.','Hillsdale is a quiet community just ten minutes south of Downtown Portland with quick access to surrounding communities, colleges and regional hospitals. The studio apartment is attached to a 1,900 square foot home stretching over a private 1/3 acre lot that abuts a bank of fir trees and a stream.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-653427872638765940/original/f79cace6-e2a1-4c48-8cce-38dc08ffbdd3.jpeg',7409866,31,'45.4860607','-122.7064172',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,61.00,2,300,31,4.90,653427872638765940),(2677,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653593830691077640','Healy Heights Hideaway!','New listing in the desirable Healy Heights Neighborhood. Beautiful custom built home with gourmet kitchen, hardwood floors and intricate craftsmanship combined with vaulted living spaces and stunning views, this home is designed to inspire. Step away from the hustle and bustle with your family or friends and escape to our special home surrounded by trees. Master Bedroom with spa amenities: Steam room and Sauna! Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-653593830691077640/original/94090060-67bd-40bf-840d-44bfbc1b8682.png',465222953,54,'45.4916451','-122.7021368',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,495.00,30,30,11,4.82,653593830691077640),(2678,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653728352767290385','Cozy downtown SE PDX basement apartment','Live it up at this centrally-located spot that is across from The Clinton Theatre, award winning bars & restaurants,  just steps away from your front door. Enjoy the walkable and bikeable options of near by beloved restaurants like Salt & Straw Ice Cream or Blue Star Donuts. After a day of exploring the near by shops on Division & Hawthorne this lovely oasis will allow you to recharge your batteries for your next day of enjoying all the lovely food & endless adventures that PDX has to offer.','Trendy Richmond is known for its lively main streets of Division and Clinton, home to a mix of high-end restaurants, buzzy destination eateries, clusters of food carts and cocktail and wine bars. Boho vintage boutiques and stylish women’s apparel stores sit next to quirky homewares, gift and stationery shops. The Clinton Street Theater shows independent films and plays, and hosts community events.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-653728352767290385/original/e8d2a90a-bce3-4928-b459-4c85cef9d4e9.jpeg',93224502,25,'45.5021059','-122.6394616',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,1,14,51,4.98,653728352767290385),(2679,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653733200885647806','Home Away From Home for You & Your Pups!','A cute mid-century \"modest\" home ready to be the retreat you and your dogs are looking for. Come stay, work, and play at this quiet SE Portland home nestled between Woodstock and Eastmoreland; a few steps to the Springwater Corridor, not far from OHSU Hospital and close to public transit buses and the MAX Orange line. This neighborhood is quiet and friendly, and feels like a sweet oasis in the heart of the city. Your dogs will enjoy a private, secure yard, and even a doggie door!','The home sits right on the border of the Woodstock and Eastmoreland neighborhoods. It\'s a very quiet and friendly part of town that feels very safe walking around, even at night. My dog and I love walking through the neighborhood (which has sidewalks!). There are quiet a few parks and open spaces for your dog to play if they are respectful of anyone else around and if you pick up after your dog.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NjUzNzMzMjAwODg1NjQ3ODA2/original/9af1b15a-d6e6-46e8-9886-76ca1db15252.jpeg',115269561,38,'45.4662','-122.62132',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,4,30,14,5.00,653733200885647806),(2680,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/653893942563566757','Modern Mid Century Duplex  Woodstock/Reed College','This stylish duplex is located in the middle of Woodstock/Creston/Reed and steps away from bars, coffee shops, restaurants & shopping. The vintage/modern décor and cozy space will have you feeling right at home in Portland. There\'s a king & queen bed,1 full bath & everything you\'ll need in a stocked kitchen! Includes: Highspeed WiFi, TV/Netfilx, record player + vinyl, washer/dryer in unit, private back patio, seating areas/firepit and one free parking spot. Pets okay, come enjoy a 30+ day stay!','Woodstock/Creston/Reed College is one of the best areas in SE Portland. There are a lot of bars, restaurants, coffee shops, vintage shops & parks. It\'s all very walkable with pet friendly breweries, dog parks & much to do and see!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-653893942563566757/original/2b424657-b3f8-4625-9536-e1d5d9b2f9a2.jpeg',67230784,38,'45.48833','-122.62208',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,89.00,30,365,7,5.00,653893942563566757),(2681,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/654892861520880350','Waterfront view- the best of downtown living','Beautiful condo in downtown Portland w/ sweeping views of the city, mountains, river & West hills, showcasing a view of Mt.Hood in every room.   Recently remodeled kitchen and bath. Light rail right outside your door to enjoy northwest cuisines, arts, festivals, music, and Saturday/farmer markets.<br /><br />Blocks away from Oregon Health & Science University (OHSU), OHSU Southwater front, Portland State University, Tom McCall waterfront, Pettygrove Park, Pioneer Square, Keller Auditorium, and more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e67c11a2-54cf-4909-bfa0-62e7fdd033b6.jpg',154270631,44,'45.50946','-122.6792',1,3,2.00,2.00,2.00,180.00,30,1125,2,5.00,654892861520880350),(2682,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/655842703628712898','Cheerful 2-bedroom Home Near UP and St. Johns','Adorable bungalow just blocks from University of Portland, Downtown St. Johns and Cathedral Park. This two bedroom, one bathroom home has recently undergone an extensive facelift included new paint, furnishings, plus a backyard upgrade gazebo & fire pit. 4 min walk to UP. 5 min drive to St. Johns, Forest Park, Kenton and I-5. 10 mins to Adidas, Legacy Emanual Hospital and Downtown Portland. Perfect for traveling nurses and travelers looking to be centrally located in a quiet, safe neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-655842703628712898/original/4d56b2c0-0172-4ec5-ad79-c3a864d3234d.jpeg',221421926,57,'45.57833','-122.72961',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,82.00,31,120,7,4.14,655842703628712898),(2683,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/657364725764938172','Charming Downtown PDX Guest Suite w/ Skyline Views','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. <br />Conveniently located near Downtown Portland, 23rd street, PSU, Farmer\'s Market, and the Max.<br />Enjoy sweeping views of the city and the mountains. You will love the private balcony and are steps away from the street car, museums, farmers\' market, and various outdoor dining options.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-657364725764938172/original/6ec81d28-184f-43ac-a8f1-e1e96ee93146.jpeg',41397606,3,'45.514913','-122.6934524',2,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,94.00,3,100,89,4.89,657364725764938172),(2684,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/658853909872369844','Brand New Tiny Home/Pottery Studio in Cute Village','Welcome to DARK MODE, the tiny home/pottery studio 2 blocks from adorable Multnomah Village.  Find peace in this serene hidden backyard oasis.<br /><br />Unit is 200 square feet plus loft and deck, behind the main house.  Features include:<br /><br />- Jetted tub<br />- Sleeping loft (queen)<br />- Pull out bed (full)<br />- Fire pit<br />- Porch swing<br />- Work desk <br />- Cascading water feature<br />- Outdoor dining table<br /><br />No kitchen but has a sink, fridge, microwave, water boiler, and plenty of wonderful food options within a few blocks.','Multnomah Village is a quaint Portland neighborhood set away from the busy downtown and central eastside. Explore downtempo mom and pop shops and the lush Gabriel Park all within walking distance','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6e66f40b-12c8-4298-98c3-62deb321f6c0.jpg',2027604,18,'45.4644154','-122.7157624',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,89.00,1,10,62,4.94,658853909872369844),(2685,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/658933295553087847','Adorable modern studio ADU private guest suite','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place in the heart of Multnomah Village. Close to OHSU and a quick drive downtown or to Eastside. You\'re also only a short walk to all the great restaurants and pubs in the Village.<br /><br />This ADU has a private entrance, located above detached garage, with a garden view. Studio apt. with Murphy bed is perfect for couples or the solo traveller. Comes fully furnished with induction hot plate, coffee pot and microwave. No laundry on site.','Multnomah Village is a quiet, walkable neighborhood in Southwest Portland. Food carts, coffee shops, restaurants and bakeries all await. Plus some great pubs and the best beer and wine selection in the city at John’s Market.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-658933295553087847/original/30583642-76a1-410c-a670-2b6c422d1a28.jpg',275331592,18,'45.47045','-122.70394',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,98.00,2,30,32,4.94,658933295553087847),(2686,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/659400646012326892','Charming 1 bedroom apt+ shared patio and hot tub','Just what you need to make your Portland stay a breeze! Steps from the historic Mississippi neighborhood with shops, restaurants, and bars. Your basement unit has its own private entrance.  Apartment complete with smart TV, bedroom, its own private bathroom, kitchenette, sitting room with dedicated work station, and wifi. Friendly and respectful owners living in the main house. You\'ll have shared use of the patio and well-maintained hottub. Laundromat is a block away. On-street parking is free.','Mississippi Avenue is a North Portland neighborhood that was established in the late 1800s. The stretch of Mississippi Avenue between North Skidmore and North Fremont Streets is home to an eclectic mix of bars, restaurants, retailers, food carts, spas, hairstylists and other businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-659400646012326892/original/90868b53-fda4-46f6-8059-97248014b351.jpeg',54429267,9,'45.55222','-122.67404',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,364,41,4.85,659400646012326892),(2687,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/659767601130305492','Open garden studio in the heart of the SE Portland','This spacious and open floor plan garden studio is in the heart of SE Portland. Within steps of the Belmont District, a few blocks from Hawthorne Blvd, Division St, Stark St, 28th & Burnside, and so much more. You can easily walk, bike, or bus to awesome places to see, drink, eat, visit, etc. An excellent launching point for all of the Rose City, we are a short bike ride or bus to Downtown, museums, and concert venues. Enjoy all that Portland has to offer at this centrally-located neighborhood.','SE Portland is a foodie, craft beer/wine/distillery, vintage shop haven. Located a few blocks from the Hawthorne District, the Goat Blocks, 28th & E Burnside, there are endless options of vintage and indie shops, coffee houses, restaurants, bars, breweries, and food carts. Plus the Belmont District boasts its own mix of aforementioned options. <br /><br />Some of the best restaurants and music venues Portland has to offer can be found within a short walk, bike ride, or bus ride from this property and neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-659767601130305492/original/9a8f8347-093c-4c0d-8b58-2fc7abbf44c5.jpeg',45108209,32,'45.51516','-122.64256',1,4,1.00,0.00,2.00,100.00,2,14,156,4.99,659767601130305492),(2688,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/659947146669887391','You Found it! 4 Convenient Units, Pet-Friendly','Nestled among the heart of Downtown Portland’s entertainment district, cultural highlights and notable attractions surround you. Just a short five-minute walk will find you the Pioneer Courthouse Square and the world-famous Powell’s Books. Spend your time exploring the lively city streets or get outdoors at nearby trails, waterfront parks or nearby golf courses. Whatever you choose, this city will always have something new waiting for you to check out.','O\'Bryant Square 0.1 miles <br />U.S. Bancorp Tower 0.1 miles <br />Gerding Theater at Armory Building 0.1 miles <br />Powell\'s City of Books 0.1 miles <br />Galleria Center Shopping Center 0.1 miles <br />Pioneer Place 0.2 miles <br />Lan Su Chinese Garden 0.3 miles <br />Portland Art Museum 0.4 miles <br />Portland Union Station 0.4 miles <br /> Portland International Airport 6.2 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-659947146669887391/original/9a23d47c-5220-4dd0-9d15-2993d740fbd0.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52179','-122.67881',4,16,4.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,659947146669887391),(2689,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/659947812990469867','Prime Location! 3 Comfortable Units, Pets Allowed','Nestled among the heart of Downtown Portland’s entertainment district, cultural highlights and notable attractions surround you. Just a short five-minute walk will find you the Pioneer Courthouse Square and the world-famous Powell’s Books. Spend your time exploring the lively city streets or get outdoors at nearby trails, waterfront parks or nearby golf courses. Whatever you choose, this city will always have something new waiting for you to check out.','O\'Bryant Square 0.1 miles <br />U.S. Bancorp Tower 0.1 miles <br />Gerding Theater at Armory Building 0.1 miles <br />Powell\'s City of Books 0.1 miles <br />Galleria Center Shopping Center 0.1 miles <br />Pioneer Place 0.2 miles <br />Lan Su Chinese Garden 0.3 miles <br />Portland Art Museum 0.4 miles <br />Portland Union Station 0.4 miles <br /> Portland International Airport 6.2 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-659947812990469867/original/f7f1e7ed-7cfa-4483-b7c9-83945eb5f79e.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52179','-122.67881',4,12,3.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,659947812990469867),(2690,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/659948652749547626','Portland\'s Hidden Gem! 2 Great Units, Pets Allowed','Nestled among the heart of Downtown Portland’s entertainment district, cultural highlights and notable attractions surround you. Just a short five-minute walk will find you the Pioneer Courthouse Square and the world-famous Powell’s Books. Spend your time exploring the lively city streets or get outdoors at nearby trails, waterfront parks or nearby golf courses. Whatever you choose, this city will always have something new waiting for you to check out.','O\'Bryant Square 0.1 miles <br />U.S. Bancorp Tower 0.1 miles <br />Gerding Theater at Armory Building 0.1 miles <br />Powell\'s City of Books 0.1 miles <br />Galleria Center Shopping Center 0.1 miles <br />Pioneer Place 0.2 miles <br />Lan Su Chinese Garden 0.3 miles <br />Portland Art Museum 0.4 miles <br />Portland Union Station 0.4 miles <br /> Portland International Airport 6.2 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-659948652749547626/original/ac098dab-1416-4f8c-a4aa-6b36054cfa13.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52179','-122.67881',4,8,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,659948652749547626),(2691,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/659948853802404078','Great Location Near Oregon Zoo, Pets Allowed','Nestled among the heart of Downtown Portland’s entertainment district, cultural highlights and notable attractions surround you. Just a short five-minute walk will find you the Pioneer Courthouse Square and the world-famous Powell’s Books. Spend your time exploring the lively city streets or get outdoors at nearby trails, waterfront parks or nearby golf courses. Whatever you choose, this city will always have something new waiting for you to check out.','O\'Bryant Square 0.1 miles <br />U.S. Bancorp Tower 0.1 miles <br />Gerding Theater at Armory Building 0.1 miles <br />Powell\'s City of Books 0.1 miles <br />Galleria Center Shopping Center 0.1 miles <br />Pioneer Place 0.2 miles <br />Lan Su Chinese Garden 0.3 miles <br />Portland Art Museum 0.4 miles <br />Portland Union Station 0.4 miles <br /> Portland International Airport 6.2 miles',