 With the city slogan of \"Keep Portland Weird,\" there is not a lack of unique things to explore in this very walkable city. Head downtown to visit iconic stops like Voodoo Doughnuts, Powell bookstore (among other small bookstores), the Portland Japanese Garden, or rent a bike along the waterfront path.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-660016538100493547/original/ebb3e56b-dd27-4fbf-a7a7-34c4451b71da.jpeg',466054612,53,'45.44468','-122.72484',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,2,30,99,4.94,660016538100493547),(2694,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/660079319216133534','Charming 1BR 1st-Floor | Patio | Washer/Dryer','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-660079319216133534/original/3ab69345-e5ec-4475-9491-208614d209f9.jpeg',111798260,9,'45.54875','-122.66497',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,108.00,1,1125,11,4.73,660079319216133534),(2695,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/660108525587383727','KEX Portland-Bunk in a Small Bunk Room-Mixed','Each bunk is equipped with canvas privacy curtains and in-bunk storage, electrical outlet, reading light and large drawers to securely store belongings.  Just down the hall and throughout the building are multiple shared, individual locking bathrooms, each with its own shower.  All beds come with linen & personal bath towels.ots from this hip place. The size of the room is 123-160 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-660108525587383727/original/141b8b17-cb50-4414-80c4-d2ce2c49329b.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.523','-122.66186',3,1,5.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,1,28,11,4.73,660108525587383727),(2696,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/660117967354180645','KEX Portland-Small Bunk Shared Bath-Female Only','Each bunk is equipped with canvas privacy curtains and in-bunk storage, electrical outlet, reading light and large drawers to securely store belongings.  Just down the hall and throughout the building are multiple shared, individual locking bathrooms, each with its own shower.  All beds come with linen & personal bath towels. The size of the room is 123-160 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-660117967354180645/original/183c2f71-5320-426a-9ef0-cae5cac63a00.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.52488','-122.6624',2,4,11.00,1.00,4.00,179.00,1,28,0,1.00,660117967354180645),(2697,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/660119213265372932','KEX Portland-Bunk in a Small Bunk Room-Female Only','This listing is only for our female travelers. Each bunk is equipped with canvas privacy curtains and in-bunk storage, electrical outlet, reading light and large drawers to securely store belongings.  Just down the hall and throughout the building are multiple shared, individual locking bathrooms, each with its own shower.  All beds come with linen & personal bath towels. The size of the room is 123-160 sq ft.','KEX is just across the Willamette River from downtown, only a 10 minute walk across the Burnside Bridge. In addition to being close to downtown, the Central Eastside neighborhood where KEX is located is filled with great restaurants, coffee, shopping, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-660119213265372932/original/cb9bfdcd-6222-4501-a136-bdd64cf7fbab.jpeg',325943042,12,'45.5249','-122.66245',3,1,5.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,1,28,4,4.25,660119213265372932),(2698,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/660470564616496766','Cozy & Private Alberta Arts Backyard Cottage','Charming Backyard Cottage in Portland, Oregon<br /><br />Welcome to our delightful one-bedroom backyard cottage in the heart of Portland, Oregon. Nestled in a peaceful residential neighborhood, this home offers the perfect blend of cozy comfort and convenient city living.<br /><br />The cottage features a full kitchen, complete with all the essentials you need to whip up a delicious meal or brew your morning coffee.<br /><br />25% discount offered for stays of 28+ days.','Quiet and safe neighborhood three blocks from the popular Alberta Arts district. Short walk to many great restaurants, bars, shops, and galleries. <br />Whole Foods 1/2 mile away<br />Two very nice city parks within 1 mile radius. <br />15 minute drive to downtown attractions including Powell’s books and Saturday Market. <br />15 minute drive to Portland International Airport.<br />1 hour drive to Multnomah Falls.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e2e8a491-230d-4965-8dce-70770c36e38f.jpg',27983728,6,'45.55521','-122.64753',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,17,5.00,660470564616496766),(2699,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/661211103109997839','Modern 2BR Alberta Arts w/ Kitchen, Yard & Laundry','Stay in our spacious 2-bedroom apartment in Portland, Oregon. Enjoy a full kitchen, yard, and in-unit washer for laundry / dryer. The main bedroom has a queen bed and large closet, 2nd room has a workstation / desk & full bed, ideal for remote workers. Immerse yourself in the vibrant food scene on Alberta. Yes, we\'re pet friendly (upon pet approval)! Enjoy key-less entry and fast WiFi. There is ample free street parking, no permit required. This is a fully private apartment beneath our home.','Historically known as the focal point of Portland culture, Alberta lives up to expectations and supplies residents and visitors with the best of Artistic Culture, Fine Dining, and Artisan shopping. On the last Thursday of every month there is an art walk that features galleries and shops during the winter months, and array of local artisan vendors lining the streets in the summer months. Aside from the bustling urban culture, Alberta features charming residential areas just steps from the exciting bohemian culture. Walk to attractions such as Alberta Park and Mcmenamins Kennedy school or venture out 25 miles to Multnomah falls, 65 miles to Mt. Hood, and 70 miles to Oregon Coast, etc.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-661211103109997839/original/0498aa72-f990-4b76-868e-6d744d04ca0e.jpeg',179283335,29,'45.5603574','-122.65068',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,77.00,2,1125,143,4.90,661211103109997839),(2700,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/661556710038890071','Tabor Bungalow','Bright Tabor bungalow perfect for couples, young families, and professionals! Coffee shops, restaurants, and Hinterland Bar & food pod blocks away & Mt Tabor within walking distance. Open floor plan, skylights, wood floors, architect-built. Fast WiFi, full kitchen with gas range and a lux island overlooking a spacious backyard. Call this place home for all your Portland visits!<br /><br />One small, approved dog may be welcome if you are a very conscious pet owner and agree to keep the home clean.','Mt Tabor is a lovely area of Portland with many nice older homes tucked into quiet neighborhood streets. Climb the hill up Mount Tabor and you’ll have some stunning views with beautiful scenery and the Portland skyline off in the distance. Mount Tabor Park is one of the largest in Southeast Portland, and it takes up a significant chunk of the neighborhood. It’s complete with everything you could want, including a community garden, dog park, picnic area, and plenty of hiking trails. You can also play tennis or basketball at the courts on site, and a playground ensures that the little ones have fun too. Mount Tabor Park is also home to one of Portland’s reservoirs, so residents can be sure that their water is fresh from the source.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-661556710038890071/original/d9785d12-f360-454a-b229-5058ba48fca9.jpeg',6989662,15,'45.50755','-122.61083',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,200.00,2,60,22,4.91,661556710038890071),(2701,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/661892578124228196','Happy To Be Home','Welcome to Andy’s home.<br /><br />Here you will find a clean cozy half basement guesthouse with everything you need when traveling with family and friends - full kitchen, washer, dryer, street parking or off street parking. It is a half basement level so usually a little colder. Convenient location near public transportations. Short distance to grocery stores, restaurants, shopping malls, movie theater, bowling alley. 17 minutes to downtown and 15 minutes to airport by car.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2a7e13c6-775f-49a7-ab8f-51fe59353f9a.jpg',102800396,78,'45.48972','-122.54361',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,2,300,101,4.95,661892578124228196),(2702,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/663295482632521527','Boho Chic Secret Garden Suite','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. Enjoy bright mornings on your private patio overlooking our beautiful backyard garden and sleep tight in the extra cozy queen bed. The bathroom boasts a clawfoot tub to soak away your travel stress, and free street parking means you can easily get around town to see the gorgeous nature of the PNW and find plenty of delicious food along the way. Our newest addition is our hot tub, housed in the backyard solarium, perfect for a post-hike soak.','We\'re located in the Mill Park neighborhood of SE Portland, with easy access to SE Division St, Interstate 205 and 84. PDX airport is 6 miles away and we have bus lines and the Max (light rail) nearby for public transportation. Our neighborhood is friendly and you\'ll see folks walking their dogs and kiddos biking on the side streets.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-663295482632521527/original/129e9742-61ed-4b8b-8039-62d871b37067.jpeg',16870156,90,'45.50742','-122.54743',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,2,1125,81,4.96,663295482632521527),(2703,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/663800915593630505','Cozy 2-bedroom cottage in Historic Irvington PDX','This quaint 2 bed 1 bath house is located on a quiet street in the historic Irvington neighborhood. Set back from the street surrounded by trees, you\'ll feel like you\'ve escaped from the city in the private, shaded, and fenced backyard. The kitchen has been recently renovated with spacious layout. French doors in the dining room open to backyard for an indoor/outdoor dining experience.<br />Walk score 83<br />Bike Score 97','Historic Irvington Neighborhood is located in Northeast Portland. The beautiful Irving Park is one block away!<br />We are located within walking distance to local cafes, restaurants and grocery stores. <br />Popular areas for shopping, eating and nightlife include N Williams, Mississippi, Alberta.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-663800915593630505/original/ae0ae6cf-4d83-4c75-99f2-ffa4f1b43f81.jpeg',20542428,7,'45.54253','-122.65669',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,120,0,1.00,663800915593630505),(2704,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/664087898786528202','Charming Private Yellow Cottage','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish one-bedroom cottage located in a peaceful and accessible North Portland neighborhood. Enjoy lounging under the Redwood trees right outside your cottage, or cooking on a 5-burner Bosch gas stove in your full kitchen. Enjoy the historic 1900\'s hardwood floors and new European appliances. Drive or bike to multiple awesome neighborhoods within 6-10 minutes. After a long day, enjoy the tiled walk-in shower and dream sweetly on your queen Casper mattress.','Neighborhood: Quiet, inclusive, safe neighborhood within walking distance to historic Peninsula Park (check out the rose gardens and community pool!) and coffeeshops/restaurants. It\'s the perfect blend of being far enough away from the bustle that you can put your feet up and enjoy the quiet, but close enough that you could bike to enjoy the bustle in ten minutes. <br /><br />Things to do: You will be blocks from coffeeshops, food trucks, New Seasons Market, Dekum Triangle (Breakside Brewery, Firehouse Restaurant, Farmer\'s Market) and about one to 1.5 miles from multiple awesome neighborhoods with shops, restaurants, breweries, two McMenamins (Kennedy School and Chapel Pub), studios, gyms, etc. on N. Killingsworth, N. Williams and N. Mississippi. <br /><br />Proximity (by car):<br />- 15 mins from PDX airport<br />- 11 mins from downtown Portland<br />- 9 mins from University of Portland<br />- 7 mins form the Moda Center<br /><br />Grocery: Close to numerous grocery stores including N','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-664087898786528202/original/25c26644-89c9-4817-929b-6d365f015bdf.jpeg',47895705,48,'45.57080360764506','-122.67005955621464',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,104.00,2,365,147,5.00,664087898786528202),(2705,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/664388309210242596','Artsy Mid-Century Bungalow - Walk to Alberta','Make yourself at home at this beautiful, sundrenched, artistic, craftsman bungalow. Located 4 blocks from Alberta Arts Corridor, and a bike ride away from the Mississippi Arts District and Williams Street, this centrally located home provides amazing access to so much of what Portland has to offer. Come home and relax in your warm and inviting home away from home.','The Alberta Arts District is a fun, creative, quirky, quintessential Portland neightborhood full of unique boutiques, cafes, and restaurants. It is located along Alberta Street, between NE 12th and NE 33rd Streets. Alberta Arts District is best known for:<br /><br />  - A lively arts community that throws a big party every Last Thursday of the <br />    month<br />  - Funky galleries, independently owned boutiques, coffee shops, and <br />     restaurants<br />  - One of Portlands most culturally diverse neighborhoods, with many African- <br />     American and Latino-owned businesses','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-664388309210242596/original/2dde464a-1f31-4665-ab3c-2d1afb35de6e.jpeg',1618,29,'45.56367','-122.65251',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,3,730,23,4.74,664388309210242596),(2706,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/664690740524633440','Garden view 1-bedroom B&B with indoor fireplace.','A unique place to set the stage for a memorable trip in beautiful Portland, Oregon. With our convenient location you\'ll be minutes away from downtown Portland, multiple Farmers Markets, dozens of hiking trails, OHSU,  number of local cafes, food trucks, and breweries. Easy access to I-5 and I-217 allows you to visit dozens of local wineries and farms in under 1 hour. Quiet and safe neighborhood within a walking distance to Dickinson park to watch sunsets.','Quiet, friendly neighborhood with a country feel, surrounded by big old trees. Peaceful and relaxing.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-664690740524633440/original/3e34b74b-42ed-4988-bb0c-8af9c28e70b6.jpeg',1450850,34,'45.45344','-122.73488',2,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,89.00,1,14,21,5.00,664690740524633440),(2707,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/665283275138352573','Cozy and Modern Lower-Level Apartment','Welcome! Enjoy the comfy new queen beds, new stainless steel appliances, Art TV, and a workspace in the 2nd bedroom, ready for remote working.<br /><br />Close to University of Portland, St. Johns, and Kenton neighborhoods.<br /><br />Walk 3 blocks to New Seasons for local groceries. Explore nearby restaurants, coffee, breweries, shops, and events. <br /><br />This is a daylight basement apartment with your own separate entrance via garage - look for the green door. The hosts live upstairs.','We are located in the Portsmouth neighborhood with so much to offer! The Airbnb is situated across from a cute bookstore, 2 blocks from a classic western dive bar and Thai takeout, 3 blocks from New Seasons Grocery and just a short drive to both the St. John’s and Kenton neighborhoods with great local businesses, parks, and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-665283275138352573/original/3a3c1e10-eda6-4923-92d4-3bcc5eddf662.jpeg',1696816,60,'45.58736','-122.72914',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,141,4.99,665283275138352573),(2708,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/666750717055505359','Bright & Spacious 2br/2ba w/ Skylights','1200 sq ft of sunlight and custom wood counter tops<br /> <br />Relax on the deck with a drink from your own private kegerator at our 2 br/ 2ba 2nd floor unit with a private entrance up the cedar stairs.<br /><br />Kitchen is fully stocked and equipped with a gorgeous custom butcher block island, gas cast iron stove, large stainless steel fridge/freezer, dishwasher and kegerator.<br /><br />Dog friendly for up to 2 well-behaved pups with pet fee. (Supervised at all times)<br /><br />Owner lives below & shares the yard and laundry.','Walking distance from University of Portland, parks, restaurants, bars, and coffee.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/58bcaa8f-ec2c-4e10-b5ec-68fe98741eae.jpg',78620294,57,'45.57767','-122.72115',1,8,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,20,4.95,666750717055505359),(2709,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/668206718092663882','Modern Home in Walkable Neighborhood, BBQ + Patio!','Welcome to Alberta Retreat, your upscale spacious home in the walkable Alberta Arts  District in Northeast, Portland! <br /><br />✓ Fully equipped chef\'s kitchen for longer stays<br />✓Large Patio with for BBQ’ing<br />✓Office Space w/printer<br />✓Private washer & dryer<br />✓Private Driveway for 2 cars <br />✓ Smart TV with 65in screen<br />✓ 5 minute walk to coffee shops, restaurants, boutiques & parks<br />✓ Fast, seamless WiFi<br />✓ Central Heating & Air<br />✓ Pet-friendly & non-smoking<br />✓ Complimentary Gym Equipment','It\'s hard to describe the Alberta Arts District and the surrounding neighborhoods in just a small typed box. <br /><br />The hype is real, you just need to go explore it and find out for yourself all what everyone\'s talking about! So many amazing restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, craft breweries and other things to do that you\'ll never be bored.<br /><br />Just step outside this little haven and have tons of fun for as long as you stay!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-668206718092663882/original/68d44297-0fb9-4592-b2ba-cbb5952f5162.jpeg',53371722,29,'45.5602578','-122.6509649',1,8,2.50,4.00,4.00,153.00,30,1125,134,4.97,668206718092663882),(2710,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/668314893844780906','Cozy home in Sellwood, walk to dining & parks.','This single family residence located in Sellwood, and within walking distance to coffee shops, restaurants and bars. Public transit is just around the corner to catch a bus or train to OHSU or to downtown. Whether you’re working from home or just visiting, you will find this central location a perfect place to experience Portland.','Sellwood is a great place for families and couples young and old! This neighborhood is safe to walk around with several parks nearby(about a mile walk is the Westmoreland park). There’s great food, coffee and bars within walking distance. Qfc is nearby if you need some quick groceries but Trader Joe’s is a good go to as well. <br /><br />I enjoy how centrally located this place is without being in downtown. Taking transit is remarkably easy by catching the 70, 17 or 19 bus or the orange line.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/42a78d41-c157-4885-899d-46f1c409bb92.jpg',23251845,20,'45.48203','-122.6436',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,1125,1,5.00,668314893844780906),(2711,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/668715745896879192','Chic Portland Studio w/ Stunning City Views!','Experience all the perks of city living at this Portland vacation rental! This 1-bathroom studio boasts an ideal location within walking distance of Downtown, as well as an in-unit washer and dryer, 2 workstations, and a full kitchen. Here, you\'ll find everything you need for a memorable couple\'s getaway or remote-work retreat. Opt to venture out and you can shop and dine nearby, visit Washington Park and the Portland Zoo, or walk across the street to enjoy a Timbers game at Providence Park!','WALKABLE (<0.5 miles): The Civic Taproom & Bottle Shop (on-site), Providence Park (across the street), Portland Gear, Next Level Burger West Burnside, Coco Donuts Uptown, HunnyMilk, Kingston Sports Bar & Grill, Wildwood Saloon, Marathon Taverna, Elephants Delicatessen, Ke’s Artisan Bakery, Kells Brewery, Grassa, Cheryl’s on 12th <br />AREA ATTRACTIONS: Powell’s City of Books (0.6 miles), Portland Art Museum (0.7 miles), The Freakybuttrue Peculiarium & Museum (1.2 miles), Portland Saturday Market (1.5 miles), Moda Center (1.6 miles), Oregon Museum of Science & Industry (1.9 miles), Pittock Mansion (2.1 miles), Oaks Amusement Park (5.8 miles) <br />OPT OUTSIDE: Couch Park (0.3 miles), Washington Park (0.5 miles), Director Park (0.6 miles), North Park Blocks (0.7 miles), South Park Blocks (0.8 miles), Portland Japanese Garden (1.0 miles), International Rose Test Garden (1.0 miles), Salmon Street Springs (1.1 miles), Keller Fountain Park (1.2 miles), Macleay Park (1.5 miles), Hoyt Arboretu','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-668715745896879192/original/a2faece9-5d9d-4d77-a6d9-b85d78ab2b02.jpeg',121688409,3,'45.52254','-122.69057',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,2,5.00,668715745896879192),(2712,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/669305353590719807','Modern, Upgraded Apartment -  free parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-669305353590719807/original/294a0235-7863-42d2-b211-8c487eaae383.jpeg',466495851,2,'45.528785926699896','-122.68201929650164',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,368.00,30,1125,0,1.00,669305353590719807),(2713,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/669317123420077294','Great Spacious Apartment - Free Parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-669317123420077294/original/67366ba6-5461-4b59-887d-611e9d5be94b.jpeg',466495851,2,'45.53053','-122.68129',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,452.00,30,1125,0,1.00,669317123420077294),(2714,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/669506825858487742','Peaceful 2-Bedroom home with off-street parking','You will love the quiet, comfort, safety, and creativity of this home. Rooms are simple and comfortable with neutral colors and live house plants. The kitchen is well equipped and stocked with essentials for those who want to cook a meal, but simple and functional for those who just need fridge space or coffee/ tea. The home sits at the top of a hill in the beautiful and family-oriented Maplewood neighborhood of southwest Portland. Maplewood Coffee & Tea is an excellent cafe only 0.2 miles away.','Maplewood is a safe and tight-knit family neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4e56ff6e-6730-49e0-80d6-626d38a48084.jpg',14821108,75,'45.47331664993261','-122.73063383996485',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,6,31,15,4.93,669506825858487742),(2715,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/669599855382680760','Spacious, bright garden studio on Peninsula Park','Explore the world-class restaurants, coffee shops and bars in the nearby Williams and Mississippi districts. Take a stroll around the award winning (and oldest) rose garden in the City of Roses across the street in Peninsula Park. At home, this second story studio has extra space in the meditation loft, a full kitchen, fast internet, and projector for streaming. Enjoy your private deck over the shared garden with hammock and H/C outdoor shower. Bus and train nearby with ample on-street parking.','Walking distance to Williams District, Mississippi, Killingsworth, Alberta Arts.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-669599855382680760/original/1a379419-2297-498e-ad93-d2b4f745b759.jpeg',88152288,48,'45.56888','-122.67473',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,83.00,2,182,160,4.99,669599855382680760),(2716,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/669609421306508434','Spacious home w/outdoor sauna near bars & eateries','Feel at home in our spacious craftsman in North Portland\'s Overlook neighborhood. Lovely and walkable area, close to restaurants, bars, coffee shops, and Adidas campus. Built in 1909, home retains beautiful vintage character with modern comforts and sits on a large yard with a barrel sauna. Easy access to I-5, Max trains and bus line.<br />Great spot for families, friends, or business travelers.  <br /><br />The property is shared with a separate apartment where your hosts, Colin & Holly reside.','Walkable, lovely neighborhood, predominantly residential. Killingsworth street, half block away, has an eclectic mix of a bars, coffee shops and restaurants. <br />Easy access to public transportation band highway. Roughly a 20-30 minute ride on the Yellow line Max train to downtown, or a 5-10 minute drive. <br /><br />We are also close to Kenton and Mississippi neighborhoods, Adidas campus, Portland Community College and University of Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-669609421306508434/original/a7e84782-d4b7-4f12-9776-e9bcfd3531db.jpeg',6739097,13,'45.563640206763154','-122.68885608762503',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,185.00,3,29,105,4.96,669609421306508434),(2717,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/670511637834568872','Cheerful 4 bedroom home with a Jacuzzi tub','Bring the whole family to this great place with lots of room for fun.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-670511637834568872/original/7b3f976f-e066-4070-9d9b-c991b7f90bac.jpeg',371974160,63,'45.5070601','-122.5252662',1,6,3.00,4.00,5.00,295.00,30,730,15,4.27,670511637834568872),(2718,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/671219502584869415','Sleek Urban Oasis - Remodeled 2BR in Popular FoPo!','Relax at this renovated ranch w/ fenced yard in central Foster-Powell. Two bedrooms each w/ large closet, w/ king and full beds. Full bath with walk-in shower.  Stunning kitchen w/ brand new SS appliances. Open concept living room spills into dining. Electric fireplace, large windows and ample natural light.  50” smart TV w/ streaming apps. Utility room with shared laundry and new washer/dryer. Fenced backyard for pets. Minutes to shops/restaurants/bars/parks. Bike score - 100. Walk score - 82.','Kerns Park, which features a field and a playground is just 1 block away. If you have dogs, the field is an unofficial dog area. There are tons of shops, cafes, bars and restaurants on Foster, about a 5-10 minute walk away!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-671219502584869415/original/79a2fb0a-a3a1-48b4-ae5f-8bcafb987930.jpeg',60630727,36,'45.4955801540111','-122.59356552754186',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,30,200,0,1.00,671219502584869415),(2719,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/671858254574642141','Adorable 1 bedroom guest house','Private guest house. ALL new furniture  Cookware, bedding , silverware, mattress, ALL NEW 10/23/24<br />Cook up a feast in the full size kitchen, w/microwave, Keurig coffee, & all cooking needs and essentials! <br />Super hot shower, heat plus AC, pet allowed. <br />Gated parking, shared yard & outdoor security cameras. <br />Upstairs is top outside deck w/laundry plus whatever storage you may need. (It’s one room with only the washer/dryer in it).','It’s very quiet street as all the people own their own homes. Location wise it’s central to everything with fast freeway access or cycle way to anywhere. <br />Parks are everywhere. Mt tabor, Powell butte, local ones and more. <br />Close to local to many restaurants, gym, bars and shopping, they’re all walking distance!! Examples: the Zoiglhaus brewery & food hall, flipside bar and carts, and 82nd is full of restaurants and shopping not too far.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/43dfec82-8c65-4ac0-bb7b-bae66b79bab9.jpg',469701702,72,'45.48004131075059','-122.56133817136289',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,66.00,30,365,20,4.50,671858254574642141),(2720,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/673987542017094388','The Happy Place - 2BD Sellwood Creative Retreat','Welcome to \'The Happy Place,\' a tranquil, modern retreat within a charming 1908 Craftsman home that shares its space with a portrait photo studio. Designed by artists, this lower-level haven is thoughtfully filled with treasures—artwork, books, games, and everything you need for a comfortable stay, right down to the cozy slippers. Here, creativity abounds, making it more than just a place to rest; it\'s an experience of inspiration and comfort in the vibrant Sellwood Moreland neighborhood.','Sellwood Moreland, on Portland’s southern edge, is just three miles from downtown. It’s the perfect blend of small-town charm and big-city amenities. Explore a lively 2-mile stretch of restaurants, boutiques, cafes, and food carts. Nature lovers will find plenty nearby, with wildlife reserves, riverfront views, and beautiful public parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-673987542017094388/original/ffde84b9-b7c6-4a51-98a4-fbf4a535dc8f.jpeg',2526625,20,'45.46361','-122.64981',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,150.00,2,28,104,4.99,673987542017094388),(2721,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/674092406780609521','Cheerful 2-bedrooms, parking, private entry.','Two cozy bedrooms right in the heart of SE Portland!  This is newer construction, with brand-new appliances, and new furniture - it all feels fresh and clean. The kitchen is fully stocked with all of your cooking needs, it\'s like your home away from home.<br /><br />The neighborhood is within walking distance of coffee shops, food carts, and public transportation. Very accessible to I-205, MAX line, and PDX airport. A great place to call your home base while on vacation - or even remote working.','Quiet neighborhood near  Lents Park with plenty of areas to play and outdoor activities. Plenty of street parking and access to freeways, Clackamas Town Center, Eastport Plaza, food cars, and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6Njc0MDkyNDA2NzgwNjA5NTIx/original/90de88a6-5e65-45f3-a8b6-3d5e60a43f37.jpeg',85798968,72,'45.48651','-122.57656',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,360,17,4.94,674092406780609521),(2722,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/674550968953011743','Heron Cottage, Urban Retreat-King Bed','The Heron Cottage was built in 1914 and was part of a network of small farms that existed in what was then the hinderlands of Portland.   Now it\'s an urban vest pocket neighborhood with easy access to a regional hospital, light rail, bus routes and freeways.  This is a pedestrian neighborhood with very narrow streets.  We know our neighbors and enjoy the cultural diversity of this little enclave.   The cottage\'s front porch beckons you to slow down, relax and maybe even make some new friends.','The neighborhood around Heron Cottage PDX is diverse, friendly and a bit quirky (in a good way).  We love it because it is within walking distance to so many things:  public transportation, grocery store and hospital.  The light rail gives you easy access to downtown Portland, PSU, the airport etc.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-674550968953011743/original/03ea0a5d-98f3-45f8-8437-a2b130612bb5.jpeg',32630833,52,'45.5285727','-122.6001984',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,96.00,2,30,86,4.98,674550968953011743),(2723,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/674585418783526567','Lovely 1-bedrom rental unit Portland, OR','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located apartment. Steps away from public transportation. Plenty of Shops, grocery stores, and restaurants nearby.','Grocery store, restaurants, bars all within walking distance. very convenient location.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/26371f5e-fde1-4c3e-87e4-2615235c2687.jpg',189964332,51,'45.57574','-122.68229',1,5,1.00,1.00,2.00,96.00,30,1125,57,4.77,674585418783526567),(2724,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/674708571417397325','Close-in Spacious Boho-Glam 1br Apartment by Park','Conveniently located & within a block of one of Portland\'s most beautiful parks, this private 1 br basement apartment features a mix of vintage & modern decor, curated to delight the senses & plenty of amenities to make your stay comfortable.<br /><br />Our walkable neighborhood offers grocery, restaurants, shops & bars for close-to-home enjoyment. You\'ll also be mere minutes from downtown plus trendy Mississippi & Alberta districts. Nearby public transportation includes light rail train & bus lines.','Exploring all Portland has to offer is easy from here with lots of options for getting places. There\'s tons to explore in the neighborhood by foot or bike. We have a high walk score and a perfect bike score. New Seasons Market, Cherry Sprout, Ethiopian and Asian markets are just down the street for grocery shopping. Restaurants, coffee shops, teahouse, dive bars, trendy shops, public library, brunch spot, record store, music venues, all within walking distance. Peninsula Park for walking, picnics, tennis, sunbathing and the must-see sunken, Rose Garden is just a block away. Trendy Mississippi and Alberta Street districts are a mere 5 minutes away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-674708571417397325/original/494e707c-5962-4fb8-8adf-0579af0f956f.jpeg',22682285,24,'45.56488467627353','-122.67573566138553',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,30,60,10,4.90,674708571417397325),(2725,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/674794424442832669','University Park Hideaway','Cozy North Portland studio in a quiet neighborhood near University of Portland, Cathedral Park and St. John\'s.   The unit is fully self contained with a private entrance.  It features a queen size bed, sofa bed, bathroom, and kitchenette.','The Hideaway is in North Portland between the University of Portland and St. John’s. St John’s feels like it’s own little town within Portland and has a number of cafes, restaurants and bars. The St. John’s food truck pod and the University of Portland are both within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/28515f08-c332-4557-9972-24af65308460.jpg',9013078,57,'45.58098','-122.7336',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,50.00,2,29,104,4.88,674794424442832669),(2726,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/674857657126531323','Cheerful historic Victorian w A/C, patio, firepit','Stay in this cute & cozy historic Victorian cottage close to restaurants, bars, shops, downtown Portland, and easy access to all the City of Roses has to offer. Live music venues nearby and easy access to highways, bike paths, and public transit. <br /><br />Enjoy the Pacific Northwest\'s best season with long summer evenings on the back patio, eat dinner outside, and light a fire in the firepit. Charcoal grill (+ charcoal) available on request. If the night gets chilly, warm up in the clawfoot tub.','The block itself is quiet and sleepy, and is surrounded by an urban, bustling, and vibrant portion of NE Portland with nightlife. Visit the nearby King Farmer\'s Market for fresh produce, or walk to a nearby restaurant or bar to enjoy Portland\'s amazing cuisine.<br /><br />The home is in the middle of the historic Eliot neighborhood, which has many charming Victorian cottages and grand old houses. Walk one block down the street to see historic homes with towers!  One of the houses a block away is in the National Register of Historic Places.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/552cadba-4aa8-4e89-bd6c-7d3adebaf807.jpg',114720959,26,'45.5383','-122.6623',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,1,6,7,4.86,674857657126531323),(2727,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/675614298438060598','Charming Basement Suite in Historic Laurelhurst','Perfect family friendly daylight basement close to everything Portland has to offer! <br /><br />Downtown Portland is only a few minutes drive, while all the trendy Eastside eateries are a 10 minute walk away! PLUS, free parking!<br /><br />We are a lively bunch living above you, and while we will do our best keeping it a quiet oasis for you and your guests, you may hear our children & pets from time to time.','Laurelhurst is a charming and historical landmark within Portland. The houses are traditional tudors and craftsman style houses, most of which are over 100 years old. I guarantee you will fall in love with this charming PDX neighborhood!<br /><br />There are also several parks within walking distance, all of which are great for kids and pets.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-675614298438060598/original/96e6032b-48ba-47e6-bf4d-60c5f3642199.jpeg',46669750,23,'45.53256','-122.6288',1,3,1.00,0.00,1.00,169.00,1,3,45,4.82,675614298438060598),(2728,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/675615805836588490','Cozy 2 bedroom house w/ patio and backyard!','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish 2 br/2ba space w/ private backyard. Centrally located and super walkable neighborhood near desirable Gladstone and Clinton streets , as well as close proximity to OHSU, downtown, and easy freeway access (all 10-15 minute drives).<br /><br />Please note: there isn\'t any parking on the property. The \"driveway\" is actually a shared space with the neighbor, and unfortunately, we don\'t have the ability to park a car there.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-675615805836588490/original/b5d2262d-6007-4cad-afa6-a0d8bc11e815.png',36297855,56,'45.49133','-122.64044',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,115.00,30,1125,30,4.97,675615805836588490),(2729,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/676281142555739574','Heart of Hawthorne bed and bath','Location, location! This spacious room is located between Hawthorne and Division and very close to Belmont and downtown - so many great places are just a short walk away. This basement space is inviting and cozy with a sofa seating area, a table for meals and a king size bed (converted twins). Amenities include microwave and mini fridge, lots of board games and a desk area for work. Private entrance and private bathroom with rain shower. Back garden deck and seating area available for use.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-676281142555739574/original/cb176f67-0f2b-4dee-81cf-bb706afdb06d.jpeg',77156023,8,'45.50912','-122.62551',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,80.00,1,28,46,4.89,676281142555739574),(2730,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/676331157348011700','Charming 1-bedroom condo in historic building','Located just off NE 28th Ave, this second-story condo is a few minutes\' walk from bars, restaurants, parks and shopping. The apartment building, constructed in 1930, is on the National Historic Registry with a beautiful brick exterior and Art-Deco design elements in the foyer and halls. A front courtyard sets the building off the street, providing privacy and blocking the sounds of the city so you can get work done or just relax while still being minutes away from all that Portland has to offer.','The Kerns neighborhood is located in Portland\'s central East Side, with many highly acclaimed restaurants and bars as well as vintage stores, coffee shops, and general shopping. Play a pickup game on the basketball court at Oregon Park, stop by Güero for a torta (as seen on Diners, Drive-Ins, and Dives!), and end your day with drinks at the Captured Beer Bus on 28th or a movie at Laurelhurst Theater!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-676331157348011700/original/fd3c2dc2-9d1e-4e67-9237-aa793858aeb2.jpeg',15054186,12,'45.52929','-122.63807',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,105.00,30,1125,7,5.00,676331157348011700),(2731,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/676333784462773641','Cozy modern guest suite in friendly neighboorhood','Enjoy your time in The City of Roses in our cozy & modern new guest suite. It has a full kitchen with a newly-installed induction stove, 100 Mbps wifi, a large comfy Queen bed and a full bathroom with a dual-head shower, washer, dryer, clean linens and complimentary bath amenities.<br /><br />A 5 min bike to local favs: Bipartisan Cafe, Lazy Susan, The Observatory, our historic Academy Theatre, and Montavilla Farmer\'s Market!<br /><br />10 min from the airport, 20 min from the Columbia Gorge and Bridal Veil Falls.','Very friendly family neighborhood with lots of pedestrians, dogs, and bikers.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-676333784462773641/original/9d5bd5e6-53c6-4c69-8566-f34cfdb25c3a.jpeg',387932205,10,'45.5137','-122.57386',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,30,91,51,4.51,676333784462773641),(2732,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/676978545437829993','Private Room (#2/2) in a Peaceful Home','Keep it simple at this peaceful home in a quiet neighborhood. Bedroom #2 is the smaller bedroom with basic furnishings and a large south facing window.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/65a4c12a-cf06-410f-a2b8-6f8eba56336c.jpg',14821108,75,'45.47331030197611','-122.73071866482498',2,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,7,90,23,4.91,676978545437829993),(2733,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/677557606844393309','Central PDX Craftsman!','Prime Location + luxury lodging! Home is located in the middle of SE Portland. The home is a short walk to many of the best restaurants and venues in Portland and is only a short drive to downtown. The home was recently renovated and boasts a fully featured kitchen, remodeled bathrooms, and an entertainment center ideal for movie nights and games.<br /><br />The home has five, very comfortable, beds.<br />One King<br />One Queen<br />One Daybed that transforms into Full<br />Two Rollable Twins<br /><br />Aesthetic by @maisonmsgiquepdx','Delightful tree-lined streets surrounded by historic homes and peaceful parks. This neighborhood boasts some of the best food Portland has to offer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-677557606844393309/original/c4b88151-3754-416a-ba5c-8f97340e2ea9.jpeg',219462395,32,'45.5155723','-122.6393539',1,5,1.50,2.00,5.00,103.00,2,365,140,4.96,677557606844393309),(2734,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/678235415193907867','Backyard Oasis in Amazing N Portland','Our newly built backyard studio complete with a modern bathroom, natural light from large windows, and French doors opening onto a spacious, covered deck. The deck connects to a charming Airstream fully equipped kitchen, cozy workspace, and a full-size bed. We are just steps from the light rail,  and walking distance to a  vibrant neighborhood  cozy cafes, parks, live music, and exceptional dining.The property includes high-speed internet, a Smart TV, and all essentials for a comfortable stay.','This quiet North Portland neighborhood is well-known for its growing restaurant scene and close proximity to downtown.  <br /><br />Fantastic Arbor Lodge home combines warm craftsman style with modern amenities & a superb layout that won\'t disappoint! Walkable to New Seasons, public transportation,  easy street parking in front. Uber-convenient location close to I-5, MAX, Mississippi, Adidas, Fire on the Mountain & The Alibi! <br /><br />The MAX stop is only a block away and connects you with the Airport, the Convention Center, the MODA Center, the Pearl District and Pioneer Square in the heart of downtown.    <br /><br />Great bars, food carts, yoga and coffee shops are at the end of our street and the popular N. Mississippi, N. Williams, and Alberta Arts districts are only a mile (a very inexpensive Lyft ride) away.  There is also a New Seasons grocery store within two blocks of the studio.<br /><br />Parking is unrestricted street parking, so no permit required and it\'s free and ava','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-678235415193907867/original/23fd1362-e7f4-4973-9f67-f5150852cedf.jpg',52609760,13,'45.5661','-122.68117',2,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,30,365,57,4.84,678235415193907867),(2735,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/678423328153488625','2 bd townhome near Nike & Intel -all new flooring!','Private newly remodeled stylish townhouse with views of woods and creek.  New LVT on first floor and new carpet on second floor.  New bigger sofa this week!<br />This is perfect when traveling to town for work or staying for a few months between homes.  2 parking spots, easy access to amenities, and office area with highspeed internet.  Walking distance to grocery and restaurants and easy access to major highways.  Close to Intel, Nike and OHSU','There is a grocery store with a Starbucks and a pharmacy with in walking distance.  The road is busy, but there is a path.  There are also several restaurants and pubs.  <br />There are several parts nearby: Gabriel Park, Hamilton Park and Albert Kelly Park.  There are also some great neighborhoods nearby with shopping and rrestaurants  Multnomah Village and Hillsdale are worth checking out.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6Njc4NDIzMzI4MTUzNDg4NjI1/original/cd5c440b-f47b-4ac3-aba2-2d767dc6bb97.jpeg',30942269,70,'45.48734839999999','-122.7278616',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,31,365,6,5.00,678423328153488625),(2736,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/678988598721794229','Adorable duplex getaway with balcony - walkable','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-678988598721794229/original/1f669f77-a50d-48d5-a2e0-89cf17aeef7b.jpeg',111798260,27,'45.52722','-122.6983',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,1,1125,49,4.71,678988598721794229),(2737,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/679008417453494488','The One With The View ~4bd/3ba incredible location','Gorgeous and updated.  The perfect option for work relocations, retreats, travel nurses, or extended family stays. Located within minutes to all Portland has to offer. Find us on IG:  theonewiththe.view','The Overlook neighborhood offers easy walkability to restaurants, bars and parks.  Conveniently located near both the adidas and Daimler Trucks N. American headquarters.  New Seasons and Fred Meyer grocery stores are minutes away by car or bike.  Short walk to Max Train.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-679008417453494488/original/b5337ac7-e6f0-4c41-8906-2ab1b899ac47.jpeg',6541481,13,'45.55878','-122.68903',1,9,3.00,4.00,6.00,219.00,30,365,3,5.00,679008417453494488),(2738,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/679164191653063506','Beautiful Apartment near OHSU & Downtown','500 sf apt. in a single-family house in friendly inner-SW Portland. Open living design with full kitchen, living space, bedroom with large closet. New stainless appliances, TV, rain shower, & towel warming rack. Craftsmanship throughout with shiplap accent walls, old-growth timber beam, custom concrete countertops, Italian kitchen backsplash & Japanese bathroom tile. Plenty of natural light. Shared laundry (washer/dryer) area. Outdoor patio & yard includes dining table and fire pit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-679164191653063506/original/817ad955-9683-4e2b-b5a5-fd1e5ede77de.jpeg',17932869,22,'45.48953','-122.67866',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,679164191653063506),(2739,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/679636681753414602','#InvestREPM Historic Kenton Guest House','#InvestREPM Historic Kenton! Private Guest House in popular Kenton neighborhood. Conveniently located to I-5, PDX & blocks to public transit (MAX), you can go anywhere in Portland without a car! Close to Adidas, University of Portland and bordering the Arbor Lodge neighborhood. Walk to local restaurants & shopping, Tastefully updated with comfortable furnishings, 1 bed/1 bath, Washer/Dryer, Kitchen, FREE Street Parking and private patio!  Stay, Relax, Enjoy!','Portland’s Kenton neighborhood is a dream for early risers, who can choose from a wide selection of delicious breakfast and coffee options. Both results of the revitalization efforts, coffeehouses Presso and Prince each offer a distinct ambiance and an elevated menu of beverages and snacks. There’s no wrong choice here, but Presso’s slightly larger menu and decadent coffee creations (hello, charcoal lavender latte!) are the perfect way to treat yourself. For a quick bite, choose from their selection of specialty toasts or pastry items. More substantial brunch and breakfast options can be found just next door at the brand new establishment, Derby’s.<br />Walking around Kenton can transport you to another place and time entirely, as the collection of businesses along historic Denver Avenue creates a feeling of small-town living. We encourage you to embrace this narrative and explore the main strip as a tourist. Like many small towns, there are plenty of gems to be found. Among them are t','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-679636681753414602/original/050342a8-a98e-4766-aac0-f9926a57560a.jpeg',434667229,55,'45.580856','-122.67942',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,59.00,30,120,0,1.00,679636681753414602),(2740,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/679899563389035921','Adorable Portland Retreat','Welcome to the City of Roses! Nestle into our adorable & freshly furnished suite in the incredibly walkable Ladd\'s Addition neighborhood in South East Portland.<br /><br />Walking distance to a ton of restaurants, coffee shops, vintage stores & more, our home has easy access to all our favorite Portland haunts! <br /><br />***<br />We\'re so excited for the opportunity to share a little piece of our home with you — your stay helps us achieve a longtime dream of hosting & sharing our love of travel, so thank you!','WELCOME TO PORTLAND! With the city slogan of \"Keep Portland Weird,\" there is no a lack of unique things to explore in this very walkable city. Head up Hawthorne Blvd to visit iconic stops like Lounge Lizard Vintage Furniture and sip coffee at TOV - a double decker coffee bus! Hop on the MAX to head downtown and explore the iconic Powell\'s bookstore, or head to the Forest Park area to explore the International Rose Test Garden, Portland\'s Japanese Garden, and learn some of the history of Portland with a side of incredible views at Pittock Mansion.  <br />If you are looking for more recommendations from locals who love it here, just ask!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-679899563389035921/original/40f647ee-a5db-4a52-8216-c4c9c1b4a742.jpeg',469663895,25,'45.5081','-122.65334',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,78.00,1,30,108,4.91,679899563389035921),(2741,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/680385292342148785','Byrnes Addition Classic Craftsman ~ 99 WalkScore','Welcome to our spacious 5-bedroom, 2500 square foot craftsman located in the heart of Portland\'s Central Eastside. Boasting a 99 WalkScore, you\'ll be steps away from restaurants, local shops, bookstores, and breweries.<br /><br />Our home combines Portlandia vintage charm with modern updates. It\'s fully equipped with stainless steel appliances, a large in-unit washer/dryer, and can comfortably accommodate up to 12 guests.<br /><br />With PDX airport just a 15-minute drive away, your Portland adventure starts here!','Nestled in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant and eclectic Laurelhurst neighborhood. This prime location offers the perfect blend of urban excitement and residential tranquility, making it an ideal base for your Portland adventures.<br /><br />The Laurelhurst neighborhood is renowned for its tree-lined streets, historic homes, and beautiful gardens. Just a short stroll away, you\'ll find the iconic Laurelhurst Park, a lush urban oasis featuring walking trails, a picturesque pond, and plenty of green space for picnics and relaxation. This beloved park is a favorite among locals and visitors alike, offering a peaceful retreat within the city.<br /><br />Food enthusiasts will delight in the proximity to some of Portland\'s best dining options. The nearby Kerns and Buckman neighborhoods are home to an array of top-rated restaurants, cafes, and food carts. Whether you\'re craving gourmet cuisine, a casual bite, or a freshly brewed cup of coffee, there\'s something to satisfy every palate. Don\'t mi','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-680385292342148785/original/48c1a071-fd4b-4e8d-bed0-5ffcfb55b4d3.jpeg',68847451,12,'45.52441','-122.64517',1,12,2.00,5.00,6.00,441.00,1,365,137,4.93,680385292342148785),(2742,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/680386853395826077','Comfy & Eclectic Craftsman Home; inner SE Portland','Located in the heart of Inner Southeast Portland\'s Waverly Heights neighborhood, The John Barleycorn Home  is just two blocks from Division & Clinton Street\'s best restaurants and shops. It is ideal for families, friends, small gatherings and exploring the neighborhood and city. The entire house, yard, front porch, deck and all the amenities are available. The house sleeps 5 easily. (Your host, an Airbnb Superhost since 2015, lives in the property\'s basement apartment, with separate entrance)','The John Barleycorn Guest House is in the Waverly Heights neighborhood in inner Southeast Portland. Just two blocks from Division Street and the Clinton Street Corner, home to many of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars and shops. The house is on Woodward Street, a quiet, safe street in a lovely, walkable neighborhood with eclectic houses and gardens. Plenty of parking and bike stations, and there\'s a kids\' pocket park a couple of blocks away, a nearby dog park, and organic grocery stores and coffee shops within walking distance. Waverly Heights was originally an Italian and German neighborhood...there\'s an old growth Western Red Cedar 3 blocks away where the neighbors gather to discuss important issues and events.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-680386853395826077/original/c6eabbcc-85cc-49b6-a557-f947d44b8794.jpeg',32168092,25,'45.50214380000001','-122.6363929',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,207.00,2,7,32,4.97,680386853395826077),(2743,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/680519123710389251','Sunny corner w/ open floor plan','Sunny open concept unit on main floor of beautiful 1947 home with second unit below.  Outdoor space in the front with a large deck. Easy street parking in front of home. The home is close to several fun areas to find new places to eat and shop. Several parks are within walking distance; with one of the city\'s oldest rose gardens and community pool just up the street. Located an easy walk from the bus line and Max train for city commuting. Quiet neighborhood with plenty of on street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9ba06a06-20a6-4f63-af9b-d454f9680ed9.jpg',3228077,48,'45.5714','-122.6704',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,98.00,30,700,6,5.00,680519123710389251),(2744,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/680549349971316539','Sweet two-bedroom home in a great NE PDX location','Located seconds away from Normandale Park, short walks to bus and Max lines, and a 10-minute walk from the Hollywood district, this is a great base for exploring Portland.  The home furnishings are modest and sparse with lots of plants and light, in a quiet neighborhood.  Covered, private, lit back patio has a grill, and is a great place to chill.  Fenced in back yard.','Great neighborhood for walks and bike rides! 1 minute walk to Normandale Park. 5 minute walk to New Deal Cafe. 10 minute walk to Barley Pod Beer & Food Carts. 15 minute walk to Hollywood District movie theater, restaurants, etc. Convenient to Max and bus lines, I-84 Interstate, and 53rd Ave Bike Boulevard.  Centrally located and close to great Portland places!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-680549349971316539/original/af1e1f81-66c4-43c0-9d95-63280374a7fa.jpeg',205093579,11,'45.531014','-122.6081749',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,3,5.00,680549349971316539),(2745,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/681735879647474008','Classic two bedroom home in portland proper','Centrally located craftsman home that has all amenities for basic living.  This unit is the entire top/main floor (not a basement or ADU) and completely private with its own entrance.  Home has central A/C for those hot summer days!<br /><br />We are a 5 min walk from buses, locally owned restaurants, convenience stores, grocery stores, beautiful Lents park and the famous 82nd st. <br /><br />The property is a duplex with a top/bottom unit. My wife and I will be living on the bottom floor with a separate entrance.','We are located in South East Portland and extremely close to a shopping center with tons of amazing food options, convenience stores, entrance to the freeway and public transport. <br /><br />- Bus is a 5 min walk away<br />- Subway is 11 min walk away<br />- Mexican, Korean, Vietnamese, Japanese food and more only a 5 min walk away<br />- Huge public park is a 2 min walk away<br />- Convenience store is a 5 min walk away<br />- Shopping center is a 5 min walk away<br /><br />With a walk score 85/100 and a bike score of 94/100. This is a non-vehicle users dream! But also extremely convenient for a vehicle user as you are mins away from freeways and major highways to easily get all around Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-681735879647474008/original/ae6357a4-8696-4060-a3dd-b7529434c33a.jpeg',92277999,72,'45.48476','-122.57422',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,87.00,1,29,115,4.95,681735879647474008),(2746,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/681789275269508432','Natural Light 3 bedroom on Alberta','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Although there are 2 bedrooms upstairs, there is also a smaller office that is also being used as a bedroom. There is a full bathroom upstairs. A 2nd bathroom with a shower is on the main floor. The fully fenced backyard is private with a beautiful bamboo pergola for shade and protection from the rain. A long driveway to park your car for the duration of your stay - walk to all shops, cafes and coop on Alberta, only a half-block away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-681789275269508432/original/03388c9b-89c6-4703-88b9-67365e702803.jpeg',1676487,29,'45.55816','-122.6507',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,475.00,30,365,0,1.00,681789275269508432),(2747,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/684223698083782025','Getaway in the city','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at our centrally-located basement apartment. We are easy driving distance to the 205 freeway and walking distance to the downtown Lents area, which has a farmer\'s market, great food carts, and wonderful local restaurants. We have a yard and deck that is set up for kids, dogs, and a flowering, bountiful garden. You have your own private entrance and space and we are just upstairs if you need anything.','We\'re in a quiet neighborhood, walking distance from two awesome parks (including Lents Park, where the Portland Pickles play), with easy access to public transit and the freeway if you want to get into the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-684223698083782025/original/21fa41d6-b166-430f-b0e4-8d0f6043892a.jpeg',40159913,72,'45.48684011420278','-122.56271148625777',1,4,1.00,2.00,4.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,684223698083782025),(2748,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/684605727203576160','Tasteful, clean, and quiet 2 bedroom in inner NE.','Welcome to Backyard Tranquility, centrally located in the inner NE Portland, with great restaurants and two large grocery stores a short walk away, and within a 10min bike/drive time from the downtown. Modernly decorated and carefully maintained, the property offers two large bedrooms, one that doubles as an office, a stylish kitchen, dining area, and a spacious living-room. It features a beautiful backyard with a seasonal hot-tub, quiet surroundings, and a private driveway.','King neighborhood','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-684605727203576160/original/f0269ab0-7654-4a1a-b243-b127abc238cc.jpg',19393124,14,'45.54998','-122.65701',1,5,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,360,360,7,5.00,684605727203576160),(2749,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/684876250591721835','1BR Historic Soul District Remodel','Private basement unit, separate entrance, perfect for solo travelers or couples. With one bedroom, one bathroom, full kitchen, a huge TV in the living room, and a dining area, you\'ll feel right at home. Relax in comfort or explore the city; this cozy space has everything you need for a memorable stay. 91 WalkScore and 99 BikeScore, you will be only blocks to some of the best restaurants, bars, and shops in town.','Welcome to the vibrant and eclectic neighborhoods of Boise and King in Portland, Oregon! Nestled in the heart of the city, you\'ll be just steps away from some of the best local eats, drinks, and shopping. Take a short trip to N Williams, Mississippi, and Alberta to explore a variety of top-rated restaurants, bars, and shops. Blocks away from the Moda Center, perfect for your night at the Blazer game or concert! Our neighborhood boasts a unique mix of historic architecture and modern amenities, creating a charming and lively atmosphere.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-684876250591721835/original/52ac2f27-e5af-4336-8b65-7afa133994ae.jpeg',118237877,26,'45.54292','-122.66241',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,1,365,182,4.84,684876250591721835),(2750,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/685483860908649441','Charming, Convenient, Modern, one-bedroom studio.','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. Modern finishes with chic style. Convenience at your doorstep! Grocery store across the street, public transportation outside your doorstep, friendly upscale pub and pizza place within steps of your door. <br />Beautiful Tabor neighborhood close to Mt. Tabor, Laurelhurst Park, Hawthorne District and more. <br />Roku TV, Internet, all utilities included. Fresh towels, linens, and super comfy bed.','We are located in the beautiful Tabor neighborhood. We are walking distance from Laurelhurst Park, Mt. Tabor Park, and many beautiful neighborhoods.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-685483860908649441/original/e208a870-de1a-4ec6-9a14-6238f62c2699.jpeg',149555015,52,'45.52379','-122.60682',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,60,365,0,1.00,685483860908649441),(2751,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/686055616461675524','Alberta Arts 3 Bedroom with Gas Fireplace & A/C','Classic Mid-Century home with modern renovation in Alberta Arts. This thoughtfully updated townhouse has a light-filled, open main floor living, dining, kitchen with peninsula bar. The main floor bedroom and bath overlook the private backyard. Brand new full kitchen with high end appliances, gas range and quartz counters. New, well-lit bathrooms. Hunker down in lower level family room. Private fenced backyard + short couple blocks to excellent restaurants, boutique shops + Alberta Park.','Our place is nestled in the thriving and industrious retreat for the creatives, and business owners who work and live here. The area is called Alberta Arts, and it\'s a welcoming area of Northeast Portland for residents and visitors. Alberta Street is the primary street through the neighborhood and is just a few blocks away. The many newly renovated retail storefronts and restaurants mix in well with the older businesses and buildings that have been here a very long time. There\'s trendy and unique shopping with many handcrafted and local items, and boutique shops. Don\'t miss the large Alberta Park a few blocks down the road. It\'s many large trees, dog park, and playground draw several people and families from this neighborhood and others.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-686055616461675524/original/632034f8-c0a2-4b84-b9af-5fe735620f4e.jpeg',35847109,29,'45.56479','-122.65158',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,132.00,30,365,2,4.50,686055616461675524),(2752,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/688037050970730157','One Mississippi Ave - Adventures in Portland!','Welcome to ONE MISSISSIPPI AVE - the vibrant heart of Portland\'s Mississippi Avenue district! We\'ve created a cozy, inviting, safe, modern loft space at the doorstep of one of Portland\'s most energized, eclectic, and fun neighborhoods!  <br /><br />Our attention to your needs and detail, assures a comfortable, satisfying, and pleasurable stay. Everything else is just outside your door! Walk to nearby shops, bars, restaurants, a food court and so much more. It\'s the absolute best of what Portland offers!','\"When it comes to Portland, a little extra effort researching neighborhoods will lead you to a tiny, trendy slice of the city known as Mississippi Avenue. Complete with yummy eats, entertainment, and fun shops, this pedestrian-friendly arterial is a great location for a perfect stay!\"','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-688037050970730157/original/c926fbce-6309-4fbf-9155-af29ab7b67eb.jpeg',120621079,9,'45.55325','-122.67451',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,1,90,60,5.00,688037050970730157),(2753,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/688668699196547886','Spacious 2 bedroom in Portland (King bed)','This property is centrally located just 2 minutes from the entrance to I5 freeway. Quick access to Downtown Portland and a quick 10min commute to Washington. New Seasons, a diner/bar, coffee shop, and gas station are all located across the street. The max train is located across the street making for easy public transportation. Lots of options within walking distance making this home extremely convenient.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-688668699196547886/original/ccdd2782-b835-4aa7-ad3b-7b09fe3ffc36.jpeg',354945893,51,'45.56966','-122.68357',1,4,1.50,2.00,3.00,150.00,30,365,39,4.87,688668699196547886),(2754,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/689093778107204387','Bright, Modern, Artsy 1-Bed Condo (New)','There\'s no better way to experience the beauty of Portland than by sleeping right in the heart of it. Our Modern one-bedroom is fully equipped to make your stay a relaxing and stress-free one. Our home is surrounded by restaurants, bars, and shops in bustling neighborhoods like Mississippi Ave, Alberta art district, and DT. We provide wifi, entertainment, toiletries, coffee, and extra towels. We have done our best to make this home away from home. So please come and enjoy your getaway with us.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-689093778107204387/original/9bcb52a6-e28c-4a93-b6c6-efefe5617174.png',473884242,14,'45.55443','-122.66159',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,2,365,97,4.94,689093778107204387),(2755,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/689893975568882564','The very heart of Inner SE Portland, @Division St','With an almost 100% walk score you have found the perfect spot to explore Portland. The Division/Hawthorne district is the heartbeat of what gives Portland it\'s truly unique reputation, centrally located, you can reach downtown in under 3 miles (10min) and the Airport in 20 min. Walk out the door and you are steps away from some of the top eateries and local businesses in the city. Yet the house is a perfect oasis, quiet, spacious, and completely yours for the duration of your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-689893975568882564/original/1cd90956-0fd0-42d8-8c3a-d3a0d8499294.jpeg',714512,8,'45.50552','-122.62906',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,350.00,30,30,14,4.86,689893975568882564),(2756,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/690032639501196206','Bohemian Oasis','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. PDX airport is a 5 min drive, and public transportation is plentiful. <br /><br />It’s a single story house with a couple steps leading up to the porch. The front yard is fully fenced in and beautifully landscaped. <br /><br />Inside you’ll be warmly welcomed by refreshing cool air, and a quiet escape from the city life. Which is only 10-20 min from the action, if that’s what you seek. <br /><br />Careful consideration of all items provided','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-690032639501196206/original/b30fed5c-8a60-4931-9d9c-7efa34d38346.jpeg',329081,80,'45.555766272154614','-122.5759619101882',1,3,1.50,2.00,2.00,130.00,1,27,8,5.00,690032639501196206),(2757,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/690736115780736885','#LiebeHausPDX - Historic space near Reed College','Take it easy at this unique and historic getaway. Enjoy your stay at #LiebeHausPDX, a new basement apartment in a 1912 estate, designed to feel like your home away from home. This stylish abode is nestled in the Woodstock neighborhood, walking distance to Reed College, and less than 2 blocks from the famous Keeper Coffee Co. Walk or drive to nearby bars, restaurants, shops, parks/playgrounds, and 4 grocery stores (Trader Joe’s, New Seasons, and 2 Safeways) on Woodstock and Powell.<br /><br />72 walkscore','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-690736115780736885/original/b92c8005-ea6f-4034-92b1-1f6e19b115ae.jpeg',24496266,38,'45.4872','-122.61954',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,92.00,1,1125,13,4.92,690736115780736885),(2758,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/691287608005268426','Unique & Cozy Tiny Home in SE Portland','TBD','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-691287608005268426/original/d7827e45-1d9d-48f8-ba52-7ede391c4042.jpeg',139193165,72,'45.49168','-122.57',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,691287608005268426),(2759,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/691334864591036905','ART CAN Airstream + Sauna!','ART CAN airstream is an eco-focused space retreat housed in an artfully remodeled 27ft. 1973 Airstream Overlander. <br /><br />Located in the heart of NE Portland Oregon, you\'ll be staying in a lovely private yard with lots of plants, giant trees and a 8\' barrel sauna for relaxing. <br /><br />Steps away you\'ll find the outdoor shower, clean and odor-free composting toilet, fire pit and covered outdoor lounge area for your use. <br /><br />This space is not safe or suitable for children under 7 years old.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-691334864591036905/original/064db0e4-6869-446f-bb0c-d53a05a976cb.jpeg',434785,14,'45.5549513','-122.6588571',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,2,31,22,4.82,691334864591036905),(2760,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/692725601738514445','Luxury MicroHaus- Private Yard & AC (Alberta Arts)','Super unique and comfortable MicroHaus in the heart of the Alberta Arts action! Easy walking distance to Salt & Straw, Great Notion Brewing, Tin Shed, Gumba, among a multitude of other restaurants, shopping and fun in Alberta!<br /><br />Designed and built by engineers from the Jet manufacturer Airbus and Audi!<br /><br />for more details: microhaus.me','Independent and diverse, this Northeast Portland neighborhood teems with art, shopping and dining options. It\'s a walkable, fun neighborhood, also close to downtown, industrial, and other central neighborhoods and sights.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-692725601738514445/original/ecc3b39c-e751-4a5a-851d-b6f707125c87.jpeg',10039803,29,'45.55891','-122.64901',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,2,1125,53,4.87,692725601738514445),(2761,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/693112757301137926','Casa Midori - a Charming Cottage w/ Garden Sauna','Charming cottage in a lovely neighborhood of NE Portland just a few miles from downtown and walking distance to Alberta Arts District. <br /><br />Although close-in, this home is on a quiet residential street on a designated Neighborhood Greenway, making it a walking & cycling paradise (walk score 71, bike score of 96). Walk to many neighborhood coffee shops, restaurants, parks,  grocery stores, and more.','The house is located on one of Portland\'s Neighborhood Greenways, so it is excellent for walking and biking (walk score 71, bike score 96!).  Lots of nearby public transportation options as well. There are two major grocery stores nearby, along with several coffee shops and restaurants, and very close by is the lovely Alberta Park. Larger Fernhill Park is nearby as well. <br />The neighborhood is very quiet and has a charming local vibe with pretty houses and gardens, yet downtown is only a short drive, bus or bike ride away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0bd9f233-e104-40e9-8486-cefb1e5493b8.jpg',57431738,45,'45.56911','-122.64633',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,123.00,3,90,30,4.97,693112757301137926),(2762,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/693705266685374609','Sunlit Portland Bungalow: No Cleaning Fee','Bright, open, urban oasis. Kick off your adventure in the Pacific NW with coffee in the sun-drenched kitchen or unwind with a glass of wine by the fire after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer. Plenty of space to bring your outdoor gear, conveniently located both as a gateway to the city, and the gorge! A quick 10 minutes from the Portland Airport.<br /><br />Inquire if wanting longer length stay than is advertised- happy to extend things out!','Close to city-wide views at Rocky Butte (and a heck of a bike ride, if you\'re so inclined!), Roseway is a family-friendly and fun community with fantastic parks, restaurants, and coffee shops within walking distance. Donuts, bakeries, bagels, Thai, Mexican, Hawaiian, and local pizza all call the neighborhood home.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-693705266685374609/original/451b267b-4414-4296-9f38-64a606b416b9.png',59068154,39,'45.5479','-122.58192',1,5,1.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,10,5.00,693705266685374609),(2763,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/693921413298925106','The Abbey on Birkendene M#41532','The house requires a minimum 31-day stay and utilities are not included.<br />An idyllic home surrounded by trees, with your own spacious elevated patio. This beautiful 3 bedroom 3 bathroom home features an open floor plan, where you’ll immediately be struck by a dazzling white grand piano. The master bedroom is gorgeous and features an elegant master bath, complete with dual sinks and a soaking tub with a large window overlooking your trees.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-693921413298925106/original/c60ef888-e790-475a-a90c-f414e687d103.jpeg',126824075,81,'45.5398','-122.77633',1,6,3.00,3.00,4.00,277.00,30,365,0,1.00,693921413298925106),(2764,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/694138607283893076','Modern and Serene Woodstock Home Close to PDX','Our home is located in the southeast Portland neighborhood of Woodstock. Conveniently nearby are grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants, bars and breweries! Whether you are visiting friends or family, students at Reed\'s College, or sightseeing Portland, this stay is absolutely set up to offer a convenient location and give you all the amenities of home!','This quaint, residential neighborhood is one of the oldest neighborhoods in Portland and is quiet and peaceful with a smaller downtown feel. Lots of street parking, and friendly neighbors. A mile and a half from Safeway Grocery and Fred Meyers. Only one mile from Heart Coffee! <br /> <br />12 Miles from PDX Airport <br />6 Miles from Downtown Portland <br />6.2 Miles to Portland Art Museum <br />3.5 Miles from Willamette Riverfront <br />5 Miles from Trails and Biking Paths <br />10 Miles from The Grotto <br />30 Miles to Multnomah Falls','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-694138607283893076/original/333b925b-21a7-44a4-8bb2-e0560fffba12.jpeg',473913292,69,'45.46395','-122.60552',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,150.00,2,28,39,4.85,694138607283893076),(2765,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/694194103648771974','Portland Retreat with Scenic Views and Fireplace','Indulge in the ultimate Portland getaway in our one bedroom vacation rental unit! Perched atop a serene boutique apartment building, this charming apartment offers more than just a place to stay – it\'s an experience to remember.<br /><br />Imagine cozying up by the fireplace as you gaze out at breathtaking views of the cityscape. Or luxuriating in the bathroom\'s skylight-lit tub, unwinding after a day of exploration.<br /><br />Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to make unforgettable memories in the City of Roses!','Just a few minutes walking distance to well loved venue, The Revolution Hall (we suggest making reservations for their beautiful roof top bar, with incredible food, drink and Portland views. Also within one minutes walk to the well known Sandy Hut Bar and Grill which recently turned 100 years old and has become a popular Portland staple. We own a small bar downstairs as well called Chandelier, stop by for a cocktail or charcuterie board Wednesday through Saturday 4pm-11pm. Very close to the famous Voodoo Doughnuts and several businesses and well loved iconic Portland businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-694194103648771974/original/85c4ef90-e1ad-42f3-9d29-f1019afbda70.jpeg',474734231,32,'45.52223','-122.65099',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,164.00,1,28,85,4.76,694194103648771974),(2766,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/694768663129527003','Private, stylish Guesthouse - heart of NE PDX!','Welcome to Bella Casa!  Stylish and private guest house in NE PDX. <br />Designing Bella Casa has been a labor of love for over a year! This space shares thoughtful and tasteful design with each and every guest. This is a detached unit with a private ( but shared) newly revamped back yard space. It’s central, with an easy to access private entrance. Just 8 minutes from the Portland Airport, and we offer free parking. Hope to host you soon!','Roseway Neighborhood<br />2.4 miles from PDX Airport <br />Across the street: Scott Elementary + Wellington Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fcc241de-46c8-4ce5-8ad9-79deb34572c5.jpg',10612299,39,'45.553295546552306','-122.59449999779463',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,30,1125,95,4.97,694768663129527003),(2767,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/694943159551691377','#InvestREPM Multnomah Village Modern Retreat','#InvestREPM Multnomah Village & Hillsdale Modern Retreat! Tastefully designed with modern finishes & decor. This 1 bedroom- 1 bath guest house is spacious, bright and newly remodeled. Nestled in the trees with a comfortable outdoor space. Dog friendly w/ additional $50 pet fee for up to (2) pre-approved dogs.','This neighborhood is convenient to I-5, OHSU, and downtown. Approx 5-7 min to the OHSU campus. Beaverton, Tigard and Washington County are on the borders and minutes from the property.The home is located in the  Multnomah Village District, known for its charming small town vibe. Multnomah Village has plentiful sidewalk cafes, bakeries and bookstores, and offers casual dining options like taverns, cozy American restaurants and traditional Italian eateries. In sprawling Gabriel Park, there are sports fields, a large skatepark and picnic areas. Stores selling women’s fashions, rustic home decor and antiques cluster around Southwest Capitol Highway. The Hillsdale neighborhood is also very close to the location and features plenty of dining, shopping and nightlife.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-694943159551691377/original/240358a8-a32b-42d9-9fa7-7edf03dba8e8.jpeg',434667229,17,'45.4814269','-122.7126619',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,67.00,31,120,0,1.00,694943159551691377),(2768,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/695642759922619224','Large Room in NE Portland','Welcome in!  <br /><br />This is a large room in a centrally located apartment in NE Portland, Oregon.<br /><br />This is a basement apartment with a big room and a large window and storage! It has a full kitchen with new tile, a bath tub, and leather couch.  It is a spacious three bedroom apartment with great walkability.  This space is in a vibrant community; with groceries, a farmer\'s market, a movie theater, a block away!   <br /><br />There is off street parking  and a healing space above.  Thank you for your interest!','Outside of this building you can see the Marquee for the historic Hollywood Theater. <br /><br />-Fast wifi<br />-farmer\'s market is every Saturday in the summer/ twice in winter <br />-Sizzle Pie Pizza, Sushi Chiyo,  and Vegan Doe Donuts within a block of this <br />-Three grocery stores within a short walking distance: Trader Joe\'s, Whole Foods, and Grocery Outlet.  <br />-Target is a 5 minute walk (about two blocks).<br /><br />We are directly off the Hollywood Max stop and the Busline 12!  This is an urban space so we recommend locking up bikes.  That being said we have not had problems!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-695642759922619224/original/b333b464-e728-4c27-aaee-654bc323339d.jpeg',13588271,84,'45.53483','-122.62042',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,730,2,5.00,695642759922619224),(2769,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/695748705493977786','Cozy bedroom (and more) in a quiet neighborhood','We are offering a quiet bedroom retreat with full-house facilities. The bedroom is located upstairs, right next to the bathroom. The main floor has a dining room, living room and fully-equipped kitchen. There is a laundry in the basement. The backyard is a restful garden.','Quiet street. One and one-half blocks off Hawthorne with a T-intersection. Traffic is mainly neighbors.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-695748705493977786/original/06505aea-8a84-4e98-ba2c-4a303e90bee0.jpeg',5742402,8,'45.510096','-122.6302839',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,695748705493977786),(2770,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/695941831223105713','Cheerful home with fireplace! Sleeps 8','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space located in NE Portland, OR. Only 13 minute drive from downtown Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-695941831223105713/original/c63d036a-fdc3-45dc-9b75-2a64cb6bede6.jpeg',68306541,63,'45.53343','-122.53305',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,195.00,2,30,163,4.91,695941831223105713),(2771,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/696332289610523301','Historic Charm in Fun PDX Neighborhood!','This classic Portland style gem has everything you need to feel at home. A spacious floor plan with loads of natural light, high ceilings, hardwood floors. Gas fireplace and claw-foot tub are cozy on cold nights. Central heat/ac keep you comfortable and washer/dryer for lite packing. Fully loaded kitchen. Private entrance and secure keypad entry.  The space is a quiet and comfortable sanctuary in the heart of one of Portland\'s most dynamic neighborhoods. <br />Family owned and operated 💛','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6Njk2MzMyMjg5NjEwNTIzMzAx/original/5c0c6ea2-b9f8-46e5-a759-3f1a5aed0a0f.jpeg',6240473,8,'45.50377','-122.62426',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,95.00,30,90,23,4.83,696332289610523301),(2772,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/696401590237253496','Cozy ADU - Alberta Arts District','The space is cozy yet roomy for a single person or a small traveling party.','This ADU is located in the heart of NE Portland. More specifically known as the Alberta Arts District. It’s walking distance from many restaurants, shops, parks, and other leisure activities . It’s a peaceful and friendly neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5f705450-730e-447f-b8e5-563602ef4146.jpg',298839013,29,'45.56481796137102','-122.6543044253767',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,115.00,30,365,2,5.00,696401590237253496),(2773,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/697093348622285119','Your Perfect 3-Bedroom Retreat','Welcome to The Dorian Penthouse: Your Perfect Family Getaway!<br /><br />Looking for simplicity, peace, and convenience? Look no further! Our spacious 3-bedroom Penthouse is the ultimate retreat for families seeking relaxation and comfort.','Just a few minutes walking distance to well loved venue, The Revolution Hall (we suggest making reservations for their beautiful roof top bar, with incredible food, drink and Portland views. Also within one minutes walk to the well known Sandy Hut Bar and Grill which recently turned 100 years old and has become a popular Portland staple. We own a small bar downstairs as well called Chandelier, stop by for a glass of cocktail or charcuterie board Wednesday through Saturday 4pm-11pm. Very close to the famous Voodoo Doughnuts and several businesses and well loved iconic Portland businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-697093348622285119/original/284fb94d-103a-4496-a64f-a7ea18ca59ef.jpeg',474734231,32,'45.52223','-122.65099',1,6,2.00,3.00,4.00,464.00,1,28,53,4.74,697093348622285119),(2774,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/697154165338580302','~RARE FIND~ Gorgeous Nature Getaway + Parking','Prepare to be captivated! Immerse yourself at our recently built luxury forest escape, nestled in the heart of one of Portland\'s most esteemed neighborhoods. This enchanting haven combines the serenity of nature with the opulence of modern comfort. Located just a brief ~5-minute drive from the vibrant Downtown area and the lush expanse of Washington Park. Your extraordinary getaway awaits—discover the pinnacle of relaxation and indulgence amidst the splendors of Portland\'s premier locale.','Lucious forest neighborhood that is quiet and safe. Friendly neighbors walking their dogs and nearby trails and paths for you to explore. Car break ins are rare here, but be sure not to leave any valuables in your vehicle - just in case.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-697154165338580302/original/aa91738b-e779-4b47-845f-362a8c2c9aca.jpeg',87103452,54,'45.50574','-122.70899',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,164.00,2,150,87,4.75,697154165338580302),(2775,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/697272777138664442','Urban Luxury! Central Location! Walk Everywhere!','Welcome to your ultimate Portland getaway at this urban luxury home located in-between the favorited N Williams and N Mississippi Streets! Immerse yourself in the vibrant and eclectic energy of the city, while still enjoying the peace and privacy of your own personal oasis.','This space is perfectly set between Williams and Mississippi Ave\'s.   The walkability to amazing restaurants and portland staples is nothing short of perfect.  It also is a short drive downtown being close to the 405 bridge entrance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-697272777138664442/original/2feedeac-0f09-458b-9b91-eef50b459a6c.jpeg',1218855,9,'45.55204','-122.66904',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,1,730,102,4.87,697272777138664442),(2776,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/697911506470630392','Spacious, Newly Renovated NOPO 1BR Apartment!','You\'ll love this clean, comfortable and spacious apartment in Kenton neighborhood in North Portland!! The apartment is in my walk-out renovated basement.  It is 2 levels, with 4 steps separating the living room and dining and entry from the kitchen, bathroom and bedroom - with a private entrance and small patio!<br />Wifi with a comfortable office is provided as well.<br />Lovely, friendly and peaceful neighborhood, 4 block walk to 2 parks, a block from bus, walkable to grocery, coffee, restaurants & bars','From its vintage shops like Give & Take and Kenton Antiques & Collectibles to its restaurants—Swift and Union is named after the meat companies whose workers once filled the nearby homes—North Portland’s Kenton neighborhood shouts its history out loud.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-697911506470630392/original/ca29a474-02b5-4332-9f65-174201653f5c.jpeg',154338,55,'45.58136','-122.69945',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,62.00,31,186,3,5.00,697911506470630392),(2777,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/698558069197590135','Lovely space with cozy fireplace in N. Portland.','Keep it whimsical at this peaceful and centrally located place.  Centered between Kenton shops and the University of Portland.  Offering lovely shops, parks and approximately 20 minutes to PDX!  Cozy in by the fireplace, sip on coffee in the bistro or sit outside in gated private patio. Come stay, relax and enjoy!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-698558069197590135/original/01d71a3a-b1fd-4d1d-b304-31e91df82b42.jpeg',1125772,55,'45.58459','-122.70211',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,76.00,2,31,161,4.92,698558069197590135),(2778,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/699159043720569981','Charming Nopo Basement Apartment','Charming & newly renovated Nopo basement apartment - designed with couples, solo travelers, and business folks in mind. Situated in the heart of Williams, Alberta, &amp; Mississippi Neighborhoods and close to public transportation. This central location is incredibly bike-able (bike score of 100) and within walking distance of many popular Portland destinations including Peninsula Park Rose Garden, Eem, and Salt + Straw.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-699159043720569981/original/19b9b0f5-e10b-45de-a412-5610f3db585e.jpeg',95543760,24,'45.55883523441427','-122.66963404739207',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,1,4,23,4.78,699159043720569981),(2779,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/699341738040482524','Craftsman ,Dog friendly,fenced ,Overlook,UofP ,','7 min from University or Portland Super dog friendly with a large fenced yard .Overlook neighborhood is one of Portland’s hidden gems..A few minutes away from Mississippi St restaurants are 7 blocks away. There are great parks in this area: Mock\'s Crest, Overlook Park, and Peninsula Park Rose Garden. Short walk to the Max Line.<br /><br />two bedrooms and a loft are on the 2nd level.There is a kitchen with many gadgets and great art in all the rooms.<br />There is a $50.00 per pet charge for entire stay .','Close to Overlook Park. Great neighborhood. One of the safest and least crowded neighborhoods in Portland.Walk to Overlook park or Mock’s crest for amazing views of the city, Forest Park and the Willamette River.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-699341738040482524/original/2e1dd5d8-f7f4-4e49-bff2-405c7e218aa1.jpeg',6568816,13,'45.56203989999999','-122.6875431',1,6,1.00,3.00,12.00,115.00,30,120,3,4.33,699341738040482524),(2780,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/699387049020307615','Modern Bedroom in Classic SE Portland Home','Looking to see and taste Portland? Want to stay in a spacious comfortable place to travel? You\'ve found the right place! This special place is close to everything. This special 1 bedroom in a shared Portland classic home on the main floor with a green kitchen, a spacious sunlight living room, a front porch, and a backyard with chickens. We (my husband and I) are also pet friendly as we have two dogs and a cat as well. Lastly, we are central to division and many other activities! Welcome!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-699387049020307615/original/10350419-6750-47bc-8d29-52d94a24da6f.jpg',459788767,61,'45.48724120000001','-122.6230437',2,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,30,365,6,4.83,699387049020307615),(2781,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/699866077857802475','Cozy private Montavilla studio with loft bed','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.','Very friendly, quiet neighborhood with easy access to the interstate. 10 minutes to airport, 2 min drive/10 minute walk to great dining and entertainment, 10 minute drive to Hawthorne district, 15 minutes to downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f5890bef-e790-4992-862f-a634ee55d16a.jpg',20082274,10,'45.5156568','-122.5742302',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,2,4,17,5.00,699866077857802475),(2782,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/700076801537012842','Julio\'s','Charming 3rd floor studio in the Alphabet District, is centrally located in one of Portland’s most desirable and eclectic neighborhoods. With a walk score of 99, this historic condo has easy access to the Pearl, NW 23rd, MAX, Portland Streetcar, Powell’s Bookstore and Providence and Washington Parks. You can even hear the bells of St. Mary Cathedral toll twice a day!','Alphabet District, 99 walk score, minutes from the Pearl, NW 23rd, Providence and Washington Parks, St. Mary\'s Cathedral, Fred Meyer and Whole Foods','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-700076801537012842/original/5eb59037-0e4f-4316-9e6a-ed166385a2fe.jpg',101246805,27,'45.52413','-122.68947',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,95.00,30,31,8,5.00,700076801537012842),(2783,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/700788397628875688','4-BDR Pet-Friendly Home Perfect for Extended Stays','Perfect for families, remote workers, or those in need of temporary housing, this spacious and freshly renovated 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom duplex offers all the comforts of home, with a charming boho mid-century vibe and modern amenities.','From this spot in the vibrant North Tabor neighborhood, you’ll be close to I-84, Laurelhurst, Montavilla, the Hollywood District, and more. It’s a nine-minute walk to the MAX Blue, Green, and Red lines at the NE 60th Ave MAX Station stop. Plus, the 19 and 20 bus lines are within a block or two. This location has fantastic access to everything that makes Portland great—restaurants, bars, parks, and more. The year-round Montavilla Farmers Market is within 1.5 miles, and beautiful Mt. Tabor Park is just a bit further. Trader Joe’s, QFC, Fred Meyer, and more are within a quick drive. In the morning, walk a couple of blocks to Seven Virtues Coffee Roasters for a latte. Plus, there are fantastic dining options within two miles, including Screen Door Eastside, The Observatory, Malka, Crema Coffee + Bakery, Coquine, and Vintage Cocktail Lounge.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzAwNzg4Mzk3NjI4ODc1Njg4/original/40d2f20f-5906-4c3a-a354-6a1d006b4636.png',1828909,11,'45.52793','-122.60643',1,8,2.00,4.00,3.00,169.00,30,365,0,1.00,700788397628875688),(2784,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/701211181701375210','Luxury Condo with Home Gym next to OHSU','This is a well-furnished, clean, and peaceful condo in close proximity to OHSU, restaurants, bars, and more. The building is calm and family-friendly. The master bedroom includes a separate bathroom. The living room has another half-bath, pull-out couch, and twin bed.<br /><br />The unit comes equipped with a full kitchen, large desk, wifi, central air/heating, and TV.<br /><br />Additionally, there is a significant amount of exercise equipment, including dumbells, a barbell, a squat rack, bench, and exercise bike.','The neighborhood is mostly families and young professionals. It is very safe. There are many restaurants, shops, and other stores. Of note, this unit is about a 5-10 min walk from the OHSU buildings.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/fa995c69-476d-42ad-a7b7-6190074e9f2b.jpg',354869636,22,'45.49746','-122.66987',1,3,1.50,1.00,3.00,100.00,30,365,3,5.00,701211181701375210),(2785,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/701409621986014410','Lovely Condo on the Spectacular Willamette River','Fantastic downtown city location that can\'t be beat!  Right on the river.<br />Open the sliding glass door and walk right out to nature and the beautiful Willamette River!  Sit outside on the patio enjoying a morning cup of coffee with an eye level view of the river and nature.  Ground floor is convenient for a pet. <br />A common fire pit, picnic area and bbq are available for your use.  Year round jacuzzi and seasonal pool can also be enjoyed. <br />Award winning restaurants nearby along with museums!','Located in desirable Historic Old Town-Chinatown and the bustling Pearl District with its great variety of award winning restaurants and urban parks.  Music, museums and cultural activities are within a short distance.  <br /><br />A convenience store is located 1 minute away and full service grocery stores and gyms are located in the neighborhood.  Hike in the woods of the largest urban park in the nation, Forest Park.  The light rail and major bus lines are all within a short walking distance.<br /><br />Enjoy your days off exploring the coast (1.5 hour drive), Columbia Gorge (1 hour drive) or winter skiing on Mt. Hood (1.5 hour drive).','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-701409621986014410/original/13672fd2-fc2e-47fc-a0cc-7693c7d6b4a4.jpeg',26929359,43,'45.5292','-122.67327',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,89.00,31,160,6,5.00,701409621986014410),(2786,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/701551500446065280','Modern 2 bed+office Home in hip FoPo, Fully Fenced','Fully updated, this cozy home-away-from-home features 2 bedrooms + dedicated separate office, a full bathroom with tub, a stackable washer/dryer, a private, fenced  back yard, high speed internet, and on-site parking in the driveway. The home is in a quiet, walkable residential neighborhood near the hip Foster/Powell neighborhood. Drinking coffee on the front porch, you\'ll meet many neighbors who stop and say hi as they walk their dogs to one of the many nearby parks.','This home sits right in the heart of the Foster Powell neighborhood. Walk to any number of restaurants, bars, shops, and coffee shops. It’s a quiet street where everyone waves hi and likes to stop and introduce themselves.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-701551500446065280/original/9909e8c6-c4aa-4b5c-baa1-bb38228d323a.jpeg',78879277,36,'45.49401','-122.60235',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,30,180,4,5.00,701551500446065280),(2787,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/702006264063079852','Modern home blocks from trendy Mississippi Ave','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally located home. Located only 3 blocks off trendy Mississippi Ave and 5 blocks off N Williams. Both streets have some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, boutiques, and coffee shops. <br /><br />Start your day by walking to get a coffee or breakfast. End it by walking to a bar/restaurant for dinner or drinks.','Located 3 blocks off trendy Mississippi Ave and 5 blocks off N Williams home to some of Portland\'s best Restaurants, bars, coffee shops, and boutiques. Walk score if 93 and a bike score of 100!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-702006264063079852/original/ac3f5fa2-07d9-4456-a9ad-35e040bf4e63.jpeg',49218021,24,'45.55473','-122.67159',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,299.00,3,28,72,4.93,702006264063079852),(2788,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/702226271303268350','2 Bedroom Daylight Basement fully stocked','Beautiful upgraded daylight basement with a full kitchen, two bedrooms, living room, full bathroom with washer and dryer, living room, entry area, own entrance. Front entrance leads to backyard of larger home. <br />Common areas, like hot tub, and backyard might be shared with guests staying in the larger home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47362022/original/50e21e54-40bc-4e50-96d4-310e2bc604ea.jpeg',382375965,78,'45.48287','-122.51592',1,7,1.00,2.00,4.00,275.00,31,365,1,5.00,702226271303268350),(2789,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/702842151001368098','Bedroom in the basement with a desk and fireTV','This is a comfortable room in the basement of our home. It had a desk for working and FireTV for entertainment. There is a shared half bath on the same floor and a shared full bath on the floor above.<br />Portland has a occupancy tax if the rental is less than 31 days so if you want to save approximately 200 dollars of tax, book for  31+ days !','5-10 min walking distance are the St. John\'s bridge , McMenamins St. Johns, Soma Kombucha Speakeasy, Occidental brewing company, Stormbreaker brewing St. Johns, St. John\'s twin theaters, St. Johns food carts. Paiku , Louie\'s pizza, Rockabilly cafe and several other restaurants and coffee shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-702842151001368098/original/ddb48464-1484-4b35-b8df-2bea359bb540.jpeg',8587273,58,'45.59134','-122.74686',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,40.00,30,31,2,5.00,702842151001368098),(2790,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/703526855016323050','Mallory Hideout an Artistic Oasis w 2 Soaking Tubs','Come and relax in this artistic retreat perfect for a short Portland getaway or an extended stay! Located on a quiet treelined street, the entire home is available to you! There are two bedrooms, two bathrooms, and even two living rooms! We have a TV, office space, fully equipped kitchen, and basic essentials so you can make yourself at home during your stay!','The Piedmont neighborhood of Portland has convenient access to all other neighborhoods of Portland without the traditional Portland crowds. You can relax in the privacy of your 2 bed home or use it as a base to explore other Portland neighborhoods like nearby Alberta Arts District for some coffee and breakfast, then venture over to SE Hawthorne Blvd or SE Division for fun shops and Salt & Straw ice cream. Downtown or the Alphabet District\'s NW 23rd and NW 21st is a close drive away as well which has some of Portland\'s best restaurants, cocktails, and more shopping!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-703526855016323050/original/e28c6a88-c7b3-4d4b-997f-59443c27daeb.jpeg',7409866,48,'45.5756481','-122.6635805',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,81.00,1,1125,94,4.87,703526855016323050),(2791,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/703857434750615410','Cheery (3+ bdr) home - Woodstock and Foster Powell','Bring the dogs - fully fenced back yard<br />Modern kitchen and new appliances <br />Two renovated bathrooms<br />Sleep up to 8<br />Comfy TV room and fast WiFi <br />Walk to Woodstock, Portland Mercado, Mt Scott Park and gym pool-one block away<br />Lots of sleeping possibilities—use third bedroom as an office or role away bed and couch<br />Day bed + trundle in additional bedroom','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-703857434750615410/original/af6cb17a-75df-475d-98e7-07c1baeaec91.jpeg',222472596,65,'45.4810474','-122.5905601',1,6,2.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,3,5.00,703857434750615410),(2792,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/703860952484953528','Cozy Elegance in Historic Portland','Experience historic Portland from this gorgeous century home! Tall ceilings and tons of windows allow you to relax in style while sipping artisanal coffee and planning your perfect Portland day. <br /><br />This 115-year-old house was completely renovated, yet keeps its charm with original details elegantly intact. Minimalist glam decor includes a club-size disco ball. Yes, it spins!<br /><br />This is my personal home, so expect everything you need to cook or chill. Peloton included.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-703860952484953528/original/a49d51b9-a31f-44e1-8420-0a82e9b52da5.jpeg',4332497,14,'45.55385','-122.6597',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,195.00,30,30,0,1.00,703860952484953528),(2793,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/703884095725381952','Spectacular Kitchen - Comfy Bed - 85” TV - Plants!','This quiet & spacous SE Portland bungalow features a queen sized 1-bedroom, 85” TV, DVD player & DVDs, desk space, dining room, bathroom & fully stocked kitchen with ALL the gadgets! Pasta, ice cream, sous vide, stand mixer++ Steps from SE Hawthrone & SE Belmont, this pot positive walker’s paradise (score of 96) is the perfect spot for a Portland moment. 21+ only, no pets. Looking for a dog friendly spot? We have The RoseBud & Barkfest downstairs, a 2 person Schitt’s Creek themed hotel room','Welcome to Sunnyside! This adorable neighborhood is centrally located for all your Portland needs. We are less than 12 minutes from the airport and just 10 minutes from downtown and Sunnyside is walkable and bikeable. We’re just a few blocks from the SE Belmont St. and SE Hawthorne St. bars,  restaurants many of which have outdoor (and heated when needed) dining and trendy shops, arcades and theaters. We are on the bike path and .5 miles from Laurelhurst Park and 1.2 miles from Mt. Tabor Park. We are just 2 blocks from Peacock Lane which is a Christmas light extravaganza and the Tetra Recreational Cannabis shop is just 2 blocks away as well. Skiing is just a little over an hour on Mt. Hood and there are plenty of day-trip worthy destinations including Timberlake Lodge, where the exteriors of Stanley Kubrick’s The Shining was filmed for The Grand Overlook Hotel as well as Cannon Beach and Ecola State Park where scenes from The Goonies were filmed. We also have an online map for you with','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-703884095725381952/original/779b120a-0128-4247-bdcc-e3b62238d7c0.jpeg',27168187,16,'45.5151967','-122.6205382',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,108.00,5,28,29,5.00,703884095725381952),(2794,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/704889798849761800','Modern Studio for Two in Portland, OR','Please always ask about availability first! We MUST check inventory for every inquiry to insure units are available. Please do not request to book until we confirm, as we do not block dates. <br /><br />Rates do vary based on availability and are subject to increase during special events, high season, and holidays. We are using a live owner\'s inventory. <br /><br />These are stock pictures for our resorts and may not be specific to the actual unit you will be assigned at check in. <br /><br />Thanks for your understanding!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-704889798849761800/original/8aa904ff-5c5f-4aae