><br />These are stock pictures for our resorts and may not be specific to the actual unit you will be assigned at check in. <br /><br />Thanks for your understanding!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-704889875639887651/original/e4fb60aa-d571-47e5-a575-3b3a0a22d76b.jpeg',12568111,43,'45.52097','-122.67065',1,5,1.50,2.00,4.00,486.00,30,365,0,1.00,704889875639887651),(2800,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/705610452366070396','Cute SE Portland House with Yard','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. Close to Foster and Woodstock neighborhoods. House is perfect for telecommuting. 2 month minimum stay starting October 14 - January 5.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8379b1b9-f0e9-4adf-8638-6904ab89def8.jpg',5617147,67,'45.49042461555897','-122.60713018476962',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,60,75,0,1.00,705610452366070396),(2801,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/705731625164984473','Room in Buckman','Quiet suburban retreat close to coffee shops, restaurants, and vintage shops. Walk to some of Portland\'s most popular neighborhoods, or spend a quiet day in this vintage Portland gem.<br /><br />Bedroom is on the second floor.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-705731625164984473/original/db6b92d8-67f1-41ad-ba42-e72ef28f2b46.jpeg',952325,16,'45.51533','-122.62946',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,49.00,1,60,59,4.92,705731625164984473),(2802,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/705869553394371810','The Woodshop - 2Bed/2Bath  w/skylights','The ol\' Woodshop next to the Haunted Mansion. Join us for the Halloween season, the main host house transforms into the neighborhood favorite Haunt display. A ghost or two may wonder by the woodshop from time to time. The whole gang will be cozy in this unique cottage.  2Bed/2Bath former Woodworking Shop.  2nd floor bedrm skylights & small private yard/patio.  Full kitchen, & open design w/ high ceilings. Queen bed in 1st Fl bdrm & a King bed in 2nd Fl bdrm.   Add\'l rollaways/cots in unit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzA1ODY5NTUzMzk0MzcxODEw/original/6bc3d951-6931-4cf0-bcea-beae45dad069.jpeg',165841,8,'45.50059521930725','-122.6107465592322',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,178.00,2,30,23,4.91,705869553394371810),(2803,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/706075161785155593','Brand New Bright 1 Bedroom Guest House w Sun Deck','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located home walking distance from popular SE shopping and eating area - Division St. Take some time to relax in this cool one bedroom above garage-suite, only steps away from the popular Division St\'s Kati Thai, Salt & Straw, Bollywood Theatre, the First Ever Stumptown Coffee, Broder Cafe and more. Enjoy the location, sunny deck, AC, fast wifi & free street parking.','Division St and Clinton St are both very popular food and shopping destinations here in Portland. Both are walking distance from our place.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-706075161785155593/original/1019612c-2515-43a9-b21b-bbab167ffac9.jpeg',23400410,8,'45.50306','-122.63481',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,102.00,31,365,10,5.00,706075161785155593),(2804,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/707186955313004841','Tahitian Stay-Free Parking/Pearl District/Downtown','Tahitian, one of the four types of Pearls in the world. Welcome to Pearl District in PDX! <br /><br />Simple yet elegant, the Tahitian Stay combines convenience and style. Location is extremely walkable and offers quick access to Whole Foods and the MAX Light Rail. Simply step out of the building and get lost in the brewery blocks, fine dining, entertainment & premier retail shopping.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9485a343-192b-4005-83df-71e2c6715088.jpg',183340435,2,'45.52691','-122.68485',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,141.00,2,365,94,4.96,707186955313004841),(2805,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/707408575405836615','Walk to everything * Your Portland Adventure','Come stay in the heart of one of the city’s most vibrant neighborhoods.  You have immediate access to all of the shops and restaurants on SE Hawthorne, Belmont, and Division.<br />Boasting a walk score of 98 and a bike score of 100,  this location is truly a walking or biking paradise.','Walk to beautiful Laurelhurst Park. <br />Experience the sunset from one of Portland\'s best views on top of Mt. Tabor.<br />Eat your way through Portland\'s best restaurants on SE Division.<br />Try the new food cart pod on Division and 35th.<br />Spend an afternoon reading books at Powells Bookstore on Hawthorne.<br />Go to a movie at the historic Bagdad Theater.<br />Try the Egyptian coffee from Tov - a double-decker bus.<br />Get a breakfast sandwich from Fried Egg I\'m in Love.<br /><br />The best restaurants, the best boutiques, the best beer and cider, the best coffee, the best tea... it\'s honestly all right here in SE Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-707408575405836615/original/10fd1fc0-d353-4cb8-b665-21a1cc610d1a.jpeg',7637370,16,'45.51310700000001','-122.626305',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,30,30,43,4.95,707408575405836615),(2806,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/708000592674343335','Charming 2BD/1BA. Classic Ranch. Close to airport','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.2BR/1BA fully furnished home for rent in the Cully neighborhood of NE Portland. Charming 1,000 sq ft 1950’s ranch with 1-car garage, washer/dryer, fireplace, A/C, deck, and front and back yard. Walk to restaurants, bars and other amenities. Steps from Fernhill Park and bus stop. Awesome neighborhood and great neighbors.','Cully neighborhood is also known as the garden district of Portland, it houses quite a few urban farms and farmer neighbors. It is also the last neighborhood in the Portland metro with oversized lots, which gives it a cozy country feel.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-708000592674343335/original/50be35b7-598b-4d17-b67d-99b8b850e7c9.jpeg',477999674,21,'45.56674','-122.6183',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,149.00,30,1125,9,4.56,708000592674343335),(2807,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/708022350338748346','Modern Oasis in Heart of Central Eastside','Welcome to your serene sanctuary in the heart of the city! Indulge in the perfect blend of comfort and convenience at our stylish loft.<br /><br />Nestled atop The Dorian, our spacious loft offers a tranquil escape for families seeking a weekend getaway or professionals in need of a rejuvenating retreat. With 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a cozy fireplace, you\'ll feel right at home in this modern oasis.','Just a few minutes walking distance to well loved venue, The Revolution Hall (we suggest making reservations for their beautiful roof top bar, with incredible food, drink and Portland views. Also within one minutes walk to the well known Sandy Hut Bar and Grill which recently turned 100 years old and has become a popular Portland staple. We own a small bar downstairs as well called the Chandelier, stop by for a cocktail or charcuterie board Wednesday through Saturday 4pm-10pm. Very close to the famous Voodoo Doughnuts and several businesses and well loved iconic Portland businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-708022350338748346/original/8e6fec49-610f-4943-b5c6-0e5f5d133458.jpeg',474734231,32,'45.52223','-122.65099',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,239.00,1,28,96,4.70,708022350338748346),(2808,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/708047395843219732','Adorable modern two-bedroom guesthouse','This unique place has a style all its own. Well designed, clean & modern home with fun outdoor space, including swings, patio area & other family-friendly features. Get cozy in the heart of Sellwood, meet the locals & get a real “Portland feel” in our 500 square foot guesthouse.<br />This guesthouse sits adjacent to the property owner’s residence and includes one lofted bedroom accessed by ladder, other bedroom is on main level. <br />Street parking available. Note friendly children & pets are onsite.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-708047395843219732/original/1c4a0e5a-d9ed-48c2-b34c-1853f305baca.jpeg',75631543,20,'45.46013','-122.65414',1,2,1.00,2.00,0.00,150.00,30,365,1,5.00,708047395843219732),(2809,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/708930346473369883','Northeast Portland Home with Private Outdoor Space','If you want to experience quintessential Portland, this is the place to be. Located in the vibrant Williams district, the house is perfectly situated between the Alberta Arts District and historic Mississippi. You are within walking distance to shops, award winning restaurants, coffee, parks, food carts and craft beer. If you want to head downtown or NW 23rd, you are a quick car, transit, or bike ride away.','ATTRACTION                 DISTANCE FROM HOME<br />Washington Park                3.7 miles<br />OMSI                        5 miles<br />Multnomah Falls                30.6 miles<br />Powell’s Books                3.3 miles<br />Alberta Arts District                1.3 miles<br />Historic Mississippi                .5 miles<br />Saturday Market                3.3 miles<br />NW 23rd                    3.1 miles                    <br />Waterfront Park                3 miles<br />Salt and Straw                1.4 miles<br />Alberta Park                    1.7 miles<br />Forest Park                    10.5 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-708930346473369883/original/8e02a4fd-35bb-47ba-a551-cef997f3e27a.jpeg',471726253,24,'45.5561','-122.66886',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,111.00,1,90,78,4.86,708930346473369883),(2810,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/709098649385287191','Beautiful Scandinavian Design -Near PDX/Waterfront','Experience a delightful family adventure here, featuring a beautiful two-story design. Plenty of parking awaits. Revel in contemporary design elements both inside and outside. Creating a unique retreat for weekend relaxation or a midweek escape. This unit graciously accommodates 5 guests, offering 1 queen bed, a comfy pull-out couch, and an air mattress. Enjoy the convenience of a full bathroom, washer/dryer, huge T.V. and everything essential for a comfortable short/mid term stay. WELCOME!','This home is in a great neighborhood. It quite peaceful having the home located towards the back of the property. I personally know the neighbors next door they are very nice.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-709098649385287191/original/b3e557b9-8451-44ff-9b12-417220d8366f.jpeg',453525127,87,'45.50943','-122.48358',1,5,1.50,1.00,1.00,83.00,2,365,39,4.90,709098649385287191),(2811,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/709341407596059553','NE Portland Bungalow','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located bungalow in the heart of NE Portland.  Just steps away from coffee shops, restaurants, bars, Whole Foods, Alberta Arts district, parks, shopping and more. <br />This spacious home features an upstairs, private bedroom with king size bed, walk-in closet and bathroom.  Main floor boasts a large open kitchen, living space, dining area, tv room and 2nd bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-709341407596059553/original/6848730e-5346-45b0-94f6-fc917c82f14f.jpeg',35982517,6,'45.55031117925501','-122.65362952500638',1,2,2.00,1.00,2.00,159.00,1,7,46,4.98,709341407596059553),(2812,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/709491776525884425','Light-filled Cottage Studio in Sellwood','This charming cottage studio is newly remodeled with a kitchenette, full bathroom, and a queen bed. It is attached to the back of the house and there is a private exterior entrance. <br /><br />On a quiet, beautiful street in Sellwood, you are within walking distance to numerous restaurants, coffee shops,  and parks. There is free street parking','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-709491776525884425/original/2de7ef95-8320-4419-81de-775158e24d70.jpg',60432956,20,'45.45903','-122.6506',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,82.00,1,20,102,4.99,709491776525884425),(2813,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/710152086069545549','Peaceful, newly renovated home away from home','Come enjoy yourselves! <br /><br />Stay like a local in this brand new listing - a two bedroom Portland neighborhood home. Newly renovated from top to bottom, this bright and clean 1962 home features a dedicated room for work or yoga/exercise/relaxing. Great for work or vacation!<br /><br />Easy access to downtown, Foster-Powell, Woodstock neighborhood, the Mt. Scott Community Center and fitness center, neighborhood parks, local music, food carts, all the necessities, and the beautiful hikes just outside of town.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2aa94356-7c0e-4eff-b6fe-e5257745d13b.jpg',19634831,69,'45.47446','-122.58528',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,127.00,2,90,45,4.98,710152086069545549),(2814,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/711123286067557303','Bright Two Bedroom Cozy Home in FoPo / SE Portland','Minutes from Foster Rd. and Mt. Tabor, this sweet house has all of the amenities to keep you comfy and cozy during your stay in SE Portland.<br /><br />Our home has a fully functioning kitchen, washer / dryer, work station / desk in the main bedroom, plenty of storage for your clothing, and a cute fenced in backyard with a covered outdoor dining space. When in season, pick figs from the fig tree in the back yard!','Foster Powell is a friendly neighborhood located in SE Portland. Close to fun restaurants and bars on Foster Road, a 5-10 minute drive to the bustling areas on Division, 7-10 minute drive to Trader Joe\'s, a 5 minute drive to Safeway, and walking distance to the best little grocery store in all of SE Portland, Bread and Roses!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-711123286067557303/original/85082a82-b23e-47b6-a4e5-a1e0ce809102.jpeg',590514,36,'45.49604','-122.59406',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,105.00,30,1125,8,5.00,711123286067557303),(2815,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/712207156229114625','Libby\'s Retreat - 2 bd in Mississippi / Williams','Beautiful, remodeled 1907 home in fun, trendy, foodie area. The home is well appointed with comfortable furnishings, smart tv flatscreen, a fully functional kitchen with gas range, dishwasher, fridge, washer & dryer in kitchen, and lots of gated outdoor space.  <br />Queen beds in both bedrooms, firm and extra firm hybrid mattresses. The twin daybed has a medium hybrid mattress. <br />The beautiful dining room and living room has lots of space for relaxing and enjoying time together.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-712207156229114625/original/7ef6d6fe-bfe4-4429-b0f2-290eb2a7951f.jpeg',4084831,9,'45.55002','-122.6715',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,190.00,3,60,5,5.00,712207156229114625),(2816,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/712940761331432701','Lovely Quiet Neighborhood In NW/Alphabet District','Situated on Lovejoy Street, catch the streetcar right outside the building’s front door, and explore Portland. There’s a great coffee shop  200 feet from the front door.  Easy walk to great grocery markets, such as Trader Joe’s. Two blocks and you’re in the heart of NW 21st with its eclectic array of restaurants, pizza places, bagel shops, and pubs.  Two more blocks and you’re on 23rd with its Bohemian stores, tea rooms, and European vibe.  The Pearl District is nearby.','When you are at home you will find a quiet neighborhood across from the renovated Film Exchange building that houses professional spaces, including several salons. Under the old studio system in the 1930s, the Film Exchange is where Warner Brothers, Fox, and Paramount, distributed films to the Portland area movie theaters. It is a lovely Spanish Colonial commercial structure brought back to its former glory. While you are at the Film Exchange, check out the Commissary, which bakes the pastries for the local coffee shops.  It’s open to the public on Thursday and Friday.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-712940761331432701/original/e83ca369-baab-4441-86c3-5dcc184cdac1.jpeg',83619132,27,'45.53061','-122.69057',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,30,180,8,5.00,712940761331432701),(2817,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/714467821470104738','Cheerful 2BR Suite, NE PDX, near Fremont & Airport','Cozy up in our brand new construction guest suite! Tall ceilings, huge windows with lots of natural light, and a full kitchen let you stay in an easy location close to everything Portland has to offer. We\'re the perfect spot to have a staycation, work remote from Portland, or serve as home base for a trip to explore the beautiful Pacific Northwest. <br /><br />Main bedroom has super comfy queen bed. Second full bedroom is set up as an office, but easily converts into additional private sleeping space.','Centrally located 10 minutes from the Portland International Airport. Walking distance to restaurants, food trucks, grocery store, coffee shops and more! We are located close to NE Fremont and NE Alberta Street.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-714467821470104738/original/7a7f9282-5fd3-4ae0-926a-e1d4fc49a8a6.jpeg',22262180,21,'45.56046','-122.59628',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,55.00,30,365,17,4.94,714467821470104738),(2818,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/714472984424625043','Private Studio near Alberta Arts District','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. Concordia Oasis close to Alberta Arts District, the Kennedy school, bus line, Alberta park, and Fernhill park. Main level studio with a private entrance, an outdoor garden, full kitchen, full bathroom, and your own washer and dryer in the unit. A relaxing retreat space in lovely Concordia neighborhood walking distance to New Seasons Market, University Of Oregon Campus, multiple parks, restaurants, cafes, and shopping. Close to PDX airport!','This is the beautiful Concordia neighborhood of NE Portland. A short 5 block walk east on Holman will take you to large Fernhill Park (Nature patch, playground, dog off-leash area, full sized track, baseball field, soccer field, Volleyball court, splash pad, playground, walking paths, weekly events) Alberta park is about 10 blocks west and has wooded area, basketball courts, tennis courts, native plants nature trail, large fields). The Airbnb studio is two blocks from the Kennedy school (Vintage bars, heated soaking pool, gardens, restaurant, theater, and gift shop). New Seasons grocery store, Walgreens, Pizza place , peoples yoga studio, Kiss Cafe, and a Tea house are 3 blocks south. Alberta Arts District is seven blocks away with restaurants, music venues, pubs, yoga studios, and art studios! Everything is in walking distance and the bus stops at 33rd and Holman to take you anywhere in Portland!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3a1278e0-6d28-41ef-b06a-c2d9426629eb.jpg',184323147,1,'45.5680963','-122.6309045',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,100.00,30,90,5,4.80,714472984424625043),(2819,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/714914707519927515','Wonderful den with private bedroom & bathroom','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place. Personal entryway free Wi-Fi and cable .Great central location minutes away from shopping downtown pdx and city transportation.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-651134422492850228/original/662ac8a0-0fcf-4cf9-8eb1-94fc481f37cc.jpeg',464680245,48,'45.58159','-122.67576',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,365,4,4.00,714914707519927515),(2820,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/715651972178407069','Downtown Portland with city Views!','Amazing 3 bedroom and 2 full bathrooms with city views in a great location of Downtown Portland. Located close to many restaurants and food carts. Every room thoughtfully decorated for a different experience. Very clean and cozy. Close proximity to Portland State University, pioneer square, public transportation, Saturday market, and freeway.','Public Transportation. Portland State University. Downtown. Food Carts. Easy freeway access. Chevron gas station and market. Dominos. Chipotle. Local bars. Only a few minutes from Pioneer square.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-715651972178407069/original/12cd05e7-726c-4da5-a14d-53a68a99b987.jpeg',111511932,44,'45.51041','-122.68267',1,5,2.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,83,4.90,715651972178407069),(2821,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/715878924416858489','Quirky 1 Bedroom Near Reed College','This stylish one bedroom w/ a queen sized bed is a private world of its own,  tucked across the street from Reed College and located in the upscale East Moreland neighborhood. Newly remodeled, this space offers a fully equipped kitchen and washer/dryer. Thoughtfully curated by hosts whom honor guests, our space is deep cleaned,  aired out and disinfected in accordance with OSHA and the WHO for virus prevention. Also features 2 roll-away twin beds for additional guests.','Eastmoorland neighborhood is a mixture of beautiful maintained homes with wide streets. Reed college is a beautiful open college with walking trails along the stream in the middle of the campus and used by residents in the area as well as students and faculty.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/797eee18-fee0-4875-8171-b7505896bcc5.jpg',54662569,5,'45.47884','-122.63365',1,4,1.00,1.00,3.00,95.00,2,200,85,4.95,715878924416858489),(2822,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/716148753790021423','Vintage Cottage in NE Portland','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway in one of the best neighborhoods in Portland. Located in Northeast Concordia neighborhood near the Kennedy School. Walk to parks, cafe’s, shopping and more. <br /><br />This is a pet friendly home located next to Fernhill park, one of the best off-leash dog parks in Portland.<br /><br />The cottage is 100+ years old and is very special if you like vintage spaces. It\'s not the largest house on the block, but it is the cutest!','Located near Fernhill park, a great neighborhood for walking. Many cafe’s close by. McMennamins Kennedy School is right down the street.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzE2MTQ4NzUzNzkwMDIxNDIz/original/8848981f-c88d-4731-a4bf-8434155a296e.jpeg',40115262,1,'45.56421','-122.62415',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,3,90,16,5.00,716148753790021423),(2823,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/716858136132859567','Midcentury Modern Retreat -3BR/2BA by Starbucks','Experience the heart of Northeast Portland in this chic 3-bedroom mid-century modern home, ideal for families, groups, or business travelers. Accommodating up to 6 guests, it features a dedicated workspace, fast Wi-Fi, and a fully equipped kitchen for both work and play. <br /><br />Relax in the BBQ-friendly backyard or explore nearby Mount Tabor Park, local breweries, and vibrant shopping. This retreat places you close to Portland\'s food scene and outdoor gems—perfect for all your adventures!','Walking distance to local bars and restaurants (Walk Score 87) <br />5 Minutes from Hawthorne\'s Main Strip of bars and restaurants <br />10 Minutes from the Moda Center<br />10 Minutes from Downtown Portland<br />15 Minutes from the Portland Japanese Gardens<br />15 Minutes from the Oregon Z00<br />Minutes away from dozens of Breweries','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-716858136132859567/original/b1eb5f7a-c498-48af-93d2-74dcb8793d87.jpeg',392859086,52,'45.52386','-122.60957',1,6,2.00,3.00,5.00,154.00,1,730,121,4.95,716858136132859567),(2824,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/716870129902164837','The Writer’s Den','Welcome to, The Writer’s Den. A beautiful home that will leave you feeling relaxed and peaceful by the end of your stay. This home has been meticulously decorated. Each item handpicked for your enjoyment. The space has everything you need for a long stay. You’ll feel right at home here, you may not want to leave! <br />This home is located walking distance to two very popular streets in Portland, Hawthorne and Belmont.','Hawthorne and Belmont are two of the most popular and exciting neighborhoods in Portland. You will find everything you need right in these neighborhoods. You can walk to the grocery store, restaurants, coffee and tea shops, food carts, corner stores, bars, etc. This is the most ideal location if you are looking for easy accessibility to some of Portland’s best.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/64d510ff-6710-46ab-9821-f039ddef8a1e.jpg',205079895,16,'45.516','-122.62726',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,30,365,10,5.00,716870129902164837),(2825,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/717481886813195276','The Portland Loft- Stylish Penthouse with Views!','Located in the heart of downtown Portland this top floor corner loft will be your comfy base for enjoying all that Portland has to offer. Walk score of 98 allows you to explore the city without a car. The top floor loft was remodeled in 2006 and features granite countertops, stainless steel gas appliances, vaulted ceilings with skylights. The loft floor plan offers privacy as well as being open and bright with tons of natural light from the windows and skylights.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-717481886813195276/original/089800ea-4629-47d4-8c45-e8979bbda7a7.jpeg',64689549,44,'45.51466','-122.68499',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,144.00,30,365,34,4.62,717481886813195276),(2826,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/717533087089074629','Tranquil Urban Retreat - The Dorian Loft 504','Welcome to Your Urban Retreat at The Dorian!<br /><br />Discover simplicity and comfort in our tranquil loft, perfectly situated for a relaxing getaway.','Just a few minutes walking distance to well loved venue, The Revolution Hall (we suggest making reservations for their beautiful roof top bar, with incredible food, drink and Portland views. Also within one minutes walk to the well known Sandy Hut Bar and Grill which recently turned 100 years old and has become a popular Portland staple. We own a small bar downstairs as well called the Chandelier, stop by for a cocktail or charcuterie board Wednesday through Saturday 4pm-11pm. Very close to the famous Voodoo Doughnuts and several businesses and well loved iconic Portland businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-717533087089074629/original/f18ae2fa-26da-4fc3-92cd-5d2c59b3acaa.jpeg',474734231,32,'45.52223','-122.65099',1,4,2.00,2.00,3.00,239.00,1,28,109,4.82,717533087089074629),(2827,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/718752889700836447','Two-Story Condo w/ Pool & more!','A great home away from home. This two-story condo has everything you could need, including a stocked kitchen, dedicated working space, A/C, deck + grill, ample storage and covered parking space.  Don\'t forget the pool and hot tub :) Step outside your door for easy access to everything; riverfront walking or biking, a short walk to great and iconic restaurants, breweries, bookstores, shops and bars in The Pearl and Downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-718752889700836447/original/f86f6fb6-b045-4be5-ac22-02fecf62f652.jpeg',2292620,43,'45.53011','-122.67414',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,118.00,31,365,3,5.00,718752889700836447),(2828,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/719087935871649418','Cozy Bungalow in Ladd’s Addition • Walk/Dine/Shop','Welcome to “Happy Place”, your cozy retreat that feels like a home-away-from-home in the vibrant heart of Portland! Our sanctuary in the bustling SE Clinton/Division area offers fast internet, perfect for work-from-home needs, and is a short stroll from top restaurants, bars, and boutiques. Boasting a walkability score of 92, city exploration is a breeze. Ideal for foodies, culture lovers, and outdoor adventurers, we provide FREE parking and embrace the spirit of Portland living.','Immerse yourself in a vibrant neighborhood begging to be explored. Meander through charming streets, bursting with top-rated eateries, quaint local shops, and convenient grocery stores. Indulge your palate at our favorite dining spots like Pine State Biscuits, Double Dragon, and Magna Kusina. A few blocks away, discover the fresh offerings at New Seasons grocery. An enchanting stroll leads you to the idyllic Ladd Circle Park and Rose Gardens - a verdant oasis in the heart of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-719087935871649418/original/5682cb46-040a-4be7-af4d-bc62a6682fdd.jpeg',20985428,25,'45.50527374286095','-122.6514853915651',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,99.00,1,30,114,4.89,719087935871649418),(2829,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/719092368603119038','Cozy East Side Duplex with Gorgeous Downtown Views','Perfect for friends, family, or co-workers, this apartment has everything you need. Within walking distance to Clinton, Division, and Hawthorne, you can find endless food & drink, movie theaters, music, etc. At home, enjoy the massive front deck for a beautiful view of downtown. Make a nice pot of coffee, and enjoy a bird’s eye view of the neighborhood. If you have to work, we have high speed internet, and plenty of room to stretch out and get down to business. Work or play, we have it!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-719092368603119038/original/d5239c1e-5ed4-41cd-90ff-81e8fedc874e.jpeg',480100048,25,'45.5024917','-122.6423911',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,2,28,65,5.00,719092368603119038),(2830,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/719138831057020494','Nicki’s Million Dollar View Suite @Pdx Downtown','Amazing downtown location with million-dollar views, private en-suite bathroom, comfortable bed, self-controllable AC/heat, self-check-in and free roadside parking. You\'ll be 7 min a walk from the max. All the restaurants, shops and galleries are nearby. You’ll have, water kettle, microwave, fridge, Smart TV, and free laundry.<br /><br />PSU - 5 min walk<br />Supermarket - 12 min walk<br />Providence park (Timbers) - 13 min walk<br />Keller auditorium - 15 min walk<br /><br />Shared place has Workout area, dining table and couch.','No need for a car here, everything is at walking distance,<br />down town, MAX, PSU, restaurants and nightlife.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzE5MTM4ODMxMDU3MDIwNDk0/original/9b787a6e-512f-409d-8e42-f8dd6f65bbb8.jpeg',103330725,3,'45.51576','-122.69405',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,55.00,1,365,158,4.85,719138831057020494),(2831,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/719485711018080784','Guest house in quiet neighborhood near downtown','Private studio apartment set away from the street to avoid any traffic noise. The guesthouse is a 10 minute bike ride from the downtown waterfront park as well as many great local restaurants and cafe\'s. Tree-filled Irving Park is 1 block away. Located just down the street from public transit and 1.3 miles from the Oregon Convention Center as well as the Moda Center. Come enjoy our beautiful place in the Irvington neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-719485711018080784/original/a5204a5b-6d34-44fc-91e2-974fee616e91.jpg',462390230,26,'45.54518','-122.65926',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,102.00,1,40,160,4.98,719485711018080784),(2832,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/722051988500436655','Lovely two bedroom room with indoor fireplace','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space. With mountain views city views and a Riverview this place can’t be topped','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d761923c-9986-4db6-ac3c-c4c8e64ce105.jpg',480665927,59,'45.52783','-122.66333',1,3,2.00,1.00,2.00,300.00,30,365,1,5.00,722051988500436655),(2833,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/722558423246890995','PDX Studios: 2C - Short & Long-Term Stays Welcome!','PDX Studios: Your Cozy Portland Retreat<br /><br />Welcome to PDX Studios,your ideal Portland home-away-from-home. Nestled in the lively Williams District and close to the Mississippi Historical and Alberta Arts Districts, this cozy space is perfect for short and long-term stays. Convenient for travel nurses and medical professionals with Emanuel Hospital nearby,plus major centers like OHSU just 20 minutes away. Enjoy a warm atmosphere with soothing hues, an inviting bedroom, kitchenette,and private bath.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/04e393ac-d40d-4eba-b1fa-a899f289d1de.jpg',472195025,9,'45.5501729','-122.6682332',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,16,4.88,722558423246890995),(2834,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/722559167308339557','Peaceful Garden Oasis','This light-filled “mother-in-law” gem has been maximized for comfort and livability.  With floor to ceiling windows, multiple skylights, and southern exposure, the house boasts brightness year round. While the footprint may be small, the luxuries are not.  Gas fireplace and cooktop, dishwasher,  full bathtub and shower, in unit washer and dryer, queen-sized memory foam mattress, and air conditioning make this home special.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-722559167308339557/original/da5bd786-c711-4707-820a-daa150ce23d9.jpeg',3588025,58,'45.59432','-122.74282',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,25,730,0,1.00,722559167308339557),(2835,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/723123992700581697','Northeast Portland Charm 2 Bdrm','Have fun with the whole family at this stylish place. Two-bedroom Old Victorian home with a Portland twist, located in a great neighborhood in NE Portland. Just blocks away from Penninsula Park.  Updated new kitchen and bathrooms. Make this your home away from home.','Nestled in the heart of North East Portland, just blocks away from Peninsula Park and walking distance to Kenton, Dekum Triangle and Alberta. Its a quiet and charming neighborhood. <br />Ample street parking and parking in the backyard. <br />House backs onto a quiet alley.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-723123992700581697/original/c4c41db1-76e1-43fc-8616-d959b8edd6ed.jpg',10783143,48,'45.56878','-122.66373',1,4,1.50,2.00,3.00,166.00,30,365,0,1.00,723123992700581697),(2836,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/723356983483276813','Bright 1 bedroom in the heart of the Pearl','Bright, spacious, clean, and safe 1-br in the heart of the Pearl District. . You\'ll be located in one of the most walkable parts in Portland, steps away from the waterfront, bars/restaurants, and other trendy neighborhoods like Nob Hill and Slabtown.<br /><br />Fully stocked with everything you could ever want (this is my primary residence when I\'m in town). Includes: washer/drier, wifi, central heating/AC, dishwasher, etc.<br /><br />Apartment building amenities include outdoor grill, study area, gym and patio.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0326e076-3345-4fa8-80e7-af0136f1be45.jpg',112457577,2,'45.52984','-122.68444',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,2,4.50,723356983483276813),(2837,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/723447024672867336','Bright, gorgeous and cozy house with fireplace.','This 1927 gem of a home has been thoughtfully designed throughout. With its sun-soaked rooms, coved ceilings, arched openings and built-ins, this house oozes charm. The numerous large windows let in loads of gorgeous light. The house is filled with high quality furniture, linens and accessories. There is a working, wood burning fireplace and a chef\'s kitchen.<br /><br />You\'ll be perfectly situated in the heart of NE Portland, walkable to all the trendy streets such as Alberta, Williams and Mississippi.','This house is located in the King neighborhood of inner NE Portland. The King neighborhood is multi-cultural, socially conscious, and has become super popular in the last few years. It is full of cool, historic homes and is close to Downtown, the Alberta Arts District, Mississippi St. and N. Williams. It is bike friendly, pedestrian friendly, and has a really high walk score! <br /><br />King neighborhood was first settled in 1872. It was incorporated into the city of Portland in 1891, and has been a center for African American culture for many years. The Urban Renewal that Portland put in motion in the early 2000s has disrupted this in many ways, but the people who live in this neighborhood want to keep the heart and soul of their neighborhood alive!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzIzNDQ3MDI0NjcyODY3MzM2/original/9d600ee7-a78d-43b2-a5e4-aa68c6147f64.jpeg',2141579,24,'45.56244','-122.66482',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,225.00,4,730,23,4.96,723447024672867336),(2838,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/724199906177888151','Hillside 2 Bedroom Apt-across from OHSU','This apartment is perfect for families, couples, solos, adventurers, here on business, visiting to relax or moving to the area, we think you will enjoy our comfortable home.<br />Beautiful, spacious, quiet, tree-lined home conveniently located just across from the OHSU Hospital with views of the Hills.','-OHSU Student center<br />-Scientists at Oregon Health & Science University<br />-5 minutes from downtown Portland<br />-Nurse school OHSU <br />-Hospital for Children is located at OHSU<br /><br />Marquam Hill Campus<br />Marquam Hill Campus is OHSU\'s largest location. It is located one mile south of downtown Portland. South Waterfront Campus is directly west and connects to Marquam Hill via Portland Aerial Tram.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-724199906177888151/original/27458b9d-446e-4588-8279-8a9bd752a704.jpeg',234902210,30,'45.497277645663615','-122.68991412821802',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,93.00,3,30,18,5.00,724199906177888151),(2839,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/724209134376964588','Cozy Private Apartment','Enjoy a cozy stay near Reed College and Kenilworth Park. This private 1 bedroom apartment has a fully stocked kitchen, private entry, and easy access to public transit and ample street parking.<br /><br />A new in-unit washer and dryer is available for your use.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-724209134376964588/original/25f2d0c1-a981-4ba8-a588-416a8a813f49.jpeg',19700666,61,'45.4901487','-122.6265373',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,77.00,2,365,50,4.92,724209134376964588),(2840,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/725289662533833257','Spacious & Serene w/ Private Backyard + Treadmill','Beautifully updated and well-appointed two-bedroom, two-bath home close to Beaumont Village and the Alberta Arts District. Stunning woodwork and thoughtful amenities offer a unique and tranquil place to rest, visit with loved ones, or even get some work done. Includes central air conditioning and heating, an office/workout space, private backyard, functional kitchen,  gorgeous tub, 2 smart TVs, Bluetooth enabled soundboard, 120v outdoor outlet, free laundry & off street parking.','Friendly, residential neighborhood in the heart of NE Portland. The street is cute & quiet with ample parking. <br /><br />We\'re a 1/2 mile walk to some of the best restaurants and shops in Beaumont Village/NE Fremont Street. We especially recommend Grand Central Bakery, Prince coffee, Pip’s donuts and Chai, Blackbird Winebar, Amalfis, The Arrangement for amazing gifts, and Beaumont Village Market for basics + Portland brands. <br /><br />We\'re also close to the hip haunts on NE 42nd, including Miss Zumstein Bakery, Sorbu Paninoteca (Tuscan food cart), Oakshire Beer Hall, NEPO 42, and one of the best dive bars/karaoke spots in Portland: Spare Room Restaurant & Lounge.  <br /><br />We\'re a five minute drive (or 20 minute walk) to New Seasons Market and the Alberta Arts District. <br /><br />16 minutes to downtown Portland, 12 minutes to the airport, and 5-10 minutes to hundreds of renowned eateries & art galleries--it\'s easy to access any of Portland\'s attractions from our location.<br ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-725289662533833257/original/6989e2e6-a210-4d12-aabd-ff551f477620.jpeg',481269461,21,'45.55632453963853','-122.61510740965605',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,2,28,62,4.94,725289662533833257),(2841,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/725688896006929078','Bright 2 bed/1 bath with Garage Parking','A cozy home-away-from-home, this mid-century condo features 2 bedrooms, a full bathroom with tub, a stackable washer/dryer, a dedicated work area, high speed internet, and on-site covered parking. The condo is in a quiet, walkable residential neighborhood in SE Portland, and is one of four condos in a small 4-plex condo building.','This home is located in a quiet walkable SE Portland neighborhood. Easily walk to beautiful Creston Park, Trader Joes, Keeper Coffee, and Coffee Beer, all within a half mile of the apartment. This unit is located two miles from the heart of the Woodstock neighborhood where you\'ll find the Woodstock Park, New Seasons grocery, multiple restaurants/bars, great coffee shops, Goodwill, and plenty of small, local shops. Going the other direction, you will be two miles to the heart of the uniquely charming Foster/Powell neighborhood (FoPo), with multiple coffee shops, food cart pods, many bars, and classic Portland vibes.<br /><br />Reed college is only 1 mile away, an easy 3 minute drive or 7 minute bike ride.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-725688896006929078/original/4d5d38f1-421f-422f-9e26-d74273961935.jpeg',78879277,38,'45.49011','-122.61974',1,4,1.00,2.00,4.00,108.00,30,270,0,1.00,725688896006929078),(2842,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/726007270625250685','Stylish apartment with a loggia by the river','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-726007270625250685/original/f1858d94-2fd8-4dff-896d-70b023b87464.jpeg',348361462,91,'45.60127','-122.65926',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,726007270625250685),(2843,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/726051602296797640','Welcoming Space- Steps from Mt. Tabor Park','This spacious home has been thoughtfully designed with modern bohemian décor. This is an uplifting space for your stay while you explore the beautiful city of Portland. Whether you want to explore the city’s unique scenery or vibrant culture, this premier location provides you with endless options. This home is less than 3 blocks from Portland’s hidden gem: Mt. Tabor Park. You are close to some of Portland’s top-rated restaurants, bars, and food trucks on Division, Hawthorne, and Belmont street.','Mt. Tabor neighborhood is best known for its beautiful city park, Mt. Tabor Park- an extinct volcano just a short 5-minute walk from here. The park features numerous walking paths, tennis courts, basketball courts, majestic fir trees, and breathtaking panoramic views of the city and water reservoirs at the peak of the park. This is a destination for explorers, hikers, walkers, bikers, dog-walkers, and birders. Families with kids can enjoy the playground and picnic area. <br /><br />Distance to local attractions: <br /><br />Mt. Tabor Park: 3 blocks/5 min walk to first entrance<br />Rain or Shine Coffee: 1 block/2 min walk<br />Green Zebra Grocery: 0.5 miles/3 min drive<br />the heart of Division Street (restaurants, bars, and food trucks): 0.5 miles/3 min drive/15 min walk<br />Hawthorne Blvd (restaurants, bars, and Portland culture): 1 mile/6 min drive<br />Laurelhurst Park: 1.5 miles/8 min drive<br />The Moda Center: 3.6 miles/11 min drive<br />Downtown Portland: 2.6 miles/11 min dri','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-726051602296797640/original/ff6525b5-3500-482a-92e5-cf2139cf29e7.jpeg',159947287,15,'45.50891','-122.60309',1,10,3.50,4.00,6.00,269.00,1,1125,115,4.96,726051602296797640),(2844,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/726114668174057348','Pristine Renovation w/ Epic Location, Hot Tub','If you are looking for the perfect combination of location, amenities, along with décor and furnishing, the Mississippi Villa will be hard to beat. Sitting just one block from the famous Mississippi Avenue you are seconds from some of the best food, drinks, and entertainment Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-726114668174057348/original/673b80e3-461f-4fe8-abb6-e0ac4872fc64.jpeg',62261998,9,'45.55349','-122.67502',1,10,3.00,5.00,7.00,295.00,3,29,40,4.78,726114668174057348),(2845,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/726881571984081547','Hillsdale Guest House, Close-In SW Portland','Hillsdale is one of close-in SW Portland\'s coveted neighborhoods. This home is located on a quiet, dead-end street in the central west-side of Portland.<br /><br />Walk to SW hills hiking trails, parks, coffee, and public transit. <br /><br />Just a short drive to Multnomah Village, Raleigh Hills, Downtown Portland, Lake Oswego, Beaverton, Hillsboro, the Willamette River and Portland\'s east side.','Quiet, dead-end street. Residential neighborhood, close-in SW Portland, West Hills. <br /><br />Walking trails, public transit, easy access to neighborhood amentities like parks, schools, coffee, shopping, etc.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-726881571984081547/original/4f27c160-be94-445e-93a8-5b729f8a77f6.jpeg',3666843,70,'45.4905','-122.71133',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,140.00,30,350,3,5.00,726881571984081547),(2846,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/729180941575654368','Long Term Architectural SW Hills 3bed 2 bath','This unique place has a style all its own.','peaceful established residential neighborhood, good for long term stays .','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-729180941575654368/original/efefa768-58a2-4142-817f-cd32e8f1c97a.jpeg',971012,31,'45.4692378155871','-122.69603736698627',1,6,2.00,3.00,4.00,350.00,30,365,1,5.00,729180941575654368),(2847,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/729265811685215463','2bd Home | Dog Friendly | Central Location','Centrally located with quick access to PDX, Downtown Portland, Alberta Arts District, and all major freeways, getting you to any work event or outdoor adventure of your choosing quickly.  <br /><br />A Cully neighborhood retreat, just fully refreshed with light and bright paint, beautiful vacation-inducing landscaping,  and brand new kitchen appliances, all met with unique pieces of art and adventure artifacts highlighting just a few of the many gems Oregon has to offer.<br /><br />IG: Cully_Retreat_PDX','The Cully neighborhood is a slow-moving and quiet neighborhood sitting at an elevation just right to enjoy a view of Mt St Helens from the front patio. You\'ll see neighbors strolling by each morning taking their furry friends to the local dog park or getting their daily power walk. <br /><br />In typical Portland style, this neighborhood is full of great food, drink, and in under an hour, you can find yourself immersed in your favorite outdoor adventure!<br /><br />FOOD, DRINK, SWEETS<br />(walking/biking up to 5 min drive distance)<br />  - Nico\'s Cantina<br />  - Hi-Top Tavern<br />  - Oakshire Beer Hall<br />  - Upright Brewing (coming winter \'22)<br />  - NePo42<br />  - Taco Pedaler<br />  - Otto\'s Pizzeria<br />  - Kainos Coffee<br />  - Bison Coffee<br />  - Ben + Esthers Vegan Jewish Deli<br />  - Pip\'s Donuts<br />  - Nico\'s Ice Cream<br /><br />GROCERY<br />(biking/walking up to 10 min drive distance)<br />  - Trader Joe\'s<br />  - Safeway<br />  - Whole Foods<br />  - Fred M','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/750436f2-4811-4aff-a913-3f36d78c2577.jpg',23113393,21,'45.55852','-122.58334',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,140.00,2,29,34,4.88,729265811685215463),(2848,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/729761991989336932','The Ascentuary','A rare and magical get away in the trees. This space is located on the ground level of the home. We host space for creators of all kinds, On a vacation or passing through for work this location is near most amenities, yet set up in the peaceful hills near happy valley area in Portland..','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cb763539-52a2-42e7-89d0-f26b35f36a74.jpg',379187817,77,'45.46642','-122.53713',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,111.00,30,60,2,5.00,729761991989336932),(2849,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/729832173908648098','The Lydia','Traveling professionals, find your home away from home with our charming rental unit. Equipped with high-speed WiFi, off-street parking for two (2) vehicles, and all utilities included, you\'ll have everything you need for a comfortable and convenient stay. Enjoy a peaceful and quiet neighborhood in the heart of Inner SouthEast Portland, OR, with easy access to top employers & hospitals.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-729832173908648098/original/9b788220-3ccc-4bfd-8838-22a17026a7b0.jpeg',47581293,32,'45.52022','-122.64003',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,4,5.00,729832173908648098),(2850,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/729851001241949301','One bedroom suite in historic Isam White House','Clean third floor one bedroom suite in the historic Isam White House with bedroom, living area with convertible sofa, dining area, kitchenette and private bathroom with shower. Includes access to 3rd floor private balcony (furniture removed in fall / winter) .  One of the last grand mansions downtown that hasn\'t been converted to condos or offices. We are at the shopping and restaurant districts of Northwest 21st and 23rd Avenues. Walkability score of 97!','Northwest Portland, Nob Hill, also known as the Alphabet District offers sophisticated shopping, dining and people-watching. Victorians, Colonial Mansions, boutiques and restaurants line the streets of this neighborhood that\'s ideal for leisurely strolls, while the adjoining Forest Park was made for hikes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-729851001241949301/original/fa48f19b-2d55-4f79-a61f-7ed9e23ff858.jpeg',7409866,27,'45.52514619999999','-122.6926936',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,1,1125,108,4.92,729851001241949301),(2851,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/731137342154059342','Great Mississippi Location w/ Secure Parking!','Cute and tidy 2 Bedroom plus dedicated office with 2 Full Bathrooms. Walking distance to some of the best restaurants, coffee, & shops Portland has to offer. <br /><br />High Speed Internet and Apple TV. <br /><br />Secure, fenced, private  parking plus plenty of street parking. Convenient location in the Mississippi neighborhood - close to downtown and the Williams/Vancouver area. Walking distance to the MAX line. Close to I 5.','1-2  blocks from a jazz club, food carts, a German brew pub, amazing coffee (Capitola Coffee and The Fresh Pot) and some of Portland\'s most well thought of pizza (Lovely 50/50\'s). A few more blocks away is more breweries, vegan ice cream, burgers, Thai, sushi, Italian, Scandinavian and famous donuts (Blue Star) cute boutiques, marijuana dispensary and more. <br /><br />Stroll Mississippi Ave to many great restaurants, music venues, shops and cool places! <br /><br />7 blocks from the Williams/Vancouver corridor. Which has more great restaurants, a Barre 3 studio, liquor store, a great grocery store (New Seasons) and more. <br /><br />Easy access to downtown from the property. Via car or public transportation. Close to Veterans Coliseum and the  Moda Center.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ac7be2f8-c6c1-4b09-a6e4-62894068a43b.jpg',10920081,9,'45.553111','-122.674762',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,228.00,1,120,86,4.99,731137342154059342),(2852,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/731353931061536966','private room & bath Laurelhurst','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. The entire unit is mostly private. We only need access occasionally. Guests have free use of yard and outdoor seating areas.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-731353931061536966/original/f50dad5d-c248-447a-a119-54cf5ad45d4d.jpeg',10928596,12,'45.52741','-122.63379',2,1,1.00,1.00,2.00,49.00,31,90,0,1.00,731353931061536966),(2853,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/734682333185993354','Lovely Condo Alphabet District','This gorgeous contemporary 880sf 1 BR, 1.5 BA condo in NW Portland\'s historic Alphabet District has a fully equipped kitchen, gas cooking, in-unit full-size laundry, gas fireplace, balcony, and assigned underground parking.  Furnishings include linens, coffee maker (Keurig or Nespresso), spices, BBQ grill, and more.  <br /><br />With a walk score of 95, you\'ll find many great restaurants and and some of Portland\'s most unique retail shopping starting just a block away.','Northwest Portland offers sophisticated shopping, dining and breath-taking views of the city.  Northwest Portland’s historic Victorian homes reimagined as boutiques, galleries, theaters and restaurants exude Old Portland charm in this walkable neighborhood that’s close to the Pearl District, Old Town Chinatown and downtown Portland —as well as Forest Park, with its 70 miles (113 km) of trails to explore in Portland’s west hills.  Within just 2 blocks of the condo you will come upon some of Portland\'s best dining experiences.  There are over 75 bars, restaurants, coffee shops and ice cream parlors within a 20 square block area.  Also walkable are grocery and liquor stores, a meat market, FedEx shop, and the most unique retail shopping west of the river.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-734682333185993354/original/2776421e-cc6a-4f45-ba42-99025617f519.jpeg',927951,27,'45.52802324516975','-122.70110687419566',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,105.00,31,122,0,1.00,734682333185993354),(2854,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/734802604830008560','Stylish tranquil Southwest Portland getaway','Welcome to our Midcentury modern pied-à-terre near Multnomah Village within a peaceful and quiet neighborhood! It is very centrally located, with easy access to trails, and within a short easy drive to downtown Portland. It is also strategically located with easy access to the Willamette Valley (1hr), or to the Gorge for hiking (1hr). It is halfway between the Oregon coast and Mount Hood (about 1.5hr each way). In other words, it is perfectly located to explore Portland and Northern Oregon!','We have a great quiet neighborhood, with easy access to trails and walking paths. Multnomah Village is just around the corner with access to great food, bars and local shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-734802604830008560/original/2a7696ec-3664-4481-ac15-5758d9143270.jpeg',6243014,83,'45.4566849','-122.7311356',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,77.00,2,360,85,4.94,734802604830008560),(2855,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/734994207908547884','Private and Elegant Condo - Precious Location!','This Fully-furnished 1 bed-1 bath condo is ideally located in a quite and secure historic building, a block from Providence Park. Steps to grocery stores, medicare, countless restaurants, and many iconic landmarks. The location is surrounded by downtown Portland, the Pearl and NW 23rd districts - lots of fun! Walking score is 98, a mainline Max stop next to the building and easy access to plenty of street parking available all around. This place will has all you need for a long term stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-734994207908547884/original/50e9d708-25a2-49e1-be87-648eaef551ef.jpeg',457161382,3,'45.522','-122.68889',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,90,730,0,1.00,734994207908547884),(2856,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/735420134908965150','Fabulous Spacious Condo in the heart of Portland','This tranquill and spacious condo has all you need for a longterm stay in Portland. It is located in a very private and quite building with plenty of good amenities, and just a block away from the famous 23rd Ave in Nobhill, where all the funs are gathered.  You are going to find the most peaceful and convenient experience at our place. Welcome to Portland :)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-735420134908965150/original/6ea75584-bcac-4998-9fce-a1cb38f58e6b.jpeg',457161382,27,'45.52765','-122.70174',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,70.00,150,730,2,4.50,735420134908965150),(2857,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/735631897148630149','Historically Refurbished 1909 Duplex in the Trees','Located in inner N Portland close to the MAX line, Mississippi Comercial Distric and I5. 10 minutes to downtown.','Overlook','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-735631897148630149/original/8df3b341-3c15-43d1-9ad9-8b64eb7e39d6.jpeg',72716191,13,'45.55936','-122.68624',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,85.00,31,364,0,1.00,735631897148630149),(2858,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/735664483136331173','Walk to everything from our cozy 1 bd ADU.','Welcome to the Beech St BnB! This ADU is a spacious 675 sq. ft 1 bedroom, 1 bath private apartment. Unwind from a day visiting with family and friends or from touring around the Beaumont/Wilshire neighborhood. It is close to public transportation, the airport, and the city center. Beech St Bnb is ideal for couples, solo adventurers, business travelers, and people visiting their families who live nearby.','Beech St BnB is located in the heart of Beaumont Neighborhood. <br /><br />Highlights include:<br />- 1 block from Fremont St with multiple restaurants, coffee shops, and <br />   shopping. <br />- Some of our favorite spots include Bagel Land, Little Griddle for brunch, <br />   Prince coffee, Pips donuts for their famous little donuts, Tacovore, and <br />   Saibang Thai for tasty and quick thai food. <br />- Local clothing boutiques such as Folly & Adorn<br />- For kids there is a game shop at Puddletown Games & Puzzles, as well as a <br />   kids book store at Sunshine Books. <br />- Grab some local art items at several spots, but one of my favorites is Breeze & <br />   Branch. You can even take an art class there!<br />- Sign up for a facial or massage at The Jungle Room located in Bosk and <br />   literally right across the street from the ADU.<br />- Grab a quick beverage or snack right across the street at Everest market.<br /><br />Beech St BnB is located close to all the po','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3215ce36-b44b-448d-a272-bef2027fa650.jpg',20743858,46,'45.55098','-122.61931',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,125.00,1,28,93,4.99,735664483136331173),(2859,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/736286948060532000','Beautiful downtown studio vacation home with patio','Beautiful downtown studio in residential home setting. Immediately off Portland State University campus. Walk to all downtown venues. Art museum, Symphony, Theatre, Restaurants, Farmer\'s Market. Lots of pluses. Your own outdoor deck, full kitchen, large windows, excellent lighting, gas fireplace, washer/dryer. It is an isolated pocket of turn-of-the-century homes on the lower edge of Portland\'s South West Hills Neighborhood, just off Broadway and off the south end of the Park Blocks.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-736286948060532000/original/f0e3a949-3401-4d09-ade7-2d430a2f5a41.png',483342821,54,'45.5090147','-122.6877937',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,123.00,30,90,0,1.00,736286948060532000),(2860,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/736514022686748633','Hazelwood getaway in NE Portland #2','Welcome to my Portland home!<br /><br />My name is Jake and I live with my dog (Peaches) and cat (Barnaby) in the Hazelwood neighborhood of NE Portland. <br /><br />Private upstairs bedroom with shared bath, super comfy queen mattress, and a TV!<br /><br />15 min drive to downtown 15 min drive to the airport. Very close to MAX light rail (closest station 3 blocks away) and a golf course with an amazing brewery.<br /><br />Perfect place to call home for a month+ while you settle in Portland :)  <br /><br />Very quiet neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-588293421871372350/original/28485ace-3f96-41d8-88ea-6aec912a4a6e.jpeg',426284483,63,'45.52519','-122.51912',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,30.00,30,365,4,4.50,736514022686748633),(2861,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/738488406586540247','Cozy 2 bedroom Home Near Mississippi St','Newly remodeled spacious home, which is centrally located, 10 minutes downtown Portland, 1.5 blocks off of the I5 interstate, in walking distance to many restaurants and shops.  This home is in a quiet centrally located neighborhood .','The location is one of the most convenient locations in Portland. The neighborhood walk/bike friendly, and located next to tons of public transportation. It also is filled with a variety food choices/breweries within a 1mile radius. There is also a park with a rose garden within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-738488406586540247/original/12951df2-6829-4b2f-bcdb-8f4fc9206d6e.jpeg',483735464,24,'45.55854','-122.67576',1,6,1.00,2.00,2.00,175.00,1,30,19,4.95,738488406586540247),(2862,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/738682585451111470','Convenient NE PDX | comfort modern living','Thoughtfully designed, cozy, renovated basement-level guest suite that is approximately 800 sq ft, located in Northeast Portland. You have your own private entrance with easy on-street free parking.<br /><br />Less than 15 minutes driving distance from I-5, Moda Center, Convention Center, PDX airport, restaurants, parks, and coffee shops! Convenient bus stops a few walking minutes away. Let us know if you’d like specific recommendations.','We are located in the Piedmont neighborhood, known for the amazing & free to public Peninsula Park, which includes thousands of roses in the summertime. <br /><br />We are also a 10 minute walk to a local neighborhood that has the original Breakside brewery, local pizza joint, and a fantastic Italian restaurant, just to name a few options! <br /><br />We recommend checking out the local restaurants, and art shops, and just taking a stroll down Alberta St., just to see what it really means to \"Keep Portland Weird!\"','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-738682585451111470/original/aa1cd73d-747f-4cc2-abb7-6bc517b7ea0f.jpeg',264587074,48,'45.57146','-122.66422',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,30,211,4.99,738682585451111470),(2863,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/739859122134328071','Cozy room in unique Victorian close to nightlife','This cozy Victorian house is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit and explore Portland. Tall ceilings and vintage features give it an old-fashioned flair. Take a bath in the original clawfoot tub from the turn of the century. Visit nearby shops, bars, restaurants, music venues, and explore all the fun Portland has to offer. Centrally located, close to public transit and highways with lots of free parking.<br />House is shared with a friendly local who loves meeting travelers!','Our neighborhood has a quiet, friendly atmosphere. Tall trees line the street and there is a diversity of ages and families of different generations in the area. Although our street is quiet, we are in the middle of the city, close to major roads and many bars, restaurants, shops, and music venues. Typical inner city sounds abound, including traffic, passersby, and the occasional horn or siren. See live music at the Wonder Ballroom or discover Ethiopian cuisine at nearby Queen of Sheba restaurant.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/97d99140-770a-4e09-91e6-35611fba0600.jpg',114720959,26,'45.53842','-122.66293',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,1,1125,13,4.92,739859122134328071),(2864,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/739973521873812669','Private studio in SE Portland!','- Check-in: 3pm / Check-out: 11am (if we are able to, we can honor unique times.)<br /><br />- Washer/drier, on-demand water-heater, wi-fi with apple speaker<br />- TV with netflix, disney, HBO, hulu<br />- Half a mile from the Green MAX line (Lents/Foster stop)<br />- Queen-size bed + pull-out couch, can sleep 4 (probably most comfortable for 2 though).<br />- Small kitchenette (2 burner hot plate, toaster/convection oven, refrigerator)<br />- Access to grill and outside firepit','We live in the Lents Neighborhood of South East Portland, half a mile from the Foster/Lent\'s Green Max line and half a mile from the I205 Foster exit.<br /><br />There are a few parks nearby (Lents park... go Pickles!, Glenwood City Park) and Kelly Elementary School.  Bella\'s Italian Bakery is a cute coffee cafe 2 blocks away.  We are also close to Flip Side Bar and Food Carts.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzM5OTczNTIxODczODEyNjY5/original/e12893e7-b034-4bca-8429-3be90d36c6f3.jpeg',13613391,72,'45.4754753','-122.5700172',1,3,1.00,0.00,1.00,80.00,30,30,46,5.00,739973521873812669),(2865,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/740049473507358706','Lovely 1-Bedroom condo with river view!','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-740049473507358706/original/a191ad2a-765a-4e18-830d-54a3b95eb5b0.jpeg',289572266,22,'45.4853947','-122.6733703',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,30,180,0,1.00,740049473507358706),(2866,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/741164837264194419','PDX Studios: 3B- Short & Long-Term Stays Welcome!','PDX Studios: Your Cozy Portland Retreat<br /><br />Welcome to PDX Studios,your ideal Portland home-away-from-home. Nestled in the lively Williams District and close to the Mississippi Historical and Alberta Arts Districts, this cozy space is perfect for short and long-term stays. Convenient for travel nurses and medical professionals with Emanuel Hospital nearby,plus major centers like OHSU just 20 minutes away. Enjoy a warm atmosphere with soothing hues, an inviting bedroom, kitchenette,and private bath.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1e4c9638-9c71-46f9-9c4b-3103400f3cab.jpg',472195025,9,'45.55046','-122.66929',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,365,22,4.73,741164837264194419),(2867,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/741990840694328986','Central & Cozy in Hollywood!','Welcome! <br /><br />This is a shared space with a private room.  It is a beautiful centrally located apartment in Portland, Oregon.  This is in a vibrant community; with groceries, a farmer\'s market, a theater, and local shops a block away!   <br /><br />It’s set up with all items: a full kitchen, bath tub, & living room that feels super sweet.  <br /><br />It has new floors, fresh paint, and new mattresses. There is off street parking.  <br /><br />There is another tenant named Miguel here currently. Thank you for your interest!','-Walkability Score of 94*<br /><br /><br />-Centrally located in Northeast <br />-Sizzle Pie Pizza, Sushi Chiyo, and Doe Donuts Vegan Ice cream near<br />-3 grocery stores by foot (Trader Joe\'s, Whole Foods, and Grocery Outlet 5 minute walk)   <br />- Farmer\'s market on Saturdays<br />-24 hour fitness within walking distance<br />-Hollywood Max Center two blocks away and buslines<br /><br />This is below an urban wellness space.  It is urban so we ask you to lock doors and bring bikes inside.  That being said we have never had a problem!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-695642759922619224/original/1e74e2a1-fcc6-4b8a-b5cf-f0c4427ffcb1.jpeg',13588271,84,'45.53517','-122.61932',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,120,8,4.63,741990840694328986),(2868,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/743397552725911399','Classic Bungalow, Great Area','Enjoy easy access to popular shops and restaurants from this charming place to stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-743397552725911399/original/3ba4bfde-69ba-47c1-8493-a4a91711248b.jpeg',22737017,8,'45.50092','-122.63033',2,2,1.00,2.00,1.00,66.00,30,90,0,1.00,743397552725911399),(2869,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/744104995413838746','Luxury Tiny House Getaway','This memorable place is anything but ordinary. Custom Designed with a Scandinavian air in mind. This brand new tiny house has all the comforts of a big house in a space that feels airy and light-filled.','5 min drive to Proud Mary\'s and Alberta Arts District<br />5 min walk to 42nd Street where you can find bars and restaurants like Nepo 42 and a Vegan Food Cart Pod<br />15 min walk to Fremont street where you can find restaurants such as Grand Central Bakery or Red Sauce Pizza<br />15 min drive to the Pearl District where you can find the famous Powell Bookstore and several restaurants shops and bars<br />10 min drive to Broughton Bach Park where you can enjoy a peaceful Morning Walk on the Columbia River<br />15-20 min walk to beautiful city parks around<br />Easy access to Columbia River Gorge highway 30 and to Mount Hood, Hood River and surrounding nature escapes','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-744104995413838746/original/2898c6e6-d7ee-4608-8fab-1da9be9b712b.jpeg',28313660,21,'45.55997','-122.61575',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,30,1125,64,4.97,744104995413838746),(2870,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/745170507580930579','Colorful, Light-Filled Bungalow in Inner NE PDX','My bungalow is a cozy, colorful, and light-filled 1bed/1bath with everything you need for a short or extended stay.  Located in a quiet, tree-lined, and walkable inner NE neighborhood, the century-old home showcases Portland charm, friendly neighbors, and access to all that Portland offers.  Cozily read in bed; watch streaming services from the plush couch; cook and eat a meal on the porch, dining nook, or bar; use the dedicated workspace; or sweat it out on the Peloton in the workout room.','I hope you enjoy exploring the neighborhood and this beautiful city I get to call home!  I chose to buy this home because of its location, safety, beauty, and considerate neighbors.<br /><br />Sabin/Irvington neighborhoods are lined with trees and historical homes to enjoy during a stroll, run, or bike ride. Beautiful Irvington Park is a ten-minute walk. Visit the nearby and very popular Alberta St., Williams St., Killingsworth St., or Fremont St. by foot or bike for restaurants, boutique stores, bars, cafes, and grocery stores! Last Thursday is held on Alberta Street and is filled with music, food, artists, and vendors. The house is uniquely central-- drive to the airport, Forest Park, or SE neighborhoods all within 15 minutes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-745170507580930579/original/9255f6ae-830e-4d97-9a57-5d57b6ffb08a.jpeg',143151,6,'45.5543685','-122.6522102',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,2,730,39,4.95,745170507580930579),(2871,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/747026997784201029','Modern + Cozy 1br in the heart of SW Portland','Ok, here\'s how this goes. Head out the door and choose wooded trails, or the 1/2 mile stroll to the best croissant of your life.<br /><br />Sip coffee brewed on the award winning Ratio Six and curl up with the Apple TV, or plug in at the desk and get some work done.<br /><br />Head to wine country, a short jaunt downtown, or over to Portland\'s Eastside for culinary experience.<br /><br />Enjoy a quiet, beautiful neighborhood that is central to all that Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-747026997784201029/original/79294b45-dd97-4fe7-8e11-e98c6f7cc159.jpeg',375783,31,'45.47096','-122.69237',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,107.00,2,30,32,4.84,747026997784201029),(2872,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/747323959182331555','Quiet Redwood Retreat','Relax in this * peaceful * contemporary * cozy *  guest house in North Tabor that has all the essential comforts from home. You will love the high ceilings and the calming aesthetic with a short walk to the trails of Mt. Tabor. Grab a bite or brew at the neighborhood town of Montavilla. See a show at one of our local venues. The private suite is an easy commute to just about anywhere in Portland.','North Tabor is nestled along the north side of Mount Tabor and is served by the 60th MAX station, the 50s bikeway, and bus lines along Burnside, Glisan, and 60th, offering convenient access to I-84.  NE Glisan runs through it. <br /><br />North Tabor offers easy walking distance to Mount Tabor Park (best kept secret in Portland), Montavilla breweries, coffee and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-747323959182331555/original/c232bf34-1b85-4d04-ae27-efd8c904778c.jpeg',5839728,52,'45.52436','-122.60246',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,3,180,42,5.00,747323959182331555),(2873,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/747846220490653978','Enjoy Sunrise at the River','Enjoy this centrally-located spot great for getaway and business travel. <br />River views from every room and private roof top. Located walking distance to the Pearl district and Downtown. <br />Full of great restaurants, parks and bars. Cross the Steel Bridge and take a 10 minute walk to the Moda Center, home of the Portland Trailblazers and  concerts. The condo is located right across a  3 mile loop that goes through Tom McCall waterfront great for runners, bike ride or just to walk around and explore!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-747846220490653978/original/67a07a1e-899a-4bac-b1ec-43de9205d282.jpeg',22667801,43,'45.52678','-122.67253',1,2,2.00,2.00,0.00,180.00,30,1125,0,1.00,747846220490653978),(2874,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/748044805266769206','Cozy & Bright Smart Home in SW Portland','My property spans a generous third of an acre, striking the perfect balance between privacy and sociability. Whether you\'re enjoying a quiet evening on the porch or joining in on neighborhood gatherings, my home seamlessly integrates into the fabric of this dynamic and evolving community. Step into this modern oasis where every detail has been meticulously curated to enhance your comfort and convenience. Bathed in natural light, this smart home welcomes you with open arms!','Quiet, family-oriented neighborhood. Less than 10-minute drive to any adventure of your choice: <br />Downtown Portland<br />Downtown Lake Oswego<br />Trails & Parks<br />Nightlife<br />The Oregon Zoo<br />Hundreds of Restaurants & Food Carts (Yes - hundreds. We have an amazing food scene here. Ask me for recommendations.)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-748044805266769206/original/57187e66-5786-455f-8f06-59ff88eff3a6.jpeg',37853275,68,'45.43657','-122.73894',1,6,2.00,2.00,2.00,175.00,30,365,1,5.00,748044805266769206),(2875,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/749493346472349392','Akoya Stay - Free Parking/Pearl District/Downtown','Akoya, one of the four types of Pearls in the world. Welcome to Pearl District in PDX! <br /><br />Simple yet elegant, the Akoya Stay combines convenience and style. Location is extremely walkable and offers quick access to Whole Foods and the MAX Light Rail. Simply step out of the building and get lost in the brewery blocks, fine dining, entertainment & premier retail shopping.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/66b09eff-794c-4f99-9927-7ff9f5c64e16.jpg',183340435,2,'45.52721','-122.68534',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,140.00,2,365,103,4.96,749493346472349392),(2876,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/749604589248680927','NW Portland Oasis walkable to DT Shops & Dining','A true one of a kind stay in newly remodeled Victorian home in NW Portland. This home was established in 1890. Your MCM inspired oasis has been updated with modern touches while maintaining its original charm. Boasting a walking score of 98, it is the perfect place to come relax after a walk to countless shops and restaurants. Nestled in the Alphabet District, this city oasis straddles Downtown Portland, the Pearl District and the infamous NW 21st and 23rd ave.','Our home straddles the Pearl District and Alphabet District. It is within walking distance to shops and dining.  Great for walking and running.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-749604589248680927/original/3c741e04-ca70-44a0-a049-5afa87caed59.jpeg',17654502,27,'45.5262','-122.68822',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,88.00,1,1125,90,4.93,749604589248680927),(2877,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/750105963970945538','Cozy Daylight Basement Apartment','Our cozy daylight basement apartment is clean and bright, with easy access to downtown and east Portland. <br /><br />Just off 205 and near Division, our neighborhood Montavilla is well known for its coziness and quaint vibe. Our house is a south-facing 1950s ranch-style home nestled between two huge maples. <br /><br />The basement apartment has a large south-facing window and two east-facing windows, perfect for watching the sunrise.','Montavilla is a cute neighborhood just east of Mount Tabor. Our house is located just a five minute drive from Tabor which is a great place to run, walk, or bike. We are also close to Powell Butte, and Rocky Butte, great places for hikes and sunrise views. <br /><br />The downtown Montavilla area is located just five minutes away by car or a 15 minutes bike ride. There’s tons of BIKETOWN bikes around if you want to be car free during your stay. Downtown Montavilla has a ton of great food options, from Pizza to Sushi and everything in between.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-750105963970945538/original/affb0390-cae3-47a5-869d-92a2c3eae683.jpeg',56527701,10,'45.50891','-122.57476',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,4,90,21,4.81,750105963970945538),(2878,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/750231205752146268','Cozy family friendly ranch close to amenities','This comfortable ranch is perfect for families and friends looking to explore the best of Portland. You won’t have any trouble getting around or finding things to do! Close to public transit (2 1/2 blocks to Max station) - short Max ride to Expo, Moda Center and downtown. Easy walking or biking distant to restaurants, cafes, bars and shopping along trendy N Mississippi and Alberta Arts District. Free off street parking for up to two vehicles','Home is located in the Overlook neighborhood of North Portland. Centrally located with close access to public transit. Easy walking and biking to entertainment, restaurants, bars, groceries and shopping.  A perfect base camp for exploring Portland and the surrounding area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-750231205752146268/original/a21c24a9-d735-48ad-9e38-81e265bc37ca.jpeg',485855141,13,'45.55911','-122.68195',1,7,2.00,3.00,4.00,149.00,2,45,76,4.99,750231205752146268),(2879,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/750260372351835719','The Loft; N. Portland','Private Loft Apartment – Designed and built by Connor 2022<br /><br />Centrally located in N Portland, a few blocks from the University of Portland and easy access to the many eateries, coffee shops, and outdoor experiences that St. Johns has to offer. A true haven for visiting parents, business travelers, couples and solo travelers alike. <br /><br />You’ll love the aesthetic and amenities, such as a King sized Casper mattress. Pet and Smoke Free environment.','This area is bustling with character! It’s mostly older homes and new families, so most nights are pretty quiet. There’s a great local coffee cart a few blocks away, as well as Starbucks, several restaurants and taverns within walking distance. Local charm abound in this area!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-750260372351835719/original/55736bcb-4f5c-4dc4-a279-c21f80ab03b4.jpeg',6358589,60,'45.58611','-122.72383',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,365,80,5.00,750260372351835719),(2880,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/750340629024400008','I offer the best service you’re welcome','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-750340629024400008/original/0d34bd6e-458b-4254-b888-52b8efdff7f8.jpeg',485867552,60,'45.59164579999999','-122.7273948',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,30,365,8,4.75,750340629024400008),(2881,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/750901238372577461','Private Entery Suite In The Heart Of SW Portland!','Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located private entry suite with an attached bathroom. Free parking on the quiet street right out front.<br />Walking distance to bars, restaurants, OHSU, and the south water front. You\'ll have a Keurig, microwave, mini fridge/freezer, Smart TV/projector, and a dedicated work space with a printer. This unit is attached to the main house. Please note that this unit may have noise from everyday living and pet noise from the main house it\'s attached to','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/0f612f37-ecae-4f29-9c6c-809fb9f307a1.jpg',150582690,22,'45.48735','-122.67858',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,2,365,25,4.84,750901238372577461),(2882,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/751305215989667691','Inviting 2 bedroom home w/ garden and free parking','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. Feel right at home as you pull up in the driveway surrounded by lush gardens. Get out and enjoy downtown Portland just minutes away or stroll to some of the best neighborhood eateries and bars within a half mile nestled amongst the adored Alberta Arts district and Woodlawn neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-751305215989667691/original/572f36a5-a404-4764-a4cb-4364f0d2dc44.jpeg',82716541,45,'45.56993','-122.64955',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,90,6,5.00,751305215989667691),(2883,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/751406487906734054','The Auric Door Inn on Mississippi','Stay in a piece of Portland history right on Mississippi Ave! Recently renovated, this 1896 home features old Portland charm, contemporary finishes and designer touches. Two private bedrooms and one private office w/ full sized bed. Spacious living area & kitchen. Large yard for people watching & outdoor meals. <br /><br />Bars, restaurants, coffee shops, food carts and shopping are all within walking distance. Easy freeway access and a stone\'s throw from the bus line. Off street parking available!','Mississippi Avenue is 10 minutes north of downtown Portland, in a historic northeast neighborhood. North Mississippi Avenue features a long stretch of vibrant shops, unique bars, music venues and restaurants. Expect a little bit of everything along Mississippi Avenue!<br /><br />Grocery: <br />New Seasons Market - Williams  <br />Cherry Sprout Produce - 722 N Sumner St<br /><br />Coffee & Tea: <br />Fresh Pot  <br />Capitola Coffee <br />Albina Press <br /><br />Neighborhood Restaurants: <br />Welcome to JamRock  <br />Mississippi Delta<br />Gravey<br />Mama Khouri\'s <br />Mississippi Pizza <br /><br />Parks: <br />Overlook Park  <br />Skidmore Bluffs<br /><br />Bars: <br />The Rambler <br />Prost <br />The 1905<br />Psychic Bar<br /><br />Shopping: <br />Flutter <br />The Blackhorn Mercantile <br />Sloan<br />The Meadow <br />Paxton Gate','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-751406487906734054/original/0ba1e45c-5d00-4ff0-b4c6-7740de12bd08.jpeg',221421926,9,'45.55247771079813','-122.67533924520204',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,157.00,1,180,47,4.85,751406487906734054),(2884,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/751466143120941858','The Artist\'s Garden - Tiny Studio Cottage','Get cozy in this adorable SE Portland studio. Situated in the garden, this blue gem provides comfort and convenience in a unique Portland tiny home experience. Perfect for a solo traveler or a couple looking to explore SE neighborhoods with easy access to Portland State University, Reed College, and downtown.','This quaint studio is located in an up and coming SE neighborhood with walking distance to great coffee, groceries, restaurants, bars, a pharmacy, and more. Additionally, the studio is situated between the popular Woodstock and Division neighborhoods.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-751466143120941858/original/4f1fc199-5462-4706-87b0-df35ef95343b.jpeg',221421926,38,'45.48946','-122.61887',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,31,365,29,4.52,751466143120941858),(2885,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/752115267659581256','Elegant Richmond Gem nestled up to Hawthorne Blvd.','Come enjoy this delightfully renovated home tucked in right between two of PDX\'s most renowned and beloved treat streets. Infamous Hawthorne Blvd. & Division st. boast the best selection of shops, eateries, bars, theaters, etc. this wonderful city has to offer. The space itself is a completely updated  and gorgeous 1 bed/1bath unit in a historic duplex. Right on a city Greenway for pedestrians and bikers heading between downtown and Mt. Tabor, there truly is a bit of everything to explore here!','A few blocks North you\'ll find Hawthorne Blvd. with nearly anything you can imagine available right at your fingertips. The same South is bustling Division street with eateries galore. Lincoln Greenway is a straight shot from Downtown to Mt. Tabor and provides easy access through the city with minimal car traffic. Plenty of public transport is available and without wait on Hawthorne, Division, and Cesar Chavez Blvd. \"My Vice\" is a local brunch spot with outstanding food and drink within a block from the house. New Seasons Market is 3 blocks north for any groceries needed during your stay :)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-752115267659581256/original/0f6e9c1b-bd66-493e-9b4f-26987eb6bb1c.jpeg',135529356,8,'45.5073','-122.62173',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,2,365,88,4.93,752115267659581256),(2886,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/752496894983364059','Fantastically Located Urban Retreat: Painted Hills','Broadway is a bustling street in the heart of Portland. This cozy unit, referred to as the Painted Hills Suite, in a fourplex is located on the Eastside near the Moda Center, restaurants, etc. Downtown Portland is a 7-minute drive across the bridge.  Sitting just three blocks from the BIKETOWN rental location, you have a number of transportation options.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-752496894983364059/original/7a1b5939-c263-4811-9462-6e6646ce76f4.jpeg',62261998,59,'45.53389','-122.65832',1,8,1.00,2.00,3.00,96.00,3,29,27,4.52,752496894983364059),(2887,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/753338173161413470','Daylight Dreaming. Exceptional New 2-Bedroom Condo','Great unit all to yourself! From the upgrades throughout, all fully renovated! Spacious living areas to brand new appliances, this light and spacious place is your next vacation rental! Plenty of space to talk, visit, watch tv, sleep, read, enjoy your own back patio and more!<br />Great condo with full amenities. 2bed/1bath, full kitchen, W/D in unit. Nice hardwood floors, spacious open light. Unit comes with a single car garage. <br />Centrally located, and right off the local Metro bus routes.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-753338173161413470/original/aa6b07b8-38bd-474c-b293-3de95529d09d.jpeg',41102088,78,'45.50182','-122.52157',1,2,1.00,2.00,4.00,107.00,30,365,0,1.00,753338173161413470),(2888,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/753950808614510253','The Smith House, a Quaint 1941 Portland Cottage','Our quaint 1941 cottage is the perfect way to step back in time and experience the charm and splendor of old school Portland.<br />Our home is a one of a kind original gem. We have maintained all of its original character while adding in comfort amenities. <br /><br />Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located home. Walk to Alberta Arts, Mississippi Street, Grocery Stores, restaurants and coffee shops , Irvington Park, Moda Center and the convention center. Walk Score 90','We have free off street parking for our guests.<br />Our home is in an excellent neighborhood with the best location in town.<br />We are on a quiet street and have wonderful neighbors.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzUzOTUwODA4NjE0NTEwMjUz/original/bc870900-21fa-4cc7-80f8-c39f0eb775cc.jpeg',12846561,14,'45.54923','-122.657',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,185.00,2,365,9,5.00,753950808614510253),(2889,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/754232993941617458','Charming SE Portland - Prime Location','Located in what is one of the most desired locations in Portland with walkable bars, restaurants, food carts, parks, grocery, bike path and more. 3 massive bedrooms although one is set up as a kids room. 1 large bathroom with tub. The master offers a deluxe Cali King and the second bedroom has a Queen all with great light. The main floor has plenty of space for relaxing and full kitchen for cooking. Front porch is awesome for morning coffee or evening cocktail.  Fenced yard, dogs ok.','Inner SE Portland is considered one of the more sought after areas for locals and visitors.  Historic charm, great accessibility, popular restaurants and bars, shopping and so on.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-754232993941617458/original/7b45437b-1ee1-4bc4-b478-5c626744fc3e.jpeg',1872896,25,'45.50872','-122.64086',1,6,1.00,3.00,2.00,200.00,30,365,2,5.00,754232993941617458),(2890,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/755150674288332173','Freshly renovated, swanky duplex.','This chic space is nestled on a quiet street in the hip Brooklyn neighborhood, a stone\'s throw from downtown. Coffee shops, parks, restaurants, antiques, Max line and pubs all within a few blocks, make strolling around a real pleasure. With all new furnishings and amenities throughout, including WIFI, a dedicated work space and a cozy king size bed, you\'ll stay in comfort with a modern vibe. There is even a private cozy patio with a unique bamboo Zen fountain and BBQ perfect for chilling out. .','The historic Brooklyn neighborhood still has it’s old school charm, but new gems are improving it every year.  Earning a walking score of 90, within 1/2 a mile there are 10+ restaurants, 5 bars/pubs, 4 coffee/tea shops, 3 minimarts, 2 parks, an antiques shop, pharmacy, a fantastic German deli, live theatre venue, post office, and even a Cider house , Bottle shop(beer) and a dispensary all with great selections. There really are things to do in every direction and  It definitely makes strolling around a real pleasure.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-755150674288332173/original/181ae233-ca5d-4a7e-b799-78ea456c7998.jpeg',486782124,56,'45.496198861100375','-122.65108708198137',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,130.00,3,120,22,5.00,755150674288332173),(2891,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/755546773009805742','Superbly Located Urban Retreat: Silver Falls','The Silver Falls Suite is one of four units located on this Broadway property in the heart of the Portland, right off the streetcar line near the Moda Center, Convention Center, Downtown and all the infamous foodie joints. Sitting just three blocks from the BIKETOWN rental location, you have a number of transportation options.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-755546773009805742/original/98ef7b92-baaa-4c28-bce2-1aed1e681a9b.jpeg',62261998,7,'45.53543','-122.65612',1,8,1.00,2.00,4.00,91.00,3,29,33,4.33,755546773009805742),(2892,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/756032983528475416','Lovely 2 bedroom 2 bath apartment!','The whole group will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place. 15 mins away from the airport. Gas station directory across the street! Also 3 restaurants across from the apartments. In the home there are 2 full bathrooms, 2 full bedrooms with tvs included, Wi-Fi installed and full kitchen. <br /><br />Gym is downstairs with fob access.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-756032983528475416/original/90515c38-43c8-4356-9a20-85d332ddab5b.jpeg',138656740,92,'45.60244','-122.67626',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,756032983528475416),(2893,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/757186695951578047','Adorable Portland Retreat < 8 Mi to Downtown!','Gain access to Portland and its top attractions while having your own private space at this lovely 2-bedroom, 1-bath vacation rental! This home features a welcoming interior with a fully equipped kitchen and a fenced-in yard with a fire pit and grill where your pets can roam without any worry. You’ll have easy access to downtown as well as plenty of local spots to eat and shop. Catch a Trailblazer’s game at The Moda Center or brighten up your day by viewing an exhibit at The Portland Art Museum.','AREA ATTRACTIONS: Davis Graveyard (1.5 miles), Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden (2.7 miles), North Clackamas Aquatic Park (3.2 miles), Leach Botanical Garden (4.1 miles), Oak Amusement Park (4.2 miles), USS Blueback Submarine (5.6 miles), Moda Center (7.6 miles), Washington Park (9.5 miles), Portland Japanese Garden (9.6 miles), Oregon Zoo (9.6 miles), Hoyt Arboretum (10.3 miles) <br />THE GREAT OUTDOORS: Elk Rock Island (4.5 miles), Mount Talbert Nature Park (5.1 miles), Tryon Creek State Natural Area (7.3 miles), Powell Butte Nature Park (7.6 miles), Gabbert Butte (10.1 miles) <br />HISTORY BUFFS: Milwaukie Museum (2.9 miles), Oregon Museum of Science and Industry (6.5 miles), Portland Art Museum (7.5 miles), Oregon History Museum (7.5 miles), World Forestry Center (9.8 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (11.6 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-757186695951578047/original/a7133838-fdb5-4f02-a226-4d0d8ee60ee7.jpeg',121688409,69,'45.4663','-122.59999',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,66.00,30,1125,4,4.75,757186695951578047);
INSERT INTO `listings` VALUES (2894,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/757494742161675641','Mid-Century Modern Gem Near Multnomah Village','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. Large windows reveal a wooded retreat in the heart of SW Portland. Close to urban trail network and parks. Wildlife and nature are abundant.<br /><br />When you want to head out, you\'re minutes to Multnomah Village, Lake Oswego, Sellwood, and downtown Portland. Beach, mountains, wine country and the Columbia River Gorge are all within 30-90 minutes.<br /><br />The space is newly renovated with a designers touch. A daylight basement apartment with private entrance.','This is a quiet, peaceful neighborhood in a very wooded, serene part of Portland. <br />One of the best parts of this area is the feeling you get when you’re outside… it feels like a forest with the best quick access to all the City has to offer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-757494742161675641/original/5876d25a-4805-44ae-ab63-6eee812017c3.jpeg',96898246,83,'45.4508026','-122.7319382',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,30,1125,2,5.00,757494742161675641),(2895,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/757943341506854184','Spacious 2 BR /1 bath w/ Gas fireplace & laundry','You will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place. Close and easy access to I-84 & I-205, easy to get around town and hop over the bridge to Vancouver, Wa. The airport is less than 5 miles. The Gorge, Mt Hood, Mt St. Helens, and Oregon Beach are all within 1hr-2hr. Great for day trips.','A quiet neighborhood, close to the airport.  Shopping and getting around are easy by car.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-757943341506854184/original/72318a2b-c9b4-40b2-b3db-a234c0035885.jpeg',487307218,40,'45.5478157','-122.5423223',1,4,1.00,2.00,4.00,80.00,30,30,1,4.00,757943341506854184),(2896,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/758568648776945468','Groovy Modern Retreat in Alberta Arts!','A modern artists daydream located steps from some of Portlands most treasured restaurants, shops and parks. Enjoy spacious, bright, and airy living spaces made for those who truly want the Portland \"feel.\" Featuring stunning art throughout the home, groovy features and unique plants in each room. Stocked with eco friendly, non-toxic products and energetically balanced before each new guest. Integrate yourself in the Alberta Arts District, centrally located with a Walkscore of 83!','Integrate yourself in the Sabin neighborhood/Alberta Arts District, 10 minutes to downtown Portland and walkable to some of Portlands most desired restaurants, coffee spots, and locally owned shops- you can\'t beat this location. Check out our custom neighborhood guide for the best recommendations!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-758568648776945468/original/23936ab2-d0ce-465e-9f21-e63c61ae728a.jpeg',487407932,6,'45.55238856592287','-122.65469185458103',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,229.00,2,28,94,4.91,758568648776945468),(2897,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/760163436599997694','4 BDR Long Stays Pet Friendly','Welcome to Rose City House! <br /><br />Make this spacious, newly renovated 1922 craftsman your home away from home for your extended stay in Portland. <br /><br />Sprawl out across 2 floors in this spacious and cozy home:<br />*Pet friendly<br />*All utilities included<br />*Driveway parking for 4 cars<br />*Walk-in closets for storage<br />*Fully stocked kitchen <br />*Dedicated workspace<br />*Fast internet<br />*Ethernet<br />*65 inch Roku TV <br /><br />Conveniently located off I-5 and Highway 30 near PDX airport, Moda Center, 10 minutes from downtown.','Piedmont is a cute neighborhood that offers bars, restaurants, coffee shops and parks. Make sure to stop by the stunning Peninsula Park Rose Garden to see the roses if you\'re visiting between May and October. The location is close to I-5, MAX and public transit.<br /><br />Message us for recommendations!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzYwMTYzNDM2NTk5OTk3Njk0/original/64eafd9f-17de-4fda-aac9-86b8cd6efc3a.jpeg',192117374,48,'45.576243343473635','-122.66737432564253',1,10,1.50,4.00,5.00,149.00,30,365,63,4.92,760163436599997694),(2898,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/760953576527081522','Artsy apartment in NE PDX (montly min)','Stay in the heart of the Alberta Arts district. Walk to everything that NE Portland has to offer; coffee, parks, eats, gyms, shopping and galleries. 10-15 minutes from downtown and the airport.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-760953576527081522/original/4ae0e480-f54f-4208-96ff-75bd747d1548.jpeg',487868768,1,'45.56086','-122.64247',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,30,365,0,1.00,760953576527081522),(2899,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/761159231447024130','Your Portland Home Away From Home','This 3 bedroom home lies within a quiet and peaceful neighborhood. It has a fully fenced backyard with a patio table to enjoy the outdoors. Indoors, you will find comfortable and cozy couches to watch your favorite shows or relax reading any of the books from the shelf. There are also plenty of amazing food cart pods nearby. If you enjoy the outdoors, there is a park within walking distance with many other parks and trails within a short drive. The home includes two work stations.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-761159231447024130/original/246425f4-9e17-488e-83b5-8320ce59e7a0.jpeg',127449972,69,'45.471669307713356','-122.59304996308427',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,80.00,30,365,5,4.80,761159231447024130),(2900,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/761722528688946815','The Humboldt Abode','A fully renovated and remodeled basement featuring a private entrance and on-site laundry room. This mini apartment boasts a new bathroom, beautiful kitchen and dinette area. Spacious enough to stretch your legs, cozy enough to feel right at home. Walking distance to many eateries, allowing you to taste all the amazing food Portland has to offer. If you\'re looking to let your hair down a bit, the Downtown area is merely a 7 min. drive away and will provide you the ultimate night out you deserve!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-761722528688946815/original/0129b804-2886-4c2a-8c84-a66b76ca55ed.jpeg',488015807,9,'45.55239','-122.66503',2,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,90.00,2,365,29,4.86,761722528688946815),(2901,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/761723198428833974','Comfy Rustic Modern Tiny House','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. Tucked away in the historic Albinia District you are just a short drive away from the Moda Center arena and the Downtown night life. You will have the best of both worlds: A rustic cabin feel in the heart of city life. Cozy and inviting, yet spacious enough to comfortably sleep 4. Peaceful getaway to relax and unwind.<br /><br />Please come and visit us to enjoy all that the city of Portland has to offer!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-761723198428833974/original/249b3f88-4b63-4f5d-8a21-4aae65ce1864.jpeg',488015807,9,'45.5531736','-122.6654255',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,135.00,2,1125,132,4.91,761723198428833974),(2902,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/763138676352579110','Charming vintage studio DT Portland','This special place is an adorable Studio in the Heart of Downtown with Washer/Dryer in Unit! - Great studio unit in the Empress! Enjoy being close to everything downtown Portland has to offer. The Empress is in a great, accessible location. Easy access to the highway, located near numerous transit options, and a quick walk/bike ride to numerous eateries.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-763138676352579110/original/97c06942-5301-4482-9cfc-24753c5e8d4a.jpeg',340860910,27,'45.52322230000001','-122.6870309',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,30,90,8,4.63,763138676352579110),(2903,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/763278557466324285','A Modern Sanctuary in Woodland Garden','We’re happy you’re considering a stay with us. Our home is located in a quiet neighborhood with forest-like surroundings. The property is near adorable Multnomah Village, where legendary food carts, restaurants, cafes, and shops are all just a lovely stroll away from each other. Fifteen minutes by car to downtown Portland, twenty minutes to the PDX airport, near-by access to I-5, a TriMet bus line stop just up the street—our place offers a great home base for your next visit to Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-763278557466324285/original/e7a02877-77d7-4730-a84a-e42e6a4d1a11.jpeg',5386496,75,'45.468','-122.72905',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,1,30,37,4.97,763278557466324285),(2904,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/763911243873013844','Peaceful Sanctuary','Relax and renew in this peaceful studio apartment.  Sleep deeply with a comfy mattress and no city noise. Wooded park nearby for morning or afternoon strolls. You can walk to Multnomah Village or Gabriel Park.  Quiet, safe neighborhood with easy parking.<br /><br />The photos are from my travels to India and Nepal as are the bed coverings.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-763911243873013844/original/46a4029c-fa3f-49b8-abd4-a0306a96edae.jpeg',13136838,18,'45.4611875','-122.7227443',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,5,4.80,763911243873013844),(2905,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/765129266078344425','Historical Portland Home < 2 Mi to Downtown!','Fall in love with the charm of The City of Roses while you stay at this equally stunning 4-bedroom, 2.5-bath home! The vacation rental boasts a location near public transportation, downtown, and local dining and shopping, while providing guests with a beautifully maintained space to call home during their stay. Enjoy the private garden in the morning while you sip coffee, then venture out and discover the vibrancy and uniqueness of local shops and more throughout the different quadrants!','PORTLAND HOT SPOTS: Northeast Broadway - shops, restaurants, bars & bakeries (walking distance), Moda Center (1 mile), Oregon Convention Center (1 mile), Alberta & Mississippi Arts Districts (1 mile), Vintage stores, coffee shops & bars on Southeast Belmont Street (3 miles), thrift stores, bookstores & dining on Southeast Hawthorne Boulevard (3 miles), Portland Art Museum (3 miles), Oregon Zoo (6 miles) <br />GET OUTSIDE: Colonel Summers Park (2 miles), Lan Su Chinese Garden (2 miles), Portland Audubon (5 miles), Washington Park (6 miles), Tualatin Hills Nature Park (14 miles) <br />WINERIES & VINEYARDS: Fullerton Wines (3 miles), Hamacher Wines (18 miles), Hawks View Winery (19 miles), Alloro Vineyard (21 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (7 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-765129266078344425/original/58e2501b-46d6-4eae-b009-ef2d00d4fbe8.jpeg',121688409,7,'45.5369','-122.64974',1,10,2.50,4.00,5.00,383.00,2,1125,21,4.62,765129266078344425),(2906,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/765154119553277992','Charming Historic Portland 2 Bedroom Apartment','It’s all about Portland in this charming historic two bedroom apartment. This 100 year old apartment features original hardwood floors, moldings, windows and doors with splashes of stained glass throughout. We have decorated this home with art from local artists, it’s all about Portland!  Located within walking distance to markets, fabulous restaurants, local bars and public transportation this is sure to be the perfect spot for those looking to experience historic Portland to its fullest.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-765154119553277992/original/7dd0c376-fc51-4e7f-b9e9-2afc4da8b8f9.jpeg',147708508,16,'45.5158672','-122.6335861',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,115.00,30,90,5,5.00,765154119553277992),(2907,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/765421272081685934','KING BED w HOT TUB! >10 min from DT PDX','Treat yourself to our relaxing airbnb :) Equipped with 2 large bedrooms full kitchen and backyard￼! Located within walking distance to charming Multnomah Village￼<br />amenities include:<br />• NEW Hot tub<br />• Sauna  <br />• King bed <br />• A/C <br />• Blow drier & hair straightener <br />• Plenty of air purifiers and fans to <br />• Board games <br />• Automatic coffee <br />• Premium mattresses, <br />• premium pillows & bedding <br />• 65\" smart TV<br />• 2 humidifiers with aromatherapy <br />• Yamaha sound bar & sub & Bluetooth speakers <br />• blender','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e827a855-b3c7-4974-a2dd-0cbe2a060594.jpg',488672037,34,'45.45965','-122.72058',1,6,1.00,2.00,5.00,144.00,1,1125,171,4.85,765421272081685934),(2908,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/766222983615935022','New Renovated 2 bed townhouse near Nike, OHSU','This stylish place to stay is perfect for business professionals, traveling nurses and anyone coming to Portland needing furnished accommodations for one month or longer.  It\'s also great if you are between homes or renovation your current home.','Located in Raleigh Hills, you are within walking distance to a grocery with a Starbucks, a pharmacy and a few restaurants.  Although it\'s a busy road, the property is set far back and there are walking paths.<br />You are also in close proximity to several shopping centers and parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a53d4f41-8737-412b-a765-ca0d1b063975.jpg',30942269,70,'45.48783','-122.72828',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,94.00,31,365,7,5.00,766222983615935022),(2909,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/768304797187577153','Rare Mississippi Ave Suite - 94 WalkScore, Disney+','◦ NEW A/C<br />◦ Apple TV with Disney+<br />◦ Wireless Phone Charger<br />◦ Private Patio with Outdoor Table<br />◦ Small Kitchenette<br />◦ Add-On: Baggage Drop, Early Check-In, Late Check-Out (When Available)<br />◦ Near Mississippi Ave Neighbourhood (94 Walk Score)<br />◦ 5 min drive from Moda Center, 8 min drive from Downtown<br />◦ 1 min walk from restaurants, record store, grocery store, MAX Line<br /><br />Note: This is a private suite with a separate entrance on backside of the home. Front of home is unaccessible to suite.','Mississippi Avenue features a long stretch of vibrant shops, unique bars, music venues and is in walking distance to some of Portland\'s best restaurants and food carts (including incredible gluten free and vegan options).<br /><br />Steps away from Border Nord, Gravy, Victoria Bar, Prost, Miss Delta, Uchu Sushi, Lovely\'s Fifty-Fifty (featured on Chef\'s Table), Matt\'s BBQ (featured on Somebody Feed Phil and Diners, Drive-ins & Dives), Kate\'s Ice Cream (Vegan), The 1905 Jazz Bar, Blue Star Donuts, Men-Sen Thai, Bar Bar, Sweedeedee and Por Que No.<br /><br />Get coffee at Albina Press, Capitol Coffee, Bastion Coffee and more.<br /><br />Grocery store and convenience store around the block.<br /><br />Shop at Pistil\'s Nursery, Sunlan Lighting, Paxton\'s Gate, The Meadow, Mississippi Records, Cherry Sprout Groceries, Rose City Comics, ReBuilding Center, and Sock Dreams.<br /><br />Enjoy the annual Mississippi Street Fair and the rose gardens and fountains at Peninsula Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-768304797187577153/original/e43827cf-f4a8-45a6-8e57-1e385272c60a.png',89844621,24,'45.56015','-122.67437',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,52.00,2,120,167,4.87,768304797187577153),(2910,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/768931760655186587','Centrally located 1 Bed Home on Hawthorne-New AC','Enjoy Portland while staying in our spacious 1-bedroom home located in the heart of the city in the Hawthorne District. We are excited to host you in our newly remodeled guest space with new Mini Splits for AC and heat while you are exploring the city. Whether you are traveling for vacation or business, our charming, historic home has all you need to rest and recharge.','The Hawthorne district is known for its bohemian vibe and an eclectic mix of quirky gift shops, bookstores and resale boutiques along Southeast Hawthorne Boulevard. Low-key eateries include classic diners, taco spots and vegetarian restaurants, while pubs, music clubs and beer bars make for lively nightlife. Mt. Tabor Park, on an extinct volcano, has walking and biking trails and panoramic city views.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-768931760655186587/original/e2e94dc5-a8ec-4eea-a2d9-bd0bbda926e3.jpeg',33928647,16,'45.51302','-122.6285',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,1,28,107,4.93,768931760655186587),(2911,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/769200425606834444','La Casita','Walking into each room of La Casita will give you a different feeling, from tranquil ocean chill to soft desert sunset to colorful floral jungle, luxurious pirate captain quarters and a mystical room in the sky... Plus, the front porch, back patio and urban forest oasis give you access to the nature while in the heart of St. John\'s.','St John’s is a unique, fun Portland place! The house is a close walk to cafes, grocery stores, gym, shops, a little movie theater, parks etc. <br /><br />Historic Cathedral Park (with its iconic St. John’s arched green bridge) and Pier Park (a natural haven full of cedar trees and a disc golf course) are minutes away.<br /><br />Cathedral Coffee,  Daydreamer Coffee, West Coast Fitness, and the food cart pod at St. John’s beer porch are all less than a 10-minute walk. Downtown St. John’s is a few minutes by car, or a 15-minute walk. Stroll the streets and see a variety of PNW trees and flowers, plus seasonal holiday lights.<br /><br />About the block—there are two overgrown properties on our street for sale that we expect will be turned into lovely new homes soon. Currently, they add a lil quirk! The neighbors who live on this street are fantastic. They take care of their places as we’ve love on ours, and we all look out for one another.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9f417915-7e0a-4853-89d1-437ded720ada.jpg',38738358,58,'45.59102','-122.74149',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,769200425606834444),(2912,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/769640157609873966','Spacious Suite in Urban Farmhouse','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene 1912 farmhouse nestled next to Johnson Creek and the Springwater Corridor greenway. Your open suite includes a private bathroom and sitting room-office. <br />Cozy up around the fire pit on the large deck, and enjoy our six ducks as they waddle around the yard and provide your breakfast eggs in the spring and summer. Walk 2 blocks to the famous Cartlandia food carts, or rent a bike and enjoy Portland the local way.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-769640157609873966/original/bfe0ac81-e43e-4c8e-a9ad-19b1ee529a13.jpeg',128635441,69,'45.46182544992708','-122.58463028465576',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,38,10,5.00,769640157609873966),(2913,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/770273458151493831','PDX Pad on Clinton','- Freshly renovated<br />- Incredible central location<br />-Modern finishes<br />- Fully size functional kitchen <br />-Washer + Dryer<br />- Smart TV<br /><br />Just renovated! Two-bedroom apartment in historic SE Portland home with private access, located in the middle of all the restaurants, shops, galleries, and nightlife Clinton Street has to offer.  150 Feet to La Moule, Cafe Broder, Dots Cafe, Clinton Street Coffee House and several other restaurants and bars.<br /><br />5 minute walk to the heart of division street as well!','Hosford-Abernethy is a neighborhood in the inner Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. While Clinton street has plenty of it\'s own spots, Division street in only 2 blocks away and offers it\'s own selections of boutiques, restaurants and bars.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-770273458151493831/original/8441e2c7-72c0-438a-9f27-4a0b74d9fa29.jpeg',43639745,25,'45.50411','-122.64036',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,2,21,57,4.96,770273458151493831),(2914,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/771116464191677446','Portland Getaway!  Visit the Alberta Arts District','Come visit Portland, and live like a local! Modern guest house with all the comforts of home while on vacation. Located in the Alberta Arts District within walking distance of popular Alberta Street with loads of restaurants, bars, galleries and cafes.<br /><br />Amenities included: full kitchen with cooking implements, dishwasher, coffee maker, coffee/tea, blow dryer, shampoo, conditioner, body wash, towels, washer/dryer, detergent, bedding, ironing board, iron, air conditioner/heater, private entrance.','The house is in the Alberta Arts District.  <br />Lots of shopping and restaurants and cafes just blocks away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/83fd27f2-a90f-43ad-ab85-ad086119368d.jpg',128445968,1,'45.55615','-122.63924',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,71.00,30,60,84,4.94,771116464191677446),(2915,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/771171342966033406','Hazelwood getaway in NE PDX #4','Welcome to my Portland home!<br /><br />My name is Jake and I live with my dog (Peaches) and cat (Barnaby) in the Hazelwood neighborhood of NE Portland.<br /><br />Main floor office bedroom with shared bath, super comfy queen mattress, and a TV!<br /><br />15 min drive to downtown 15 min drive to the airport. Very close to MAX light rail (closest station 3 blocks away) and a golf course with an amazing brewery.<br /><br />Perfect place to call home for a month+ while you settle in Portland :) <br /><br />Very quiet neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-588293421871372350/original/28485ace-3f96-41d8-88ea-6aec912a4a6e.jpeg',426284483,63,'45.52382','-122.51756',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,30.00,30,365,4,4.75,771171342966033406),(2916,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/771183966925479816','Location, Location, Location & Comfort','Attention foodies, shoppers, bikers, coffee connoisseurs, and beer lovers! No need to look further: If you love walking, you\'ve found your Portland headquarters here. Creative chefs, bold baristas, and trendy traders are around the corner. From concerts at the Crystal Ballroom and soccer games at the Providence Park to urban hikes in one of the largest city parks where you can find an award winning rose garden and a Japanese tea house. Streetcars and max lines are close to further explore PDX.','The NW District of Portland--aka Nob Hill and Alphabet District-- is one of the oldest and most established neighborhoods in Portland with two commercial high streets. The most famous one is 23rd Ave, which is filled with superb restaurants and mostly local shops, however, you\'ll also see Pottery Barn and RH too. Two blocks east is 21st Ave, which is mostly for nightlife with many bars, a cinema, and a few specialty shoppes from tattoo, rare books, and high end deli and gourmet finds. Both avenues are great for getting desserts and coffee:  Salt and Straw, Eb & Bean, Barista, Sterling Coffee. Your Airbnb can be found exactly in the center of these high streets. As the name conveys: you\'ll find the streets that go from east/west are your named streets that are in alphabetical order with Burnside St as the divider between the Northwest and Southwest quadrants of Portland. The north/south avenues are numbered with descending, each block getting you closer to the Willamette River, the cent','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-771183966925479816/original/8afa15c5-ad68-4861-906d-ef3c98d61713.jpeg',8525373,27,'45.52659','-122.69563',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,1,4,54,4.93,771183966925479816),(2917,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/771361361062690139','Boho Chic Townhouse Unit: The Ideal Portland Base','Chic, ideally located 1BR, 1BA separate downstairs unit in townhouse with private entrance. Perfect for commuters, situated in a safe neighborhood on a bike-friendly street.<br /><br />Access to washer & dryer.<br /><br />Kitchenette comes with new appliances: Microwave, XL Air Fryer, & Induction Cooktop (no conventional oven/stovetop).<br /><br />Walkable to Providence Hospital, Supermarkets, Starbucks, Tabor Tavern, Laurelhurst & Mt Tabor Parks.<br /><br />Commute to downtown:<br />Car: 8min<br />Bike: 19min<br /><br />Experience comfort & convenience!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-771361361062690139/original/8cdec195-7e08-4c1b-84ce-bb4e51357c1e.jpeg',23534283,52,'45.525298','-122.607747',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,93.00,30,1125,2,5.00,771361361062690139),(2918,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/772044202098632064','Welcome to La Casita!','Enjoy a laid back experience at this centrally-located place. North Tabor Montavilla neighborhood has much to offer. Close to freeway, bus-lines and Max train. 10 minute walk to numerous local bars an restaurants, short drive to downtown. This one bedroom house is in a quiet neighborhood. But close to many great local attractions','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-772044202098632064/original/dce642c0-cdab-4736-a942-38b2d1cdb158.jpeg',20452429,10,'45.53166','-122.59203',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,87.00,30,365,2,5.00,772044202098632064),(2919,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/772586702616210074','Casa Duende Guest Unit in Sellwood, SE Portland','Welcome to our apartment suite, Casa Duende! Conveniently located just 10 min south of the city,  in the heart of the charming, coveted Sellwood neighborhood. Wake up to quaint historic homes, singing birds and friendly smiles. One of the most walkable neighborhoods in Portland,  just few blocks from a grocery store, bars, coffee shops and restaurants. Access to running and bike trails, and a beautiful park on the river. Perfect for a couple or friends, work trip, or checking out the city.','We are located in lovey Sellwood, a historic neighborhood with craftsman homes, parks, river and city views, and all the ammenities. A few blocks walk from the New Seasons grocery store, bars, coffee shops, restaurants, and historic antique shops. Check out our neighborhood guide below also! <br />Just across Tacoma street, you will find Sellwood park with small sandy beaches, walking/running trails, and Oaks Park (the oldest amusement park in the state!). The park is adjacent to the docks, where residents sunbathe in the summer, and paddle board, kayak and canoe year-round. Access to the Springwater corridor trail is just two blocks from us. The brightly lit ramp between the house and garage leads you right down to the French doors of your private entrance. There are no stairs, and free street parking! Perfect for a couple of any age, two friends, a professional on a work trip, or someone simply checking out the city. <br /><br />Neighborhood Guide:<br /><br />-New Seasons Grocery Sto','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-772586702616210074/original/e2c4eee4-5db9-47a7-9eac-1a78d5f47576.jpeg',489883774,20,'45.46162','-122.65646',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,98.00,1,4,98,4.88,772586702616210074),(2920,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/772624272005415799','Studio Apartment in NW Portland','Experience Portland’s top-rated, family-owned hostel, in the vibrant Northwest District! Enjoy a FREE breakfast and explore nearby downtown attractions, Washington Park, the Rose and Japanese Gardens, and hiking trails. Join our daily free events like walking tours, tap tastings, live music, and trivia nights. For over 25 years, our mission has been to provide a welcoming, affordable, and safe space, connecting Portland with travelers worldwide and making a positive impact locally and beyond.','We are located in the Northwest district, just a few blocks from popular shops, cafes, pubs, cinemas, and some of the city\'s best restaurants. Many area attractions, including the Pearl District, downtown Portland, Saturday Market, Portland Farmers Market, Powell\'s Bookstore, art galleries, the Lan Su Chinese Garden, museums, the MLS Stadium, and Pioneer Square, are within walking distance. The Rose Gardens and Japanese Gardens are a short bus ride or a 25-minute walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-772624272005415799/original/4a2abfb2-1d15-49c2-a7db-d8195b6cbf7b.jpeg',2820851,27,'45.52497','-122.6902',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,118.00,1,365,4,4.75,772624272005415799),(2921,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/772719108396426474','Quiet comfortable home','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay. Perfect for those traveling for work, relocating, or just vacationing in the Portland area.  Have access to camping equipment, hiking equipment, kayaks, and a paddleboard. The landlord lives in a lower unit, easily available for questions and requests, the only shared space is the laundry room.','Pleasant Valley - quiet neighborhood, the house is on a dead-end street but easy quick access to 205','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-772719108396426474/original/cde51f10-0620-4fbe-9c81-ad616097e210.jpeg',145813310,77,'45.472038139225496','-122.52717692157329',1,6,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,6,5.00,772719108396426474),(2922,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/772740366403108396','Luxury in Portland\'s Alberta Arts District','This beauty is in the Alberta Arts district within walking distance of popular Alberta Street with loads of restaurants, bars, galleries and cafes. <br /><br />The entry level hosts an office, master bedroom with ensuite, a second full bathroom with a deep tub and shower, and  laundry.  <br /><br />Climb the stairs to another master bedroom with a queen size bed, with an ensuite, an additional half bath, and open floor plan kitchen/dining/living room bathed in natural light.  <br /><br />Within 15 minutes of PDX','Just a few blocks from Alberta Street.   <br /><br /><br />This neighboorhood is a geat snapshot of Portland:  lots of small, unique mom and pop shops and restaurants!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-772740366403108396/original/970d362e-3336-4f80-85ee-81ad9283656a.jpeg',128445968,19,'45.55542','-122.63949',1,5,3.50,2.00,3.00,163.00,2,28,57,4.95,772740366403108396),(2923,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/773178418746550450','Forest Views Private Guest Suite','Perfect for traveling nurses or nomadic professionals for 30+ day leases. Backyard forest views of the Kelly Butte Nature Area.<br /><br />Shared driveway, separate private entrance, new kitchenette, electric heaters in every bedroom and bathroom, washer and dryer in unit, and cozy living room with tv. Basement level and stays cool in the summer but we also have fans and AC. <br /><br />17 min to Downtown PDX, 10 min walk to the MAX station, 5 min walk to the new FX2 express bus, close to many hospital','Quiet, close to many grocery stores, public transit, and hospitals','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-773178418746550450/original/6d8133c2-d60d-4d24-b528-47a0bbc6a50d.jpeg',11194078,78,'45.5013476','-122.5625991',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,30,365,0,1.00,773178418746550450),(2924,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/773489110588263501','1904 Carriage House, Portland, Oregon','This is a 1904 Carriage House that was originally built to house the horse carriage and related horse tack. It is a peaceful, cozy spot with easy access to cafes and restaurants. Staying in is easy with privacy, and the ability to cook. There is a fenced-in backyard and pets are welcome.','Trendy Hawthorne District.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-773489110588263501/original/b894734f-9a37-407e-ae5a-158e485b14e7.jpeg',100110020,32,'45.5131458','-122.6442277',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,1,365,86,4.87,773489110588263501),(2925,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/774063414377223440','Cozy retreat in SE Woodstock','A short walk away from coffee, craft brews, and restaurants, this daylight-basement apartment is unique and stylish. With 850 square feet, it features two bedrooms, queen beds, a living room with a cozy sectional, a 55\" TV with all the latest streaming, and a dining nook, and the kitchen offers a dishwasher, range, microwave, and full-size refrigerator. Enjoy all the Woodstock neighborhood has to offer with its parks, renowned Reed College, Eastmoreland golf course, and much more.','Southeast Portland, Woodstock neighborhood. In walking distance to the grocery stores (New Seasons and Safeway), coffee, pubs, and restaurants. Woodstock park is a 5-minute walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2fd0489a-f7f7-44bc-ba04-3bf272f58a13.jpg',174855751,38,'45.48261','-122.60798',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,3,8,51,4.96,774063414377223440),(2926,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/774633870709578792','Ladd\'s Addition Guest Suite','Enjoy a cozy stay at this centrally-located guest suite.','The Ladd\'s Addition neighborhood is organized around a unique circular layout.  Founded in 1891, it is among the oldest planned neighborhoods in the Western United States. Lovely historic homes line the streets and towering trees keep the neighborhood brimming with greenery. Ladd’s Addition is bordered by Hawthorne Boulevard on the north end and Division Street on the south end - both filled with popular restaurants, shops and a vibrant retail district.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-774633870709578792/original/48fcbba0-2b82-4867-82ec-944b8827d8d1.jpeg',9313887,25,'45.51104','-122.65025',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,105.00,2,365,97,4.96,774633870709578792),(2927,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/776405964169451423','Magnificent Location, *Pet Friendly*, Steam Shower','Sometimes it is hard to find it all. However at the Rhone Retreat you really have found it. The location is seconds away from fantastic drinks, food, and entertainment. The home has been upgraded and enhanced it countless ways, and each piece of furnishing and décor was curated to create that perfect blend of style and comfort for your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-776405964169451423/original/0c1ddd7e-efc4-4bb4-9aa2-42557c6033e1.jpeg',62261998,36,'45.49592','-122.60792',1,5,3.00,2.00,4.00,182.00,2,29,43,4.58,776405964169451423),(2928,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/777291245405048538','Modern condo with Mount Hood views near OHSU','Basecamp PDX is a beautifully appointed condo perfect for travel nurses, professionals, and remote workers looking for a place to call home for stays of 1 month or more. Near floor to ceiling windows flood the Scandinavian design inspired space with natural light and provide stunning views of Portland and Mt. Hood.<br /><br />Feel right at home with full kitchen, desk/workspace, comfy beds, balcony, and reading nook. 2 parking spaces are included: 1 enclosed secure garage space + 1 covered carport space.','The condo is located in the Southwest Hills neighborhood of Portland which has sweeping views of the city and Mt. Hood from throughout. Walking up further into the hill provides vantage points of the city and surrounding landscape from all sorts of angles. In addition to the natural beauty, you\'ll be surrounded by some of Portland\'s largest and most historic homes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-777291245405048538/original/937418cf-5fde-44d5-ae0a-4caa09763680.jpeg',1810577,54,'45.505037748855734','-122.68632795038411',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,31,365,0,1.00,777291245405048538),(2929,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/777779337849698837','Charming Luxury/SE Portland/MtTabor/Montavilla/MCM','NEW PROPERTY! Come relax and stay at this freshly remodeled 1950 mid-century modern, SE Portland home at the foot of Mt. Tabor, in the desired Montavilla Neighborhood.  Less than 15 minutes from the Portland Airport, and blocks from hundreds of restaurants, coffee shops, food carts, and hikes, you\'re in for an experience you may be eager to repeat. Enjoy plenty of and comfortable space inside to fix a meal, eat, sleep, relax, or even work if you need to.','This home is nestled on an adorable oversized corner lot, where two \"Portland Greenway\" streets come together.  These are streets designed for less auto traffic, with a higher encouragment of bicycles and pedestrians.  This allows for great people-watching, and a special sense of community.<br /><br />You will be a few blocks away from many entrances to the coveted Mt. Tabor, full of walking/running trails, and expansive views of Portland and beyond.  In another direction and within several blocks, you can walk to the quaint Montavilla neighborhood, featuring cute and eclectic restaurants and a variety of spots to grab a craft beer, cocktail or glass of wine.  If you time it right, I suggest a  muffuletta sandwich at Sebastiano\'s and some vegan oat milk vanilla soft serve at Rabbit Hole!  I\'ve created a local guidebook with all my recommendations, so be sure to check that out...you can find it within the Airbnb listing once you book!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-777779337849698837/original/0a0fbcdd-eb38-47fa-b846-d5713acf446c.jpeg',930613,15,'45.50841','-122.58588',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,201.00,3,365,36,5.00,777779337849698837),(2930,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/778265000364762909','Charming Craftsman Close to Restaurants & Shops','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at our centrally-located home. Located on a beautiful treelined street in the heart of Portland\'s most desirable neighborhood, you will find yourself close to the best restaurants and shops in between bustling NW 21st and NW 23rd streets. Our stunning remodeled house has 3 bedrooms (2 queen beds & bunks), 2 bathrooms and a spacious recently redone backyard.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-778265000364762909/original/13084e69-24ed-464d-af3a-82e1c2980607.jpeg',3851254,27,'45.52842','-122.69654',1,6,2.00,3.00,4.00,215.00,30,365,2,5.00,778265000364762909),(2931,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/778962715615782731','Private Suite in Quiet Neighborhood','Enjoy a private basement apartment suite below our family home! Close to Portland airport and the beautiful outdoors of the Columbia Gorge and Mt. Hood National Forest.  Home is close enough to downtown to enjoy a night on the town and far out enough to easily access the great outdoors. Please note that the space is only accessible by stairs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-778962715615782731/original/fb5cbd81-5a71-42a9-ad23-4a8489df905f.jpeg',490942213,90,'45.5163733','-122.5309942',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,1,14,64,4.83,778962715615782731),(2932,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/780551511100085524','The Perch PDX - Modern Studio on Division','A guesthouse in the SE Division/Hawthorne neighborhood that will make you feel right at home. The Perch PDX is light and bright. It\'s a short walk away from locally roasted coffee, farm-to-table fine dining, endless brunch options, a hip brewery and beer garden, bagels made fresh daily, authentic Mexican street tacos, a neighborhood wine bar, a fiercely independent movie theater, groceries, and some of the best Thai food in Portland.','East of the Willamette River and south of Burnside Street, Southeast Portland is home to many favorite neighborhoods and business districts, as well as the dormant volcano at Mount Tabor Park and delectable food in Buckman and Hosford-Abernathy.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-780551511100085524/original/81610271-022a-4880-ab48-a0121a8311bf.jpeg',491213027,25,'45.5038','-122.63954',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,1,90,169,4.97,780551511100085524),(2933,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/780813354690504892','Beaumont/Cully ADA compliant, family friendly Gem!','Centrally located in the peaceful Beaumont/Cully neighborhood this family friendly 2 bedroom, 2 bath home w/ full handicapped accessibility, is in the heart of popular Fremont, NE 42nd, and Alberta Arts Districts and minutes to the airport. The house is available for stays lasting 30 days or more.','We are located on a peaceful street off the popular NE 42nd Ave between Prescott and Alberta Ct. Easy access to all the attractions Portland has to offer. There are shops, cafes, music venues, theatre, movie theatre, bars, restaurants, gyms, spas and more in close proximity along with grocery stores, farmers markets and convenience stores. There is a laundromat a few blocks away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NzgwODEzMzU0NjkwNTA0ODky/original/c002991b-bd7e-4109-a93f-89ef621e2fac.jpeg',1626000,21,'45.55634037637081','-122.61472744882978',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,365,25,4.92,780813354690504892),(2934,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/781419064368125577','17Wood','Beautiful one bedroom apartment, close to every great coffee shop in Portland. Located just off of Portland\'s beloved Division street, where you will find the city’s most famous ice cream joints, restaurants, and food carts. This corner apartment located on the ground level of a 10-plex and comes with a dedicated off street parking space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-781419064368125577/original/393d772f-e60f-43e5-ae32-be74f29ac805.jpeg',108866481,25,'45.50227798272519','-122.64835875481367',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,1125,4,5.00,781419064368125577),(2935,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/781849783860879847','Cozy Suite in the heart of Portland','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.<br /><br />You will find yourself within a mile proximity to everything you need. Great coffee, and great food. 3 minute walk to Portland\'s famous Pine State Biscuits. 3 minute drive to Jam on Hawthorne and Cartopia. New Seasons Market within a mile radius. <br /><br />Quick access to I-5, Highway 99E and Interstate 26.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-781849783860879847/original/541323f2-70f9-4598-8f2c-24f8ef9f1b17.jpeg',491435195,25,'45.50614','-122.6547',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,730,19,4.79,781849783860879847),(2936,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/782598662676728927','Willamette River Perch','A lovely two-floor one bedroom / one bath 840 square foot private entry condo on the river in the heart of Portland! <br /><br />Two balconies overlooking the river. <br /><br />Swimming pool, hot tub, firepits, barbeque grills. <br /><br />While on the couch, enjoy the river view & warmth of the fireplace. You may even catch a glimpse of a sea lion!<br /><br />Easy walk to shops, restaurants...<br /><br />Remodeled bathroom with heated floor!<br /><br />Super close to all mass transit. <br /><br />Dedicated parking spot.','On the river and easy walking distance to the Pearl District, Downtown Portland, the Alphabet District! Near all mass transit lines as well in case you want to venture out and about town','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1a32716f-e44c-42b3-b6ff-7bd22dd44854.jpg',191758910,43,'45.5302089','-122.6746408',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,85.00,30,150,4,5.00,782598662676728927),(2937,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/783003086108763319','A cozy mid-century modern house in lake Oswego','Centrally located , fully remodeled, walking distance to shopping center in a very peaceful  Lake Oswego neighborhood.','The house located in a very affluent and quiet Lake Oswego neighborhood with easy access to the entire city as well as shopping and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-783003086108763319/original/c79eeb9f-d936-4b78-8cc4-2b1e35723e30.jpeg',18704603,73,'45.4335855','-122.6976303',1,4,1.00,3.00,3.00,130.00,30,1125,6,5.00,783003086108763319),(2938,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/783475961349345030','Guesthouse with Fenced Yard in NE Portland','Enjoy staying in the private, cozy hideaway in vibrant Northeast Portland. This studio is a great place to relax after exploring all that Portland has to offer.<br /><br />Walk down the street to visit local coffeehouses, restaurants, breweries and more!  Or hop on your bike to visit nearby neighborhoods like Alberta, Hawthorne and Belmont.<br /><br />The studio is also dog-friendly! We have two dogs who will also be using the fully fenced in back yard, so please let us know if your pup needs some space.','Woodlawn offers walkable breweries, restaurant and coffee shops plus a neighborhood feel on the residential streets themselves. It’s also an easy walk or bike ride to nearby neighborhoods in NE Portland like Alberta and Irvington, or a quick drive (5-10 minutes) to downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4cbdbd26-3798-4070-9bb4-35cb3d9bff98.jpg',101992842,45,'45.567023683097055','-122.65580523721611',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,82.00,3,30,79,4.89,783475961349345030),(2939,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/783959795983426914','Mid-Century 2 Bd, 1 Ba Condo w/ Attached Garage','Centrally located within inner Southeast Portland, this beautiful, large 1,200 sq ft 2 bedroom, 1 bath condo is a true mid-century gem. Sitting above the street level, you have gorgeous sunset views out of the full wall of windows in the living/dining space. The home features a freshly updated kitchen and bathroom with quartz countertops and all new stainless steel appliances. There are two living areas, a private dedicated desk space for work, and an attached garage for free parking.','This home is located in a quiet walkable SE Portland neighborhood. Easily walk to beautiful Creston Park, Trader Joes, Keeper Coffee, and Coffee Beer, all within a half mile of the apartment. This unit is located two miles from the heart of the Woodstock neighborhood where you\'ll find the Woodstock Park, New Seasons grocery, multiple restaurants/bars, great coffee shops, Goodwill, and plenty of small, local shops. Going the other direction, you will be two miles to the heart of the uniquely charming Foster/Powell neighborhood (FoPo), with multiple coffee shops, food cart pods, many bars, and classic Portland vibes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-783959795983426914/original/11984e79-3451-4275-84d4-2d4671a98478.jpeg',78879277,67,'45.491499601454336','-122.61958863218928',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,60,180,1,5.00,783959795983426914),(2940,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/784288992276908856','Retro artist\'s loft on Belmont','Newly renovated attic apartment in a Victorian home right on bustling Belmont street with shopping, food, coffee, and bars just a block away! This attic apartment features hand-painted retro wall details and three skylights for plenty of natural light even on grey winter days. Our cozy loft embodies the funky, creative vibe found in Southeast Portland and is a stone\'s throw from all the entertainment that the Hawthorne district has to offer.','SE Belmont St features cafés, small local shops, coffee, bars and a grocery store all within two blocks of the residence! Well-known Hawthorne Street is a five minute stroll south and features more dining, shopping, and entertainment options. The Avalon Arcade and Bagdad Theater are both within a short walking distance, and the neighborhood has plenty of food options for every diet. Late night options for food and drink are plentiful, but there are also multiple breakfast/brunch places open early in the morning! This is the perfect location for anyone who wants to vacation like a local and get to know exactly what makes Portland such a vibrant city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-784288992276908856/original/e1bcca1a-352f-4359-beb1-6bdc9ad9eb5f.jpeg',15054186,16,'45.51709286890107','-122.62658230203078',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,1,1125,254,4.91,784288992276908856),(2941,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/784321325760026956','Cozy Forest Hideaway','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-784321325760026956/original/1b041eca-4950-48c2-aa00-0d3b0c3acbab.jpeg',30171544,28,'45.46868630328087','-122.67943656068637',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,79.00,1,30,0,1.00,784321325760026956),(2942,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/785568217785068491','Cozy retreat close to all the fun!','Enjoy this brand new stylish, retreat, centrally located on 30th between Hawthorne and Division, where you can walk to and explore all the best restaurants and shops. The suite is a newly remodeled daylight basement suite with a separate entrance. All new appliances and carpets in a beautifully maintained Craftsman house.  It is a non smoking unit  Mt Hood and the beach just 75 min drive. Parks  nearby Only offering 30+ day rental. If you stay 31+ days there is NO lodging tax (11.5% savings)','Located in SE Portland\'s Richmond neighborhood, in between Hawthorn and Division. Just walk a couple of blocks to all the best restaurants and shops in the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-785568217785068491/original/109847a6-efe4-4406-9c60-79d38b17bb36.jpeg',14992703,8,'45.5074038','-122.6344712',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,30,1125,4,5.00,785568217785068491),(2943,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/785600127297331197','#StayInMyDistrict Overlook Backyard Tiny Suite','#StayinMyDistrict Overlook Backyard Tiny Suite! Live like a local while experiencing this trendy Portland District! Less than a mile to coffee shops, restaurants, shopping and local hot spots! Convenient to Mississippi, Killingsworth, Alberta, and Arbor Lodge. This sweet and tiny home is the perfect studio suite for your next Portland getaway. Fully furnished to create a comfortable and charming space! Loft bed and 1bath studio suite, with Kitchenette, Covered Patio and Street Parking.','Overlook neighborhood is one of Portland’s favorite neighborhoods, especially the section that is in the Overlook Triangle, and close to the Overlook. As you are going out along busy bustling Killingsworth headed from I-5, suddenly you are hit with absolutely breathtaking views of Downtown Portland and Mt. Hood looking out across the river. You can also see Forest Park and the West Hills over the Industrial River area. As you curve around you see the arched bridges of Portland silhouetted by Downtown. People are walking and biking all along the way. <br />Overlook is bordered by the Willamette River on the SW, the Freemont Bridge on the south, I-5 to the east and Ainsworth and Willamette to the north. It is just minutes to downtown by car of bike or just hop on the MAX. It borders Arbor Lodge neighborhood, University Park, Boise–Eliot and the Willamette River! Overlook Neighborhood is a highly sought-after neighborhood and a place that many desire to live in! It has much to offer. Gorg','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-785600127297331197/original/661b5708-2ad9-465e-be03-e41c27a375d6.jpeg',3142393,13,'45.55452','-122.68898',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,1,15,50,4.84,785600127297331197),(2944,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/786916255377210028','Modern Suite in NE Portland','Kick back and relax in this stylish space. Full kitchenette, washer/dryer, BBQ, covered patio with grass yard. Unit has its own private entrance & exit.  Located across from Alberta Park in Portland\'s Arts District with restaurants & shops 4 blocks away. Covered basketball court, walking trail, tennis court across the street. Please note the unit is on the 1st floor of our 3 story residence. While the unit is fully private, our small family does live above it.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-786916255377210028/original/68de9143-52fa-4f2f-a686-9bab93934985.jpeg',492280709,29,'45.562403805421354','-122.64669004173163',1,3,1.00,0.00,1.00,98.00,30,30,2,3.50,786916255377210028),(2945,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/787137702031075284','Dreamy spa vibe loft','This dreamy loft is  just what you need to relax and unwind - whether you\'re looking to stay in, or adventure around- this will be your oasis to come home to!','The John\'s Landing neighborhood is very quiet and residential, while still just a few miles from the heart of downtown and with easy access to get to all other parts of Portland!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-787137702031075284/original/3e0f51f8-b949-43bd-9dff-553b74261a30.jpeg',7409866,22,'45.4714005','-122.6733007',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,93.00,30,365,77,4.91,787137702031075284),(2946,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/787715368146460329','Mount Tabor Loft With Hot Tub','Welcome to our stunning loft, the perfect space for your next business trip or urban getaway. Enjoy our modern space with heated floors, high-speed internet, and your very own private hot tub. Relax on the comfortable sofa or retreat to the cozy loft with a plush queen-sized bed.','We are located in SE Portland, Oregon four blocks away from Mt. Tabor and just a short drive to Hawthorne street. Our street is very quiet, mostly made up of families, and retirees.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-787715368146460329/original/216e30c3-52cb-49c3-89a1-834168c5f700.jpeg',59070590,37,'45.50243838232859','-122.5863766674591',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,106.00,1,365,157,4.89,787715368146460329),(2947,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/787963769614817698','Mississippi District Retreat','Located in energetic Mississippi District, w/walking score of 100! Features high-end finishes & fenced yard. Lives large w/ 2-story vaulted living room, couch w/ chaise, 50” Smart TV, & 2 patios for entertaining. Chef\'s kitchen includes modern eat island w/ storage, integrated dishwasher, induction cooktop, & stainless steel appliances. 2 bedrooms & study loft upstairs. Full bath features luxury walk-in, tile-surround shower & tile floor. Washer/Dryer. Mt. Hood views from bedroom windows.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-787963769614817698/original/b828f340-3149-4a19-99c7-bc06b0623244.jpeg',263333566,24,'45.55936586239735','-122.67230147637686',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,160.00,30,360,0,1.00,787963769614817698),(2948,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/788551599739384798','Stylish, comfortable, private.','Forget your worries in this serene space, tastefully decorated with original art by a local artist. Let this be your home away from home. Conveniently located near Multnomah Village in SW Portland with easy access to I-5 and a short drive to downtown Portland. We\'re located on a quiet street with access to Woods Memorial Park just outside the door. Enjoy all the amenities of home while you stay in this private apartment.','This apartment is located just steps from Wood Park on a quiet street. Enjoy a tranquil stroll through Wood Park and other nearby trails. It is near Multnomah Village in SW Portland. There is nearby easy access to I-5, and it\'s a short drive to downtown Portland. It is also strategically located with easy access to the nearby Willamette Valley and Columbia Gorge. Take a 1.5 hour drive west to reach the beautiful Oregon Coast or a 1.5 hour drive east to visit picturesque Mt. Hood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-788551599739384798/original/5418e9ce-ae59-4cb8-8fa6-99588c8ed77c.jpeg',514724040,83,'45.4572223','-122.7260131',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,94.00,2,30,50,4.98,788551599739384798),(2949,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/789374284887176491','Urban Minimalist Home','Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located home base in the central location of SE Portland. Right off FWY 205 and main artery 122nd Ave, walking distance to public transit, Division Center shopping, banks, restaurants, businesses and much more. You will find everything you need in this modern home. No clutter, plenty of room for your energy to flow.','SE Division St & SE 122nd Ave has a Walk Score of 81 out of 100. This location is Very Walkable so most errands can be accomplished on foot.<br />This location is in the Powellhurst-Gilbert neighborhood in Portland. Nearby parks include West Powellhurst City Park, Mill City Park and Lincoln City Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/dc0c6666-1f77-4f36-8d58-103728eee6b2.jpg',54667782,90,'45.50769','-122.53801',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,116.00,3,365,48,4.79,789374284887176491),(2950,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/791443989413789589','The Arthur Tiny House @Tiny Digs Hotel- Train Vibe','❤️ Make your interesting choice of stay in Portland at Tiny Digs Hotel, a community of tiny houses located in the popular Kerns neighborhood, a Foodie heaven. We imagined, designed, and custom-built the collection to showcase many different options of tiny house designs to be experienced. Have yourself a unique experience by living big in a tiny house! ✨<br /><br />Remember to click the ❤️ in the upper right-hand corner so you can easily refer back to this listing while you search for your perfect stay.','We are in the Kerns neighborhood right next door to \"the most delicious half mile in Portland\". There are over 50 restaurants and brew pubs within a 10 minute walk o