ig in a tiny house! ✨<br /><br />Don\'t forget to click the ❤️ in the upper right hand corner so you can easily refer back to this listing while you search for your perfect stay.','We are in the Kerns neighborhood right next door to \"the most delicious half mile in Portland\". There are over 50 restaurants and brew pubs within a 10 minute walk of our little tiny houses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-791444129857262450/original/db0918e5-5700-488a-9fde-185cabfc2a74.jpeg',84008197,12,'45.52632','-122.63824',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,170.00,30,30,2,5.00,791444129857262450),(2961,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/791444143388475757','The Zen - Custom Tiny Home w/ Zen Vibe','❤️ Make your interesting choice of stay in Portland at Tiny Digs, a community of tiny houses located in the Kerns neighborhood, voted one of the top neighborhoods of the nation. We imagined, designed, custom-built the collection with a desire to showcase many different options for tiny house designs to be experienced by all. Have yourself a unique experience by living big in a tiny house! <br /><br />Don\'t forget to click the ❤️ in the upper right-hand corner so you can easily refer back to this house.','We are in the Kerns neighborhood right next door to \"the most delicious half mile in Portland\". There are over 50 restaurants and brew pubs within a 10 minute walk of our little tiny houses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-791444143388475757/original/80fc6aea-7ea5-4241-a2ff-865e51b90576.jpeg',84008197,12,'45.52632','-122.63824',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,170.00,30,30,2,5.00,791444143388475757),(2962,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/792355334800404402','Vagabond  Farm /Nature retreat','Make a unique mini getaway and stay at our hillside farm on the banks of Powell Buttes 600 acre nature park.  Visit the Mini donkeys, alpacas, pigs and goats. An easy arrival next to our Yurt gathering space.','Our driveway starts at the Powell Butte trailhead.  Plan to the 600 acres of nature trails or a jaunt down to open space at Gates Park.  Minutes from SE favorite of Asian, Mexican and Food truck options or jump on to the mountain road an hour up to Hood.  We are easy access to main roads leading to airport, downtown, Mount Hood or coast.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1ce3bc86-3022-4d51-b81d-b5db30e22242.jpg',421792,78,'45.487920648410714','-122.51855481740566',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,31,51,4.88,792355334800404402),(2963,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/795572460840148285','ENJOY THE CiTY, RiVER & MT VIEW. NEWLY remodeled','Please book on this updated listing. <br />Welcome to an expansive views of Portland, Columbia River and Mt. Hood! Newly renovated 2700 sq ft, 2 bed with den, 2.5 bth, a/c & mid-century touch.The bright layout opens to living, dining & chef’s kitchen perfect for entertaining.  Ensuite spa bath. Dedicated workspace<br /><br />Lower level has the family room, one bedrooms, bath with whirlpool tub, laundry, and a large back yard. Easy freeway access, to PDX airport, hospitals, parks and shops. 3 day stay minimum.','Rocky Butte is an extinct volcanic cinder cone butte with steep forested slopes visible from Interstates 205 and 84. Joseph Wood Hill Park is located at the top. The slopes of Rocky Butte are managed as the Rocky Butte Natural Area. The Butte is part of the Boring Lava Field, a group of over 30 cinder cones in Oregon and Washington. The site was formerly home to Rocky Butte Jail.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-795572460840148285/original/62ec82d7-793f-4f03-bf35-91bf2a948758.jpeg',442663509,74,'45.54204586854118','-122.56702368595184',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,230.00,30,365,1,5.00,795572460840148285),(2964,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/796332063442924370','Sunstone House Master, wifi, sink/vanity, walk in','2 miles to Adidas, on 2 bus lines, 7 hospitals within 10 - 20 min drive. UofP is 1 mile. I-5 North or South one mile. Welcome to Sunstone house, The bedroom is tranquil, with luxurious twin-sized or queen memory foam beds dressed in high-quality linens for a restful night\'s sleep. Ample storage space, We are a eco minded house with solar panels, and edible garden, We have keyless rooms, full kitchen, 2 full bathrooms, laundry onsite & wifi. Located in the Kenton neighborhood of Portland Oregon.','The Kenton, Arbor Lodge, and Portsmouth neighborhoods are found in North Portland, south of St. Johns and on the peninsula between the Willamette and Columbia Rivers.  North Portland has access to parks, quieter urban neighborhoods, excellent public transit options. Living in Kenton offers residents a dense suburban feel.  In Kenton there are a lot of bars, restaurants, coffee shops, and parks. Many families and young professionals live in Kenton.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6Nzk2MzMyMDYzNDQyOTI0Mzcw/original/fc2e872c-496f-4e06-b1e2-476e95b0f447.jpeg',493461219,51,'45.576989814629805','-122.70117697817005',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,40.00,30,180,5,4.80,796332063442924370),(2965,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/796345756472913069','Charming 1913 St. Johns Bungalow','Find peace in the city by yourself, with friends, or with your family in a vintage craftsman home, with remaining original rustic and sacred charm. Located two blocks from a food cart pod and grocery store, and a bit further to shops, restaurants, and movie theaters of St. Johns, you will have much of what you want/need. Nature is also abundant all around with green parks in every direction. Explore or just sit on the large covered front porch and watch the eclectic passers by.','St Johns is one of Portland\'s best kept secrets, or maybe not so much anymore! It is straddled between the Willamette and Columbia Rivers and along with the quaintness of a small town feel, with it\'s own shops, restaurants,, grocery stores and movie theaters, there are also multiple nature spaces and parks surrounding the neighborhood. Cathedral Park in the vast park under the St. Johns bridge. Pier Park is a disc golf course, wooded, one mile around park with an outdoor public pool in the summer. Kelly Point Park is literally where the rivers converge and is a short 5 mile drive from St. Johns. Forest Park is across the bridge and boasts 40 miles of urban forest and hiking trails in some old growth forests. And, Sauvie Island is a 15 minute drive northeast on to farms, and beaches to walk on, swim and play along the Columbia River.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-796345756472913069/original/bf88ce09-24f8-4c34-b612-c467a120613c.jpeg',32365096,58,'45.592254','-122.7390671',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,129.00,2,365,59,4.86,796345756472913069),(2966,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/796359857640032064','Mid-Century Apt - walk to Reed','This cozy apartment has all you need for your visit to Portland! Features a bathroom with standing shower, bedroom with queen bed and a large open plan living room / dining room. The kitchen is fully equipped with stove, microwave, full size refrigerator and dishwasher. Warm up next to the gas fireplace, binge your favorite shows on the smart TV, have your kids play with the toys, and/or work remotely from the desk.','The neighborhood is a mid-century dream with wide streets that are easily walkable. Located just a few blocks from Reed College in South East Portland, you can also easily walk to Trader Joes, cafes, restaurants, and parks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-796359857640032064/original/02208c55-b540-4f39-9c53-d5a72e85a0ba.jpeg',182966,61,'45.4889364','-122.6317289',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,31,31,4.87,796359857640032064),(2967,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/796688042569856711','Central Downtown Studio w/Vintage Charm near Train','This studio apartment is situated in a gorgeous vintage building located just steps from the red and blue max train lines. Perfect for a solo traveler visiting Portland for business or a couple looking to explore the city with ease. This studio has everything you need for a comfortable stay including a queen size murphy bed, comfy sofa, Roku TV, updated bathroom, and free laundry facilities in the building.<br /><br />**Guests required to sign & complete a rental agreement via Docusign by email.','Located mere steps from Providence Park, this studio is situated in the perfect place to catch a Portland Timbers or Thorns game. You can find the max train nearby to take you further into downtown, or to the other side of the river where many popular neighborhoods exist. The Portland Streetcar is also within walking distance which loops through downtown, Portland State, the Pearl District, NW, and close-in to the eastside of Portland. You can’t ask for a more central location! Many coffee shops, bars, restaurants, and shopping options are nearby. <br /><br />As with most major cities, there’s a decent sized population of individuals experiencing homelessness in Portland. The HOA and tenants are very vigilant in preventing loitering or encampments near the property, but there will be homeless individuals in the general area and throughout Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-796688042569856711/original/ae9b76ba-bf80-464d-9019-e230772b5a37.jpeg',221421926,3,'45.52219','-122.68828',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,63.00,31,365,5,5.00,796688042569856711),(2968,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/797129982142519818','Penthouse with mountain views!','This is a 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom apt. It is a corner unit with views of 3 mountains. There is a gym located in the building,  a rooftop BBQ, a movie theatre that can be privately reserved at no cost, a rooftop community room &  a community coffee/espresso machine. This is a secure building with a concierge and security 24/7 and underground parking that is available if needed. It is two blocks from Powell\'s bookstore, one block from Whole Foods and the shops and restaurants of the Pearl District.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-797129982142519818/original/ce8236a6-fde7-49fd-9539-f4abb7c2629a.jpeg',554332,44,'45.52265','-122.68354',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,279.00,2,365,22,4.91,797129982142519818),(2969,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/797791392938976390','Cute Remodeled Two Bed Townhouse','Centrally located but in quiet neighborhood. Two bedroom townhouse just recently remodeled and furnished but with some classic charm. No one above or below with large yard to enjoy. Happy to answer any questions','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-797791392938976390/original/3a5bc50b-9d4f-474c-94b5-0b1aa747c066.jpeg',8680367,8,'45.50000388240757','-122.63344938459156',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,30,365,1,5.00,797791392938976390),(2970,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/797950305927604069','Sky in Portland Studio-across from OHSU','This studio is perfect for couples, solos, adventurers, here on business, visiting to relax or moving to the area, we think you will enjoy our comfortable studio/apartment.<br /><br />Beautiful, spacious, quiet, tree-lined home conveniently located just across from the OHSU Hospital with views of the Hills','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-797950305927604069/original/090b466f-f618-4cad-9fca-0401fa6c30a0.jpeg',234902210,30,'45.49940658100719','-122.68897329970427',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,99.00,30,30,8,4.75,797950305927604069),(2971,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/798524810822950384','Woodlawn Cottage','Private, quiet, charming backyard studio. Walk or bike to restaurants and parks. Close to NE Alberta and 5 min to a Whole Foods. 12 min drive to PDX','Mostly Quiet, modest, old Portland urban neighborhood. Walk through lovely green Woodlawn Park to restaurants and cafes.  One mile from Alberta Arts District.Close to A Whole foods Market','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-798524810822950384/original/cbd2fa2a-3423-483f-8653-01edeb8d4eaa.jpg',494658346,45,'45.57418130023464','-122.64967889756147',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,91.00,1,5,144,4.97,798524810822950384),(2972,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/799640108538362464','Classy Irvington Living Space by Convention Center','Stay in the heart of the historic Irvington neighborhood in a beautifully renovated living space, next to the delightful Irving Park, near cafes and shopping, and minutes to the Moda Convention Center and Downtown Portland.  Walk score 82, Bike Score 81.','Irvington is a classic American community-minded neighborhood with beautiful older homes, manicured lawns, matured trees, and quiet streets that are perfect for evening strolls.  <br /><br />IRVING PARK:<br />Irving Park, which is next to the house, is a beautiful park with lots of green grass, big trees, picnic tables, sports fields, a playground with a spray pool water feature, an off-leash dog park, and tennis courts. There are many community events held in this park throughout the summer. <br /><br />EATERIES WITHIN 10 MINUTES WALK:<br />•	Caffe Destino – Coffee shop, breakfast, pies, sandwiches<br />•	TwentySix Café – Artsy coffee shop, bagels, avocado toast, pastries<br />•	Starbucks - Coffee shop<br />•	En Vida PDX – South American bistro<br />•	Morchella - Modern American restaurant<br />•	Free House – Creative cocktails and small plates<br />•	Rose City Book Pub – Beers, wine, food, books, community events<br />•	Mojos Sushi – Sushi<br />•	The Pocket Pub - Gourmet pizza restau','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-799640108538362464/original/f2dc971c-2c5d-4f2e-8500-2ecaae2b561b.jpeg',90342574,7,'45.54661651887042','-122.65669768761386',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,3,90,41,4.95,799640108538362464),(2973,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/800756909716372191','Beautiful Bedroom/Bath near OHSU - Women Only','Minutes from OHSU & Willamette River Park - You’ll love this bright & spacious private bedroom with a personal bathroom! Centrally located in John’s Landing in South Portland, you’re near shops & restaurants while still being on a quiet street. This room has a comfortable queen size bed and high quality linens, a personal bath and a coffee and tea bar. You also have access to the shared living area and kitchen. Great for traveling professionals and students!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-800756909716372191/original/d802da8e-8ef2-4d16-b24e-6527cb816f33.jpeg',163637443,22,'45.48037370000001','-122.6751608',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,47.00,2,90,32,5.00,800756909716372191),(2974,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/800888845918066064','Cozy Apartment In Historical Nob Hill','Stay in the heart of Portland, with a 98 walk score you can get to several bars, restaurants, and tourist destinations on foot from this location. The apartment is over 100 years old and has a blend of historical and modern style. There is one main bedroom, and an additional full-size pull out bed in the dining room. You will see some unique features in the \"Keep Portland Weird\" spirit, including a fully penny-tiled kitchen floor and a swan bathroom faucet. Enjoy your stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-800888845918066064/original/80ec2460-ed69-456a-a8c5-21972d0ddf92.jpeg',166070389,27,'45.52822','-122.69432',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,118.00,30,120,1,5.00,800888845918066064),(2975,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/801407363851089197','Comfortable, light-filled home','Enjoy a comfortable experience in this centrally-located home. It\'s a quiet, clean, light-filled space. Perks include plenty of street parking and a fenced backyard.','The house is located in the Eliot neighborhood in NE Portland. It\'s very centrally located. Pretty much everywhere you might want to visit is between a 5-15 minute drive, including the Japanese Garden, Hawthorn/Division Street, Downtown and Alberta. There are also great coffee shops, restaurants, Irving Park and the Moda Center within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODAxNDA3MzYzODUxMDg5MTk3/original/17ef5b1d-4802-4137-a823-1bff969955cd.jpeg',23777060,26,'45.53853','-122.66486',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,30,730,3,5.00,801407363851089197),(2976,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/801749425257156147','Vibrant 3BR/1BA: Quirky Charm! $0 Cleaning Fee','Stay in a private bungalow that offers a full kitchen, loft & basement-full of amenities. Ideal for Long Stays! Loft offers a master suite & a separate office space and futon sleeping area. The basement has a Rec/Fitness & Yoga Rm for your enjoyment. Located in the heart of PDX & walking distance from shops, bars, restaurants & local food carts. You have bikes in the garage to help with exploration. You will also be few miles away from Downtown, MODA/Convent Center should you wish to see shows!','NE Portland is a true slice of Portland that offers you a density of bars, restaurants, and shopping, while still feeling like you\'re experiencing a local neighborhood feel. Explore NE Alberta St., N. Williams Corridor, walk to Mississippi Street and explore unique coffee shops, restaurants, and bars!<br /><br />What makes this area great is that you\'re also only 2.5 miles from downtown Portland - so it\'s really easy to bike, take a bus, or an uber/lyft and be downtown within 10 to 15 minutes.<br /><br />The Moda, Conventional center and Loyd Center are minutes away. The expo center is close too, as well as all major hospitals (OHSU, Randall/Legacy, Providence, Keiser)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-801749425257156147/original/17a6146f-e8e0-4ab9-9d6a-c648719831fc.jpeg',494186847,14,'45.55540100940579','-122.66177587375176',1,5,1.00,3.00,3.00,154.00,1,30,27,4.89,801749425257156147),(2977,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/802265902350785032','Private room with king bed','Bedroom in my house on a large lot with gardens.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/451beeca-b31e-415a-8f7d-60a01cc5cc95.jpg',16105357,40,'45.55301','-122.54809',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,33.00,30,90,4,4.25,802265902350785032),(2978,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/802904673688739007','Unwind in Style at Dossier Hotel! Pets Allowed!','Experience the very best of Oregon in downtown Portland. The propert