me of the best restaurants, bars, boutiques, and picturesque streets in Portland!','Located only steps from the Boise neighborhood’s popular  Mississippi Ave and Williams Ave areas, and with the peace of mind and easy, stress-free parking of a quiet residential street. The vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood is a pleasant walk or quick drive away. Downtown is only 10 minutes away, the airport is 20 minutes, and countless other Portland neighborhoods are easily accessible.<br /><br />You are perfectly positioned to eat at some of Portland’s best restaurants and food carts, hang out at trendy bars, browse through eclectic boutiques, get a local beer at a nearby brewery, and stroll along beautiful, tree-lined streets; or if you want to stay in, take advantage of the fully-outfitted kitchen with two grocery stores just blocks away, or take-out that can be at your door in minutes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-807235981511526608/original/ba9a178e-08b9-4972-b99c-9e65a2173c61.jpeg',37422309,14,'45.55226380419144','-122.66284541613825',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,114.00,2,21,72,5.00,807235981511526608),(3015,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/807336196107263310','Laurelhurst Dream on Restaurant Row ~ 97 WalkScore','Perfectly situated just off NE Portland\'s renowned Restaurant Row, our location allows you to walk to some of the city\'s best dining spots. You\'ll also have easy access to top shows, thrift shops, and bars, all just steps away.<br /><br />Recently renovated to create an open, inviting space, our home ensures everyone stays connected—whether you\'re cooking in the spacious kitchen or watching the game on the massive 75\" 4K HDTV. Your Portland experience couldn\'t be better anywhere else!','Nestled in the heart of Portland\'s bustling Eastside, this area is known for its diverse array of attractions, making it an ideal location for visitors seeking a true Portland experience.<br /><br />Just steps from your doorstep, you\'ll find some of Portland\'s most beloved eateries. From cozy cafes and trendy brunch spots to gourmet restaurants and lively food carts, the options are endless. Indulge in a variety of cuisines, whether you\'re craving the famous Voodoo Doughnuts, enjoying a farm-to-table meal at a local bistro, or grabbing a quick bite from one of the many nearby food trucks.<br /><br />The neighborhood is dotted with unique boutiques, vintage stores, and independent shops. Explore the locally-owned businesses and find one-of-a-kind treasures, whether it\'s handmade jewelry, vintage clothing, or quirky home decor. The nearby Hollywood District and Laurelhurst Theater offer additional shopping and entertainment options.<br /><br />For those looking to experience Portland\'s v','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-807336196107263310/original/1380efff-5b31-4525-9d11-2e045301bd14.jpeg',88253867,12,'45.52761560041774','-122.63484129463795',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,131.00,30,1125,159,4.81,807336196107263310),(3016,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/807378255689177641','Modern 4B Home w/ King Bed & Spectacular Balcony','Gather your loved ones and escape to the ultimate family vacation home in the heart of Portland\'s desirable Overlook neighborhood. This magnificent architectural dwelling offers a spacious and open floor plan, perfect for creating memories and bonding with your loved ones.','Welcome to the wonderful Overlook neighborhood, where you can experience the perfect blend of tranquility and easy access to all the vibrant hotspots that Portland has to offer! our neighborhood is truly one-of-the-kind offering breathtaking views of the city and the river! . Plus, we\'re just a stone\'s throw away from the famous Adidas headquarters and a mere 5-minute drive from Portland\'s renowned Mississippi District, Alberta Art District, and Williams Corridor. You can reach downtown in less than 10 minutes. Come and discover the best of both worlds in the charming Overlook neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODA3Mzc4MjU1Njg5MTc3NjQx/original/c902e643-49be-4dbf-899d-9fceec58731c.jpeg',12300845,13,'45.55906','-122.69255',1,8,2.50,4.00,4.00,320.00,3,365,32,5.00,807378255689177641),(3017,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/807538018934047113','Charming and Bright 1 Bedroom Alberta Arts Loft','In the heart of the vibrant and livable Alberta Arts District! Well-maintained, classic 1900\'s styling, bay window, front porch, fir floors 1BR/1BA. Laundry facilities available! <br /><br />Great alternative transportation options-including 15 mins bike ride to the city center, bus lines (#6,#8,#72,#15) and more. WalkScore rating for this house is described as a Walker\'s Paradise.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODA3NTM4MDE4OTM0MDQ3MTEz/original/e8c2036b-9849-4805-950d-811599bb0b3c.jpeg',16400193,1,'45.55704880532659','-122.63600802819364',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,1,365,8,4.38,807538018934047113),(3018,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/808217780785206973','Bright & Peaceful Retreat in the heart of NE PDX','Discover a peaceful oasis in the sought-after Alberta Arts District, within walking distance to Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, coffee, and galleries. Our guest house offers a quiet and sunlit retreat, perfect for a romantic getaway, creative escape, or family trip with your little one. An unforgettable stay in Rose City awaits!<br /><br />15 Minute Drive from the Airport<br />5-10 Minute Walk to food, coffee, bars','We feel so lucky to live in our favorite neighborhood in Portland and are excited for you to experience it too! The vibe is family-friendly and quiet, but it\'s close enough to restaurants, bars, and nightlife. During the summer months (June-Aug) don\'t miss Last Thursdays on Alberta Street, our iconic monthly street fair and art walk with vendors, music, and food.<br /><br /> Welcome to Portland’s Alberta Arts District!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-808217780785206973/original/5f