03711,48,'45.58134','-122.67608',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,71.00,1,14,93,4.92,809534874053543750),(3021,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/809670307250850030','Apartment in Montavilla','Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located home base. Down town portland is just a 15min drive away, lots of restaurants on the montavilla strip along with food carts all within walking distance. Perfect for business professionals, traveling nurses, or anyone looking for a nice place to call a home away from home.','A block away is the montavilla strip! Enjoy nice neighborhood restaurants, bars, and local shops!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-809670307250850030/original/4e107216-dff7-4c98-b3cd-7d4667b7c315.jpeg',265276953,10,'45.51757619667681','-122.57699023363975',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,365,4,5.00,809670307250850030),(3022,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/809699986136549281','Montavilla Bohemian Getaway','Welcome! Enjoy your stay in our bohemian inspired private suite with a separate entrance in the basement of our home complete with a kitchenette, washer/dryer in unit, bathroom, and walk-in closet. <br /><br />Wherever you are visiting from, we welcome you as a guest in our inclusive space for folks of various backgrounds and identities.<br /><br />- Lydia & Skylar','Montavilla is an East Portland neighborhood with restaurants, breweries, cafes, shops, farmers market, and a historic movie theater. It is a short hop to downtown Portland (7 miles) and only 5 miles from the airport. The neighborhood is quiet and walking/biking friendly.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-809699986136549281/original/a2e63717-d92c-4b50-bc64-0b71cd041cfb.jpeg',125074133,10,'45.51363','-122.57491',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,82.00,30,730,23,4.91,809699986136549281),(3023,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/810316437853659117','Piedmont Pied-à-terre (Basement Unit)','Remodeled basement apartment, with all the amenities one needs for a perfect getaway in Portland. With just the right amount of space for your group! Our basement apartment is great for short and long term stays. <br /><br />Did we mention we have a Pool and Spa? We have availability throughout the year.<br /><br />You are just 3 blocks from one of Portland’s best parks that has a fun kid play space.','Quiet residential neighborhood <br />Parks/Playground in close walking distance','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-810316437853659117/original/168b1ede-ee57-44be-ba96-8e55dcc97e5b.jpeg',33654666,24,'45.56485','-122.66866',1,6,1.00,2.00,2.00,74.00,2,27,82,4.91,810316437853659117),(3024,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/810747872671612653','Downtown PDX Condo Indoor Pool Mt Hood Views','Modern & Spacious  Condo  AC w/ large covered balcony with views of Mt. Hood. Hi Rise. Full time security. Indoor heated pool. HOT TUB. Sauna.  Outdoor pool June - Sept<br /> Garage parking available.  <br /><br />** 2 full bthrooms<br />** 1 Bedroom/ Queen Bed <br />** Laundry in the unit<br />** 24 Hour Desk <br />** Fitness Center <br />** Outdoor/ Indoor Heated Swimming Pool <br />** Garage parking  $150 per month<br />** EV charging available<br />Walking distance to PSU shopping, restaurants, theaters , public transportation, PSU OHSU.','Downtown Portland Walk to restaurants, cafes and shops,  Portland State University, Keller auditorium  and  the Waterfront.   Perfect location!  Waterfront Marina  and a lovely river walk. <br /><br />This Downtown Portland. Secure condo is located in a safe, quiet corner of downtown Portland. Walk to Portland State University and easy access to OHSU. Portland Streetcar & Bus Stop right out the front of the building. Waterfront promenade, park, fountains and public art surround the property. <br /><br />Walkable to local dining, shopping, & entertainment. This bright and light Condo, features floor to ceiling windows with Downtown & Mountain views. <br /><br />Enjoy tree lined street views of Portland while sipping your morning coffee on a sunny day or enjoy a glass of wine from the balcony! Modern updates and amenities will make you feel right at home.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-810747872671612653/original/c13ec366-e48c-4172-a8d7-883a135227c3.jpeg',477663,44,'45.507560465898024','-122.68011728902255',1,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,168.00,31,365,1,5.00,810747872671612653),(3025,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/810807731475232907','Portland Home: Private Hot Tub, Porch & Patio','If you’re seeking a getaway rich in culture featuring an eclectic mix of attractions, then look no further than this 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom vacation rental house in Portland. With fine art and street art, theaters both indoors and outdoors, restaurants offering fine dining to tasty food carts, craft breweries, and the world’s largest independent bookstore, Portland offers a large variety of things to do and enjoy! After a fun-filled day, unwind in the private hot tub or relax in the living room.','PORTLAND HOT SPOTS: Williams District (0.6 miles), Alberta Arts District (0.7 miles), Dekum Triangle (0.7 miles), Historic Mississippi District (1 mile), Vintage stores, coffee shops & bars on Southeast Belmont Street (5 miles), Portland Art Museum (5 miles), thrift stores, bookstores & dining on Southeast Hawthorne Boulevard (6 miles), Oregon Zoo (8 miles) <br />GET OUTSIDE: Peninsula Park Rose Garden (0.5 miles), Colonel Summers Park (4 miles), Lan Su Chinese Garden (4 miles), Washington Park (6 miles), Portland Audubon (6 miles), Tualatin Hills Nature Park (14 miles) <br />WINERIES & VINEYARDS: Fullerton Wines (4 miles), Hamacher Wines (20 miles), Hawks View Winery (20 miles), Alloro Vineyard (22 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (7 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-810807731475232907/original/23daeb1a-7eff-43be-93f2-268e196e6a34.jpeg',121688409,14,'45.56525441090002','-122.66383182556599',1,16,2.00,4.00,7.00,250.00,2,1125,33,4.94,810807731475232907),(3026,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/810807908433127660','Central, private condo w/ access to all hot spots','Private condo in North Portland located steps away from delicious coffee, friendliest neighborhood market and original Portland rose garden at Peninsula Park. When it\'s clear, Mt. Saint Helens is visible from the balcony and there\'s no better place for a glass of wine - or kombucha, this is Portland after all. <br /><br />Easy access to downtown or Moda Center with Max (public transit) stop just one block away. Only 15 minutes from the Portland airport. <br /><br />Perfect for a solo getaway or couple retreat.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-810807908433127660/original/afbbeb25-833b-4e22-80f8-912a5397e5d1.jpeg',381904802,13,'45.5648','-122.68219',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,109.00,30,300,16,5.00,810807908433127660),(3027,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/810827559615326553','Huge Private Studio in Woodstock','This lovely home is within 2 blocks of the iconic Woodstock neighborhood with its boutiques and restaurants... it is also just down the street from Reed College, which is one of the most beautiful campuses in the country!<br /><br />There\'s a partial wall that divides a space that can be used as a separate sleeping area. We can provide a twin rollaway bed upon request + prepare it as a comfortable 2nd bed.<br /><br />There\'s currently a family renting the main house... the studio apartment is completely private.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f56427b7-8c61-48fc-9134-aec3e414edf3.jpg',145095859,38,'45.48161093032738','-122.60823236574736',1,3,1.00,0.00,1.00,79.00,2,365,1,5.00,810827559615326553),(3028,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/811068227606969700','Burnside manor, perfect location (Room A2)','Beautifully appointed, fully furnished home. The shared spaces in the house are only shared with other tenants, host does not live on site. The kitchen, living room, and outdoor patio, are tastefully decorated and fully equipped for your comfort and convenience. The house is located in the desirable Kerns neighborhood next to Whole Foods, Starbucks and the restaurants and shops of 28th Ave and Burnside. Free laundry facilities and secure keyless locks for each room and the common spaces!','The Kerns neighborhood is located in the Northeast section of Portland, Oregon. It is known for its tree-lined streets and historic homes. The neighborhood is home to many restaurants, cafes, and bars, as well as shops and services. It is also home to Laurelhurst Park, a large park with a playground, walking paths, and a pond. Additionally, the Kerns neighborhood is close to the Oregon Convention Center and the Lloyd Center shopping mall. The neighborhood is considered as one of the most popular and desirable neighborhoods in Portland, with a mix of single-family homes, condos, and apartments. Overall, Kerns is considered a walkable, bike-friendly neighborhood with a good mix of residential and commercial areas.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODExMDY4MjI3NjA2OTY5NzAw/original/6336f625-d657-44eb-b5f8-64000d50b7ed.jpeg',45217575,12,'45.524811686947864','-122.63570535960616',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,35.00,31,93,3,5.00,811068227606969700),(3029,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/811241015065386514','Elite Guest Studio','Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located home base in the central location of SE Portland. Right off FWY 205 and main artery 122nd Ave, walking distance to public transit, Division Center shopping, banks, restaurants, businesses, Hospital and much more. You will find everything you need in this modern guest unit.','It’s located on the main arterial road 122nd Street, close to FWY 205 and HWY 84, 4 minutes from Adventist Hospital, walking distance to shopping centers, restaurants and businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4ad9e988-8936-4ada-8cf8-f728e5e4e790.jpg',54667782,90,'45.50622415869013','-122.5360873988638',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,3,365,39,4.67,811241015065386514),(3030,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/811648303299843102','Alphabet District - Walk everywhere','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located historic condo. Brand new AC unit will keep you cool. Trader Joe’s, a movie theater, numerous restaurants, bars, shops and coffee houses are only steps away. About 1/2 mile to Washington Park, with many attractions and beautiful wooded hiking trails. You don’t have to drive anywhere, as you are in the heart of the Alphabet District, the Little Europe of Portland. Enjoy peace and serenity inside, then step outside and enjoy the action!','This is possibly the epicenter of the alphabet district. Not more than 5 minutes walk from everything. Cinema 21, scores of bars and restaurants, parks and grocery stores.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/52701d19-c5e5-4d2e-bd26-fe87054872de.jpg',83619132,27,'45.52718039553565','-122.693718162145',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,150,2,5.00,811648303299843102),(3031,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/812547650130131187','Burnside Manor, ideal location! (Room A3)','Beautifully appointed, fully furnished home. Each room has its own unique style and charm, and the shared spaces in the house, including the kitchen, living room, and outdoor patio, are tastefully decorated and fully equipped for your comfort and convenience. The house is located in the desirable Kerns neighborhood next to Whole Foods, Starbucks and the restaurants and shops of 28th Ave and Burnside. Free laundry facilities and secure keyless locks for each room and the common spaces!','The Kerns neighborhood is located in the Northeast section of Portland, Oregon. It is known for its tree-lined streets and historic homes. The neighborhood is home to many restaurants, cafes, and bars, as well as shops and services. It is also home to Laurelhurst Park, a large park with a playground, walking paths, and a pond. Additionally, the Kerns neighborhood is close to the Oregon Convention Center and the Lloyd Center shopping mall. The neighborhood is considered as one of the most popular and desirable neighborhoods in Portland, with a mix of single-family homes, condos, and apartments. Overall, Kerns is considered a walkable, bike-friendly neighborhood with a good mix of residential and commercial areas.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-812547650130131187/original/e1bd617f-95c3-4207-bf16-ff05e9ac8582.jpeg',45217575,12,'45.52474869415479','-122.63514968688351',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,36.00,31,730,10,5.00,812547650130131187),(3032,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/813684425473155078','Sunstone House, Kenton/Arbor lodge on transit','Welcome to our charming urban retreat, where extended stays of 31 days or longer are a breeze! Nestled in the heart of the vibrant city, our cozy oasis is the perfect home away from home for medical professionals, digital nomads, and business travelers on extended assignments. Whether you\'re seeking a comfortable space for work or a peaceful haven to unwind after a long day, our inviting living space is ready to cater to your needs during your extended stay.  Long Term stays available.','The Kenton, Arbor Lodge, and Portsmouth neighborhoods are found in North Portland, south of St. Johns and on the peninsula between the Willamette and Columbia Rivers. North Portland has access to parks, quieter urban neighborhoods, excellent public transit options. Living in Kenton offers residents a dense suburban feel. In Kenton there are a lot of bars, restaurants, coffee shops, and parks. Many families and young professionals live in Kenton.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODEzNjg0NDI1NDczMTU1MDc4/original/e491aae7-05ed-4922-a8b5-eb232717f151.jpeg',493461219,55,'45.5780432','-122.7015336',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,34.00,30,180,7,5.00,813684425473155078),(3033,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/813917416690692172','Serene PDX home','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay.  Take a walk down on the private road with the family or dog.  Killingsworth being 5 minutes away by car and only 15 min walk.  Take a photo with the iconic   Adidas superstar shoe a few blocks down.  This location is prime for the iconic Portland locations : Alberta, 23rd, Killingsworth, and more!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-813917416690692172/original/376e702b-e36e-4783-9375-21d6ce464ec3.jpeg',434311611,13,'45.56729','-122.69957',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,145.00,30,365,0,1.00,813917416690692172),(3034,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/814459776909440627','New Home Near it All on Division w/ EV Charger','Welcome to The Eloise — a bright, art-filled home centrally-located in the bustling Division/Clinton district of SE Portland.<br /><br />This beautiful ADU has it all. A suite with king bed & bathroom with a luxurious shower; workspace w/ speedy wi-fi; lounge; two TVs a full kitchen, & EV charger. Premium amenities & local treats await you. <br /><br />Tucked into a quiet street just off Division, you’re within walking distance to restaurants, shops, bars, venues, bus & TriMet lines & a 5-minute drive to Downtown.','The Eloise is located in the Division/Clinton District, a vibrant and eclectic area in Southeast Portland with excellent restaurants, bars, shops, and things to see and do. You could easily be fed and entertained exclusively within a half-mile radius of The Eloise during your stay. The neighborhood is centrally-located and easy to get to other parts of Portland and beyond. You’re gonna love it here. <br /><br />Three blocks away, on Division and 20th, you’ll find New Seasons Market, your go-to for groceries and toiletries; and Nossa Familia Coffee’s Seven Corners Cafe, serving up delicious coffee and tea drinks. <br /><br />Breakfast in the neighborhood:<br />Genie\'s Cafe (American brunch classics)<br />Broder Cafe (Scandinavian breakfast & lunch)<br />Honeycuspe (waffle-centric food truck)<br />Pine State Biscuits (biscuits, fried chicken, pancakes)<br />Shoofly (vegan bakery)<br /><br />Nearby restaurants to check out:<br />Palomar (Cuban)<br />Double Dragon (Vietnamese)<br />Nuestra','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-814459776909440627/original/27ae38e4-dac0-48dd-98bf-f39e617a856f.jpeg',2601420,25,'45.50404','-122.64937',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,162.00,2,29,149,5.00,814459776909440627),(3035,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/814749346573841630','Breathtaking Views','Welcome to the best city skyline view in Portland. Every room includes 180 degree breathtaking views of downtown Portland, Washington Park, and the majestic Mount Hood. <br /><br />A 4,400 sq ft home on 1.7 hilltop acres offers stunning views, just 5 minutes by car to downtown and a 15-minute walk to NW 23rd\'s finest shops and restaurants. Within a mile of Portland Japanese Garden, Pittock Mansion, Washington Park, and Providence Park, it combines tranquility with proximity to top attractions.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-814749346573841630/original/9507325c-ef3b-47e7-a5e6-cb649007125e.jpeg',35288585,79,'45.52479328800589','-122.70333090374922',1,8,4.50,4.00,4.00,12.00,30,365,2,5.00,814749346573841630),(3036,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/814875331087261525','Top Floor Vintage Studio','Just a short walk to all the Portland landmarks such as Powell’s City Books, Timbers Stadium, Forest Park, International Rose Garden, Waterfront, and more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-814875331087261525/original/0e0c1aad-24eb-47ca-8974-2cf3bebd4715.jpeg',105280373,27,'45.52304519394259','-122.69017007028594',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,78.00,30,365,0,1.00,814875331087261525),(3037,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/815888767665522284','Pet-Friendly Oregon Abode - Furnished Balcony','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-815888767665522284/original/b2d1e9cd-ac0e-44be-9750-3d74a4d75776.jpeg',121688409,8,'45.51051','-122.62564',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,116.00,30,1125,2,5.00,815888767665522284),(3038,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/815965357659669746','Modern, warm convenience','.Lovely room with q