g 1920s bungalow w/one queen bed & couch in the sunroom. Sleeps 2 comfortably, 3 if someone is small enough for either couch. 1 bathroom w/claw foot tub. Ac/heat, Wi-Fi, smart LED lighting & smart speakers throughout home, small VHS collection & vintage 13inch VHS/TV combo. Back deck & sweet backyard for small group hangs. Street parking.','Quiet residential street just blocks from shops, cafes, Reed College, restaurants, bars, New Seasons and Safeway, major bus lines etc on SE Woodstock Ave. House is a short ten minute drive to shops on SE Division St or Hawthorne, as well as Tabor Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-819022636683134619/original/cd7e6b62-9534-4948-bb7f-7a38361dee78.jpeg',9073779,38,'45.479878','-122.606527',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,30,180,2,5.00,819022636683134619),(3045,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/819741373264776639','Woodstock Charmer!','Enjoy a relaxing stay in this charming house.  It is close to a beautiful park, shopping, restaurants, a library and transportation. It\'s a quite walkable neighborhood that is convenient to downtown. There is a long driveway for you car(s) or parking in front.  Enjoy the private, fenced backyard.  It\'s a friendly neighborhood, you may even get to know the dog owners as they walk by on their way to the park.','Woodstock is a great little neighborhood in SE Portland.  It\'s easy walk, or even quicker drive.  There are coffee shops, a bakery, grocery stores as well as a wide variety of restaurants.  It\'s a quick drive/bus ride to downtown Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-819741373264776639/original/4d819f9d-a810-43aa-9d77-269452cc3aa0.jpeg',32425053,38,'45.48573986298348','-122.61276644783952',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,180,4,4.75,819741373264776639),(3046,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/819874655855874968','Cozy, private unit walkable to Williams Ave','A place all to yourself, two blocks from all Williams Ave has to offer! You\'ll have a private entrance to your 1 bed, 1 bath, plus living area/kitchenette unit, and all the basics you\'ll need for your stay.<br /><br />Centrally located, you\'ll also be a walk/short drive to Mississippi Ave, NE Alberta St., and downtown Portland, and just a 20 minute drive from PDX airport.','The Boise neighborhood is best known for Williams Ave, a vibrant street with some of Portland\'s best - vintage storefronts, eateries, bakeries, coffee shops, and breweries.<br /><br />Within a short walk are popular spots like Eem, XLB, Migration Brewing, Dos Hermanos, and so many more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-819874655855874968/original/2fcd38fe-ad5f-441e-80bd-999027921644.jpeg',499594361,14,'45.55109','-122.66423',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,82.00,1,730,76,4.93,819874655855874968),(3047,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/820163642614389696','Cathedral Dream','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. Beautiful 2 bedroom in the heart of the St Johns neighborhood! Tucked just behind Cathedral Park this light  &  bright open floor plan features bamboo floors, dining nook, granite tile kitchen countertops, stainless steel appliances  &  pantry. Conveniently located in downtown St. Johns, this condo has a WalkScore of 85 and is close to U of P, New Seasons, McMenamins Theater  &  Pub  &  much more!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-820163642614389696/original/fd531cd8-06ea-48e0-8f9a-813387900939.jpeg',287402927,42,'45.58745731508019','-122.75669127614005',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,91.00,30,730,3,5.00,820163642614389696),(3048,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/820971896462892704','1898 House','In the heart of close-in NE Portland near great restaurants, bars, shopping & more. N Mississippi & Irvington-10 minute walk,  Alberta Arts District-1 mile. Catching a concert, Blazer game or Winterhawks game? MODA Center/Memorial Coliseum-1 mile. Downtown Portland-5 minute drive. 2 bedrooms sleep 2 in each, common area has pull out that sleeps 1 or a couple kids. No kitchen, but has microwave & fridge. Smart TV & hi-speed internet.','The 1898 House is in a residential neighborhood surrounded by great old homes, plenty of wonderful parks and awesome restaurants, bars and shopping that are a quick walk away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-820971896462892704/original/940360fd-5f0d-46cd-952e-6a1d3f8585cc.jpeg',116888183,26,'45.54813','-122.66528',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,85.00,1,29,134,4.85,820971896462892704),(3049,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/821789815962369995','Cozy Room in Quiet Piedmont Bungalow','Small bedroom (75 sq ft) with shared bath and a dedicated workspace in a quiet home & neighborhood that\'s close to many Portland amenities, including:<br />*  7 miles to PDX<br />*  3 miles to Oregon Convention Center<br />*  2 miles to Mississippi Ave & Alberta Arts Districts<br />*  4 miles to Downtown','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-818955070142751800/original/6fd12853-ec50-4318-a1c5-32e7a161e6e7.jpeg',94702,48,'45.57401765226076','-122.66514860425363',2,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,31,1,5.00,821789815962369995),(3050,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/821950661736336503','Cute and cozy Apartment Home in Portland!','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. <br /><br />Conveniently located near the airport, shopping, dining, and attractions. <br /><br />Fully furnished and ready for your enjoyment.  <br /><br />We are happy to host you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ca0357fb-2935-4f6d-b35c-507d8cd6b430.jpg',67795266,14,'45.55484374650742','-122.66234716632657',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,30,365,0,1.00,821950661736336503),(3051,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/822720380485026187','The Cortland: Designer Home- Steps to 23rd Ave!','Welcome to The Cortland, located in one of Portland\'s most walkable and transit-friendly neighborhoods, Nob Hill! This fully remodeled, professionally designed two-bedroom apartment is just steps away from world-famous 23rd Avenue and hundreds of eateries, pubs, breweries and shops. Every d