t area is easily Portland\'s most popular district, with its bevy of art galleries, high-end restaurants, breweries, local shops, and cafes, as well as its proximity to the Timbers Stadium, Downtown, and the Pearl District. The Walk Score of this house is 97 and there is nothing you can\'t walk to, such as:<br /><br /><br />• Papa Haydn<br />• Salt & Straw<br />• Lush<br />• Timbers Stadium<br />• Barista<br />• Cinema 21<br />• Mio Sushi<br />• Trader Joe\'s<br />• Whole Foods<br />• The Fireside<br />• Boxer Ramen<br />• MAC<br />• Little Big Burger<br />• Blue Star Donuts<br />...and too many more to list!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-822725151506516398/original/e79d34e3-5ac8-4139-8b85-7667be300a43.jpeg',500247539,27,'45.5281228','-122.6977627',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,129.00,30,365,1,5.00,822725151506516398),(3056,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/823260561009170650','Adorable St. Johns House w/Porch','You will be close to everything at this centrally-located home in St. Johns!  This is an adorable home with hardwood floors, a covered front porch, and back deck. The kitchen is fully equipped with all the cooking essentials you need. You\'ll love staying here because it\'s a short walk to the park, restaurants, coffee shops, our community movie theatre, & Stormbreaker Brewing!','North Portland, St. Johns<br />Adorable part of the city near the famous and beautiful St. Johns Bridge and picturesque Cathedral Park. Walking distance to locally ran restaurants, bars, cinemas, scooter shops, coffee hangouts, and brew pubs.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-823260561009170650/original/c344e6ca-1210-4e23-8e48-81a76bd9e359.jpeg',16581727,42,'45.59161254818027','-122.76100939029166',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,79.00,7,100,39,4.90,823260561009170650),(3057,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/823279377987913554','Watts Landing - a city escape','A short walk from downtown Kenton, this 2 bedroom flat is centrally located to access all that Portland has to offer. Along the MAX line, its the perfect spot if you\'re looking to spend time in N/NE Portland, hit a Blazers, Timbers, Thorns game, attend races at PIW, or a show at MODA. Tons of restaurants and coffee shops in the area.<br /><br />With two bedrooms, dining room, full kitchen, bathtub, fireplace, dedicated work space, and large tv, it\'s the perfect place for a couple, small group or a family.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-823279377987913554/original/36d25b34-0a05-4cb5-a25c-db96df1bf570.jpeg',4153980,55,'45.58159410925733','-122.68294152965618',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,1,1125,48,4.94,823279377987913554),(3058,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/823349273592783197','Explore Portland from a Modern Private Suite','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-823349273592783197/original/6bf763a4-1e8e-42a8-bac6-20485a18c8f6.jpeg',491435195,25,'45.505626238987986','-122.6530231790166',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,2,730,21,4.76,823349273592783197),(3059,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/824680577411840329','Month long stay in the city','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish 1 bed/1 bath with full kitchen, washer and dryer. Renovated February 2022 with new central A/C and heating. Work from home with included WIFI, stay for a travel nursing assignment.  Living room couch has a full size pullout bed. Quiet neighborhood in inner NE Alberta area. Just off Alberta park within walking distance to many restaurants and breweries. Separate detached unit is behind the main house with a staircase entrance. Message with any questions.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-824680577411840329/original/3895e328-245b-4ca3-8f19-0c373e370691.jpeg',123105551,45,'45.56842409886617','-122.64813640913172',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,31,363,0,1.00,824680577411840329),(3060,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/824712137951653421','Charming 3bed Home w/ Yard - Walk Score 91!','Welcome to the Douglas House! This centrally-located home is the perfect blend of comfort and convenience. With plenty of space for a group of friends or family and a fenced backyard, it’s the perfect spot to stay in while enjoying all that Portland has to offer. With a walk score of 91, you can easily access many of Portland’s most popular bars, restaurants and shops on foot! We can\'t wait to host you! Come stay!','Located along a prominent throughway, the King neighborhood provides direct access to several of Portland’s prominent eateries and neighboring districts. Its centrally-located nature makes it one of the best neighborhoods to get around in and from, earning a Walk Score of 90 and a bike score of 98. With over 125 restaurants, shops and bars nearby, you can walk to a multitude of locations within a matter of minutes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-824712137951653421/original/4bb0f717-e690-4506-a40c-3caa34db9d41.png',500642386,14,'45.549044','-122.659371',1,8,1.00,3.00,4.00,99.00,30,365,6,5.00,824712137951653421),(3061,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/825301611376268303','Sweet Spot','More like a house than an apartment.  This sweet one-bedroom, close-in to downtown (appox. 10 min. by car), yet near Portland trails,  Multnomah Village,  BIG trees and lots of green spaces is ideally located.  Detached, second floor,  in-law suite sets far off the street,  has driveway and street parking, garden space,  and cozy vibe. Public transport easily accessible.  <br />*Sorry,  some dog breeds not permitted due to insurance exclusions. Extended stays only (30-day minimum)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2abcfb6e-ff2b-40a7-be82-6896c64a7fdd.jpg',87322583,17,'45.482844596755','-122.73179188370705',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,31,350,1,5.00,825301611376268303),(3062,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/825727995686716580','2 Bed/1 Bath in NE - Close to Mississippi Ave','This modern, brand new 2 bed/ 1 bath apartment occupies the entire lower level of a classic Portland home. Located within close proximity to popular Mississippi Avenue, you will have easy access to all the best dining and shopping. There\'s a kitchen & built-in banquette if you prefer to whip up a meal or heat up some takeout from one of the restaurants close-by. The private outdoor space features a seating area and a small, fully-fenced yard that is perfect for those traveling with pets.','The Boise-Eliot neighborhood is known to be one of Portland\'s hottest, hippest neighborhoods! With such well-known streets as Mississippi, Alberta and Williams being smack dab in the middle of Boise, there\'s no lack of things to do, see, explore, eat and drink. Bring some comfy shoes, grab a couple coins for the bus lines, and go on an epic Portland adventure - this neighborhood is sure to be the perfect host.<br /><br />FROM PORTLAND\'S MOST POPULAR NEIGHBORHOOD WEBSITE:<br /><br />\"Portland\'s Boise-Eliot neighborhood is one of the most unique and most popular Portland neighborhoods. Most locals know Boise-Eliot by a few names: Williams Avenue and Mississippi Avenue. While technically both part of the same neighborhood proper, these two streets have truly developed their own unique personality and feel with respect to the independent businesses that line their streets and the folks who frequent them.<br /><br />The Mississippi Ave neighborhood has changed radically in the last 10 years','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-825727995686716580/original/543e2bea-32a7-47bc-8bf6-cdefc6ce7bc6.png',500850476,9,'45.5518977','-122.6649269',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,2,365,44,4.84,825727995686716580),(3063,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/825972289210753775','4 Exquisite Units At Dossier Hotel Portland','Experience the very best of Oregon in downtown Portland. The property provides quick and hassle-free access to many of the state’s hidden gems, including the famed Portland Japanese Gardens, Portland Art Museum, Mission Theater, and Portland Saturday Market. The natural beauty of surrounding mountains, nearby lakes, and magnificent vistas is irresistible, offering numerous hiking, climbing, and kayaking options. Downtown Portland is renowned for its culinary diversity, museums, and artists.','- Tender Loving Empire - 0.2 mile; <br />- Portland Art Museum - 0.3 mile; <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park - 0.7 mile; <br />- Mission Theater - 0.9 mile; <br />- Portland Paddle Sports Center - 1.2 miles; <br />- Oregon Museum of Science & Industry - 1.7 miles; <br />- International Rose Test Garden - 1.8 miles; <br />- Japanese Garden - 2.4 miles; <br />- House of Vintage - 2.7 miles; <br />- Hoyt Arboretum - 3.4 miles; <br />- Portland International Airport - 12.0 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-825972289210753775/original/f09638fd-7009-4875-bb60-f2912f9802bc.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52006','-122.68008',4,16,4.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,825972289210753775),(3064,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/826160162155753901','The Vibey Treehouse Nest Apt.','Welcome to our cozy and bright apartment with treehouse vibes! Perfectly located for a chill stay, this space is sure to delight. With plenty of natural light and modern vibes, you\'ll feel right at home. Our neighborhood is mellow, yet close to all the hot spots. Take a stroll to local shops and cafes or find your way over to the local climbing gym. After a day of adventure, unwind in our comfortable living area. Come experience the best of Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-826160162155753901/original/6ddabef8-9c7a-46a0-a058-1ce3b1c23ba8.jpeg',24000631,32,'45.519432526377926','-122.65167623346892',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,86.00,30,1125,32,4.91,826160162155753901),(3065,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/826946368538072330','Historic Victorian Artist\'s Lair','This late 1800\'s gem welcomes travelers to a brilliant, hand-curated stay. Euro chic. Grounding. Sophisticated high ceilings let in plenty of natural light. A modern interior juxtaposes original wood floors and tastefully-sprinkled curiosities throughout. Sumptuous linen bedding. Get swept into the funky soul and vibrancy of SE Portland. Food scene is top!<br />Perched off the street by stairs leading to a quaint porch with peekaboo city view. Public transit 2 blocks away to downtown and PDX airport.','Location: This home is located in a transitional yet walkable neighborhood and is rich in history and culture. Stellar food options and local shops abound. There are homes that have been fully updated and others that have not. You will likely see transients and unhoused persons. The neighborhood is safe and we\'ve never had any issues. There is railway/transit traffic nearby. We want guests to have informed insight on the dynamics of the neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-826946368538072330/original/ab059907-3739-4f44-a044-42da396bea77.jpeg',109508502,25,'45.50465','-122.65207',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,127.00,4,20,40,4.98,826946368538072330),(3066,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/826972597892783809','Classic Portland Craftsman with AC near Beaumont','This 1912 home is classic “Old Portland”! Full of new and high-end furnishings (Room & Board, Rejuvenation), vintage decor and original artwork, the overall aesthetic honors the unique culture of Portland & the PNW.<br /><br />A large fenced backyard and hardscaped patios make an ideal spot for relaxing and enjoying a peaceful retreat close to all the city has to offer.<br /><br />Amazing coffee shops and restaurants all within blocks and easy access to public transportation into the city or roads to the mountains.','The Roseway neighborhood is a lovely area with coffee and wine shops and restaurants (amazing taqueria and pizza) in walking distance. The street ends at a large public golf course. Neighbors care for their unique craftsman homes and gardens and this area is considered safe. Fremont Street/Beaumont-Wilshire is to the north and also within walking distance with great shops to explore. Walk to an amazing food cart park just West on Sandy Blvd for some of the best food Portland has to offer!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-826972597892783809/original/72f23e52-335d-4834-98eb-4674a5c68cac.jpg',12273725,39,'45.54407271511198','-122.5942692308273',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,200.00,30,89,7,5.00,826972597892783809),(3067,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/827509220018608218','Rose City Retreat','Located near the airport, enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located home base with a full kitchen, laundry, bathroom and king size bed (and a pullout couch - please tell us ahead of time if you want it made up for you otherwise we will leave it as a couch). We are near Whole Foods, Trader Joe’s, and bus transit on Sandy Blvd to explore Portland.','A quiet, well-established residential area near bus stops for easy transit via the Portland Trimet system. We live one block away from Sandy Blvd. which has some walkable areas with restaurants and a small pod of food carts, and a nice coffee shop called Case Study; this is centrally located in Northeast Portland—10 minutes from the Airport, and 5 minutes drive from Whole Foods or Trader Joes and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-827509220018608218/original/54c60327-41be-4a29-9a15-ef48f25d058a.jpeg',20940822,11,'45.54589910028744','-122.5995420108459',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,3,10,44,4.98,827509220018608218),(3068,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/827681729317697370','Pacific Northwest Cozy','This cozy studio in the heart of SE Portland is perfect for you if:<br /><br />--you\'re looking for a walkable neighborhood near restaurants, cafes & shops (we\'re close to Hawthorne, Belmont & Division)<br />--you want a place w/ a kitchen<br />--you like old craftsmans w/ character (ours was built in 1909)<br />--you\'re not a light sleeper wanting to sleep in--we live upstairs with our 4 year old & he\'s up at 7:30 every morning :)<br /><br />We live upstairs and are happy to help with anything you need while you\'re here!','Southeast Portland is VERY cute, and we\'re super close to Mt. Tabor, which we think is the most beautiful park of all (even more so than Forest Park, which is also stunning.) We\'re in walking distance to four grocery stores (Whole Foods, Safeway, Fred Meyer, and New Seasons), and several amazing restaurants and coffee shops. Plus bus lines down Belmont or Hawthorne.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-827681729317697370/original/1e28c6e8-eb85-4b53-8345-3d1a85e33ee2.jpeg',4935076,16,'45.51368','-122.63383',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,2,180,32,4.94,827681729317697370),(3069,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/828294789666308206','Cozy Artsy St Johns Bungalow','Take it easy at this charming and tranquil vintage 1925 bungalow. Filled with my artwork, leafy plants and sunlight colors!<br />Enjoy Portland and consider my home your city retreat.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/32b96cfc-9e2f-4271-9c62-58801c8eed6d.jpg',13263099,58,'45.5869','-122.7451',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,215.00,28,28,0,1.00,828294789666308206),(3070,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/828303424324118380','Private room in Portland Heights','Stay in the guest room if our restored 1912 Portland heights home. We love to share the views, and our golden retriever lucky would love to get a few pets too.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d0c7df3e-9e7a-4c4f-9d5c-4141cef9ac61.jpg',10075773,54,'45.50741529716741','-122.69676759839058',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,160.00,30,365,0,1.00,828303424324118380),(3071,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/828415611132090947','Cozy Cottage with Fenced Yard and Clawfoot Tub!','You\'ll love soaking in the bath and sitting under the rose of sharon blossoms in the private peaceful patio in this private studio located in our back garden. Located in popular walkable lents our home offers AC, high speed wifi the comfiest queen memory foam bed and a small quiet private space with easy access to the 205 and inner Portland corridor. I offer discounts for multi month stays so reach out and ask me if you\'re planning to stay more than 30 days!','Lents/ FoPo: We’re located in Lents 2 blocks from Foster Powell aka Fopo and our hoods are frequently grouped together as they share many amenities and transit lines. Sometimes we’re also referred to as the “Jade District” due to the high historic concentrations of Asian/ Pacific Islander communities and businesses in our area. Translation - we have some of the best food in the city here! Our area is unique because it’s both super walkable as well as easy for car commuters. It’s a 15 min drive to the Airport, 20 min drive to downtown and about 5 mins in any direction to somewhere cool/ useful. <br /><br />Our area is also one of the top 5 fastest growing areas in inner city Portland. Popular with young professionals and families the median age of people in our neighborhood is about 37 and the average home price is about 435 as of 9/23. <br /><br />There’s 2 max stations and half a dozen bus lines within a few blocks of the Airbnb as well as food carts, coffee shops, microbreweries and ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-828415611132090947/original/8b92d9e9-d086-4645-a19e-ec8e3ab139e6.jpeg',501414071,72,'45.48268767467955','-122.57613551782592',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,30,365,5,5.00,828415611132090947),(3072,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/828978241312428962','Spacious & Beautiful Hillside Oasis, SW Hills PDX','Spacious, serene & private, with tall ceilings & picture windows, gas fireplace, pool table and outdoor living space. This home sits atop the valley in the exclusive SW Hills. Mobility friendly with zero stairs. Only 8 minutes to OHSU and downtown Portland, 10 to Beaverton. 15\'x15\' king bedroom with seating & work area. Large new *kitchen, new appliances & full-size washer/dryer, with free coffee and fast WIFI!','Quiet and picturesque with curving roads and green space, in SW Hills-Hillsdale neighborhood. Home is only 1.5 miles to Hillsdale, 2 to Multnomah Village, 2.7 to OHSU and 3.3 to the center of downtown Portland. Mere blocks to Council Crest Park which has a 360 degree view and the popular Fairmont loop for walking or biking. 8 minutes to Oregon Zoo, 9 mins to Portland State University, 10 mins to Portland Japanese Garden, Powell\'s City of Books, Providence Park and Portland Art Museum.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-828978241312428962/original/641d813d-9480-43b7-a5ab-f6fd4bb8527c.jpeg',116596023,31,'45.4939673','-122.711362',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,112.00,3,28,35,4.97,828978241312428962),(3073,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/829194396436425156','Room in a Landmark Victorian','Enjoy a private room in a National Historic Landmark Victorian 140 year old house with stunning views of downtown Portland and South Waterfront and the scenic ranges beyond. The home is located a convenient, short 10-15 min walk to downtown Portland, or the South Waterfront. Stay with a local home grown Portland artist where you can revel in the creative and artistic flair throughout the residence. It is a truly unique home: you will not find anything quite like it to lay your head.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-829194396436425156/original/9a1208ef-56d4-409b-8659-6ed6391fae64.jpeg',5467063,30,'45.49647510484333','-122.67914347350597',2,2,1.50,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,2,5.00,829194396436425156),(3074,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/829790858587040616','Hot Tub, Game Room & Fire Pit!','The Avalon is the perfect home for entertainment and relaxation! From the hot tub and outdoor seating with fire pit, to the unfinished basement game room with pool table, air hockey, and lounging area with TV, there is no shortage of fun to be had here! Just one block from the many bars and restaurants of NE Broadway and a 10 minute ride to Downtown Portland and Mississippi, this centrally-located house is the perfect home base for checking out everything Portland has to offer!','Sullivan\'s Gulch is located in Northeast Portland. It is bordered by the Lloyd, Kerns, Hollywood, Grant Park, Laurelhurst, and Irvington neighborhoods. Sullivan\'s Gulch is conveniently located on bus lines, and within a short distance to the MAX light rail station at Lloyd Center.<br /><br />Rail lines:<br />MAX Blue Line - 0.8 mi<br />MAX Red Line - 0.8 mi<br />MAX Green Line - 0.8 mi<br />Portland Streetcar - A Loop - 1.0 mi<br />Portland Streetcar - B Loop - 1.1 mi<br /><br />Bus lines:<br /><br />77 Broadway/Halsey - 0.1 mi<br />70 12th/NE 33rd Ave - 0.1 mi<br />17 Holgate/Broadway - 0.2 mi<br />12 Barbur/Sandy Blvd - 0.3 mi<br />6 Martin Luther King Jr Blvd - 1.2 mi','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-829790858587040616/original/eff5b366-04e6-4524-9f4b-d65376649631.png',501694949,4,'45.534236','-122.6376903',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,155.00,30,365,64,4.56,829790858587040616),(3075,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/830552382387723890','Sunny Sabin Guesthouse | Private Studio Portland','Private guesthouse located in the charming Sabin neighborhood in Northeast Portland, known for its welcoming community and great location! <br /><br />Only a few blocks to Sabin’s restaurants, cafes, shops, parks, and grocery stores. Super close to Portland’s vibrant Alberta Arts District, Williams Ave, Mississippi Ave, and Fremont Ave. 15 min drive to downtown. <br /><br />Sabin is a biker\'s/walker\'s paradise. This private, relaxing space is the perfect place to unwind after a long day exploring the city!','Sabin is an inclusive and community-focused neighborhood','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/45ae0c99-a70e-43a1-810c-9b890cf84ed3.jpg',227683766,6,'45.551519','-122.6530289',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,103.00,2,600,41,4.93,830552382387723890),(3076,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/830594705221023616','Designer 3bed/2bath Home - Steps to Mississippi!','Welcome to Tussi\'s! For those of you who love to be smack dab in the middle of the action, with every restaurant, bar, shop and cafe right outside your door, this designer, 2-story townhome, with its Walk Score of 96, is the perfect place to experience Portland by day, and comfortably lay your head at night. Located smack dab in the middle of one Portland\'s most popular areas, Mississippi Street, this house is a stone\'s throw from all of the action Portland has become famous for. Come stay!','The Mississippi neighborhood has quickly become one of Portland\'s most coveted foodie areas, with such names as ¿Por Qué No?, Tasty & Sons, Prost!, Gravy, Blue Star Donuts, Mee Sen Thai, Interurban and more just steps away from the house! And with easy access to the Overlook MAX station, getting downtown is super easy, too; be there in less than twenty minutes! As mentioned throughout the listing, this home is one block from I-5 and is not the best fit for those sensitive to background noise.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-830594705221023616/original/7d5f7145-41bb-4e56-bc7c-4f8f029cef03.jpeg',111978787,9,'45.5504621','-122.6779972',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,114.00,30,360,31,4.74,830594705221023616),(3077,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/831116378786205246','Wyndham Portland Waterfront Park Resort | Studio','When your idea of vacation calls for quirk, Portland is the place to be. Located in the heart of downtown in the Historic Waterfront District, this modern resort is a prime headquarters for exploration.<br /><br />This listing is for a Queen Bed Studio Suite at Club Wyndham Portland Waterfront Park Resort. This spacious studio suite measures approximately 380 - 403 square feet. You will enjoy a queen murphy bed and a kitchenette. Maximum occupancy is two.','• Club Wyndham Portland Waterfront Park Resort is in Portland, OR','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-831116378786205246/original/c1c46b82-1f61-4719-b995-daf8f3f29a33.jpeg',442029804,43,'45.52123929011583','-122.67232239776979',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,147.00,30,365,0,1.00,831116378786205246),(3078,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/831116394929909304','Wyndham Portland Waterfront Park Resort | Studio','When your idea of vacatio