 a main bus route and bicycle greenways for easy transportation. Downtown Portland is only 15 minute drive away.','Located in the North East Alberta Arts district. Cute walkable neighborhood close to main bus line, restaurants, coffee, bakeries and only 15 minutes from downtown.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-831282798146448473/original/c220d78b-e56a-4c31-b955-bed8bee9ce71.jpeg',141751197,21,'45.5584','-122.61577',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,39.00,1,14,145,4.97,831282798146448473),(3108,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/831431559871172095','Ken\'s bungalow suite','Great for business-minded guests or tourists! The suite has a separate entrance into the home, a private bathroom and living room. 10 minutes (3.5 miles) to PDX. 15 minutes (6.5 miles) to downtown. Several restaurants are an easy walking distance.','Located near the Madison South and Gateway neighborhoods. Ten minutes to PDX by rideshare. Freeway (I84) is nearby for quick access to downtown by car or head to the Gorge. The Max 82nd stop is 5 minute walk, which takes you to the airport, downtown and all over the Metro area. Close to Rose City Golf Course and Rocky Butte.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b026b379-5979-477f-ba2b-149f50c69f32.jpg',94889798,74,'45.53925','-122.57773',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,1,21,20,3.90,831431559871172095),(3109,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/831782549297378683','LG Home/Room/Bath/NWilliams Trendy, Food,Bars,Yard','-30+ day BRAND new remodeled room/home rental<br /><br />-full bath, shower, tub<br /><br />- steps to trendy areas restaurants, shops, bars on N Vancouver Ave  & N Williams Ave & Mississippi neighborhood <br /><br />- enjoy amenities of an entire home, gourmet kitchen, dining room, backyard, front porch, laundry<br /><br />-live in Craftsman home with hardwoods, light/bright, clean house w/ Roomba Robot<br /><br />-cook w/best appliances<br /><br />-warm/cool new dual pane windows, A/C, central heat, insulation<br /><br />-workout dual pilates, yoga, aerial silks','The Vancouver/Williams corridor is a vibrant commercial district on Portland’s close-in Eastside. <br /><br />This home is located in the heart of the North Williams District, vibrant commerical district. Our close-in North Portland location offers easy access to great brewpubs, bars and restaurants, locally-owned boutiques, beautiful city parks, arterial bike ways, spas, salons, yoga,  Barre studios, and events venues such as Moda Center, the Wonder Ballroom, downtown Portland. <br /><br />North Vancouver Avenue is the southbound arterial for the corridor, while North Williams Avenue is the complementary northbound arterial. These arterials carry both car and bicycle traffic, with nearly 9,000 bicycles per day between the two streets.<br /><br />Major employers in the area include Adidas’ North American headquarters (1,200 employees) and PCC’s Cascade Campus (over 20,000 full and part-time students annually). Down the street from Emanuel Children\'s Hospital and short drive to Oregon H','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-831782549297378683/original/4fb4affe-91c9-41d2-8463-d02ed7df22db.jpeg',6242935,24,'45.5553146','-122.6677392',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,42.00,30,365,1,5.00,831782549297378683),(3110,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/831984323475302535','Luxurious Modern loft ! Free Garage Parking','This downtown city loft provides a prime location, breathtaking views, and convenient access to all the best that the city has to offer. The proximity leads to an array of fabulous dining and trendy cafes. The loft is surrounded by boutique stores and high-end shopping. Find numerous theaters, cinemas, and live music venues in the area.  Whether you are a foodie, a shopaholic, or a culture enthusiast, this loft is the perfect base for you to explore and experience the bustling city life','Pearl District','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-831984323475302535/original/0f7d29ac-8dca-4efe-941b-37d9e9c1fd11.jpeg',439103919,2,'45.5269042','-122.6795883',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,108.00,2,28,63,4.78,831984323475302535),(3111,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/832130778073618434','Apt w/ Sauna in Craftsman','This close-in apartment within a Craftsman home in located in the stunning tree-lined Historic Neighborhood of Irvington. It has 2 bedrooms and a bathroom that features a pristine sauna, extra large shower w/ 5 shower heads, and radiant heat flooring. Fully stocked kitchenette, in-unit laundry, A/C, TV w/ Roku streaming, Wi-Fi, and a back garden w/ fire pit. Walking distance to Whole Foods, coffee, sushi, bars, restaurants, and shopping. Downtown is a mere 10 minute drive.','This close-in home is located in the stunning Historic Neighborhood of Irvington. Tree-lined streets, well cared for homes, and close proximity to shops and restaurants is what makes this neighborhood one of the most sought-after in Portland. <br />A hip coffee shop is just two blocks away, and Whole Foods, sushi, a neighborhood bar, and shopping are just a few blocks. This neighborhood is nestled between two shopping/restaurant districts: NE Broadway and Alberta Arts District. Downtown is a mere ten minute drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-832130778073618434/original/2cd105e9-d433-474c-ab2c-7fb99ff00101.jpeg',434680279,7,'45.54364','-122.64895',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,105.00,30,90,6,4.83,832130778073618434),(3112,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/832890797069658898','Cozy Suites 15 mins PDX airport','Peaceful and centrally-located. We’re super hosts since January 2019.<br />- 15 mins from PDX airport, 82nd Jade district (great Asian restaurants)<br />- 20-25 mins to downtown, Moda Center, Japanese Garden, Chinese Garden, Happy Valley, Hawthorne District, Alberta, downtown Vancouver<br />- 30 mins to Beaverton/Tigard, Multnomah Falls, Silverton Falls.','We live in a quiet, established 1940s neighborhood on the Glendoveer Golf Course corridor. Hidden mid-century gems are two to three streets down.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6b242a20-2a6f-4810-903c-e76799ad2e71.jpg',202400439,71,'45.53160460000001','-122.5068561',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,85.00,1,28,109,4.79,832890797069658898),(3113,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/833008820425318111','Vibrant 1950s Mt Scott Home','This funky 1950’s-style home on Woodstock is perfect for travelers looking for a cozy spot in SE! Featuring 2 bedrooms with ultra-comfy beds, updated kitchen & bath, a cozy living area with TV, and a spacious front yard, you\'ll have everything you need to enjoy your stay. Located in SE Portland, we are a short distance from Reed College and a quick walk to plenty of popular bars, restaurants and shops. Come visit!','The Mount Scott-Arleta neighborhood is located in Southeast Portland. It is bordered by the Woodstock, Creston-Kenilworth, Foster-Powell, Lents, and Brentwood-Darlington neighborhoods.<br /><br />Mt. Scott-Arleta feels almost suburban though it is very much a part of urban Portland. This is a wonderful neighborhood of older Portland homes and old growth trees lining many of the streets.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-833008820425318111/original/5ac28060-a8d8-4fcc-8260-7ddf2bd9864e.png',502209389,65,'45.4793569','-122.5984902',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,2,365,33,4.82,833008820425318111),(3114,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/833353819875092168','Quiet Portland Guest House','Quiet, new construction back yard ADU.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-833353819875092168/original/f1488b90-f3c4-4194-bf98-0c0a9c5c00e6.jpeg',41313924,21,'45.5508821','-122.6034969',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,70.00,2,31,44,4.98,833353819875092168),(3115,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/833521729084949016','9 Queen Beds/3.5 Baths/2 Kitchens','This house comes with an additional basement apartment. Enjoy 4,317 square feet of luxury living for everyone.  The living room will welcome you right in and the formal dining room will seat up to 10 comfortably.  The basement dining room will seat six more and has a full kitchen.  Both  kitchens have double ovens and are fully equipped with everything you could possibly need.  Within walking distance of bars, restaurants, grocery store, theaters, shopping mall, and sports arenas.  Very clean!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7ee46611-2bfd-4ee3-a59a-19d594be9282.jpg',123968362,7,'45.53651980440951','-122.65006609373528',1,10,3.50,6.00,9.00,950.00,2,365,2,5.00,833521729084949016),(3116,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/834080355583718471','Cozy Retreat w/ Fireplace','After a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer, come home to comfort. The livingroom features a gas fireplace, comfortable modern furnishings, and the kitchen features all new stainless steel appliances. The second floor loft king bedroom offers a spacious living space of its own and its own private bathroom complete with custom luxury tilework and a rain shower. There is one queen bedroom on the main floor and a full bathroom with bathtub and luxurious rain shower.','Located just 5 blocks to the center of historic Kenton. Downtown Kenton is rich with 5 star coffee and tea shops, restaurants, bars, a downtown library, and a vibrant arts scene. A short walk or bike ride to the Max station, located on the 4 bus line.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODM0MDgwMzU1NTgzNzE4NDcx/original/b0192a0e-bc69-430c-9dbe-d710ad65ca6e.jpeg',4747418,55,'45.578495329483694','-122.68815975467736',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,108.00,3,1125,8,5.00,834080355583718471),(3117,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/834256182681884821','Midcentury Haven, plus a doggo!','Come meet me and my dog, Rocko in my adorable midcentury ranch-style house. The neighborhood is super quiet and I am curating a peaceful and vibrant house since purchasing it in February 2023. I try to keep the pictures updated but I\'m always improving the space as I go!','This neighborhood is fairly residential. There is a beautiful park just a block or two behind my house where I frequently walk with Rocko.<br /><br />There\'s a few places in the area that I do like to eat at, and we\'re in the center of a bunch of big box stores so you won\'t be far from any groceries or anything you might need to get while you\'re here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-834256182681884821/original/66ae6b2d-6ff5-4c76-acbd-168e50377ba4.jpeg',59627203,35,'45.53784','-122.54272',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,1,100,28,5.00,834256182681884821),(3118,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/835074424419955172','Modern Private Full Suite, Central Location.','Enjoy a stylish experience on a nice quiet street. The space has east, south, and western exposures providing tons of natural light. Very walkable and bike-friendly. Close to parks, restaurants, and shops. Direct bus-line to downtown is only a half a block away. Off-street parking in driveway for one vehicle.','Friendly and quiet','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODM1MDc0NDI0NDE5OTU1MTcy/original/670d00df-56cd-4e39-86de-51fa5a779ec1.jpeg',356648186,67,'45.4911513','-122.6141778',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,1,1125,21,5.00,835074424419955172),(3119,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/835122195318139103','Charming *30+Day* Suite! 2 Min Walk From OHSU','Live in the comfort of having your home *STEPS* away from OHSU Hospital in this quaint and stylish abode! This 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom suite boasts a fresh and inviting interior with back deck views of Mt. Hood and OHSU campus. <br /><br />Features to highlight include:  brand new carpet, furniture, and household essentials, washer/dryer, dedicated workspace (x 2) with desks, high-speed WiFi, smart TV, designated parking.<br /><br />Rent includes all utilities (i.e. electricity, heat, WiFi, water, garbage)','Just steps away from Oregon Health & Science University on Marquam Hill. Restaurants (Thai food) and convenience store within 1-2 minute walking distance. Safe neighborhood (OHSU/City Police Station around the corner). Centrally located, less than 5 minute (2 mile) drive to downtown Portland and a short car ride to the Convention Center, Rose Garden, Moda Center, and the Oregon Zoo.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-835122195318139103/original/95cee875-780a-4491-b5db-4885af5ba342.jpeg',35669572,30,'45.498495798635396','-122.6901537441803',1,3,1.00,3.00,3.00,92.00,30,365,2,5.00,835122195318139103),(3120,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/835505421900009247','SE Division 1 Bdrm Cutie!','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Fantastic location off SE Division and 51st near great food pods, restaurants, beer gardens. Walk to Mt. Tabor. Enjoy Portland to the fullest. Secured parking!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-835505421900009247/original/e65f4953-b3a2-4db1-b636-c57bd635ffc6.jpeg',30079973,8,'45.5050251','-122.6101922',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,31,365,0,1.00,835505421900009247),(3121,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/835717666863461578','Modern 2 Bed, 2 Bath in Alberta Arts','Location<br />Two blocks from Alberta Arts – Salt&Straw, Proud Mary, Gumba<br /><br />About the space<br />NEW 2bed/2bath (1 King w/marble shower, 1 Queen w/soaking tub) spaced apart for privacy. Heated bathroom floors, towel warmers.  Living room w/  50” TV and Netflix.  Fully stocked kitchenware essentials and coffee/tea.  Individually room-controlled AC throughout.<br /><br />Guest Access<br />Private 24/7 keyless entry to daylight basement unit<br /><br />Other things to note<br />No animals or smoking<br />Family resides above in the main home','Quiet residential street','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-835717666863461578/original/c67f611e-8873-4800-b005-83028f96e758.jpeg',502965969,6,'45.557123852660645','-122.6470528468176',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,150.00,2,60,99,4.98,835717666863461578),(3122,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/835796314493867618','Dazzling 3bd, 2ba Home w/Private Deck near Alberta','This bright and stylish home features 3 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms near Portland\'s popular Alberta neighborhood. This sunlit home is perfect for traveling professionals or temporary housing for a small family. Hang out on the front porch with your morning coffee as neighbors stroll by, or seek the comfort of the back deck with a covered area to shade from winter rain or summer sun.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-835796314493867618/original/f3d2705b-a900-46d9-b265-305e03a869e9.jpeg',221421926,46,'45.55473','-122.63051',1,5,2.00,3.00,3.00,85.00,31,365,3,4.67,835796314493867618),(3123,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/836188026973289312','Charming room in St John’s - no cleaning fee','Kick back and relax in this private room with a shared bath in the small yet beloved community of St John’s. <br /><br />We have two curious and excitable cattle dogs that will greet you at the door and try to snuggle with you if you leave your door open. They are very social so if you are NOT fond or comfortable with dogs we may not be the right fit for you.<br /><br />Please inquire if you\'re interested in a longer stay or dates are blocked off that you\'re visiting. We may be able to accommodate.','Cruise down Willamette boulevard for a great bike ride or run, or stop in to New Seasons grocery and grab snacks for a picnic in Cathedral Park boasting views of the iconic St. John’s bridge.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-836188026973289312/original/083b74d7-18d5-4eac-99aa-adb893be3cef.jpeg',65276444,58,'45.5905','-122.73236',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,2,21,85,5.00,836188026973289312),(3124,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/836310915166337383','Light and Bright Daylight Basement Apartment','Welcome to our cozy daylight basement apartment in SE Portland dedicated exclusively to traveling professionals. Our unit is fully furnished with 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom. This unit includes one bedroom with a queen size bed and one bedroom with a full size bed. The living room has a couch with cozy throw blankets, the kitchen is fully equipped and the bathroom has a shower/tub combination. There is a private entrance, dedicated laundry room and plenty of street parking in a quiet neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-836310915166337383/original/fef84d49-f322-47d2-8e9f-0a0f04af5101.jpeg',17946344,90,'45.51516804875882','-122.53153668912469',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,365,2,5.00,836310915166337383),(3125,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/837314102395515610','Urban Bungalow w/ Bikes, Gym & PDX Vibes','Stay in a private bungalow that offers a full modern kitchen, loft & basement-full of amenities. Ideal for YOUR Stays! Loft offers a master suite & a separate office space and futon sleeping area. The basement has a Rec/Fitness & Yoga Rm for your enjoyment. Located in the heart of PDX&walking distance from shops, bars, restaurants & local food carts. You have bikes in the garage to help with exploration. You will also be few miles away from Downtown, MODA/Convent Center and close to Expo center!','NE Portland is a true slice of Portland that offers you a density of bars, restaurants, and shopping, while still feeling like you\'re experiencing a local neighborhood feel. Explore NE Alberta St., N. Williams Corridor, walk to Mississippi Street and explore unique coffee shops, restaurants, and bars!<br /><br />What makes this area great is that you\'re also only 2.5 miles from downtown Portland - so it\'s really easy to bike, take a bus, or an uber/lyft and be downtown within 10 to 15 minutes.<br /><br />The Moda, Conventional center and Loyd Center are minutes away. The expo center is close too, as well as all major hospitals (OHSU, Randall/Legacy, Providence, Keiser)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-837314102395515610/original/d19be173-ca01-4ce1-b861-66b9d0391d1b.jpeg',494186847,14,'45.556','-122.66123',1,5,1.00,3.00,3.00,92.00,2,30,20,4.70,837314102395515610),(3126,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/837896812703586063','Private Unit in Woodstock, near Reed College','Enjoy your stay in private modern one bedroom/full bath in beautiful Woodstock District. Close to Reed College! <br /><br />Perfect for a single person or couple. Free laundry on site.<br /><br />Easy walking to food carts, Grand Central Bakery, bars and breweries, New Seasons grocery store, coffee shops, ice cream, cuisine eateries, vintage shops, dispensaries, bank and even a gas station.<br /><br />Bus line to other neighborhoods and downtown. Easy access to 205N/I-84E to airport, Multnomah Falls and Columbia Gorge.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODM3ODk2ODEyNzAzNTg2MDYz/original/6681d3fa-f7d1-484a-9b16-912718afaf9c.jpeg',503453546,65,'45.478968','-122.6009337',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,61.00,1,31,151,4.92,837896812703586063),(3127,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/838186442611301171','Restored 2BR | Balcony Dog Friendly | W/D','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-838186442611301171/original/9b141049-e470-4a67-8427-8d63ccc0a064.jpeg',111797012,27,'45.52795','-122.69983',2,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,206.00,2,1125,2,5.00,838186442611301171),(3128,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/838253676121376423','Tranquil guesthouse nestled high in the forest','Perched High in Portland\'s South West Hills with refreshing privacy and stunning views expressed from every room, a detached guest house on an enchanting historic property awaits you. Very chic, the guest house has been completely restored and revitalized.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-838253676121376423/original/a4a5c687-d9da-4c3d-b4b5-1c20379d6e30.jpeg',503514196,54,'45.498687416997306','-122.71006109864314',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,300.00,3,1125,22,5.00,838253676121376423),(3129,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/838341411200410821','Walkable Portland Studio < 1 Mi to Dtwn!','Explore the City of Roses like a local when you stay at this cozy Portland vacation rental. This 1-bathroom, basement-level studio is the perfect place for couples or solo travelers who want to be right in the heart of the action. Use the city’s incredible public transportation to hop around from attraction to attraction or explore on foot! After strolling through Hoyt Arboretum or browsing Powell’s Books, grab a bite to eat or a refreshing drink in the Pearl District.','WALKABLE (<0.5 miles): The Civic Taproom & Bottle Shop, Providence Park, Portland Gear, Next Level Burger West Burnside, Coco Donuts Uptown, HunnyMilk, Kingston Sports Bar & Grill, Wildwood Saloon, Marathon Taverna, Elephants Delicatessen, Ke’s Artisan Bakery, Kells Brewery, Grassa, Cheryl’s on 12th <br />AREA ATTRACTIONS: Portland Art Museum (0.7 miles), Powell’s City of Books (0.9 miles), The Freakybuttrue Peculiarium & Museum (1 mile), Portland Saturday Market (2 miles), Pittock Mansion (2 miles), Oregon Museum of Science & Industry (3 miles)  <br />OPT OUTSIDE: Washington Park (1 mile), Portland Japanese Garden (1 mile), International Rose Test Garden (1 mile), Marquam Nature Park (2 miles), Oregon Zoo (2 miles), Hoyt Arboretum (3 miles)  <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (14 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-838341411200410821/original/686c02bc-b078-42a7-84bd-c6addf154754.jpeg',121688409,3,'45.51942','-122.69432',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,106.00,2,1125,16,4.88,838341411200410821),(3130,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/838461309206940083','1910 Historic Jessie Morehead House - 98 WalkScore','Welcome to a Registered Historic Home designed by renowned architect William C. Knighton, situated on NW 21st Ave with a WalkScore of 98. Original woodwork, fixtures, and tasteful furnishings add timeless elegance to your stay.<br /><br />The unbeatable location puts you steps away from highly rated restaurants and bars. The only challenge will be deciding which spot to try first. Experience the perfect blend of historic charm and modern convenience in this architectural gem.','Nestled in the vibrant and historic Northwest District. This prime location offers a perfect blend of urban excitement and charming neighborhood vibes, making it an ideal spot for visitors looking to experience the best of Portland.<br /><br />The area around NW Everett St is renowned for its culinary delights. You’ll find an eclectic mix of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and trendy bars within walking distance. From farm-to-table eateries and artisanal bakeries to international cuisine and food carts, there’s something to satisfy every palate. Don’t miss out on the local favorites like Salt & Straw for unique ice cream flavors and the iconic Blue Moon Tavern & Grill for a laid-back dining experience.<br /><br />Just a few blocks away is the bustling NW 23rd Avenue, a shopper\'s paradise lined with an array of boutiques, vintage stores, and specialty shops. Whether you\'re hunting for unique fashion pieces, handmade jewelry, or quirky gifts, you\'ll find plenty of treasures to bring h','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-838461309206940083/original/d1999fdf-7855-43d3-974a-437b59835749.jpeg',88253867,27,'45.523955393711994','-122.69338619190002',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,107.00,1,365,102,4.75,838461309206940083),(3131,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/838470354781704787','1910 Historic Jessie Morehead House - 98 WalkScore','Welcome to a Registered Historic Home designed by renowned architect William C. Knighton, situated on NW 21st Ave with a WalkScore of 98. Original woodwork, fixtures, and tasteful furnishings add timeless elegance to your stay.<br /><br />The unbeatable location puts you steps away from highly rated restaurants and bars. The only challenge will be deciding which spot to try first. Experience the perfect blend of historic charm and modern convenience in this architectural gem.','Nestled in the vibrant and historic Northwest District. This prime location offers a perfect blend of urban excitement and charming neighborhood vibes, making it an ideal spot for visitors looking to experience the best of Portland.<br /><br />The area around NW Everett St is renowned for its culinary delights. You’ll find an eclectic mix of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and trendy bars within walking distance. From farm-to-table eateries and artisanal bakeries to international cuisine and food carts, there’s something to satisfy every palate. Don’t miss out on the local favorites like Salt & Straw for unique ice cream flavors and the iconic Blue Moon Tavern & Grill for a laid-back dining experience.<br /><br />Just a few blocks away is the bustling NW 23rd Avenue, a shopper\'s paradise lined with an array of boutiques, vintage stores, and specialty shops. Whether you\'re hunting for unique fashion pieces, handmade jewelry, or quirky gifts, you\'ll find plenty of treasures to bring h','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-838470354781704787/original/5e677a13-b269-4651-b2cb-132c10912098.jpeg',88253867,27,'45.52413','-122.6943',1,16,5.50,7.00,8.00,814.00,1,365,33,4.58,838470354781704787),(3132,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/839115035159081196','Portland Floating Home Getaway w/ Sauna!','Relaxation and outdoor fun await as close to the Columbia River as you can get at this waterfront vacation rental in Portland, Oregon! Highlighted by its direct water access, this unique retreat features 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a full kitchen for easy at-home dining. Explore Portland’s cultural hotspots and green spaces or take a day trip to the Columbia River Gorge National Scenic Area! When it’s time to unwind, you can enjoy a cozy evening with the pellet stove and the sound of the water.','PORTLAND HOTSPOTS: Portland International Raceway (2 miles), Alberta Arts District (5 miles), Historic Mississippi District (5 miles), Powell’s City of Books (7 miles), Portland Art Museum (8 miles), OMSI (9 miles), Pittock Mansion (10 miles), Oregon Zoo (10 miles) <br />GET OUTSIDE: Columbia River (on-site), Peninsula Park Rose Garden (4 miles), Lan Su Chinese Garden (7 miles), Portland Japanese Garden (9 miles), Washington Park (9 miles), Portland Audubon (9 miles), Forest Park (14 miles), Columbia River Gorge National Scenic Area (21 miles) <br />WINERIES & VINEYARDS: Fullerton Wines (8 miles), Hamacher Wines (22 miles), Hawks View Winery (25 miles), Alloro Vineyard (26 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (8 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-839115035159081196/original/ed9d487c-32bb-44a7-b03f-7a8a4761eeca.jpeg',121688409,91,'45.60186','-122.66412',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,187.00,2,1125,38,4.97,839115035159081196),(3133,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/839443927931107991','Vintage Sellwood Bungalow - Kayaks Provided!','Your next fun-filled getaway to Portland awaits with a stay at this 2-bedroom, 1-bath vacation rental nestled in the Sellwood neighborhood. This family-friendly cottage was built in 1912 and offers a newly renovated interior with free WiFi, a fully equipped kitchen, a front porch for enjoying morning coffee, and a prime location just minutes from restaurants, events, and attractions. During your stay, be sure to explore all the area has to offer and explore the Willamette River by kayak!','THINGS TO DO + SEE: Shopping, cafes, restaurants; Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden (2 miles), Oaks Amusement Park (2 miles), USS Blueback Submarine (3 miles), Moda Center (5 miles), North Clackamas Aquatic Park (5 miles), Leach Botanical Garden (6 miles), Washington Park (6 miles), Portland Japanese Garden (7 miles), Oregon Zoo (7 miles), Hoyt Arboretum (7 miles) <br />OPT OUTSIDE: Biking, walking trails; Eastmoreland Golf Course (0.9 miles), Sellwood Riverfront Park (1 mile), Elk Rock Island (3 miles), Tryon Creek State Natural Area (6 miles), Mount Talbert Nature Park (7 miles), Powell Butte Nature Park (10 miles), Gabbert Butte (12 miles) <br />HISTORY BUFFS: Milwaukie Museum (3 miles), Oregon Museum of Science and Industry - OMSI (4 miles), Portland Art Museum (5 miles), Oregon History Society (5 miles), World Forestry Center (7 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (15 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-839443927931107991/original/9be6a763-59d2-427c-b3ba-63848cb0c18f.jpeg',121688409,20,'45.468425290474705','-122.64891229735068',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,1,3.00,839443927931107991),(3134,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/840233470616755202','The Pool House | Private Pool, Spa, & Sauna','New Photos Coming Soon! <br /><br />New luxury vinyl plank floors, paint, and interior design, throughout the home. <br /><br />We are also on Swimply so hourly rentals are booking up the space fast! Please reach out if you would like to stay and host a special event during your visit. <br /> <br />Perfect for family fun or private poolside gatherings with friends. Inquire now about booking this hidden gem. Number of guests flexible for gatherings.','- Visit Powell Butte Nature Park:<br />   - Distance: Approximately 4 miles<br />   - Driving Time: Around 15 minutes<br />   - Enjoy hiking and stunning views of the city and Mount Hood at this serene nature park.<br /><br />- Explore Division Street:<br />   - Distance: Approximately 2.5 miles<br />   - Driving Time: Approximately 10 minutes<br />   - Head to Division Street, known for its eclectic mix of restaurants, boutiques, and cafes, making it a hub for Portland\'s vibrant food scene.<br /><br />- Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden:<br />   - Distance: Approximately 6 miles<br />   - Driving Time: Around 15 minutes<br />   - Take a leisurely stroll and capture beautiful photos in this peaceful garden, especially during spring when the rhododendrons are in full bloom.<br /><br />- Venture to Mt. Tabor Park:<br />   - Distance: Approximately 4 miles<br />   - Driving Time: Around 15 minutes<br />   - Explore a volcanic cinder cone with walking trails, picnic spots, and great view','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-840233470616755202/original/f661375f-ee69-4edc-a6a3-2d27f2edab8f.jpeg',212998892,78,'45.50056','-122.56371',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,1.00,1,730,50,4.94,840233470616755202),(3135,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/840598570049396333','Light-Filled Folk Victorian Near Hawthorne','Welcome! This special home is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.  Just steps to dining, shopping, and entertainment! Spend more time vacationing and less time traveling.  Multiple theaters, quaint retail shops and food carts are all within short walking distance. A quick Uber will get you to downtown Portland, OMSI, Hawthorne and Sellwood. Or take a stroll with your good dogs through historic Ladd\'s Addition, just one block away!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cf0665f1-f28c-4e56-96f7-3d7c941a11ef.jpg',3508484,25,'45.50862','-122.65487',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,120.00,31,89,41,4.98,840598570049396333),(3136,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/841428982778722801','Peaceful basement studio','(More photos coming soon!) <br /><br />Beautiful studio apartment in the basement of a 1909 farmhouse. This is one of the most fun neighborhoods in Portland, as hip and adorable as can be. Easily walk or cycle to the Belmont district, Hawthorne District, Burnside, Laurelhurst Park, Mt. Tabor, and lots of great restaurants and coffee shops. You\'ll be about a 30 min bus ride from downtown (and biking is only 15-20 min!). I love this area and am happy to give recommendations and advice.','The neighborhood is dense and residential, many shades of green, full of funky craftsman architecture, studded with awesome independent businesses. <br /><br />Laurelhurst park is just two blocks east of us, and it is a lovely green place for walking, running, stroking large mossy trees. <br /><br />Mt. Tabor park is about a fifteen minute bike ride east, and it is also lovely and green, a huge forested hill that has views of the city. <br /><br />Nearby favorite food: <br />-Belmont Street, to the south, is full of hip bars with great food, and TABOR BREAD!<br />-Burnside, to the north, has a Whole foods and an independent movie theater serving local beer on tap, the infamous Screen Door restaurant, and Sizzle Pie pizza <br />-A pod of food carts on 28th Ave between Ash and Ankeny <br />-Coalition Brewing and Crema cafe on Ankeny and 28th <br />-Bamboo Sushi and Ken\'s Artisan Pizza 28th and Pine <br />-And just a couple of blocks west of the house on Stark, there\'s Oblique Coffee, the','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/7dfd97f0-dca8-44ab-a55c-95f87f571ee6.jpg',16029200,16,'45.51856','-122.63282',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,150.00,30,365,15,4.67,841428982778722801),(3137,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/842055674731103760','Truly Magical SE Location w/ Porch, Deck & Yard','Amazing location on coveted Clinton Street bike path, entire 2-story quirky 1908 foursquare home with 3 beds, 2 baths, formal dining room, stocked kitchen, private yard, snuggled between Clinton commercial pod and hugely popular Division Street. Fenced backyard for your pup. Covered porch for endless people-watching; back deck off the kitchen for lounging. Easy street parking with no meters. Piccolo Park playground and picnic area across the street. 5* restaurants & pubs steps from your door.','Peaceful location on a bike/pedestrian corridor in a very trendy walkable neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/e283a674-7e16-4819-b081-00cd566f3bbc.jpg',4006487,25,'45.50401','-122.63968',1,8,2.00,3.00,3.00,176.00,120,365,5,4.80,842055674731103760),(3138,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/842813725493393910','Foodie Heaven Bungalow','Want a peaceful and centrally-located home with top rated restaurants within walking distance? Then this cozy bungalow is all you need!','On a summer day in Portland, 28th Avenue is bustling with activity. There are plenty of restaurants with outdoor seating, and the vibe is light-hearted and fun. Be sure to check out Guero for some of Portland’s best tortas and pozole, Angel Face for cocktails and romance. Navarre for French, Italian and Spanish food. If you love pizza, try Ken’s Artisan for wood-fired pie and Dove Vivi for its cornmeal crust. Stammtisch serves up German fare like kraut, sausage, and super yummy potato salad. For excellent Thai head to Paadee. <br /><br />Of course there is ice cream, Fifty Licks has some outstanding and drool-worthy flavors like Blood Orange Creamsicle. Cheese and Crack Snack Shop offers soft-serve ice cream cones and uh…mazing s’more sundaes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-842813725493393910/original/f85f9798-69f7-426a-9fbd-366dfaa94c10.jpeg',76761573,12,'45.521608895457476','-122.63615986399476',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,150.00,3,365,50,4.94,842813725493393910),(3139,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/843085266516991553','Gorgeous new renovation in Alberta Arts District!','In the heart of Alberta Arts:  Best of the Best! Cuisine, Music, Coffee, Shopping, Bars, transportation! Jaw dropping renovation in 2023. One bedroom and bathroom on main floor. Two bedrooms on lower level. Ample onsite parking!','Adorable arts district in popular NE Portland neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-843085266516991553/original/19ed1ea1-8ba7-4032-9d33-84bb51c1cc6d.jpeg',30878885,14,'45.558677332544725','-122.6576327227539',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,139.00,30,365,1,5.00,843085266516991553),(3140,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/843279129090144124','Phil\'s awesome place with Grace','Bring the whole family to this great place with lots of room for fun.<br />In addition two bedrooms with queen size beds, a family room with a TV including a couch that can fold flat for extra an guest.  There is a small incomplete kitchen area without a full size range or dishwasher but it has a coffee maker, refrigerator, microwave and a hot plate with pans, dishes, utensils, washer/ dryer with a dinning area.','Very peaceful. lots of trees. People are nice. There\'s a very good bakery in town less than a mile away. Also some very nice restaurants near by.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-843279129090144124/original/c36cfebb-e1bd-404c-a358-40d0c601f2f1.jpg',469941472,31,'45.4843231','-122.6953227',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,1,30,56,4.86,843279129090144124),(3141,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/843427001852952453','Portland Historic Landmark #3','12 Foot Ceilings! This Historic Home was built by one of Oregons most prominent and earliest pioneers. Originally built on the banks of the Willamette River, neighbors only to the local Native American houses,  is now centered in the Hawthorne District.  Experience the charm and elegance of a bygone era.  As a guest, you will not only be transported back in time but thrust you into Portland\'s rich history.','The Stephens House in Southeast Portland offers a convenient and comfortable stay for travelers. Located in the historic Stephens Addition neighborhood and across from Ladd\'s, the Stephens House is close to many happening attractions such as the Hawthorne District, downtown Portland, and the Oregon Convention Center. The house itself is spacious and beautifully furnished, with a fully equipped kitchen, laundry facilities, and free WiFi. The hosts are also known for their excellent hospitality and attention to detail, ensuring that guests have a pleasant and stress-free stay. Overall, The Stephens House is a great option for travelers looking for a convenient and cozy home away from home in Southeast Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-843427001852952453/original/3e585eba-824b-43c0-8f7d-4aa38bdd58f2.jpeg',95203243,25,'45.50965','-122.65401',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,122.00,2,27,21,5.00,843427001852952453),(3142,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/843459903907068727','Private Apartment-Walk to shops, bars, restaurants','Classy, modern, newer private apartment located in the unique and tranquil neighborhood of Mississippi and Alberta district in Portland, Oregon. Whether you are in Portland for business or pleasure, this new space is thoughtfully designed to provide an amazing stay with all of the necessary amenities for fun or business. <br /><br />Within walking distance to an abundance of restaurants, bars and trendy shops on Mississippi, Williams and Alberta St.','The Boise neighborhood is one of the hottest neighborhoods in Portland right now- with trendy shops, cafes and eateries, plus an area of Food Carts. There are also lots of really cool old houses- some gorgeous! And it’s just a few blocks to the MAX on Interstate!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-843459903907068727/original/c3ddf12d-0dfa-4064-a4b5-4e5c4ed1325e.jpeg',411850,24,'45.555491290305','-122.670463857011',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,14,74,4.97,843459903907068727),(3143,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/843557718047015051','Casa Nena','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place. Walking distance to Tri-Met and bus. We sit on top of a hill in the North Tabor neighborhood.  A short drive to Mt. Tabor Park & walking distance from the Montavilla neighborhood with plenty of restaurants and bars to check out, there\'s no shortage of options of what to do or see. The home is nestled in the top unit of a triplex & sleeps 4 comfortably. 2 on the queen and we offer an air mattress upon request.','A mix of urban and suburban feel, North tabor offers something for everyone. If you\'re looking for somewhere to grab a drink, Montavilla is just a short walk away with a variety of watering holes. If you\'re looking to enjoy some outdoor time, Mt Tabor is a short drive away. Looking to go downtown or explore different Portland Neighborhoods? The Tri-met bus and train is a short walk away and offers multiple routes to your desired destination!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-843557718047015051/original/3281de8f-59e0-4c19-a643-9cf84c42d300.jpeg',504645540,52,'45.526301974337194','-122.59962606296594',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,180,113,4.90,843557718047015051),(3144,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/844148741703712256','Spacious light-filled 1700 sf 2 Bed Home on MAX','Light-filled historic 1700 sq ft 2+bedroom sanctuary steps away from light rail, and local scene with markets, bars, and restaurants. Spacious with modern upgrades and tastefully well-appointed living room, dining room, cozy TV room, and home gym, with a delightful back deck and classic Northwest garden and firepit.  A perfect place to work or entertain with blazing internet speeds, multiple individual workspaces, Smart TVs, Bluetooth Speakers.','Stroll the quiet Arbor Lodge neighborhood to one of its many public parks, like Peninsula Park, truly one of Portland\'s gems.  Or walk a few minutes to New Seasons Market to grab ingredients for your next mouth-watering meal.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-844148741703712256/original/63fe71b1-0e47-4c01-af4f-dd1d1435efea.jpeg',15248312,51,'45.56758','-122.6843',1,4,1.00,3.00,2.00,145.00,4,60,14,4.93,844148741703712256),(3145,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/844223362514264939','PDX Studios: 3C- Short & Long-Term Stays Welcome!','PDX Studios: Your Cozy Portland Retreat<br /><br />Welcome to PDX Studios,your ideal Portland home-away-from-home. Nestled in the lively Williams District and close to the Mississippi Historical and Alberta Arts Districts, this cozy space is perfect for short and long-term stays. Convenient for travel nurses and medical professionals with Emanuel Hospital nearby,plus major centers like OHSU just 20 minutes away. Enjoy a warm atmosphere with soothing hues, an inviting bedroom, kitchenette,and private bath.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a33eae72-a1bc-4cff-819c-002a58ebf448.jpg',472195025,9,'45.55118','-122.66857',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,30,365,12,4.75,844223362514264939),(3146,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/844861849804685816','Light-Filled Apartment','Enjoy a beautifully constructed modern space filled with light and providing ample privacy in a quiet neighborhood just blocks from the Alberta Arts District.','Concordia/Alberta Arts neighborhood. Parks, coffee shops, groceries, restaurants and more all within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-844861849804685816/original/6689be27-149f-4017-96e5-30e54aa0c9eb.jpg',41664793,1,'45.56563824350929','-122.64295771475872',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,365,10,5.00,844861849804685816),(3147,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/845844713260815993','Cozy retreat in wooded neighborhood.','Enjoy this cozy wooded retreat, surrounded by trees.  In a safe, quiet corner of Portland, you are 100 feet from a cafe built in an old post office.  Head to nearby Multnomah Village for local shops, food carts.  If your heart desires, take a short drive to the Oregon Zoo, the Japanese Gardens, or visit Powell\'s - the famous bookstore downtown! Or enjoy all the home has to offer - fully equipped kitchen, beautiful patio, and woods. Bring the whole family, or come with friends!','Maplewood is a small quiet neighborhood in SW Portland near Multnomah Village.  These neighborhoods are withing Portland city limits, but avoid either the urban vibe of downtown or suburban Beaverton/Tigard.  You will find trailheads within blocks of the house.  Beautiful homes adjacent to gravel roads.  Almost the feel of a ski town.  There is a local book store, local toy store, local ice cream, several local cafes, and several nicer restaurants, and some old bars with musicians and dogs.  You can also buy an electric pedal for your guitar, or yarn for knitting.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-845844713260815993/original/c6e6a819-2481-4d14-bf02-e2483d3d0350.jpeg',505113577,75,'45.47096','-122.73123',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,145.00,2,21,57,4.93,845844713260815993),(3148,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/845853041745497264','Stylish and cozy home in Portland','Come relax in a cozy home tucked away in Mt. Scott Neighborhood in SE Portland. This comfortable two bedroom, one bath home with an office is perfect as a launching pad for your Portland adventures! It is also a well suited working space. Just walking distance from Portland Meracado kitchen, coffee and tea shops, smoothie bar, food carts, and all the things. The Mt. Scott Park and Community Center are a 5 min walk away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-845853041745497264/original/807f6607-8f53-470c-84f2-1abed7bec675.jpeg',3334615,69,'45.47571','-122.58464',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,165.00,1,365,17,4.76,845853041745497264),(3149,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/846229264348083928','Spacious, Sunlit Laurelhurst Park Apartment','This newly remodeled 800 sq. ft space is in the lower level of a historic Portland home in one of the city\'s most vibrant neighborhoods. Inside, spacious rooms with high ceilings and comfy furnishings make for a great living space. With a lush yard, patio, and one of Portland\'s favorite parks across the street, outside time is easy!','You will be centrally located in inner SE Portland, close to the East Burnside/Cesar Chavez intersection. Access to I-84 is very easy. We are in a classic Portland neighborhood with a great mix of historic housing and numerous neighborhood shopping and restaurant districts within 5-20 minute walks. The neighborhoods in the area are enjoyable ones to walk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODQ2MjI5MjY0MzQ4MDgzOTI4/original/843f4b94-4762-445d-ba64-5a2e394eb19a.jpeg',1909916,23,'45.52230972404349','-122.62959600612353',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,60,2,5.00,846229264348083928),(3150,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/846331310163630868','Longterm rental next to OHSU','We are a fully furnished 8 bedroom house, with full kitchen, group work space, living spaces and outdoor spaces. We are centrally located, in SW portland Next to OHSU campus and steps from Portland famous hiking trails, restaurants and plaid pantry. Perfect for large groups, families or organizations looking for an executive housing. We only rent for 30 days or more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-846331310163630868/original/37caaa0a-05c1-4dbf-8b55-3f9c41c808ab.jpeg',10977609,30,'45.49795','-122.69344',1,12,4.00,8.00,9.00,499.00,30,365,1,2.00,846331310163630868),(3151,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/846507880728455577','Woodlawn neighborhood home','Comfortable and fun! This house is right by the Woodlawn and Concordia neighborhoods. A short walk to several bars and restaurants. Our basement is a paradise for movie and board game lovers! Featuring an extensive library of board games, an amazing 55\" TV with wrap-around couch, and a dry bar! Check out the city while its sunny and cozy up in our basement when it rains. We hope you\'ll pick our house for your next Portland adventure!','Quiet neighborhood with great Portland-famous food spots and breweries within walking distance!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-846507880728455577/original/5da0863b-32eb-4e1b-b676-b5fa777cf9bb.jpeg',73065974,45,'45.57353016854745','-122.64440705657341',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,200.00,2,365,62,4.98,846507880728455577),(3152,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/846543031665509353','Comfort, Quiet, Convenience in 3-room Oasis','You\'ll love the comfort and charm of this private, single-level, 3-room space in a quiet safe residential neighborhood. Nestled among tall Douglas fir trees and hills, close to I-5, yet only a short drive to all Portland has to offer! You\'ll enjoy a private bedroom with luxury mattress and smart TV,  private workspace with fast wi-fi, coffee bar, microwave, minifridge, a private bath with tub/shower. Whether travelling solo or as a couple, you will have all you need for a great stay in Portland!','This modern and attractive home is located in a quiet, peaceful and safe residential neighborhood, filled with trees and hills.   Only four minutes from I-5; a short drive to Multnomah Village\'s charming shops, restaurants, and bars;  a 12-minute drive to downtown Portland.  It is perfect for travelers looking to explore Portland, visit Lewis and Clark College, be near OHSU, Doernbecher, and the VA Hospital, or for remote working in a safe quiet and clean environment.<br /><br />You’ll be within a 10-15-min drive to anything you want to see and do in Portland.<br />Distances to nearby attractions:<br />- Downtown Portland: 7.4 miles<br />- Portland (PDX) Airport: 18.2 miles<br />- Multnomah Village: 1.6 miles<br />-  Lewis and Clark College: 2.8 miles<br />- Portland Community College Sylvania Campus: 2.3 miles<br />- OHSU: 4.8 miles<br />- Doernbecher Children\'s Hospital: 5.2 miles<br />- Portland VA Hospital: 4.5 miles<br />- Tryon State Park: 2.8 miles<br />- Portland Japanese Garde','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-846543031665509353/original/2a501dd5-112d-453a-90a8-cc786dc6e111.jpeg',9583289,86,'45.4521226','-122.7027993',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,90,46,5.00,846543031665509353),(3153,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/849430780621296700','Architect\'s Contemporary Cottage','Located on the cusp of North and Northeast Portland, this historic property offers luxurious amenities and a stylish updated design. Unwind in the spacious living areas or outdoors on the private patio and native garden. Close to local shops and attractions on N Williams and N Mississippi, 10 minutes from University of Portland, and a quick 15 minute commute from the PDX airport, our home promises a balance of cozy comfort, convenience, and architectural charm.','Easily walk to bars, restaurants, and cafes on N Williams Ave, N Mississippi Ave, NE Alberta St, and N/NE Killingsworth. <br /><br />Piedmont’s Peninsula Park, just a 7 min walk away, is a true gem of our neighborhood (it’s where we got married)! The 16 acre park hosts the oldest rose garden in Portland, a playground, countless heritage trees surrounding playing fields, and an outdoor public pool in the summer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-849430780621296700/original/470b8daa-c451-4225-a6c3-3ec7347f3a27.jpeg',50684661,24,'45.56567','-122.66789',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,1,365,55,5.00,849430780621296700),(3154,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/849568848535912264','Furnished Waterfront Portland  near Pearl district','Monthly Rental. Beautifully decorated condominium nestled in a safe, gated complex with a popular paved riverside walking path next by. Enjoy a glass of local wine or craft beer in the patio, while watching the boats pass by the Willamette River. Enjoy peaceful music as you gaze out to a stunning view in the comforts of your vacation home/remote office. Within walking distance of many popular city attractions including the Pearl District and many of the city\'s best restaurants and bars.','Our condominium is located next to the Willamette River. It is a clean and comfortable 1 bedroom condominium with a queen bed and a bathroom. Our kitchen is well equipped with everything you will need to make wonderful home meals. Open living room and patio has a stunning view of the Willamette River & the Moda Center where Portland Trail Blazers play. Free high-speed internet is available. Free assigned parking space provided. Convenient access to public transport, restaurants, and markets. Enjoy taking walks along the river, or take short bike rides to all the cultural, outdoor activities and parks that the beautiful Portland city has to offer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1d4fc431-c76b-49f2-b55a-8654c062279d.jpg',22732353,43,'45.5296378','-122.6740745',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,90.00,30,90,41,4.93,849568848535912264),(3155,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/850795469124431230','Restored Farmhouse + Backyard Tiny House Village','Our charming farmhouse has been lovingly restored to retain its original character while incorporating modern amenities. Highlights include a cozy living room with a fireplace, a fully equipped kitchen, and comfortable bedrooms. The enchanting backyard tiny house village features beautifully decorated tiny houses, each offering a cozy, memorable lodging experience. Enjoy the perfect blend of rustic charm and contemporary convenience at our unique and delightful property.','Our charming home is nestled in the idyllic Division/Clinton district, also known as the Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood on local maps. Just four blocks away lies the historic Ladd\'s Addition, known for its beautiful rose gardens and unique diagonal street layout. While our home is situated on a bustling street, walking one block north will bring you to a serene residential area.<br /><br />You\'ll be steps away from some of Portland\'s finest restaurants, eclectic shopping, and convenient grocery stores, all within easy walking distance. Enjoy the vibrant local culture with nearby cafes, boutiques, and farmers\' markets. The area is also well-served by public transit, making it easy to explore other parts of the city. Whether you\'re looking for a quiet stroll through tree-lined streets or an evening out at a trendy eatery, our neighborhood offers the perfect blend of urban excitement and residential tranquility.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/716bea01-ec24-40f9-b519-ea9e2c2692c1.jpg',273076012,56,'45.49785','-122.64059',1,14,5.00,7.00,7.00,746.00,1,365,23,4.87,850795469124431230),(3156,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/851419394796144737','Little Green Garden Apartment','You will be super cozy and close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located charming spot decorated with local art and stocked with coffee and tea from pdx!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-851419394796144737/original/50ff892b-ef54-4868-b6d7-cc326eff3cca.jpeg',58277473,6,'45.55430688185383','-122.65426090352022',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,83.00,3,30,41,4.90,851419394796144737),(3157,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/851437745027355952','Bright artist’s condo in Pearl','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','Safest location in Portland with lots of amazing restaurants and bars. Close to Downtown area and OHSU which can be conveniently reached by Street Car','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6c13d6c8-37ef-4a8e-91d4-5e7bbb53b0ed.jpg',57539574,2,'45.5261744','-122.681954',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,165.00,30,365,7,5.00,851437745027355952),(3158,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852174998208945495','Convenient duplex close to airport','30 day+, Convenient and comfortable 2br/2.5ba duplex with 2 car attached garage.  Very close to PDX Airport and Multnomah Falls.  Perfect for corporate housing longer term stays.  Work space with desk, wi-fi, Smart TV.  Kitchen remodeled, new carpet upstairs, new floors downstairs.  Fence installed for privacy as well as containment for furry friends.  Fully furnished with kitchen utensils, linens, bedding','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-852174998208945495/original/c11cd1de-1797-4784-8131-ea6ac5e7bc14.jpeg',69574685,71,'45.549103715456084','-122.50967111438513',1,3,2.50,2.00,2.00,85.00,30,1125,2,5.00,852174998208945495),(3159,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852202953451833825','Charming Historic Portland Home Near Downtown','Pack your bags and get ready for a fun-filled Portland getaway at this 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom vacation rental home! The home is nestled in Northeast Portland, which boasts popular attractions like The Moda Center, Rose Quarter, the Oregon Convention Center, the Hollywood Theatre, and more! After a day of exploring the walkable downtown area, return to the comfort of home and unwind with a home-cooked meal, a movie marathon on the Smart TV, or an evening around the fire pit.','PARKS & TRAILS: Knott City Park (3 miles), Luuwit View Park (4 miles), Spring Water Trail (7 miles), Powell Butte Nature Park (8 miles), Happy Valley Nature Park (8 miles), Tryon Creek State Natural Area (12 miles), Woods Memorial Natural Area (13 miles), Multnomah Falls (26 miles), Mt Hood (64 miles) <br />DOWNTOWN PORTLAND (~7 miles): Oaks Amusement Park, Portland Art Museum, Washington Park, Lan Su Chinese Garden, Oregon Zoo, Portland Japanese Garden, International Rose Test Garden, Powell\'s Books <br />LOCAL SIPS: Fullerton Wines (8 miles), Cooper Mountain Vineyards (21 miles), Hawks View Winery (23 miles), Hamacher Wines (23 miles), Alloro Vineyard (25 miles), Blakeslee Vineyard Estate (25 miles), Raptor Ridge Winery (28 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (4 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-852202953451833825/original/846fa310-bb00-4f6e-b1e8-b1aea10f9a05.jpeg',121688409,74,'45.53855232533509','-122.57810368529056',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,112.00,30,1125,0,1.00,852202953451833825),(3160,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852460521953545346','La Casa Blanca en Mississisppi ~ 95 WalkScore','Welcome to our charming three-bedroom retreat in the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and dive into the vibrant local scene, with endless dining, shopping, and entertainment options just steps away. After a fun-filled day exploring, return to unwind in style with a massive 4K HDTV, a fully equipped kitchen, and comfortable memory foam mattresses in all three bedrooms. Discover the best of Mississippi Street from our perfectly situated apartment!','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-827615026974390085/original/a7cda61d-ccb2-4e21-87f2-6f5a7222063a.jpeg',36435346,9,'45.55249','-122.67635',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,210.00,1,365,115,4.91,852460521953545346),(3161,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852477677487336792','Experience Urban Living in the Pearl District!','Centered in the heart of Portland\'s Pearl District, this condo will give you easy access to restaurants, entertainment, parks, shopping, and work - all by foot. The 8th floor view provides some of the best views of Portland and overlooks one of the most unique urban parks:  Tanner Springs Park.  Fields Park and the Willamette River are just steps away.<br /><br />You\'ll have a free parking space included in the gated garage.<br /><br />Walk Score: 96<br />Bike Score: 99<br />Transit Score: 82','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-852477677487336792/original/f4097db3-d961-47f1-bbdd-6de059b71399.jpeg',72711647,2,'45.531402487834654','-122.6819119171843',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,82.00,30,364,3,5.00,852477677487336792),(3162,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852782113131509831','River Front Home on Bike Path','Take in the sunrise at this tranquil gem with stunning views of the river and mountains. This charming home nestled among spectacular old trees has everything you need to relax while being centrally located with easy access to shops, restaurants and parks.  A flight of stairs leads up to the main level with a spacious living room, kitchen with dining area and bathroom with a deep soaking tub. The top floor is an open space with a yoga studio, lofty master bedroom, a full bathroom and a deck.','Nestled between the South end of Willamette Park and the Sellwood Bridge, Miles place is a unique street that feels tucked away from the city while being close to many great neighborhoods including Sellwood, John\'s Landing, Lake Oswego, Milwaukie, Hillsdale and just a 10 minute drive to downtown Portland. It is also close to Reed Collge and Lewis & Clark College.  The street is also a bike path so its easy to hop on the Greenway trail that takes you all the way downtown or across the bridge to Sellwood. The river is not accessible form the house, but there are access points in Willamette park where you can launch your paddle board or kayak.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-852782113131509831/original/4a27a7c9-e13e-4bb2-a280-da1a4ce9e8c2.jpeg',931231,22,'45.47184132745055','-122.67072805931001',1,4,2.00,1.00,2.00,196.00,30,90,12,5.00,852782113131509831),(3163,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852847637766720251','1910 Historic Jessie Morehead House - 98 WalkScore','Experience Portland in style at our newly renovated lower apartment, nestled in a historic home on bustling NW 21st Ave. With a 98 WalkScore, you\'re just steps from top-rated dining, shopping, and nightlife. Indulge in the elegance and sophistication of high-end finishes, fixtures, and furnishings, all designed to create an unforgettable stay. This prime location ensures your only challenge will be choosing from the myriad of exceptional restaurants and bars just a few blocks away!','Nestled in the vibrant and historic Northwest District. This prime location offers a perfect blend of urban excitement and charming neighborhood vibes, making it an ideal spot for visitors looking to experience the best of Portland.<br /><br />The area around NW Everett St is renowned for its culinary delights. You’ll find an eclectic mix of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and trendy bars within walking distance. From farm-to-table eateries and artisanal bakeries to international cuisine and food carts, there’s something to satisfy every palate. Don’t miss out on the local favorites like Salt & Straw for unique ice cream flavors and the iconic Blue Moon Tavern & Grill for a laid-back dining experience.<br /><br />Just a few blocks away is the bustling NW 23rd Avenue, a shopper\'s paradise lined with an array of boutiques, vintage stores, and specialty shops. Whether you\'re hunting for unique fashion pieces, handmade jewelry, or quirky gifts, you\'ll find plenty of treasures to bring h','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-852847637766720251/original/e669f960-5ecc-4667-8d0f-09f4ab6a2bae.jpeg',88253867,27,'45.523825959948255','-122.69418704533766',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,108.00,1,365,73,4.89,852847637766720251),(3164,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/852876229816597689','Eclectic Bedroom in Hawthorne-Division Craftsman','Funky 2 twin bedroom in Classic 1913 Craftsman bungalow. Prime location on quiet residential street between popular Hawthorne & Division Districts!<br /><br />Walk score of 91 means a quick stroll to restaurants, vintage shops, parks, theaters, cannabis dispensaries & lots of fun!<br /><br />In addition to the 400SF private bedroom, enjoy access to spacious common living spaces, stocked gourmet kitchen, lush backyard w edible landscaping & a \"bohoasis\" under the covered patio.<br /><br />We are LGBTQ+, BIPOC & 420 friendly.','The Richmond neighborhood is one of the most popular areas in SE Portland. Our home is nestled on a quiet residential street between Hawthorne and Division, 2 of the most popular districts with lots of eateries, shops, parks and entertainment options. It is a historic neighborhood of quaint old homes, lined with trees, walkable and very safe.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-852876229816597689/original/d99fb8a0-157c-4d0c-9d72-9dc014b90ae4.jpeg',113067946,8,'45.50994','-122.61461',2,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,71.00,2,28,0,1.00,852876229816597689),(3165,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/853090949731468655','Room in Stylish Mid-Century Tree House & Hot Tub','Looking for a calm, quiet retreat outside of the bustle of Downtown / Eastside, but still close-by? This is the spot! Located in a forested neighborhood, this clean & stylish home is perched high above street level, giving you a leafy sense of floating in the trees. Cook in the well-appointed kitchen, soak in the hot tub under huge trees, light a fire, and walk to nearby food carts. Save city vibes for AM touring, but choose PNW nature vibes in the PM for a relaxing, safe, and cozy stay in PDX!','The neighborhood has tons of old growth trees and a lovely leafy vibe. Just a 5-7 minute walk to Hillsdale Town Center which has Basics Market, an organic grocery store with a deli counter, Gurton\'s, an adorable plant shop, Baker and Spice, a beloved bakery, Sasquatch Brewing, a cute brewpub, City Thai, a decent Thai joint, McMenniman\'s Bar and Cafe, as well as a Starbucks, Einstein\'s bagels, and the Hillsdale Food Cart Park, a pod of different kinds of ethnic food carts.<br /><br />If you\'re looking for a bit more of a stroll, ~20 minute walk will take you over to the very cute shops and cafes of Multnomah Village, where I recommend the AMAZING mediterranean food at Yalla. You won\'t be disappointed.<br /><br />This is a great spot to book if you want to run around and have a fun urban experience during the day, but retreat to more of a quiet, chill nature vibe at night.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-853090949731468655/original/96b4dba0-605d-4c74-8598-baf11a543fc7.jpeg',4632981,31,'45.47814','-122.70264',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,120,0,1.00,853090949731468655),(3166,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/853145330798317295','Modern Boho Subunit in Stunning Sellwood-Moreland','Stay in a 100-yr old, refurbished Craftsman home in a brand new, modern/boho decorated daylight subunit apartment w/separate entrance. Sleeps 4. Access to washer, dryer, kayaks, canoe, bikes and grill! Centrally located in popular Westmoreland neighborhood within walking distance to Max Light Rail. Explore fun shops & antique stores, coffee, and restaurants. Near Eastmoreland Golf Course, West Moreland Park, Oak Bottom Wildlife Refuge, Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden & Eastmoreland Garden.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-853145330798317295/original/3fddc347-8417-44d1-b56e-962fd757f94d.jpeg',506655551,20,'45.4741574856053','-122.64646344105216',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,110.00,2,28,23,4.61,853145330798317295),(3167,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/854276125903354595','Modern Home with Cedar Sauna & Outdoor Patio','This new home in a quiet neighborhood in NE Portland has all the comforts & amenities you need to enjoy Pacific Northwest life at its best!  <br /><br />The home features large windows to let in tons of light & creates a feeling of both spaciousness and cozy comfort. The kitchen boasts brand new appliances, while the bedroom includes a full size closet & sliding doors that access a private patio. As our guest, you will enjoy access to the brand new cedar barrel sauna. Come relax at our Portland oasis!','The neighborhood is quiet and safe and made up of working professionals, retired folks and families. It is walkable and there are great restaurants, bars and coffee shops within walking and biking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODU0Mjc2MTI1OTAzMzU0NTk1/original/3538474f-4d36-4c3c-b4fc-e5042f912f37.png',33760108,21,'45.5508321','-122.6017186',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,108.00,3,30,74,5.00,854276125903354595),(3168,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/854425035138978032','Private Cottage + Work-from-home Oasis Near PDX!','Kick back and relax in this quiet, modern 4-person studio. Perfect for business travelers an couples checking out Portland. Ultra-fast fiber internet. Private entrance and easy parking in safe, quiet neighborhood. Spacious bathroom with heated floors. Luxurious bed,  linens, and sleeper sofa. Backyard garden with fire pit and BBQ. Endless hot water. 4K home theatre with Dolby Atmos sound. Easy-to-use smart home features. Full kitchen with oven, stove, microwave, fridge, and Keurig coffee maker.','This is the historic Hazelwood neighborhood of Portland! From here, you’re only about 10-15 minutes from downtown, and only 45 minutes from Mt. Hood!<br /><br />A little about the property - This property was originally developed by the previous owners starting in the 50s. It’s been added on to over the years and today is only on the second owner! We  even have the original receipts for the cherry and apple trees that are in the backyard from 1952, purchased from the nearby Portland Nursery (worth a visit!). The cottage you’re staying in was originally a workshop before being converted into an ADU in 2018.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-854425035138978032/original/70c2bdf0-297e-40f7-8e2f-f7b6b916a694.jpg',154094191,63,'45.5300113','-122.5501485',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,87.00,1,1125,100,4.92,854425035138978032),(3169,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/855068162451978593','Guest suite in St. John\'s','Modern house in a quiet St. John\'s neighborhood with space for multiple guests. Beautiful nearby parks and close to the University of Portland!<br /><br />The downstairs space is shared with plenty of private space upstairs for guests. There is a parking driveway parking spot along with easy street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-855068162451978593/original/5ca387e9-0ce5-4e77-8dfb-d1a929dd1e81.jpeg',370017367,58,'45.59444364015827','-122.73824246643949',2,4,1.50,1.00,2.00,70.00,30,30,20,5.00,855068162451978593),(3170,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/855097881523473366','Cute, quiet 2bed in SE Portland','Kick back and relax or work from home in this calm, stylish space. Home built in 2018. Modern, clean, easy, energy efficient, furnished. Lovely neighbors, family friendly. Walkable to coffee shops, restaurants, market and recreational center with gym, pool, roller rink, all within 4-5 blocks. Close to 2-3 major bus lines to downtown. 15 minute drive to city center.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-855097881523473366/original/eee34edb-07da-44a3-80f8-4187f8698cf3.jpeg',691959,65,'45.48455','-122.5889',1,4,2.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,120,1,5.00,855097881523473366),(3171,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/855211263419185345','Cozy Cottage in Sunnyside','Come and relax in this cozy cottage.  It is setback off a quiet street in the Sunnyside neighborhood.  The backyard is fully fenced for your furry family members. <br /><br />Quite area within walking distance of Laurelhurst Park,  easy access to the Belmont district, 28th Avenue “Restaurant Row”, Burnside, Hawthorne, Division St/Clinton, and Central Eastside districts, and a short bus ride or drive to downtown and the Pearl','Sunnyside is a neighborhood in the south east section of Portland, between SE Stark Street and SE Hawthorne Blvd. and from SE 28th Ave. to SE 49th Ave.. The Sunnyside Neighborhood motto is \"Proud Past, Bright Future\". Sunnyside has a \"strong sense of Portland individuality\" with many locally owned coffee shops and businesses. Sunnyside is sometimes referred to as the Belmont neighborhood, for its main commercial st  To see a full review of the neighborhood I suggest going to portland neighborhood dot com','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8b76aa4f-d038-48e5-b68b-4c95c1eaac07.jpg',58501537,16,'45.51804331457479','-122.6333158',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,20,29,4.93,855211263419185345),(3172,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/855692533793103757','Hawthorne Schoolhouse','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-855692533793103757/original/1ca8f090-6bd6-4202-a18f-4185997ec962.jpeg',98199385,8,'45.50942','-122.63096',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,2,365,97,5.00,855692533793103757),(3173,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/855762641762098497','Rose City Modern Loft','Welcome to our modern yet serene two-bedroom loft, nestled  off N Mississippi Avenue in Portland. This space is more than just a place to stay—it\'s a sanctuary for those seeking comfort and ease in the heart of the city.<br /><br />Our loft invites you to relax and feel at home, offering amenities that support a restful and enjoyable stay. Whether you are here to explore or simply to unwind, we are here to offer you a space of peace and presence. We look forward to welcoming you as our guests.','Portland really is a city of neighborhoods grouped together, each one with their own distinct flavor. The Mississippi District in North Portland has the Bohemian, hipster vibe that visitors usually attribute to Portland. In the spirit of Keeping Portland Weird, the city is divided into quadrants – five of them. North Portland juts out from Northeast, and Mississippi Street is one of the most adorable parts of the quadrant.<br /><br />The district is readily accessible from downtown on the #4 TriMet bus; disembark at about Mississippi and Beech. Stroll down the street and enjoy the independently-owned shops, diverse eateries and uber-Portland bar scene. You will get the true Portland experience! This is where the locals hang out.<br /><br />The boutique shopping scene can’t be beat, with a slightly more eclectic vibe than Portland’s trendy Nob Hill or the Pearl District. Score some tax-free treasures to take home from Gumbo Gifts (family-friendly curios, etc.). You can find all your fav','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-855762641762098497/original/1e49cbf9-dfc5-417b-820b-2c22b42be7a2.jpeg',21382575,9,'45.554063','-122.675313',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,132.00,3,30,56,4.89,855762641762098497),(3174,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/856660054921966822','NEW! Cozy Garden Apt. on 28th Ave\'s Restaurant Row','Experience comfort and creativity in our cozy garden apartment, ideally situated in the historic neighborhood of Kerns, steps from NE 28th Ave.\'s Restaurant Row. Discover some of Portland\'s best restaurants, trendy bars, and charming shops. The apartment is minutes from downtown, the hip neighborhoods of Belmont and Hawthorne, and the nightlife of the central eastside. In warmer months, relax on our delightful furnished garden patio, complete with a cozy Solo Stove firepit for your enjoyment.','Located in the historic Kerns neighborhood, the Garden Apartment is three blocks from the shops and restaurants on 28th Ave.\'s Restaurant Row. One block from Oregon Park -  which features a playground, basketball courts, and picnic tables.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-856660054921966822/original/146219e2-6269-441c-bb1a-495e310da861.jpeg',1839219,12,'45.527597225584024','-122.6361298173844',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,91.00,2,28,51,4.98,856660054921966822),(3175,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/856809773339671182','Oregon apartment across OHSU','Bring the whole family to this great place with lots of room.<br /><br />This apartment is perfect for families, couples, solos, adventurers, here on business, visiting Portland to relax or moving to the area, we think you will enjoy our comfortable home.<br /><br />Beautiful, spacious, quiet, tree-lined home conveniently located just across from the OHSU Hospital with views of the Hills.','-OHSU Student center<br />-Scientists at Oregon Health & Science University<br />-5 minutes from downtown Portland<br />-Nurse school OHSU <br />-Hospital for Children is located at OHSU<br /><br />Marquam Hill Campus<br />Marquam Hill Campus is OHSU\'s largest location. It is located one mile south of downtown Portland. South Waterfront Campus is directly west and connects to Marquam Hill via Portland Aerial Tram.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-856809773339671182/original/ade54261-d718-4d43-a5a3-52facf798713.jpeg',234902210,30,'45.497568194815436','-122.68908095819702',1,6,1.00,2.00,5.00,105.00,30,30,16,4.94,856809773339671182),(3176,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/856811017433604364','Unique-Studio Apt. Across OHSU Hospital','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway.<br /><br />Enjoy the \"Unique-Studio\" living experience in our amazing apartment, just right across from OHSU hospital: Studio apartment with: one queen bed, small living room with a sleeper sofa with a twin bed, and desk area. It can accommodate up to 3 guests very comfortable.<br />Is perfect for small family, couples, solo adventures, here for business, nurses or relocating.<br />Beautiful, spacious, and quiet.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-856811017433604364/original/709811d6-b8fb-41b7-949b-76dcb10d47c5.jpeg',234902210,30,'45.49744','-122.69023',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,30,30,2,5.00,856811017433604364),(3177,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/857090990464458615','Studio in Alphabet District PDX','Enjoy the central location in the Historic Alphabet District - easy access to highway, Nike rental bikes, bus & max lines. <br />This old Portland style studio with modern updates is perfect for a weekend in the city, a stay retreat (hello bubble bath), a business trip (3min walk to the pearl and 8min walk to downtown) or traveler’s reset. <br />Full kitchen, full size Murphy bed offers additional space when closed, washer & dryer, fold out futon for additional guests/families, claw foot tub/shower combo.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-857090990464458615/original/5ea66090-f53e-4702-b463-015b2b28fef8.jpeg',34150929,27,'45.5261398148372','-122.68908331088493',1,2,1.00,0.00,2.00,48.00,30,365,40,4.98,857090990464458615),(3178,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/857983556354022814','Prime Downtown Location! Pets Allowed!','Located in downtown Portland, this property offers easy access to all attractions, including the Oregon History Museum, Portland Art Museum, Portland University, and Providence Park. The MAX Light Rail Station is just nearby, providing easy access to the Moda Center, the Oregon Convention Center, and Portland International Airport. No matter what time of year you choose to visit Portland, there’s always something new to experience!','- Pioneer Courthouse Square  - 0.2 mile; <br />- Classical Chinese Garden  - 0.5 mile; <br />- Lan Su Chinese Garden  - 0.5 mile; <br />- Oregon History Museum  - 0.5 mile; <br />- Portland Art Museum  - 0.5 miles; <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.5 mile; <br />- Oregon Museum of Science and Industry – 1.4 miles; <br />- Washington Park International Rose Test Gardens – 1.9 miles; <br />- Oregon Zoo – 2.9 miles; <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 3.0 miles; <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles; <br />- Johnson Creek – 4.0 miles; <br />- Vancouver Waterfront – 8.8 miles; <br />- Pearson Air Museum – 9.4 miles.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-857983556354022814/original/5f55a672-4788-444e-920c-9c766548c45f.jpeg',501999514,44,'45.52','-122.67727',4,5,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,1,5.00,857983556354022814),(3179,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/857984630242289646','Relaxing Retreat! Onsite Parking, Pets Allowed!','Located in downtown Portland, this property offers easy access to all attractions, including the Oregon History Museum, Portland Art Museum, Portland University, and Providence Park. The MAX Light Rail Station is just nearby, providing easy access to the Moda Center, the Oregon Convention Center, and Portland International Airport. No matter what time of year you choose to visit Portland, there’s always something new to experience!','- Pioneer Courthouse Square  - 0.2 mile; <br />- Classical Chinese Garden  - 0.5 mile; <br />- Lan Su Chinese Garden  - 0.5 mile; <br />- Oregon History Museum  - 0.5 mile; <br />- Portland Art Museum  - 0.5 miles; <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.5 mile; <br />- Oregon Museum of Science and Industry – 1.4 miles; <br />- Washington Park International Rose Test Gardens – 1.9 miles; <br />- Oregon Zoo – 2.9 miles; <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 3.0 miles; <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles; <br />- Johnson Creek – 4.0 miles; <br />- Vancouver Waterfront – 8.8 miles; <br />- Pearson Air Museum – 9.4 miles.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-857984630242289646/original/e4852a7c-b9a8-416e-a64b-b71f7c54f3b1.jpeg',501999514,44,'45.52','-122.67727',4,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,3,4.33,857984630242289646),(3180,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/858806723683921843','Upscale •Balcony •Gym •Rooftop +Amenities','Step into this chic apartment boasting a million-dollar balcony view. Nestled in a prime location with a walk score of 100 and a biker\'s paradise score of 92, it\'s an urban haven. Enjoy 24hr Concierge service, a well-equipped gym, rooftop vistas, a movie theater room, and conference facilities – a perfect blend of style and convenience. Welcome to the epitome of sophisticated city lodging.','Located in the heart of downtown Portland, the Pearl District is best known for its wide array of restaurants, breweries, galleries and shops. Walk around and explore some of Portland\'s best known attractions including the famous Powell\'s City of Books. Fast access to I-405 and Burnside Street, 100% Walk Score, 96% Bike Score, and 93% Trains Score.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-858806723683921843/original/234402dd-fae9-497e-9c31-aef0d7b0992f.jpeg',459606784,2,'45.52309','-122.68365',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,131.00,1,30,63,4.90,858806723683921843),(3181,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/858936340215312695','Bungalow suite near Reed, Woodstock, and Sellwood','This one bedroom, one bath private basement with a separate entrance and dedicated parking space is conveniently located in Portland’s Woodstock neighborhood. Walking distance from Trader Joe’s, Reed College, East Moreland golf course and the Woodstock main strip. A quick drive to many other vibrant SE Portland neighborhoods, including Sellwood and Division, as well as downtown Portland.','The Woodstock neighborhood has a peaceful, neighborhood feel while also being close to the city. Just a quick walk to everything you may need- grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants, bars and parks. <br /><br />Coffee: Our favorite coffee shop- keepers coffee- is located just a few blocks away. Others we enjoy nearby are coffee beer, Esperanza trading co., and Papaccinos. <br /><br />Grocery stores: Trader Joe’s is just a block down the main road. New Seasons and Safeway are also both about 3/4 of a mile away. <br /><br />Restaurants: Nudi, Ottos, Cafe Rowan, Ate-oh-Ate, and Doublemountain brewery just to name a few! <br /><br />Bars: 13th gravity moon is a small little bar attached to Keepers Coffee. Otherwise, the best bar scene is nearby in the Sellwood, Division, Hawthorne etc neighborhoods. <br /><br />Parks: Kenilworth park, Berkeley Park with nice tennis courts, Woodstock Park. Reed College and the Rhododendron gardens are about a mile away and are a great place to walk with ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-858936340215312695/original/9ffeb14d-66fb-484a-895a-d76e164f2f7a.jpeg',393324690,38,'45.48764','-122.62251',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,2,30,63,4.94,858936340215312695),(3182,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/859265393425040165','Japanese Craftsman Abode - Miss Historic District','Discover the very best of Portland from the comfort & convenience of this upgraded private retreat! Perfectly situated minutes from Downtown, stroll along the Willamette River, enjoy beautiful public parks & gardens or tour over 80 microbreweries just a short drive away. Visit Pearl District, Old Town,  Pittock Mansion, Powell’s City of Books, Oregon Zoo, Portland Japanese Garden, Washington Park & more! The perfect place for family & friends, you will love this luxe private getaway in Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-859265393425040165/original/912e6de2-b3ec-406e-8820-848a8802fc4a.jpeg',181205324,9,'45.5466','-122.67692',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,67.00,2,28,21,4.71,859265393425040165),(3183,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/859348828157007152','Cozy Portland Studio w/ Patio + Yard!','Explore Portland, Oregon, at your leisure when you book this delightful vacation rental. The 1-bathroom studio features a kitchenette, a Smart TV, plenty of natural light, and a great location in a peaceful neighborhood. The studio is just 3 miles away from the vintage stores, bars, and coffee shops on Belmont Street, as well as the thrift shops, bookstores, and restaurants on Hawthorne Boulevard! Foodies will especially love this home’s proximity to the city’s fabulous food pods. Book now!','PORTLAND HOT SPOTS: Lloyd Center Mall (0.5 mile), Oregon Convention Center (1 mile), Broadway Bridge (2 miles), Pearl District (2 miles), Alberta Arts District (2 miles), Vintage stores, coffee shops & bars on Southeast Belmont Street (3 miles), thrift stores, bookstores & dining on Southeast Hawthorne Boulevard (3 miles), Portland Art Museum (3 miles), Oregon Zoo (6 miles) <br />GET OUTSIDE: Colonel Summers Park (2 miles), Lan Su Chinese Garden (2 miles), Portland Audubon (5 miles), Washington Park (6 miles), Tualatin Hills Nature Park (14 miles) <br />WINERIES & VINEYARDS: Fullerton Wines (3 miles), Hamacher Wines (18 miles), Hawks View Winery (19 miles), Alloro Vineyard (21 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (7 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-859348828157007152/original/6d2da9bd-2088-4200-8c94-063a690b6d2f.jpeg',121688409,7,'45.53636','-122.65037',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,126.00,2,1125,3,5.00,859348828157007152),(3184,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/859717456092128576','Private Room in 50s Mid-Century MOD Designer Home','This sweet 1950s Mid-Century home has been updated with bright retro colors and vintage furnishings. Centrally located in the desirable inner-SE quadrant of Portland, you\'ll be just a 10-15 minute drive from downtown or convention center, and 1-2 miles from Division and Hawthorne Streets, lined with boutiques, restaurants, and coffeeshops. You\'ll stay in the Master Bedroom of this 2 bedroom house, comfortably accommodating 2 adults, (up to 3 with a small single-bed, provided with advance notice)','Portland\'s Inner-SE Quadrant is known as the favorite and friendliest quadrant for locals. The Woodstock / Reed College neighborhood is safe, residential and peppered with walkable parks and easy-to-access coffeeshops, restaurants, grocery stores, and more. This listing is walking distance to Reed College, Keeper Coffee, and Trader Joe\'s.','http