le room with climate control and TV. Whether you\'re here for business or pleasure, you\'ll find everything you need for an unforgettable stay.','- Lan Su Chinese Garden - 1.1 miles; <br />- Governor Tom McCall Waterfront Park - 1.3 miles; <br />- Oregon Museum of Science and Industry - 1.6 miles; <br />- Moda Center - 1.7 miles; <br />- Pioneer Place - 1.9 miles; <br />- Pioneer Courthouse Square - 2.1 miles; <br />- Stark\'s Vacuum Museum - 0.3 miles; <br />- Hawthorne District - 2.8 miles; <br />- Portland International Airport (PDX) - 6.2 miles.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-860217381165277076/original/f7a1738a-2fe0-47c0-b85d-7daceed42a51.jpeg',501999278,32,'45.5192','-122.66105',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,860217381165277076),(3196,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/860840967402524592','North Portland Studio','This Fully Furnished, newly constructed, Basement Studio Apartment is a private space just for you.  This space provides 1 queen bed with a full closet, a private bathroom, a fully stocked kitchen, an eating area and a living room.  It\'s the perfect place to stay for a vacation while you explore the Pacific Northwest, search for a longer-term rental/home purchase or a place to land should your business travel bring you to Portland.','University Park is a quiet and lovely Neighborhood in North Portland.<br />You\'ll enjoy walking through the area with older homes and parks as well as the University of Portland\'s beautiful campus which is just a 10 minute walk and 4 blocks to Columbia Park.<br /><br />This home is centrally located.  Easy access to I-5 with less than 10 minutes to Downtown Portland or Vancouver and 10 miles to the Portland International Airport.  Great shopping nearby at Janzten Beach Center or Lloyd Center Shopping Mall & Ice Skating Rink which is less than 5 miles away.<br /><br />For grocery shopping, New Seasons and Fred Meyers are just 1 mile away or for a longer trip of about 3 miles, you can go to Trader Joes & Whole Foods.  The Portland Farmer\'s Market is a great seasonal place as well for fresh fruits and vegetables.<br /><br />There are lots of options for coffee shops and restaurants on Lombard which is just 1/2 mile away. Take a short trip to the popular St. Johns and Kenton areas which ar','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-860840967402524592/original/63c8d146-74d8-4097-b5c5-f2a0bc233a95.jpeg',5758142,57,'45.577750597125394','-122.7161860517577',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,2,5.00,860840967402524592),(3197,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/861665109475998019','Stunning Views in Pearl District','Stunning 1 Bedroom in The Pearl! Floor to ceiling windows allowing for optimal natural light and gorgeous sunset views of the West Hills. Cozy bedroom is separated with a sleek sliding door. Walking distance from shops, restaurants, hiking, and public transportation. Building is secured requiring a FOB for admittance and has an elevator. Available for monthly rentals only. **Secured parking in garage available upon request**','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-861665109475998019/original/a2f80e92-6d36-4ba0-a27d-8acc6d8769cd.jpeg',41949398,2,'45.530241550682256','-122.68691581839813',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,175.00,30,365,0,1.00,861665109475998019),(3198,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/862426477960968122','Vacation and Remote Work! Enjoy all PDX offers!','Spacious and cozy studio apartment on a 3/4 acre property in Portland, Oregon, is ready and waiting for you! Ideally located within walking distance to parks, trails, shopping, and much more!<br /><br />Featuring: <br />Queen bed, full-sized appliances, including washer/dryer, cooking essentials and utensils, a cozy sofa, TV in the living area, air conditioner, and onsite parking.<br /><br />Multnomah Village, parks, and public transportation nearby<br /><br />Everything you need to make this place your home-away-from-home!','There are parks and green spaces nearby.  Hiking abounds with the trails in the Woods Memorial Natural Area.  My favorite is the Marigold Trail. The trails are perfect length for a lunch-break hike or for an afternoon.  Or neighborhood is also within walking distance of Multnomah Village for shopping or dining.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-862426477960968122/original/d658670a-d2b0-4a23-b65b-85aa634365ae.jpeg',9075051,18,'45.4598204','-122.7177973',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,31,1125,7,5.00,862426477960968122),(3199,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/862455832416419352','Arnold Creek Hidden Gem','This hidden gem is a secluded and private get away for a small family, couple, or single individual coming out to explore the great city of Portland, with or without fur pets. Be close enough to the city with the feels of a suburban area!<br /><br />We have over 20 parks nearby with trails and water features that are both children and dog friendly.<br /><br /> If you’re a foodie like us you’ll enjoy all that Multnomah Village and local restaurants have to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-862455832416419352/original/bbee09b4-d87a-48f9-9bc3-abc195950f8d.jpeg',102637138,41,'45.44688379999999','-122.699408',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,90.00,2,365,29,4.76,862455832416419352),(3200,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/862921843725921525','Bright and cozy craftsman','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located house.<br />Amazing Coffee shops, restaurants and parks! Great place for a small family or a couple. <br />The neighborhood is quiet, yet walkable to all the fun!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-862921843725921525/original/db2e7fa3-f158-4f5e-bfb1-9e3da2230b72.jpeg',7284060,45,'45.5694515','-122.6554396',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,30,90,1,5.00,862921843725921525),(3201,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/863166483335878286','Near Portland Art Museum Center and Oregon Zoo!','Our hotel is situated in the downtown of Portland only minutes away from exciting locations such as Internati