, nestled just one block away from Kern Park in the vibrant Foster-Powell neighborhood. With its inviting brightness and modern amenities, this peaceful retreat provides the perfect setting for relaxation and quality time with the whole family.','Foster-Powell is a neighborhood in the Southeast section of Portland, Oregon. The triangular neighborhood is bounded by three major transit arteries: Powell Boulevard to the north, Foster Road to the south, and 82nd Avenue to the east.  The neighborhood is mostly inhabited by families with Kern park less than 1 block away and Holgate Library close by.  Winco Foods, New Seasons, Fubonn and SF Supermarket are all within 1.5 miles or less of the house.  There are countless restaurants, coffee shops and food carts close by.  I’m more than happy to send a list of recommendations!  Interstate 205 is about 5 minutes away, Downtown Portland and Portland International Airport are both 15 minutes in either direction.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-873455517566890127/original/27c026af-1961-46ce-8605-f6f75a7851b9.jpeg',4139334,36,'45.49359','-122.59136',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,250.00,2,365,9,5.00,873455517566890127),(3243,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/873600030624855364','Near Portland Art Museum! Pet-friendly Rooms!','Our hotel is situated in the downtown of Portland only minutes away from exciting locations such as International Rose Test Garden and Powell’s City of Books. Ideal for a fun vacation, the area provides an amazing selection of activities for guests to enjoy. Feast your eyes on lifelike artworks at the Portland Art Museum, experience nature at the Oregon Zoo or go for an entertaining concert at Moda Center. The list of what to engage in is endless and there’s something for everyone!','- Portland Art Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- International Rose Test Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- Oregon Zoo – 1.9 miles <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.4 miles <br />- Oregon History Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Classical Chinese Garden – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Japanese Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 2 miles <br />- U.S. Bancorp Tower – 0.2 miles <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles <br />- Johnson Creek – 5.6 miles <br />- O’Bryant Square – 0.1 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-873600030624855364/original/ce45fdb5-0a5a-4b2f-89f0-51f0c6072c84.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52101','-122.67835',4,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,35,4.69,873600030624855364),(3244,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/873877255708787914','Spacious 3BR Q21 | Elevator | Washer/Dryer','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-873877255708787914/original/9eef6892-5256-428f-afd9-d246752536d7.jpeg',40890310,27,'45.53288','-122.69574',1,8,2.00,3.00,4.00,325.00,2,1125,4,5.00,873877255708787914),(3245,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/873878057547838882','Unbeatable 1BR Q21 | Patio | Game Room','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-873878057547838882/original/4f8b3536-3c3a-4241-8695-5a23ef68779d.jpeg',40890310,27,'45.53368','-122.69572',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,162.00,1,1125,2,3.00,873878057547838882),(3246,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/873918210376496557','Halsey Abode in Rose City Park','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located studio. The space is great for a couple, someone traveling alone, or a couple of friends to enjoy time in Portland. Located along two bus routes and a short walk to light rail make our light-filled space a wonderful place to rest while enjoying all Portland has to offer.','Our studio is located in the Rose City Park neighborhood in Portland. It is a short walk to our local Park, Normandale. there is a coffee shop and food carts close by. Our neighborhood is very walkable and you can get nearly to all needs within a 15 minute walk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-873918210376496557/original/c8416644-a415-4b15-8c2b-7adf2c0864a5.jpeg',24118107,11,'45.53435','-122.60408',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,61.00,2,5,44,4.95,873918210376496557),(3247,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/874156225451139627','Suburban Sanctuary PDX','Kick back and relax in this calm, adorable space.','The neighborhood is quiet and walkable. Kind passersby’s are often seen walking their pets throughout the day & I’m happy to report that our neighbors look out for one another.<br /><br />The backyard is a private oasis during the summer months though Powell Butte Nature Park is 1 mile away for even more of a wooded experience.<br /><br />For your culinary delights there is an Oriental Food Market on Powell and a Mexican Grocery Store just north on division.<br />If cooking isn’t your jam, several great restaurant options are not a far drive away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-874156225451139627/original/91e4dffd-1e11-4c99-baec-e749b146204b.jpeg',27701355,87,'45.495231','-122.4882116',1,5,1.00,3.00,3.00,120.00,30,180,7,5.00,874156225451139627),(3248,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/874692954316448703','Guesthouse in Historic Kenton','Welcome to our second floor apartment, just built in 2020. We put a lot of love and care into all of the finishing touches in this bright and inviting space to make it feel comfortable for our guests. We live on a dead end street in the Kenton neighborhood, just minutes away from \"downtown\" Kenton. Restaurants, cafes, shops, bus & max stops are all a short walk away. The apartment is above our home, with a separate entrance via exterior stairs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-874692954316448703/original/4d79097f-132d-4179-90df-99606af3833e.jpeg',20899071,55,'45.57760592212727','-122.69010103902905',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,874692954316448703),(3249,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/874787906960807152','Sweeeeet Home Alberta 3BR/1BA','Welcome to our beautiful Portland home located in the vibrant & highly sought-after Alberta Arts District! This spacious & inviting home is perfect for large groups looking for a comfortable & convenient place to stay while exploring all that this lively neighborhood has to offer. Step outside & you\'ll find yourself surrounded by a plethora of amazing food & drink options. When you\'re ready to unwind, retreat to our cozy home, where you\'ll find plenty of room for everyone to relax & recharge.','Welcome to the charming Alberta Arts District, one of Portland\'s most vibrant and diverse neighborhoods! Situated in the northeast part of the city, this lively community is known for its eclectic mix of boutiques, galleries, restaurants, and cafes.<br /><br />As you stroll down Alberta Street, you\'ll be greeted by an array of colorful murals and street art, showcasing the neighborhood\'s unique character. Browse through the many boutique shops and galleries, which feature everything from handmade jewelry to vintage clothing and local artwork.<br /><br />The Alberta Arts District is also home to a fantastic food scene, with a wide variety of restaurants, cafes, and food carts serving up everything from classic American fare to international cuisine. Be sure to sample some of the neighborhood\'s famous dishes, such as the fried chicken and waffles at the Tin Shed Garden Cafe, the award-winning biscuits at Pine State Biscuits, or the artisan ice cream at Salt & Straw.<br /><br />In additio','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-874787906960807152/original/7c609cf7-2b0e-437b-80eb-15ca7cf322db.jpeg',384690762,29,'45.56078','-122.65082',1,6,1.00,3.00,4.00,104.00,30,365,78,4.87,874787906960807152),(3250,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/875456260715536642','Charming Entire House + Parking','Come stay at our updated home with everything you need close by.<br /><br />🔹You can park in the driveway + on the street (free)<br />🔸50\" 4k HD smart tv<br />🔹Dedicated high-speed WiFi <br />🔸Fully equipped + stocked kitchen<br />🔹2 Queen beds + 5\' couch<br />🔸Onsite washer+dryer<br />🔹Will provide Pack n\' Play and high chair upon request<br />🔸8 mi from PDX Airport and 6 mi from downtown Portland<br />🔹Private fenced backyard (no grass)<br />🔸This house is a duplex  (no shared amenities; full privacy)<br />🔹PLEASE FOLLOW HOUSE RULES','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-875456260715536642/original/9713414f-6781-4b70-bf44-83ff4d3e5290.jpeg',270612196,36,'45.49681','-122.59887',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,200.00,1,60,44,4.86,875456260715536642),(3251,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/875622827519972255','Historic Haven 1bd/1ba in Brooklyn Portland SE','We pride ourselves on offering the ultimate comfort and relaxation. Our fully furnished kitchen, bathroom, and bedroom are meticulously designed for you.<br /><br />Our home is a 10-minute drive to downtown and 18-30 minutes to the airport. You\'ll be within 10 minutes of vibrant Southeast Portland neighborhoods like Hawthorne, Sellwood, Irvington, Foster-Powell, Buckman, and Ladd\'s Addition. The bus stop is right in front, and the Trax station is 5 minutes away.<br /><br />We can\'t wait to host you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODc1NjIyODI3NTE5OTcyMjU1/original/88cce5ce-5b61-4aae-8e71-d900fdf5f4f0.jpeg',5054191,56,'45.49564293493494','-122.65190790847439',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,2,120,21,4.81,875622827519972255),(3252,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/876051321284691129','The Leo','This home is fully furnished 3 bedroom 2 1/2 bath home located in SW Portland. This lovely home is perfect for traveling professionals, families and groups. Enjoy the convenience of on-site laundry and free off street parking.  This home has a fully fenced rear patio, and is dog friendly.  The location of this home is unbeatable, as it is conveniently located close to major highways, making it a very easy commute to many parts of the city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-876051321284691129/original/808009ae-d3ea-44df-9d9b-5c971dc69377.jpeg',47581293,17,'45.4840678','-122.7286103',1,5,2.50,3.00,3.00,295.00,30,400,1,5.00,876051321284691129),(3253,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/876874188618232298','Modern unit - In the Heart of Sellwood','Welcome to our centrally located Airbnb in the heart of Sellwood, one of Portland\'s most vibrant neighborhoods! This Light &bright BASEMENT unit is perfect for those who want to explore all that Portland has to offer. You will be within walking distance to a wide variety of great amenities, including restaurants, coffee shops, boutique stores, and more. You\'ll love strolling around and soaking up the local vibe.**Please note this rental is for 21yrs+only** ONLY 2 people maximum','Hip, walkable, Fun, Restaurants, Bars, Library, Easy walk to river and amazing Sellwood Park and Oaks Bottom Wildlife refuge, public transportation available from airport with light rail and a bus.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-876874188618232298/original/8397ab74-5bac-42d2-a131-5a7a08d1962e.jpeg',31679049,20,'45.469067503342856','-122.65447224442168',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,365,110,4.95,876874188618232298),(3254,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/876909149657565386','Beautiful Apartment in Southeast','This is a charming lower level of a beautiful home in the highly desired Richmond neighborhood in SE Portland. You will have the entire apartment to yourself, along with a private entrance and gated patio to enjoy a bit of the outdoors during your stay :)<br /><br />Safe, quiet neighborhood with access to amazing eateries, nightlife, shopping, parks and much more! Walk Score of 90!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50420415/original/f340304c-ac2c-4ea6-9186-4cf36450abed.jpeg',222322282,8,'45.50008','-122.63339',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,30,175,6,4.83,876909149657565386),(3255,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/877441190357419783','1BR with great location & washer/dryer','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-877441190357419783/original/a086e4e0-7c91-4e8e-84f9-001ed0fe9ebe.jpeg',111797012,20,'45.47849','-122.64503',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,140.00,2,1125,13,4.31,877441190357419783),(3256,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/877736133901244428','Luxury Living on NW 23rd Ave, Walk Score 99','Welcome to the Best Located Airbnb in Portland!<br /><br />A walker\'s paradise with a walk score of 99, our 2000 sq ft home has recently been fully renovated. It features brand new stainless steel appliances, blazing fast WiFi, and comfortably sleeps up to 12 guests.<br /><br />Our historic yet modern home is situated in the Alphabet District on NW 23rd. Just steps away, you\'ll find Salt and Straw, bars, restaurants, bookstores, and shops. Enjoy the perfect blend of classic charm and modern convenience!','With its ornate Victorian houses and tree-lined streets, fashionable Nob Hill is a charming and established neighborhood. Known for its trendy shopping on 23rd Avenue, Nob Hill offers a unique blend of upscale boutiques and eclectic shops. The neighborhood boasts a thriving dining scene, featuring refined restaurants and laid-back eateries serving a variety of international cuisines. Cozy cafes add to the charm, pouring specialty coffee that attracts both locals and visitors alike. Nob Hill perfectly combines historic elegance with modern vibrancy, making it a must-visit destination in Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-877736133901244428/original/e8214021-0eed-4bd5-a07f-b58ea62b3a4e.jpeg',286367128,27,'45.5289126','-122.69902',1,12,2.00,4.00,5.00,431.00,2,365,80,4.96,877736133901244428),(3257,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/877771899994133091','Auna\'s Place and Garden','Perfectly imperfect! Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.  Family home for over 90 years.  Feel like you are visiting Grandma’s house.  Centrally located to everything Portland has to offer.  Great walkability.   Enjoy the antique/thrift shops of Sellwood, golf at Eastmoreland, walk to nearby neighborhood restaurants.  Easy public transportation. We are close to Reed College, OHSU, Downtown, Willamette River, Oaks Park.  You name it, you can easily get there.','Sellwood is a cute old established neighborhood.  Centrally located to all Portland had to offer.  Excellent walkability score and very bike friendly.  We are walking distance to the Willamette River, Sellwood pool and shops restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/82b57706-82a1-458b-bf30-5c9b5be18fb1.jpg',3948888,20,'45.462759747604416','-122.65516600697298',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,200.00,2,21,29,4.97,877771899994133091),(3258,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/878278378268415086','Burnside Manor, best location, full 1bd (Unit B)','Beautifully appointed, fully furnished unit. Kitchen, living room, and outdoor patio, are tastefully decorated and fully equipped for your comfort and convenience. The house is located in the desirable Kerns neighborhood next to Whole Foods, Starbucks and the restaurants and shops of 28th Ave and Burnside. Free laundry facilities and secure keyless locks!','The Kerns neighborhood is located in the Northeast section of Portland, Oregon. It is known for its tree-lined streets and historic homes. The neighborhood is home to many restaurants, cafes, and bars, as well as shops and services. It is also home to Laurelhurst Park, a large park with a playground, walking paths, and a pond. Additionally, the Kerns neighborhood is close to the Oregon Convention Center and the Lloyd Center shopping mall. The neighborhood is considered as one of the most popular and desirable neighborhoods in Portland, with a mix of single-family homes, condos, and apartments. Overall, Kerns is considered a walkable, bike-friendly neighborhood with a good mix of residential and commercial areas.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-878278378268415086/original/ea4e4523-2f69-4284-a6fb-43286970b9f1.jpeg',45217575,12,'45.5237586','-122.6361379',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,49.00,31,185,8,5.00,878278378268415086),(3259,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/878428599426795341','Rocky Butte Retreat','Welcome to this peaceful retreat recently renovated! Your home away from home is here in this  mid-century gem:)  30 day minimum rental.<br />Across from a beautiful community garden on a quiet street in a established neighborhood with views of Rocky butte. Cute as a button and fully stocked kitchen and sunny living room. Recently restored to all its charm with all new hardwood floors, interior paint, & more!<br /> -Double paned windows<br />- BRAND new Furnace and AC in June 2023<br />Your home away from home!','Perched on the backside of the Grotto. Across from the Beech Street community garden and on a sloped yard, this home offers a peaceful retreat where you often hear birds. You\'ll see people often walking dogs up this street to Rocky Butte.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-878428599426795341/original/41067484-3544-44e6-9b25-af3077c8c507.jpeg',37834902,74,'45.55012','-122.5747',1,3,1.00,2.00,1.00,99.00,30,30,2,5.00,878428599426795341),(3260,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/878996975322508832','2 bedroom near Pier Park','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located home. It is a 3 bedroom home nestled into the quiet but well connected St. John’s neighborhood. Great home for those wanting to get downtown quickly (no traffic!) or head North to Vancouver, WA and enjoy Portland’s awesome offerings. We are within walking distance to great bars, coffee shops, and a nice summer farmer’s market. You can take public transit to just about anywhere, with easy access to the airport with an affordable cab or bus.','St. Johns is a neighborhood with small-town charm in Portland, Oregon, located in North Portland on the tip of the peninsula formed by the confluence of the Willamette River and the Columbia River. Our favorite spots within walking distance is Daydreams Cafe, Paiku Breakfasts, Beto taqueria, and the Garrison for delicious cocktails. We love our local food trucks (beer porch), and urban German where you can sip locally made beer while viewing the Cathedral bridge from their outdoor patio! A quick drive to downtown PDX is about 10 minutes. We are 20 minutes from the PDX airport, and 10-15 from NE PDX shops like Alberta/albino/mississippi.  One of the best parts of living in St. Johns is there is rarely much traffic in any direction you go.<br /><br />Hikes:<br />1. Forest Park: This 5,200-acre park has over 80 miles of trails to explore, making it a great destination for hikers of all skill levels.<br />2. Cathedral Park: This park is home to the iconic St. Johns Bridge and offers beauti','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/52cf2e69-1ee5-4aa1-bb95-55a1befc667b.jpg',23781261,58,'45.59878016920372','-122.74758249323067',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,30,60,0,1.00,878996975322508832),(3261,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/879398099453709192','Star-Studded Hotel with Mini-Golf, and Lounge!','This vintage-inspired boutique hotel is located in a charming pocket of downtown Portland known locally as the Goose Hollow neighborhood. You can explore the renowned International Rose Test and Japanese Gardens, stroll the meandering trails of Forest Park, and visit the enchanting Pittock Mansion. You can also enjoy the hotel\'s signature amenities, such as a pop-up cinema, a mini-golf course, and a cocktail lounge. Whether you are looking for a romantic getaway, a business trip, or a family vac','- Providence Park - 0.2 miles; <br />- Powell\'s City of Books - 0.4 miles; <br />- Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall - 0.5 miles; <br />- Portland Art Museum - 0.5 miles; <br />- Lan Su Chinese Garden - 0.9 miles; <br />- International Rose Test Garden - 1.6 miles; <br />- Oregon Museum of Science and Industry - 1.7 miles; <br />- Washington Park - 2.2 miles; <br />- Pittock Mansion - 2.3 miles; <br />- The Grotto - 6.8 miles; <br />- Portland International Airport - 9.7 miles.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-879398099453709192/original/ffe0f472-424f-42fb-bc77-ec9eef3fd4ea.png',174792040,3,'45.521','-122.68776',4,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,879398099453709192),(3262,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/879827947604573552','plant sanctuary','Welcome to my home. When not airbnbing, this is where I live. The house feels like a home - with lots of plants, saturated colors, the most perfect and private outdoor space, a kitchen with sharp knives and cast irons skillets, a veggie garden and eclectic trinkets. This is a space for relaxing, reading, cooking, small dinner parties, and pondering. The neighborhood is quiet and the neighbors are kind. You won’t want to leave.','In the heart of Montavilla. Close to Mt Tabor, Montavilla Farmer\'s Market (Sundays), Hungry Heart Bakery, Monticello Antiques, East Glisan Pizza, Roscoe\'s bar','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-879827947604573552/original/fdf17084-c112-4153-b7b9-86de93115ccd.jpeg',13526464,10,'45.524990457797756','-122.5709564883053',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,175.00,3,10,19,5.00,879827947604573552),(3263,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/880412830796813344','Stay Wildwood','Introducing Wildwood House:<br />Your Tranquil Portland Oasis<br /><br />Nestled amidst the serene and picturesque West Hills of Portland, Oregon, the Wildwood House is a sanctuary of tranquility and creativity. This charming 1928 cedar-shingled gem, resembling a storybook gingerbread house, offers an idyllic escape for those seeking respite in a peaceful, Zen-like setting.','Perched above the iconic St. Johns Bridge, Springville Hill is a quiet neighborhood renowned for its natural beauty and peaceful seclusion. Set within the West Hills, you\'ll enjoy breathtaking views lush surroundings. Whether you\'re seeking a tranquil hillside retreat or eager to explore Portland\'s diverse wonders, Springville Hill offers the best of both worlds. Despite its rural feel, it provides convenient access to the vibrant culture, dining, and entertainment that Portland has to offer with just a short drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-880412830796813344/original/334353b1-3e90-4a97-bf59-c5f