inics and hospitals.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-881189619149329653/original/1f1491e7-a7a9-426e-8c63-8d53ec515551.jpeg',512501431,75,'45.47041272870189','-122.72534653544425',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,225.00,5,365,2,5.00,881189619149329653),(3266,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/881431276327906589','Modern condo in North Tabor','Welcome to your new temporary home in NE Portland, OR! Located in a serene and peaceful neighborhood, this condo triplex unit offers the perfect balance of privacy and accessibility. <br /><br />The property has recently been renovated, with mini split heating and cooling, brand new appliances and furniture, and an open-plan, modern kitchen with quartz countertops.  This spacious unit boasts two bedrooms, each with a queen-sized bed.  The bathroom features a tub/shower combo for added convenience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-881431276327906589/original/7c146669-da8f-4b2e-bbf0-56d9754aeeb2.jpeg',281637273,52,'45.52592724833489','-122.60619054578856',1,3,1.50,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,300,2,5.00,881431276327906589),(3267,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/881431286255017318','Modern condo in North Tabor','The property is located in a peaceful neighborhood, this condo triplex unit offers the perfect balance of privacy and accessibility. The unit is close to freeway access, several grocery stores and recreational destinations, including Laurelhurst Park, and Mt. Tabor Park.<br /><br />The property has recently been renovated, with mini split heating and cooling, brand new appliances and furniture, and an open-plan, modern kitchen with quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances.','Perfect neighborhood for walking and running.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-881431286255017318/original/148bdde8-e343-462e-8f85-04e48a829d4a.jpeg',281637273,52,'45.52516','-122.60674',1,3,1.50,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,330,1,5.00,881431286255017318),(3268,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/881889716889991407','Cozy in walkable Woodstock','Walk to everything from our cozy tiny home. Located in the Woodstock neighborhood, and adjacent to Foster Powell neighborhood you don\'t need a car to explore the city from here! If you have one, there\'s free covered off street parking! <br /><br />This unit is cozy with everything you need to have a memorable experience in Portland. Pets allowed with approval. NOTE: the laundry room is shared with the upstairs guest. Some noise transfer between units may be noticeable from lower unit.','A wide range of character homes dots this neighborhood which is walking distance to multiple parks, cafes, restaurants and shops. The neighbors are friendly and involved and the sidewalks are wide with lots of mature trees.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-881889716889991407/original/d4e440c3-66c8-4b75-ba17-a87b8538d1b4.jpeg',501414071,65,'45.4811685','-122.5839037',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,69.00,30,365,12,5.00,881889716889991407),(3269,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/882133205079344979','Central & Peaceful walk to transit & restaurants','My home is located in the peaceful historic Irvington neighborhood. The house is within 10 minutes of walking the MAX train and buses, which can take you downtown in 20 minutes. It\'s a 15-minute Uber ride to the airport or downtown. It is a 5-minute drive/30-minute walk to the Oregon Convention Center or Moda Center. <br /><br />Portland is a lovely place to visit. We have amazing cuisine, wine, beer, coffee, hiking, skiing, paddle boarding, friendly dogs and nice people.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-624053992012208991/original/50105272-fa10-462a-bc99-ff7fb72e0f8e.jpeg',33081979,7,'45.54064343767531','-122.65439817789337',2,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,1,365,101,4.72,882133205079344979),(3270,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/882516112627638676','Modern Apartment in Portland\'s Pearl District','Stunning apartment in the heart of Portland\'s Pearl District. Breathtaking city view from up high. Modern kitchen with upscale appliances, high quality contemporary modern furniture, stylish European influenced interior design. Fully furnished - Ready to move in and to enjoy Portland. Walking distance to countless restaurants, breakfast places, cafes, bars, boutiques, grocery stores and shopping.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-882516112627638676/original/0f7327db-76c1-4e2e-bb1b-2e71641565f9.jpeg',234801624,2,'45.5292249','-122.6857045',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,31,500,5,5.00,882516112627638676),(3271,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/882551413492261260','Private room + private bath in new home - Room B','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space while visiting the Portland area. In the morning enjoy a cup of coffee on the back patio while you listen to the birds. During the day work from home with high speed internet while taking breaks at the park at the end of the road. Cozy Up in the living room after exploring the iconic parks nearby. Finish it off with a good nights sleep in your comfortable bed.<br />We can\'t wait to meet you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9ad83daa-132a-41c1-a588-ab19d96d7194.jpg',230664404,78,'45.48525','-122.539',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,31.00,30,60,15,4.93,882551413492261260),(3272,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/882737451887617905','Alberta Arts District Retreat','This cozy apartment owned by jazz enthusiasts is in a woodsy and artsy NE Portland neighborhood and is ideal for long stays. It’s close to universities, hospitals, and downtown and is walking distance to restaurants, coffee bars, and pubs with craft cocktails as well as art galleries and boutiques. Vaulted ceilings, a cast-iron gas stove, and well equipped kitchen give the space a unique charm.','The quiet neighborhood streets and alleys are lined with mature cedar trees, yet it is just a stones throw from the Alberta Arts District, University of Oregon’s Portland campus, and the Kennedy School. It is walking distance to restaurants, coffee bars, and pubs with craft cocktails as well as art galleries and boutiques.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-882737451887617905/original/aa95a249-29a7-4da0-a6e4-25e522af7660.jpeg',455346786,1,'45.5668625','-122.6363025',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,112.00,31,90,7,5.00,882737451887617905),(3273,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/883518232938647263','Cozy pied-à-terre in NE PDX','The coolest studio apartment in the BEST NE location. Ground floor unit w/direct outdoor access.  No contact-access from host, who is responsive, but will give you total privacy.  Ambient lighting, cozy bedding, fast Wi-Fi, full kitchen, pour over coffee setup and a drip coffee maker, smart tv, new Stumptown mattress. Directly next door to laundry room. The best restaurants and cocktail bars are steps away; Italian restaurant, upscale pub-fare, cafes, vintage shops, all within 1/2 a block!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-883518232938647263/original/f25bc7c7-38dc-4641-82f9-e37e9c0e215f.jpeg',38713113,1,'45.5622879','-122.6345323',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,99,6,4.67,883518232938647263),(3274,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/883645436498601988','Historic Ladd’s Addition Loft!','Loft room for rent in a beautiful  craftsman home in the historical neighborhood of Ladd\'s Addition! Walk to rose gardens, dozens of amazing restaurants, bars, shops and train. Near Division and Hawthorne. Beautiful neighborhood with tree lined streets and rose gardens. Upstairs loft room and office/living space. Features: brand new open kitchen, deck and patio with fire-pit. Gas fireplace inside and central air. Street parking. Shared bathroom. peaceful, family friendly and quiet area.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODgzNjQ1NDM2NDk4NjAxOTg4/original/d5c862df-7ec6-43ee-8652-fee06b09f17a.jpeg',31920019,25,'45.5082731','-122.6460118',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,40.00,30,365,1,5.00,883645436498601988),(3275,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/884410004022703539','Huge house in the best location.','You\'ll have a 