r condo is located in a wonderful, mature neighborhood where you will experience a safe and quiet part of downtown Portland.  Enjoy a calming a stroll through nearby gardens on the way to food carts, the waterfront, shopping, Salmon fountain, outdoor markets, restaurants and coffee shops.  Want to catch an Off Broadway performance at Keller Auditorium?  Walk there in 5 minutes!  Three minutes by car and you\'ll be motoring on the freeway to your next adventure!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-887745300179116212/original/358b8a35-af27-402d-9647-f821b90c7a2b.jpeg',56229591,44,'45.5103912','-122.6782267',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,160,6,5.00,887745300179116212),(3283,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/888355193556146850','Upscale Relaxing Retreat 2 BR/1 BA ~ Sleeps 4','Welcome to our beautifully remodeled & spacious two-bedroom retreat. The space has been thoughtfully designed to provide a calming ambiance, making it an ideal place to unwind after a day of exploring the city. For those seeking to experience the city\'s renowned neighborhoods, you\'re in luck! Portland\'s popular streets are all nearby, offering a plethora of trendy shops, eclectic eateries, & lively entertainment options. You\'ll have no shortage of exciting experiences to create lasting memories.','I love living here because of easy access to the freeways, airport, city center, shopping,<br /> walking distance to restaurants, bars, yoga and Gym, and seasonal farmers market. public transportation with 3 deference-buss and the max train,  bike trails','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-888355193556146850/original/cca00918-c1cc-4640-90a8-1cc3f4150a7d.jpeg',239624495,72,'45.47436642349438','-122.5680455288583',1,4,1.00,2.00,5.00,95.00,30,365,34,4.82,888355193556146850),(3284,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/888383791928040371','Beautiful, child friendly, near trails, central ac','Have fun with the whole family at this stylish place. This is newly renovated 4 bedroom, office and 3 bathrooms spacious home located within walking distance from the Powell Butte Nature trails. The home is equipped with a dedicated office space and comes with high speed internet. The main master bedroom has a jetted tub with a walk in closet.','Portland','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-888383791928040371/original/e885f5d4-e4d9-4654-9a6d-15d0ac57b11a.jpeg',514114443,77,'45.492252642498585','-122.50498753787026',1,13,3.00,4.00,7.00,190.00,2,1125,86,4.81,888383791928040371),(3285,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/888467456581934420','Cedar House: A Quiet Retreat','Come stay in our brand new light-filled guesthouse with a high cedar ceiling and tons of natural light/windows.  The guesthouse is set back away from the street in our private fenced backyard with its own entrance and access to the hot tub.  Guests also enjoy their own private backyard.  House has central heat and air conditioning and a farmhouse natural feel.  On-site acupuncture or massage treatments available upon request.  Also option to harvest from main house’s organic garden.','Roseway is the best!  We have some fun cafes/restaurants/brewery/wine shop within walking distance.  The neighborhood is quiet with tons of gardens, and close to busy neighborhoods without being right in the noise and bustle. You are perfectly placed close to airport, 5-10 mins from NE neighborhoods like Beaumont, Alberta Arts District and Mississippi.  Also nearby Sandy Ave gets you to SE and downtown super quick.  And we are close to both 205 and 84 highways for getting out to the Columbia River Gorge, Mt. Hood, Hood River, the coast, wine country, you name it.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-888467456581934420/original/a8989f9e-f90a-45e6-bdfb-f35da064a5b9.jpeg',2576419,39,'45.55278115240964','-122.58634507656097',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,68.00,30,365,15,4.93,888467456581934420),(3286,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/888684393175448358','Great location! Private, modern entire guest suite','Thank you for choosing our Airbnb and welcome to Portland!<br /><br />Located in Southeast Portland between Hawthorne and Division and just a 5-10 minute drive to Downtown Portland, we are walkable to some of the city’s best restaurants, coffee shops, breweries, bars, shopping and the iconic Portland food carts. Check out our favorite spots book - a guide to the surrounding area with all of our recommended local hangs.','We are nestled between Hawthorne and Southeast Division with easy walkable access to tons of great restaurants, bars, breweries, shopping and entertainment. We are just a 5 minute drive to downtown Portland. <br /><br />Our neighborhood is Hosford-Abernethy which is on the border of Ladd\'s Addition - the oldest planned residential development, and one of the oldest in the western US. It is known for its unique diagonal street pattern, vs the surrounding rectilinear grids. Take a stroll around and check out the beautiful historical architecture and large American Elm Trees. In the center of Ladd\'s Addition is a beautiful rose garden, surrounded by 4 smaller rose gardens which are kept up by the local community.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-888684393175448358/original/9cf0c9d3-7bcd-4fd7-b24a-da5d7a744cc2.jpeg',36901481,25,'45.507272693354835','-122.65379810000002',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,89.00,2,30,101,4.98,888684393175448358),(3287,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/888747726506268577','Lovely cedar hot tub—serene, superb location!','★Make memories!★ Step and relax into a cedar hot tub! Located in popular inner Southeast neighborhood, featuring private garden and curated modern interior details. Walk in any direction for coffee shops, breweries, wine bars, cannabis boutiques, music venues and eateries. Revolution Hall is only 5 blocks away! Explore the town, or stay in, play boardgames and soak in the hot tub. Enjoy yourself, you deserve it! <br />Space is NOT suitable for children or pets.','★Buckman is the best Portland neighborhood in our humble opinion; charming homes grand or small, unique shops, bars, eateries all nestled within. The all so known Voodoo donuts is just a 3 block walk away for all your donut needs! So much to do just by walking!★','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODg4NzQ3NzI2NTA2MjY4NTc3/original/4f9a4f42-448a-4594-ad8b-6233aa4a543a.jpeg',122732291,32,'45.52235849894956','-122.64885590584788',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,10,14,4.93,888747726506268577),(3288,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/889347365329464731','N Portland Adventure Basecamp!','You’ll enjoy easy access to everything Portland has to offer from this well located newer home …with a beautiful park next door and easy access to Kenton restaurants and transit! Great privacy in your room with dedicated bathroom at opposite end of house from the owner. I often travel on weekends, so you may have the place to yourself! <br /><br />Garage access in case you need to store sports equipment or bicycles.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d25afe6a-bc6c-4401-9da1-192f48a6c6d8.jpg',3105723,55,'45.5829113','-122.6928081',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,65.00,2,30,28,5.00,889347365329464731),(3289,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/889780629145553306','Private 2 Bedroom with Backyard, Fire-pit, parking','Welcome to our stylish and modern Airbnb property, located 15 min from the airport and downtown in the beautiful nautical neighborhood of Bridgeton in Portland, Oregon. With its charming and unique surroundings, our home is the perfect place to relax and unwind after adventuring during your stay in the Pacific Northwest. One of the highlights of our property is the private outdoor patio, with Adirondack chairs, fire-pit and yard games. Plenty of parking for 2-3 vehicles depending on size.','located near the Portland Yacht Club and Columbia Edgewater Country Club. This home is perfect for those who love outdoor activities with a bike path nearby and Janzen Beach just a short drive away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-889780629145553306/original/b11e08cf-0119-44fb-8b93-7ddd7d25a07e.jpeg',28263687,92,'45.60181','-122.66957',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,175.00,2,90,32,4.91,889780629145553306),(3290,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/890090772362310514','PDX Studios: 1C - Long-Term Stays Welcome!','PDX Studios: Your Cozy Portland Retreat<br /><br />Welcome to PDX Studios,your ideal Portland home-away-from-home. Nestled in the lively Williams District and close to the Mississippi Historical and Alberta Arts Districts, this cozy space is perfect for short and long-term stays. Convenient for travel nurses and medical professionals with Emanuel Hospital nearby,plus major centers like OHSU just 20 minutes away. Enjoy a warm atmosphere with soothing hues, an inviting bedroom, kitchenette,and private bath.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6aa0b3d7-427d-4a07-8d32-3ae33141922f.jpg',472195025,9,'45.55022554575267','-122.66826845705509',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,59.00,30,365,6,4.17,890090772362310514),(3291,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/890622252402648652','Urban Rustic','Welcome to the nest (also my home). Whether you plan to retreat for days in peaceful silence or base camp here while adventuring the city, you\'ll get your cozy on and feel at home. <br /><br />Spacious, open, colorful, friendly... come settle in. In colder times, enjoy the radiance of fire at your feet. When the sun returns, you\'ll want to enjoy the garden and patio area. It\'s truly a sanctuary bearing fruits, herbs and veggies for the taking. <br /><br />Chemical free, designed with a nod to simplicity and flow.','Everyone who visits LOVES this neighborhood of NE Portland. The house is 11 min from the airport, 11-15 min to downtown (depending on traffic), and walkable to Alberta Arts District (10 minutes), music venues and loads of parks all around. The best is Fernhill Park (dog people take note!). If you literally want to stumble out the door to coffee, great restaurants, thrift shopping and more then NE 42nd St is half a block away. Another nearby favorite is the Historic Hollywood Theatre which is a 5 min drive or 10 min bus ride away. The neighborhood is also notable for its thriving Indigenous community and its artistic contributions to the area. Holiday time is particularly great with weeks of craft fairs just blocks away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-890622252402648652/original/dd165031-88a4-413e-95b3-0cd032ac3458.jpeg',92215419,1,'45.56028','-122.62152',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,140.00,30,90,8,5.00,890622252402648652),(3292,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/891703444010811592','Craftsman Subterranean Retreat','1 bedroom, 1 bath with spacious living room and separate entrance in the basement of a classic craftsman home. <br /><br />Centrally-located just four miles from downtown and within short walking distance to an amazing food cart park, coffee shops, and many top rated restaurants. <br /><br />Keep cozy in this quiet and freshly decorated space with all new beds, bedding and furnishings. Small kitchenette with microwave, mini-fridge, coffee maker, sink and hot plate. Private entrance with only a shared laundry room.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3695be9b-adb4-4f26-b471-8565fec45f5a.jpg',12273725,39,'45.54426','-122.59484',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,30,89,1,5.00,891703444010811592),(3293,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/892118545879274992','Old Portland Style with Fenced Yard in Woodlawn','Experience old Portland in this  beautiful 100-year-old  three-bedroom kit house with newly finished wood floors and a brand-new kitchen. The front door opens to an elegant foyer with a curving staircase in this classic foursquare design. Rejuvenate in the claw-foot tub, noodle around on the piano, relax on the oversized sofa. Then take a stroll down to Woodlawn park and Dekum Street, lined with restaurants you\'ll want to write home about. Or just eat in in the elegant dining room.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-892118545879274992/original/194ba7d2-2820-4476-872b-cdb0a2629e78.jpeg',51264241,45,'45.56834','-122.65372',1,4,1.50,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,892118545879274992),(3294,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/892122974256379348','Alberta Arts Craftsman ADU','This one-bedroom garden apartment built in 2014 sits beneath a fully-restored 1914 Arts and Crafts bungalow in the heart of Portland\'s famed Alberta Arts District.','The Concordia neighborhood is named for the former Concordia University that operated within it for over 100 years. It is one of several Portland neighborhoods that make up the Alberta Arts district.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-892122974256379348/original/c2ff21ed-9614-4490-ac76-4dde90ebdbb0.jpeg',107922685,1,'45.5559257','-122.6422021',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,134.00,2,6,15,5.00,892122974256379348),(3295,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/892200612531088895','Hillsdale Retreat','Unique retreat in the heart of SW Portland\'s Hillsdale quiet mid-century neighborhood.  Envisioned for your multi-purpose use: Vacation get away, work retreat, visiting professional, post medical procedure recovery refuge, or small group offsite creativity session.  Close to Hillsdale Business district<br /><br />Updated and designed in mind for guests of all mobility capabilities. <br /> No step entrance, wider than normal door ways, ADA bathroom with zero clearance shower.  Full kitchen and dining room.','Walk to Hillsdale shopping center (grocery, restaurants, bakery, shopping, banking, dry cleaning, UPS store, take out, library)<br />Ida B. Wells High School 0.2 miles<br />Hillsdale Farmer\'s Market 0.3 miles  Sundays  9:00AM - 1:00PM                      <br />   [Weekly Mid- April - November, every other Sunday December - mid-April ]<br />Fred Meyer Grocery Store and Burlingame shopping area 0.8 miles <br />J.C.C. Mittleman Jewish Center 1.0 miles<br />Southwest Community Center / Gabriel Park   1.8 miles<br />Multnomah Business and Shopping District 1.9 miles<br />Lewis and Clark College 2.9 miles<br />Oregon Health and Sciences 3.1 miles<br />Downtown Portland 4.8 miles<br />Oregon Zoo 5.5 miles<br />Portland Japanese Garden 6.1 miles<br />Portland International Airport 15.1 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-892200612531088895/original/9015cd0a-cccb-4d5b-92ac-32ef6b849278.jpg',95030930,31,'45.47379981836275','-122.69149059207321',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,185.00,30,120,11,5.00,892200612531088895),(3296,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/892315206523159373','large room in downtown Portland','Private room and bath in downtown Portland near PSU, OSHU , restaurants Museum, Parks. Downtown waterfront. Feel free to contact me if you cannot book because some days are not available in the calendar. Or any  questions you have.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/67c8dfd6-46bb-467c-a358-429183df8150.jpg',479014456,44,'45.507581165678644','-122.68082362490748',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,365,2,5.00,892315206523159373),(3297,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/893799897736979995','FamilyFriendly 2 BR Spacious Apt','Consider our above-ground sun-filled basement apartment if you are looking for a comfortable and spacious place to stay. It is a fully furnished unit with a private entrance, kitchenette, bathroom, and two bedrooms. You can enjoy the amenities of our apartment, such as Wi-Fi, a kid\'s corner, and a work area. Our apartment is in a quiet, safe neighborhood, close to public transportation, shops, and restaurants. Easy street parking will make coming and going a breeze. Private entrance!','This Air B & B is located in Hillsdale, a quiet and safe neighborhood near the downtown area. You will love the Hilldale shopping district, where you can dine, shop, and explore the retro style of the 60\'s. Don\'t miss the popular farmers market every Sunday in the summer, where you can buy fresh produce and local crafts. You can walk to all these places from our Air B & B. You can also visit the charming Multnomah Village, which is a bit further but still within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-893799897736979995/original/7c3a3752-b881-4e89-b1dd-a2810dfd2ffa.jpeg',515297813,31,'45.47244','-122.69466',1,5,1.00,2.00,6.00,110.00,2,120,19,4.74,893799897736979995),(3298,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/893832515070372621','Delightful Central & Quiet SW Portland Location','Tucked away in the beautiful Garden Home region of Portland, this wonderful retreat offers everything a traveler or couple could need for their trip to the area.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-893832515070372621/original/b603ab2e-6983-4c3a-b325-4a70aab868e0.jpeg',62261998,34,'45.45741532776549','-122.74377724389147',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,113.00,2,29,10,4.70,893832515070372621),(3299,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/894535420527931643','Mt Tabor Curvy Cutie','Welcome to your temporary home!  Keyless self check in.  Ideal for a family or individual in between homes or relocating, or temporary contract workers.  We do have a 31 day minimum stay. Close to Providence hospital complex.  Ideal for 1-4 people due to only 1 small bathroom, but beds can be provided for up to 6 if needed sofabed/ or cot. We will provide monthly house cleaning and special discounts at the salon next door.  Detached garage and basement included!<br />Bursting with charm.','Mt. Tabor','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-894535420527931643/original/caebbea6-722a-47b8-bc8b-c480defa00a4.jpeg',64363482,52,'45.5230192','-122.601306',1,6,1.00,2.00,4.00,157.00,31,300,1,5.00,894535420527931643),(3300,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/895608030748887075','Back to Black | Modern Stylish Alberta Arts Home','Charming bungalow in the heart of Portland. Enjoy a peaceful stay within walking distance of everything Alberta and Killingsworth have to offer. World-class restaurants and bars at your doorstep.  a 2 bed / 1 bath bungalow with a designer\'s touch, including a peaceful backyard to enjoy an aperitif or a BBQ.','Alberta Arts & Killingsworth neighborhood - Close to downtown. Convenient to the airport. Easy access to the Oregon Coast and the Columbia Gorge. Home to some of Portland\'s finest bars and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-895608030748887075/original/17911750-4834-4077-a91a-91178edce958.jpeg',7409866,1,'45.56369','-122.63691',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,128.00,1,365,58,4.93,895608030748887075),(3301,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/895711833921636990','A Gorgeous River View Modern Suit.','Gorgeous river view spacious modern 2 Bedrooms 1 bath suit with private interests. Over 1500 sqft, it’s the perfect getaway in the city. Cozy, quiet and relaxing, private scape with amazing access to the city. 15 mins away from the local favorite pearl district,20mins from downtown, and Sauvie island (where you can enjoy the river beach and picking delicious Oregon berries),25mins from Beaverton! <br />Full amenities, spacious kitchen, AC, dining room, etc. <br />License number: <br />City registration pending','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-895711833921636990/original/4447178f-ad18-439f-9b3a-d2ac1195bcb7.jpeg',148853179,89,'45.5970855','-122.7880667',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,276.00,30,365,1,5.00,895711833921636990),(3302,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/895738378282073345','Sellwood Yellow Bungalow','Historic Westmoreland Bungalow, fully furnished with everything you need. Spacious open plan LR/DR/Office. Updated \"Chef\'s Kitchen\" with many appliances, cooking, serving, and dining supplies. Remodeled bathroom with dual shower. Private yard, garden, patio with BBQ & dining and more! <br />Walk score of 93, biker\'s paradise score of 95, just steps to parks, library, restaurants, shopping, gourmet coffee and more!<br />Mid-stay cleaning mandatory for bookings > 30 days, $175 per cleaning every two weeks.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-895738378282073345/original/8fb4eff1-3d3c-47a3-aa92-25e7d4720d95.png',6492281,20,'45.46764916175612','-122.64570729284013',1,6,1.00,2.00,2.00,174.00,31,365,5,5.00,895738378282073345),(3303,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/896236767799664104','Patton Heights Bungalow','Welcome to your dream retreat in the southwest hills of Portland, Oregon! Nestled amidst the breathtaking natural beauty of the Pacific Northwest, this unique ultra-modern bungalow is a haven for discerning travelers seeking the perfect blend of contemporary luxury and serene surroundings. Whether you\'re a traveling nurse,  executive or a visiting family, this extraordinary property promises an unforgettable stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODk2MjM2NzY3Nzk5NjY0MTA0/original/7f57b221-a5a6-45ed-8a08-55ea35ba218e.jpeg',158074447,54,'45.49941','-122.72622',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,105.00,31,300,3,5.00,896236767799664104),(3304,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/896345924356452882','Mountain & River View ‧ Spacious ‧ Modern Home','Gorgeous River view 🏞️Spacious & Modern 5 Bedrooms 3 bath home. <br /><br />⭐️ Enjoy over 3000 sqft,  it’s the perfect getaway in the city<br />⭐️ Private Backyard<br />⭐️ Cozy, quiet and relaxing<br />⭐️ Private scape with amazing access to the city. <br /><br />✅ 15 mins away from local favorite pearl district <br />✅ 20mins from downtown and Sauvie island (where you can enjoy the river beach and picking delicious Oregon berries)<br />✅ 25mins from Beaverton<br />✅ National Day Fireworks Panorama<br /><br />License number: <br />City registration pending','Nearby Shops and Amenities<br /><br />Grocery Stores<br /><br />New Seasons Market - Slabtown: A popular store offering organic and locally sourced products.<br /><br />Fred Meyer: A comprehensive supermarket for everyday shopping needs.<br /><br />Linnton Grocery: A local convenience store with a small-town feel.<br /><br />Coffee Shops<br /><br />Coava Coffee Roasters: Known for its minimalist aesthetic and premium coffee.<br /><br />The Clearing Cafe: A cozy spot offering coffee and light snacks near Forest Park.<br /><br />Starbucks (St. Johns area): A reliable chain offering the usual favorites.<br /><br />Dining Options<br /><br />Cornelius Pass Roadhouse: A historic brewpub offering great food and drinks.<br /><br />Tastebud: Known for its wood-fired pizzas and farm-to-table dishes.<br /><br />Tavern on Kruse: An upscale option for American cuisine and cocktails.<br /><br />Shopping and Entertainment<br /><br />St. Johns Farmer’s Market: A great place for fresh produce and local','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-896345924356452882/original/c49b52eb-2bc1-4c73-b588-231a34b9cdd5.jpeg',148853179,89,'45.5970855','-122.7880667',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,141.00,2,365,86,4.92,896345924356452882),(3305,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/896623531301605289','Gorgeous Basement apartment','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay. Large basement apartment with gorgeous view, amazing amenities, close to Woodstock and Sell-wood, walking distance  to max line and bus stop, private bathroom and refrigerator. Pet friendly . View of the creek. Close to play ground. California king tempurapedic bed. Extra large tv.','Small hidden neighborhood in outer Southeast Portland. Safe and clean. We are very close to Sellwood, and Woodstock. We are in Southeast Portland. We are walking distance to the max and to the bus stop. Pretty much anything in Portland is about 20 minutes away unless you were going to woodstock or Sellwood or other places in southeast','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a51cb51b-e383-43ea-9414-a79abe9f7b7d.jpg',118259966,72,'45.46842','-122.55624',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,30,62,29,4.86,896623531301605289),(3306,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/897208367466405759','Hidden Gem-Sellwood-king bed','Charming house, trendy with an amazing open concept kitchen. It has been thoughtfully decorated to make your stay comfortable, enjoyable and private. You can expect very clean, well appointed, cozy, spacious and turn- key accommodations. <br />It is the perfect alternative to a hotel, providing a cost savings, convenience, and all the comforts of a home. Ideal for corporate housing & families with relocation needs. Small service dogs ONLY upon request and approval.','This neighborhood doesn\'t get any better! You have the water front, parks, great restaurants, bars, coffee shops and stores all within biking/walking distance, making it really convenient for all your needs and JUST MINUTES AWAY FROM DOWNTOWN!  Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike, there are bike lanes and trails, road connectivity to Downtown and most of the attractions in Portland. Sellwood-Moreland is considered one of the best places to live in Oregon. It offers residents an urban feel. Many families and young professionals live in Sellwood-Moreland. One of the best things about this very walkable neighborhood is how incredibly friendly, safe and clean it is!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-897208367466405759/original/37c489be-f9d5-4219-a7cd-37e3fef620bc.jpeg',213350724,20,'45.4606143591197','-122.64820051434782',1,4,1.00,3.00,3.00,219.00,30,365,3,5.00,897208367466405759),(3307,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/897256146402650825','The Empire: Cozy luxury studio, steps to 23rd!','Welcome to The Empire, located in one of Portland\'s most walkable and transit-friendly neighborhoods, Nob Hill! This fully remodeled, professionally designed studio apartment is just steps away from world-famous 23rd Avenue and hundreds of eateries, pubs, breweries and shops. With luxury finishes, curated design elements, and an unbelievably comfy King-size bed this is the perfect home for enjoying everything Portland has to offer. Come Stay in a beautifully restored piece of Portland\'s history!','The Nob Hill/23rd Street area is easily Portland\'s most popular district, with its bevy of art galleries, high-end restaurants, breweries, local shops, and cafes, as well as its proximity to the Timbers Stadium, Downtown, and the Pearl District. The Walk Score of this house is 97 and there is nothing you can\'t walk to, such as:<br /><br />• Papa Haydn<br />• Salt & Straw<br />• Lush<br />• Timbers Stadium<br />• Barista<br />• Cinema 21<br />• Mio Sushi<br />• Trader Joe\'s<br />• Whole Foods<br />• The Fireside<br />• Boxer Ramen<br />• MAC<br />• Little Big Burger<br />• Blue Star Donuts<br />...and too many more to list!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-897256146402650825/original/b2ebcd49-fab6-4667-bab8-df796520a707.jpeg',500247539,27,'45.5281441','-122.6977315',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,30,365,3,4.67,897256146402650825),(3308,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/897258314573927843','The Piano Room','Enjoy a stylish experience in a  centrally-located spacious craftsman house. Close to numerous bars, restaurants, and second-hand stores, the piano room is a perfect place to rest your head and loose yourself in playful sounds of classical music. This 10-min neighborhood between Hawthorne and Belmont has everything you need in walking distance.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-897258314573927843/original/d823de96-ad84-4435-8fa5-1a344237a0d2.jpeg',20673854,32,'45.51324','-122.64922',2,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,48.00,1,10,118,4.90,897258314573927843),(3309,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/897391468276692529','The Black Studio: Modern, Private Guesthouse','Welcome to our cozy and charming 360 square foot studio nestled in the heart of the Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood in Northeast Portland, just a few minutes away from the vibrant Alberta Arts district. Our place is ideal for solo travelers or couples seeking a comfortable and intimate space; our place offers all the amenities you need for a memorable stay, including: <br />- Fast WiFi at over 200 Mbps a minute,<br />- Heating and cooling, <br />- A stocked kitchen,<br />- Free parking on the premises, <br />and more!','The Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood of Portland, Oregon is located in the city\'s northeast section, on Alameda Ridge with views of Downtown, the Willamette River, and the Cascades. Majority of the historic homes in the area were built in the early 1900\'s. There\'s plenty of restaurants and stores in the area to grab a bite or do some retail therapy.<br /><br />We are located near the Alberta Arts district, one of the most sought after Portland neighborhoods. Alberta Street, the main drag through that neighborhood, has many newly renovated retail storefronts and restaurant space. These are mixed in with older businesses that have been there forever. The shopping area can now only be considered trendy. There is a strong focus on indie designers, handcrafted items, and boutique shops.<br /><br />Most of the shops lining Alberta Street highlight handmade local designer clothing, paper mache’ lamps, and imported gifts from afar. Alberta art galleries and shops showcase some fine local work. S','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-897391468276692529/original/b110f428-24cf-4482-bb07-88e67439b4fa.jpeg',215058058,46,'45.5480732','-122.6298727',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,73.00,2,365,70,4.97,897391468276692529),(3310,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/898027816707264119','Hawthorne House in Portland','Unique century-old duplex home with original wood flooring, plenty of natural light, and thoughtfully curated vintage and second-hand furniture throughout. Located near some of Portland\'s best spots for eating, thrifting, and entertainment. It\'s giving Portland charm!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-898027816707264119/original/b0e14d23-44ea-48cd-bcda-323dcfcc7b21.jpg',136296935,25,'45.51207','-122.63626',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,30,1125,55,4.80,898027816707264119),(3311,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/898059556478835853','95 Walk Score /AC+Heat+Laundry /Shops+Restaurants','Enjoy a cozy experience at this centrally-located townhome! A luxury Portland 2 bedroom, 2022 build with a yard. No matter your age, lifestyle, or interests, you are bound to find something to love in the nearby Mississippi, Williams, and Alberta neighborhoods. A close walk to several parks, restaurants, food carts and bars. Close to the airport and a 10 min drive Downtown.  Ample FREE street parking in-neighborhood.','The property is located on a quiet street that is a couple blocks away from local restaurants, shops, bars, and other fun attractions. Skip the rental car! We are right smack in the middle of it all. The house is walking distance to the best of Portland: Williams Street, Alberta Arts District and Mississippi Ave. Only one block from Portland’s most popular bike corridor. We are no more than 15 minutes by car to anything in Portland. No joke - the location can\'t be beat!<br /><br />Williams street– 1 block away<br />Great Coffee shops, bars, restaurants, + food carts – 20+ within 10 min walk<br />New Seasons Grocery Store: 2 min walk<br />EEM – NY Times top 50 restaurant 2021– 8 min walk','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODk4MDU5NTU2NDc4ODM1ODUz/original/6abe4fc0-7a79-4cc0-9772-ac6ee937d801.jpeg',400237209,26,'45.54806118356353','-122.6635605718257',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,180,32,5.00,898059556478835853),(3312,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/898483410783527884','Dog-friendly 2BR, walk to Division & Hawthorne','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-898483410783527884/original/c21955b9-43fa-462f-ba74-485e495c8ce1.jpeg',111797012,25,'45.50565925423474','-122.64317946442208',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,172.00,2,1125,3,4.33,898483410783527884),(3313,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/898636578550204799','Architect Built A New, Modern, Cute Origami Studio','Unwind in this serene and stylish studio.<br /><br />Welcome to a beautiful, secure, and contemporary studio perfect for travelers exploring the Portland Metro area. Immaculately clean and modern, this fully furnished and spacious studio is located in North Portland, just minutes from downtown, the airport, and I-5 for quick access to all destinations. Built in 2019, the building offers a safe and tranquil residential environment, allowing you to enjoy the charm of Portland city life.','Piedmont is a neighborhood in Portland, Oregon with a population of 6,867. Piedmont is in Multnomah County and is one of the best places to live in Oregon. Living in Piedmont offers residents an urban suburban mix feel and most residents own their homes. In Piedmont there are a lot of bars, restaurants, coffee shops, and parks. Many young professionals live in Piedmont and residents tend to be liberal. The public schools in Piedmont are above average.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6ODk4NjM2NTc4NTUwMjA0Nzk5/original/e3b808ca-a246-4a3c-96a5-bc132596acb7.jpeg',516390143,48,'45.57354362367735','-122.6677140819878',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,76.00,1,30,7,5.00,898636578550204799),(3314,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/898921729130447606','Guest Suite - SW PDX Hillsdale','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.<br /><br />You\'ll have the entire lower level apartment to yourself.  Enjoy a private bathroom, kitchenette and outdoor patio.  10min drive to downtown andthe bustling Inner East Portland, and easy access to two frequent bus lines.  Walking distance to food carts, shops, restaurants, & brewery.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5820fb16-a833-4586-ab60-9149b092cc29.jpg',153132135,31,'45.47864','-122.7001',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,72.00,2,365,58,4.66,898921729130447606),(3315,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/899603714273138617','Lofted Eastmoreland Guesthouse','Clean, light-filled gem in the historic, tree-lined SE Portland neighborhood of Eastmoreland! This quiet guest house is tucked off the street behind the main house leading you to your own private entrance. The space is a calm sanctuary with easy access to the hustle & bustle of the city.<br /><br />With public transport & some of our favorite spots near like Sellwood & Woodstock neighborhoods, Reed College, and the Rhododendron Garden, there is plenty to see and do during your visit!','Close to everything you could need. Neighborhood is lush with beautiful landscaping and trees.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-899603714273138617/original/75f884f2-d94e-4d00-9c65-79f8095b6d7b.jpeg',516607928,5,'45.4764071','-122.628567',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,179.00,2,365,6,5.00,899603714273138617),(3316,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/899977289283083842','Bright, 1BR Alameda apartment in central location','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-899977289283083842/original/cfa4d4e6-485d-43d3-950b-a2860d6f9f83.jpeg',111797012,19,'45.54667','-122.63893',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,122.00,2,1125,2,5.00,899977289283083842),(3317,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/900300707915080944','Bright Studio with Private Entry & Patio','Enjoy a cozy stay in SE Portland at our newly renovated light-filled basement studio. Highlights include a modern Japandi-style kitchen with induction cooktop and smart oven, a cozy reading nook to get lost in a book and watch the famous Portland rain, and a new all-in-one washer/dryer. Centrally located in the Brooklyn neighborhood, it\'s a few minutes walk to two light rail stations and a just a block away from a beautiful park. You have everything you need for a comfortable stay!','Brooklyn is a quiet neighborhood just minutes from downtown and blocks from the public light rail transportation (MAX) line. The Aladdin Theater (a sweet concert venue) is just a few blocks north. Brooklyn has two beautiful neighborhood parks with playgrounds and shaded picnic spots, a few cute coffee shops like Rose City Coffee and Adapt Cafe, and eateries like Meta Pizza, Botto\'s BBQ, Original Hotcake House. We\'re walking distance from all the bustle of Division Street and not far from the Sellwood Riverfront Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-900300707915080944/original/d8c27007-118c-4712-9422-22dcea5f4a82.jpeg',6339111,56,'45.49214838585785','-122.65127872198939',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,80.00,30,60,5,5.00,900300707915080944),(3318,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/901645800107754984','The Martins Street Retreat Full House','Enjoy a stay entirely private for you and your party in a home in the Mt. Scott-Arleta neighborhood of Portland. With activities and amenities nearby, and local transportation a stone throw away, make this destination an ideal launching pad for your Northwest trip. Included comforts are streaming cable TV, Disney+, Hulu, DVDs, video games, free wifi, board games, table games, and much more.','Access to Mount Scott Park and community center (closed for renovation until 2025), the Mercado, Woodstock blvd., neighborhood restaurants and bars on Foster rd., provide plenty of activities and amenities in the nearby area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-901645800107754984/original/dc74d412-bb60-43f3-b496-c18b68dc458a.jpeg',88737989,65,'45.47857','-122.58547',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,26,4.92,901645800107754984),(3319,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/903704475289320456','Urban Serenity: The Modern Auto Loft with a View','This newly renovated kitschy Airbnb located above Green Drop Garage boasts trendy decor and a touch of urban charm. Enjoy our spacious balcony and unwind in the fresh Oregon air!<br /><br />Located near Reed College and the Rhododendron Garden, you\'ll find yourself immersed in the natural beauty of the area. After a day of exploring, retreat to our stylish accommodations, or continue venturing out to Portland\'s thriving arts scene, renowned restaurants, and eclectic city vibe.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-903704475289320456/original/1297f77b-a693-4908-b6e3-d42172c250db.jpeg',23133356,61,'45.48483','-122.63703',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,94.00,30,365,11,4.82,903704475289320456),(3320,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/904346162900783284','Cozy PDX Hideout, Ideal Location','Welcome Friends!  I\'m excited to host you!<br /><br />This is a daylight basement unit...but don\'t let that turn you off. Everyone who stays here raves about how comfortable and cozy it is. 200+ 5star reviews on the previous account! ...& fyi, pics brighter than apartment usually is. Ceilings 6\'9 doorways 6\'0<br /><br />Add-ons (please notify host if 3rd bed is needed)<br /><br />- >4 guests: $50 per person/night <br />- <4 guests that require 3rd bed: $50/night<br />Baby Crib: $35/night on request<br /><br />Any questions? Ask! :)<br /><br />-David','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-904346162900783284/original/56b286a3-c55f-4156-8703-348be44c742e.png',2032871,9,'45.55162','-122.66903',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,124.00,1,1125,50,4.96,904346162900783284),(3321,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/904442113720967318','Townhouse studio loft, off-street parking, ECONO','This studio apartment is in the heart of the up-and-coming Foster-Powell neighborhood. Just go for a short walk and you\'re sure to get a taste of Portland. Foster also enjoys easy access to downtown Portland, the Airport, and many beautiful surrounding areas.<br /><br />This studio townhouse-style apartment has vaulted ceilings, giving it a spacious feel. It has unfinished stair flooring and a few other unfinished areas, and the dishwasher needs 2b replaced - making for a good stay with a great discount!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b6e4ad11-c7ac-4d35-a726-03832d0ca1df.jpg',98430746,65,'45.489419583655284','-122.59712420403956',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,9,4.78,904442113720967318),(3322,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/905231363687603998','Duplex Upper Unit, prime locale','Great central inner east side location nestled on a quiet residential street.  Less than three blocks to Whole Foods, restaurants, ice cream, bars and the prettiest park in the city.  Two friendly pups living downstairs.<br />Walk Score: 94<br />Bike Score: 90','Kerns / Laurelhurst.  28th street (3.5 blocks away) is a great strip with bars, restaurants, and Whole Foods.  Laurelhurst Park (4 blocks away) is a gorgeous and peaceful park with old growth trees and a duck pond. The neighborhood is very walkable and family friendly.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/b2a589e7-fe1f-4409-9be2-c97fa3ff3861.jpg',497612770,12,'45.52368696522956','-122.63276181111449',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,30,25,4.88,905231363687603998),(3323,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/905888293109301476','Modern & Luxurious Boho Getaway (10 min to PDX)','*Lush, tree views throughout!*<br />Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located newly built 3 bed 3 bath townhouse! ~10 Min to PDX & ~15 min to Downtown! The area is very walkable and is across from a park! Lots of trendy, local shops and dining nearby! 1 well behaved dog weighing 60 pounds or less is allowed!<br /><br />Long term discount available!','The unit sits across from Fernhill park on 42nd Avenue. It is also walking distance to a Biketown station, Portland Community College, the new U of O’s Ballmer Institute for Children’s Behavioral Health Campus, and many shops and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/5d6cff24-7055-48a6-8d60-0442fd683ded.jpg',32831349,21,'45.56644016959822','-122.61922161783444',1,8,3.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,15,4.93,905888293109301476),(3324,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/906033198265947735','Roomy Townhouse near Portland','Bring family or friends to this great place with lots of room for fun.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-906033198265947735/original/f4426289-79c5-4bbc-9dc4-05725e5e22d3.jpeg',377397572,53,'45.4516484916237','-122.72300481679858',2,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,60.00,30,365,0,1.00,906033198265947735),(3325,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/907311141960761779','Vintage Charm & Modern Appeal in Downtown NW','This Vintage Building & Immaculate Modern Condo in the Heart of NW Portland is waiting for you! Superbly located, you\'ll be able to walk, explore and experience the Goose Hollow, NW and Pearl districts with ease. Providence Park, The Crystal Ballroom, Powells Bookstore and Whole Foods are all less than a 5 minute stroll. With a walk score of 99+ this is the definition of city living! The building is quiet and has secured entry. As a former hotel, The Empress has distinctive charm and character.','This Vintage Building & Immaculate Modern Condo in the Heart of NW Portland is waiting for you! Superbly located, you\'ll be able to walk, explore and experience the Goose Hollow, NW and Peal districts with ease. Providence Park (PTFC🤟🏼❤️). The Crystal Ballroom, Powell\'s Bookstore and Whole Foods are all less than a 5 minute stroll. With a walk score of 99+ this is the definition of city living! The building is quiet and has secured entry. As a former Hotel, The Empress has distinctive charm and character.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-907311141960761779/original/18acc1f0-985f-4af4-8fe4-7750c5a9ca99.jpeg',3380883,27,'45.5236','-122.68643',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,103.00,31,89,7,5.00,907311141960761779),(3326,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/908014927769295067','Tabor Hideaway','Nestled in vibrant Portland, Oregon, this vacation hideaway is a perfect escape. With its own private outdoor entrance, this cozy space features a reading chair, perfectly plush mattress, and a fully equipped kitchenette! Whether you choose to venture out and explore the city with the easily accessible and fast FX bus line nearby, or simply relax in the tranquility of the hideaway, this little vacation space offers a magical retreat from the outside world 💌','South Tabor is a beautiful, quiet, and accessible neighborhood. Just a 10-minute walk to Mt. Tabor park, and easy access to the FX bus lines!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-908014927769295067/original/db031757-4cbc-4cb8-af0c-4747c946bf46.jpeg',167270,37,'45.5020404','-122.5865534',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,96.00,2,10,56,4.96,908014927769295067),(3327,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/908304649068689178','Garden studio in Laurelhurst','Cozy, sunlit studio apartment with great morning light from two skylights overhead.<br /><br />Our studio is the perfect place to explore Portland from. We\'re a short walk to the best of historic Southeast Portland--Belmont, Stark, Burnside, Hawthorne, and Division streets. Many of Portland’s beloved restaurants, bars, and coffee shops, along with towering pines and spring-fed pond of Laurelhurst Park, are just around the corner.<br /><br />Enjoy the garden patio for morning coffee or drinks at night.','The studio is about 15-20 minutes from the airport. A 10-minute drive to The Pearl downtown. <br /><br />Laurelhurst is our favorite neighborhood to explore by foot. There\'s much to see--lovely old Craftsman houses, gardens, shops, and more. We\'ll have maps and guides available to help orient you in the city.<br /><br />By foot:<br />-3 minutes to Belmont or Stark (restaurants, shops, & H Mart)<br />-5 minutes to Laurelhurst Park<br />-10 minutes to Burnside (restaurants & shops)<br />-12 minutes to Whole Foods Grocery<br />-15 minutes to Hawthorne or trendy 28th Street (restaurants & shops)<br />-15 minutes to Fred Meyer Grocery<br />-20-25 minutes to Division Street (restaurants & shops)<br /><br />Portland is also famously bikeable. There are bike rental stations just a short walk from the studio.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-908304649068689178/original/bb63568e-d7e0-48b2-a025-0daeb184846d.jpeg',12727712,16,'45.51767','-122.63171',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,2,365,72,4.96,908304649068689178),(3328,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/908743277651383231','Modern ADU near Penninsula Park','Welcome to your awesome rental, perfectly situated 1 mile north of vibrant Alberta street! This fully furnished basement ADU is waiting to become your cozy sanctuary, complete with 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, and a spacious fenced backyard for you and your dog to enjoy the great outdoors.<br /><br />Step into a world of modern comfort as you enter this beautifully designed living space with gigabit fiber internet. The furnishings have been curated to create a contemporary and inviting atmosphere.','Convenience meets excitement in this fantastic Piedmont location. Alberta street, with its eclectic mix of boutiques, art galleries, cafes, and restaurants, is within easy reach. Explore the vibrant local scene, indulge in mouthwatering cuisine, and immerse yourself in the lively cultural hub that Portland is renowned for.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-908743277651383231/original/94e4ffe9-7832-40b9-a8de-f38093bd9012.jpeg',188588035,45,'45.5720316253388','-122.66111357503759',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,70.00,30,365,4,5.00,908743277651383231),(3329,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/909392262743592919','Tasteful bungalow in quiet area','Tasteful one-level bungalow in quiet neighborhood. Fully remodeled throughout with open kitchen, dining and living room. French doors lead to private deck and backyard. Extra spacious primary bedroom with built-in closet and queen bed. Second bedroom with queen bed and ample natural light. Fully remodeled bathroom with original built-ins. Hardwood floors throughout. Fast wifi and smart TV. The property has a fully separate basement apartment that is used minimally by the owner.','Beaumont-Wilshire','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-909392262743592919/original/b42eef15-e97f-4b73-9dc6-1e692dd388f4.jpeg',6647211,46,'45.55681','-122.62265',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,365,4,5.00,909392262743592919),(3330,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/909480263886281046','Luxurious king bed suite! Free Garage Parking','This high-end downtown apartment on the 6th floor offers breathtaking views of the city. The apartment is furnished with modern furniture and features a spacious living area with ample natural light. Equipped with underground parking, and access to nearby restaurants, entertainment venues, and shopping areas all within walking distance, this  lofts prime location make this contemporary style apartment an ideal choice for those seeking a sophisticated and comfortable urban living experience.','Pearl District','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-909480263886281046/original/ece985b4-524b-484b-92cf-07eea5187a5d.jpeg',439103919,2,'45.527640491191974','-122.67910999434578',1,4,1.00,0.00,2.00,120.00,2,28,60,4.90,909480263886281046),(3331,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/910045500215544034','Sunstone House XL Master, A/C, Desk, sink/vanity.','Welcome to our charming urban retreat, where extended stays of 31 days or longer are a breeze! Nestled in the heart of the vibrant city, our cozy oasis is the perfect home away from home for medical professionals, digital nomads, and business travelers on extended assignments. Whether you\'re seeking a comfortable space for work or a peaceful haven to unwind after a long day, our inviting living space is ready to cater to your needs during your extended stay.','The Kenton, Arbor Lodge, and Portsmouth neighborhoods are found in North Portland, south of St. Johns and on the peninsula between the Willamette and Columbia Rivers. North Portland has access to parks, quieter urban neighborhoods, excellent public transit options. Living in Kenton offers residents a dense suburban feel. In Kenton there are a lot of bars, restaurants, coffee shops, and parks. Many families and young professionals live in Kenton.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-910045500215544034/original/4eae7567-8ff4-4833-b752-2defb61bbe9a.jpeg',493461219,55,'45.57777','-122.70135',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,400.00,30,180,2,5.00,910045500215544034),(3332,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/910913013732711554','Colorful & Cozy Basement Getaway','Welcome to our Colorful, Cozy, Basement Studio Apartment! <br /><br />This delightful space comfortably hosts up to 4 guests. Unwind and enjoy our inviting media setup, featuring a large projector for movie nights and gaming sessions. The space boasts essential amenities, including a private entrance, modern kitchen, bathroom, AC, and added convenience of a washer & dryer. <br /><br />Come experience the perfect blend of comfort, style and functionality in our charming basement retreat.<br /><br />Permit #23-040776-000-00-HO','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-910913013732711554/original/1fa48e29-42e4-40b9-8a1f-bedc16fd27a2.jpeg',519271828,11,'45.52772','-122.61009',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,133.00,2,90,2,5.00,910913013732711554),(3333,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/911907936546162036','BEST Location! Upscale, beautiful Slabtown home!','Beautiful, newly built SLABTOWN home, equipped with high-end finishings and decor. BEST NW location! Walking distance to: NW 23rd, the Pearl, some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, boutique shopping, New Seasons Grocery Market, Good Sam., Dove Lewis, and NW-based corp. offices. Comfortable living space, two balconies, two ensuite private bedrooms & bathrooms. Modern kitchen includes stainless appliances + wine fridge. Home gym w/ Peloton, TRX, Yoga Mats. Pvt garage prking w/ 240v outlet!','According to TravelPortland, Slabtown is tucked between two trendy Northwest Portland neighborhoods (the Pearl and Nob Hill), and is a unique mix of residential and industrial buildings. The trendy area, which boasts walkable streets, plentiful shopping, coffee, restaurants and art galleries, is within walking distance of many other local hot spots. From here, you can easily access downtown, the Pearl District, Nob Hill and Forest Park, either on foot or via Portland Streetcar. But feel free to stay put — everything you need can be found in this lively, friendly neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTExOTA3OTM2NTQ2MTYyMDM2/original/cc30418c-fdc8-4c67-bf47-08d8ea8140c7.jpeg',33434004,27,'45.531661','-122.6907526',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,260.00,2,365,62,4.98,911907936546162036),(3334,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/912458674669356950','Modern Penthouse •Free Parking •Balcony +Amenities','Step into the centrally-located, stylish Penthouse featuring expansive 12ft ceilings and a million-dollar balcony view. Situated in an area with a Walk Score of 100, a Biker\'s Paradise score of 96, and a Transit Score of 93, this space seamlessly blends luxury with convenience. Whether it\'s a relaxing getaway or a business trip, welcome to a spacious retreat designed for both comfort and sophistication.','Located in the heart of downtown Portland, the Pearl District is best known for its wide array of restaurants, breweries, galleries and shops. Walk around and explore some of Portland\'s best known attractions including the famous Powell\'s City of Books. Fast access to I-405 and Burnside Street, 100% Walk Score, 96% Bike Score, and 93% Trains Score.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-912458674669356950/original/485ad7c0-108e-4f03-94ad-f29189f0eedd.jpeg',459606784,2,'45.52474','-122.68288',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,140.00,1,30,51,4.86,912458674669356950),(3335,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/912543945106086277','Posh Victorian Studio (31 day min-no tax)','Stylish studio apartment located in a charming Victorian building with a popular Mexican food cart right out front. Located just 2 blocks from one of Portland\'s most popular areas~NW 23rd (Trendy-third) Avenue -a 1.5 mile stretch of eateries & unique shops. A bus stop is 2 blocks away, downtown is only 6 minutes via car & Forest Park is a 15 minute walk away. The studio is in the front of the building and there can be some street noise so not a good fit for noise sensitive guests.','The NW Alphabet District has all kinds of wonderful shops and restaurants.  There is a lot of hustle and bustle going on around here. We are situated amongst residential homes, commercial businesses and next to a highway overpass. There is a popular Mexican food cart located on the property typically open 10-6.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-912543945106086277/original/33ec7ff2-fd7c-4f26-8703-7bbc05c2ba10.jpeg',98202133,27,'45.53878402617625','-122.69713664838298',1,1,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,31,365,4,5.00,912543945106086277),(3336,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/912548820450963364','Comfy 2 bed Victorian Apt (31 day min-no tax)','Comfortable 2 bedroom apartment located in a in charming Victorian building with a popular Mexican food cart right out front.  We are located just 2 blocks away from one of Portland\'s most popular shopping and eating areas~NW 23rd (Trendy-third) Avenue where you\'ll find a huge variety of coffee shops, restaurants and unique shops. A bus stop is 2 blocks away or get downtown in 6 minutes via car. Enjoy Forest Park-only a 15 minute walk away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/19223f6b-f339-4119-bb74-327fd695c63e.jpg',98202133,27,'45.53755','-122.69771',1,6,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,31,365,0,1.00,912548820450963364),(3337,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/913029717242134731','Urban NE 3bd home + bonus, fenced yard & garage','Welcome to our charming 4-bedroom, 2-bath home with a fenced yard, tuck under garage, office/work space, AC, huge light filled living room and en-suite bedroom. Our spacious and comfortable home is the perfect retreat for families or groups seeking a delightful stay in the heart of NE Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-913029717242134731/original/4bae7062-a2d7-40e6-bc51-83d3ece196e5.jpeg',221421926,1,'45.56047','-122.62793',1,6,2.50,4.00,3.00,150.00,31,365,1,5.00,913029717242134731),(3338,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/913267448023771763','Whole Unit with Free Parking','3 unit in one house. Rent out a unit in a near Portland\'s attractions. This unit, \"NO SHARED\" located on the first floor ensures complete privacy entire spaces. Enjoy easy access to Montavilla bars and restaurants, or take a leisurely walk to the top of Mt. Tabor Park for stunning city views during your picnic. The home is conveniently situated near the airport, downtown, public transit, and major freeways, making it an ideal starting point for exploring everything Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/1a306a16-b42f-42a7-81b5-1e21b73b4d51.jpg',380057237,10,'45.515