e block north of lively Belmont Street.<br /><br />Within walking distance to innumerable restaurants, shops, and bars on nearby Belmont, Hawthorne, Division, and SE 28\'th streets. Located less than 20 minutes from the airport and within 90 minutes of Mt. Hood, Willamette Valley wine country, and the Oregon coast.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-915273520524194693/original/f27d98c5-35ff-4098-874d-c7205fb96291.jpeg',145090401,16,'45.518492013394415','-122.63182827494224',1,6,2.50,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,915273520524194693),(3342,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/915963764943538408','Impeccable Home, Pet Friendly, BBQ, Next to Park','Sitting on the edge of the west hills next to Bridlemile Elementary and Hamilton park this exquisite home is such an incredible location to explore and enjoy all Portland and the Pacific Northwest has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-915963764943538408/original/f24df3e3-dad2-4c1d-b86f-c7d38d7ddbb9.jpeg',62261998,70,'45.49201026126763','-122.72658361661505',1,5,3.00,2.00,3.00,233.00,2,29,13,5.00,915963764943538408),(3343,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/916199820963776027','96 walk score ~ Victorian-style home ~ Unit B','Experience an authentic Portland getaway at The Vic PDX, our beautifully restored 1885 Victorian-style duplex, where original character meets modern amenities. Located in the lively Buckman neighborhood, walk to Portland\'s best food, drink, and entertainment spots. Stay at The Vic and enjoy Portland like a local!','Welcome to Buckman, Portland\'s vibrant and artsy neighborhood on the east side of the Willamette River. Nestled next to the trendy Hawthorne and Belmont neighborhoods, this eclectic gem boasts historic charm with beautifully preserved Victorian and Craftsman-style homes, giving it a bohemian touch. Get ready to indulge in a delightful culinary journey at the local cafes, restaurants, and bars. Buckman\'s commitment to supporting local businesses adds to its unique community spirit. Join a diverse and welcoming community, and enjoy easy access to downtown and nearby attractions or walk to neighboring Hawthorne and Belmont neighborhoods! Buckman has it all – history, creativity, and a whole lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-916199820963776027/original/e138dafd-2fc3-4401-b797-95ca5eca9a86.jpeg',32095859,32,'45.51785','-122.64981',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,1,365,93,4.98,916199820963776027),(3344,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/916995874474822725','Bedroom w/En Suite Bath near OHSU, Lewis & Clark','Welcome to my beautiful PDX garden home, close to OHSU, Lewis & Clark, Multnomah Village, Lake Oswego, and more! My name is Juliana, and I live downstairs with my two sweet pups, Leo and BooBoo. I put a lot of thought and care into making my home warm and welcoming, with high end amenities such as Pendleton blankets, and a fully equipped kitchen. Whether you\'re looking for privacy, a place to play games and make friends, or a little bit of both, this is a great and safe place to call home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-916995874474822725/original/2e13180b-e9b9-498f-98c9-84b61cee872a.jpeg',29056793,53,'45.451666035018604','-122.71432551033207',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,2,365,17,5.00,916995874474822725),(3345,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/917481835900528362','Charming Guest Suite in the Heart of Hawthorne','LOCATION, location, location! A peaceful in-home guest suite in the heart of Hawthorne awaits. Centrally located in Southeast Portland, easy walking distance to numerous hip restaurants, bars & shops on Hawthorne and Division. Gorgeous walkable neighborhoods with tons of Portland charm. Step back in time in this 1910 Craftsman home with warm inviting gardens. Enjoy the fabulous front porch while sipping your morning coffee or the lush backyard oasis before heading out on your next PDX adventure!','Charming neighborhoods in every direction full of unique Craftsman homes with gorgeous gardens. Walkers paradise!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-917481835900528362/original/55b2c75f-2e17-432b-a027-d7f0f93d8cdd.jpeg',80824107,8,'45.5070966','-122.6211928',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,2,14,35,5.00,917481835900528362),(3346,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/918090546520538102','Serene Oasis: Swim Spa, Sauna, 10 Min to Downtown','Escape to the epitome of luxury in this remodeled in one of Portland\'s most prestigious neighborhoods. Nestled within a lush, secluded forest and accessed via a private driveway (shared with another house), this home offers unparalleled privacy. Unwind and rejuvenate in your very own sauna or take a refreshing dip in the 14 foot swim spa for the ultimate relaxation or sit around the indoor fireplace. The house is located 10 min drive to Downtown Portland and major attractions within the city.','Situated in one of Portland\'s premiere neighborhoods, you\'ll have easy access to the city\'s finest attractions, restaurants, and parks. Whether you\'re exploring the local scene or retreating to your private oasis, this home offers the best of both worlds.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-918090546520538102/original/0c775c0a-c2f8-431a-8825-a573840b488e.jpeg',249997321,54,'45.5072149','-122.70848',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,221.00,2,180,50,4.94,918090546520538102),(3347,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/918455436573148298','Floating Home on the Willamette River!','FIRST TIME ON AIRBNB- DISCOUNTED PRICE!<br /><br />This beautiful floating home is designed for those that enjoy living on the water. Enjoy living in this urban oasis close to Portland’s vibrant downtown. Comfortable, modern furniture with amenities, access to our brand-new wake surfing boat, and spacious living areas to enjoy during your stay.  Stunning rooftop setup allows for a panoramic view of our one of a kind, PNW beauty. Boating, SUP, or experiencing our water life from your deck chair is a must!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-918455436573148298/original/646d4e7e-bb1e-4895-989b-e4de859b35eb.jpeg',258097276,22,'45.4678464','-122.6684666',1,6,1.50,2.00,4.00,183.00,30,365,4,4.75,918455436573148298),(3348,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/918801856359066727','Bright Studio in Unique N Cully','This newly remodeled basement space is light-filled, cozy, industrial.<br />The airport is 10 min or less with easy access to major highways. Downtown is 20 min, the Alberta Arts district is a 7 min drive. 42nd street offers a park, pubs, food and other activities a mile away.<br />The apartment is designed for longer stays with off street parking and all of the basics for cooking and self maintenance . <br />Public transportation involves a 7 minute walk to the bus stop with  access to the transit system.','We love the unique and quiet North Cully neighborhood with its array of various vintages of homes, several on huge lots that include community gardens gorgeous landscaping and even a small farm.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-918801856359066727/original/fafc1a7e-59a8-4267-837d-c25068ac567b.jpeg',794622,21,'45.56528','-122.60827',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,56.00,30,365,1,5.00,918801856359066727),(3349,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/920269277018184160','The Black House Studio Unit #1 (North Portland)','The Black House Studio are cozy/serene spaces idea for the solo or duo traveler. They are situated in the Overlook neighborhood, one of the city’s many desirable neighborhoods and are close in proximity to the Mississippi and Albert Arts District. <br /><br />Located less than 10 minutes from downtown off the  I-5, you are in the middle of everything that PDX has to offer. The studios are just a short walk, bike ride or Lyft from local grocery stores, restaurants, nightlife, parks, entertainment and more.','The Overlook neighborhood in Portland is one of the city’s many desirable neighborhoods. Located north of the Pearl District across I-5, staying in Overlook puts you in the middle of everything that PDX has to offer, including great restaurants, nightlife, parks, entertainment and more. <br /><br />The studio is also located near the Mississippi & Alberta Arts Districts, the Adidas US Headquarters, University of Portland, Swan Island, the Kaiser Permanente Interstate Medical campus, and minutes from the Moda arena and Oregon Convention Center.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/c285c93d-ee21-4235-9acd-df0334a14f5d.jpg',38007422,13,'45.5567599','-122.6831454',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,365,13,4.92,920269277018184160),(3350,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/921712515998741477','Cozy Foster-Powell Portland GEM with Local Charm','Welcome to my cozy  Craftsman bungalow in bustling Foster Powell, Portland! With vintage charm and modern comfort, it\'s your ideal home base. Put on a record and relax in the vibey living space, make meals and memories in the well-equipped kitchen, or unwind on the front porch. A quick stroll to local eclectic shops, food carts, and bars. Hop on public transport or bike shares for all day exploration. Your perfect Portland stay begins here at this amazing family friendly central location!','Dive into the eclectic pulse of Foster Powell, Portland\'s hidden gem where vintage vibes meet contemporary eclectic-cool. Wander tree-lined streets adorned with a mix of historic Craftsman homes and modern abodes, mirroring the diversity of its residents. Foster Road, the neighborhood\'s beating heart, weaves a lively tapestry of local shops, trendy boutiques, and a kaleidoscope of eateries and food trucks. The Foster Powell Community Garden blooms with connections, hosting everything from gardening workshops to vibrant festivals. Street art whispers tales of creativity, turning walls into a vibrant canvas. Culinary adventures unfold in artisanal coffee shops like the Carnelian Coffee shop just steps away, the EastPort or Mercado food carts just .7mi away, and the legendary Assembly Brewing. As the sun sets, Foster Powell awakens, inviting you to explore quirky bars and historic pubs, savoring craft brews and artisanal cocktails. Parks like Kern Park, FoPo Park, and Powell Butte Nature ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-921712515998741477/original/f5df4742-1193-4066-a8c8-8c3045dc504b.jpeg',2275772,36,'45.4904491','-122.592589',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,112.00,2,370,67,4.94,921712515998741477),(3351,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/922076577301419678','Southwest PDX Casita near Max/Airport &  I84/205','Detached Portland guesthouse conveniently located in quiet neighborhood  8 minutes from the airport. Easy access to both I-84 and I-205. Portland Transit MAX Station located within walking distance, 4 minutes from guesthouse. With convenient access to both interstates and public transportation it\'s easy to explore Oregon. World famous Multnomah Falls, Mt. Hood and all of Portlands beautiful bridges are all easily accessed from our property. Owners live in main home if you need anything!','While being close to transportation hubs, Parkrose maintains a calm and residential atmosphere, offering a retreat from the hustle and bustle of the city.<br /><br />Parkrose is surrounded by the natural beauty of the Pacific Northwest. Multnomah Falls, one of Oregon\'s most iconic natural wonders, is a short drive away. The stunning vistas of Mt. Hood and the numerous picturesque bridges of Portland are also within reach.<br /><br />The neighborhood boasts a variety of local dining options, from family-owned restaurants to cozy cafes, where guests can savor a taste of Portland\'s culinary scene. <br /><br />Parkrose is known for its friendly and welcoming community, which adds to the overall comfort and appeal of the area.There are several parks and recreational areas nearby, providing opportunities for outdoor activities, picnics, and leisurely walks.<br /><br />Overall, Parkrose offers a balance of convenience and tranquility, making it an excellent choice for both travelers and those','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-922076577301419678/original/b199e97e-a92e-4188-91fb-fc762aa4532e.jpeg',368211725,40,'45.55706','-122.56338',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,106.00,30,1125,11,5.00,922076577301419678),(3352,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/922089321634259778','Alberta Arts Blue Bungalow','Welcome home! This house is full of adorable character. It\'s a 2 bedroom, 1 bath house in a very charming and walkable neighborhood. Located a few houses from booming Alberta street with many restaurants, bars, galleries, shops and coffee shops. The grocery store and pharmacy are also 2 blocks from the home. Kennedy School and the Alberta Theater are just a short stroll away! The house also has an attached, but completely seperate studio apartment that will be rented seperately.','This home is in the heart of the Alberta Arts District. There are many shops, restaurants, bars and galleries just steps from the front door. Such a fun and vibrant neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-922089321634259778/original/add95d4a-4cd6-4d8e-b2bb-11dee18fbd57.jpeg',320016841,1,'45.56012','-122.63321',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,156.00,30,365,1,5.00,922089321634259778),(3353,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/923162268964691788','Farmhouse Studio','Our 1909 Farmhouse sits on a large city lot, in the thriving Eliot neighborhood with many great restaurants, coffee shops, retail, shopping etc., all within walking distance. We are close to the Moda Center and the Convention Center, and about a 20 minute walk to downtown Portland. Our little space is super cute, very modern and cozy.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-923162268964691788/original/ca00a6b9-a41a-4119-b369-3c8e1ff3d0a6.jpeg',715222,26,'45.5425634','-122.6634739',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,99.00,30,365,35,4.94,923162268964691788),(3354,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/923267881103406541','The Little Blue ADU','Welcome to our cozy and inviting newly constructed ADU! With easy airport access and all that NE Portland offers, this charming space features new stainless appliances, quartz countertops, and an upstairs washer and dryer. With high ceilings and ample sunlight, this compact space feels surprisingly spacious. Located steps away from McMenamins Kennedy school, enjoy their soaking tub, restaurants, bars, gardens, and movie theater. Book now for a warm and delightful stay!','Located directly across the street from McMenamin\'s Kennedy School, the ADU can serve as a great way to access events held there and all they have to offer (If you don\'t know about their outdoor soaking pool, you should check it out!).  <br /><br />The area has a laid-back neighborhood vibe while also being close to airport access and nearby coffee shops and restaurants of Killingsworth and Alberta Streets.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-923267881103406541/original/dad62a75-3abf-4d66-b33f-d7323b3e31db.jpeg',1795866,1,'45.56437023140178','-122.63113126158714',1,4,1.50,2.00,3.00,70.00,2,1125,108,4.95,923267881103406541),(3355,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/923710029994345521','3 Rooms w/ City Views at Dossier Hotel!','Experience the very best of Oregon in downtown Portland. The property provides quick and hassle-free access to many of the state’s hidden gems, including the famed Portland Japanese Gardens, Portland Art Museum, Mission Theater, and Portland Saturday Market. The natural beauty of surrounding mountains, nearby lakes, and magnificent vistas is irresistible, offering numerous hiking, climbing, and kayaking options. Downtown Portland is renowned for its culinary diversity, museums, and artists.','- Tender Loving Empire - 0.2 mile; <br />- Portland Art Museum - 0.3 mile; <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park - 0.7 mile; <br />- Mission Theater - 0.9 mile; <br />- Portland Paddle Sports Center - 1.2 miles; <br />- Oregon Museum of Science & Industry - 1.7 miles; <br />- International Rose Test Garden - 1.8 miles; <br />- Japanese Garden - 2.4 miles; <br />- House of Vintage - 2.7 miles; <br />- Hoyt Arboretum - 3.4 miles; <br />- Portland International Airport - 12.0 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-923710029994345521/original/24e9f7bc-8add-4de9-8cce-b55d5c26114a.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52006','-122.68008',4,12,3.00,3.00,6.00,2.00,30,1125,0,1.00,923710029994345521),(3356,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/923995127784439421','Updated & Cozy Portland Home','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful place to stay in St John’s neighborhood of Portland. This home is updated with everything you could possibly need. Our neighborhood is friendly, calm & walkable to the shops and restaurants in the town of St. John’s','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-923995127784439421/original/8c22394e-9e1d-4801-ac12-9eecd4208ee0.jpeg',22331368,58,'45.59308079666039','-122.73890439675418',1,5,2.00,3.00,2.00,175.00,2,90,2,5.00,923995127784439421),(3357,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/924625971167213488','1BR downtown apt with streaming, full kitchen, W/D','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-924625971167213488/original/2fd3ad62-005a-4b04-9685-d812a2cedbb6.jpeg',111797012,23,'45.52613','-122.61998',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,149.00,2,1125,2,4.50,924625971167213488),(3358,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/924785367893536388','A cozy guest room','The room is setup for my guests such as  friends or family. It may not be perfect like a hotel room, but you can stay comfortably and feel at home. <br /><br />You\'ll have a private room and bathroom. Also you can use the kitchen and dining area if you want.<br /><br />Note: The room is 3rd floor, no elevator. Please take off your shoes in the house.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-924785367893536388/original/b9f49596-5f13-41b5-9505-5983083b973d.jpeg',10548064,52,'45.5257072100483','-122.6067995563646',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,45,0,1.00,924785367893536388),(3359,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/924891373027461452','BEST location (99 walk score!) low clean fee','Elegantly stylish flat located in the desirable NW area of Portland. This 1,000 sq. ft. accommodation comprises the basement floor of a historical Portland home. Walk to everything: public transit, coffee shops, restaurants, bars, Trader Joe’s, yoga/gyms, hiking trails. The Pearl District with its eclectic mix of shops, restaurants, and bars, is just blocks away. <br />I know all the best places to eat/drink/and hangout, so you will have the insider\'s guide.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-924891373027461452/original/ffba28b8-b677-487f-b3da-09cb4ae2f7c5.jpeg',3823371,27,'45.52805598359648','-122.68949317628912',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,163.00,3,365,51,5.00,924891373027461452),(3360,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/925471616132982698','1-BR Condo w/ Private Parking','Immerse yourself in the best of Portland at this spacious and private end-unit condo in the heart of John\'s Landing. Just steps from the river, Zupan\'s Market, shopping, restaurants, and Willamette Park.<br /><br />This condo has everything you need for a comfortable and enjoyable stay, including a spacious living room with fireplace, fully equipped kitchen with dishwasher and washer/dryer, 1 bedroom/bath, private balcony, gated entry, free WiFi and parking.','Beautiful quiet neighborhood just minutes from downtown and across the street from the Willamette River.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-925471616132982698/original/983c1c7c-01a4-4a55-ad1d-cb31a4a6d5ef.jpeg',29332333,22,'45.47375','-122.67391',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,200.00,30,1125,2,4.50,925471616132982698),(3361,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/926827419231695106','Modern Basement Guest Suite with Piano','Private guest suite in the basement of our family home on a quiet block in Southeast Portland. Walk 3 blocks to Trader Joe’s, 6 blocks to Reed College campus (including a great track for runners) and a quick walk to coffee, brunch, and drug store. We’re an easy walk to beautiful Kenilworth Park - great for running, walking or picnicking. You’ll have easy access to public transportation and a 15 minute drive to downtown and other great Portland destinations. Musicians may enjoy playing our piano!','Located in the peaceful Reedview neighborhood, a few minutes from popular areas like Hawthorne, Woodstock, Sellwood and FoPo.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-926827419231695106/original/89cca3ea-ce0d-4b2b-8f93-ee918bd52c19.jpeg',304357232,61,'45.4884493','-122.6264846',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,2,5,17,5.00,926827419231695106),(3362,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/927178260072364040','\"Enchanted Haven: Joyful Abode\"','Experience the ultimate family retreat in our centrally located STR. Explore downtown Portland and the charming Eliot district on foot, with shops and restaurants at your doorstep. Enjoy our brand new, fully equipped kitchen and unwind in the fun backyard, complete with BBQ, fireplace, and playground.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-927178260072364040/original/42f6a1bf-5b71-40c2-a55f-4208a6edff73.jpg',197517322,26,'45.5430278','-122.6652453',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,210.00,1,30,68,4.94,927178260072364040),(3363,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/929266002843301947','Private room and Bath in downtown Portland','beautiful apartment with large room and bathroom','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/8eb7674d-cac0-4548-b71a-381f0441eca7.jpg',479014456,44,'45.50881','-122.67998',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,60.00,31,365,1,5.00,929266002843301947),(3364,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/929776897173652971','Center Rose City Condo','This unique condo, located in a pretty neighborhood in central NE Portland, is well-located for exploring on foot and by transit. Many food options and grocery stores are within a short walk.  Rose City Park golf course, RCP Bluff natural area,  and Normandale dog park are also nearby.<br />This single level unit is furnished with a personal collection of vintage furnishings and art. It features an amazing bathroom with huge walk-in shower.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-929776897173652971/original/fbe5a800-fefe-4f9a-91e4-230c558a1b15.jpeg',524133889,11,'45.5401144','-122.604195',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,86.00,30,30,0,1.00,929776897173652971),(3365,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/929905627129224951','Luxury Penthouse with Stunning Views & Fireplace','Tranquil Penthouse Retreat with City Views<br /><br />Experience the epitome of urban luxury in our spacious and stylish penthouse, where every detail is designed to elevate your stay to new heights of comfort and convenience. <br /><br />Located on the top floor of The Dorian, this meticulously appointed 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom sanctuary offers the perfect blend of sophistication and serenity for your next getaway.','Just a few minutes walking distance to well loved venue, The Revolution Hall (we suggest making reservations for their beautiful roof top bar, with incredible food, drink and Portland views. Also within one minutes walk to the well known Sandy Hut Bar and Grill which recently turned 100 years old and has become a popular Portland staple. We own a small bar downstairs as well called the Chandelier, stop by for a glass of wine or charcuterie board Wednesday through Saturday 4pm-11pm. Very close to the famous Voodoo Doughnuts and several businesses and well loved iconic Portland businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-929905627129224951/original/3bad8f9e-8723-481d-89fa-0a6bd401d67c.jpeg',474734231,32,'45.52223','-122.65099',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,389.00,1,28,16,4.75,929905627129224951),(3366,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/930562079745673610','Newly Built Modern Townhome','Welcome to our furnished 2 bed, 1.5 bath townhome in Portland, OR. Open floor plan, modern kitchen, cozy bedrooms, and convenient location. Perfect for professionals and short-term stays.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-930562079745673610/original/589da67f-2855-447f-b91f-d2a4e4964279.jpeg',524344892,55,'45.57825221420024','-122.7000070360375',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,125.00,30,730,16,4.88,930562079745673610),(3367,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/930641485021623765','Immaculate and Private Space, Walk to Everything','A modern artists getaway located near some of Portland\'s most treasured restaurants, shops and parks. Enjoy private, intentional, and \"feel-good\" living spaces made for those who are seeking a beautiful landing spot in the heart of the city. Featuring local art throughout the home, exceptional functionality, while offering peace and quiet. Integrate yourself in Laurelhurst, and enjoy a WalkScore of 71.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-930641485021623765/original/948384d1-834b-4c3f-a2e0-f72231eb695b.jpeg',62261998,23,'45.52537510911049','-122.62453098183595',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,2,29,9,4.89,930641485021623765),(3368,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/931302173378290933','Maplewood ADU Garden Retreat','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful 1 bedroom/1 bath retreat just a short walk to neighborhood Maplewood Coffee & Tea. Walking distance to April Hill Park and Gabriel Park. 10-15 minute walk to Multnomah Village with shops and restaurants nearby. Short drive to Lewis & Clark College and OHSU (Oregon Health Sciences University)  Easy 30 minutes from PDX international airport. Property located on a large garden lot in SW Portland. Windows facing south, west & north.','The Maplewood neighborhood is in Southwest Portland, west of SW 45th Ave. The neighborhood is connected by schools, walking, biking, greenspaces, hills, and creeks, including April Hill Park and its wetland boardwalk.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-931302173378290933/original/4ab541c1-df1f-4821-a89d-4c1e5caec25d.jpeg',512501431,75,'45.47131655429192','-122.72436245980981',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,104.00,5,300,2,5.00,931302173378290933),(3369,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/931418244950696318','Cozy Sunnyside 2BD/1BA w/ AC, full kitchen','Four blocks from Portland\'s iconic Belmont and Hawthorne streets, close to some of the city\'s best restaurants, bars, and coffee shops — Midnight, Alto Lounge, Gold Dust, and more — in walking distance. My place is good for couples, solo adventurers and business travelers.<br /><br />Come and enjoy Portland\'s Sunnyside neighborhood , and don\'t hesitate to ask for any recommendations!<br /><br />Thanks - Rob','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTMxNDE4MjQ0OTUwNjk2MzE4/original/01ece6de-ca4f-422f-bb8c-43d721bc64ef.jpeg',3114360,16,'45.51412800806845','-122.63421742508545',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,172.00,2,20,20,5.00,931418244950696318),(3370,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/931832244116411052','Fully Renovated Hilltop Oasis','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. Surrounded by majestic trees and hiking trails. Wraparound decks on each of the two floors. Two queen-size bedrooms plus a queen sleeper sofa in the den. New kitchen, bathrooms, and laundry room. Centrally located, a 10-minute drive from downtown Portland and a 15-minute walk to Hillsdale (which has lovely cafes, restaurants, bars, grocery store, pharmacy, etc).','This neighborhood is the Southwest Hills.<br />Hillsdale is a great area nearby.<br />Portland is small. It takes 10-30 minutes to drive almost anywhere you need to go. Downtown is very close.<br />Grocery store, pharmacy, and liquor store are a short lovely 15-minute walk away down a trail that starts on 18th Drive or you can go by car if you have a lot to carry.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-931832244116411052/original/f7d622bc-cef7-4678-84df-78d3a88b6930.jpeg',150727103,31,'45.48904','-122.6989',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,250.00,30,120,3,5.00,931832244116411052),(3371,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/932912790261502097','The 1911 on Fremont','Built in 1911, this classic four square sits in the heart of Portlands Rose City Park neighborhood.  The newly remodeled guest suite features modern amenities while embracing the classic charm of this Portland original.  PDX is only an eight minute drive from the house to the terminal! Whether a foodie searching for the next Portland dining hot spot or on the lookout for perfect cup of coffee, you\'re only minutes away.','Set in the middle of Portland’s Rose City Park neighborhood, shopping, dining, and the airport are only minutes away. The highlight of the neighborhood is the proximity to the Alberta Arts District, Alameda and the hip Mississippi neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-932912790261502097/original/e2622f34-d967-4b2a-8752-f27dff9429a7.jpeg',245586843,39,'45.545822959704','-122.58121365893915',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,62.00,2,30,38,4.89,932912790261502097),(3372,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/933273043957204589','Portland Apartment w/ Deck - 3 Mi to Downtown!','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-933273043957204589/original/7592bf9d-c64f-4403-9a13-810d8087c852.jpeg',456511812,25,'45.50466','-122.63849',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,933273043957204589),(3373,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/933412745503316254','Superb Location, Pet Friendly, Super Walkable','This fantastic home offers two wonderful rental options. This listing is the bottom level and offers two bedrooms and one bathroom. The location is seconds away from fantastic drinks, food, and entertainment. There are numerous upgrades and enhancements, while each piece of furnishing and décor was curated to create that perfect blend of style and comfort for your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-933412745503316254/original/d37e5fa4-e320-455e-a842-4d3481f39593.jpeg',62261998,36,'45.49678','-122.60799',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,85.00,3,29,14,4.07,933412745503316254),(3374,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/934111763448689801','Floatopia Getaway','Welcome to our charming floating home on Oregon\'s Willamette River. Experience nature\'s beauty and modern comforts in this small, enchanting abode.  <br />Outside, your private deck offers a serene space to unwind. Watch kayakers glide by, witness stunning sunsets.<br />Conveniently located near Portland, you’ll have easy access to vibrant attractions and activities.<br />Book your stay for a perfect Oregonian retreat.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-934111763448689801/original/bbc879f2-6d86-4318-86b6-c0b2e95f4686.jpeg',6243698,20,'45.47498754887664','-122.66152740627305',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,81.00,30,90,6,5.00,934111763448689801),(3375,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/935631617595917441','Fantastic Woodstock Townhouse, Pet Friendly','For groups visiting Portland and the surrounding areas, the Woodstock Townhouse is a pretty special place. Sitting in the heart of Southeast Portland you are centrally located to most everything while at the same time well away from the bustle of downtown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-935631617595917441/original/27de8ef3-a596-4a14-8d81-19a40062cf09.jpeg',62261998,38,'45.488956767994125','-122.62030882537222',1,10,4.00,5.00,7.00,227.00,3,29,3,4.67,935631617595917441),(3376,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/935656522148122127','Don\'s Place','Quiet, sunny, large detached apartment in charming Sellwood neighborhood -- the perfect blend of small town living with easy access to the city. Blocks from: 3 city parks, 3 shopping/dining areas, public pool, Oaks Amusement Park, river beaches & marinas, wildlife refuge and natural areas, bike paths to downtown. New construction and BRAND NEW furnishings.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-935656522148122127/original/a8a624eb-2cf4-482a-bb9b-3dd5b232c944.jpeg',415328335,20,'45.46950396568197','-122.65771007123145',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,2,365,1,5.00,935656522148122127),(3377,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/937147556749225708','Low rating from 1 unrealistic guest. Entire home','Entire townhome; safe village<br />1 guest gave low rating b/c AC broke. They were 100% compensated. Walk-in/out 1600 sq townhome in John\'s Landing. 40\" ft vaulted ceilings & skylights throughout. 2 bedrooms, 2.5 baths, large garden patio, garage, free parking. <br />2 blocks to Willamette River to kayak, paddle, boat, swim, tennis or bike bath.<br />Walk to pubs and several parks, Thai restaurant, Indian, wine shop, organic grocery store.<br />15- minute drive to OHSU <br />25-minute drive to Willamette Valley wineries','walk everywhere! To pubs, restaurants, river with beach and boat ramp, kayaking, boating, bike path, tennis, etc. <br />very friendly, safe & quiet -young families and singles mostly.<br />McMenamins Pub - 2 blocks walking<br />Elephants Deli - 4 blocks<br />Zupan\'s organic grocery - 7 blocks; 15-minute max walk<br /><br />stretch out & chill with lots of SPACE inside & out!<br />walk to ALL of your outdoor needs; adventure, food, drink, arts & culture','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-937147556749225708/original/cf2cd333-7ea5-4b9e-9cee-4a6f660d7571.jpeg',6913528,22,'45.490857491023675','-122.67389639979613',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,205.00,30,60,1,2.00,937147556749225708),(3378,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/937345033383464102','South Waterfront w/ River Views','Experience luxury waterfront living, where the vibrant energy of downtown Portland meets the tranquil beauty of the Willamette River. This upscale east facing condo has plenty of natural light and stunning views of the Willamette River. The peak of Mt. Hood is visible on a clear day. Minutes from OHSU and Portland Aerial Tram -great for medical/nursing students and traveling physicians and nurses. Steps from streetcar, restaurants, bike paths, and more. Queen bed. One parking space. Work desk.','Located in the heart of South Waterfront next to South Waterfront park and RiverPlace marina. Very quite and peaceful, yet close to all the excitement. Adjacent to the new restaurant, Dough Zone. McCormick & Schmick\'s is around the corner. Lots of people running, biking, and walking along South Waterfront and RiverPlace marina. The harbor and Poet\'s Beach are only steps away. During the summer, lots of festivals and events happen at the South Waterfront. Coffee shops, ice cream shops, salons, and more in walking distance. OHSU is also in walking distance and has a wonderful Farmer\'s Market (May-October). Take the streetcar anywhere in downtown! Make sure to visit 23rd Ave and indulge in Salt & Straw and other unique tea shops, coffee shops, restaurants, and more. Visit the PSU farmers market on Saturdays (open all year). So much to do!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTM3MzQ1MDMzMzgzNDY0MTAy/original/70bfdde6-4e33-4257-8f32-d2d2c7785e15.jpeg',148406683,44,'45.50661','-122.67358',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,60,365,3,5.00,937345033383464102),(3379,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/938575983695772667','Boho luxury loft! Downtown Pearl location .','This downtown loft offers a comfortable and stylish stay within walking distance of fabulous dining and bars, offering a wide variety of culinary experiences. You\'ll also have access to excellent shopping options, from trendy boutiques to well-known brands. Entertainment options are abundant in the area, with theaters, live music venues, and art galleries nearby. Whether you\'re looking for a relaxing evening or an exciting night out, there is something for everyone!','Pearl District','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-938575983695772667/original/b037325f-32f9-49b4-ba23-6492dd13407a.jpeg',439103919,2,'45.5269042','-122.6795883',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,80.00,2,28,43,4.86,938575983695772667),(3380,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/938655486483273224','Amazing location in SE Portland','Full one bed apartment in amazing central SE Portland location. In walking distance of SE Division, SE Hawthorne and Ladd’s Addition. Surrounded by Portland’s best restaurants, bars, food carts, thrift shops… a true Portland experience!','The home is located right between three iconic Portland neighborhoods- SE Division, SE Hawthorne and Ladds Addition.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-938655486483273224/original/e3d63276-6d5d-4798-a420-e5824f2da57f.jpeg',181345657,25,'45.50655','-122.65417',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,89.00,1,365,81,4.93,938655486483273224),(3381,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/939382785339327685','Cozy Cathedral Park Home - Full Home w/ office','Beautifully renovated home 2BR/2.5Ba + an office. Close to Cathedral Park and one block off the scenic Williamette Blvd. Walking distance to downtown St. Johns. Two renovated bathrooms. Master bedroom with king bed. Second bedroom also includes a king bed. Third bedroom has a queen bed. Office on 1st floor. Two car driveway. Ample parking. 950Mbps Internet! Fully fenced private backyard and awning with firepit, multiple lounging chairs, & bbq. Central A/C and heat with Nest thermostat.','Home is situated in the beautiful Cathedral Park neighborhood which borders St. Johns to the north and University Park to the east. The St. Johns bridge and Cathedral Park are only a 1/2 mile away! Downtown St. Johns is a short walk away where there are many restaurants & bars. The main entrance to University of Portland is only 1 mile away! Forest Park access is within a mile just across the St. Johns Bridge. NW 23rd is only a 12 minute drive, downtown is an easy 15 minute drive. Sauvie\'s Island is only a 15 minute drive. Downtown Vancouver and the new waterfront is less than a 15 minute drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-939382785339327685/original/a8ab4c2a-c644-43a6-8aa7-eb89f04efdf4.jpeg',20055534,42,'45.58645','-122.74863',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,210.00,2,60,35,4.94,939382785339327685),(3382,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/939816739441592530','Mid-Century Modern Gem in PDX/LO','Tastefully renovated 3 bed, 2 bath mid-century home provides the perfect balance of accessibility and privacy! Walk to coffee, wine bars, shops & eateries or take a short drive to downtown PDX, trails, or Willamette Valley wineries. Pour some wine & unwind under the covered patio, roll putts on the putting green & pick fresh fruit from the backyard! It feels like home with a gourmet kitchen, oak hardwoods, tongue & groove ceilings & dedicated office space.  EV? The charger is ready for you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-939816739441592530/original/cbac9209-5565-4237-ba93-877ddb834870.jpeg',25435078,68,'45.43340226867938','-122.74170630875027',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,256.00,2,112,44,4.98,939816739441592530),(3383,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/939829795382089496','Relax and Unwind! Pets Allowed, Central Location!','Our hotel is situated in the downtown of Portland only minutes away from exciting locations such as International Rose Test Garden and Powell’s City of Books. Ideal for a fun vacation, the area provides an amazing selection of activities for guests to enjoy. Feast your eyes on lifelike artworks at the Portland Art Museum, experience nature at the Oregon Zoo or go for an entertaining concert at Moda Center. The list of what to engage in is endless and there’s something for everyone!','- Portland Art Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- International Rose Test Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- Oregon Zoo – 1.9 miles <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.4 miles <br />- Oregon History Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Classical Chinese Garden – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Japanese Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 2 miles <br />- U.S. Bancorp Tower – 0.2 miles <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles <br />- Johnson Creek – 5.6 miles <br />- O’Bryant Square – 0.1 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-939829795382089496/original/9edec206-ae87-4be4-be76-059a7f5bca94.png',174792040,44,'45.52101','-122.67835',4,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,939829795382089496),(3384,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/939832319274527413','Central and Pet-friendly Hotel near Art Museum!','Our hotel is situated in the downtown of Portland only minutes away from exciting locations such as International Rose Test Garden and Powell’s City of Books. Ideal for a fun vacation, the area provides an amazing selection of activities for guests to enjoy. Feast your eyes on lifelike artworks at the Portland Art Museum, experience nature at the Oregon Zoo or go for an entertaining concert at Moda Center. The list of what to engage in is endless and there’s something for everyone!','- Portland Art Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- International Rose Test Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- Oregon Zoo – 1.9 miles <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.4 miles <br />- Oregon History Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Classical Chinese Garden – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Japanese Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 2 miles <br />- U.S. Bancorp Tower – 0.2 miles <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles <br />- Johnson Creek – 5.6 miles <br />- O’Bryant Square – 0.1 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-939832319274527413/original/f9e768d0-1480-49b1-bf1d-1a6aaf17a7f0.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52101','-122.67835',4,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,939832319274527413),(3385,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/939838559899584939','Group Getaway! 3 Comfortable Units, Pets Allowed!','Our hotel is situated in the downtown of Portland only minutes away from exciting locations such as International Rose Test Garden and Powell’s City of Books. Ideal for a fun vacation, the area provides an amazing selection of activities for guests to enjoy. Feast your eyes on lifelike artworks at the Portland Art Museum, experience nature at the Oregon Zoo or go for an entertaining concert at Moda Center. The list of what to engage in is endless and there’s something for everyone!','- Portland Art Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- International Rose Test Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- Oregon Zoo – 1.9 miles <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.4 miles <br />- Oregon History Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Classical Chinese Garden – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Japanese Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 2 miles <br />- U.S. Bancorp Tower – 0.2 miles <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles <br />- Johnson Creek – 5.6 miles <br />- O’Bryant Square – 0.1 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-939838559899584939/original/2be608a5-5a88-4d7f-b683-b8e72ed7eb4c.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52101','-122.67835',4,12,3.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,939838559899584939),(3386,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/939840263450573118','Rare Find! Four Modern and Pet-friendly Units!','Our hotel is situated in the downtown of Portland only minutes away from exciting locations such as International Rose Test Garden and Powell’s City of Books. Ideal for a fun vacation, the area provides an amazing selection of activities for guests to enjoy. Feast your eyes on lifelike artworks at the Portland Art Museum, experience nature at the Oregon Zoo or go for an entertaining concert at Moda Center. The list of what to engage in is endless and there’s something for everyone!','- Portland Art Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- International Rose Test Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- Oregon Zoo – 1.9 miles <br />- Tom McCall Waterfront Park – 0.4 miles <br />- Oregon History Museum – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Classical Chinese Garden – 0.4 miles <br />- Portland Japanese Garden – 1.4 miles <br />- World Forestry Discovery Museum – 2 miles <br />- U.S. Bancorp Tower – 0.2 miles <br />- Portland International Airport – 6 miles <br />- Johnson Creek – 5.6 miles <br />- O’Bryant Square – 0.1 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-939840263450573118/original/05213bc3-26f0-44ed-9afe-710885781bdc.jpeg',174792040,44,'45.52101','-122.67835',4,16,4.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,939840263450573118),(3387,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/940724499677091303','Quirky N Portland gem','Enjoy this cozy and colorful one-bedroom basement apartment in the heart of North Portland. This private suite in a quiet neighborhood feels secluded, but is just steps away from a major bus-line and all the city has to offer. The location, well equipped kitchen, and room to stretch out make this a dynamite spot for foodie couples, solo adventurers, and visiting family.','Sitting on the boundary line of the St. John\'s and Portsmouth neighborhoods, the area is mostly residential with lively strips of restaurants (Gracies Apizza, Fishwife, vegan Homegrown Smoker) food trucks (St John\'s Beer Porch), coffee shops (Sparrow Bakery), and bars (Chill N Fill, Slim\'s) interspersed throughout. New Seasons grocery store is just a few blocks away. Columbia Park is a 15 minute walk, and Forest Park is a ten minute drive over the St. John\'s bridge. Check out the neighborhood farmers market on Saturday\'s and the local flea on Sunday\'s, or catch a movie at McMenamins theatre and pub!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-940724499677091303/original/ead3af70-c8de-4695-998c-2e32b8820afb.jpeg',527144978,60,'45.58361229381164','-122.72122912400854',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,1,30,59,4.98,940724499677091303),(3388,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/940745277869635715','The Plex PDX','Live Like a Local! The Plex will immerse you in mid century style and vintage charm with privacy and modern comforts-all in the heart of Portland. Sip coffee on the patio while you plan your adventures. Eat, drink, and play in this walkable central neighborhood. Just a few blocks from destination casual and upscale dining, coffee shops, boutiques, and historic Laurelhurst Park and Theater. Perfect for up to 4 people with driveway parking and a garage to store bikes and other gear.','The Plex is located in the Kerns neighborhood and is just two blocks from Larelhurst Park. Right down the street is the East Restaurant Row centered at 28th and Burnside anchored with the historic Laurelhurst Theater, Whole Foods, and now famous, at least to Portlander”s, 50 Licks Ice Cream. This is a fun and safe neighborhood to explore and walk around in, and of course eat and sample all the local favorites.<br />East Burnside offers quite a few worthwhile stops, starting at Music Millenium, the largest and oldest independent record store in the Pacific Northwest. You can head down the hill toward downtown and check out unique shops, coffee shops, and some of Portland’s best restaurants. <br />If you’re feeling adventurous you can go a half mile south to Belmont Street, where you”ll find H Mart grocery store; local bars; casual dining and the famous Stumptown Coffee. Go another half mile south to Hawthorne, a hub for boutique shopping and casual dining for the weary shopper.<br /><br','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-940745277869635715/original/5b901fc7-b261-44cc-9903-9ea6ba31a17b.jpeg',7409866,12,'45.52036','-122.6337',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,1,365,65,4.97,940745277869635715),(3389,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/941455725289167595','Modern Home — Prime Alberta Arts','This new home is steps from lively Alberta Street, the heart of NE Portland. It\'s perfect for couples, business travelers, and anyone looking to explore Northeast, Portland\'s best neighborhood. Plush king-size bed, open kitchen and living room, 1.5 bathrooms, and private yard. <br /><br />Explore awesome restaurants, bars, and shops around the corner, while staying on a quiet residential street. This home is just 15 minutes from the airport, and close to downtown (transit friendly!).<br /><br />Hablamos español.','This freestanding house is on a quiet street in one of Portland\'s hottest, most walkable neighborhoods. As Travel Portland puts it, \"Independent and diverse, this Northeast Portland neighborhood teems with art, shopping and dining options.\"<br /><br />Local dining options just steps from the house offer cuisine for every taste (vegan to carnivore), craving (foie gras to fried chicken) and budget (PBR to Dom Pérignon).<br /><br />Peppered with locally owned shops, cafés, bars and galleries, Alberta Street (one short block away) is famed for its monthly Last Thursday street fair, but offers entertaining options any day of the month.<br /><br />When you check in I\'ll send you a link to a map I created with my favorite haunts in the neighborhood and beyond.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-941455725289167595/original/bcbeb4da-8cc8-4e0e-b599-1afc29041a26.jpg',2179254,29,'45.561116867135325','-122.64737143929112',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,125.00,2,32,58,5.00,941455725289167595),(3390,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/942352505794589081','The Willamette House','Walk to parks, trails, river, shops, restaurants and more. <br /><br />Great house with private courtyard and back yard with views of Forest Park in the Distance.<br /><br />Historic Downtown St. Johns, The iconic St. Johns Bridge, Cathedral Park (home of the largest free jazz festival west of the Mississippi), Forest Park, the largest urban park in the country, The Willamette River, Pubs, Fine dining, a historic theater, specialty shops all are just outside your front door.','Pastifico d\'Oro Italian restaurant. Lombard House Tap room. St. Johns Beer porch and food cart pod. The Sparrow Bakery. St. Johns Twin Cinema. mcMenamins St. Johns Theater and Pub. Stormbreaker Brewing. Affagato. Two Stroke Coffee. Cathedral Coffee. Salty Tea Cup. Shop Lyko Slow Goods. John Street Cafe. Sabatino Moto. Vinyl Resting Place. 3 Tracks Music. Paiku. Blue Sky Gallery. Atelier Gallery. The Garrison. West Coast Fitness. The Fixin\' To. Slim\'s.Portland Abbey Arts','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-942352505794589081/original/dee0fe30-3a34-4e4c-a727-b11f48e3d51f.jpeg',79759220,42,'45.58643','-122.75062',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,101.00,31,364,1,5.00,942352505794589081),(3391,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/942383793527622418','Privacy and peace to relax.','Relax with the privacy and feel comfortable to enjoy outside around of the studio. We are all the time to help you when it is necessary. This place doesn’t connect with the house, but we are open to do you feel safety and glad with the services. Safety, quite and clean is first .','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-942383793527622418/original/23bf2e72-c017-4956-ad7e-d0935df6ee5d.jpeg',198328059,69,'45.4683399','-122.5975812',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,30,1125,8,4.25,942383793527622418),(3392,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/942873336541176566','Quiet & bright NW private room w/ bath','Enjoy a stylish stay at this centrally-located place in the heart of Portland\'s most beloved neighborhood. A short walk to 23rd street with plenty of boutique shops, restaurants, and drinks (coffeehouse, tea places, and bars).  Nearby outdoor explorations like Wallace Park and we are exactly a half-mile walk to Forest Park.<br /><br />This room includes a private bathroom, an office desk (sit/stand), and a reading nook. Some shared living spaces: kitchen, living room 75\" TV, and downstairs bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-942873336541176566/original/4283f207-b5e4-496c-95b7-1350eaf2f79e.jpeg',41117487,27,'45.53482332039998','-122.70292928733669',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,62.00,30,1125,28,5.00,942873336541176566),(3393,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/943502589442473696','Zen Den Spa near Hospitals & Downtown','This 28+ day pet friendly private rental has: Full kitchen, Spa inspired bathroom, 14” comfy bed w pillow top, 65” HDTV, private entrance &  patio.  Shared laundry & outdoor fireplace all surrounded by gardens.  5 blocks to 90 acre Gabriel Park w dog park, trails, & community Center.  3 miles to downtown, Oregon Health Science University (OHSU), & St. Vincent Hospital. Pamper yourself & book the Travel Nurse Paradise. Safe neighborhood w free parking.<br /><br />Reach out for longer stay Discounts!!','This is a safe quiet neighborhood near downtown & 10 min to OHSU and St Vincent Hospitals. 5 blocks to Gabriel park, woods and SW community Center. Great restaurants adjacent to Multnomah Village. So easy to navigate traffic with multiple options to avoid it.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-943502589442473696/original/da2f895e-6537-4950-bf05-c86cbb6ab71f.jpeg',16083734,17,'45.48293','-122.72249',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,30,299,5,5.00,943502589442473696),(3394,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/943601291050028057','Portland Waterfront Park Studio','When your idea of vacation calls for quirk, Portland is the place to be. Located in the heart of downtown in the Historic Waterfront District, this modern resort is a prime headquarters for exploration. In a walkable city like Portland, all you’ll need are comfortable shoes and your sense of adventure.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d7d8d278-3f0f-4202-a435-ee6c1dd3bb2d.jpg',240078487,43,'45.52072','-122.67093',1,2,1.00,0.00,3.00,170.00,30,365,0,1.00,943601291050028057),(3395,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/944177182671893320','Massive Nob Hill Craftsman ~ 99 WalkScore, 8 beds','Welcome to a Remote Workers Dream!<br /><br />Location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a walk score of 99, our 3000 sq ft home has brand new stainless steel appliances, blazing Wifi with an office for remote workers, and can sleep up to 16 guests comfortably.<br /><br />Our charming, yet modern and updated home is located in the heart of NW Portland - nestled between Alphabet and Pearl Districts, restaurants, independent bookstores and shops.<br /><br />We\'re also close to Alberta Arts, Mississippi and Downtown PDX!','With ornate Victorian houses and tree-lined streets, fashionable Nob Hill is an established neighborhood known for its trendy shopping on 23rd Avenue. A thriving dining scene covers refined restaurants and laid-back eateries with international cuisines, while cozy cafes pour specialty coffee.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-686084536254749277/original/04711173-7c37-4f71-be35-268e07a7849c.jpeg',415317125,27,'45.52821','-122.68826',1,16,4.00,7.00,8.00,240.00,1,365,68,4.88,944177182671893320),(3396,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/944296532897820040','Hobbit Hideaway Studio w laundry near OHSU & St V','Hobbit Hideaway Studio sleeps 2 w private entrance & shared laundry. Spa bathroom w bidet & a modern Chef’s kitchen. <br /><br />Relax in a Queen Adjtbl Bed, recliner, & HDTV w Fast WiFi. Shared laundry & OD fireplace & gardens near 90 acre Gabriel Park w dog run, trails, & community Center.  3 miles to downtown, (OHSU) & St. Vincent Hospitals. Pamper yourself & book the Pet Friendly Travel Nurse Paradise. Ideal for work relocation, moving, & safe neighborhood w free parking.<br /><br />Reach out for Longer Stays!!','This is a safe quiet neighborhood near downtown & 10 min to OHSU and St Vincent Hospitals. 5 blocks to Gabriel park, woods and SW community Center. Great restaurants adjacent to Multnomah Village. So easy to navigate traffic with multiple options to avoid it.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-944296532897820040/original/2dbc5a8b-0299-43c5-9404-93a4236b9cfc.jpeg',16083734,17,'45.48252254061741','-122.72283867001535',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,105.00,30,299,1,5.00,944296532897820040),(3397,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/944565109548195613','Forest Studio Oasis ~ Mile from Multnomah Village','Nestled in Portland\'s captivating woodland, this freshly renovated studio offers the perfect escape. Just a mile from Multnomah Village, steps from Alice Trail, and a few blocks from I-5, our retreat combines seclusion with convenience. Enjoy the tranquility while being a mere 10-minute drive from downtown. With thoughtful furnishings for comfort and ample privacy, it\'s an ideal spot to unwind after exploring Portland\'s vibrant attractions. Experience the unique charm of our city with ease!','Located just a mile from the vibrant Multnomah Village and steps away from Alice Park, the SW Capitol Highway neighborhood offers an enriching blend of urban and natural charm. It\'s a welcoming community nestled in the heart of Portland, where bustling city life and tranquil green spaces coexist.<br /><br />Living in 