ck, the living room or your locked, private, stylish room.☀️','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-950142189466710669/original/f33cad51-01ab-4a3b-a5be-29c6fcb7a11e.jpeg',529731294,74,'45.54633','-122.56763',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,45.00,1,7,78,4.99,950142189466710669),(3424,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/950164724466711179','Luxury Downtown Condo','This doorman luxury downtown condo is close to everything - easily walk to bars and restaurants. Luxury furnishing with a Restoration Hardware Cloud Couch, Dyson Vaccum, 2 Smart Tvs with rotating wall mounts. There is a kitchen island with stools, separate bar area, as well as a desk and work area, with the highest speed internet. There is a full size door that opens out giving a bit of a balcony feel. The in unit washer/dryer, designated parking space and central ac/heat ensure ease and comfort','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-950164724466711179/original/1115b8e2-b28c-408a-ac59-8f42ac7ae070.jpeg',11579,27,'45.52361','-122.69083',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,30,365,4,5.00,950164724466711179),(3425,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/950204985400764289','Peaceful Portland Studio','Enjoy a stylish and carefree experience at this centrally-located apartment with an out door patio. Experienced super hosts. Private entrance,and self check-in make for easy arrivals.  Keeping the apartment  pet, smoke, and scent free assure that all guests are comfortable and able to stay.<br />We are keeping a very clean space and following disinfection protocols before and after every stay. <br />We are always happy to meet guests and are here to answer questions and help in any way if needed.','The Brooklyn neighborhood is located in SE portland just south of Ladds Addition.  A quick trip across the bridge gets you to OHSU and the SW waterfront.The Aladdin Theater is a short walk around the corner and Reed College is a five minute drive. We are close in Se and very centrally located to most of what Portland has to offer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-950204985400764289/original/bd3c267e-696e-490f-8dc5-e57e530d8cfd.jpg',14636342,56,'45.4981056','-122.6566003',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,2,1125,42,4.98,950204985400764289),(3426,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/950244984066737378','*Cute Boho Room in Sunny Loft w/Huge Deck*','Escape to this peaceful, boho bedroom in our sunny second story loft off of a huge deck with outdoor seating.  <br /><br />Here you can relax from the hustle of the city in a safe, serene space while still being in Inner Portland and convenient to all the sights.<br /><br />Relax on the deck, the living room or your locked, private, stylish room.☀️<br /><br />In summer book a private swim session in our gorgeous  pool. 🏊‍♀️','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-950244984066737378/original/fe1f04ca-a3b5-49a4-99e2-11d25baa0735.jpeg',529731294,74,'45.54563359245309','-122.56684065908847',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,45.00,1,7,65,5.00,950244984066737378),(3427,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/950444551338776284','Portland\'s Classic Haven on Bartholomew E#41001','Step into this spectacular home, where timeless traditional and period details are found throughout. With distinctive flair and exceptional quality, this property is far from standard or \"cookie-cutter.\" Enjoy a HUGE private southerly VIEW, a master bedroom on the main floor, two spacious bedrooms upstairs, and a charming \"Paris apartment\" on the lower level. The home also features a private walkout and a large lower yard, perfect for exploration.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-950444551338776284/original/80f931fa-2d09-4ca0-928d-e2bc6407eb02.jpeg',414420881,81,'45.5396933932916','-122.76932122561568',1,9,3.50,4.00,6.00,297.00,30,1125,1,1.00,950444551338776284),(3428,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/950449667262495566','FairyPortland on Bartholomew G#41001','The house requires a minimum 31-day stay and utilities are not included.<br />Timeless traditional and period details found throughout this spectacular home. Nothing standard or \"cookie-cutter\" with distinctive flair and quality. HUGE private Southerly VIEW, master bedroom on main, two large bedrooms up and \"Paris apartment\" on the lower level. Walkout private walk and large lower yard for exploring. Remodeled with Anderson wood windows, solid core doors, new roof, new furnace, A/C, two mini-splits.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-950449667262495566/original/2306d4d4-3ab2-481f-be89-e55b8bac8089.jpeg',504252105,81,'45.53918','-122.77118',1,9,3.50,4.00,6.00,297.00,30,1125,0,1.00,950449667262495566),(3429,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/950766433856164781','Condo in a vibrant harborside','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.<br />This garden-level unit feels warm, cozy and quiet. Yet, it is in the heart of a vibrant harborside community of condos, restaurants and businesses. Enjoy watching the Dragon boats and Christmas ships or stroll down to summer festivals. This building has a fabulous large top floor common area deck where you can enjoy river views and fireworks.','This garden-level unit feels warm, cozy and quiet. Yet, it is in the heart of a vibrant harborside community of condos, restaurants and businesses. Enjoy watching the Dragon boats and Christmas ships or stroll down to summer festivals, spring cheery blossoms. This building has a fabulous large top floor common area deck where you can enjoy river views and fireworks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-950766433856164781/original/c43ccf27-6764-4f14-8fd8-ac8810e3ccae.jpeg',49352828,44,'45.50865','-122.67274',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,78.00,30,365,0,1.00,950766433856164781),(3430,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/951042244918602409','Stylish Urban Retreat','Whether you’re a digital nomad, a medical professional on assignment, or simply seeking a chic urban escape, this centrally located, light-filled guesthouse is your ideal Portland retreat. Experience the perfect blend of modern comforts and local charm while you explore everything the City of Roses has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-951042244918602409/original/149d30a0-51d5-43c0-88c6-10cb70c9f318.jpeg',3936317,12,'45.52374','-122.6459',1,2,2.00,1.00,2.00,103.00,30,365,5,5.00,951042244918602409),(3431,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/951717761693896847','The Drop INN','Quaint private one bedroom, single bathroom with full kitchen, garage apartment.  Completely isolated and separated from the upstairs part of the Condo.  A Separate entrance, to come and go as you wish.<br /><br />Apartment comes with privacy curtains, a 55 inch smart TV, Wi-Fi, kitchen equipment, oven/range, washer/dryer and a refrigerator.  Parking in front of the unit is free and on street parking is plenty available.','The St. Johns neighborhood is an old historic hold over from when Portland was more blue collar working class families. Older buildings and family owned business still permeate the downtown St. Johns community.  It is the location for Portland\'s primary shipping ports and sits between the Columbia River, approximately 5 mins away, and the Willamette River also about 5 mins, from the Apartment.  Parks, rivers, tennis courts, nature trails and walking paths are within blocks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTUxNzE3NzYxNjkzODk2ODQ3/original/d4ea5d8a-5241-40c4-82df-0370a2364bf0.jpeg',82348342,58,'45.59318864574072','-122.73194954600096',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,1,30,7,4.71,951717761693896847),(3432,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/952219185508515736','Airstream oasis w/ hot tub','Relax in this newly restored 1960\'s airstream with your own private yard!<br /><br />Walk to dozens of food carts, restaurants and bars in the hip Foster-Powell neighborhood.  Have a hot-tub.  Have a picnic.  Have a fire.  <br /><br />Private parking. Private entrance. On-site plumbed and indoor private bathroom.  Glorious outdoor area with games, patio, multiple hang-out spots and vibey evening lights.  Play vintage video and board games in this well-appointed 1960\'s silver cottage.  Sleep soundly and in style.','Foster-Powell neighborhood (affectionately known as Fo-Po) is home to unique experiences you can’t find anywhere else in the city and that’s what makes it a perfect Portland neighborhood to explore.  <br /><br />EATING?<br />casual? check out the carts at the mercado a short walk away<br /><br />DRINKING?<br />I love ALL the bars on Foster, my favorite is Thunderbird<br />I also love the Lay Low on foster.<br />third recommendation is the kinda dive tiki bar called La Hui<br /><br />DANCING?<br />go check out the Tango Berratin!<br /><br />VINTAGE SHOPPING?<br />Go check out the next neighborhood over, Montavilla.  Our favorite shop is called Endure.  Sweet finds from the 1960\'s.  a lot of pretty stuff to look at.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-952219185508515736/original/d6ca8bbb-7bed-4b8a-a653-af3ad95f2b0c.jpeg',5786616,36,'45.487040576516996','-122.58639349575789',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,365,22,4.09,952219185508515736),(3433,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/953268457098917806','Charming 2-Bed Minutes to OHSU, Fenced Yard! (18B)','Welcome to our delightful fully furnished two-bedroom apartment nestled on Marquam Hill, conveniently located near OHSU. Whether you\'re a medical professional seeking temporary accommodation or a visitor looking for a comfortable stay close to medical facilities, this apartment is tailored to meet your needs.','The OHSU neighborhood is a vibrant and dynamic area in Portland, Oregon. It\'s characterized by a mix of modern amenities and natural beauty. With its proximity to OHSU, it often has a healthcare and academic atmosphere. The neighborhood boasts stunning views of the city and the surrounding landscape due to its elevated position. It\'s known for its safe environment, making it conducive for walking and jogging. Access to public transportation, like Trimet bus #8, provides easy connections to the rest of the city. Additionally, there are charming restaurants, convenient stores, and welcoming spaces that make this neighborhood a comfortable and enjoyable place to live or visit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-953268457098917806/original/cbaf84f1-1d77-4a40-ae92-247e98ebd0a4.jpeg',410009654,30,'45.49730001332016','-122.69100913904626',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,30,1125,0,1.00,953268457098917806),(3434,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/954469742905000332','Sunny Bedroom in Walkable NE Portland Gem','Being in the heart of NE Portland comes with access to many adventures. You can walk to multiple bus lines, and the max, within 5 minutes or simply walk to your favorite nearby spot. If driving, we have plenty of free street parking and the airport is an easy 10 minutes from here- no freeway needed. We are within a 15-20 minute drive to downtown, or The Columbia Gorge and equal distance to both Mt. Hood and the ocean — both of which take about an hour and half and have wineries along the way.','This neighborhood has everything I could need. I don’t have to drive if I don’t want to as there is a  convenience store, bar, coffee shop and dispensary within a 5 minute walk. We have a grocery store just down Glisan and so many other restaurants and bars along the way. Just a little bit further is Stark St. and that’s just a fun and lively spot to be. I’m never bored or without options and I love that there is still the feeling of a neighborhood community in this part of town. <br /><br />If I do get in my car it’s to quickly drive to nature. I can feel like I’m outside of the city within minutes. Which really is my favorite part of it all, the convence and access to outdoor activities.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-954469742905000332/original/7f188de2-66a8-43bd-8d66-30033a13bdbb.jpeg',4844054,10,'45.52853654775181','-122.5771328506898',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,46.00,30,200,6,5.00,954469742905000332),(3435,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/954592780029610769','Cozy Bedroom in Walkable NE Portland','Being in the heart of NE Portland comes with many perks. You can walk to multiple bus lines, and the max, within 5 minutes or simply walk to your favorite nearby spot. If you drive, the airport is an easy 10 minute drive from here- no freeway needed. We are also within a 15-20 minute drive to The Gorge, and downtown as well as an hour and a half from Mt. Hood and the ocean — both of which have wineries on the way. There is free, and plenty, street parking here which makes it easy to explore!','This neighborhood has everything I could need. I don\'t have to drive if I don\'t want to as there is a convenience store, bar, coffee shop, park and dispensary within a 5 minute walk. We have a grocery store just down Glisan and so many other restaurants and bars along the way. Just a little bit further south is Stark St. - about half a mile or so from the house- and that\'s just a fun and lively spot to be. I\'m never bored or without options and |love that there is still the feeling of a neighborhood community in this part of town.<br />If I do get in my car it\'s to quickly drive to nature. I can feel like I\'m outside of the city within minutes. Which really is my favorite part of it all, the convence and access to outdoor','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-954592780029610769/original/a9e6bc82-e13e-4f37-be8b-72f15740d2e2.jpeg',4844054,10,'45.52868701107266','-122.57893437577906',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,29.00,30,180,4,5.00,954592780029610769),(3436,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/955223896557162511','Private, peaceful treetop studio in Alberta Arts','Our private, upstairs studio is perfectly situated for urban exploration & relaxation.  A short walk to Alberta Arts District & Alberta Park, the studio offers easy access to local eateries, bars, shops, coffee, and nature. After a busy day out, return to our quiet street and peaceful studio nestled among the trees. Inside, cozy up to watch TV from the comfort of the queen bed or the couch. Enjoy the bright, window-filled space, complete with a fully outfitted kitchen & dining nook.','We are located in the beautiful, eclectic Concordia neighborhood. Concordia is one of the more diverse neighborhoods in Portland and you\'ll see a wide mix of families, couples, and individuals as you explore. Our street is quiet and the neighborhood is residential, but you\'re only a short walk from several bustling areas and a quick drive from several more popular districts, so there\'s a lot to explore nearby! <br /><br />Location highlights:<br />- 2 blocks from the popular Alberta Park<br />- 3 blocks from Alberta St., the heart of the Alberta Arts district with dozens of shops, restaurants, bars, and art galleries<br />- 8 min walk to bars, restaurants, and yoga studios on 30th & Killingsworth in one direction, and 15th & Killingsworth in the other direction<br />- 7 min drive to Williams and Mississippi districts with restaurants, bars, shops, and music/comedy venues<br />- 15 min drive to the Pearl District in NW Portland<br />- 15 min drive to/from the airport','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-955223896557162511/original/12d04656-8ce3-455a-acb1-f4918cb75a27.jpeg',3064751,1,'45.56485','-122.64281',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,80.00,2,28,41,5.00,955223896557162511),(3437,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/955331771782942396','New studio in Foster Powell -Unit C','Light and bright new studio apartment located in the heart of the Foster Powell Neighborhood!  15 minutes from downtown with many public transportation options and a block from the bike route to take you anywhere in the city.  Close to the Woodstock neighborhood, Creston Park, Foster Street bars and restaurants blocks away. <br />Full kitchen and bathroom.<br />Sister unit next door available for friends/family to stay in separate listing.<br />TV and wifi available.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/971bde80-d5ee-4a5f-a229-7746e64b1e3b.jpg',38193018,67,'45.49325318828033','-122.60566011905583',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,2,20,46,4.93,955331771782942396),(3438,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/955346639642318313','Clean and Cozy New Studio - Unit B','Light and bright new studio apartment located in the heart of the Foster Powell Neighborhood!  15 minutes from downtown with many public transportation options and a block from the bike route to take you anywhere in the city.  Close to the Woodstock neighborhood, Creston Park, Foster Street bars and restaurants blocks away. <br />Full kitchen and bathroom.<br />TV and wifi available<br />Sister unit next door for family/friends in a separate listing.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ef968cf0-f71d-42d2-aa04-4c234055930b.jpg',38193018,67,'45.493166721981474','-122.60627836955261',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,62.00,2,20,50,4.92,955346639642318313),(3439,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/955457763522180499','Private Room & Shared Bath - Room A','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful oasis. A 30 minute drive to downtown Portland, waterfalls at the Gorge, and beautiful lakes / rivers dotting the base of Mt. Hood!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-955457763522180499/original/80779388-4a74-4f32-ac6b-44e116ebb1cd.jpeg',531181880,78,'45.48514','-122.53903',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,29.00,30,60,7,5.00,955457763522180499),(3440,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/955646206468099120','Luxury Apartment Central Pearl Sleeps 6 | Unit 6','Unwind in this stylish two-bed apt in Central Pearl District. The Local area is full of award-winning restaurants, bars, shops, historic landmarks, and attractions. <br /><br />✔ Fully Equipped Kitchen<br />✔ Comfortable Bedrooms w/ King Bed<br />✔Queen Sleeper Sofa <br />✔ Open Concept Living Area<br />✔ High-Speed Wi-Fi<br />✔On site parking available<br /><br />Learn more below! Be among the very first to relish an elegant stay at this centrally-located, 2-bed, 2-bath apartment nestled in the vibrant heart of Pearl District.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-955646206468099120/original/e78dfd69-c307-4648-8435-69b72c24b5cb.jpeg',531225529,2,'45.52362','-122.68397',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,274.00,31,365,58,4.86,955646206468099120),(3441,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/956126149466173650','Spacious SE Bungalow - WFH Bliss','Spacious living, dining, and working space with a refreshed interior highlight this FoPo charmer. Walking distance from the city\'s most culturally diverse cuisine.<br /><br />After you spend all day exploring, there\'s plenty of room to relax. Want to WFH? There\'s a well-appointed office space with great natural light.  It won\'t be hard to envision yourself becoming part of Portlandia after a few days here!','Foster-Powell is a distinctive Southeast neighborhood that warmly welcomes both cyclists and pedestrians. With its own distinct character, FoPo offers unparalleled experiences that remain exclusive to this corner of the city.<br /><br />The house is situated a short distance from Foster Road, which hosts an array of dining establishments, including brunch spots, pizzerias, a charming coffee shop, a Brazilian café, a distinctive bubble tea establishment, as well as various neighborhood bars and additional restaurants, all conveniently within walking proximity. <br /><br />A brief drive down Foster Road will lead you to the bustling Southeast Portland area, where you can explore Division Street, Hawthorne Boulevard, and Belmont Street. Here, you will discover a diverse selection of shops, dining venues, bars, coffeehouses, grocery stores, bookshops, an arcade, parks, thrift stores, and numerous other amenities.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-956126149466173650/original/5ce79f03-57ec-499b-9386-58e57e9f48b0.jpeg',7660282,36,'45.49628360508767','-122.60103951343721',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,195.00,3,28,58,5.00,956126149466173650),(3442,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/956544720912406604','1 bedroom between Mississippi and Williams Ave','Enjoy a newly remodeled and stylish experience at this centrally-located place. This is very cozy and private. 10 minutes from PDX and 5 minutes from Alberta St. This apartment is located in the Boise-Eliot neighborhood 4 blocks from Mississippi St. A very walkable neighborhood with grocery stores, coffee shops and restaurants, shopping and a park 1 block away.','Eclectic and walkable with nationally recognized restaurants','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4c6e3775-71a5-42cd-a1f4-35aab8c57591.jpg',141693638,9,'45.55263','-122.67104',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,105.00,1,28,43,4.93,956544720912406604),(3443,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/957233776998175657','Clean Bright Guest Suite Food Carts Mississippi Av','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. Enjoy what the North Portland historic Mississippi area has to offer! Shop local, dine at popular restaurants, food carts, breweries, pubs and enjoy a show at the Mississippi Studios venue a few blocks away! This space is walking distance to public transportation, hospitals, grocery stores and entertainment. Perfect for a fun weekend!','North Mississippi Ave is a 5 block stretch of trendy shops and unique restaurants and bars located in the Boise neighborhood. North Portland (NoPo) is The Fifth quadrant of the 5 main sections of the City of Portland. The neighborhood is situated just a half mile from the up and coming Williams area, a 5 minute drive from the Alberta Arts District and Pearl District and 10 minutes from downtown with easy access to many transportation opportunities to go to and from.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2c20d613-1aae-4655-9ae3-77069b4f61f7.jpg',127919376,9,'45.55341908102529','-122.67712126106211',1,2,1.00,0.00,2.00,120.00,1,28,50,4.98,957233776998175657),(3444,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/957368130732232173','Peaceful NoPo Haven','Escape the hustle and bustle and immerse yourself in the peaceful ambiance of this inviting 2 bedroom, 2.5-bathroom North Portland haven. This serene escape is designed to offer you a restful getaway while providing all the comforts of home. Whether you are visiting Portland for vacation, work or study, this property has everything you need for your home away from home! <br /><br />***2 additional queen beds available upon request***','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-37913012/original/dc1417b6-2475-47fd-9870-c15a9185a54b.jpg',82507993,60,'45.586243036007005','-122.71537889457291',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,120.00,1,29,37,5.00,957368130732232173),(3445,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/957565663596363579','Breathtaking Views w/ Modern Lux - 2320','Come enjoy your luxurious home away from home! This newly remodeled, modern-lux retreat boasts stunning, panoramic views of the Portland skyline, including clear views of Mt. Hood, Mt. Saint Helen, and Mt. Adams ... all from your balcony. Centrally located, you are just a few minutes drive away from all that Portland has to offer, be it activities (e.g. beach, K1, top-golf, etc.), POIs (e.g. Moda Center, Columbia River, the Japanese/Chinese Gardens, etc.), or nightlife (hot restaurants & bars).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-957565663596363579/original/a854c1b6-ca73-48e3-b538-c792a781f26b.jpeg',531726605,54,'45.50701268699304','-122.68687427281043',1,5,2.00,2.00,5.00,197.00,2,365,31,4.94,957565663596363579),(3446,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/957982295911121191','Modern home w/spacious loft BR in NE Alberta Arts','Welcome to our stylish and modern retreat in the heart of Portland, Oregon. Our place is located conveniently in NE Alberta District close to many bars, restaurants and shops.','This neighborhood is surrounded by plenty of boutiques, art galleries, coffee shops, restaurants and bars. Situated one block from Alberta Street and one block from Killingsworth Street, both of which provide much entertainment! <br /><br />Checkout our guidebook for more info on where to go and what to do!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-957982295911121191/original/986b53fe-85c6-425e-88c3-9858dc6d9b43.jpeg',108772508,29,'45.56244','-122.65011',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,189.00,2,7,9,5.00,957982295911121191),(3447,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958042741495561940','Kenton Cottage','Kick back and relax in this calm, sweet space. Close to University of Portland, parks, and quaint downtown Kenton.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-958042741495561940/original/be69191a-2290-424e-bf8f-45c7f5c4bdd6.jpeg',308999019,55,'45.57908','-122.69561',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,958042741495561940),(3448,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958061190197898697','Modern & Luxurious Boho Getaway','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located newly built 3 bed 3 bath townhouse! ~10 Min to PDX & ~15 min to Downtown! The area is very walkable and is across from a park! Lots of trendy, local shops and dining nearby! 1 well behaved dog weighing 60 pounds or less is allowed!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-958061190197898697/original/116c2be4-de87-4751-8fd5-1cad650780a4.jpeg',32831349,21,'45.56777','-122.61965',1,8,3.50,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,958061190197898697),(3449,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958121097873778733','Sunny in Sellwood','Come stay with us and be charmed by your cheerful Sellwood home. Lovely gardens and lovely people all around. <br />Comfortable queen bedroom with semi private patio and access to the back yard. Well appointed seating area with queen futon. <br />Luxe wet room bathroom with heated floors and handicap accessible shower. <br />Fully appointed kitchen but who needs it with the food carts across the street?! <br />Blocks away from Sellwood Park and Sellwood Riverfront Park (Literally the best dog park in the world!)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-958121097873778733/original/5e0cd23a-33e4-4e38-ab44-1c88502bbf19.jpeg',90355699,20,'45.46667','-122.65299',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,30,90,10,5.00,958121097873778733),(3450,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958161495968728832','Cozy private space on alberta park!','Enjoy a relaxing and zen space on top of Alberta park with your own private entrance, entire floor, and full bathroom just for you. <br /><br />You’ll be just a 10min walk to some of Portland’s best restaurants, bars, and coffee shops. <br /><br />The futon’s mattress is full sized, firm, very comfortable, and comes with linen sheets.<br /><br />You’re also welcome to access the main floor’s living room, kitchen, and huge deck too if you want!','Please be conscious of loud noise for the neighbors sake after 10p.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-958161495968728832/original/164123c3-099f-4d1a-b68d-ac731409ab8e.jpeg',8641229,29,'45.56463','-122.64573',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,1,365,45,4.96,958161495968728832),(3451,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958213856152157461','Japanese suite in dog-friendly SE Victorian','Welcome to my charming historic home nestled in the heart of inner SE Portland! Built in 1906, the former boarding house exudes character and charm, original details and modern comforts.<br /><br />It boasts two kitchens, a TV room, parlor, and a gorgeous formal dining room with standing desk.<br /><br />Both nature lovers and dogs love the location — a huge corner lot across from a park! Mature landscaping (including 6 sequoia!) surrounds the house, giving the interior privacy and a serene ambiance.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-958213856152157461/original/176e8414-bd6b-41be-999a-e938a94c5132.jpeg',5068356,32,'45.51446343983277','-122.64960617675658',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,31,365,1,5.00,958213856152157461),(3452,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958326698629083779','Breathtaking Views w/ Modern Lux - 2330','Come enjoy your luxurious home away from home! This newly remodeled, modern-lux retreat boasts stunning, panoramic views of the Portland skyline, including clear views of Mt. Hood, Mt. Saint Helen, and Mt. Adams ... all from your balcony. Centrally located, you are just a few minutes drive away from all that Portland has to offer, be it activities (e.g. beach, K1, top-golf, etc.), POIs (e.g. Moda Center, Columbia River, the Japanese/Chinese Gardens, etc.), or nightlife (hot restaurants & bars).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-958326698629083779/original/35b6ccb0-b636-4ce2-85b5-2bf029680828.jpeg',531726605,54,'45.50535205189099','-122.6870578083767',1,5,2.00,2.00,5.00,228.00,2,365,31,4.90,958326698629083779),(3453,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958750368664910206','Private room in Overlook','Enjoy this bright, peaceful guest room in our home while you easily explore the local gems Portland has to offer in the quaint and accessible neighborhood of Arbor Lodge/ Overlook. Walk to a handful of coffee shops and Parks, enjoy a local brew at over at Double Mountain down the street or hop on the max for less than 15 mins to get downtown. Feeling chill? Our covered back patio is ideal for a quite night at home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-958750368664910206/original/dbf7c089-f8f7-4a61-850c-a808be089050.jpeg',12802704,13,'45.56547802428813','-122.68932582274407',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,120,0,1.00,958750368664910206),(3454,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/958914862686053197','The Gray Chalet','Smack in the heart of the OHSU campus and shaded by trees and mountainside sits this private pristine retreat. With two cozy as a cloud queen nectar mattresses, smart TV and board games galore our pet friendly retreat will leave you feeling rested and rejuvinated. Walking distance to the OHSU campus, off street parking spaces, a full kitchen and laundry room and a quick drive or bus ride to downtown Portland, the Oregon Zoo, Forest Park and 5 star dining you won\'t want to leave our Gray Chalet.','Homestead is the neighborhood surrounding OHSU campus and nestled in Marquam nature park! It\'s very much a locals only area. In that most people who come up here live here. It\'s very picturesque and covered in trees. The roads are mostly dirt/ gravel! So careful if your car has low profile! It\'s a great place to walk the dog or enjoy a glass of wine on the porch. It\'s quiet with lots of nature around! NOTE: most maps apps have a hard time finding us, we will send you a video link on how to get there!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-958914862686053197/original/5252b100-4669-4fec-a153-29a568fd18e3.jpeg',357891266,30,'45.50192','-122.69208',1,5,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,9,4.89,958914862686053197),(3455,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/960941123120620430','Portland Vacation Rental ~ 5 Mi to Downtown!','Escape to the vibrant city of Portland, Oregon, and enjoy a delightful stay at this 1-bathroom vacation rental studio. Located just a short drive away from attractions such as Washington Park and the Oregon Museum of Science and Industry, this retreat is perfect for exploring the city. Relax on the patio, fire up the gas grill for a delicious BBQ, or take a bike ride along the nearby trails. No matter how you choose to spend your stay, this Portland studio will serve as the perfect home base!','OUTDOOR FUN: Biking, walking trails; Eastmoreland Golf Course (0.9 miles), Sellwood Riverfront Park (1 mile), Elk Rock Island (3 miles), Tryon Creek State Natural Area (6 miles), Mount Talbert Nature Park (7 miles), Powell Butte Nature Park (10 miles), Gabbert Butte (12 miles) <br />LOCAL ATTRACTIONS: Shopping, cafes, restaurants; Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden (2 miles), Oaks Amusement Park (2 miles), USS Blueback Submarine (3 miles), Moda Center (5 miles), North Clackamas Aquatic Park (5 miles), Leach Botanical Garden (6 miles), Washington Park (6 miles), Portland Japanese Garden (7 miles), Oregon Zoo (7 miles), Hoyt Arboretum (7 miles) <br />HISTORY: Milwaukie Museum (3 miles), Oregon Museum of Science and Industry - OMSI (4 miles), Portland Art Museum (5 miles), Oregon History Society (5 miles), World Forestry Center (7 miles) <br />AIRPORT: Portland International Airport (15 miles)','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-960941123120620430/original/a56c5bbe-3443-4cca-a2b1-3c4dd3f7949d.jpeg',121688409,20,'45.46819064310323','-122.64844673564899',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,51.00,30,1125,0,1.00,960941123120620430),(3456,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/961805621796757529','25’ trailer studio w/AC and pool','25-foot long remodeled trailer studio apartment with AC and shared pool. Fully furnished and lots of storage! Sofa turns into second bed.','Beautiful quiet tree-lined street, across from a historic botanical garden.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-961805621796757529/original/5714fd58-400d-4e41-88c9-f13f74bace57.jpeg',657231,77,'45.47176420656024','-122.5332281879432',1,3,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,961805621796757529),(3457,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/962336354960085035','Spacious Corporate Haven','Welcome to our North Portland Corporate Rental - your ideal haven for a productive and comfortable stay! This spacious 4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom gem is thoughtfully designed to cater to the needs of professionals seeking a clean and spacious environment with ample workspaces. Whether you\'re in town for business, a remote work assignment, or a corporate retreat, this property is your perfect solution.<br /><br />*a lease is required for all stays*<br /><br />Video Tour available upon request!','The home is a part of the New Columbia development and is located in the Portsmouth neighborhood. The community has a basketball court, playgrounds, soccer field, a community garden and pocket parks throughout the 82 acre neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-37913012/original/dc1417b6-2475-47fd-9870-c15a9185a54b.jpg',82507993,60,'45.588078443893956','-122.71662147732951',1,8,2.50,4.00,5.00,135.00,30,365,1,5.00,962336354960085035),(3458,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/963166265899727509','Cozy home in heart of Portland','Thanks for considering staying in our home. My partner and I live in this house full time, renting it out when we are away traveling. You will find many personal touches and amenities, and will have access to all! Our home is centrally located in North Portland. Food and great coffee within walking distance, the Max train station only a few blocks away, and downtown Portland within an 8 minute drive.','The neighborhood is very quiet. The immediate neighbors are all very friendly. There is a nice cafe two blocks away called Grindhouse.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-963166265899727509/original/0563fb8b-1509-4f2e-9297-4053225ec21c.jpeg',116576921,51,'45.57112','-122.68834',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,7,365,0,1.00,963166265899727509),(3459,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/963285507942021743','Park Blocks Condo in The Pearl','The Park Blocks Condo sits on a leafy street in Portland\'s Pearl District. The condo\'s balconies look out to a sprawling park, mature shade trees and an exciting neighborhood that stretches on for blocks.<br /><br />Walk to Whole Foods or World Foods grocery stores, a wide selection of cafes and restaurants or just casually stroll along it\'s streets and enjoy classic architecture such as the historic and formidable US Customs Building.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-963285507942021743/original/8da3242b-2e91-4c3b-99c0-0a2bc06bc1eb.jpeg',205079895,2,'45.52509404311631','-122.67910380040922',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,999,3,5.00,963285507942021743),(3460,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/964511911828115052','Deluxe 2 bed 2 bath with AC','Enjoy the true Portland vibe in the upstairs unit of this BEAUTIFULLY and COMPLETELY renovated LUXURY heritage duplex home. Designed to accommodate modern day life.<br /><br />Private entrance through a shared vestibule, Chef\'s kitchen, AC, DW, strong Wi-Fi, front load W/D, California closets in both BR\'s. New 4k smart TV\'s in master bedroom & great room. <br /><br />Perfect sleep on lux king or queen beds. <br /><br />Located in the amazing Alberta Arts / Concordia area. Close to everything. 86 walk & 80 bike score.','We\'re steps away Alberta Arts District and all it has to offer.  Along with its neighboring North Williams and Mississippi Street neighborhoods, you\'ll be staying in a vibrant and diverse area in Portland, Oregon. From its artistic spirit to its culinary delights and welcoming community, you\'ll find yourself immersed in a unique and enriching living experience. Enjoy your time exploring this exciting part of the city!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-964511911828115052/original/6fc4d8bb-2f2f-4f99-bbd6-907f947e100a.jpeg',7718653,14,'45.556455564680526','-122.65488863739661',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,122.00,2,365,54,4.98,964511911828115052),(3461,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/964795565024109995','Tiny Home Haven in Montavilla','Escape to this adorable tiny home among the trees! You’ll have your own patio to enjoy morning coffee on and are only a few blocks away from Montavilla city center where you\'ll find some of the best restaurants, shops and cafes in town. This is the perfect base camp from where to explore Portland and the surrounding area as it is only about a 13 minute drive from the airport and centrally located to most attractions.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-964795565024109995/original/f949f20e-3d10-42c7-a689-cc0fa0b635df.jpg',1337759,10,'45.52885924609834','-122.58005383751711',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,180,25,4.96,964795565024109995),(3462,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/964850040753513916','Charming Apt in NE Portland','Centrally-located apartment in the quiet neighborhood of North Tabor in NE Portland. A 5 min walk to the Max line provides easy access to PDX and downtown. Walk to the coffee shop around the corner or stroll to the restaurants and bars located within a mile of the apartment. The space has new furnishings and is equipped with everything you need for a comfortable stay. <br />Homeowners live in main house above