-table cuisine. International flavors are also abundant, with a mix of ethnic restaurants that cater to a wide range of tastes. For those interested in arts and entertainment, the Buckman neighborhood is a treat. There are theaters, music venues, and performance spaces nearby where you can catch live music, theater productions, comedy shows, and more. One of the standout features of the Buckman neighborhood is its walkability. Being within walking distance to so many amenities means that visitors can easily access grocery stores, parks, fitness centers, and othe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTY3Mzg0Mzk5NTkyODA0NDU2/original/80aa6502-6c4b-426b-ba0c-80c35a1c7ab2.jpeg',534173163,32,'45.5163047','-122.6519507',2,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,503.00,1,28,8,5.00,967384399592804456),(3472,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/967439876932338612','Pip\'s Place','This cozy cottage is tucked into an ideal location just two blocks from Alberta Street. The best of both worlds, it’s a quiet, restful space that is mere minutes by foot to restaurants, galleries, bars and live music venues. You can step out for breakfast, coffee, lunch and dinner, or you can enjoy the small but well-equipped kitchen for home-cooked meals.  Wander down for a soak at the nearby wellness center or let the cottage be your home base for exploring the city and beyond!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4c47011c-943e-4f32-9cee-504f8fbdbd79.jpg',95307476,1,'45.55709966586497','-122.63594657278304',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,14,88,5.00,967439876932338612),(3473,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968035385856579134','Hawthorne Hale','At the Hawthorne Hale we strive to give you a premium boutique hotel-like experience within our uniquely renovated 1906 craftsman home. Located in a neighborhood full of plant life, untouched by high rise buildings, yet centrally nestled between the fun filled streets of Hawthorne and Division. Walking distance to many shops, restaurants, bars, and cafes. Across the street from Sewallcrest Park and a few blocks from Bagdad Theater and Powells Bookstore. Private home - Shared back yard and sauna.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/ef05abcc-fdef-4b11-bc4f-2a23ed826144.jpg',98199385,8,'45.509358848902714','-122.63062863088204',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,475.00,2,365,12,5.00,968035385856579134),(3474,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968040232556866373','#StayInMyDistrict Arbor Lodge The Ainsworth','#Stay in My District Arbor Lodge & Popular Overlook. Just off I-5/I-405 Corridors. Minutes to Downtown, Mississippi, & Alberta Arts Districts, Restaurants, Art & Shopping. Walk, Bike or Ride. Comfy Old Style Home w/Modern upgrades & Wood Floors. Main level has 1 King Bdrm, Bath, Private Work Room, Open Concept Living/Dining Room for 4, Full kitchen, Stainless Steel Appliances. Upstairs Bdrm w/King Bed. Private Fenced Yard w/Covered Patio, BBQ, Fire Pit, Dining Table. FREE Street parking. No Pets','Arbor Lodge neighborhood, Portland, is one of the most popular neighborhoods in Portland. It is full of historic homes, little shops and coffee houses, and the MAX light rail runs right through it. It is located in N Portland and borders Overlook neighborhood to the south, Piedmont to the east, and Kenton to the north. It’s southern border is Willamette Blvd, which has a walking bike path that goes all along the Willamette Overlook. Arbor Lodge Neighborhood is a great place for walking, bike riding and just looking at the view of the city and Mt Hood over the Willamette River and industrial area.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-968040232556866373/original/d10393d5-3b99-4917-b1ad-5e632aa192ee.jpeg',3142393,51,'45.5665696','-122.6857367',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,84.00,1,28,35,4.80,968040232556866373),(3475,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968090629222705357','Portland - WP Studio Deluxe','Large Studio Deluxe condo at a resort condo development in beautiful Portland, OR<br /><br />★ If reserving a FRIDAY OR SATURDAY there is a 2 night mi