hared space, Ultra-high speed fiber internet. washer and dryer unit.<br />Area has parks, restaurants, and downtown St Johns, Farmers Market, Trails, Boating, Disc Golf, Wildlife Sanctuary all nearby. <br />12 min commute to Pdx. Fifteen minute commute to Vancouver. Short distance to highways and bus line.','St Johns','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-968380651569439343/original/059b3a60-8ff9-4cbe-ac65-d3a9d479ac3b.jpeg',528153813,58,'45.59499','-122.73368',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,30,90,6,4.50,968380651569439343),(3479,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968397916814310248','Sellwood Private Retreat','Sellwood Gem, if you have never visited this neighborhood please do. This retreat is close enough to all the action yet far enough to enjoy your coffee overlooking the neighborhood in peace. Tons of heart went into this place. Built as an owner retreat. Full kitchen, Chef faucet and deep sink with butcher block and quartz tops. Coffee shop, restaurants, and convince store at the corner. Blocks to the river and part of the 40 mile loop trail is within blocks for runners/bikers. Pet free unit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-968397916814310248/original/f2b15076-7b25-4dd9-bf5e-93288de4a1ed.jpeg',528153813,20,'45.45975652684277','-122.64557098635417',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,73.00,30,90,4,5.00,968397916814310248),(3480,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968437315071728054','Bright and Fun Modern Vibe, 4 Blocks 2 Alberta','\'The Fish\' is a spectacularly done studio style retreat with a fun and fresh vibe in the heart of northeast Portland just moments away from the Alberta Arts District.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-968437315071728054/original/1c2dda63-7213-42cb-949a-db759f2635a6.jpeg',62261998,29,'45.56327202143666','-122.65317293603042',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,71.00,2,29,12,4.92,968437315071728054),(3481,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968742014925537030','Northwest Nob Hill!  Free Parking! Walk to it all!','Large 970 sq ft first floor one bedroom in Northwest Portland, just 2 blocks from 23rd Ave. It features a bedroom with king bed, fully equipped kitchen, island, microwave and dishwasher, dining area with table and chairs, cozy living room with sleeper sofa, flat screen TV, fireplace, air conditioning, internet and a desk for your computer. Quaint open floor plan with French doors that lead out onto your own patio. Free street parking.  Nob Hill, Alphabet District, Walk score 97<br /><br />Located Alphabet','The unit is located on a quiet dead end street with lots of street parking plus a path at end of street for direct access to Thurman where the coffee shops, bakeries and boutiques begin.   <br /><br />The unit is in a prime, highly desirable location close to it all! It\'s just a few blocks from NW 23rd Avenue (near Thurman) featuring retail boutiques, home design shops both local and well-known, restaurants, bakeries, breweries, coffee shops, antiques, galleries, parks and hiking trails (just blocks from Forest Park) )... just about everything for an enjoyable visit to Portland! It is very close to public transit and the street car for quick access to the Pearl District (also within walking distance), Willamette River and Downtown, making this a great place to stay whether for work or fun!   <br /><br />Parking is on the street and pretty easy as it is located on a quiet, dead-end street. We provide free parking on the street for one car.  If you have an extra car please let us know as','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-968742014925537030/original/2916978c-ff90-47ba-a3d0-8e61bcaa1930.jpeg',45609473,27,'45.5362908','-122.7013965',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,134.00,2,28,19,5.00,968742014925537030),(3482,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968759063348468915','Northwest Nob Hill! Updated Spacious Home!','Victorian home in prime NW Portland, close to 23rd Ave!  Main floor has two bedrooms w/tv\'s, bathroom, living room w/sleeper sofa, formal dining room,  gourmet kitchen with French doors to deck. Upstairs master bedroom suite with king bed, TV, bathroom claw foot tub plus shower, washer/dryer and French doors leading onto balcony. Driveway parking included. No parties allowed. Studio apt. and garage for housekeeping and supplies underneath with separate outside entrance.','The house is located on a quiet dead end street with lots of street parking plus a path at end of street for direct access to Thurman where the coffee shops, bakeries and boutiques begin. <br /><br />The house is in a prime, highly desirable location close to it all! It\'s just a few blocks from NW 23rd Avenue (near Thurman) featuring retail boutiques, home design shops both local and well-known, restaurants, bakeries, breweries, coffee shops, antiques, galleries, parks and hiking trails (just blocks from Forest Park) )...  just about everything for an enjoyable visit to Portland! It is very close to public transit and the street car for quick access to the Pearl District (also within walking distance), Willamette River and Downtown, making this a great place to stay whether for work or fun! <br /><br />Walk score 97.  Located Alphabet District, Nob Hill.  NW 23rd Ave 5 minute walk (lots of shops and restaurants), Streetcar on NW 23rd ave 12 minute walk, OHSU 8 minute drive, Legacy Hosp','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-968759063348468915/original/ae5b2002-944b-4708-91a9-5eadf2d793a1.jpeg',45609473,27,'45.536362','-122.701559',1,7,2.00,3.00,4.00,267.00,2,28,19,4.95,968759063348468915),(3483,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968955759201440812','Sunstone Suite - 202','Welcome to our charming 2-bedroom loft suite nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland\'s Inner East Side! With an unbeatable location and a perfect blend of modern comfort and urban style, this loft is the ideal base for your Portland adventure.<br /><br />Important Information for Your Stay<br /><br />VioletSuitesPDX is an unhosted boutique hotel. It is vital that guests review the check-in instructions prior to arrival to ensure a smooth and enjoyable stay.','Situated within walking distance to numerous well-regarded restaurants, performance venues, and activities, the Buckman neighborhood is a hub of cultural and culinary experiences. The Buckman neighborhood\'s proximity to a variety of well-regarded restaurants makes it a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll find a diverse range of dining options, from trendy cafes serving artisanal coffee and pastries to upscale eateries offering farm-to-table cuisine. International flavors are also abundant, with a mix of ethnic restaurants that cater to a wide range of tastes. For those interested in arts and entertainment, the Buckman neighborhood is a treat. There are theaters, music venues, and performance spaces nearby where you can catch live music, theater productions, comedy shows, and more. One of the standout features of the Buckman neighborhood is its walkability. Being within walking distance to so many amenities means that visitors can easily access grocery stores, parks, fitness centers, and othe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-968955759201440812/original/c40b0e1c-c982-4e51-885b-1e9b31e040c9.jpeg',534173163,32,'45.5163047','-122.6519507',2,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,319.00,1,365,8,5.00,968955759201440812),(3484,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968957740832247538','Chinook Suite - 203','Welcome to our charming 2-bedroom loft suite nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland\'s Inner East Side! With an unbeatable location and a perfect blend of modern comfort and urban style, this loft is the ideal base for your Portland adventure.<br /><br />Important Information for Your Stay<br /><br />VioletSuitesPDX is an unhosted boutique hotel. It is vital that guests review the check-in instructions prior to arrival to ensure a smooth and enjoyable stay.','Situated within walking distance to numerous well-regarded restaurants, performance venues, and activities, the Buckman neighborhood is a hub of cultural and culinary experiences. The Buckman neighborhood\'s proximity to a variety of well-regarded restaurants makes it a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll find a diverse range of dining options, from trendy cafes serving artisanal coffee and pastries to upscale eateries offering farm-to-table cuisine. International flavors are also abundant, with a mix of ethnic restaurants that cater to a wide range of tastes. For those interested in arts and entertainment, the Buckman neighborhood is a treat. There are theaters, music venues, and performance spaces nearby where you can catch live music, theater productions, comedy shows, and more. One of the standout features of the Buckman neighborhood is its walkability. Being within walking distance to so many amenities means that visitors can easily access grocery stores, parks, fitness centers, and othe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTY4OTU3NzQwODMyMjQ3NTM4/original/49650e80-4fed-4f99-8d3e-93427188f9ad.jpeg',534173163,32,'45.5163047','-122.6519507',2,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,319.00,1,28,17,4.94,968957740832247538),(3485,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/968960713848236432','Hazelnut Suite - 204','Welcome to our charming studio loft suite nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland\'s Inner East Side! With an unbeatable location and a perfect blend of modern comfort and urban style, this loft is the ideal base for your Portland adventure.<br /><br />Important Information for Your Stay<br /><br />VioletSuitesPDX is an unhosted boutique hotel. It is vital that guests review the check-in instructions prior to arrival to ensure a smooth and enjoyable stay.','Situated within walking distance to numerous well-regarded restaurants, performance venues, and activities, the Buckman neighborhood is a hub of cultural and culinary experiences. The Buckman neighborhood\'s proximity to a variety of well-regarded restaurants makes it a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll find a diverse range of dining options, from trendy cafes serving artisanal coffee and pastries to upscale eateries offering farm-to-table cuisine. International flavors are also abundant, with a mix of ethnic restaurants that cater to a wide range of tastes. For those interested in arts and entertainment, the Buckman neighborhood is a treat. There are theaters, music venues, and performance spaces nearby where you can catch live music, theater productions, comedy shows, and more. One of the standout features of the Buckman neighborhood is its walkability. Being within walking distance to so many amenities means that visitors can easily access grocery stores, parks, fitness centers, and othe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-968960713848236432/original/a3f66284-e510-4b28-9739-cd2825e2dd5d.jpeg',534173163,32,'45.5163047','-122.6519507',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,212.00,1,28,5,5.00,968960713848236432),(3486,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/969042011644657376','Luxurious Urban Retreat! Free garage parking!','This downtown city loft provides a prime location, breathtaking views, and convenient access to all the best that the city has to offer. The proximity leads to an array of fabulous dining and trendy cafes. The loft is surrounded by boutique stores and high-end shopping malls. Find numerous theaters, cinemas, and live music venues in the area.  Whether you are a foodie, a shopaholic, or a culture enthusiast, this loft is the perfect base for you to explore and experience the bustling city life','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-969042011644657376/original/3ea48390-98ae-42be-a65c-a5e6b411bc4b.jpeg',439103919,2,'45.5269042','-122.6795883',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,90.00,2,28,47,4.94,969042011644657376),(3487,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/969409372250574952','Wonderful Alberta Townhome w/ Patio and Garden','This wonderful 2015 townhome known as the South Alberta Retreat is bright and comfortable. The main floor opens onto deck with a few steps down to the garden. Located on a quiet residential street in Northeast Portland, it is an easy walk to neighborhood parks, restaurants and shops. Downtown Portland is a short drive or bike ride away. You will find countless upgrades and enhancements throughout.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-969409372250574952/original/b1783b21-d171-44cf-a489-f73d1a9f3571.jpeg',62261998,14,'45.55008','-122.65827',1,4,3.00,2.00,2.00,137.00,2,29,13,5.00,969409372250574952),(3488,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/971092511345161024','Hawthorne Bungalow','Come enjoy this stylish, peaceful and centrally-located Hawthorne bungalow! Extremely walkable: steps to Hawthorne Blvd shops, restaurants & theaters and also walkable to Division, Belmont and Clinton, and next to Tri Met bus lines. The location can\'t be beat!<br />The French country kitchen is stocked with pots, pans, utensils, and anything you need to cook a great meal. The garage operates as a separate office space, and the backyard includes chairs and a hammock for relaxing.','Extremely walkable: steps to Hawthorne Blvd shops, restaurants & theaters and also walkable to Division, Belmont and Clinton, and next to Tri Met bus lines.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-971092511345161024/original/1fba6d9f-10ef-4993-9b34-262a3877b179.jpeg',320949994,8,'45.51166117804823','-122.62811773982959',1,5,1.00,3.00,3.00,135.00,60,364,1,5.00,971092511345161024),(3489,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/971673863552654417','City Forest Retreat','Close to city...but not too close. Relax in the comfort of a fully renovated \"rear windows\" apartment, overlooking towering cedars and Douglas firs. Birdwatching, urban hiking and easy access in all directions. Close to highest viewpoint in Portland.  Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. During colder months, enjoy remote controlled gas fireplace while you read or binge watch your favorite shows in the living room.','Neighborhood is quiet with a forest like setting.  Shops and restaurants on NW 23rd Ave  are 1.5 miles away and the Rose Garden and Japanese Garden are a little over 1 mile away.  Downtown Portland is also less than 2 miles away.  Forest hiking trails are within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-971673863552654417/original/5ad00f79-b357-482d-847a-c2665231eb68.jpeg',28015540,54,'45.5056956517736','-122.71096674762889',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,122.00,2,28,56,5.00,971673863552654417),(3490,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/973148273721602085','3 bd/2bath Perfect location!','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a3750a3c-2e41-4a3a-8e3e-d59d99182df4.jpg',18590525,8,'45.51112047706101','-122.63295771711725',1,6,2.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,7,4.71,973148273721602085),(3491,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/973901027085186302','Airy Basement Apartment','Newly remodeled and comfy/cute one bedroom apartment that doesn\'t feel or look like a basement apartment. This beautifully remodeled and fully furnished basement apartment is a refreshing, welcoming space that feels like a fun holiday home. A wide open floor plan leads from the spacious living room through to the dining area, and surprise! A gorgeous, brand spanking new kitchenette with lots of counter space, custom tile, and a two burner cooktop. Large bedroom, and cute bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-973901027085186302/original/04a01320-e3d8-488b-9abc-f859a3e6cf2b.jpeg',17083437,48,'45.57901685349763','-122.67220258857397',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,64.00,31,365,0,1.00,973901027085186302),(3492,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/974108770045896073','Cute Room w/ Pool on the Roof','My room is on the 12th floor with a view East; tranquil city-watching and on a clear day a view of Mt. Hood<br />The building has wonderful amenities, the best of which is the view of the sunset from the roof on the 17 floor where there is also a small pool, several bbq grills & private fire pits.<br />From the apartment a short walk can be taken on the Burnside Bridge to a ramp that walks down to the Willamette River.<br />Blocks away from the best food in town, walking and public transportation are each easy','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-974108770045896073/original/1f66599f-9607-41f2-a6df-133eeef11643.jpeg',445417507,32,'45.5226453','-122.6623776',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,135.00,30,365,2,5.00,974108770045896073),(3493,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/974257294889296131','My Little Jewel Box','Welcome to my little jewel box!<br />A recent top to bottom refresh keeping all the timeless charm and period details with the fusion of modern luxury, accentuated by sophisticated and playful decor.','Located in one of Portland\'s most popular neighborhoods this property lies between The Pearl District to the north, Slabtown to the West, Goose Hollow to the south and downtown to the southeast.  Plenty of dining and shopping options as well as easy access to the street car and Max.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-974257294889296131/original/fe0329ae-44fc-44e7-a1f1-a3af45b48864.jpeg',299702617,27,'45.5232268','-122.6870496',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,30,90,1,5.00,974257294889296131),(3494,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/974752450689840263','Charming Historical PDX Colonial','Live like a Portlandia in this spacious Historic Colonial home. Built in 1907–classic yet modern inside.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/716ccb9d-e01f-4eb2-aaa7-b6ed5eda4e37.jpg',408641058,4,'45.53167029999999','-122.6464413',1,8,3.50,3.00,4.00,265.00,30,180,32,4.84,974752450689840263),(3495,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/975442305072551533','The Owl Room - Upstairs Room in a Hillsdale','Enjoy this newly remodeled, comfortable bedroom upstairs in a charming Cape Cod style house in Southwest Portland (Hillsdale).  <br />10 minutes from Downtown Portland and the bustling Inner East Portland and 5 minutes from the popular Multnomah Village.  <br />This is a great spot to chill and/or work away from the office (or home).<br /><br />We\'ve put a lot of working into making this room and home as inviting and comfortable as possible.  We hope that you enjoy it and feel the love that we put into it for you.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-975442305072551533/original/5034b97a-74e5-4923-ae74-f475759c071f.jpeg',153132135,31,'45.47926534793807','-122.69961852670515',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,39.00,1,365,40,4.65,975442305072551533),(3496,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/975800646823202883','Charming Roseway House','Bring the whole family to this home with lots of room for fun. The entire house and large, fenced backyard are yours for the stay. Laundry in unit. Perfect for longer stays. 8-min to airport. Two standing desks. Start your morning with a cup of coffee on the private deck and relax in the fully fenced backyard next to the fire pit in the evening.','Quiet neighborhood with easy access to lots of indoor and outdoor activities. Just a 5-min drive to Rocky Butte, one of the best viewpoints in Portland. 10-min walk to The Grotto, featuring a beautiful display of Christmas lights in the wintertime. Walking distance to Safeway and close to other grocery stores, restaurants, coffee shops, bars, and Pip’s doughnuts (one of the most popular doughnut spots in Portland). Easy access to both the city center and for driving out of the city. 15-min drive to Sandy River and Sandy River Delta (aka Thousand Acres dog park – a huge off-leash dog park with river access). The Columbia Gorge, Mt. Hood (a skiing paradise), and Oregon’s wine country are less than an hour drive away. Oregon’s beautiful coast is a 90-min drive away.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-975800646823202883/original/21364d43-4959-455f-87b1-75348659a711.jpeg',127445547,39,'45.54893067266575','-122.58171658962965',1,5,2.00,3.00,4.00,100.00,30,180,1,5.00,975800646823202883),(3497,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/976889855332538771','Modern Apartment','Enjoy easy access to the bustling Alberta Arts, North Williams, and North Mississippi Districts from our modern daylight basement apartment. Tucked into a quiet neighborhood just a few blocks away from the action, you\'ll appreciate the contemporary yet comfortable feel of the space. We are committed to making your stay as enjoyable as possible and will do whatever it takes to earn your five-star review. NO CLEANING FEE!!!!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-976889855332538771/original/f3833ee8-fd06-455d-8a77-9caa2e6e0528.jpeg',130967908,14,'45.553029617519464','-122.66109406668701',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,105.00,1,28,185,4.98,976889855332538771),(3498,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/977636435342317633','Always Sunny Magnificent Manor','Discover charm and luxury in this beautifully remodeled 1904 Colonial Foursquare. Located in Southeast Portland\'s vibrant Buckman neighborhood,  4 bed, 4 bath home blends historic elegance with modern comfort. Enjoy spacious living, exquisite period details, and contemporary amenities. Perfectly situated for exploring Portland, with easy access to attractions, restaurants, and grocery stores. Whether for business or leisure, experience the best of old and new Portland in this centrally located.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-977636435342317633/original/f2ec3603-6561-4ac5-a099-736131e7fab3.jpeg',1213257,32,'45.51773','-122.6485',2,1,2.00,2.00,1.00,65.00,30,365,0,1.00,977636435342317633),(3499,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/977855333525415738','Rustic home in Multnomah village, Portland','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. The house has everythig you need for your stay in Portland. Shops and restaurants are a half mile away. It is located in a quiet neighborhood with a small town feeling and it is yet a short bus ride or car drive from downtown. It’s a nice place to stay and work from home or take a deserved rest after work. Trees and nature surrounding you will make you feel like you are on a vacation! Come and experience by yourself!','This house is close to I-5  and downtown in the desirable Multnomah village area of Southwest Portland. You will be close also to Willamette valley wine county, the ocean and Columbia gorge with the beautiful waterfalls!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-977855333525415738/original/4f175369-289f-45c8-a33a-6e4db378d47f.jpeg',9377224,18,'45.46399','-122.70683',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,30,180,4,5.00,977855333525415738),(3500,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/978577475168686072','Historic Stephens House #1','Fireplace, quartz countertops, italian oven and gas range, california king bed, glass enclosed shower and 12 Foot Ceilings! This Historic Home was built by one of Oregons most prominent and earliest pioneers.  Experience the charm and elegance of a bygone era. As a guest, you will not only be transported back in time but thrust you into Portland\'s rich history. This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.','The Stephens House in Southeast Portland offers a convenient and comfortable stay for travelers. Located in the historic Stephens Addition neighborhood and across from Ladd\'s, the Stephens House is close to many happening attractions such as the Hawthorne District, downtown Portland, and the Oregon Convention Center. The house itself is spacious and beautifully furnished, with a fully equipped kitchen, laundry facilities, and free WiFi. The hosts are also known for their excellent hospitality and attention to detail, ensuring that guests have a pleasant and stress-free stay. Overall, The Stephens House is a great option for travelers looking for a convenient and cozy home away from home in Southeast Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-978577475168686072/original/c8cb227d-20ed-4cec-8a78-3b2790d696ab.jpeg',95203243,25,'45.50965','-122.65401',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,98.00,2,27,13,5.00,978577475168686072),(3501,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/978887542628794026','Petite Palazzo VlLLA  ~ Small+Stylish Villa','★ INCLUDES OATMEAL BREAKFAST, TEA & STARBUCKS COFFEE<br />★ ENTIRE SPACE is PRIVATE, BATH TOO! ★ KOI POND ★ FIBER OPTIC WIFI<br /><br />★AC  ★LUXURIOUS STEARNS & FOSTER MATTRESS<br /><br />★ PRIVATE OUTDOOR ENTRANCE with LOCKBOX - ARRIVE ANYTIME!<br /><br />★ REFRIGERATOR, MICROWAVE, TOASTER, MR COFFEE MAKER, KETTLE + MORE!<br /><br />★ KOI POND & TROPICAL GARDENS<br /><br />★ RAIN HEAD NATURAL STONE SHOWER','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTc4ODg3NTQyNjI4Nzk0MDI2/original/ed0094b8-2f1f-4fc2-a56b-dcde92468a69.jpeg',4884977,52,'45.52358','-122.59482',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,62.00,1,28,69,4.86,978887542628794026),(3502,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/978906954246756391','1928 Craftsman! 87 Walkscore! Food Carts, Grocery','Our sprawling and unique 1928 home has room for everyone. Quick walk to Mosaic Taphouse, Leisure, Bahn Mi Up, Fixin\' To, Mcmenamin\'s, Sparrow Bakery, St Johns Beer Porch, and Grocery Outlet. We\'ve worked hard to create a unique and comfy stay for our guests, you\'ll love the antique furniture and the modern conveniences! Notably, our home has been featured in 3 films! Good dogs  allowed!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/51022141-9160-49ef-ae55-9b1bc9a8f03a.jpg',3508484,58,'45.59139','-122.7473',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,165.00,3,89,14,5.00,978906954246756391),(3503,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/978983600664347803','Oak Street Retreat','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-978983600664347803/original/6f2d3861-29e1-4c11-b2d6-7892a38571ac.jpeg',146445726,32,'45.5198683','-122.6458589',2,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,250.00,30,365,0,1.00,978983600664347803),(3504,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/980549321160587970','Super charming, fully restored 1894 Victorian','This house was taken down to the studs and put back together with all its original charm.  Great location in inner SE Portland, two blocks from bars, pubs, bottle shops, restaurants, cafes and public transportation (bus and light rail).  Short walk to Tillicum bridge (no cars), which takes you across the river to the OHSU tram stop.  Private, landscaped outdoor patio with fire pit and gas BBQ.','Edge of residential area in very old part of Portland.  2 blocks from bakery, cafes, bars, pubs, etc.  Easy access to OHSU tram via Tillicum pedestrian bridge, couple blocks from Max (light rail), bus.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-980549321160587970/original/1fa3edb4-fbaf-42d1-a092-3cf0d50066c1.jpeg',74481791,25,'45.5032','-122.65228',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,140.00,30,365,1,5.00,980549321160587970),(3505,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/980724230458451699','Craftsman Style Home','Located in the Mississippi and Alberta Arts District. The whole group will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place.  House is off I-5, ten minutes to downtown Portland, 15 minutes to airport and several restaurants within a 10 minute walk.','Mississippi and Alberta Arts District','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-980724230458451699/original/56e171f9-b00f-4992-b732-db9694a8aaf7.jpeg',151457231,24,'45.5601','-122.67704',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,187.00,30,365,6,4.33,980724230458451699),(3506,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/981118808708297933','The Betty - A Pet Friendly 1920s Vintage Bungalow','Welcome to our delightful 1920s Bungalow, situated in the heart of SE Portland, just steps away from the iconic Revolution Hall. Our beautiful (and pet-friendly!) three-bedroom one-bath home also features a fully-fenced yard, a very relaxing sun room with a hammock, two parking spots, and a dog park across the street.<br /><br />This cozy abode offers not only a comfortable stay but also an opportunity to immerse yourself in the vibrant culture and charm of one of Portland\'s most dynamic neighborhoods.','What truly sets this space apart is its prime location. The Buckman neighborhood, where our Bungalow is nestled, is a hub of creative energy and culinary delights. Just steps from your front door, you\'ll find Revolution Hall, a renowned venue for live music and events, offering an unforgettable cultural experience.<br /><br />When it\'s time to explore, you\'ll be spoiled for choice with a plethora of top-notch restaurants and bars at your fingertips, reflecting the culinary diversity that Portland is known for. Whether you\'re a foodie, a craft beer enthusiast, or simply eager to savor the local flavors, this neighborhood has it all.<br /><br />The Buckman area is also rich in history and artistic spirit, and you can take leisurely strolls to discover colorful murals, boutique shops, and a vibrant arts scene. For a taste of the great outdoors, head to the nearby Laurelhurst Park, a beautiful green oasis perfect for picnics, leisurely walks, or simply enjoying the serene atmosphere.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-981118808708297933/original/0f6cbc77-a3e7-4f37-a5b3-288111c3aa68.jpeg',1782525,32,'45.51765555084311','-122.65301946866215',1,5,1.00,3.00,3.00,178.00,2,30,51,4.78,981118808708297933),(3507,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/981307394211319494','spacious beautiful home','A spacious beautiful home, that is welcoming and very clean and neat. With great air-conditioning and fireplace. Four bedrooms with 4 beds. Very close to lots of Shopping Centers, as well as close to the freeway..<br /> Garage not included ￼','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-981307394211319494/original/21c7584f-77fe-4960-85b6-414424dccdaa.jpeg',182137080,63,'45.512814','-122.5524091',1,11,2.00,4.00,4.00,350.00,30,365,13,4.23,981307394211319494),(3508,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/982596981779167077','Urban Oasis in the Heart of the Pearl District','Welcome to our cozy Airbnb in the heart of Portland\'s Pearl District! <br /><br />Our stylish condo is centrally located, making it the perfect base for your Portland adventure or a home base for our travel workers.','Situated in the trendy Pearl District, you\'ll be steps away from some of the city\'s best restaurants, cafes, and bars.<br /><br />- Need groceries? There\'s a well-stocked grocery store just around the corner.<br /><br />- Craft beer enthusiast? You\'re in luck! Some of Portland\'s famous breweries are within walking distance.<br /><br />- Explore the city\'s attractions easily, as you\'re close to public transportation hubs and iconic landmarks.<br /><br />- Don\'t miss out on the delicious dining options in the Pearl District. Our guidebook has some recommendations!<br /><br />- Take a stroll along the Willamette River or visit nearby parks for some outdoor fun.<br /><br />- Explore the vibrant arts scene with galleries and theaters nearby.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-982596981779167077/original/1bf348de-d149-45ee-a6cc-85419c69a061.jpeg',123106801,2,'45.52613505720129','-122.68025642846163',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,91.00,31,365,3,5.00,982596981779167077),(3509,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/983278640222145228','Portland Modern','Welcome to our Midcentury Modern – a true masterpiece inspired by the iconic Frank Lloyd Wright. Nestled on a lush 1/3 acre private retreat, this architectural gem is just minutes away from Multnomah Village and Gabriel Park. Immerse yourself in the timeless beauty of this completely renovated mid-mod marvel, where high vaulted open beamed wood ceilings adorn every room on the main floor. This house is perfect for friend groups, families or corporate retreats. Note: 4 bedroom, 2 bath, 2 kitchen.','Known for its charming vibe, residential Multnomah Village has plentiful sidewalk cafes, bakeries and bookstores, and offers casual dining options like taverns, cozy American restaurants and traditional Italian eateries. In sprawling Gabriel Park, there are sports fields, indoor pool and hot tub, a large skatepark and picnic areas. Stores selling women’s fashions, rustic home decor and antiques cluster around Southwest Capitol Highway.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-983278640222145228/original/fe2f3de6-21c5-4c79-8305-1ee73a06651d.jpeg',52327539,18,'45.46341','-122.7222',1,5,2.00,2.00,5.00,272.00,2,1125,70,4.97,983278640222145228),(3510,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984043712273390826','Peaceful Inner Southeast Studio.','Enjoy a peaceful stay in inner SouthEast Portland - walking distance to lots of shops, bars, good restaurants and coffee! Ask your host about booking an in house bodywork session to round out your relaxing stay with us.','Charming neighborhood and nice neighbors.  We are on the bike path, reducing car traffic making it quieter and nicer. Makes it easy, and fun to get around and explore. Close to several cool spots we personally enjoy and like to recommend. I have a pdx 101 list I send guests when they book , maps in the studio and personal recommendations I can make based on your interests when visiting. Cheers!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-984043712273390826/original/97b6e66a-0012-4ae6-8393-8119f1a4e19f.jpeg',537908933,32,'45.522375','-122.649791',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,99.00,1,365,60,4.85,984043712273390826),(3511,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984099718263107224','Spacious Division Convenient','Are you looking for a place for your family to enjoy Oregon? This is your place.<br /><br />The house is perfectly designed for a getaway with family or a big group of friends. 6 beds that can comfortably sleep 12.  Two balconies off of the bedrooms to enjoy fresh air.<br />Conveniently located only 9 miles from the Portland International Airport.  10 miles from Downtown Portland. 25 miles away from the famous Multnomah Falls.<br /><br />5 minutes walking to multiple restaurants, coffee shops, and grocery stores.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-984099718263107224/original/60b46ad8-7af2-40fe-8d01-8139dcf08084.jpeg',84376678,90,'45.5044562','-122.532025',1,12,2.50,4.00,6.00,180.00,31,365,15,4.80,984099718263107224),(3512,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984132150082389448','Green Suites of Dreams','Enjoy a comfortable Green Certified home with bamboo floors, gas fireplace, and central AC in NE Portland\'s Beaumont-Wilshire Neighborhood. Cook in the well-equipped kitchen with gas range, dishwasher and granite counters. Work remotely from the quiet dedicated workspace. Both bedrooms are suites. From the main level suite step out and relax into the backyard with quaint patio and gas BBQ. Conveniently located near Alberta Street, Fremont & 42nd, New Seasons and Legacy Emanuel Medical Center.','Bordered by the Alameda, Concordia, Cully, Rose City Park, and Grant Park neighborhoods, the Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood of Portland, Oregon is located in the city\'s northeast section, on Alameda Ridge with views of Downtown, the Willamette River, and the Cascades. \"Beaumont Village\", located on NE Fremont Street, from NE 33rd Ave. to NE 50th Ave., is the main commercial district in the neighborhood, but the neighborhood also lies within walking distance of the Hollywood District, to the south and Alberta Arts District to the northwest.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-984132150082389448/original/5df822c1-eb6a-42d2-9e54-326db14bf007.jpeg',158074447,46,'45.55729','-122.62407',1,4,2.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,31,90,3,5.00,984132150082389448),(3513,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984163163924885758','Two Bedrooms available now!','Lovely place and very quiet!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-984163163924885758/original/1ef90e32-e890-4200-96ea-d3f1290f5524.jpeg',90138486,87,'45.5026719','-122.4926704',2,2,0.00,2.00,2.00,50.00,30,90,1,5.00,984163163924885758),(3514,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984167458407555619','Ivon Street Dual Suite Rowhome','Enjoy a comfortable stay in this newly built, dual suite condo in Inner SE Portland. Located just a block south of iconic Division St, within walking distance to Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. Easy access to public transportation (¼ mile walk). Hardwoods throughout, stainless steel appliances, central AC, and radiant floor heat in the bathrooms, this home has everything you need for an enjoyable stay. Only 3 miles from OHSU, Legacy Emanuel or Providence Portland Medical Ctr.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-984167458407555619/original/da734034-6aaf-4f46-8588-b21cd00b86f8.jpeg',158074447,25,'45.50388','-122.65116',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,123.00,31,365,3,5.00,984167458407555619),(3515,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984274338904473188','Benji and Friends','Welcome to Benji and Friends! Go enjoy all of Portland during the day and relax and recharge here at night. Located on the main level, this private room is as comfortable as it gets. Rest up in the Tuft & Needle Mint king bed with lots of pillows. There’s ample storage with a dresser, luggage rack, and closet. Get some work done at the desk or enjoy some down time using the 43-inch TV or Alexa speaker. Feeling peckish? Grab a free snack in the mini fridge! Love dogs? You’re in luck–we have 3!','There’s a ton nearby including bars, coffee shops, restaurants, and a food truck pod. Vegan donuts, amazing pizza, killer burgers, and more! There’s a Whole Foods seven blocks away, a Trader Joe\'s another three, and a gym three blocks up!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-984274338904473188/original/c3bddef6-db5c-45dc-943c-7f14e65adfed.jpeg',36400059,11,'45.53846273385286','-122.6112401085755',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,1,14,76,4.96,984274338904473188),(3516,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984287915670628558','Play&Work in Southwest Portland','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place. Close to hospitals, highways, and shopping.<br />Perfect for anyone looking to work for several months or looking for their perfect home in the Portland area.<br />This home has everything you need -- full-size kitchen, washer dryer, private garage and a bonus room','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-984287915670628558/original/8880f095-8bec-4892-8c91-3332728f660e.jpg',9075051,22,'45.488699340781416','-122.67844119685586',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,65.00,31,1125,3,5.00,984287915670628558),(3517,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984339351067450587','Fremont Cottage','Fremont Cottage is set on a quiet, leafy street in NE Portland. Inside the cottage you\'ll find a cozy space with room to spread out and relax. This home is perfect for two people who want easy access to NE Portland, points beyond, and a peaceful place to call home. <br />A 0.6 mile walk will take you to NE Fremont St where you can explore   shops, cafes, restaurants & bars. <br />The backyard, deck & front porch are perfect place to enjoy the Pacific Northwest\'s fresh air.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-984339351067450587/original/03371c70-bf6f-4313-9fc1-7e95c29c60c2.jpeg',205079895,21,'45.55213579689565','-122.60897610762471',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,3,5.00,984339351067450587),(3518,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/984883280822097312','Private Garden PDX','This peaceful, quiet and cozy two-room suite (1 BR + LR)  offers privacy, comfort and great neighborhood convenience. Very kid-friendly and dog-friendly. A bit tight for 3 adults. Outdoor seating for two. Easy street parking. There is no kitchenette but cheerful cafes are just around the corner, including Keeper Coffee, Cafe Rowan, a brew pub, Trader Joe’s and more. Quirky space: HVAC system and water heater are located in the suite. For a separate fee, we will walk your dog.','Friendly, easygoing, middle class neighborhood at the junction of three smaller neighborhoods within Portland: Woodstock, Creston-Kenilworth and Reed. We provide a detailed description of local walks and dog parks. It\'s just a 20 minute walk to Reed Lake natural area, Creston off-leash dog park or Woodstock Village. This is an unusual combination of being extremely convenient to restaurants and stores, yet still quiet and relaxed. It is very walkable! It has character. Hundred year old bungalows mixed with modern apartment buildings.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-984883280822097312/original/bb9d6a93-1a26-4c6b-b042-b6141e09d057.jpeg',531116583,38,'45.4897655','-122.6220881',1,3,1.00,1.00,4.00,89.00,1,28,125,4.82,984883280822097312),(3519,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/985516440770760904','Noble Old Geezer squatting in Slabtown','Built in 1896,  my partner Martha and I have owned this Victorian home for 33 years.   We are located directly in the heart of Slabtown, within walking distance of many local restaurants, bars,  shops and bustling NW 23rd Avenue . Working together as a restoration team, general contractor and artist;  we have revitalized this property so our guests can enjoy this unique gem.  This home is a true historic residential survivor in this new thriving neighborhood.  <br />Thanks very much,  Paul','We are located centrally in Slabtown directly across the street from New Seasons grocery, Breakside Brewing around the corner and Please Louise Pizzeria down the street.   Wallace Park and the branch library are 4-6 blocks away.   NW 21st and NW 23rd are two thriving avenues within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-985516440770760904/original/5d641515-91ca-422c-8bbc-f2e54eb62598.jpeg',538252368,27,'45.533374','-122.695876',1,4,1.00,2.00,4.00,190.00,2,14,43,5.00,985516440770760904),(3520,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/985601699670354370','Garden view 2BR in great location','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-985601699670354370/original/12e3de24-0f68-494a-89ae-60801b3ded81.jpeg',112452733,86,'45.4590414754308','-122.70588421974294',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,145.00,2,1125,2,5.00,985601699670354370),(3521,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/987738194847784693','Heart of the Pearl. South Facing Studio.','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located brand new apartment building with Big City Views!  The location is off the charts.  Walkable to grocery stores, shopping and a bounty of cafe and restaurants. Very safe and vibrant core Pearl District address.','DOCK 59 is located in the center of the Pearl District, on the corner of Johnson Street and 13th Avenue. Officially designated as a historic district in 1986, the neighborhood has a dynamic and colorful history. Portland was an active port city and railroad hub for the West Coast at the end of the 19th century, doubling in population after the 1905 Lewis and Clark Exposition. As a result of the city\'s explosive growth, 13th Avenue developed as a thriving warehouse and distribution center. Now, a century later, 13th Avenue still retains its unique charm and industrial aesthetic. Recognizable today for its distinctive loading docks that line the street, it\'s a vibrant, bustling area for locals to walk, shop and enjoy the numerous restaurants and cafes. In addition, these city blocks host the First Thursday Street Gallery every month closing off the area to traffic as the streets transform into a sparkling art gallery.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-987738194847784693/original/1ae20b26-3df6-4174-af19-32f30eb5752c.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52946','-122.68417',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,31,365,2,4.50,987738194847784693),(3522,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/987855691022078561','The Happy House','You\'ll be close to everything staying in this centrally-located mid-century home in the heart of Woodstock. <br /><br />This wonderfully walkable spot is just 2 blocks from the park, with play areas for kids, adults, and dogs, and 3 blocks from shops and restaurants. <br /><br />Enjoy coffee on the front porch or a meal on the warmly lit covered patio. <br /><br />Make yourself at home in this quiet, private home. equipped with everything you\'ll need - from entertainment for all ages to quiet work and relaxation spaces.','Centrally located in the heart of Woodstock, just 2 blocks from our spacious, tree-filled park with playgrounds, off-leash dog park, tennis and basketball courts, baseball and soccer fields. Also just 3 blocks from shops and favorite restaurants Toast, Laughing Planet, Grand Central Bakery, Double Mountain, Cloud City Ice Cream, Delta Cafe, Otto\'s and The Heist, a fabulous 20-cart pod. Woodstock also offers great Thai, Japanese, pizza, and multiple cafes, bars and pubs. <br /><br />Also in walking distance are New Seasons Market with gorgeous rooftop bar, Trader Joe\'s, and Safeway grocery stores, wonderful Woodstock library, hair and nail salons, a UPS store, and multiple bus lines.<br /><br />The Woodstock Farmer\'s Market is 3 blocks away, open June-October. Eastmoreland public golf course, open all year, is a five-minute drive. Mt. Scott Community Center is 1.5 miles away, with indoor lap and play pools (+slide, current pool, hot tub), vintage roller rink, basketball courts, fitness ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-987855691022078561/original/0b65062e-8966-4097-89bb-d5281f678ad8.jpeg',76259815,38,'45.48301','-122.61612',1,6,1.00,0.00,6.00,112.00,30,180,1,5.00,987855691022078561),(3523,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/988346770685329049','Cozy basement room','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful oasis.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-988346770685329049/original/ac04fbd0-f1b0-403a-9a33-8950188f9077.jpeg',5460298,15,'45.506308628613134','-122.60607978248524',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,31,1,5.00,988346770685329049),(3524,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/988608946014273382','Family & pet friendly, 5BR, sleeps 12','Welcome to PDX Retreat, your ideal home away from home in Portland! This modern 5-bed, 2-bath property is perfect for families or groups seeking a comfortable and memorable stay. Enjoy our prime location less than ten minutes from PDX Airport and close to Portland\'s many attractions.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-988608946014273382/original/d527d495-be4c-406b-9dfb-5eaadfd7d9ad.jpeg',34601684,21,'45.557265360582676','-122.58893943048265',1,12,2.00,5.00,8.00,322.00,30,365,7,5.00,988608946014273382),(3525,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/988652358260268989','Newer Built Fopo Gem, Close to Everything!','Our newly built bright and modern guest house is fully equipped with all the modern amenities you need to relax and recharge after a day of adventuring in the city.<br /> It  is located in the popular FoPo (Foster-Powell) district and is the perfect location for exploring Portland.  <br />Heaps of local coffee shops, bakeries, food carts, bars and breweries are just minutes of walks away. Also easy access to local parks, shopping districts.<br />We would love to host you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-988652358260268989/original/e543b7f3-60c9-475f-9a0e-b6d772217d43.jpeg',23545520,65,'45.48656714719636','-122.59599647019853',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,91.00,1,365,58,4.88,988652358260268989),(3526,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/988668925024574141','The White Room','Bold colors + unique houseplants grace all the corners of my home. You\'ll be staying with me + my two adorable (and sometimes wild) mini Aussie pups. Being a dog lover is a must if you\'d like to stay here - as well as being okay with occasional barking + doggo kisses. The kitchen is stocked, common spaces clean and fun, and I can be great conversation - or quiet. I value direct communication and your comfort during your stay is very important to me. I work out of the house 11am - 5pm, M-Th.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-988668925024574141/original/a48109dd-90a2-4066-af8e-b9ba0bb1095d.jpeg',13526464,10,'45.52310251516244','-122.57272434749022',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,1,365,5,5.00,988668925024574141),(3527,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/989071216670299123','OHSU 1Bed Huge deck Pets love it! (04A)','Welcome to our delightful fully furnished one-bedroom apartment nestled on Marquam Hill, conveniently located near OHSU. Whether you\'re a medical professional seeking temporary accommodation or a visitor looking for a comfortable stay close to medical facilities, this apartment is tailored to meet your needs.','The OHSU neighborhood is a vibrant and dynamic area in Portland, Oregon. It\'s characterized by a mix of modern amenities and natural beauty. With its proximity to OHSU, it often has a healthcare and academic atmosphere. The neighborhood boasts stunning views of the city and the surrounding landscape due to its elevated position. It\'s known for its safe environment, making it conducive for walking and jogging. Access to public transportation, like Trimet bus #8, provides easy connections to the rest of the city. Additionally, there are charming restaurants, convenient stores, and welcoming spaces that make this neighborhood a comfortable and enjoyable place to live or visit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-989071216670299123/original/fbaa538a-78f3-4b4a-83c9-bf77ba5c7cc7.jpeg',410009654,30,'45.49642','-122.69208',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,1125,1,5.00,989071216670299123),(3528,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/990581500754669978','The Secret Garden','Keep it simple at this restful yet centrally-located getaway. While close to the bustling Hawthorn district, and a short walk from Mt. Tabor, this place provides all the comforts that home away from home could include.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTkwNTgxNTAwNzU0NjY5OTc4/original/c3fad90e-22f2-4448-bd50-4ff4a4628b19.jpeg',539403040,15,'45.51385','-122.60967',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,1,1125,66,4.95,990581500754669978),(3529,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/990639087033549945','Carriage House Condo in NW PDX','Historic carriage house condo close to everything. Tucked away in quiet, peaceful, charming Nob Hill just blocks from vibrant NW 23rd, endless dining, shopping, entertainment options, public transport, and Forest Park trails. <br /><br />- Exposed brick, high ceilings, big windows, wood floors, gas fireplace, gas range<br />- Modern kitchen & bathroom<br />- Large bedroom w/ designated office space & walk-in closet<br />- Private patio, ground level entry & direct access to laundry <br />- Off-street parking','Nob Hill is 5 minutes from downtown Portland. Its main commercial area stretches for 17 blocks along NW 23rd Avenue (between NW Thurman and W Burnside St).<br /><br />NW 23rd Ave is full of character, with many restaurants, bars, cafes, and shopping boutiques along a pedestrian friendly, leafy street. The surrounding neighborhood is full of beautiful 19th century Victorian/Edwardian mansions, and vintage 1920s apartment buildings.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-990639087033549945/original/5af01b63-099e-4f80-8d6f-3f9f318a7ddb.jpeg',68571913,27,'45.5302343','-122.7041247',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,30,365,4,4.75,990639087033549945),(3530,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/991377971675951867','Art Deco Oasis: Den, Office, Garden','Welcome to our spacious home in the heart of Portland\'s charming St. Johns neighborhood, where Art Deco design meets modern comfort. With vintage-inspired décor, thoughtful details, and a blend of historic elegance, this large home offers a truly unique and enchanting retreat.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-991377971675951867/original/e8467930-d720-4e0d-9743-90e04e467c6c.jpeg',221421926,58,'45.58983','-122.74907',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,120.00,2,1125,12,4.67,991377971675951867),(3531,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/992301859440741547','Forest Sanctuary in Portland','Welcome to your forest retreat! Nestled amidst the serene beauty of nature, this completely renovated home combines modern design with the tranquility of the woods. Boasting  2,800 sq f (260 sq m), 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, it offers ample space for a comfortable stay. Enjoy the city of Portland from the comfort of your own forest sanctuary.','Quiet neighborhood nestled among Portland hills. The neighborhood offers views of the Willamette River and Mt. Hood along with heavily wooded areas surrounding. <br /><br />A close drive to OHSU, Lewis and Clark, and Willamette Waterfront Park, our neighborhood is centrally located to easily access all areas of Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-992301859440741547/original/35cd96e4-878a-4008-be63-98d32607556e.jpeg',56928924,28,'45.466993191825786','-122.67516712214835',1,5,2.50,3.00,3.00,168.00,60,180,0,1.00,992301859440741547),(3532,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/992709540375836743','Modern condo in North Tabor','Peaceful and centrally-located!  Plenty of onsite parking, very close to highway 84, close to two grocery stores and Laurelhurst and Mt. Tabor Park.  <br /><br />The property has recently been renovated, with mini split heating and cooling, brand new appliances and furniture.<br /><br />Whether you\'re in town for a short-term work assignment or a fun-filled vacation, this property provides everything you need for a comfortable stay. Don\'t hesitate to book your stay now and experience the best Portland offers!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-992709540375836743/original/43f95662-4d13-4148-8841-16d8e5e6a9de.jpeg',281637273,52,'45.523943163324155','-122.60477647776804',1,3,1.50,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,330,2,5.00,992709540375836743),(3533,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/992773814986483743','Beautiful Portland Gem Minutes from Mt. Tabor','Welcome to Downstairs at 76th, a newly remodeled basement flat in a beautiful 1970s craftsman bungalow. Large windows usher an abundance of natural light into this unique, design-forward space. Step outside to explore Montavilla—an eclectic neighborhood with artisan cafes, a local theater, and a year-round farmers market—or immerse yourself in nature at nearby Mt. Tabor. A blend of charm and convenience, you\'re close to the best of PDX yet nestled in a cozy neighborhood. Welcome home!','Discover Montavilla, a charismatic neighborhood that flawlessly fuses the city\'s rich history with a contemporary feel. Wander through its streets to find beautiful 20th-century architecture interspersed with trendy cafes and boutiques, or take a hike on Mt. Tabor with trailheads just minutes away.<br /><br />The region is renowned for its indie Academy Theater and the bustling Montavilla Farmers Market, offering the finest local produce. Wine bars, craft breweries, and eclectic eateries invite you to savor Portland\'s culinary prowess. You must check out Yaowarat, a new Thai-Chinese restaurant just opened blocks away on Stark Street by famous Portland chef, Akkapong Earl Ninsom. And don’t miss the captivating murals and art installations that underscore the area\'s creative spirit.<br /><br />With its strategic proximity to downtown and just fifteen minutes from the airport, Montavilla offers the best of Portland: vibrant culture, convenience, and neighborhood warmth. Dive deep into the','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTkyNzczODE0OTg2NDgzNzQz/original/d697f11a-32ca-4aff-aa99-010ffc1b1728.jpeg',23120473,15,'45.50953','-122.5854',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,1,365,51,4.90,992773814986483743),(3534,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/992949858004557003','Modern studio heart of The Pearl','Kick back and relax in this sun filled fully furnished studio where comfort meets style in the heart of Portland. Perfectly designed for solo professionals and travelers or two people seeking an adorable furnished apartment. Situated in the vibrant heart of the Pearl District, Dock 59 offers easy access to all the best attractions, restaurants and cafes the city has to offer.<br /><br />The  kitchen is perfect for preparing meals at home from the grocery store two blocks away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-966731493012568759/original/5a50b2a3-1018-4259-b0d0-f3f26fbc0eb3.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52798387945975','-122.68507129213833',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,31,365,2,5.00,992949858004557003),(3535,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/993640877809319950','Ebony Room at Hayhurst Manor','This stylish place is perfect for couples or people looking for a staycation or, travel stop. <br /><br />There is a writing desk, a chair in the bedroom, and good wifi capable of handling video calls. <br /><br />The living room and kitchenette are fully stocked to cook and eat at home.  <br /><br />The house is near a main bus line that will take you to several restaurants and grocery stores within five minutes, downtown in 30 minutes, and OHSU within 25 minutes.  There is also parking if you have a car.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-993640877809319950/original/b0cfa7c2-0f70-435c-82e6-e0d57bdb34d6.jpeg',29156235,17,'45.48568','-122.72545',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,38.00,1,90,9,4.78,993640877809319950),(3536,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/994292533218406554','Walkable Basement Guest Suite','Studio basement apartment in a beautiful, old Portland neighborhood. Within walking distance of parks, restaurants, and public transportation, and only a short bus ride away from downtown and multiple local business hotspots like the Beaumont neighborhood, the Hollywood district, and Alberta street. Only a 10 minute drive to/from the airport!','Our house is 2 blocks from bus line 24 (goes towards Mississippi St and Vancouver/Williams St which both have quite a lot of food and shopping places), 3 blocks from line 71 (towards Mt Tabor and close-ish to Hawthorne street - another food/shopping area), and 4 blocks from line 12. The 12 takes you into downtown in about 20 minutes and has a stop within a couple of blocks to the Hollywood Transit center which gives you access to the red, green, and blue MAX lines.<br /><br />Our walk/transit/bike scores, for reference:<br />- 77 Walk Score (Very Walkable) <br />Most errands can be accomplished on foot.<br />- 40 Transit Score (Some Transit)<br />A few nearby public transportation options.<br />- 95 Bike Score (Biker’s Paradise)<br />Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike.<br /><br />Our street is pretty quiet, we have some of Portland’s infamous narrow streets, which limits a lot of fast car traffic. We have a lot of neighborhood families walking with their babies and pets. We lo','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-994292533218406554/original/6d5cdc63-6ed6-43b7-85de-834bf783dd37.jpeg',196930510,39,'45.5507','-122.59791',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,37.00,30,180,5,4.20,994292533218406554),(3537,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/994374745361485342','Million dollar views condo','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place! 1 bed/1 bath condo in the heart of NW Portland. Take a stroll to the famous NW 23rd Ave in Portland, or take public transportation to any of the nearby neighborhoods.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-994374745361485342/original/bd0b4ee4-dcdb-49fb-81db-5c2c08fb05ab.jpeg',20684802,79,'45.524497698362005','-122.70243668953223',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,1,5.00,994374745361485342),(3538,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/994473318337328068','Frankie\'s Place; vintage luxury Craftsman retreat!','Welcome to Frankie\'s Place, the chic, cozy, walkable Northwest Craftsman you\'ve always wanted.  A plush and comfy space with style, free parking, fast WiFi, a great location and tons of amenities, you\'ll relish your convenient urban getaway.  Featuring comfy beds, linens and amenities, you\'ll be close to all Portland has to offer, yet tucked away when it\'s time to relax.  No elaborate check out instructions and unbeatable location, amenities and comfort!','Located in the Richmond neighborhood, a coveted spot in Inner Southeast Portland close to all the action.  Salt and Straw, Stumptown Coffee, Hawthorne shops and eateries.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9345506c-fada-4b2b-977d-979389c86b74.jpg',23227876,8,'45.5011','-122.62066',1,6,3.00,2.00,3.00,189.00,1,365,23,4.87,994473318337328068),(3539,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/994990150833930882','Irvington Garden Suite','Enjoy a stylish experience in our apartment suite in the center of Portland\'s historic Irvington neighborhood. This spacious apartment suite has been completely renovated and designed to accommodate world travelers and visitors. Classic, modern, and comfortable with all the features needed for a relaxed stay. A private and secure entry opens up to a lush patio area with water feature. Walk or bike to a multitude of coffee shops, restaurants, shopping and entertainment venues.','The Irvington neighborhood is located in the Northeast section of Portland, Oregon. The neighborhood traces its history to the William and Elizabeth Irving Donation Land Claim of 1851 as well as several small adjoining subdivisions. The neighborhood streets were laid out in 1887, and residential lots began selling in 1891.<br />An early example of a streetcar suburb, Irvington contains the largest, most diverse, and intact collections of Queen Anne, Arts and Crafts, and Colonial Revival style residences in the City of Portland as well as the State of Oregon. In 2010, Irvington was designated an historic district and added to the National Register of Historic Places.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTk0OTkwMTUwODMzOTMwODgy/original/5536b420-ef95-4374-8cc3-5e41dc2acd10.jpeg',540374904,7,'45.5406932','-122.6517649',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,125.00,3,30,24,5.00,994990150833930882),(3540,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/995029431118894021','Close In NE Portland Studio','Enjoy easy access to everything from this close in NE Portland studio apartment. This 2nd story apartment in a 1880 victorian home is newly renovated with new everything! <br />It is short walk to the Oregon Convention Center, Moda Center, Emanuel Hospital, and more.  Near the Max, buses, and street car. Centrally located, you\'ll also be a walk/short drive to Williams Ave, Mississippi Ave, NE Alberta St., and downtown Portland. PDX Airport is a 20 minute drive.  There is street parking available.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-995029431118894021/original/4c3736ff-304c-4355-b1d2-b451874c099d.jpeg',22827926,26,'45.540359613278056','-122.66420809658493',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,87.00,1,365,81,4.93,995029431118894021),(3541,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/995126496012556008','Cozy Oasis - 5BD Craftsman Home - Arcade','Experience Portland in this spacious 5-bedroom, 2-bathroom home with a charming porch offering Southwest waterfront views. Ideally located, you\'re minutes from top eateries, breweries, and boutique shops, plus iconic attractions like Mount Tabor Park, Portland Waterfront Park, and Oregon Museum.<br /><br />Start your mornings with coffee on the porch, relax with friends, and explore the city’s highlights. This family-friendly retreat blends comfort and convenience for an unforgettable Portland getaway.','Although this neighborhood is conveniently situated near the city center, it offers a secure and sheltered environment, free from homelessness concerns. The area boasts numerous charming century-old homes, making it an ideal location for leisurely strolls and exploration.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-995126496012556008/original/5f235b4f-c595-4097-8dfd-ab8768e6cb29.jpeg',392859086,22,'45.496311999999996','-122.67550224232788',1,10,2.00,5.00,6.00,204.00,1,365,68,4.84,995126496012556008),(3542,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/995304495062249613','Modern Overlook Guest Suite','Perfect location to explore PDX, located in the heart of Overlook neighborhood in North Portland. Close to Max Light Rail (yellow), walking distance to great restaurants and bars, coffee shops, grocery stores, and some of the best parks in Portland. The neighborhood is a great mix of residential and commercial and is very walkable - there’s even a great bar and restaurant right across the street.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-995304495062249613/original/8d08f6bb-f75d-49a6-8697-9e8ef5582282.jpeg',18930985,13,'45.5621931721026','-122.68778822811899',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,82.00,2,183,70,4.97,995304495062249613),(3543,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/995344686289615364','Centric Room in Goose Hollow','Private bedroom with shared kitchen/living room right at the heart of downtown.<br /><br />Digital nomad friendly with fiber internt, usb-c(2 monitors/keybaords/mouse). <br /><br />Walk to the providence park to cheer for your favorite soccer team or to Portland art museum and PSU.  Right next to Washington park/rose garden/japanese garden/zoo. Furthermore, the MAX station can connect you to other portland suburbs. Zipcar/Free2move for car rental.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-995344686289615364/original/539a7fcd-f721-4b1a-8f7f-3023b52aca5e.jpeg',27645822,3,'45.51668410109616','-122.69097112721413',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,2,30,22,4.82,995344686289615364),(3544,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/996343834072385168','Classic Country Style Home','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. Conveniently located in the St John\'s neighborhood, minutes from restaurants, entertainment, Cathedral Park, and University of Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-996343834072385168/original/673f4607-8c27-41c3-89b7-876835a30be1.jpeg',147133852,58,'45.59325','-122.74194',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,279.00,30,365,0,1.00,996343834072385168),(3545,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/996382563947841589','Peaceful, Spacious North Portland Bungalow','Cozy spacious home with lovely period details,wood floors and gorgeous natural light.2 large upstairs bedrooms with comfortable beds,main floor office with a third queen bed,2 full baths,well-equipped kitchen,a formal dining room,cozy nicely styled livingroom with library,front yard deck under two mature dogwood trees with outdoor chairs perfect for morning coffee. Please note that  the backyard is not available for use.Owner lives on site in a separate studio at the back of the property.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-996382563947841589/original/6ef73f73-bcc8-4bd0-99e7-70d771d6a4ee.jpeg',5728075,57,'45.57707498258768','-122.71039981299633',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,203.00,2,14,19,4.79,996382563947841589),(3546,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/996430199712251762','Entire house with gated yard!','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. Enjoy this Newly renovated cozy home with a unique ambiance with touch of designer home feel!!! <br />Brand new kitchen!! Brand new , flooring and designer walls, including designer ceilings!!! <br />THIS IS ONE OF A KIND HOME!!! <br />Located in a great family, friendly <br />neighborhood of concordia !!! Walking distance to Alberta district many other restaurants ,cafes and parks! <br />It’s perfect for someone that works from home !!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-996430199712251762/original/06e60a80-ddb5-4f79-b214-c22cd0e80971.jpeg',120784744,1,'45.57220756224642','-122.63746105884948',1,3,1.50,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,365,1,5.00,996430199712251762),(3547,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/996592151655691500','The Perfect Nob Hill Craftsman ~ 99 WalkScore','You will not find a better situated home in Portland. Right in the heart of Portland\'s NW 23rd District, you will find yourself able to easily walk to many desirable locations.','Within 3 blocks <br />-Countless delicious restaurants <br />-Starbucks / local coffee shops<br />-Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw<br />-Portland street car<br />- A variety of bars/night life<br /><br />A short walk to <br />- Providence Park (home of the Timbers)<br />- MAX (local light rail throughout town/airport transfer)<br />-Forrest Park (largest urban park in america)<br />-Grocery / convenience stores','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-996592151655691500/original/d8525f98-43e8-4477-8513-f177d1846f93.jpeg',330048235,27,'45.52542540905673','-122.6981365298368',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,163.00,30,1125,0,1.00,996592151655691500),(3548,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/997842491911394829','Privacy and Parking.','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-997842491911394829/original/b265c137-3bf3-45ed-81fe-64477a1a5908.jpeg',516724220,44,'45.50788448385291','-122.67298572102337',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,107.00,30,365,0,1.00,997842491911394829),(3549,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/998526319006717916','Sweet Beech St Retreat','Warm up on chilly Portland nights in our cozy hot tub and enjoy the wonderful Beaumont Village neighborhood with ease! Our newly finished apartment with your own separate entrance and free parking includes full bedroom with king size bed, deep soaking tub, washer/dryer, kitchenette and a queen sized pull-out sofa. Just one block away from the many shops, restaurants, and cafes on Fremont St, and an easy walk/bus/bike/carshare ride to explore other neighborhoods.','One of the most beloved neighborhoods in Portland, Beaumont Village boasts dozens of restaurants, bars, coffee shops, and unique stores.  You\'ll be staying just a block away from everything you might need while you\'re here!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/13c3bb75-9e44-4a37-affe-e408cbe3f7a0.jpg',2918874,46,'45.55050415671671','-122.61740656997628',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,2,31,16,4.75,998526319006717916),(3550,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/998622425722470713','A queer little craftsmen','Room in a quiet work-from-home house with great access to grocery stores, bus lines, and public parks. Feel free to use our hot tub, backyard fit pit area, and office space as you need. Want sushi or pho? It\'s right next door and delicious!<br /><br />Views from the room look out over our lush backyard. Perfect for someone who needs to sleep near nature without being in the woods!<br /><br />This is a shared home but we\'re welcome to answer questions about how your stay will feel. Dogs welcome.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-998622425722470713/original/e0018369-473b-4584-82c9-67c116929221.png',12612277,6,'45.54897857823915','-122.64880179664934',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,44.00,30,365,0,1.00,998622425722470713),(3551,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/998874941320111854','Bright and modern 2bd/2.5ba- close to Alberta st!','Come and stay with us at Vega! Spacious, sleek and modern, Vega is the perfect Portland getaway for any group. With a walk score of 82, you\'ll be just 5 blocks from the world-famous Alberta Arts District, one of Portland\'s hottest destinations. Plus, you\'ll be right around the corner from amazing locally owned shops, pubs, eateries & galleries. This quiet home offers the perfect spot to unwind after enjoying all Portland has to offer!','You\'re so close to the action at this house, which sits just a few blocks from the Alberta Arts District, with some of the city\'s most heralded restaurants, cafes, shops and bars, such as:<br /><br />-- Petite Provence<br />-- Gumba<br />-- Hat Yai<br />-- Pine State Biscuits<br />-- Wilder<br />-- Bollywood Theater<br />-- Bamboo Sushi<br />-- Salt & Straw<br />-- Tin Shed<br />-- The Waffle Window<br />-- Podnah\'s BBQ<br />-- ... and too many more to list!<br /><br />LOCAL DESTINATIONS:<br />------------------------------------<br />- 2.0 Blocks to Killingsworth St<br />- 5.0 blocks from Alberta Arts District<br />- 5.0 miles to downtown<br />- 7.0 miles to Portland International Airport<br />- 28 miles to Multnomah Falls<br />- 74 miles to Mount Hood<br />- 82 miles to Oregon coast (Seaside)\"','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-998874941320111854/original/967e4e28-e559-4325-a2dd-d4f2a71aa311.jpeg',500856872,29,'45.5658536','-122.6487761',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,353.00,30,365,44,5.00,998874941320111854),(3552,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/999273678789048919','Cozy guesthouse','Stylish and private garden guesthouse nestled in the backyard of our home. Close to Woodlawn park, restaurants, bars and farmers market.','Woodlawn is a cute neighborhood that houses Woodlawn park, Woodlawn farmers market, restaurants and bars. Very easy access to the airport, but still quiet and quaint. The whole city is pretty easy to access from Woodlawn either by car, transit or, bicycle.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-999273678789048919/original/0988d7ca-3565-4770-a7e5-0ccc5e4cf522.jpeg',86370223,45,'45.57403','-122.65881',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,1,14,64,4.95,999273678789048919),(3553,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/999305306050472647','Eclectic 5 BR House in Trendy Hawthorne+Division','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. This historic home (built in 1938) takes its place among SE\'s many photogenic charmers. Inside this worldly four-bedroom home you\'ll find period details like rich hardwoods and sunny windows combined with a minimalist, serene design for pure relaxation. When you\'re good and zen, head out to explore Division / Hawthorne \"foodie row\" with some of the best restaurants in PDX at your doorstep','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-999305306050472647/original/8d541b3c-8416-4f01-9a75-4f7d70fb2c57.jpeg',309565441,8,'45.50471896970194','-122.62195020418378',1,12,1.00,5.00,6.00,151.00,1,730,64,4.80,999305306050472647),(3554,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1000814547576538131','Roomy 1BR w/ patio, 205 access!','Fully furnished, spacious ground floor 1br/1ba unit of a duplex in trendy Montavilla neighborhood. Great proximity to I-205 (literally a minute drive) w/ downtown just 15 minutes away. Walkable to Montavilla park, super easy access to grocery stores, and a short drive to one of Portland\'s best parks, Mt. Tabor Park.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1000814547576538131/original/c7730b44-1828-4958-819a-191c8f7b95f3.png',36297855,10,'45.52706','-122.56917',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,30,365,3,5.00,1000814547576538131),(3555,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1000826855572177238','Roomy 2BR w/ patio, 205 access!','Fully furnished, spacious top floor 2br/1ba unit of a duplex in trendy Montavilla neighborhood. Great proximity to I-205 (literally a minute drive) w/ downtown just 15 minutes away. Walkable to Montavilla park, super easy access to grocery stores, and a short drive to one of Portland\'s best parks, Mt. Tabor.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1000814547576538131/original/c7730b44-1828-4958-819a-191c8f7b95f3.png',36297855,10,'45.525993460717345','-122.56952743138395',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,365,4,5.00,1000826855572177238),(3556,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1001052889641317898','Basement Apartment','Welcome to Casita de Rose City, our charming 1-bedroom, 1-bath basement apartment in beautiful Portland, Oregon! Our cozy and funky space is the perfect home away from home, offering amenities you need for a comfortable stay.','Our apartment is conveniently located near some of Portland\'s most popular destinations:<br /><br />University of Portland: Just a short drive away, making it an ideal choice for visiting students, faculty, or sports enthusiasts.<br />Portland Community College: Close proximity for those attending classes or conferences.<br />Legacy Emanuel Hospital: Easy access for medical professionals or visitors.<br />Peninsula Park: A lovely park to enjoy a peaceful stroll or a picnic.<br />Historic Mississippi Neighborhood: Explore this vibrant area filled with unique shops, restaurants, and entertainment options, all within walking distance.<br />Convenience:','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1001052889641317898/original/63a8901b-b84b-4943-b3bd-1160257effab.jpeg',23048400,48,'45.5708','-122.67102',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,7,19,4.95,1001052889641317898),(3557,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1001528499266006678','Magnificent finishes and views!','A rare opportunity to get to stay in Portland\'s most coveted view neighborhood, full of multi-million dollar homes, and under 200 feet away from the house with the highest listing price in all of Portland (at $9mil). This is an every surface touched renovation in 2023, utilizing Italian tile, Oregon black walnut,  rare mid-century modern furniture pieces and decades old original works of art. We renovated this space in the vision of the finest boutique hotels we have stayed at throughout Europe.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1001528499266006678/original/3e49ca0e-b421-4874-ab02-1de8cbf2f38c.jpeg',11299964,54,'45.51037','-122.68867',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,163.00,2,28,21,4.95,1001528499266006678),(3558,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1001627335081881662','Family + Pet-friendly, sleeps 16','Host a large gathering of family or friends, 8 minutes from the airport. More photos of the downstairs to come!','Quiet and friendly neighborhood','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-988608946014273382/original/e4fee4aa-6bb6-4541-a060-dfcde9c7fde1.jpeg',34601684,21,'45.55722','-122.58898',1,16,3.00,6.00,12.00,430.00,30,365,3,5.00,1001627335081881662),(3559,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1001708523709356253','Oval Office Suite (NEW! VIEWS! HIP! Close In!)','Keep Portland Quirky!! A cheerful and charismatic abode awaits you in one of Portland’s best neighborhoods. An absolutely one of a kind property with old school charm and modern amenities. Enjoy the penthouse suite of this historic home!! Relax by the cozy fireplace or read a book in the cute “oval office” room. Enjoy the luxurious kitchen and bath. Take in the view of downtown Portland from the spacious deck. Bright, light and colorful. Portland how it used to be!! Fun, unique, artsy, safe!!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/770180fe-a26b-4aed-8c88-92aa36ba58a0.jpg',1602024,38,'45.48986175887841','-122.61869778801739',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,194.00,30,365,2,5.00,1001708523709356253),(3560,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1002175747617278142','Luxury in The Pearl','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1002175747617278142/original/ce1d3626-59de-4c04-b9b0-3d48c164e321.jpeg',22299166,2,'45.53377893881703','-122.68057910013233',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,30,365,4,5.00,1002175747617278142),(3561,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1002492024592966675','Cozy urban Living on the River.','Comfortable urban living on the river. Steps from a natural wetland refuge and a walking/biking path. Walk to shopping and restaurants. A 10 minute drive to downtown Portland and 15 minute walk to the lower OHSU medical complex and iconic tram. <br />This newly remodeled and fully furnished extended stay rental has 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a full kitchen. New flooring throughout. The second bedroom is set up to be used as either an office or second bedroom. <br />Two reserved off street parking spots.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAwMjQ5MjAyNDU5Mjk2NjY3NQ%3D%3D/original/65c2b20d-b281-41cf-8b74-efbdc5f0e023.jpeg',391563994,22,'45.4874465','-122.674371',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,300,2,5.00,1002492024592966675),(3562,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1003066133694324177','Spacious digs in wonderful Montavilla, Portland','Welcome to your home away from home in the charming and historic Montavilla neighborhood of Portland! Quietly cool and community-oriented, Montavilla is a self-contained Portland oasis, featuring standout restaurants, cute independent shops and cafe\'s, craft-cocktail and beer bars, artisan bakeries, funky vintage shops, and the lively Montavilla Farmers Market. You\'ll never want to leave!','This apartment is located in a beautiful home in a residential area less than 1 mile from charming downtown Montavilla.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAwMzA2NjEzMzY5NDMyNDE3Nw%3D%3D/original/08d01af6-a872-4bac-933d-7c5a07004d47.jpeg',161782239,10,'45.50888100469333','-122.57329163320803',1,4,1.00,1.00,3.00,85.00,3,1125,9,5.00,1003066133694324177),(3563,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1003773179923030629','Impeccable Single Level Home, Pet Friendly, Fully','Nestled away in the heart of the Northeast Portland this single level Wygant Way retreat is loaded with charm and amenities.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-100377317