ric homes with Mt. Tabor\'s tree-covered slopes at your back, you\'ll get views of Mt. Hood and Mt. Saint Helens on walks throughout the neighborhood. We love that it\'s quaint and quiet, close to nature, but also just steps from shops, restaurants, and more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1005128844041297630/original/9fefe246-85bc-4ca9-9e41-6a66adb22c58.jpeg',30699962,15,'45.519032409291555','-122.58834710909231',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,110.00,2,27,16,5.00,1005128844041297630),(3567,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1005288596527472363','FoPo Craftsman','Bring your whole family and enjoy this charming renovated 1911 PDX home in the trendy Foster Powell neighborhood! Close to food trucks, groceries and lots of restaurants/bars. The house is about 20 min from downtown. <br /><br />The home includes  a fully stocked kitchen, a dining room for 6 and the living room with a large sectional. The backyard is available for guests with a gazebo and lounge furniture.','Great safe neighborhood with tons of food trucks, restaurants, bars, coffee shops and parks!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/29f437d7-c313-4dd7-a7b6-b04fdba2da3d.jpg',11493470,36,'45.48782373860765','-122.58756423453885',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,250.00,2,365,10,4.90,1005288596527472363),(3568,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1005879503517963785','Hazelwood getaway in NE PDX #3','Welcome to my Portland home!<br /><br />My name is Jake and I live with my dog (Peaches) and cat (Barnaby) in the Hazelwood neighborhood of NE Portland.<br /><br />Master bedroom with shared bath,  super comfy Cali King bed, and a 75 in TV!<br /><br />15 min drive to downtown 15 min drive to the airport. Very close to MAX light rail (closest station 3 blocks away) and a golf course with an amazing brewery.<br /><br />Perfect place to call home for a month+ while you settle in Portland :) <br /><br />Very quiet neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-588293421871372350/original/6f08059f-41b1-4321-b5c8-71fcd5ff6100.jpeg',426284483,63,'45.52524','-122.51752',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,35.00,30,365,3,4.67,1005879503517963785),(3569,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1006595988054094192','La Casa del Abuelo','Find your perfect Portland retreat in this newly-built guesthouse with contemporary style and deluxe amenities. Ground floor is ADA accessible. Great, central location.  Easy access to downtown. Within blocks of some of Portland’s top restaurants, shops, and cafes. <br />Unwind with rain showerheads, decompress with Xfinity cable, and slip away under Egyptian cotton sheets. Whether you need rest & relaxation, or a convenient location for your Portland adventures, you’ll find the best of both worlds.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAwNjU5NTk4ODA1NDA5NDE5Mg%3D%3D/original/ce3f2695-8bdc-428a-9e37-ebdf1228a8a2.jpeg',208901740,32,'45.51546319390009','-122.64233063703774',1,4,2.00,1.00,2.00,122.00,2,365,41,5.00,1006595988054094192),(3570,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1006823034177451494','Spacious private whole guest house in NE Portland!','Stylish and comfortable separate apartment in a house in Woodlawn neighborhood has own entrance, kitchen, bath and bedroom. Digital lock allows anytime arrival. Over 800 sqft.<br /><br />Easily accessible via public transit or car. Plentiful street parking. 2.5m to PDX, 4m to downtown, close to I-5.<br /><br />Comfortably appointed and well stocked. Great pillows. Big 4K TV. High speed WiFi. <br /><br />Friendly owner accepting of all!','Close to brews, food, park, market, and more!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1006823034177451494/original/2a51eb49-3584-43f5-83a5-e9cc633d1bf3.jpeg',1102941,45,'45.57622661014088','-122.65205147365425',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,93.00,2,365,62,4.97,1006823034177451494),(3571,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1007367939386007473','Arboreal Room at Hayhurst Manor','Hayhurst Manor is a gorgeous modern home. Enjoy a soak in our hot tub surrounded by beautiful trees. <br /><br />This stylish place is perfect for couples or people looking for a staycation or travel stop. With fabulous restaurants and bars just minutes away, this is the ideal spot for whatever brings you to Portland. <br /><br />The living room and kitchenette are stocked with the equipment to cook and eat at home. There is a writing desk and chair in the bedroom and good wifi capable of handling video calls.','Although the road noise is pretty loud in our yard, walk one block back, and it\'s quite peaceful. <br /><br />Several pedestrian paths connect the roads between neighborhoods and many parks nearby, and you\'ll see many people walking their dogs at all hours of the day. <br /><br />Big trees are everywhere, so anywhere you walk, it\'s beautiful! <br /><br />If you like longer walks, you can get to Gabriel Park and SW Recreation Center in 25 minutes or less. Otherwise, it\'s a 5-minute drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1007367939386007473/original/328dbcd8-365c-4d3d-9fd1-786a61ab3d4d.jpeg',29156235,17,'45.48564','-122.72693',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,36.00,1,120,22,4.82,1007367939386007473),(3572,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1008001543794995163','Spacious single home','','Quiet neighborhood and helpful neighbors if questions arise.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1008001543794995163/original/a4565647-1be8-49be-9e94-f4ef741c3ea6.jpeg',85024584,19,'45.55246395380858','-122.63991653414112',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,42,0,1.00,1008001543794995163),(3573,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1008964151375634170','Riverfront Loft in NW Portland','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. Close to the pearl and old town without being in either. Walk along the river or to the Moda center.','Riverfront condo unit in NW Portland near downtown with access to a riverfront walking path!  If you\'re coming to Portland by train this unit is just a 0.3 mile walk to Portland Union Station. The MAX light rail is also just a 0.3 mile (7 minute) walk which is a quick way to tour Portland without paying the high cost of taxis and Ubers. The Lan Su Chinese garden is a popular and very peaceful attraction to visit,  just 0.3 miles away. Old Town Pizza is just 0.4 miles away and boasts a classic Portland vibe with delicious pizza and pints (open Wed-Sun from 3pm to 10pm). With the MAX light rail you\'re only a few minutes from other Portland attractions and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1008964151375634170/original/e36ad4ca-df62-4eb7-8667-dd6a061d0ea2.jpeg',7409866,43,'45.528329844423354','-122.67251405864955',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,2,5.00,1008964151375634170),(3574,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1009047174799471899','Brooklyn Bungalow','Inner SE Brooklyn Basement Bungalow in historic 1912 home. Private entrance, retro kitchen, living room with large tv and huge bedroom with King bed!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1009047174799471899/original/166f7811-b260-4e18-bd52-657aac36346a.jpeg',28626754,56,'45.49966','-122.64912',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,365,2,5.00,1009047174799471899),(3575,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1009087237501792759','The Abbey on Birkendene E#41532','The house requires a minimum 30-day stay and utilities are not included.<br />An idyllic home surrounded by trees, with your own spacious elevated patio. This sounds like perfection in the Pacific Northwest! This beautiful 3 bedroom 3 bathroom home features an open floor plan, where you’ll immediately be struck by a dazzling white grand piano. The unique kitchen overlooking the living room is a show stopper, with dark cabinets, striking countertops, and a central island with range.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1009087237501792759/original/06e7c2b7-0a2a-48c7-93fb-a0b5e445379e.jpeg',414420881,81,'45.53991','-122.77539',1,9,3.00,3.00,3.00,277.00,30,365,0,1.00,1009087237501792759),(3576,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1009386553931324024','Floating Home on the Columbia','90 day minimum. Cleaning service provided every 2 weeks, included in price of stay.<br /><br />Newly remodeled inside and out with luxury in mind. With the river beneath you, staying in this 2-story 2215 square foot floating home feels like a relaxing vacation. Watch the boats go by from the comfort of the couch, or take a peaceful walk along the docks of the moorage.','Many stores/restaurants within a few minutes walking distance (Target, TJ Maxx, Homegoods, Home Depot, Petco, Panera Bread, Starbucks, and many more!) Fred Meyer less than 10 min drive away in Vancouver.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1009386553931324024/original/b48e84e5-3095-4531-a372-682780ecde08.jpeg',415163842,85,'45.611551281339665','-122.68782652940932',1,4,3.00,2.00,2.00,219.00,90,365,0,1.00,1009386553931324024),(3577,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1009420385372234939','King bed Winter Hawk Suite! Free garage parking.','This high-end downtown apartment on the 6th floor offers breathtaking views of the city. The apartment is furnished with modern furniture and features a spacious living area with ample natural light. Equipped with underground parking, and access to nearby restaurants, entertainment venues, and shopping areas all within walking distance, this  lofts prime location make this contemporary style apartment an ideal choice for those seeking a sophisticated and comfortable urban living experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1009420385372234939/original/32571a0f-c2e8-4cb8-bcea-7653e8781b0d.jpeg',439103919,2,'45.5269042','-122.6795883',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,92.00,2,28,49,4.94,1009420385372234939),(3578,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1009693143026517956','Emerald Heights Retreat near hiking trail 5BD/3BTH','Sitting near the top of the Southwest Hills surrounded by lush trees and quiet nature is this once in a lifetime vacation escape. <br /><br />Just minutes from downtown, hiking trails, the Oregon Zoo, and the Arts district the location of the home puts you near all the fun of the city while also relaxing in your spacious and private Emerald Heights Retreat.','An easy drive up winding roads near popular hiking trails sits this pristine home nestled in the forest. The Arts district sits at the bottom of the hill, the Zoo is nearby as well as Marquam Nature Park, Towhee trail, PDX airport and OSHU.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-1009693143026517956/original/8295c59f-c3b8-4ac3-9812-f8231a8c2c9e.jpg',49270200,54,'45.500201255799816','-122.69994573971726',1,10,3.00,5.00,6.00,327.00,30,365,3,4.67,1009693143026517956),(3579,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1010512381629118167','QueenAnne stunner ABC district','This historic Portland manor was built in 1894 and was formerly a boarding house. It is in the heart of the Nw alphabet district. Everything is within walking distance, coffee shops, fine dining, cheap eats, New Seasons market (my favorite place for groceries), Powell\'s Booksellers, karaoke, upscale ice cream, Cinema 21, Forest Park, Washington park and, well, you get the idea. <br />The home is very comfortable. Please feel at home here. You are a welcome guest.','This is Portland\'s Premier neighborhood where you can walk to nearly anything you need. This historic district is loaded with coffee shops, restaurants, grocery stores, bars, karaoke, and we even have an amazing movie house that features independent films. The tree lined famous 23rd avenue shops are one block down and the Good Samaritan hospital (for all of you traveling health care providers) is two blocks away. Public transportation is at the ready with both the street care and the bus line within two blocks.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1010512381629118167/original/f96a665b-a262-4c8d-ae20-8a85137a37bc.jpeg',2896834,27,'45.530190558747364','-122.70173508095138',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,55.00,30,90,0,1.00,1010512381629118167),(3580,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1011235917149279200','Magic 2nd Floor / Walk Score 93!','Everyone\'s safety is our top priority.  We are following Airbnb\'s enhanced cleaning protocols.  <br /><br />The Magic House is in the heart of a peaceful, charming restaurant and boutique district, 3 blocks to SE Hawthorne and Division.  15 minutes to the Airport, Convention Center and Downtown.<br /><br />You have the entire Magic Second Floor with a private bathroom.  Guests staying in the Magic Attic above will share the front door, stairway, 2nd floor hallway and sculpture garden.','The Magic House is centrally located in one of the most beautiful, charming and safest neighborhoods in Portland. There is an abundance of restaurants, grocery stores, neighborhood strolling, boutique browsing and hiking options beginning within one block.<br /><br />See a movie, or just step in to witness the beautiful and iconic McMenamin\'s Bagdad theater, accompanied by an epic restaurant/bar/pool hall in the back called the \"Back Stage Bar\", at SE 37th and Hawthorne. It will give you a feel for classic Portland!<br /><br />We are minutes from Mt Tabor park which has a lovely forest with walking trails sitting upon a dormant volcano. We are 45 minutes to the spectacular 600 foot tall Multnomah waterfall in the gorgeous Columbia River Gorge scenic area (check to see if it has re-opened).<br /><br />Division Street is the new up and coming Southeast neighborhood. With lots of modern architecture, new restaurants and shops you will get a feel for the freshest vibe Portland has to offer','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-17464418/original/f45a927e-a903-4f7e-a910-102f81380528.jpeg',26822355,8,'45.50887','-122.62351',1,4,1.00,2.00,1.00,29.00,1,4,47,4.96,1011235917149279200),(3581,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1011702387381898063','Arbor Lodge Retreat Blissful Sanctuary','Discover serenity in the heart of Portland! Our cozy Airbnb is a peaceful retreat, centrally located near Max transit, New Seasons market, and vibrant bars and restaurants. Enjoy a quiet haven with easy access to the city\'s buzz. Book now for a tranquil stay!','Welcome to Arbor Lodge, your urban oasis in the heart of North Portland, Oregon! Nestled in a vibrant and tree-lined neighborhood, our cozy Airbnb offers a perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and local charm.<br /><br />The Space:<br />Our thoughtfully designed space is ideal for solo travelers, couples, or small groups seeking a home away from home. Enjoy the warmth of natural light in our inviting living area, complete with comfortable furnishings and tasteful decor. The open layout creates a seamless flow between the living, dining, and kitchen areas.<br /><br />Bedrooms:<br />Rest easy in our well-appointed bedrooms, featuring plush bedding and a serene ambiance. The decor reflects the unique character of the Arbor Lodge neighborhood, known for its eclectic mix of historic and modern architecture.<br /><br />Kitchen:<br />For those who love to cook, our fully equipped kitchen awaits your culinary adventures. Local farmers\' markets provide fresh ingredients for you to whip up del','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAxMTcwMjM4NzM4MTg5ODA2Mw%3D%3D/original/06bf9f6d-faf7-4667-ab16-1c7bbba29f08.jpeg',7990678,51,'45.56749041199184','-122.68909618672598',2,4,1.50,1.00,1.00,72.00,30,90,0,1.00,1011702387381898063),(3582,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1011887443911257508','Historic 3BR+2Bath Home with Private Secret Garden','This Historic Landmark and charming Victorian Queen Anne home is nestled in the vibrant Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood, part of the Central Eastside area of Portland. Built in 1892, this enchanting 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom residence is a true gem that embodies the unique character of this dynamic area. With ornate architectural details and vintage aesthetic, you\'ll step back in time while enjoying all the conveniences of the present. We love the unique secret garden, laundry, and secure car garage!','Located in SE Portland, the Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood borders the Willamette River on the west, Southeast 29th Avenue on the east, Powell Boulevard on the south and Hawthorne Boulevard on the north. The neighborhood is both residential and industrial.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1011887443911257508/original/777afec3-c563-4e39-9ad6-95ba94179cf7.jpeg',543774163,25,'45.50959','-122.65963',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,206.00,30,365,15,5.00,1011887443911257508),(3583,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1013092144345637783','Lively and Cozy Portland home. Sleeps 10.','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. This historic home (built in 1906) takes its place among NE\'s many photogenic charmers. Inside this worldly four-bedroom home you\'ll find period details like rich hardwoods and sunny windows combined with a minimalist, serene design for pure relaxation. When you\'re good and zen, head out to explore Alberta\'s \"foodie row\" with some of the best restaurants in PDX at your doorstep','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1013092144345637783/original/34dc9001-6e02-4cd6-be20-4de008d1278d.png',309962671,45,'45.56977585751','-122.66108446624338',1,10,2.00,4.00,5.00,142.00,1,365,96,4.91,1013092144345637783),(3584,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1013224200184228972','Urban Industrial Downtown Condo','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.  Urban industrial 2-story condo with modern interior design/decor.  Floor to ceiling windows on 2 sides provide lovely daylight throughout the unit.  Two working gas fireplaces and small balconies.  Centrally located in the Arts District or hop on the street car to take a 10 minute ride to NW Portland, Good Samaritan Hospital or the Pearl District.','Located right in downtown Portland, near the Arts District, and Portland State University. The street car stops right out  front and the Max train is a few blocks away. It’s easy to get from the condo to both the Pearl District and NW Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAxMzIyNDIwMDE4NDIyODk3Mg%3D%3D/original/022928d1-9c8b-41a2-97f7-7c6067939ea3.jpeg',5722606,44,'45.51422811151577','-122.68652725853322',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,30,180,1,5.00,1013224200184228972),(3585,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1013916613705820306','Rose City Sanctuary','Peace and quiet await in this fully remodeled two-bedroom apartment in the daylight basement of our 1911 Portland bungalow. Ideal for traveling professionals or those looking to relocate and stay 31+ days. We are centrally located, minutes from the airport, downtown, hospitals and dining. The owners live on site and are available to help meet the needs of your stay.','Rose City Park Neighborhood, blocks away from Rose City Park and golf course, walking path, view of Mt. Hood, coffee shops, and restaurants.<br /><br />Walk Score- 79/100<br />Bike Score- 85/100<br />Transit Score- 48/100<br /><br />PDX- 4.6 miles<br />Max light rail station 0.9 miles<br />Trimet bus stop- 2 blocks<br /><br />Providence Hospital 1.1 mile<br />Legacy Emanuel Hospital 3.1 miles<br />OHSU 4.9 miles<br />PeaceHealth Southwest 5.8 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1013916613705820306/original/49ffbabe-c840-409f-943d-822870cb47ae.jpeg',451514691,11,'45.54231','-122.602',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,112.00,31,365,0,1.00,1013916613705820306),(3586,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1014604005281042281','Downtown Portland Poolside Condo with Hot Tub.','Cozy home with 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom. Pool and Hot tub are just steps away out of the back patio. We are along the Willamette River but we have no river view. The condo complex borders the Willamette River and has a beautiful path for walking and jogging. Close to many restaurants and public transportation. One numbered parking spot.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAxNDYwNDAwNTI4MTA0MjI4MQ%3D%3D/original/851ae81b-88c1-4b8c-a5ec-b2768e7c23f7.jpeg',4539980,43,'45.53051042690672','-122.67533205449583',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,30,365,1,5.00,1014604005281042281),(3587,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1014857416560113053','Cozy Creekside Haven in Beautiful SW Portland','Nestled alongside the tranquil beauty of Fanno Creek, we offer your group a soul-soothing retreat, where nature\'s embrace becomes a cherished part of your stay.','Bridlemile is situated in the southwest part of Portland, and you can use it as a base to explore other parts of the city. Downtown Portland and other attractions are easily accessible from this neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1014857416560113053/original/18c3737d-dc9e-47e5-8d21-f3a5a6fc9827.jpeg',33316274,70,'45.48702','-122.72596',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,365,1,5.00,1014857416560113053),(3588,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1015125591570982259','Hayhurst Hideaway','Hayhurst Hideaway is a gorgeous modern home. Enjoy a soak in our hot tub surrounded by beautiful trees. <br /><br />This stylish place is perfect for people looking for a staycation or travel stop. With fabulous restaurants and bars just minutes away, this is the ideal spot for whatever brings you to Portland. <br /><br />The living room and kitchenette are stocked with the equipment to cook and eat at home. There is a writing desk and chair in each of the bedrooms and good wifi capable of handling video calls.','Although the road noise is pretty loud near our house, walk one block back, and it\'s quite peaceful. <br /><br />Several pedestrian paths connect the roads between neighborhoods and many parks nearby, and you\'ll see many people walking their dogs at all hours of the day. <br /><br />Big trees are everywhere, so anywhere you walk, it\'s beautiful! <br /><br />If you like longer walks, you can get to Gabriel Park and SW Recreation Center in 25 minutes or less. Otherwise, it\'s a 5-minute drive.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1015125591570982259/original/f7108c81-8a88-45f6-9fc1-2fd2768352c9.jpeg',29156235,17,'45.484864091737656','-122.72670882813547',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,71.00,1,90,40,4.83,1015125591570982259),(3589,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1015187564134109120','Charming Portland Hideaway-Woodstock Neighborhood','Private daylight basement studio with king-sized bed, full bathroom, Wi-Fi, kitchenette stocked with essentials, a minifridge and microwave.  Located in the safe, charming, and walkable Woodstock neighborhood of SE Portland. <br />Within walking distance to Trader Joe’s, Reed College, and the shops and restaurants along Woodstock’s main strip - convenience is at your doorstep!<br /><br />Also just a short drive to the lively Sellwood, Division and Hawthorne neighborhoods, as well as downtown Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1015187564134109120/original/ed41d8c5-9cad-4c1c-8888-50edc8bcf9b6.jpeg',15443948,38,'45.48858','-122.61235',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,2,28,2,5.00,1015187564134109120),(3590,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1015606956727546098','Great king bed,WiFi,Parking,PDX','Gorgeous one bedroom, king bed, one bath, in the desirable Sellwood neighborhood. It is located upstairs. It has private deck, courtyard, dedicated onsite parking. Living room area with wet bar makes it ideal to work from home. Living room,  kitchenette (over the counter burner available). Washer and dryer in unit, parking onsite (first come-first serve), and large deck. Walking distance to restaurants, stores, coffee shops, New Seasons, CVS, Wonderful location, OHSU. Service dogs allowed.','This neighborhood doesn\'t get any better! You have the water front, parks, great restaurants, bars, coffee shops and stores all within biking/walking distance, making it really convenient for all your needs and JUST MINUTES AWAY FROM DOWNTOWN!  Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike, there are bike lanes and trails, road connectivity to Downtown and most of the attractions in Portland. Sellwood-Moreland is considered one of the best places to live in Oregon. It offers residents an urban feel. Many families and young professionals live in Sellwood-Moreland. One of the best things about this very walkable neighborhood is how incredibly friendly, safe and clean it is!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/28a38657-3ed3-4956-8949-4161badb4e84.jpg',213350724,20,'45.45896','-122.64648',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,30,365,2,5.00,1015606956727546098),(3591,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1016059367607163707','Chic Retreat in the Pearl','Welcome to our quiet oasis in the heart of the Central Pearl District. Nestled in one of Portland\'s most sought-after neighborhoods, the quiet and private studio is ideal for work or rest. Shopping, dining, & entertainment are all within walking distance.<br /><br />Steps to public transport for trips downtown or the NW District. Private garage for car owners (extra fee) to easily explore city treasures like Washington Park, Forest Park, and Pittock Mansion or urban events downtown or at the Moda Center.','The Pearl District is known for its chic vibe and showcases renowned dining options, art galleries, cultural venues, as well as fashionable boutiques and shops (Lululemon, West Elm, CB2 and Powell’s Bookstore to name a few). Its historical cobblestone streets harken back to its warehouse district origins, while contemporary bars, restaurants, modern lofts and parks throughout the neighborhood underscore its collective charm.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAxNjA1OTM2NzYwNzE2MzcwNw%3D%3D/original/ce529371-ae3b-4764-b71b-a14c3041da81.png',8106668,2,'45.52901975236683','-122.68433756371262',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,141.00,2,14,21,5.00,1016059367607163707),(3592,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1016093741267378064','Chic, Modern, Spacious & Central','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located home. A short walk to an upscale grocery store, and to 3 of the highest rated fine dining restaurants in all of Portland Jacquline\'s, Yama Sushi, and Quaintrelle. The home is centrally located, positioning you within 15 minutes (by foot or car), to everything Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1016093741267378064/original/e0cdb213-1d59-43f5-8ca3-393daca1b4be.jpeg',19786705,25,'45.50168','-122.64759',1,6,3.00,2.00,2.00,550.00,30,365,0,1.00,1016093741267378064),(3593,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1016191923901612313','Portland AF','Welcome to your cozy unique lil home in PDX!  This tiny home features all Portland-themed art and local Portland artists.  A truly unique stay hosted by a life long local Portlandian.   We\'re so pleased to have you :)','Located in SE Portland.  Lents neighborhood is just 20-minutes from Downtown Portland. Don’t expect white picked fences - this is a working class neighborhood. Not a polished, gentrified trendy area, but a diverse community rich with multicultural flavors. <br /><br />Enjoy plenty of outdoor activities like hiking Kelly Butte & Powell Butte, biking the Woody Guthrie Trail.  Close by Leach Botanical Gardens, Zenger Farms & Johnson Creek.<br /><br />Just a couple of blocks away from Springwater Corridor, Portland\'s gorgeous 40 mile bike path that loops throughout the entire city.  Parks, gardens & old growth rain forests nearby.<br /><br />Near by Jade district, you\'ll find excellent & abundant Asian restaurants & grocers.  Plenty of retail cannabis shops around.  Strip clubs galore! (Portland is famous for :)) Farmer\'s market in the spring and summer seasons.  Breweries, pizza spots & coffee shops.  Yoga, food carts & bars.  <br /><br />1 Block from TriMet bus stop.  Portland\'s light ra','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1016191923901612313/original/c8696dc8-8d93-49fe-872e-357d18e9f198.jpeg',1094944,78,'45.48049844091069','-122.54357634530294',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,66.00,30,365,2,4.50,1016191923901612313),(3594,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1016859194329867115','Beautiful newly built home','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1016859194329867115/original/7d33869f-2d28-43e5-aadc-b04bd6e59175.jpeg',544788956,21,'45.557346375386444','-122.61062862967962',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,150.00,30,120,0,1.00,1016859194329867115),(3595,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1016879831727643365','Private Fernview Bed and Bath','Enjoy a relaxing stay at this centrally-located Portland bed and bath. Includes private entrance with fenced in patio attached, kitchenette, and water kettle for leisurely morning tea and coffee (included). This newly built home is modern, well decorated, and located near Portland\'s desirable Alberta Arts District, Concordia neighborhood and PDX Airport. A block away from Fernhill Park and within walking distances to many restaurants, food carts, parks, bars, and much more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-1016879831727643365/original/e0351d75-9d0f-4885-aad2-bb9f4a65d1c5.jpg',48325865,21,'45.56703','-122.61957',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,53,4.98,1016879831727643365),(3596,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1018313289626243490','Large Historic House','You\'ll have a great time at this comfortable place to stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/421e62d5-3102-46b4-9eba-f4c460ffce9f.jpg',16105357,40,'45.55332673505067','-122.54680536002445',1,9,1.50,4.00,5.00,120.00,30,90,0,1.00,1018313289626243490),(3597,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1018954728359821877','Sellwood Apt - Quiet & Walkable!','This private garden apartment is located on a quiet and peaceful street in the heart of the charming Sellwood neighborhood of Portland. 1 bed + 1 bath are accompanied by a full living space and kitchenette. It is the perfect space for individuals or couples visiting the area or traveling for business.<br /><br />An absolutely amazing location - shops, restaurants, cafes, groceries, food trucks, parks, and more are all within minutes walking distance.','Located just three miles south of downtown Portland and over the Sellwood Bridge, the Sellwood Moreland neighborhood is brimming with unique shops, tasty food and fabulous adventures. It\'s the perfect community to raise a family, start a career or just visit on the weekend. We like to say it has that small town charm with a big city offering. <br /><br />Our residents know how fortunate they are to not only be steps away from natural beauty but also close to many wonderful shops and services. This makes Sellwood Moreland one of the most walkable neighborhoods in Portland.<br /><br />Come see for yourself!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1018954728359821877/original/1220bf7f-816f-4923-b251-838fb1dc3732.jpeg',55659355,20,'45.46783','-122.65188',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,107.00,1,21,26,4.96,1018954728359821877),(3598,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1020303134753104666','Hazel Haus: secluded SW PDX home with hot tub','Welcome to Hazel Haus! A curated, contemporary mid-century home with two bedrooms, two baths in beautiful, secluded (yet close-by) SW Portland, Oregon.','Our home is on a quiet street in the Collins View neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1020303134753104666/original/d5de7e83-c5b4-4216-9f40-48e8df50dbc2.jpeg',285147,49,'45.45523','-122.6836',1,4,2.00,2.00,3.00,125.00,30,365,3,5.00,1020303134753104666),(3599,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1020324895941264891','South Tabor Mid-Century Gem','This lovely Rummer style home offers lots of light and mid-century charm. Located in the desirable South Tabor neighborhood, only a few blocks to Mount Tabor Park and SE Division - enjoy your stay in a quiet home with easy access to the best restaurants and shops that Portland has to offer.','The South Tabor neighborhood is nestled at the base of beautiful Mount Tabor, with trails for walking, running and hiking. On a clear day, Tabor offers breathtaking views of Mount Hood and downtown Portland. South Tabor is a lovely, quiet neighborhood, walking distance from several restaurants, food carts and shops on SE Division.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1020324895941264891/original/aae755de-0b48-43eb-a727-e2cd85b4fe3e.jpeg',104330986,37,'45.50434','-122.59294',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,0,1.00,1020324895941264891),(3600,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1020455421434435178','Alberta Arts Acorn Den','Blocks to the excitement of Alberta Arts District, while nestled in a peaceful neighborhood setting, the Acorn Den Guest-suite is the perfect Portland home away from home. <br /><br />You will share the property with our dogs, cat and a few humans. We work from home, and live above the suite, so you may hear us milling about, floorboards squeezing, neighborhood noise and occasional barks from our dogs.<br /><br />You\'re welcome to hang out in the backyard, but pets must always be accompanied by their humans.','The fringe of Alberta Arts, officially Concordia. Exceptionally walkable for coffee, restaurants, groceries, movie theater, soak tubs, galleries, yoga studio, and the Alberta Rose Theater.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/3c1646f3-418f-41c3-9ddf-dd400fe27441.jpg',1150087,1,'45.55751050042361','-122.63221138198755',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,80.00,2,5,20,4.95,1020455421434435178),(3601,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1021130162613104436','Sweeeeet Home Alberta 1BR/1BA','Welcome to our modern 1BR/1BA basement suite in Portland\'s Alberta Arts District! Industrial charm meets comfort in this chic space for two. Relax in the cozy living area, sleep well in the king-size bed, and refresh in the sleek bathroom. The kitchenette is perfect for light meals. Explore the vibrant neighborhood with art, shops, and eateries steps away. Enjoy a private entrance, free Wi-Fi, and streaming services. Immerse yourself in Portland\'s culture—book now for a memorable stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1021130162613104436/original/e8b46390-e110-404d-8a7d-f7e17d851bad.jpeg',384690762,29,'45.56512','-122.65067',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,41.00,30,365,16,4.81,1021130162613104436),(3602,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1021172111056064388','Designer 3BD Hawthorne Home','Indulge in a chic urban retreat within the vibrant Hawthorne / Richmond neighborhood.<br /><br />Designed by Studio Define\'s principal designer Victoria, our home offers a well-stocked kitchen, stylish bedrooms, and spacious living & dining areas.<br /><br />Various shopping and trendy dining options are within walking distance making your Portland exploration a total pleasure!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAyMTE3MjExMTA1NjA2NDM4OA%3D%3D/original/e6a9ad5d-4e77-438f-8454-a79f34f0f04e.jpeg',378901,8,'45.50795','-122.62797',1,6,3.00,3.00,3.00,169.00,1,365,28,4.93,1021172111056064388),(3603,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1021255135465217072','Beautiful two level Craftsman','This 2000 square foot craftsman house is in between Hawthorne and Division Avenues which contains the best restaurants and shops all within walking distance. <br />I’ve spent many years renovating this 1910 home and happy to share it with guests.<br />I have spent years renting each floor separately ( please see positive reviews:) and have recently decided to combine both levels and rent the entire house.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1021255135465217072/original/e835e2bb-3b8d-438e-8f24-093a8f1d2075.jpeg',77382200,8,'45.50619','-122.62715',1,5,2.00,3.00,4.00,265.00,30,365,0,1.00,1021255135465217072),(3604,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1021667442026901728','Entire PDX Condo with City View','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Furnished, east facing City and mountain views and all luxury amenities including 24-hour concierge and secure underground parking. Desirable location and walk score >98 with Washington Park, restaurants, Timbers, Thorns and downtown all nearby! Easy transportation to OHSU and Legacy Good Samaritan.<br /><br />Minimum 3-month rental desired (1-month possible) and max of 12-months.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1021667442026901728/original/32065d4e-0bc8-4386-a168-d7e39a97cd19.jpeg',545874741,27,'45.52311','-122.68988',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,90,365,2,5.00,1021667442026901728),(3605,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1021714725123193540','The Portland Dome: Glamping in the City','With nearly half of the dome’s surface clear, you will be as close to nature as it takes, yet feel completely safe and cosy. <br /><br />Our dome is equipped with top-notch insulation, ensuring a pleasant climate inside regardless of the weather. Step onto the plush carpet underfoot, adding comfort to your glamping experience. <br /><br />The dome has fast & reliable Wi-Fi, electricity, and a heater, ready for a cozy day in bed and busy workday.<br /><br />This property is off grid, with a porta potty and no running water.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-1021714725123193540/original/604e8f6b-3909-4fec-8cd6-b331ef466780.jpg',6048666,15,'45.50547','-122.59012',1,2,0.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,30,1125,4,5.00,1021714725123193540),(3606,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1021781616484144153','Designer Owned Suite in Historic Hollywood','We designed this meticulously built suite with the goal of creating a sustainable, beautiful tiny home experience unlike any we’ve seen. Awash in natural light, it is nestled between two lushly planted outdoor spaces adorned with palm trees and a large water fountain. The property is located in the Hollywood district, one of Portland’s oldest, beautiful walkable neighborhoods, less than fifteen minutes from downtown. And just 30 minutes from the Columbia Gorge waterfall area.','The house is located in the Hollywood  District, one of Portland\'s oldest established neighborhoods. You are within walking distance of every service you may need, Whole Foods, pharmacy, coffee houses, pubs, restaurants,  bakeries and a library. Parks, Saturday Farmers Market. The neighborhood is full of beautiful Portland style craftsman houses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1021781616484144153/original/09283e35-5d92-4e9f-8c72-a8b0c34b9001.jpeg',393441074,33,'45.5393263','-122.6186725',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,87.00,1,365,29,4.97,1021781616484144153),(3607,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1022416138200261072','Private NE Portland Guesthouse','We\'re an upscale, private, guesthouse in central PDX - like a private hotel, but better.  Free food/drinks/snacks – crazy amenities.<br /><br />There’s a cook\'s kitchen, private courtyard, king & queen, full bathroom, keypad access, free parking, and washer/dryer.  It’s a busy street and the stairs are steep  – but The Loft is isolated, serene, and walkable.  Free parking.<br /><br />This is a *nice* neighborhood, and we prioritize cleanliness, privacy, and amenities..  Dogs & kids are welcome, and so is quiet.','The Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood in Portland, Oregon, is an urban mix of residential and commercial areas.  It\'s central to the hippest parts of the city, and minutes from the airport and downtown via car, taxi/Uber, and mass transit.<br /><br />Beaumont-Wilshire is known for its welcoming atmosphere and family-friendly environment. The streets are lined with trees, contributing to the neighborhood\'s picturesque and suburban feel. The architecture in Beaumont-Wilshire is diverse, showcasing a mix of styles such as Craftsman, Colonial, and bungalow-style homes. This architectural variety gives the neighborhood a unique and appealing aesthetic.<br /><br />We have a bustling commercial district with local businesses, shops, and restaurants. Beaumont Village, a popular section within the neighborhood, is particularly known for its shops, cafes, and small businesses. It serves as a central hub where we gather to enjoy the community atmosphere.<br /><br />Green spaces and parks are integra','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1022416138200261072/original/adf379ec-b9d0-420b-a973-79060aa4e60b.jpeg',220393005,46,'45.55075','-122.62963',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,139.00,1,28,90,4.99,1022416138200261072),(3608,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1023198658932387954','Garden Escape - Fun Walkable Neighborhood','Tucked into a colorful garden with secret outdoor spots you\'ll easily escape the bustle of the city and you can still walk to the rainbows of Portland - coffee, beer, food, parks and shops are a short walk away. Bike, walk or skate to your favorite places from here or stay home and get lost in the rainbows of the garden. If you like to be social and like to hide away in nature - this is a perfect spot for you! Utilities and wifi are included in the monthly price.','We are at the edge of the International District and famous Mississippi neighborhood. Lots of parks, shops, breweries, restaurants and great neighborhood watching from the front porch of this house.  We have some great vintage and art stores within walking distance.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1023198658932387954/original/29aced23-8d82-4b5a-8c0f-f868b525e2a6.jpeg',1483711,24,'45.56261','-122.67682',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,30,90,0,1.00,1023198658932387954),(3609,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1023925749550583614','2BR serene city home with private Japanese garden','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1023925749550583614/original/be947b91-61b4-4659-99aa-6e62a12b25a6.jpeg',112452733,8,'45.50060216788901','-122.6121497469742',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,201.00,2,1125,0,1.00,1023925749550583614),(3610,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1023996513050492606','River Views, Serenity, & Paths!','Welcome to a living experience where every day feels like a vacation. <br /><br />This open one-bedroom loft style gem offers stunning Willamette River views from every room and an inviting atmosphere filled with positivity. You\'ll find ample closet space and lots of light.<br /><br />Located by the river path, adjacent to the Max Metro Line, Pearl District, Uptown, and Downtown, Powell\'s City of Books, local breweries, and Providence Park for sports fans, this offers you an urban escape.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1023996513050492606/original/772d8bcf-b429-4d3a-9acb-bd988fed6a88.jpeg',10306850,43,'45.5298943','-122.6745259',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,97.00,30,365,2,5.00,1023996513050492606),(3611,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1024162649617658397','SE Woodstock Charming 2 br','This adorable Portland space is in the heart of the Woodstock neighborhood. Just steps away from Portland\'s famous German deli (Otto\'s), locally roasted coffee from Esperanza, Oregon\'s favorite brewery Double Mountain and so much more. This quaint upstairs unit is the perfect place to welcome you to the City of Roses. The place comes with off street parking, a fully equipped kitchen, great wifi, TV, and so much more to make you feel at home as you explore!','Megan describes the Woodstock area as the most walkable neighborhood in the city. In less than five minutes you can have a craft beer, local groceries, coffee, an amazing meal, golf the iconic Eastmoreland Course, visit Portland\'s amazing Rhododendron garden, or hike through the beautiful Reed College campus. If you want to get outside of the neighborhood, we\'re just 20 minutes from downtown and close to all of the main highways to get you in and out of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/f87bdf63-ee7b-4152-a3ed-4a7b7c0f977e.jpg',86128240,38,'45.47857253318576','-122.6201662075515',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,145.00,30,365,2,5.00,1024162649617658397),(3612,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1024297617129482353','Williams Avenue Hideaway','Welcome to our charming studio nestled in the heart of NE Portland! This cozy ground floor suite on the lower level of our home offers a perfect blend of comfort and convenience, making it an ideal home base for travelers seeking a local experience.<br />Our space features a plush king bed, ensuring a restful night\'s sleep. Additional amenities include a thoughtfully designed kitchenette, full bathroom, smart TV, fast WIFI, washer/ dryer and a private patio all at your disposal during your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1024297617129482353/original/639c8e51-3626-4996-8217-7d1a91328c21.jpeg',19754870,9,'45.55326326646057','-122.66647064310966',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,90.00,1,28,63,4.94,1024297617129482353),(3613,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1025258548327124520','Blue Waters Room at Hayhurst Hideaway','Hayhurst Hideaway is a gorgeous modern home. Enjoy a soak in our hot tub surrounded by beautiful trees. <br /><br />This stylish place is perfect for couples or people looking for a staycation or travel stop. With fabulous restaurants and bars just minutes away, this is the ideal spot for whatever brings you to Portland. <br /><br />The living room and kitchenette are stocked with the equipment to cook and eat at home. There is a writing desk and chair in the bedroom and good wifi capable of handling video calls.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1025258548327124520/original/664ed51e-e0b8-4889-83e8-b04aef93bdbf.jpeg',29156235,70,'45.48664','-122.72636',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,26.00,1,90,10,4.80,1025258548327124520),(3614,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1025372610592644434','New Modern 2 Bedroom Guest House (ADU) in Sellwood','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1025372610592644434/original/3f16258e-f655-42d1-8003-066ecba1a367.jpeg',58406397,20,'45.46447','-122.644',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,31,365,2,5.00,1025372610592644434),(3615,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1025399831778175717','Portland Condo w/ Hot Tub Access, Near Downtown!','Seeking a place to call home during your stay in Portland? Look no further than this vacation rental on the Willamette River! This 1-bed, 1-bath condo makes it easy to get where you\'re going, with Portland Union Station within walking distance and downtown just 1 mile away. Plus, you\'ll have access to community perks like a pool and hot tub!','- 1 miles to Powell\'s City of Books <br />- 3 miles to Portland Japanese Garden<br />- 4 miles to Oregon Zoo <br />- 13 miles to Portland International Airport','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1025399831778175717/original/158f2658-1cb1-45b6-9636-0f971304c72b.jpeg',121688409,43,'45.53063','-122.67599',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,61.00,30,1125,1,2.00,1025399831778175717),(3616,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1026407601572557182','Garden House Apartment','This unique place has a style all its own. I\'m a gardener so it has an exquisite garden. Also have a hobby of salt water aquariums so the apartment has a beautiful 300 gallon tank','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1026407601572557182/original/d1215731-3593-40a4-9a3b-7e4eddf58949.jpeg',8680367,8,'45.50108802056681','-122.61771901534424',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,30,365,0,1.00,1026407601572557182),(3617,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1026781455659992140','Hawthorne Apartment','Quiet and walking distance to the best coffee places, food trucks, breweries, restaurants, shops and parks. Enjoy the best of Portland!','Centrally located  in Southeast Portland, walking distance to the best spots in Hawthorne, Belmont and Division! Quiet neighborhood, residential, full of trees, nice parks and shops.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1026781455659992140/original/b230edd3-e9e4-4bd0-b7e5-fcdc92b4d13e.jpeg',20760775,25,'45.51199','-122.64007',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,2,60,46,4.96,1026781455659992140),(3618,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1026978495677416284','Family-friendly 2BR Home, Pet-accepted, Near Parks','Welcome to Your Portland Retreat!<br /><br />Discover the comfort and convenience of this newly renovated 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom home, nestled in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Woodstock neighborhood. Perfectly designed for family getaways, our home offers the ideal blend of modern amenities and cozy charm.','Woodstock is a very walkable neighborhood. <br /><br />Restaurants/bars/taphouses: <br />- Double