ance to local restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1029075572280297837/original/14bdbaef-046c-40f9-90c2-37bb45c5c778.jpeg',546492960,12,'45.5235008','-122.6563562',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,96.00,1,365,4,3.75,1029075572280297837),(3621,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1029082016777210902','Exceptional Pet Friendly Home, Game Room w/ Pool','This fantastic suburban home sits in the heart of Portland\'s Bridlemile neighborhood. Nestled up against the west hills you will find you are just minutes from downtown Portland, the Oregon Zoo, and countless other places to explore.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1029082016777210902/original/c0a0ff6b-0d8e-42e6-b815-3a4855a3b805.jpeg',62261998,70,'45.49014420558069','-122.73613589534833',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,153.00,2,29,22,5.00,1029082016777210902),(3622,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1029097532244244979','Eastside Lodge Portland: 2 Queen Bed','Under new management and newly renovated in 2023. Conveniently located near Moda Center and walking distance to local restaurants.','Conveniently located near Moda Center and walking distance to local restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1029097532244244979/original/f0b2ad51-0172-4d4d-ae8c-0d4095677044.jpeg',546492960,12,'45.5235008','-122.6563562',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,96.00,1,365,23,4.35,1029097532244244979),(3623,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1029398723212833583','Furnished 1 BR unit near OHSU Dog Friendly (04D)','Welcome to our spacious furnished one-bedroom apartment nestled on Marquam Hill, conveniently located near OHSU. Perfect for medical professionals or visitors seeking to stay close to medical facilities and bringing own furniture.<br /><br />Large full kitchen with electric stove/oven and full size fridge. All utilities, WiFi and use of laundry included.<br /><br />Pets welcome, no breed restrictions. Proximity to public transportation, shops, restaurants, and scenic trails further enhances its appeal.','The OHSU neighborhood is a vibrant and dynamic area in Portland, Oregon. It\'s characterized by a mix of modern amenities and natural beauty. With its proximity to OHSU, it often has a healthcare and academic atmosphere. The neighborhood boasts stunning views of the city and the surrounding landscape due to its elevated position. It\'s known for its safe environment, making it conducive for walking and jogging. Access to public transportation, like Trimet bus #8, provides easy connections to the rest of the city. Additionally, there are charming restaurants, convenient stores, and welcoming spaces that make this neighborhood a comfortable and enjoyable place to live or visit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAyOTM5ODcyMzIxMjgzMzU4Mw%3D%3D/original/853f94f7-13eb-47fa-9ee4-fef4e2caad7f.jpeg',410009654,30,'45.49568800545293','-122.69091533520964',1,2,1.00,2.00,1.00,160.00,30,365,1,5.00,1029398723212833583),(3624,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1029739785052383741','Getmash Suit','Very nice ranch style home located at Portland city center. The home is close to shopping center and has nearby freeway access. Few miles away from Portland airport(PDX) and downtown Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1029739785052383741/original/5a250d2c-a4b3-4561-9ccb-0dd6ccd51485.jpeg',428157777,63,'45.51494262069415','-122.52309111154815',1,5,2.50,4.00,4.00,140.00,30,365,2,5.00,1029739785052383741),(3625,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1029825129098370434','PDX Studios: 2A- Short & Long-Term Stays Welcome!','PDX Studios: Your Cozy Portland Retreat<br /><br />Welcome to PDX Studios,your ideal Portland home-away-from-home. Nestled in the lively Williams District and close to the Mississippi Historical and Alberta Arts Districts, this cozy space is perfect for short and long-term stays. Convenient for travel nurses and medical professionals with Emanuel Hospital nearby,plus major centers like OHSU just 20 minutes away. Enjoy a warm atmosphere with soothing hues, an inviting bedroom, kitchenette,and private bath.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1029825129098370434/original/b56f7d7b-97ab-4418-9b76-1cf79411150e.jpeg',472195025,9,'45.55064','-122.66874',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,365,2,3.00,1029825129098370434),(3626,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1030504841750880148','Luxurious 1Br Condo in the Pearl','Explore the best of Portland while staying in this luxurious, safe, quiet condo with every possible convenience you could want. Enjoy a full gourmet kitchen, espresso machine, in-unit washer & dryer, central HVAC, built-in closets, gas furnace, Peloton Treadmill and Bike (no shoes, unless you\'re Men\'s size 13), ultra high-speed 1GB internet and WiFi with unlimited usage, 77\" OLED 4K SmartTV with 5.1 Surround Sound, King-size memory foam bed, bidet toilet, \"Rain\"-style showerhead, etc. etc. etc.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1030504841750880148/original/e4bbc1ba-0fbc-476f-8378-9718b89f8ef4.jpeg',25690568,2,'45.53003431169428','-122.68219104456722',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,90,365,0,1.00,1030504841750880148),(3627,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1032002506568127807','The Nook House in South Tabor','Bright and airy yet cozy and intriguing, the Nook House is an inspiring domestic sanctuary, located just minutes from the bustle of SE Division and Hawthorne. Wander room to room past vintage furniture and colorful art collected over 20 years. Follow the winding stairs to bedrooms with vaulted tongue-and-groove ceilings. Take a nighttime hottub soak and then come inside for a fire in the wood stove. Walk Score 72/Bike Score 99.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAzMjAwMjUwNjU2ODEyNzgwNw%3D%3D/original/64dbca3f-49c0-415a-b871-055c47ff1735.jpeg',26873626,37,'45.50086282070664','-122.5882164',1,6,1.50,3.00,3.00,457.00,2,30,13,4.92,1032002506568127807),(3628,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1032044044744485852','Luxury Historic Haven Blocks to Restaurants','Welcome to the charming Murphy House in historic Portland! Nestled on a serene tree-lined street, it\'s your perfect getaway. Recently renovated, we\'ve decked it out with cozy, stylish furniture. You\'ll be just 3 blocks from Broadway Street, teeming with restaurants, shops, and public transport. Plus, Spin Lounge Laundry is a short stroll away. <br /><br />Easy 18-minute access to the airport and 84 freeway. Your family and friends will love it here!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAzMjA0NDA0NDc0NDQ4NTg1Mg%3D%3D/original/048c4f22-da4a-45de-b66a-195eb0cdf444.jpeg',13285949,4,'45.533713589143495','-122.64279287555479',1,5,1.00,1.00,3.00,107.00,2,31,37,4.95,1032044044744485852),(3629,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1032656952166462864','Corner of  Heaven','Welcome to our newly remodeled home in the heart of Sellwood-Moreland District! This is a highly desired neighborhood with great walking and biking scores. You will be close to shops, restaurants, riverfront scenery and parks. <br /><br />You will be just a short drive away from Downtown Portland, Lake Oswego, Beaverton, and more surrounding cities as Sellwood is a central location in Portland. <br /><br />We look forward to host you in our updated home!','Downtown Sellwood-Moreland community is bustling with local shops and restaurants within walking distance! The Willamette River is just a couple blocks away with a beautiful view. Guests will have access to the community center and community pool! Perfect location for all!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1032656952166462864/original/80480b06-c032-4e0d-94cf-15e68015fb9b.jpeg',345143977,20,'45.46516','-122.65672',1,5,3.50,2.00,2.00,179.00,2,30,38,4.97,1032656952166462864),(3630,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1033502422786263877','Cozy, walkable and safe','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful oasis. Private entrance with quiet neighbors. Large tree making unique bird habitat in rear yard. Cozy neighborhood close in but without the busyness.','Very walkable Hollywood neighborhood. Only a few blocks from grocery, movies, train and bus.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAzMzUwMjQyMjc4NjI2Mzg3Nw%3D%3D/original/73389bdd-2a61-4aa6-aa36-5c3632ca3831.jpeg',4691790,11,'45.53225','-122.61435',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,2,365,23,4.87,1033502422786263877),(3631,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1033547371117770728','Modern Apt Nestled in Lush Hills','Welcome to our stylish newly remodeled basement apartment! Nestled in the the Southwest hills of Portland, our spacious, and clean apartment has everything you need! <br />- 900 sqft suite<br />- LG appliances<br />- Bathroom with soaking tub and Kholer bidet<br />- Lululemon workout mirror<br />- Molekule air purifier<br />- Kitchen with induction cooktop and countertop appliances<br />- pull out couch with extra bedding<br />- Access to a huge backyard with Weber grill & outdoor furniture<br />- Surrounded by awesome hiking trails','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1033547371117770728/original/d0e5eec1-933a-45ff-95b6-03910b5331cd.jpeg',83088925,31,'45.48900127456048','-122.70317385724556',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,100.00,3,365,1,5.00,1033547371117770728),(3632,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1034946730543939530','New Modern N. Portland apt #2','Kaya Camilla Apartments - an architecturally stunning apartment built in 2020 with unbeatable location. Close to the Adidas Headquarters! Modern high ceiling open floor plan 1 bd 1ba apt, large windows with natural light with amenities, including plush queen bed, sleeper sofa bed, pull out closet bed (upon request), full kitchen, brand new bathroom, laundry and outdoor centered courtyard w/ firepit! 10 min from Downtown!','Great walking distance to bus stops, bars, restaurants, fitness clubs & shops. 10min car ride to downtown Portland','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1034946730543939530/original/779