,'Coda Guesthouse -New in 2024','This stylish place to stay is perfect for visits to Portland.  Located in the desirable Woodstock neighborhood, it is a short walk to restaurants, a food cart pod, grocery stores and a brew pub.  Coda is a musical term meaning an ending part of a piece of music.  This is the perfect place to end your day.  Coda is a comfortable space with instruments to play, and a Sonos system to listen to your favorite music and relax.  You will enjoy the full kitchen and wonderful bathroom.','Woodstock Village in Portland OR is a wonderful place with restaurants, brew pub, food cart pod, shopping and groceries all walkable from Coda.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1036929634174016323/original/3e729b5f-276f-4c7c-a019-3d471b9ffe8e.jpeg',14796564,69,'45.47193769419999','-122.61321369731765',1,5,1.50,1.00,2.00,125.00,1,1125,53,5.00,1036929634174016323),(3637,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1037547091941624799','Cozy loft cottage','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located hideaway close to all the Sellwood neighborhood coffee shops, restaurants & gift stores.','Located in a quiet corner in the coveted Sellwood neighborhood of SE Portland','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1037547091941624799/original/fcc20ad4-7e68-4326-ab8b-ea24733b3dd1.jpeg',5887595,20,'45.459219719106926','-122.64434798582433',1,2,1.00,0.00,2.00,58.00,2,90,35,4.94,1037547091941624799),(3638,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1037838353277729257','Vintage in-city retreat','Enjoy all the benefits of Portland from a comfortable distance. Book this storybook Tudor on three acres next to Johnson Creek, with all the features of a country retreat PLUS easy access to inner Southeast Portland\'s shops and restaurants. This vintage charmer is spacious and comfortable—with lots of beautiful, private outdoor space. Finish your screenplay, clear your head, rest, relax, cook, read, wander the grounds, or just stay inside and watch the Criterion Channel. It\'s all possible.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAzNzgzODM1MzI3NzcyOTI1Nw%3D%3D/original/b9c205dd-8b90-471a-8ccd-11989b09dd50.jpeg',44542145,77,'45.47044945298918','-122.53061663599254',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,145.00,2,30,5,4.40,1037838353277729257),(3639,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1039360464260912150','Downtown Penthouse Condo - Minutes from PSU & OHSU','Discover urban luxury in this 2-story loft-like penthouse condo in downtown Portland. This 1-bed 2-bath spacious unit boasts a fully equipped kitchen, two cozy gas fireplaces, and in-unit washer/dryer. Floor-to-ceiling windows flood the space with natural light, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere. Immerse yourself in city living, surrounded by fantastic restaurants just steps away! Ideal for those traveling for work, school, or other obligations for 30+ day stays.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAzOTM2MDQ2NDI2MDkxMjE1MA%3D%3D/original/f4295ed8-4ca1-4634-8243-b65f85974a13.jpeg',155841507,44,'45.51579','-122.68614',1,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,63.00,30,365,2,5.00,1039360464260912150),(3640,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1039951678032368494','Family Farm Camper','Reconnect with nature at this unforgettable escape, Glamping in the Elkmont. Enjoy a comfortable Queen bed, two bunks and modern amenities kitchenette (microwave, oven, sink, fridge, quick shower, composting toilet) while you ramble the farm, visiting our rescue mini donkeys, alpaca, pigs, goats, bunnies and birds on our 5 acre farm next to a 600 acre nature park.  Minutes from downtown PDX, airport and food carts!','We are proud of the diversity of Nature and people in our neighborhood. With over 52 languages spoken and the largest 600 acre nature park, Powell Butte, in our back yard. Our driveway starts at the trailhead entrance behind a coded Gate.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1039951678032368494/original/0ab39762-6f5f-4000-b968-ad49e22b0bb7.jpeg',421