complex.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA0MjQwMDUwNDM0ODUyMjg3Ng%3D%3D/original/cb7539d7-e36e-45a4-bbc5-7b33b02b5c75.jpeg',114037020,3,'45.51418570299069','-122.69099548459053',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,63.00,60,364,2,5.00,1042400504348522876),(3648,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1043550136697742721','Home in SW Portland','Historic, Multnomah Village neighborhood next to The French Quarter! Tranquil home nestled in the trees of SW Portland. A short walk to Grand Central Bakery, Fat City Cafe, Spielmans, Starbucks and many other unique shops & restaurants. <br /><br />Light-filled, open floor plan w/ vaulted ceilings. Two bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms, full kitchen w/ island seating, dining area, great room, weight room, and library with keyboard, guitar & fireplace. Smart TV with Netflix. Great backyard & patio.<br /><br />Shoe Free House','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1043550136697742721/original/e21e0a1a-43ff-4e64-80bd-d8f2e90a36a1.jpeg',550374755,18,'45.46386665865641','-122.70475082497288',1,6,1.50,2.00,2.00,165.00,2,7,5,4.80,1043550136697742721),(3649,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1044358027236291632','Corner One Bedroom with Views!','This unique place has a style all its own.  <br /><br />This gorgeous open concept corner one bedroom is in the Heart of The Pearl District.  Offering easy access to fashionable retail spots, excellent dining venues and a quick walk to Safeway or Whole Foods Grocery Stores.  Nearby attractions include Powell’s City of Books, Portland Art Museum, Roseland Theater and Lan Su Chinese Garden.  During your stay, you’ll love the contemporary design, floor-to-ceiling windows, airy bedroom and in unit wash/dryer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1044358027236291632/original/a4f18b6c-14db-482b-a5d5-4edb52cabf9a.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52883364684177','-122.68462255597116',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,31,365,3,5.00,1044358027236291632),(3650,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1044450791807876419','Big Private Quaint Lodge','The owner of this house is a professional photographer and would like to share his house while he is away.<br />This 2404 square feet two-story house has: 2x Bedrooms, 1x Study, 1x Kid\'s Space, 1x Spacious living room, 1x Kitchen with supplies, 2x Dining Areas, Attached Garage with space with 3 cars. The master bedroom is located upstairs with its own private bathroom. The other 2nd-floor bedroom has a full-sized bed. The kid\'s room has an additional pull-out bed that can go from twin to queen size.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1044450791807876419/original/d9e61a33-5c1a-4ae1-9cde-1217a19d289d.jpeg',550583144,71,'45.54692','-122.49452',1,10,2.50,2.00,0.00,213.00,1,28,42,4.93,1044450791807876419),(3651,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1044460668752688190','Inner Southeast Luxe Townhouse!','The whole group will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place!<br /><br />Located one block off East Burnside.  Walking distance to several trendy neighborhoods including 28th Street, Hawthorne Street, Belmont and Downtown. Close to lots of great restaurants & coffee shops!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1044460668752688190/original/dc7749e4-898e-467e-9357-004243c44bba.jpeg',537908933,32,'45.522375','-122.649791',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,225.00,2,7,26,4.81,1044460668752688190),(3652,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1044776352594191894','Blueground | Overlook, nr coffee, zoo & hiking','Discover the best of Portland, with this one bedroom apartment in Overlook. . It’ll be easy to simply show up and start living in this elegantly Blueground furnished apartment with its fully-equipped kitchen, cozy living room, and our dedicated, on-the-ground support. (ID #PDX10)','This furnished apartment is located in Overlook, just north of Portland across the Williamette River. In addition to local retailers, there are several popular restaurants in Overlook, including Fire on the Mountain Buffalo Wings. Looking for a fun night out? Be sure to visit the Alibi Tiki Lounge, a quirky karaoke bar. On days with nice weather, Overlook Park provides a green space to let your dog off leash or go for a family picnic. Thanks to its location, you can drive five minutes to downtown Portland, ride your bike, or take the MAX Yellow Line.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1044776352594191894/original/f401c937-b4e5-475a-b423-6d0909cf6abc.jpeg',107434423,13,'45.56464039999999','-122.6818621',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,31,1125,0,1.00,1044776352594191894),(3653,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1044776679107723746','Blueground | Old Town, nr dining, bars & tech hubs','Feel at home wherever you choose to live with Blueground. You’ll love this charming Old Town furnished two bedroom apartment with its modern decor, fully equipped kitchen, and exquisite living room with great balcony views. Ideally located, you’re close to all the best that Portland has to offer! (ID #PDX15)','This furnished apartment is located in Old Town, also known as Old Town Chinatown. Situated in Northwest Portland, it’s a convenient space to live, work, and play. This walkable neighborhood features popular eats and drinks at VooDoo Donut, Ground Kontrol Classic Arcade and Bar, and Pine Street Market. Plus, there are Live music venues and this neighborhood is home to the lively Saturday Market. For a cultural experience, visit the Lan Su Chinese Garden or Japanese American Museum of Oregon. Need a nature escape? Visit the WorldMark Portland Waterfront Park along the Willamette River.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1044776679107723746/original/00155e3a-e443-4014-b308-0478314412a7.jpeg',107434423,43,'45.5286955','-122.6729121',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,102.00,31,1125,0,1.00,1044776679107723746),(3654,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1046417769184611706','Modern Metro Getaways/Walk to Restaurants shopping','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Come to enjoy it with your whole family and friends. Walking distance to shopping and all kind of cuisines. Less than 15 mins to Airport, 20 mins to Downtown. Easy access to tons of popular recreational attractions. It’s very well equipped with all the amenities for you to stay long or short term. Dedicated office, extra spot for overnight guests.','This is a friendly, walkable neighborhood, walk to grocery stores and restaurants.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/83303eff-3146-4253-8cc0-2804ea5c02e2.jpg',209964089,37,'45.50114743278881','-122.58107587695122',1,7,2.50,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,25,5.00,1046417769184611706),(3655,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1047102320573620594','the bear & the hare den','Charming studio retreat nestled within a peaceful residential neighborhood, offering you the perfect blend of comfort and convenience during your stay in Portland. Our cozy studio provides a welcoming haven.<br /><br />Connected to our home, this studio offers a private entrance ensuring complete privacy during your stay. . The studio boasts a comfortable living space, and a private outdoor area – the perfect place to enjoy a cup of coffee<br /><br />We look forward to hosting you soon!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1047102320573620594/original/079ecbdc-bd3c-4a84-b7de-896cf570376a.jpeg',20033141,87,'45.50672','-122.50044',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,90.00,2,14,35,5.00,1047102320573620594),(3656,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1047542319928861771','Bright Spacious Elliot Cottage','Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space. The bright and open cottage, just 5 mins cycling / driving to downtown is a true sanctuary in the heart of Portland. Walking distance to some of the best restaurants, breweries and shops that Portland has to offer. The 2 story, open floor plan provides ample room for guests and their friends. BBQ, fire pit, AC, fireplace, fenced yard for our fuzzy friends and privacy, it\'s packed with everything you\'ll need for a comfortable stay.','',