ss.<br /><br />Close walk to plenty of shops and restaurants on SE Hawthorne and SE Belmont, bike paths, and on those streets: two main bus lines (plus many others). Updated photos, month to month lease.<br /><br />Floor Air Conditioning unit keeps it cool or circulates air. Top of the line Cadet wall heaters. All utilities included.<br /><br />Property Reviews, ALL 5 Star:<br /><br />','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1049295316081986981/original/6d76ecdc-02e5-4cf8-933f-ea8b139259e1.jpeg',5181286,16,'45.51263930187742','-122.61479167311363',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,30,365,0,1.00,1049295316081986981),(3659,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1049360366962493526','Pdx- great for travel workers.','Great location private 1 bedroom apartment with fully stocked kitchen. Laundry on site.  Parking.  Relaxing outdoor space.  Dogs allowed.  Local hosts to help you make the most of your visit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1049360366962493526/original/05782f02-1193-4c93-a0be-2197a9e16229.jpeg',107286245,69,'45.4703935','-122.5925687',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,30,1000,0,1.00,1049360366962493526),(3660,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1049612122437207411','Arbor Lodge Retreat Pine Tree Room','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA0OTYxMjEyMjQzNzIwNzQxMQ%3D%3D/original/481ec89e-42b2-44e3-8920-cd5bce81de75.jpeg',7990678,51,'45.56643948796177','-122.69074771878016',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,52.00,30,30,0,1.00,1049612122437207411),(3661,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1050119973482094081','The Portland Sun House','This unique Mandala home is a stand-alone house with one bedroom in an ideal location for your staycation or adventures around Portland and surrounding areas. This space features a unique layout with natural light, vaulted wooden ceilings, large skylights, a gas fireplace, and a fully equipped kitchen. The private outdoor courtyard with a firepit, seating and a hot tub for your comfort and relaxation.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1050119973482094081/original/60240662-849a-4e4b-b9b0-23ba35f6c878.jpeg',132230840,14,'45.55202','-122.65802',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,128.00,1,365,110,4.99,1050119973482094081),(3662,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1050484465431584757','Quirky Loft by Alberta Arts District','Centrally located guest house in Northeast Portland and walkable to the Alberta Arts District. The unit is a one bedroom loft. Take the rolling ladder up to the sleeping area where you can rest on a queen size bed. The living room has a very comfortable couch with a fold out full size bed. The unit is very quiet and you can walk to many bars and restaurants.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1050484465431584757/original/9b0e94ca-1440-49ed-8f15-dce1e56a4889.jpeg',17505595,14,'45.56121623601416','-122.66401113142825',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,96.00,1,30,0,1.00,1050484465431584757),(3663,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1053071654716102292','Perfect Ladd\'s Addition Loft ~ Breweries & Bars','Nestled between Hawthorne and Division, my duplex in the Industrial Central Eastside offers walking distance access to Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, artisan shops, and services. Just over a mile from downtown, it’s easily accessible by bike, foot, or bus. Designed as a modern farmhouse loft, it ensures ultimate relaxation. Enjoy urban convenience and cozy charm at our unique Portland retreat!','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This vibrant area boasts a Powell\'s bookstore, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more. Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, get messy with wings at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or enjoy a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. The vibrant indie spirit thrives in Hawthorne, with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at the Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of fun, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park atop a dormant volcano ven','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1053071654716102292/original/b3dd1b47-dadd-423f-aad4-5e4b373403cc.jpeg',112798186,25,'45.50923238709554','-122.65554990769772',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,170.00,30,365,13,5.00,1053071654716102292),(3664,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1053567805335670145','The Delores','Step into The Delores at The Eliot Tower, a captivating fully furnished 1-bedroom, 2-bathroom condo boasting an additional den space with a Murphy bed.   Located in the heart of Portland\'s Theater District, this luxurious home is tailor-made for anyone seeking a temporary haven, while enjoying a premium urban lifestyle. With 24 hr concierge service, secured garage parking, on site gym, outdoor patio and additional amenities, this turnkey solution offers the pinnacle of comfort and convenience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1053567805335670145/original/72493bdb-b72a-4bbc-a38f-b2aa2255f58d.jpeg',47581293,44,'45.5166092','-122.6843096',1,4,2.00,1.00,1.00,105.00,60,365,0,1.00,1053567805335670145),(3665,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1053655652389056981','Old meets new: Cozy 1BR','Discover our enchanting retreat in Portland\'s historic Sullivan\'s Gulch neighborhood. Our 1910 abode merges vintage allure with contemporary amenities for a cozy home-away-from-home.<br /><br />Catering to the modern voyager, our space offers swift WiFi, a plush queen bed, a smart TV for streaming (personal login needed), and window A/C for those warm summer days.','The unit is just steps away from 2 grocery stores (Fred Meyer and New Seasons), and a few minutes walk from lively bars and restaurants that represent the best of Portland’s dining scene.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1053655652389056981/original/8a0fa3d2-951b-48ed-b018-da473993b4cb.jpeg',215058058,4,'45.53412','-122.6351',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,61.00,2,365,16,5.00,1053655652389056981),(3666,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1053694438951150205','New & modern in central area','New two-story duplex in south Portland neighborhood. Area is family-friendly and safe, close to everything you could possibly need. Close to the Woodstock village with grocery stores, cafes, restaurants, convenience store, etc. Surrounded by parks, waterfront walkways, and a public golf course.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1053694438951150205/original/ee3513b7-b594-4726-b7d3-313722b1a6e4.jpeg',38041116,38,'45.47351481003379','-122.61710924291508',1,3,1.50,2.00,0.00,80.00,30,365,1,5.00,1053694438951150205),(3667,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1055196566132445470','Mid-Century Hillsdale Retreat','Welcome to our chic 2-bedroom, 1-bath Mid-Century Modern retreat, where timeless design meets contemporary comfort. Our fully renovated apartment offers a stylish and inviting space, perfect for your getaway. <br /><br />Enjoy the convenience of walking distance to culinary delights, with City Thai, Gigi\'s Cafe, and the Hillsdale Food Cart Park just steps away. Immerse yourself in the vibrant local scene, or stay home and utilize the fully equipped kitchen to cook a delicious meal.','Scenic Location: Hillsdale is situated in a picturesque part of Portland, offering residents scenic views and a generally peaceful atmosphere. The neighborhood is known for its green spaces and proximity to nature.<br /><br />Local Shops and Restaurants: Hillsdale has a variety of local shops, boutiques, and restaurants. Residents can enjoy exploring unique stores and dining at a range of eateries, contributing to a vibrant local community. Some of my favorites are: Gigi\'s Cafe, City Thai, Chart House, and so much more!<br /><br />Access to Downtown: While Hillsdale offers a more suburban feel, it is still conveniently located for those who work or enjoy activities in downtown Portland. Commuting to the city center is typically straightforward.<br /><br />Hillsdale Farmers Market: The neighborhood hosts a farmers market, providing residents with access to fresh, locally sourced produce and artisan goods. It\'s a great place to support local businesses and enjoy a weekend outing.<br /><b','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA1NTE5NjU2NjEzMjQ0NTQ3MA%3D%3D/original/3b8982d9-bce0-4849-912b-cac166ce7cd1.jpeg',552766988,31,'45.480551503781015','-122.69225385950082',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,134.00,1,7,64,4.98,1055196566132445470),(3668,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1055260349224164027','Modern Detached ADU in SE PDX','Built in 2022, a detached ADU with privacy fence, separate entrance and driveway. Ring doorbell camera at front door available with house monitor or phone app.<br /><br />Furnished 2 story house with 856 sqft. Main floor has living room, dining area, full kitchen, and half bath. Upstairs are 2 bedrooms, full bath with walk-in tile shower, and washer/dryer.<br /><br />2 blocks from Woodstock with grocery stores, restaurants, bakery, library and coffee shops. Woodstock park 0.5 miles away and Mt. Scott park 0.9 mile.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1055260349224164027/original/b0b95633-efff-4129-8c67-c4aca4cc0bdb.jpeg',51531579,38,'45.48342613936183','-122.6061395709542',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,80.00,30,365,3,5.00,1055260349224164027),(3669,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1055930254558115931','Mid-Century Turned Modern','Welcome home to this freshly renovated 4-bedroom 2-bath, every surface brand new.<br /><br />You\'ll be just 1 block off the main strip in the St John\'s neighborhood, often called a \"small town in a big city\" for its charm & character.  Multiple cafes, restaurants, bars, shops, food carts, epic parks, disc golf, hiking trails & more are within walking distance, and we\'ve posted a map of our favorites by the front door.<br /><br />Whatever brings you to Portland, we truly hope you\'ll enjoy your stay. We love it here!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1055930254558115931/original/70e2ecf3-a106-4036-838b-7c5e144b19fe.jpeg',44524705,58,'45.59375605098636','-122.75777075380306',1,8,2.00,4.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,4,5.00,1055930254558115931),(3670,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1057609881379389653','Zen Retreat','Keep it simple at our peaceful and centrally-located house. We are just two miles north of the Convention Center downtown, and one mile to three different walkable districts. We are surrounded by beautiful parks, boutique shops, good coffee, food and beer. Perfect for families and business travelers. <br /><br />We are also close to I-5 and the airport, but you can’t hear interstate traffic or planes from our cozy little home!<br /><br />Enjoy the back patio in the spring and summer, or the piano indoors.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA1NzYwOTg4MTM3OTM4OTY1Mw%3D%3D/original/120ad39e-21f3-48ca-9b3b-81c166c458ea.jpeg',9811187,24,'45.563632175877835','-122.6674280811124',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,2,91,8,4.88,1057609881379389653),(3671,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1058057157362322138','Cozy Apartment in the Heart of Foster-Powell','Light and bright one bedroom apartment located in the heart of southeast Portland\'s Foster-Powell neighborhood. Private, with a separate entrance, a full kitchen, cozy living and dining rooms and washer/dryer. The bedroom has a queen-sized bed and the couch in the living room pulls out into a queen-sized bed. <br /><br />A short walk to some of Portland’s great restaurants, coffee, parks, and public transportation (connecting to downtown and airport). Close to Reed College, Mt. Tabor, and the Gorge.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1058057157362322138/original/cef419ed-aece-466d-ab6c-85e6be4773a7.jpeg',9052047,36,'45.49175','-122.59498',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,105.00,1,30,12,4.75,1058057157362322138),(3672,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1059801639008023008','SE House just steps to Woodstock','Bring the whole family to this great place with lots of room for fun. Walkable to Woodstock and close to fun on Division & Hawthorne. Dog friendly!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA1OTgwMTYzOTAwODAyMzAwOA%3D%3D/original/b4e39539-82d0-4160-a164-ad1cd97abe82.jpeg',39825650,38,'45.48699828207072','-122.61956165083753',1,7,3.00,4.00,5.00,160.00,30,90,0,1.00,1059801639008023008),(3673,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1060393144483495940','Cozy Apt in the Heart of SE','Welcome to your home-away-from- home in the heart of the popular Richmond neighborhood! This comfy 1-bedroom apt offers a blend of comfort and local charm. Just a quick stroll or bike ride to a wide variety of restaurants, bars, fun shops and even a historic movie theater. The apt features a comfy queen sized bed, fully equipped kitchen and on-site laundry. Quietly tucked away above the street, this is the perfect base for exploring Portland.  Book now for an awesome stay in the City of Roses!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1060393144483495940/original/5d34a898-3cee-499a-b092-0e3a77237504.jpeg',21238112,8,'45.504512543397006','-122.63344729374326',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,81.00,30,90,1,5.00,1060393144483495940),(3674,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1060420753487118513','Multnomah Village Townhome','Townhome in central Multnomah Village. Modern and accessible to downtown and south of town.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1060420753487118513/original/a09b698f-87c1-4d5e-9c74-a648154f77fd.jpeg',21189128,18,'45.4665636937093','-122.71292006629609',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,106.00,30,365,0,1.00,1060420753487118513),(3675,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1060424214769253657','Cozy Home in Hawthorne District','This home in NE Portland is waiting for you! Location is nested in a quiet neighborhood near two popular districts for food, entertainment, and shops. At the end of the day, come back home to a cozy environment where you can lounge, sprawl, and rest. The property has two levels. The ground level has a fully stocked kitchen, TV room, living room, and a half bath. Second floor has three bedrooms with either a queen or king bed and two full baths.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1060424214769253657/original/32444c57-9c8a-44e4-b292-648ae1bb7eba.jpeg',529320812,8,'45.50823538577857','-122.62088449168952',1,7,2.50,3.00,3.00,121.00,30,365,0,1.00,1060424214769253657),(3676,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1060470225656512076','The Color Pop, unique cozy loft–walk to Rev Hall!','★ Enjoy Portland like a local. Walk score 97!<br />Situated in the best of SE. Quick walk to Revolution Hall!<br />One of a kind serene bi-level loft space in 1887 Victorian house, curated color pop details, natural plants and luxe bathroom is the vibe. <br /><br />Walk to coffee, breweries, movie theater, cocktail & wine bars, cannabis, vintage shops, Rev Hall, MODA/Conv. Center and yummy foodie spots!<br /><br />Free street parking. Easy to airport and Columbia Gorge via I-84.<br />Space is NOT suitable for children or pets. ★','The best location! <br />5 blocks from Revolution Hall! Short walk, bus or Uber to Moda Center! Easy walk over the Burnside bridge to downtown.<br />Bus stop is one block away on Burnside street.<br />Perfectly located in historic neighborhood with tree lined streets and beautiful gardens abound.<br />Our bike route street offers easy free parking!  And quiet evenings.<br />Walk the neighborhood to coffee shops, breweries, wine bars, cannabis, unique clothing shops, music venues (5 blocks to Revolution Hall) and incredible dining spots! <br />Quick easy access to I-84 to Multnomah Falls and hiking spots in the Columbia gorge.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-888747726506268577/original/33068271-832a-4050-9587-8f171ae655c6.jpeg',122732291,32,'45.5222480417361','-122.6489496509626',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,103.00,1,14,72,4.94,1060470225656512076),(3677,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1060970093786538309','Super Cute Vintage Apt in the Heart of SE','Welcome to your home-away-from- home in the heart of the popular Richmond neighborhood! This comfy 1-bedroom apt offers a blend of comfort and local charm. Just a quick stroll or bike ride to a wide variety of restaurants, bars, fun shops and even a historic movie theater. The apt features a comfy queen sized bed, well stocked kitchen and on-site laundry. Quietly tucked away above the street, it\'s the perfect base for exploring Portland.  Book now for an awesome PDX stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1060970093786538309/original/489ec023-4b5c-4eb7-b072-6115fd5a41e3.jpeg',21238112,8,'45.503145852504936','-122.6315944067374',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,72.00,30,90,0,1.00,1060970093786538309),(3678,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061029974620288077','Sequoia View tiny home','Amazingly located tiny home in the Alberta Arts District.  Within a 2 minute walk, you are treated to Great North Coffee, Dogwood Wine Bar, T.C. O\'Leary\'s Irish Pub, The Alberta Rose Theatre, Assembly Brewing Pizza, Ignite Fitness & a plethora of food options including Thai, Mexican, Ethiopian, Middle Eastern, Ramen & more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1061029974620288077/original/4d94013a-7bf2-4230-828c-8361bfff55fb.jpeg',17566672,1,'45.55745','-122.63606',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,87.00,1,60,77,5.00,1061029974620288077),(3679,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061114960752210922','Eastmoreland Gem, Pet Friendly, Near Reed College','This wonderful home is nestled in the heart of Eastmoreland. Inside you will find numerous upgrades and updates. Every bit of décor and furnishing was procured to create that perfect blend of Portland style and comfort.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1061114960752210922/original/7b1f233d-271c-4bbb-b3d8-765d7d120833.jpeg',62261998,5,'45.47813','-122.62369',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,182.00,30,120,9,4.78,1061114960752210922),(3680,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061122220595454652','Montis-Free Parking/DT PDX/Centrally Located','Embodying a minimalist and modern design, the studio features floor-to-ceiling windows that provide stunning views of East Portland. Fully equipped with state-of-the-art appliances. Experience the ease of living with complimentary parking, provided in our well-secured garage for your peace of mind.','Across the Willamette River from downtown, the Central Eastside area seamlessly combines industrial elements with the emergence of new restaurants, microbreweries, venues, theatres and opportunities for riverside recreation. It provides convenient access to both central-city and eastside districts, creating a dynamic and well-connected urban environment.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6719345b-1ee3-4f67-ba8d-c3a1f9317634.jpg',183340435,32,'45.52181305164338','-122.66104889698279',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,143.00,2,365,39,4.95,1061122220595454652),(3681,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061146794606232217','Lavender Farm Stay at Urban Donkey Studio','Enjoy the combination of a relaxing modern space on a beautiful urban lavender farm with sweet farm animals, secret gardens, private golf course views, in an open airy studio that will make your stay here truly unforgettable. Urban Donkey Studio is attached to the main house, separated by a private atrium corridor.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1061146794606232217/original/56e10684-66c7-4f4d-9d95-451920eea9ad.jpeg',60370460,88,'45.585082915450656','-122.64020391154128',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,251.00,2,7,1,5.00,1061146794606232217),(3682,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061196632333999104','Fluvio-Free Parking/DT PDX/Centrally Located','Embodying a minimalist and modern design, the studio features floor-to-ceiling windows that provide stunning views of West Portland. Fully equipped with state-of-the-art appliances. Experience the ease of living with complimentary parking, provided in our well-secured garage for your peace of mind.','Across the Willamette River from downtown, the Central Eastside area seamlessly combines industrial elements with the emergence of new restaurants, microbreweries, venues, theatres and opportunities for riverside recreation. It provides convenient access to both central-city and eastside districts, creating a dynamic and well-connected urban environment.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/d8655515-3b10-4b4b-8f44-bd071ce1fc22.jpg',183340435,32,'45.52161062302518','-122.66169988813007',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,174.00,2,365,41,4.98,1061196632333999104),(3683,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061576402809179724','The Rachel','Introducing The Rachel, a charming fully furnished 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom home nestled in the serene NE Portland neighborhood. This cozy abode caters perfectly to traveling professionals seeking a comfortable stay, insurance relocation specialists, relocating families, or anyone in need of temporary furnished housing in Portland, OR. Offering a tranquil environment and all-inclusive amenities, The Rachel is designed to provide utmost comfort during your stay.','The Mount Tabor neighborhood is nestled in the heart of Northeast Portland.  This vibrant area, centered around the majestic Mount Tabor, offers a perfect blend of natural beauty and urban charm. A playground for nature lovers, you can explore the lush trails and breathtaking views at Mount Tabor Park, just blocks away from your temporary home. Immerse yourself in the local culture by strolling through the Hawthorne District, known for its eclectic shops, artisanal cafes, and unique boutiques. Discover a myriad of culinary delights at the diverse range of restaurants, and don\'t miss the chance to explore the historic Mount Tabor Reservoirs. Whether you\'re seeking tranquility in nature or the excitement of urban exploration, Mount Tabor has something to captivate every traveler.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1061576402809179724/original/82ce0f4f-5fdc-4ef7-a961-117a155db016.jpeg',47581293,52,'45.5230192','-122.5987313',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,30,180,1,5.00,1061576402809179724),(3684,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061698400269346340','Basement apartment in N Portland','Cozy basement apartment in Piedmont! Full kitchen with microwave, oven, and stove. 1 true bedroom with queen sized bed, but with another queen bed and a pull out couch for sleeping as well. 1 full bathroom, laundry room with washer and dryer, and private entrance. TV with wifi connected and in guest mode to allow for you to add your own streaming accounts during your stay! We live upstairs but our door to the basement will be locked. We have dogs upstairs, so no pets.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1061698400269346340/original/c77c581b-0f0b-4036-a3e1-7eb9e6e5a49e.jpeg',12337434,48,'45.573133023892744','-122.66686976329837',1,6,1.00,1.00,3.00,120.00,2,365,27,4.81,1061698400269346340),(3685,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061792428581317560','Osprey Suite - 205','Welcome to our charming studio loft suite nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland\'s Inner East Side! With an unbeatable location and a perfect blend of modern comfort and urban style, this loft is the ideal base for your Portland adventure.<br /><br />Important Information for Your Stay<br /><br />VioletSuitesPDX is an unhosted boutique hotel. It is vital that guests review the check-in instructions prior to arrival to ensure a smooth and enjoyable stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA2MTc5MjQyODU4MTMxNzU2MA%3D%3D/original/66a19584-f7c2-4af8-b98e-073616072916.jpeg',534173163,32,'45.5163047','-122.6519507',1,3,1.00,2.00,1.00,191.00,1,365,11,5.00,1061792428581317560),(3686,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062339027647734815','Bright&Colorful 2-bed + HOT TUB!','Walk to the Kenton foodie district from this cute Portland Bungalow, located right on the MAX line, and within walking distance to all the restaurants, cafes and shops just a few blocks away. Built in 1924, this 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom historic home is perfect for traveling singles and couples alike, and with a Walk Score of 85, you can ditch the car and bring comfy shoes instead; come stay a while!!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062339027647734815/original/e884f9a4-355f-4d07-984c-d9e8a735b555.jpeg',35707797,55,'45.58187909999999','-122.6839335',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,178.00,1,45,55,4.87,1062339027647734815),(3687,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062339344166045032','Tandem House - Perfectly Cozy SE Portland Gem!','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at our perfectly-located Southeast Portland home! Quiet, established neighborhood with close proximity to nightlife, amazing food, and beautiful outdoor spaces. You\'ll find that everything you need is at your fingertips!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062339344166045032/original/46fc73fc-5f43-4e19-89a3-21c1dfaff945.jpeg',554673566,8,'45.50178','-122.60926',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,165.00,3,1125,15,4.93,1062339344166045032),(3688,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062454649888081063','Tree Views in the city!','This is a lovely two bedroom apartment in a four plex with its own private deck overlooking a grove of lush trees. Insulated from sound and temp, close to major bus lines, five minute drive to PSU, OHSU, downtown. The apartment is close to the south waterfront, several parks, and nearby shopping centers and restaurants. It is practically downtown, yet situated on a quiet street. Bring your bike and store it safely on your private deck. Enjoy this peaceful and centrally located apartment.','Cozy residential neighborhood in a natural setting on a Court, not a thru-street. Just a couple of blocks from a privately owned convenience store. Lots and lots of trees around. Very close to Barbur Blvd and public transit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062454649888081063/original/e6d4c8eb-f851-4219-a61e-72599a60a71f.jpeg',62203396,30,'45.49167808584356','-122.6810675353352',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,76.00,30,365,2,3.50,1062454649888081063),(3689,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062528082587552790','Fairmount Guest Quarters','Welcome to Fairmount Guest Quarters, a custom designed, 1-bedroom apartment in the peaceful West Hills of Portland. If you\'re looking for a quiet escape, this colorful pied-à-terre is steps away from hiking and biking trails, just 1.7 miles from OHSU, 3.5 miles from downtown Portland, and 8.2 miles from Nike World Headquarters. Includes private, off street parking and a flat, private entrance surrounded by mature trees. Enjoy a staycation or a cozy get-away in the heart of Portland\'s West Hills.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062528082587552790/original/25c9aa39-e580-4f8a-9a1f-164c3245843c.jpeg',424626768,54,'45.49886','-122.7009058',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,3,30,0,1.00,1062528082587552790),(3690,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062576133986479336','Hideaway retreat in the trees!','Located SW Portland, yet conveniently located just six minutes from Portland State University (PSU) and Oregon Health & Science. It\'s a short walk to the tram that connects to OHSU. The well-known Elephant\'s Deli is close by, about a half mile down Corbett Ave. The apartment is close to the South Waterfront, several parks, and nearby shopping centers and restaurants. It is practically downtown, yet situated on a quiet street with no outlet. at this peaceful and centrally-located place.','Quiet, safe, and short dead-end street. Nice houses. Lots of trees.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062576133986479336/original/7297cc62-e9ff-4de8-b0d2-3bdc584d621c.jpeg',62203396,30,'45.49009','-122.68178',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,79.00,30,365,0,1.00,1062576133986479336),(3691,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062589223192713275','Cozy-Comfy Central - 2 bdrm','Relax in a beautiful, quiet craftsman home, just a 5-minute walk to nearby hip Hawthorne & Division Streets! Enjoy spacious, comfy bedrooms, a newly remodeled bath, as well as large living & dining rooms and a front porch. Classic, cozy, old-school Portland style. Lots of street parking, on a bike street, in a quiet, safe neighborhood. Decorated with photography and filled with antique cameras. We include a polaroid camera you can use to capture memories of your trip.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062589223192713275/original/83e5c764-22bf-464a-8d4b-8f5e0e847ae8.jpeg',62203396,8,'45.50718889701538','-122.62011656335338',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,87.00,2,365,12,4.50,1062589223192713275),(3692,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062638205768777696','Relax, Sanctuary in the city!','This 2 bed 1 bath apartment is centrally located in the heart of SE Portland! Walkable to both Hawthorne and Division Streets for tons of shopping, restaurants, coffee shops, pubs, book stores, etc. It really is a great location in Portland. The house is located on a nice tree lined bike street. The neighborhood is wonderful and safe. This apartment is on the top floor a duplex, which shares the laundry area and back yard with the main floor guests. The patio and apartment are private.','Awesome neighborhood! Quiet, safe, nice houses, bike street. Very close to Cesar Chavez, Hawthorne Blvd, Division St, Mt Tabor park, Fred Meyers, New Seasons, cafes, pubs, restaurants, shopping, and more!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062638205768777696/original/c2f62637-946e-43d9-889c-3310abdf9dc5.jpeg',62203396,8,'45.50769955214169','-122.61905845707257',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,4,4.75,1062638205768777696),(3693,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1062668037446533470','Creekside Cottage in the city!','Enjoy a peaceful, private stay at the Plum Cottage! Located just minutes from Lewis & Clark, Tryon Creek park, downtown Portland and OHSU. This is a newly remodeled, fully-separate one bedroom cottage ADU with a large deck overlooking a creek with towering trees. The cottage can accommodate up to three, with a pull-out twin bed in the living room.','located on a quiet dead end street tucked away in a wooded neighborhood you feel like you are in the woods! A quick drive and you are downtown in 10 minutes, OHSU in 10 minutes, Lewis and Clark College in 10 minutes!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1062668037446533470/original/b35cce40-ecf9-4e57-aa8f-0f36fd4c03e2.jpeg',62203396,41,'45.455687891009326','-122.69063901147238',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,68.00,30,365,2,3.50,1062668037446533470),(3694,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1063192899009656860','The Arbor Lodge Retreat Ground Floor Suite','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1063192899009656860/original/5bf0f8b3-cae6-4764-8a20-b45d589c6c8c.jpeg',7990678,51,'45.56775254141657','-122.69081260278716',2,2,1.50,1.00,0.00,65.00,30,90,0,1.00,1063192899009656860),(3695,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1063789741515155362','Creekside Sanctuary in the City','Come enjoy this newly remodeled 2 bed, 1 bath space surrounded by nature, yet only minutes from Downtown and OHSU. This gorgeous unit is in a peaceful, secluded and safe setting with plenty of off-street parking. It includes spacious large bedrooms, a walk-in tile & glass shower, fully-stocked kitchen with quartz countertops, gas fireplace (in bedroom), work desk, high speed wifi, free parking, pull-out couch, large backyard, and more.','Quiet, peaceful, safe, dead-end street. trees and a creek in the back yard. Deer in the yard from time to time!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1063789741515155362/original/8903423d-c955-4d1e-8bf6-9c5f3b7d39a6.jpeg',62203396,49,'45.45455','-122.68983',1,6,1.00,2.00,3.00,85.00,30,365,2,5.00,1063789741515155362),(3696,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1063889570550708473','Charming Sellwood Tudor Home 2BR/1BA','Beautiful charming home located in a quiet and friendly street in the desired Sellwood neighborhood.  Sidewalk lined street with mature trees. If traveling with kids, our place is stocked with toys, board games, Wii, books, and even a car bed upon request. Pet free home for those with allergies.<br /><br />Walk 5 minutes to nearby 13th Ave for restaurants, coffee shops, library and food carts, antique shops, or nearby CVS pharmacy. New Seasons grocery and outdoor swimming pool nearby as well.','Sidewalk lined street with mature trees and even a neighbor with chickens nearby. Our home is located in the Sellwood-Moreland neighborhood, the 24th most walkable neighborhood in Portland with a neighborhood Walk and Bike Score of 92+. Nearby parks include Westmoreland Park Nature Playground, Sellwood Riverfront Park, and Johnson Creek Park. Retail and professional businesses nearby e.g. medical and dental clinics, art studios, bike shops, fitness club, antique shops, food carts, and Sellwood outdoor swimming pool.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/21d299ff-3857-4a50-a4be-a648db67159f.jpg',372581905,20,'45.46619','-122.64859',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,31,370,0,1.00,1063889570550708473),(3697,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1063943630643440445','Marquam Hill OHSU 1BR w/ Fenced Yard (04C)','Welcome to our delightful fully furnished one-bedroom with private fenced front yard nestled on Marquam Hill, conveniently located near OHSU. Whether you\'re a medical professional seeking temporary accommodation or a visitor looking for a comfortable stay close to medical facilities, this apartment is tailored to meet your needs.','The OHSU neighborhood is a vibrant and dynamic area in Portland, Oregon. It\'s characterized by a mix of modern amenities and natural beauty. With its proximity to OHSU, it often has a healthcare and academic atmosphere. The neighborhood boasts stunning views of the city and the surrounding landscape due to its elevated position. It\'s known for its safe environment, making it conducive for walking and jogging. Access to public transportation, like Trimet bus #8, provides easy connections to the rest of the city. Additionally, there are charming restaurants, convenient stores, and welcoming spaces that make this neighborhood a comfortable and enjoyable place to live or visit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1063943630643440445/original/b85ece93-79a5-467a-8985-14c8d0316ee2.jpeg',410009654,30,'45.49586343851083','-122.692075008296',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,90.00,30,730,0,1.00,1063943630643440445),(3698,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1064608704353965319','Historic Haven in Sellwood','This 2-bedroom Victorian gem, built in 1899, has been artfully restored with a rustic-modern blend. Ascend the stairs from the private covered porch, to a bright open living area and fully-equipped kitchen. Two bedrooms, separated by the living space, feature walk-in closets & blackout shades. Relax in the bathroom complete with soaking tub, rain shower, and heated floors. Amenities include laundry, Wi-Fi, cable, and smart TV. Located in the heart of Sellwood, it’s perfect for work or leisure.','Centrally located in a trendy Portland neighborhood — Sellwood has everything you could need and want within walking distance. Located just one block from New Seasons grocery, diverse food trucks, restaurants and local cafes. Walkable to cute shops, antique stores, salons, and a variety of fitness studios. <br /><br />For recreation, explore nearby Sellwood Riverfront Park, the Springwater Corridor, or enjoy Oaks Amusement Park. Golf enthusiasts can head to Eastmoreland Golf Course or Waverly Country Club, both close by. Plus only a few miles from OHSU Medical Center and Reed College, and 12 minutes from downtown PDX. <br /><br />You will love getting to be a part of this small community when you stay here!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1064608704353965319/original/c450eabc-d8eb-4229-9f9f-791b316974d9.jpeg',2470117,20,'45.46487','-122.65556',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,98.00,30,365,2,5.00,1064608704353965319),(3699,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1064609257803196914','Hobbit’s Hideaway in Sellwood','Step into our comfortable   1-bedroom in a historic 1899 Victorian duplex in Sellwood. The fully-equipped kitchen, comfortable queen bed, and a small office area make this the ideal spot for short or long stays (30-day min). Cozy up in front of the smart TV and enjoy amenities like WiFi, zonal heating/AC, and shared laundry.<br /><br />Located in a trendy Portland neighborhood, you\'ll be steps from shops, cafes, and restaurants. It\'s walkable to the riverfront park and just minutes from downtown PDX.','Centrally located in a trendy Portland neighborhood — Sellwood has everything you could need and want within walking distance. Located just one block from New Seasons grocery, diverse food trucks, restaurants and local cafes. Walkable to cute shops, antique stores, salons, and a variety of fitness studios. <br /><br />For recreation, explore nearby Sellwood Riverfront Park, the Springwater Corridor, or enjoy Oaks Amusement Park. Golf enthusiasts can head to Eastmoreland Golf Course or Waverly Country Club, both close by. Plus only a few miles from OHSU Medical Center and Reed College, and 12 minutes from downtown PDX. <br /><br />You will love getting to be a part of this small community when you stay here!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1064609257803196914/original/a1a65d6c-3da5-4c33-a024-6be512ee8841.jpeg',2470117,20,'45.4652592','-122.6548061',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,30,365,2,4.50,1064609257803196914),(3700,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1064609476718123970','A Victorian Portland Paradise','Experience a warm and inviting escape in our renovated 1899 Victorian duplex. From the covered porch, step inside a bright, open kitchen/living area perfect for cooking and entertaining. Enjoy a luxurious bathroom with a soaking tub & heated floors, and two private bedrooms ideal for couples, friends, or a WFH office. <br /><br />Located in Sellwood, steps from shops, cafes, and restaurants. Walkable to the riverfront park and just minutes from downtown PDX. Ideal for short or long stays (30-day minimum).','Centrally located in a trendy Portland neighborhood — Sellwood has everything you could need and want within walking distance. Located just one block from New Seasons grocery, diverse food trucks, restaurants and local cafes. Walkable to cute shops, antique stores, salons, and a variety of fitness studios. <br /><br />For recreation, explore nearby Sellwood Riverfront Park, the Springwater Corridor, or enjoy Oaks Amusement Park. Golf enthusiasts can head to Eastmoreland Golf Course or Waverly Country Club, both close by. Plus only a few miles from OHSU Medical Center and Reed College, and 12 minutes from downtown PDX. <br /><br />You will love getting to be a part of this small community when you stay here!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1064609476718123970/original/72757cb5-1cfd-4344-ba29-829c389820f2.jpeg',2470117,20,'45.46539897059878','-122.65390339605665',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,98.00,30,365,0,1.00,1064609476718123970),(3701,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1064854606428799380','NW 23rd, Parks and City Center','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.   Walking, hiking, Portland Streetcar and Max Trains. Limited On Street Parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/4afa8704-4535-4fcc-bb62-3d597e89f076.jpg',12668677,27,'45.52897839067802','-122.70059918373731',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,52.00,31,65,0,1.00,1064854606428799380),(3702,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1065105756300618904','Spacious room with  bathroom','Recently renovated roomy bedroom with separate bathroom. I will only need access to the bathroom to use the wash and dryer there otherwise it is only yours. Recent updates to the rest of the house as well with lots of space to relax, work, a