','-122.6155052',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,270.00,30,365,0,1.00,1074119523644719346),(3728,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1074271375122820963','Natural setting Relax & Recharge','Our place is perfect for a longer stay so you can enjoy and get to know our neighborhood parks, hiking trails and closeby Multnomah village. We\'re within 3.5 miles from the closest hospital and between 7-10 miles from all the major hospitals in the Portland metro area.<br />You\'ll be living with me and my fiancée and 2 cats in a large single family house with a large front and backyard. The bedroom, private bath and your (mostly) own kitchen are in the spacious daylight basement with backyard view.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1074271375122820963/original/cb571d07-feca-4fa5-b6e3-4ab1a14a53b3.jpeg',59478478,18,'45.47162','-122.71338',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,40.00,30,92,2,5.00,1074271375122820963),(3729,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1074596637948145636','Tulip Tree','The Tulip Tree is an efficient, all electric, modern apartment conveniently located two blocks from the Alberta Street shopping and dining strip.  The area is very walkable and served by multiple bus lines.  The apartment has free on-street parking just outside and includes a mini-kitchen and all the usual amenities.<br /><br />Designed and built by Salmon Built LLC','The house is located in the King Neighborhood adjacent to the Alberta Street shopping and dining corridor. The street features several art galleries and interesting shops. We are a short ride or drive from downtown and several other neighborhood centers. Public transportation and bike lanes are plentiful.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1074596637948145636/original/974ad945-c6c1-48e4-8415-9e2bca1d59ae.jpeg',9930480,14,'45.558358197168786','-122.65685478771803',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,89.00,1,365,70,5.00,1074596637948145636),(3730,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1075442168503134986','Best Portland Location! AND a fenced in yard','Welcome to our charming vacation rental in the heart of Portland! This cozy 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom property comfortably accommodates 4 guests. Enjoy amenities such as a fenced-in backyard, fireplace, and a fully equipped kitchen. Free parking onsite and a fire pit for cozy evenings. Nearby attractions include trendy restaurants, cafes, and boutiques. Book your stay now for a relaxing getaway!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1075442168503134986/original/f2807d30-b117-4d12-82ac-c31878bf1d9e.jpeg',10463034,8,'45.50940005276318','-122.63494507491727',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,3,30,1,3.00,1075442168503134986),(3731,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1075457579893578506','NE Portland Room & Hot Tub','This Northeast gem is a perfect destination for those looking to unwind or experience  all the best Portland has to offer! Located just blocks from the Alberta Arts District, Williams Street, & Mississippi Street, explore endless restaurants, cafes, music venues, and bars. After hiking in the Gorge, discovering Oregon wine country, or exploring all things that make Portland weird, spend the evening relaxing in your own private hot tub.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1075457579893578506/original/9ada7900-46ba-48bb-907c-e18c1d0db16e.jpeg',18687988,24,'45.55884088601519','-122.66468167911637',2,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,77.00,1,365,16,5.00,1075457579893578506),(3732,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1077097286818529182','Chic Abode in Foster Powell','If you\'re a fan of great food, craft beer, and pour-over coffee, this is your place. My apartment is situated in the Foster-Powell District, which neighbors many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants, bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.<br /><br />My place is great for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers. As a convenient home base within walking distance of the neighborhood hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how hipsters live in Stumptown.','','https://a0.muscache.com