his spot is perfect for fans of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee, and Portlandia vibes. Our spacious six-bedroom home is in a historic building in the NE Mississippi/Alberta District, known for its top restaurants, bars, and shops.<br /><br />This duplex features 6 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, with 3 bedrooms and 1 bathroom on each side. Ideal for families and large gatherings, offering ample space and privacy. Enjoy the best of Portland living!','Talk about location! This area is often referred to as Foodie Row. You are just a hop, skip, and a jump away from two of Portland\'s hottest streets, Alberta and MLK. The neighborhood is brimming with shops and restaurants where you can easily lose track of time. You’ll even find a unique coffee roaster inside a double-decker bus! If vintage shopping, lifestyle boutiques, and novelty gift shops are your thing, you’ll need a couple of days to explore everything this vibrant neighborhood has to offer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1079304867676158693/original/3d698e9b-927d-4483-8f36-36af8d68aa8e.jpeg',113868705,14,'45.54996','-122.66204',1,16,2.00,6.00,8.00,679.00,1,365,8,5.00,1079304867676158693),(3736,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1080396309400254741','Private Room in Quiet Irvington','Fully equipped private room in central location in NE Portland.  The apartment is near coffee shops, LA Fitness, and several restaurants all within walking distance.  The private room has a closet and the apartment has a kitchen, dining room, and living room for all guest to use. There is a back yard and private covered front porch, both are perfect for enjoying a meal, doing a little work, or waking up with a cup of coffee/tea and croissant/donut from the nearby bakeries and coffee shops.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1080396309400254741/original/c9e28478-8cc2-4b2c-8d71-04378137953f.jpeg',208515091,7,'45.538144793355976','-122.64970699435912',2,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,1,28,21,5.00,1080396309400254741),(3737,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1080589389764411655','Modern, Pool table, Near Airport','Welcome to our downstairs one bedroom unit. The space is ideal for up to 6 guests. This is a downstairs duplex unit. Enjoy the convenience of a smart TV and parking on-site. The house has been recently renovated with a contemporary touch. Have fun with a pool table and a selection of board games. Located just an 8-minute drive from PDX airport, and near highly-rated parks. Book now for an unforgettable stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/2a61f0ba-5b0e-48fe-afcd-f45a063c46a0.jpg',34601684,21,'45.557461276224494','-122.58850039417692',1,6,1.00,1.00,4.00,100.00,30,365,1,5.00,1080589389764411655),(3738,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1081074550335559779','Garden Zen Getaway','Kick back and relax in this soothing garden side guest suite','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1081074550335559779/original/302b8ce1-30ab-4168-9bf1-371c76f03a66.jpeg',24461064,10,'45.52362798481916','-122.57055492842494',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,1,30,23,4.96,1081074550335559779),(3739,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1081415489941399805','Basement Studio Apartment','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place studio apartment. Kitchen, roomy bathroom with tiled shower. One queen bed plus a pull out sofa couch.  Private entrance.  TV, Wifi and easy parking on the street. Centrally located near the bus line and close to downtown and shops and cafes.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1081415489941399805/original/462e5400-201b-49e3-a456-5dbfbd1ffca3.jpeg',20413267,19,'45.5506088','-122.6329758',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,66.00,1,365,1,5.00,1081415489941399805),(3740,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1082724808899917233','Charming guesthouse','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish and newly renovated space. With a grocery store, convenience store, and a MAX light rail stop all within two blocks, exploring the city is a breeze! Sleep comfortably on a king size Nectar premium hybrid mattress. Sleeper sofa turns into a twin size bed. We made sure everything is as comfortable as possible, including plush towels, premium coffee selection, TV with all your streaming services, plenty of extra pillows and linens, and many extra amenities.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1082724808899917233/original/634a77c6-b587-4b33-9985-0305c1be764b.jpeg',210156506,51,'45.574955145038494','-122.68025523439331',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,77.00,1,14,45,4.96,1082724808899917233),(3741,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1083544652169285103','4BR Elegant Hawthorne Gem','Nestled near vibrant Hawthorne Blvd in Portland, our cozy townhouse offers comfort & style, ideal for exploring the city. With four plush bedrooms, a fully equipped kitchen, and a living area perfect for relaxation, it\'s your home away from home. Enjoy easy access to local shops, cafes, and parks, ensuring a memorable stay. Welcome to your Portland retreat! experience at this centrally-located place.','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District puts you within walking distance to a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!) Make new friends over some vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for a fancy night out at Castagna - all within a 1.5 mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. There’s vibrant indie spirit in Hawthorne, with lots of made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore here in hipster heaven. Or, catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews.<br /><br />And if bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park on top of a dormant volcano vent, where you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible panoramic views of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1083544652169285103/original/04cbc9be-a07a-409e-81da-a7537959d103.jpeg',33606696,32,'45.51332037392363','-122.64403269521577',1,8,2.50,4.00,2.00,215.00,30,365,2,5.00,1083544652169285103),(3742,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1084674184719690256','Recently Upgraded 1BR Apt – Downtown Location','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city near by<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates of what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland street car, A variety of bars/night life, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1084674184719690256/original/20c81df7-f55c-4581-83a0-c783a7babc97.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52964438333081','-122.67978179264043',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,233.00,30,1125,9,4.78,1084674184719690256),(3743,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1084851570326398152','Serene Home w/ Office & Hot Tub','This home is nestled amidst a beautiful garden and is an ideal retreat for traveling professionals or anyone seeking tranquility in Portland. With two bedrooms plus an office/bedroom, it provides ample space for relaxation and productivity. Have fun by taking advantage of the hot tub and ample outdoor areas. Upgrades in the kitchen and bathroom will also help you settle in right away. Conveniently situated in Woodstock, you\'ll have easy access to Reed College, OHSU, and downtown Portland.','Woodstock is a charming neighborhood nestled in Southeast Portland, Oregon. Its tree-lined streets and diverse community make it an inviting place to call home. With a mix of housing options, including craftsman-style bungalows and mid-century ranch homes, Woodstock appeals to families, young professionals, and retirees alike. The neighborhood\'s vibrant commercial corridor along Woodstock Blvd offers an array of locally-owned shops, restaurants, and cafes, contributing to its lively atmosphere. Additionally, Woodstock is home to several parks and green spaces, providing residents with ample opportunities for outdoor recreation and relaxation. Overall, Woodstock offers a perfect blend of urban amenities and suburban charm in the heart of Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1084851570326398152/original/c0c3bf5d-a7a6-40a9-ae81-d908009480bf.jpeg',4490212,38,'45.48888','-122.60762',1,4,2.50,3.00,3.00,135.00,31,180,3,5.00,1084851570326398152),(3744,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1085560406442361163','Cute Home with Private Deck Near Downtown Portland','Wake up to songbirds, deer and old growth trees in this cute home in the historic Portland Heights neighborhood, one of the city’s greenest, safest, and centrally located neighborhoods. <br /><br />You’ll be a 5-minute drive from downtown Portland and the Pearl District, and just a 10-minute drive from the music and food of the Eastside neighborhoods like Mississippi and Alberta. <br /><br />You’re also a 5-minute drive from Portland’s most scenic view at Council Crest (there’s a bonus dog park too)!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1085560406442361163/original/8860b130-473a-49bf-