br />Our home is perfect for a family or individuals that are looking to visit Portland. It\'s surrounded by nature, a stream, beautiful trees and overlooking the Willamette River. The home is located in the neighborhood of Linnton and in Forest Park where you\'re close to grocery stores, nature and restaurants.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1086958055619185692/original/108a6083-9039-4df0-9df0-ec6805c125db.jpeg',5650853,89,'45.58895664000684','-122.77926988067506',1,5,2.00,2.00,2.00,112.00,30,60,0,1.00,1086958055619185692),(3748,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1087118588963723214','Safe and Convenient OHSU Studio w/ Own Yard! (04B)','Private and spacious studio apartment in a very safe neighborhood. <br /><br />- Studio unit with Kitchenette.<br />- Private in unit laundry.<br />- Near convenience store and restaurants. <br />- WiFi, and utilities included.<br />- Mini-split AC installed for the ultimate comfort.<br />- Pet friendly, no breed restrictions, fenced yard in front, no pet fees.<br />- Many previous guests often walk home during lunch to take care of their pets.','The OHSU neighborhood is a vibrant and dynamic area in Portland, Oregon. It\'s characterized by a mix of modern amenities and natural beauty. With its proximity to OHSU, it often has a healthcare and academic atmosphere. The neighborhood boasts stunning views of the city and the surrounding landscape due to its elevated position. It\'s known for its safe environment, making it conducive for walking and jogging. Access to public transportation, like Trimet bus #8, provides easy connections to the rest of the city. Additionally, there are charming restaurants, convenient stores, and welcoming spaces that make this neighborhood a comfortable and enjoyable place to live or visit.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1087118588963723214/original/47c9c4ab-ea00-4791-bfff-f374b9bf8ea6.jpeg',410009654,30,'45.49754','-122.69182',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,79.00,30,365,0,1.00,1087118588963723214),(3749,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1087325550559254471','Comfy Mt Tabor Studio','300 sqft single-level studio on a quiet residential street, steps from Mt Tabor park & convenient to several bus lines, this is the perfect home base for enjoying your time in Portland. The studio sits behind the main house with a private, keypad entry, well-appointed kitchen, queen-sized bed, TV, wifi, and full private bath with shower and bidet. High-speed wifi on secure guest network. A great fit for a traveling professional looking for a longer-term stay.<br />1 guest max for stays 15+ days.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA4NzMyNTU1MDU1OTI1NDQ3MQ%3D%3D/original/cc70ff83-638b-49ab-bba1-020c0415522b.jpeg',43620911,15,'45.51062944742509','-122.6016953992177',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,92.00,2,21,23,5.00,1087325550559254471),(3750,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1087589827049540729','Work from anywhere, great amenities, free parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see a