e not included.<br />Welcome to your new home! This beautiful residence, featuring 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, is a haven of tranquility and style. Step into a space adorned with elegant touches like granite countertops, hardwood floors, and a cozy gas fireplace. The kitchen, a hub for family gatherings, opens onto a deck, creating a harmonious family room/kitchen combo. Outside, a deck, garden, and porch invite you to enjoy the great outdoors.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1094489989128958710/original/d9384b4f-41b8-40c8-a7ec-938fe004d318.jpeg',126824075,81,'45.53911','-122.7777',1,9,2.50,4.00,5.00,347.00,30,365,0,1.00,1094489989128958710),(3764,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1095052785822573704','Pinky\'s Place; Vintage Hawthorne luxury','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.   A plush and comfy space with style, free parking, fast WiFi, a great location and tons of amenities, you\'ll relish your convenient urban getaway. Featuring comfy beds, linens and amenities, you\'ll be close to all Portland has to offer, yet tucked away when it\'s time to relax. No elaborate check out instructions and unbeatable location, amenities and comfort!','Located in the fabulous, walkable and trendy Hawthorne neighborhood, a coveted spot in Inner Southeast Portland close to all the action.   You will be just steps to Cubo, Khao Moo Dang, The Hazel Room, Bread and Ink Cafe, The Waffle Window, Gold Dust Meridian, food trucks, vintage shops, and also SE Division faves Salt and Straw, Stumptown Coffee, and many other Hawthorne/Division/Belmont shops and eateries.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1095052785822573704/original/bedfaf01-89c3-4dee-8d63-b035f3379620.jpeg',489775282,16,'45.5124','-122.63234',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,199.00,2,365,17,5.00,1095052785822573704),(3765,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1095619560275179737','Creston & Chill Studio','This peaceful basement studio is centrally-located  in the Creston-Kenilworth neighborho