y Market. For a cultural experience, visit the Lan Su Chinese Garden or Japanese American Museum of Oregon. Need a nature escape? Visit the WorldMark Portland Waterfront Park along the Willamette River.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1097034587607696517/original/d359ffd1-d462-4b3d-a1d1-459d331daf90.jpeg',107434423,44,'45.5138725','-122.6777685',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,164.00,31,1125,0,1.00,1097034587607696517),(3773,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1097546054986296644','Cozy 3-BR Home Near New Seasons & Hospital E#42057','Welcome to our Cozy 3BR Townhouse in the heart of Portland! Built in 2019, this modern home spans three spacious levels, offering the perfect blend of relaxation, work, and entertainment. The open-concept design seamlessly connects the kitchen, dining, and living areas, ideal for both intimate gatherings and family events. With two large living rooms, there’s plenty of space to unwind or host guests in style 🛋️. The home is in pristine condition, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA5NzU0NjA1NDk4NjI5NjY0NA%3D%3D/original/7d78662c-3299-4f20-ac73-51268b5d4b55.jpeg',414420881,9,'45.54837673523862','-122.67223004000893',1,7,2.50,3.00,3.00,110.00,30,365,0,1.00,1097546054986296644),(3774,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1097557564024557273','3B Townhouse near New Seasons & Hospital G#42057','The house requires a minimum 30-day stay and utilities are not included.<br />**This is a fully furnished rental property, with furniture and decorations currently being set up for an enhanced living experience.**<br />Welcome to your brand new, three-level townhouse nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland, Oregon. This contemporary urban abode boasts two spacious living rooms, perfect for both relaxation and entertainment.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1097557564024557273/original/e58484ce-23ce-403b-a744-aee262d6ced3.jpeg',504252105,9,'45.5480442