78,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1099529429273847159','Yalem place','Your family will be close to everything when you stay at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1099529429273847159/original/e92b11e8-813d-4dda-b3a0-23fc9d08e94a.jpeg',556708963,66,'45.55372480802736','-122.51921443483214',2,1,2.00,2.00,2.00,60.00,30,365,0,1.00,1099529429273847159),(3779,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100129594352683341','Central studio with bonus room','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Cute daylight basement with separate entrance, the 700 sq feet includes a large studio space with areas for sleeping and living, plus a bonus room with door that can serve as an office or other working space, plus bathroom and kitchenette. We are directly across from a very popular rose garden/park and community center, centrally located, lots to do!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1100129594352683341/original/b58dd77c-48b2-47ec-896e-c31cacfa813c.jpeg',2401950,48,'45.57060937274162','-122.67130323142817',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,59.00,30,365,0,1.00,1100129594352683341),(3780,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100153907812737426','Cozy NE PDX Retreat','Step into our Deco Den! A thoughtfully designed 2br. apt nestled in a quiet corner of Portland. The space features a stocked kitchenette, in-unit washer & dryer, dedicated workspace, fast wifi, and a smart TV. Perfect for families, couples, remote workers, or a group of friends, Deco Den is a short walk from cafes, eateries, and Arbor Lodge park. The public bus and MAX light rail are also just a few blocks away giving you access to all the great things Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEwMDE1MzkwNzgxMjczNzQyNg%3D%3D/original/b1b4d915-fe78-4497-a1df-1f25ec300d8b.jpeg',11334723,13,'45.56485447695319','-122.69565398236145',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,105.00,7,120,0,1.00,1100153907812737426),(3781,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100520186544800568','Sellwood Comfortable Suite Wifi/Parking, Portland','This stylish suite  is perfect for work and vacation trips, in the desirable Sellwood, Portland. It has been thoughtfully furnished and decorated to make your stay comfortable, enjoyable and private. You can expect very clean, well appointed, turn- key accommodations. It is the perfect alternative to a hotel Jr. Suite with all the comforts of a home, private patio, providing a cost savings and convenience. Ideal for corporate housing, medical stays, work stays, or any relocation needs.','This neighborhood doesn\'t get any better! You have the water front, parks, great restaurants, bars, coffee shops and stores all within walking distance, making it really convenient for all your needs and JUST MINUTES AWAY FROM DOWNTOWN! <br />Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike, there are bike lanes and trails, road connectivity to Downtown and most of the attractions in Portland.<br />Sellwood-Moreland is considered one of the best places to live in Oregon. It offers residents an urban feel. Many families and young professionals live in Sellwood-Moreland.<br />One of the best things about this very walkable neighborhood is how incredibly friendly, safe and clean it is!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-733315146702021571/original/9abf4de0-3381-47a6-b53d-c43549c4a86a.jpeg',213350724,20,'45.46046135698815','-122.64659264559937',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,89.00,30,180,3,5.00,1100520186544800568),(3782,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100684675031978943','Dog-friendly 2BR with covered porch & yard','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1100684675031978943/original/06903b3f-66d4-487c-9327-2e825f33ca6d.jpeg',112452733,11,'45.54557','-122.61306',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,167.00,2,365,4,5.00,1100684675031978943),(3783,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100737158098094483','City center escape with High Horse bar/restaurant','Resort fee of $30.00 per night collected by hotel. <br />Our pet-friendly hotel rooms in Portland offer a stunning view of the city, the mountains, or the West Hills. Featuring a 65-inch HDTV, complimentary WiFi, and room service in Portland so you can enjoy the most delicious meals from the comfort of your deluxe room.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1100737158098094483/original/2b2a6f5e-aa17-4e15-b06a-b814fbce0cf9.jpeg',558047525,44,'45.5204493','-122.6786825',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,196.00,30,365,75,4.80,1100737158098094483),(3784,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100833950683788181','Top-Floor Duplex in Mt. Tabor','Quiet neighborhood in the city. Close to everything, this centrally-located home in Mt. Tabor has a beautiful back yard area designed for relaxing. Pet-friendly with a fully fenced yard and lots of pet amenities. Stocked kitchen for a foodie with extras like an ice cream maker, air fryer, panini press, etc… Full, lower level laundry. King suite in the master and kids’ room with games and art supplies for adults and children. Local art displayed. A short walk to restaurant and parks.','Mt Tabor','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1100833950683788181/original/43023445-ea39-4373-92b3-7b5425e31064.jpeg',540946370,52,'45.52331','-122.59724',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,159.00,1,29,13,4.92,1100833950683788181),(3785,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1100853551241099783','High Rise Condo, Stunning Views','Panoramic views await at this high-rise condo!<br />The open-concept layout is bathed in natural light, courtesy of the large windows that frame the picturesque scenery.<br />The gourmet kitchen is equipped with everything you need. Enjoy your morning coffee on the private balcony or unwind in the living room next to the cozy fireplace.<br />The spacious bathroom features a glass shower, soaking tub and modern amenities. Retreat to the comfy queen bed and turn on the candles to end the evening.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEwMDg1MzU1MTI0MTA5OTc4Mw%3D%3D/original/54532be5-3ba7-4bd1-a766-aa8a2290f398.jpeg',18223920,22,'45.4967915','-122.6702786',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,30,365,2,5.00,1100853551241099783),(3786,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1101634649528846103','River Cabin in St. Johns','Keep it simple at this peaceful, northwestern, urban river cabin studio. High ceilings with delightfully inviting sleeping loft, featuring a moonview skylight! Views of St. Johns Bridge and the Willamette River, just 2 blocks walking distance to Cathedral Park and shops, restaurants, groceries, and movie theaters. Fully stocked kitchen with everything you’ll need to enjoy cooking and coffee. It is the perfect balance of solitude and community, where you can be in tune with self, city and nature.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1101634649528846103/original/38af9134-d3ef-4e92-87e7-be7ad5571e51.jpeg',32365096,42,'45.59142','-122.76098',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,98.00,1,365,25,4.88,1101634649528846103),(3787,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1101646991797402946','Garden house tiny home: 2 lofts','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1101646991797402946/original/1dc99872-e4c6-4999-80d9-67898b289192.jpeg',1125850,63,'45.529436829633745','-122.54097649395024',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,30,365,0,1.00,1101646991797402946),(3788,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1102918030285255523','Private Studio in Vibrant Portland','Escape to our cozy studio guest house nestled in the heart of Portland\'s lively Boise neighborhood. Positioned between the bustling Williams and Mississippi districts, our private studio guest suite offers the ideal retreat for travelers seeking both excitement and relaxation during their stay in the City of Roses.','This space is nestled between Williams and Mississippi Ave. The neighborhood is extremely walkable with many cute cafes, restaurants, bars, and shops. Downtown Portland is just a 15 minute bike ride away, or head over to the Overlook Max Red Line and utilize Portlands transit system. <br /><br />A few of our favorite places are steps away: Matador Restaurant and Bar, Sushi Hada, JinJu Patisserie, and Eem.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1102918030285255523/original/2c3566d2-d7a3-442a-be35-1696d251f038.jpeg',60223816,9,'45.55106809999999','-122.6685625',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,88.00,1,1125,61,5.00,1102918030285255523),(3789,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1103681247682826616','Cozy bedroom in PDX','Welcome to a warm and cozy bedroom nestled in the heart of vibrant central Portland (PDX)! This inviting space offers a peaceful ambiance for solo adventurers or couples seeking relaxation. Conveniently located in the middle of SE and NE, this Airbnb provides the perfect haven for your Portland adventure. Experience the warmth of Portland hospitality in our charming urban location.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1103681247682826616/original/5abd6308-b383-4a2c-8047-bf773eebebf2.jpeg',15042017,11,'45.53302279099679','-122.60370075351553',2,1,1.00,2.00,0.00,44.00,30,365,0,1.00,1103681247682826616),(3790,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1103702599597968746','Landing Pad Close to Downtown','This apartment is just a short walk to one of Portland\'s most popular neighborhoods, Alberta Arts District -- full of restaurants, galleries, cafes, shops, and more. The house is also just a block away from public transit, a grocery store, food carts, and a brewery. It is a great spot to land while you explore all that Portland has to offer!','Urban. This house is located a block from MLK Blvd, a busy commercial street. It has it\'s pluses (easy public transport, close to Alberta Arts District, etc) and it comes with the feel of an urban house in the city. There will be traffic noise and people noise. If you are looking for a quiet neighborhood setting, this is not it.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1103702599597968746/original/24c52a9b-0b44-48eb-82fd-5a15088186d0.jpeg',62203396,14,'45.56069','-122.66161',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,70.00,30,365,3,4.33,1103702599597968746),(3791,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1103719835588788077','Landing Pad Close 2 Downtown 423','Welcome home! This charming old Portland house is located just a few blocks from Alberta Arts District, with its shops, restaurants, bars, coffee, and more! This home is also across the street from Natural Grocers, food carts, and a pub. If you\'re in town to explore Portland, you likely won\'t need a car -- we are right on several bus lines. Sleeps up to 6 people.','The house is located off MLK which is a busy street. The good part is that there is easy access to bus line to go downtown. This is a city house and all that goes along with that. If you are looking for a sleepy quiet neighborhood street this may not be the best fit. However if you are looking for a great place to call home base with easy public transport and walking distance to Alberta Arts District then this is a great spot!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1103719835588788077/original/3994e35b-d1e0-4188-b70b-9db97e1b2958.jpeg',62203396,14,'45.5605','-122.6601',1,7,1.00,3.00,3.00,80.00,30,365,2,4.50,1103719835588788077),(3792,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1104340170176037493','Bright! Modern! South-facing studio with views!','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located brand-new apartment building with Big South-facing windows!  The location is off the charts.  Walkable to grocery stores, shopping and a bounty of cafe and restaurants. Very safe and vibrant core Pearl District address.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1104340170176037493/original/ad637bfe-15d9-4143-8b81-e43719225d59.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.5287869','-122.6846317',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,31,365,0,1.00,1104340170176037493),(3793,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1104487986036504972','Cozy Cottage in Central Portland','Experience the simplicity and charm of living in a tiny house that has everything you need.  <br /><br />Enjoy reading a book or a cup of tea on the bench near the large picture window. <br /><br />Or curl up in the loft with a queen size bed, skylight, and window. <br /><br />Work at the built in desk. <br /><br />Cook meals in the small fully equipped kitchen with a sink, mini fridge with freezer, and two burner stovetop. <br /><br />Have a drink or meal at the outdoor patio table.<br /><br />The bathroom has a shower and a sawdust compost toilet.','Located in a cute walkable neighborhood with multiple grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants, and bars within a 10 minute (or less) walk. Easy access to public transportation - there are 3 bus lines and a light rail line all within a 10 minute walk from the house.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1104487986036504972/original/d185afda-1d97-4b0d-b24d-02e5d0658d8b.jpeg',7548435,25,'45.50124','-122.64705',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,101.00,30,60,0,1.00,1104487986036504972),(3794,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1104571168396220031','Alberta Arts Colorful Craftsman','Welcome to my one and only home—an Airbnb rarity!<br /><br />Note: The City of Portland doesn’t allow the detached studio to be listed as a dwelling unit, so keep that in mind when booking.<br /><br />Enjoy my life-changing Costco inflatable hot tub—I keep it clean, please do the same. I test it regularly.<br /><br />Alberta Arts District is full of history, with a park one block away, plus restaurants, bars, and shops nearby. You\'ll love the easy access to everything from this central location!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1104571168396220031/original/ff8fb423-3c6f-4885-805a-63ab10e83400.png',10368260,29,'45.560522329535615','-122.6436274099812',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,249.00,3,365,6,5.00,1104571168396220031),(3795,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1104587065685714527','Guest House Private Entrance Studio Basement','Welcome to De Lux Studio where comfort meets convenience in Portland. Located near freeway 205, minutes from PDX airport and Downtown, and blocks from Adventist Hospital. Enjoy premium bedding, individual bathroom with complimentary amenities , along with free WiFi and Smart TV.','Division Street & 109th Ave is a major thoroughfare running through the neighborhood, offering access to various amenities such as shops, restaurants, and services. The area is known for its diverse community and convenient access to public transportation routes.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/9f457b1b-8d41-4e08-a347-5a9fe2b64273.jpg',54667782,63,'45.504430684297844','-122.55043950097313',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,58.00,3,365,24,4.83,1104587065685714527),(3796,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1104632129750343170','Quiet Rose City Home','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. On Beautiful Tree Lined Street','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEwNDYzMjEyOTc1MDM0MzE3MA%3D%3D/original/a5134143-8321-4077-800c-d68f0133cef2.jpeg',132726838,11,'45.5435631','-122.6073339',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,72.00,30,90,0,1.00,1104632129750343170),(3797,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1104839733177487789','The Sylvan Retreat on Bartholomew E#42048','The house requires a minimum 30-day stay and utilities are not included.<br />Welcome to your new home! This residence, featuring 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, is a haven of tranquility and style. Step into a space adorned with elegant touches like granite countertops, hardwood floors.  Each room, carefully designed for comfort, includes a formal living room, dining room, den, and bonus room. Upstairs, discover well-appointed bedrooms with wall-to-wall carpeting and ample natural light.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1104839733177487789/original/6e1d7879-3bb7-45d7-afbd-99ef84b9feb6.jpeg',414420881,81,'45.53787','-122.77719',1,9,2.50,4.00,4.00,347.00,30,365,0,1.00,1104839733177487789),(3798,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1105061881783948940','Modern 1BR Apartment - Free Parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay in Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1105061881783948940/original/7aa045c0-9ade-41df-94ba-eee23a3a6225.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52944','-122.68155',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,216.00,30,1125,3,5.00,1105061881783948940),(3799,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1105791721156016415','The Walnut-Beautiful One-Bedroom','The Walnut is a bright, clean, cozy one-bedroom apartment in the basement level. You\'ll enjoy the full kitchen, dining table for four, roomy living area with pull-out couch, and office nook with electric standing desk. This renovated apartment is tucked into an urban eco-community. You\'ll love the location and the ambiance. The Walnut is good for couples, solo adventurers, or business travelers.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1105791721156016415/original/28df5129-4bae-4602-8cfd-42687a731c24.jpeg',17575711,25,'45.50327306059247','-122.64552613477841',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,74.00,30,364,0,1.00,1105791721156016415),(3800,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1105854415657769677','Modern 3b Home - Family Heaven - Bike Score 99!','Welcome to our spacious 3-bedroom home in Portland\'s University Park! Enjoy the large backyard with a patio and firepit. With 3.5 bathrooms, everyone has ample space. Kids will love the bunk beds, and everyone can relax in the generous living room and bonus room. Explore nearby parks, cafes, and shops, or take a short drive to downtown Portland. Plus, with a 99 bike score and 81 walking score, getting around is a breeze! Experience the best of Portland from our comfortable retreat!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1105854415657769677/original/e94075e5-313e-4869-ad6a-7907772c806e.jpeg',47299013,57,'45.5836666','-122.7335005',1,6,2.50,3.00,4.00,195.00,30,365,1,5.00,1105854415657769677),(3801,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1105886822863948646','Edison Street House','Quiet street in the Cathedral Park Neighborhood within walking distance of the St John\'s Bridge and shopping area with fine restaurants and shops.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-904577521863134620/original/2ce24ecf-85cc-4b52-988a-e1e0ada4a7ab.jpeg',499873467,42,'45.58504962385032','-122.75009761678191',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,1,365,21,4.81,1105886822863948646),(3802,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1107562330795585549','Bright Cozy Bungalow In Walkable Mt Scott','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. High speed WiFi, 2 Queen beds and a 60 inches flatscreen! I mean - who wouldn’t want to chill in this cozy colorful living room. Did I mention there’s AC?! AND Laundry in the basement!? And for those traveling with felines or fido we welcome pets!! There’s even a HUGE park down the street lined with fir trees for daily walkies! It’s easy to get around here with multiple modes of public transport within walking distance and off street parking!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1107562330795585549/original/e4b61020-d44f-48f6-aa32-3e79667c