ed near the city\'s best, with secure parking. Let this be the beginning of your unforgettable Portland tale.','Vibrant trendy Pearl District in the heart of downtown Portland with access to the best portland has to offer and close to major freeways.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1108768897452044117/original/e10b261f-b775-4407-87f4-f9ee42ccdba3.jpeg',9605653,2,'45.5292249','-122.6857045',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,30,1125,3,4.67,1108768897452044117),(3806,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1109653206569074320','Colorful mid-mod guest suite - no cleaning fee','Private 1-bedroom finished basement apartment with large bright windows in the quiet and charming Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood. Cheerful colors, mid-century decor, modern amenities, high-speed WiFi, automatic espresso machine. 15 minutes from the airport and downtown. One block from 14.4 acre Wilshire Park. Stroll or bike to the Alberta Arts district, McMenamins Kennedy School, or the shops and restaurants on NE Fremont and NE 42 Avenue. The area is bicycle friendly even by Portland standards.','Quiet, lovely residential neighborhood close to restaurants, bars, etc on both Alberta and Fremont','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEwOTY1MzIwNjU2OTA3NDMyMA%3D%3D/original/886d0d06-d320-48e8-90f9-c26f14321f5e.jpeg',62789472,46,'45.5529757','-122.6247263',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,94.00,1,29,109,4.92,1109653206569074320),(3807,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1110907701914090952','Chic Flat! Close walk to Mississippi St','Experience the peaceful and centrally-located chic flat we fondly call Pinot! Ideally situated between the vibrant Mississippi and Williams districts in N Portland. Discover trendy bars, charming shops, and diverse dining options. Only 10 minutes from downtown Portland and a half-mile from renowned culinary and unique bars. Plus, during the summer months, indulge in the delightful outdoor space complete with a cozy firepit for your enjoyment.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1110907701914090952/original/a6383fce-65b1-49d6-a4cc-4195f8950163.jpeg',89568523,24,'45.5564048','-122.6698179',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,365,23,4.91,1110907701914090952),(3808,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1110949444575871394','Bright Studio with huge windows!','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located brand-new apartment building with Big South-facing windows!  The location is off the charts.  Walkable to grocery stores, shopping and a bounty of cafes and restaurants. Very safe and vibrant core Pearl District address.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1110949444575871394/original/435dce39-83f6-4efb-aafb-b1d3dffe80da.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52983019755131','-122.68347392408637',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,31,365,0,1.00,1110949444575871394),(3809,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1111752122797633846','New! SW Hills Private Studio Apt','Escape to this urban oasis in Portland\'s vibrant west side! Experience modern tranquility in this 500 sq. ft. newly refreshed, spotlessly clean studio with private entrance. Stylish open layout with minimalist design. Fully-equipped kitchen for culinary adventures. Plush king bed & smart TV with streaming. Located 5 mins from Hillsdale, 10 mins from OHSU, 15 mins from Downtown/NW 23rd. Off-street parking. Spotless clean with fast wifi. Ultimate city living meets serene comfort.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1111752122797633846/original/e96c788c-3756-4ace-bdb7-b9bdb56902e6.jpeg',10330653,54,'45.49334959999999','-122.7064892',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,55.00,30,365,2,5.00,1111752122797633846),(3810,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1112372373897800004','Kenton Park Studio','Kick back and enjoy this bright and spacious cute studio in the heart of the darling Kenton neighborhood! It sits 2 blocks from the lovely Kenton Park where you can walk to downtown Kenton where there are cute cafe\'s and eats to enjoy! Close to downtown, public transportation a block away and other fun close neighborhoods to enjoy.  Easily accessible from highways and the airport. It has a private entrance. The space was just newly renovated by us designers :)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1112372373897800004/original/9b6080df-6b64-498d-b9b4-6f7e53e282ef.jpeg',4847328,55,'45.58354067028523','-122.69483421215755',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,1,7,20,5.00,1112372373897800004),(3811,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1113131483672875455','Unbeatable location in heart of NW Alphabet','New listing in the heart of Portland’s famous NW Alphabet district, with some of the city’s best restaurants, bars, cafes, parks, art galleries, and boutique shopping literally right outside your door. Located in a turn of the century gem of a building with vaulted ceilings, original hardwoods and period charm. High-speed internet. Onsite laundry. Anything you need is just a short walk away. Perfect location to explore downtown without the need for a car','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1113131483672875455/original/d3724a0b-bb4c-41db-86e3-f4730ec8973f.jpeg',155798693,27,'45.5279012','-122.6947192',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,88.00,30,365,2,5.00,1113131483672875455),(3812,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1113712769941574372','Cozy home in Woodlawn !','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally located home. Within short walking distance to Woodlawn park, great restaurants and food carts. A short drive to New  seasons and Natural grocers organic grocery stores.  Within 4 miles of convention center, within a 2 hour drive to the Oregon coast and Mt. hood national forest and an easy eight mile drive to Portland airport and close  to hospitals. Long driveway and garage for great parking options.  <br />Minimum of 30 nights stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1113712769941574372/original/c49ca37b-12fc-4a44-9303-1da1edebac15.jpeg',332266235,45,'45.57222','-122.65883',1,4,1.00,2.00,1.00,125.00,30,365,0,1.00,1113712769941574372),(3813,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1114039101986762310','Rose Den Retreat','Rose Den Retreat - a sunlit,  modern 1000 sf basement bedroom suite, conveying a sense of coziness and sophistication, convenient to urban entertainment venues, parks, and  public transportation. Lap up all Portland has to offer from our close-in location including, Adidas HQ, Overlook Wedding House, Mocks Crest Lookout, Forest Park, Washington Park, Moda Center, Mississippi Historic District, NW 23rd Ave, Pearl District, Esplanade, Delta Park Sport Complex and the Vancouver Waterfront.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTExNDAzOTEwMTk4Njc2MjMxMA%3D%3D/original/bdb0cb75-cd90-44c4-95c0-6d37c09ae73e.jpeg',367248748,13,'45.55246944397513','-122.6836339861962',2,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,94.00,2,29,0,1.00,1114039101986762310),(3814,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1114523330156345293','The Conservatory - Hawthorne Boho Victorian Room','Historically a queer and Jewish community home, our house is alive, loving, respectful, inclusive, and quiet. Folks are typically working during the day (though we\'ve frequently had nurses on the night shift as well) with a gentle hum of activity in the evenings. Walk to shops, restaurants, bars, groceries, parks - truly a wonderful, central location. Big covered porch, hot tub, outdoor spaces to enjoy. High ceilings and beautiful architectural touches, and comfortable, welcoming, and sweet.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1114523330156345293/original/b0852371-e7a6-4b44-8ea5-62e3f71fa34d.jpeg',267863188,16,'45.5158527','-122.6128575',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,36.00,30,90,2,5.00,1114523330156345293),(3815,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1114709133889331276','Cedar Room with Private Bath','Welcome to cedar room with a private bath that offers a tranquil retreat in a bustling location. Nestled conveniently near freeway 205, just a swift 7-minute drive from the airport, this spacious accommodation ensures easy access to major freeways and highways, making it a haven for travelers on the go.','Division and 109 neighborhood offers a rich tapestry of cultural experiences and community connections. The proximity to the Slavic grocery store adds to the neighborhood’s vibrant atmosphere, providing residents with access to authentic ingredients and flavors from Eastern Europe. Residents and visitors alike gather regularly for a multitude of events and gatherings, fostering a strong sense of camaraderie and belonging.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/97ed9b09-0ffe-4d4f-8570-a318f20af345.jpg',54667782,78,'45.5032696','-122.551048',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,43.00,3,180,9,4.67,1114709133889331276),(3816,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1115162220830257960','Luxury Open Plan Apt, Free Parking WFH Home Set up','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are located in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Pearl District, known for its rich culture and creativity. You\'ll find world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries just steps away. The Portland Streetcar stops right at your doorstep, and there are three nearby parks, making it a perfect place to live your best life.<br /><br />Here are some exciting things you can do in the area:<br /><br />The work score is 97, indicating excellent access to workspaces, and the transit score is 89, with many trams and light rail options throughout the city.<br />Feel free to bring your bike; there\'s a secured parking garage where you can safely store it for free.<br />Within a 10-block radius, there are plenty of attractions to explore. Be sure to check with the Portland City Council for updates on what\'s open.<br />You\'ll find a wide variety of delicious restaurants, both local gems and famous ones like Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop, Salt & Straw. The Pearl District and NW 23rd ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1115162220830257960/original/cb5a771a-acbb-4f5f-9005-a18a3844b028.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53051','-122.68172',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,8,5.00,1115162220830257960),(3817,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1115202901611749892','Walk to Alberta Arts & transit','Have fun in the food, drink, and nature paradise that is Portland! Centrally located in NE Portland, the house is a quick 5-minute walk to Williams Street and 15-minute walk to Alberta Arts and Mississippi districts, where you will find many good restaurants, food carts, breweries, bars, and coffee shops. Get to downtown Portland in 15 minutes via Uber or public transit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-48452803/original/2660ee2c-c6d1-412e-a9b4-5fa18ef62981.jpeg',33081979,14,'45.5551','-122.65899',2,1,1.50,0.00,0.00,0.00,1,365,20,4.50,1115202901611749892),(3818,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1115262013481264611','The Brooklyn Guesthouse','Welcome to the newest addition to the vibrant Brooklyn Neighborhood in Southeast Portland – the Brooklyn Guest House. We strive to create a memorable and comfortable experience for every guest, whether you are here for work or play. From our thoughtfully designed accommodations to our attentive service, we invite you to discover the essence of Portland hospitality and make yourself at home in our urban oasis. You will love the accessibility w/ downtown, OHSU & many other spots just minutes away','The Brooklyn neighborhood was originally named \"Brookland\" by Giddeon Tibbets due to the rivers, creeks, and lakes on his property.<br /><br />Since those days of German influence, you can still find delicious food down the street at Edel Weiss deli. Rose City Coffee is right around the block and has a delightful and talented staff of baristas ready to take your order.<br /><br />\"Today it is regarded as among southeast Portland\'s most desirable residential neighborhoods.\" - Wikipedia','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1115262013481264611/original/8626cfc0-0683-4acc-a68c-07d473725ccf.jpeg',215058058,56,'45.4973221','-122.649575',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,74.00,2,365,27,4.96,1115262013481264611),(3819,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1115569062428082384','The Lounge - Hawthorne Boho Victorian Room','Historically a queer and Jewish community home, our house is alive, loving, respectful, inclusive, and quiet. Folks are typically working during the day (though we\'ve frequently had nurses on the night shift as well) with a gentle hum of activity in the evenings. Walk to shops, restaurants, bars, groceries, parks - truly a wonderful, central location. Big covered porch, hot tub, outdoor spaces to enjoy. High ceilings and beautiful architectural touches, and comfortable, welcoming, and sweet.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1115569062428082384/original/8cd3be90-886d-44f7-922c-0f114a669e33.jpeg',267863188,15,'45.51694','-122.61189',2,2,2.00,1.00,1.00,35.00,30,90,1,4.00,1115569062428082384),(3820,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1115580969126070333','Landing | Incredible 1BD, Courtyard, Gym','Fall in love with the waterfront living lifestyle at Bridgetown Lofts, located in Portland\'s dynamic Northwest District. Be among the first to reside in these stunning apartment homes, where you\'ll wake up to breathtaking river views and the companionship of your beloved pet. Each residence is thoughtfully designed with chic interiors and tailored amenities to enhance your lifestyle.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1115580969126070333/original/b27a313d-7460-45c8-bd4a-caf0aa79eee2.jpeg',263502162,27,'45.53751547961821','-122.68492896057104',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,92.00,30,180,0,1.00,1115580969126070333),(3821,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1115581253756418961','Landing | Incredible 1BD,