q.ft. home. Enjoy the total calm and beauty of acres of parkland trails right at your doorstep. Walk to the Oregon Zoo, Arboretum, Rose Garden, Japanese Garden, archery range and just minutes to shops, groceries, boutiques and every amenity PDX has to offer. Minutes from Downtown, the Pearl, Slabtown and Beaverton and much more. (TIP: Save on Taxes by booking 32 nights or more)<br /><br />Contact host for room options.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1079258390103261404/original/3553d473-2d24-42c9-a73a-0e13ca197bde.jpeg',8333670,64,'45.51844','-122.71453',2,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,30,365,1,5.00,1116129638519716008),(3825,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1116953962654468791','Luxury Penthouse Living, Breathtaking Views, Huge','This private penthouse resides at the top of the Crane Building in Northwest Portland. Inside you will find modern luxury with vaulted celings, African Mahogany millwork, wide plank floors, and so much more.  Additionally there are seamless transitions to the private 1,282 square foot tarrace that wraps around three sides. You\'ll want to spend every moment you can ejoying the sights and sounds of of this downtown masterpiece.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1116953962654468791/original/f6adbfbc-2d89-495d-a2fe-be11991e50d6.jpeg',62261998,2,'45.5288','-122.68463',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,465.00,30,360,0,1.00,1116953962654468791),(3826,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1117483641338643701','Landing | Incredible 1BD, Gym, Courtyard','Fall in love with the waterfront living lifestyle at Bridgetown Lofts, located in Portland\'s dynamic Northwest District. Be among the first to reside in these stunning apartment homes, where you\'ll wake up to breathtaking river views and the companionship of your beloved pet. Each residence is thoughtfully designed with chic interiors and tailored amenities to enhance your lifestyle.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1117483641338643701/original/007508f2-0573-4e