e. The bedroom is the only one located on the first floor and the only other residents (other than our corgis) are my husband Matthew and myself!','Lents is a super walkable fun neighborhood with great access to the 205, 82nd Ave, Vancouver, the Airport and SE suburbs such as Milwaukee and Or city. We have bakeries, coffee shops, breweries and farmers markets all within walking distance. There’s 6 restaurants and a dispensary 1 block away and loads of public transportation.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1118338892460840636/original/aaf94419-763e-4ff7-b2db-31feaf3e6669.jpeg',501414071,72,'45.48213','-122.57635',2,2,0.00,0.00,0.00,0.00,30,90,2,5.00,1118338892460840636),(3830,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1118377452931102179','PDX Blue House, Art District.','Welcome to PDX Blue House, your perfect home-away-from-home in Portland’s vibrant Alberta Arts District. Just steps from top restaurants and art galleries, this charming historic house features a classic wraparound porch, spacious living areas, a fully stocked kitchen, and remodeled bathrooms. The large backyard with a fire pit is perfect for relaxing. With its comfort, style, and unbeatable location, PDX Blue House is ideal for a long stay. Book now and settle into Portland’s best neighborhood!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1118377452931102179/original/4198bd26-114e-4dc9-a209-5e596c21a8bc.jpeg',50747753,14,'45.563742666502904','-122.65551572795103',1,7,2.00,4.00,5.00,145.00,30,500,0,1.00,1118377452931102179),(3831,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1118829315479590507','Tiny House! in NE Portland','The Tiny House is a unique way to explore the city and stay in a memorable place! Located at the gateway to the Alberta Arts District, lots of restaurants, shopping, coffee shops, and more.<br /><br />Being that it\'s a tiny house on wheels, it is more like glamping than it is staying in a hotel. If you are expecting that type of stay, you will be very happy! If you are expecting a lux hotel, maybe not ;-)','Located at the gateway to Alberta Arts District! Walking distance to pubs, coffee, shops and more. Natural Grocers is located across the street, as is a food cart pod. It\'s just off MLK Blvd so it\'s close to public transport, easy to get to the max line, downtown, etc. It\'s in the city so expect there to be city noise, city people, etc.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1118829315479590507/original/8036478b-ecf7-49e3-9cd6-c5a5e5334eb8.jpeg',62203396,14,'45.558822977257925','-122.66048436060186',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,37.00,30,365,0,1.00,1118829315479590507),(3832,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1118848823530241848','Restful Retreat, near parks','Welcome to the little getaway tiny house in SW Portland! A relaxing retreat to enjoy while you explore all the fun of the city. Located within walking distance of public transport, Multnomah Village, coffee shops, etc., and less than 10 minutes drive to downtown, Lewis & Clark, OHSU, South Waterfront.<br /><br />The tiny house has many of the comforts of home. A fully stocked kitchenette, and cute bathroom along with a washer/dryer combo.<br /><br />Looking forward to hosting your visit soon!','Really nice neighborhood in SW Portland. Walkable to shops, restaurants, coffee, pubs, public transport, etc.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1118848823530241848/original/83d8e0f7-e729-42f4-8b0c-c45b437f2b46.jpeg',62203396,31,'45.47283','-122.69827',1,4,1.00,0.00,2.00,47.00,30,365,1,5.00,1118848823530241848),(3833,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1118939903326254346','Spacious 3 bedroom, pet friendly','Lovely 3 bedroom home in Glendoveer neighborhood. Granite kitchen countertops and stainless steel sink with pull down faucet. Tons of cabinet storage, including pantry. Newer garbage disposal and refrigerator, newer dishwasher and glass cooktop range. Bathroom comes with lots of built in storage. Large dining area with hardwood floors. Large, light-filled living room. Central heat/digital thermostat, ceiling fans throughout, new high-capacity hot water heater. Access to private backyard area.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1118939903326254346/original/751d8a0b-6217-43b0-82f6-9f471412f91b.jpeg',133384876,71,'45.53124185050341','-122.50428328018513',1,3,1.00,3.00,3.00,63.00,30,120,1,5.00,1118939903326254346),(3834,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1119514514855968653','Iconic Portland Stay: Suite w/ City Views Near Zoo','Immerse yourself in iconic Portland, where creativity meets history. Enjoy stunning city views, local art galleries, charming bookstores, and bustling markets right on your doorstep.','- Portland Art Museum - 0.2 miles<br />- Portland State University - 0.6 mile<br />- Portland Japanese Garden - 2.3 mile<br />- Oregon Museum of Science & Industry - 2.1 mile<br />- Oregon Zoo - 2.5 miles<br />- Pioneer Courthouse Square - 0.2 miles<br />- Powell\'s City of Books - 0.6 miles<br />- International Rose Test Garden - 2 miles<br />- Portland International Airport (PDX) - 11.3 miles<br />- Portland-Hillsboro Airport (HIO) - 15.8 miles<br />- Portland-Troutdale Airport (TTD) - 16 miles','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1119514514855968653/original/f5af5004-cb8f-4432-83e9-8eba3836580e.jpeg',501999278,44,'45.51722','-122.68107',4,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,1125,0,1.00,1119514514855968653),(3835,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1119516819261597587','Historic Charm Meets Modern Luxury in Downtown','Immerse yourself in iconic Portland, where creativity meets history. Enjoy stunning city views, local art galleries, charming bookstores, and bustling markets right on your doorstep.','- Portland Art Museum - 0.2 miles<br />- Portland State University - 0.6 mile<br />- Portland Japanese Garden - 2.3 mile<br />- Oregon Museum of Science & Industry - 2.1 mile<br />- Oregon Zoo - 2.5 miles<br />- Pioneer Courthouse Square - 0.2 miles<br />- Powell\'s City of Books - 0.6 miles<br />- International Rose Test Garden - 2 miles