irport. We 1 parking spot on driveway and plenty of free street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1119973903355947273/original/2de382ab-8f47-40d0-88b4-16bc7924dd4e.jpeg',75969980,78,'45.495284254660426','-122.54592993924062',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,1,7,15,4.93,1119973903355947273),(3850,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1120188929619416155','Holiday hygge! High design in chic urban loft.','Celebrate the season in luxury urban living. Open, airy design creates light, bright, spacious feel. Gourmet kitchen allows chefs to dream big in this small package. Miele & Beko appliances, compact wine fridge, Gas-on-Glass range is centerpiece of stunning island design. Garage door opens to garden for outdoor access. Full wet room bath with tub and rain shower. Private patio and front porch, private  entrance on Wiberg lane. Rais high efficiency woodstove cranks up the cozy factor.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1120188929619416155/original/0c8dc369-377f-4ca8-8a04-81fffeb52c7a.jpeg',60374968,46,'45.54251','-122.61497',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,30,90,0,1.00,1120188929619416155),(3851,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1120359728810940269','Stylish Craftsman in Charming Alameda Neighborhood','This 2 bedroom 1.5 bath house is located in NE Portland on the gorgeous Alameda Ridge. Very open with 2000 sqft. Many large windows with views overlooking the Ridge and neighborhood. Located in a friendly community, a short walk to restaurants, food carts, bars, bakeries, grocery & boutique stores, and parks.<br /><br />Our previous 5 years as superhosts unfortunately was deleted when we changed managers. Still the same great property!<br /><br />We love animals but have a strict no pet policy.','Charming, quiet, historic neighborhood near thriving Beaumont village shops, restaurants, and bars. Check out the many public stairways cutting up and down the Alameda Ridge.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1120359728810940269/original/f249a9fe-fc3d-46db-9eaf-25a79d2315e7.jpeg',40231311,11,'45.54273','-122.61234',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,260.00,4,365,8,5.00,1120359728810940269),(3852,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1121045393479463404','New Urban Pad N Williams Trendy Area PDX','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.-30+ day BRAND NEW REMODELED Urban Pad, Large 1 Bed / 1 Bath, Outdoor Space, steps to trendy areas restaurants, shops, bars, gyms, spas, New Seasons, entertainment, parks on N Vancouver Ave & N Williams Ave & Mississippi Close: adidas, Emanuel, OHSU, Univ. of Portland, Pearl District, Downtown100 Bike Score 85 Walking Score, public transportation max, bus','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1121045393479463404/original/cfca0fd8-adf6-4a65-b872-87aa41c9075f.jpeg',6242935,24,'45.55532','-122.66774',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,65.00,30,365,1,5.00,1121045393479463404),(3853,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1121211117934905786','Near craft breweries & artisan coffee shops','Experience comfort and convenience in our Two Queens Room with a flat-panel TV, free Wi-Fi, 5-star bedding, hypoallergenic pillows, and walk-in showers. Enjoy Fox Sports NW, bamboo flooring, city views, easy transit access, and a tabletop mini fridge for added convenience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1121211117934905786/original/0a8c01c3-5066-408c-81e3-24190d390983.jpeg',569132554,3,'45.522297','-122.695747',2,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,17,4.53,1121211117934905786),(3854,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1121211118089238750','Low-key escape in stately Goose Hollow','Indulge in modern comfort at our One Queen Room, featuring a flat-panel TV, high-speed internet, plush bedding, hypoallergenic amenities, walk-in shower, work area, bamboo flooring, Fox Sports NW, convenient transit access, and a tabletop mini-fridge, all in a prime location.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1121211118089238750/original/0369a1d4-9c39-4850-a3b4-0d57da180ee8.jpeg',569132554,3,'45.5223','-122.69575',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,81.00,1,365,41,4.44,1121211118089238750),(3855,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1121222625110476449','Private Retreat in Portland','Welcome to your cozy getaway, perfectly located just two blocks from the bustling Division Street in Southeast Portland. Our inviting rental offers the ideal base for exploring the vibrant local scene, with easy access to some of Portland\'s best dining, shopping, and entertainment options.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1121222625110476449/original/1da75f08-2449-4994-adc9-a37454475926.jpeg',39653154,8,'45.50235350622756','-122.63033399765655',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,155.00,1,365,3,5.00,1121222625110476449),(3856,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1121809076123517025','Elegant, Recently Upgraded Apt – Pearl District!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1121809076123517025/original/b2d64a59-c2e5-481f-8ca2-cad517449a87.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52911','-122.68116',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,217.00,30,1125,10,4.90,1121809076123517025),(3857,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1123160925297073037','Entire Suite In NE Portland','Welcome to Rose City and this cozy 1100 sqft basement apartment in central convenient NE Portland area. About 8 min to PDX airport, 12 min to downtown Portland, Convention Center, 20 min to downtown Vancouver, close to I84, I205 and I5. You will have endless options for enjoying the Portland scene from Rocky Butte, the Grotto, Portland City Grill. Minutes away from unique restaurants, brewery, bars, shopping centers. Hit some golf at nearby Rose City Golf Course, Glendoveer Golf Course.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1123160925297073037/original/80480651-6156-471b-b9bd-8573d6ba636e.jpeg',421805892,74,'45.5402584','-122.5749956',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,90.00,2,18,10,4.90,1123160925297073037),(3858,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1124767627626589847','Private Kenton Guest House','Modern home away from home, a block away from downtown Kenton and 2 blocks from Max station. Steps away from local restaurants, tap rooms and coffee shops! 1 queen bedroom and a full size pullout couch. Full kitchen, bathroom, in-unit laundry and private furnished back patio! Just 10 minutes from Downtown Portland, and 8 minutes from Vancouver, WA. Perfect spot for a quick PDX visit to explore the city or settle in with everything you could ever need!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1124767627626589847/original/bdb96bba-7f6d-4827-a6bc-2802286baa5a.jpeg',37615397,55,'45.5822102','-122.685211',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,111.00,1,29,37,5.00,1124767627626589847),(3859,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1125539005145196193','Modern studio in NE, one block to Williams Ave','Discover your urban sanctuary just steps from NE Williams Avenue! This trendy studio offers a private entrance, backyard patio, kitchenette, en suite bathroom, queen bed, and flat-screen TV. WiFi included. Immerse yourself in Portland\'s best: coffee shops, restaurants, bars, and boutiques. Need tips? We\'ve got you covered!','Williams Ave has everything you need for a wonderful stay in Portland. The James Beard finalist for best bakery (Jinju) is one block away (get a croissant). 3 coffee shops in walking distance (I prefer Hypnos). The most famous Thai restaurant EEM is two blocks down. Get there right at 5 to get on the waitlist, they don’t take reservations. <br /><br />Mississippi Ave is a quick 8 min walk with loads of bars and shopping as well.<br /><br />The northeast section of Portland is the perfect distance between the airport and downtown. You can also walk to Moda center for a show or hit up Alberta street for live music.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEyNTUzOTAwNTE0NTE5NjE5Mw%3D%3D/original/561cde18-5c88-4bb2-80d6-44aee4176842.jpeg',2498133,9,'45.55380805790574','-122.66538508236408',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,2,30,50,4.92,1125539005145196193),(3860,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1125542449347506354','Quiet, walkable 2BR with pool, gardens & 2 patios','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1125542449347506354/original/2eb725ba-b578-4e66-9e2e-31ae29500263.jpeg',112452733,18,'45.45836251206073','-122.71331133081777',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,186.00,2,1125,11,4.82,1125542449347506354),(3861,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1127010490662298590','Budget friendly studio Location!','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located apartment building.  Designed by TVA Architects this building and its location will not disappoint.  Only two blocks to Safeway grocery store and five blocks to Whole Foods grocery store.  Endless, shops, cafés and restaurants just out your door.   The famed streetcar is only a block and a half away.<br /><br />Everything is provided to make your stay as comfortable as possible, including a full-size washer and dryer, dish washer and air conditioning.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1127010490662298590/original/28290973-73ab-40f7-9b1d-54e915a79189.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52788222947498','-122.68532167752811',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,61.00,31,365,0,1.00,1127010490662298590),(3862,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1128335342341697625','Private Studio NE Portland','Escape to a charming guesthouse in Portland’s Alberta Arts District, brimming with eateries, murals, coffee shops, bars, galleries and unique shops. Relax in your private retreat, furnished with a queen bed, fold-out couch, fully-equipped kitchen, and serene outdoor space. <br /><br />The space is nestled in the backyard, separate from the main house, ensuring ultimate privacy & tranquility.  Relax and unwind with everything you\'ll need for your time in Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEyODMzNTM0MjM0MTY5NzYyNQ%3D%3D/original/6876321d-125f-4ad8-9e10-7184c2ea7e4c.jpeg',473872760,1,'45.55980554109836','-122.63819364936383',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,124.00,1,365,66,4.98,1128335342341697625),(3863,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1128646883152487910','Discounts for monthly stays - new basement apt.','Newly renovated 800 sq ft one bedroom basement apartment. Nice quiet neighborhood with street parking . Fully furnished with washer and dryer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1128646883152487910/original/53f2e0e1-36f1-4884-8b7c-257e1e2f2e34.jpeg',78533154,65,'45.48321003104697','-122.5887608255266',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,74.00,30,90,0,1.00,1128646883152487910),(3864,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1129021561053153992','Lovely 2BR, patio, free parking','One level two bedroom home. Comfortable king beds. Central heating and cooling. Patio and garden for outdoor relaxation. Free off street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1129021561053153992/original/828d6911-a2f9-4215-bd97-3367a811eed6.jpeg',493660370,63,'45.53294','-122.52366',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,78.00,1,365,24,4.79,1129021561053153992),(3865,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1129093985409455291','Portland at your doorstep','Newly built studio space above garage, one queen bed and a futon couch for extra sleeping space. Shared backyard with owners who love to host, beautiful patio and hot tub!  Enjoy the beauty of one of Portland\'s oldest and most beautiful neighborhoods with modern conveniences.  Very comfortable and an easy walk, bike or ride share to anywhere in Portland\'s center.  Food carts, restaurants, bars and entertainment are all within minutes.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1129093985409455291/original/842f540a-a122-40be-bf5a-f64cb42b5671.jpeg',122948453,25,'45.5110375','-122.6513326',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,119.00,1,30,69,4.99,1129093985409455291),(3866,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1129758384498928541','Sunnyside Up!  By Laurelhurst','Explore our Close-In South East Portland area from Steffies House. Take in all that Portland has to offer, and check out our local Food Carts using this affordable top floor apartment to come back to. Recharge here or at big beautiful Laurelhurst Park just 2 blocks away. Rivers, forests and beaches make great day-trips. Historical Hawthorne Blvd has great local shops, cafes, restaurants, many grocery stores,  library, a great plant nursery, all within easy walking distance. Trimet and Max, too.','Mostly residential area inbetween main roads and shopping with awesome park too. Bike friendly, great walk scores.<br />Laurelhurst Park is 1.6 miles around for walking and jogging, make friends at the Pickleball and Tennis courts. There are sidewalks everywhere here for safe walking and jogging too.<br /> Mt Tabor offers a huge city park as well. you may venture further out to Lower Mclay Park, etc, so many parks!<br /> Local Portland Nursery is just maybe 1/2 a mile away, be sure to check that out too. It\'s Spring! Enjoy the Abundance!<br />3 theaters pretty close, as well as lots of other great places to explore around here.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/27f07769-44b3-481a-978f-3de00b4cc5d7.jpg',395535389,16,'45.518137121528014','-122.62270626129421',1,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,46.00,30,30,1,3.00,1129758384498928541),(3867,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1130031081574563446','Modern Family Farmhouse','Relax with the whole family at this peaceful walkable Portland home.  Originally built in 1920, but a complete remodel in 2020 including adding 3 floors. This tall modern farmhouse has it all.   State of the art kitchen,  fireplace, kids play area, loaded gym including peloton and TRX, outdoor kitchen and living area plus hot tub and a variety of work from home office space.  We are a 5 minute walk to shops and restaurants and a 10 minute drive to most of Portlands Eastside hot spots!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1130031081574563446/original/233c7045-8a6c-43f0-a67b-529f8742528f.jpeg',6313800,46,'45.544202','-122.6164076',1,7,3.50,3.00,4.00,244.00,30,45,0,1.00,1130031081574563446),(3868,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1130621358405748421','Rich history of celeb guests back in the day','Our hotel rooms & suites in Portland, OR are designed to provide each guest with an opportunity to \"stay like a local\" during their time at Mark Spencer Hotel.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1130621358405748421/original/a468db71-e5fd-488e-8b72-0684affd634d.jpeg',562929837,44,'45.522133','-122.682362',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,86.00,1,365,32,4.81,1130621358405748421),(3869,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1131405572344348513','NEW Custom Home in SE Division!','30 day minimum booking. Beautiful detached unit comes fully equipped. Show-stopping design with vaulted ceiling, open beam, skylight and storage loft. Lots of light comes in the open living space. Kitchen comes fully equipped, with full-size appliances, living room has TV and comfy seating. Sunroom leads to large bathroom with full-size washer and dryer and tile tub. Quiet and private bedroom has king size bed and quality linens. All utilities, A/C, and dedicated high speed internet included.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1131405572344348513/original/4bae034b-d520-4e9f-a416-290cc60f1695.jpeg',38307544,8,'45.505086342640105','-122.61894658227766',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,82.00,30,365,0,1.00,1131405572344348513),(3870,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1132818126374104678','Forest Retreat Portland *Non-Toxic Stay','Welcome to the Forest Retreat - Designed with nature in mind!<br /><br />A retreat to get back to the basics, for a restorative reset from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Wake up with the sunrise, make some french press, take a few breaths on the meditation pillow and head down the block to one of the many trailheads within walking distance.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1132818126374104678/original/0750dc9a-301b-4689-a080-3f29094af747.jpeg',33397453,49,'45.45162281780336','-122.68327893132182',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,28,12,5.00,1132818126374104678),(3871,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1132842623187348861','2 Bedroom Apartment  Portland - Steps to Moda','Enjoy all the quirky Portland sights from this centrally located haven just a short walk from the Moda Center, Memorial Coliseum, and the Wonder Ballroom. Nestled close in and between N Williams and NE Martin Luther King Jr Blvd, this prime location puts you within easy reach of everything that Portland offers. Our charming 2 bedroom, 1 bath basement apartment offers you 900 sq ft of living space with a separate entrance in a gorgeous remodeled Victorian style house in the middle of everything.','For shows, sports and big events, Northeast Portland is hard to beat. It’s also home to many popular neighborhoods, where you’ll find excellent eateries and culture galore.<br /><br />Portland’s largest quadrant boasts striking architecture, historic theaters, a variety of public golf courses and other attractions. It comprises numerous colorful neighborhoods, including the Alberta Arts District, Hollywood, Williams, Lloyd and many more. If you’re coming to Portland for a big event — like a Trail Blazers game at the Moda Center, a concert at the Veterans Memorial Coliseum or a conference at the Oregon Convention Center — odds are good that Northeast Portland is your destination. This quadrant is also home to top-notch restaurants and bars, and noteworthy sights like the Grotto.<br /><br />Northeast Portland is located north of East Burnside Street, east of North Williams Avenue and the Willamette River, and south of the Columbia River. Inner Northeast is a bustling urban environment of','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEzMjg0MjYyMzE4NzM0ODg2MQ%3D%3D/original/76e72e4a-3c80-4922-ba97-c593a2cabf6a.jpeg',419836336,26,'45.53755','-122.66397',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,109.00,1,29,20,4.95,1132842623187348861),(3872,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1132842856981419943','Hawthorne 2 Bedroom Basement','Experience the best of Southeast Portland from the comfort of this freshly renovated basement apartment in our family’s home. <br /><br />Your private entrance is steps off of bustling Hawthorne Blvd. You’ll descend in to a space that is clean, secluded, and quiet. You can rest and recuperate in the comfort of premium amenities highlighting  the best of Portland and the Pacific Northwest.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEzMjg0Mjg1Njk4MTQxOTk0Mw%3D%3D/original/69fb9b15-c585-4ef8-8450-acce317780b7.jpeg',872359,25,'45.5114316070704','-122.6373758634369',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,1,3,3,5.00,1132842856981419943),(3873,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1133977616751033752','Cozy family friendly apartment','Only a 12 minute drive from the airport, feel right at home in this charming and cozy one-bedroom apartment. Located in a delightful neighborhood brimming with attractions, you\'ll have everything you need for an enjoyable stay. Explore a variety of restaurants and shops, all within walking distance of two beautiful parks.<br /><br />*PLEASE NOTE that this apartment is located in the basement, so you will hear sounds from our home above. More about this in the notes.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1133977616751033752/original/59887d35-f929-4712-95eb-723dc5ae8e95.jpeg',25561,46,'45.55539','-122.6210175',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,1,14,22,4.73,1133977616751033752),(3874,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1134896351586725884','Sellwood Spacious Apt./WiFi/King bed','Gorgeous one bedroom, two twin bed (can be converted into a king upon request), one bath, in the desirable Sellwood neighborhood. It is located upstairs. It has a gated private courtyard, dedicated onsite parking.  Living room, fully equipped kitchen, parking onsite (first come-first serve), and large deck. Walking distance to restaurants, stores, coffee shops, New Seasons, CVS, Wonderful location, OHSU. Service dogs allowed.','This neighborhood doesn\'t get any better! You have the water front, parks, great restaurants, bars, coffee shops and stores all within walking distance, making it really convenient for all your needs and JUST MINUTES AWAY FROM DOWNTOWN! <br />Daily errands can be accomplished on a bike, there are bike lanes and trails, road connectivity to Downtown and most of the attractions in Portland.<br />Sellwood-Moreland is considered one of the best places to live in Oregon. It offers residents an urban feel. Many families and young professionals live in Sellwood-Moreland.<br />One of the best things about this very walkable neighborhood is how incredibly friendly, safe and clean it is!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/a061ceef-e27b-4602-b6a5-85b9069ce38c.jpg',213350724,20,'45.45878605054108','-122.64811329158725',1,2,1.00,1.00,4.00,110.00,30,365,1,5.00,1134896351586725884),(3875,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1134913304328830737','Serene Studio Sanctuary','Newly furnished studio located in the heart of the city centralized in Portland historical and famed Mississippi neighborhood. While you explore the city!  Traveling for business or vacation, our private guest studio has all you need to recharge and relax. Amenities include High-speed Wifi, cable clean linens, laundry machines, Keurig electric kettle, and more. Uncompetitive free street parking<br />Please feel free to reach out with any questions or concerns<br />12mins-OHSU 7mins-Kaiser 5mins-Emanuel','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1134913304328830737/original/e33b91b9-06fa-4113-b067-f6df028e054e.jpeg',385154341,24,'45.56291160692881','-122.66864061355591',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,31,365,0,1.00,1134913304328830737),(3876,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1135437412474835351','Gorgeous 1BR Apt in the heart of Downtown PDX','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1135437412474835351/original/305ade48-17fc-4a9b-819e-d4eb32cf00f8.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52881','-122.68133',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,168.00,30,1125,4,4.50,1135437412474835351),(3877,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1135579556531818807','2BR-1BA Bungalow with Hot Tub!','Welcome to your cozy retreat in Portland! Nestled in a serene neighborhood minutes from downtown and OHSU, this charming bungalow offers the perfect blend of convenience and relaxation. Unwind in the private hot tub* after a day exploring the city\'s eclectic vibes. With tasteful decor, equipped kitchen, and nearby hiking trails, this retreat promises a rejuvenating stay for up to five guests. Experience Portland\'s vibrant culture from your peaceful oasis.<br /><br />*One time $25 hot tub use fee per stay','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1135579556531818807/original/74b406ed-3186-4468-939b-aebc52dcca0f.jpeg',125873825,22,'45.4904','-122.67914',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,185.00,1,365,7,5.00,1135579556531818807),(3878,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1135653366481910590','The Perfect Portland Escape ~ Chef\'s Kitchen','Newly built townhome with everything you could imagine to make your Portland trip effortless. With high end finishes and tasteful design, falling in love is merely a formality. Explore Portland\'s exceptional restaurant scene, or dine in with the beautiful chef\'s kitchen and luxurious appliances.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-555824778380966061/original/a0c4d927-360b-4209-8856-ed966e591f69.jpeg',11279818