g-lite private deck, with a hot tub for you, and a fully fenced, side yard for the 4-legged family members.  A dog park is also just across the street. Free, easy off-street parking and easy access to downtown too.','Very quiet, safe, mature neighborhood with off street parking.  While we are 7 minutes from PSU, this is not a college housing neighborhood.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTEzNjMyODk0NDg3MTM5NTg2MA%3D%3D/original/bbac8dec-7cab-4f02-90b9-10ecf7cf94cd.jpeg',179379371,54,'45.49972','-122.71276',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,2,365,30,5.00,1136328944871395860),(3882,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1136398224149109941','D & M Homestay','Cozy light & bright 2 bedroom, 1 bath apartment.  Has own separate entrance and is privately located  in a fully fenced backyard.  The unit is equipped with a full functioning basic kitchen set up if desired to cook a light meal, have a cup of coffee or tea while sitting at the breakfast nook listening to the birds in the surrounding trees.  This unit is conveniently located within walking distance to the bueatiful town of N. Portland St Johns that has many great restaurants and pubs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1136398224149109941/original/504be093-26f8-4112-9163-050d75897f2f.jpeg',253123241,58,'45.59535789478961','-122.75127254198992',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,115.00,2,14,15,5.00,1136398224149109941),(3883,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1136596010962834566','The North Tabor Retreat ~ Families & Remote Work','Newly built townhome with everything you could imagine to make your Portland trip effortless. With high end finishes and tasteful design, falling in love is merely a formality. Explore Portland\'s exceptional restaurant scene, or dine in with the beautiful chef\'s kitchen and luxurious appliances.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-552848042925497266/original/52812f31-9822-4699-872e-314dbe2164e7.jpeg',112798186,52,'45.52628','-122.6056',1,4,2.50,2.00,2