ransportation options.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1138634792355772519/original/6cde250c-8eb0-4dde-b9f2-49d23c4f2bc9.jpeg',62261998,59,'45.533727786090374','-122.65701369716125',1,8,1.00,2.00,4.00,113.00,3,29,13,4.69,1138634792355772519),(3890,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1138770647064475997','Hawthorne Hideaway','A former back yard brewery has been fully renovated and transformed into a peaceful home. Steps to shops, restaurants & theaters. Walk to everything! The bedroom is a spacious loft that includes a queen bed and a work area. Full kitchen is stocked with anything you need to cook a great meal. A shared backyard  with outdoor cooking space includes a grill and a small patio for your use.  Laundry facilities are in the main house and available once a week on Sunday. Hot tub not available.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1138770647064475997/original/d766d6a8-975c-4d0e-bdba-ae36c358ea88.jpeg',573243587,8,'45.5105221','-122.6311662',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,31,180,3,5.00,1138770647064475997),(3891,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1139450493232176586','Chic 4 BR Home Steps Away from Portland Eateries','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. Our private and spacious four-bedroom home sits in the heart of the eclectic Burnside District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.<br /><br />With a convenient home base within walking distance to the neighborhood hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDA0MzU0ODc%3D/original/058f066a-d100-4165-a04c-c9757bf6b895.jpeg',310753989,12,'45.523651856975206','-122.63382016353896',1,10,2.00,4.00,0.00,265.00,1,365,7,3.71,1139450493232176586),(3892,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1139863250721566913','Massive 8BD Home Steps from Trendy SE Pdx Eateries','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. This recently renovated home takes its place among SE\'s many photogenic charmers. Inside this worldly seven bedroom home you\'ll find period details like rich hardwoods and sunny windows combined with a minimalist, serene design for pure relaxation. When you\'re good and zen, head out to explore Division / Hawthorne \"foodie row\" with some of the best restaurants in PDX at your doorstep','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-999305306050472647/original/19bd16cf-f840-4d27-af60-189a607e502d.jpeg',309565441,8,'45.504887195303795','-122.62202806884981',1,16,2.00,7.00,8.00,464.00,1,365,10,4.80,1139863250721566913),(3893,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1140572853357689691','Cabin Charli~Backyard Oasis','Enjoy a private stay at this modern tiny home with easy access to local restaurants, bars, and coffee shops just a block away or a 5-10min drive to popular neighborhoods such as Mississippi, Alberta and Williams. You\'ll have everything you need to be comfortable in this cozy, fully functional home that features a queen size bed, full bathroom, kitchenette, and off street parking in our driveway. We are dog friendly so feel free to bring your well-trained pup! No cats please due to allergies.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0MDU3Mjg1MzM1NzY4OTY5MQ%3D%3D/original/0005b172-e78c-46c1-bfa7-77e9d9f3ca5e.jpeg',22568116,13,'45.56313','-122.68122',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,86.00,1,7,75,5.00,1140572853357689691),(3894,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1140825297879197193','Modern 2-BR Sanctuary - A Walkers Paradise','Welcome to our 2-bedroom basement unit in the heart of SE Portland! This brand new basement unit has large windows that invite the sunshine in. Perfectly situated in a highly walkable neighborhood, between Division and Hawthorne district. You\'re just steps away from trendy cafes, local shops, and