-new private guest cottage, thoughtfully designed to provide the perfect stay.  blend of comfort and convenience. Inside, you’ll find a comfy queen-size Murphy bed, a fully equipped kitchen with a full-size oven, microwave, air fryer, refrigerator, and even a washer and dryer for your convenience as well as HIGH Speed Wi-Fi keeps you connected during your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0MTYwNDg2ODczMTkyOTE1Nw%3D%3D/original/b14dd13d-b266-4fd5-b4e9-2638b2620696.jpeg',52609760,46,'45.55467','-122.61972',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,89.00,1,365,31,4.74,1141604868731929157),(3898,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1142141767426237714','Quiet Spacious Woodstock Retreat','Welcome to Woodstock Retreat! Perfect for families and professionals, this open space features a modern design, vaulted living space, chef’s kitchen, comfy furniture, and large backyard! The perfect place to relax after a hard day of work or play. Dream on the extremely comfortable beds and kick back on the enormous deck with a coffee or local brew.  Snuggle up by the fireplace with a book or movie. Enjoy the neighborhood and easy walk to coffee shops, restaurants, grocers, and Woodstock Park!','Woodstock is a trendy and desirable neighborhood with a great community vibe.  A lovely 15 minute walk will take you to numerous restaurants, an amazing new food cart pod with bar service, coffee shops, Grand Central Bakery, Otto’s Sausage Kitchen and Meat Market (with a great deli!), New Seasons and Safeway grocers, pet store, Veterinarian, and much more!!<br />Spacious Woodstock park is right down the block (easy 3 minute walk) with an off-leash dog area, playground, and softball fields.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1142141767426237714/original/b4008715-a994-4040-a46c-dd45c95ce212.jpeg',4139648,38,'45.4862681','-122.6120995',1,5,2.00,2.00,3.00,237.00,2,365,12,5.00,1142141767426237714),(3899,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1143446520850754123','The Tuscan VlLLA ~ Kitchen ~ Stylish Villa','★ ENTIRE SPACE is PRIVATE, BATH TOO! ★ KOI POND ★ FIBER OPTIC WIFI <br />★ INCLUDES OATMEAL BREAKFAST, TEA & STARBUCKS COFFEE<br /><br />★AC  ★LUXURIOUS STEARNS & FOSTER MATTRESS<br /><br />★ PRIVATE OUTDOOR ENTRANCE with LOCKBOX - ARRIVE ANYTIME!<br /><br />★ GRANITE KITCHENETTE: Refrigerator/Freezer/Microwave Oven/Toaster/Electric Cooktop Range/Mr Coffee Maker/Hot Water Kettle + more!<br /><br />★ KOI POND ★ TROPICAL GARDENS ★ OUTDOOR TABLES & CHAIRS<br /><br />★ RAIN HEAD NATURAL STONE SHOWER with massaging pebble floor... ahhh!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1143446520850754123/original/be89210d-c1aa-4e39-9f15-7a9e3e5c99b8.jpeg',4884977,15,'45.52214','-122.59511',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,1,28,46,4.89,1143446520850754123),(3900,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1143529693618699297','Urban Oasis- Stylish Penthouse Retreat in PDX','Luxurious Penthouse Retreat with City Views <br /><br />Escape to sophistication and serenity in our stunning penthouse apartment, where modern elegance meets urban convenience. Located on the top floor of the esteemed Dorian building, this spacious and well-appointed unit offers the perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience for your next getaway.','Just a few minutes walking distance to well loved venue, The Revolution Hall (we suggest making reservations for their beautiful roof top bar, with incredible food, drink and Portland views. Also within one minutes walk to the well known Sandy Hut Bar and Grill which recently turned 100 years old and has become a popular Portland staple. We own a small bar downstairs as well called the Chandelier, stop by for a cocktail or charcuterie board Wednesday through Saturday 4pm-11pm. Very close to the famous Voodoo Doughnuts and several businesses and well loved iconic Portland businesses.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1143529693618699297/original/088ae679-f501-45ae-ac79-338511ae38fb.jpeg',474734231,32,'45.52223','-122.65099',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,239.00,1,28,17,4.94,1143529693618699297),(3901,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1144243912847040448','Private ADU 2 Bed Suite, Private Bath, Kitchenette','Enjoy a peaceful, private experience at this centrally-located ADU studio +w/kitchenette in a Lovely 1940\'s, fully equipped, beautifully maintained neighborhood, home, gardens. Comfortably sleeps 3-4, w/one queen & 1 double bed. Private bathroom.  Steps from public transportation, walk to great restaurants, coffee shops, healthy groceries, bakery\'s, 420, live entertainment, 4.4 mi to PDX Airy, 2 mi from Convention Center 2 mi from City Center, 2 (dog) parks just a fewblks away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/93f519e8-8126-485d-8ca2-ba6b09df531b.jpg',748943,46,'45.54805','-122.62961',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,129.00,1,365,1,5.00,1144243912847040448),(3902,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1144255058369098541','Room in Beautiful Backyard ADU','Keep things simple in this peaceful backyard hideaway, featuring lots of natural light and the latest in eco-friendly design, materials, fixtures and technology. A glass sliding door onto a covered stone patio extends the living space into the bird-friendly garden. Perfect for a quiet, single person, you will share this beautiful, little 2-story, 2-bedroom house with the owner. Just two blocks from restaurants & shops on N Williams and centrally located with easy access to any part of town.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1144255058369098541/original/622bb410-41bf-417b-b628-f9f7025cee23.jpeg',11122733,14,'45.55406953121386','-122.66386718014168',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,52.00,31,120,0,1.00,1144255058369098541),(3903,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1144309034763332769','Very walkable ~ Alberta Arts District','Experience Portland\'s sought after Alberta Arts neighborhood at Studio 5304, our small (but mighty!) tiny home. Walk to Portland\'s best food, drink, and entertainment spots. Stay at Studio 5304 and enjoy Portland like a local!','The Alberta Arts District in Portland, Oregon, located in the Northeast quadrant, boasts a vibrant atmosphere characterized by its eclectic mix of art galleries, boutiques, and restaurants lining NE Alberta Street. Known for its street art and murals, the neighborhood hosts numerous community events and festivals throughout the year, showcasing local talent and fostering a sense of inclusivity. With a diverse culinary scene and live music venues, the Alberta Arts District offers a dynamic experience that celebrates creativity and culture.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0NDMwOTAzNDc2MzMzMjc2OQ%3D%3D/original/d3a261e9-3725-4f1b-b690-705a56d008a7.jpeg',32095859,1,'45.56083384537864','-122.63655921461019',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,70.00,1,365,18,4.94,1144309034763332769),(3904,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1144823622243583511','Urban Oasis','Have fun with the whole family at this stylish Reed/Woodstock home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1144823622243583511/original/a775331a-aae3-4936-8e9f-9308f621b93c.jpeg',31648101,38,'45.48754820725635','-122.62171242918244',1,6,2.00,3.00,0.00,250.00,5,365,2,3.50,1144823622243583511),(3905,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1144955695104864005','Quiet Urban Oasis w/Garden.','2 BD/1 BA House 12 Minute by car to Downtown Portland Waterfront., 35 minutes by bus. 896 Sq ft home. 3 Designated Parking Spots Included in price. Free street parking on the street.  Guests allowed to host small party of up to 15 guests with prior notice and additional fee based on size of party. <br /><br />Basic Amenities:<br /><br />Kitchen with basic cooking utensils<br />50 Inch smart tv in Living space w/soundbar<br />Tea/Coffee Station<br />Wine Glasses <br />Pets allowed with additional fee.<br />Extra Cots available at request','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1144955695104864005/original/4c50af60-ac63-40fa-be71-51a49871441c.jpeg',462140560,68,'45.44127586565096','-122.74211069215313',1,7,1.00,2.00,4.00,117.00,30,365,0,1.00,1144955695104864005),(3906,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1145007203120557567','Fantastic Southeast Retreat, Pet Friendly','This wonderful retreat is tucked into a quiet corner of southeast Portland just up from the edge of Johnson Creek. The location sits a few miles from groceries, shopping, and entertainment and you can be in downtown Portland in less than 10 miles.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1145007203120557567/original/178eeab9-5acb-4166-96d9-6f156733ea8c.jpeg',4732860,77,'45.47186','-122.52434',1,6,2.50,3.00,4.00,102.00,1,365,22,4.77,1145007203120557567),(3907,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1145271768067601637','Multnomah Village Hideout','Explore our new, artist-built bungalow in Multnomah Village, Portland. This cozy space sleeps four with a queen bed upstairs and a pullout couch downstairs. Steps away are charming cafes, shops, and a park with hiking trails and dog parks. Enjoy local activities like bingo and dining on pet-friendly patios. Complete with essentials including laundry and a breakfast nook, this bungalow is perfect for both short and extended stays, offering a unique Portland experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0NTI3MTc2ODA2NzYwMTYzNw%3D%3D/original/d3b6bca4-c7e4-4642-9c5e-bed2695c9fd9.jpeg',132257876,18,'45.4695234','-122.7122587',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,138.00,2,31,28,5.00,1145271768067601637),(3908,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1145527687477416157','Calming, Serene, Comfortable','Relax and unwind in this comfortable and calming well appointed space!!<br /><br />Long stay discounts of 15% off!!<br /><br />Nice sized room has all you need!  Full size sized comfy bed with luxury linens. Desk/ office chair, High Speed WIFI, Black out curtains, 32 inch HDX smart TV W/Netflix,  Small fridge with freezer. Microwave and coffee maker and toaster oven. <br /><br />Close to Bus, light rail, <br />stores, gas, restaurants, coffee, movie theater, and more!!<br /><br />Close to Columbia River Gorge and 1 hr to Mt Hood Skiing!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0NTUyNzY4NzQ3NzQxNjE1Nw%3D%3D/original/6664fbdf-2ed9-4fcc-a369-355531ee2ff2.jpeg',19259335,87,'45.51813090558277','-122.49251537024975',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,32.00,30,180,2,5.00,1145527687477416157),(3909,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1145635386373543847','Blueground | Hillsboro, nr shops & restaurants','Show up and start living from day one in Portland with this bright one bedroom Blueground apartment. You’ll love coming home to this thoughtfully furnished, beautifully designed, and fully-equipped Pearl District home . (ID #PDX20)','This furnished home is located in the Pearl District. It’s a walkable, vibrant area of Portland that offers easy access to fashionable retail spots, excellent dining venues, and endless entertainment. Nearby, you\'ll find Jamison Square, Union Station, and a variety of local eateries like Verde Cocina en la Perla, Break Bread, Pho Van Fresh, and Allora. You can also reach convenient shopping spots for groceries and more. Nearby attractions include Powell\'s City of Books, the Portland Art Museum, and the Roseland Theater.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1145635386373543847/original/c78cb034-4169-47c2-98c0-cd7824fedfd4.jpeg',107434423,2,'45.52748039999999','-122.6806115',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,121.00,31,1125,0,1.00,1145635386373543847),(3910,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1145760001781211130','Artsy Dual Suite Bungalow','Welcome to our artsy oasis in Portland\'s Alberta Arts District. This cozy bungalow offers two units for added privacy, each with its own charm. Upstairs, discover two bedrooms, a full bath, a fully equipped kitchen and large live edge wood dining table perfect for gatherings and shared moments. Downstairs a private suite awaits with a cozy bedroom, bath, and its own kitchenette - offering a serene escape or a cozy hideaway, complete with a separate entrance. 4 blocks from Alberta Arts District.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1145760001781211130/original/4e9d4cd9-fc53-4b6f-87dd-9ab20b421e3a.jpeg',1618,29,'45.56290790000001','-122.65186',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,248.00,1,365,1,5.00,1145760001781211130),(3911,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1146402274673839839','Historic NW Portland Studio Loft','Furniture may differ from photographs. This unique place has a style all its own. Built in the early 1900s, this home blends character and original architecture, all while being conveniently located in the beautiful NW Portland Park blocks. You will be just steps to a delicious Italian eatery and around the corner from a local wine shop.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0NjQwMjI3NDY3MzgzOTgzOQ%3D%3D/original/3f53bcaf-79db-4089-a172-bc710b83bb86.jpeg',522779263,2,'45.5269042','-122.6795883',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,105.00,30,730,0,1.00,1146402274673839839),(3912,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1146419744923078371','Corner One Bed! Views! Location!','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located corner one bedroom. <br /><br />This gorgeous place in the heart of The Pearl offers easy access to fashionable retail spots, excellent dining venues, endless entertainment and quick walk to Safeway or Whole Foods.  Nearby attractions include Powell\'s City of Books, Portland Art Museum, Roseland Theater, and Lan Su Chinese Garden. During your stay, you\'ll love the contemporary design, floor-to-ceiling windows, airy bedroom, and in unit washer/dryer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1146419744923078371/original/51d82a01-9525-4d81-a811-4202311ccd19.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52935','-122.68425',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,81.00,31,365,0,1.00,1146419744923078371),(3913,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1146434679684915769','Kerby Basement Studio','This is a basement apartment in a charming old  craftsman house located two blocks from Mississippi Ave.<br /><br />The basement has its own entrance, and to access the studio, one must pass through a small common area with a washer and dryer. <br />There is a small kitchen and bathroom. <br /><br />The space is nice and cool in the hot Portland summer.<br /><br />There is a respectful couple and their dog that live upstairs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1146434679684915769/original/fa0f6b61-1d84-4edd-9339-0589d85dddd1.jpeg',1922050,9,'45.55259439020436','-122.67179571804203',1,1,1.00,0.00,1.00,88.00,30,100,0,1.00,1146434679684915769),(3914,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1146518474439100798','Cozy 2 BR Apartment Near OHSU','Entire 2BD/2.5Ba apartment with nature at your doorstep. Just 2 mins from OHSU and 10 mins from downtown Portland, you can easily enjoy all aspects of Portland. Or, stay in and relax in the comfortable living room, watching your favorite shows on the smart TV. Make this place your home away from home and discover the beauty of the Pacific Northwest','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1146518474439100798/original/cc892334-2b77-46d0-810f-3f156182d595.jpeg',529320812,30,'45.49742','-122.6917',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,1146518474439100798),(3915,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1146540824139456850','Comfortable 2BD/2.5BA Apartment','Escape to this entire 2-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom apartment with nature right outside your door. Conveniently located just 2 minutes from OHSU and a quick 10-minute drive to downtown Portland, you\'ll have easy access to all that the city has to offer. Alternatively, unwind in the cozy living room with a smart TV, where you can catch up on your favorite shows. Make this your home away from home and experience the wonders of the Pacific Northwest!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1146518474439100798/original/cc892334-2b77-46d0-810f-3f156182d595.jpeg',529320812,30,'45.497531609750375','-122.6899890767588',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,1146540824139456850),(3916,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1146596173399024600','Minimalist Sanctuary Steps from Alberta Street','A sun-soaked house in the heart of the Alberta Arts District — your home away from home. This private oasis features a comfortable loft bedroom, a sleek kitchen and private kitchenette, a versatile office space and a cozy living room — all designed with luxury, beauty and function in mind. Explore NE Alberta Street just steps away, or unwind in our spacious backyard. Quiet, safe and centrally located, here you’ll find inspiration, comfort and convenience in one package.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1145343227978455368/original/af1a218b-3f31-4a8a-83dd-8de325b62dfc.jpeg',51450038,29,'45.55811','-122.64474',2,2,0.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,28,200,2,5.00,1146596173399024600),(3917,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1147107049645509565','Spacious Studio Long Stays Pet Friendly w/Backyard','Welcome to Cedar & Porch Properties! <br /><br />Recently remodeled vintage stucco duplex, tons of charm and original character! We designed the furnishing to have a distinct Portland vibe with a mix of vintage pieces and locally sourced decor, but with all the comforts of home. Beautiful space featuring original hardwood floors, & new modern fixtures. Super close to bus lines and MAX light rail public transportation, as well as local restaurants. Fenced backyard and extra storage in the utility room.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-1147107049645509565/original/4f5f3b05-6932-430f-ba5e-7cdb953b003a.jpg',1828909,48,'45.578193134676816','-122.67435062538361',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,1147107049645509565),(3918,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1147335083509448390','New 1 bed, 1 bath! Walk to Alberta and Mississippi','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1147335083509448390/original/42575845-a6a8-4bd0-a5e2-433e6868bb1b.jpeg',77828962,24,'45.55673','-122.66675',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,90.00,60,180,0,1.00,1147335083509448390),(3919,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1147390152414082997','*NEW* Hale Tiki Aloha Portland Hawaiian Experience','Hale Tiki is your Hawaiian inspired stateside retreat! We’ve got all the “Aloha” charm you’re looking for in the heart of Portland, Oregon. <br /><br />This spacious, newly renovated and thoughtfully designed studio apartment is a warm, relaxing space to unwind when you’re not out exploring what our beautiful area has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1147390152414082997/original/739e0044-6973-42e7-a39c-40b6d049f91d.jpeg',126192938,28,'45.46435','-122.68728',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,84.00,2,14,2,5.00,1147390152414082997),(3920,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1148620542698461219','Lower-level studio in historical neighborhood','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1148620542698461219/original/e6b42ae3-7092-4ba5-82d0-dfa2da0511e2.jpeg',112452733,22,'45.49035','-122.67927',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,124.00,2,365,0,1.00,1148620542698461219),(3921,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1149301896025488005','High-rise Pearl District 2beds 1bath +Amenites','Discover the charm of our brand new listing! This generously spacious 1 bath 1 bedroom + Large Den that will be a 2nd bedroom furnished with 2 Queen size beds and plenty seating for up to 5 guests. Ensuring ample comfort and relaxation, be among the first to experience its inviting ambiance and modern amenities.','Booking here offers convenient access to anything you need, with abundant options for physical adventure, cultural discovery, and artistic expression. Fast access to I-405 and Burnside Street, 100% Walk Score, 96% Bike Score, and 93% Transit Score.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1149301896025488005/original/1af84f4e-b373-488c-85b8-d31b822aca00.jpeg',459606784,2,'45.52701649999999','-122.6825704',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,200.00,1,30,16,4.69,1149301896025488005),(3922,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1149627752685513784',