14052479','Contemporary South Facing Studio','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located brand new building designed by a famous architect.  Enjoy floor ceiling windows, contemporary finishes. Walk to hundreds of restaurants, shops, and bars.  Two blocks to Safeway, grocery store and five blocks to Whole Foods grocery store..  One and a half blocks to the street.  Dock 59 is located on  The Historic 13th Ave in the Pearl District and therefore has an A+ plus location!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-966731493012568759/original/5a50b2a3-1018-4259-b0d0-f3f26fbc0eb3.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.52908','-122.68488',1,2,1.00,0.00,0.00,64.00,31,365,0,1.00,1150835011514052479),(3926,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1150934690146965263','Amazing Location Brand New 2bd1bth Fremont Flat','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1150934690146965263/original/cb63dd69-8f9b-46be-aa22-02d0d4a0ae04.jpeg',32636156,46,'45.5531015906799','-122.61959652681689',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,30,365,0,1.00,1150934690146965263),(3927,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1150955915071257526','Alberta Arts District','Come enjoy a place to rest your head and venture into a well-known pocket of NE Portland: Alberta Arts District! Alberta offers a variety of delectable restaurants, bakeries, bars, ice cream parlors and cafes. <br /><br />Centrally located, this comfortably furnished suite has all you need for an urban adventure, including a private space in the back for a BBQ and cozy fire pit. <br /><br />This 2 story house has separate entries for both floors: the Airbnb is on the main floor, while tenants live on the 2nd floor.','If you want to experience Portland and all it has to offer, Alberta Art District is one place you don\'t want to miss. Known for its street art, restaurants, bars, bakeries, cafes and ice cream shops, there are a plethora of delightful discoveries awaiting you. Just to give you an idea of some of the eateries you\'ll find on Alberta Street:<br /> <br />Salt-n-Straw (Ice Cream)<br />Petite Provence Boulangerie & Patisserie (French Bakery)<br />Tin Shed (Brunch)<br />Radio Room (Bar including roof top patio)<br />Bole (Ethiopian Food)<br />Baes Alberta (Fried Chicken)<br />Les Caves & Los Clov (wine)<br />Zilla Sake (Sushi)<br />La Bonita (Mexican)<br />Bollywood (Indian restaurant)<br /><br />Enjoy a different side of the neighborhood and visit McMenamin\'s Kennedy School, a historic elementary school from 1915, renovated and turned into the post unique hotel and social gathering. You\'ll find classrooms and offices into small bars, a  movie theater, brewery, soaking pool, and gift shop.<br','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1150955915071257526/original/d4d2cbb3-6586-494f-8a2d-cb1e482a60e4.jpeg',45410272,1,'45.5570987','-122.631487',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,103.00,1,365,29,4.72,1150955915071257526),(3928,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152269899384993700','Cheerful 2BR home in North PDX','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.<br /><br />Come as guest & leave as a friend! <br /><br />The house is located in a quiet neighborhood and has three standard bedrooms and three bathrooms. <br /><br />Shared space <br />The main floor includes a kitchen, a dining space,  a bathroom and a living room plus TV.<br /><br />The two rooms and a bathroom is located upstairs.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1152269899384993700/original/070ff970-225c-486a-bf53-5995e4dff19c.jpeg',555170698,55,'45.58500076095007','-122.69449544117516',2,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,90.00,30,90,0,1.00,1152269899384993700),(3929,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152466511536648710','Charming studio in NW','Charming studio in old building,<br />kitchen with  big fridge microwave <br /><br />walkable and close to 21st and 23rd street <br />Groceries store by walk 5 minutes<br />Forest park Pittock Mansion <br />Riverfront Willamette ~20 min by walk','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1152466511536648710/original/fe63ae23-3111-46e6-a141-7f5f40a1c8b2.jpeg',14355701,27,'45.533473259266216','-122.70185618135552',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,80.00,40,1125,0,1.00,1152466511536648710),(3930,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152514304329454586','Alberta Arts Luxury, Sleeps 8, Walk Score 99','If you\'re a fan of great food, craft beer, and pour-over coffee, this is the place for you. Located in the vibrant Alberta District, our home is near Portland\'s top-rated restaurants, bars, vintage shops, and offers some of the best people-watching around.<br /><br />Perfect for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers, our home is a convenient base within walking distance of the neighborhood\'s hotspots. Immerse yourself in the hipster lifestyle of Stumptown and experience Portland like a local.','The Alberta Arts District in Portland, Oregon, stretches from Williams Ave to 33rd Ave. As one of Portland\'s oldest sections, it boasts a rich history of independence and diversity. The neighborhood is lined with an eclectic mix of shops, restaurants, bars, and galleries, ensuring there\'s something for everyone. As you walk down the streets, you\'ll be greeted by vibrant murals that add color and character to this lively area, making it a true cultural gem in the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6NDc1MTU5ODM%3D/original/231ac246-18cc-46b3-b54a-80f235381b8f.jpeg',111039325,29,'45.56084636977112','-122.64737919859363',1,8,1.50,3.00,4.00,224.00,1,365,12,4.75,1152514304329454586),(3931,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152857101583291955','Urban Lifestyle | ADA Room + Curated Experience','Welcome to Portland, where you\'ll find a vibrant culinary scene with diverse restaurants, breweries, and coffee houses. Our city is also famous for its serene green spaces like trails, parks, and streams. The Accessible King Roll-In Shower room is inclusive, with specially designed guestrooms featuring 35-inch wide doorways for mobility, hearing, and vision needs, ensuring a comfortable stay for two guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152857101583291955/original/919ce2c4-bd4e-4929-b668-4be4da280484.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52143','-122.67902',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,171.00,1,365,0,1.00,1152857101583291955),(3932,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152857535926726570','Urban Retreat | ADA Two Double + Locally Inspired','Welcome to Portland! Boasting a vibrant food scene filled with a variety of restaurants, craft breweries, and cozy coffee shops. It is equally famed for serene green spaces such as trails, parks, and streams that offer an escape within the city. The accommodation is inclusive, with a specially designed guestroom for individuals with mobility, hearing, and vision needs, featuring 35-inch wide doorways. Exquisitely designed to ensure a comfortable experience for 4 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152857535926726570/original/5c584c97-7742-4a0b-bf88-946513e97b6b.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.51910724270162','-122.67961788157425',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,184.00,1,365,0,1.00,1152857535926726570),(3933,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152857972406455343','Accessible Two Doubles | DT Portland & More Perks','Welcome to Portland! Portland boasts a vibrant food scene filled with a variety of restaurants, craft breweries, and cozy coffee shops. It is equally famed for serene green spaces such as trails, parks, and streams that offer an escape within the city. This accommodation is inclusive, specially designed for individuals with mobility, hearing, and vision needs, featuring 35-inch wide doorways. This room is exquisitely designed to ensure a comfortable experience for 4 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152857972406455343/original/dba2fef5-8ea6-4d91-8f46-9041ac4d6b9e.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52139378112376','-122.67918585560176',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,184.00,1,365,0,1.00,1152857972406455343),(3934,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152858416459676648','Artful Retreat | Corner Room + Unique Amenities','Welcome to Portland! Portland offers a dynamic culinary scene with varied restaurants, breweries, and coffee shops, complemented by peaceful green spaces like trails and parks. The Premium Corner room, in the quiet corners of the hotel with large windows, features plenty of natural light and stunning city and mountain views (Even the bathroom has a view!). Decorated with natural colors and luxurious materials, the room guarantees a restful sleep and a rejuvenating morning.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152858416459676648/original/df93046b-99b5-4a39-96ce-115535051a23.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52099','-122.68028',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,194.00,1,365,1,5.00,1152858416459676648),(3935,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152858535178879553','Scenic City Views! Premium King Room, Central','Welcome to our Premium room! It offers a refined environment with impressive city views, ideal for catching one of Rose City’s legendary sunsets. The space is generously sized and features large windows along with a choice of comfortable bedding options, perfect for up to 3 guests. The decor combines natural tones and luxurious textures, highlighted by original local artwork. A range of thoughtful comforts enhances your experience during your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152858535178879553/original/922fc7b7-3bfe-411f-bd33-937b4d8dc711.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52056','-122.68076',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,182.00,1,365,0,1.00,1152858535178879553),(3936,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152859060147099188','Double Comfort | Premium Beds + Curated Experience','Enjoy the luxury of Portland\'s city views from our premium room for 4, ideal for catching one of Rose City’s legendary sunsets. Generously sized and features large windows that showcase the urban landscape, along with a choice of comfortable bedding options, perfect for up to 4 guests. The decor combines natural tones and luxurious textures, highlighted by original local artwork. A range of thoughtful comforts enhances your experience during your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152859060147099188/original/962f074a-8f82-44c4-81ae-279d2e94ea1c.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52048','-122.67943',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,194.00,1,365,1,4.00,1152859060147099188),(3937,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152859532133279047','Downtown Portland, Comfy Bed + Many Hotel Perks!','Spacious accommodations, above and beyond the usual standard! Decorated with earthy colors and luxurious touches of leather, velvet, and soft wool. Original artwork from local artists, inspired by Oregon\'s natural beauty. Includes an airy bathroom with slate floors and a soaking tub, perfect for unwinding after a day of outdoor activities. Guests enjoy thoughtful amenities designed to enhance their stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152859532133279047/original/8a08cc97-f3b5-45e0-b033-f8a5dfb3e136.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.51979','-122.67921',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,184.00,1,365,0,1.00,1152859532133279047),(3938,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152859994560114655','Vibrant Location, Hotel Perks, Sleep Experience','Spacious accommodations, above and beyond the usual standard! Decorated with earthy colors and luxurious touches of leather, velvet, and soft wool. Original artwork from local artists, inspired by Oregon\'s natural beauty. Includes an airy bathroom with slate floors and a soaking tub, perfect for unwinding after a day of outdoor activities. Guests enjoy thoughtful amenities designed to enhance their stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152859994560114655/original/179faf65-86f4-452b-a471-9f8adaa1b6fe.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52109','-122.67976',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,171.00,1,365,0,1.00,1152859994560114655),(3939,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152867887268827192','Downtown Adventure | Studio Suite + Local Touches','Welcome movers and shakers who like to live large! The loft suite offers stylish decor and thoughtfully chosen amenities, making it perfect for those seeking comfort and elegance during their visit to Portland. Experience luxury where every detail—from the high-quality materials to the local artwork—enhances your stay. Features a productive workspace and a private soaking tub, ideal for unwinding after exploring the city or attending meetings. It accommodates up to 4 guests!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1152867887268827192/original/90d8f1d3-83b1-4a1b-a354-948588fc4b2a.jpeg',570756621,44,'45.52000808917498','-122.68126478197685',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,216.00,1,365,1,5.00,1152867887268827192),(3940,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1152929203623833209','Spacious Irvington Retreat','Bring the whole family to this great place with lots of room for fun. The Irvington neighborhood, it\'s filled with beautiful, old houses and spectacular gardens.  A walk in the neighborhood is like a walk in the park.  Plus the house is walk distance to grocery stores and train station.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE1MjkyOTIwMzYyMzgzMzIwOQ%3D%3D/original/7d61417d-1e84-4d03-8e80-29bbae6cf275.jpeg',13285949,7,'45.53750440296506','-122.65326747731318',1,8,4.00,4.00,4.00,250.00,30,125,0,1.00,1152929203623833209),(3941,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1153360038074948529','Loft space galore','Take on the city views in this two story loft with a modern kitchen and bathroom , AC, WiFi and anything else you need to yourself in a spacious and peaceful  pearl dristrict/ slabtown boutique studio loft in northwest Portland. Whether it’s time to recharge or take charge this unit will be your home base.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1153360038074948529/original/5bd8bcdf-fe00-4fcd-897d-04434b311a81.jpeg',431780069,27,'45.53086595556401','-122.68848560750484',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,150.00,1,140,0,1.00,1153360038074948529),(3942,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1154663173203023149','Beautiful Tinyhome in the garden','Cozy tiny home with covered patio. Home features wood floor, tiled bathroom with shower, full kitchen, refrigerator, coffee maker, microwave, washer and dryer. Free off-street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6cdf3048-9735-4c5c-b304-b2cbc59b6a03.jpg',493660370,63,'45.532896744321285','-122.52499805323919',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,85.00,1,365,26,4.85,1154663173203023149),(3943,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1155068612926049127','Entire Apartment in SW Portland','Welcome to my artsy and cozy apartment in SW Portland! For soccer lovers, you will have a clear view of Providence Park from the rooftop where you\'ll enjoy watching live soccer games. The apartment is fully furnished and you\'ll have access to all shared amenities in the building. Our building amenities include a gym, dedicated workspace with free WiFi, and access to the rooftop  with BBQ grills, fire pits and great views. The building is also close to public transportation, restaurants, shops.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1155068612926049127/original/22350a82-9a53-4598-bb01-56ccab49c286.jpeg',205408873,3,'45.519130280455386','-122.68968180484413',1,3,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,14,5,5.00,1155068612926049127),(3944,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1155946168748666465','The Woodsman','You\'ll love this Luxury mid century modern retreat fully equipped for longer term stays. Located in the walkable Richmond neighborhood featuring a fully fenced yard with amazing outdoor seating and fire-pit area. Also 3 off street parking spots, walk in shower with dual vanity upstairs, soaker tub downstairs, full laundry room, elevated front porch with loads of seating, and gourmet chefs kitchen it\'s the perfect home base to explore Portland from.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE1NTk0NjE2ODc0ODY2NjQ2NQ%3D%3D/original/61588253-f7b5-4f79-896a-7f71427d04f5.jpeg',501414071,8,'45.50105468231147','-122.61456917657121',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,102.00,30,365,2,5.00,1155946168748666465),(3945,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1156027424029283086','New 3 Story Condo w/ Balcony | Heart of Kerns Dist','Welcome to your modern retreat in the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Kerns neighborhood. Located 7 miles from Portland International Airport and an 8-minute drive to Downtown Portland. Immerse yourself in Portland\'s award-winning restaurant scene, amidst lively bars, boutique shops & Whole Foods Market within a few blocks. 3rd floor primary suite with balcony, washer/drier, prime location, 3 beds which sleep 5 total in bedrooms. No Cleaning Fee! PLEASE NOTE: THERE’S NO DOOR ON 3rd FLOOR SUITE','Kerns Neighborhood. A new list from Time Out revealed that the Kerns neighborhood is the fifth coolest neighborhood in the world and the coolest neighborhood in the U.S. — beating out vacation destinations in Lisbon, Portugal and Paris, France. This walkable thoroughfare is still mostly populated by one- or two-story brick buildings, which house some of the neighborhood’s coolest venues: record stores like Music Millennium, cozy German restaurant Stammtisch (perfect for a late-afternoon beer) and one of Portland’s favorite old cinemas, Laurelhurst Theater. Meanwhile Laurelhurst Park, on Kerns’s southeast border, hosts everything from music and comedy evenings to outdoor movies. You’ll find locals stocking up across the neighborhood on groceries – Olympia Provisions salami, Cowbell Creamery cheese and fresh produce from Providore Fine Foods – for picnics near the duck pond.<br /><br />Kerns is the artsy, mixed-use home of the Laurelhurst Theater, a landmark, art deco cinema built in 192','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE1NjAyNzQyNDAyOTI4MzA4Ng%3D%3D/original/f6164d45-78ae-491c-8455-de43343a8640.jpeg',329177157,12,'45.52547879999999','-122.6400218',1,5,3.00,2.00,3.00,224.00,2,60,29,5.00,1156027424029283086),(3946,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1156182653769621493','Casita Studio, W/D & Workspace','PDX Casita offers a cozy and inviting retreat for your stay in Portland. Centrally located, you will have quick access to airport, downtown and Moda Center. What truly sets our guesthouse apart is the energetic warm colors and rustic charm. Enjoy privacy and comfort in our studio guesthouse, with private entrance behind the main house.','Piedmont is a cute neighborhood in North Portland with coffee shops, bars, and parks. It\'s close to I-5 and Highway 30--quick access to the whole city!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1156182653769621493/original/d6d5666f-5fd0-4018-abc8-a5617b59a654.jpeg',192117374,48,'45.57767','-122.66678',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,132.00,30,365,1,5.00,1156182653769621493),(3947,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1156499988390986530','Quiet Hawthorne Townhome, central SE walk & bike','Welcome to our lovingly restored Craftsman duplex in Portland\'s vibrant Hawthorne district! This 2-bedroom, 1-bath with a dedicated office is both centrally located and a quiet retreat in the city.<br /> <br />You\'ll find coffee, restaurants, vintage shops, and beautiful city parks all within a 5-min walk!<br /><br />The hosts (Triska and Aaron) live in one unit, and you\'ll have the entire other unit. We\'ll respect your privacy while ensuring your stay is comfortable.','This is a quiet, tree-lined street with friendly neighbors.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE1NjQ5OTk4ODM5MDk4NjUzMA%3D%3D/original/78ddc423-4e4c-4dd1-abe9-d13b0395e73c.jpeg',1239735,32,'45.51218','-122.64485',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,194.00,2,29,12,5.00,1156499988390986530),(3948,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1156534079896487924','Spacious Top-Floor Getaway w/ Balcony!','Experience the best of Portland in our stunning one-bedroom top-floor unit.<br /><br />Our modern unit boasts a large living room with plenty of windows for natural light. The full kitchen is equipped with everything you need for culinary delights, and the bedroom opens onto a fully covered balcony. Enjoy the convenience of an additional half bath and your own private staircase leading up to the unit. The front deck, with its comfortable seating and scenic view, provides a perfect spot to unwind.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE1NjUzNDA3OTg5NjQ4NzkyNA%3D%3D/original/462cd3da-606d-4ae9-9c99-8f5e88cc4fe8.jpeg',577541645,61,'45.48864','-122.6387',1,5,2.00,1.00,2.00,110.00,2,365,10,4.90,1156534079896487924),(3949,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1156556734568109464','Stylish 1bed1bath •Rooftop City Views +Amenities','Discover the charm of our brand new listing! This stylish spacious 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom retreat is tailor-made for up to 3 guests, ensuring ample comfort and relaxation. Be among the first to experience its inviting ambiance and modern amenities. Plus, as an exclusive offer, the first three bookings will enjoy a delightful 20% discount. Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to indulge in a memorable getaway!','Booking here offers convenient access to anything you need, with abundant options for physical adventure, cultural discovery, and artistic expression. Fast access to I-405 and Burnside Street, 100% Walk Score, 96% Bike Score, and 93% Transit Score.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE1NjU1NjczNDU2ODEwOTQ2NA%3D%3D/original/22524b6a-d165-444b-987f-e58b230f0bf7.jpeg',459606784,2,'45.52698643466611','-122.68102544760742',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,139.00,30,31,7,5.00,1156556734568109464),(3950,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1156619218634036261','Vintage Charm w/ Modern Comfort Near Reed College!','Welcome to Your Cozy Portland Hideaway!<br />Discover the perfect blend of vintage charm and modern comfort in our delightful one-bedroom, one-bathroom unit. Nestled in a charming 5-unit complex, this inviting space is just a stone\'s throw from Reed College, near local bus and MAX light rail lines, the b