experiences, such as photographic heritage displays and wellness facilities. Relish Portland\'s history and contemporary charm in our Premium Queen room, perfect for two guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1160518784870510281/original/fd051bae-4908-4017-9293-25b6a47b0b08.jpeg',570762701,44,'45.520501114584285','-122.67769969524598',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,140.00,1,365,0,1.00,1160518784870510281),(3962,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1160519234765220049','Superior King | Global Fusion + Tailored Luxury','Step into the allure of downtown Portland, where history seamlessly merges with modern luxury. Immerse yourself in an urban oasis surrounded by culture and beauty. Enjoy curated experiences, including a photographic legacy and wellness offerings. Experience Portland\'s past and present in our Superior King room, perfect for two guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1160519234765220049/original/2f25f716-bb0a-40b2-b378-c39c319a9d2a.jpeg',570762701,44,'45.52179','-122.67857',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,163.00,1,365,0,1.00,1160519234765220049),(3963,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1160903024999966352','Urban Treehouse on Mt Scott','Kick back and relax in our Victorian treehouse inspired space! You will enjoy the whole space to yourself in this quiet, forested neighborhood. Our neighborhood is on the edge of country and city, close to the freeway and downtown, and close to the local mountain, forest hikes, and rivers. Food carts and restaurants are a short drive away, and two short hikes are down the road. This space is attached to our main house, up the separate balcony stairs on the second floor.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2MDkwMzAyNDk5OTk2NjM1Mg%3D%3D/original/cd034832-4aaf-489f-9aff-2140fbbbb685.jpeg',246070767,77,'45.46939','-122.5417',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,99.00,2,90,11,4.82,1160903024999966352),(3964,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1161055990101408759','Southeast Sunset Apartment','Welcome to your charming retreat in South East! Nestled near the heart of South East Portland, our beautifully decorated one-bedroom apartment offers a prime location with walking access to one of Portland\'s most delightful neighborhoods.<br />		· Private entrance<br />		· Contact-less check-in<br />		· Free HIgh-Speed WiFi<br />		· Workspace w/ desk & chair<br />		· Well-stocked kitchen<br />		· Record player for your enjoyment<br />		· Washer & dryer<br />		· Room & Board queen mattress <br />		· Outdoor space for relaxing','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1161055990101408759/original/94d52cc6-7ace-4090-9f14-902adfffb35a.jpeg',989774,25,'45.50205','-122.64271',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,115.00,1,29,18,4.83,1161055990101408759),(3965,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162007593590697452','Terrace Studio | Executive Floor w/ Lounge Access','Discover the epitome of luxury nestled in Portland\'s vibrant West End, where an exciting cultural scene beckons. The Terrace Studio Suite stands as your lavish urban escape—a haven for relaxation and renewal, ensuring you\'re primed to conquer the day ahead with revitalized energy. With its own outdoor firepit, this suite offers an extra touch of allure. Tailored for a comfortable stay for 2 guests, revel in the unmatched comfort of this exceptional suite.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162007593590697452/original/6a13db40-6561-4582-a9d4-a9e71c196cfb.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.51999','-122.68242',2,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,255.00,1,365,1,5.00,1162007593590697452),(3966,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162008128458958978','Parlor Suite | Signature Amenities + 24-Hour Gym','Discover the pinnacle of luxury nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland\'s West End. Immerse yourself in the city\'s rich cultural diversity, where every corner promises eclectic flavors and vibrant entertainment. Experience a surge of creativity amidst the ample space, elegant furnishings, and artful decor of our spacious Parlor Suite King, abundant with natural light. Ideal for 2 guests seeking the perfect blend of comfort and inspiration.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162008128458958978/original/edc55108-3a9c-47a1-8775-f9aa73670a32.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.51968','-122.68199',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,216.00,1,365,0,1.00,1162008128458958978),(3967,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162008630092492767','Premier Double Beds with Signature Amenities','Explore the pinnacle of luxury nestled in Portland\'s dynamic West End. Immerse yourself in the city\'s vibrant cultural scene, where diverse flavors and lively entertainment abound. This spacious room, flooded with natural light, offers the perfect retreat for up to 4 guests, featuring Premier Two Double Beds for ultimate comfort and relaxation. Enjoy the elegant decor and modern amenities that make this room an exceptional choice for your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162008630092492767/original/355cb09c-1c2c-4a80-b7b1-fd0051b04938.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.52114','-122.68298',2,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,169.00,1,365,1,4.00,1162008630092492767),(3968,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162009066473285718','Premier King near Boutiques and Art Galleries','Discover the ultimate luxury nestled in Portland\'s vibrant West End. Immerse yourself in the city\'s rich cultural tapestry, where diverse flavors and vibrant entertainment await at every turn. The Premier Corner King room offers a spacious retreat flooded with natural light, featuring elegant decor and modern amenities, perfect for accommodating 2 guests in absolute comfort and style. Experience the unique character and charm that make this room a truly special haven.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162009066473285718/original/5b92b6b7-67ff-4d9a-ba88-dcd89fbc6698.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.51969002307961','-122.68157358441019',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,176.00,1,365,0,1.00,1162009066473285718),(3969,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162009546981943336','Premier Corner Room | Access to 24-Hour Gym','Discover the pinnacle of luxury tucked into Portland\'s lively West End. Immerse yourself in the rich cultural tapestry of the city, where diverse flavors and vibrant entertainment abound at every corner. The bright and spacious Premier Corner King room, with large windows, offers an inviting retreat. Featuring a supremely comfortable bed, this spacious and elegantly decorated room exudes unique character and charm, making it perfect for 2 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162009546981943336/original/ee36050f-3bb5-4a02-8d72-fd9924afcbb0.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.52025','-122.68228',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,207.00,1,365,0,1.00,1162009546981943336);
INSERT INTO `listings` VALUES (3970,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162010010686673386','Executive Room w/ Terrace and Virtual Concierge','Explore the epitome of luxury nestled in Portland\'s vibrant West End. Immerse yourself in the rich cultural tapestry of Portland, where diverse flavors and vibrant entertainment await at every turn. The Executive Queen with terrace, an executive-level sanctuary in downtown Portland, offers inspired accommodations gracefully arranged for an unparalleled experience. Equipped with a splendidly comfortable bed, this handsomely decorated room is perfect for 2 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162010010686673386/original/81da6724-05c8-4554-b661-f5045d4784b7.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.52099','-122.68295',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,233.00,1,365,3,4.67,1162010010686673386),(3971,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162010512820000608','Executive King Room with Signature Amenities','Indulge in the pinnacle of luxury nestled within the dynamic West End of Portland. Immerse yourself in the city\'s diverse cultural landscape, where every corner reveals eclectic flavors and vibrant entertainment. The Executive King offers a distinguished retreat in downtown Portland, boasting inspired accommodations thoughtfully. With its supremely comfortable bed, this roomy and stylishly decorated space offers a unique charm and character, ideal for 2 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162010512820000608/original/c1e9e766-adba-4960-b204-ff20f11cca39.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.521427163072744','-122.68329926223689',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,207.00,1,365,0,1.00,1162010512820000608),(3972,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162010966186283309','Deluxe Queen Room Near Boutiques and Art Galleries','Experience unmatched luxury in Portland\'s bustling West End, where a diverse array of flavors and vibrant entertainment awaits. Our Deluxe Queen room boasts a distinctive vintage-modern aesthetic and timeless allure. Relax in the stylish seating nook, adorned with leather and tweed, perfect for morning brainstorming or leisurely card games. This elegantly decorated room, featuring a supremely comfortable bed, exudes unique character and charm making it perfect for 2 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162010966186283309/original/b31a0979-0cbe-4ead-b28b-1f453582feac.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.52101','-122.68296',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,148.00,1,365,7,5.00,1162010966186283309),(3973,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162011407563983146','Deluxe Room with Access to State-Of-The-Art Gym','Discover unparalleled luxury in Portland\'s vibrant West End, where a rich blend of eclectic flavors and lively entertainment awaits you. Our Deluxe King room offers a unique vintage-modern style and historical charm. Unwind in the elegantly designed seating nook, furnished with leather and tweed, ideal for morning brainstorming sessions or a casual game of cards. This roomy and elegantly designed space offers distinctive character and charm, ideal for 2 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162011407563983146/original/abb5bd90-95c2-4d3a-a791-7633e862cab8.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.52126','-122.68189',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,164.00,1,365,0,1.00,1162011407563983146),(3974,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162011844955322109','Accessible Deluxe Room w/ Virtual Concierge','Experience the epitome of luxury nestled in Portland\'s vibrant West End, where eclectic flavors and vibrant entertainment await at every turn. Immerse yourself in Portland\'s rich cultural tapestry while staying in our thoughtfully crafted Accessible Room, designed to meet the needs of guests requiring mobility, hearing, and vision accommodations. This spacious and handsomely decorated room boasts its own unique character and charm, perfect for 2 guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162011844955322109/original/371aee41-2d0e-49c8-8598-893f49684b5a.jpeg',570761729,44,'45.52025','-122.68372',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,143.00,1,365,0,1.00,1162011844955322109),(3975,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1162290964300925286','Cheery, retro-style room with kitchenette','Experience genuine comfort in our Deluxe King One Bedroom suite, featuring inviting Tuscan-inspired decor, a fully equipped modern kitchen, ample workspace, a custom \"Park Lane\" mattress, elegant kitchenware, Pharmacopia toiletries, and speedy Wi-Fi for a convenient and cozy stay in Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1162290964300925286/original/1232d821-0f6e-4aa3-b16e-c8bce57547f3.jpeg',569132554,3,'45.522297','-122.695747',2,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,109.00,1,365,4,4.75,1162290964300925286),(3976,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1163037614683875912','Stunning Views Portland Hillside','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. With stunning views of the Willamette River, Mount Hood, and downtown Portland. Located in SW Portland on the OHSU hillside. Walkable and rideable to downtown Portland waterfront. A short 5 minute car ride. <br />Amazing spacious private roof top deck for outdoor enjoyment. Fully furnished with washer and dryer in unit. King bed and portable AC units installed for the summer months. Private parking spot.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1163037614683875912/original/822d5467-2c84-495f-9e16-e9e1ca08beb1.jpeg',579226206,30,'45.49753271662358','-122.67974079941268',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,300,0,1.00,1163037614683875912),(3977,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1163414372011566787','Laurelhurst Landing','Live it up in Laurelhurst in this spacious, furnished one-bedroom basement unit. Fully stocked kitchen with all the essentials to craft and enjoy your favorite meals. Available for 30+ night stays. Wifi and all utilities included. Perfect for digital nomads or traveling professionals. Seven blocks to Providence Portland. Just a few blocks to Laurelhurst Park\'s walking trails, duck pond, pickleball courts and summer movie series. Centrally located to grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1163414372011566787/original/034d6a05-3d1c-4b77-9212-e375d3293d47.jpeg',579332456,23,'45.52331','-122.62143',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,30,360,1,5.00,1163414372011566787),(3978,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1163858048574624302','The Clyde by Kasa | Double Full Room','Welcome to The Clyde, an iconic building infused with Portland\'s unique spirit. Our spaces, adorned with art, were curated to foster community, connection, and creativity. Located in the heart of downtown, it\'s the perfect place to experience the city\'s vibrant energy with easy access to sought-after restaurants, shops, and attractions. Our tech-enabled rooms offer self check-in at 4pm, 24/7 guest support by text, phone, or chat. On-site and virtual Front Desk services are also available.','Explore Downtown Portland\'s West End for a rich slice of the city\'s vibrant culture. This area offers a delightful blend of character, creativity, and whimsy, seamlessly merging modern, historic, and industrial vibes with green spaces. Within walking distance, you\'ll find an array of restaurants, shops, galleries, eateries, theaters, and music venues. Immerse yourself in the unique charm and dynamic energy that make the West End a must-visit destination for both locals and travelers.<br /><br />Don’t miss out on our favorite neighborhood spots:<br />- Living Room Theaters, 240 ft away<br />- Ikimono Ramen, 250 ft away<br />- Bamboo Sushi, 489 ft away<br />- Mucca Osteria, 0.1 miles away<br />- Thai Peacock, 0.1 miles away<br />- Whole Foods Market, 0.1 miles away<br />- Beer O’Clock, 0.2 miles away<br />- Cheryl’s on 12th, 0.2 miles away<br />- Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall, 0.2 miles away<br />- Jake’s Famous Crawfish, 0.2 miles away<br />- Multnomah Whiskey Library, 0.2 miles away<br','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2Mzg1ODA0ODU3NDYyND