ic stroll along the Wilamette River a few blocks away and explore the nearby cafes, restaurants and bars.  A well stocked kitchenette with Nespresso coffee, outdoor deck, hot-tub and spa-like amenities await your visit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1166347941461020331/original/a1b94252-b388-40f3-98c1-16c3489e1ba5.jpeg',14517914,22,'45.47896129999999','-122.6766347',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,108.00,2,30,19,5.00,1166347941461020331),(3997,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1167410650282014702','The Portland Chalet','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. Walk score of 92 \"walkers paradise\". Only 2 miles from downtown but in serene setting across from Powell Park. Garden style apartment with 8 units in total with a parking lot in back.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1167410650282014702/original/68463e60-ad24-4290-bc7a-d7ee394a103d.jpeg',8680367,25,'45.4988','-122.63867',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,30,365,0,1.00,1167410650282014702),(3998,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1167737395396804893','The Richmond Rambler (Sauna)','Quiet artist retreat, 2BR, modern remodel, rambler/duplex, single level, with sauna within the heart of St Johns, N. Portland.<br /><br />St Johns is filled with homegrown shops, independent spirit, and plentiful things to do. <br /><br />Shop the Farmers Market, picnic by the river under the iconic St. Johns Bridge, hike Forest Park, or drive to beach under a canopy of old growth trees on Germantown Rd. <br /><br />Visit Sauvie Island (Chinook land) for its farms, swimming, paddle boarding, birding, biking & wineries','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1167737395396804893/original/579bde96-eb21-4460-a966-a8c04e702231.jpeg',6328036,58,'45.59294309530413','-122.74925818700288',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,2,9,2,5.00,1167737395396804893),(3999,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1167793581368574568','Laurelhurst Dougan Suites #3','Just renovated with luxury finishes. Beautiful, bright daylight basement suite in the elegant Laurelhurst historic James Dougan home, built in 1922. Walking distance to Hawthorne, Belmont, hundreds of restaurants & shops. Kitchenette shared with suite across hall and both suites can be rented together for a larger group. Most guests rarely use the kitchen or overlap. \"Absolutely recommend this place! One of my favorite places I\'ve stayed, quiet & clean, great location, and the host is so sweet!\"','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2Nzc5MzU4MTM2ODU3NDU2OA%3D%3D/original/4f49cec2-c263-40c2-a80a-5b09b7ca96cc.jpeg',5726659,23,'45.52379850468621','-122.62194521664402',2,3,1.50,1.00,1.00,133.00,1,365,5,5.00,1167793581368574568),(4000,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1168365869740616591','*NEW* Bright + Cozy Gateway to PNW Adventures','We are a cozy, newly renovated 1950\'s home featuring a private 1 bed/1 bath guest suite with backyard. Owner lives next door. Nestled in the Montavilla neighborhood, we are just a stone\'s throw from local coffee shops, restaurants, bars, and more. Our home is packed with a combination of both practical and unique amenities for the perfect stay, including ample street and driveway parking. Whether visiting for a weekend trip or booking an extended stay, we are the perfect choice for your needs!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2ODM2NTg2OTc0MDYxNjU5MQ%3D%3D/original/3d050581-7e52-41a8-a84f-0500f0b11d6f.jpeg',77871519,10,'45.5300173665843','-122.58959771839382',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,84.00,1,365,44,5.00,1168365869740616591),(4001,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1168921577791654205','*Dec Deals* Bright & Cozy Alberta Condo, Fast WiFi','Walking distance to Alberta Arts District, N Williams Ave, and Mississippi Ave! Cozy 500 sqft private condo in NE Portland. Walk to shops, bars, restaurants & transit.<br /><br />Full kitchen, fast wi-fi, free laundry, and private entrance. Free street parking!<br /><br />Tri-Met bus line: 6<br /><br />* Downtown Portland: 3 mi<br />* Portland Airport: 7 mi<br />* Neighborhoods: <br />* N Williams 4 blocks<br />* Alberta Arts 5 blocks<br />* Mississippi Ave 0.5 mi<br /><br />All are welcome!','THE NEIGHBORHOOD<br /><br />Our Airbnb in Northeast Portland is walking distance to Williams Ave, Alberta Street, and Mississippi St. Situated in a quiet section on the cusp of the vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood of Northeast Portland. You are perfectly positioned to eat at some of Portland’s best restaurants and food carts, hang out at trendy bars, browse through eclectic boutiques, get a local beer at a nearby brewery, and stroll along the beautiful, tree-lined streets.<br /><br />Award winning restaurants:<br /><br />* EEM - Thai-bbq tropical fusion <br />* XLB - Chinese soup dumplings & comfort dishes<br />* Life of Pie - Unique pizzas made in a wood-fired oven & served in hip, garage-like environs<br />* Kayo\'s Ramen bar - Absolute best Ramen in Portland<br /><br />Snacks/ Coffee shops/ Bars:<br /><br />* CoCo donuts<br />* Either/Or<br />* The box social<br />* Jinju Pattiserie<br />* What\'s the scoop<br /><br />Easily drive, take transit, or ride share to other parts of Portla','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2ODkyMTU3Nzc5MTY1NDIwNQ%3D%3D/original/cfb33447-d134-4cbb-aafe-8397ffa10fba.jpeg',283383512,14,'45.55399','-122.66262',1,4,1.00,1.00,0.00,89.00,1,28,16,4.88,1168921577791654205),(4002,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1169029465319122807','Brand New Hawthorne Escape','Experience Portland\'s eclectic charm from our inviting 1 bedroom, 1 bath apartment.<br /><br />Step outside and immerse yourself in the local scene—discover unique vintage shops, indie bookstores, and artisanal coffee houses just around the corner. Wander through bustling boutiques, admire street art, and soak up the local culture with a leisurely stroll.<br /><br />Whether you\'re in town for adventure, relaxation, or a bit of both, our Hawthorne hideaway is the perfect base for a memorable Portland experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1169029465319122807/original/685092ad-4ce0-491b-976d-11e7a2072860.jpeg',33745235,8,'45.51184510640125','-122.6236289807656',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,71.00,1,365,8,5.00,1169029465319122807),(4003,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1169034745386864123','Sweeeeeet Home Alberta 3BR/1BA','Welcome to our beautiful Portland home located in the vibrant & highly sought-after Alberta Arts District! This spacious & inviting home is perfect for large groups looking for a comfortable & convenient place to stay while exploring all that this lively neighborhood has to offer. Step outside & you\'ll find yourself surrounded by a plethora of amazing food & drink options. When you\'re ready to unwind, retreat to our cozy home, where you\'ll find plenty of room for everyone to relax & recharge.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1169034745386864123/original/1bbd54e3-430b-4973-acbf-7141dd322524.jpeg',384690762,29,'45.56557','-122.65153',1,6,1.00,3.00,0.00,87.00,1,365,34,4.88,1169034745386864123),(4004,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1169081107963083225','Sweeeeeet Home Alberta 1BR/1BA','Welcome to our modern 1BR/1BA basement suite in Portland\'s Alberta Arts District! Industrial charm meets comfort in this chic space for two. Relax in the cozy living area, sleep well in the king-size bed, and refresh in the sleek bathroom. The kitchenette is perfect for light meals. Explore the vibrant neighborhood with art, shops, and eateries steps away. Enjoy a private entrance, free Wi-Fi, and streaming services. Immerse yourself in Portland\'s culture—book now for a memorable stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2OTA4MTEwNzk2MzA4MzIyNQ%3D%3D/original/2ed606fe-2a66-479b-bf17-0549069574a1.jpeg',384690762,45,'45.56674445558323','-122.65033973450991',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,42.00,1,365,22,4.77,1169081107963083225),(4005,'https://www.