 bedroom, 1 bath apartment.<br /><br />Step outside and immerse yourself in the local scene—discover unique vintage shops, indie bookstores, and artisanal coffee houses just around the corner. Wander through bustling boutiques, admire street art, and soak up the local culture with a leisurely stroll.<br /><br />Whether you\'re in town for adventure, relaxation, or a bit of both, our Hawthorne hideaway is the perfect base for a memorable Portland experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1170380318220243592/original/9f26c870-ce8a-4478-ad0a-31d3f809e557.jpeg',33745235,8,'45.51119','-122.6238',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,61.00,1,365,11,4.91,1170380318220243592),(4015,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1170388069361935706','Brand New Hawthorne Oasis','Experience Portland\'s eclectic charm from our inviting 1 bedroom, 1 bath apartment.<br /><br />Step outside and immerse yourself in the local scene—discover unique vintage shops, indie bookstores, and artisanal coffee houses just around the corner. Wander through bustling boutiques, admire street art, and soak up the local culture with a leisurely stroll.<br /><br />Whether you\'re in town for adventure, relaxation, or a bit of both, our Hawthorne hideaway is the perfect base for a memorable Portland experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1170388069361935706/original/ad85df08-e310-411e-964b-be7703255f0e.jpeg',33745235,8,'45.51097','-122.62501',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,69.00,1,365,5,5.00,1170388069361935706),(4016,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1170419229564865791','Brand New Hawthorne Loft','Experience Portland\'s eclectic charm from our inviting 1 bedroom, 1 bath apartment.<br /><br />Step outside and immerse yourself in the local scene—discover unique vintage shops, indie bookstores, and artisanal coffee houses just around the corner. Wander through bustling boutiques, admire street art, and soak up the local culture with a leisurely stroll.<br /><br />Whether you\'re in town for adventure, relaxation, or a bit of both, our Hawthorne hideaway is the perfect base for a memorable Portland experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1170419229564865791/original/e9213fbc-db71-4b8c-8d2b-f8141a436d70.jpeg',33745235,8,'45.51099871790915','-122.62541666537042',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,83.00,1,365,9,4.89,1170419229564865791),(4017,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1170484550963230373','Burnside Manor-superb location - (Room #1)','Beautifully appointed, fully furnished home. Each room has its own unique style and charm, and the shared spaces in the house, including the kitchen, living room, and outdoor patio, are tastefully decorated and fully equipped for your comfort and convenience. The house is located in the desirable Kerns neighborhood next to Whole Foods, Starbucks and the restaurants and shops of 28th Ave and Burnside. Free laundry facilities and secure keyless locks for each room and the common spaces!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE3MDQ4NDU1MDk2MzIzMDM3Mw%3D%3D/original/733e80cc-2cce-41ff-902f-c2f9285de03e.jpeg',45217575,12,'45.52281356543715','-122.63551633957137',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,35.00,31,93,3,5.00,1170484550963230373),(4018,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1170586539555217847','Cozy Cully Suite | w/ Private Patio + Near PDX','Welcome to our cozy guest suite nestled in the charming Cully neighborhood! As soon as you step into our thoughtfully designed suite, you\'ll be greeted by modern comforts and stylish decor. The space features a private entrance, hardwood floors, ample natural light, fully equipped kitchen, and luxurious tile bathroom with rainfall shower. Unwind after a day of exploring Portland in the cozy living area, complete with a comfortable sofa and a Roku Smart TV for your entertainment.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1170586539555217847/original/9537967b-b3aa-4541-a533-b24364276e4c.jpeg',135228378,21,'45.5612013','-122.598389',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,63.00,2,365,22,4.95,1170586539555217847),(4019,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1171644337801975661','Sunstone House Queen, workspace, wifi, transit,','Welcome to our charming urban retreat, where extended stays of 31 days or longer are a breeze! Nestled in the heart of the vibrant city, our cozy oasis is the perfect home away from home for medical professionals, digital nomads, and business travelers on extended assignments. Whether you\'re seeking a comfortable space for work or a peaceful haven to unwind after a long day, our inviting living space is ready to cater to your needs during your extended stay. Long Term stays available.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1171644337801975661/original/4a9fd83f-292c-48e7-82c4-1c3c6aa10f7c.jpeg',493461219,55,'45.57908994905513','-122.70052684002005',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,41.00,30,365,1,5.00,1171644337801975661),(4020,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1171895031896150694','Tufted headboard and a touch of plaid','Service fee of $28.75 per night per room collected by hotel. <br />Our thoughtfully appointed deluxe guest room features refined decor, custom hardwood finishes, and fine furnishings, including a queen bed with pillow-top mattress and work desk with chair. Amenities include robes, laptop-size safe, iron/ironing board, complimentary Wi-Fi, lighted make-up mirror, and flat-screen television.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1171895031896150694/original/e3b3f077-2873-4ca4-ac49-61c9bc519dac.jpeg',576715754,44,'45.52','-122.67725',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,87.00,1,365,5,5.00,1171895031896150694),(4021,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1171895031942155292','Pillowtop mattress and playful fabric prints','Service fee of $28.75 per night per room collected by hotel. <br />Our thoughtfully appointed deluxe room features refined decor, custom hardwood finishes, and fine furnishings, including a king bed with pillow-top mattress, armchair, and work desk with chair. Amenities include robes, laptop-size safe, iron/ironing board, complimentary Wi-Fi, lighted make-up mirror, and flat-screen television.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1171895031942155292/original/07a2c353-c088-4aca-9027-c08339fe524a.jpeg',576715754,44,'45.52','-122.677251',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,89.00,1,365,0,1.00,1171895031942155292),(4022,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1172048749522202121','Beautiful ADU in Portland','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. No expenses were spared in the building of this ADU. Enjoy the short commute to and from the airport. Located right off I84.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1172048749522202121/original/dfc5bef1-ffe7-4dba-bca6-8cfba7c54319.jpeg',59649194,82,'45.54164','-122.52496',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,145.00,30,365,0,1.00,1172048749522202121),(4023,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1172132873842435912','Cozy Studio in Portland','Enjoy easy access to everything Portland has to offer from this perfectly located home base.  Just 10 minutes to downtown Portland and OHSU, PSU and the South Waterfront.  <br /><br />This one bedroom studio has a king size split bed with head and lower recline as well as massage and underbed lighting.  A well equipped kitchenette with appliances and large sink.  The bathroom is full size with a 4 foot walkin shower.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1172132873842435912/original/18bf21f9-6a58-4ae6-851e-71ddb6f30804.jpeg',196865274,53,'45.44675426685593','-122.72695603204647',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,106.00,4,180,7,4.86,1172132873842435912),(4024,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1172160124928596276','Slabtown Classic Victorian','Enjoy a stay in Portland’s most beautiful neighborhood, Slabtown, where the city founders built their grand homes. Just blocks from NW 23rd and on the Portland Street Car line, you can have a quiet comfortable night’s rest in a home filled with conveniences and be walking distance from dozens of amazing restaurants, Portland’s famous coffee shops, breweries, wine bars, bars, shops, and more.<br /><br />Large TV, blazing WiFi, ice cold AC, central heat, amazing location and countless charging options','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1172160124928596276/original/16f54f6b-e2d4-4e63-9eb3-cbe391756a95.jpeg',415317125,27,'45.53036536794053','-122.69208401437137',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,154.00,1,365,41,5.00,1172160124928596276),(4025,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1172356971801143720','Day events now available','The whole group will be comfortable in this spacious and unique space. Up to 8 people in main house but rate changes over 5 ppl.<br />No animals. Lots of frogs, bunnies and coyotes, deer already! No need to bring your own:)<br />This is a main house only. Max 8 people overnight. <br />If you are interested in an event,entire 7 acres with bunkhouse, gameroom, 6 queen beds, full bath, & 4 cabins are available to add on.$1350/nt for max of 20 ppl,extra for events<br />2 night minimum','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1172356971801143720/original/401943cd-f967-479e-a828-58e9792ebb9b.jpeg',7915925,77,'45.46749','-122.52718',1,5,3.50,2.00,12.00,285.00,2,90,2,4.00,1172356971801143720),(4026,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1172854875518860424','The Slabtown Loft ~ Local Coffee Shops & Eateries','Welcome to our beautiful NW Portland Home!<br /><br />Location, location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a walk score of 99, our stylish home has brand new appliances, 3 queen beds, a sleeper sofa, and can sleep up to 9 guests.<br /><br />Our charming, yet modern and updated home is located in the heart of NW Portland - nestled between Alphabet and Pearl Districts, restaurants, independent bookstores and shops.<br /><br />We\'re also close to Alberta Arts, Mississippi and Downtown PDX!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-692101730537021288/original/d35f7c9f-81e7-4c59-bdb2-e961abe35957.jpeg',309781078,27,'45.528045495552654','-122.68914936588398',1,9,2.00,2.00,4.00,186.00,1,365,19,4.89,1172854875518860424),(4027,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1172900860791053931','The Slabtown Nest ~ Local Coffee Shops & Eateries','Welcome to our beautiful NW Portland Home!<br /><br />Location, location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a walk score of 99, our stylish home has brand new stainless steel appliances, 7 queen beds, a large sofa bed, and can sleep up to 16 guests comfortably.<br /><br />Our charming, yet modern and updated home is located in the heart of NW Portland - nestled between Alphabet and Pearl Districts, restaurants, independent bookstores and shops.<br /><br />We\'re also close to Alberta Arts, Mississippi and Downtown PDX!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-695106127841483565/original/ae537ec3-b443-456b-a1e9-ab24ca833380.jpeg',309781078,27,'45.52843','-122.68771',1,16,4.00,5.00,6.00,291.00,30,365,0,1.00,1172900860791053931),(4028,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1173327507968766353','Top floor of Craftsman w/ Creative Office','A creative, vegetarian, and organic home. We live on the main floor with our 8 year old. The house is filled with our personal art & crystals, which is energetically cleansed often. There is a drafting table and easel with a mini fridge and water kettle.<br />The garden is a year-round feature w/ a fountain and hammock. Borrow an art or metaphysical book, work or make some art, and enjoy this bought out area: excellent food, and shopping nearby, transit, & vegetarian food co-op is across the street!','It’s a cute walkable area! I love the gardens year round and like to stroll around on walks or head towards the local restaurants and shopping on Division.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1173327507968766353/original/455c0675-3252-416b-be6d-53427e785436.jpeg',8321125,25,'45.49945','-122.64464',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,42.00,30,180,0,1.00,1173327507968766353),(4029,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1174471274633412874','Victorian-style home ~ very walkable ~ Unit A','Experience an authentic Portland getaway at The Vic PDX, our beautifully restored 1885 Victorian-style duplex, where original character meets modern amenities. Located in the lively Buckman neighborhood, walk to Portland\'s best food, drink, and entertainment spots. Stay at The Vic and enjoy Portland like a local!','Welcome to Buckman, Portland\'s vibrant and artsy neighborhood on the east side of the Willamette River. Nestled next to the trendy Hawthorne and Belmont neighborhoods, this eclectic gem boasts historic charm with beautifully preserved Victorian and Craftsman-style homes, giving it a bohemian touch. Get ready to indulge in a delightful culinary journey at the local cafes, restaurants, and bars. Buckman\'s commitment to supporting local businesses adds to its unique community spirit. Join a diverse and welcoming community, and enjoy easy access to downtown and nearby attractions or walk to neighboring Hawthorne and Belmont neighborhoods! Buckman has it all – history, creativity, and a whole lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1174471274633412874/original/8fda76f1-26e6-43b0-89ff-4f68f5683c71.jpeg',32095859,32,'45.516965931602705','-122.65156842385822',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,1,365,23,5.00,1174471274633412874),(4030,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1174918582721651089','Quiet Mid-Century Beauty!','Beautiful mid-century ranch home in quiet neighborhood.  1 mile from Multnomah Village, close to Hillsdale shops and cafes and only 6 miles from downtown Portland.  Lots of light, cozy beds and lots of areas to lounge inside and out.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1174918582721651089/original/93cc6344-f41d-4525-8181-8904e1797f09.jpeg',503160365,86,'45.45382261202222','-122.70612088786638',1,6,2.00,2.00,2.00,285.00,3,7,5,5.00,1174918582721651089),(4031,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1175497529486184374','Contemporary, sleeps 5, hot tub.','Like new, modern, contemporary home, sleeps 5, blazing fast wifi, central ac for those warm Portland summer days, and a cozy fireplace and a hot tub for the cool nights.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1175497529486184374/original/48ce436e-c320-48ee-8e38-fa2f9c5cb058.jpeg',177429857,55,'45.58925','-122.70128',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,196.00,2,29,16,5.00,1175497529486184374),(4032,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1175713449404726517','Northeast Portland Craftsman Cottage Oasis','Welcome to our Craftsman cottage in Portland\'s Concordia neighborhood. Your little oasis in the city.<br /><br />The house is located on a charming neighborhood block, close walking distance to restaurants, coffee, yoga, parks, the University of Oregon, the Kennedy School and New Seasons (grocery).<br /><br />Enjoy cooking in the modern, light-filled kitchen or relaxing in the privacy of the lush garden. Quiet, dedicated office, whole-house Sonos sound system and wood-fired sauna with an outdoor shower','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE3NTcxMzQ0OTQwNDcyNjUxNw%3D%3D/original/3650f6eb-edb1-436b-a5c7-33fb8efe7148.jpeg',4227812,1,'45.56300886866874','-122.6336604679332',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,180,0,1.00,1175713449404726517),(4033,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1176156125051593026','The Historic Hafner Haus, 23 guests 9 bedrooms','airbnb.com/h/thehistorichafnerhaus<br />Please note that this is a new listing. You can click on the link above to see additional super host reviews, photos and details.<br />The Historic Hafner Haus is a beautiful home on the city\'s historical registry. We have meeting space too.<br />The house has 7 proper bedrooms + 2 additional semi-private rooms with beds, sleeping as many as 2. 3 in 15 beds. There are three full baths. <br />there is a police rest area at the church as well as PSU.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1176156125051593026/original/005f2fba-5a86-4221-b14d-7d8737f892bd.jpeg',8207605,44,'45.51598930483526','-122.68808053613341',1,16,3.00,8.00,17.00,990.00,2,365,0,1.00,1176156125051593026),(4034,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1176228397546458099','Cozy Nook in Concordia near Alberta Arts','Enjoy a comfortable and luxurious stay in a trendy, must-see neighborhood of Portland! Steps away from the famous Kennedy School with a salt water soaking pool and New Seasons grocery store. Walking distance to the Alberta Arts District with some of the best restaurants, coffee shops, and unique stores in the city. A large dog-friendly park with a playground is 1 block away, a major bus line is 2 blocks away, and the Airport/Downtown are both a quick 10 minute drive.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1176228397546458099/original/d2dece94-b1ed-465d-8775-3cdd65140d8f.jpeg',4133563,1,'45.56492084506814','-122.6260415539673',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,101.00,1,25,18,5.00,1176228397546458099),(4035,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1176263310464880846','Modern apartment in Sellwood','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. We are in the heart of the Sellwood community, mere steps from the many great restaurants on 13th and 17th.  And, if you are a Reed, Lewis & Clark or Portland State prospective student or proud parent visiting a student we are minutes away from all three campuses (Reed - 1.5 miles, Lewis & Clark – 4 miles and Portland State – 5 miles). Our walking score is a near perfect 97 with many options for coffee, food and bars within 5 blocks.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1176263310464880846/original/d33528e8-164d-4bcb-a5c8-4d8661058944.jpeg',56148412,20,'45.46997182779713','-122.6513648973661',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,97.00,1,10,24,5.00,1176263310464880846),(4036,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1176444962161649718','Spacious Getaway in Woodlawn Triangle','Welcome to our open and spacious home in Portland\'s Woodlawn Triangle! Conveniently located near all the best Portland has to offer, it\'s the perfect getaway for families, friends, and pet lovers.<br /><br />Stairs are required for entry as well as access to the upstairs where the bedrooms are located. only 1 flight but be advised!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1176444962161649718/original/9e1480bd-c483-42c4-981b-c3d0c3b5c8c7.jpeg',424564457,45,'45.576006828868756','-122.65195279083079',1,8,2.50,4.00,4.00,177.00,2,365,11,4.55,1176444962161649718),(4037,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1176923623378111902','Stylish PDX Studio Oasis','Welcome to our Stylish ADU Studio Oasis, a beautifully decorated studio apartment located behind our home. Perfect for a peaceful and quiet getaway, this new build from 2015 offers everything you need for a comfortable stay in Portland\'s charming Concordia neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1176923623378111902/original/de3ae5d5-9ac2-460b-aec3-ebfee0c5dbad.jpeg',172846341,1,'45.56992','-122.64331',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,70.00,2,14,27,5.00,1176923623378111902),(4038,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1176970353828791085','Furnished bachelor\'s pad.','Furnished one bedroom to be shared in a 2 bedroom and 1 bath apartment.  Stocked kitchen, dinning, and  livingroom to be shared.  Minimum stay 30 nights. Maximum stay 90 nights.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1176970353828791085/original/d4a60fd2-a1c0-41c8-8413-ca57455d96c5.jpeg',157314777,63,'45.5221872','-122.5331765',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,31.00,30,90,1,4.00,1176970353828791085),(4039,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1177000503753934498','1902 Light-Filled Victorian House near Hawthorne','Welcome! This special home is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit. Steps to dining, shopping, and entertainment! Spend more time vacationing and less time traveling.  Multiple theaters, quaint retail shops and food carts are all within short walking distance. A quick Uber to downtown Portland, OMSI, Hawthorne and Sellwood. Or take a stroll with your good dogs through historic Ladd\'s Addition, just one block away! We are a highly rated guest favorite, see pics for reviews :)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/cf0665f1-f28c-4e56-96f7-3d7c941a11ef.jpg',3508484,25,'45.50781105733849','-122.65537390986016',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,173.00,3,89,13,5.00,1177000503753934498),(4040,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1177093770963046702','The Cedar','This stylish basement unit is full of character, with a large,  beautiful  kitchen. Relax in the spacious living room, slumber in cozy separate bedroom, and then choose Keurig, drip or french press for your morning coffee.  Walk out to quiet street lined with towering cedars and firs, and onwards to rail or bus lines for easy access to all your PDX adventures.  Sit/stand desk on wheels for optimal work setup anywhere. Restaurant and grocery stores nearby.  Kids upstairs - silence not guaranteed.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1177093770963046702/original/fd4def73-326b-496e-9a3a-625e2a74d4fd.jpeg',23710045,51,'45.57258','-122.69051',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,1,30,16,4.69,1177093770963046702),(4041,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1177605299677934186','Sedona Vibes in PDX ~ Walk to Local Shops & Coffee','Explore the Alberta Arts district right outside the front door of this spacious tasteful 2 BR home. In the heart of Alberta District with acclaimed restaurants, bars, and shops steps away. If you want to stay in, enjoy your favorite shows and movies, with a giant 65\" 4KTV, YouTube TV and blazing gigabit speed internet. Or whip up your favorite meal in the full kitchen. No matter what you need you\'ll be sure to find it here!','Nestled in the heart of Portland, the Alberta Arts District is a vibrant, eclectic neighborhood renowned for its rich culture, artistic spirit, and lively community. This area is a haven for artists, foodies, and culture enthusiasts alike, offering a dynamic blend of creativity and innovation at every turn.<br /><br />Stroll along Alberta Street, the district’s main artery, where you’ll find an array of art galleries, unique boutiques, and local shops showcasing the work of Portland’s talented artisans. Every Last Thursday of the month, the street transforms into a bustling art walk, featuring live performances, street vendors, and an open-air gallery experience that’s not to be missed.<br /><br />Food lovers will delight in the diverse culinary scene, with a variety of eateries serving up everything from gourmet farm-to-table dishes to mouthwatering street food. Whether you’re in the mood for a cozy café, a trendy brunch spot, or an evening at one of the neighborhood’s popular breweri','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE3NzYwNTI5OTY3NzkzNDE4Ng%3D%3D/original/e4c0ca11-c839-4d2f-8d34-0b126aa86d69.jpeg',61445011,1,'45.558282441026236','-122.63756598139828',1,4,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,14,4.57,1177605299677934186),(4042,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1178250967070099132','Luxe Pearl District Condo','Beautiful, spacious centrally located light-filled condo. Enjoy Mt. Hood views. Entertain in newly remodeled gourmet kitchen with hi-end SS appliances. Seating for 6 overlooking city-scape. Streetcar and urban amenities just out your door- restaurants, coffee shops, wine bars,  Powell\'s books, shopping, art galleries, movie theaters. Short walk to multiple parks including 30+mile hiking trails in Forest Park. Japanese Garden, Portland Rose Garden and Lan Su Chinese garden less than a mile.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1178250967070099132/original/46633510-0442-4670-8d5f-e1fe5089c7cf.jpeg',583279973,2,'45.5292249','-122.6857045',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,365,0,1.00,1178250967070099132),(4043,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1178338930478202975','#StayInMyDistrict St. Johns Bungalow','#StayInMyDistrict St. Johns Bungalow! This spacious St. Johns home is in the heart of St. Johns. Approx 3 blks to several local restaurants and local shopping. A couple of blocks from the Willamette River. Covered front porch also boasts gorgeous views and a firepit, Private fenced backyard with outdoor fireplace & comfortable seating, BBQ Grill & outdoor dining table! Sleeps up to 5, 3 bed/2.5 bath, Living Room & Family Room, Desk, washer/dryer, 2 spaces available for parking + FREE street park','The home is in the heart of the historic \"St Johns\" neighborhood, in Portland OR. This neighborhood is a local favorite and a great place to experience the heart and soul of one of Portland’s favorite neighborhoods. The river and Forest Park to the West, Downtown Portland to the South, you will be in the center of the action! St Johns boasts quaint little coffee shops, restaurants and unique shopping. There are a variety of restaurants, pubs, breweries, candy/ice cream shops, bike shops, and a convenience store within 5 blocks of the home. Just across the bridge from Portland’s iconic Forest Park with miles of single-track running, hiking and mtn biking trails. Within an easy walk of the park, visitors can beat the heat with a summery kolsch in the airy tasting room of the Euro-inspired Occidental Brewing. The Forest Park trail system connects all the way to NW Portland and Washington Park, home of the Oregon Zoo, Portland Japanese Garden and the Rose Garden. Only a 10-minute drive to ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1178338930478202975/original/1b59a35b-654c-4d60-9336-a9492b03b035.jpeg',3142393,42,'45.59359629999999','-122.7602958',1,5,2.50,3.00,4.00,99.00,1,28,26,4.85,1178338930478202975),(4044,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1179188475625464949','Perfect Portland Farmhouse Loft ~ Breweries & Bars','Nestled between Hawthorne and Division, my duplex in the Industrial Central Eastside offers walking distance access to Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, artisan shops, and services. Just over a mile from downtown, it’s easily accessible by bike, foot, or bus. Designed as a modern farmhouse loft, it ensures ultimate relaxation. Enjoy urban convenience and cozy charm at our unique Portland retreat!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-594945042080304553/original/ab94816b-2fbc-4e68-8607-65447832ef84.jpeg',112798186,25,'45.509517039228676','-122.65406888740344',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,97.00,30,365,5,5.00,1179188475625464949),(4045,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1179251026643680518','Sellwood treehouse near river','Relax with the whole family at our peaceful place. We have a 3 year old so we have a high chair, toys and a toddler bed if you have kiddos. We also have a beautiful piano for you to play because my husband is a piano tuner and we’re both musicians. Sellwood is a very unique and walkable neighborhood with a lot to do for the whole family. Also just a short drive to the center of Portland. <br /><br />Our place has everything you need to feel at home.<br /><br />We live near some of Portland’s most beautiful parks!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1179251026643680518/original/8f68ec24-f5bf-44fb-8b48-2ab61175734d.jpeg',580802357,20,'45.470448915603896','-122.64801007468542',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,375.00,2,30,1,5.00,1179251026643680518),(4046,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1179315849893823721','Fantastic 1920\'s English Cottage w/ Patio, Seconds','Welcome to your charming English-style retreat in the heart of Multnomah Village, Portland! This delightful two-bedroom, one and a half bath home, built in 1920, combines historic charm and comforts to create a unique and inviting atmosphere for your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1179315849893823721/original/56deb2dc-01f3-48eb-af10-e01128692c84.jpeg',62261998,18,'45.469013497299116','-122.70973619043217',1,5,1.50,2.00,3.00,119.00,2,29,8,4.38,1179315849893823721),(4047,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181299893931301821','Portland gem-convenience galore!','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1181299893931301821/original/9bccf8fe-937e-44b0-b220-7fddeba2842c.jpeg',433692207,39,'45.54775108577078','-122.5910085210383',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,132.00,30,120,0,1.00,1181299893931301821),(4048,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181315309085438217','Furnished Room in a 2 bdrm Aprt  (30 nights Min)','Furnished, Centraly Located 2 blocks from MAX stop.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1181315309085438217/original/710cd171-12a3-4292-a2ab-6d2d56e6eb42.jpeg',157314777,63,'45.52174','-122.53274',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,34.00,30,90,0,1.00,1181315309085438217),(4049,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181366632131055188','Cute & Charming Portland Home w/ 91 WalkScore','Experience Portland in this charming mid-century home! Featuring original hardwood floors, rustic doors, and tasteful updates, it offers a warm and inviting space. With a 91 WalkScore and 96 BikeScore, you’re just blocks from top restaurants, bars, and shops. Enjoy the cozy vintage feel with modern amenities like updated mid-century furniture, a fully equipped kitchen, and high-speed WiFi. This home provides comfort and convenience in one of Portland’s most vibrant neighborhoods.','Nestled in the heart of Northeast Portland, the intersection of NE Garfield and Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard (MLK) is a vibrant and eclectic neighborhood that beautifully blends history, culture, and modern urban living. This area is a testament to Portland\'s rich diversity and community spirit, offering a unique living experience for residents and visitors alike.<br /><br />The neighborhood around NE Garfield and MLK is steeped in history, with many buildings reflecting the architectural styles of the early 20th century. The tree-lined streets are dotted with charming Craftsman and Victorian homes, interspersed with contemporary apartments and condominiums that cater to a variety of lifestyles. This blend of old and new creates a dynamic streetscape that is both inviting and visually appealing.<br /><br />As one of Portland\'s most diverse neighborhoods, the area is a cultural melting pot where different ethnicities and traditions converge. This diversity is reflected in the local ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1181366632131055188/original/1f40c4f2-8a5f-43d7-a547-27ee42196865.jpeg',177257126,14,'45.55595403987443','-122.66301824481491',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,147.00,1,365,28,4.86,1181366632131055188),(4050,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181417484595788591','Budget-Friendly Basement Hideaway - 91 WalkScore','Experience the full Portland vibe in this newly renovated mother-in-law suite! Featuring diamond-bladed concrete floors, industrial touches, and a brand-new bathroom and kitchenette, this modern space will make you fall in love with the city. With a 91 WalkScore and 96 BikeScore, you’re just blocks away from some of the best restaurants, bars, and shops in town.','Nestled in the heart of Northeast Portland, the intersection of NE Garfield and Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard (MLK) is a vibrant and eclectic neighborhood that beautifully blends history, culture, and modern urban living. This area is a testament to Portland\'s rich diversity and community spirit, offering a unique living experience for residents and visitors alike.<br /><br />The neighborhood around NE Garfield and MLK is steeped in history, with many buildings reflecting the architectural styles of the early 20th century. The tree-lined streets are dotted with charming Craftsman and Victorian homes, interspersed with contemporary apartments and condominiums that cater to a variety of lifestyles. This blend of old and new creates a dynamic streetscape that is both inviting and visually appealing.<br /><br />As one of Portland\'s most diverse neighborhoods, the area is a cultural melting pot where different ethnicities and traditions converge. This diversity is reflected in the local ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1181417484595788591/original/33640863-d097-4c6f-add1-a07ec9e7c277.jpeg',177257126,14,'45.55469135640413','-122.66306585914488',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,61.00,1,365,27,4.81,1181417484595788591),(4051,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181541357162789550','The Garden Cottage on Garfield ~ 91 WalkScore','Experience Portland in this charming mid-century home and newly renovated mother-in-law suite! Featuring original hardwood floors, rustic doors, industrial touches, and modern updates, this space offers a warm and inviting ambiance. With a 91 WalkScore and 96 BikeScore, you’re just blocks from top restaurants, bars, and shops. Enjoy modern amenities like updated mid-century furniture, a fully equipped kitchen, and high-speed WiFi. This space will make you fall in love with the city.','Nestled in the heart of Northeast Portland, the intersection of NE Garfield and Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard (MLK) is a vibrant and eclectic neighborhood that beautifully blends history, culture, and modern urban living. This area is a testament to Portland\'s rich diversity and community spirit, offering a unique living experience for residents and visitors alike.<br /><br />The neighborhood around NE Garfield and MLK is steeped in history, with many buildings reflecting the architectural styles of the early 20th century. The tree-lined streets are dotted with charming Craftsman and Victorian homes, interspersed with contemporary apartments and condominiums that cater to a variety of lifestyles. This blend of old and new creates a dynamic streetscape that is both inviting and visually appealing.<br /><br />As one of Portland\'s most diverse neighborhoods, the area is a cultural melting pot where different ethnicities and traditions converge. This diversity is reflected in the local ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1181366632131055188/original/0554fe01-398b-4aaa-996b-dfa650a501b2.jpeg',177257126,14,'45.55643586072575','-122.66256571914684',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,279.00,1,1125,0,1.00,1181541357162789550),(4052,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1182653444590358758','Central Retreat w Patio & Office','Eclectic midcentury design with all the aminities needed to relax and enjoy Portland. TV, washer/dryer, wifi, separate office, fully stocked kitchen, dining table for 8, books, games and a shared patio stpace with adjoining units. A five minute walk to one of Portland\'s best shopping and dining districts, 23rd Ave. Great for a family or a few friends looking to enjoy Portland. The separate office also makes it ideal for travelers who need to stay productive. Pets allowed with additional $50 fee.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1182653444590358758/original/d0002bd0-b0ec-4fc9-a0f1-61815b156c00.jpeg',4328483,27,'45.536421371869324','-122.70411439133942',1,6,2.00,2.00,4.00,175.00,1,365,34,4.76,1182653444590358758),(4053,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1182702205461855854','#StayinMyDistrict Alberta Arts Daylight Studio','#StayinMyDistrict Alberta Arts Daylight Basement Studio! Walkable and less than a mile to some of Portland’s best coffee shops, restaurants, breweries & shopping hot spots! Convenient to transit, Mississippi, Alberta Arts, and Williams/Vancouver bike corridor. This sweet spot is the perfect studio suite for your next Portland getaway. Comfortable & Charming! Full kitchen, Queen Bed, Sofa Sleeper, Pet Friendly, FREE Street Parking,','The Humboldt neighborhood in Portland, OR is like the cool kid on the block! It\'s a lively urban hub right next to hotspots like the Alberta Arts District, a skip and a hop away from the Bohemian charm of North Mississippi Avenue, N Williams a neighborhood known for its urban energy and eclectic mix of amenities, this whole area is a magnet for young pros looking for a quick commute downtown. With bike lanes galore and top-notch public transport links, getting around is a breeze. And let\'s not forget the food scene - from trendy eateries to cozy bakeries, this neighborhood is a foodie\'s paradise. Plus, with Portland Community College in the mix, you can soak up that youthful, educational energy. It\'s a melting pot of culture, creativity, and community - a real gem in the city!<br />Humboldt is bordered by the I-5 corridor and the Mississippi District to the West and MLK Ave, and the Alberta Arts District to the East. The Willamette River and the Freemont Bridge to the south, I-5 to the','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1182702205461855854/original/40d22fc0-ecea-436f-a42e-d4daed05b080.jpeg',3142393,24,'45.5599459','-122.6651135',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,69.00,1,28,24,5.00,1182702205461855854),(4054,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1182862931216955955','Single Level 2B Home Pets and Long Stay Welcome','Welcome to your home away from home! This recently remodeled fully furnished ranch-style home, fully furnished and pet-friendly, offers a large private fenced backyard perfect for extended stays in vibrant Portland, OR.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE4Mjg2MjkzMTIxNjk1NTk1NQ%3D%3D/original/83a343d1-4554-41fa-a781-5685e2f024b8.jpeg',1828909,55,'45.58573','-122.69588',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,1182862931216955955),(4055,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1183425696008017307','Woodstock Apartment','Se Woodstock apartment that can be rented as a one or a two bedroom unit. Access to Reed Lake and Springwater corridor natural areas and SE Woodstock neighborhood as well as convenient access to bus  lines throughout the rest of the city. Short bike ride or drive to downtown.<br /><br />This apartment has its own fenced backyard and deck as well as a front porch.  It has a washer and dryer, and a dishwasher. The kitchen is stocked with all the cookware you may need.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1183425696008017307/original/2374415f-94b9-482e-8259-ef44c78e253d.jpeg',56716111,38,'45.483489751022006','-122.61847931619761',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,30,730,0,1.00,1183425696008017307),(4056,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1183494873950070231','Chic Belmont retreat (NEW) w/tree views & king bed','Experience weird and wonderful SE Portland from a serene, newly-built home in a walkable/bikeable neighborhood with king bed and lots of light!<br /><br />Wake up well rested and open curtain on floor to ceiling windows to morning light. Enjoy the full kitchen & soaker tub in a breathtaking architect-designed home perfect for foodies, couples, and remote work. Great location just steps from bakeries, shops, parks and taprooms.<br /><br />Discover the quirky character and trendy eats of Belmont-Hawthorne-Tabor!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1183494873950070231/original/9bee1bfe-10a8-47cd-a732-b92a06f62d5c.jpeg',295718411,16,'45.51552','-122.61485',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,158.00,2,8,22,5.00,1183494873950070231),(4057,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1184187416444231693','Artful Abode | 2 Bedroom + Office','Come stay at our cozy house, located in the central Creston-Kennilworth neighborhood in Portland. We invite you to relax, cook food and lounge in our beautiful backyard. This house has one bedroom on the main floor and one bedroom upstairs along with an office and daybed for relaxing between office work. Amenities include a large and well-equipped kitchen, board games, kid books and toys, and off-street parking. Be aware that the steps to the second floor are authentic to 1908 (aka, steep!).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE4NDE4NzQxNjQ0NDIzMTY5Mw%3D%3D/original/9c5161c0-2327-4691-8364-9cccb6dcfecc.jpeg',7409866,67,'45.49333','-122.61863',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,138.00,1,365,15,5.00,1184187416444231693),(4058,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1184417470702377914','Foster Powell Studio Hideaway','Whether you\'re a foodie, coffee snob, craft beer fanatic, or lover of the great outdoors, come see what The City of Roses has in store for you at our quintessential SE Portland studio apartment. Our studio serves as an affordable home base for exploring stump town.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE4NDQxNzQ3MDcwMjM3NzkxNA%3D%3D/original/d469fc58-4b2a-48fd-99f0-a2d6d3bc7c1d.jpeg',310317194,