ven to unwind after a long day,','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1185547509214938202/original/e94ec384-b696-4331-9218-cf62280e172e.jpeg',493461219,51,'45.57675548946534','-122.70152679642771',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,42.00,30,365,1,5.00,1185547509214938202),(4062,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1186337302549565753','#StayinMyDistrict St Johns Forest Park Apt','Stay in My District Forest Park! Large, private daylight basement apartment with separate exterior entrance. Nestled in the trees w/access to Forest Park Trails, across the bridge St Johns Neighborhood. (5 min), less than 15 min. from downtown Portland and Pearl District. Great amenities to make your stay as close to home as possible. 1bed/1bath, Full kitchen, additional sleeping area in living area, dining room, private laundry, WIFI, Smart TV, & FREE street Parking. Dog Friendly w adtl $50 fee','Nestled in the trees overlooking the river, in Forest Park. The neighborhood is quiet and you can hop on a trail directly out your door. This is a great space for the outdoor enthusiast that wants to stay close to the city. The location is across the bridge (St Johns Bridge is one of Portland\'s oldest & most photographed bridges) St Johns is an eclectic North Portland neighborhood with it\'s own town center. The neighborhood retains its small-town charm with its many locally owned shops, pubs and cafés. Spring thru Summer there is a local Farmers Market every Saturday. Annual St Johns Parade, St John\'s Ale Fest and the Cathedral Park Jazz Fest are a must! Pack a picnic blanket for an afternoon in Cathedral Park, cross the picturesque St. Johns Bridge and get ready to explore a lovely, lesser-known side of Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1186337302549565753/original/c5f7c665-c93b-4fef-aac8-b46a18627e66.jpeg',3142393,89,'45.5825669','-122.7756075',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,60.00,1,28,175,4.79,1186337302549565753),(4063,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1188075779086650211','Dougan Suites, Two Bedroom','Just renovated with luxury finishes. Beautiful, bright daylight basement suite in the elegant Laurelhurst historic James Dougan home, built in 1922. Walking distance to Hawthorne, Belmont, hundreds of restaurants & shops. Great for families or small groups. \"Absolutely recommend this place! One of my favorite places I\'ve stayed, quiet & clean, great location, and the host is so sweet!\"','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-628298167479598203/original/0c1b90d8-fa57-4a83-b242-842c48a60953.jpeg',5726659,23,'45.5237870999248','-122.62180324977982',1,5,2.00,2.00,4.00,265.00,1,365,6,5.00,1188075779086650211),(4064,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1188597386051774364','Memoir Buckman - Studio Queen Apartment','This Studio fully furnished apartment at Memoir Buckman is equipped with a full kitchen, dedicated 1 GB complimentary WiFi, in-unit washer/dryer, premium bath amenities, Parachute towels and linens, housekeeping, and concierge services. Nestled in the vibrant Buckman neighborhood, enjoy easy access to local coffee shops, pubs, and dining options, as well as being next door to the historic Troy Laundry Building, now home to Soho House Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE4ODU5NzM4NjA1MTc3NDM2NA%3D%3D/original/f0367d90-a75e-4a45-a7a9-9f3b5418483b.jpeg',576475782,32,'45.52185','-122.65649',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,169.00,1,365,24,4.75,1188597386051774364),(4065,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1188598794773234366','Beaumont Wilshire Tudor 2BR, 3 BA','Enjoy our gourmet kitchen, formal dining room, two living rooms and a full bathroom on the first level.  Outside you will find a spacious patio and yard with a trampoline, couch and dining table for 6. Upstairs has two bedrooms and two full bathrooms with a stocked laundry room.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1188598794773234366/original/df4e6221-87c9-4dc9-b50d-007459ab8508.jpeg',256681,46,'45.55115','-122.62526',1,5,3.00,2.00,2.00,239.00,1,365,5,4.60,1188598794773234366),(4066,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1189349514136132188','Sabin Potter\'s Cottage','Enjoy a peaceful visit to the City of Roses in our one bedroom guest cottage.<br /><br />Filled with light, this little home has a full bath, fully equipped kitchen, laundry, a memory foam mattress and plenty of room to breathe - all within walking distance of restaurants, parks and shops. <br /><br />Spread out in the shared garden space or get cozy - an efficient heat pump keeps you at just the right temperature, no matter the season.<br /><br />Designed by Dyer Studios and filled with local art, our cottage welcomes you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1189349514136132188/original/db77ed01-f057-40ef-b70e-5faf57d29527.jpeg',14130724,6,'45.553952208490166','-122.65553049300279',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,120.00,3,25,11,5.00,1189349514136132188),(4067,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1190108318605775167','Cute Apartment in Buzzin\' N PDX','Enjoy this stylish, cozy place from which to explore Portland. Nestled in North Portland near several bars and restaurants. Easy access to the rest of  Portland with most key destinations being less than a 15 minute drive. Newly renovated with a well stocked kitchen and a washer/dryer for your convenience. Everything you need is available to allow you to focus on simply enjoying your trip. Pets allowed with additional $50 fee.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1190108318605775167/original/669e1a8c-b67a-4925-b7f1-b23206d06a80.jpeg',4328483,51,'45.57139987755635','-122.69067001503647',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,85.00,1,365,29,5.00,1190108318605775167),(4068,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1190108369618745635','Light-Filled, Clean 2-Bedroom','Enjoy this stylish, cozy place from which to explore Portland. Nestled in North Portland near several bars and restaurants. Easy access to the rest of Portland with most key destinations being less than a 15 minute drive. Newly renovated with a well-stocked kitchen and a washer/dryer for your convenience. Everything you need is available to rest easy and enjoy Portland. Pets allowed with additional $50 fee.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1190108369618745635/original/f9968090-beb6-4d83-a7b1-0abad5fa8ba8.jpeg',4328483,51,'45.569882139420585','-122.69072185674652',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,75.00,1,365,20,4.65,1190108369618745635),(4069,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1190999582341459141','Spacious Suite for Extended Stay','Welcome to our inviting home at the heart of inner Southeast. This beautifully designed and brand new space features high ceilings, open layout, separate entrance and more - perfect for your extended stay in Portland.<br /><br />Location!<br /><br />1 block away from Salt & Straw, Ava Gene\'s, Lauretta Jean\'s etc on Division. Hawthorne, known for its unique shops and vibrant nightlife, is walk distance away.<br /><br />if staying 31+ days, there is NO lodging tax (11.5% savings) Please inquire for discount if longer stays','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1190999582341459141/original/3f106baf-8139-44f3-9acd-e3fb7858c45a.jpeg',8760931,8,'45.50384563035613','-122.6289531743054',1,2,1.00,2.00,1.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,1190999582341459141),(4070,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1191268344678580677','Historic Hafner Haus, 6 guests, 3  Rooms.','Historically significant home adjacent to Portland State University campus. <br />Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located home base.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1176156125051593026/original/005f2fba-5a86-4221-b14d-7d8737f892bd.jpeg',8207605,44,'45.51461356812736','-122.68746554807758',1,6,1.00,3.00,6.00,149.00,2,365,2,5.00,1191268344678580677),(4071,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1191417168662093908','Sellwood Manor','This classic 1915 Victorian home is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.   Our attention to detail will make your stay unforgettable.  Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, the deluxe King Size bed, and a soak in the clawfoot tub in the spacious bathroom.  <br /><br />The outdoor space offers an enchanting 400 sq ft deck equipped with barbeque and a secluded HOT TUB surrounded by forest trees.  Within walking distance to downtown Sellwood and the Willamette Riverfront Beach.   <br /><br />Pets welcome!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1191417168662093908/original/aad73dea-919a-4ed5-9175-8cb4127c1fd8.jpeg',24050247,20,'45.45869643226402','-122.65630683888324',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,145.00,3,28,11,4.91,1191417168662093908),(4072,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1191465502742862968','The Artist\'s Oasis on Alberta','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-44251824/original/7e1f3898-4add-4ad9-8b8f-444eb7328ea0.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55807','-122.66921',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,102.00,1,365,1,5.00,1191465502742862968),(4073,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1191471917136543665','Historic PDX Home - Best Location','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. This historic home (built in 1906) takes its place among Burnside\'s many photogenic charmers. Inside this worldly three-bedroom home you\'ll find period details like rich hardwoods and sunny windows combine with a minimalist, serene design for pure relaxation. When you\'re good and zen, head out to explore Burnsides\'s \"foodie row\" with some of the best restaurants in PDX at your doorstep','Across the Willamette River from downtown, this area blends industrial Portland with new restaurants, microbreweries and riverside recreation.<br /><br />Criss-crossed with train tracks and lined with old industrial factories, some of Portland’s favorite restaurants, boutiques and events call the Central Eastside home. Read on for our recommended things to do and see in Portland’s Central Eastside.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-47516744/original/a5bacddb-d256-41e5-a615-ccb8868394ac.jpeg',293772932,32,'45.5228','-122.65529',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,100.00,30,365,1,5.00,1191471917136543665),(4074,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1192001099004589760','Spacious Home in Irvington','The whole group or family will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place.<br /><br />The Irvington neighborhood, it\'s filled with beautiful, old houses and spectacular gardens.  A walk in the neighborhood is like a walk in the park.  Plus the house is walk distance to grocery stores and train station.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-115292920362383