ghborhood also boasts a vibrant nightlife, with live music venues and craft breweries that perfectly','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-791947684416198562/original/f99c0243-b0dd-41c5-94b9-b50ebd792d41.jpeg',177257126,32,'45.51590895971698','-122.65227589422695',1,2,1.00,1.00,4.00,200.00,30,365,0,1.00,1196561525544397015),(4099,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1197326452408653972','Beautiful Home in SW Portland','Welcome to this enchanting house in Portland. This lovely vacation rental offers a cozy retreat for guests. With 2 queen beds in the 2 bedrooms, you\'ll have a perfect night\'s sleep. The house features all the essentials you need, including a hair dryer, WiFi, washing machine, heating, and AC. Whether you\'re exploring the vibrant city or relaxing in the comfort of this charming house, it\'s easy to see why you\'ll be able to unwind at our place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1197326452408653972/original/7fcd41cb-0896-4a0f-96f5-4c10b37fe2e0.jpeg',9829273,34,'45.4535943','-122.7422335',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,365,0,1.00,1197326452408653972),(4100,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1197841139459734039','Arbor Lodge Retreat Master Suite','Experience luxury in our newly remodeled master suite: a private sanctuary w/ a large walk-in closet and modern bathroom. Enjoy entertainment on a 50\" smart TV,  Nespresso maker, and access a mini fridge w/ a freezer. Rest on a plush memory foam mattress with new down/feather comforter and memory foam pillows.  Unwind in a dedicated reading area, where natural light cascades through large windows, creating a tranquil atmosphere ideal for escaping into your favorite book or work on your laptop.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1197841139459734039/original/d516328e-9141-462f-a442-13138f97c984.jpeg',7990678,13,'45.56614404087776','-122.69112966119215',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,30,30,0,1.00,1197841139459734039),(4101,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1197933406808554221','2 Crow Ranch - Modern PDX 2BR','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful oasis in SW Portland (15min drive to downtown or Tigard). <br /><br />This home features a large kitchen, open family room, fireplace, dining area, and 2 bedrooms, and is well appointed for business travelers, families, or friends on vacation. <br /><br />Located in the quiet Arnold Creek neighborhood, adjacent to the Loll Wildwood green space, my home is the perfect launchpad for exploring Portland, working remotely, or resting close to nature and the city center.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE5NzkzMzQwNjgwODU1NDIyMQ%3D%3D/original/231d8e9b-0ac4-4bf4-9389-0e9e276f67db.jpeg',588905578,73,'45.4449687','-122.7125978',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,105.00,2,14,0,1.00,1197933406808554221),(4102,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1198629730285682205','The Zen Loft','Take it easy at this unique and tranquil getaway. Kick back and relax in this mostly glass, lofted, unique and stylish space. Enjoy the soft natural light, serene experience nestled amongst the trees. The Zen Loft boasts a spa steam shower with essential oils to suit your mood, as well as a luxurious king sized bed. Enjoy a full  kitchen and washer and dryer for your convenience. Close to shopping and restaurants. Perfect for a staycation or visitors from out of town!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE5ODYyOTczMDI4NTY4MjIwNQ%3D%3D/original/82b0e951-012d-4a53-9f59-f9c5d2636100.jpeg',251587005,45,'45.57056384962092','-122.65634107868848',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,162.00,2,14,4,5.00,1198629730285682205),(4103,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1198700415603997671','2 Bedroom Private Suite','Entire top floor of our centrally-located 3,000 sq.ft. home. Two kid friendly bedrooms connected by your own private bath. Enjoy the calm and beauty of acres of parkland right at your doorstep. Walk to the Oregon Zoo, Arboretum, Rose Garden, Japanese Garden, archery range. Just 5 min drive to shops,