r stay and experience Portland at its finest!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1199517319938772068/original/05275ce7-b4f8-49d8-8193-9ddb3b4ef735.jpeg',154267216,15,'45.52237','-122.58755',1,9,2.00,3.00,5.00,145.00,30,365,1,5.00,1199517319938772068),(4107,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1200133482154067988','Backyard Tiny House - Boho Hawthorne Victorian','Historically a queer and Jewish community home, our large house is welcoming, loving, respectful, inclusive, and quiet ~ with high ceilings and Victorian architectural touches. The Backyard Tiny House is lined with cedar, cozy and airy. Folks are typically working during the day (though we\'ve frequently had nurses on the night shift as well) with a gentle hum of activity in the evenings. Walk to shops, restaurants, bars, groceries, parks. Big covered porch, hot tub, outdoor spaces to enjoy.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1200133482154067988/original/e01c3663-dbe4-45ae-ae51-e6eeb8bb96c7.jpeg',267863188,15,'45.5151','-122.61205',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,24.00,30,90,0,1.00,1200133482154067988),(4108,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1201640474990258752','Private Room(1 of 2) in PDX Craftsman','4 bedroom, 2.5 bathroom house with availability for 1-2 bedrooms and 1.5 bathrooms for guests. There is a bonus office space on the main floor as well as the 4th bedroom currently used for storage. <br /><br />Conveniently located to many of Portland\'s popular attractions and is within walking distance to a grocery store,  pharmacy, food carts, parks, walking/hiking trails and much more. Ask me for recommendations!<br /><br />10-15 minutes away from PDX airport, Ikea, Costco, and main business roads/highways.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1201640474990258752/original/909003f9-3a05-43b5-b6a8-97841118fb70.jpeg',136757844,10,'45.52324127622889','-122.59005984115727',2,1,1.50,2.00,2.00,50.00,30,365,0,1.00,1201640474990258752),(4109,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1201654732549179986','Apartment in Northwest Portland','Unwind in this stylish one-bedroom apt on NW 19th Avenue in north downtown Portland. Our neighborhood is full of award-winning restaurants, bars, shops, historic landmarks, and attractions. Adventure through Portland and the region easily from this prime location. Once you are ready to relax, retreat to the comfy apt.<br /><br />✔ Fully Equipped Kitchen<br />✔ Comfortable Bedroom w/ Queen Bed<br />✔ Open Concept Living Area<br />✔ High-Speed Wi-Fi<br />✔ Fold out Full-Size Sleeper Sofa<br /><br />Learn more below!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIwMTY1NDczMjU0OTE3OTk4Ng%3D%3D/original/6bc1de36-b029-4852-b0f7-59832b67334f.jpeg',590060758,27,'45.531740200146444','-122.69173412407292',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,122.00,1,365,19,4.95,1201654732549179986),(4110,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1201659321123361914','Traditional Craftsman Home in Mt. Tabor','4 bedroom, 2.5 bathroom house equipped with blackout curtains and a bonus office space on the main floor. The 4th bedroom is currently used for storage. <br /><br />Conveniently located to many of Portland\'s popular attractions and is within walking distance to a grocery store,  pharmacy, food carts, parks, walking/hiking trails and much more. I will leave my favorite recommendations to enjoy yourself. <br /><br />10-15 minutes away from PDX airport, Ikea, costco, and main business roads/highways.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1201640474990258752/original/909003f9-3a05-43b5-b6a8-97841118fb70.jpeg',136757844,10,'45.52373','-122.59046',1,5,2.50,3.00,3.00,130.00,30,90,0,1.00,1201659321123361914),(4111,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1201671978189408312','Spacious, Well-Designed Suite w/ Private Entry','Come and go with easy parking and a private entry! This stylish suite features cork floors (that feel so nice under foot), a one-of-kind kitchenette, comfy sitting room, and custom finishes. It’s conveniently near some of Portland\'s best restaurants, food carts, coffee shops, and brewpubs. Quality coffee and snacks are provided to guests.<br /><br />I truly strive to provide exceptional standards for bedding, cleanliness, and hospitality (see past guest reviews!).','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1201671978189408312/original/b49f9008-bc6b-456a-9b55-3c79fa39a596.jpeg',7263006,13,'45.559331655924694','-122.68005571904908',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,72.00,1,14,36,5.00,1201671978189408312),(4112,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1201780712719410595','The Gardner Haus Bungalow','Welcome to The Gardner Haus, a family friendly Portland bungalow designed with joy in mind. We\'ve created this space as a haven for our family, and we’re delighted for the opportunity to share it with others in our community to enjoy Portland and the Pacific Northwest when we\'re traveling.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1201780712719410595/original/6aa3fe55-8e38-4266-bc9b-6083cf4c2fcc.jpeg',77167680,67,'45.49034975324216','-122.61234077626546',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,222.00,30,365,0,1.00,1201780712719410595),(4113,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1201793232538286968','Good Clean place walking distanc','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1201793232538286968/original/5e6f3646-9af6-4b5f-94f2-4e653e400884.jpeg',590091685,3,'45.52287','-122.69187',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,125.00,1,5,1,5.00,1201793232538286968),(4114,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1202339687084635071','Walkable to all the good things!','Enjoy a relaxing stay at a new (July 2024), light-filled basement  apartment in our classic Portland bungalow.  We are located in a quiet residential neighborhood in SE Portland, right between the bustling Hawthorne and Division Street dining and shops. Tons of options are a short walk away.  Or, relax in the cozy apartment, and make use of the fully appointed kitchen and coffee bar that we built - just for you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1202339687084635071/original/fb824c83-a419-4063-b506-c69e58246fd9.jpeg',60068989,25,'45.50897390566252','-122.63993623017302',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,111.00,3,10,16,4.94,1202339687084635071),(4115,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1202365179689693635','Modern Unique Comfortable  near to everything','Always deep-cleaned, full of sun, walk to everything - bus, food, entertainment all in Multnomah Village - Completely private. We are available to you 24 hrs. You have access to two bedrooms with AC, each with a private and spacious bathrooms, walk-in closets and and a balcony for each bedroom. The main floor (+half bath) and the pent house each have a fireplace. The beds and the linens are always fresh . Book it now, you will be comfortable.','The streets are all new with sidewalk and bike path. Family oriented. Alice Path is just across the street - beautiful nature. Spring Garden, a fully equipped park its a great place to see the sunrise and enjoy the swing - full playground. Gabriel park is a bit further with tennis court and swimming pool. <br />Food, restaurants, food carts, coffee shops, bars, flower shops, boutiques are within 10 min walk. Costco, Winco, flower shops, are are within the radius of 4 miles.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1202365179689693635/original/fa5a83b2-b27e-41a4-a20d-8469695fc5fc.jpeg',493756268,18,'45.45864','-122.71895',1,4,0.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,1,365,0,1.00,1202365179689693635),(4116,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1203754833257046278','City Serenity: Stylish 2-Bed in heart of St. Johns','NEW 2-bedroom 2-bathroom gorgeous townhome-style condo in an amazing central N Portland in the heart of St. Johns!  Enjoy the convenience of a walkable lifestyle with great proximity to restaurants + shops, parks and entertainment. Open concept living with high ceilings and large windows make this light and bright feel with glass door out to private, fenced patio. Custom kitchen boasting gorgeous tile work, quartz counters, custom cabinetry, sleek black fixtures + stylish lighting with AC.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1203754833257046278/original/14ad7ae2-21c2-475d-85c7-dd6a2163a55d.jpeg',590666605,58,'45.58833289454387','-122.74730188817084',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,178.00,2,25,7,5.00,1203754833257046278),(4117,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1204441657929046019','Radiant Roselawn | Entire Alberta Arts Home','Spread out and enjoy a beautifully curated experience with the entire family at this two bedroom, two and a half bathroom airbnb. Just one block from Alberta Street with many options for shopping and restaurants! A great home base for enjoying all of Portland\'s neighborhoods. The open concept kitchen/dining/living room make it easy to socialize with friends and family while cooking a meal in!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIwNDQ0MTY1NzkyOTA0NjAxOQ%3D%3D/original/c601206b-7225-42fa-8a77-0448ca8f54e4.jpeg',7409866,14,'45.56214','-122.65902',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,215.00,1,365,19,4.89,1204441657929046019),(4118,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1204480024727412581','Walkable&Modern Sellwood Living','Ditch the car in Sellwood-Moreland! Walk to shops, restaurants, and the local movie theater. Explore the Willamette River, wildlife refuge & Oaks Amusement Park nearby. Easy access to all of Portland via bike/MAX/TriMet. This 2016 3-bd home features an open layout, chef\'s kitchen, gas fireplace & master suite with walk-in closet. Laundry & off-street parking included. Your Portland adventure starts here!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1204480024727412581/original/e36621cb-7421-451a-b32d-178586881129.jpeg',158074447,20,'45.46884','-122.65403',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,135.00,31,180,0,1.00,1204480024727412581),(4119,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1205904879166210576','Beautiful Heart of Inner SE','Enjoy this upgraded stylish home w/huge patio above street, next to Puff Coffee, Whole Foods, Laurelhurst Park & Theater,  Bamboo Sushi, Ken’s, new A/C, gourmet kitchen with gas range, two car gar, unfinished basement hangout area w/couches lots storage space, W/D, backyard oasis great fireplace. Walk to everything awesome you could want or need! Fully furnished, and a longer lease can be discussed, pets ok w/deposit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1205904879166210576/original/555af5a3-d591-403b-89e8-dfa6b23f515d.jpeg',31560564,16,'45.51817','-122.63687',1,6,1.00,3.00,0.00,0.00,30,365,0,1.00,1205904879166210576),(4120,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1205981967194041588','The Badger Haven','Fantastic hidden getaway close to everything in Portland. Welcome to our Badger Haven, a full 3-bedroom, 1-bath unit tucked away in our fully finished basement.<br /><br />This space is full of peace and quite with luxury bedding, tile shower, stainless appliances, Wi-Fi, 2 tv\'s, and immediate access to all things in the Portland metro area. <br /><br />We are situated right on the dividing line between Milwaukie, Sellwood and Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1205981967194041588/original/ac50bd33-0ee0-45b8-ac58-8ece080f87b6.jpeg',124334269,47,'45.4627221','-122.6275449',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,225.00,1,365,10,4.90,1205981967194041588),(4121,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1206662400232746332','Pearl District 2 Bed/Bath Condo','Beautiful 2 bedroom, 2 full bathroom unit at this centrally-located condo in the heart of the Pearl District. 30-day or longer rentals only. <br /><br />The Pearl District offers an array of great shops, restaurants, breweries, and convenience to all Portland has to offer!<br /><br />$300 per stay pet deposit (non-refundable).<br /><br />Thanks for looking and feel free to email with any questions!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1206662400232746332/original/b88808d3-138a-4d73-a6f8-c40e1776768d.jpeg',45533700,2,'45.52864945429147','-122.68200578234489',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,175.00,30,365,0,1.00,1206662400232746332),(4122,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1207337846733034458','Park Place Penthouse','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.<br />Wonderful Mid-Century condo. Top floor 2 bed/2 bath one level Penthouse, natural light-filled, corner unit. Grand balcony, Top Deck, overlooks views of Washington park, condo pool, outdoor picnic area, GREAT VIEW of Mt St Helens, and city lights. Secure Building with covered parking available.  Convenient and walking to shopping, restaurants, etc. Walk to Forest Park, Rose Gardens, Washington Park and more! Walking score 91','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1207337846733034458/original/1ed59e2b-b0c8-4ab0-a635-924d490e6565.jpeg',32859540,3,'45.52094','-122.69976',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,85.00,30,365,0,1.00,1207337846733034458),(4123,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1208083660294148335','Stumptown Commons','MESSAGE ME FOR SPECIAL RATES AND DISCOUNTS! Escape to a stylish loft style ground floor apartment with fully fenced yard. Tucked away off vibrant Division St. This urban oasis offers a perfect blend of tranquility and convenience walking distance to loads of restaurants, bars and cafes. With free street parking, a fully fenced yard, king sized bed, high speed wifi in unit laundry, AC and smart TV you\'ll love this bright and airy home from home in a safe neighborhood.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1208083660294148335/original/fb430c62-433b-491b-bc65-b12432a74229.jpeg',501414071,8,'45.50505','-122.61601',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,118.00,30,365,0,1.00,1208083660294148335),(4124,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1208238199871170691','Downtown Portland Cozy Studio','Nice and quiet downtown Portland studio suitable for two people with easy access to bars restaurants Providence Park only three blocks away. This studio is in a historic building. Street parking is free after 7pm till 8am. During the daytime hours parking is free in two hour periods.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1208238199871170691/original/29e3b372-c9da-4ec7-a7d1-5b6deca9f5de.jpeg',7598561,27,'45.52379','-122.68933',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,54.00,30,365,2,4.50,1208238199871170691),(4125,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1209768234370340362','Charming & Cozy Sellwood House','Welcome to our newly remodeled home in the heart of Sellwood-Moreland District! This is a highly desired neighborhood with great walking and biking scores. You will be close to shops, restaurants, riverfront scenery and parks. <br /><br />You will be just a short 10-15 minute drive from Downtown Portland, Lake Oswego, Beaverton<br /><br />We encourage you to take advantage of your proximity to the Oaks Bottom Nature Reserve, Willamette River, and Westmoreland Park, all of which are 10 minutes walking distance!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1209768234370340362/original/05a6f8a8-9788-46ae-83b7-25f751582f62.jpeg',508682112,20,'45.47012','-122.6504',1,5,2.00,3.00,3.00,150.00,2,31,3,5.00,1209768234370340362),(4126,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1209815100385280504','Bright Quiet Room for 1-2 in historic Alberta home','This quiet, peaceful room in an historic, updated 1907 Foursquare house is just steps from Alberta Arts District and other neighborhoods, with local shops, bars, & eateries.<br /><br />(Also see SERENE SPACE, PATIO SUITE OR PATIO COTTAGE if this room is booked during your dates.)<br /><br />FEATURES:<br />• Queen Bed w/ memory foam mattress<br />• Organic cotton bedding, towels & toiletries<br />• Fully equipped kitchen<br />• High-pressure shower<br />• A/C & work space<br />• Large patio w/ gas fire pit<br />• LGBTQ+ Friendly','PERFECT CENTRAL LOCATION<br /><br />You couldn’t ask for a better spot to take in Portland’s charms, right outside the door:<br /><br />    • Just 15 minutes from the airport, and 10 minutes to downtown and the Convention/Moda Centers.<br />    • Directly off N Williams Ave and NE Alberta Street, right in the heart of some of Portland’s most popular shopping and restaurant districts – with easy access to all the rest of Portland’s star attractions.<br />    •  Within easy walking distance to a lot of shops, restaurants, pubs, cafes and food carts.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1209815100385280504/original/59bffce4-c376-4da2-9ccd-50edb9f50c57.jpeg',6946676,24,'45.5583077','-122.6653068',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,46.00,1,14,6,4.83,1209815100385280504),(4127,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1210187411580734221','Fresh Belmont Charmer w/ 95 WalkScore','Newly refreshed with updated kitchen, bathroom, and flooring, this Belmont charmer is perfectly situated on Portland\'s Eastside. The best restaurants, bars, and shops are right outside your door. After spending all day exploring, there\'s plenty of room to hang out and relax with a movie. Or perhaps you want to enjoy leftovers from one of the top restaurants next door. It won\'t be hard to envision yourself becoming part of Portlandia after a couple of days here!','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!). Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. Hawthorne boasts a vibrant indie spirit, with plenty of made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park on top of a dormant volcano vent, where you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible panoramic views of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1210187411580734221/original/f35ed44c-c3a8-4298-9ca7-798781e61283.jpeg',592522307,16,'45.51735','-122.62488',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,265.00,1,365,2,4.50,1210187411580734221),(4128,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1210292695787872961','Woodstock Sanctuary - Spacious & Modern','Gorgeous sunlit modern living space curated with designer midcentury details! Curl up in the B&B Italia sofa while streaming your favorite show, relax on the balcony with morning coffee, or play a record from our curated vinyl collection. <br /><br />Walkable to food carts, breweries, upscale grocery, coffee, ice cream, eateries, vintage, dispensaries, and more.<br /><br />Close to Reed College, easy free street parking. Access I-205 to airport and outdoor destinations.<br /><br />Space is NOT suitable for children or pets.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1210292695787872961/original/d0de25cf-0949-4b35-9f4a-b65b9b9add12.jpeg',503453546,65,'45.47941915406559','-122.60192816964202',1,2,1.50,1.00,0.00,0.00,1,29,8,5.00,1210292695787872961),(4129,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1210903063101977846','The Brooklyn & Reed Hideaway','Welcome to our enchanting 1 bedroom, 1 bath nestled in the vibrant Brooklyn and Reed neighborhood. Complete with a full kitchen, a huge 55-inch TV, and wifi to keep you connected. Unwind in the comfort of a plush queen bed, and relish the tranquility of your own outside area.<br /><br />Immerse yourself in the local charm as just blocks away is the prestigious Reed College or embark on a short trip to the historic Sellwood neighborhood. Indulge in the lively atmosphere of nearby bars and superb eateries.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-934915537765648781/original/045a0b99-3749-4ad0-bd50-732510b07211.jpeg',118237877,67,'45.49075','-122.63781',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,67.00,1,365,13,4.85,1210903063101977846),(4130,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1210915542343711782','Cozy Brooklyn & Reed Retreat','Welcome to our enchanting 1 bedroom, 1 bath nestled in the vibrant Brooklyn and