1211786360676846020/original/8f4c21de-7dfb-46a6-94ad-e3fdede60aa1.jpeg',158074447,8,'45.503404164897184','-122.61635174305397',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,99.00,31,180,1,5.00,1211786360676846020),(4155,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1211828695481374831','#StayinMyDistrict Kenton Private Guest House','#StayinMyDistrict Historic Kenton! Private Guest House in popular Kenton neighborhood. Conveniently located to I-5, PDX & blocks to public transit (MAX), you can go anywhere in Portland without a car! Close to Adidas, University of Portland and bordering the Arbor Lodge neighborhood. Walk to local restaurants & shopping, Tastefully updated with comfortable furnishings, 1 bed/1 bath, Washer/Dryer, Kitchen, FREE Parking and private patio! Stay, Relax, Enjoy!','Portland’s Kenton neighborhood is a dream for early risers, who can choose from a wide selection of delicious breakfast and coffee options. Both results of the revitalization efforts, coffeehouses Presso and Prince each offer a distinct ambiance and an elevated menu of beverages and snacks. There’s no wrong choice here, but Presso’s slightly larger menu and decadent coffee creations (hello, charcoal lavender latte!) are the perfect way to treat yourself. For a quick bite, choose from their selection of specialty toasts or pastry items. More substantial brunch and breakfast options can be found just next door at the brand new establishment, Derby’s.<br />Walking around Kenton can transport you to another place and time entirely, as the collection of businesses along historic Denver Avenue creates a feeling of small-town living. We encourage you to embrace this narrative and explore the main strip as a tourist. Like many small towns, there are plenty of gems to be found. Among them are t','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1211828695481374831/original/ca7e05a5-e441-4a47-ba07-24a62622075c.jpeg',3142393,55,'45.5809027','-122.6794152',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,57.00,1,365,96,4.69,1211828695481374831),(4156,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1211841126762877380','#StayInMyDistrict Sunnyside Vintage Charmer','#StayinMyDistrict Sunnyside. Discover historical charm in the popular Sunnyside & SE Hawthorn District in a Colonial Revival apartment. Walk to local shops and dining and enjoy one of Portland\'s most popular neighborhoods. Modern finishes & Vintage charm offer style and comfort in a cozy 1100 sq ft space. Hardwood floors, high ceilings and tons of light, on the main level offers 1 bed/1 bath, sofa sleeper, private patio, living area, full Kitchen, FREE Parking, Smart TV and WIFI. Accommodates 4.','The Belmont District which is located in Southeast Portland, runs along Belmont Street from about 31st to 60th Avenues. Interestingly, the Belmont District is actually located in the Sunnyside neighborhood and the property falls right in the middle of the Sunnyside neighborhood and boarder the hip Hawthorn District.  The Sunnyside District area is a very popular area in SE Portland. Known to most as \"Belmont\", Sunnyside has a strong sense of Portland individuality. Sunnyside has many locally owned coffee shops, markets, and distinctive shops and restaurants. Belmont Street is a favorite destination for many locals, whether it`s for an afternoon at the Avalon Arcade, a night at the Blue Monk, or a cup of coffee at the neighborhood cafe. This area has a nice mix of urban diversity, with a funky feel, and local color. You might often hear The South East Belmont neighborhood is diverse and eclectic, and a neighborhood\'s neighborhood. <br />Oh, but there\'s plenty of places to go in the Belm','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1211841126762877380/original/0c3f1074-9b4f-487c-9a25-5691c3400158.jpeg',3142393,16,'45.5134271','-122.6291806',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,64.00,1,365,142,4.77,1211841126762877380),(4157,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1212361976961943520','The Ladd\'s Addition Bohemian Dream ~ 95 WalkScore','Located right on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, this spot is a foodie\'s paradise. Walk to the food carts on Hawthorne or the top-rated restaurants on Division, ensuring every meal is a delight. Your biggest challenge will be deciding which amazing place to try first! This tastefully updated apartment has everything you need to make your time in Portland truly exceptional.','Located right on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, this spot is a foodie\'s paradise. Walk to the food carts on Hawthorne or the top-rated restaurants on Division, ensuring every meal is a delight. Your biggest challenge will be deciding which amazing place to try first! This tastefully updated apartment has everything you need to make your time in Portland truly exceptional.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1212361976961943520/original/24f92093-e1bf-41c5-8807-7dae70c64b6d.jpeg',592522307,25,'45.50712','-122.65537',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,1,365,26,4.73,1212361976961943520),(4158,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1212372998727149064','BoHo Oasis in Ladd\'s Addition with 2 Beds','Located on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, my place is perfectly situated in a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll be within walking distance to the vibrant food carts on Hawthorne and the top-rated restaurants on Division. Every meal will be a delight, with the only challenge being which fantastic spot to try first! The tastefully updated apartment is equipped with everything you need to make your time in Portland truly amazing.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s culinary and cultural scene, commonly known as “Foodie Row.” Nestled in the vibrant Hawthorne/Buckman District, you\'ll find yourself within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This lively area is home to Powell\'s Books, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1212372998727149064/original/5d842f93-6da0-4962-bb53-05ac6f3e6d95.jpeg',592522307,25,'45.50692','-122.65452',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,75.00,1,365,12,4.92,12123729987