area its distinct character. The neighborhood is also home to several parks, including the popular Colonel Summers Park, which features a playground, basketball court, and plenty of space for picnics and outdoor activities.<br /><br />The architecture in Ladd\'s Addition is a mix of styles, ranging from Craftsman bungalows to Tudor Revivals, with many of the homes featuring beautiful gardens and landscaping. The streets are also adorned with beautiful vintage streetlights, adding to the area\'s historic charm.<br /><br />Beyond its beauty, ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1213157477201958907/original/e9029030-fb7a-4986-8f3e-4db9c6e37a88.jpeg',592522307,56,'45.49803','-122.64251',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,89.00,1,365,3,5.00,1213157477201958907),(4173,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1213175219747157572','Stay Portland Collection -  Studio Near OHSU','Welcome to my charming studio nestled in the scenic Southwest Portland neighborhood. Just moments away from Downtown Portland, OHSU, river running trails, and Marquam Nature Park, this thoughtfully designed space offers a cozy retreat with modern amenities and stylish decor. Enjoy the convenience of being close to downtown while still experiencing the picturesque and tranquil atmosphere of the Southwest neighborhood.','Located in the charming and historic South Portland neighborhood, this area, also known as Corbett-Terwilliger-Lair Hill, is one of the city’s oldest and most picturesque neighborhoods, boasting tree-lined streets, historic homes, and a tranquil, community-focused atmosphere.<br /><br />South Portland offers an ideal blend of residential peace and urban convenience. Enjoy leisurely strolls through the neighborhood\'s many parks, including Lair Hill Park and Duniway Park, which provide plenty of green space, walking trails, and recreational facilities. The area is perfect for outdoor enthusiasts and those looking to relax in nature.<br /><br />Food lovers will appreciate the proximity to some of Portland’s best dining spots. From cozy cafes and bakeries to trendy restaurants and food carts, there’s something to satisfy every palate. The nearby South Waterfront District also offers a variety of dining options and stunning river views.<br /><br />For shopping and entertainment, you’re just','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1213175219747157572/original/eb5d7e80-a1f5-49a3-b668-7faac6509b18.jpeg',592522307,22,'45.49797','-122.67595',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,72.00,1,365,10,4.70,1213175219747157572),(4174,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1213182084263061899','Stay Portland Collection - Peaceful  Studio ~ OHSU','Welcome to my peaceful studio nestled in the scenic Southwest Portland neighborhood. Just moments away from Downtown Portland, OHSU, river running trails, and the Marquam Nature Park. This thoughtfully designed space offers a cozy retreat with modern amenities and stylish decor. Enjoy the convenience of being close to downtown while still experiencing the picturesque and quiet southwest neighborhood.','Located in the charming and historic South Portland neighborhood, this area, also known as Corbett-Terwilliger-Lair Hill, is one of the city’s oldest and most picturesque neighborhoods, boasting tree-lined streets, historic homes, and a tranquil, community-focused atmosphere.<br /><br />South Portland offers an ideal blend of residential peace and urban convenience. Enjoy leisurely strolls through the neighborhood\'s many parks, including Lair Hill Park and Duniway Park, which provide plenty of green space, walking trails, and recreational facilities. The area is perfect for outdoor enthusiasts and those looking to relax in nature.<br /><br />Food lovers will appreciate the proximity to some of Portland’s best dining spots. From cozy cafes and bakeries to trendy restaurants and food carts, there’s something to satisfy every palate. The nearby South Waterfront District also offers a variety of dining options and stunning river views.<br /><br />For shopping an