 neighborhoods. This prime location offers the perfect blend of urban living and natural beauty, ensuring a memorable stay for all our guests.<br /><br />The neighborhood is renowned for its vibrant dining scene, featuring an array of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and trendy bars. Whether you\'re craving gourmet cuisine, a casual bite, or a perfectly brewed cup of coffee, you\'ll find an abundance of options just a short walk away. Don\'t miss the chance to explore local favorites like Ken\'s Artisan Bakery, Ringside Steakhouse, and the numerous food carts that dot the area.<br /><br />Shopping enthusiasts will love the proximity to a variety of boutique stores, vintage shops, and specialty markets. Just a short stroll away, you\'ll find the bustling streets of the Pearl District and downtown Portland, where you can discover unique fashion pieces, handcrafted jewelry, and eclectic home decor. Powell\'s City of Books, t','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216008932509595242/original/30a12ef6-3b96-441e-a9a1-5f21c4f4cc79.jpeg',592522307,3,'45.51997611753315','-122.69462978419016',1,9,2.50,4.00,6.00,264.00,1,365,0,1.00,1216008932509595242),(4204,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216071426077891668','1923 Belmont House of Antiques ~ Coffee & Brunch','Discover the best of Portland\'s food, drink, and culture from this prime location in the famous Belmont District. With top-rated restaurants, craft beer pubs, and pour-over coffee shops just steps away, this home offers a convenient base for families, friend groups, and business travelers. Enjoy the neighborhood\'s vintage shops and great people-watching spots, and immerse yourself in the authentic Portland lifestyle.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216071426077891668/original/774d2343-95a9-422f-9fbf-e8e2d7f0672b.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.51552','-122.6409',1,8,1.50,4.00,4.00,265.00,1,365,9,4.00,1216071426077891668),(4205,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216074663050436936','Bright Studio Heart of Pearl','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located brand new apartment building with Big City Views!  The location is off the charts.  Walkable to grocery stores, shopping and a bounty of cafe and restaurants. Very safe and vibrant core Pearl District address.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1216074663050436936/original/c7ead47c-4096-471c-9fd4-475d8b560435.jpeg',41852577,2,'45.5287869','-122.6846317',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,65.00,31,365,1,5.00,1216074663050436936),(4206,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216074883043918210','Hotel Style Studio Apartment - #F','Enjoy easy access to everything from this perfectly located home base. Ideal for work from home while on the road, if you know what I mean.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/017ff6ed-7cd3-4829-9fa6-583744c3f146.jpg',121088523,13,'45.55777822550246','-122.68051981047196',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,82.00,30,365,0,1.00,1216074883043918210),(4207,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216300449899549855','Heritage Room at Hayhurst Manor','This stylish place is perfect for couples or people looking for a staycation or, travel stop. <br /><br />There is a writing desk, a chair in the bedroom, and good wifi capable of handling video calls. <br /><br />The living room and kitchenette are fully stocked to cook and eat at home.  <br /><br />The house is near a main bus line that will take you to several restaurants and grocery stores within five minutes, downtown in 30 minutes, and OHSU within 25 minutes.  There is also parking if you have a car.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1216300449899549855/original/6fa442de-2d98-49a5-8ab4-599ce0d01a48.jpeg',29156235,70,'45.48635','-122.72391',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,33.00,1,360,1,4.00,1216300449899549855),(4208,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216358666133114541','Large Furnished Craftsman','Bring the whole family to this great place with lots of room for fun.<br />We\'re on a corner  lot with plenty of outdoor space. There are fruit trees, garden beds, and herbs. We also have two hens if someone likes free eggs, otherwise we can make accommodations for them :) <br />We are also located near Woodstock with New Seasons, Safeway, Grand Central Bakery, Cloud City Ice Cream, and more!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1216286111675303165/original/23c4158b-1caf-45eb-ba2e-26f7a4cc20a7.jpeg',44771610,69,'45.47025743380094','-122.5926762690745',1,7,2.50,5.00,5.00,200.00,31,180,0,1.00,1216358666133114541),(4209,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216708682898039328','Scandinavian Loft ~ Local Espresso & Boutiques','This beautifully remodeled 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment blends early 1900s charm with modern conveniences. The renovation preserved original character with restored doors, trim, and hardware. Despite its historic touches, the apartment is modernized with new appliances, updated windows, high-speed internet, YouTube TV, and Netflix, ensuring a comfortable stay. Enjoy the perfect balance of classic charm and modern luxury in this unique Portland retreat.','Welcome to the vibrant neighborhood of NW Portland, where your Airbnb places you at the heart of all the action. Nestled in the trendy and dynamic Slabtown district, this location offers a perfect blend of historic charm and modern amenities.<br /><br />Just steps away from your doorstep, you’ll find a variety of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, and bustling bars. Savor a gourmet meal at St. Jack, enjoy a casual brunch at Besaw’s, or grab a craft cocktail at Breakside Brewery. For coffee lovers, a visit to Dragonfly Coffee House or Barista is a must. The area is also home to an array of unique shops and boutiques, such as Child’s Play Toys and EcoVibe, perfect for indulging in some retail therapy.<br /><br />For outdoor enthusiasts, the nearby Wallace Park offers a green oasis for relaxation, picnics, and leisurely strolls. Additionally, the scenic trails of Forest Park, one of the largest urban forests in the United States, are just a short distance away, providing a beautiful setti','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216708682898039328/original/31ddc207-495f-4095-8a31-4a8a79922bc0.jpeg',592522307,27,'45.53488854057352','-122.70024256320815',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,165.00,1,365,7,3.57,1216708682898039328),(4210,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216713384380614094','Luxurious Alphabet District Home - 99 Walk Score','Location, location, location! A walker’s paradise with a walk score of 99, our 1600 sq ft home is fully equipped with brand new stainless steel appliances, blazing WiFi, and can sleep up to 8 guests comfortably.<br /><br />Our charming, yet modern and updated home is located in the heart of the Alphabet District on NW 21st—next door to bars, restaurants, independent bookstores, and shops.<br /><br />We’re also close to Alberta Arts, Historic Mississippi Ave, the Pearl, and Downtown PDX!','Welcome to the heart of Portland’s vibrant Alphabet District! This Airbnb places you in one of the city’s most desirable neighborhoods, known for its unique blend of historic charm and modern amenities.<br /><br />Just steps from your door, you’ll find a diverse array of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, trendy bars, and independent boutiques. Whether you’re craving a gourmet meal, a casual coffee, or a craft cocktail, NW 21st Avenue has something to satisfy every palate. Be sure to explore popular local favorites like Salt & Straw for artisanal ice cream, Ken’s Artisan Bakery for delicious pastries, and McMenamins Blue Moon Tavern for a quintessential Portland pub experience.<br /><br />The neighborhood’s walkability is second to none, with a walk score of 99, making it easy to explore on foot. For shopping enthusiasts, the nearby Pearl District offers high-end shops and galleries, while NW 23rd Avenue is lined with charming stores and eclectic shops.<br /><br />Nature lovers will ap','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216713384380614094/original/5538db29-6531-4482-a098-0c22f112cc90.jpeg',592522307,27,'45.525559673304286','-122.69529440027625',1,8,2.00,3.00,4.00,279.00,1,365,10,4.70,1216713384380614094),(4211,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216721701466015684','The Original Portland Mayor Estate ~ 6 Beds','Rumored to be the Original Portland Mayor\'s Home, the original woodwork, fixtures, and tasteful furnishings will fill your trip with Class and Elegance. The location cannot be beat and the only trouble will ensue when you try to pick between the many highly rated restaurants and bars within a few blocks!','Portland is known as one of the best food cities in the country. Foodies galore! Being in the heart of the NW district, also referred to as the Alphabet district, you will quickly become lost in quaint shops, and endless superb dining options. History buffs will want to stop in for a Spanish coffee at Huber\'s, Portland\'s oldest bar, and of course, you can\'t leave without trying a unique flavor of ice cream from Salt & Straw just a few blocks away!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216721701466015684/original/8b7bc64f-1797-4ebf-9f09-c21e6d9eb116.jpeg',592522307,27,'45.538096309061295','-122.69455531415109',1,12,3.00,6.00,6.00,285.00,1,365,4,4.75,1216721701466015684),(4212,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216727685534531734','Perfect Portland Farmhouse Loft ~ Breweries & Bars','Nestled between Hawthorne and Division, my duplex in the Industrial Central Eastside offers walking distance access to Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, artisan shops, and services. Just over a mile from downtown, it’s easily accessible by bike, foot, or bus. Designed as a modern farmhouse loft, it ensures ultimate relaxation. Enjoy urban convenience and cozy charm at our unique Portland retreat!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216727685534531734/original/74bd7821-ca0a-4b7a-b80c-7b64ebd25469.jpeg',592522307,25,'45.50866','-122.65512',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,97.00,1,365,12,4.83,1216727685534531734),(4213,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216732408482350999','Urban Rose Residence - Downtown & OHSU Proximity!','Welcome to our charming 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom home! Perfect for families, groups, or business travelers, this spacious retreat offers comfort and style. Enjoy a cozy living area with a large flat-screen TV, a fully equipped kitchen, and a dining area. Each bedroom features plush beds with premium linens. Modern bathrooms are stocked with fresh towels and toiletries. Located in a vibrant neighborhood, close to top-rated restaurants and shops. Book now for a memorable stay!','Welcome to the vibrant and historic South Waterfront District, one of Portland’s most desirable neighborhoods. Nestled along the Willamette River, this area offers a unique blend of urban living and natural beauty, making it a perfect destination for both relaxation and adventure.<br /><br />Our home is located in a prime spot, just steps away from the scenic South Waterfront Park. Here, you can enjoy peaceful walks along the river, watch boats glide by, or take a relaxing break on the green lawns. The park also connects to the Willamette Greenway Trail, perfect for biking and jogging enthusiasts who want to explore the city’s stunning waterfront scenery.<br /><br />A short stroll will take you to the Portland Aerial Tram, offering breathtaking views of the city and a quick ride to the Oregon Health & Science University (OHSU). For those interested in arts and culture, the Portland Opera and the Oregon Museum of Science and Industry (OMSI) are nearby, offering a variety of exhibitions ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216732408482350999/original/673cce65-af66-4d57-959c-df83a6b10efb.jpeg',592522307,22,'45.50148799503571','-122.67684347571776',1,10,2.00,4.00,5.00,357.00,1,365,3,5.00,1216732408482350999),(4214,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216736749796927638','A Bohemian Paradise - Walk to Hawthorne/Division','My duplex is in the Industrial Central Eastside, nestled between the popular streets of Hawthorne and Division. It\'s within walking distance to some of Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, craftspeople, and all types of services! My home is also just over a mile from the downtown financial district via bike, walking, or bus. The interiors are designed to create a bohemian paradise, ensuring ultimate relaxation for your getaway!','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This vibrant area boasts a Powell\'s bookstore, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more. Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, get messy with wings at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or enjoy a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216736749796927638/original/32d433fb-1f62-4f3c-bdc6-c39efa4f7043.jpeg',592522307,25,'45.507520505731996','-122.65557764689102',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,1,365,14,4.79,1216736749796927638),(4215,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216739608127973119','Haven by the Hill - Downtown & OHSU Proximity!','Welcome to our charming 5-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home! Perfect for families, groups, or business travelers, this spacious retreat offers comfort and style. Enjoy a cozy living area with a large flat-screen TV, a fully equipped kitchen, and a dining area. Each bedroom features plush beds with premium linens. Modern bathrooms are stocked with fresh towels and toiletries. Located in a vibrant neighborhood, close to top-rated restaurants and shops. Book now for a memorable stay!','Welcome to the vibrant and historic South Waterfront District, one of Portland’s most desirable neighborhoods. Nestled along the Willamette River, this area offers a unique blend of urban living and natural beauty, making it a perfect destination for both relaxation and adventure.<br /><br />Our home is located in a prime spot, just steps away from the scenic South Waterfront Park. Here, you can enjoy peaceful walks along the river, watch boats glide by, or take a relaxing break on the green lawns. The park also connects to the Willamette Greenway Trail, perfect for biking and jogging enthusiasts who want to explore the city’s stunning waterfront scenery.<br /><br />A short stroll will take you to the Portland Aerial Tram, offering breathtaking views of the city and a quick ride to the Oregon Health & Science University (OHSU). For those interested in arts and culture, the Portland Opera and the Oregon Museum of Science and Industry (OMSI) are nearby, offering a variety of exhibitions ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216739608127973119/original/85d92955-0fe8-43b7-8944-f7d93bd24bed.jpeg',592522307,22,'45.50068','-122.67629',1,9,2.50,5.00,5.00,305.00,1,365,7,4.86,1216739608127973119),(4216,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216741575892513111','Perfect Ladd\'s Addition Loft ~ Breweries & Bars','Nestled between Hawthorne and Division, my duplex in the Industrial Central Eastside offers walking distance access to Portland\'s best restaurants, cafes, bookstores, brew-pubs, distilleries, artisan shops, and services. Just over a mile from downtown, it’s easily accessible by bike, foot, or bus. Designed as a modern farmhouse loft, it ensures ultimate relaxation. Enjoy urban convenience and cozy charm at our unique Portland retreat!','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This vibrant area boasts a Powell\'s bookstore, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more. Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, get messy with wings at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or enjoy a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. The vibrant indie spirit thrives in Hawthorne, with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at the Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of fun, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park atop a dormant volcano ven','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216741575892513111/original/4eed6fed-37e7-4849-aec3-5d61408ad90f.jpeg',592522307,25,'45.509608608128055','-122.6550651159269',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,179.00,1,365,2,4.50,1216741575892513111),(4217,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216779058355408192','Mississippi Micro-Luxe: Mid-Century Style','Have you ever imagined if you could downsize? Maybe just wondered what the Tiny House craze is all about? In the heart of the Mississippi district, everything is within walking distance of this beautiful new tiny home. With acclaimed restaurants, bars, and shows just steps away, you won\'t run out of things to do. They say great things come in small packages, and that holds true here with everything you\'ll need for your stay. One stay here and you\'ll be downsizing to the Tiny Life!','Welcome to the vibrant and eclectic neighborhood of Overlook in North Portland! Our tiny home offers you the perfect base to explore one of the city\'s most dynamic areas. Overlook is known for its friendly atmosphere, tree-lined streets, and close-knit community vibe, making it an ideal destination for both locals and visitors alike.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find a diverse array of dining options that cater to all tastes and preferences. Whether you\'re in the mood for a gourmet meal at one of the trendy bistros, a quick bite at a food truck, or a craft beer at a local brewery, you\'ll find it all just a short stroll away. Some neighborhood favorites include The Arbor Lodge, known for its excellent coffee and cozy atmosphere, and Breakside Brewery, where you can enjoy a variety of locally brewed beers.<br /><br />For those who love the outdoors, Overlook Park is just a few blocks away. This spacious green area is perfect for picnics, leisurely walks, or simply relaxing ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216779058355408192/original/a03f8b96-7cd3-4635-b5e8-41a89fe24064.jpeg',592522307,13,'45.55450822701755','-122.67876299605453',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,64.00,1,365,10,4.60,1216779058355408192),(4218,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216787712385821777','Noir-Emerald: Modern TinyLux in Portland','Have you ever imagined if you could downsize? Maybe just wondered what the Tiny House craze is all about? In the heart of the Mississippi district, everything is within walking distance of this beautiful new tiny home. With acclaimed restaurants, bars, and shows just steps away, you won\'t run out of things to do. They say great things come in small packages, and that holds true here with everything you\'ll need for your stay. One stay here and you\'ll be downsizing to the Tiny Life!','Welcome to the vibrant and eclectic neighborhood of Overlook in North Portland! Our tiny home offers you the perfect base to explore one of the city\'s most dynamic areas. Overlook is known for its friendly atmosphere, tree-lined streets, and close-knit community vibe, making it an ideal destination for both locals and visitors alike.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find a diverse array of dining options that cater to all tastes and preferences. Whether you\'re in the mood for a gourmet meal at one of the trendy bistros, a quick bite at a food truck, or a craft beer at a local brewery, you\'ll find it all just a short stroll away. Some neighborhood favorites include The Arbor Lodge, known for its excellent coffee and cozy atmosphere, and Breakside Brewery, where you can enjoy a variety of locally brewed beers.<br /><br />For those who love the outdoors, Overlook Park is just a few blocks away. This spacious green area is perfect for picnics, leisurely walks, or simply relaxing ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216787712385821777/original/8d4b8b2b-d192-4d36-9a4e-d36f6e4b10ee.jpeg',592522307,9,'45.55271528463767','-122.67852566568803',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,64.00,1,365,17,4.29,1216787712385821777),(4219,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216792165548967768','Spacious Midcentury (Open Plan)','Airy, bright midcentury open floorplan. Separate entrance (1 bath, 1 bdrm suite) , newly renovated, 15 min drive to downtown/The Pearl/Lloyd. Custom built-in cabinets, dining area, plank flooring. Kitchenette w/fridge, cooktops, convection oven (No range).  3-4 blocks way (cafes, food cart, bullet bus to downtown. 25min to PDX. Bike room, laundry, huge closets, walk-in tile shower. Street parking is ample. Ppl love N Portland! Adidas, UoP, Kaiser are all close. Great spot! Smart TV, 5G internet.','Arbor Lodge is a North Portland neighborhood that borders the East side of the Williamette. It overlooks the river with great lookout spots overlooking Swan Island and the West Hills. Kenton, Mississippi, Alberta, St. John districts are all within driving distance for going out and/or restaurants, window shopping, etc. <br /><br />Neighborhood stuff:<br />Mee Dee Thai  on N Killingsworth has a fantastic Thai.<br />Madrona Hill Cafe (Greely) and Blend (Killingsworth) both have great coffee.  I like Madrona myself.<br />New Seasons is one mile away just off I-5 and Rosa Parks. Fred Meyer is farther on Interstate/N Lombard.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIxNjc5MjE2NTU0ODk2Nzc2OA%3D%3D/original/84ed2c79-5195-49c3-959e-e750b20703db.jpeg',527520179,51,'45.56925','-122.69962',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,82.00,2,5,11,5.00,1216792165548967768),(4220,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1216792972717587506','Teal & Terra