t Row ~ 97 WalkScore','Perfectly situated just off NE Portland\'s renowned Restaurant Row, our location allows you to walk to some of the city\'s best dining spots. You\'ll also have easy access to top shows, thrift shops, and bars, all just steps away.<br /><br />Recently renovated to create an open, inviting space, our home ensures everyone stays connected—whether you\'re cooking in the spacious kitchen or watching the game on the massive 75\" 4K HDTV. Your Portland experience couldn\'t be better anywhere else!','Nestled in the heart of Portland\'s bustling Eastside, this area is known for its diverse array of attractions, making it an ideal location for visitors seeking a true Portland experience.<br /><br />Just steps from your doorstep, you\'ll find some of Portland\'s most beloved eateries. From cozy cafes and trendy brunch spots to gourmet restaurants and lively food carts, the options are endless. Indulge in a variety of cuisines, whether you\'re craving the famous Voodoo Doughnuts, enjoying a farm-to-table meal at a local bistro, or grabbing a quick bite from one of the many nearby food trucks.<br /><br />The neighborhood is dotted with unique boutiques, vintage stores, and independent shops. Explore the locally-owned businesses and find one-of-a-kind treasures, whether it\'s handmade jewelry, vintage clothing, or quirky home decor. The nearby Hollywood District and Laurelhurst Theater offer additional shopping and entertainment options.<br /><br />For those looking to experience Portland\'s v','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1217642137202561345/original/608af1e1-9d9d-4d42-881c-06d6cc21f543.jpeg',592522307,12,'45.525965644132036','-122.63651095998081',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,138.00,1,365,10,4.80,1217642137202561345),(4228,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1218368397269253120','forested farm retreat- 420 friendly','Come hangout at our little urban forest farm just minutes from downtown Portland and PDX airport. Duck Stack Farms is on beautiful Kelly Butte nature park and we are surrounded by massive doug firs. LGBTQ+ owned and operated, and your room is 420 friendly. Host lives on site in other part of house, you will have your own entrance and bathroom complete with a clawfoot tub- perfect for a good relaxing soak. As a bonus you get to hangout with ducks! Which is basically free therapy if you ask us...','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1218368397269253120/original/10daed40-1ba5-4ccd-91e3-eb1381f77c77.jpeg',23383138,78,'45.49899','-122.5516',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,111.00,1,365,10,4.90,1218368397269253120),(4229,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1218956233080807306','Cute St. John\'s Bungalow','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful North Portland bungalow.  Minutes away from St. John\'s historic downtown shops and amenities, walk to food carts, grocery store, and local coffee.  Enjoy the Pacific Northwest at its best on a hike in nearby Forest Park, or on a stroll through Cathedral or Pier Parks just around the corner.  Take advantage of ample storage in the house, as well as the plentiful garden beds just waiting for a green thumb.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1218956233080807306/original/24bf8415-de16-4680-ad6a-fae5e877e23d.jpeg',19929352,58,'45.59151620691572','-122.73418965114203',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,68.00,31,365,0,1.00,1218956233080807306),(4230,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1219600878630087989','Classic 1920s Alberta Home + 2 Tiny Homes','This historic home, renovated with modern amenities, retains its original charm with hardwood floors, a china hutch, and built-in cabinets. Enjoy natural sunlight and a plush living room. This compound has 2 southwest-themed tiny homes as well. Experience tiny living with modern amenities and comfort. Located in the Alberta Arts District, just steps away from Portland\'s best.','Welcome to the vibrant and eclectic neighborhood surrounding our Airbnb. Located in the heart of the sought-after Concordia district, this area is renowned for its unique blend of historic charm and modern amenities, offering an authentic Portland experience.<br /><br />Just a short walk from your doorstep, you\'ll find the bustling Alberta Arts District, known for its colorful murals, indie boutiques, and a plethora of dining options. Enjoy a leisurely breakfast at the iconic Tin Shed Garden Café or savor a gourmet meal at the award-winning Beast. For a more casual option, visit Pine State Biscuits for some of the best comfort food in town.<br /><br />The neighborhood is a paradise for coffee lovers, with numerous local coffee shops like Case Study Coffee Roasters and Extracto Coffeehouse, where you can enjoy expertly brewed coffee in a cozy atmosphere. If you\'re a fan of craft beer, the nearby McMenamins Kennedy School offers a unique setting in a historic former school, complete with','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1219600878630087989/original/967a7d2c-935c-43a2-aa59-5ae40ede217a.jpeg',592522307,1,'45.55910223988361','-122.63451011060984',1,12,3.00,6.00,6.00,729.00,1,365,2,5.00,1219600878630087989),(4231,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1240643589706788177','Basement apartment near Downtown St. Johns','Entire basement apartment just blocks away from the heart of St. Johns! Shops, grocery stores, restaurants, food trucks, and amenities all within a 15 minute walk. Quick access to Cathedral Park and Forest Park. Entire basement apartment to yourself with separate entrance. 1 bedroom, 1 full sofa bed, and a queen blow up mattress, bathroom with shower, washer/dryer, and kitchenette (microwave, mini fridge, Keurig).  Wii gaming system and access to streaming services.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1240643589706788177/original/43011f06-923d-46c6-8d1f-516bc1724273.jpeg',350073109,58,'45.5921','-122.74233',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,1,3,7,5.00,1240643589706788177),(4232,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1219777428696128193','Bright & Charming Basement Unit','Enjoy a highly-sought after, quiet, yet centrally-located neighborhood, with stylish ambiance in walking distance to the bluff (N.Wilamette)!  Close proximity to the maxrail station (2miles) and walking distance to the bus line.  Need a workout on your travels?  Ride our peloton, rent our paddle boards, or borrow our cruiser bikes!  Pet-friendly with $150 non-refundable fee.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1219777428696128193/original/58f6c7e4-dde2-430c-9ec1-a373dd340d4e.jpeg',8467436,57,'45.578709129735905','-122.72004328985777',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,88.00,30,365,0,1.00,1219777428696128193),(4233,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1219861584902740523','Tiny Portland Retreat','Tiny Portland Oasis<br /><br />Discover a peaceful Tiny House in Brentwood-Darlington. Perfect for long-term stays, this cozy retreat offers a private patio and easy access to Portland\'s best. Book now!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50757309/original/967e6d32-2381-48bf-b7e9-63ffacabfd80.jpeg',9171462,69,'45.4676601747753','-122.59357774629704',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,90,0,1.00,1219861584902740523),(4234,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1220466224892344993','Cute & cozy  bungalow by OHSU/VA','Surrounded by trees and close to downtown, Hillsdale & Multnomah Village, OHSU/VA/Doernbecher, is our shabby chic bungalow that’s hosted many med student and medical professionals over the years. Walk, bike, or easy bus to “the hill”. Grocery, Farmers Market, great running on Terwilliger- all of it is right here. This is a lived in family home and I come back once in a while and mainly work in NYC. Open to non medical professionals but know that is usually who is here. The top floor is for rent.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1134133223599358066/original/1c10067e-c931-4d86-b51f-11d5d5361a18.jpeg',38024828,31,'45.47153216408506','-122.68415478299916',2,1,2.00,1.00,1.00,30.00,30,365,0,1.00,1220466224892344993),(4235,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1221111367183910932','Foxchase Flat 3 with back patio','This Fox Chase Flat is simple, clean, spacious with lots of natural sunlight. Located within a few hundred feet of some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, coffee shops, and markets. Only 10 minutes from Portland airport, 7 miles from the center of downtown.<br />A charming place to make yourself at home, while you explore all that Portland has to offer or just simply work from home.<br />This flat has a style all its own.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-677594422283905769/original/78d798a7-d982-4f54-8263-932c2dcb8edb.jpeg',1213257,1,'45.56277417150557','-122.63386356407602',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,99.00,1,365,10,4.90,1221111367183910932),(4236,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1221362070977376034','Beautiful 2 bedroom SE PDX','We are excited to share our newly furnished private basement guest suite.  Whether you are traveling for business or vacation, or private guest space has all you need to relax and recharge.   We have tenants that live in the main home on the property.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1221362070977376034/original/3ed0efc0-18eb-4f5b-a793-3542dc9405dd.jpeg',504516689,36,'45.4929497','-122.6004152',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,1,365,4,3.25,1221362070977376034),(4237,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1221778226401159917','#StayinMyDistrict Sellwood Coco Rose Retreat','#StayinMyDistrict Sellwood Retreat! This private garden Retreat is located in the heart of Sellwood! Live like a local and experience a vibrant SE Portland neighborhood! Known for its “walkability” and “friendly neighborhood feel”!  Walk (1 block) to local hotspots, nightlife, dining, coffee, & boutique shops, from this comfortably appointed Queen Studio Suite. Relax and enjoy a glass of wine on the private patio. Kitchenette & kitchen amenities, W/D in unit, FREE street parking!','You will find it hard to leave the Coco Rose Retreat, but the eclectic shops, eateries, and nightlife of historic Sellwood will be calling your name. 1-3 blocks in either direction will lead you to food, drink and shopping. The river and local parks are also within walking distance. <br /><br />The Sellwood District is a popular Southeast Portland neighborhood. Historic Sellwood-Moreland boasts an array of shops, vintage vendors and restaurants, as well as a rambling wildlife refuge — all just minutes from downtown.  Sellwood is a popular destination neighborhood located in the City of Portland, situated on the east bank of the Willamette River near the southern tip of Ross Island. The house is located in the heart of everything and one could easily get by without a car and find tons to do within walking distance.<br /><br />The neighborhood offers specialty retail, antiques, grocery and hardware stores, banks, dry cleaners as well as tons of restaurants and a seasonal farmers market a','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1221778226401159917/original/8e9e6c74-7a6b-47fd-bdc4-161fe079e098.jpeg',3142393,20,'45.4673808','-122.6540142',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,57.00,1,28,252,4.90,1221778226401159917),(4238,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1221794988319618798','The Madison Farmhouse ~ Vintage Shops & Espresso','Great food. Craft beer. Pour-over coffee. My apartment is situated in the famous Hawthorne District, neighboring many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants, bars, and vintage shops, and offering some of the best people-watching around.<br /><br />My place is ideal for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers. As a convenient home base within walking distance of the neighborhood hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This vibrant area boasts a Powell\'s bookstore, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more. Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, get messy with wings at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or enjoy a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. The vibrant indie spirit thrives in Hawthorne, with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at the Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of fun, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park atop a dormant volcano ven','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1221794988319618798/original/09a6849e-ff30-41c2-925c-8aa4c9e03766.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.513895033320324','-122.64350076730256',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,82.00,1,365,5,5.00,1221794988319618798),(4239,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1221812710102180049','Warhol Suite ~ Cozy Apartment ~ 92 WalkScore','Experience Portland from this charming 1-bedroom apartment. The bedroom offers playful decor and cozy furnishings, perfect for unwinding after exploring the city. Relax in the inviting living room with a 65” 4K HDTV, or cook up a meal in the fully equipped kitchen. This cozy apartment promises an authentic Portland stay, making it a getaway your friends and family will envy!','Discover the historic neighborhood of Ladd\'s Addition, a charming and picturesque area located in the heart of Southeast Portland. This neighborhood is renowned for its beautiful tree-lined streets, cozy cafes, and quaint shops, all nestled in a peaceful and serene setting.<br /><br />Ladd\'s Addition was developed in the early 20th century and is known for its unique layout, with a central circle surrounded by four diamond-shaped gardens that give the area its distinct character. The neighborhood is also home to several parks, including the popular Colonel Summers Park, which features a playground, basketball court, and plenty of space for picnics and outdoor activities.<br /><br />The architecture in Ladd\'s Addition is a mix of styles, ranging from Craftsman bungalows to Tudor Revivals, with many of the homes featuring beautiful gardens and landscaping. The streets are also adorned with beautiful vintage streetlights, adding to the area\'s historic charm.<br /><br />Beyond its beauty, ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1213127149948400127/original/166d46ae-2415-4431-a73e-ab79d621f1d5.jpeg',592522307,25,'45.50020288435752','-122.64375779855752',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,1,365,4,5.00,1221812710102180049),(4240,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1222074025002548768','Princeton Street Bungalow','Historic bungalow in walkable neighborhood. Enjoy the small town vibe of St Johns without leaving Portland. Home boasts spacious indoor and outdoors living areas with easy access to nearby parks, restaurants, and entertainment.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1222074025002548768/original/0abfc389-eb84-4be6-8a11-8e7d3ad43ba3.jpeg',28882446,42,'45.58594','-122.7477',1,3,1.00,2.00,0.00,0.00,30,30,0,1.00,1222074025002548768),(4241,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1222087807300533546','Walkable, convenient SE PDX Home','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. Enjoy an outdoor patio, bbq grill, off street parking, washer/dryer and more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIyMjA4NzgwNzMwMDUzMzU0Ng%3D%3D/original/587155ac-a860-4676-9e9c-71ffbd33ea43.jpeg',95218588,8,'45.503518847165864','-122.63089561540524',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,94.00,1,365,8,5.00,1222087807300533546),(4242,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1222205010508270083','Cozy Portland Retreat, Views','This 1960s gem has a centralized floor plan which makes it feel both cozy and spacious. Enjoy calming views of the mountains and across the river from the upstairs bedrooms. Be charmed by the kitchen’s original cabinets, vintage drawer liners, and first ever self-cleaning oven range. If you have a young heart or any young persons traveling with you, they will have fun on the airplane teeter totter. Our home is just right for a family and perfect for a lone traveler. Closest house to the airport!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1222205010508270083/original/23f6228f-a07e-49fe-8cb1-bd861c21ba93.jpeg',23709045,66,'45.54484','-122.52034',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,235.00,1,1125,8,4.88,1222205010508270083),(4243,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1222477338564932208','Historic Hafner Haus B&B, Room 3','The Historic Hafner Haus is on the historical registry for the city of Portland. it is a very special house and the most central single family residence to the center of Portland. <br />You’ll be charmed by this very special home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6Mzk2MjcxMzM%3D/original/dc25e76e-012a-4534-add3-cac811b1af9a.jpeg',8207605,44,'45.51484','-122.68682',2,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,68.00,3,365,1,5.00,1222477338564932208),(4244,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1222502624824509913','The Mackenzie','Welcome to The Mackenzie! Picture yourself in this delightful 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom single-family home nestled in the serene Brentwood-Darlington neighborhood of SE Portland. Perfect for a variety of travelers and families, this fully furnished home provides a warm and inviting retreat with all the modern conveniences you need for a comfortable stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIyMjUwMjYyNDgyNDUwOTkxMw%3D%3D/original/731a70c2-e64e-4f30-8aaf-b78c0ccf3cfe.jpeg',47581293,69,'45.46816','-122.592',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,95.00,30,365,0,1.00,1222502624824509913),(4245,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1222676124966714507','Private Stylish Cozy Suite  w/Courtyard','The private attached studio was featured in Portland Monthly Magazine and opens onto its own courtyard with a high-fence and outdoor seating. The studio has contemporary furnishings, floor to ceiling blackout drapery, a huge shower and you will sleep like a baby in the super comfy bed, with quality linens and an assortment of pillows. Easy and ample free parking ...and many little extras you may want while traveling help make your stay pleasant and comfy.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1222676124966714507/original/0b560c69-8746-4498-8548-ad59a991f88b.jpeg',511957285,74,'45.54586650251596','-122.57249059785184',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,59.00,1,7,27,4.85,1222676124966714507),(4246,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223194395056026608','Cozy Scandinavian Loft ~ Espresso & Boutiques','You\'ll have a great time at this comfortable place to stay. It has been tastefully designed from the ground up with purpose at every corner. Experience true comfort at our fresh new home. Fully furnished, with endless amenities and everything you would need.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216708682898039328/original/31ddc207-495f-4095-8a31-4a8a79922bc0.jpeg',592522307,27,'45.53506823496772','-122.69824556135167',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,163.00,1,365,6,4.33,1223194395056026608),(4247,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223199785978002693','Cozy Haven by the Hill - Downtown & OHSU!','Welcome to this stunning apartment. Fully furnished, full amenities and kitchen. Enjoy comfortable living with our 2 bedroom 1 bathroom apartment. Find purpose in every corner and enjoy your stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216739608127973119/original/85d92955-0fe8-43b7-8944-f7d93bd24bed.jpeg',592522307,22,'45.50054','-122.67739',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,163.00,30,365,1,5.00,1223199785978002693),(4248,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223219925668172008','Cozy Urban Rose Residence - Downtown & OHSU!','Enjoy this stunning modern home with a vintage twist. With all the modern amenities and furnishings to make your stay as comfortable as possible, while holding its vintage charm. Find purpose and color in every corner.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216732408482350999/original/673cce65-af66-4d57-959c-df83a6b10efb.jpeg',592522307,22,'45.50148','-122.67651',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,166.00,1,365,6,4.83,1223219925668172008),(4249,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223232439557555472','The Original Portland Mayor Cozy Estate','This unique property is believed to be owned by the original mayor of Portland! Experience the true history and charm of Portland with this stunning and purposefully designed home. Experience true comfort with warmth at every corner.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216721701466015684/original/8b7bc64f-1797-4ebf-9f09-c21e6d9eb116.jpeg',592522307,27,'45.53616187767059','-122.694824014166',1,4,3.00,2.00,2.00,109.00,1,365,4,4.50,1223232439557555472),(4250,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223252192205014352','Fresh & Cozy Belmont Charmer w/ 95 WalkScore','Newly refreshed with updated kitchen, bathroom, and flooring, this Belmont charmer is perfectly situated on Portland\'s Eastside. The best restaurants, bars, and shops are right outside your door. After spending all day exploring, there\'s plenty of room to hang out and relax with a movie. Or perhaps you want to enjoy leftovers from one of the top restaurants next door. It won\'t be hard to envision yourself becoming part of Portlandia after a couple of days here!','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!). Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. Hawthorne boasts a vibrant indie spirit, with plenty of made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park on top of a dormant volcano vent, where you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible panoramic views of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1210187411580734221/original/f35ed44c-c3a8-4298-9ca7-798781e61283.jpeg',592522307,16,'45.51583827715301','-122.62295402800457',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,97.00,1,365,3,5.00,1223252192205014352),(4251,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223962828815418140','Tiny House SW Portland! TreeView','Experience Tiny House living in SW Portland!  Close to downtown, OHSU, Tram, South Waterfront, and more!  <br />This tiny house sits in the back yard area of the main house. It has it\'s own entrance, it\'s private, there is a patio area to hang out with trees.  It\'s perfect for a place to land and explore Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1223962828815418140/original/859a3eb5-5b15-429c-a0a3-9ac5d664c830.jpeg',62203396,22,'45.488897788311526','-122.67740117331672',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,47.00,30,365,1,4.00,1223962828815418140),(4252,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223978383132990686','Beautiful Alameda full ADU!','Full ADU has all your needs covered in beautiful Irvington / Alameda area.  Easy transit to all Portland has to offer, and walking distance to Alberta street.  Ideal for a mid-term rental; come enjoy this turn-key walk-in property!<br /><br />ADU is the full ground floor or a 4 year old stylish custom home; includes full bath, full kitchen, living room, bedroom, closet space, (new) washer/dryer in unit.  Utilities included in price.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1223978383132990686/original/d2b2dd0f-aed7-481b-9a42-db66fb050a1a.png',3236741,6,'45.5551715','-122.6431855',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,69.00,30,120,0,1.00,1223978383132990686),(4253,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1223989476410297130','Bright and Comfy Urban Retreat','Tucked into a quiet SE neighborhood, and yet well-connected, our home is an excellent place from which you can experience all that the Rose City has to offer any time of year.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE2MTYxMTIzMzExOTY3Njg4NQ%3D%3D/original/5777f527-1e68-44b7-bb8b-11126e00d282.jpeg',383472892,36,'45.497084901330396','-122.60451960559641',1,2,2.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,2,14,5,5.00,1223989476410297130),(4254,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1224063362163721666','The Jennifer','Welcome to The Jennifer! Imagine yourself living in this beautifully restored 4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom historic home, located in the charming Nob Hill neighborhood of Portland, OR. This fully furnished property offers a unique blend of historic charm and modern luxury, making it an ideal choice for corporate executives, professionals, and families seeking a temporary yet luxurious home.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1224063362163721666/original/e2246d0c-a5f3-437f-a5c4-629d32dde6e4.jpeg',47581293,27,'45.528991757761915','-122.69686339254213',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,300.00,30,365,0,1.00,1224063362163721666),(4255,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1224245354362400522','Meadowlark Suite - 201 2B1B','Welcome to our charming 2-bedroom loft suite nestled in the vibrant heart of Portland\'s Inner East Side! With an unbeatable location and a perfect blend of modern comfort and urban style, this loft is the ideal base for your Portland adventure.<br /><br />Important Information for Your Stay<br /><br />VioletSuitesPDX is an unhosted boutique hotel. It is vital that guests review the check-in instructions prior to arrival to ensure a smooth and enjoyable stay.','Situated within walking distance to numerous well-regarded restaurants, performance venues, and activities, the Buckman neighborhood is a hub of cultural and culinary experiences. The Buckman neighborhood\'s proximity to a variety of well-regarded restaurants makes it a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll find a diverse range of dining options, from trendy cafes serving artisanal coffee and pastries to upscale eateries offering farm-to-table cuisine. International flavors are also abundant, with a mix of ethnic restaurants that cater to a wide range of tastes. For those interested in arts and entertainment, the Buckman neighborhood is a treat. There are theaters, music venues, and performance spaces nearby where you can catch live music, theater productions, comedy shows, and more. One of the standout features of the Buckman neighborhood is its walkability. Being within walking distance to so many amenities means that visitors can easily access grocery stores, parks, fitness centers, and othe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1224245354362400522/original/fb04c361-22a7-4f98-9285-f4037b9756a4.jpeg',534173163,32,'45.5163047','-122.6519507',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,321.00,1,365,2,5.00,1224245354362400522),(4256,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1224656437314056242','Buckman Bliss: Quiet Oasis Near Portland\'s Pulse','As a Portland native, I guarantee our location provides the quintessential visitor experience. You\'ll be amidst parks, bars, and eateries, yet nestled in a peaceful, safe neighborhood. Dive into Portland\'s vibrant life or retreat to a tranquil haven when needed. Embrace the city\'s unique mix of natural beauty and architectural charm - Welcome to the best of the Pacific Northwest!','The Buckman Neighborhood is incredible. Within walking distance you will find some of the hottest shopping districts and commercial areas Portland has to offer, but it\'s on a quiet street tucked right outside of all the noise. Close by areas includes Burnside, Belmont, Hawthorne, and Division. You can also take a beautiful walk over the Burnside Bridge to get to Downtown Portland and/or NW Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1224656437314056242/original/218b7624-fc17-4127-b2e3-7d5614a80cd7.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.52189892228637','-122.65219374850668',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,89.00,1,365,0,1.00,1224656437314056242),(4257,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1226793510635392748','Luxury Apartment in Central Pearl 6a','The whole group will enjoy easy access to everything from this centrally located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-955646206468099120/original/28368d36-a8e5-4b72-8614-048cd36b998d.jpeg',531225529,2,'45.52346','-122.68394',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,177.00,1,365,11,5.00,1226793510635392748),(4258,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1226916273646198687','St. John\'s Oasis','This 1 bedroom 1 bathroom daylight basement unit with ground level entrance offers tons of natural light, a private entrance & backyard, parking spot & gas fire stove. Located on a sleepy street that dead ends at Pier Park. Outside your door is access to a huge public green space with towering trees, public pool, disc golf course, skate park & more! Blocks away from downtown St. John\'s where you can find many fun bars, restaurants, a farmers market & grocery stores.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1226916273646198687/original/82654a2e-ddc9-4d6f-9c6d-0a4fcb0dabdf.jpeg',69442902,58,'45.598509944629164','-122.7518097637249',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,1226916273646198687),(4259,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1226959758389056548','NEW - Skylight Guesthouse','Step into our brand-new, 500 sqft apartment—the perfect home base for your visit to Portland. Location can\'t be beat: Nestled in the vibrant heart of SE, this cozy retreat is walkable to all the fun on Hawthorne and SE Division: myriad dining options, shopping, and the natural beauty of Mt. Tabor Park. Our unit offers the very best of city living. This private space features vaulted ceilings and oversized skylights that infuse it with natural light all year round. All are welcome here!','We are located in the heart of Richmond, in beautiful SE Portland. An easy walk to both SE Hawthorne and SE Division Streets, plus the gorgeous woods and views at Mt. Tabor Park.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1226959758389056548/original/20cb3a8f-be0a-42d8-96cd-1d24b494d072.jpeg',108509736,8,'45.505233627178455','-122.61318342630383',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,120.00,2,30,12,4.92,1226959758389056548),(4260,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1227222193025681045','The Modern Bungalow of Beaumont','Welcome to our newly remodeled sanctuary located in the heart of the historic Beaumont-Wilshire neighborhood of Portland, Oregon. This delightful 2BR 2BA home is a beacon of modern comfort and timeless charm right in the city\'s northeast section. Inside our beautifully appointed space, you\'ll discover a seamless blend of contemporary style and traditional elegance that will make you feel at home. It is also a short walk to the boutiques, restaurants, coffee shops, and more along Fremont Street.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1227222193025681045/original/1fd638bb-5739-4725-a3be-66bd54cfb8ee.jpeg',592522307,21,'45.54936','-122.60371',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,91.00,1,365,9,4.33,1227222193025681045),(4261,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1227476106352710014','Gorgeous 1BR Apt in the heart of Downtown PDX','Welcome to The City of Roses and the Downtown Pearl District. Stay at a beautifully upgraded Flexcation apartment with free parking included for long-term stays and all the amenities you need! The apartments are ideal for a quiet escape and are not suitable for events, parties or groups. There is 24/7 security in the building to ensure the health, wellbeing, and safety of all guests.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light