231984266379296924','Alberta Arts Gem! Fenced Yard','Welcome to our charming home, nestled in the vibrant Alberta Arts District. This beautiful space is perfect for those seeking a cozy yet lively Portland experience, surrounded by the city’s renowned arts, culture, and culinary delights.<br /><br />**Prime Location**<br />Situated just a short walk from some of the best restaurants, cafes, and shops in Portland, you’ll have no shortage of dining options and local boutiques to explore.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1231984266379296924/original/08b8390d-7481-4c8a-bd99-962c6eb98493.jpeg',61699098,1,'45.55902','-122.63463',1,7,1.50,3.00,4.00,159.00,30,365,0,1.00,1231984266379296924),(4279,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1232043523557527717','Wonderful Rare Burlingame Escape, Wooded Patio,','Welcome to South Burlingame Hideaway, a serene retreat nestled in a quiet neighborhood just under four miles from downtown Portland. This charming home offers the perfect balance of urban convenience and tranquil relaxation, making it an ideal base for your Pacific Northwest adventures.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1232043523557527717/original/88bb2c01-3b01-42d0-b044-86fc85795fc5.jpeg',62261998,28,'45.46522642316508','-122.68171321300859',1,8,3.00,4.00,4.00,233.00,2,29,6,5.00,1232043523557527717),(4280,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1232105424125404207','Cute Bungalow - sleeps up to 6!','Cozy two bedroom, one bathroom house. <br />Located in the University Park District of North Portland, across the street from Portsmouth Park and 5 blocks from the University of Portland. <br />Close to grocery store, food carts/restaurants.<br />2 blocks off of Lombard St.<br />Quiet neighborhood with plenty of street parking.<br />Sleeps up to six people, with a living room futon sofa that converts into a queen size bed.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIzMjEwNTQyNDEyNTQwNDIwNw%3D%3D/original/60450252-