 Seasons market. Or you can jump into your car and get to the vibrant Alberta street in just a 5-minute drive.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1232767742748755582/original/69768470-9174-484c-9435-6f572f5267de.jpeg',531286691,21,'45.56351757687725','-122.60758419732385',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,40.00,1,1125,1,5.00,1232767742748755582),(4284,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1232866371654620458','Walkable in hipster SE Portland','My neighborhood is everything great about Portland, walkable to so many cool restaurants and shops, surprisingly quiet with a sweet clean park at the end of the block with a playground and tons of space for picnics. The location is everything, I can’t even really begin to describe it but it’s the reason I live here! <br />I’m just getting this listing up after having rented it as an apartment for years but everyone tells me I should air B and B because of my location so I’m giving it a shot!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1232866371654620458/original/2055af93-18f1-40ec-8e6b-03523f710db1.jpeg',5504418,8,'45.5112538285051','-122.63253271579742',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,136.00,2,90,1,5.00,1232866371654620458),(4285,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1232932892260980403','Perfect SE Portland Retreat','Nestled in the heart of inner Southeast Portland, this location offers an abundance of restaurants, bars, and activities within walking distance. When you’re not exploring the vibrant neighborhood, enjoy the open and spacious layout of the home, ensuring a comfortable and relaxing stay.','Welcome to the vibrant and eclectic neighborhood of Southeast Portland! Your Airbnb places you in the heart of the dynamic and culturally rich area of Eastmoreland, offering a perfect blend of urban energy and residential charm.<br /><br />Just a short walk from your doorstep, you’ll find the bustling Division Street, known for its diverse range of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, trendy bars, and unique boutiques. Enjoy a meal at local favorites like Ava Gene’s or Pok Pok, grab a coffee at Stumptown Coffee Roasters, or indulge in some sweet treats at Salt & Straw.<br /><br />For those who love the outdoors, the beautiful and expansive Reed College campus and Crystal Springs Rhododendron Garden are nearby, providing picturesque settings for a leisurely stroll or a peaceful afternoon. Additionally, the nearby Eastmoreland Golf Course offers a scenic spot for golf enthusiasts.<br /><br />The neighborhood is also home to a variety of community parks, including Kenilworth Park and Berkel','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1232932892260980403/original/e3c90f27-a9c9-4550-b91b-fa150df7974d.jpeg',592522307,61,'45.48964','-122.63745',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,94.00,1,365,4,4.00,1232932892260980403),(4286,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1233496154040528851','Shabby Chic Studio Retreat w/ Courtyard view','Welcome to your perfect Portland getaway! This charming ground-level studio is located in a historic mansion, offering a unique blend of Shabby Chic decor and modern comfort. With a spacious open layout, the studio features a cozy bedroom area with a wardrobe and TV, a full kitchen, and a comfortable living room—all seamlessly connected. The cement floors are beautifully accented with plush carpets, giving the space a stylish yet cozy vibe.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIzMzQ5NjE1NDA0MDUyODg1MQ%3D%3D/original/df1c35e8-c7be-4b2a-bc67-174f058362de.jpeg',577541645,61,'45.4896','-122.63855',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,99.00,2,365,6,4.83,1233496154040528851),(4287,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1233604485923195402','New Build Modern Lux Apartment: Walkable Location!','Experience an unforgettable stay in this luxurious apartment ideally situated for exploring the very best of Portland. You\'ll be just a short stroll away from shops, bars, restaurants, boutiques, local food carts, New Seasons market, Irving Park, and the city\'s charming streets.<br /><br />Every detail has been thought through. Whether you’re eager to discover all that Portland has to offer, seeking a peaceful getaway, or looking for a work-friendly base in a new city, you’ll find exactly what you need.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1233604485923195402/original/ed70287f-9e38-43c8-88ba-7465a2089010.jpeg',582763053,26,'45.5479934673716','-122.6616942604046',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,140.00,1,1125,19,5.00,1233604485923195402),(4288,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1234069767311563780','5 Star-Apartment Live Like Hotel','Entire Condo Unit. NE Portland. Lives Like A 5-Star Hotel. LOCATION.<br />The apartment unit functions like an upmarket Hotel Suite! <br />Open, light filled design. Timber beams, Industrial chic.<br />Large 92 SF terrace. <br />Washer and Dryer in unit. <br />Free On Street Parking<br />Pet Friendly. Under 20 pounds pet rule<br /><br />**Early check in/Late checkout can typically be accommodated if request in advance***<br /><br />***This Listing Only Allows Guests to Book for 30 Day Plus . As Per Portland Regulations.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1234069767311563780/original/d87b396d-f48a-405b-9f91-d5489d01d4fd.jpeg',485364133,24,'45.554614315432424','-122.67416599020109',1,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,0.00,5,30,1,5.00,1234069767311563780),(4289,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1234432098310812080','Spacious Cozy 2BR in SW Portland','Experience comfort and convenience in our spacious 2BR apartment just 10 minutes from downtown Portland. Enjoy the entire unit with two cozy bedrooms and an open-concept living area. The master bedroom features a queen bed, while the second bedroom offers two double beds and a single bed for flexible sleeping arrangements. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, private backyard, and comfortable living space. Perfect for families, couples, or business travelers seeking seeking a relaxing stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1234432098310812080/original/db9460b1-15ce-4249-94cd-ce019a24e209.jpeg',587095918,53,'45.4485512','-122.7251835',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,99.00,2,365,4,4.25,1234432098310812080),(4290,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1234990533159561901','Cedarbrook Apt on Fanno Creek','Prime Location! Stunning Cedarbrook Furnished Short-Term Apartment Near Hillsdale and Multnomah Village on Fanno Creek<br />Our beautiful townhouse apartment is ideally situated in an excellent location close to both Hillsdale and Multnomah Village.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1234990533159561901/original/398223ad-0287-4a09-a29b-ff7629677f12.jpeg',9829273,70,'45.4865749','-122.7224689',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,365,0,1.00,1234990533159561901),(4291,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1235031588343228891','Hipster Vibe Apartment - Food Carts & Live Music','Welcome to the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and find endless restaurants, coffee shops, bars, and more just blocks away. With so many options, you\'ll always have something to do and new places to explore.<br /><br />When it\'s time to relax, enjoy the massive 4K HDTV or cook a meal in the spacious kitchen. Whether you\'re a solo traveler or on a romantic getaway, this is the perfect retreat in the heart of PDX. Enjoy the vibrant neighborhood, modern amenities, and the charm of Portland living.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1235031588343228891/original/5eb44cc6-a177-42c1-9de2-e50480efb328.jpeg',592522307,9,'45.553523671715006','-122.67695148175677',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,1,365,14,4.79,1235031588343228891),(4292,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1235587499101413291','Stunning Home in Concordia','A stylish retreat close to the trendy restaurants and shops of the Alberta area.  Great central location, close to Columbia River Gorge, Mount Hood and the Oregon Coast.<br /><br />The apartment benefits from a lovely open plan dining living area, generous kitchen and two bedrooms. One bedroom is a beautiful king room and the other is a twin room (with a trundle twin setup). There’s also a generous bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1235587499101413291/original/ddc91f91-54fd-494b-adc1-cdb83a0ab314.jpeg',471976098,1,'45.57226','-122.63883',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,106.00,2,365,5,5.00,1235587499101413291),(4293,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237135028233204841','Luxurious Alphabet District Home - 99 Walk Score','Location, location, location! A walker’s paradise with a walk score of 99, our 1600 sq ft home is fully equipped with brand new stainless steel appliances, blazing WiFi, and can sleep up to 4 guests comfortably.<br /><br />Our charming, yet modern and updated home is located Alberta Arts, Historic Mississippi Ave, the Pearl, and Downtown PDX!<br /><br />THIS LISTING IS ONLY 2 BDS/1BTH.','Welcome to the heart of Portland’s vibrant Alphabet District! This Airbnb places you in one of the city’s most desirable neighborhoods, known for its unique blend of historic charm and modern amenities.<br /><br />Just steps from your door, you’ll find a diverse array of top-rated restaurants, cozy cafes, trendy bars, and independent boutiques. Whether you’re craving a gourmet meal, a casual coffee, or a craft cocktail, NW 21st Avenue has something to satisfy every palate. Be sure to explore popular local favorites like Salt & Straw for artisanal ice cream, Ken’s Artisan Bakery for delicious pastries, and McMenamins Blue Moon Tavern for a quintessential Portland pub experience.<br /><br />The neighborhood’s walkability is second to none, with a walk score of 99, making it easy to explore on foot. For shopping enthusiasts, the nearby Pearl District offers high-end shops and galleries, while NW 23rd Avenue is lined with charming stores and eclectic shops.<br /><br />Nature lovers will ap','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237135028233204841/original/b33a111b-d244-4641-9e71-47db3a39a384.jpeg',419668128,27,'45.52606588278976','-122.69587746038326',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,270.00,1,365,4,5.00,1237135028233204841),(4294,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237192279478230378','Cozy Rocky Butte Guest House','Nestled at the base of Rocky Butte, our home is a peaceful, tranquil escape from city life. Within walking distance of one of my favorite Portland landmarks, the Rocky Butte viewpoint, the neighborhood offers lots of trails, several nearby parks, a zen meditation center/garden that is always offering classes, and a wide array of tasty food within a short driving distance. We\'re a ten minute drive to the airport, and a ten minute drive to downtown PDX','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237192279478230378/original/625d4123-0a14-4b6e-b632-a2f1b40551df.jpeg',148150029,74,'45.54433','-122.57156',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,80.00,30,90,0,1.00,1237192279478230378),(4295,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237283494486085593','Willamette Park Bungalow','Welcome to the Willamette Park Cottage, a calming retreat nestled steps from Willamette Park (and its playground, tennis courts, boat launch, dock, soccer fields, and trail all the way to NW Portland!). Walk a few feet to Fulton Pub (a McMenamin’s restaurant), St. Honoré Boulangerie, or to one of the many Thai, Hawaiian, or Chinese restaurants. You are minutes from OHSU’s Marquam Hill and Waterfront campuses and less than 10 minutes from downtown Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237283494486085593/original/1cfcfe8d-8481-45b1-b6ff-46c416fb3fd4.jpeg',51025954,22,'45.47659','-122.67517',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,199.00,30,45,0,1.00,1237283494486085593),(4296,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237315060543630260','Historic PDX Home - Sleeps 10, Perfect Location','If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. This historic home (built in 1906) takes its place among Burnside\'s many photogenic charmers. Inside this worldly three-bedroom home you\'ll find period details like rich hardwoods and sunny windows combine with a minimalist, serene design for pure relaxation. When you\'re good and zen, head out to explore Burnsides\'s \"foodie row\" with some of the best restaurants in PDX at your doorstep','Across the Willamette River from downtown, this area blends industrial Portland with new restaurants, microbreweries and riverside recreation.<br /><br />Criss-crossed with train tracks and lined with old industrial factories, some of Portland’s favorite restaurants, boutiques and events call the Central Eastside home. Read on for our recommended things to do and see in Portland’s Central Eastside.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237315060543630260/original/584d2c61-8b3a-439b-88e7-a67418f31184.jpeg',592522307,12,'45.523820102833824','-122.65536406167064',1,10,2.00,3.00,5.00,337.00,1,365,12,4.83,1237315060543630260),(4297,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237329559188991658','Southwest Hills Estates','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237329559188991658/original/313ac768-e837-413f-8154-9d89d2476683.jpeg',49270200,54,'45.505175568159','-122.69346896140863',1,7,3.00,4.00,4.00,200.00,30,365,0,1.00,1237329559188991658),(4298,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237747217992575503','Guesthouse in the Garden - Alberta Arts District','Enjoy a stay at this peaceful ~300 sq ft guest house located in the middle of the Alberta Arts District. Private entrance and entire place to yourself, no shared walls.<br /><br />Short stroll to great restaurants, art galleries, and shops.<br /><br />One block from Salt n Straw and several coffee shops. Great brunch, lunch, and dinner options all within walking distance.<br /><br />Plenty of free street parking available nearby.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237747217992575503/original/0bfc2db1-8d48-4e43-a4a4-fb39bb3cf56d.jpeg',25618931,29,'45.560039408294266','-122.64519363068847',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,98.00,1,25,11,4.91,1237747217992575503),(4299,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1237881584088279184','PDX Retreat: Kid & Dog Friendly!','Nestled in Portland\'s vibrant Woodstock neighborhood, this charming 2-bedroom home offers privacy and tranquility just steps from local bars, restaurants, parks, and cafes. Perfect for families with kids (4+) and dogs, it features a fully fenced backyard with a swingset, making it an ideal base whether you\'re with friends, family, and/or your dogs. Get the best of city and peaceful relaxation. Enjoy the best of Portland from this cozy, well-maintained retreat.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1237881584088279184/original/4025ea27-a4fb-48d3-b646-b4ab450a18d8.jpeg',9966834,38,'45.480268286623044','-122.61354883288409',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,195.00,1,29,16,5.00,1237881584088279184),(4300,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1238632268461810857','Peaceful and centrally located!','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place, with everything you need!  Full kitchen, separate bedroom, washer dryer, sunny garden apartment, right across the street from Jam (best breakfast in portland!) Grand central Bakery, and year round farmers produce market.  Only steps to some of Portland\'s best restaurants and shops, and no more than a 5 min Uber ride to just about anywhere else in Portland, you can\'t be this location!  Very private and quiet spot to unwind..','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1238632268461810857/original/04d16c69-775f-45e0-a5d1-a2755eaed247.jpeg',3903828,25,'45.51156','-122.64312',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,2,365,9,5.00,1238632268461810857),(4301,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1238797311320110365','Elegant & Airy 3BR/2BA in NE-Portland','This lovely apartment is in the heart of it all when it comes to NE Portland! Think steps to some of the best shopping districts such as Mississippi Ave, Alberta Arts, Williams, and MLK. Enjoy an eclectic array of bars, restaurants, shops, and cultures as all NE Portland has to offer is within arm’s reach of this magnificent property touting a WalkScore of 93.','This apartment is located smack dab in the center of NE Portland. Within blocks you can be at any of the sought after shopping districts in the city such as the Alberta Arts District, Mississippi Ave, MLK, and Williams Ave. Hip and Trendy restaurants, bars, cafes, and food carts are all within steps of this apartment boasting a Walk Score of 92!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-28249015/original/4d74c477-053e-4e6e-b6b4-22ad526f6dfa.jpeg',213363744,14,'45.55094554293126','-122.65971757558412',1,7,2.00,3.00,3.00,168.00,1,365,0,1.00,1238797311320110365),(4302,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1238819120342037491','Skyline Sanctuary','Spacious modern lower-level two-bedroom condo with great views, hot tub, Sauna, balcony seating, yard, dog-friendly.<br /><br />Luxurious hilltop private retreat in upscale Portland neighborhood with stunning views, private hot tub and sauna, and enclosed yard. Inside, enjoy a stylish living room with fireplace, dining, fully equipped kitchen, and 3 modern full bathrooms, featuring high-quality linens, central AC, and 3 smart TVs. Minutes from Forest Park, Oregon Zoo, and downtown Portland attractions.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1238819120342037491/original/36001e2f-356b-435d-b225-5b7fc5297448.jpeg',471402019,81,'45.537115531132955','-122.75956347584726',1,5,3.00,2.00,2.00,188.00,1,1125,0,1.00,1238819120342037491),(4303,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1239012635074051037','Peaceful Room in Alberta Arts Hostel','Peaceful home in vibrant Alberta Arts neighborhood! <br /><br />Art galleries, boutiques, and parks just are steps away, and the bus stop across the street makes it easy to explore the rest of Portland, including downtown attractions like the Portland Art Museum and Powell\'s Books. <br /><br />This charming home features a fully equipped kitchen, comfortable living room, and high-speed WiFi so you can stay connected and work remotely if needed.<br /><br />Book now and experience the best of Alberta Arts and beyond!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1239012635074051037/original/8c48ed5c-5708-4788-a8af-7eb9485eab6a.jpeg',501715,6,'45.55720465835114','-122.64938469976187',2,1,4.00,1.00,1.00,41.00,30,365,1,4.00,1239012635074051037),(4304,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1239453790911121517','Classic 1920s Alberta Two Bedroom Haven','This historic home has been renovated with modern amenities but still shows the original character with refinished hardwood floors, the original china hutch, and built-in cabinets. Wake up to natural sunlight and watch TV in the plush living room.<br /><br />You will have access to the entire house, but will only use two bedrooms.  We use a secure lockbox on site that will help with checking in. You’ll receive the lock box code in the booking confirmation.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1217614282017083094/original/9dab4692-76d9-456b-b219-71c3053c6407.jpeg',592522307,1,'45.558392364154344','-122.63483902722254',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,122.00,1,365,1,5.00,1239453790911121517),(4305,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1239468899417584498','Downtown Portland Condo','Downtown Condo 100 transit score 99 walk score. Centrally located, walking distance to the Civic Stadium, 23rd street restaurants and shops the Pearl District and much more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIzOTQ2ODg5OTQxNzU4NDQ5OA%3D%3D/original/8a1032e0-4175-4be0-89eb-6c3a40a8c422.jpeg',650485628,27,'45.52346568712731','-122.68773509694648',1,2,1.00,0.00,2.00,44.00,31,180,0,1.00,1239468899417584498),(4306,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1239523162116197460','Bohemian Hideaway','Bohemian Sophistication in Portland','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1239523162116197460/original/7cfbad3d-9577-47a2-b8a0-9c27972fad8c.jpeg',455398,13,'45.55989','-122.68291',1,5,2.00,2.00,5.00,141.00,2,27,4,5.00,1239523162116197460),(4307,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1239856929796009810','Modern Living - Big Views','This hip, modern 2-bedroom home (1 king, I full and 1 queen) with a bonus room offers not just comfort and style, but breathtaking views of four stunning mountains and Sauvie Island.  Bright and airy living room with floor-to-ceiling windows that frame the panoramic mountain views. Fully equipped gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances, quartz countertops, and a large peninsula, perfect for cooking and entertaining.  The owners bedroom is locked and inaccessible to Airbnb guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1239856929796009810/original/0651e87f-290f-4d54-88bb-45797b11aafa.jpeg',5722606,89,'45.6153976188161','-122.80620017515963',1,5,2.50,2.00,3.00,160.00,4,90,2,5.00,1239856929796009810),(4308,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1239968908809107398','Alberta Arts Mid Century Cottage','This Mid Century Modest home is tasteful and classic. Only walking distance from the Alberta Rose and the strip\'s bustling restaurants and boutique shops.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Ho