l circle surrounded by four diamond-shaped gardens that give the area its distinct character. The neighborhood is also home to several parks, including the popular Colonel Summers Park, which features a playground, basketball court, and plenty of space for picnics and outdoor activities.<br /><br />The architecture in Ladd\'s Addition is a mix of styles, ranging from Craftsman bungalows to Tudor Revivals, with many of the homes featuring beautiful gardens and landscaping. The streets are also adorned with beautiful vintage streetlights, adding to the area\'s historic charm.<br /><br />Beyond its beauty, ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-604388791863005484/original/7fcfaa9a-58ba-46ea-8637-e0bf27983af5.jpeg',291835749,56,'45.49827','-122.6435',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,72.00,30,365,7,4.86,1240279063303126251),(4311,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1240286414840269075','Golden Age of Hollywood Apartment ~ 92 WalkScore','Discover the heart of Portland in this charming 1-bedroom apartment. Enjoy playful decor and relax in comfort after a day of adventure. Located in a central area, you can easily explore the city\'s bustling neighborhoods and attractions(closely located to Clinton and Division). Sink into the plush couch and watch your favorite shows on the 65\" 4K HDTV. Make your stay in Portland unforgettable with a stay in this cozy apartment - your friends and family will envy your \"real\" Portland experience!','Discover the historic neighborhood of Ladd\'s Addition, a charming and picturesque area located in the heart of Southeast Portland. This neighborhood is renowned for its beautiful tree-lined streets, cozy cafes, and quaint shops, all nestled in a peaceful and serene setting.<br /><br />Ladd\'s Addition was developed in the early 20th century and is known for its unique layout, with a central circle surrounded by four diamond-shaped gardens that give the area its distinct character. The neighborhood is also home to several parks, including the popular Co