 streets are also adorned with beautiful vintage streetlights, adding to the area\'s historic charm.<br /><br />Beyond its beauty, ','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-840061543621249858/original/4bacdd2e-6b55-46bb-b8f6-74c9ce51de5e.jpeg',291835749,56,'45.49839','-122.64394',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,89.00,1,365,3,5.00,1241385813063968060),(4314,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1241395384419717120','Ladd\'s Addition Bohemian Paradise ~ 95 WalkScore','Located on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, my place is perfectly situated in a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll be within walking distance to the vibrant food carts on Hawthorne and the top-rated restaurants on Division. Every meal will be a delight, with the only challenge being which fantastic spot to try first! The tastefully updated apartment is equipped with everything you need to make your time in Portland truly amazing.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s culinary and cultural scene, commonly known as “Foodie Row.” Nestled in the vibrant Hawthorne/Buckman District, you\'ll find yourself within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This lively area is home to Powell\'s Books, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49641575/original/97a33d33-c458-4fb6-a86a-79eaf9ee1fef.jpeg',88253867,25,'45.507351530485536','-122.6544409035491',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,71.00,1,365,12,4.83,1241395384419717120),(4315,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1241401230164040982','BoHo Oasis in Ladd\'s Addition with 2 Beds','Located on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, my place is perfectly situated in a food lover\'s paradise. You\'ll be within walking distance to the vibrant food carts on Hawthorne and the top-rated restaurants on Division. Every meal will be a delight, with the only challenge being which fantastic spot to try first! The tastefully updated apartment is equipped with everything you need to make your time in Portland truly amazing.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s culinary and cultural scene, commonly known as “Foodie Row.” Nestled in the vibrant Hawthorne/Buckman District, you\'ll find yourself within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This lively area is home to Powell\'s Books, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-49853280/original/e263c739-dc72-4c7e-a9ac-cc6d58bcc030.jpeg',88253867,25,'45.50519306414952','-122.65384056249125',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,79.00,1,365,3,5.00,1241401230164040982),(4316,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1241408666649780667','1892 Bohemian Dream Studio in Ladd\'s Addition','Located right on the edge of Ladd\'s Addition, this spot is a foodie\'s paradise. Walk to the food carts on Hawthorne or the top-rated restaurants on Division, ensuring every meal is a delight. Your biggest challenge will be deciding which amazing place to try first! This tastefully updated apartment has everything you need to make your time in Portland truly exceptional.','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s culinary and cultural scene, commonly known as “Foodie Row.” Nestled in the vibrant Hawthorne/Buckman District, you\'ll find yourself within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors—no chain restaurants here! This lively area is home to Powell\'s Books, Blue Star Donuts, music venues, and much more.<br /><br />Indulge in vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, savor the wings around the corner at Fire on the Mountain, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for an elegant evening at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn’t just for foodies. The Hawthorne area boasts a vibrant indie spirit with numerous made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore. Immerse yourself in this hipster haven by catching a movie at the Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-50091923/original/3da125e7-0efe-424f-b452-3a51b3dce2a9.jpeg',88253867,25,'45.50694','-122.65453',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,71.00,1,365,4,5.00,1241408666649780667),(4317,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1242142860300496745','Private 1br Unit in SW Portland','Welcome to your cozy 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom retreat in a quiet, safe neighborhood. Part of a garden cottage 4-plex, this unit features a bright and spacious living area, a comfortable bedroom, and a well-equipped kitchen and bathroom. Relax on the patio surrounded by beautiful greenery. Conveniently located near Lewis and Clark College, Tryon Creek Park, OHSU, hiking trails, shops, and restaurants, and just 10 minutes to downtown from this peaceful escape.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1242142860300496745/original/422053d2-8f03-4bbd-9a63-e3acb1c3f214.jpeg',117337305,49,'45.45947172703511','-122.68323253583772',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,62.00,30,365,1,5.00,1242142860300496745),(4318,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1242335315210541357','Sun-Filled 2-Bed Hawthorne Apt','My place is a pedestrian\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 98/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. My private and spacious two-bedroom apartment sits in a historic building at the heart of the eclectic SE Hawthorne District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0MjMzNTMxNTIxMDU0MTM1Nw%3D%3D/original/d4f04d44-09b1-411f-ac3d-875145a6aa67.jpeg',132746867,16,'45.51325527493305','-122.62820227694544',1,5,1.00,2.00,4.00,68.00,1,360,5,4.80,1242335315210541357),(4319,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1242865286651385624','Martha\'s Haven','A quiet home with a nice backyard, very near many wonderful restaurants, cafes, and bars. Tranquil accommodations in the center of the Alberta Arts District.  My cat, Miss Martha, is friendly, and enjoys time in the fenced yard.  If you have a cat allergy, this space would not be a good fit.   LGBT-friendly!. Transgender Owned and Operated.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1242865286651385624/original/f18031f0-a85c-4fe0-a464-ef173301805f.jpeg',591868335,29,'45.5620329','-122.6470059',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,2,28,0,1.00,1242865286651385624),(4320,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1242914036702684229','Portland Vibes | Hiking. Free Breakfast','Stay within walking distance of downtown Portland’s famous parks, museums and street markets at Hyatt House Portland Downtown Hotel.','▶ Activities and cultural attractions <br />—  Cannon Beach  – 1 h 31 min drive <br />—  Cooper Mountain Nature Parks – 31 min drive <br />—  Portland Japanese Gardens – 14 min drive <br />—  Pumpkin Ridge Golf Club – 29 min drive <br />—  The Reserve Vineyards and Golf Club – 33 min drive <br />—  Forest Park Lower Macleay Trail – 16 min drive <br />—  Pittock Mansion – 17 min drive <br />—  Multnomah Falls – 40 min drive <br /> <br />▶ Places to eat and drink  <br />—  H Bar – at the hotel <br />—  Portland Sports Bar and Grill – 1 min drive/ 3 min walk <br />—  McCormick & Schmick’s Harborside Restaurant – 2 min drive/ 3 min walk <br />—  Il Terrazzo – 2  min drive/ 5 min walk <br />—  Little River Cafe – 2 min drive/ 5 min walk <br />—  Dough Zone Dumpling House – 1 min drive/ 1 min walk <br /> <br />▶ Places to visit <br />—  Oregon Zoo – 10 min drive <br />—  Patricia Reser Center for the Arts – 17 min drive <br />—  Cooper Mountain Vineyards  – 28 min drive <br />—  Portland Art','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1242914036702684229/original/ab0a466f-434e-40c7-9a75-499f0d50c70f.png',567081251,44,'45.50678334884094','-122.6745636533337',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,1,365,0,1.00,1242914036702684229),(4321,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/12