ouch for overflow guests this is the perfect getaway in the heart of the cities inner east side!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1243832095162234555/original/c1d42083-db56-4e3b-9961-263c170eefa5.jpeg',501414071,14,'45.56278897676917','-122.66143374631987',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,131.00,30,365,0,1.00,1243832095162234555),(4326,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1244006942797208024','Cute & Cozy Apt. in the Pearl','Modern one-bedroom apartment with top-notch kitchen appliances, a walk-in closet, in-unit washer and dryer, plus building amenities including a rooftop deck with BBQ grill, lounge area, and a gym.<br />Located in the vibrant Pearl District, this apartment is steps away from shopping, brewerys, and a plethora of dining options. Plus, easy access to public transportation for seamless commutes to exploring the city. There\'s always something new to discover in the Pearl.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0NDAwNjk0Mjc5NzIwODAyNA%3D%3D/original/6d7e90c0-15c0-4a3f-8e79-66303a5b5b64.jpeg',426638857,2,'45.53126063790125','-122.68295377092453',1,6,1.00,1.00,2.00,122.00,1,29,1,2.00,1244006942797208024),(4327,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1244213810649137111','Modern luxury amenities 1bed','You\'ll have a great time at this comfortable place to stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1244213810649137111/original/cd62df98-5f85-4fc9-b571-ddb2a8d3b625.jpeg',384758373,27,'45.53547','-122.69416',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,139.00,30,365,1,4.00,1244213810649137111),(4328,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245054190166105267','the Garage Mahal is New 3 bed for Monthly bookings','Welcome to the Garage Mahal.  New & Built w love & luxury.  You will find time to reflect on the joys of life easily.  Full kitchen w laundry spa bath w bidet, 70\" HDTV, Adjustable Queen bed w zero gravity, a daybed that can be a twin, a King, or 2 twins. Surrounded by gardens, outdoor fireplace, fruit trees, grape vines, & 5 blocks to one of the best parks in Portland.  It features a Community center w pools, gym, dog park, & wooded trails.  Close 2 OHSU, St. Vincent, & Village shops','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1245054190166105267/original/e43988cd-f061-40e3-8a7a-e7ad64d8feae.jpeg',16083734,17,'45.48231060958139','-122.7228134116394',1,4,1.00,1.00,3.00,139.00,30,299,0,1.00,1245054190166105267),(4329,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245083626517680775','Cozy Room in Guest Suite Near Airport','Welcome to your cozy retreat in North Portland! Newly renovated basement unit, this charming 1-bedroom is in a shared space (one other guest room) designed with comfort and convenience in mind. Laundry avaiable for >5 day stays. Near airport, perfect for early morning/late night flight. Self-check in makes it easy to come in when needed. <br /><br />Note: If you are interested in renting both rooms, please inquire. Otherwise, shared bathroom, living room, and back porch with other guest room (if rented).','St. Johns is a vibrant and eclectic neighborhood in North Portland, known for its strong sense of community and rich history. It boasts a charming, small-town feel with a mix of historic architecture and modern development. The neighborhood is home to stunning views of the Willamette River and the iconic St. Johns Bridge, a picturesque suspension bridge that adds to the area\'s scenic beauty.<br /><br />St. Johns has a thriving local arts scene, independent shops, and a variety of cozy coffeehouses, craft breweries, and unique restaurants. Cathedral Park, located beneath the St. Johns Bridge, is a popular spot for outdoor activities, summer concerts, and relaxing by the river. The neighborhood also has ample green spaces, including Forest Park, which offers miles of hiking trails just a short drive away.<br /><br />This laid-back neighborhood is a hidden gem within Portland, offering a friendly, inclusive atmosphere. It has great access to public transportation and a growing selection o','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0NTA4MzYyNjUxNzY4MDc3NQ%3D%3D/original/d0f00666-378a-425e-b8b3-2e2f12e25f89.jpeg',32200220,58,'45.59716237991815','-122.75634291801839',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,40.00,1,7,0,1.00,1245083626517680775),(4330,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245101549395711000','Portland\'s Finest - Luxury Pearl District 2 BR','Location, location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore ® of 96/100, this modern, newly furnished four bedroom Portland  can sleep up to 4 people comfortably. Our home is nestled between the Pearl District and Alphabet District in Northwest Portland, which boast some of Portland\'s best restaurants, bars, and shops. For guests that enjoy the outdoors, we\'re just minutes away from Forest Park\'s many hiking trails.<br /><br />THIS LISTING IS FOR TWO BEDROOMS ONLY!!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-51004521/original/6641e732-5da7-4904-9f40-dcb883aa9171.jpeg',356211715,27,'45.5317','-122.68714',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,128.00,1,365,5,4.80,1245101549395711000),(4331,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245107865396460878','Crossroads Vintage Funk Penthouse ~ 94 WalkScore','Welcome to your perfect Portland getaway! Our spacious 4-bedroom, 3-bath apartment on Division Street offers the ideal blend of comfort, style, and convenience. Enjoy ample room to relax and unwind in our open-concept living area, featuring comfortable seating, a large flat-screen TV, and stylish decor. Located in the heart of the Division in SE Portland, walkable restaurants, bars, shops, and more are never in short supply!','Located in the heart of Southeast Portland, our apartment offers you the best of urban living in a vibrant, eclectic neighborhood. Division Street is renowned for its lively atmosphere, brimming with trendy cafes, artisanal bakeries, gourmet restaurants, and boutique shops. You\'ll find an array of culinary delights, from farm-to-table eateries to food carts serving diverse international cuisines.<br /><br />The neighborhood is not only a food lover\'s paradise but also a hub for arts and culture. Explore local galleries, unique shops, and craft breweries that capture Portland’s indie spirit. Division Street is pedestrian-friendly, making it easy to stroll and soak in the local vibe. Nearby, you\'ll find lush parks and green spaces, perfect for a leisurely walk or a relaxing afternoon.<br /><br />With its mix of residential charm and bustling commercial activity, the area provides a perfect balance of convenience and community. Public transportation options are plentiful, with several bus','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-816129853440603598/original/0adcaf37-5ba6-4dce-862d-21f143c84945.jpeg',187761372,25,'45.505238365809134','-122.64499089045826',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,179.00,1,365,0,1.00,1245107865396460878),(4332,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245122082775890633','Modern & Spacious 2BR in Central SE PDX!','This tastefully renovated SE Portland charmer is near delicious food and trendy bars! Within steps from booming Foster-Powell, minutes away from SE Division St., Hawthorne, and so much more. You won’t have any trouble finding awesome stuff to do, places to see, drink, eat, visit, etc.','SE Portland is a Foodie’s paradise. Located a block from Foster Rd, Foster-Powell boasts its own mix of cafés, bars, food carts, and vintage shops. Experience what true Portland is all about within a short walk from this property and neighborhood!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-40138718/original/f6e53960-34bc-40f8-ab08-d2039630ff3e.jpeg',51832729,67,'45.49222','-122.60306',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,103.00,1,365,3,4.67,1245122082775890633),(4333,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245135481336767523','Luxury Living on NW 23rd Ave, Walk Score 99','Discover a cozy and modern haven in our brand-new, garden-level 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom suite. Featuring two comfortable queen beds, this thoughtfully designed space accommodates up to 4 guests with ease.<br /><br />Nestled in the heart of Portland’s vibrant Alphabet District, this suite boasts a walk score of 99, putting NW 23rd Avenue’s best attractions right at your doorstep. Enjoy iconic spots like Salt & Straw, local bookstores, trendy bars, unique shops, and top-notch restaurants—all just steps away.','With its ornate Victorian houses and tree-lined streets, fashionable Nob Hill is a charming and established neighborhood. Known for its trendy shopping on 23rd Avenue, Nob Hill offers a unique blend of upscale boutiques and eclectic shops. The neighborhood boasts a thriving dining scene, featuring refined restaurants and laid-back eateries serving a variety of international cuisines. Cozy cafes add to the charm, pouring specialty coffee that attracts both locals and visitors alike. Nob Hill perfectly combines historic elegance with modern vibrancy, making it a must-visit destination in Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0NTEzNTQ4MTMzNjc2NzUyMw%3D%3D/original/d60b45f1-4a6f-4eff-88a2-1c665b6f39c6.jpeg',286367128,27,'45.530006679125435','-122.69814854200253',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,113.00,1,365,0,1.00,1245135481336767523),(4334,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1245199497506868894','Scenic balcony retreat on Laview','Welcome to our serene and cozy retreat with a view! Nestled in a tranquil setting, this charming home blends rustic elegance with modern comforts. Two spacious bedrooms and a beautifully appointed living space offer the perfect sanctuary for restful nights in this quiet environment, with balconies offering stunning scenic views which span from downtown Portland all the way to the Sellwood Bridge. Enjoy heated tile floors and a luxurious steam shower, as well as a full kitchen and cozy nooks.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1245199497506868894/original/de0dc2ef-72d2-47e4-b14e-efa9f62837e4.jpeg',651909792,22,'45.47212','-122.67444',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,106.00,3,30,0,1.00,1245199497506868894),