he full basement offers a laundry room and additional storage. Perfectly located, it is just steps away from shops, restaurants, and entertainment. Major hospitals, universities, and Portland\'s Rose Quarter are all within easy reach.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0NzEwNjk1Mzg1MTE4OTEyOA%3D%3D/original/90b9c8a0-b491-4401-a6ff-68a85fca9149.jpeg',158074447,7,'45.54002','-122.65583',1,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,75.00,31,365,0,1.00,1247106953851189128),(4338,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1247126967826067342','Pearl District 2bed 1bath •Free Parking •Rooftop','A prestigious location in the heart of downtown Portland. Designed with high ceilings, a spacious layout and a million dollar city view visible from the living room & bedroom. Ideally located in the middle of one of North America\'s most vibrant cities filled with trendy retail, buzz-worthy restaurants, and green spaces to explore and discover.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0NzEyNjk2NzgyNjA2NzM0Mg%3D%3D/original/40833e0f-5773-4e60-a17d-3b628021dec8.jpeg',459606784,2,'45.52637713206193','-122.68144726475248',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,200.00,2,30,9,5.00,1247126967826067342),(4339,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1247144666051908754','The Quirky Portland Bungalow','The Quirky Portland Bungalow is located one block from popular Alberta Street.  The two bedroom home includes a full bath, a clawfoot tub & shower combo,  a living and dining room and galley kitchen with a dishwasher. The washer & dryer, freezer, and other 1/2 bathroom are located in the basement. There is a front porch, wrap-around deck and turfed fenced backyard. Rent includes utilities. First and last, deposit and fees are required. Close to everything will make it easy to plan your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1247144666051908754/original/30126ddf-992f-4a78-8665-aa44bfd2d798.jpeg',449432266,1,'45.55802229377887','-122.6361588699224',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,80.00,60,240,0,1.00,1247144666051908754),(4340,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1247209606459435192','Entertainment Hub NE Portland','Walkable, peaceful and centrally-located place in NE Portland.  Across the street from Grand Central Bakery, McPeets Pub, Prince Coffee, Starbucks and many delicious restaurants.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1247209606459435192/original/814caf0b-4856-4e48-a14d-0af65e5a6c00.png',10664501,46,'45.5481138','-122.6164927',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,90.00,30,365,0,1.00,1247209606459435192),(4341,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1247336786707205078','Angel\'s Rest Suite!','This 2 bedroom unit is fully furnished with large living room, formal dining room, full size kitchen, large bedrooms and an enclosed sun room. There are 2 bedrooms, one with a queen bed, the other with 2 twins. Go out on the town, stay in and watch a movie, or even enjoy a relaxing soak in a classic clawfoot tub! This unit features beautiful views of the city, modern air conditioning, and all of the charm and character you would expect from a custom built turn of the century Portland fourplex.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1247336786707205078/original/bab9d938-95a3-487b-ac46-cb07c2a86459.png',652450228,59,'45.534305623093516','-122.65806160626256',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,30,300,0,1.00,1247336786707205078),(4342,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1247351426410960433','1BR apt w/ free parking by restaurant row (Kerns)','Apartment in the Kerns Neighborhood (just ranked one of the top 10 neighborhoods in the WORLD). Walking distance to countless bars and restaurants on exciting 28th Ave. Historic Laurelhurst Theatre just a 5 minute walk. 10 minute Uber to downtown/Providence Park. 8 minute Uber to the Moda Center. Citybike rentals 400 feet from the front door. Many of Portland’s best restaurants, bars, breweries, parks and shops within walking distance. <br /><br />Great for couples, business travelers, and solo travelers.','','https://a0.muscac