,30,180,0,1.00,1247946085758233931),(4351,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248593398068528276','Elegant, Recently Upgraded Apt – Pearl District!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1248593398068528276/original/b899405f-6f1f-42f5-b5a1-9eb60a7f5c71.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.52880350871436','-122.67992578032407',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,95.00,1,14,5,4.80,1248593398068528276),(4352,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248636022564687042','The Todd','Welcome to The Todd! Experience luxurious living in this sleek, fully furnished 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom condo, located in SW Portland. Designed with elegance and comfort in mind, this stunning unit is perfect for discerning professionals, corporate executives, or anyone looking for a high-end retreat in the city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI0ODYzNjAyMjU2NDY4NzA0Mg%3D%3D/original/3cdfc2e1-8e14-482b-b02e-40c34fc7335b.jpeg',47581293,22,'45.48659867106526','-122.67400910458015',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,365,0,1.00,1248636022564687042),(4353,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248705532694233497','Casa Solárium ~ Local Eateries, Parks & Espresso','Located in the heart of Portland\'s renowned Sunnyside Neighborhood, this 3BR apartment is just a short walk from many desirable spots. Notably, it\'s only two blocks from the eclectic SE Hawthorne Blvd! Enjoy this cozy, spacious getaway with family and friends, and immerse yourself in the splendid local attractions on the beautiful east side of town.','Welcome to Central Southeast Portland, a foodie\'s paradise where the options are endless! As a food fanatic myself, I can assure you that you\'re just a short walk away from some of the city’s best restaurants, delicious bakeries, renowned local coffee and tea shops, lively bars, and vibrant nightlife. You\'ll also find boutique shops, grocery stores, and so much more right at your doorstep.<br /><br />Beyond the culinary delights, the neighborhood offers a wealth of parks and recreational opportunities. Take a leisurely stroll or enjoy a picnic at Laurelhurst Park, known for its beautiful landscapes and serene pond. For those who love to stay active, the Eastbank Esplanade provides a scenic path along the Willamette River, perfect for walking, running, or cycling.<br /><br />Art enthusiasts will appreciate the local art scene, with numerous galleries and murals adding a splash of creativity to the area. Don\'t miss a visit to the Portland Art Museum or the quirky, yet fascinating, Indepe','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-11089716/original/5aa8fec9-799b-48b9-ad68-c83db04b1423.jpeg',33606696,16,'45.51652','-122.63695',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,121.00,1,365,1,5.00,1248705532694233497),(4354,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248707094529932789','Charming & Elegant 4BR Rose City Vintage Bungalow','Welcome to the beautiful ornate Rose City Bungalow, a perfect gathering place for family and friends! Nestled in the heart of the Rose City. Located just a mile east of Portland’s authentic Hollywood District. This home offers the ideal blend of charm and elegance.','Offering an eclectic taste of city life with small town charm. We are a short distance from the Alberta Arts District, Historic Mississippi Ave, and the Pearl District of Downtown Portland. In addition, PDX airport is just a 15-minute drive away!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1248707094529932789/original/f381f08a-8c61-4f1d-8889-34dea09a8de2.jpeg',221421926,11,'45.54628','-122.59766',1,10,3.00,4.00,5.00,189.00,31,364,0,1.00,1248707094529932789),(4355,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248717369348061934','Heart of Buckman MidCentury Dream 86 WalkScore 2BR','If you\'re a fan of great food, craft beer, and pour-over coffee, this is your place. My home is situated in the famous Buckman District, neighboring many of Portland\'s top restaurants, bars, and vintage shops, and offering some of the best people-watching around. My place is perfect for families, groups of friends, and business travelers. With a convenient home base within walking distance of the neighborhood\'s hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!). Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. Hawthorne boasts a vibrant indie spirit, with plenty of made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park on top of a dormant volcano vent, where you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible panoramic views of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1213897475383778607/original/697f0187-90fd-4c99-a355-f6798a407be2.jpeg',592522307,16,'45.51757','-122.62219',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,1,365,3,4.33,1248717369348061934),(4356,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248731865719201417','Joshua Tree Vibes in SE PDX - Local Bars & Food','If you\'re a fan of great food, craft beer, and pour-over coffee, this is your place. My home is situated in the famous Buckman District, neighboring many of Portland\'s top restaurants, bars, and vintage shops, and offering some of the best people-watching around. My place is perfect for families, groups of friends, and business travelers. With a convenient home base within walking distance of the neighborhood\'s hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','Commonly known as “Foodie Row,” the Hawthorne/Buckman District places you within walking distance of a wide variety of top-notch local flavors (no chain restaurants here!). Make new friends over vegan poutine fries and grilled PB&Js at the Cartopia food cart pod, share a pie at Apizza Scholls (consistently voted Portland’s favorite pizza), or opt for a fancy night out at Castagna—all within a 1.5-mile stretch.<br /><br />But Portland isn\'t just for foodies. Hawthorne boasts a vibrant indie spirit, with plenty of made-in-Oregon shops and boutiques to explore in this hipster haven. Catch a movie at Bagdad Theater and Pub, a revamped 1920s theater turned view-and-brew venue serving local McMenamins food and microbrews. If bar hopping through neighborhoods isn’t your idea of recreation, head up to Mt. Tabor, a 196-acre city park on top of a dormant volcano vent, where you’ll find miles of hiking trails and incredible panoramic views of the city.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1213908359495354793/original/cda7b594-7cab-412b-b364-0b246de00649.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.51764294462031','-122.64581747580336',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,86.00,1,365,1,5.00,1248731865719201417),(4357,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1248751921061550011','1923 Belmont House of Antiques ~ Coffee & Brunch','Discover the best of Portland\'s food, drink, and culture from this prime location in the famous Belmont District. With top-rated restaurants, craft beer pubs, and pour-over coffee shops just steps away, this home offers a convenient base for families, friend groups, and business travelers. Enjoy the neighborhood\'s vintage shops and great people-watching spots, and immerse yourself in the authentic Portland lifestyle.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1216071426077891668/original/774d2343-95a9-422f-9fbf-e8e2d7f0672b.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.51563','-122.64058',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,95.00,1,365,1,5.00,1248751921061550011),(4358,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1249331361656505558','La Casa Blanca en Mississisppi ~ 95 WalkScore','Welcome to our charming three-bedroom retreat in the heart of Mississippi Street! Step outside and dive into the vibrant local scene, with endless dining, shopping, and entertainment options just steps away. After a fun-filled day exploring, return to unwind in style with a massive 4K HDTV, a fully equipped kitchen, and comfortable memory foam mattresses in all three bedrooms. Discover the best of Mississippi Street from our perfectly situated apartment!','Welcome to the heart of Portland\'s vibrant Mississippi neighborhood! This highly sought-after foodie haven is home to some of the city\'s top-rated eateries, including Por Que No, Tasty and Sons, Ox, Gravy, Samurai Blue, and Mee Sen, all just minutes from your doorstep. And if that\'s not enough, Portland\'s Original Food Carts are just a block away!<br /><br />But the Mississippi neighborhood offers so much more than just food. With great live music venues, breweries, coffee shops, and a plethora of shopping options, you\'ll find something for everyone here. Take a short walk and immerse yourself in the energy of the Historic Mississippi Ave business district, featuring 20 locally-owned shops and 26 restaurants and bars.<br /><br />For fitness enthusiasts, the neighborhood boasts a variety of options, including yoga studios, Barre 3, and numerous class pass workout options.<br /><br />Discover all that this vibrant neighborhood has to offer by visiting mississippiave Dotcom for a complete','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-827615026974390085/original/a7cda61d-ccb2-4e21-87f2-6f5a7222063a.jpeg',36435346,9,'45.552567132130335','-122.67680560324756',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,168.00,1,365,2,4.50,1249331361656505558),(4359,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1249336962611011665','Perfect 1 Bed ~ 95 WalkScore','Welcome to our newly renovated home in the heart of inner SE Portland! This house is the perfect retreat for families eager to experience everything Portland has to offer. Completely updated with new appliances, stylish furniture, and modern finishes, you\'ll enjoy a comfortable and contemporary stay.<br /><br />We look forward to hosting you and helping you create unforgettable memories during your time in Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1215979551866724983/original/6d2f0ba9-8ed3-4cfc-a0f5-4424daea0cb7.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.514283435805936','-122.6525128069777',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,164.00,1,365,0,1.00,1249336962611011665),(4360,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1249340997511828513','Renewed Classic Craftsman in SE ~ 95 WalkScore','Welcome to our newly renovated home in the heart of inner SE Portland! This house is the perfect retreat for families eager to experience everything Portland has to offer. Completely updated with new appliances, stylish furniture, and modern finishes, you\'ll enjoy a comfortable and contemporary stay.<br /><br />We look forward to hosting you and helping you create unforgettable memories during your time in Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1215987960558491314/original/29411311-d186-412d-856e-5fb9d39ca4dc.jpeg',592522307,32,'45.51608519717592','-122.65273650790232',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,164.00,1,365,6,5.00,1249340997511828513),(4361,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1250206071813588209','Modern Guest Suite— great location!','This modern, private entry lower level home is located in Belmont, one of Portland\'s coolest neighborhoods. It is perfect for anyone wanting to experience the best of what Portland has to offer! It is located within walking distance to some of the city\'s most popular restaurants, bars and coffee shops. Only a short, 4-block walk to historic Laurelhurst Park, a city landmark, and 12-minute scenic bike ride to downtown. Located in a quiet neighborhood, close to everything.','Sunnyside and Belmont are vibrant neighborhoods in Southeast Portland known for their eclectic vibe and strong community spirit.<br /><br />Sunnyside features tree-lined streets, charming Craftsman homes, and a mix of local businesses, cafes, and parks. It\'s home to Sunnyside School and a variety of small shops that contribute to its friendly, neighborhood feel. The area often hosts community events and has a diverse population, making it lively and welcoming.<br /><br />Belmont, adjacent to Sunnyside, is particularly famous for its lively nightlife and dining scene. Belmont Street is lined with unique bars, restaurants, and boutique shops, showcasing a mix of cuisines and creative local flavors. The atmosphere is laid-back and artsy, attracting a diverse crowd.<br /><br />Both neighborhoods are bike-friendly and have easy access to public transport, making them popular among young professionals, families, and students. Overall, Sunnyside and Belmont encapsulate the quirky, inclusive s','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1250206071813588209/original/a641c593-8339-4af2-ae89-85bad4f7969e.jpeg',32524294,16,'45.51591880000001','-122.6275425',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,2,90,3,4.67,1250206071813588209),(4362,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1251698730524048518','La Casita Chingona','3 bedroom, 1 bath, Outdoor 4-person dry sauna & spacious backyard with fire pit','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1251698730524048518/original/eb0f3838-3511-498d-858b-20c518f8a428.jpeg',71212009,87,'45.50859930885796','-122.49992401128686',1,4,1.00,3.00,4.00,120.00,2,14,0,1.00,1251698730524048518),(4363,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1251788592876791093','Bohemian Oasis ~ Food, Coffee & Craft Beer Lovers','If you\'re a fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee, this is your place. My apartment is situated in the famous Buckman District - which neighbors many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and offers some of the best people-watching around.<br /><br />My place is great for couples, solo adventures, and business travelers. With a convenient home base within walking distance to the neighborhood hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-28293489/original/0fa34246-9a88-4d5b-aff9-dd3223219525.jpeg',146196024,32,'45.51644','-122.63976',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,1,365,0,1.00,1251788592876791093),(4364,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1252421394537012298','Walkable Alphabet District- 1 Bdrm W office Condo','Ideally situated NW Alphabet district ground level apartment, fully furnished for extended stays!Trendy NW 23rd and Slabtown businesses at your doorstep! Access the unit through the private stamped concrete patio.  Glass door entry opens to great room. Primary bedroom is fitted with a queen bed, and has lots of storage. Washer and dryer within the unit, and assigned parking. We are a property management company. booking is subject to a $65 background check to ensure the safety of all residents.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1252421394537012298/original/af6dd1de-fbc4-4f28-a6ab-30f7369c97fb.jpeg',653700983,27,'45.5318346','-122.6934143',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,129.00,30,365,0,1.00,1252421394537012298),(4365,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1252444802539432913','Mini Dome by Dodeca Domes','Experience the magic of dome living in the world’s first pentakis dodecahedron home. This unique tiny home was constructed with a heavy emphasis on building science, energy, and space efficiency. Located in a private backyard setting, the mini dome features a hot tub, fiber internet, a spiral staircase, and a thoughtfully designed modern interior. Located in North Portland, the property is less than 10 minutes to Downtown Portland and 30 minutes to the Columbia River Gorge.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI1MjQ0NDgwMjUzOTQzMjkxMw%3D%3D/original/31223314-2f94-409e-9881-13e0beaa2afb.jpeg',26378984,51,'45.5706607','-122.682528',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,180.00,2,10,2,5.00,1252444802539432913),(4366,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1253170899648247744','The milking shed','Super sweet tiny house nestled in a thick garden in the midst of the foodie neighborhood of Kerns. We used to run a tiny farm and this was where we had the goats and our milking barn. <br />I love this space, the feel of it and the way the light moves. It is super quiet and cozy.<br /><br />But beware-It is small! The sleeping area is in the loft and, unless you are very short, you will have to bend over to get into the space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1253170899648247744/original/fc5faea2-b3a3-409b-a8ab-e287e4baf924.jpeg',14954072,12,'45.529413827209495','-122.63290572025483',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,130.00,2,10,1,5.00,1253170899648247744),(4367,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1253689861594120993','Little Henry House on Duke St','Enjoy this special studio cottage in a quiet neighborhood on the edge of Woodstock Blvd. The cottage is entirely private with its own locked, fenced patio. If the season is right, help yourself to the apples and pears on the trees or delight in their blooms. Inside is airy and modern with construction finished early 2024. Everything is new, with comfort, ease, and aesthetics considered, and just a few short blocks away from Woodstock Blvd. Close to Reed College.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1253689861594120993/original/ee076bd0-428c-46cb-a1a2-87f68e36a049.jpeg',29604513,38,'45.47589','-122.61034',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,2,21,0,1.00,1253689861594120993),(4368,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1253898059723339555','Cozy East PDX Gem - Guest Suite!','Explore Southeast Portland like a local! Go for a hike for epic views of the city at Mt Tabor Park, green bathe in Kelly Butte Natural Area, or grab some boba at Just Tea. There’s plenty more to do and explore in our neighborhood - within access by foot, bike & public transit.<br /><br />Sit down and stay awhile - snuggle into the queen bed in the bedroom, or stretch out on a convertible sofa bed in the common space & watch TV while you plan your PDX adventures.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1253898059723339555/original/29c1e2a7-6759-45b2-841d-b659c247ce0a.jpeg',653650992,63,'45.51753','-122.52529',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,3,45,6,4.67,1253898059723339555),(4369,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1254019089032383954','Stylish Duplex Near Alberta Arts District','Welcome to our modern and stylish newly constructed Duplex! Centrally located in the heart of NE Portland with easy airport access and all that Northeast Portland  has to offer. This welcoming space features new appliances, open living space, and prime location.<br /><br />Located steps away from convenient stores, restaurants, and other high populated areas such as the Alberta Arts District, you\'ll never run out of things to do or places to go.<br /><br />This duplex does have a shared backyard with other tenants.','This property is in the heart of the Concordia Neighborhood in NE Portland! Nestled among tree-lined streets, Concordia is a blend of urban energy and serene residential charm. Known for its welcoming community and eclectic atmosphere, this area offers something for everyone.<br /><br />You’ll be just steps away from the trendy Alberta Arts District, where local coffee shops, farm-to-table restaurants, and unique boutiques line the streets. Explore Alberta Street, famous for its vibrant street art, galleries, and the beloved Last Thursday art walk. Outdoor lovers will enjoy the proximity to Alberta Park, a peaceful spot for morning jogs, picnics, or simply soaking in the beautiful Pacific Northwest greenery.<br /><br />Concordia is also home to the historic Kennedy School, a unique hotel, brewery, and entertainment venue that features cozy bars, a soaking pool, and a theater. Whether you’re here to enjoy the local culture or explore the greater Portland area, Concordia’s location makes','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1254019089032383954/original/573ab64f-c659-4801-b92a-b6d40ba0b657.jpeg',260686384,1,'45.56182','-122.6296',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,117.00,2,27,7,5.00,1254019089032383954),(4370,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1254425778970428245','Bright Recently Upgraded Apt – Downtown Location','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1254425778970428245/original/f59aec72-5cfb-41fa-863d-ac02cd0dc7f9.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53101076589625','-122.68060735882878',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,93.00,1,14,2,5.00,1254425778970428245),(4371,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1254442242405941688','Amazing location luxury complex','You\'ll have a great time at this comfortable place to stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1244213810649137111/original/cd62df98-5f85-4fc9-b571-ddb2a8d3b625.jpeg',384758373,27,'45.53506','-122.69403',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,127.00,2,365,4,5.00,1254442242405941688),(4372,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1256695349900209760','City Cottage with Country Feel','Fully fenced cottage is nestled in the forest at the end of the road, it\'s very quiet, very private. Just off the property, there is a walking path to park (Play Haven Park), w/ wildlife aplenty; bunnies, hawks, squirrels, berry picking, and more!  We are located near Leach Botanical Gardens,   And very convenient, to hwy 205, just down the road from The Gorge Hwy 84 East.  For those of you that need hospital services, we are very close to Adventist and Kaiser.   We are 15 mins from the airport.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1256695349900209760/original/234a97f4-dcd7-454