at place to stay while exploring the Portland Metro area!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI1NzM5NDMzMDUzODI2MTYzMQ%3D%3D/original/a84fb679-e545-42db-98dc-a38846eff856.jpeg',595813530,56,'45.4923068','-122.6412631',1,5,1.50,2.00,2.00,90.00,30,365,0,1.00,1257394330538261631),(4376,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1257447110387358031','1906 upgraded Craftsman','Welcome to Halsey House… you\'ll find the location hard to beat with this home, it doesn\'t get more central and convenient than this. Tucked in Sullivan\'s Gulch, adjacent to Irvington, Alameda, Grant Park, Kerns and Laurelhurst, the city is at your doorstep. <br /><br />This beautifully updated Craftsman-style house combines classic charm with modern comforts. Walking distance to multiple grocers, public transit, restaurants and bars, our spacious home is perfect for all seeking a unique experience','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI1NzQ0NzExMDM4NzM1ODAzMQ%3D%3D/original/94ea6ca6-6c86-42c0-b1c7-b7d9eed2c111.png',3035263,4,'45.53322','-122.63765',1,8,2.00,4.00,3.00,150.00,30,150,0,1.00,1257447110387358031),(4377,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258030518825555336','Buzzy living-room style lobby','Up to 2 Adults • Queen Bed • 120 sq ft / 11 sq m • Doggy Friendly <br />Care more about the size of the bed than the size of the room? Meet your perfect Portland crash pad. <br />Our Snug rooms are compact and built for travellers who value getting out and exploring over staying in. All Snug rooms offer a queen-size bed and a walk-in shower. They’ve got hangers to hang your most precious looks, but storage space is kept to a minimum otherwise.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1258030518825555336/original/40de58c4-ba64-44a3-95f8-a4eca8089800.jpeg',654982020,43,'45.5234861','-122.6745926',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,1,365,127,4.46,1258030518825555336),(4378,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258030606766040958','Well-placed in the heart of historic Old Town','Up to 2 Adults • Queen or King Bed • 200 sq ft / 19 sq m • Doggy Friendly <br />Our Cosy rooms are perfectly formed to fit two people without needing to step on toes, All Cosy rooms have either a Queen or King size bed, walk-in shower and cleverly designed to maximize the space.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1258030606766040958/original/12149e00-530f-49bd-b87a-1efd0ebed7fc.jpeg',654982020,43,'45.5234861','-122.6745926',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,118.00,1,365,350,4.73,1258030606766040958),(4379,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258059603379357403','Guest Suite with WiFi, AC, streaming','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1258059603379357403/original/851784e5-21ad-4296-b1ac-b8558514428b.jpeg',112452733,22,'45.479637779922','-122.67371841652033',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,1,365,5,4.80,1258059603379357403),(4380,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258138310448827507','Parkrose Cedar Loft','Enjoy a cozy hideaway in the heart of Parkrose Heights, perfectly situated 10 minutes from the airport, 15 minutes from downtown Portland, and 20 minutes from the world-famous Columbia River Gorge. Step into the charming cedar loft, however, and you\'ll forget all about leaving. This tiny home is the ideal place to curl up with a book and a cup of tea after a long day of exploring the magic of Oregon. Sleep peacefully in the comfy loft, sip a hot drink on the couch, and plan your next adventure.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1258138310448827507/original/ac3b8c46-ae03-4381-bcf4-bc709ac7306f.jpeg',70146531,35,'45.537726140038075','-122.54682195270212',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,69.00,1,31,5,5.00,1258138310448827507),(4381,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258178894931827417','University Park NoPo Bungalow','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. University Park neighborhood just down the street from St John this home offers a prime location in central North Portland. Spend your weekends exploring entertainment venues like the St. John’s Theatre or head to Cathedral Park in downtown St. John for a lovely afternoon stroll. North Portland is easy commute to all parts of the City with quick access to the I-5, Downtown Portland, Vancouver and Portland international airport nearby.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1258178894931827417/original/c744d45c-75cd-4256-89bc-3f8ee82c68ff.jpeg',13747851,57,'45.57946','-122.72868',1,2,1.00,2.00,2.00,135.00,30,365,0,1.00,1258178894931827417),(4382,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258377037223715846','Cozy Home in the Heart of Woodlawn PDX','Enjoy everything this peaceful Woodlawn neighborhood has to offer while staying in this newly-built charming townhome. Take a short stroll to the lovely Woodlawn park on Saturdays after your visit to the morning Farmer\'s Market. Let this townhome be your temporary home that brings you peace of mind and a sense of rest for whatever purpose brings you to Portland :)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1258377037223715846/original/0bbdedc0-1913-47f6-838d-44d2751d8fce.jpeg',163514776,48,'45.573513','-122.6746933',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,109.00,30,365,0,1.00,1258377037223715846),(4383,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258713352123914741','Tiny room renovation in progress','Hardscaping in progress.<br /><br />2 blocks from the best of Portland, grocery stores, McMenamin\'s Bagdhad Theater, Powell\'s Books, Cafes, shopping, restaurants and bars.<br /><br />This house is a century old house complete with antique doors and hundred-year old worn floors and vintage worn furniture. The renovated, shared bathroom features a rainfall shower.<br /><br />We are currently doing hardscaping in the front yard, so the entrance is in the back.<br /><br />We are an artistic family who loves to share our home with guests!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1258713352123914741/original/ef22934b-bdb8-4145-9dd8-64650f6cfd0c.jpeg',653792378,8,'45.5105','-122.62464',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,55.00,1,5,1,4.00,1258713352123914741),(4384,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1258727634110216045','Stunning  Mt Tabor Gem Custom Designed','Come relax, retreat, or entertain in our cozy home. The open layout and high ceilings allow for natural light to highlight the warm, rustic finishes. Reclaimed lumber and cork floors create a modern vibe. Upstairs, a spacious suite awaits you with a king-sized bed and ample closet space. <br /><br />The versatile loft area has a dedicated workspace and a comfortable twin-sized daybed with a sunset view.<br /><br />Unwind with a soak in the hot tub and snuggle down for a movie night with our big projector screen.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-1258727634110216045/original/e1e7bf2f-fa66-4be3-8ea3-f10174b22214.jpg',22261625,15,'45.52017','-122.60022',1,4,1.50,1.00,1.00,197.00,2,365,4,5.00,1258727634110216045),(4385,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1259125764874970325','Charming Townhouse with Gym in Peaceful St. Johns','Escape to a serene, plant-filled townhouse in St. Johns! This fully furnished home features an open main floor with a moody Scandinavian-style living room, a smart TV, and a dining room that doubles as a workstation. Upstairs, enjoy two bedrooms with Tempur-Pedic mattresses, a private bath for the main, and convenient laundry. Amenities include a well-equipped kitchen, home gym, patio with grill, and parking. Steps from nature and close to local shops, cafes, and Cathedral Park!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI1OTEyNTc2NDg3NDk3MDMyNQ%3D%3D/original/bf141910-02fc-450c-8615-8127fa39cf02.jpeg',16111776,42,'45.59584757013761','-122.76530597777278',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,71.00,30,119,0,1.00,1259125764874970325),(4386,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1259398772307188598','Modern Portland Retreat Steps to Mississippi Ave!','Delight in the highlights of Portland from the comfort of this modern private retreat! Conveniently situated near downtown just steps away from Mississippi Ave, enjoy easy access to boutique shops, local restaurants, music venues & coffee spots or explore the vibrant Pearl District simply a short drive away. Visit Old Town, Pittock Mansion, Oregon Zoo, Japanese Garden, WA Park & more! A delightful haven for couples, friends & solo travelers alike, you will love this private getaway in Portland!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI1OTM5ODc3MjMwNzE4ODU5OA%3D%3D/original/d9ed222b-c07c-4ae9-bd00-d855b0551349.jpeg',353152177,9,'45.5466939','-122.6769154',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,100.00,3,365,0,1.00,1259398772307188598),(4387,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1259414626311060451','#StayInMyDistrict Multnomah Village Apartment','#StayinMyDistrict SW Portland & Multnomah Village! Tastefully designed with quality furnishings and decor. These 2 bedroom/1.5 baths single level home is spacious, bright and recently updated. Hardwood floors, great finishes and comfortable spaces to relax, will help you to enjoy your home away from home. Washer & Dryer, FREE parking, SmartTV & WIFI, private patio and shared deck with seating & a grill. Conveniently located to OHSU, S Waterfront, I-5 South and Downtown Portland.','This neighborhood is convenient to I-5, OHSU, and downtown. Approx 5-7 min to the OHSU campus. The home is located within .5 miles of Multnomah Village, known for its charming vibe. Multnomah Village has plentiful sidewalk cafes, bakeries and bookstores, and offers casual dining options like taverns, cozy American restaurants and traditional Italian eateries. In sprawling Gabriel Park, there are sports fields, a large skatepark and picnic areas. Stores selling women’s fashions, rustic home decor and antiques cluster around Southwest Capitol Highway.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1259414626311060451/original/44f15163-651b-4aa1-8c50-6b5007b6e434.jpeg',3142393,31,'45.4807096','-122.7075242',1,6,1.50,2.00,3.00,72.00,1,28,3,5.00,1259414626311060451),(4388,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1259426831699100841','New ADU in NoPo!','Take a break and unwind at this peaceful space. Located in the friendly, walkable neighborhood of Kenton, this ADU is a five minute drive off of I-5, a 5-10 walk to the nearest bus lines and MAX station, and a block-and-a-half away from the central Denver St. commercial zone of Kenton with access to restaurants (Vietnamese, Thai, Mexican, soul food, pizza, pub food), coffee shops, library, and convenience store. Fred Meyer and New Seasons grocery stores are within a mile.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1259426831699100841/original/1bf32ce1-bd40-4cb7-989a-f9077fefcde7.jpeg',488807813,55,'45.58157','-122.69052',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,1,60,3,5.00,1259426831699100841),(4389,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1260089957481212413','Historic Carriage House in Portland','Experience a one of a kind stay at Portland\'s White House Carriage House; a luxurious, sophisticated property built in 1911 as a summer home for lumber baron Robert Lytle. <br />One of the most expensive homes ever built in the city at the time, guaranteed to offer exceptional accommodation!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1260089957481212413/original/b76cba5b-b42b-489e-b685-035533a6a6d3.jpeg',93484544,7,'45.53729112117123','-122.64362152315923',1,6,3.00,3.00,3.00,115.00,1,365,1,5.00,1260089957481212413),(4390,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1260109202490779270','Digital Nomad Oasis Near Tryon State Park (SW PDX)','Digital nomad’s delight! Peaceful, comfortable fully furnished private room near the heart of PDX within walking distance to scenic Tryon Creek State Park and groceries. <br /><br />Room features a memory foam queen bed, a motorized sit-stand desk in front of a large window. High-speed Internet ensures a reliable connection for working or unwinding with your favorite shows on the in-room smart TV. Smart lock on bedroom door. Mini fridge/freezer.<br /><br />Equipped kitchen, parking, washer/dryer. Shared bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1260109202490779270/original/b11dde08-696a-4605-aa83-7981e4020482.jpeg',36383186,73,'45.43692668583415','-122.69140272924727',2,1,1.50,1.00,1.00,26.00,31,180,0,1.00,1260109202490779270),(4391,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1260351836952356589','2BD Hideaway SE Portland Private Apt!','Walk to everything! Super close to restaurants, bars, parks and shops! Freshly renovated and centrally located. This spacious and bright two-bedroom  apartment is the perfect spot to relax after a day of hiking, biking or shopping. Smart TV , fully equipped kitchen with basic essentials and full bathroom with a tub. Laundry is shared w/  two other apartments. <br /><br />Apartment has a separate entrance but does share the laundry room with the other two units.  (located downstairs)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1260351836952356589/original/8bfb4b0a-b94e-415b-92a9-e796942fb88f.jpeg',221421926,25,'45.50794','-122.65514',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,125.00,31,365,0,1.00,1260351836952356589),(4392,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1262318270255538552','Modern, Upgraded Apartment -  free parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Renu Suites are situated in the midst of what has become the hub of culture and creativity in Portland: the Pearl District. With world-class boutiques, restaurants, and art galleries a stone’s throw away, the Portland Streetcar stopping at your doorstep, and three nearby parks as your backyard, you can live your best life at the Renu Suites in the Pearl.<br /><br />Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1262318270255538552/original/669362f9-1940-4338-a714-c59a298ff044.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53075791776035','-122.68162275493616',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,76.00,1,14,0,1.00,1262318270255538552),(4393,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1262423549083728136','Irvington - Bright, 2Bed Home w/Fireplace, Parking','(MESSAGE ME BEFORE BOOKING FOR SPECIAL PRICING!) <br />You\'ll love this cozy and stylish retreat fully equipped for longer term stays. Located in the pristine Irvington neighborhood and featuring a fully fenced (shared) yard with outdoor seating and 1 dedicated driveway parking spot. The home has an indoor fireplace, full washer & dryer, a dedicated working space, and fully-stocked kitchen. This is great place to stay while exploring the Portland Metro area!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI2MjQyMzU0OTA4MzcyODEzNg%3D%3D/original/2f3df0d1-635d-47e9-a8ca-b771f45371ad.jpeg',595813530,7,'45.53956059999999','-122.6532013',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,1,365,3,4.67,1262423549083728136),(4394,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1262434159953178853','Overlook Inn','Looking for something quiet, safe and always has parking available.  This 2,000sf home with a backyard, garage, storage, washer and dryer on site is the perfect place to enjoy all Portland has to offer. 5min from downtown and a 2min walk to the metro make life super easy for work and more. Please come enjoy this recently remodeled historic bed and breakfast from 1910 with old growth trees, next to Overlook park, close to bars, restaurants, coffee shops and more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1262434159953178853/original/bc6f31d9-7c55-4888-873d-acefaa645b70.jpeg',139480728,13,'45.55000144810039','-122.68533833464784',1,6,1.00,3.00,3.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,1262434159953178853),(4395,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1262582517622267271','Stunning Pearl District Condo, Next to Parks, Open','Welcome to The Pinnacle, your stylish and serene retreat in the heart of Portland’s vibrant Pearl District! This beautifully updated 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom condo sits just steps away from the tranquil Tanner Springs Park, and The Fields Park, offering the perfect balance of urban convenience and natural beauty.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1262582517622267271/original/41e9d27f-412b-4480-8301-8d18b64839eb.jpeg',62261998,2,'45.53182','-122.68157',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,295.00,6,29,0,1.00,1262582517622267271),(4396,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1263036839533626275','Memoir Buckman - One Bedroom Apartment','This One-Bedroom fully furnished apartment at Memoir Buckman is equipped with a full kitchen, dedicated 1 GB complimentary WiFi, in-unit washer/dryer, premium bath amenities, Parachute towels and linens, housekeeping, and concierge services. Nestled in the vibrant Buckman neighborhood, enjoy easy access to local coffee shops, pubs, and dining options, as well as being next door to the historic Troy Laundry Building, now home to Soho House Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE4ODU5NzM4NjA1MTc3NDM2NA%3D%3D/original/7eaa248a-f8aa-4f2e-9545-dccd9e08939f.jpeg',576475782,32,'45.52033240893572','-122.65463916877732',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,189.00,1,365,3,4.33,1263036839533626275),(4397,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1263042320795955489','Memoir B