f everyday living with a vacation-like atmosphere.','Located in the serene surroundings of Hayden Island, Yacht Harbor Club offers residents a tranquil, resort-inspired lifestyle in their own secluded retreat. With stunning views, exceptional amenities, and a waterfront location perfect for outdoor enthusiasts, our one- and two-bedroom apartment homes blend the comfort of everyday living with a vacation-like atmosphere.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1263163765266234537/original/ebb21548-1c79-4e9d-beaf-4936b7862934.jpeg',263502162,85,'45.6052','-122.66016',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,180,0,1.00,1263163765266234537),(4400,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1263282004512153257','5 BD/3.5BA -Arcade-WFH Desks-Pool/Pingpong Table','Welcome to this spacious 5-bedroom Portland retreat, located just off Hawthorne Boulevard! Featuring king-size beds, a fully equipped kitchen, and cozy living spaces perfect for group stays. Enjoy added fun with an Arcade, WFH desks, and a pool/ping pong table. Explore nearby cafes, shops, and parks within walking distance. Whether you\'re here for a Portland family-friendly vacation or a friends\' reunion, this home offers the ultimate comfort and convenience for a memorable Portland experience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1263282004512153257/original/33bb8ca0-3224-4d98-8729-8b4c82025a83.jpeg',392859086,16,'45.51215','-122.61306',1,10,3.50,5.00,5.00,176.00,30,365,0,1.00,1263282004512153257),(4401,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1263888873271510388','Vintage Cozy City Condo','If you love city life then this place is for you. It is centrally located near the Pearl District, Alphabet District, Goose Hollow, and Downtown. It’s a great place to call home with your pet, while visiting or searching for a long-term residence in Portland.  Experience authentic Portland in this beautiful, vintage gem. With a walk score of 100, within walking distance to NW 23rd and 21st, downtown and transit.','','https://a0.mus