/c0b898d0-b369-4957-9cda-612b5cb1f6be.jpeg',20452429,10,'45.5319517','-122.5916483',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,84.00,30,365,0,1.00,1264499433962191822),(4405,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1264611556686093723','Downtown 1 bedroom condo','Charming 3rd floor walk-up condo in the heart of Portland. Step out and catch the bus, street car, walk, or bike ride throughout downtown. <br /><br />Interior features include hardwood floors, granite countertops, claw foot tub & gas stove. <br /><br />Wash/dryer combo/hanging clothes rack in unit. Bike storage, addt\'l coin-op wash/dryer in basement.<br /><br />Near museums, PSU,  farmer\'s market, Keller Aud., shops,  restaurants, Providence/OHSU hospitals. <br /><br />Quiet building. Street parking or lot directly across the street.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1264611556686093723/original/dcc61f26-6b5b-41e8-b7c4-671b41789c4f.jpeg',77100748,44,'45.51597','-122.68513',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,63.00,30,90,0,1.00,1264611556686093723),(4406,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1264749437088281652','Buffalo Terrace with Sauna','Take it easy at this bright, airy getaway. Surrounded by lush gardens, Buffalo Terrace is a private, 2-bedroom eden. Enjoy the hidden outdoor sauna and lounge around on the expansive cedar deck under the covered pergola.<br /><br />Delicious restaurants, cozy cafes, and the famous Breakside Brewery are located a few blocks away in Woodlawn neighborhood\'s quaint center triangle.<br /><br />Buffalo Terrace is centrally located just 10 minutes south of PDX Airport with easy access to I-5, highways 99 and 30.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/airflow/Hosting-1264749437088281652/original/74395be8-dd70-4a06-8ac1-234edcbd9996.jpg',12544836,45,'45.57628','-122.65604',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,129.00,1,150,0,1.00,1264749437088281652),(4407,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1265159767757998662','Room in 2brm Apartment.','Spacious bedroom,  fully furnished, all utilities paid, free wifi, 1 block from MAX station,  free off street parking for 1 car. 31 day minimum stay.  No smoking of any kind,  no pets.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1176970353828791085/original/d4a60fd2-a1c0-41c8-8413-ca57455d96c5.jpeg',157314777,63,'45.52294','-122.53365',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,31.00,30,90,0,1.00,1265159767757998662),(4408,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1265330415288298051','2BR Pearl District, Near Dining','Welcome to your home away from home in Portland’s vibrant Pearl District! This upscale 2-bed, 2-bath condo is perfect for a 30+ day stay, offering luxury and comfort just steps from Jamison Park, renowned restaurants, cozy coffee shops, and unique boutiques. The bright, open layout with floor-to-ceiling windows provides stunning views, while the gourmet kitchen and private patio with a Weber grill make it easy to relax. Enjoy 7 day a week concierge services and parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1265330415288298051/original/ab960a05-66f4-4b8f-922d-abfeefe518cb.jpeg',2647869,2,'45.52868748240784','-122.68095424798821',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,95.00,30,365,0,1.00,1265330415288298051),(4409,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1265641205787293157','Hot Tub Oasis - SE Portland','Relax in this calm and private space with a lush oasis backyard. <br />Backyard complete with a covered patio, hot tub, fully fenced backyard and fire pit.<br /><br />15 min drive from the airport, MODA center or downtown, close to multiple forms of public transportation and surrounded by amazing food.<br /><br />Huge tree filled off-leash dog park 4min drive or 15min walk away.<br /><br />Within a 15min walk of many food options: Ethiopian, Mexican, Pizza, Chinese, Sushi, Sports Bar, Food Trucks, etc. <br /><br />Free off-street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1265641205787293157/original/4635527d-b0aa-4b0c-8248-be046861810a.jpeg',20092431,90,'45.5113621','-122.5366461',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,171.00,1,365,3,5.00,1265641205787293157),(4410,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1266003813620161219','Basement room, under renovation','Hardscaping in progress<br /><br />Basement room with low ceilings and shared, renovated bathroom!<br /><br />Amazing location:<br /><br />Walk 2 blocks to<br /><br />• grocery stores<br />• boutique shopping<br />• thrifting<br />• ￼restaurants <br />• bars<br />• cafes<br /><br /><br />Neighbourhood feel, but walk two blocks for a vibrant and artsy shops.<br /><br />Powell’s Books and McMenamin’s Baghdad Theater are 2 blocks away!<br /><br />This room is within a century old worn house with character, common in our neighborhood.<br /><br />We are a family, and we love meeting guests!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1266003813620161219/original/1233fa3c-3a6c-43d2-8b43-87f8859f48bc.jpeg',653792378,8,'45.51106559017932','-122.62620293163931',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,365,3,5.00,1266003813620161219),(4411,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1266306789583151849','Magnificent home for business or leisure','Welcome to our newly refreshed Airbnb! This cozy and stylish space has been fully repainted with modern tones that create a warm and inviting atmosphere. You’ll love the brand-new hardwood floors, which add both elegance and a touch of luxury. We’ve furnished the space with all-new, contemporary pieces, thoughtfully chosen for both comfort and style. Whether you’re here for work or leisure, you’ll appreciate the fresh, modern look, enhanced by the attention to detail in every room.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1240050854125502676/original/c5afe115-c990-4360-b8e7-66b19c2e09fd.jpeg',75574560,40,'45.55477768423556','-122.55134720244658',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,228.00,2,365,1,5.00,1266306789583151849),(4412,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1266724688149252707','Cozy modern Farmhouse w/private entrance','Welcome to Portland ! <br />Explore Oregon and Washington from our CoZy modern FarmHouse, conveniently near Safeway, target, Walmart and local restaurants. Situated in a quiet, friendly neighborhood, farmhouse is just 13 minutes from PDX airport. We have tandem parking for two cars on the driveway. One space is in front of the other and plenty of free street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1266724688149252707/original/63711113-d9d7-4e17-8318-4619e7cde5d8.jpeg',75969980,78,'45.49484287480349','-122.5456723277883',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,100.00,1,7,7,5.00,1266724688149252707),(4413,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1266803867385459817','John’s Landing Townhome','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. Brand new construction features a room/en suite with adjustable massage bed are just a few features that will have you enjoying your stay. Multiple restaurants, bakeries and pubs are within walking distance. Sunrise or sunset river walks are always lovely.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1266803867385459817/original/597e0b46-ddf7-4c18-81f9-9b62aab4b014.jpeg',36392016,22,'45.4821691','-122.6762398',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,75.00,2,365,2,5.00,1266803867385459817),(4414,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1267668949709054354','Urban Oasis with Fenced Yard','*Monthly renters only!* Dogs welcome. Sanctuary vibe with warm, cozy rooms and a secluded fully-fenced backyard for your dog (no cats). On a quiet street that ends at a park. The large primary bedroom is on its own floor. The 2nd bedroom is on the main floor. Both have desks. Bonus TV room has an exercise bike. The bathroom has a rainfall shower and handheld. Light-filled living room and the kitchen/dining has everything you need for home-cooked meals. Laundry and storage in the basement.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1267668949709054354/original/db427105-2466-4c3f-bd5a-47ba3ed6d111.jpeg',7636507,51,'45.5706564','-122.6948092',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,60,90,0,1.00,1267668949709054354),(4415,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1267900314145219185','Bright & Spacious Barnsley Court Retreat G#42234','Bright & Spacious Barnsley Court Retreat is a beautifully maintained home in a highly sought-after Portland community. This charming residence offers an expansive layout, blending comfort, relaxation, and space for entertaining. Perfect for family getaways, business travel, or extended stays, this home is designed to meet your every need. ✨','Location <br />Located in the desirable Cedar Mill neighborhood, Barnsley Court Retreat offers an excellent location with access to top-rated schools like Cedar Mill Elementary and Sunset High School, both just a short drive away. For your shopping and dining needs, the nearby Timberland Town Center features popular spots such as Market of Choice, Starbucks, and MOD Pizza. Nature lovers will appreciate the proximity to parks like Forest Park and Tualatin Hills Nature Park, perfect for weekend hikes and outdoor activities. Commuters will benefit from easy access to US-26, providing a quick route to downtown Portland and Beaverton’s tech corridor. Whether it’s convenience or tranquility you seek, Barnsley Court Retreat offers the best of both worlds.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1267900314145219185/original/c15f3c2b-f8ea-4906-a788-15ed05045910.jpeg',504252105,81,'45.53408805404298','-122.7654934880642',1,9,3.50,4.00,4.00,230.00,30,365,0,1.00,1267900314145219185),(4416,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1267983714851169062','Barnsley Court Retreat E#42234','The house requires a minimum 30-day stay and utilities are not included.Welcome to Barnsley Court Retreat, a charming home located in the vibrant city of Portland, OR. This beautifully maintained residence offers a spacious layout perfect for both relaxation and entertaining. The open-concept kitchen is equipped with modern appliances and ample storage, making it ideal for culinary enthusiasts.','Location <br />Located in the desirable Cedar Mill neighborhood, Barnsley Court Retreat offers an excellent location with access to top-rated schools like Cedar Mill Elementary and Sunset High School, both just a short drive away. For your shopping and dining needs, the nearby Timberland Town Center features popular spots such as Market of Choice, Starbucks, and MOD Pizza. Nature lovers will appreciate the proximity to parks like Forest Park and Tualatin Hills Nature Park, perfect for weekend hikes and outdoor activities. Commuters will benefit from easy access to US-26, providing a quick route to downtown Portland and Beaverton’s tech corridor. Whether it’s convenience or tranquility you seek, Barnsley Court Retreat offers the best of both worlds.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI2Nzk4MzcxNDg1MTE2OTA2Mg%3D%3D/original/2cb83271-ae9d-463e-b898-af6904da3594.jpeg',414420881,81,'45.53572267849505','-122.76597760540332',1,9,3.50,4.00,4.00,230.00,30,365,0,1.00,1267983714851169062),(4417,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1268126729965231605','Studio Suite - Double Queen','Junior Suite with 2 Queen beds. Separate sitting area, beverage station, with mini-fridge and microwave, hairdryer and iron unit. Bathrooms are bright, clean and offer plenty of vanity space to spread out. TV includes premium channels. The hotel is dog-friendly with $25/per pet/ per night. Maximum 2 dogs in selected rooms.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1268126729965231605/original/6ad0a303-9f7a-4276-b0d3-78de7725d6d1.jpeg',598548847,40,'45.567129','-122.542194',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,100.00,1,365,0,1.00,1268126729965231605),(4418,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1268126730110509808','Studio Suite - King','Junior Suite King features a king bed and sleeper sofa. Room features a separate living area with a beverage station, mini-fridge, microwave and a dining table. Bathroom includes spacious vanity area with hairdryer. TV includes premium channels. The hotel is dog-friendly with $25/per pet/ per night. Maximum 2 dogs in selected rooms.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1268126730110509808/original/d48129d8-b003-415a-8219-eeb8c3efa53f.jpeg',598548847,40,'45.567129','-122.542194',2,2,1.00,1.00,0.00,92.00,1,365,0,1.00,1268126730110509808),(4419,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1268201952297658671','Luxury downtown condo in the pearl','Luxury 1+ bedroom condominium in Portland’s nicest downtown neighborhood, the pearl.<br />Guests love the 12 foot ceilings, amazing city views, and incredible location.<br />Over 20 of Portland’s best restaurants and bars are within 4 blocks, as well as multiple grocery stores and retail shops.<br />The Portland streetcar stops adjacent to the building, allowing guests to access the entire city via public transportation.<br />The well appointed unit features a master suite, flex space/office, 2 full bathrooms.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1268201952297658671/original/18687f4e-73fc-4b84-9f7d-07f0e72eb849.png',522020795,2,'45.529622351689994','-122.6822156086564',1,4,2.00,1.00,1.00,110.00,30,125,0,1.00,1268201952297658671),(4420,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1268431601858176762','New Private Studio Retreat in NE PDX (Beaumont)','Enjoy your private retreat in Portland, Oregon, with this new second-floor studio unit that promises modern living and comfort.<br /><br />The open layout, vaulted ceilings, and windows provide ample natural light.<br /><br />Indulge in a spa-like experience in the bathroom, featuring a luxurious walk-in shower.<br /><br />Within walking distance to many great shops/restaurants/bars and parks.<br /><br />This booking is pet-friendly and provides free always-available street parking. Book now!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1268431601858176762/original/851d55a7-ba59-4f1d-bf7d-2334234d6d33.jpeg',175752086,46,'45.54931','-122.62391',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,86.00,2,1125,7,5.00,1268431601858176762),(4421,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1270527444904770029','Elegant Retreat in Serene Gardens PD#42234','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1270527444904770029/original/254753ed-7c16-4850-a974-f94237a5deee.jpeg',657694750,81,'45.53397658938837','-122.76712360433108',1,8,3.50,4.00,4.00,267.00,30,365,0,1.00,1270527444904770029),(4422,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1270945947343299303','Stunning Views | Central Pearl District Sleeps 6','Unwind in this stylish two-bed apt in Central Pearl District. The Local area is full of award-winning restaurants, bars, shops, historic landmarks, attractions and business centers. <br /><br />✔ Long term stays <br />✔Dedicated work space <br />✔ Fully Equipped Kitchen<br />✔ Comfortable Bedrooms w/ King Bed<br />✔Queen Sleeper Sofa <br />✔ Open Concept Living Area<br />✔ High-Speed Wi-Fi<br />✔On site parking available','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-965844006304410584/original/39b84ed1-afe9-49af-846b-da3d2b3946db.jpeg',531225529,2,'45.524468712333615','-122.6843778065977',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,191.00,1,365,2,5.00,1270945947343299303),(4423,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1271164597124512665','Cully Neighborhood Backyard Birdhouse','This brand new ADU has high ceilings, big windows, a well appointed kitchen, comfortable king bed with quality bedding, and a washer dryer in unit. <br /><br />Our naturescaped yard is Backyard Habitat Certified. In a few years it will be beautifully grown in, but it’s already attracting birds and pollinators and is home to our resident wild bunny and a family of crows that nest in the trees above the house. <br /><br />A shared patio is attached to the main house facing the ADU in a courtyard-like layout.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1271164597124512665/original/ed6bbc4f-1d59-44fe-8a01-e1a23adbbdd8.jpeg',26626812,21,'45.56113906506299','-122.61256725301944',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,75.00,3,90,3,5.00,1271164597124512665),(4424,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1271256985925599564','Light Filled Townhouse','This 3-story townhouse is well designed and conveniently located in the Arbor Lodge neighborhood.  Walking distance to two grocery stores, public transportation (MAX yellow line) and restaurants.  The entry floor offers a single car garage, mud room and private back patio with plumbed gas BBQ.  The second floor offers kitchen, dining and living space and the third floor has two bedrooms with their own private bath.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1271256985925599564/original/ec219cfa-0eb8-4ee2-b773-5ce670c18631.jpeg',147951910,51,'45.573788382608186','-122.68032372745854',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,138.00,1,30,4,5.00,1271256985925599564),(4425,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1271364038118380604','Cozy condo with a view!','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space. Newly renovated and thoughtfully furnished to make you feel at home away from home. Wake up to breathtaking views of the sunrise over Mount Hood and the South Waterfront. Enjoy easy access to downtown and outside of Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1271364038118380604/original/d0ff796d-58a4-4cca-b49c-3cefe16677c8.jpeg',655053851,30,'45.497311','-122.6795935',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,68.00,30,730,0,1.00,1271364038118380604),(4426,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1271709898404641549','3 bed SpeakEasy by airport & Hospitals','Don’t let the secret out, but you found the our Speakeasy w all kinds of custom comforts. <br /><br />Super quiet and cozy with full kitchen, laundry, private entry and bike storage on a city bikeway. <br />96 biking score<br />80 walking score<br />Close  food/ shops/ airport/ downtown. <br /><br />You will have Quiet and comfy stay with Queen beds, a chefs kitchen, Italian tiled bath and 800 sqrft to call home. <br />Enjoy a high walking score neighborhood & all the great food just steps away. <br /><br />Reach out for longer stay Discount!!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1271709898404641549/original/0dad07cc-6874-4b7c-bcbb-32f1ac1fb14e.jpeg',16083734,11,'45.54636','-122.6039',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,92.00,30,300,0,1.00,1271709898404641549),(4427,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1272004366925420018','Old School PDX Cozy Craftsman Charmer (OSPiCCC)','Cool and cozy Portland house built in the mid 20s. Quiet neighborhood and close to transit, bike roads and walking to the Fremont/Cully/Hollywood areas. Old school record player, NES and 80s hi-fi setup in the living space (with aux cable to blast your tunes). Modern TV in the main bedroom. Using the hammock on the back patio is required at least once during your stay. Take a load off and still stay central to the PDX action. Cheers, Nick','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1272004366925420018/original/26f2ca00-d3c0-4296-8035-44a5b4a1be11.jpeg',21469538,11,'45.5471744','-122.5986322',1,5,2.50,2.00,2.00,87.00,2,90,0,1.00,1272004366925420018),(4428,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1272593137881426813','Walkable apt. in NE Portland (families/pets)','Welcome to the centrally located & convenient neighborhood of Alberta Arts in NE Portland. <br />Steps from the home, you\'ll find all manner of restaurants, coffee shops, entertainment, groceries, liquor store, pharmacy, art galleries and much more.<br />Our inviting 2-bedroom, 1-bath street level apt. has everything you\'ll need for your stay here in Portland. No stairs from the sidewalk or inside the apartment. Our block boasts free street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1272593137881426813/original/cd0b389c-dcb1-4d5b-8fab-e6cdc8808a07.jpeg',56920726,1,'45.56138322200676','-122.63446645985294',1,5,1.00,2.00,3.00,126.00,30,210,0,1.00,1272593137881426813),(4429,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1272696891315438608','Garden Charmer Amazing location in SE Mount Tabor','Classic Portland one bedroom street level independent apartment is part of a larger home with its own entrance and plenty of privacy. Original pine floors, spacious living room, full kitchen, bedroom with queen bed and luxury linens. Recently renovated. Lush green quiet neighborhood street close to one of the city\'s best parks: Mt. Tabor. Great proximity to shopping and restaurants on Belmont, Hawthorne, Glisan, Stark and Burnside streets. Perfect for a single or couple','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1272696891315438608/original/1be886f0-e829-4ee1-8a56-48c9aa1595f1.jpeg',22261625,15,'45.51994','-122.59968',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,135.00,1,365,2,5.00,1272696891315438608),(4430,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1272718053257401098','Mocks Crest Oasis- 5BD/2BA- Prime Location','Note: These photos are older and the home is currently getting remodeled with larger beds and more beds. The property will have 3 king beds and 2 queen beds. If you book I would be happy to confirm the overall look of the place for you with photos or video of the place. <br /><br />Welcome to your charming retreat! This spacious 5BD/2BA home blends classic charm with modern comforts. Located minutes from the University of Portland and nearby parks, it\'s ideal for family getaways or group stays.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1272718053257401098/original/6be93b77-1cbf-4a9d-8a92-92d3a30a9f26.jpeg',392859086,51,'45.57693405482944','-122.7061585490738',1,10,3.50,5.00,5.00,170.00,30,365,0,1.00,1272718053257401098),(4431,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1273213402982038654','Squiggly Room','This unique, fully furnished bedroom has a fun style all its own! <br />Room 1 of 5 in the home. Make a new friend by inviting another guest to one of the walkable neighborhood restaurant/bars!<br /><br />Our spacious home in FOPO has an open kitchen fully equipped with all of your cooking needs. With appliances such as air fryer, toaster, waffle maker, coffee maker, etc. you should have no trouble whipping up any meal you crave.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1273213402982038654/original/b2cae370-b1dc-4f47-ae4c-db304d0d1860.jpeg',58415337,65,'45.48899','-122.59797',2,2,1.50,1.00,1.00,44.00,30,90,0,1.00,1273213402982038654),(4432,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1273380101335675003','Charming 2-Bedroom Retreat','Welcome to your home away from home in the charming, historic Sellwood neighborhood! Our home offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience, just steps from an array of restaurants, cozy cafes, lively bars, and unique boutique shops. With Sellwood’s friendly, walkable atmosphere, you’ll feel immersed in the local charm the moment you arrive.<br /><br />This isn’t just any rental—it’s my personal home. I live on-site in a separate apartment, always available to make your visit as seamless as possible','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1273380101335675003/original/85be5c68-8014-4a65-933c-9bd073e32a6c.jpeg',84180202,20,'45.46661','-122.65269',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,1,365,2,5.00,1273380101335675003),(4433,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1274892065575878293','Victorian Apartment in Slabtown!','Discover charm and convenience in this third-floor Victorian-era apartment nestled in NW Portland\'s trendy Slabtown neighborhood. This bright, two-bedroom spiral stair walk-up features a cozy living room and a fully equipped kitchen designed for long-term stays. Bathed in natural light, the space is perfect for both work and relaxation. Enjoy easy access to local bars, restaurants, and essential shops, all within walking distance. A unique blend of historic charm and modern comforts awaits you!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1274892065575878293/original/d4766c38-6465-452e-82ba-6564b64afec8.jpeg',172553029,27,'45.5322323','-122.6940556',1,4,1.00,2.00,3.00,91.00,2,30,3,5.00,1274892065575878293),(4434,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1274950505762799417','Walkable, Charming Guest House','Welcome to our quiet studio guest house in the lovely neighborhood of St. Johns! <br /><br />Park in the driveway and nestle in this space that features a super comfortable queen bed, rocking chair, dining table, TV, games, and a washer/dryer for your convenience. Relax in the private bathroom with a hot shower. <br /><br />Perfect for a peaceful getaway, our guest house offers everything you need for a comfortable stay -- even the drawers are labeled for ease of access to limit the stress of looking for things!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1274950505762799417/original/41eeb5af-312c-4a98-80f1-b5a58fdc7e3a.jpeg',405693839,58,'45.58623742589761','-122.74125338017689',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,2,30,3,4.67,1274950505762799417),(4435,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1275453275419754090','Fresh Slabtown Charmer w/ 99 WalkScore','Welcome to our beautiful NW Portland Home!<br /><br />Location, location, location! A walker\'s paradise with a walk score of 99, our stylish home has brand new stainless steel appliances, 4 queen beds, 2 baths, and can sleep up to 8 guests comfortably.<br /><br />Our charming, yet modern and updated home is located in the heart of NW Portland - nestled between Alphabet and Pearl Districts, restaurants, independent bookstores and shops.<br /><br />We\'re also close to Alberta Arts, Mississippi and Downtown PDX!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1275453275419754090/original/caab5617-f801-4b2e-a3b7-417871b6fea1.jpeg',309781078,27,'45.52957688579369','-122.68843411280992',1,8,2.00,3.00,4.00,179.00,1,365,3,5.00,1275453275419754090),(4436,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1275558919065532462','Covered Backdeck in NE Portland','Enjoy the Pacific Northwest under a covered deck in a beautifully landscaped private backyard! This home has tons of natural light and beauty right outside the windows. One queen bed located on the main floor and a king bed upstairs. Finished basement with entertainment center. Recently remodeled kitchen. And a 200 sq/ft bonus shed. Parkblocks located directly across the street. One block from food carts, Juniors cafe, and Upright Brewing beer station. 10 minutes to the Portland airport','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1275558919065532462/original/dc48e30b-e1de-4271-b124-f2e1d612f87e.jpeg',658977106,39,'45.55442074416993','-122.58924884914691',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,96.00,30,365,0,1.00,1275558919065532462),(4437,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1275773195220377758','Rosewater Rm*Private Entry&Bath*Spacious*Fridge','Walk to shops, services, restaurants, breweries, bars, venues and Peninsula Park rose garden. ~15-min drive to airport. ~10-min drive to downtown Portland. Off-street parking $20/night payable to host. Occasional access to host\'s kitchen upstairs is limited (case by case advance approval). Air mattress with headboard available for 3 or more guests checking in.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1275773195220377758/original/000bd8c7-7e78-4e87-a7fa-fb8aa037be64.jpeg',9181734,24,'45.559283410422466','-122.66665946692228',2,7,1.00,1.00,1.00,52.00,2,7,1,5.00,1275773195220377758),(4438,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1277076071358137325','Empress Rose','Welcome to the Empress! This vintage condo was once part of a downtown Portland Hotel. Now reimagined into apartments, this historic building is full of charm.  The space is decorated with art and antiques curated from around the United States. The cozy cottage core vibe is set against amazing views of downtown Portland, and even Mount Hood on a clear day. This special place is close to everything, and is a short walking distance from Providence Park Stadium, making it easy to plan your visit.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1277076071358137325/original/92ccf317-0ff0-4176-9e2e-a1a282a36b11.jpeg',248639891,2,'45.52409','-122.68629',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,70.00,3,95,0,1.00,1277076071358137325),(4439,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1277813417524489276','Charming East Portland Base: Explore & Unwind','Whether you\'re a foodie, craft beer enthusiast, coffee connoisseur, or a lover of the great outdoors, discover what the City of Roses has to offer at our newly remodeled three-bedroom apartment in central downtown. Perfectly situated on the edge of the Belmont District, our private home provides a comfortable haven for you. Enjoy a home-away-from-home experience in a prime location, ready to explore everything that makes Portland uniquely weird!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53108500/original/f89da8df-ffe2-4473-9936-c380e54ca110.jpeg',293772932,16,'45.51602500108407','-122.61309238775954',1,4,1.50,2.00,2.00,228.00,1,365,0,1.00,1277813417524489276),(4440,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1277826419165300595','Modern 3 BR Home Walkable to Alberta and more','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 90/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee, etc. this is your place. Our fun home sits at the heart of the eclectic NE District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around. With a convenient home base within walking distance to the neighborhood hot spots, you can get an authentic taste of how the hipsters live in Stumptown.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-53891208/original/416ea750-82a8-4c46-b360-fbfe8a1b796d.jpeg',374074476,14,'45.56095','-122.6627',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,122.00,1,365,0,1.00,1277826419165300595),(4441,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1277922303298190178','Portland Chalet','Newly furnished large one bedroom units. Everything you would need if coming from out of town. Great location close to downtown and freeway access.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1277922303298190178/original/337e3290-9aae-4840-81a3-e9b46d8b57a5.jpeg',8680367,56,'45.49734','-122.64041',1,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,50.00,30,365,0,1.00,1277922303298190178),(4442,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1278623460948012474','Tropical Room at Hayhurst Hideaway','Hayhurst Hideaway is a gorgeous modern home. Enjoy a soak in our hot tub surrounded by beautiful trees. <br /><br />This stylish place is perfect for couples or people looking for a staycation or travel stop. With fabulous restaurants and bars just minutes away, this is the ideal spot for whatever brings you to Portland. <br /><br />The living room and kitchenette are stocked with the equipment to cook and eat at home. There is a writing desk and chair in the bedroom and good wifi capable of handling video calls.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1278623460948012474/original/2c8a4530-58f4-4a8c-9d3b-9f037c0286ad.jpeg',29156235,17,'45.48528','-122.72636',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,30.00,1,90,0,1.00,1278623460948012474),(4443,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1279048683747200462','G UNIT Luxury Penthouse','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located modern condo building close to all the action. Wygant Flats is a 8 unit condo building built in 2020.  The G unit just got fresh paint and new furniture ready to host your next Portland stay.  11ft ceilings with an open concept living room and kitchen. High end appliance package and finishes this is a great place to host a dinner party. Views of the NW Hills from your balcony. Perfect central location 5 minutes to downtown or all the NorthPDX','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1279048683747200462/original/7032d7c5-7c0f-441d-9d29-084617edd53f.jpeg',18210091,13,'45.55838359386282','-122.68158405992216',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,145.00,30,365,0,1.00,1279048683747200462),(4444,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1280053974013789953','New Spacious Basement Apartment','Spacious, new one-bedroom basement apartment on quiet cul-de-sac with nearby park. <br />Near Hollywood district of Portland, less than four miles from airport and within walking distance of bus and Max transit. <br />Porcelain tile floors with radiant floor heating. <br />King size bed with high end medium-firm mattress. <br />Fully equipped kitchen.<br />Grand room includes dining table, modern sofa and coffee/end tables, Ekornes stressless chair, and 55\" flat screen TV with some streaming services.<br />Come enjoy!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1280053974013789953/original/5028be29-b620-428e-b2ad-7c61497a8bb5.jpeg',21616055,11,'45.5331229','-122.6069765',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,63.00,2,30,2,5.00,1280053974013789953),(4445,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1280132393007097652','Bright and Cozy in Kenton','Reach out for special pricing!! <br /><br />This stunning 3/2.5 bath single family home with fully fenced yard, off street parking, full kitchen with viking gas appliances, including vitamix and espresso machine! Enjoy the home gym, sauna AND personal movie theater along with two dedicated work zones, AC, and a master suite with king bed, double vanities and walk in shower. This space is the perfect landing for a month or 3 in Portland.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1280132393007097652/original/d78ebe06-41d5-494b-9b55-cc26d7eb35aa.jpeg',501414071,55,'45.584527290724836','-122.69947347430183',1,8,2.50,3.00,4.00,144.00,30,365,0,1.00,1280132393007097652),(4446,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1281405876459557317','Villa Eco-Studio','Completely separate/private & recently remodeled space. Appliances are all new. Uniquely curated space with many sustainable & eco-friendly materials. Amazing central location in heart of the Montavilla neighborhood. Mt. Tabor Park is just about a 1/2 mile away. Many high rated eateries just steps away. No shortage of nearby groceries. There’s even a movie theatre! Don’t miss out on Montavilla, it’s a total gem!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1281405876459557317/original/2048b66c-c3ee-489f-b955-4be27212c9a4.jpeg',9463317,10,'45.517183','-122.5811185',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,50.00,30,365,0,1.00,1281405876459557317),(4447,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1282608869770505839','Cozy Walkable House in SE','Cozy duplex perfect for anyone located in the hip Foster/Powell neighborhood! Retro Kitchen with up to date appliances, cute living room with 2 comfy couches. Retro Super Nintendo game console, board games, books and a smart TV leaving you with endless possibilities to relax after a long day at work. Super walkable to coffee shops, restaurants, and many more! Close to Mount Tabor which will leave you with breathtaking views of downtown Portland. Small fenced backyard + off-street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1282608869770505839/original/58b29a75-e7b4-4a8d-b14f-a2110894fb54.png',660514419,67,'45.4923130244959','-122.60525004700995',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,100.00,30,365,0,1.00,1282608869770505839),(4448,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1282888940596331038','The Mint Chip','Is there anything better than mint chip ice cream, old growth trees and strolls in the park! Steps to Powell Butte\'s 600+ acre nature park this space lives large at 1200 sf. This 2 bed 1 bath ADU welcomes you home with style and comfort. <br />This home features:<br />- pet-friendly<br />- fully fenced-in, attached private yard<br />- dedicated workspace<br />- fast internet<br />- fully stocked kitchen<br />- Smart Tvs<br />-2 Queen memory foam beds <br />-In unit laundry','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1282888940596331038/original/d2ff4c30-7b61-45a3-8481-f8fc149cb818.jpeg',501414071,87,'45.49298','-122.5068',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,84.00,30,365,0,1.00,1282888940596331038),(4449,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1282957605830083086','Charming Flat in NW','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.  Welcome to our charming, fully furnished main-level flat at Irving Street Towers. Located in the heart of the trendy NW Nob Hill, steps from the popular NW 23rd and 21st Ave! Tons of character in this historic building, offering a blend of classic craftsmanship and modern convenience.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1282957605830083086/original/968c1506-4575-403d-bcb2-2440290f3d48.jpeg',370069479,27,'45.5279012','-122.6947192',1,4,1.00,1.00,1.00,76.00,30,365,0,1.00,1282957605830083086),(4450,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1283378931114277369','Family-friendly Kenton Home','A welcoming living room with a smart projector provides the ideal space for relaxation, while a fully stocked kitchen and dining area make meals a breeze. Enjoy upgraded outdoor living spaces, including covered front and back patios. The primary bedroom features a king bed, walk-in closet, and private bath, in addition to two additional kid-friendly bedrooms includes a climbing gym, full bed, twin bed, and crib. Parks, restaurants, and public transit all within walking distance!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1283378931114277369/original/7e3abeee-9659-4abc-bf7f-353d893d850d.jpeg',24150641,55,'45.587834347892716','-122.70189214347333',1,6,2.50,3.00,3.00,113.00,30,365,0,1.00,1283378931114277369),(4451,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1283404665212734496','Cully Dreamhouse','Our home is the oldest original farmhouse in our neighbourhood.  From the archways and cove ceilings to the heated bathroom floor and big screen entertainment system, our home retains its historic charm while providing modern luxury.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1283404665212734496/original/13896425-4946-44bc-9ad1-5f52287d6e9b.jpeg',563061,21,'45.5577439','-122.6092777',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,153.00,3,365,0,1.00,1283404665212734496),(4452,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1283568174210420936','Studio 1 Bath, OHSU, Dog Friendly (04E)','Private and spacious studio apartment in a very safe neighborhood.<br /><br />- Studio unit with Kitchenette.<br />- Near convenience store and restaurants.<br />- Wifi, and utilities included.<br />- Mini-split AC installed for the ultimate comfort.<br />- Pet friendly, no breed restrictions, fenced yard in front, no pet fees.<br />- Many previous guests often walk home during lunch to take care of their pets.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1283568174210420936/original/544b9607-5e40-4418-bacc-bdcae2268785.jpeg',410009654,30,'45.49667','-122.6912',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,278.00,30,365,0,1.00,1283568174210420936),(4453,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1284142698359772731','The Gable House','Experience the warmth and charm of the spacious The Gable House, a 1913 Craftsman-style 6-bedroom home, ideal for traveling nurses and healthcare professionals. Conveniently close to major hospitals, this distinctive home blends classic architectural details modern amenities.<br /><br />The Gable House is conveniently located in central Portland, just a few blocks away from Portland’s  Kern neighborhood, named one of the top 10 Coolest Neighborhoods in the World by Time Out Magazine 2024.  ','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI4NDE0MjY5ODM1OTc3MjczMQ%3D%3D/original/c413a081-1f1c-44a0-80e1-415c76789ed8.jpeg',372413573,4,'45.53442938275042','-122.64304256574249',2,2,2.50,1.00,2.00,47.00,30,365,0,1.00,1284142698359772731),(4454,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1285108003318001457','Good Morning City, River!','This special place is close to everything, making it easy to plan your visit.  Wake up to coffee on the balcony with beautiful sunrise over the river.  Take a walk or streetcar to all parts of the City from this convenient downtown condo!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1285108003318001457/original/13a14906-9ba7-4b43-ae12-e97583165b2b.jpeg',45681974,44,'45.510415547436565','-122.67976405906658',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,47.00,31,200,0,1.00,1285108003318001457),(4455,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1285671867479177183','Artsy - renovation in progress','2 blocks from the best shopping, dining, coffee shops and music venues in Portland.<br /><br />Room with queen bed.<br /><br />Walk to 3 grocery stores from our house.<br /><br />Historic worn house, with shared luxury bathroom.<br /><br />Hardscaping in progress (yard renovation)','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1285671867479177183/original/52bb717b-c0de-4e42-9b87-bb1ae0c48561.jpeg',653792378,8,'45.511104638692736','-122.6249973806618',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,365,1,4.00,1285671867479177183),(4456,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1286264310360856929','Monthly Stay among Iconic Neighborhoods and Trails','Relax in this stylish, serene rental nestled in the heart of Portland’s quintessential neighborhoods: Eastmoreland, Woodstock, and Sellwood. Enjoy quick access to miles of scenic walking trails. This well-equipped space includes a luxurious mattress, blackout blinds, workspace, in-unit laundry, dishwasher, smart TV, WiFi, and reserved parking spot. Friendly neighbors, excellent schools/colleges, and easy access to hospitals, businesses, and public transit make this perfect for an extended stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1286264310360856929/original/7fd22d77-6b4c-4fc0-95af-1139a9de4f48.jpeg',661317538,5,'45.4655117292041','-122.6227076421547',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,80.00,30,365,0,1.00,1286264310360856929),(4457,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1286348556240734822','Bright newly renovated basement apartment','Kick back and relax in this calm, stylish space.<br />Well appointed modern two-bedroom apartment  in a prime location near vibrant bars, top restaurants, and convenient bus lines! Street parking is plentiful. Fully appointed with all essentials for living and cooking, as the homeowner previously resided here for six months. Perfect for pet-friendly renters seeking a well-equipped, ideally located unit with a knowledgeable, on-site homeowner!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1286348556240734822/original/6e1b8a2f-fda9-4de6-8076-10305ebdc057.jpeg',33038338,45,'45.572997908712864','-122.64540106974353',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,85.00,1,45,3,5.00,1286348556240734822),(4458,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1287380872845413447','Beautiful New Studio Amazing Location','Welcome to our chic and modern tiny house, nestled in the heart of North Portland and just a short stroll from the light rail. Here, you can embrace the charm of tiny living without compromising on comfort. The space offers a cumfy bed, a kitchenette, and a modern bathroom stocked with all the essentials. Designed to feel open and inviting,  and large window doors fill the interior with natural light.  This tiny house provides the perfect retreat for a comfortable and relaxing stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1287380872845413447/original/446a018a-755c-4ee8-a8a8-d80f92cfc018.jpeg',347291255,13,'45.56628648552776','-122.6820358496817',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,80.00,1,365,1,5.00,1287380872845413447),(4459,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1287382163485871849','Cozy Portland Hills Home Made For Parents & Kids','Located in the stunning NW Portland Hills, you\'ll fall in love with the views, peace, and safety. Nike and Intel campuses, Forest Park hiking trails, and the city\'s best cycling are all here. And downtown is only 8 miles away!<br /><br />Our magic sauce is our mother\'s collection of children\'s books, board games, and child-friendly needs - a cumulation of 30+ years of teaching. <br /><br />Between the commons are three bedrooms, a bathroom, a full kitchen, and yoga friendly deck on the same floor.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-622498954503960798/original/39825dcf-fb4e-4214-8e67-554749426cd3.jpeg',7869789,81,'45.55164749059923','-122.77735004922235',1,7,1.00,3.00,2.00,219.00,30,365,0,1.00,1287382163485871849),(4460,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1287850780187849074','NE Portland 1 bdrm Apartment (Private Entry)','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place. This modern and well-appointed apartment features a queen-sized bed with plush linens, a spacious living area with a comfy sofa, and a Peloton bike and tread for your use. Enjoy the convenience of a clean and bright bathroom with direct access from the office and the bedroom. Includes fresh towels and toiletries for your comfort.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1287850780187849074/original/be0f2755-88b5-4ccd-af40-7ee1b0b84f9b.jpeg',4912906,11,'45.54599294147656','-122.60937766194345',2,3,1.00,1.00,1.00,60.00,3,28,0,1.00,1287850780187849074),(4461,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1287925404088392895','Modern 2bed/bath Outer SE PDX','Modern Apt in SE PDX.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1287925404088392895/original/1bacdbdb-a61b-43e3-adc9-44db2c823265.jpeg',52609760,36,'45.4933285419593','-122.59938170623323',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,108.00,1,1125,1,5.00,1287925404088392895),(4462,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1288326516091404242','Private Guest Suite in Beautiful Alberta Home','Beautiful, quiet guest suite in million dollar Dutch Colonial home in Portland’s iconic Alberta Arts District neighborhood. Furnished with high-end, comfortable furnishings, you have it all. Centrally located and just minutes from downtown, this private space sits a half block from Alberta street and has an amazing walking score, offering guests immediate access to some of Portland’s best restaurants, breweries, cafes, bars, food trucks, stores, shops, art galleries, parks, public transportation','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1288326516091404242/original/f707d96c-4a6b-44fa-b5c9-0cdf00d5d583.jpeg',74887347,1,'45.559331463556504','-122.64018913039882',1,5,1.00,1.00,1.00,85.00,2,1125,1,5.00,1288326516091404242),(4463,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1289197474809470307','Modern Apt. Downtown Portland','Hello and welcome to MW8 Apartments! We offer fully furnished apartments in Portland, Oregon. If you are looking to experience all of the benefits of downtown living, look no further. We are located in the heart of downtown Portland Oregon. With nearby access to the Portland Streetcar, MAX Light Rail, TriMet bus stops, and the downtown TriMet transit Center, commuting is a breeze for our residents.  Combining convenience with quality is our niche.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1289197474809470307/original/efc44753-9f53-4600-85fa-7d7ae18b6c78.jpeg',392860183,44,'45.509501812633125','-122.68194986216845',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,129.00,30,365,0,1.00,1289197474809470307),(4464,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1289307549238720838','Brand-New Apt, 5 min to OHSU!','This modern unit offers a fresh, comfortable space with all the conveniences you need for a perfect stay. You\'ll find yourself in a quiet building with zero prior tenants, ensuring an untouched, pristine environment. <br /><br />Perfect for professionals, students, or visitors to OHSU, this apartment features an open layout and fast Wi-Fi. You’ll have easy access to public transportation, local dining spots, and Portland’s scenic parks.<br /><br />5-7 min to OHSU!!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1289307549238720838/original/56b9192c-9b55-4f1b-8d1c-f81c0fa5f499.png',524344892,22,'45.49726','-122.67452',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,95.00,30,365,0,1.00,1289307549238720838),(4465,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1289354240769388620','Walkable Rose City Getaway','Welcome to the City of Roses! Nestle into our adorable & freshly furnished home in Portland proper. It is in the incredibly walkable Hollywood/Rose City neighborhood in North East Portland.<br /><br />Walking distance to a ton of restaurants, coffee shops, food carts, sports bar, & more. The home has easy access to all our favorite Portland haunts!  Walk to Rose City park, golf course and tennis courts. 10  minutes to downtown Portland and 12 Minutes to Downtown Vancouver.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1289354240769388620/original/19e3633c-ac87-4aca-bda3-686eac51ed1b.jpeg',67772888,11,'45.537015973867604','-122.60402856642433',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,3,365,0,1.00,1289354240769388620),(4466,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1290263298854218718','Walkable Rose City Apartment','Welcome to the City of Roses! Nestle into our adorable & freshly furnished apartment in Portland proper. It is in the incredibly walkable Hollywood/Rose City neighborhood in NE Portland.<br /><br />Walking distance to a ton of restaurants, coffee shops, food carts, sports bar, & more. Our apartment has easy access to all our favorite Portland haunts!  Walk to Rose City park, golf course and tennis courts. 10  minutes to downtown Portland  and 12 Minutes to Downtown Vancouver.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1290263298854218718/original/24f72a5a-7885-4e5e-9500-05cb917040ef.jpeg',67772888,11,'45.53616374517969','-122.60255388182813',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,119.00,3,365,0,1.00,1290263298854218718),(4467,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1290823387362273646','Room in 1911 farmhouse near Reed and Trader Joe\'s','A first floor bedroom in a 1911 farmhouse near Reed College, across the street from Trader Joe\'s, and near some popular SE Portland bar/restaurant destinations (Gladstone, Woodstock, Division, Hawthorne). Make yourself at home in the rest of the house, including the kitchen, living room, dining room, and patio. The first floor bathroom is reserved for Airbnb guests (we rent two rooms) but a good chance you have it to yourself. Includes folding table and chair for working, and washer and dryer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1290823387362273646/original/1790f4af-162c-40c1-aa82-4948660c67c5.jpeg',8793178,38,'45.48915218372368','-122.62272662547863',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,48.00,1,45,1,5.00,1290823387362273646),(4468,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1290914754175591744','Graffiti/renovation in progress','Hardscaping in progress<br /><br />Basement room, Queen bed<br /><br />Best location in Portland. Hip neighborhood feel. <br /><br />Room in quintessential worn century old house. <br /><br />Shared renovated luxury bathroom.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1290914754175591744/original/bc9ae060-9467-4783-8986-9fafdfb050c5.jpeg',653792378,8,'45.50983988704511','-122.62414590892205',2,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,53.00,30,365,0,1.00,1290914754175591744),(4469,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1290994617734367758','Rose City Basement Retreat','Welcome to your cozy, private 2-bedroom, 1-bath basement retreat in the heart of Portland! Nestled on a spacious 0.3-acre lot surrounded by lush trees, this serene getaway offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Whether you\'re looking to explore the vibrant city or relax in nature, this is the ideal home base. Forget your worries in this spacious and serene space. Surrounded by trees, the expansive yard provides plenty of space to enjoy the outdoors.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1290994617734367758/original/629cc897-6fa5-40a9-9855-9e22b38042e9.png',35390809,86,'45.459432462439864','-122.69618273495925',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,130.00,5,365,0,1.00,1290994617734367758),(4470,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1291573482930896948','Cozy 2-Bedroom Getaway','Modern 2-Bedroom Retreat in SE Portland<br /><br />Step into this beautifully designed 2-bedroom unit in the heart of SE Portland, offering a perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience. Whether you’re visiting for work or leisure, this space provides everything you need for a relaxing stay.<br /><br />Located close to trendy shops, local cafes, and vibrant nightlife, this SE Portland gem is the perfect base for exploring the city.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1291573482930896948/original/acf4acdb-d69d-4556-9539-a6c983790746.jpeg',381505779,56,'45.4998124','-122.6529472',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,129.00,1,365,1,5.00,1291573482930896948),(4471,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1291616492956336054','Charming 2BR Cottage Retreat + 16\' Backyard Yurt','Welcome to Regina’s quaint cottage, a perfect blend of vintage charm and modern comfort!<br /><br />Nestled at the foot of Mount Tabor, mere minutes from the heart of SE Portland and conveniently located near major city arteries, this delightful 2 bedroom retreat also features a 16\' backyard yurt in addition to the main home, making it an ideal home away from home for couples, families, or friends looking to spend some quality time together while exploring everything Portland has to offer.','South Tabor, named because it is located just south of popular and picturesque Mount Tabor Park, is conveniently located close to many major city arteries, making getting around very easy. It is also a quite walkable area that is home to many beautiful gardens, a neighborhood gathering place at 61st and Clinton built by City Repair, and a Farmers Market.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI5MTYxNjQ5Mjk1NjMzNjA1NA%3D%3D/original/8dfd4123-5eb2-4d8d-af4a-fc7d3bc22d59.jpeg',5382362,36,'45.49743670163076','-122.59313702313212',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,159.00,2,28,0,1.00,1291616492956336054),(4472,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1292164626775706180','Bright Home in Walkable Richmond','Modern, bright two-bedroom, two-bath home with vaulted ceilings and an open layout. Features include a fully equipped kitchen with a dishwasher, high-speed internet, a Peloton bike, and a washer/dryer off the master suite. The master bedroom has blackout blinds and an ensuite bath with skylights. The versatile second bedroom can serve as an office or guest room. Enjoy the outdoor patio with a gas fireplace and mini grill. Safe, clean, and close to everything—perfect for work and relaxation!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1292164626775706180/original/153d0bc8-ac89-45f0-894c-546f89992a1f.jpeg',85235637,8,'45.5032809534443','-122.63062041024027',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,150.00,30,365,0,1.00,1292164626775706180),(4473,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1292783906868554609','New Guest Suite in Alberta Arts Dist.','Brand New in Portland\'s Alberta Arts District. This stylish unit sleeps 4. Featuring a custom mural and local art throughout. Steps away from Portland\'s hot dining scene, with over 50 bars, restaurants and food carts within walking distance. This newly renovated space has been thoughtfully appointed to make your stay both relaxing and memorable.<br /><br />This light and airy space comes with high-speed internet, oversized windows, blackout curtains and sound proofing applications to enhance your stay.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1292783906868554609/original/93d0f094-dad2-431e-b825-efce95c9dc34.jpeg',323461842,1,'45.5606897','-122.6346123',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,65.00,1,30,3,5.00,1292783906868554609),(4474,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1292813161295843408','Lola\'s basement retreat','Newly remodeled basement apartment located in the Mississippi District of Portland. Flexible layout, this apartment can serve as a two-bedroom space or as a one-bedroom with an office. The 8-foot ceilings create an open, spacious feel.<br /><br />A complete kitchen with a fridge, stove, microwave, coffee maker, air fryer, and beverage cooler. The second bedroom includes a twin daybed that easily converts to a queen and also has a portable sit/stand laptop stand. On-site shared laundry.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1292813161295843408/original/86d8300b-1c20-4af4-99de-23adf3160794.jpeg',74140845,24,'45.55929608783317','-122.67588593359018',1,3,1.00,2.00,2.00,66.00,31,365,0,1.00,1292813161295843408),(4475,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1292912173809854297','Modern Studio Steps from OHSU!','Spacious and modern studio apartment set among the trees at the doorstep of the medical campus on Marquam Hill. Forward architecture, contemporary interiors, a rooftop retreat, Momiji Sushi on ground floor, park-like surroundings and trails – all with instant access to OHSU and just minutes to the South Waterfront and downtown Portland, Oregon. Fully equipped with full kitchen including dishwasher, washer/dryer, cozy linens, and comfy sofa bed from Crate and Barrel.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1292912173809854297/original/78ddf4f7-63a9-4071-b58b-ec5eb8f1dcd1.jpeg',532092702,30,'45.49720337692543','-122.68817361734267',1,2,1.00,0.00,1.00,60.00,31,365,0,1.00,1292912173809854297),(4476,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1293106783608757593','Charming & Cozy Retreat in Portland','Welcome to your peaceful retreat in the Hayhurst neighborhood! This cozy bedroom offers the best of both worlds: serene natural surroundings 