ving room and a separate dining area that also doubles as a work space. The full size kitchen features full size appliances and the huge, clean basement is for perfect for all your storage needs. The spacious 2 bedrooms are furnished with queen sized beds and there is a large fully fenced backyard for your pet to enjoy.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1295079032465864442/original/270bf833-bcb4-4b54-8fdd-e86023f1d3f3.jpeg',652450228,32,'45.51792330833162','-122.64642209352544',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,120.00,30,548,0,1.00,1295079032465864442),(4498,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1296355512400960966','Sedona Vibes in PDX ~ Walk to Local Shops & Coffee','Explore the Alberta Arts district right outside the front door of this spacious tasteful 2 BR home. In the heart of Alberta District with acclaimed restaurants, bars, and shops steps away. If you want to stay in, enjoy your favorite shows and movies, with a giant 65\" 4KTV, YouTube TV and blazing gigabit speed internet. Or whip up your favorite meal in the full kitchen. No matter what you need you\'ll be sure to find it here!','Nestled in the heart of Portland, the Alberta Arts District is a vibrant, eclectic neighborhood renowned for its rich culture, artistic spirit, and lively community. This area is a haven for artists, foodies, and culture enthusiasts alike, offering a dynamic blend of creativity and innovation at every turn.<br /><br />Stroll along Alberta Street, the district’s main artery, where you’ll find an array of art galleries, unique boutiques, and local shops showcasing the work of Portland’s talented artisans. Every Last Thursday of the month, the street transforms into a bustling art walk, featuring live performances, street vendors, and an open-air gallery experience that’s not to be missed.<br /><br />Food lovers will delight in the diverse culinary scene, with a variety of eateries serving up everything from gourmet farm-to-table dishes to mouthwatering street food. Whether you’re in the mood for a cozy café, a trendy brunch spot, or an evening at one of the neighborhood’s popular breweri','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1296355512400960966/original/b845fbec-cc98-46f0-8664-d318858c1e3b.jpeg',592522307,1,'45.56049','-122.63788',1,2,1.00,1.00,1.00,164.00,1,365,0,1.00,1296355512400960966),(4499,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1296367678914617775','HeartofHawthorne MidCentury Dream 95 WalkScore 2BR','Live out your mid-century modern dream in this newly renovated Southeast charmer. Perfectly situated in the heart of Hawthorne, you can walk to the best shows, thrift shops, and restaurants in seconds. My home was thoughtfully renovated with an emphasis on living local: the floors, cabinets, and cabinet pulls were all manufactured here in the Northwest using sustainable practices!','Hawthorne, often hailed as the Heart of Portland, truly lives up to its reputation. This vibrant neighborhood boasts some of the city\'s best restaurants, concert venues, and vintage thrift stores, all lining the bustling streets. You could easily spend your entire trip exploring these few blocks and never run out of exciting options.<br /><br />The dining scene in Hawthorne is unparalleled, offering a diverse array of culinary delights. From farm-to-table eateries and trendy brunch spots to food carts serving global cuisines, there’s something to satisfy every palate. Don’t miss out on iconic local favorites like Apizza Scholls and Por Qué No.<br /><br />Music lovers will appreciate the live music venues scattered throughout the area, featuring both local talents and touring artists. Catch an intimate show at the historic Aladdin Theater or groove to the beats at the cozy Hawthorne Theatre.<br /><br />For those who love to shop, Hawthorne is a treasure trove of unique finds. Wander thr','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1296367678914617775/original/4f7855fe-50fc-4112-bda2-13419bdc6e6a.jpeg',88253867,8,'45.51199391162046','-122.62166401440885',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,264.00,1,365,0,1.00,1296367678914617775),(4500,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1296420745117627912','Luxury Living on NW 23rd Ave, Walk Score 99','Welcome to the best-located Airbnb in Portland! Nestled in the Alphabet District on NW 23rd, this historic yet modern 3000 sq ft home features two units—a 4-bedroom and a 2-bedroom—comfortably sleeping up to 16 guests. Fully renovated, it boasts brand-new stainless steel appliances, blazing fast WiFi, and classic charm blended with modern convenience. Steps from Salt & Straw, bars, restaurants, and shops, it’s a walker’s paradise with a walk score of 99!','With its ornate Victorian houses and tree-lined streets, fashionable Nob Hill is a charming and established neighborhood. Known for its trendy shopping on 23rd Avenue, Nob Hill offers a unique blend of upscale boutiques and eclectic shops. The neighborhood boasts a thriving dining scene, featuring refined restaurants and laid-back eateries serving a variety of international cuisines. Cozy cafes add to the charm, pouring specialty coffee that attracts both locals and visitors alike. Nob Hill perfectly combines historic elegance with modern vibrancy, making it a must-visit destination in Portland.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1296420745117627912/original/9f3c2fdf-b9c7-4d28-a82b-a1b55ffce1f7.jpeg',286367128,27,'45.52931398529465','-122.69931123035283',1,16,3.00,6.00,7.00,1.00,1,365,0,1.00,1296420745117627912),(4501,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1296563601263020523','Basement suite in North Portland','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1296563601263020523/original/44935c0b-b78c-43b2-a07a-37a3781c8291.jpeg',1886343,48,'45.57519','-122.67633',2,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,54.00,30,65,0,1.00,1296563601263020523),(4502,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1296835499508566929','Garden Oasis in Se PDX W/Bikes','Enjoy our covered porch&lovely fenced backyard, our garden has raspberries, blueberries, rhubarb,fruit trees <br />All hardwood floors, with floor to ceiling windows and a woodstove to cuddle up to in the evening. <br /><br />quite block is nestled between 2 great districts. The classic Woodstock shopping district which features delicious dining and a cozy old town feelings. north is foster which has ample bars  Detroit style pizza, brunch spots and the wonderful mercado with pan Latin American food carts.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1296835499508566929/original/3c0fb27e-63b3-403e-b6fe-8ab1203bca5e.jpeg',129809851,38,'45.485065551344796','-122.6021506691977',1,3,1.50,2.00,2.00,72.00,30,365,0,1.00,1296835499508566929),(4503,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1297466901520339667','Newly Remodeled Private Suite w/ Separate Entry','Cozy Retreat 20 Minutes from PDX<br /><br />Make yourself at home in our newly remodeled two-bedroom suite, ideal for travelers, families, or business visitors. Enjoy comfy beds, a fresh modern design, private entry, and a kitchenette for light meals and snacks. Nestled in a gently elevated and quiet neighborhood, you’re just a short drive from dining, parks, and local attractions. A perfect blend of comfort and convenience awaits—book now for a relaxing and memorable Portland stay!','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1297466901520339667/original/cddde9e6-f146-40b2-9850-519a15975c49.jpeg',663853304,78,'45.48438','-122.52043',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,75.00,1,14,0,1.00,1297466901520339667),(4504,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1297640104235745801','Luxury Apartment in Central Pearl | 9','Unwind in this stylish two-bed apt in Central Pearl District. The Local area is full of award-winning restaurants, bars, shops, historic landmarks, attractions and business centers. <br /><br />✔ Long term stays <br />✔Dedicated work space <br />✔ Fully Equipped Kitchen<br />✔ Comfortable Bedrooms w/ King Bed<br />✔Queen Sleeper Sofa <br />✔ Open Concept Living Area<br />✔ High-Speed Wi-Fi<br />✔On site parking available','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-965844006304410584/original/9a6b2b40-4f3c-4ee4-b01b-b814dc7aa789.jpeg',531225529,2,'45.52518714725655','-122.68442676980821',1,6,2.00,2.00,3.00,160.00,1,365,0,1.00,1297640104235745801),(4505,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1297644131209088720','A Charming Hideaway in SE','Keep it simple at this peaceful and centrally-located place. Fully remodeled as of last year with brand new everything. A walking distance to great dining and wonderful parks. Fully fenced backyard.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1297644131209088720/original/6ba3f996-1717-4623-a165-efbd67bdb1b5.png',226607963,16,'45.51824960673026','-122.62044108797728',1,6,2.00,3.00,3.00,183.00,30,365,0,1.00,1297644131209088720),(4506,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298033172987565345','Apt in Alberta Arts District: Walkable Paradise!','','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1298033172987565345/original/76dfbdb4-eb26-4591-801a-40dda5eccbd7.jpeg',121688409,1,'45.55734416209358','-122.6342863485894',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,101.00,2,1125,0,1.00,1298033172987565345),(4507,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298154277738180105','Modern Cozy & Private Retreat','Newly remodeled, luxurious 2-bedroom, 1-bath daylight basement apartment, just 5 min from NW 23rd Ave and 10 min from the Pearl District. Enjoy a spacious living room, large bedrooms, and a full kitchen for all your culinary adventures. The bathroom features double sinks, and a stacked washer/dryer with a deep sink adds convenience. This apartment offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and a prime location for your Portland getaway.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1298154277738180105/original/e5f2cc89-6565-426f-8345-fb7e05153eba.jpeg',249997321,27,'45.53788489999999','-122.7157792',1,5,1.00,2.00,2.00,111.00,2,365,0,1.00,1298154277738180105),(4508,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298156356623670303','Brand new duplex with patio','Stunning New One-Bedroom single level. Nestled in the Sellwood neighborhood, you\'ll be surrounded by shopping, coffee shops, and restaurants within 1 block! <br /><br />Enjoy the convenience of in-unit laundry and a modern bathroom with a rain shower head. The airy space boasts 14-foot ceilings and skylights. Sofa features an additional queen sleeper bed. <br /><br />The kitchen includes a hand crafted live edge table and quartz countertops. Outside, you\'ll find a charming fenced patio with a table and grill.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1298156356623670303/original/1897b4c7-39ec-4ff0-aa3d-d61f6a294506.jpeg',3382661,20,'45.46629194837467','-122.64918414984773',1,2,1.00,1.00,2.00,66.00,30,365,0,1.00,1298156356623670303),(4509,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298248474554381134','Stylish Luxe Suite N Williams & Alberta Districts','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer. This is a sublisting of a main home.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1298248474554381134/original/a9050d9b-da81-4f77-a9f3-1f76cc1eb79c.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.558317261133844','-122.6674191400125',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,1,365,0,1.00,1298248474554381134),(4510,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298255919482982300','The Cascadia Retreat - Luxury Home ~ 90 WalkScore','Perfectly nestled between some of the most vibrant neighborhoods in North Portland, our location offers unparalleled convenience. Within moments, you can walk to the bustling bars, renowned restaurants, and lively shows on Williams, N Mississippi, and Alberta streets. This brand-new building, featuring high-end finishes, provides a luxurious retreat where you can unwind after a day of exploring all that Portland has to offer. Sublisting of main home.','Location, location, location! You won\'t find a better spot to stay in Portland. Our home is just 20 minutes from the airport and a short jaunt to the vibrant Alberta and Mississippi neighborhoods. Alberta boasts an array of hot spots, from unique shops and delicious restaurants to cozy coffee shops and beautiful parks. The food scene on Alberta is unparalleled, offering a variety of options that will delight any foodie.<br /><br />The Pacific Northwest is renowned for its outdoor activities, all within an hour\'s drive. Whether you\'re into hiking, biking, or exploring nature, there\'s something for everyone. Our quiet, cozy neighborhood is also conveniently close to Concordia University, perfect for visiting loved ones at the school.<br /><br />Within walking distance, you\'ll find two fantastic food cart villages and several public transportation lines, making it easy to take a quick 25-minute ride into downtown Portland. Prefer to take an Uber? You\'re just a 10-15 minute drive away from','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1298255919482982300/original/fcd77957-93c6-426d-b242-2c5f043a26ea.jpeg',190656099,24,'45.55798828891886','-122.66887287471646',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,1,365,0,1.00,1298255919482982300),(4511,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298755763974237128','Charming Vintage Bedroom for Single Female Guest','Welcome to Regina’s quaint cottage, a perfect blend of vintage charm and modern comfort!<br /><br />Nestled at the foot of Mt Tabor, mere minutes from the heart of SE Portland and conveniently located near major city arteries, this delightful retreat offers a private bedroom with plush bedding, and shared use of the rest of the main home\'s living and dining area, full kitchen and bath, making it an ideal home away from home for a single female traveler wanting to explore everything Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI5MTYxNjQ5Mjk1NjMzNjA1NA%3D%3D/original/d3f0329a-2ff0-4532-9ce1-340c41c6b06a.jpeg',5382362,37,'45.498753993553684','-122.59196291619475',2,1,1.00,1.00,1.00,39.00,2,28,0,1.00,1298755763974237128),(4512,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298779549362113230','Charming Cottage in Heart of SE 2 BR/4 guests','Welcome to Regina’s quaint cottage, a perfect blend of vintage charm and modern comfort!<br /><br />Nestled at the foot of Mount Tabor, mere minutes from the heart of SE Portland and conveniently located near major city arteries, this delightful retreat features two cozy bedrooms, a warm and welcoming living area, full kitchen and bath, making it an ideal home away from home for couples, small families or friends looking to spend some quality time together while exploring everything Portland has to offer.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTI5MTYxNjQ5Mjk1NjMzNjA1NA%3D%3D/original/8dfd4123-5eb2-4d8d-af4a-fc7d3bc22d59.jpeg',5382362,37,'45.497961853886785','-122.59142754954337',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,79.00,2,28,0,1.00,1298779549362113230),(4513,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298835607539152274','Private Portland Group Getaway | Sleeps 12','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 94/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. Our private and spacious six-bedroom home sits in the heart of the eclectic SE Division District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1298835607539152274/original/51a9f671-f24a-4e2a-8e61-e776f22a30d0.jpeg',115052133,8,'45.50501281780739','-122.62184955147991',1,12,3.00,6.00,6.00,456.00,1,1125,0,1.00,1298835607539152274),(4514,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298844467425808731','Vibrant Iconic Portland Home in Heart of Division','A walker\'s paradise with a WalkScore® of 94/100. If you\'re a big fan of great food, craft beer, pour-over coffee and Portlandia, this is your place. Our private and spacious four-bedroom home sits in the heart of the eclectic SE Division District - home to many of Portland\'s top-rated restaurants and bars, vintage shops, and some of the best people-watching around.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1298844467425808731/original/2208b225-77ee-4296-9e7b-1f726ebd948b.jpeg',115052133,8,'45.5037170046627','-122.62025651058639',1,8,2.00,4.00,4.00,279.00,1,365,0,1.00,1298844467425808731),(4515,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1298851580263131025','Vibrant Portland Getaway | Chic Flat','Welcome to our cozy Portland apartment! Located in the heart of the the Division District. This stylish space is perfect for exploring all that Portland has to offer. With comfortable furnishings, a fully equipped kitchen, and a convenient location near cafes, shops, and attractions, you\'ll have everything you need for a memorable stay. Explore Powell\'s City of Books, visit the Portland Art Museum, or simply relax and soak up the city\'s vibrant atmosphere. WalkScore 94/100','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1298851580263131025/original/5071f604-8ee4-4f3a-a2a1-0f1e4abde7ea.jpeg',115052133,8,'45.504047617521145','-122.62191856183172',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,103.00,1,365,0,1.00,1298851580263131025),(4516,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1300930959577415954','Comfortable Townhome Near Shops & Eateries','Discover this haven and relaxing sanctuary on Division St, featuring real-wood furniture, top-notch appliances and year-round energy-efficient heating and AC. Bask in natural light from large windows that include honeycomb blinds for optimal privacy. Enjoy a peaceful atmosphere with superior insulation, blackout blinds for restful sleep, a relaxing bubbly bath and a frameless glass shower for a spa-like experience. Steps from restaurants, shops, a lovely park (Piccolo) and on-street parking.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1300930959577415954/original/98637e38-2451-46a7-821c-b98972a9f910.jpeg',39047000,25,'45.50403139491249','-122.63614573508211',1,4,2.50,2.00,2.00,99.00,30,365,0,1.00,1300930959577415954),(4517,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1301652862377305139','NW Pearl (walking) District','Private room in shared apartment available for longer-term stays. (You must pass our building\'s background check to stay longer than 12 days.)','Very walkable, bikable. As Trip Advisor said, \"This district is home to quirky boutiques and brands, cool restaurants, micro-breweries, historic dives, and artisan coffee shops, housed in both new high-rises and reclaimed warehouse spaces. Near the famous Powell’s City of Books, one of the largest independent bookstores in the world, and neat art galleries..\" There\'s even a monthly First Thursday arts festival throughout. The Jamison Square fountain is also a great spot to cool off in summer.','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1301652862377305139/original/23366dda-b46f-4bc7-8a50-a2f1a00ff41f.jpeg',180955538,2,'45.531112092630885','-122.68016528119679',2,5,1.00,1.00,3.00,50.00,31,365,0,1.00,1301652862377305139),(4518,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1301747302700592421','Beautiful Home Near Alberta Arts','A perfect home for a family visiting Stumptown. <br /><br />Relax in this beautiful, lovingly restored, light-filled home with 3 bedrooms, home office, 1.5 bathrooms, chefs kitchen, living room and full dining room with large family den. <br /><br />The home is within walking distance to amazing restaurants, art galleries and more on Alberta Arts, food carts, parks and more.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1301747302700592421/original/51ab3e0b-8ca6-4a3f-9357-16bde0b62228.jpeg',201130357,14,'45.563123060974874','-122.65776592947229',1,6,1.50,3.00,3.00,225.00,30,120,0,1.00,1301747302700592421),(4519,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1301813336415780154','Forest Views Home in SE Portland','Gorgeous views of the Kelly Butte Nature area. Two large bedrooms and sun-filled living room with a fully stocked kitchen and outdoor deck. Newly renovated bathroom and in-unit washer and dryer. Shared parking with the guest suite downstairs. <br /><br />In a quiet neighborhood with easy access to the freeway and Portland. Close to nearby hospitals and schools, great for traveling nurses and professionals.<br /><br />Property has an additional guest suite downstairs so you may occasionally hear other guests.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1301813336415780154/original/6b9e0e80-2e15-4ab6-85b5-549749997adb.jpeg',11194078,78,'45.50019125028266','-122.5634742858265',1,4,1.00,2.00,2.00,110.00,30,365,0,1.00,1301813336415780154),(4520,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1302343649715362801','Foodlovers loft Mississippi St.','Come stay in the heart of one of Portland’s \"MUST VISIT\" areas.... Mississippi Street! Just a short walk to some of the most popular bars, restaurants and food carts in the city.  <br /><br />New Seasons and Cherry Sprout a local organic market are minutes away if you want to prepare a meal in the fully stocked kitchen or enjoy wine in the private patio. <br /><br />From free off street parking to a king size bed the cottage is a great home base to enjoy the city or relax the day away.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1302343649715362801/original/e67477c8-82d7-4735-8da3-a80caba15d29.jpeg',3844402,9,'45.55411655455486','-122.67678331004969',1,4,1.00,1.00,2.00,87.00,2,365,0,1.00,1302343649715362801),(4521,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1302933402466841886','Great Spacious Apartment - Free Parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1302933402466841886/original/0824a610-3658-4b8f-9a98-92c75942667c.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53043312849316','-122.68148443392663',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,72.00,1,14,0,1.00,1302933402466841886),(4522,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1302935452993454124','Modern 1BR Apartment - Free Parking!','Experience hassle-free, self-check-in accommodation in Downtown Portland while exploring the vibrant atmosphere, artistic community, and historic architecture of the Pearl District neighborhood. This apartment includes WiFi, a smart TV, one bedroom, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a living room. Additionally, guests can enjoy one complimentary parking spot and a designated workspace.','Go and Explore!<br />•Work score of 97, transit score 89 with lots of trams/light rail to all over the city nearby<br />•Bring your bike – you can store it safely in the secured parking garage for free!<br />•Within 10 blocks there are loads of things to see and do. Please do check Portland City Council for updates on what is open<br />•Countless delicious restaurants, Starbucks / local coffee shops, Oprah\'s favorite ice cream shop: Salt & Straw, Portland streetcar, A variety of bars/nightlife, Pearl District, NW 23rd (Alphabet district)<br />•You will love the location of this apartment, close to everything you will need to enjoy your stay in Downtown. $5 Uber / Lyft ride to all attractions. City Bikes and Electric Scooters are also a lot of fun!','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1302935452993454124/original/7b2d23da-3ad2-4101-899d-f0cf870b8607.jpeg',409693567,2,'45.53026807694667','-122.68041357888146',1,3,1.00,1.00,2.00,86.00,1,14,0,1.00,1302935452993454124),(4523,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1303725729396873436','Rustic Guesthouse in Hawthorne','Location, location, location. Charming guesthouse in the heart of Hawthorne/Belmont. Secluded private full fenced yard with  luscious bamboo garden. Comfortable queen bed and double loft bed. Full kitchen with gas stove/oven and basic cooking essentials. Bathroom with rain shower. Washer and dryer. <br /><br />Walking distance to natural food groceries (Fred Meyers and New Seasons), trendy coffee shops, restaurants, and bars. Minutes to downtown by cars, bikes, and public transportations.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/6149369a-8260-4676-a84d-e0b2e3aeea48.jpg',114549297,16,'45.51476200982525','-122.62841161027963',1,3,1.00,0.00,2.00,81.00,1,365,0,1.00,1303725729396873436),(4524,'https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1304580889819037508','Modern 1920s Portland Home','Enjoy a stylish experience at this centrally-located place.','','https://a0.muscache.com/pictures/miso/Hosting-1304580889819037508/original/29852f56-9ed0-4792-998c-f19624d20c00.jpeg',52609760,13,'45.56502577615725','-122.6805527628087',1,4,2.00,2.00,2.00,320.00,4,365,0,1.00,1304580889819037508);
